export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"partcraft","name":"PartCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","brave":"Brave","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"partcraft","title":"What's new in 0.10","summary":"Big parts open without freezing the window, an assembly over the part limit says how many parts it places, and fixes for DXF units, the Design toolbar and Library items.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["whats new","what's new","0.10","release notes","changelog","changes","version","new features","big parts","freeze","holes","plate","large assembly","part limit","50000 parts","instance list","dxf","inches","units","design toolbar","enter","library","ifc class","pro layouts","trackpad","swipe","tour"],"headings":[{"id":"new","text":"New","level":2},{"id":"fixed","text":"Fixed","level":2},{"id":"in-every-app","text":"In every app","level":2},{"id":"said-plainly","text":"Said plainly","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThis is what changed in PartCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. It is a small release for this app, about big parts and big assemblies.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"new\"\u003ENew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBig parts open without freezing.\u003C/strong\u003E The longest freeze on opening a 1,600-hole plate went from 7.9 s to 0.16 s. The work moved off the page; the total time is about the same.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge assemblies.\u003C/strong\u003E A file over the 50,000-part limit now says how many parts it places, instead of &quot;The assembly has no instance list.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fixed\"\u003EFixed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDXF files from PartCraft were read as inches in other programs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Design toolbar wrapped to two rows at 1440 px, and a single digit typed for the selected feature was not set by \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELibrary items were written without an IFC class.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-every-app\"\u003EIn every app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDocking tool groups.\u003C/strong\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the part. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/dock-tool-groups\" data-topic=\"basics/dock-tool-groups\"\u003EDock a group of tools\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFour Pro layouts\u003C/strong\u003E (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA two-finger trackpad swipe pans\u003C/strong\u003E the sketch and the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETour tips\u003C/strong\u003E have one \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E button; the X closes the tour.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"said-plainly\"\u003ESaid plainly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAssemblies open up to 50,000 parts and 100,000 joints; raising the limits waits on a browser measurement.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every slow path on a big part has moved off the page yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDocking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanguages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the version before this one, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-9\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-9\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.9\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"This is what changed in PartCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. It is a small release for this app, about big parts and big assemblies. New Big parts open without freezing. The longest freeze on opening a 1,600-hole plate went from 7.9 s to 0.16 s. The work moved off the page; the total time is about the same. Large assemblies. A file over the 50,000-part limit now says how many parts it places, instead of \"The assembly has no instance list.\" Fixed DXF files from PartCraft were read as inches in other programs. The Design toolbar wrapped to two rows at 1440 px, and a single digit typed for the selected feature was not set by Enter. Library items were written without an IFC class. In every app Docking tool groups. In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the part. See Dock a group of tools. Four Pro layouts (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in Settings › Global › Layout. A two-finger trackpad swipe pans the sketch and the sheet. Tour tips have one Next button; the X closes the tour. Said plainly Assemblies open up to 50,000 parts and 100,000 joints; raising the limits waits on a browser measurement. Not every slow path on a big part has moved off the page yet. Docking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors. The new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project. Languages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only. For the version before this one, see What's new in 0.9.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-9","scope":"partcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.9 (kwangaphambili)","summary":"I-PartCraft 0.9 yengeza ama-fillet phakathi kobuso nokujiya kube yizolidi, ama-assembly ezinkulungwane zezingxenye, indawo yamadokhumenti enokubuyekezwa, i-Solid FEM stress add-on, izindlela eziyishumi zokwakha i-arc, usayizi wensimbi wase-UK, isigaba sokushicilela nama-add-on okushicilela nge-resin.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["okusha ku-0.9","ukukhishwa kwangaphambili","okusha","izinto ezisha","release notes","changelog","0.9","fillet phakathi kobuso","rolling ball","fillet eminingi emaphethelweni","thicken","isolidi esivela ezindaweni","step shell","iges solid","ama-fillet eskani","assembly enkulu","lightweight display","izingxenye ezingu-20000","amadokhumenti","vault","check out","revision","release","lapho kusetshenziswa","rhino link","grasshopper","3dm","amakhesa","factory floor","job queue","solid fem","finite element","von mises","natural frequency","izindlela zesigaba","izindlela ze-arc","izigaba zensimbi ze-UK","blue book","print stage","resin","goo","ctb","bed","lay flat","okusha","izinto ezisha","release notes","changelog","izinguquko","0.8","0.8.1","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","live analysis","update while editing","break it","what breaks first","load factor","nonlinear","yield","plastic strain","contact","calculix","motion study","clearance","surfaces","nurbs","fair","hull","zebra","engineer","generator","generated body","isketshi esivela esithombeni","ukulinganisa kokushicilela","ukwahlukanisa kokushicilela","shrinkage","nested sheets","g-code","drawing","dimension holes","assistant","mcp","izilimi","toolbar rows"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha-ku-0-9-1","text":"Okusha ku-0.9.1","level":2},{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"izindawo-nezolidi","text":"Izindawo nezolidi","level":3},{"id":"ama-assembly-amadokhumenti-nezixhumanisi","text":"Ama-assembly, amadokhumenti nezixhumanisi","level":3},{"id":"ukuhlaziya-nengxenye","text":"Ukuhlaziya nengxenye","level":3},{"id":"ukushicilela","text":"Ukushicilela","level":3},{"id":"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo","text":"Kuzo zonke izinhlelo","level":2},{"id":"okulungisiwe","text":"Okulungisiwe","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo-eqinisekile","text":"Imikhawulo eqinisekile","level":2},{"id":"kwangaphambili-0-8-ne-0-8-1","text":"Kwangaphambili: 0.8 ne-0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"okusha-2","text":"Okusha","level":3},{"id":"okulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1","text":"Okulungisiwe ku-0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"akusatholakali-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akusatholakali kule nguqulo","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshile ku-PartCraft 0.9, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Izindawo eziqinile manje zivala zibe yizolidi, ama-assembly ezinkulungwane zezingxenye ahlala esebenziseka, indawo yamadokhumenti igcina izinguquko, futhi i-add-on ye-Solid FEM ihlola ukucindezela engxenyeni. Into ngayinye ikutshela lapho ngokuthola khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha-ku-0-9-1\"\u003EOkusha ku-0.9.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthumela i-STEP enembile.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E manje ziyasebenza. Imigodi, izinsimbi, ama-fillet, amakhoni, amasphere nama-torus kubhalwa ebusweni babo bangempela namasirkili angempela njengemiphetho, ukuze olunye uhlelo lwe-CAD noma le-CAM lukwazi ukukhetha imbobo njengembobo. Izinhlangothi ze-spline, imithambo emodeli nama-mesh angeniswe ahlala njengama-facet ayinhlanganisela efanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EUkuthumela ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-STEP ingena, i-STEP enembile iphuma.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela le-STEP oliviulayo ligcina ubuso bayo obusicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, ama-sphere nama-torus, ngakho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E iwabhala ngokuphinda njengobuso bangempela esikhundleni semifanekiso: ibhomu lomthengisi elinezimbobo zesikulufo liphuma nobuso bayo bokuqala, kanye nalokho okusikiwe kuyo. Ubuso obugobile, obuphendukayo nobuphonswa kwefayela buhlala bungama-facet, kanjalo nemizimba evela ku-STL, OBJ ne-3MF. Vula ifayela le-STEP futhi ngengxenye elondolozwe ngaphambili. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-circle angempela kwi-DXF yobuso.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF of the sketch or flat face\u003C/span\u003E ngobuso obusicaba obukhethiwe manje ibhala izimbobo ezizungezile njengamasirkili, ngesikhungo sembobo nomsakazo wayo, ye-laser, plasma noma i-waterjet table. Okunye okuzungezayo kusasala kuma-facet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-STEP enembile yesitolo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManufacture\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExact STEP (work coordinates)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ingxenye ngemvelaphi yayo ku-work origin yesetha ne-Z ngokuhamba nge-eksisi yethuluzi, izixhumanisi ezisetshenziswa yi-G-code. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#exact-step-for-the-shop\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"exact-step-for-the-shop\"\u003EYenza izindlela zethuluzi ne-G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izindawo-nezolidi\"\u003EIzindawo nezolidi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-fillet phakathi kobuso.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E ebhokisini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha ubuso obubili besolidi elilodwa, uthayipe ububanzi (kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius at the end (mm, 0 = the same)\u003C/span\u003E ukuze umsakazo ushintshe ngomphetho). Umugqa wemiphumela ushilo ukuthi i-fillet ikhashelwe kangakanani kusuka ebhola elikhulu elivela, futhi umsakazo ongalingani uyenqatshelwa nobuso obuqanjiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet several edges\u003C/span\u003E ijikisa imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa; hlola \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorners (sphere patch where three meet)\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ube nekhoni lesphere lapho imiphetho emithathu ezungezwe ihlangana khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EIzindawo ezingagoqiwe (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujiya kube yisolidi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken into a solid\u003C/span\u003E kuleso sikhala sokusebenza inikeza indawo ukujula; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOther side\u003C/span\u003E iyikhulisa ngolunye uhlangothi. Ukugoba noma ukuzihlanganisa kwenqatshelwa nobuso nendawo okuqanjwe ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzolidi ezivela ezindaweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Izindawo ezisikiwe zingahlanganiswa nge-union, subtract ne-intersect bese zibhakwa engxenyeni njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehla. I-STEP ibhala isolidi njengesigqoko esisodwa esivaliwe ne-IGES njengesolidi esisodwa; zombili zifundwa njengesolidi. Uma ubuso bungahlanganisi ngomphetho ngomphetho, ifayela lithola ubuso obuhlukene futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-fillet emaphethelweni nawahlukile eskanini.\u003C/strong\u003E Lapho ulingana izindawo namaskani, ama-fillet emaphethelweni (ama-torus) nama-fillet anobubanzi oshintshayo emaphethelweni acishe aqondile nawo ayafunwa futhi ayadweshwa nomsakazo wawo. Ihlolwe kumaskani aqanjiwe kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ama-assembly-amadokhumenti-nezixhumanisi\"\u003EAma-assembly, amadokhumenti nezixhumanisi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-assembly amakhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Izingxenye ezingamakhophi zabelana ngemesh eyodwa, nokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELightweight display\u003C/span\u003E idweba amabhokisi ukuze umbono uqhubeke uhamba (ivula yodwa ama-assembly amakhulu kakhulu; ukukhetha nama-joint asasebenzisa izingxenye zangempela). Umsebhenzi wesihlahla singxenye ibonisa imigqa yayo yokuqala nenkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow 700 more\u003C/span\u003E yezinye. Amafayela e-assembly angabamba izimo ezingu-50,000 nama-joint angu-100,000. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EYakha i-assembly\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadokhumenti.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDocuments…\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EFile\u003C/strong\u003E ivula ingxoxo ngaphezu kwefolda yephrojekthi: hlola ukuphuma nokungena, izinhlamvu zokubuyekezwa, izimo (umsebenzi oqhubekayo, ukubuyekezwa, ukukhishwa, okungasasebenzi), umlando, ukuthi kusetshenziswa kuphi nobhalo lwezinto. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/documents-walkthrough\" data-topic=\"partcraft/documents-walkthrough\"\u003EAmadokhumenti nokubuyekezwa (i-vault)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxhumana kwe-Rhino ngqo.\u003C/strong\u003E Iskripthi esisodwa, \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E, silanda idokhumenti ye-Rhino noma ye-Grasshopper, bese lithumela okushintshile kuphela ku-PartCraft, lapho isici esingeniswe sakhiwa kabusha ngaleso sakhiwo esisha. Iyindlela eyodwa futhi idinga i-Studio. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"partcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EUkuxhumana kwe-.3dm ngqo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBona ama-cursor kabili.\u003C/strong\u003E Kusikhathi sokwabelana, i-cursor ngayinye ibonakala ngegama lomuntu nesici asikhethile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"partcraft/work-live\"\u003ESebenza ngokuphila nabanye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo sefektri.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula i-add-on ye-Factory floor ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E. Ngemva kokushicilela uhlelo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManufacture\u003C/span\u003E, ithebhu yayo ingakwazi ukuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to the factory job queue\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a job file\u003C/span\u003E. Ayisoze ithumele noma iqalise umshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuhlaziya-nengxenye\"\u003EUkuhlaziya nengxenye\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-add-on ye-Solid FEM.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E (icishe ivalwe kuze kube yilapho uyivula) bese ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E ivela ephaneli yesokudla. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh the part\u003C/span\u003E, khetha izindawo ezimile nemithwalo kumbono we-3D, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolve\u003C/span\u003E, bese udweba ukunyakaza, ukucindezela kuka-von Mises noma ukuma kwemodi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow on the model\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-fem-check\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-fem-check\"\u003ESolid FEM: ukuhlola ukucindezela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-arc kumasketshi, ngezindlela eziyishumi.\u003C/strong\u003E Umcibisholo ngasemuva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E kwi-toolbar yesketshi uhlu lwe-3-Point, Start Center End, Start Center Angle, Start Center Length, Start End Angle, Start End Direction, Start End Radius, Center Start End, Center Start Angle, Center Start Length nokuqhubeka. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-arc-methods\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-arc-methods\"\u003EDweba i-arc ngezindlela eziyishumi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wensimbi wase-UK.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukwakha kungasebenzisa izigaba ezingu-976 zase-UK (UB, UC, PFC, EA, UEA, CHS, SHS, RHS); thayipha usayizi njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E305x165x40 UB\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EIzingxenye zesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukushicilela\"\u003EUkushicilela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba sokushicilela.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint stage\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar (i-add-on ethi 3D Print, evulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo) ibeka izingxenye zakho ebhedini elinemigqa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELay flat\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn 90°\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange on the bed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit all on the bed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreview layers\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend to 3D printer\u003C/span\u003E ngokusebenzisa i-USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint noma PrusaLink. Akukho okuthunyelwa uze uqinisekise, futhi ingxenye yakho ayisoze yashintsheka. Ngefayela le-STL noma le-3MF, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungisa ingxenye yokushicilela nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushicilela nge-resin.\u003C/strong\u003E Ama-add-on ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E, konke kuvaliwe kuze kube yilapho uyavula: isilicing se-resin, ukuhlola ukuchayeka, nefomethi yamafayela i-Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox CBDDLP/CTB no-Anycubic. Ukusika kwenziwa kuthrede elisebenza ngaphandle, ngakho ikhasi liyaphendula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo\"\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiqhoqo sokuhlanza sonke isiketshe sibe yi-Bootstrap tooltip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthiphu yokuqala inenkinobho yokuvala; ihlala ivaliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wamathebhu wephaneli ongalingani uyaskrola uye ngakwesokudla esikhundleni sokusikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthebhu yesiphequluli ibonisa igama lodokhumenti ovuliwe ngaphambi kwe-PartCraft | CadCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E yesikhala sokusebenza njengohlu lokukhetha, nebhokisi lolimi libala zonke izilimi ezikwesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsisindo nokushisa zingohlobo lweyunithi kumasethingi weyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulungisiwe\"\u003EOkulungisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImenyu ye-sketch Arc manje ibala zonke izindlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbha yamathuluzi ye-add-on nesihloko sethebhu yesiphequluli kwalungiswa ngomhla ka-2026-11-09.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo-eqinisekile\"\u003EImikhawulo eqinisekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Exact STEP ifundwe kabusha ku-OpenCascade (izolidi ezivumelekile, amavolumu alingana nalawo abalwe ngesandla). Ayikaboniswa kuwo wonke amaprogramu e-CAD noma e-CAM, futhi i-assembly ayibhalwa njenge-exact STEP.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukaze kushicilelwe ngeprinta yangempela. Ukusika, i-G-code namafayela e-resin kufundwe kabusha yizinhlelo zethu noma ngeprinta elingamele; akukho fomethi ye-resin elayishwe ekhompyutheni ye-printer, nosayizi bama-printer nokuchayeka kungamaphuzu okuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Solid FEM ilinganile, ayiguquki ngokuqondile futhi iyinto eyodwa esetshenziswa, indawo eyodwa yezinto, ngaphandle kokuthintana, ukukhiqizwa noma ukugoba. Ukucindezela ezindaweni ezimile nasemakhoneni abukhali kuncike ku-mesh. Iyisisiza sokuhlola, ayibukwanga yinjiniyela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhathi ze-assembly enkulu zivela kuseva engenayo i-GPU; isakhiwo esigcwele sezingxenye ezingu-20,000 sathatha amasekhondi lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-fillet asebenza ngezibonelo zobuso ababili; akukho i-blend ejwayelekile yamaphoyinti, nokungekho i-fillet phakathi kobuso obungahlangani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana kwe-Rhino akuzange kusebenze ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper yangempela. Amadokhumenti azange azame ngabantu ababili kunethiwekhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulingana kwezindawo namaskani wangempela akuzange kuhlolwe ngesandla. Izilimi ezingaphandle kwesiNgisi ziyizinhlobo zokuqala zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-installer e-Windows awasayinwe ngekhodi, nesithombe sedisiki se-macOS asiqinisekisiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinguquko zangaphambili zitholakala kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EOkusha ku-0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwangaphambili-0-8-ne-0-8-1\"\u003EKwangaphambili: 0.8 ne-0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshile ku-PartCraft 0.8 ne-0.8.1, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Isimulation iyaphendula ngesikhathi uhlela futhi itshela ukuthi yini eqala ukuphuka, ama-assembly athola izifundo zokunyakaza, nezikhala ezintsha zenza izindawo ezingagoqiwe nezingxenye ezilinganiswa ngefisiksi. Ye-0.8.1 ingukukhishwa okuncane kokulungisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okusha-2\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingisa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha ngenkathi ngihlela.\u003C/strong\u003E Hlola \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate while I edit\u003C/span\u003E kwibhlogi ye-Solve, bese izimpendulo zilandela izinguquko zakho. Shintsha ubukhulu, umthwalo noma impahla, impendulo esheshayo, eyenziwa ngezinto ezine ezinkulu kunazo, ivela ngokushesha; uma umisa cishe isekhondi, impendulo yokuhlaziywa yesifundo yayo ephucuzwe iyayidlulisa. Imiphumela ikutshela ukuthi ubheka eyiphi. Ku-cantilever yensimbi impendulo esheshayo ibe ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ekuguqukeni nangaphakathi kuka-4 % ekucindezelekeni kwayo ephucuzwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#update-while-you-edit-live\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"update-while-you-edit-live\"\u003EHlola ukucindezela nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYini eqala ukuphuka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngesifundo esimile noma se-buckling, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat breaks first?\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EBreak it\u003C/strong\u003E block ikala imithwalo kuze kuphuke ingxenye. Ilanda, okubi kakhulu kuqala, isici sokuqala sokuvimbela (ngophawu obomvu lapho ukucindezela kuphakama khona) nesici se-buckling. Isici esingaphansi kuka-1 sisho ukuthi ingxenye isivele ihlehla njengoba ilayishwe, futhi Problems ikhombisa iphutha. Lezi zici zivela esifundweni esilinganayo, ngakho zinhle njengalokho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#find-out-what-breaks-first-break-it\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"find-out-what-breaks-first-break-it\"\u003EHlola ukucindezela nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvuma nokuxhumana.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlobo ezimbili zezifundo ezengeziwe: esingalingani lapho izinto zilandela umugqa wazo kuze kube sesivinini sokuvuma bese sihamba kancane, nebhalwa umzuzwana wokuhamba ngale ndlela, nesingxhumanisa lapho izingxenye ezihlukene ziphushelana (ngaphandle kokungcangcazela) noma zibambelelene (zibotshelwe). Ukulayisha okungazinzile noma izingxenye ezicindezela kakhulu kuya ngaphakathi kwezinye kuyabonakala ku-Problems. Ukungcangcazela, ukunyakaza okukhulu, izinyathelo ezinkulu, ukuguquka okukhulu nokukhathala akuxazululwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#yielding-and-contact-nonlinear-studies\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"yielding-and-contact-nonlinear-studies\"\u003EHlola ukucindezela nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-deck ye-CalculiX.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/span\u003E igcina isifundo ye-CalculiX, uhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa futhi olusebenziswa wena; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalculiX results (.frd)\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ifayela lemiphumela libuyele kumesh efanayo. I-PartCraft ayisoze iqale lolo hlelo, futhi iyakutshela uma ingxenye ishintshile kusukela ngesikhathi kulondolozwe i-deck.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-assembly\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzifundo zokunyakaza.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMotion\u003C/span\u003E ishayela inani le-joint eyodwa ngesikhathi osinikeza (isivinini esihlala njalo, esilinganisiwe, i-sine, noma phumela nabuye): ibeka i-assembly ngesinyathelo ngasinye ngamajoyinti nalupu ezivaliwe, futhi ibika lokho okungqubuzanayo nokuthi izingxenye zisondelana kangakanani. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point\u003C/span\u003E idweba indawo yephoyinti, isivinini nokushesha kwalo, inani le-joint nokukhala kusukela ngesikhathi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave CSV\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave plot\u003C/span\u003E zikhipha lokho. Ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E, ibha ye-Step through the run ihambisa i-assembly kunoma yisiphi isinyathelo. Izilungiselelo zesifundo zilondolozwa efayelini le-assembly. Isivinini nokushesha kuvela emaphozisheni alondoloziwe, ngakho sebenzisa izinyathelo eziningi uma ukukhuphuka okubukhali kufunda kancane. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly#a-motion-study\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\" data-hash=\"a-motion-study\"\u003EHlola i-assembly ukuthola ukuphambana nokunyakaza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo nezingxenye ezivela ku-physics\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhala sezindawo ezingagoqiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E ebhokisini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole amajika nezindawo ze-NURBS ecaleni kwengxenye: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZebra\u003C/span\u003E, nokuqhubeka (G0, G1 noma G2) okulinganiswa ezindaweni ezinembile, nomphetho obi kakhulu kunalokho owacela ulethwa ku-Problems nge-Match fix. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFair\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa imigqa yesigqoko ukuze kutholakale ukuguquka nokushintsha kwesimo sokugoba, bese yakha kabusha ezingekho ngokuhle ngaphakathi kokubekezelela kwakho. Izindawo zigcinwa efayelini lengxenye futhi azishintshi izici zengxenye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EIzindawo ezingagoqiwe (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhi se-Engineer.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngineer\u003C/span\u003E kwisishintshi sesikhala sokusebenza, khetha umakhi bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E: iskripthi silinganisa ingxenye ngalokho okufanele kukwenze (ukushisa ukuze kuhambe, imifudlana, ingcindezi, impahla, inqubo yokushicilela) ngezibalo zethekisthi, bese siyakhe, bese sibuyisa izibalo esizisebenzisile ngemithombo yazo, izihlola zokukhiqiza namafayela wamathuluzi okuhlaziya. Okufanayo kunikeza ingxenye efanayo kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha. Umakhi ugcinwa engxenyeni, futhi ukuvula ingxenye akusoze kusebenzise iskripthi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-generators\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-generators\"\u003EIzingxenye ezivela ku-physics: abakhi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/write-a-generator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/write-a-generator\"\u003EBhala umakhi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuklama, imidwebo nokwakha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsketshi esivela esithombeni.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeatures\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch from a photo…\u003C/span\u003E ilandelela isithombe sengxenye eyisicaba esisemhlabathini osobala (umphetho nezimbobo) noma umdwebo wepeni ibe yimigqa, ama-arc namasirkili. Unikeza ubude obubodwa, uhlole ukubukwa bese wenza isketshi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics#a-sketch-from-a-photo\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-hash=\"a-sketch-from-a-photo\"\u003EIzisekelo zesketshi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulinganisa nokuhlukanisa ukushicilela.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale for printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa ngeyunithi ngayinye ngaphandle kokushintsha ingxenye, isibonelo ngesilinganiso sokuncipha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit for printing (a zip of pieces)…\u003C/span\u003E isika ingxenye enkulu kakhulu ebhedini lakho ibe yizingcezu ezinombolo ezihlanganiswe ngamapegi, izikhiye, ama-dovetail, izimbobo zamadowel noma izikhala zamagnethi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003EShicilela nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi afakiwe njenge-G-code.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENested sheets to G-code\u003C/span\u003E ifunda i-DXF efakiwe futhi yenza uhlelo olulodwa ngeshidi ngalinye ngokusebenzisa i-post oyikhethayo: izimbobo nezingxenye ezikhishiwe kuqala, bese kuba imiphetho. Ayihleli ukungena, indlela yokusika noma imiphetho ehlanganyelwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts#cut-the-sheets-g-code\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-hash=\"cut-the-sheets-g-code\"\u003EHlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo eyenza okwengeziwe ngokwayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheet\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha ishidi elincane le-A elibamba izibonelo ngesikali esijwayelekile esikhulu kuze kube ngu-1:1. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension the holes\u003C/span\u003E ibeka uphawu lwesikhungo embobweni ngayinye, isilinganiso esisodwa ngosayizi ngamunye nezindawo ezivela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lombono. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EYenza umdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo zifika ngezilimi ezingu-54. Eziphezu kwesiNgisi ziyizinhlobo zomshini ize kube yilapho umuntu wendabuko efunda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha i-Wrap (njengangaphambili), imigqa emi-2 noma umugqa oyodwa; ibha engafaneli iyaskrola ngokuthi isuke ngaphansi. Ibha yesici ye-PartCraft ibonisa ithuluzi elisetshenziswa kakhulu ngobukhulu, bese izinhlobo ziyacashwa ngemva kwenkinobho ehlukaniswe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma i-AI yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Studio iyisiteshi sokuxhumanisa umsizi wakho siqu nazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili, ngelungelo lokufunda kuphela, lokuphakamisa noma lokuhlela ngohlelo ngalunye. Umsizi oxhunyiwe angalinganisa ingxenye kusukela kusigaba esifana nebhulaki ngomthwalo, akhombise umsebenzi wakhe nazo zonke izihlolo, bese ayakha; ubika lokho akungahlolanga (ukugxila kwesistimu, ukukhathala, ukuguqula kwamaplastiki). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003ESebenzisa i-PartCraft nomsizi we-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1\"\u003EOkulungisiwe ku-0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqaleka kwesikrini esigcwele.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukukhetha ngokuhamba kwe-hover kuyanciswa manje. Imbangela siyiyo engcono esiyibonile futhi ayizange iqinisekiswe ngomuntu obike.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlimi ngesikhathi sokusebenza.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Studio nezinguqulo ezipakishiwe zingashintsha ulimi ngesikhathi zisebenza; ngaphambili kwakuyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu asikaboniswa kuwo wonke amapulatifomu: sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akusatholakali-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkusatholakali kule nguqulo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Connect your AI ayiqedile: ukuxhumana kwe-one-click ngaphakathi kwe-Studio, isixhumanisi esingekho kwasekuseni se-AI yesiphequluli, ukhiye wakho we-API ngaphakathi kwe-Studio nephakheji ye-MCP eshicilelwe akwethenjwa. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Studio ayisayinwanga ngekhodi: i-Windows ingasongela, i-macOS iyacela ukuthi ucindezele ngakwesokudla bese uvula. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-stack-up asengamakhuluma ohlangothi olulodwa: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tolerance-stackup\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tolerance-stackup\"\u003EIzitaki zokubekezelela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkunye kuhlu \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinguquko zangaphambili zitholakala kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EOkusha ku-0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshile ku-PartCraft 0.9, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Izindawo eziqinile manje zivala zibe yizolidi, ama-assembly ezinkulungwane zezingxenye ahlala esebenziseka, indawo yamadokhumenti igcina izinguquko, futhi i-add-on ye-Solid FEM ihlola ukucindezela engxenyeni. Into ngayinye ikutshela lapho ngokuthola khona. Okusha ku-0.9.1 Ukuthumela i-STEP enembile. Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) ne-STEP AP214 (exact solid) manje ziyasebenza. Imigodi, izinsimbi, ama-fillet, amakhoni, amasphere nama-torus kubhalwa ebusweni babo bangempela namasirkili angempela njengemiphetho, ukuze olunye uhlelo lwe-CAD noma le-CAM lukwazi ukukhetha imbobo njengembobo. Izinhlangothi ze-spline, imithambo emodeli nama-mesh angeniswe ahlala njengama-facet ayinhlanganisela efanayo. Bona Ukuthumela ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF. I-STEP ingena, i-STEP enembile iphuma. Ifayela le-STEP oliviulayo ligcina ubuso bayo obusicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, ama-sphere nama-torus, ngakho Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) iwabhala ngokuphinda njengobuso bangempela esikhundleni semifanekiso: ibhomu lomthengisi elinezimbobo zesikulufo liphuma nobuso bayo bokuqala, kanye nalokho okusikiwe kuyo. Ubuso obugobile, obuphendukayo nobuphonswa kwefayela buhlala bungama-facet, kanjalo nemizimba evela ku-STL, OBJ ne-3MF. Vula ifayela le-STEP futhi ngengxenye elondolozwe ngaphambili. Bona Vula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo. Ama-circle angempela kwi-DXF yobuso. Export › DXF of the sketch or flat face ngobuso obusicaba obukhethiwe manje ibhala izimbobo ezizungezile njengamasirkili, ngesikhungo sembobo nomsakazo wayo, ye-laser, plasma noma i-waterjet table. Okunye okuzungezayo kusasala kuma-facet. I-STEP enembile yesitolo. Ku-Manufacture, Exact STEP (work coordinates) ibhala ingxenye ngemvelaphi yayo ku-work origin yesetha ne-Z ngokuhamba nge-eksisi yethuluzi, izixhumanisi ezisetshenziswa yi-G-code. Bona Yenza izindlela zethuluzi ne-G-code. Okusha Izindawo nezolidi I-fillet phakathi kobuso. Khetha Surfaces ebhokisini le-Workspace, bese Fillet between faces. Khetha ubuso obubili besolidi elilodwa, uthayipe ububanzi (kanye ne-Radius at the end (mm, 0 = the same) ukuze umsakazo ushintshe ngomphetho). Umugqa wemiphumela ushilo ukuthi i-fillet ikhashelwe kangakanani kusuka ebhola elikhulu elivela, futhi umsakazo ongalingani uyenqatshelwa nobuso obuqanjiwe. Fillet several edges ijikisa imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa; hlola Corners (sphere patch where three meet) ukuze ube nekhoni lesphere lapho imiphetho emithathu ezungezwe ihlangana khona. Bona Izindawo ezingagoqiwe (NURBS). Ukujiya kube yisolidi. Thicken into a solid kuleso sikhala sokusebenza inikeza indawo ukujula; Other side iyikhulisa ngolunye uhlangothi. Ukugoba noma ukuzihlanganisa kwenqatshelwa nobuso nendawo okuqanjwe ngayo. Izolidi ezivela ezindaweni. Izindawo ezisikiwe zingahlanganiswa nge-union, subtract ne-intersect bese zibhakwa engxenyeni njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehla. I-STEP ibhala isolidi njengesigqoko esisodwa esivaliwe ne-IGES njengesolidi esisodwa; zombili zifundwa njengesolidi. Uma ubuso bungahlanganisi ngomphetho ngomphetho, ifayela lithola ubuso obuhlukene futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lokho. Ama-fillet emaphethelweni nawahlukile eskanini. Lapho ulingana izindawo namaskani, ama-fillet emaphethelweni (ama-torus) nama-fillet anobubanzi oshintshayo emaphethelweni acishe aqondile nawo ayafunwa futhi ayadweshwa nomsakazo wawo. Ihlolwe kumaskani aqanjiwe kuphela. Ama-assembly, amadokhumenti nezixhumanisi Ama-assembly amakhulu. Izingxenye ezingamakhophi zabelana ngemesh eyodwa, nokuthi Views › Lightweight display idweba amabhokisi ukuze umbono uqhubeke uhamba (ivula yodwa ama-assembly amakhulu kakhulu; ukukhetha nama-joint asasebenzisa izingxenye zangempela). Umsebhenzi wesihlahla singxenye ibonisa imigqa yayo yokuqala nenkinobho ethi Show 700 more yezinye. Amafayela e-assembly angabamba izimo ezingu-50,000 nama-joint angu-100,000. Bona Yakha i-assembly. Amadokhumenti. Documents… eqenjini le-File ivula ingxoxo ngaphezu kwefolda yephrojekthi: hlola ukuphuma nokungena, izinhlamvu zokubuyekezwa, izimo (umsebenzi oqhubekayo, ukubuyekezwa, ukukhishwa, okungasasebenzi), umlando, ukuthi kusetshenziswa kuphi nobhalo lwezinto. Bona Amadokhumenti nokubuyekezwa (i-vault). Ukuxhumana kwe-Rhino ngqo. Iskripthi esisodwa, cadcraft_link.py, silanda idokhumenti ye-Rhino noma ye-Grasshopper, bese lithumela okushintshile kuphela ku-PartCraft, lapho isici esingeniswe sakhiwa kabusha ngaleso sakhiwo esisha. Iyindlela eyodwa futhi idinga i-Studio. Bona Ukuxhumana kwe-.3dm ngqo. Bona ama-cursor kabili. Kusikhathi sokwabelana, i-cursor ngayinye ibonakala ngegama lomuntu nesici asikhethile. Bona Sebenza ngokuphila nabanye. Isakhiwo sefektri. Vula i-add-on ye-Factory floor ku-Settings › Add-ons. Ngemva kokushicilela uhlelo ku-Manufacture, ithebhu yayo ingakwazi ukuthi Add to the factory job queue noma Save as a job file. Ayisoze ithumele noma iqalise umshini. Ukuhlaziya nengxenye I-add-on ye-Solid FEM. Vula Solid FEM ku-Settings › Add-ons (icishe ivalwe kuze kube yilapho uyivula) bese ithebhu ye-Solid FEM ivela ephaneli yesokudla. Mesh the part, khetha izindawo ezimile nemithwalo kumbono we-3D, Solve, bese udweba ukunyakaza, ukucindezela kuka-von Mises noma ukuma kwemodi nge-Show on the model. Bona Solid FEM: ukuhlola ukucindezela. I-arc kumasketshi, ngezindlela eziyishumi. Umcibisholo ngasemuva kwe-Arc kwi-toolbar yesketshi uhlu lwe-3-Point, Start Center End, Start Center Angle, Start Center Length, Start End Angle, Start End Direction, Start End Radius, Center Start End, Center Start Angle, Center Start Length nokuqhubeka. Bona Dweba i-arc ngezindlela eziyishumi. Usayizi wensimbi wase-UK. Ukwakha kungasebenzisa izigaba ezingu-976 zase-UK (UB, UC, PFC, EA, UEA, CHS, SHS, RHS); thayipha usayizi njenge-305x165x40 UB. Bona Izingxenye zesakhiwo. Ukushicilela Isigaba sokushicilela. Inkinobho ye-Print stage ku-toolbar (i-add-on ethi 3D Print, evulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo) ibeka izingxenye zakho ebhedini elinemigqa: Lay flat, Turn 90°, Arrange on the bed, Fit all on the bed, Preview layers, bese Send to 3D printer ngokusebenzisa i-USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint noma PrusaLink. Akukho okuthunyelwa uze uqinisekise, futhi ingxenye yakho ayisoze yashintsheka. Ngefayela le-STL noma le-3MF, bona Lungisa ingxenye yokushicilela nge-3D. Ukushicilela nge-resin. Ama-add-on ku-Settings › Add-ons, konke kuvaliwe kuze kube yilapho uyavula: isilicing se-resin, ukuhlola ukuchayeka, nefomethi yamafayela i-Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox CBDDLP/CTB no-Anycubic. Ukusika kwenziwa kuthrede elisebenza ngaphandle, ngakho ikhasi liyaphendula. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Isiqhoqo sokuhlanza sonke isiketshe sibe yi-Bootstrap tooltip. Ithiphu yokuqala inenkinobho yokuvala; ihlala ivaliwe. Umugqa wamathebhu wephaneli ongalingani uyaskrola uye ngakwesokudla esikhundleni sokusikwa. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ibonisa igama lodokhumenti ovuliwe ngaphambi kwe-PartCraft | CadCraft. Settings ibonisa Layout yesikhala sokusebenza njengohlu lokukhetha, nebhokisi lolimi libala zonke izilimi ezikwesakhiwo. Isisindo nokushisa zingohlobo lweyunithi kumasethingi weyunithi. Okulungisiwe Imenyu ye-sketch Arc manje ibala zonke izindlela. Ibha yamathuluzi ye-add-on nesihloko sethebhu yesiphequluli kwalungiswa ngomhla ka-2026-11-09. Imikhawulo eqinisekile I-Exact STEP ifundwe kabusha ku-OpenCascade (izolidi ezivumelekile, amavolumu alingana nalawo abalwe ngesandla). Ayikaboniswa kuwo wonke amaprogramu e-CAD noma e-CAM, futhi i-assembly ayibhalwa njenge-exact STEP. Akukaze kushicilelwe ngeprinta yangempela. Ukusika, i-G-code namafayela e-resin kufundwe kabusha yizinhlelo zethu noma ngeprinta elingamele; akukho fomethi ye-resin elayishwe ekhompyutheni ye-printer, nosayizi bama-printer nokuchayeka kungamaphuzu okuqala. I-Solid FEM ilinganile, ayiguquki ngokuqondile futhi iyinto eyodwa esetshenziswa, indawo eyodwa yezinto, ngaphandle kokuthintana, ukukhiqizwa noma ukugoba. Ukucindezela ezindaweni ezimile nasemakhoneni abukhali kuncike ku-mesh. Iyisisiza sokuhlola, ayibukwanga yinjiniyela. Izikhathi ze-assembly enkulu zivela kuseva engenayo i-GPU; isakhiwo esigcwele sezingxenye ezingu-20,000 sathatha amasekhondi lapho. Ama-fillet asebenza ngezibonelo zobuso ababili; akukho i-blend ejwayelekile yamaphoyinti, nokungekho i-fillet phakathi kobuso obungahlangani. Ukuxhumana kwe-Rhino akuzange kusebenze ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper yangempela. Amadokhumenti azange azame ngabantu ababili kunethiwekhi. Ukulingana kwezindawo namaskani wangempela akuzange kuhlolwe ngesandla. Izilimi ezingaphandle kwesiNgisi ziyizinhlobo zokuqala zomshini. Ama-installer e-Windows awasayinwe ngekhodi, nesithombe sedisiki se-macOS asiqinisekisiwe. Bona Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Izinguquko zangaphambili zitholakala kuthi Okusha ku-0.7. Kwangaphambili: 0.8 ne-0.8.1 Lokhu yikho okushintshile ku-PartCraft 0.8 ne-0.8.1, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Isimulation iyaphendula ngesikhathi uhlela futhi itshela ukuthi yini eqala ukuphuka, ama-assembly athola izifundo zokunyakaza, nezikhala ezintsha zenza izindawo ezingagoqiwe nezingxenye ezilinganiswa ngefisiksi. Ye-0.8.1 ingukukhishwa okuncane kokulungisa. Okusha Ukulingisa Shintsha ngenkathi ngihlela. Hlola Update while I edit kwibhlogi ye-Solve, bese izimpendulo zilandela izinguquko zakho. Shintsha ubukhulu, umthwalo noma impahla, impendulo esheshayo, eyenziwa ngezinto ezine ezinkulu kunazo, ivela ngokushesha; uma umisa cishe isekhondi, impendulo yokuhlaziywa yesifundo yayo ephucuzwe iyayidlulisa. Imiphumela ikutshela ukuthi ubheka eyiphi. Ku-cantilever yensimbi impendulo esheshayo ibe ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ekuguqukeni nangaphakathi kuka-4 % ekucindezelekeni kwayo ephucuzwe. Bona Hlola ukucindezela nokuguquka. Yini eqala ukuphuka. Ngesifundo esimile noma se-buckling, i-What breaks first? ku-Break it block ikala imithwalo kuze kuphuke ingxenye. Ilanda, okubi kakhulu kuqala, isici sokuqala sokuvimbela (ngophawu obomvu lapho ukucindezela kuphakama khona) nesici se-buckling. Isici esingaphansi kuka-1 sisho ukuthi ingxenye isivele ihlehla njengoba ilayishwe, futhi Problems ikhombisa iphutha. Lezi zici zivela esifundweni esilinganayo, ngakho zinhle njengalokho. Bona Hlola ukucindezela nokuguquka. Ukuvuma nokuxhumana. Izinhlobo ezimbili zezifundo ezengeziwe: esingalingani lapho izinto zilandela umugqa wazo kuze kube sesivinini sokuvuma bese sihamba kancane, nebhalwa umzuzwana wokuhamba ngale ndlela, nesingxhumanisa lapho izingxenye ezihlukene ziphushelana (ngaphandle kokungcangcazela) noma zibambelelene (zibotshelwe). Ukulayisha okungazinzile noma izingxenye ezicindezela kakhulu kuya ngaphakathi kwezinye kuyabonakala ku-Problems. Ukungcangcazela, ukunyakaza okukhulu, izinyathelo ezinkulu, ukuguquka okukhulu nokukhathala akuxazululwa. Bona Hlola ukucindezela nokuguquka. Ama-deck ye-CalculiX. Export › CalculiX deck (.inp) igcina isifundo ye-CalculiX, uhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa futhi olusebenziswa wena; Export › CalculiX results (.frd) ifunda ifayela lemiphumela libuyele kumesh efanayo. I-PartCraft ayisoze iqale lolo hlelo, futhi iyakutshela uma ingxenye ishintshile kusukela ngesikhathi kulondolozwe i-deck. Ama-assembly Izifundo zokunyakaza. Assembly › Motion ishayela inani le-joint eyodwa ngesikhathi osinikeza (isivinini esihlala njalo, esilinganisiwe, i-sine, noma phumela nabuye): ibeka i-assembly ngesinyathelo ngasinye ngamajoyinti nalupu ezivaliwe, futhi ibika lokho okungqubuzanayo nokuthi izingxenye zisondelana kangakanani. Add a point idweba indawo yephoyinti, isivinini nokushesha kwalo, inani le-joint nokukhala kusukela ngesikhathi; Save CSV ne-Save plot zikhipha lokho. Ngemva kwe-Run, ibha ye-Step through the run ihambisa i-assembly kunoma yisiphi isinyathelo. Izilungiselelo zesifundo zilondolozwa efayelini le-assembly. Isivinini nokushesha kuvela emaphozisheni alondoloziwe, ngakho sebenzisa izinyathelo eziningi uma ukukhuphuka okubukhali kufunda kancane. Bona Hlola i-assembly ukuthola ukuphambana nokunyakaza. Izindawo nezingxenye ezivela ku-physics Isikhala sezindawo ezingagoqiwe. Khetha Surfaces ebhokisini le-Workspace ukuze uthole amajika nezindawo ze-NURBS ecaleni kwengxenye: Curve, Loft, Sweep, Match ne-Zebra, nokuqhubeka (G0, G1 noma G2) okulinganiswa ezindaweni ezinembile, nomphetho obi kakhulu kunalokho owacela ulethwa ku-Problems nge-Match fix. Fair ilinganisa imigqa yesigqoko ukuze kutholakale ukuguquka nokushintsha kwesimo sokugoba, bese yakha kabusha ezingekho ngokuhle ngaphakathi kokubekezelela kwakho. Izindawo zigcinwa efayelini lengxenye futhi azishintshi izici zengxenye. Bona Izindawo ezingagoqiwe (NURBS). Isakhi se-Engineer. Khetha Engineer kwisishintshi sesikhala sokusebenza, khetha umakhi bese ucindezela New: iskripthi silinganisa ingxenye ngalokho okufanele kukwenze (ukushisa ukuze kuhambe, imifudlana, ingcindezi, impahla, inqubo yokushicilela) ngezibalo zethekisthi, bese siyakhe, bese sibuyisa izibalo esizisebenzisile ngemithombo yazo, izihlola zokukhiqiza namafayela wamathuluzi okuhlaziya. Okufanayo kunikeza ingxenye efanayo kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha. Umakhi ugcinwa engxenyeni, futhi ukuvula ingxenye akusoze kusebenzise iskripthi. Bona Izingxenye ezivela ku-physics: abakhi kanye Bhala umakhi. Ukuklama, imidwebo nokwakha Isketshi esivela esithombeni. Features › More › Sketch from a photo… ilandelela isithombe sengxenye eyisicaba esisemhlabathini osobala (umphetho nezimbobo) noma umdwebo wepeni ibe yimigqa, ama-arc namasirkili. Unikeza ubude obubodwa, uhlole ukubukwa bese wenza isketshi. Bona Izisekelo zesketshi. Ukulinganisa nokuhlukanisa ukushicilela. Export › Scale for printing (STL or 3MF)… ilinganisa ngeyunithi ngayinye ngaphandle kokushintsha ingxenye, isibonelo ngesilinganiso sokuncipha. Export › Split for printing (a zip of pieces)… isika ingxenye enkulu kakhulu ebhedini lakho ibe yizingcezu ezinombolo ezihlanganiswe ngamapegi, izikhiye, ama-dovetail, izimbobo zamadowel noma izikhala zamagnethi. Bona Shicilela nge-3D. Amashidi afakiwe njenge-G-code. Export › Nested sheets to G-code ifunda i-DXF efakiwe futhi yenza uhlelo olulodwa ngeshidi ngalinye ngokusebenzisa i-post oyikhethayo: izimbobo nezingxenye ezikhishiwe kuqala, bese kuba imiphetho. Ayihleli ukungena, indlela yokusika noma imiphetho ehlanganyelwe. Bona Hlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini. Imidwebo eyenza okwengeziwe ngokwayo. Sheet › Automatic ikhetha ishidi elincane le-A elibamba izibonelo ngesikali esijwayelekile esikhulu kuze kube ngu-1:1. Dimension the holes ibeka uphawu lwesikhungo embobweni ngayinye, isilinganiso esisodwa ngosayizi ngamunye nezindawo ezivela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lombono. Bona Yenza umdwebo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Izilimi. Izinhlelo zifika ngezilimi ezingu-54. Eziphezu kwesiNgisi ziyizinhlobo zomshini ize kube yilapho umuntu wendabuko efunda. Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi. Settings › General › Toolbar rows ikhetha i-Wrap (njengangaphambili), imigqa emi-2 noma umugqa oyodwa; ibha engafaneli iyaskrola ngokuthi isuke ngaphansi. Ibha yesici ye-PartCraft ibonisa ithuluzi elisetshenziswa kakhulu ngobukhulu, bese izinhlobo ziyacashwa ngemva kwenkinobho ehlukaniswe. Xhuma i-AI yakho. I-Studio iyisiteshi sokuxhumanisa umsizi wakho siqu nazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili, ngelungelo lokufunda kuphela, lokuphakamisa noma lokuhlela ngohlelo ngalunye. Umsizi oxhunyiwe angalinganisa ingxenye kusukela kusigaba esifana nebhulaki ngomthwalo, akhombise umsebenzi wakhe nazo zonke izihlolo, bese ayakha; ubika lokho akungahlolanga (ukugxila kwesistimu, ukukhathala, ukuguqula kwamaplastiki). Bona Sebenzisa i-PartCraft nomsizi we-AI. Okulungisiwe ku-0.8.1 Ukuqaleka kwesikrini esigcwele. Ukukhetha ngokuhamba kwe-hover kuyanciswa manje. Imbangela siyiyo engcono esiyibonile futhi ayizange iqinisekiswe ngomuntu obike. Ulimi ngesikhathi sokusebenza. I-Studio nezinguqulo ezipakishiwe zingashintsha ulimi ngesikhathi zisebenza; ngaphambili kwakuyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu asikaboniswa kuwo wonke amapulatifomu: sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi. Akusatholakali kule nguqulo I-Connect your AI ayiqedile: ukuxhumana kwe-one-click ngaphakathi kwe-Studio, isixhumanisi esingekho kwasekuseni se-AI yesiphequluli, ukhiye wakho we-API ngaphakathi kwe-Studio nephakheji ye-MCP eshicilelwe akwethenjwa. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo. I-Studio ayisayinwanga ngekhodi: i-Windows ingasongela, i-macOS iyacela ukuthi ucindezele ngakwesokudla bese uvula. Bona Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Ama-stack-up asengamakhuluma ohlangothi olulodwa: bona Izitaki zokubekezelela. Okunye kuhlu Okungakakhiwa okwamanje. Izinguquko zangaphambili zitholakala kuthi Okusha ku-0.7.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"partcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.7 (ngaphambili)","summary":"I-PartCraft 0.7 yengeza indawo yokusebenza ye-Illustrate yemihlahlandlela, amafayela e-STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF namafayela e-.3dm avulwa njengezidumbu eziqinile, izakhiwo zensimbi ezihlanganisiwe, amaluphu avaliwe, izingxenye ezinezakhiwo eziningi, iphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho, amapost ongawahlela nge-3D finishing nomtapo wamathuluzi, okuseleyo okugcinwa phakathi kwama-nest, izinhlelo ze-laser, ukuthumela kwe-USD namathuluzi womsizi wakho we-AI.","section":"start","order":7,"keywords":["okusha 0.7","ukukhishwa kwangaphambili","amanothi okukhishwa","ushintsho","izinguquko","0.7","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","illustrate","umhlahlandlela","umdwebo wezobuchwepheshe","umbono ohlukanisiwe","amabhamuni","uhlu lwezingxenye","imiyalelo","3d ehlanganyelayo","ukunyakaza","step","stp","stl","obj","3mf","3dm","i-mesh iye esolidini","vula i-mesh","isakhiwo sensimbi esihlanganisiwe","ingxenye yesakhiwo","uhlaka","uhlu lokusika","iluphu evaliwe","uxhumo","amabha amane","ingxenye enkulu","izakhiwo eziningi","iphekhi yamavarianti","amavarianti","umlungiseleli","isiphathi se-post","hlela i-post","cpost","okulinganayo","scallop","ukuqeda i-3d","umtapo wamathuluzi","imibala yesitoko","okuseleyo","insalela","laser","usd","usdz","umsizi","mcp","okuhlangene","izinyunithi","isiputukezi"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"imihlahlandlela-ngokusuka-kuklama-lwakho","text":"Imihlahlandlela ngokusuka kuklama lwakho","level":3},{"id":"ukuvula-amanye-amafayela","text":"Ukuvula amanye amafayela","level":3},{"id":"izingxenye-nezinhlanganisela","text":"Izingxenye nezinhlanganisela","level":3},{"id":"ukwakha","text":"Ukwakha","level":3},{"id":"abasizi","text":"Abasizi","level":3},{"id":"okushintshiwe","text":"Okushintshiwe","level":2},{"id":"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo","text":"Kuzo zonke izinhlelo","level":2},{"id":"akukakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akukakwenziwa kule nguqulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinto ezishintshe ku-PartCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Izingxenye ziza kusuka emafayeleni amaningi, futhi indawo entsha yenza imihlahlandlela ngokusuka kuklama lwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"imihlahlandlela-ngokusuka-kuklama-lwakho\"\u003EImihlahlandlela ngokusuka kuklama lwakho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza ye-Illustrate.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E kumshintshi we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlahlandlela\u003C/span\u003E: umhlahlandlela uqala ngengxenye evulekile noma ngenhlanganisela evulekile, ngenhlanganisela egciniwe, noma ngefayela le-glTF, OBJ, STL noma 3MF (isihlahla sawo namagama kugcinwa; amakhophi engxenye eyodwa aba yingxenye eyodwa enenani). Umhlahlandlela uyifayela layo (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E) enekhophi yezingxenye, ngakho imibhalo iqhubeka kuyilapho uklama luqhubeka. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EQala umhlahlandlela ku-Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibono nokubukeka.\u003C/strong\u003E Fihla, yenza zibonakale kancane, hlukanisa noma shintsha imibala yezingxenye, dlala umbono ohlukaniswayo, sika isigaba noma ibhokisi emodelini, engeza isikhulisi, bese ugcina konke njengombono. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-views\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-views\"\u003EImibono, ukubukeka, izigaba nesikhulisi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhamuni nohlu lwezingxenye.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuchofoza kanye kwenza amabhamuni zonke izingxenye umbono oziboniso; izinombolo zihlala nezingxenye zazo futhi azisoze ziphindwe. Uhlu lungahlala embonweni futhi lugcinwe njenge-CSV. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-parts-list\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-parts-list\"\u003EUhlu lwezingxenye namabhamuni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzincazelo ezihlala zinamathiselwe:\u003C/strong\u003E amalebula nezincazelo ezigcwalisa inombolo yengxenye, igama, impahla noma inani, izimpini, izibalo, amakhona neradiyasi ezivela ezingxenyeni, ezimo nezithombe. Zihamba nengxenye yazo lapho ihlukaniswa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-annotations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-annotations\"\u003EIzincazelo ezihlala zinamathiselwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yobuciko, imiyalelo nefayela le-3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Thumela noma yimuphi umbono njengemigqa yobuciko ye-vector (SVG noma PDF) enemigqa efihliwe namasekhishi anemigqa, noma njenge-PNG; shintsha imibono ibe imiyalelo ngezinyathelo ibe yi-PDF noma ikhasi elilodwa le-HTML; noma gcina ifayela elilodwa le-HTML elivula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kunoma yisiphequluli esiyiso, nemibono, uhlu lwezingxenye nokunyakaza. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-line-art\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-line-art\"\u003EImidwebo yezobuchwepheshe\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-instructions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-instructions\"\u003EImiyalelo\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-interactive\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-interactive\"\u003EIfayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkunyakaza nokubuyekeza.\u003C/strong\u003E Faka izikhombisi zokunyakaza ezingxenyeni nasekhamera, qopha umbono ohlukaniswayo sinyathelo ngesinyathelo, bese ulondoloza ividiyo. Lapho uklama lushintsha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza kusuka kwidizayini…\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa okunyakazile, okushintshile, okufikile noma okuhambile ngaphambi kokuthi kushintshe lutho, futhi igcina imibono, izincazelo, amabhamuni nezikhombisi zihlala nezingxenye zazo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-animation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-animation\"\u003EYenza umhlahlandlela ube nokunyakaza\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-update\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-update\"\u003EBuyekeza umhlahlandlela kusuka kwidizayini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuvula-amanye-amafayela\"\u003EUkuvula amanye amafayela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-STEP avulwa njengezidumbu eziqinile.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ifunda i-AP203, i-AP214 ne-AP242 STEP ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel. Izindawo eziqondile ziqhubeka ziqondile, izindawo ezigobile ziba izindawo eziqondile eziningi ezincane, futhi inhlanganisela ingena njengesidumbu esisodwa nengxenye ngayinye lapho ifayela lilibeka khona. Dweba ezindaweni zalo eziqondile, usike kuzo futhi wengeze kuzo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-mesh ye-STL, OBJ ne-3MF iba izidumbu eziqinile.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula noma uyidonse ifayela: i-PartCraft ihlanganisa amakhona aphindiwe, ivala izikhala ezincane, igcwalisa izimbobo futhi iguqule izinxantathu ezibheke ngendlela engalungile, bese ikutshela ukuthi yenzeni nokuthi i-mesh manje iyavaleka yini. Khetha izinyunithi nokuthi yiyiphi indlela eyaphezulu, bese isidumbu sifika njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E, nezindawo zaso eziqondile njengezindawo zokudweba. I-mesh engeke ivale itshela ukuthi kusele izimbobo ezingaki futhi ayingezi lutho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF njengesidumbu esiqinile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-.3dm avulwa njengesidumbu esisodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ama-mesh, ama-polysurface, ukukhishwa kanye nokubekwa kwamabhulokhi efayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ifika njengesidumbu esisodwa esiqinile, kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe kufayela noma ahlelwe izinxantathu yi-PartCraft, ngokulungiswa okufanayo nokuhlolwa kwe-&quot;iyavaleka?&quot; njenge-mesh. Amajika, umbhalo, izinto ze-SubD, izendlalelo nemibala kukhishwa, nencwadi iyasho lokho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-.3dm njengesidumbu esiqinile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izingxenye-nezinhlanganisela\"\u003EIzingxenye nezinhlanganisela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka oluvela ezigabeni zensimbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Dweba uhlaka ngemigqa, esketshini eyodwa noma kwezimbalwa kuhlaka lwe-3D, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye yesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E: isigaba etafuleni le-AISC noma le-EN 10365 sihamba kuwo wonke umugqa. Amakhona ayasikwa ngokuhlangana noma ngokuthinta, izingxenye ezihlangana ngokwe-T noma ezintathu ekhoneni zisikwa ukuze zilingane, imiphetho ekhululekile ingathola amakepisi namapuleti okuqinisa amakhona, nohlu lokusika lunika ubude nama-engeli wokuphela kwesiqeqeshana ngasinye (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza uhlu lokusika (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EUhlaka oluvela ezigabeni zensimbi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaluphu avaliwe kuzinhlanganisela.\u003C/strong\u003E Izingxenye ezihlanganiswe ngendandatho (uxhumo lwamabha amane, ihemu nesilayidi, uhlaka oluqiniswe) manje ziyavaleka: donsa noma uthayphe inani kulupu bese konke kulandela, futhi ukuhlolwa kokunyakaza kuhamba ngaleluphu ngendlela efanayo. Ukuxhumana okusenokunyakaza kuba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, nelupu elingeke livale liba bomvu futhi lishiye ukuthi likude kangakanani. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly#closed-loops-linkages\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\" data-hash=\"closed-loops-linkages\"\u003EAmaluphu avaliwe: uxhumo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye ezinamakhulu ezakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E I-PartCraft igcina isidumbu esasinaso phakathi komlando, ngakho ushintsho ngasemuva komlando lwakha kabusha kuphela izakhiwo ezilandela, futhi okusikiwe nokuphakanyiwe okungathintani kwenziwa kanyekanye. Ivivinywe ngengxenye enezakhiwo ezingu-750. Iwindi lezimingcele ligcina ukuqhubeka namakhulu wezibalo, futhi ukuhlehlisa kugcina izinyathelo ezingu-200 ngaphandle uma zisebenzisa inkumbulo eningi (akusoze kube ngaphansi kwezingu-20). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history#parts-with-hundreds-of-features\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\" data-hash=\"parts-with-hundreds-of-features\"\u003EIzingxenye ezinamakhulu ezakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphekhi yamavarianti…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungiselelwa\u003C/strong\u003E ku-thebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E yakha zonke izilungiselelo, noma ezo ozithikile, ku-zip eyodwa: i-STEP, i-IFC, ishidi lokudweba le-DWG kanye nesibonelo ngasinye, ithebula lezimingcele zazo (CSV ne-JSON), nengxenye njengento eyodwa yomtapo nezivarianti zayo. Ukulungiselelwa okungakwazi ukwakhiwa kuyadwetshwa futhi kukhishwe. Umugqa womyalo wenza okufanayo nge-\u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft variants\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EYenza iphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukwakha\"\u003EUkwakha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzisebenzi zamapost ongazihlela.\u003C/strong\u003E Amapost afana ne-Fanuc, GRBL ne-LinuxCNC ku-Manufacture manje angamafayela amafupi kufomethi yePartCraft yakhe, futhi abhala kanye kanye okwawabhala ngaphambili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela iposi…\u003C/span\u003E ivula ikhophi yakho yomunye (futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIposi elisha…\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa ifayela le-post…\u003C/span\u003E), ikhombisa ukuthi yiliphi umugqa olungalungile, futhi ibonise i-G-code ayibhalayo njengoba uthayipha. Amapost agcinwa engxenyeni nanjengamafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.cpost\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EIzisebenzi zamapost ongazihlela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqeda i-3D: Parallel ne-Scallop.\u003C/strong\u003E Qeda ubuso bonke bemodeli ngebhola, ngesihlabi se-bull-nose noma esiyisicaba, ngemigqa eyi-Parallel nanoma yiliphi ikhona, noma ngokudlula okuhlukaniswe ngebanga elithile ukuze umgogodla phakathi kwawo ube nokuphakama okucelwayo (akusebenzi nesihlabi esiyisicaba). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EUkuqeda i-3D: parallel ne-scallop\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo wamathuluzi.\u003C/strong\u003E Gcina amathuluzi kulesi sisheshi sengxenye ngayinye, bese uwathumela noma uwangenise njengefayela le-JSON ukuze uwadlulisele kwenye ikhompyutha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tool-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tool-library\"\u003EUmtapo wamathuluzi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko ngokuqhathaniswa nemodeli ngemibala.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa isitoko esilingisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E sivuliwe, isitoko siluhlaza emodelini, sibomvu lapho ithuluzi lisike khona, nesiphuzi kuya kwegrey lapho isitoko sisele khona, nencwadi esendaweni yephaneli. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#simulate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"simulate\"\u003ELingisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuseleyo okugcinwe phakathi kwama-nest.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngemva kwe-nest, okusele kwephuleti ngalinye kungaba yinsalela enenombolo nempahla yayo nobukhulu bayo. I-nest elandelayo yempahla nobukhulu obufanayo isebenzisa izinsalela kuqala, bese kugcwala amaphuleti; uhlu lwesitoko lugcinwa kufayela nanjengeCSV, futhi i-DXF iphawula insalela ngayinye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-offcuts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-offcuts\"\u003EGcina futhi usebenzise okuseleyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlelo ze-laser.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwelaser…\u003C/span\u003E ithatha izinkombandlela kufayela le-DXF futhi isethe ukuthi isendlalelo ngasinye senzani (sika, cwecwa, bhala, gcwalisa), ibonise izinyathelo zekhanda bese igcina i-G-code yemodi yelaser ye-GRBL. Ku-Chrome ne-Edge ingaphinda ihlaka umsebenzi ngelaser ivaliwe, bese iwuthumela nge-USB. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa kufayela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/laser-cutting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/laser-cutting\"\u003EThumela umdwebo ku-laser\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthumela kwe-USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ingxenye nempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima, noma inhlanganisela enengxenye ngayinye kanye kanye namakhophi wonke abekiwe, ngamamitha nge-Z ephezulu. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"partcraft/usd\"\u003EThumela ingxenye noma inhlanganisela njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"abasizi\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi womsizi wakho we-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma kuvuliwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, umsizi oxhunyiwe nge-CadCraft Studio angafunda izakhiwo, izimingcele nezakhiwo zobunzima, asethe ipharamitha bese ekha kabusha (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa), aqhube isikripthi se-CraftScript, Lua noma Python njengendlela indawo yokusebenza ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikripthi\u003C/span\u003E eyenza ngayo, athumele i-STL, 3MF, i-STEP ebhikiwe noma i-USD, agcine, futhi athumele umhlahlandlela njenge-PDF, SVG, imiyalelo noma ifayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo. Iseva lefayela nomugqa womyalo we-\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E kwenza okufanayo ezingxenyeni nasemihlahlandlelweni egciniwe. I-PartCraft ayinayo i-AI. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003ESebenzisa i-PartCraft nomsizi we-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okushintshiwe\"\u003EOkushintshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye enesidumbu esivela kufayela igcinwa njengenguqulo yengxenye 5.\u003C/strong\u003E Ingxenye enesidumbu se-STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF noma \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E igcina izinxantathu ezilungisiwe ngaphakathi kwefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho awudingi ifayela lokuqala futhi. I-PartCraft 0.6 yenqaba inguqulo 5 ngomyalezo wayo &quot;inguqulo entsha&quot; esikhundleni sokuyivula ngendlela engalungile. Ezinye izingxenye zigcinwa njengakuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/file-formats#the-partcraft-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/file-formats\" data-hash=\"the-partcraft-files\"\u003EAmafayela e-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmapost obhala wena agcinwa engxenyeni. I-PartCraft endala evula ingxenye enjalo iyawuphonsa amapost lapho iyigcina futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo\"\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyunithi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinyunithi\u003C/span\u003E inolunye uhlu ngalunye lwe-ubude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, ngosayizi abanikezwa izincazelo zeyunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala iyunithi ongayisebenzisi nakancane, futhi ayiphumi ohlwini lweyunithi; faka inkanyezi kwenye, umsebenzi omusha uqala kuyo. Ifayela lihlala ligcina iyunithi yalo. Amabhokisi e-PartCraft awalandeli izinhlu noma inkanyezi kusaqala: izingxenye sezisabonisa ngamamilimitha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EIzinyunithi, izinani ezithayiwe nezinhlu zeyunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo esihlangene nezipaneli ezihlungazelwayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E ingena okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini ezithinta nemishini ebanjwayo zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Iphaneli ngayinye eseceleni inebha yesihloko emincane: yidonse ukuze uyimise noma uyiphakamise, yilahle ebhareni yephaneli yenye ukuze yabelane ngefreyimu njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze ishelele ngasemphethweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisela emphethweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003ELungisa izipaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadayalogi ayanyakaza.\u003C/strong\u003E Donsa idayalogi ngebha yesihloko uyikhiphe endleleni yomdwebo; ibuyela lapho uyishiye khona. Chofoza kabili ebhareni yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele ephakathi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EHambisa idayalogi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIresiphi zabasizi be-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlela umdwebo, dweba isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala ukubalwa kwamanani, zama ivarianti yengxenye…), ngayinye nethuluzi layo elibizwayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye ihlolwa ngezivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIresiphi zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E itsha kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlimi\u003C/span\u003E. Yona, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E manje sekunawo wonke amagama ezinhlelo, njengemihlahlandlela engakabhekwa yisisebenzi somdabu. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi, kanti eyodwa isesiSpanishi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-CadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E ithi kungani ukuhlolwa kwesibuyekezo kwehlulekile (akukho ifayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginesha esingalungile) esikhundleni sokuthi &quot;Kwenziwe&quot; nje, futhi iyeka ukubuyisa ikhadi le-Okusha elivaliwe uze ube ukukhishwa okusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa kule nguqulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 ayisayiniwe ngekhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusayina, nephakheji ye-Microsoft Store, kudlulele ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eduze kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi oluthe xaxa\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka noma kunjalo\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngakwesokudla ku-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi kakukho ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlu ze-engeli nokuthambeka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinyunithi\u003C/span\u003E ziyagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elizifunda okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzidumbu ezivela kumafayela e-STEP, e-mesh nama-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E azinakho umlando, nezindawo zazo ezigobile ziyizindawo ezincane eziqondile. Imibala, amagama ezingxenye nesihlahla senhlanganisela akufundwa ku-STEP; amajika, izinto ze-SubD, umbhalo, izendlalelo nemibala akufundwa ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E. Umfundi we-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ubhekwe emafayeleni abhalwe ithuluzi lefomethi ngokwalo, hhayi okwamanje emafayeleni agcinwe uhlelo lokumodela ngokwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Illustrate ayikavuli amafayela e-STEP ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwenye ifayela…\u003C/span\u003E okwamanje (vula i-STEP kwi-Idizayini bese uqala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka engxenyeni evulekile\u003C/span\u003E), i-ModelCraft ne-BimCraft azikwazi ukudlulisa imodeli ngqo kuyo, nezithombe ezisezingeni le-path tracer azinikezwa. Ukuthunyelwa kwevidiyo nefayela elisebenzisanayo azikahlolwa ngamafoni nezithebuleti zangempela okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo ze-laser zithatha izinkombandlela kumafayela e-DXF kuphela: amaphethini aqondile ezingxenye zethala adinga i-exact kernel. I-CadCraft Studio ayinayo i-Web Serial okwamanje, ngakho gcina i-G-code bese uyithumela ngohlelo lwe-laser yakho. I-G-code ye-laser namapost amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi awakaqinisekiswa emshinini wangempela: hlola zonke izinhlelo kusilingisi somlawuli wakho kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda i-3D kuyi-Parallel ne-Scallop kuphela: akukho ukuhlanza i-3D, i-waterline, i-pencil noma ukukhishwa okusele, akukho ukujikeleza. Umtapo wamathuluzi ugcinwa kulesi sisheshi, awuhlanganiswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi lomlungiseleli, lapho izivakashi zikhetha ivarianti kuwebhusayithi zilande, livulelwe abasebenzi kuphela kuze kuvulwe isiswishi sewebhusayithi. Amachweba (izindawo zokuxhuma) akasethwa kusuka ku-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye zesakhiwo zilandela imigqa eqondile kuphela futhi ziyisidumbu esisodwa, azinawo amajeqe okushisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzitayela zemenyu yebhande ze-PartCraft zisadweba zonke izinkinobho ngosayizi ogcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImagnethi: amamagnethi asingiwe aseqa ku-2-D kuphela; izinjini, insimbi egcwele kanye nomeshi wezingxenye ezigobile azikakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kusencwadini \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lezi yizinto ezishintshe ku-PartCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Izingxenye ziza kusuka emafayeleni amaningi, futhi indawo entsha yenza imihlahlandlela ngokusuka kuklama lwakho. Okusha Imihlahlandlela ngokusuka kuklama lwakho Indawo yokusebenza ye-Illustrate. Khetha Illustrate kumshintshi we-Indawo yokusebenza, bese Okusha eqenjini le-Umhlahlandlela: umhlahlandlela uqala ngengxenye evulekile noma ngenhlanganisela evulekile, ngenhlanganisela egciniwe, noma ngefayela le-glTF, OBJ, STL noma 3MF (isihlahla sawo namagama kugcinwa; amakhophi engxenye eyodwa aba yingxenye eyodwa enenani). Umhlahlandlela uyifayela layo (.partcraft-manual.json) enekhophi yezingxenye, ngakho imibhalo iqhubeka kuyilapho uklama luqhubeka. Bona Qala umhlahlandlela ku-Illustrate. Imibono nokubukeka. Fihla, yenza zibonakale kancane, hlukanisa noma shintsha imibala yezingxenye, dlala umbono ohlukaniswayo, sika isigaba noma ibhokisi emodelini, engeza isikhulisi, bese ugcina konke njengombono. Bona Imibono, ukubukeka, izigaba nesikhulisi. Amabhamuni nohlu lwezingxenye. Ukuchofoza kanye kwenza amabhamuni zonke izingxenye umbono oziboniso; izinombolo zihlala nezingxenye zazo futhi azisoze ziphindwe. Uhlu lungahlala embonweni futhi lugcinwe njenge-CSV. Bona Uhlu lwezingxenye namabhamuni. Izincazelo ezihlala zinamathiselwe: amalebula nezincazelo ezigcwalisa inombolo yengxenye, igama, impahla noma inani, izimpini, izibalo, amakhona neradiyasi ezivela ezingxenyeni, ezimo nezithombe. Zihamba nengxenye yazo lapho ihlukaniswa. Bona Izincazelo ezihlala zinamathiselwe. Imigqa yobuciko, imiyalelo nefayela le-3D. Thumela noma yimuphi umbono njengemigqa yobuciko ye-vector (SVG noma PDF) enemigqa efihliwe namasekhishi anemigqa, noma njenge-PNG; shintsha imibono ibe imiyalelo ngezinyathelo ibe yi-PDF noma ikhasi elilodwa le-HTML; noma gcina ifayela elilodwa le-HTML elivula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kunoma yisiphequluli esiyiso, nemibono, uhlu lwezingxenye nokunyakaza. Bona Imidwebo yezobuchwepheshe, Imiyalelo kanye Ifayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo. Ukunyakaza nokubuyekeza. Faka izikhombisi zokunyakaza ezingxenyeni nasekhamera, qopha umbono ohlukaniswayo sinyathelo ngesinyathelo, bese ulondoloza ividiyo. Lapho uklama lushintsha, Buyekeza kusuka kwidizayini… ibonisa okunyakazile, okushintshile, okufikile noma okuhambile ngaphambi kokuthi kushintshe lutho, futhi igcina imibono, izincazelo, amabhamuni nezikhombisi zihlala nezingxenye zazo. Bona Yenza umhlahlandlela ube nokunyakaza kanye Buyekeza umhlahlandlela kusuka kwidizayini. Ukuvula amanye amafayela Amafayela e-STEP avulwa njengezidumbu eziqinile. Vula ifunda i-AP203, i-AP214 ne-AP242 STEP ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel. Izindawo eziqondile ziqhubeka ziqondile, izindawo ezigobile ziba izindawo eziqondile eziningi ezincane, futhi inhlanganisela ingena njengesidumbu esisodwa nengxenye ngayinye lapho ifayela lilibeka khona. Dweba ezindaweni zalo eziqondile, usike kuzo futhi wengeze kuzo. Bona Vula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo. I-mesh ye-STL, OBJ ne-3MF iba izidumbu eziqinile. Vula noma uyidonse ifayela: i-PartCraft ihlanganisa amakhona aphindiwe, ivala izikhala ezincane, igcwalisa izimbobo futhi iguqule izinxantathu ezibheke ngendlela engalungile, bese ikutshela ukuthi yenzeni nokuthi i-mesh manje iyavaleka yini. Khetha izinyunithi nokuthi yiyiphi indlela eyaphezulu, bese isidumbu sifika njenge-Imported1, nezindawo zaso eziqondile njengezindawo zokudweba. I-mesh engeke ivale itshela ukuthi kusele izimbobo ezingaki futhi ayingezi lutho. Bona Vula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF njengesidumbu esiqinile. Amafayela e-.3dm avulwa njengesidumbu esisodwa. Ama-mesh, ama-polysurface, ukukhishwa kanye nokubekwa kwamabhulokhi efayela le-.3dm ifika njengesidumbu esisodwa esiqinile, kusuka kuma-mesh agcinwe kufayela noma ahlelwe izinxantathu yi-PartCraft, ngokulungiswa okufanayo nokuhlolwa kwe-\"iyavaleka?\" njenge-mesh. Amajika, umbhalo, izinto ze-SubD, izendlalelo nemibala kukhishwa, nencwadi iyasho lokho. Bona Vula imodeli ye-.3dm njengesidumbu esiqinile. Izingxenye nezinhlanganisela Uhlaka oluvela ezigabeni zensimbi. Dweba uhlaka ngemigqa, esketshini eyodwa noma kwezimbalwa kuhlaka lwe-3D, bese Okwengeziwe › Ingxenye yesakhiwo: isigaba etafuleni le-AISC noma le-EN 10365 sihamba kuwo wonke umugqa. Amakhona ayasikwa ngokuhlangana noma ngokuthinta, izingxenye ezihlangana ngokwe-T noma ezintathu ekhoneni zisikwa ukuze zilingane, imiphetho ekhululekile ingathola amakepisi namapuleti okuqinisa amakhona, nohlu lokusika lunika ubude nama-engeli wokuphela kwesiqeqeshana ngasinye (Londoloza uhlu lokusika (CSV)). Bona Uhlaka oluvela ezigabeni zensimbi. Amaluphu avaliwe kuzinhlanganisela. Izingxenye ezihlanganiswe ngendandatho (uxhumo lwamabha amane, ihemu nesilayidi, uhlaka oluqiniswe) manje ziyavaleka: donsa noma uthayphe inani kulupu bese konke kulandela, futhi ukuhlolwa kokunyakaza kuhamba ngaleluphu ngendlela efanayo. Ukuxhumana okusenokunyakaza kuba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, nelupu elingeke livale liba bomvu futhi lishiye ukuthi likude kangakanani. Bona Amaluphu avaliwe: uxhumo. Izingxenye ezinamakhulu ezakhiwo. I-PartCraft igcina isidumbu esasinaso phakathi komlando, ngakho ushintsho ngasemuva komlando lwakha kabusha kuphela izakhiwo ezilandela, futhi okusikiwe nokuphakanyiwe okungathintani kwenziwa kanyekanye. Ivivinywe ngengxenye enezakhiwo ezingu-750. Iwindi lezimingcele ligcina ukuqhubeka namakhulu wezibalo, futhi ukuhlehlisa kugcina izinyathelo ezingu-200 ngaphandle uma zisebenzisa inkumbulo eningi (akusoze kube ngaphansi kwezingu-20). Bona Izingxenye ezinamakhulu ezakhiwo. Iphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho. Iphekhi yamavarianti… ngaphansi kwe-Ukulungiselelwa ku-thebhu ye-Imingcele yakha zonke izilungiselelo, noma ezo ozithikile, ku-zip eyodwa: i-STEP, i-IFC, ishidi lokudweba le-DWG kanye nesibonelo ngasinye, ithebula lezimingcele zazo (CSV ne-JSON), nengxenye njengento eyodwa yomtapo nezivarianti zayo. Ukulungiselelwa okungakwazi ukwakhiwa kuyadwetshwa futhi kukhishwe. Umugqa womyalo wenza okufanayo nge-partcraft variants. Bona Yenza iphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho. Ukwakha Izisebenzi zamapost ongazihlela. Amapost afana ne-Fanuc, GRBL ne-LinuxCNC ku-Manufacture manje angamafayela amafupi kufomethi yePartCraft yakhe, futhi abhala kanye kanye okwawabhala ngaphambili. Hlela iposi… ivula ikhophi yakho yomunye (futhi Iposi elisha… ne-Ngenisa ifayela le-post…), ikhombisa ukuthi yiliphi umugqa olungalungile, futhi ibonise i-G-code ayibhalayo njengoba uthayipha. Amapost agcinwa engxenyeni nanjengamafayela e-.cpost. Bona Izisebenzi zamapost ongazihlela. Ukuqeda i-3D: Parallel ne-Scallop. Qeda ubuso bonke bemodeli ngebhola, ngesihlabi se-bull-nose noma esiyisicaba, ngemigqa eyi-Parallel nanoma yiliphi ikhona, noma ngokudlula okuhlukaniswe ngebanga elithile ukuze umgogodla phakathi kwawo ube nokuphakama okucelwayo (akusebenzi nesihlabi esiyisicaba). Bona Ukuqeda i-3D: parallel ne-scallop. Umtapo wamathuluzi. Gcina amathuluzi kulesi sisheshi sengxenye ngayinye, bese uwathumela noma uwangenise njengefayela le-JSON ukuze uwadlulisele kwenye ikhompyutha. Bona Umtapo wamathuluzi. Isitoko ngokuqhathaniswa nemodeli ngemibala. Uma Bonisa isitoko esilingisiwe sivuliwe, isitoko siluhlaza emodelini, sibomvu lapho ithuluzi lisike khona, nesiphuzi kuya kwegrey lapho isitoko sisele khona, nencwadi esendaweni yephaneli. Bona Lingisa. Okuseleyo okugcinwe phakathi kwama-nest. Ngemva kwe-nest, okusele kwephuleti ngalinye kungaba yinsalela enenombolo nempahla yayo nobukhulu bayo. I-nest elandelayo yempahla nobukhulu obufanayo isebenzisa izinsalela kuqala, bese kugcwala amaphuleti; uhlu lwesitoko lugcinwa kufayela nanjengeCSV, futhi i-DXF iphawula insalela ngayinye. Bona Gcina futhi usebenzise okuseleyo. Izinhlelo ze-laser. Thumela › Uhlelo lwelaser… ithatha izinkombandlela kufayela le-DXF futhi isethe ukuthi isendlalelo ngasinye senzani (sika, cwecwa, bhala, gcwalisa), ibonise izinyathelo zekhanda bese igcina i-G-code yemodi yelaser ye-GRBL. Ku-Chrome ne-Edge ingaphinda ihlaka umsebenzi ngelaser ivaliwe, bese iwuthumela nge-USB. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa kufayela. Bona Thumela umdwebo ku-laser. Ukuthumela kwe-USD. Thumela › Iphakheji ye-USD (.usdz) ibhala ingxenye nempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima, noma inhlanganisela enengxenye ngayinye kanye kanye namakhophi wonke abekiwe, ngamamitha nge-Z ephezulu. Bona Thumela ingxenye noma inhlanganisela njenge-USD. Abasizi Amathuluzi womsizi wakho we-AI. Uma kuvuliwe ku-Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › Abasizi, umsizi oxhunyiwe nge-CadCraft Studio angafunda izakhiwo, izimingcele nezakhiwo zobunzima, asethe ipharamitha bese ekha kabusha (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa), aqhube isikripthi se-CraftScript, Lua noma Python njengendlela indawo yokusebenza ye-Isikripthi eyenza ngayo, athumele i-STL, 3MF, i-STEP ebhikiwe noma i-USD, agcine, futhi athumele umhlahlandlela njenge-PDF, SVG, imiyalelo noma ifayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo. Iseva lefayela nomugqa womyalo we-cadcraft kwenza okufanayo ezingxenyeni nasemihlahlandlelweni egciniwe. I-PartCraft ayinayo i-AI. Bona Sebenzisa i-PartCraft nomsizi we-AI. Okushintshiwe Ingxenye enesidumbu esivela kufayela igcinwa njengenguqulo yengxenye 5. Ingxenye enesidumbu se-STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF noma .3dm igcina izinxantathu ezilungisiwe ngaphakathi kwefayela le-.partcraft.json, ngakho awudingi ifayela lokuqala futhi. I-PartCraft 0.6 yenqaba inguqulo 5 ngomyalezo wayo \"inguqulo entsha\" esikhundleni sokuyivula ngendlela engalungile. Ezinye izingxenye zigcinwa njengakuqala. Bona Amafayela e-PartCraft. Amapost obhala wena agcinwa engxenyeni. I-PartCraft endala evula ingxenye enjalo iyawuphonsa amapost lapho iyigcina futhi. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Izinyunithi. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Izinyunithi inolunye uhlu ngalunye lwe-ubude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, ngosayizi abanikezwa izincazelo zeyunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala iyunithi ongayisebenzisi nakancane, futhi ayiphumi ohlwini lweyunithi; faka inkanyezi kwenye, umsebenzi omusha uqala kuyo. Ifayela lihlala ligcina iyunithi yalo. Amabhokisi e-PartCraft awalandeli izinhlu noma inkanyezi kusaqala: izingxenye sezisabonisa ngamamilimitha. Bona Izinyunithi, izinani ezithayiwe nezinhlu zeyunithi. Isakhiwo esihlangene nezipaneli ezihlungazelwayo. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo › Okuhlangene ingena okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini ezithinta nemishini ebanjwayo zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Iphaneli ngayinye eseceleni inebha yesihloko emincane: yidonse ukuze uyimise noma uyiphakamise, yilahle ebhareni yephaneli yenye ukuze yabelane ngefreyimu njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze ishelele ngasemphethweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisela emphethweni. Bona Lungisa izipaneli. Amadayalogi ayanyakaza. Donsa idayalogi ngebha yesihloko uyikhiphe endleleni yomdwebo; ibuyela lapho uyishiye khona. Chofoza kabili ebhareni yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele ephakathi. Bona Hambisa idayalogi. Iresiphi zabasizi be-AI. Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlela umdwebo, dweba isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala ukubalwa kwamanani, zama ivarianti yengxenye…), ngayinye nethuluzi layo elibizwayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye ihlolwa ngezivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bona Iresiphi zabasizi be-AI. Izilimi. Português (Portugal) itsha kuthi Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ulimi. Yona, Português (Brasil), Español (México) kanye Bahasa Indonesia manje sekunawo wonke amagama ezinhlelo, njengemihlahlandlela engakabhekwa yisisebenzi somdabu. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi, kanti eyodwa isesiSpanishi. I-CadCraft Studio ithi kungani ukuhlolwa kwesibuyekezo kwehlulekile (akukho ifayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginesha esingalungile) esikhundleni sokuthi \"Kwenziwe\" nje, futhi iyeka ukubuyisa ikhadi le-Okusha elivaliwe uze ube ukukhishwa okusha. Akukakwenziwa kule nguqulo 0.7 ayisayiniwe ngekhodi. Ukusayina, nephakheji ye-Microsoft Store, kudlulele ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eduze kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha Ulwazi oluthe xaxa, bese Qhubeka noma kunjalo. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngakwesokudla ku-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha Vula. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi kakukho ukwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone okwamanje. Izinhlu ze-engeli nokuthambeka ku-Izinyunithi ziyagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elizifunda okwamanje. Izidumbu ezivela kumafayela e-STEP, e-mesh nama-.3dm azinakho umlando, nezindawo zazo ezigobile ziyizindawo ezincane eziqondile. Imibala, amagama ezingxenye nesihlahla senhlanganisela akufundwa ku-STEP; amajika, izinto ze-SubD, umbhalo, izendlalelo nemibala akufundwa ku-.3dm. Umfundi we-.3dm ubhekwe emafayeleni abhalwe ithuluzi lefomethi ngokwalo, hhayi okwamanje emafayeleni agcinwe uhlelo lokumodela ngokwalo. I-Illustrate ayikavuli amafayela e-STEP ku-Kusuka kwenye ifayela… okwamanje (vula i-STEP kwi-Idizayini bese uqala Kusuka engxenyeni evulekile), i-ModelCraft ne-BimCraft azikwazi ukudlulisa imodeli ngqo kuyo, nezithombe ezisezingeni le-path tracer azinikezwa. Ukuthunyelwa kwevidiyo nefayela elisebenzisanayo azikahlolwa ngamafoni nezithebuleti zangempela okwamanje. Izinhlelo ze-laser zithatha izinkombandlela kumafayela e-DXF kuphela: amaphethini aqondile ezingxenye zethala adinga i-exact kernel. I-CadCraft Studio ayinayo i-Web Serial okwamanje, ngakho gcina i-G-code bese uyithumela ngohlelo lwe-laser yakho. I-G-code ye-laser namapost amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi awakaqinisekiswa emshinini wangempela: hlola zonke izinhlelo kusilingisi somlawuli wakho kuqala. Ukuqeda i-3D kuyi-Parallel ne-Scallop kuphela: akukho ukuhlanza i-3D, i-waterline, i-pencil noma ukukhishwa okusele, akukho ukujikeleza. Umtapo wamathuluzi ugcinwa kulesi sisheshi, awuhlanganiswa. Ikhasi lomlungiseleli, lapho izivakashi zikhetha ivarianti kuwebhusayithi zilande, livulelwe abasebenzi kuphela kuze kuvulwe isiswishi sewebhusayithi. Amachweba (izindawo zokuxhuma) akasethwa kusuka ku-PartCraft. Izingxenye zesakhiwo zilandela imigqa eqondile kuphela futhi ziyisidumbu esisodwa, azinawo amajeqe okushisela. Izitayela zemenyu yebhande ze-PartCraft zisadweba zonke izinkinobho ngosayizi ogcwele. Imagnethi: amamagnethi asingiwe aseqa ku-2-D kuphela; izinjini, insimbi egcwele kanye nomeshi wezingxenye ezigobile azikakhiwa. Konke okunye kusencwadini Okungakakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qala nge-PartCraft","summary":"Yini ePartCraft ayenza namuhla, okudingeka isiphequluli sakho, nengxenye yokuqala ngemizuzu eyishumi, kusukela ekuskeçheni kuya kufayela elilondoloziwe.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["qala","ukuqala kokuqala","isiqalo esisheshayo","isingeniso","ithutorial","ingxenye yokuqala","ipuleti","parametric","umenzi wengxenye"],"headings":[{"id":"okudingekayo","text":"Okudingekayo","level":2},{"id":"vula-i-partcraft","text":"Vula i-PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"ingxenye-yakho-yokuqala-ipuleti-nemgodi","text":"Ingxenye yakho yokuqala: ipuleti nemgodi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-umjikelezo","text":"Dweba umjikelezo","level":3},{"id":"nikeza-usayizi","text":"Nikeza usayizi","level":3},{"id":"khipha-isolidi","text":"Khipha isolidi","level":3},{"id":"engeza-umgodi","text":"Engeza umgodi","level":3},{"id":"londoloza","text":"Londoloza","level":3},{"id":"lapho-okulandelayo","text":"Lapho okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft iyi-app ye-parametric yengxenye nenhlanganisela yomndeni we-CadCraft. Udweba isikethi se-2D, uyibophe ngezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, uyiguqule ibe isolidi ngezici ezifana ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ungashintsha noma iyiphi inombolo kamuva: ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha kusuka emlandweni wayo. Izingxenye zibe sezingena ezinhlanganisweni, lapho amajoyinti azibeka khona futhi akuvumele uhlole ukunyakaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwenziwa yileli nguqulo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkutholayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasketshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa, amarektangili, izindilinga, imisalo, amaphoyinti nemigqa yesisekelo, nezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, nesimo esiphilayo: ichazwe kancane, ichazwe ngokuphelele noma ichazwe ngokweqile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici zesolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhipha, sika, jikeleza, sika ngokujikeleza, imbobo elula nembobo enesikhala, amaphethini ayisiqondo nawokujikeleza, isibuko, ama-fillet nama-chamfer phakathi kwezindawo ezithe tshe, namama-shell nezinhlaka ezindaweni ezithe tshe. I-sweep, i-loft nezinye izici ezidinga i-kernel eqondile azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmlando\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela izinombolo zanoma yisiphi isici, vimbela, buyela emuva, hlela kabusha futhi usule, nokuhlehlisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezixhunywe ngamajoyinti aqinile, ajikelezayo nokuhamba, ukuhlolwa kokugqekeza nokuhlolwa kokunyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi le-A3 elinemibono emithathu, i-isometric, isigaba, umbono wemininingwane, izilinganiso eziphelele, ama-datum, imifreyimu yokulawula izici nezimpawu zokuqeda ubuso, ethunyelwa njenge-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela awo engxenye nenhlanganisela; i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP eyenziwe ngobuso, i-DXF ne-PDF ephumayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kusebenza kusiphequluli sakho, kukhompyutha yakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho lutho olulayishwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/files\"\u003EAmafayela: vula, londoloza nokuthumela\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole lapho amafayela aya khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingekayo\"\u003EOkudingekayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox noma i-Safari yamanje enendlela ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EWebGL\u003C/strong\u003E (izithombe ze-3D) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EWebAssembly\u003C/strong\u003E evuliwe. Zombili zivulwa ngokuzenzakalela. Ijiyomethri yesolidi yakhiwa yi-mesh kernel ye-WebAssembly elayisha nge-app: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImbewu iyinhle kakhulu. I-trackpad iyasebenza, nezikrini ezithinta ziyasebenza ukubuka nokudweba okulula: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esinobubanzi obungu-1280 pixels noma ngaphezulu sibonisa ibha yonke yamathuluzi emugqeni owodwa. Amawindi amancane askrolela ibha yamathuluzi ngokuqondile; kuma-foni amaphaneli avulela njengamashidi kusuka kubha engaphansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwengeziwe ngamabhrawuza: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EAmabhrawuza nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft isebenza ebhrawuzeni, nasekhompyutheni ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje: uvula izingxenye kukhompyutha yakho futhi ubuyisele kuyo njengamafayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-i-partcraft\"\u003EVula i-PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda kuze isikrini sithi &quot;Kulayisha i-kernel ye-solid…&quot;. Lokhu kuthatha isikhashana okokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbona i-view ye-3D engenalutho enamapuleni amathathu asisekelo, umlando ngakwesobunxele (&quot;Part1&quot;, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza ephambili\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza ephezulu\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E) nebhokisi ku-view elithi &quot;Qala ingxenye&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIchip eseduze nesokudla sebha yesimo ithi &quot;Kernel yemeshi&quot;: i-PartCraft yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel kulolu nguqulo, ngakho ubuso obujikelezayo buyizinxantathu ezithe tshe. Ungaqala ukumodela ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-view ithi isiphequluli asikwazi ukubonisa i-3D, noma i-kernel ingalayishanga, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting#the-app-does-not-start\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"the-app-does-not-start\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ingxenye-yakho-yokuqala-ipuleti-nemgodi\"\u003EIngxenye yakho yokuqala: ipuleti nemgodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzokwenza ipuleti elingu-60 × 40 mm, elinobukhulu obungu-10 mm, nomgodi ongu-6 mm uwudlule. Izinyunithi zimamilimitha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dweba-umjikelezo\"\u003EDweba umjikelezo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza ephambili\u003C/strong\u003E emlandweni ngakwesobunxele. Indiza iyakhanyisa ku-view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yamathuluzi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. I-view iphenduka ibheke ngqo kwindiza, nethuluzi lomugqa liyasebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ethulusini le-Irektangili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi siye kuphoyinti lemvelaphi (iphoyinti elibomvu elincane elinesiphambano). Isikwele esincane sikhombisa ukuthi siyabamba. Chofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambela phezulu nakwesokudla bese uchofoza futhi. Unerektangili. Imigqa yayo iluhlaza: okuluhlaza kusho ukuthi isenganyakaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nikeza-usayizi\"\u003ENikeza usayizi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ethulusini lesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa ophezulu, bese uchofoza kancane phezu kwawo. Ibhokisi lenombolo livula ubude bamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Ccode\u003E60\u003C/code\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Irektangili iguqukela ku-60 mm ububanzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa wesobunxele, bese uchofoza kancane ngakwesobunxele kwawo. Bhala \u003Ccode\u003E40\u003C/code\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIchip ekhoneni elingakwesobunxele esiphezulu kwe-view manje ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIchazwe ngokuphelele\u003C/strong\u003E, nemigqa iguquka ibe yinki (emnyama kwitimu elithi Iphepha, ekhanyayo kwitimu elithi Imodeli). Wonke amaphoyinti nosayizi ulungisiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uqale irektangili kude nemvelaphi, ichip ithi &quot;Ichazwe ngokungaphelele · amadigri angu-2 enkululeko&quot;. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ye-Select, chofoza ikhona elilodwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza imvelaphi, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Ihlangene\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"khipha-isolidi\"\u003EKhipha isolidi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yamathuluzi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuze kuvale isikethi (ngokuvamile kabili).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E. Kuvela isolidi esingu-10 mm. &quot;Extrude1&quot; yengezwa emlandweni, &quot;Sketch1&quot; ihlehliswe ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli yesokudla kubonakala izilungiselelo zokukhipha. Ukushintsha ubukhulu, bhala inombolo entsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"engeza-umgodi\"\u003EEngeza umgodi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obukhulu obuthe ngaphambili kwepuleti (ukuphela kokukhishwa). Bonke ubuso buyakhanyisa futhi ephaneli yesokudla ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kulobu buso\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ethulusini le-Point bese uchofoza eduze nephakathi kobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E. Umgodi ongu-6 mm uwudlula ipuleti. Shintsha \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yesokudla uma ufuna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesobunxele esiphansi manje lifunda ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi (60 × 40 × 10 mm) kanye &quot;Imigodi edlule: 1&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"londoloza\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiphequluli sakho silanda \u003Ccode\u003EPart1.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E efolda yakho yokulanda. Ifayela liphethe umlando wonke: vula futhi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uqhubeke uhlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uqambe kabusha ingxenye kuqala, chofoza indawo engenalutho ku-view ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese uthayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E elisha ephaneli yesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-okulandelayo\"\u003ELapho okulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EDweba isikethi sakho sokuqala\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza ngokuphelele isikethi\u003C/a\u003E zichaza isikhethi ngokugcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EShintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo\u003C/a\u003E ikhombisa indlela yokuhlela into oyakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EJikeleza, gqumuza nokhande ngaphakathi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EYenza umdwebo\u003C/a\u003E kuqeda ingxenye. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuhlu okungenziwa yileli nguqulo, njengama-sweep nama-loft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"partcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUvela kolunye umenzi we-parametric\u003C/a\u003E uhlu lwezinkambiso ezisebenza ngokuhlukile lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIzinkinobho nemouse\u003C/a\u003E uhlu olugcwele lwezinqamuleli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/help\" data-topic=\"basics/help\"\u003EUkusebenzisa lolu siqondiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft iyi-app ye-parametric yengxenye nenhlanganisela yomndeni we-CadCraft. Udweba isikethi se-2D, uyibophe ngezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, uyiguqule ibe isolidi ngezici ezifana ne-Ukukhipha, Jikeleza ne-Imbobo, futhi ungashintsha noma iyiphi inombolo kamuva: ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha kusuka emlandweni wayo. Izingxenye zibe sezingena ezinhlanganisweni, lapho amajoyinti azibeka khona futhi akuvumele uhlole ukunyakaza. Okwenziwa yileli nguqulo: Umsebenzi Okutholayo Amasketshi Imigqa, amarektangili, izindilinga, imisalo, amaphoyinti nemigqa yesisekelo, nezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, nesimo esiphilayo: ichazwe kancane, ichazwe ngokuphelele noma ichazwe ngokweqile Izici zesolidi Ukukhipha, sika, jikeleza, sika ngokujikeleza, imbobo elula nembobo enesikhala, amaphethini ayisiqondo nawokujikeleza, isibuko, ama-fillet nama-chamfer phakathi kwezindawo ezithe tshe, namama-shell nezinhlaka ezindaweni ezithe tshe. I-sweep, i-loft nezinye izici ezidinga i-kernel eqondile azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo: bheka Okungakakhiwa Umlando Hlela izinombolo zanoma yisiphi isici, vimbela, buyela emuva, hlela kabusha futhi usule, nokuhlehlisa Izinhlanganisela Izingxenye ezixhunywe ngamajoyinti aqinile, ajikelezayo nokuhamba, ukuhlolwa kokugqekeza nokuhlolwa kokunyakaza Imidwebo Ishidi le-A3 elinemibono emithathu, i-isometric, isigaba, umbono wemininingwane, izilinganiso eziphelele, ama-datum, imifreyimu yokulawula izici nezimpawu zokuqeda ubuso, ethunyelwa njenge-PDF Amafayela Amafayela awo engxenye nenhlanganisela; i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP eyenziwe ngobuso, i-DXF ne-PDF ephumayo Konke kusebenza kusiphequluli sakho, kukhompyutha yakho. Akukho lutho olulayishwa. Bheka Amafayela: vula, londoloza nokuthumela ukuze uthole lapho amafayela aya khona. Okudingekayo I-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox noma i-Safari yamanje enendlela ye-WebGL (izithombe ze-3D) ne-WebAssembly evuliwe. Zombili zivulwa ngokuzenzakalela. Ijiyomethri yesolidi yakhiwa yi-mesh kernel ye-WebAssembly elayisha nge-app: bheka I-mesh kernel. Imbewu iyinhle kakhulu. I-trackpad iyasebenza, nezikrini ezithinta ziyasebenza ukubuka nokudweba okulula: bheka Trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane. Isikrini esinobubanzi obungu-1280 pixels noma ngaphezulu sibonisa ibha yonke yamathuluzi emugqeni owodwa. Amawindi amancane askrolela ibha yamathuluzi ngokuqondile; kuma-foni amaphaneli avulela njengamashidi kusuka kubha engaphansi. Okwengeziwe ngamabhrawuza: Amabhrawuza nekhompyutha. I-PartCraft isebenza ebhrawuzeni, nasekhompyutheni ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje: uvula izingxenye kukhompyutha yakho futhi ubuyisele kuyo njengamafayela. Vula i-PartCraft Vula i-PartCraft. Linda kuze isikrini sithi \"Kulayisha i-kernel ye-solid…\". Lokhu kuthatha isikhashana okokuqala. Ubona i-view ye-3D engenalutho enamapuleni amathathu asisekelo, umlando ngakwesobunxele (\"Part1\", bese Indiza ephambili, Indiza ephezulu, Indiza yesokudla) nebhokisi ku-view elithi \"Qala ingxenye\". Ichip eseduze nesokudla sebha yesimo ithi \"Kernel yemeshi\": i-PartCraft yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel kulolu nguqulo, ngakho ubuso obujikelezayo buyizinxantathu ezithe tshe. Ungaqala ukumodela ngokushesha. Uma i-view ithi isiphequluli asikwazi ukubonisa i-3D, noma i-kernel ingalayishanga, bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Ingxenye yakho yokuqala: ipuleti nemgodi Uzokwenza ipuleti elingu-60 × 40 mm, elinobukhulu obungu-10 mm, nomgodi ongu-6 mm uwudlule. Izinyunithi zimamilimitha. Dweba umjikelezo Chofoza Indiza ephambili emlandweni ngakwesobunxele. Indiza iyakhanyisa ku-view. Khetha Isikethi kwibha yamathuluzi, noma cindezela S. I-view iphenduka ibheke ngqo kwindiza, nethuluzi lomugqa liyasebenza. Cindezela R ethulusini le-Irektangili. Hambisa isikhombi siye kuphoyinti lemvelaphi (iphoyinti elibomvu elincane elinesiphambano). Isikwele esincane sikhombisa ukuthi siyabamba. Chofoza. Hambela phezulu nakwesokudla bese uchofoza futhi. Unerektangili. Imigqa yayo iluhlaza: okuluhlaza kusho ukuthi isenganyakaza. Nikeza usayizi Cindezela D ethulusini lesilinganiso. Chofoza umugqa ophezulu, bese uchofoza kancane phezu kwawo. Ibhokisi lenombolo livula ubude bamanje. Bhala 60 bese ucindezela Enter. Irektangili iguqukela ku-60 mm ububanzi. Chofoza umugqa wesobunxele, bese uchofoza kancane ngakwesobunxele kwawo. Bhala 40 bese ucindezela Enter. Ichip ekhoneni elingakwesobunxele esiphezulu kwe-view manje ithi Ichazwe ngokuphelele, nemigqa iguquka ibe yinki (emnyama kwitimu elithi Iphepha, ekhanyayo kwitimu elithi Imodeli). Wonke amaphoyinti nosayizi ulungisiwe. Uma uqale irektangili kude nemvelaphi, ichip ithi \"Ichazwe ngokungaphelele · amadigri angu-2 enkululeko\". Cindezela S ye-Select, chofoza ikhona elilodwa, Shift+chofoza imvelaphi, bese ukhetha • Ihlangene ephaneli yesokudla. Khipha isolidi Khetha Phuma kwibha yamathuluzi, noma cindezela Esc kuze kuvale isikethi (ngokuvamile kabili). Khetha Ukukhipha. Kuvela isolidi esingu-10 mm. \"Extrude1\" yengezwa emlandweni, \"Sketch1\" ihlehliswe ngaphansi kwayo. Ephaneli yesokudla kubonakala izilungiselelo zokukhipha. Ukushintsha ubukhulu, bhala inombolo entsha ku-Ukujula (mm) bese ucindezela Enter noma Tab. Ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha. Engeza umgodi Chofoza ubuso obukhulu obuthe ngaphambili kwepuleti (ukuphela kokukhishwa). Bonke ubuso buyakhanyisa futhi ephaneli yesokudla ithi Ubuso. Khetha Sketch kulobu buso ephaneli yesokudla. Cindezela P ethulusini le-Point bese uchofoza eduze nephakathi kobuso. Khetha Phuma. Khetha Imbobo. Umgodi ongu-6 mm uwudlula ipuleti. Shintsha Ububanzi (mm) ephaneli yesokudla uma ufuna. Ibhokisi le-Ingxenye ngakwesobunxele esiphansi manje lifunda ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi (60 × 40 × 10 mm) kanye \"Imigodi edlule: 1\". Londoloza Cindezela Ctrl+S noma khetha Londoloza. Isiphequluli sakho silanda Part1.partcraft.json efolda yakho yokulanda. Ifayela liphethe umlando wonke: vula futhi nge-Vula ukuze uqhubeke uhlela. Ukuze uqambe kabusha ingxenye kuqala, chofoza indawo engenalutho ku-view ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese uthayipha Igama elisha ephaneli yesokudla. Lapho okulandelayo Dweba isikethi sakho sokuqala kanye Chaza ngokuphelele isikethi zichaza isikhethi ngokugcwele. Shintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo ikhombisa indlela yokuhlela into oyakhe. Jikeleza, gqumuza nokhande ngaphakathi kanye Yenza umdwebo kuqeda ingxenye. Okungakakhiwa kuhlu okungenziwa yileli nguqulo, njengama-sweep nama-loft. Uvela kolunye umenzi we-parametric uhlu lwezinkambiso ezisebenza ngokuhlukile lapha. Izinkinobho nemouse uhlu olugcwele lwezinqamuleli. Ukusebenzisa lolu siqondiso.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isikrini se-PartCraft","summary":"Ukuhambisa kuzo zonke ibha namaphaneli: ibha yamathuluzi nendlela eshintsha ngayo, umlando, izinto zengxenye, i-view ye-3D, ipaneli yezakhiwo nebha yesimo.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["isikrini","ukwakheka","ibha yamathuluzi","umlando","umlando wezici","izakhiwo","ipaneli","ibha yesimo","interface","ui","ukuhambisa","isikrini esigcwele"],"headings":[{"id":"ibha-ye-app","text":"Ibha ye-app","level":2},{"id":"ibha-yamathuluzi","text":"Ibha yamathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"umlando-ngakwesobunxele","text":"Umlando (ngakwesobunxele)","level":2},{"id":"izici-zengxenye","text":"Izici zengxenye","level":3},{"id":"i-view-ye-3d-phakathi","text":"I-view ye-3D (phakathi)","level":2},{"id":"ngenkathi-ukhetha-imiphetho-noma-izindawo","text":"Ngenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma izindawo","level":3},{"id":"esheethini-lomdwebo","text":"Esheethini lomdwebo","level":3},{"id":"ngenkathi-isikethi-sivuliwe","text":"Ngenkathi isikethi sivuliwe","level":3},{"id":"ipaneli-yezakhiwo-ngakwesokudla","text":"Ipaneli yezakhiwo (ngakwesokudla)","level":2},{"id":"ibha-yesimo-ngaphansi","text":"Ibha yesimo (ngaphansi)","level":2},{"id":"esikrinini-esincane","text":"Esikrinini esincane","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsikrini sinezingxenye ezinhlanu: ibha yamathuluzi phezulu, umlando ngakwesobunxele, i-view ye-3D phakathi, ipaneli yezakhiwo ngakwesokudla kanye nebha yesimo ngaphansi. Phezu kwakho konke kuhlezi i-app bar ye-CadCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-ye-app\"\u003EIbha ye-app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha encane eseqongeni ingeyewebhusayithi ye-CadCraft, hhayi ye-PartCraft uqobo. Ibonisa igama le-app nalapho isebenza, imenyu yenguqulo, \u003Cstrong\u003EMayelana ne-PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, inkinobho yemodi yesikrini kanye noshintsho lwetimu Iphepha / Imodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphepha\u003C/strong\u003E wumugqa omnyama esikhwameni elikhanyayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli\u003C/strong\u003E wumugqa okhanyayo kusikhangiso esimnyama. Imibala yesikethi ilandela itimu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) inethebhu elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E: iyiphi inkinobho yemouse ejikeleza i-view, ivili lemouse noma i-trackpad, nezihlobanisi lapho udweba. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yemodi yesikrini, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ijikeleza phakathi kwe-normal, full screen, kanye ne-full screen nebha ezifihliwe. Nebha ezifihliwe, hambisa isikhombi ngaphezulu komphetho (noma thinta lapho) ukuze ziphinde zivele. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela ku-normal. Lesi sinqamuleli yi-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nakuMac, hhayi ⌘.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yamathuluzi\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yamathuluzi ihlelekile. Iguquka ngalokho okwenzayo, ukuze ihlale emugqeni owodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIbonakala\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho kungavulwanga isikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrektangili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela lapho isikethi sivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu: Sika ngokujikeleza, Indiza, Ieksisi, Iphoyinti, Sweep, Loft, Uhlaka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngxenyeni, hhayi lapho kuvulwe isikethi noma umdwebo. Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezimbili ezithe tshe; i-Shell ne-Draft zisebenza ezindaweni ezithe tshe. I-Sweep ne-Loft azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (zidinga i-kernel eqondile); ukuchofoza kwenye kukutshela lokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela lapho ukhetha imiphetho noma izindawo ze-fillet, chamfer, shell noma draft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngxenyeni (kusebenza uma ingxenye inesolidi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatum\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImifreyimu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqeda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela esheethini lomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngxenyeni (kusebenza uma ingxenye inesolidi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjoyinti\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugqekeza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela kwinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho uhlela ingxenye evela kwinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu: Sika, Kopisha, Namathisela, Namathisela endaweni, Phindaphinda, Susa, Khetha konke, Khetha lutho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjalo; ngalinye lisebenza esikethini, emlandweni noma kwinhlanganisela oyikuyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBheka ngqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E (imenyu: Linganisa, Izakhiwo zobunzima, Isigaba, Uhlaka, Zebra, Ukugoqeka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindiza eziyisisekelo\u003C/span\u003E, bese Isometric, Phambili, Emuva, Phezulu, Phansi, Ngesokudla, Ngesokunxele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHambisa phezu kwenkinobho ukuze ubone ukuthi yenzani nesinqamuleli sayo. Inkinobho ehlwenywe ngegrey ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa njengamanje: isibonelo izinkinobho zezici lapho kuvulwe isikethi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjoyinti\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokuthi inhlanganisela inezingxenye ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini lokuhlela ihlu ngalinye lesenzo sokuhlela nesinqamuleli sayo. Ukuthi ukopisha namathisela kusebenza kuphi kulandela lapho usemi khona; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi uphindaphinde\u003C/a\u003E. Into ehlwenywe ngegrey itooltip yayo ichaza ukuthi kungani ingasebenzi njengamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E inezinto ezithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (ama-facet, mesh kernel)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E. Ezimbili ze-STEP eqondile ziyagreyiwa: azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo, ngakho sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umlando-ngakwesobunxele\"\u003EUmlando (ngakwesobunxele)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli ngakwesobunxele wumlando wezici zengxenye, uhlu i-PartCraft eyakha kusuka phezulu kuya phansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhanda liwigama lengxenye (&quot;Part1&quot; kuze kube usuku ululungise igama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza ephambili\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza ephezulu\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E zivela kuqala. Chofoza enye ukuze uyikhethe; iyakhanyisa ku-view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwazo kukhona izici zakho ngokuhlelwa kwazo. Isikethi esisetshenziswa yisici sibhalwe ngaphansi kwalesi sici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIflegi ekugcineni komugqa ikutshela isimo sawo:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIflegi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(akukho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwakhiwe, nesikethi sichazwe ngokuphelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E−\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi esingakachazwa ngokuphelele (singasanyakaza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi esichazwe ngokweqile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwakhiwe, nesixwayiso (hlola ukuze ufunde)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ error\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici sehlulekile. Hlola ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani, noma chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ not built\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici sidinga esinye esehlulekile noma esivaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvinjiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla kwegama lesici kubonakala inombolo yaso enkulu, njengo &quot;25 mm&quot; we-Extrude noma &quot;Ø6.6 thru&quot; wembobo. Chofoza kabili inombolo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E emugqeni, ukuze uyishintshe lapho. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isici ukuze usihlele ngakwesokunene. Chofoza kabili isikethi ukuze usivule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ubuyela emuva, umugqa othi \u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuyela emuva · qhubeka phambili\u003C/strong\u003E uvela ohlwini. Izici ngaphansi kwawo zihlwenywe ngegrey futhi azakhiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umugqa ugxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zihambisa phakathi kwemigqa, ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zihambisa isici ngokwaso, lapho umlando uvuma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwinhlanganisela leli phaneli libonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E (eyokuqala imakwe ngokuthi &quot;ibekwe phansi&quot;) no\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izici-zengxenye\"\u003EIzici zengxenye\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi komlando, ibhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E lidweba \u003Cstrong\u003EIvolumu\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yobuso\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi (X × Y × Z)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EImigodi edlule\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzidumbu\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinxantathu\u003C/strong\u003E, inani \u003Cstrong\u003ELezici\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi zingaki \u003Cstrong\u003EEzihlulekile\u003C/strong\u003E. Ivolumu neendawo zesolidi elinobuso elakhiwe yi-mesh kernel, zincane kancane kunenani langempela lezimo ezijikelezayo (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/features#curves-resolution\" data-topic=\"partcraft/features\" data-hash=\"curves-resolution\"\u003EIzici nezinketho zazo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwinhlanganisela ibhokisi linekhanda elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/strong\u003E: Izingxenye, Izibonelo, Amajoyinti, Akuxhunyiwe kanye Nokungenelela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-view-ye-3d-phakathi\"\u003EI-view ye-3D (phakathi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-view ibonisa isolidi, amapuleni asisekelo nanoma yisiphi isikethi esingakasetshenziswa yisici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapuleni asisekelo adwetshwa ngokugcwele uma ingxenye ingenalutho. Kuthi ngemva kokuba nesolidi azihambe emuva: adwetshwe ngokukhanya, ukuze angamboza ingxenye, nokuchofoza kuwelele engxenyeni. Ayabuya ngokugcwele uma ukhetha lapho udweba khona (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphandle kokukhetha) nalapho ukhetha enye emlandweni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindiza eziyisisekelo\u003C/span\u003E iyazifihla ngokuphelele; zisabonakala uma ukhetha lapho udweba khona. I-PartCraft iyakhumbula leso sinqumo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDudula ukuze uphendule ingxenye, dudula ngesokudla noma ngaphakathi ukuze uhambe, ukhulise ngevili endaweni yesikhombi. Imininingwane ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIzinkinobho nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa phezu kobuso, umphetho noma indiza ukubona ukukhanya. Chofoza ukuze ukhethe. Ubuso buyakhanya bonke, nemiphetho idwetshwa ngokuphelele futhi ikhethwa ngokuphelele. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ukuqoqa izinto eziningi. Zihlala zimakiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhubo le-view ngakwesokudla ngaphezulu liguqula ingxenye: chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukubuka kusuka khona, dudula ukuze uphendule; inkinobho yendlu ibuyela kusimo sokuqala. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"partcraft/view-cube\"\u003EIkhubo le-view\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ukhetha i-Extrude ebonisa umcibisholo oweorenji ohlangothini lwayo, dudula ukuze ushintshe ukujula noma i-engeli, noma bhala ebhokisini eliseduze nawo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes#drag-it-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\" data-hash=\"drag-it-in-the-view\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ingxenye iyize, ibhokisi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EQala ingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E lidweba izinyathelo zokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWisa ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E noma le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E endaweni ye-view ukuze uyivule. Ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E elishiywe lapho livula njengesidumbu esiqinile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ngenkathi-ukhetha-imiphetho-noma-izindawo\"\u003ENgenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma izindawo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E ngaphandle kokukhetha lutho (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E kwisici esinjalo), ingxenye ibonakala njengangaphambi kwalelo sici. Chofoza imiphetho noma izindawo ukuze wengeze noma ukhiphe; izimpawu zazo zikhombisa okukhethiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaqeda. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EJikeleza, gqumuza nokhande ngaphakathi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"esheethini-lomdwebo\"\u003EEsheethini lomdwebo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E ithathela indawo i-view ye-3D ngeshidi lomdwebo le-A3. Ivili lemouse lisondeza, dudula ngesokunxele noma ngaphakathi uyashelelisa, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyalingana. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EYenza umdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ngenkathi-isikethi-sivuliwe\"\u003ENgenkathi isikethi sivuliwe\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-view iphendukela ukubheka ngqo indiza yesikethi, nesendlalelo esingu-2D sivela phezulu. Ingxenye ibonisa kuphela izici ezenziwe ngaphambi kwalesi sikethi. Ibha encane ngakwesobunxele esiphezulu ibonisa ichip yesimo sesikethi (&quot;Ichazwe ngokuphelele&quot;, &quot;Ichazwe ngokungaphelele · amadigri angu-3 enkululeko&quot; njalo njalo) negama lalo, njengo &quot;Sketch2 on a face of Extrude1&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipaneli-yezakhiwo-ngakwesokudla\"\u003EIpaneli yezakhiwo (ngakwesokudla)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli ngakwesokudla ibonisa lokho okukhethiwe, nekhanda layo libiza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E (akukhethiwe lutho): igama layo \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E nesilungiselelo se-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndiza: inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kuyo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo lwalo (ubuso obuthe, isilinda nerediyasi nomugqa wayo omaphakathi, ukhoni, ibhola noma ithoyisi), indawo yalo, isici esilenzile, nakubuso obuthe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kulobu buso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBheka ngqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ubuso njenge-DXF\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtrude kusuka kulo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika kulo\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmgodi lapha\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/extrude-and-cut#pull-or-push-a-whole-face\" data-topic=\"partcraft/extrude-and-cut\" data-hash=\"pull-or-push-a-whole-face\"\u003EDudula noma ukhande ubuso bonke\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo lwawo (oqondile, isongo nesisekelo nesilinganiso sesongo, noma ijika), ubude bawo, nezinhlangothi ezimbili okuphakathi kwazo (njengo &quot;Extrude1 end face and Extrude1 side&quot;), nezinkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho noma izindawo eziningi ezikhethwe nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: inani lazo, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E zemiphetho, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsici: izinombolo nezinketho zaso, izilinganiso zesikethi saso, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVimbela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela lapha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E negama laso \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikethi esivuliwe: isimo sasho, izihlobanisi ongazengeza ekukhethweni, uhlu lwezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza ngamakhoordinethi\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma kusiketshi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha njenge-DXF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsheethini lomdwebo: izilungiselelo zesigaba nezemininingwane, noma uphawu olukhethiwe lwe-GD&amp;T.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwinhlanganisela: inhlanganisela, ingxenye ekhethiwe, noma ijoyinti elikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ibhokisi lenombolo lisebenza uma ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma uchofoze endaweni. Ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha; akukho inkinobho ethi KULUNGILE. Sebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyela emuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yesimo-ngaphansi\"\u003EIbha yesimo (ngaphansi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesobunxele, izixhumanisi zesikhombi esikethini (kuphela lapho kuvulwe isikethi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi, imilayezo: okufanele wenze ngokulandelayo, nokuthi kungani kwenqatshelwe into. Yifunde uma kungabonakali ukuthi kwenzeka okuthile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla eduze, ichip ye-kernel: njalo ithi &quot;Kernel yemeshi&quot; kulolu nguqulo. Hlola ukuze ufunde ukuthi kusho ukuthini. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla, ichip: &quot;Iyakhiwa kabusha…&quot; ngenkathi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha, bese &quot;Yakhiwa kabusha ngo-… ms&quot; uma konke kuhamba kahle, noma &quot;1 isici sihlulekile&quot;. Kwinhlanganisela ithi &quot;Ibekwe ku-… ms&quot; noma ibala izinkinga zokuxhuma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EQala umanuwali ku-Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E: indawo yokusebenza eyenza imanuwali yenhlanganisela ngezingxenye nezinhlanganisela zakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikrinini-esincane\"\u003EEsikrinini esincane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuya ku-760 pixels obubanzi, njengefoni, i-view igcina isikrini: ibha yamathuluzi iwumugqa owodwa oskrolelwa ngokuqondile, namaphaneli avulela njengamashidi kusuka kubha engaphansi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E ifihla ibha yamathuluzi futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E iyibeka ngaphansi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isikrini sinezingxenye ezinhlanu: ibha yamathuluzi phezulu, umlando ngakwesobunxele, i-view ye-3D phakathi, ipaneli yezakhiwo ngakwesokudla kanye nebha yesimo ngaphansi. Phezu kwakho konke kuhlezi i-app bar ye-CadCraft. Ibha ye-app Ibha encane eseqongeni ingeyewebhusayithi ye-CadCraft, hhayi ye-PartCraft uqobo. Ibonisa igama le-app nalapho isebenza, imenyu yenguqulo, Mayelana ne-PartCraft, inkinobho yemodi yesikrini kanye noshintsho lwetimu Iphepha / Imodeli. Iphepha wumugqa omnyama esikhwameni elikhanyayo. Imodeli wumugqa okhanyayo kusikhangiso esimnyama. Imibala yesikethi ilandela itimu. Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,) inethebhu elithi PartCraft: iyiphi inkinobho yemouse ejikeleza i-view, ivili lemouse noma i-trackpad, nezihlobanisi lapho udweba. Bheka Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft. Inkinobho yemodi yesikrini, noma Ctrl+Shift+F, ijikeleza phakathi kwe-normal, full screen, kanye ne-full screen nebha ezifihliwe. Nebha ezifihliwe, hambisa isikhombi ngaphezulu komphetho (noma thinta lapho) ukuze ziphinde zivele. Esc ibuyisela ku-normal. Lesi sinqamuleli yi-Ctrl+Shift+F nakuMac, hhayi ⌘. Ibha yamathuluzi Ibha yamathuluzi ihlelekile. Iguquka ngalokho okwenzayo, ukuze ihlale emugqeni owodwa: Iqembu Izinkinobho Ibonakala Ifayela Okusha, Vula, Londoloza, Thumela (imenyu) Njalo Isikethi Isikethi Lapho kungavulwanga isikethi Isikethi Phuma, Umugqa, Irektangili, Indilinga, Umnsalo, Iphoyinti, Umugqa wesisekelo, Fillet, Isilinganiso, Ukwakha Kuphela lapho isikethi sivuliwe Izici Ukukhipha, Sika, Jikeleza, Imbobo, Olayini, Ngokujikeleza, Isibuko, Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Okwengeziwe (imenyu: Sika ngokujikeleza, Indiza, Ieksisi, Iphoyinti, Sweep, Loft, Uhlaka) Engxenyeni, hhayi lapho kuvulwe isikethi noma umdwebo. Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezimbili ezithe tshe; i-Shell ne-Draft zisebenza ezindaweni ezithe tshe. I-Sweep ne-Loft azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (zidinga i-kernel eqondile); ukuchofoza kwenye kukutshela lokho Izici Kuqediwe Kuphela lapho ukhetha imiphetho noma izindawo ze-fillet, chamfer, shell noma draft Umdwebo Umdwebo Engxenyeni (kusebenza uma ingxenye inesolidi) Umdwebo Datum, Imifreyimu, Ukuqeda, Imininingwane, PDF, Emuva Kuphela esheethini lomdwebo Inhlanganisela Inhlanganisela Engxenyeni (kusebenza uma ingxenye inesolidi) Inhlanganisela Engeza ikopi, Faka, Ijoyinti, Ukugqekeza, Hlela ingxenye, Vala Kuphela kwinhlanganisela Inhlanganisela Emuva Lapho uhlela ingxenye evela kwinhlanganisela Hlela Hlehlisa, Phinda wenze, Kopisha, Namathisela, Okwengeziwe (imenyu: Sika, Kopisha, Namathisela, Namathisela endaweni, Phindaphinda, Susa, Khetha konke, Khetha lutho) Njalo; ngalinye lisebenza esikethini, emlandweni noma kwinhlanganisela oyikuyo Ukubuka Lingana, Bheka ngqo, Imibono (imenyu: Linganisa, Izakhiwo zobunzima, Isigaba, Uhlaka, Zebra, Ukugoqeka, Izindiza eziyisisekelo, bese Isometric, Phambili, Emuva, Phezulu, Phansi, Ngesokudla, Ngesokunxele) Njalo Hambisa phezu kwenkinobho ukuze ubone ukuthi yenzani nesinqamuleli sayo. Inkinobho ehlwenywe ngegrey ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa njengamanje: isibonelo izinkinobho zezici lapho kuvulwe isikethi, noma Ijoyinti ngaphambi kokuthi inhlanganisela inezingxenye ezimbili. Imenyu Okwengeziwe eqenjini lokuhlela ihlu ngalinye lesenzo sokuhlela nesinqamuleli sayo. Ukuthi ukopisha namathisela kusebenza kuphi kulandela lapho usemi khona; bheka Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphindaphinde. Into ehlwenywe ngegrey itooltip yayo ichaza ukuthi kungani ingasebenzi njengamanje. Imenyu Thumela inezinto ezithi STL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, 3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile), STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile), STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi), STEP AP214 (ama-facet, mesh kernel), DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe kanye Umdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&T. Ezimbili ze-STEP eqondile ziyagreyiwa: azikakhiwa kulolu nguqulo, ngakho sebenzisa STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi). Umlando (ngakwesobunxele) Ipaneli ngakwesobunxele wumlando wezici zengxenye, uhlu i-PartCraft eyakha kusuka phezulu kuya phansi. Ikhanda liwigama lengxenye (\"Part1\" kuze kube usuku ululungise igama). Indiza ephambili, Indiza ephezulu kanye Indiza yesokudla zivela kuqala. Chofoza enye ukuze uyikhethe; iyakhanyisa ku-view. Ngaphansi kwazo kukhona izici zakho ngokuhlelwa kwazo. Isikethi esisetshenziswa yisici sibhalwe ngaphansi kwalesi sici. Iflegi ekugcineni komugqa ikutshela isimo sawo: Iflegi Okusho (akukho) Kwakhiwe, nesikethi sichazwe ngokuphelele − Isikethi esingakachazwa ngokuphelele (singasanyakaza) + Isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile ⚠ Kwakhiwe, nesixwayiso (hlola ukuze ufunde) ⚠ error Isici sehlulekile. Hlola ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani, noma chofoza ⚠ not built Isici sidinga esinye esehlulekile noma esivaliwe off Kuvinjiwe Ngakwesokudla kwegama lesici kubonakala inombolo yaso enkulu, njengo \"25 mm\" we-Extrude noma \"Ø6.6 thru\" wembobo. Chofoza kabili inombolo, noma cindezela F2 emugqeni, ukuze uyishintshe lapho. Bheka Shintsha usayizi. Chofoza isici ukuze usihlele ngakwesokunene. Chofoza kabili isikethi ukuze usivule. Uma ubuyela emuva, umugqa othi Ibha yokubuyela emuva · qhubeka phambili uvela ohlwini. Izici ngaphansi kwawo zihlwenywe ngegrey futhi azakhiwe. Uma umugqa ugxilile, ↑ ne-↓ zihambisa phakathi kwemigqa, ne-Alt+↑ / Alt+↓ zihambisa isici ngokwaso, lapho umlando uvuma. Kwinhlanganisela leli phaneli libonisa Izingxenye (eyokuqala imakwe ngokuthi \"ibekwe phansi\") noAmajoyinti esikhundleni salokho. Izici zengxenye Ngaphansi komlando, ibhokisi le-Ingxenye lidweba Ivolumu, Indawo yobuso, Usayizi (X × Y × Z), Imigodi edlule, Izidumbu, Izinxantathu, inani Lezici nokuthi zingaki Ezihlulekile. Ivolumu neendawo zesolidi elinobuso elakhiwe yi-mesh kernel, zincane kancane kunenani langempela lezimo ezijikelezayo (bheka Izici nezinketho zazo). Kwinhlanganisela ibhokisi linekhanda elithi Inhlanganisela: Izingxenye, Izibonelo, Amajoyinti, Akuxhunyiwe kanye Nokungenelela. I-view ye-3D (phakathi) I-view ibonisa isolidi, amapuleni asisekelo nanoma yisiphi isikethi esingakasetshenziswa yisici. Amapuleni asisekelo adwetshwa ngokugcwele uma ingxenye ingenalutho. Kuthi ngemva kokuba nesolidi azihambe emuva: adwetshwe ngokukhanya, ukuze angamboza ingxenye, nokuchofoza kuwelele engxenyeni. Ayabuya ngokugcwele uma ukhetha lapho udweba khona (Isikethi ngaphandle kokukhetha) nalapho ukhetha enye emlandweni. Imibono › Izindiza eziyisisekelo iyazifihla ngokuphelele; zisabonakala uma ukhetha lapho udweba khona. I-PartCraft iyakhumbula leso sinqumo. Dudula ukuze uphendule ingxenye, dudula ngesokudla noma ngaphakathi ukuze uhambe, ukhulise ngevili endaweni yesikhombi. Imininingwane ku-Izinkinobho nemouse. Hambisa phezu kobuso, umphetho noma indiza ukubona ukukhanya. Chofoza ukuze ukhethe. Ubuso buyakhanya bonke, nemiphetho idwetshwa ngokuphelele futhi ikhethwa ngokuphelele. Shift+chofoza ukuqoqa izinto eziningi. Zihlala zimakiwe. Ikhubo le-view ngakwesokudla ngaphezulu liguqula ingxenye: chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukubuka kusuka khona, dudula ukuze uphendule; inkinobho yendlu ibuyela kusimo sokuqala. Bheka Ikhubo le-view. Uma ukhetha i-Extrude ebonisa umcibisholo oweorenji ohlangothini lwayo, dudula ukuze ushintshe ukujula noma i-engeli, noma bhala ebhokisini eliseduze nawo. Bheka Shintsha usayizi. Uma ingxenye iyize, ibhokisi elithi Qala ingxenye lidweba izinyathelo zokuqala. Wisa ifayela le-.partcraft.json noma le-.partcraft-asm.json endaweni ye-view ukuze uyivule. Ifayela le-.step, .stp, .stl, .obj, .3mf noma .3dm elishiywe lapho livula njengesidumbu esiqinile. Ngenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma izindawo Ngemva kwe-Fillet, Chamfer noma Shell ngaphandle kokukhetha lutho (noma Khetha imiphetho kwisici esinjalo), ingxenye ibonakala njengangaphambi kwalelo sici. Chofoza imiphetho noma izindawo ukuze wengeze noma ukhiphe; izimpawu zazo zikhombisa okukhethiwe. Kuqediwe noma Esc iyaqeda. Bheka Jikeleza, gqumuza nokhande ngaphakathi. Esheethini lomdwebo Umdwebo ithathela indawo i-view ye-3D ngeshidi lomdwebo le-A3. Ivili lemouse lisondeza, dudula ngesokunxele noma ngaphakathi uyashelelisa, futhi F iyalingana. Bheka Yenza umdwebo. Ngenkathi isikethi sivuliwe I-view iphendukela ukubheka ngqo indiza yesikethi, nesendlalelo esingu-2D sivela phezulu. Ingxenye ibonisa kuphela izici ezenziwe ngaphambi kwalesi sikethi. Ibha encane ngakwesobunxele esiphezulu ibonisa ichip yesimo sesikethi (\"Ichazwe ngokuphelele\", \"Ichazwe ngokungaphelele · amadigri angu-3 enkululeko\" njalo njalo) negama lalo, njengo \"Sketch2 on a face of Extrude1\". Ipaneli yezakhiwo (ngakwesokudla) Ipaneli ngakwesokudla ibonisa lokho okukhethiwe, nekhanda layo libiza: Ingxenye (akukhethiwe lutho): igama layo Igama nesilungiselelo se-Amajika. Indiza: inkinobho ethi Sketch kuyo. Ubuso: uhlobo lwalo (ubuso obuthe, isilinda nerediyasi nomugqa wayo omaphakathi, ukhoni, ibhola noma ithoyisi), indawo yalo, isici esilenzile, nakubuso obuthe Sketch kulobu buso, Bheka ngqo, Khipha ubuso njenge-DXF, Extrude kusuka kulo, Sika kulo kanye Umgodi lapha (bheka Dudula noma ukhande ubuso bonke). Umphetho: uhlobo lwawo (oqondile, isongo nesisekelo nesilinganiso sesongo, noma ijika), ubude bawo, nezinhlangothi ezimbili okuphakathi kwazo (njengo \"Extrude1 end face and Extrude1 side\"), nezinkinobho Fillet ne-Chamfer. Imiphetho noma izindawo eziningi ezikhethwe nge-Shift: inani lazo, ne-Fillet ne-Chamfer zemiphetho, kanye ne-Sula. Isici: izinombolo nezinketho zaso, izilinganiso zesikethi saso, bese Vimbela, Buyela lapha, Hambisa phezulu, Hambisa phansi, Susa negama laso Igama. Isikethi esivuliwe: isimo sasho, izihlobanisi ongazengeza ekukhethweni, uhlu lwezihlobanisi nezilinganiso, Engeza ngamakhoordinethi, kanye Phuma kusiketshi, Lingana no-Khipha njenge-DXF. Esheethini lomdwebo: izilungiselelo zesigaba nezemininingwane, noma uphawu olukhethiwe lwe-GD&T. Kwinhlanganisela: inhlanganisela, ingxenye ekhethiwe, noma ijoyinti elikhethiwe. Yonke ibhokisi lenombolo lisebenza uma ucindezela Enter noma Tab, noma uchofoze endaweni. Ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha; akukho inkinobho ethi KULUNGILE. Sebenzisa Ctrl+Z ukubuyela emuva. Ibha yesimo (ngaphansi) Ngakwesobunxele, izixhumanisi zesikhombi esikethini (kuphela lapho kuvulwe isikethi). Phakathi, imilayezo: okufanele wenze ngokulandelayo, nokuthi kungani kwenqatshelwe into. Yifunde uma kungabonakali ukuthi kwenzeka okuthile. Ngakwesokudla eduze, ichip ye-kernel: njalo ithi \"Kernel yemeshi\" kulolu nguqulo. Hlola ukuze ufunde ukuthi kusho ukuthini. Bheka I-mesh kernel. Ngakwesokudla, ichip: \"Iyakhiwa kabusha…\" ngenkathi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha, bese \"Yakhiwa kabusha ngo-… ms\" uma konke kuhamba kahle, noma \"1 isici sihlulekile\". Kwinhlanganisela ithi \"Ibekwe ku-… ms\" noma ibala izinkinga zokuxhuma. Bheka futhi Qala umanuwali ku-Illustrate: indawo yokusebenza eyenza imanuwali yenhlanganisela ngezingxenye nezinhlanganisela zakho. Esikrinini esincane Kuya ku-760 pixels obubanzi, njengefoni, i-view igcina isikrini: ibha yamathuluzi iwumugqa owodwa oskrolelwa ngokuqondile, namaphaneli avulela njengamashidi kusuka kubha engaphansi. Amathuluzi ifihla ibha yamathuluzi futhi Hambisa iyibeka ngaphansi. Bheka Trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amafayela: vula, londoloza nokuthumela","summary":"Amafayela e-PartCraft avula futhi alondoloza, zonke izinhlobo zokuthumela nokuthi zigcina ini, lapho amafayela aya khona, nokuthi yini eshintsha ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi nangaphakathi kwama-browser.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["vula","londoloza","thumela","landa","ifayela","partcraft.json","ifayela lenhlanganisela","stl","3mf","step","dxf","pdf","lapho kukhona amafayela ami","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","londoloza njenge"],"headings":[{"id":"okuvulwa-yi-partcraft","text":"Okuvulwa yi-PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza","text":"Ukulondoloza","level":2},{"id":"ukuthumela","text":"Ukuthumela","level":2},{"id":"umsebenzi-ongalondolozwanga","text":"Umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga","level":2},{"id":"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo","text":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo","level":2},{"id":"umehluko-phakathi-kwamabhrawuza","text":"Umehluko phakathi kwamabhrawuza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft isebenza ngamafayela akwikhompyutha yakho. Ayikaze ilayishe ingxenye, futhi akukho akhawunti noma isitoreji se-cloud esihileleke. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvulwa-yi-partcraft\"\u003EOkuvulwa yi-PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsandiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKanjani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ye-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma uyiphonsele endaweni ye-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlanganisela ye-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo: i-PartCraft iyazi ukuthi yiluphi uhlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi se-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsidumbu esifundwa njengezinxantathu: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP bese uyakha kulo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-mesh e-STL, OBJ ne-3MF nawo avulwa njengezidumbu eziqinile (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, i-OBJ noma i-3MF\u003C/a\u003E), kanjalo namafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E). Ifayela le-DXF, i-IGES namafayela engxenye ezinhlelweni zokusebenza ezinye akukwazi ukuvulwa (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImithetho lapho uvula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lefayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela kumele liphele nge-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E, nefayela kumele libe ngaphansi kuka-50 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafayela ahlolwa ngaphambi kokuthi kukhonjiswe okuthile. Ifayela elonakele noma elihlelwe liyenqatshwa ngesizathu esilula, njengalesi: &quot;Lona akuyona ifayela le-PartCraft.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela elilondolozwe i-PartCraft entsha liyenqatshwa: &quot;Leli fayela lilondolozwe yi-PartCraft entsha (inguqulo yefayela 3); lona lifunda inguqulo 2.&quot; Amafayela amadala ayavuleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ingxenye esesikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-PartCraft iyabuza kuqala: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELahla izinguquko\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza kuqala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza\"\u003EUkulondoloza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilondoloza lokho okusesikrinini:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngxenyeni: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;igama lengxenye&gt;.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, umlando ophelele (amasketshi, izihlobanisi, izilinganiso, izici, isikhundla sokubuyela emuva), isigaba se-sheet somdwebo, izinkomba zemininingwane ne-GD&amp;T, nombhalo wawo wonke amasolidi e-STEP angeniswe kusakhiwo sangaphambilini. Izici lolu nguqulo olungakwazi ukuzakha zigcinwa zingashintshiwe. Isolidi uqobo alilondolozwa; i-PartCraft iyakhiwa kabusha emlandweni lapho ifayela livulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKunhlanganisela: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;igama lenhlanganisela&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E, nengxenye ngayinye \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi kwayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ifayela elilodwa liphethe yonke inhlanganisela, ngakho ungayithumela yodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza kuwukulanda. Ibhrawuza yakho ibeka ifayela efolda yakho ye-Downloads, noma ibuze lapho kufanele libekwe khona uma usuyisethile ukuthi ibuze. Ukulondoloza futhi kwenza ukulanda okusha; ibhrawuza ingalinika igama elithi \u003Ccode\u003EPart1 (1).partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E esikhundleni sokubhala phezu kwendala. Ungaqamba kabusha noma uhambise amafayela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi-mafayela sakho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E njengoba uthanda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwezinhlamvu, izinombolo, izikhala, \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E egameni lengxenye ziba \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E egameni lefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmabhrawuza amaningi anesilungiselelo esibuza ukuthi kulondolozwe kuphi ngasinye sokulanda. Sivule uma ufuna ukhetho &quot;Londoloza njenge&quot; njalo: ku-Chrome ne-Edge kungaphansi kwe-Downloads kuzilungiselelo; ku-Firefox kuthi General, Files and Applications; ku-Safari kuthi General, File download location.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwengeziwe ngokuthi ukulanda kuya kuphi nokugcina amafayela ephephile: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthumela\"\u003EUkuthumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ezinye izinhlobo zamafayela. Ngayinye iwukulanda, iqanjwe ngegama lengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInto yemenyu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukuwo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.stl\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL ebhayinari yezinxantathu zesolidi, mamilimitha, \u003Cstrong\u003EZ iphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-3MF enesolidi njengento eyodwa, mamilimitha, \u003Cstrong\u003EZ iphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (kuyagreyiwa): idinga i-kernel eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (kuyagreyiwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi eyenziwe ngobuso obuthe kusuka kumesh: \u003Cstrong\u003Eubuso obujikelezayo buyizinhlamvu eziningi ezincane ezithe tshe\u003C/strong\u003E. Mamilimitha, ngama-axis e-PartCraft (Y iphezulu). I-STEP okufanele uyisebenzise kwamanye ama-CAD kulolu nguqulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - &lt;sketch&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - face.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-DXF R12. Isikethi: imigqa, izindilinga, imisalo namaphoyinti ngokuhlelwa kwesikethi, ezendaweni ezithi PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION ne-POINTS. Ubuso obuthe obukhethiwe: izinkomba zalo njengama-polyline avaliwe (imiphetho ejikelezayo njengezinhlamvu zayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - drawing.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi lomdwebo le-A3: imibono emithathu, i-isometric, isigaba nemininingwane uma isethiwe, izilinganiso eziphelele, izimpawu ze-GD&amp;T, ibhlogo yesihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E akukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo: sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E. Inesimo nevolumu elifanele, kodwa wonke ubuso obujikelezayo buyizinhlamvu eziningi ezincane ezithe tshe, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo azikwazi ukukhetha umgodi njengesilinda. Setha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ngcono kuqala uma lokho kubalulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthunyelwa kuvela engxenyeni esesikrinini. Ukuthumela akusebenzi kwinhlanganisela; alikho ukuthumela kwenhlanganisela okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP eyenziwe ngobuso ne-DXF yobuso zikhiqizwa njalo ngezinxantathu. Isilungiselelo se-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E (esiphaneli esesokudla uma kungakhethiwe lutho) silawula ukuthi zinhle kangakanani, kusuka ku-32 kuya ku-256 izinxantathu ngesijikeleko ngasinye. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokuthumela i-STL noma i-3MF ukuze kube bushelelezi lapho kuphrintwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkudweba kwe-PDF kusebenzisa ifonti ye-Helvetica eyakhelwe kumfundi we-PDF. Izinhlamvu ezingabonakali zishicilelwa njenge-&quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinyathelo ngezinyathelo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\"\u003EThumela ukuze kuphrintwe, i-STEP ne-DXF\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EYenza ishidi lomdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umsebenzi-ongalondolozwanga\"\u003EUmsebenzi ongalondolozwanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft igcina ikhophi yokubuyisela yengxenye noma yenhlanganisela evulekile kulesi sipheki ngemuva nje kwesiguquko ngasinye, ngakho ukuhlakazeka noma ithebhu evaliwe akuyilahlisi: ngesikhathi esilandelayo uvula i-PartCraft iyabuza ukuthi &quot;Buyisa umsebenzi wakho?&quot;. Lokhu akuwona ukulondoloza: londoloza kwifayela ukuze ugcine umsebenzi wakho. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EBuyisa umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uzama ukuvala ithebhu noma ukuqala kabusha ngezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, ibhrawuza iyabuza ukuthi &quot;Shiya le sayithi?&quot;. Lobo ubhokisi bebhrawuza uqobo; i-PartCraft ayikwazi ukushintsha amagama alo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E nokuvala inhlanganisela kubuza ngaphambi kokulahla izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kwenzeka kukhompyutha yakho: i-mesh kernel (uhlelo lwe-WebAssembly) iyalandwa nge-app futhi yakha ijiyomethri ngasendaweni, namafayela afundwa abhalwe kudiski yakho. Akukho data yengxenye engena kunethiwekhi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze usebenze ngaphandle kwanoma yiluphi uxhumo, londoloza i-PartCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi lapho usuku ku-inthanethi: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ku-ibha ye-app bese ulinda kuze kubalwe (&quot;Ilondoloza 40 kwangu-212&quot;) kuze kuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ikhophi elondoloziwe lifaka umtapo we-3D ne-mesh kernel, ngakho emva kwalokho ukumodela, ukulondoloza, konke ukuthumela nokudweba konke kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uma kuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza ukuze uzame futhi uma usuku ku-inthanethi; \u003Cstrong\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali\u003C/strong\u003E kusho ukuthi lo window webhrawuza awukwazi ukugcina ikhophi (ama-window angasese nezinye izikhompyutha ezilawulwayo). Uma ikhophi selondoloziwe, ukuchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E kunikeza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Imininingwane: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuku ku-inthanethi. Noma ungalondolozanga ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, uma i-PartCraft seyilayishile futhi i-chip yebha yesimo ithi &quot;Kernel yemeshi&quot;, ungaqhubeka usebenza uma uxhumo lwehla. Ungalayishi kabusha ikhasi kuze ubuyele ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwuku-inthanethi. Uma i-PartCraft seyivuliwe, qhubeka usebenza; ukulondoloza nokuthumela kuyasebenza. Uma ibha ye-app ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E, i-PartCraft iphinde ivuleke kusuka ekuqaleni ngaphandle koxhumo; kungenjalo ungalayishi kabusha leli thebhu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umehluko-phakathi-kwamabhrawuza\"\u003EUmehluko phakathi kwamabhrawuza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulanda.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhrawuza ngayinye inefolda yayo yokulanda nendlela yayo yokubuza. Uma ibhrawuza ibuza ukuthi le sayithi ingalanda amafayela, yivumele, kungenjalo ukulondoloza nokuthumela akusebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa nokushiya\u003C/strong\u003E ifayela phezu kwe-view kuyasebenza ku-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela efonini noma ethabulethini.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-iPhone ne-iPad, Vula ivula i-Files app; amafayela alondoloziwe aya ku-Files, Downloads. Ku-Android aya kufolda ye-Downloads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela aqukethe okufanayo phakathi kwamabhrawuza nezinhlelo zokusebenza ezinye.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft isebenza ngamafayela akwikhompyutha yakho. Ayikaze ilayishe ingxenye, futhi akukho akhawunti noma isitoreji se-cloud esihileleke. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Okuvulwa yi-PartCraft Ifayela Isandiso Kanjani Ingxenye ye-PartCraft .partcraft.json Vula, Ctrl+O, noma uyiphonsele endaweni ye-3D Inhlanganisela ye-PartCraft .partcraft-asm.json Okufanayo: i-PartCraft iyazi ukuthi yiluphi uhlobo Isolidi se-STEP .step, .stp Isidumbu esifundwa njengezinxantathu: Vula ifayela le-STEP bese uyakha kulo Ama-mesh e-STL, OBJ ne-3MF nawo avulwa njengezidumbu eziqinile (Vula i-STL, i-OBJ noma i-3MF), kanjalo namafayela .3dm (Vula imodeli ye-.3dm). Ifayela le-DXF, i-IGES namafayela engxenye ezinhlelweni zokusebenza ezinye akukwazi ukuvulwa (bheka Okungakakhiwa). Imithetho lapho uvula: Igama lefayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela kumele liphele nge-.json, nefayela kumele libe ngaphansi kuka-50 MB. Amafayela ahlolwa ngaphambi kokuthi kukhonjiswe okuthile. Ifayela elonakele noma elihlelwe liyenqatshwa ngesizathu esilula, njengalesi: \"Lona akuyona ifayela le-PartCraft.\" Ifayela elilondolozwe i-PartCraft entsha liyenqatshwa: \"Leli fayela lilondolozwe yi-PartCraft entsha (inguqulo yefayela 3); lona lifunda inguqulo 2.\" Amafayela amadala ayavuleka. Uma ingxenye esesikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-PartCraft iyabuza kuqala: Khansela, Lahla izinguquko noma Londoloza kuqala. Ukulondoloza Londoloza noma Ctrl+S ilondoloza lokho okusesikrinini: Engxenyeni: \u003Cigama lengxenye\u003E.partcraft.json, umlando ophelele (amasketshi, izihlobanisi, izilinganiso, izici, isikhundla sokubuyela emuva), isigaba se-sheet somdwebo, izinkomba zemininingwane ne-GD&T, nombhalo wawo wonke amasolidi e-STEP angeniswe kusakhiwo sangaphambilini. Izici lolu nguqulo olungakwazi ukuzakha zigcinwa zingashintshiwe. Isolidi uqobo alilondolozwa; i-PartCraft iyakhiwa kabusha emlandweni lapho ifayela livulwa. Kunhlanganisela: \u003Cigama lenhlanganisela\u003E.partcraft-asm.json, nengxenye ngayinye ngaphakathi kwayo. Ifayela elilodwa liphethe yonke inhlanganisela, ngakho ungayithumela yodwa. Ukulondoloza kuwukulanda. Ibhrawuza yakho ibeka ifayela efolda yakho ye-Downloads, noma ibuze lapho kufanele libekwe khona uma usuyisethile ukuthi ibuze. Ukulondoloza futhi kwenza ukulanda okusha; ibhrawuza ingalinika igama elithi Part1 (1).partcraft.json esikhundleni sokubhala phezu kwendala. Ungaqamba kabusha noma uhambise amafayela ku-Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi-mafayela sakho njengoba uthanda. Izinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwezinhlamvu, izinombolo, izikhala, _, . kanye - egameni lengxenye ziba _ egameni lefayela. Amabhrawuza amaningi anesilungiselelo esibuza ukuthi kulondolozwe kuphi ngasinye sokulanda. Sivule uma ufuna ukhetho \"Londoloza njenge\" njalo: ku-Chrome ne-Edge kungaphansi kwe-Downloads kuzilungiselelo; ku-Firefox kuthi General, Files and Applications; ku-Safari kuthi General, File download location. Okwengeziwe ngokuthi ukulanda kuya kuphi nokugcina amafayela ephephile: Lapho amafayela akho aya khona. Ukuthumela Imenyu Thumela ibhala ezinye izinhlobo zamafayela. Ngayinye iwukulanda, iqanjwe ngegama lengxenye. Into yemenyu Ifayela Okukuwo STL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D \u003Cname\u003E.stl I-STL ebhayinari yezinxantathu zesolidi, mamilimitha, Z iphezulu 3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D \u003Cname\u003E.3mf I-3MF enesolidi njengento eyodwa, mamilimitha, Z iphezulu STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile) \u003Cname\u003E.step Akukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (kuyagreyiwa): idinga i-kernel eqondile STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile) \u003Cname\u003E.step Akukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo (kuyagreyiwa) STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi) \u003Cname\u003E.step Isolidi eyenziwe ngobuso obuthe kusuka kumesh: ubuso obujikelezayo buyizinhlamvu eziningi ezincane ezithe tshe. Mamilimitha, ngama-axis e-PartCraft (Y iphezulu). I-STEP okufanele uyisebenzise kwamanye ama-CAD kulolu nguqulo DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe \u003Cname\u003E - \u003Csketch\u003E.dxf noma \u003Cname\u003E - face.dxf I-DXF R12. Isikethi: imigqa, izindilinga, imisalo namaphoyinti ngokuhlelwa kwesikethi, ezendaweni ezithi PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION ne-POINTS. Ubuso obuthe obukhethiwe: izinkomba zalo njengama-polyline avaliwe (imiphetho ejikelezayo njengezinhlamvu zayo) Umdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&T \u003Cname\u003E - drawing.pdf Ishidi lomdwebo le-A3: imibono emithathu, i-isometric, isigaba nemininingwane uma isethiwe, izilinganiso eziphelele, izimpawu ze-GD&T, ibhlogo yesihloko STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile) ne-STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile) akukakhiwa kulolu nguqulo: sebenzisa STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi). Inesimo nevolumu elifanele, kodwa wonke ubuso obujikelezayo buyizinhlamvu eziningi ezincane ezithe tshe, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo azikwazi ukukhetha umgodi njengesilinda. Setha Amajika ngcono kuqala uma lokho kubalulekile. Ukuthunyelwa kuvela engxenyeni esesikrinini. Ukuthumela akusebenzi kwinhlanganisela; alikho ukuthumela kwenhlanganisela okwamanje. I-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP eyenziwe ngobuso ne-DXF yobuso zikhiqizwa njalo ngezinxantathu. Isilungiselelo se-Amajika (esiphaneli esesokudla uma kungakhethiwe lutho) silawula ukuthi zinhle kangakanani, kusuka ku-32 kuya ku-256 izinxantathu ngesijikeleko ngasinye. Khetha Kuhle noma Kuhle kakhulu ngaphambi kokuthumela i-STL noma i-3MF ukuze kube bushelelezi lapho kuphrintwa. Ukudweba kwe-PDF kusebenzisa ifonti ye-Helvetica eyakhelwe kumfundi we-PDF. Izinhlamvu ezingabonakali zishicilelwa njenge-\"?\". Izinyathelo ngezinyathelo: Thumela ukuze kuphrintwe, i-STEP ne-DXF kanye Yenza ishidi lomdwebo. Umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga I-PartCraft igcina ikhophi yokubuyisela yengxenye noma yenhlanganisela evulekile kulesi sipheki ngemuva nje kwesiguquko ngasinye, ngakho ukuhlakazeka noma ithebhu evaliwe akuyilahlisi: ngesikhathi esilandelayo uvula i-PartCraft iyabuza ukuthi \"Buyisa umsebenzi wakho?\". Lokhu akuwona ukulondoloza: londoloza kwifayela ukuze ugcine umsebenzi wakho. Bheka Buyisa umsebenzi ongalondolozwanga. Uma uzama ukuvala ithebhu noma ukuqala kabusha ngezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, ibhrawuza iyabuza ukuthi \"Shiya le sayithi?\". Lobo ubhokisi bebhrawuza uqobo; i-PartCraft ayikwazi ukushintsha amagama alo. Okusha, Vula nokuvala inhlanganisela kubuza ngaphambi kokulahla izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga. Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo Konke kwenzeka kukhompyutha yakho: i-mesh kernel (uhlelo lwe-WebAssembly) iyalandwa nge-app futhi yakha ijiyomethri ngasendaweni, namafayela afundwa abhalwe kudiski yakho. Akukho data yengxenye engena kunethiwekhi. Bheka I-mesh kernel. Ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwanoma yiluphi uxhumo, londoloza i-PartCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi lapho usuku ku-inthanethi: khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ku-ibha ye-app bese ulinda kuze kubalwe (\"Ilondoloza 40 kwangu-212\") kuze kuthi Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ikhophi elondoloziwe lifaka umtapo we-3D ne-mesh kernel, ngakho emva kwalokho ukumodela, ukulondoloza, konke ukuthumela nokudweba konke kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uma kuthi Akukwazanga ukulondoloza, chofoza ukuze uzame futhi uma usuku ku-inthanethi; Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali kusho ukuthi lo window webhrawuza awukwazi ukugcina ikhophi (ama-window angasese nezinye izikhompyutha ezilawulwayo). Uma ikhophi selondoloziwe, ukuchofoza Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kunikeza Londoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu) kanye Susa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Imininingwane: Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Usuku ku-inthanethi. Noma ungalondolozanga ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, uma i-PartCraft seyilayishile futhi i-chip yebha yesimo ithi \"Kernel yemeshi\", ungaqhubeka usebenza uma uxhumo lwehla. Ungalayishi kabusha ikhasi kuze ubuyele ku-inthanethi. Awuku-inthanethi. Uma i-PartCraft seyivuliwe, qhubeka usebenza; ukulondoloza nokuthumela kuyasebenza. Uma ibha ye-app ithi Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, i-PartCraft iphinde ivuleke kusuka ekuqaleni ngaphandle koxhumo; kungenjalo ungalayishi kabusha leli thebhu. Umehluko phakathi kwamabhrawuza Ukulanda. Ibhrawuza ngayinye inefolda yayo yokulanda nendlela yayo yokubuza. Uma ibhrawuza ibuza ukuthi le sayithi ingalanda amafayela, yivumele, kungenjalo ukulondoloza nokuthumela akusebenzi. Ukudonsa nokushiya ifayela phezu kwe-view kuyasebenza ku-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari. Amafayela efonini noma ethabulethini. Ku-iPhone ne-iPad, Vula ivula i-Files app; amafayela alondoloziwe aya ku-Files, Downloads. Ku-Android aya kufolda ye-Downloads. Amafayela aqukethe okufanayo phakathi kwamabhrawuza nezinhlelo zokusebenza ezinye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"solid-kernels","scope":"partcraft","title":"I-mesh kernel","summary":"Lolu nguqulo lwe-PartCraft lwakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel esebenza esiphequluleni sakho. Lokho kusho ukuthini ngezindawo ezijikelezayo, ngamavolumu namafayela, ukuthi ungayazi kanjani ukuthi isebenza, nokuthi yiziphi izici ezilinda i-kernel eqondile.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["kernel","mesh","manifold","exact","b-rep","faceted","amajika","opencascade","occt","fillet kudinga okuqondile","akukakhiwa","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","webassembly"],"headings":[{"id":"okulindele-i-kernel-eqondile","text":"Okulindele i-kernel eqondile","level":2},{"id":"ubuso-obujikelezayo-nesilungiselelo-se-amajika","text":"Ubuso obujikelezayo nesilungiselelo se-Amajika","level":2},{"id":"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo","text":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-kernel yejiyomethri iyinjini eguqula umlando wakho ibe isolidi. Lolu nguqulo lwe-PartCraft lunayo: i-\u003Cstrong\u003Emesh kernel\u003C/strong\u003E (manifold-3d). Isebenza kukhompyutha yakho njengohlelo oluncane lwe-WebAssembly futhi ilungele ngemuva nje kokuvulwa kwe-app. Akukho lutho mayelana nengxenye yakho olucashunwa noma yiluphi uhlangothi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimo ezijikelezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinxantathu ezithe tshe. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yengxenye ibeka ukuthi kuhle kangakanani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmavolumu namabanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEsolidi elinobuso obuthe, lincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasketshi, ukukhipha, ukusika, ukujikeleza, imigodi, amaphethini, isibuko, izindiza zesisekelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet ne-Chamfer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEmaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe tshe; izindilinga ezihlangana zigqunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShell ne-Draft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-Shell ivula izindawo ezithe tshe (ubukhulu bodonga obunembile); i-Draft ithambisa izindawo ezithe tshe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP (ngobuso), umdwebo we-PDF ne-DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibono yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdwetshwe kusuka ezinxantathwini, kubandakanya nemibono yesigaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso nemiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZiqanjwe futhi ziyaziwa ngohlobo (ubuso obuthe, isilinda, ukhoni, ibhola, ithoyisi; oqondile, isongo), zithathwa emasketshini: izinhlobo ze-Simulation, zokuKhiqiza, Ukukhipha, Linganisa, ukukhetha nethebula lemigodi kuyazisebenzisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIchip eseduze nesokudla sebha yesimo ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EKernel yemeshi\u003C/strong\u003E ngenkathi yakha ingxenye yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulindele-i-kernel-eqondile\"\u003EOkulindele i-kernel eqondile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-kernel eqondile (B-rep) igcina izindilinga zangempela, izinsongo nezinkomba, namafillet abushelelezi kunoma yimaphi emaphethelweni, nama-sweep, ama-loft, izindawo, insimbi yeshidi, izimbambo, izidumbu eziningi, ukungenisa i-STEP nokuthumela i-STEP eqondile kwakhiwa kuyo. Izinguqulo zelabhoratri zangaphambili ze-PartCraft zisebenzise i-OpenCascade ngalokho. Ilayisense yayo (i-LGPL) ayihambisani nalokhu kukhishwa, lapho zonke izinhlelo zokusebenza ziyi-Apache-2.0 futhi zisebenzisa amalabhulali avunyelwe ngokulula kuphela, ngakho ayifakiwe. Akukho usuku lalokhu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuze kube yilapho, lezo zici zithi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/strong\u003E uma uzikhethile: ibha yesimo inikeza isizathu, nama-tooltip ezinkinobho zazo aphela ngokuthi &quot;akukakhiwa (kudinga i-kernel eqondile)&quot;. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuhlu ngalinye lazo nokufanele wenze kunalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye eyenziwe ngazo kwi-build yangaphambili isavuleka. Lezo zici zihlala emlandweni zimakwe njengezingakakhiwa (hlola ukuze ubone isizathu), enye ingxenye iyakhiwa, nokulondoloza kuyazigcina zingashintshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso-obujikelezayo-nesilungiselelo-se-amajika\"\u003EUbuso obujikelezayo nesilungiselelo se-Amajika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-mesh kernel idweba isongo njengepholigoni. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yengxenye ibeka ukuthi isongo eligcwele linezinhlangothi ezingakanani; izinhlangothi eziningi zibonakala zibushelelezi futhi zilinganiswa zisondele enanini langempela, kodwa zithatha isikhathi eside ukwakha. Ivolumu, izindawo nezinkomba ezivela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E zesolidi enobuso: ngomgodi noma i-boss zincane kancane kunalezo zesimo esijikelezayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-mesh kernel iyingxenye yokulanda kwe-app ngokwayo. Ukusebenza ngaphandle koxhumo, londoloza i-PartCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi lapho usuku ku-inthanethi: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ku-ibha ye-app bese ulinda kuze kuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E. Imininingwane: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-kernel yejiyomethri iyinjini eguqula umlando wakho ibe isolidi. Lolu nguqulo lwe-PartCraft lunayo: i-mesh kernel (manifold-3d). Isebenza kukhompyutha yakho njengohlelo oluncane lwe-WebAssembly futhi ilungele ngemuva nje kokuvulwa kwe-app. Akukho lutho mayelana nengxenye yakho olucashunwa noma yiluphi uhlangothi. Mesh kernel Izimo ezijikelezayo Izinxantathu ezithe tshe. Amajika ephaneli yengxenye ibeka ukuthi kuhle kangakanani Amavolumu namabanga Esolidi elinobuso obuthe, lincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo Amasketshi, ukukhipha, ukusika, ukujikeleza, imigodi, amaphethini, isibuko, izindiza zesisekelo Yebo Fillet ne-Chamfer Emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe tshe; izindilinga ezihlangana zigqunyiwe Shell ne-Draft I-Shell ivula izindawo ezithe tshe (ubukhulu bodonga obunembile); i-Draft ithambisa izindawo ezithe tshe Ukuthumela I-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP (ngobuso), umdwebo we-PDF ne-DXF Imibono yomdwebo Idwetshwe kusuka ezinxantathwini, kubandakanya nemibono yesigaba Ubuso nemiphetho Ziqanjwe futhi ziyaziwa ngohlobo (ubuso obuthe, isilinda, ukhoni, ibhola, ithoyisi; oqondile, isongo), zithathwa emasketshini: izinhlobo ze-Simulation, zokuKhiqiza, Ukukhipha, Linganisa, ukukhetha nethebula lemigodi kuyazisebenzisa Ichip eseduze nesokudla sebha yesimo ithi Kernel yemeshi ngenkathi yakha ingxenye yakho. Okulindele i-kernel eqondile I-kernel eqondile (B-rep) igcina izindilinga zangempela, izinsongo nezinkomba, namafillet abushelelezi kunoma yimaphi emaphethelweni, nama-sweep, ama-loft, izindawo, insimbi yeshidi, izimbambo, izidumbu eziningi, ukungenisa i-STEP nokuthumela i-STEP eqondile kwakhiwa kuyo. Izinguqulo zelabhoratri zangaphambili ze-PartCraft zisebenzise i-OpenCascade ngalokho. Ilayisense yayo (i-LGPL) ayihambisani nalokhu kukhishwa, lapho zonke izinhlelo zokusebenza ziyi-Apache-2.0 futhi zisebenzisa amalabhulali avunyelwe ngokulula kuphela, ngakho ayifakiwe. Akukho usuku lalokhu. Kuze kube yilapho, lezo zici zithi Akukakhiwa uma uzikhethile: ibha yesimo inikeza isizathu, nama-tooltip ezinkinobho zazo aphela ngokuthi \"akukakhiwa (kudinga i-kernel eqondile)\". Okungakakhiwa kuhlu ngalinye lazo nokufanele wenze kunalokho. Ingxenye eyenziwe ngazo kwi-build yangaphambili isavuleka. Lezo zici zihlala emlandweni zimakwe njengezingakakhiwa (hlola ukuze ubone isizathu), enye ingxenye iyakhiwa, nokulondoloza kuyazigcina zingashintshiwe. Ubuso obujikelezayo nesilungiselelo se-Amajika I-mesh kernel idweba isongo njengepholigoni. Amajika ephaneli yengxenye ibeka ukuthi isongo eligcwele linezinhlangothi ezingakanani; izinhlangothi eziningi zibonakala zibushelelezi futhi zilinganiswa zisondele enanini langempela, kodwa zithatha isikhathi eside ukwakha. Ivolumu, izindawo nezinkomba ezivela ku-Linganisa zesolidi enobuso: ngomgodi noma i-boss zincane kancane kunalezo zesimo esijikelezayo. Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo I-mesh kernel iyingxenye yokulanda kwe-app ngokwayo. Ukusebenza ngaphandle koxhumo, londoloza i-PartCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi lapho usuku ku-inthanethi: khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ku-ibha ye-app bese ulinda kuze kuthi Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Imininingwane: Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sketch-basics","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dweba isikethi sakho sokuqala","summary":"Vula isikethi endizeni noma ebusweni obuthe tshe, dweba imigqa, amakhonco eyisikwele, izindilinga, amasumo, amaphoyinti kanye nemigqa yesisekelo, gobisa ikhona, khetha, hudula nesule.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["isikethi","dweba","umugqa","irektangili","indilinga","umnsalo","iphoyinti","umugqa wesisekelo","ukwakha","fillet","isikethi sefillet","gobisa ikhona","namathela","khetha","iwindi","hudula","iphrofayili"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-isikethi","text":"Qala isikethi","level":2},{"id":"amathuluzi-okudweba","text":"Amathuluzi okudweba","level":2},{"id":"thayipha-usayizi-uma-udweba","text":"Thayipha usayizi uma udweba","level":3},{"id":"ukunamathela","text":"Ukunamathela","level":3},{"id":"gobisa-ikhona","text":"Gobisa ikhona","level":2},{"id":"ijometri-yokwakha","text":"Ijometri yokwakha","level":2},{"id":"khetha-hudula-nesule","text":"Khetha, hudula nesule","level":2},{"id":"sondeza-nokushelelisa-esikethini","text":"Sondeza nokushelelisa esikethini","level":2},{"id":"vala-isikethi","text":"Vala isikethi","level":2},{"id":"yini-eyenza-iprofayili-enhle","text":"Yini eyenza iprofayili enhle","level":2},{"id":"isikethi-esivela-esithombeni","text":"Isikethi esivela esithombeni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYonke i-solid iqala njengesikethi: umdwebo oqondile endizeni. Lesi siqondiso sihlanganisa amathuluzi okudweba. Ukubopha isikethi ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso kuchazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza ngokuphelele isikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-isikethi\"\u003EQala isikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngadweba endizeni eyisisekelo noma kunoma yiliphi ubuso obuthe tshe bengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lapho ozodweba khona:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eindiza eyisisekelo: chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yangaphambili\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza engaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yangakwesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E kumlando, noma chofoza indiza ku-view;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eubuso obuthe tshe: chofoza ubuso ku-view. Bonke ubuso buyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E ebhawini lamathuluzi noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Uma ubuso bukhethiwe ungakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kulobu buso\u003C/span\u003E epanelini elingakwesokudla; uma kuyindiza, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kuyo\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kuphendukela ngqo endizeni, amathuluzi esikethi avela ebhawini lamathuluzi, futhi ithuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E selilungele. Uma ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E ngaphandle kokukhetha lutho, izindiza eziyisisekelo ziyavela futhi ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Chofoza indiza noma ubuso obuthe tshe ukuze udwebe kuwo. Esc iyamisa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso ogobile awukwazi ukubamba isikethi: &quot;Lobo buso bugobile. Khetha ubuso obuthe tshe noma indiza ukuze udwebe kuwo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikethi esibusweni silandela lobo buso.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma ubuso bakhiwe ngumphetho wesikethi noma ngokuphela kokukhipha, isikethi esisha siyanyakaza uma isici sishintsha (isikhwama esijulile sithatha nesikethi endongeni yaso naso). Uma ipaneli ithi ubuso &quot;Ibekwe lapho ikhethwe&quot;, isikethi sihlala lapho ubuso bukhona manje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi-okudweba\"\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi ngalinye linenkinobho ebhawini lamathuluzi nokhiye. Khetha inkinobho efanayo futhi, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ubuyele ku-Khetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela yokudweba\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza okokuqala, bese uchofoza iphoyinti ngalinye elilandelayo. Imigqa iyaxhumana ukusuka ekugcineni kuye ekugcineni. Qeda uchungechunge nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuchofoza ngeqhosha lesokudla noma ukuchofoza kabili. Ukuchofoza iphoyinti elikhona nakho kuyiqeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrektangili\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ikhona elilodwa, bese ikhona elichaziwe ngakolunye uhlangothi. Uthola imigqa emine exhunyiwe emakhoneni, emibili ethe xaxa nemibili ethi ngqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isikhungo, bese iphoyinti endilingeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isikhungo, bese okokuqala, bese okokugcina. Umnsalo uhamba ngendlela esikhombi sihamba ngayo uzungeza isikhungo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza. Iphoyinti elilodwa limaka isikhungo sembobo esetshenziswa yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengomugqa, isegimenti esisodwa ngesikhathi. Idwetshwe ngamadashi; iyijometri yokwakha, esetshenziswa njengeaksi yokujikeleza noma njengereferensi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ikhona lapho imigqa ehlangana khona, thayipha umsakazo, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-spline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti igculo edlula kuwo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaqeda, ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyayivala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003EAma-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ingxenye yegculo ozoyisusa, kuze kufike ezinqamulweni ezisedlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza ngokuphelele isikethi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma udweba, ibhokisi elincane eduze nesikhombi likhombisa ubude, usayizi, ububanzi noma umsakazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"thayipha-usayizi-uma-udweba\"\u003EThayipha usayizi uma udweba\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuchofoza kokuqala komugqa, irektangili, indilinga noma umnsalo, ungathayipha usayizi esikhundleni sokuchofoza. Ukuthayipha inombolo kuvula ibhokisi eduze nesikhombi linayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmabhokisi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihamba kowelandelayo)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini eyenzeka ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude, bese I-engeli (°) kusuka ku-X axis yesikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa udwetshwa ngalobo bude, uye esikhombini noma ngengosi othayipha; uchungechunge luqhubeka kusukela ekugcineni kwawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrektangili\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi, bese Ukuphakama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIrektangili idwetshwa kusukela ekhoneni lokuqala iye esikhombini; usayizi ongawuthayiphile uvela esikhombini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndilinga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga idwetshwa ngobububanzi obuthayiphiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnsalo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo emva kwesikhungo, bese I-engeli yomnsalo emva kokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkokuqala kuhamba leyo kude kusukela esikhungweni; bese umnsalo uhamba leyo kude uzungeze, ngendlela owayihambisa ngayo isikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELolo sayizi ngalunye olithayiphile luba \u003Cstrong\u003Eisilinganiso sokushayela\u003C/strong\u003E kulesi sinyathelo, ngakho isikethi siphuma sinosayizi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa isimo namabanga aso ndawonye. Ukuchofoza esikhundleni se-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kugcina lokho okuthayiphile futhi kuthathe okunye ekuchofozeni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi ibuyele esikhombini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVala lokhu ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso uma udweba\u003C/strong\u003E uma ufuna ukudweba ngokuchofoza kuphela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, ekugcineni kwamathuluzi esikethi, kubamba i-I-spline yamaphoyinti okulawula, Elula, Ukuhambisa, Isibuko, Upholigoni, Isilotshi, amaphethini wesikethi kanye ne-Phrojekthi komphetho: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003EAma-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukunamathela\"\u003EUkunamathela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkunamathela kwengeza izixhumanisi ngawe, ukuze isikethi sihlale sixhunyiwe uma sinyakaza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti lokuphela noma umsuka\u003C/strong\u003E, kuvela isikwele esincane. Iphoyinti elisha lenziwa lihlangane nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKomugqa, endilingeni noma emnsalweni, kuvela uphawu lwesiphambano oluncane. Iphoyinti elisha libekwa kulelo gculo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwamadigri angu-3 ukuya ethe xaxa noma ethi ngqo unamathela kuwo futhi uthola ixhumanisi elithe xaxa noma elithi ngqo. Ilebula likhombisa &quot;H&quot; noma &quot;V&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ugweme ukunamathela, sondeza ngaphezulu ukuze uchofoze kude nephoyinti noma igculo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gobisa-ikhona\"\u003EGobisa ikhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lekhona lapho imigqa emibili ihlangana khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi liyavulwa linesilinganiso somsakazo esiphakanyisiwe. Thayipha umsakazo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili imigqa iyasikwa futhi ixhunyiwe ngumnsalo othintayo onesilinganiso somsakazo. Imilayezo ongayibona: &quot;I-fillet idinga ikhona lapho kuhlangana imigqa emibili kuphela.&quot; kanye &quot;Lowo msakazo mkhulu kakhulu kule migqa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgobisa lesikethiligoba ikhona leprofayili, ngakho i-extrude ithola imiphetho ethe ngqo egobile. Ukugoba imiphetho yesolidi ngqo (isibonelo imiphetho ephezulu yepuleti), sebenzisa isici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E engxenyeni: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EGobisa, chamfer nokugoqa\u003C/a\u003E. Esikethini, i-Fillet yethuluzi lesikethi; engxenyeni, iyisici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ijometri-yokwakha\"\u003EIjometri yokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yokwakha, izindilinga kanye namasumo idwetshwa ngamadashi futhi zimpunga. Ziqondisa isikethi kodwa azisibo ingxenye yeprofayili ekhishwa noma ejikelezwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha imigqa, izindilinga noma amasumo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakha\u003C/span\u003E. Cindezela futhi ukuze ubuyisele kokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-hudula-nesule\"\u003EKhetha, hudula nesule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003Eize kungabi namathuluzi asebenzayo) ukuze ukhethe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti, umugqa, indilinga, umnsalo, uphawu lwexhumanisi noma isilinganiso ukuze ukukhethe. I-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+ukuchofoza iyengeza ekukhethweni noma iyasusa. Ku-Windows ne-Linux i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+ukuchofoza yenza okufanayo; ku-Mac, ⌘+ukuchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula endaweni engenalutho ukuze udwebe iwindi: konke okungaphakathi kwalo kuyakhethwa ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula iphoyinti noma umugqa ukuze uwuhambise. Isixazululi sigcina zonke izixhumanisi nezilinganiso lapho zinyakaza, ngakho kunyakaza ijometri ekhululekile kuphela. Hudula umphetho wendilinga ukuze ushintshe umsakazo wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula inombolo yesilinganiso ukuze uhambise ilebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E epanelini elingakwesokudla, ukuze usule okukhethiwe. Ukususa ijometri kususa nezixhumanisi ezisemuva kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sondeza-nokushelelisa-esikethini\"\u003ESondeza nokushelelisa esikethini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhendula isibalo ukuze usondeze esikhombini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ngeqhosha eliphakathi noma elesokudla ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E ebhawini lamathuluzi noma epanelini elingakwesokudla ilinganisa isikethi kubuka. Esikethini ukhiye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uyithuluzi le-Fillet, hhayi Lingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vala-isikethi\"\u003EVala isikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E ebhawini lamathuluzi noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma kusiketshi\u003C/span\u003E epanelini elingakwesokudla, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E size isikethi siyavaleka. Ngalinye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuqala ikhansela okusenziwayo, bese ibuyela ku-Khetha, bese isula ukukhetha, futhi okulandelayo kuvala isikethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi sihlala sikhethiwe, ngakho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E elandelayo siyasisebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-eyenza-iprofayili-enhle\"\u003EYini eyenza iprofayili enhle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E basebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eyonke ilupu elivaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E lemigqa, izindilinga, amasumo nama-spline asolidi lesikethi (ngaphandle kwejometri yokwakha). Amalupu angaphakathi kwamanye aba yimbobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke imiphetho kumelwe ihlangane nomunye umphetho kuphela. &quot;Iprofayili ivulekile: umphetho ku-(12.5, 40) awuxhunywe lutho.&quot; ukhomba indawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okungaphezu kwemiphetho emibili okungahlangana endaweni eyodwa: &quot;Iprofayili ihlukana ku-(0, 20): ngaphezu kwemiphetho emibili ihlangana khona.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphoyinti nejometri yokwakha kuyashaywa yiprofayili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkulandelayo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza ngokuphelele isikethi ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikethi-esivela-esithombeni\"\u003EIsikethi esivela esithombeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici › Okwengeziwe › Isikethi esivela esithombeni…\u003C/strong\u003E (noma iqembu le-Isikethi kuribhoni yesihlahla sezici) lilandelela isithombe sengxenye eyisicaba emhlabathini ocwebile — umbhalo wayo nemigodi yayo — noma umdwebo wepeni, ibe isikethi semigqa, amasumo nezindilinga. Tshela ubude obubodwa (ububanzi, ukuphakama noma uhlangothi olude kakhulu) ukuze isikethi sibe nosayizi ofanele, hlola okutholiwe ku-preview, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EYenza isikethi\u003C/strong\u003E; ingasikhipha nayo, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ilandelelwa kulo mshini. Imisakazo yamakhona ibuya cishe ngo-5 %, imininingwane yepikseli noma amabili iyalahleka, futhi isithombe esithathwe ngokuthambekile noma nezithunzi ezigcwele ingxenye aziqondiswa: thatha isithombe ngqo, ngokukhanya okulinganayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Yonke i-solid iqala njengesikethi: umdwebo oqondile endizeni. Lesi siqondiso sihlanganisa amathuluzi okudweba. Ukubopha isikethi ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso kuchazwe ku-Chaza ngokuphelele isikethi. Qala isikethi Ungadweba endizeni eyisisekelo noma kunoma yiliphi ubuso obuthe tshe bengxenye. Khetha lapho ozodweba khona: indiza eyisisekelo: chofoza Indiza yangaphambili, Indiza engaphezulu noma Indiza yangakwesokudla kumlando, noma chofoza indiza ku-view; ubuso obuthe tshe: chofoza ubuso ku-view. Bonke ubuso buyakhanya. Khetha Sketch ebhawini lamathuluzi noma cindezela S. (Uma ubuso bukhethiwe ungakhetha futhi Sketch kulobu buso epanelini elingakwesokudla; uma kuyindiza, Sketch kuyo.) Ukubuka kuphendukela ngqo endizeni, amathuluzi esikethi avela ebhawini lamathuluzi, futhi ithuluzi Umugqa selilungele. Uma ucindezela Sketch ngaphandle kokukhetha lutho, izindiza eziyisisekelo ziyavela futhi ibha yesimo ithi \"Chofoza indiza noma ubuso obuthe tshe ukuze udwebe kuwo. Esc iyamisa.\" Ubuso ogobile awukwazi ukubamba isikethi: \"Lobo buso bugobile. Khetha ubuso obuthe tshe noma indiza ukuze udwebe kuwo.\" Isikethi esibusweni silandela lobo buso. Uma ubuso bakhiwe ngumphetho wesikethi noma ngokuphela kokukhipha, isikethi esisha siyanyakaza uma isici sishintsha (isikhwama esijulile sithatha nesikethi endongeni yaso naso). Uma ipaneli ithi ubuso \"Ibekwe lapho ikhethwe\", isikethi sihlala lapho ubuso bukhona manje. Amathuluzi okudweba Ithuluzi ngalinye linenkinobho ebhawini lamathuluzi nokhiye. Khetha inkinobho efanayo futhi, cindezela S, noma cindezela Esc ukuze ubuyele ku-Khetha. Ithuluzi Ukhiye Indlela yokudweba Umugqa L Chofoza okokuqala, bese uchofoza iphoyinti ngalinye elilandelayo. Imigqa iyaxhumana ukusuka ekugcineni kuye ekugcineni. Qeda uchungechunge nge-Esc, Enter, ukuchofoza ngeqhosha lesokudla noma ukuchofoza kabili. Ukuchofoza iphoyinti elikhona nakho kuyiqeda Irektangili R Chofoza ikhona elilodwa, bese ikhona elichaziwe ngakolunye uhlangothi. Uthola imigqa emine exhunyiwe emakhoneni, emibili ethe xaxa nemibili ethi ngqo Indilinga C Chofoza isikhungo, bese iphoyinti endilingeni Umnsalo A Chofoza isikhungo, bese okokuqala, bese okokugcina. Umnsalo uhamba ngendlela esikhombi sihamba ngayo uzungeza isikhungo Iphoyinti P Chofoza. Iphoyinti elilodwa limaka isikhungo sembobo esetshenziswa yi-Imbobo Umugqa wesisekelo N Njengomugqa, isegimenti esisodwa ngesikhathi. Idwetshwe ngamadashi; iyijometri yokwakha, esetshenziswa njengeaksi yokujikeleza noma njengereferensi Fillet F Chofoza ikhona lapho imigqa ehlangana khona, thayipha umsakazo, cindezela Enter I-spline B Chofoza amaphoyinti igculo edlula kuwo; Enter iyaqeda, ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyayivala. Bona Ama-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi Sika T Chofoza ingxenye yegculo ozoyisusa, kuze kufike ezinqamulweni ezisedlule Isilinganiso D Bona Chaza ngokuphelele isikethi Uma udweba, ibhokisi elincane eduze nesikhombi likhombisa ubude, usayizi, ububanzi noma umsakazo. Thayipha usayizi uma udweba Ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala komugqa, irektangili, indilinga noma umnsalo, ungathayipha usayizi esikhundleni sokuchofoza. Ukuthayipha inombolo kuvula ibhokisi eduze nesikhombi linayo: Ithuluzi Amabhokisi (Tab ihamba kowelandelayo) Yini eyenzeka ku-Enter Umugqa, Umugqa wesisekelo Ubude, bese I-engeli (°) kusuka ku-X axis yesikethi Umugqa udwetshwa ngalobo bude, uye esikhombini noma ngengosi othayipha; uchungechunge luqhubeka kusukela ekugcineni kwawo Irektangili Ububanzi, bese Ukuphakama Irektangili idwetshwa kusukela ekhoneni lokuqala iye esikhombini; usayizi ongawuthayiphile uvela esikhombini Indilinga Ububanzi Indilinga idwetshwa ngobububanzi obuthayiphiwe Umnsalo Umsakazo emva kwesikhungo, bese I-engeli yomnsalo emva kokuqala Okokuqala kuhamba leyo kude kusukela esikhungweni; bese umnsalo uhamba leyo kude uzungeze, ngendlela owayihambisa ngayo isikhombi Lolo sayizi ngalunye olithayiphile luba isilinganiso sokushayela kulesi sinyathelo, ngakho isikethi siphuma sinosayizi. Ctrl+Z isusa isimo namabanga aso ndawonye. Ukuchofoza esikhundleni se-Enter kugcina lokho okuthayiphile futhi kuthathe okunye ekuchofozeni. Esc ivala ibhokisi ibuyele esikhombini. Vala lokhu ku-Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › Isilinganiso uma udweba uma ufuna ukudweba ngokuchofoza kuphela. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft. Okwengeziwe, ekugcineni kwamathuluzi esikethi, kubamba i-I-spline yamaphoyinti okulawula, Elula, Ukuhambisa, Isibuko, Upholigoni, Isilotshi, amaphethini wesikethi kanye ne-Phrojekthi komphetho: bona Ama-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi. Ukunamathela Ukunamathela kwengeza izixhumanisi ngawe, ukuze isikethi sihlale sixhunyiwe uma sinyakaza: Ku-iphoyinti lokuphela noma umsuka, kuvela isikwele esincane. Iphoyinti elisha lenziwa lihlangane nalo. Komugqa, endilingeni noma emnsalweni, kuvela uphawu lwesiphambano oluncane. Iphoyinti elisha libekwa kulelo gculo. Umugqa ongaphansi kwamadigri angu-3 ukuya ethe xaxa noma ethi ngqo unamathela kuwo futhi uthola ixhumanisi elithe xaxa noma elithi ngqo. Ilebula likhombisa \"H\" noma \"V\". Ukuze ugweme ukunamathela, sondeza ngaphezulu ukuze uchofoze kude nephoyinti noma igculo. Gobisa ikhona Cindezela F noma khetha Fillet. Chofoza iphoyinti lekhona lapho imigqa emibili ihlangana khona. Ibhokisi liyavulwa linesilinganiso somsakazo esiphakanyisiwe. Thayipha umsakazo bese ucindezela Enter. Zombili imigqa iyasikwa futhi ixhunyiwe ngumnsalo othintayo onesilinganiso somsakazo. Imilayezo ongayibona: \"I-fillet idinga ikhona lapho kuhlangana imigqa emibili kuphela.\" kanye \"Lowo msakazo mkhulu kakhulu kule migqa.\" Igobisa lesikethiligoba ikhona leprofayili, ngakho i-extrude ithola imiphetho ethe ngqo egobile. Ukugoba imiphetho yesolidi ngqo (isibonelo imiphetho ephezulu yepuleti), sebenzisa isici Fillet engxenyeni: bona Gobisa, chamfer nokugoqa. Esikethini, i-Fillet yethuluzi lesikethi; engxenyeni, iyisici. Ijometri yokwakha Imigqa yokwakha, izindilinga kanye namasumo idwetshwa ngamadashi futhi zimpunga. Ziqondisa isikethi kodwa azisibo ingxenye yeprofayili ekhishwa noma ejikelezwa. Khetha imigqa, izindilinga noma amasumo. Cindezela Q noma khetha Ukwakha. Cindezela futhi ukuze ubuyisele kokuqala. Khetha, hudula nesule Cindezela S (noma Escize kungabi namathuluzi asebenzayo) ukuze ukhethe. Chofoza iphoyinti, umugqa, indilinga, umnsalo, uphawu lwexhumanisi noma isilinganiso ukuze ukukhethe. I-Shift+ukuchofoza iyengeza ekukhethweni noma iyasusa. Ku-Windows ne-Linux i-Ctrl+ukuchofoza yenza okufanayo; ku-Mac, ⌘+ukuchofoza. Hudula endaweni engenalutho ukuze udwebe iwindi: konke okungaphakathi kwalo kuyakhethwa ngokuphelele. Hudula iphoyinti noma umugqa ukuze uwuhambise. Isixazululi sigcina zonke izixhumanisi nezilinganiso lapho zinyakaza, ngakho kunyakaza ijometri ekhululekile kuphela. Hudula umphetho wendilinga ukuze ushintshe umsakazo wayo. Hudula inombolo yesilinganiso ukuze uhambise ilebula. Cindezela Delete noma Backspace, noma khetha Delete epanelini elingakwesokudla, ukuze usule okukhethiwe. Ukususa ijometri kususa nezixhumanisi ezisemuva kwayo. Sondeza nokushelelisa esikethini Phendula isibalo ukuze usondeze esikhombini. Hudula ngeqhosha eliphakathi noma elesokudla ukuze ushelelise. Lingana ebhawini lamathuluzi noma epanelini elingakwesokudla ilinganisa isikethi kubuka. Esikethini ukhiye F uyithuluzi le-Fillet, hhayi Lingana. Vala isikethi Khetha Phuma ebhawini lamathuluzi noma Phuma kusiketshi epanelini elingakwesokudla, noma cindezela Esc size isikethi siyavaleka. Ngalinye Esc kuqala ikhansela okusenziwayo, bese ibuyela ku-Khetha, bese isula ukukhetha, futhi okulandelayo kuvala isikethi. Isikethi sihlala sikhethiwe, ngakho Ukukhipha noma Jikeleza elandelayo siyasisebenzisa. Yini eyenza iprofayili enhle Ukukhipha kanye Jikeleza basebenzisa yonke ilupu elivaliwe lemigqa, izindilinga, amasumo nama-spline asolidi lesikethi (ngaphandle kwejometri yokwakha). Amalupu angaphakathi kwamanye aba yimbobo. Yonke imiphetho kumelwe ihlangane nomunye umphetho kuphela. \"Iprofayili ivulekile: umphetho ku-(12.5, 40) awuxhunywe lutho.\" ukhomba indawo. Akukho okungaphezu kwemiphetho emibili okungahlangana endaweni eyodwa: \"Iprofayili ihlukana ku-(0, 20): ngaphezu kwemiphetho emibili ihlangana khona.\" Amaphoyinti nejometri yokwakha kuyashaywa yiprofayili. Okulandelayo: Chaza ngokuphelele isikethi ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso. Isikethi esivela esithombeni Izici › Okwengeziwe › Isikethi esivela esithombeni… (noma iqembu le-Isikethi kuribhoni yesihlahla sezici) lilandelela isithombe sengxenye eyisicaba emhlabathini ocwebile — umbhalo wayo nemigodi yayo — noma umdwebo wepeni, ibe isikethi semigqa, amasumo nezindilinga. Tshela ubude obubodwa (ububanzi, ukuphakama noma uhlangothi olude kakhulu) ukuze isikethi sibe nosayizi ofanele, hlola okutholiwe ku-preview, bese ukhetha Yenza isikethi; ingasikhipha nayo, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ilandelelwa kulo mshini. Imisakazo yamakhona ibuya cishe ngo-5 %, imininingwane yepikseli noma amabili iyalahleka, futhi isithombe esithathwe ngokuthambekile noma nezithunzi ezigcwele ingxenye aziqondiswa: thatha isithombe ngqo, ngokukhanya okulinganayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"view-cube","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ikhyubhu lombono","summary":"Chofoza uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona lekhyubhu ekhoneni lombono ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, uyidonse ukuze uzungeze, uphendule indilinga yekhampasi, uzungeze umbono obheke ngqo, bese ubuyela ekhaya.","section":"tasks","order":11,"keywords":["ikhyubhu lombono","viewcube","ikhyubhu","ikhampasi","inyakatho","umbono wasekhaya","imibono ejwayelekile","phezulu","phambili","ngakwesokudla","iso","ikhona","umphetho","zungeza","phendula umbono","isithonjana seaxis","ukuzulazula"],"headings":[{"id":"bheka-ngaseceleni-emphethweni-noma-ekhoneni","text":"Bheka ngaseceleni, emphethweni noma ekhoneni","level":2},{"id":"zungeza-ngokudonsa-ikhyubhu","text":"Zungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu","level":2},{"id":"indilinga-yekhampasi","text":"Indilinga yekhampasi","level":2},{"id":"imibono-ebheke-ngqo-izimpini","text":"Imibono ebheke ngqo: izimpini","level":2},{"id":"ekhaya","text":"Ekhaya","level":2},{"id":"ngekhibhodi","text":"Ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"isithonjana-se-axis-noma-lutho-esikhundleni","text":"Isithonjana se-axis noma lutho esikhundleni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIkhyubhu lombono lihlala ekhoneni elingakwesokudla eliphezulu lombono ka-3D (hhayi lapho usaketsha noma ensheshini yokudweba). Liyaguquka nombono, ngakho likhombisa njalo ukuthi ubheka kangakanani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E yisiqephu se-+Y yengxenye (indiza ephezulu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E isiqephu se-+Z (indiza ephambili ibheke wena lapho ubheka kuyo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E isiqephu se-+X. Lihlala libonakala kancane kuze kube yilapho ulikhomba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-ngaseceleni-emphethweni-noma-ekhoneni\"\u003EBheka ngaseceleni, emphethweni noma ekhoneni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhomba ikhyubhu. Ingxenye ngaphansi kwesikhombi iyakhanya: phakathi kohlangothi, umphetho (ukhanya ezinhlangothini zombili ezihlanganyelwa yiwo) noma ikhona (ezinhlangothini zombili ezintathu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kuyo. Umbono uphendukela ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, ugcine iphakathi nokusondeza okufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKukhona izindawo ezingu-26 ongachofoza kuzo: izinhlangothi ezi-6 (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E), imiphetho eyi-12 namakhona ayi-8. Ikhona linika umbono ojwayelekile wamakota amathathu; umphetho ubonakala uphakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E kunikeza imibono efanayo nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E ku-ibha yamathuluzi, ngaphandle kokusondeza ukuze kugcwale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zungeza-ngokudonsa-ikhyubhu\"\u003EZungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ikhyubhu ukuze uphendule umbono, njengokuzungeza ngaphakathi kombono ngokwawo. Ukudonsa akusoze kuthathwe njengokuchofoza, ngakho ungambamba ikhyubhu noma kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indilinga-yekhampasi\"\u003EIndilinga yekhampasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndilinga ngaphansi kwekhyubhu iqukethe N, E, S no-W.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa indilinga\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uphendule imodeli ezungeze i-axis ethe xaxa, njengoba imi etafuleni elijikelezayo. Indilinga ilandela isikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza uhlamvu\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubuke kusuka lolo hlangothi, ugcine ukuthi ubheka phansi kangakanani. Embonweni osuka phezulu ngqo, uhlamvu ochofoza kuwo luya ezansi kwesikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imibono-ebheke-ngqo-izimpini\"\u003EImibono ebheke ngqo: izimpini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ubheka ngqo esiqeshini, izimpini ezincane zivela zizungeze ikhyubhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinxantathu ezine \u003Cstrong\u003Ezisa phambili\u003C/strong\u003E isiqephu sohlangothi lolo: unxantathu ongaphezulu kwekhyubhu ukhombisa isiqephu esasiphezulu, njalo njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpini ezimbili \u003Cstrong\u003Eezigobile\u003C/strong\u003E ezingakwesokudla eliphezulu ziphendula isithombe ngekota yokujikeleza ngakwesokudla noma ngakwesobunxele, zingashintshi isiqephu obheka kuso. Zisebenzise ukuphendula ipulani ukuze udonga olude luhambe ngokuqondile esikrinini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ekhaya\"\u003EEkhaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho yendlu ekhoneni elingakwesobunxele eliphezulu lekhyubhu ibuyela embonweni wamakota amathathu futhi ifaka ingxenye ngaphakathi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza okufanayo lapho ikhyubhu inokugxila kwekhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngekhibhodi\"\u003ENgekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uye kukhyubhu, bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhetha uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona ezungeze ikhyubhu, ngezinyathelweni ezingu-1/8 sokujikeleza (abafundi besikrini batshela ukuthi yiliphi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhetha eliphakeme noma elisezansi, kuya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E noma phansi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebheka kusuka kolukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift →\"\u003E⇧→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ephendula umbono ngekota yokujikeleza ezungeze i-axis ethe xaxa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbono wasekhaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ephuma ekhyubhini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho ezicindezelwa ekhyubhini zihlala ekhyubhini: azivuli amathuluzi e-PartCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isithonjana-se-axis-noma-lutho-esikhundleni\"\u003EIsithonjana se-axis noma lutho esikhundleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhombi sekhona\u003C/strong\u003E sibe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhyubhu lombono\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithonjana sezingatha\u003C/span\u003E (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngaphansi kwesobunxele: X obomvu, Y oluhlaza, Z oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELutho\u003C/span\u003E. Lesi sisheshi sikhumbula ukukhetha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings#corner-indicator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"corner-indicator\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhyubhu libonisa ingxenye njengoba i-PartCraft iyakha: Y ephezulu, ngakho i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E yekhyubhu iyindiza ephezulu. Izinhlamvu zekhampasi zokujikeleza kuphela; ingxenye ayinayo inyakatho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ikhyubhu lombono lihlala ekhoneni elingakwesokudla eliphezulu lombono ka-3D (hhayi lapho usaketsha noma ensheshini yokudweba). Liyaguquka nombono, ngakho likhombisa njalo ukuthi ubheka kangakanani: Phezulu yisiqephu se-+Y yengxenye (indiza ephezulu), Phambili isiqephu se-+Z (indiza ephambili ibheke wena lapho ubheka kuyo), Ngakwesokudla isiqephu se-+X. Lihlala libonakala kancane kuze kube yilapho ulikhomba. Bheka ngaseceleni, emphethweni noma ekhoneni Khomba ikhyubhu. Ingxenye ngaphansi kwesikhombi iyakhanya: phakathi kohlangothi, umphetho (ukhanya ezinhlangothini zombili ezihlanganyelwa yiwo) noma ikhona (ezinhlangothini zombili ezintathu). Chofoza kuyo. Umbono uphendukela ukuze ubuke kusuka lapho, ugcine iphakathi nokusondeza okufanayo. Kukhona izindawo ezingu-26 ongachofoza kuzo: izinhlangothi ezi-6 (Phezulu, Phansi, Phambili, Emuva, Ngakwesobunxele, Ngakwesokudla), imiphetho eyi-12 namakhona ayi-8. Ikhona linika umbono ojwayelekile wamakota amathathu; umphetho ubonakala uphakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili. Ukuchofoza Phambili, Phezulu noma Ngakwesokudla kunikeza imibono efanayo nakwe-Imibono ku-ibha yamathuluzi, ngaphandle kokusondeza ukuze kugcwale. Zungeza ngokudonsa ikhyubhu Donsa ikhyubhu ukuze uphendule umbono, njengokuzungeza ngaphakathi kombono ngokwawo. Ukudonsa akusoze kuthathwe njengokuchofoza, ngakho ungambamba ikhyubhu noma kuphi. Indilinga yekhampasi Indilinga ngaphansi kwekhyubhu iqukethe N, E, S no-W. Donsa indilinga ukuze uphendule imodeli ezungeze i-axis ethe xaxa, njengoba imi etafuleni elijikelezayo. Indilinga ilandela isikhombi. Chofoza uhlamvu ukuze ubuke kusuka lolo hlangothi, ugcine ukuthi ubheka phansi kangakanani. Embonweni osuka phezulu ngqo, uhlamvu ochofoza kuwo luya ezansi kwesikrini. Imibono ebheke ngqo: izimpini Uma ubheka ngqo esiqeshini, izimpini ezincane zivela zizungeze ikhyubhu: Izinxantathu ezine zisa phambili isiqephu sohlangothi lolo: unxantathu ongaphezulu kwekhyubhu ukhombisa isiqephu esasiphezulu, njalo njalo. Izimpini ezimbili ezigobile ezingakwesokudla eliphezulu ziphendula isithombe ngekota yokujikeleza ngakwesokudla noma ngakwesobunxele, zingashintshi isiqephu obheka kuso. Zisebenzise ukuphendula ipulani ukuze udonga olude luhambe ngokuqondile esikrinini. Ekhaya Inkinobho yendlu ekhoneni elingakwesobunxele eliphezulu lekhyubhu ibuyela embonweni wamakota amathathu futhi ifaka ingxenye ngaphakathi. Home yenza okufanayo lapho ikhyubhu inokugxila kwekhibhodi. Ngekhibhodi Tab uye kukhyubhu, bese: Ukhiye Yenza ← / → khetha uhlangothi, umphetho noma ikhona ezungeze ikhyubhu, ngezinyathelweni ezingu-1/8 sokujikeleza (abafundi besikrini batshela ukuthi yiliphi) ↑ / ↓ khetha eliphakeme noma elisezansi, kuya ku-Phezulu noma phansi ku-Phansi Enter noma Space bheka kusuka kolukhethiwe Shift+← / Shift+→ phendula umbono ngekota yokujikeleza ezungeze i-axis ethe xaxa Home umbono wasekhaya Esc phuma ekhyubhini Izinkinobho ezicindezelwa ekhyubhini zihlala ekhyubhini: azivuli amathuluzi e-PartCraft. Isithonjana se-axis noma lutho esikhundleni Vula Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,), ithebhu ye-PartCraft, bese usetha Isikhombi sekhona sibe Ikhyubhu lombono (okuzenzakalelayo), Isithonjana sezingatha (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngaphansi kwesobunxele: X obomvu, Y oluhlaza, Z oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma Lutho. Lesi sisheshi sikhumbula ukukhetha. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft. Ikhyubhu libonisa ingxenye njengoba i-PartCraft iyakha: Y ephezulu, ngakho i-Phezulu yekhyubhu iyindiza ephezulu. Izinhlamvu zekhampasi zokujikeleza kuphela; ingxenye ayinayo inyakatho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sketch-tools","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ama-spline, ukusika, ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi","summary":"Dweba ama-spline ngamaphoyinti okufaka nokulawula, sika futhi welule amagculo, hambisa uchungechunge, bonisa ngesibuko ngokuzungeza umugqa wesisekelo, engeza upholigoni nezilotshi, phinda ijometri yesikethi futhi uphrojekthe amaphethelo emodeli.","section":"tasks","order":15,"keywords":["spline","iphoyinti lokufaka","iphoyinti lokulawula","b-spline","nurbs","igculo","sika","welula","hambisa","isibuko","ngokufana","upholigoni","hexagon","ilotshi","phinda","linear pattern","circular pattern","phrojekthi","phrojekthi komphetho","faka","guqula izinto"],"headings":[{"id":"ama-spline","text":"Ama-spline","level":2},{"id":"sika-nelula","text":"Sika nelula","level":2},{"id":"ukuhambisa","text":"Ukuhambisa","level":2},{"id":"isibuko","text":"Isibuko","level":2},{"id":"upholigoni-nezilotshi","text":"Upholigoni nezilotshi","level":2},{"id":"amaphethini-wesikethi","text":"Amaphethini wesikethi","level":2},{"id":"phrojekthi-amaphethelo-engxenye","text":"Phrojekthi amaphethelo engxenye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELawa mathuluzi asebenza esikethini esivulekile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-spline\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E zikhona ebhawini lamathuluzi. Ezinye zikhona ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwamathuluzi esikethi. Ithuluzi ngalinye liyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayimisa. Ngamathuluzi aseqala okudweba bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EDweba isikethi sakho sokuqala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-spline\"\u003EAma-spline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-spline igculo elibushelelezi. Kukhona izinhlobo ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela yokudweba\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-spline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti igculo edlula kuwo. Qeda nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuchofoza ngeqhosha lesokudla noma ukuchofoza kabili. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuze uvale i-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-spline yamaphoyinti okulawula (ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amaphoyinti okulawula. Igculo liyadonswa ngasemaphointini kodwa lithinta okokuqala nokokugcina kuphela. Ipholigoni yokulawula edwetshwe ngamadashi ivela ngesikhathi udweba nasemva kwalokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphoyinti yisikethi amaphoyinti.\u003C/strong\u003E Hudula wona, noma wanikeze izixhumanisi nezilinganiso njengamanye amaphoyinti. Iphoyinti lokuqala le-spline lingamathela ekugcineni komugqa, lihlanganiswe nalo ngoxhumanisi ohlangene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthinta ekugcineni.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha umugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo e-spline, bese ukhetha i-spline, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ET I-tangent\u003C/span\u003E. Ukugcina kwe-spline kuzolandela umugqa. Ukuthinta okuphuma kumaphethelo e-spline kuyenqatshelwa: &quot;I-tangent ku-spline idinga umugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo ayo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphethelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphandle kwexhumanisi lokuthinta, amaphethelo e-spline yamaphoyinti okufaka awanakile (akukho ukugoba ekugcineni kakhulu). Igculo liyi-cubic futhi lidlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti, ukuhlukaniswa kwalo kusethwa yizibanga phakathi kwamaphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-spline avaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E yenza iphrofayili ngokuzimela. Ama-spline avulekile ahlanganisa imigqa namasumo ibe ilupu elivaliwe njengamanye amagculo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkususa iphoyinti ngaphakathi kwe-spline kususa lelo phoyinti futhi kugcine i-spline, uma isenamaphoyinti okungenani amabili (amathathu uma ivaliwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Extrude nokujikeleza zakha i-spline nge-mesh kernel ngezingxenye ezimfushane ezigoqe (amagculo langempela adinga i-exact kernel: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo). Ukuthunyelwa kwe-DXF kubhala i-spline njenge-polyline ehlala ngaphakathi kwe-0.01 mm kusuka egculweni, ngoba i-DXF R12 ayinayo i-spline entity.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-nelula\"\u003ESika nelula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza igculo: ingxenye ezosuswa ibonakala ibomvu, kuze kufike ezinqamulweni ezisedlule. Chofoza ukuze uyisuse. Igculo elingadluli lutho lisuswa lonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElula\u003C/span\u003E (ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza umugqa noma umnsalo eduze nomphetho ukuze welule. Ukhula kuze kufike egculweni elilandelayo oluhlangana nalo. &quot;Akukho lutho lolu phetho olunga lufinyelela.&quot; uma kungekho lutho olulimazayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESika nelula kusebenza emigqeni, emasumeni, ezindilingeni nakuma-spline (Elula: imigqa namasumo kuphela).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndilinga\u003C/strong\u003E esikiwe iba umnsalo. Isilinganiso sayo somsakazo noma sobububanzi siya emnsalweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusika maphakathi komugqa kushiya imigqa emibili ehlala emugqeni ofanayo oqondile. Ukusika maphakathi komnsalo kushiya amasumo amabili anesikhungo esifanayo nexhumanisi elilinganayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-spline\u003C/strong\u003E esikiwe iba i-control-point spline elandela igculo elidala ngokuqinile. Ixhumanisi lokuthinta ekugcineni eligciniwe liyahlala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmphetho omusha ubekwa egculweni elisikile (emugqeni, emnsalweni noma endilingeni, noma uhlangane nomphetho wayo). Ama-spline awakwazi ukubamba iphoyinti, ngakho i-spline esikayo ayengezi xhumanisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi ezingasafanele ziyasuswa\u003C/strong\u003E, nebha yesimo ithi zingaki. Isibonelo, isilinganiso sobude emugqeni osikiwe siyasuswa, kodwa izixhumanisi ezithe xaxa noma ezihambisanayo ziyahlala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhambisa\"\u003EUkuhambisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhambisa\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa, umnsalo, indilinga noma i-spline. Uchungechunge lwawo lonke luyakhanya: yonke igculo elixhunywe ngokuphelele, kuze kufike endaweni lapho kuhlangana okungenani okuthathu. Ukuhambisa ingxenye yochungechunge kuphela, khetha lawo magculo kuqala, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhambisa\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza omunye wawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi ohlangothini lapho ikhophi iya khona. Ukubonakala okuyisidashi kuyalandela. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole amahlangothi omabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza, thayipha ibanga, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa namasumo kuhanjiswa ngokunembile. Amakhoneni ayelulwa noma asikwe aze ahlangane. Ikhophi linesilinganiso se-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhambisa\u003C/strong\u003E esisodwa, futhi nezinye izingxenye ziyalandela: chofoza kabili isilinganiso ukuze ushintshe ikhophi yonke. Ibanga elikhulu kakhulu kochungechunge liyenqatshelwa, isibonelo &quot;Lelo banga likhulu kakhulu kulolu chungechunge: uhlangothi lulodwa lungaguqulwa lungene ngaphakathi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Espline\u003C/strong\u003E ihanjiswa yi-spline entsha yamaphoyinti okufaka ngaphakathi kwe-0.001 mm kusuka ekuhanjisweni kwangempela. Le khophi limisiwe: alilandeli okushintshwayo kamuva, futhi alinasilinganiso se-Ukuhambisa. I-spline ekuchungechungeni idinga ukuhlangana okubushelelezi (ukuthinta) emaphethelweni ayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibuko\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENge-Khetha, khetha okuzobonisa ngesibuko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo oyobonisa ngawo ngesibuko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphoyinti ngalinye elibonisiwe lithola \u003Cstrong\u003ENgokufana\u003C/strong\u003E exhumanisa nalo nokuqala, ngakho ikhophi iyalandela uma okokuqala kushintshwa. Amaphoyinti asemgqeni wesibuko ayabelwana, futhi amasumo abonisiwe athola ixhumanisi elifanayo. Uma kungekho lutho okukhethiwe, chofoza izinto ozofuna ukuzibonisa, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese uchofoza umugqa wesibuko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"upholigoni-nezilotshi\"\u003EUpholigoni nezilotshi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpholigoni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isikhungo, bese ikhona, bese uthayipha inani lezinhlangothi (3 kuya ku-64). Izinhlangothi zilingana futhi amakhona ahlala endilingeni yokwakha. Linganisa indilinga ukuze unikeze upholigoni usayizi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilotshi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isikhungo sesiphetho esisodwa, bese isikhungo sesinye, bese uchofoza ukusetha ububanzi. Imigqa emibili, ethinta amahafu endilinga amabili alinganayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphethini-wesikethi\"\u003EAmaphethini wesikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ijometri kuqala, bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear pattern\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, bese lapho ikhophi lokuqala liya khona, bese uthayipha inani lamakhophi (kubandakanya lowokuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircular pattern\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza isikhungo, bese uthayipha inani lamakhophi, ahlakazeke ngokulinganayo esiphethweni esigcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhophi aletha nezixhumanisi phakathi kwejometri ekhethiwe (iphethini yokujikeleza ishiya ezithe xaxa nezithi ngqo). Amakhophi awaxhunyiwe kumqondo wokuqala: shintsha eyodwa, abanye bahlala njengabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phrojekthi-amaphethelo-engxenye\"\u003EPhrojekthi amaphethelo engxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrojekthi komphetho\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho ogobile noma ojikelezayo wengxenye ngemuva kwesikethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphetho ukopishwa endizeni yesikethi ngokunembile futhi uyabanjwa (ixhumanisi le-Bopha). Awulandeli izinguquko ezizayo engxenyeni. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze wenze ijometri yokwakha. Indilinga ethambekele endizeni yesikethi izophrojektwa ibe i-ellipse, ngakho iyenqatshwa. Kanjalo namaphethelo akhululekile nalawo aqonde ngqo ngaphandle kwesikethi. Ukuphrojekthwa kudinga i-exact kernel: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lawa mathuluzi asebenza esikethini esivulekile. I-spline no-Sika zikhona ebhawini lamathuluzi. Ezinye zikhona ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe ekugcineni kwamathuluzi esikethi. Ithuluzi ngalinye liyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi Esc iyayimisa. Ngamathuluzi aseqala okudweba bona Dweba isikethi sakho sokuqala. Ama-spline I-spline igculo elibushelelezi. Kukhona izinhlobo ezimbili. Ithuluzi Ukhiye Indlela yokudweba I-spline B Chofoza amaphoyinti igculo edlula kuwo. Qeda nge-Enter, Esc, ukuchofoza ngeqhosha lesokudla noma ukuchofoza kabili. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuze uvale i-spline I-spline yamaphoyinti okulawula (ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe) Chofoza amaphoyinti okulawula. Igculo liyadonswa ngasemaphointini kodwa lithinta okokuqala nokokugcina kuphela. Ipholigoni yokulawula edwetshwe ngamadashi ivela ngesikhathi udweba nasemva kwalokho Amaphoyinti yisikethi amaphoyinti. Hudula wona, noma wanikeze izixhumanisi nezilinganiso njengamanye amaphoyinti. Iphoyinti lokuqala le-spline lingamathela ekugcineni komugqa, lihlanganiswe nalo ngoxhumanisi ohlangene. Ukuthinta ekugcineni. Khetha umugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo e-spline, bese ukhetha i-spline, bese ukhetha T I-tangent. Ukugcina kwe-spline kuzolandela umugqa. Ukuthinta okuphuma kumaphethelo e-spline kuyenqatshelwa: \"I-tangent ku-spline idinga umugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo ayo.\" Amaphethelo. Ngaphandle kwexhumanisi lokuthinta, amaphethelo e-spline yamaphoyinti okufaka awanakile (akukho ukugoba ekugcineni kakhulu). Igculo liyi-cubic futhi lidlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti, ukuhlukaniswa kwalo kusethwa yizibanga phakathi kwamaphoyinti. Ama-spline avaliwe yenza iphrofayili ngokuzimela. Ama-spline avulekile ahlanganisa imigqa namasumo ibe ilupu elivaliwe njengamanye amagculo. Ukususa iphoyinti ngaphakathi kwe-spline kususa lelo phoyinti futhi kugcine i-spline, uma isenamaphoyinti okungenani amabili (amathathu uma ivaliwe). I-Extrude nokujikeleza zakha i-spline nge-mesh kernel ngezingxenye ezimfushane ezigoqe (amagculo langempela adinga i-exact kernel: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo). Ukuthunyelwa kwe-DXF kubhala i-spline njenge-polyline ehlala ngaphakathi kwe-0.01 mm kusuka egculweni, ngoba i-DXF R12 ayinayo i-spline entity. Sika nelula Ithuluzi Ukhiye Indlela Sika T Chofoza igculo: ingxenye ezosuswa ibonakala ibomvu, kuze kufike ezinqamulweni ezisedlule. Chofoza ukuze uyisuse. Igculo elingadluli lutho lisuswa lonke Elula (ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe) E Chofoza umugqa noma umnsalo eduze nomphetho ukuze welule. Ukhula kuze kufike egculweni elilandelayo oluhlangana nalo. \"Akukho lutho lolu phetho olunga lufinyelela.\" uma kungekho lutho olulimazayo Sika nelula kusebenza emigqeni, emasumeni, ezindilingeni nakuma-spline (Elula: imigqa namasumo kuphela). Indilinga esikiwe iba umnsalo. Isilinganiso sayo somsakazo noma sobububanzi siya emnsalweni. Ukusika maphakathi komugqa kushiya imigqa emibili ehlala emugqeni ofanayo oqondile. Ukusika maphakathi komnsalo kushiya amasumo amabili anesikhungo esifanayo nexhumanisi elilinganayo. I-spline esikiwe iba i-control-point spline elandela igculo elidala ngokuqinile. Ixhumanisi lokuthinta ekugcineni eligciniwe liyahlala. Umphetho omusha ubekwa egculweni elisikile (emugqeni, emnsalweni noma endilingeni, noma uhlangane nomphetho wayo). Ama-spline awakwazi ukubamba iphoyinti, ngakho i-spline esikayo ayengezi xhumanisi. Izixhumanisi ezingasafanele ziyasuswa, nebha yesimo ithi zingaki. Isibonelo, isilinganiso sobude emugqeni osikiwe siyasuswa, kodwa izixhumanisi ezithe xaxa noma ezihambisanayo ziyahlala. Ukuhambisa Khetha Ukuhambisa ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe noma cindezela O. Chofoza umugqa, umnsalo, indilinga noma i-spline. Uchungechunge lwawo lonke luyakhanya: yonke igculo elixhunywe ngokuphelele, kuze kufike endaweni lapho kuhlangana okungenani okuthathu. Ukuhambisa ingxenye yochungechunge kuphela, khetha lawo magculo kuqala, bese ukhetha Ukuhambisa bese uchofoza omunye wawo. Hambisa isikhombi ohlangothini lapho ikhophi iya khona. Ukubonakala okuyisidashi kuyalandela. Cindezela B ukuze uthole amahlangothi omabili. Chofoza, thayipha ibanga, bese ucindezela Enter. Imigqa namasumo kuhanjiswa ngokunembile. Amakhoneni ayelulwa noma asikwe aze ahlangane. Ikhophi linesilinganiso se-Ukuhambisa esisodwa, futhi nezinye izingxenye ziyalandela: chofoza kabili isilinganiso ukuze ushintshe ikhophi yonke. Ibanga elikhulu kakhulu kochungechunge liyenqatshelwa, isibonelo \"Lelo banga likhulu kakhulu kulolu chungechunge: uhlangothi lulodwa lungaguqulwa lungene ngaphakathi.\" I-spline ihanjiswa yi-spline entsha yamaphoyinti okufaka ngaphakathi kwe-0.001 mm kusuka ekuhanjisweni kwangempela. Le khophi limisiwe: alilandeli okushintshwayo kamuva, futhi alinasilinganiso se-Ukuhambisa. I-spline ekuchungechungeni idinga ukuhlangana okubushelelezi (ukuthinta) emaphethelweni ayo. Isibuko Nge-Khetha, khetha okuzobonisa ngesibuko. Khetha Isibuko ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe noma cindezela M. Chofoza umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo oyobonisa ngawo ngesibuko. Iphoyinti ngalinye elibonisiwe lithola Ngokufana exhumanisa nalo nokuqala, ngakho ikhophi iyalandela uma okokuqala kushintshwa. Amaphoyinti asemgqeni wesibuko ayabelwana, futhi amasumo abonisiwe athola ixhumanisi elifanayo. Uma kungekho lutho okukhethiwe, chofoza izinto ozofuna ukuzibonisa, cindezela Enter, bese uchofoza umugqa wesibuko. Upholigoni nezilotshi Ithuluzi Indlela Upholigoni Chofoza isikhungo, bese ikhona, bese uthayipha inani lezinhlangothi (3 kuya ku-64). Izinhlangothi zilingana futhi amakhona ahlala endilingeni yokwakha. Linganisa indilinga ukuze unikeze upholigoni usayizi Isilotshi Chofoza isikhungo sesiphetho esisodwa, bese isikhungo sesinye, bese uchofoza ukusetha ububanzi. Imigqa emibili, ethinta amahafu endilinga amabili alinganayo Amaphethini wesikethi Khetha ijometri kuqala, bese: Linear pattern: chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, bese lapho ikhophi lokuqala liya khona, bese uthayipha inani lamakhophi (kubandakanya lowokuqala). Circular pattern: chofoza isikhungo, bese uthayipha inani lamakhophi, ahlakazeke ngokulinganayo esiphethweni esigcwele. Amakhophi aletha nezixhumanisi phakathi kwejometri ekhethiwe (iphethini yokujikeleza ishiya ezithe xaxa nezithi ngqo). Amakhophi awaxhunyiwe kumqondo wokuqala: shintsha eyodwa, abanye bahlala njengabo. Phrojekthi amaphethelo engxenye Khetha Phrojekthi komphetho ngaphansi kwethuluzi Okwengeziwe. Chofoza umphetho ogobile noma ojikelezayo wengxenye ngemuva kwesikethi. Umphetho ukopishwa endizeni yesikethi ngokunembile futhi uyabanjwa (ixhumanisi le-Bopha). Awulandeli izinguquko ezizayo engxenyeni. Cindezela Q ukuze wenze ijometri yokwakha. Indilinga ethambekele endizeni yesikethi izophrojektwa ibe i-ellipse, ngakho iyenqatshwa. Kanjalo namaphethelo akhululekile nalawo aqonde ngqo ngaphandle kwesikethi. Ukuphrojekthwa kudinga i-exact kernel: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sketch-arc-methods","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dweba umnsalo ngezindlela eziyishumi","summary":"Khetha indlela echaza ngayo umnsalo (amaphoyinti amathathu, ukuqala nokuphela nerediyasi, isikhungo nokuqala nekona, nokunye), chofoza noma uthayipha amanani, bese uqhubeka ngomugqa noma umnsalo wokugcina.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["umnsalo","umnsalo wamaphoyinti amathathu","ukuqala isikhungo nokuphela","ukuqala nokuphela neradiyasi","umnsalo othintayo","qhubeka","isitrokisi","ikona efakiwe","umnsalo wesikethi","izindlela zomnsalo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenzayo","text":"Okuzokwenzayo","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izinqaku","text":"Izinqaku","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenzayo\"\u003EOkuzokwenzayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba umnsalo esikethini ngendlela efana nalokho okwaziyo: amaphoyinti amathathu kuwo, isikhungo sawo, iradiyasi yawo, ikona eliwuhambisayo noma indlela eyishiya ngayo. Amanani angachofozwa noma athayipheke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula isikethi (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EIzisekelo zokudweba\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwibha yamathuluzi yesikethi, vula uhlu oluseduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha indlela, isibonelo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc: Start, End, Radius\u003C/span\u003E. Izindlela yilezi: Indilinga: Amaphoyinti angu-3; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ukuphela; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ikona; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ubude; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Ukuphela, Ikona; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Ukuphela, Indlela; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc: Start, End, Radius\u003C/span\u003E; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ukuphela; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ikona; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ubude; kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc: Continue\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELandela ibha yesimo, ekhomba indlela futhi ichaze okudingekayo okulandelayo: chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, isikhungo, iphoyinti lesibili emnsalweni noma iphoyinti lokuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho umyalo uthi &quot;or type&quot;, thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ikona ephelele ngamadigri (inombolo engalungile = ngokuphambene nowashi), ubude be-chord, isiqondiso sokuthinta sokuqala ngamadigri, noma irediyasi (inombolo engalungile = indlela ende).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmnsalo udwetshiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc: Continue\u003C/span\u003E iqala umnsalo olandelayo ekugcineni komugqa wokugcina noma umnsalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqaku\"\u003EIzinqaku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImimnsalo igcina isikhungo sayo, ukuqala nokuphela, ngakho izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zisebenza kuyo njengakuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbha yesimo yenqaba okufakwayo okungenzeki futhi ithi kungani, isibonelo amaphoyinti amathathu emugqeni owodwa, noma irediyasi encane kakhulu ukuthi ifike phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili okuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc: Continue\u003C/span\u003E lapho kungadwetshiwe lutho ithi &quot;Akukho okuqhubekayo kuso: dweba umugqa noma umnsalo kuqala.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenzayo Dweba umnsalo esikethini ngendlela efana nalokho okwaziyo: amaphoyinti amathathu kuwo, isikhungo sawo, iradiyasi yawo, ikona eliwuhambisayo noma indlela eyishiya ngayo. Amanani angachofozwa noma athayipheke. Izinyathelo Vula isikethi (bheka Izisekelo zokudweba). Kwibha yamathuluzi yesikethi, vula uhlu oluseduze kwe-Arc bese ukhetha indlela, isibonelo Arc: Start, End, Radius. Izindlela yilezi: Indilinga: Amaphoyinti angu-3; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ukuphela; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ikona; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Isikhungo, Ubude; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Ukuphela, Ikona; Indilinga: Ukuqala, Ukuphela, Indlela; Arc: Start, End, Radius; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ukuphela; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ikona; Indilinga: Isikhungo, Ukuqala, Ubude; kanye ne-Arc: Continue. Landela ibha yesimo, ekhomba indlela futhi ichaze okudingekayo okulandelayo: chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, isikhungo, iphoyinti lesibili emnsalweni noma iphoyinti lokuphela. Lapho umyalo uthi \"or type\", thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela Enter: ikona ephelele ngamadigri (inombolo engalungile = ngokuphambene nowashi), ubude be-chord, isiqondiso sokuthinta sokuqala ngamadigri, noma irediyasi (inombolo engalungile = indlela ende). Umnsalo udwetshiwe. Arc: Continue iqala umnsalo olandelayo ekugcineni komugqa wokugcina noma umnsalo. Izinqaku Imimnsalo igcina isikhungo sayo, ukuqala nokuphela, ngakho izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zisebenza kuyo njengakuqala. Ibha yesimo yenqaba okufakwayo okungenzeki futhi ithi kungani, isibonelo amaphoyinti amathathu emugqeni owodwa, noma irediyasi encane kakhulu ukuthi ifike phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili okuphela. Arc: Continue lapho kungadwetshiwe lutho ithi \"Akukho okuqhubekayo kuso: dweba umugqa noma umnsalo kuqala.\"","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"relations-dimensions","scope":"partcraft","title":"Phelela ngokuphelele isikethi ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso","summary":"Engeza izixhumanisi ephaneli yesokudla nezilinganiso ngethuluzi le-Dimension, funda imibala yesimo se-under, fully ne-over defined, bese ulungisa isikethi esiye sachazwa ngokweqile.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["izixhumanisi","izithiyo","izilinganiso","isilinganiso esihlakaniphile","sichazwe ngokuphelele","sichazwe ngaphansi","sichazwe ngokweqile","amandla okunyakaza","coincident","horizontal","vertical","parallel","perpendicular","tangent","equal","concentric","midpoint","fix","ukungqubuzana","eyeqile"],"headings":[{"id":"funda-isimo-sesikethi","text":"Funda isimo sesikethi","level":2},{"id":"engeza-isilinganiso","text":"Engeza isilinganiso","level":2},{"id":"engeza-isixhumanisi","text":"Engeza isixhumanisi","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-iprofayili-yebhulaketi-ene-l","text":"Isibonelo: iprofayili yebhulaketi ene-L","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-isikethi-esichazwe-ngokweqile","text":"Lungisa isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile","level":2},{"id":"donsa-ukuze-uthole-okukhululekile","text":"Donsa ukuze uthole okukhululekile","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lwezixhumanisi","text":"Uhlu lwezixhumanisi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi sichazwa \u003Cstrong\u003Engokuphelele\u003C/strong\u003E uma yonke iphoyinti nalo lonke usayizi kubekwe ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso. Isikethi esichazwe ngokuphelele sishintsha kuphela uma ushintsha inombolo, ngakho ingxenye iziphatha ngokubikezelwayo uma uyihlela kamuva. I-PartCraft ayikuphoqi ukuthi uchaze isikethi ngokuphelele, kodwa njalo ikhombisa ukuthi useduze kangakanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-isimo-sesikethi\"\u003EFunda isimo sesikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsimo sibonakala ezindaweni ezintathu: i-chip ngakwesobunxele esiphezulu embonweni, umlayezo ophezulu kwephaneli yesokudla, nethagi emlandweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EI-chip\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmbala wejometri\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIchazwe ngaphansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngaphansi · 3 amandla okunyakaza&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona ijometri engakanyakaza. Donsa ijometri eluhlaza ukuze ubone ukuthi iya ngaphi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIchazwe ngokuphelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokuphelele&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInki (omnyama ku-Paper, okhanyayo ku-Model)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke iphoyinti nosayizi kubekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIchazwe ngokweqile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObomvu ezixhumanisweni ezibandakanyekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye izixhumanisi ziphikisana, noma enye sesivele iphethwe yezinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIjometri yokwakha ingwazi futhi idashi ngokunjalo, kungakhathaliseki isimo sayo. Izinto ezikhethiwe ziba orange. &quot;Amandla okunyakaza&quot; ngumndeni owodwa lapho into ingasanyakaza: iphoyinti elikhululekile linawo amabili (kwesobunxele nakwesokudla, phezulu nasezansi), isiyingi esikhululekile linawo amathathu (indawo yaso ephakathi nesikhombisi saso).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUlayini ongaphansi komlayezo ephaneli yesokudla uphinda imibala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-isilinganiso\"\u003EEngeza isilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into ofuna ukuyilinganisa:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eumugqa owodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: ubude bawo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eisiyingi esisodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi bayo; \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-arc eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: umsakazo wayo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eamaphoyinti amabili\u003C/strong\u003E (iphoyinti lokuphela, isikhungo, iphoyinti elikhululekile noma i-origin): ibanga phakathi kwawo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti nomugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: ibanga kusuka kuphoyinti kuya kumugqa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eimigqa mibili elinganayo\u003C/strong\u003E: ibanga phakathi kwawo; \u003Cstrong\u003Eimigqa emibili enengeli\u003C/strong\u003E: ingeli phakathi kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgemva kwento eyodwa, ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Chofoza into yesibili, noma chofoza lapho okufanele kubekwe khona isilinganiso.&quot; Chofoza into yesibili, noma chofoza endaweni engenalutho lapho ufuna khona inombolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi lenombolo liyavula linesilinganiso samanje. Thayipha usayizi bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina inani elilinganisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELapho ubeka khona inombolo kuqinisekisa uhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E somugqa othambekile noma amaphoyinti amabili: ayibeke phezulu noma phansi ukuze uthole ibanga elithe xaxa, ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla ukuze uthole ibanga elithi ngqo, nanoma yikuphi okunye ukuze uthole ibanga eliqondile (elihlanganisiwe).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi lamukela izinombolo ezilula ezingamamillimitha noma amadigri, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E. Ukuqala ngo \u003Ccode\u003E⌀\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EØ\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003ER\u003C/code\u003E, noma ukuphela nge \u003Ccode\u003Emm\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E°\u003C/code\u003E, kuyashiywa. Izingeli zingu-0 kuya kwangu-180 wamadigri. Izibalo ezifana no \u003Ccode\u003E20+5\u003C/code\u003E aziyamukelwa; ukuze uxhumanise usayizi nomthamo noma ifomula, qala ngo \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha isilinganiso kamuva, chofoza kabili inombolo yaso esikethini, noma khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwaso ohlwini ephaneli yesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngakhetha futhi ijometri kuqala (ithuluzi lokuKhetha) bese ukhetha inkinobho yesilinganiso ephaneli yesokudla: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga elithe xaxa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga elithi ngqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E. Kubonakala kuphela ezilingana nokukhethiwe. Yindlela yokunika isiyingi umsakazo esikhundleni sobubanzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-isixhumanisi\"\u003EEngeza isixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zengezwa ephaneli yesokudla, hhayi ngethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ukhethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into eyodwa, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza enye uma isixhumanisi sidinga ezimbili. I-origin nayo ingakhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli yesokudla kuthi &quot;Okukhethiwe: umugqa l3, iphoyinti p1&quot; futhi kukhombise inkinobho yesixhumanisi ngasinye esilingana nakho, njengo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E∥ Parallel\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Coincident\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkinobho. Isikethi sixazulula ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma akukho sixhumanisi esilingana, ephaneli kuthi: &quot;Akukho sixhumanisi esilingana nalokhu okukhethiwe. Khetha izinto ezimbili noma eyodwa (Shift+chofoza iyengeza).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu olugcwele lwezixhumanisi, ukuthi ngayinye idinga ini nokuthi yenzani, kuku \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-relations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-relations\"\u003EIzixhumanisi nezilinganiso zesikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zibonakala esikethini njengezimpawu ezincane eduze nejometri (H, V, ∥, ⊥, T, =, ◎, M, ⚓). Amachashaza e-Coincident afihlwa uma ijometri ingakhethiwe noma isixhumanisi sinenkinga. Chofoza impawu ukuze ukhethe isixhumanisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonelo-iprofayili-yebhulaketi-ene-l\"\u003EIsibonelo: iprofayili yebhulaketi ene-L\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngethuluzi le-Line, qala ku-origin bese uchofoza izikhonkwane eziyisithupha ze-L, uphele futhi ku-origin. Ushintsho luphela lodwa lapho uchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa eduze nokuba ngokuthambekile noma ibe ngokuthi ibe ngokuthi ngqo isivele inezixhumanisi H no V ngokuzenzakalela, ngaphandle kowokugcina: umugqa ophelela kuphoyinti elikhona awuthole isixhumanisi esizenzakalelayo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza lowo mugqa wokugcina bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EV Vertical\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokudla. I-chip ithi &quot;Ichazwe ngaphansi · 4 amandla okunyakaza&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Chofoza umugqa ongaphansi, chofoza ngaphansi kwawo, uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E80\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa ongakwesobunxele, chofoza ngakwesobunxele kwawo, uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003E60\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinganisa umugqa omfushane ongaphezulu \u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E nomugqa ngaphakathi oqondile \u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EManje i-chip ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIchazwe ngokuphelele\u003C/strong\u003E futhi yonke i-L iba yinki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-isikethi-esichazwe-ngokweqile\"\u003ELungisa isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isixhumanisi esisha noma isilinganiso siphikisana nabanye, i-PartCraft ayinyakazisi lutho. Ijometri ihlala njengoba yayinjalo, izixhumanisi ezibandakanyekile ziba zibomvu, bese ibha yesimo iqamba zona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile: Horizontal, Distance 40 azikwazi ukwanelisa zonke. Hlehlisa, noma susa elinye lazo.&quot; Izixhumanisi ziyaphikisana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile: Parallel sekuphethwe. Yisuse.&quot; Ixhumanisi alengezi lutho: ezinye sezinikeza lo mphumela. (Izinhlangothi zesikwele zivele zilingana, ngokwesibonelo.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ulungise:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuhlehlisa inguquko yokugcina, noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola into ebomvu ohlwini \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi nezilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yesokudla (iqembu elilibambayo livuliwe futhi libomvu) bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwayo. Ungachofoza futhi impawu yayo noma inombolo esikethini bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule nguqulo azikho izilinganiso &quot;ezilawulwayo&quot; (zesinkomba). Isilinganiso esingabika usayizi osuvele uphethwe yezinye izixhumanisi sithathwa njengesichazwe ngokweqile. Esikhundleni salokho funda usayizi ephaneli: khetha umugqa bese ubheka inkinobho ye-Dimension, noma hlola izimfanelo zengxenye ngemva kokuthi uphonse ngaphandle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi esichazwe ngokweqile ngokuphikisana okuqinile senza isici esisisebenzisayo sihluleke (&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile: isixhumanisi esingu-1 asikwazi ukwanelisa zonke.&quot;), futhi umlando umaka \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ iphutha\u003C/strong\u003E. Isikethi esiphindeliwe nje sakha kodwa sinesixwayiso ⚠.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"donsa-ukuze-uthole-okukhululekile\"\u003EDonsa ukuze uthole okukhululekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Select, donsa noma iphoyinti eluhlaza noma umugqa. Isixazululi sinyakazisa kancane kakhulu sigcina zonke izixhumanisi. Uma ukudonsa kuphula isixhumanisi, ijometri iyabuyela emuva. Lena yindlela esheshayo yokubona ukuthi yisiphi isilinganiso esisasalelwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lwezixhumanisi\"\u003EUhlu lwezixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgalutho okukhethiwe, ephaneli yesokudla kuqoqwa \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi nezilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E. Umugqa ngamunye unalokhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E (izilinganiso kuphela): ivula ibhokisi lenombolo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhetha esikethini;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E: iyasusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zohlobo olufanayo ezivela ngaphezu kwesisodwa zabelana ngomugqa owodwa, njengo &quot;Coincident × 5&quot; lwesikwele eshiwe ku-origin. Chofoza umugqa ukuze uwuvule: ngamunye wexhumanisi ufakwe uhlu ngalokho okuxhuma khona (&quot;iphoyinti p2, iphoyinti p4&quot;) nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E nge-\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E yalo. Umugqa uqobo unalokhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhetha zonke esikethini;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa konke\u003C/strong\u003E: isusa zonke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyazibuyisela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu elibamba ixhumanisi elichazwe ngokweqile livula lodwa, negama lalo libomvu. Izilinganiso zihlala zidweshwe umugqa-ngamunye, nezinani zazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kukhethwe ijometri, uhlu lukhombisa kuphela \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi ezikhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isikethi sichazwa ngokuphelele uma yonke iphoyinti nalo lonke usayizi kubekwe ngezixhumanisi nezilinganiso. Isikethi esichazwe ngokuphelele sishintsha kuphela uma ushintsha inombolo, ngakho ingxenye iziphatha ngokubikezelwayo uma uyihlela kamuva. I-PartCraft ayikuphoqi ukuthi uchaze isikethi ngokuphelele, kodwa njalo ikhombisa ukuthi useduze kangakanani. Funda isimo sesikethi Isimo sibonakala ezindaweni ezintathu: i-chip ngakwesobunxele esiphezulu embonweni, umlayezo ophezulu kwephaneli yesokudla, nethagi emlandweni. Isimo I-chip Umbala wejometri Okusho Ichazwe ngaphansi \"Ichazwe ngaphansi · 3 amandla okunyakaza\" Obuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka Kukhona ijometri engakanyakaza. Donsa ijometri eluhlaza ukuze ubone ukuthi iya ngaphi Ichazwe ngokuphelele \"Ichazwe ngokuphelele\" Inki (omnyama ku-Paper, okhanyayo ku-Model) Yonke iphoyinti nosayizi kubekiwe Ichazwe ngokweqile \"Ichazwe ngokweqile\" Obomvu ezixhumanisweni ezibandakanyekile Ezinye izixhumanisi ziphikisana, noma enye sesivele iphethwe yezinye Ijometri yokwakha ingwazi futhi idashi ngokunjalo, kungakhathaliseki isimo sayo. Izinto ezikhethiwe ziba orange. \"Amandla okunyakaza\" ngumndeni owodwa lapho into ingasanyakaza: iphoyinti elikhululekile linawo amabili (kwesobunxele nakwesokudla, phezulu nasezansi), isiyingi esikhululekile linawo amathathu (indawo yaso ephakathi nesikhombisi saso). Ulayini ongaphansi komlayezo ephaneli yesokudla uphinda imibala. Engeza isilinganiso Cindezela D noma khetha Isilinganiso. Chofoza into ofuna ukuyilinganisa: umugqa owodwa: ubude bawo; isiyingi esisodwa: ububanzi bayo; i-arc eyodwa: umsakazo wayo; amaphoyinti amabili (iphoyinti lokuphela, isikhungo, iphoyinti elikhululekile noma i-origin): ibanga phakathi kwawo; iphoyinti nomugqa: ibanga kusuka kuphoyinti kuya kumugqa; imigqa mibili elinganayo: ibanga phakathi kwawo; imigqa emibili enengeli: ingeli phakathi kwawo. Ngemva kwento eyodwa, ibha yesimo ithi \"Chofoza into yesibili, noma chofoza lapho okufanele kubekwe khona isilinganiso.\" Chofoza into yesibili, noma chofoza endaweni engenalutho lapho ufuna khona inombolo. Ibhokisi lenombolo liyavula linesilinganiso samanje. Thayipha usayizi bese ucindezela Enter. Esc igcina inani elilinganisiwe. Lapho ubeka khona inombolo kuqinisekisa uhlobo somugqa othambekile noma amaphoyinti amabili: ayibeke phezulu noma phansi ukuze uthole ibanga elithe xaxa, ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla ukuze uthole ibanga elithi ngqo, nanoma yikuphi okunye ukuze uthole ibanga eliqondile (elihlanganisiwe). Ibhokisi lamukela izinombolo ezilula ezingamamillimitha noma amadigri, njengo 25, 12.5 noma 1e3. Ukuqala ngo ⌀, Ø noma R, noma ukuphela nge mm noma °, kuyashiywa. Izingeli zingu-0 kuya kwangu-180 wamadigri. Izibalo ezifana no 20+5 aziyamukelwa; ukuze uxhumanise usayizi nomthamo noma ifomula, qala ngo =. Ukushintsha isilinganiso kamuva, chofoza kabili inombolo yaso esikethini, noma khetha Hlela eduze kwaso ohlwini ephaneli yesokudla. Ungakhetha futhi ijometri kuqala (ithuluzi lokuKhetha) bese ukhetha inkinobho yesilinganiso ephaneli yesokudla: Ibanga, Ibanga elithe xaxa, Ibanga elithi ngqo, Umsakazo, Ububanzi noma I-engeli. Kubonakala kuphela ezilingana nokukhethiwe. Yindlela yokunika isiyingi umsakazo esikhundleni sobubanzi. Engeza isixhumanisi Izixhumanisi zengezwa ephaneli yesokudla, hhayi ngethuluzi. Cindezela S ukuze ukhethe. Chofoza into eyodwa, bese Shift+chofoza enye uma isixhumanisi sidinga ezimbili. I-origin nayo ingakhethwa. Ephaneli yesokudla kuthi \"Okukhethiwe: umugqa l3, iphoyinti p1\" futhi kukhombise inkinobho yesixhumanisi ngasinye esilingana nakho, njengo ∥ Parallel noma • Coincident. Khetha inkinobho. Isikethi sixazulula ngokushesha. Uma akukho sixhumanisi esilingana, ephaneli kuthi: \"Akukho sixhumanisi esilingana nalokhu okukhethiwe. Khetha izinto ezimbili noma eyodwa (Shift+chofoza iyengeza).\" Uhlu olugcwele lwezixhumanisi, ukuthi ngayinye idinga ini nokuthi yenzani, kuku Izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zesikethi. Izixhumanisi zibonakala esikethini njengezimpawu ezincane eduze nejometri (H, V, ∥, ⊥, T, =, ◎, M, ⚓). Amachashaza e-Coincident afihlwa uma ijometri ingakhethiwe noma isixhumanisi sinenkinga. Chofoza impawu ukuze ukhethe isixhumanisi. Isibonelo: iprofayili yebhulaketi ene-L Hlela ku-Front plane. Ngethuluzi le-Line, qala ku-origin bese uchofoza izikhonkwane eziyisithupha ze-L, uphele futhi ku-origin. Ushintsho luphela lodwa lapho uchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala. Imigqa eduze nokuba ngokuthambekile noma ibe ngokuthi ibe ngokuthi ngqo isivele inezixhumanisi H no V ngokuzenzakalela, ngaphandle kowokugcina: umugqa ophelela kuphoyinti elikhona awuthole isixhumanisi esizenzakalelayo. Cindezela S, chofoza lowo mugqa wokugcina bese ukhetha V Vertical ephaneli yesokudla. I-chip ithi \"Ichazwe ngaphansi · 4 amandla okunyakaza\". Cindezela D. Chofoza umugqa ongaphansi, chofoza ngaphansi kwawo, uthayipha 80, Enter. Chofoza umugqa ongakwesobunxele, chofoza ngakwesobunxele kwawo, uthayipha 60, Enter. Linganisa umugqa omfushane ongaphezulu 20 nomugqa ngaphakathi oqondile 45 ngendlela efanayo. Manje i-chip ithi Ichazwe ngokuphelele futhi yonke i-L iba yinki. Lungisa isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile Uma isixhumanisi esisha noma isilinganiso siphikisana nabanye, i-PartCraft ayinyakazisi lutho. Ijometri ihlala njengoba yayinjalo, izixhumanisi ezibandakanyekile ziba zibomvu, bese ibha yesimo iqamba zona: \"Ichazwe ngokweqile: Horizontal, Distance 40 azikwazi ukwanelisa zonke. Hlehlisa, noma susa elinye lazo.\" Izixhumanisi ziyaphikisana. \"Ichazwe ngokweqile: Parallel sekuphethwe. Yisuse.\" Ixhumanisi alengezi lutho: ezinye sezinikeza lo mphumela. (Izinhlangothi zesikwele zivele zilingana, ngokwesibonelo.) Ukuze ulungise: Cindezela Ctrl+Z ukuhlehlisa inguquko yokugcina, noma Thola into ebomvu ohlwini Izixhumanisi nezilinganiso ephaneli yesokudla (iqembu elilibambayo livuliwe futhi libomvu) bese ukhetha Susa eduze kwayo. Ungachofoza futhi impawu yayo noma inombolo esikethini bese ucindezela Delete. Kule nguqulo azikho izilinganiso \"ezilawulwayo\" (zesinkomba). Isilinganiso esingabika usayizi osuvele uphethwe yezinye izixhumanisi sithathwa njengesichazwe ngokweqile. Esikhundleni salokho funda usayizi ephaneli: khetha umugqa bese ubheka inkinobho ye-Dimension, noma hlola izimfanelo zengxenye ngemva kokuthi uphonse ngaphandle. Isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile ngokuphikisana okuqinile senza isici esisisebenzisayo sihluleke (\"Ichazwe ngokweqile: isixhumanisi esingu-1 asikwazi ukwanelisa zonke.\"), futhi umlando umaka ⚠ iphutha. Isikethi esiphindeliwe nje sakha kodwa sinesixwayiso ⚠. Donsa ukuze uthole okukhululekile Ku-Select, donsa noma iphoyinti eluhlaza noma umugqa. Isixazululi sinyakazisa kancane kakhulu sigcina zonke izixhumanisi. Uma ukudonsa kuphula isixhumanisi, ijometri iyabuyela emuva. Lena yindlela esheshayo yokubona ukuthi yisiphi isilinganiso esisasalelwe. Uhlu lwezixhumanisi Ngalutho okukhethiwe, ephaneli yesokudla kuqoqwa Izixhumanisi nezilinganiso. Umugqa ngamunye unalokhu: Hlela (izilinganiso kuphela): ivula ibhokisi lenombolo; Khetha: ikhetha esikethini; Susa: iyasusa. Izixhumanisi zohlobo olufanayo ezivela ngaphezu kwesisodwa zabelana ngomugqa owodwa, njengo \"Coincident × 5\" lwesikwele eshiwe ku-origin. Chofoza umugqa ukuze uwuvule: ngamunye wexhumanisi ufakwe uhlu ngalokho okuxhuma khona (\"iphoyinti p2, iphoyinti p4\") nge-Khetha nge-Susa yalo. Umugqa uqobo unalokhu: Khetha: ikhetha zonke esikethini; Susa konke: isusa zonke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (Ctrl+Z iyazibuyisela). Iqembu elibamba ixhumanisi elichazwe ngokweqile livula lodwa, negama lalo libomvu. Izilinganiso zihlala zidweshwe umugqa-ngamunye, nezinani zazo. Uma kukhethwe ijometri, uhlu lukhombisa kuphela Izixhumanisi ezikhethiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"add-by-coordinates","scope":"partcraft","title":"Faka ukwakheka kwesikethi ngokubhala izixhumanisi","summary":"Sebenzisa i-Engeza ngezixhumanisi kuphaneli yesikethi ukubeka imigqa, imigqa yesisekelo, amarektangula, izindilinga namaphoyinti ngezindawo ezinembile, ngekhibhodi kuphela.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["izixhumanisi","ukufaka okubhaliwe","ukufakwa ngekhibhodi","ukufakwa kwezinombolo","indawo echazwe ngokunembile","x y","izixhumanisi eziphelele","ukufinyeleleka","ngaphandle kwe-mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-isakhiwo","text":"Engeza isakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-umugqa-wepuleti-enesikhala-obhaliwe","text":"Isibonelo: umugqa wepuleti enesikhala, obhaliwe","level":2},{"id":"izinto-ezibhaliwe-zibekiwe-azibotshiwe","text":"Izinto ezibhaliwe zibekiwe, azibotshiwe","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELapho usuwazi izinombolo, ukuzibhala kushesha kunokuchofoza nokulinganisa. \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza ngezixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E itholakala kuphaneli yesokudla noma nini lapho kuvulekile isikethi. Ikuvumela futhi ukuthi wakhe isikethi ngaphandle kwesikhombi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zikhonjiswa ku-millimeter, ezinsikeni zesikethi uqobo: x iya ngakwesokudla ne-y iya phezulu uma ubheka isikethi, ne-(0, 0) emsukeni (isiyingi esibomvu esinesiphambano).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-isakhiwo\"\u003EEngeza isakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula isikethi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EDweba isikethi sakho sokuqala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphaneli yesokudla, skrola ufike ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza ngezixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhiwo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza\u003C/strong\u003E: Umugqa, Umugqa wesisekelo, Irektangula, Indilinga noma Iphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcwalisa amabhokisi:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmabhokisi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusukela x, y\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EKuya x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusukela x, y\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EKuya x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIrektangula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhona x, y\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhona eliphambene x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo x, y\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kunoma yibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo siyavela bese ibha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, &quot;Kungezwe irektangula.&quot; Amabhokisi ayancipha, elungele okulandelayo. Ukungezwa ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBhala ipheya njengezinombolo ezimbili ezihlukaniswe ngekhoma noma isikhala: \u003Ccode\u003E0, 0\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E25 -10\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E12.5,40\u003C/code\u003E. Izinombolo ezinegethivu namadesimali ziyavumelekile. Umsakazo kufanele ube ngaphezu kuka-zero. Uma okuthile kungafundeki njengenombolo, ibha yesimo ithi: &#039;Bhala izixhumanisi njenge &quot;x, y&quot; nomsakazo ongaphezu kuka-zero.&#039;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonelo-umugqa-wepuleti-enesikhala-obhaliwe\"\u003EIsibonelo: umugqa wepuleti enesikhala, obhaliwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula isikethi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza engaphambili\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza\u003C/strong\u003E: Irektangula. \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhona x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E-50, -30\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhona eliphambene x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E50, 30\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza\u003C/strong\u003E: Indilinga. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E-30, 0\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E30, 0\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma kusiketshi\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E: ipuleti elingu-100 × 60 enezimbobo ezimbili ezingu-10 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-ezibhaliwe-zibekiwe-azibotshiwe\"\u003EIzinto ezibhaliwe zibekiwe, azibotshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi ezibhaliwe zibeka ijiyomethri endaweni efanele, kodwa \u003Cstrong\u003Eazisona izixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E. Izakhiwo zihlala zibe bluu (zingachazwanga ngokuphelele) futhi zingahamba uma uzidonsa noma ushintsha esinye isilinganiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eirektangula ebhaliwe inamaphethelo ayo, izixhumanisi ezithe xaxa nezimile njengoba kwenziwa ngesandla, kodwa akukho okuyixhumanisa nomsuka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumugqa obhaliwe awunaxhumanisi elithe xaxa noma elimile, nakuba ubhale umugqa othe xaxa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisikhungo sendilinga esibhaliwe sikhululekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wenze isikethi sichazwe ngokuphelele, engeza izilinganiso nezixhumanisi kamuva (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza isikethi ngokuphelele\u003C/a\u003E). Isibonelo, khetha ikhona yerektangula nomsuka bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Ukuhlangana\u003C/span\u003E, noma linganisa izikhungo zendilinga ukusuka emsukeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwesikhombi ungafinyelela kanjena: hambela kumugqa wendiza emlandweni ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokhiye bemicibisholo, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyikhethe, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze wenze isikethi, engeza izakhiwo lapha, bese ufinyelela \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwesilinganiso ngasinye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma kusiketshi\u003C/span\u003E nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukukhetha i-geometry, nokungeza izixhumanisi noma izilinganiso ezintsha, kudinga ukuchofoza noma ukuthinta kulokhu kwakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaarc akakakwazi ukubhalwa. Adweba ngethuluzi le-Arc, noma bhala indilinga bese usebenzisa izixhumanisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho izixhumanisi ezihlobene (kusukela ephoyinteni lokugcina) noma izixhumanisi ze-polar (ubude nesikhona) kule bhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-geometry ebhaliwe ayibambelelani kumaphoyinti akhona. Bhala izixhumanisi ezifanayo nephoyinti elikhona, bese wengeza ukuxhumana \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Ukuhlangana\u003C/span\u003E phakathi kwawo uma kumele ahlale exhunyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lapho usuwazi izinombolo, ukuzibhala kushesha kunokuchofoza nokulinganisa. Engeza ngezixhumanisi itholakala kuphaneli yesokudla noma nini lapho kuvulekile isikethi. Ikuvumela futhi ukuthi wakhe isikethi ngaphandle kwesikhombi. Izixhumanisi zikhonjiswa ku-millimeter, ezinsikeni zesikethi uqobo: x iya ngakwesokudla ne-y iya phezulu uma ubheka isikethi, ne-(0, 0) emsukeni (isiyingi esibomvu esinesiphambano). Engeza isakhiwo Vula isikethi (bona Dweba isikethi sakho sokuqala). Kuphaneli yesokudla, skrola ufike ku-Engeza ngezixhumanisi. Khetha isakhiwo ku-Engeza: Umugqa, Umugqa wesisekelo, Irektangula, Indilinga noma Iphoyinti. Gcwalisa amabhokisi: Isakhiwo Amabhokisi Umugqa Kusukela x, y kanye Kuya x, y Umugqa wesisekelo Kusukela x, y kanye Kuya x, y Irektangula Ikhona x, y kanye Ikhona eliphambene x, y Indilinga Isikhungo x, y kanye Umsakazo Iphoyinti Ku x, y Khetha Engeza, noma cindezela Enter kunoma yibhokisi. Isakhiwo siyavela bese ibha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, \"Kungezwe irektangula.\" Amabhokisi ayancipha, elungele okulandelayo. Ukungezwa ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Bhala ipheya njengezinombolo ezimbili ezihlukaniswe ngekhoma noma isikhala: 0, 0, 25 -10 noma 12.5,40. Izinombolo ezinegethivu namadesimali ziyavumelekile. Umsakazo kufanele ube ngaphezu kuka-zero. Uma okuthile kungafundeki njengenombolo, ibha yesimo ithi: 'Bhala izixhumanisi njenge \"x, y\" nomsakazo ongaphezu kuka-zero.' Isibonelo: umugqa wepuleti enesikhala, obhaliwe Vula isikethi ku-Indiza engaphambili. Engeza: Irektangula. Ikhona x, y: -50, -30. Ikhona eliphambene x, y: 50, 30. Enter. Engeza: Indilinga. Isikhungo x, y: -30, 0. Umsakazo: 5. Enter. Isikhungo x, y: 30, 0. Umsakazo: 5. Enter. Khetha Phuma kusiketshi, bese Ukukhipha: ipuleti elingu-100 × 60 enezimbobo ezimbili ezingu-10 mm. Izinto ezibhaliwe zibekiwe, azibotshiwe Izixhumanisi ezibhaliwe zibeka ijiyomethri endaweni efanele, kodwa azisona izixhumanisi. Izakhiwo zihlala zibe bluu (zingachazwanga ngokuphelele) futhi zingahamba uma uzidonsa noma ushintsha esinye isilinganiso: irektangula ebhaliwe inamaphethelo ayo, izixhumanisi ezithe xaxa nezimile njengoba kwenziwa ngesandla, kodwa akukho okuyixhumanisa nomsuka; umugqa obhaliwe awunaxhumanisi elithe xaxa noma elimile, nakuba ubhale umugqa othe xaxa; isikhungo sendilinga esibhaliwe sikhululekile. Ukuze wenze isikethi sichazwe ngokuphelele, engeza izilinganiso nezixhumanisi kamuva (bona Chaza isikethi ngokuphelele). Isibonelo, khetha ikhona yerektangula nomsuka bese ukhetha • Ukuhlangana, noma linganisa izikhungo zendilinga ukusuka emsukeni. Ngaphandle kwesikhombi ungafinyelela kanjena: hambela kumugqa wendiza emlandweni ngo-Tab nokhiye bemicibisholo, cindezela Enter ukuze uyikhethe, cindezela S ukuze wenze isikethi, engeza izakhiwo lapha, bese ufinyelela Hlela eduze kwesilinganiso ngasinye bese ukhetha Phuma kusiketshi nge-Tab. Ukukhetha i-geometry, nokungeza izixhumanisi noma izilinganiso ezintsha, kudinga ukuchofoza noma ukuthinta kulokhu kwakhiwo. Imikhawulo Amaarc akakakwazi ukubhalwa. Adweba ngethuluzi le-Arc, noma bhala indilinga bese usebenzisa izixhumanisi. Akukho izixhumanisi ezihlobene (kusukela ephoyinteni lokugcina) noma izixhumanisi ze-polar (ubude nesikhona) kule bhokisi. I-geometry ebhaliwe ayibambelelani kumaphoyinti akhona. Bhala izixhumanisi ezifanayo nephoyinti elikhona, bese wengeza ukuxhumana • Ukuhlangana phakathi kwawo uma kumele ahlale exhunyiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"extrude-and-cut","scope":"partcraft","title":"Khipha isiqukathi bese usika kuso","summary":"Guqula isikethi sibe yisolidi ngoKhipha, setha ukujula okuvaliwe, okusemaphakathi, okuze kube ubuso, okubili noma ukuthambeka, noma ikhontha elilodwa lesikethi, bese udweba ubuso bese usika umgodi noma isilotha esidlulayo.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["khipha","isiqukathi","isiqukathi esikhishiwe","sika","ukusika okukhishiwe","umgodi","konke kudlule","okuvaliwe","phakathi kwendiza","phendulisa","ukujula","sika-khipha","isiqukathi-khipha","ipheyidi","kuze kube ubuso","kuze kube olandelayo","kuze kube ku-vertex","ukuphambuka kusuka kubuso","indlela 2","izindlela ezimbili","ukuthambeka ngesikhathi sokukhipha","ukuthambeka","ikhontha","indawo","izindawo ezikhethiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"khipha-isiqukathi","text":"Khipha isiqukathi","level":2},{"id":"setha-ukujula-nendlela","text":"Setha ukujula nendlela","level":3},{"id":"kuze-kube-ubuso-ubuso-olandelayo-noma-i-vertex","text":"Kuze kube ubuso, ubuso olandelayo noma i-vertex","level":3},{"id":"izindlela-ezimbili-ukuthambeka-ikhontha-elilodwa","text":"Izindlela ezimbili, ukuthambeka, ikhontha elilodwa","level":3},{"id":"sika-umgodi","text":"Sika umgodi","level":2},{"id":"hudula-noma-sunduza-ubuso-bonke","text":"Hudula noma sunduza ubuso bonke","level":2},{"id":"amaphrofayili-anamaqhingo","text":"Amaphrofayili anamaqhingo","level":2},{"id":"hlela-kamuva","text":"Hlela kamuva","level":2},{"id":"imiyalezo-evamile","text":"Imiyalezo evamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E isunduza iphrofayili evaliwe yesikethi ngqo iphume endizeni yayo ukuze yakhe impahla. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E yenza okufanayo kodwa isuse impahla. Zombili zingesici esifanayo ngaphansi; ungashintsha enye ibe yenye kamuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha-isiqukathi\"\u003EKhipha isiqukathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba iphrofayili evaliwe bese uvala isikethi (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EDweba isikethi sakho sokuqala\u003C/a\u003E). Isahlala ikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuvela isolidi ye-10 mm, &quot;Extrude1&quot; ijoyina umlando nesikethi sayo sigxunyiwe ngaphansi kwayo, futhi ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Extrude1 yengeziwe. Shintsha izinombolo zayo kwesokudla.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikethi esisetshenziswayo:\u003C/strong\u003E isikethi osivele wasivala, noma isikethi esikhethwe komlando. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, i-PartCraft ithatha isikethi sakamuva esingakasetshenziswa yisici. Uma kungekho: &quot;Qala ngokwenza isikethi: khetha ipuleni, Isikethi, dweba iphrofayili evaliwe, Phuma.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"setha-ukujula-nendlela\"\u003ESetha ukujula nendlela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwiphaneli yangakwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsenzo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi (engeza impahla), Sika (susa impahla), Hlanganisa (gcina ukuhlangana), Isidumbu esisha (akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: sidinga i-kernel eqondile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuvaliwe (ukujula), Phakathi kwendiza (zombili izindlela), Konke kudlule, Kuze kube ubuso noma indiza, Kuze kube ubuso olandelayo, Kuze kube ku-vertex, Ukuphambuka kusuka kubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma yisiphi isayizi ngaphezu kwe-zero (ibonakala kuValiwe nakuPhakathi kwendiza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhula ngakolunye uhlangothi lwendiza yesikethi (ayibonakali kuPhakathi kwendiza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBhala inombolo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ingxenye yakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha. \u003Cstrong\u003EPhakathi kwendiza\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka uhhafu wokujula ohlangothini ngalunye lwesikethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kuze-kube-ubuso-ubuso-olandelayo-noma-i-vertex\"\u003EKuze kube ubuso, ubuso olandelayo noma i-vertex\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakhiwa kule nguqulo: zonke iziphetho &quot;kuze kube&quot; zidinga i-kernel eqondile, futhi isici sithi &quot;Ukukhipha kuze kube ubuso, ubuso olandelayo noma i-vertex: akukakhiwa (idinga i-kernel eqondile).&quot; Sebenzisa ukujula okuvaliwe okulinganisile. Ngayo i-kernel eqondile, iziphetho zisebenza kanje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube ubuso noma indiza\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube\u003C/strong\u003E kuthatha ubuso obuthe (Khetha, bese uchofoza kuwo) noma indiza yesethulo. Ubuso obuhambisana nesikethi ludala ukujula okuqondile; obuthambekile wenza ukusika kwesiphetho ngaphezulu kwesiphambeko. Uma ubuso buseduze emuva kwesikethi: &quot;… Zama Phendula indlela.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube ubuso olandelayo\u003C/strong\u003E: iyama ebusweni bokuqala obuthe besidumbu ukukhipha okuhlangana nakho (ubuso obugobile abuxhaswa lapha: ikhombisa lokho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube ku-vertex\u003C/strong\u003E: iyama ngokulingana ne-vertex (chofoza eduze kwesiphetho somphetho) noma isici sephoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphambuka kusuka kubuso\u003C/strong\u003E: njengo-Kuze kube ubuso, kuyama \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphambuka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphambi kwakho (kulinganiswa ngokuqondile kubuso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izindlela-ezimbili-ukuthambeka-ikhontha-elilodwa\"\u003EIzindlela ezimbili, ukuthambeka, ikhontha elilodwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela yesibili\u003C/strong\u003E (Okuvaliwe): ikhipha futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula kwesibili (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngakolunye uhlangothi lwesikethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthambeka (°)\u003C/strong\u003E: izinhlangothi ziyathambeka njengoba zihamba (inegethivu: ziphuma), njenge-draft; indlela eyodwa kuphela. Akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (idinga i-kernel eqondile): yishiye ku-0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha izindawo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uchofoza phakathi kwamalunu ukuze ukhiphe; kusetshenziswa lezo zindawo kuphela (isiyingi ngaphakathi kwesikwele: chofoza phakathi kwesiyingi ukuze uthole isilinda, phakathi kwazo ukuze uthole iphuleti elinomgodi). \u003Cstrong\u003EKonke\u003C/strong\u003E kubuyela kuwo wonke amalunu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwalokhu, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zesikethi\u003C/strong\u003E zibhala izilinganiso ezishayelayo zesikethi, ukuze ushintshe usayizi weprofayili ngaphandle kokuvula isikethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKonke kudlule kusetshenziselwa okusikiwe kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Isiqukathi esisethwe ku-Konke kudlule siyahluleka ngokuthi &quot;Konke kudlule kusetshenziselwa okusikiwe. Sebenzisa ukujula kwesiqukathi.&quot; Ukushintsha isici kusuka ku-Sika kubuyela ku-Isiqukathi kushintsha Konke kudlule kube Okuvaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-umgodi\"\u003ESika umgodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe ofuna ukusika kulo. Buyakhanya, futhi iphaneli yangakwesokudla ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kulobu buso\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhodini lamathuluzi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba umkhawulo womgodi, isibonelo unxande, bese uwulinganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E. Iqala nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EKonke kudlule\u003C/strong\u003E: isusa impahla ngqo ngaphakathi kwengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgomgodi, setha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EOkuvaliwe (ukujula)\u003C/strong\u003E bese ubhala \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusika kungena empahleni, kude nobuso owadweba kuwo. Uma ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Akukho lutho oluzosikwa kulolo hlangothi lwesikethi. Zama enye indlela.&quot;, tick \u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi esisegangeni lomgodi silandela igangi: shintsha ukujula komgodi nesikethi siyanyakaza nawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hudula-noma-sunduza-ubuso-bonke\"\u003EHudula noma sunduza ubuso bonke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubuso buphume kakhulu noma bucwile, akudingeki udwebe umkhawulo wabo. Chofoza ubuso obuthe, bese kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha kusuka kulo\u003C/span\u003E khipha ubuso ngaphandle: i-PartCraft yengeza isikethi ebusweni esibamba umkhawulo wabo (imigodi ebusweni ihlala iyimigodi) nokukhipha okungu-10 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika kulo\u003C/span\u003E sunduza ubuso ngaphakathi: isikethi esifanayo nokusika kuhhafu wengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili ziyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa isikethi nesici ndawonye. Isici esisha siyakhethwa, ngakho bhala inombolo ngokushesha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukujula kwaso. Umkhawulo ukopishelwe njengemigqa namasongo ahlelekile: awulandeli izinguquko ezizayo kubuso. Uma ingxenye yomkhawulo ingakwazi ukukopishelwa (ijika elikhululekile), isikethi siyavuleka sinalokho okukwazile ukukopishelwa; qedela, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphrofayili-anamaqhingo\"\u003EAmaphrofayili anamaqhingo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi singabamba amalunu avaliwe amaningana. Amalunu ecaleni komunye aba yizisiqukathi ezihlukene (noma izinsika); ilunu eliphakathi kwelinye liba umgodi odlula kwisiqukathi. Isibonelo, unxande onezindilinga ezimbili phakathi kwawo ukhipha njengephuleti elinemigodi emibili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusebenzisa amanye amalunu kuphela, khetha wona nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E (phezulu); esinye isici singasebenzisa amanye amalunu alesi sikethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-kamuva\"\u003EHlela kamuva\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza &quot;Extrude1&quot; komlando ukuze ubuyisele izilungiselelo zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili isikethi sayo (sigxunyiwe ngaphansi kwayo) ukuze uvule isikethi; sivale ukuze sakhe kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EShintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo\u003C/a\u003E ukuvimbela, ukubuyela emuva, ukuhlela kabusha nokususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imiyalezo-evamile\"\u003EImiyalezo evamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufanele wenze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Isikethi asinayo iphrofayili evaliwe yokukhipha.&quot; Isikethi asinalunu elivaliwe lemigqa eqinile. Vala izikhala, noma buyisela imigqa yokwakha ibe yimigqa evamile nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Iphrofayili ivulekile: ukuphela ku-(x, y) akuxhunyiwe lutho.&quot; Vula isikethi uxhumanise lowo mphetho komugqa olandelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;There is nothing to cut yet.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Akukho lutho oluzosikwa okwamanje.&quot; Ukusika kudinga isolidi okuzosikwa kuyo. Yenza isiqukathi kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Nothing is left of the part after this.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Akukho lutho olusele engxenyeni ngemva kwalokhu.&quot; Ukusika kususe konke. Hlola usayizi nendlela yayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwengeziwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukukhipha isunduza iphrofayili evaliwe yesikethi ngqo iphume endizeni yayo ukuze yakhe impahla. Sika yenza okufanayo kodwa isuse impahla. Zombili zingesici esifanayo ngaphansi; ungashintsha enye ibe yenye kamuva. Khipha isiqukathi Dweba iphrofayili evaliwe bese uvala isikethi (bheka Dweba isikethi sakho sokuqala). Isahlala ikhethiwe. Khetha Ukukhipha. Kuvela isolidi ye-10 mm, \"Extrude1\" ijoyina umlando nesikethi sayo sigxunyiwe ngaphansi kwayo, futhi ibha yesimo ithi \"Extrude1 yengeziwe. Shintsha izinombolo zayo kwesokudla.\" Isikethi esisetshenziswayo: isikethi osivele wasivala, noma isikethi esikhethwe komlando. Uma kungakhethiwe lutho, i-PartCraft ithatha isikethi sakamuva esingakasetshenziswa yisici. Uma kungekho: \"Qala ngokwenza isikethi: khetha ipuleni, Isikethi, dweba iphrofayili evaliwe, Phuma.\" Setha ukujula nendlela Kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla: Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Isenzo Isiqukathi (engeza impahla), Sika (susa impahla), Hlanganisa (gcina ukuhlangana), Isidumbu esisha (akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: sidinga i-kernel eqondile) Isiqukathi Ukuphela Okuvaliwe (ukujula), Phakathi kwendiza (zombili izindlela), Konke kudlule, Kuze kube ubuso noma indiza, Kuze kube ubuso olandelayo, Kuze kube ku-vertex, Ukuphambuka kusuka kubuso Okuvaliwe Ukujula (mm) Noma yisiphi isayizi ngaphezu kwe-zero (ibonakala kuValiwe nakuPhakathi kwendiza) 10 Phendula indlela Ikhula ngakolunye uhlangothi lwendiza yesikethi (ayibonakali kuPhakathi kwendiza) Kuvalwe Bhala inombolo bese ucindezela Enter noma Tab: ingxenye yakhiwa kabusha ngokushesha. Phakathi kwendiza ibeka uhhafu wokujula ohlangothini ngalunye lwesikethi. Kuze kube ubuso, ubuso olandelayo noma i-vertex Akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: zonke iziphetho \"kuze kube\" zidinga i-kernel eqondile, futhi isici sithi \"Ukukhipha kuze kube ubuso, ubuso olandelayo noma i-vertex: akukakhiwa (idinga i-kernel eqondile).\" Sebenzisa ukujula okuvaliwe okulinganisile. Ngayo i-kernel eqondile, iziphetho zisebenza kanje: Kuze kube ubuso noma indiza: Kuze kube kuthatha ubuso obuthe (Khetha, bese uchofoza kuwo) noma indiza yesethulo. Ubuso obuhambisana nesikethi ludala ukujula okuqondile; obuthambekile wenza ukusika kwesiphetho ngaphezulu kwesiphambeko. Uma ubuso buseduze emuva kwesikethi: \"… Zama Phendula indlela.\" Kuze kube ubuso olandelayo: iyama ebusweni bokuqala obuthe besidumbu ukukhipha okuhlangana nakho (ubuso obugobile abuxhaswa lapha: ikhombisa lokho). Kuze kube ku-vertex: iyama ngokulingana ne-vertex (chofoza eduze kwesiphetho somphetho) noma isici sephoyinti. Ukuphambuka kusuka kubuso: njengo-Kuze kube ubuso, kuyama Ukuphambuka (mm) ngaphambi kwakho (kulinganiswa ngokuqondile kubuso). Izindlela ezimbili, ukuthambeka, ikhontha elilodwa Indlela yesibili (Okuvaliwe): ikhipha futhi Ukujula kwesibili (mm) ngakolunye uhlangothi lwesikethi. Ukuthambeka (°): izinhlangothi ziyathambeka njengoba zihamba (inegethivu: ziphuma), njenge-draft; indlela eyodwa kuphela. Akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (idinga i-kernel eqondile): yishiye ku-0. Izindawo: Khetha izindawo, bese uchofoza phakathi kwamalunu ukuze ukhiphe; kusetshenziswa lezo zindawo kuphela (isiyingi ngaphakathi kwesikwele: chofoza phakathi kwesiyingi ukuze uthole isilinda, phakathi kwazo ukuze uthole iphuleti elinomgodi). Konke kubuyela kuwo wonke amalunu. Ngaphansi kwalokhu, Izilinganiso zesikethi zibhala izilinganiso ezishayelayo zesikethi, ukuze ushintshe usayizi weprofayili ngaphandle kokuvula isikethi. Konke kudlule kusetshenziselwa okusikiwe kuphela. Isiqukathi esisethwe ku-Konke kudlule siyahluleka ngokuthi \"Konke kudlule kusetshenziselwa okusikiwe. Sebenzisa ukujula kwesiqukathi.\" Ukushintsha isici kusuka ku-Sika kubuyela ku-Isiqukathi kushintsha Konke kudlule kube Okuvaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo. Sika umgodi Chofoza ubuso obuthe ofuna ukusika kulo. Buyakhanya, futhi iphaneli yangakwesokudla ithi Ubuso. Khetha Sketch kulobu buso (noma Isikethi ebhodini lamathuluzi). Dweba umkhawulo womgodi, isibonelo unxande, bese uwulinganisa. Khetha Phuma. Khetha Sika. Iqala nge-Konke kudlule: isusa impahla ngqo ngaphakathi kwengxenye. Ngomgodi, setha Ukuphela ibe Okuvaliwe (ukujula) bese ubhala Ukujula (mm). Ukusika kungena empahleni, kude nobuso owadweba kuwo. Uma ibha yesimo ithi \"Akukho lutho oluzosikwa kulolo hlangothi lwesikethi. Zama enye indlela.\", tick Phendula indlela. Isikethi esisegangeni lomgodi silandela igangi: shintsha ukujula komgodi nesikethi siyanyakaza nawo. Hudula noma sunduza ubuso bonke Ukuze ubuso buphume kakhulu noma bucwile, akudingeki udwebe umkhawulo wabo. Chofoza ubuso obuthe, bese kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla: Ukukhipha kusuka kulo khipha ubuso ngaphandle: i-PartCraft yengeza isikethi ebusweni esibamba umkhawulo wabo (imigodi ebusweni ihlala iyimigodi) nokukhipha okungu-10 mm. Sika kulo sunduza ubuso ngaphakathi: isikethi esifanayo nokusika kuhhafu wengxenye. Zombili ziyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z isusa isikethi nesici ndawonye. Isici esisha siyakhethwa, ngakho bhala inombolo ngokushesha bese ucindezela Enter ukujula kwaso. Umkhawulo ukopishelwe njengemigqa namasongo ahlelekile: awulandeli izinguquko ezizayo kubuso. Uma ingxenye yomkhawulo ingakwazi ukukopishelwa (ijika elikhululekile), isikethi siyavuleka sinalokho okukwazile ukukopishelwa; qedela, bese ukhetha Phuma bese Ukukhipha noma Sika. Amaphrofayili anamaqhingo Isikethi singabamba amalunu avaliwe amaningana. Amalunu ecaleni komunye aba yizisiqukathi ezihlukene (noma izinsika); ilunu eliphakathi kwelinye liba umgodi odlula kwisiqukathi. Isibonelo, unxande onezindilinga ezimbili phakathi kwawo ukhipha njengephuleti elinemigodi emibili. Ukusebenzisa amanye amalunu kuphela, khetha wona nge-Izindawo (phezulu); esinye isici singasebenzisa amanye amalunu alesi sikethi. Hlela kamuva Chofoza \"Extrude1\" komlando ukuze ubuyisele izilungiselelo zayo. Chofoza kabili isikethi sayo (sigxunyiwe ngaphansi kwayo) ukuze uvule isikethi; sivale ukuze sakhe kabusha. Bheka Shintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo ukuvimbela, ukubuyela emuva, ukuhlela kabusha nokususa. Imiyalezo evamile Umyalezo Okufanele wenze \"The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.\" \"Isikethi asinayo iphrofayili evaliwe yokukhipha.\" Isikethi asinalunu elivaliwe lemigqa eqinile. Vala izikhala, noma buyisela imigqa yokwakha ibe yimigqa evamile nge-Q \"The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.\" \"Iphrofayili ivulekile: ukuphela ku-(x, y) akuxhunyiwe lutho.\" Vula isikethi uxhumanise lowo mphetho komugqa olandelayo \"There is nothing to cut yet.\" \"Akukho lutho oluzosikwa okwamanje.\" Ukusika kudinga isolidi okuzosikwa kuyo. Yenza isiqukathi kuqala \"Nothing is left of the part after this.\" \"Akukho lutho olusele engxenyeni ngemva kwalokhu.\" Ukusika kususe konke. Hlola usayizi nendlela yayo Okwengeziwe ku-Ukuxazulula izinkinga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"revolve","scope":"partcraft","title":"Jikeleza ingxenye ejikelezayo","summary":"Dweba uhhafu wephrofayili eduze komugqa wesisekelo, uyijikeleze ibe yingxenye egudlile, khetha i-axis nengeengeli, bese usebenzisa ukusikwa okujikelezayo ngemijikelezo.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["jikeleza","impahla ejikelezayo","ukusikwa okujikelezayo","ukujikeleza","ingxenye ejikelezayo","lathe","shaft","axis","umugqa wesisekelo","umjikelezo","iengeli","rev cut"],"headings":[{"id":"jikeleza-i-shaft-enezinyathelo","text":"Jikeleza i-shaft enezinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"sika-igrumbu","text":"Sika igrumbu","level":2},{"id":"ubuso-obujikelezayo-ku-assembly","text":"Ubuso obujikelezayo ku-assembly","level":2},{"id":"amajika-angempela-namafasethi","text":"Amajika angempela namafasethi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E ijikelezisa iphrofayili ngokuzungeza i-axis, njengengxenye eyenziwe ku-lathe: amashafu, amapulley, amafulenji, izibambo. Ukusikwa okujikelezayo (ku-menyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E yeqembu le-Features) kujikelezisa iphrofayili ukuze kususwe impahla, kwenze imigqa nezikhala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jikeleza-i-shaft-enezinyathelo\"\u003EJikeleza i-shaft enezinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E. Qala ku-origin bese uchofoza iphoyinti eliqondile ngakwesokudla, isibonelo ama-100 mm ngaphesheya. Lena i-axis. Iphukile: umugqa wokwakha awuyona ingxenye yephrofayili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole Umugqa. Dweba \u003Cstrong\u003Euhhafu\u003C/strong\u003E wephrofayili phezu komugqa wesisekelo njengelupu elilodwa elivaliwe: qala emugqeni wesisekelo, phakama, yenza isinyathelo, bese wehla ubuyele emugqeni wesisekelo, bese uhamba kuwo uye ekuqaleni. Imiphetho yayo kumele ihlangane: lupu kumele livaleke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBekela imisakazo (amakhaza aphezu komugqa wesisekelo) nobude. Ukuphakama okungu-10 ngaphezu komugqa wesisekelo kwenza idayamitha engu-20.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E. I-shaft iyavela, ijikeleza ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphrofayili kumele ihlale ohlangothini olulodwa lwe-axis. Uma idlula: &quot;Iphrofayili idlula i-axis. Yigcine ohlangothini olulodwa womugqa wesisekelo.&quot; Umphetho wephrofayili ungalala ku-axis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss (engeza impahla), Cut (susa impahla), Intersect (gcina ukuhlangana) noma umzimba omusha (New body)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E, Cut for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusikwa okujikelezayo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-engeli (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujikeleza kuya kangakanani, kusuka kancane ngaphezu kwe-0 kuya ku-360\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wokuqala wesisekelo, noma noma imuphi umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo esikethini, ohlwini njengo &quot;Centerline 1 (l1)&quot; noma &quot;Line 3 (l3)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wokuqala wesisekelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIengeli engaphelele yenza i-wedge, ijikelezwe kusuka endizeni yesikethi ngakolunye uhlangothi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isikethi singenamugqa wesisekelo futhi ushiye \u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Umugqa wokuqala wesisekelo: &quot;Dweba umugqa wesisekelo (umugqa wokwakha) esikethini ukuze ujikelezele kuwo.&quot; Ungakhetha futhi umugqa oqinile wephrofayili njenge-axis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-igrumbu\"\u003ESika igrumbu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma i-shaft isiyakhiwe, vula isikethi esisha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E (indiza efanayo nesikethi se-shaft).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba umugqa wesisekelo ku-axis efanayo: qala ku-origin bese uwugcina ulingene ukuze uthole H, noma uwuthayipha nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd by coordinates\u003C/strong\u003E (isibonelo ukusuka ku \u003Ccode\u003E0, 0\u003C/code\u003E kuya ku \u003Ccode\u003E100, 0\u003C/code\u003E). Isikethi esisha asikwazi ukuhlanganisa nemigqa yesikethi esinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba ihlombe elincane elivaliwe elihlanganisa umphetho we-shaft lapho kufanele khona igrumbu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusikwa okujikelezayo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso-obujikelezayo-ku-assembly\"\u003EUbuso obujikelezayo ku-assembly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkujikeleza kunayo i-axis ezinye izici nama-assembly angayisebenzisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einkambu \u003Cstrong\u003Engokujikeleza\u003C/strong\u003E isebenzisa i-axis yokujikeleza yokugcina ngokuzenzakalelayo (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003EIzici zokuphinda nezibuko\u003C/a\u003E);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eku-assembly, ukuxhuma phakathi kobuso obenziwe ngokujikeleza kuqala njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Erevolute\u003C/strong\u003E joint, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E inikeza &quot;Axis of Revolve1&quot; (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EYakha i-assembly\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amajika-angempela-namafasethi\"\u003EAmajika angempela namafasethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yakha ukujikeleza nge-mesh kernel (i-chip ye-status bar ithi &quot;Mesh kernel&quot;): izimo ezijikelezayo ziwamafasethi athambile, angu-64 ngokujikeleza ngokuzenzakalelayo, kanti amavolumu ancane kancane kunenani langempela (cishe ngo-0.16 % ku-64). Ukubukwa, ukuthunyelwa kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP kwakhiwe ngalawo mafasethi: setha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E (chofoza endaweni engenalutho, bese uya ohlangothini lwesokudla) ibe Fine (128) noma Very fine (256) ukuze ibe bushelelezi. Amasilinda, amakhoni namatorasi angempela adinga i-kernel echanekile: akukakwakhiwa kule nguqulo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jikeleza ijikelezisa iphrofayili ngokuzungeza i-axis, njengengxenye eyenziwe ku-lathe: amashafu, amapulley, amafulenji, izibambo. Ukusikwa okujikelezayo (ku-menyu ye-Okwengeziwe yeqembu le-Features) kujikelezisa iphrofayili ukuze kususwe impahla, kwenze imigqa nezikhala. Jikeleza i-shaft enezinyathelo Dweba ku-Front plane. Cindezela N ukuze uthole Umugqa wesisekelo. Qala ku-origin bese uchofoza iphoyinti eliqondile ngakwesokudla, isibonelo ama-100 mm ngaphesheya. Lena i-axis. Iphukile: umugqa wokwakha awuyona ingxenye yephrofayili. Cindezela L ukuze uthole Umugqa. Dweba uhhafu wephrofayili phezu komugqa wesisekelo njengelupu elilodwa elivaliwe: qala emugqeni wesisekelo, phakama, yenza isinyathelo, bese wehla ubuyele emugqeni wesisekelo, bese uhamba kuwo uye ekuqaleni. Imiphetho yayo kumele ihlangane: lupu kumele livaleke. Bekela imisakazo (amakhaza aphezu komugqa wesisekelo) nobude. Ukuphakama okungu-10 ngaphezu komugqa wesisekelo kwenza idayamitha engu-20. Khetha Phuma. Khetha Jikeleza. I-shaft iyavela, ijikeleza ngokuphelele. Iphrofayili kumele ihlale ohlangothini olulodwa lwe-axis. Uma idlula: \"Iphrofayili idlula i-axis. Yigcine ohlangothini olulodwa womugqa wesisekelo.\" Umphetho wephrofayili ungalala ku-axis. Izilungiselelo Isilungiselelo Okwenzayo Okuzenzakalelayo Umsebenzi Boss (engeza impahla), Cut (susa impahla), Intersect (gcina ukuhlangana) noma umzimba omusha (New body) Boss for Jikeleza, Cut for Okwengeziwe › Ukusikwa okujikelezayo I-engeli (°) Ukujikeleza kuya kangakanani, kusuka kancane ngaphezu kwe-0 kuya ku-360 360 I-axis Umugqa wokuqala wesisekelo, noma noma imuphi umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo esikethini, ohlwini njengo \"Centerline 1 (l1)\" noma \"Line 3 (l3)\" Umugqa wokuqala wesisekelo Iengeli engaphelele yenza i-wedge, ijikelezwe kusuka endizeni yesikethi ngakolunye uhlangothi. Uma isikethi singenamugqa wesisekelo futhi ushiye I-axis ku-Umugqa wokuqala wesisekelo: \"Dweba umugqa wesisekelo (umugqa wokwakha) esikethini ukuze ujikelezele kuwo.\" Ungakhetha futhi umugqa oqinile wephrofayili njenge-axis. Sika igrumbu Uma i-shaft isiyakhiwe, vula isikethi esisha ku-Front plane (indiza efanayo nesikethi se-shaft). Dweba umugqa wesisekelo ku-axis efanayo: qala ku-origin bese uwugcina ulingene ukuze uthole H, noma uwuthayipha nge-Add by coordinates (isibonelo ukusuka ku 0, 0 kuya ku 100, 0). Isikethi esisha asikwazi ukuhlanganisa nemigqa yesikethi esinye. Dweba ihlombe elincane elivaliwe elihlanganisa umphetho we-shaft lapho kufanele khona igrumbu. Khetha Phuma, bese Okwengeziwe › Ukusikwa okujikelezayo. Ubuso obujikelezayo ku-assembly Ukujikeleza kunayo i-axis ezinye izici nama-assembly angayisebenzisa: inkambu ngokujikeleza isebenzisa i-axis yokujikeleza yokugcina ngokuzenzakalelayo (bheka Izici zokuphinda nezibuko); ku-assembly, ukuxhuma phakathi kobuso obenziwe ngokujikeleza kuqala njenge-revolute joint, futhi Centre on inikeza \"Axis of Revolve1\" (bheka Yakha i-assembly). Amajika angempela namafasethi I-PartCraft yakha ukujikeleza nge-mesh kernel (i-chip ye-status bar ithi \"Mesh kernel\"): izimo ezijikelezayo ziwamafasethi athambile, angu-64 ngokujikeleza ngokuzenzakalelayo, kanti amavolumu ancane kancane kunenani langempela (cishe ngo-0.16 % ku-64). Ukubukwa, ukuthunyelwa kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP kwakhiwe ngalawo mafasethi: setha Amajika (chofoza endaweni engenalutho, bese uya ohlangothini lwesokudla) ibe Fine (128) noma Very fine (256) ukuze ibe bushelelezi. Amasilinda, amakhoni namatorasi angempela adinga i-kernel echanekile: akukakwakhiwa kule nguqulo. Bheka I-mesh kernel.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nest-offcuts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Gcina futhi usebenzise okusele","summary":"Ngemva kokuhlela, okusele kwephepheni ngalinye kuba yinsalela enombolo ohlwini lwempahla; ukuhlela okulandelayo kusebenzisa izinsalela kuqala, bese kusebenzisa amapuleti aphelele.","section":"tasks","order":52,"keywords":["ukuhlela","okusele","insalela","ohlwini","impahla","okushiyeke","ipuleti","ishidi","ukusebenzisa kabusha","ubukhulu","CSV"],"headings":[{"id":"sebenzisa-futhi","text":"Sebenzisa futhi","level":2},{"id":"yini-ebalwa-njengensalela","text":"Yini ebalwa njengensalela","level":2},{"id":"emdwebweni","text":"Emdwebweni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma uhlela izingxenye ezipuleteni, okusele okusetshenziswayo kwepuleti ngalinye (hhayi izingcezu ezincane kakhulu) kungagcinwa njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Einsalela\u003C/strong\u003E: inkomba enombolo (R-0001, R-0002 …) enempahla, ubukhulu, usayizi walo kanye nomsebenzi owalenza. Uhlu lulondolozwa kanye nefayela futhi lungalondolozwa njenge-CSV.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-futhi\"\u003ESebenzisa futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaka \u003Cstrong\u003Eimpahla\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enobukhulu\u003C/strong\u003E, ushiye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa izinsalela kuqala\u003C/span\u003E livuliwe, bese uhlela. Izinsalela zempahla efanayo nobukhulu obufanayo zizanywa okuncane kuqala; izingxenye ezilingene zifakwa kuzo, ngaphakathi kwenkomba yensalela ngayo nasemaphethelweni ayo; okungafakeki kufakwa kumapuleti amasha. Umbiko womsebenzi usho ukuthi yiziphi izinsalela ezisetshenziswe nokuthi yini esele. Uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza okusele njengezinsalela\u003C/span\u003E livuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza lo msebenzi empahleni\u003C/span\u003E bese ilibhala ohlwini lwempahla: insalela esetshenziswe imakwa \u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziwe\u003C/strong\u003E (nomsebenzi) futhi ayisanikezwa futhi; okusele kuyo kuba insalela entsha enokhumbula umzali wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-ebalwa-njengensalela\"\u003EYini ebalwa njengensalela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkusele kulinganiswa ngebanga osisethe (akukho ngxenye esondela kunalelo kusika). Imiphetho emincane kuno-1/20 wepuleti nezingcezu ezincane kuno-2 % yalo ziyimfucuza; shintsha womabili la makhawulo uma indawo yakho igcina izingcezu ezincane. Izimbobo ngaphakathi kwezingxenye ziyezingxenye ngokwazo futhi azigcinwa. Irola alinazinsalela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"emdwebweni\"\u003EEmdwebweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-DXF yokuhlela idweba umkhawulo wensalela ngayinye ku-ungqimba REMNANTS nenombolo yayo maphakathi, ukuze izingcezu zimakwe lapho zisikwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakwakhiwa: uhlaka lwensalela, ishidi lebhakhodi noma lelebula, izinsalela zamarola, impahla eyabiwe phakathi kwamaphrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma uhlela izingxenye ezipuleteni, okusele okusetshenziswayo kwepuleti ngalinye (hhayi izingcezu ezincane kakhulu) kungagcinwa njenge-insalela: inkomba enombolo (R-0001, R-0002 …) enempahla, ubukhulu, usayizi walo kanye nomsebenzi owalenza. Uhlu lulondolozwa kanye nefayela futhi lungalondolozwa njenge-CSV. Sebenzisa futhi Faka impahla kanye nobukhulu, ushiye Sebenzisa izinsalela kuqala livuliwe, bese uhlela. Izinsalela zempahla efanayo nobukhulu obufanayo zizanywa okuncane kuqala; izingxenye ezilingene zifakwa kuzo, ngaphakathi kwenkomba yensalela ngayo nasemaphethelweni ayo; okungafakeki kufakwa kumapuleti amasha. Umbiko womsebenzi usho ukuthi yiziphi izinsalela ezisetshenziswe nokuthi yini esele. Uma Londoloza okusele njengezinsalela livuliwe, Engeza lo msebenzi empahleni bese ilibhala ohlwini lwempahla: insalela esetshenziswe imakwa Kusetshenziwe (nomsebenzi) futhi ayisanikezwa futhi; okusele kuyo kuba insalela entsha enokhumbula umzali wayo. Yini ebalwa njengensalela Okusele kulinganiswa ngebanga osisethe (akukho ngxenye esondela kunalelo kusika). Imiphetho emincane kuno-1/20 wepuleti nezingcezu ezincane kuno-2 % yalo ziyimfucuza; shintsha womabili la makhawulo uma indawo yakho igcina izingcezu ezincane. Izimbobo ngaphakathi kwezingxenye ziyezingxenye ngokwazo futhi azigcinwa. Irola alinazinsalela. Emdwebweni I-DXF yokuhlela idweba umkhawulo wensalela ngayinye ku-ungqimba REMNANTS nenombolo yayo maphakathi, ukuze izingcezu zimakwe lapho zisikwa. Akukakwakhiwa: uhlaka lwensalela, ishidi lebhakhodi noma lelebula, izinsalela zamarola, impahla eyabiwe phakathi kwamaphrojekthi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"holes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bhoboza izimbobo nezimbobo zokungena ezindaweni zamaphoyinti esketshi","summary":"Beka amaphoyinti esketshini ebusweni, yenza izimbobo ezilula, ezingenisiwe, ezigxunyiwe noma ezinamasondo (ISO metric), bese usetha ububanzi nokujula, bese ulungisa izimbobo ezibhoboza ngendlela engalungile.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["imbobo","umsizi wezimbobo","bhoboza","imodeli ye-thread","ukuphrinta ngo-3D","counterbore","cbore","countersink","csink","imbobo enamasondo","thread","tap drill","metric thread","M6","through all","blind hole","bolt hole","amaphoyinti","izindawo zezimbobo"],"headings":[{"id":"bhoboza-izimbobo-ebusweni","text":"Bhoboza izimbobo ebusweni","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"imbobo-ye-counterbore-yesikulufo","text":"Imbobo ye-counterbore yesikulufo","level":2},{"id":"isongo-lezikulufo","text":"Isongo lezikulufo","level":2},{"id":"uma-izimbobo-zibhoboza-ngendlela-engalungile","text":"Uma izimbobo zibhoboza ngendlela engalungile","level":2},{"id":"izimbobo-ezisemihlanganisweni","text":"Izimbobo ezisemihlanganisweni","level":2},{"id":"izimbobo-ezigxunyiwe","text":"Izimbobo ezigxunyiwe","level":2},{"id":"izimbobo-ezinamasondo","text":"Izimbobo ezinamasondo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole\u003C/span\u003E ibhoboza imbobo eyodwa kumaphoyinti ngamanye esketshi. Iphoyinti eliphuthumayo yilona elenziwe ngethuluzi le-Point, hhayi isiphetho somugqa noma isikhungo sejika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bhoboza-izimbobo-ebusweni\"\u003EBhoboza izimbobo ebusweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuqondile okufanele kubhobozwe kuwo, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch on this face\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza lapho kufanele kube khona imbobo ngayinye. Linganisa amaphoyinti kusuka emiphetheni noma kumsuka uma indawo yawo ibalulekile (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EPhelela isketshi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbobo zidabula ingxenye, zibe ngu-6 mm ububanzi. Iphaneli ekudla ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EHoles\u003C/strong\u003E: zingaki ezenziwe, &quot;one per sketch point&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbobo eyodwa, ngokushesha:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ubuso obuqondile lapho imbobo kufanele ibe khona bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole here\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli ekudla. I-PartCraft yengeza isketshi ebusweni nephoyinti elilodwa lapho uchofoze khona, nembobo edabula ingxenye, konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Thayipha inombolo ngokushesha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyinike ububanzi bayo. Ukuze uyibeke ngokunembile, vula isketshi entsha bese ulinganisa iphoyinti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsketshi esetshenziswayo:\u003C/strong\u003E isketshi oyivale manje noma eyikhethayo; uma ingekho, isketshi esekugcineni engakasetshenziswa enamaphoyinti ahlukile. Uma kungekho lutho: &quot;Make a sketch with points where the holes go first (Sketch on a face, then Point).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkusethwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukhethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple, Counterbore, Countersink, Tapped (ISO metric)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi bembobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThrough all\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma ichekiwe: iphela engxenyeni. Ukuze ukhiphe, ayichofoze ukuze ibe yimbobo evaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIchekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDepth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhombisa uma i-Through all ingachekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhombisa uma kuyi-Counterbore: ububanzi bokuhlanzwa okubanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore depth\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhombisa uma kuyi-Counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhoboza ngakolunye uhlangothi lwendiza yesketshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbobo zibhoboza impahla, zimi ngokuqondile ndiza yesketshi. Ujula lwembobo evaliwe lulinganiswa kusuka endizeni yesketshi; isisekelo sayo siyaqonda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imbobo-ye-counterbore-yesikulufo\"\u003EImbobo ye-counterbore yesikulufo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza izimbobo njengasenhla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Ccode\u003E6.6\u003C/code\u003E (indawo yokukhomba isikulufo se-M6), \u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Ccode\u003E11\u003C/code\u003E nokujula kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore depth\u003C/strong\u003E kube \u003Ccode\u003E6.5\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-counterbore kumele ibe nobubanzi obudlule imbobo (&quot;The counterbore must be wider than the hole.&quot;) futhi, kwimbobo evaliwe, ibe mncane kunokujula kwayo (&quot;The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isongo-lezikulufo\"\u003EIsongo lezikulufo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzimbobeni ezihlakaniphile ezizungeze isikhungo, yenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eimbobo eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E bese uyenza ibe yiphethini: khetha isici se-Hole, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircular\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003EIzici zephethini nokuhlanganisa\u003C/a\u003E). Iphethini ilandela uma ushintsha usayizi wembobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-izimbobo-zibhoboza-ngendlela-engalungile\"\u003EUma izimbobo zibhoboza ngendlela engalungile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;There is nothing to drill on that side of the sketch. Try reversing the direction.&quot; Isketshi isendaweni ekude yempahla. Chekela \u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.&quot; Isketshi alinawo amaphoyinti ahlukile. Iziphetho zemigqa nezikhungo zamajika aziboni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;There is nothing to drill yet.&quot; Imbobo idinga isisekelo. Yenza i-boss kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimbobo-ezisemihlanganisweni\"\u003EIzimbobo ezisemihlanganisweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbobo ngayinye inendikaxi. Kumhlanganisweni, \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E ingabeka ukuhlanganiswa endikazini yembobo, ebhalwe njengo &quot;Hole1, hole 2&quot;, ukuze ipini noma isikulufo lihlelelane nayo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EAkha umhlanganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimbobo-ezigxunyiwe\"\u003EIzimbobo ezigxunyiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E (ebusweni) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink angle\u003C/strong\u003E: 90° (izikulufo ze-ISO metric ezinekhanda elibukhasi) noma 82° (izikulufo ze-inch). Thatha ububanzi besikhala sokugxuma kudatha yomkhiqizi wesikulufo (kancane ngaphezu kobubanzi bekhanda lesikulufo). Ubuso besikhala egxunyiwe bubizwa ngokuthi &quot;countersink&quot; kumapheyinti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimbobo-ezinamasondo\"\u003EIzimbobo ezinamasondo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ETapped (ISO metric)\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EThread\u003C/strong\u003E, u-M2 kuya ku-M24 coarse. Imbobo ibhobozwa ngosayizi wokubhoboza ithephu kusuka etafuleni elingezansi (ububanzi obubizwayo nge-pitch, kuya kuchungechunge lokubhoboza, njengoba i-ISO 2306 ikhombisa i-6H thread); ibhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E alisetshenziswa. Uma imbobo evaliwe, \u003Cstrong\u003EThread depth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E isetha ukuthi ijule kangakanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthreshi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM2\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM2.5\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM3\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM4\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM5\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM6\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM8\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM10\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM12\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM14\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM16\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM18\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM20\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM22\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM24\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPitch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.4\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.45\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.7\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.25\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.75\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETap drill ⌀\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.05\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthreshi liyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Ecosmetic\u003C/strong\u003E ekuqaleni: imodeli inembobo ebhobozwe, umbono udweba ububanzi obukhulu bethreshi njengamasekeli adashiwe, nephepha lokudweba liphatha inothi njengento efana &quot;4× M8×1.25 - 6H, thread through&quot;. I-STEP ihlinzeka imbobo ebhobozwe kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChekela \u003Cstrong\u003EModelled\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze usike ithreshi langempela ye-helical embobeni, ukuphrinta nge-3D. \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E iyenza ibe mikhulu ngakho konke, ukuze isikulufo esiphrintiwe sigqame: 0.1 kuya ku-0.2 mm kulungele abaphrinta abaningi. Isikhalazo bese siphela ngokuthi &quot;(modelled)&quot;. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EAmathreshi ezinhlanganweni namabhodi, adwetshiwe noma amodeliwe\u003C/a\u003E, okubuye ufake amathreshi ezinhlangeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbobo ezibhobozwa kabili, amathreshi e-inch namathreshi epayipi akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Hole ibhoboza imbobo eyodwa kumaphoyinti ngamanye esketshi. Iphoyinti eliphuthumayo yilona elenziwe ngethuluzi le-Point, hhayi isiphetho somugqa noma isikhungo sejika. Bhoboza izimbobo ebusweni Chofoza ubuso obuqondile okufanele kubhobozwe kuwo, bese ukhetha Sketch on this face. Cindezela P bese uchofoza lapho kufanele kube khona imbobo ngayinye. Linganisa amaphoyinti kusuka emiphetheni noma kumsuka uma indawo yawo ibalulekile (bheka Phelela isketshi). Khetha Exit. Khetha Hole. Izimbobo zidabula ingxenye, zibe ngu-6 mm ububanzi. Iphaneli ekudla ibonisa Holes: zingaki ezenziwe, \"one per sketch point\". Imbobo eyodwa, ngokushesha: chofoza ubuso obuqondile lapho imbobo kufanele ibe khona bese ukhetha Hole here ephaneli ekudla. I-PartCraft yengeza isketshi ebusweni nephoyinti elilodwa lapho uchofoze khona, nembobo edabula ingxenye, konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Thayipha inombolo ngokushesha bese ucindezela Enter ukuze uyinike ububanzi bayo. Ukuze uyibeke ngokunembile, vula isketshi entsha bese ulinganisa iphoyinti. Isketshi esetshenziswayo: isketshi oyivale manje noma eyikhethayo; uma ingekho, isketshi esekugcineni engakasetshenziswa enamaphoyinti ahlukile. Uma kungekho lutho: \"Make a sketch with points where the holes go first (Sketch on a face, then Point).\" Izilungiselelo Ukusethwa Okukhethwayo Okuzenzakalelayo Type Simple, Counterbore, Countersink, Tapped (ISO metric) Simple Diameter (mm) Ububanzi bembobo 6 Through all Uma ichekiwe: iphela engxenyeni. Ukuze ukhiphe, ayichofoze ukuze ibe yimbobo evaliwe Ichekiwe Depth (mm) Ikhombisa uma i-Through all ingachekiwe 10 Counterbore ⌀ Ikhombisa uma kuyi-Counterbore: ububanzi bokuhlanzwa okubanzi 11 Counterbore depth Ikhombisa uma kuyi-Counterbore 6 Reverse direction Ibhoboza ngakolunye uhlangothi lwendiza yesketshi Off Izimbobo zibhoboza impahla, zimi ngokuqondile ndiza yesketshi. Ujula lwembobo evaliwe lulinganiswa kusuka endizeni yesketshi; isisekelo sayo siyaqonda. Imbobo ye-counterbore yesikulufo Yenza izimbobo njengasenhla. Setha Type ibe Counterbore. Setha Diameter (mm) ibe 6.6 (indawo yokukhomba isikulufo se-M6), Counterbore ⌀ ibe 11 nokujula kwe-Counterbore depth kube 6.5. I-counterbore kumele ibe nobubanzi obudlule imbobo (\"The counterbore must be wider than the hole.\") futhi, kwimbobo evaliwe, ibe mncane kunokujula kwayo (\"The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.\"). Isongo lezikulufo Ezimbobeni ezihlakaniphile ezizungeze isikhungo, yenza imbobo eyodwa bese uyenza ibe yiphethini: khetha isici se-Hole, bese ukhetha Circular (bheka Izici zephethini nokuhlanganisa). Iphethini ilandela uma ushintsha usayizi wembobo. Uma izimbobo zibhoboza ngendlela engalungile \"There is nothing to drill on that side of the sketch. Try reversing the direction.\" Isketshi isendaweni ekude yempahla. Chekela Reverse direction. \"Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.\" Isketshi alinawo amaphoyinti ahlukile. Iziphetho zemigqa nezikhungo zamajika aziboni. \"There is nothing to drill yet.\" Imbobo idinga isisekelo. Yenza i-boss kuqala. Izimbobo ezisemihlanganisweni Imbobo ngayinye inendikaxi. Kumhlanganisweni, Centre on ingabeka ukuhlanganiswa endikazini yembobo, ebhalwe njengo \"Hole1, hole 2\", ukuze ipini noma isikulufo lihlelelane nayo. Bheka Akha umhlanganiso. Izimbobo ezigxunyiwe Setha Type ibe Countersink, bese Countersink ⌀ (ebusweni) kanye Countersink angle: 90° (izikulufo ze-ISO metric ezinekhanda elibukhasi) noma 82° (izikulufo ze-inch). Thatha ububanzi besikhala sokugxuma kudatha yomkhiqizi wesikulufo (kancane ngaphezu kobubanzi bekhanda lesikulufo). Ubuso besikhala egxunyiwe bubizwa ngokuthi \"countersink\" kumapheyinti. Izimbobo ezinamasondo Setha Type ibe Tapped (ISO metric) bese ukhetha Thread, u-M2 kuya ku-M24 coarse. Imbobo ibhobozwa ngosayizi wokubhoboza ithephu kusuka etafuleni elingezansi (ububanzi obubizwayo nge-pitch, kuya kuchungechunge lokubhoboza, njengoba i-ISO 2306 ikhombisa i-6H thread); ibhokisi le-Diameter (mm) alisetshenziswa. Uma imbobo evaliwe, Thread depth (mm) isetha ukuthi ijule kangakanani. Ithreshi M2 M2.5 M3 M4 M5 M6 M8 M10 M12 M14 M16 M18 M20 M22 M24 Pitch 0.4 0.45 0.5 0.7 0.8 1 1.25 1.5 1.75 2 2 2.5 2.5 2.5 3 Tap drill ⌀ 1.6 2.05 2.5 3.3 4.2 5 6.8 8.5 10.2 12 14 15.5 17.5 19.5 21 Ithreshi liyi-cosmetic ekuqaleni: imodeli inembobo ebhobozwe, umbono udweba ububanzi obukhulu bethreshi njengamasekeli adashiwe, nephepha lokudweba liphatha inothi njengento efana \"4× M8×1.25 - 6H, thread through\". I-STEP ihlinzeka imbobo ebhobozwe kuphela. Chekela Modelled ukuze usike ithreshi langempela ye-helical embobeni, ukuphrinta nge-3D. Clearance (mm) iyenza ibe mikhulu ngakho konke, ukuze isikulufo esiphrintiwe sigqame: 0.1 kuya ku-0.2 mm kulungele abaphrinta abaningi. Isikhalazo bese siphela ngokuthi \"(modelled)\". Bheka Amathreshi ezinhlanganweni namabhodi, adwetshiwe noma amodeliwe, okubuye ufake amathreshi ezinhlangeni. Izimbobo ezibhobozwa kabili, amathreshi e-inch namathreshi epayipi akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-this-frame","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlola lolu hlaka","summary":"Thatha izingxenye zensimbi zomsebenzi wokuwelda (isilayidi, isitendi, uhlaka lwamapayipi nezigaba), beka imishini ezinyaweni yayo nokusekelwa phansi, bese ubona ukuthi iyingxenye ngayinye nokuwelda ngakunye kusetshenziswa kangakanani ngaphansi kwe-AISC 360-16 noma i-EN 1993. Isisiza kuze kube yilapho injiniyela iyibukile.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["uhlaka","isilayidi","isilayidi sepompo","ingxenye yesakhiwo","ukuwelda","amawelda","hlola","AISC 360","EN 1993","ukusetshenziswa","ukusekela","imishini","umthwalo","isigaba esingenalutho","HSS","RHS","CHS","injiniyela"],"headings":[{"id":"yisebenzise","text":"Yisebenzise","level":2},{"id":"okutholayo","text":"Okutholayo","level":2},{"id":"okuhlolwayo","text":"Okuhlolwayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck this frame\u003C/span\u003E uthatha izingxenye zensimbi ezilula zomsebenzi wokuwelda, zakhe uhlaka kuzo, luxazulule ngaphansi kwesisindo sensimbi nemishini oyibeka kuyo, bese luhlola yonke ingxenye nawo wonke amawelda lapho izingxenye zihlangana khona. Ukuhamba kukodwa, ithebhu elilodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsisiza \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuze kube yilapho injiniyela iyibukile\u003C/strong\u003E. Akuyona isitembu, futhi ukudlula akuyona idizayini. Isebenzisa imigqa emaphakathi yezingxenye njengoba zidwetshwe, ithatha wonke amajoyinti njengewelda ezungeze isigaba sonke, ithatha ubukhulu bohlangothi lwe-fillet kudonga lwesigaba (kuze kube ngu-8 mm) umaungasethanga, futhi ayihloli izikulufo, amapuleti, amapuleti esisekelo, ama-anchor, ukuxhasa, i-block shear, ukukhathala noma ukuphakamisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yisebenzise\"\u003EYisebenzise\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba izingxenye ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStructural member\u003C/span\u003E (izigaba zivela ethebhleni lezigaba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck this frame\u003C/span\u003E. Tshela lapho uhlaka lumi khona (\u003Cstrong\u003Eisisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E esinyaweni ngasinye: esibotshiwe, esiqinile noma esigingqikayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinned supports at the feet\u003C/span\u003E ibeka eyodwa kuyo yonke ingxenye ephansi kakhulu) nokuthi yini esekelwe kuyo (\u003Cstrong\u003Eimishini\u003C/strong\u003E: isisindo, indawo yokuhlehla, izindawo lapho ibotshelwe khona phansi, nokuphushwa okuthe xaxa okukhethwayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ikhodi: \u003Cstrong\u003EASCE 7 + AISC 360-16\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EEN 1990 + EN 1993\u003C/strong\u003E. Setha ibanga lensimbi kanye, kwe-AISC, amandla ensimbi yokuwelda (482.6 MPa yi-E70).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the report as CSV\u003C/span\u003E ibhala zonke izithebhu, umugqa wokuthi akukabukwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlaka lufundwa ngamamilimitha nomugqa oqondile wengxenye oshayela phezulu. Izindawo zokusekela nezindawo zemishini zibhalwa njenge-x y z ngohlelo olufanayo, nge-z kuyinkomba yokuphakama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphetho wengxenye ogcina phakathi kwenye ingxenye uyihlukanisa lapho, njengonyawo noma indawo yokubotshelwa phansi esigqeni sengxenye. Isisindo sabelwa phakathi kwezindawo zokubotshelwa njengomzimba oqinile; isisindo sephakathi nendawo ngaphandle kwezinyawo, noma amandla okuphakamisa enyaweni, kuyashiwo, akusoze kufihlwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okutholayo\"\u003EOkutholayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto esetshenziswa kakhulu nokuthi kukhona okwehlulekayo yini. Izinto ukuhlola okungakwazi ukuzahlulela (isigaba esingekho ethebhleni, insimbi engenayo ifektha ekhodini) ziyabalwa futhi ziyaqanjwa, azisoze zibalwe njengezidlulile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngengxenye ngayinye nangeqembu ngalinye lamawelda: kusetshenziswa kangakanani, ukuhlola okubusayo nesigatshana sawo, nokuhlanganiswa komthwalo okubusayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-tebhu afanayo ombikweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlolwayo\"\u003EOkuhlolwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzigaba ezingenalutho (RHS, SHS, CHS, ipayipi) nezigaba ze-I ngokuqina, ukucindezela, ukugoba, ukusika nokusebenzisana kwazo; amawelda e-fillet namawelda agcwele ngendlela yevekthala elastic. Izindonga ezinqabile zigoba izigaba ezingenalutho kuphela; izindonga ezincane zishiwo njengezingahlolwanga. Ezinye izinhlala zabhalwa kumasethi wezinga kodwa azikaqhathaniswa nekhophi eshicilelwe; umbiko udwebe umthombo ngamunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EUhlaka olwenziwe ngezigaba zensimbi\u003C/a\u003E ukuze udwebe izingxenye nohlu lwazo lokusika.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Check this frame uthatha izingxenye zensimbi ezilula zomsebenzi wokuwelda, zakhe uhlaka kuzo, luxazulule ngaphansi kwesisindo sensimbi nemishini oyibeka kuyo, bese luhlola yonke ingxenye nawo wonke amawelda lapho izingxenye zihlangana khona. Ukuhamba kukodwa, ithebhu elilodwa. Isisiza kuze kube yilapho injiniyela iyibukile. Akuyona isitembu, futhi ukudlula akuyona idizayini. Isebenzisa imigqa emaphakathi yezingxenye njengoba zidwetshwe, ithatha wonke amajoyinti njengewelda ezungeze isigaba sonke, ithatha ubukhulu bohlangothi lwe-fillet kudonga lwesigaba (kuze kube ngu-8 mm) umaungasethanga, futhi ayihloli izikulufo, amapuleti, amapuleti esisekelo, ama-anchor, ukuxhasa, i-block shear, ukukhathala noma ukuphakamisa. Yisebenzise Dweba izingxenye ngo-Structural member (izigaba zivela ethebhleni lezigaba). Vula Views › Check this frame. Tshela lapho uhlaka lumi khona (isisekelo esinyaweni ngasinye: esibotshiwe, esiqinile noma esigingqikayo; Pinned supports at the feet ibeka eyodwa kuyo yonke ingxenye ephansi kakhulu) nokuthi yini esekelwe kuyo (imishini: isisindo, indawo yokuhlehla, izindawo lapho ibotshelwe khona phansi, nokuphushwa okuthe xaxa okukhethwayo). Khetha ikhodi: ASCE 7 + AISC 360-16 noma EN 1990 + EN 1993. Setha ibanga lensimbi kanye, kwe-AISC, amandla ensimbi yokuwelda (482.6 MPa yi-E70). Cindezela Check. Save the report as CSV ibhala zonke izithebhu, umugqa wokuthi akukabukwa kuqala. Uhlaka lufundwa ngamamilimitha nomugqa oqondile wengxenye oshayela phezulu. Izindawo zokusekela nezindawo zemishini zibhalwa njenge-x y z ngohlelo olufanayo, nge-z kuyinkomba yokuphakama. Umphetho wengxenye ogcina phakathi kwenye ingxenye uyihlukanisa lapho, njengonyawo noma indawo yokubotshelwa phansi esigqeni sengxenye. Isisindo sabelwa phakathi kwezindawo zokubotshelwa njengomzimba oqinile; isisindo sephakathi nendawo ngaphandle kwezinyawo, noma amandla okuphakamisa enyaweni, kuyashiwo, akusoze kufihlwe. Okutholayo Into esetshenziswa kakhulu nokuthi kukhona okwehlulekayo yini. Izinto ukuhlola okungakwazi ukuzahlulela (isigaba esingekho ethebhleni, insimbi engenayo ifektha ekhodini) ziyabalwa futhi ziyaqanjwa, azisoze zibalwe njengezidlulile. Umugqa owodwa ngengxenye ngayinye nangeqembu ngalinye lamawelda: kusetshenziswa kangakanani, ukuhlola okubusayo nesigatshana sawo, nokuhlanganiswa komthwalo okubusayo. Ama-tebhu afanayo ombikweni. Okuhlolwayo Izigaba ezingenalutho (RHS, SHS, CHS, ipayipi) nezigaba ze-I ngokuqina, ukucindezela, ukugoba, ukusika nokusebenzisana kwazo; amawelda e-fillet namawelda agcwele ngendlela yevekthala elastic. Izindonga ezinqabile zigoba izigaba ezingenalutho kuphela; izindonga ezincane zishiwo njengezingahlolwanga. Ezinye izinhlala zabhalwa kumasethi wezinga kodwa azikaqhathaniswa nekhophi eshicilelwe; umbiko udwebe umthombo ngamunye. Bona Uhlaka olwenziwe ngezigaba zensimbi ukuze udwebe izingxenye nohlu lwazo lokusika.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sebenzisa i-PartCraft nomsizi we-AI","summary":"Vumela umsizi wakho we-AI noma isikripthi sakho sisebenze nengxenye evulekile: sifunde izakhiwo, izimingcele kanye nobunzima bayo, siguqule imingcele bese siyakha kabusha, siqhube isikripthi, sithumele futhi sigcine. Icimile kuze kube yilapho uyivula.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ai","umsizi","ummeleli","mcp","model context protocol","isikripthi","ukuzenzekela","imingcele","izakhiwo zobunzima","stl","step","3mf","izimvume","ukunqamula","umsebenzi","amafolda"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"yivule","text":"Yivule","level":2},{"id":"okungacelwa-umsizi","text":"Okungacelwa umsizi","level":2},{"id":"usahlala-ulawula","text":"Usahlala ulawula","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kokuvula-i-partcraft","text":"Ngaphandle kokuvula i-PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"uma-okuthile-kungasebenzi","text":"Uma okuthile kungasebenzi","level":2},{"id":"bona-futhi","text":"Bona futhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma isikripthi osibhalile) ukuthi abheke ingxenye oyivulile, ashintshe imingcele yayo, aqhube isikripthi bese eyithumela, nokuthi unquma kanjani okungathintwa yiye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Eayinayo i-AI yayo\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kanjani. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiluphi uhlelo oluxhasa i-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-PartCraft inikeza kuphela amathuluzi, futhi wena ukhetha ayiphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yivule\"\u003EYivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya ku-app bar, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uya kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, thika \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise i-PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Icimile kuze kube yilapho uyithikile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okungenziwa yiyo. \u003Cstrong\u003EFunda\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe ekuqaleni; thika ezinye kuphela uma uzidinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uvumele ukuthi ithumele futhi igcine ku-folda, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ifolda…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafolda angasetshenziswa\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha ifolda kwidayalogi ye-Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbasizi baxhuma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kukhompyutha yakho: i-Studio ibonisa ikheli nethokheni okufanele uyinamathisele kumsizi. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula uxhumo kumsizi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungacelwa-umsizi\"\u003EOkungacelwa umsizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImvume\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_describe\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeatures_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzakhiwo ngokulandelana, nokuthi yiziphi ezakhiwe nezehlulekile, impahla, ivolumu nosayizi wesolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparams_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImingcele kanye nazo zonke izinombolo isibalo esingazilawula, nezinani zazo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emass_properties\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvolumu, indawo, isikhungo sobunzima, i-inertia ezungeze lona; ubunzima uma ingxenye inempahla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparam_set\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsetha ipharamitha noma inombolo yesakhiwo bese yakha kabusha. Isinyathelo esisodwa osingahlehlisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escript_run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqhuba isikripthi se-CraftScript, Lua noma Python njengendlela indawo yokusebenza ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikripthi\u003C/span\u003E eyenza ngayo: ivaliwe, ayinamafayela noma inethiwekhi. Ingxenye ayishintshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL, 3MF, STEP noma OpenUSD (.usdz, .usda, .usdc), njengoba zibhalwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_push\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbuyekeza imodeli exhunywe kwenye uhlelo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"partcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EGcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_status\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItshela ukuthi imodeli exhunyiwe isekhona yini nokuthi yabuyekezwa ngokugcina nini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E yePartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eillustrate_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmhlahlandlela ovela endaweni yokusebenza ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E njenge-PDF noma SVG yemigqa yemibono yawo, njengefayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo, noma imiyalelo yawo njenge-PDF noma ikhasi lewebhu, njengoba zibhalwa yizimenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E neMiyalelo zendawo yokusebenza (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EImihlahlandlela\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELolu hlobo lusebenzisa i-mesh kernel: ivolumu ivela ezinxantathwini (incane kancane kunesolidi yangempela enamajika), futhi i-STEP ibhalwa ibhikiwe, ngezinxantathu esikhundleni sezindawo ezinembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usahlala-ulawula\"\u003EUsahlala ulawula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke inguquko isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E, esimakwe ngomsizi, isibonelo &quot;Umsizi: setha l = 45&quot;. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUyazi lapho kuxhunyiwe umsizi.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinobho ku-app bar imbiza umsizi lapho exhunyiwe. Yicindezele ukuze ubone okungenziwa yiyo, noma ukuze \u003Cstrong\u003Euyinqamule\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E ibala konke ukubizwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina irekhodi\u003C/span\u003E igcina ikhophi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifunda futhi ibhala amafayela kuphela emafolda oyengezile; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E ikhipha ifolda ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kokuvula-i-partcraft\"\u003ENgaphandle kokuvula i-PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIseva lefayela le-CadCraft yabasizi (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp\u003C/code\u003E) kanye nomugqa womyalo we-\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E avula izingxenye ze-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E ngekhodi ye-PartCraft yayo nge-mesh kernel, ngaphandle kwewindi: amathuluzi afanayo okufunda, ukusetha imingcele, izikripthi ze-CraftScript, ukuthumela (i-OpenUSD nayo) nokugcina. \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert bracket.partcraft.json bracket.stl\u003C/code\u003E yakha ingxenye bese iyibhala emugqeni womyalo. Nemihlahlandlela (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E) ithunyelwa nayo lapho: \u003Ccode\u003Eillustrate_export\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert linkage.partcraft-manual.json linkage.pdf\u003C/code\u003E (engeza \u003Ccode\u003E--instructions\u003C/code\u003E imiyalelo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-okuthile-kungasebenzi\"\u003EUma okuthile kungasebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;idinga imvume yokuhlela&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E thika \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, bese ucela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;ilawulwa yisibalo&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E le nombolo ilandela ipharamitha; cela umsizi usethe ipharamitha esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInguquko yaso ibingalungile:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-futhi\"\u003EBona futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIresiphi zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nethuluzi layo elibizwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Indlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma isikripthi osibhalile) ukuthi abheke ingxenye oyivulile, ashintshe imingcele yayo, aqhube isikripthi bese eyithumela, nokuthi unquma kanjani okungathintwa yiye. I-PartCraft ayinayo i-AI yayo futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kanjani. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiluphi uhlelo oluxhasa i-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-PartCraft inikeza kuphela amathuluzi, futhi wena ukhetha ayiphi. Yivule Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya ku-app bar, noma Ctrl+,) bese uya kuthebhu ye-PartCraft. Ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi, thika Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise i-PartCraft. Icimile kuze kube yilapho uyithikile. Khetha okungenziwa yiyo. Funda ithikiwe ekuqaleni; thika ezinye kuphela uma uzidinga. Ukuze uvumele ukuthi ithumele futhi igcine ku-folda, khetha Engeza ifolda… ngaphansi kwe-Amafolda angasetshenziswa bese ukhetha ifolda kwidayalogi ye-Studio. Abasizi baxhuma nge-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha yakho: i-Studio ibonisa ikheli nethokheni okufanele uyinamathisele kumsizi. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula uxhumo kumsizi. Okungacelwa umsizi Ithuluzi Imvume Okwenzayo part_describe, features_list Funda Izakhiwo ngokulandelana, nokuthi yiziphi ezakhiwe nezehlulekile, impahla, ivolumu nosayizi wesolidi params_list Funda Imingcele kanye nazo zonke izinombolo isibalo esingazilawula, nezinani zazo mass_properties Funda Ivolumu, indawo, isikhungo sobunzima, i-inertia ezungeze lona; ubunzima uma ingxenye inempahla param_set Hlela Isetha ipharamitha noma inombolo yesakhiwo bese yakha kabusha. Isinyathelo esisodwa osingahlehlisa script_run Hlela Iqhuba isikripthi se-CraftScript, Lua noma Python njengendlela indawo yokusebenza ye-Isikripthi eyenza ngayo: ivaliwe, ayinamafayela noma inethiwekhi. Ingxenye ayishintshi part_export Thumela STL, 3MF, STEP noma OpenUSD (.usdz, .usda, .usdc), njengoba zibhalwa ku-Ifayela › Thumela link_push Hlela Ibuyekeza imodeli exhunywe kwenye uhlelo (bona Gcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila) link_status Funda Itshela ukuthi imodeli exhunyiwe isekhona yini nokuthi yabuyekezwa ngokugcina nini part_save Londoloza Londoloza yePartCraft illustrate_export Thumela Umhlahlandlela ovela endaweni yokusebenza ye-Illustrate njenge-PDF noma SVG yemigqa yemibono yawo, njengefayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo, noma imiyalelo yawo njenge-PDF noma ikhasi lewebhu, njengoba zibhalwa yizimenyu Thumela neMiyalelo zendawo yokusebenza (Imihlahlandlela) Lolu hlobo lusebenzisa i-mesh kernel: ivolumu ivela ezinxantathwini (incane kancane kunesolidi yangempela enamajika), futhi i-STEP ibhalwa ibhikiwe, ngezinxantathu esikhundleni sezindawo ezinembile. Usahlala ulawula Yonke inguquko isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, esimakwe ngomsizi, isibonelo \"Umsizi: setha l = 45\". Cindezela Ctrl+Z ukuyihlehlisa. Uyazi lapho kuxhunyiwe umsizi. Inkinobho ku-app bar imbiza umsizi lapho exhunyiwe. Yicindezele ukuze ubone okungenziwa yiyo, noma ukuze uyinqamule. Umsebenzi. Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › Abasizi › Umsebenzi ibala konke ukubizwa; Gcina irekhodi igcina ikhophi yakho. Amafolda. Ifunda futhi ibhala amafayela kuphela emafolda oyengezile; Susa ikhipha ifolda ngokushesha. Ngaphandle kokuvula i-PartCraft Iseva lefayela le-CadCraft yabasizi (npx @getcadcraft/mcp) kanye nomugqa womyalo we-cadcraft avula izingxenye ze-.partcraft.json ngekhodi ye-PartCraft yayo nge-mesh kernel, ngaphandle kwewindi: amathuluzi afanayo okufunda, ukusetha imingcele, izikripthi ze-CraftScript, ukuthumela (i-OpenUSD nayo) nokugcina. cadcraft convert bracket.partcraft.json bracket.stl yakha ingxenye bese iyibhala emugqeni womyalo. Nemihlahlandlela (.partcraft-manual.json) ithunyelwa nayo lapho: illustrate_export, noma cadcraft convert linkage.partcraft-manual.json linkage.pdf (engeza --instructions imiyalelo). Uma okuthile kungasebenzi \"idinga imvume yokuhlela\": thika Hlela ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi, bese ucela futhi. \"ilawulwa yisibalo\": le nombolo ilandela ipharamitha; cela umsizi usethe ipharamitha esikhundleni salokho. Inguquko yaso ibingalungile: cindezela Ctrl+Z. Bona futhi Iresiphi zabasizi be-AI: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nethuluzi layo elibizwayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"laser-cutting","scope":"partcraft","title":"Thumela umdwebo ku-laser","summary":"Khetha okwenziwa yi-layer ngayinye (sika, score, engrave, gcwalisa, isithombe), buka ukunyakaza kwekhanda, londoloza i-G-code ye-GRBL laser-mode, noma uyithumele kusiphequluli ngemva kokubeka umsebenzi ngohlaka.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["laser","umbhali welaser","laser engraver","GRBL","G-code","engrave","gcwalisa","dither","ukuthweba isithombe","score","sika","Web Serial","Linux","bekela umsebenzi uhlaka","amandla","isivinini","ukudlula"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-okwenziwa-yi-layer-ngayinye","text":"Khetha okwenziwa yi-layer ngayinye","level":2},{"id":"buka-bese-ulondoloza","text":"Buka, bese ulondoloza","level":2},{"id":"thumela-kusiphequluli","text":"Thumela kusiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaser\u003C/span\u003E iguqula ama-layer omdwebo ibe uhlelo lweLaser oluzosebenza nge-GRBL (oluningi lwamaLaser e-hobby nawezitolo ezincane, ama-diode nama-CO2). Ku-PartCraft, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwelaser…\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF…\u003C/span\u003E: izinkomba nezimbobo kuzofika ku-layer CUT. Amaphethini eshidi lensimbi (anemigqa yokugoba ku-layer BEND) adinga i-exact kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa kwifayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola zonke izilungiselelo ezibhodweni elingasetshenziswa kuqala, gqoka izibuko zokuvikela ezifanele i-laser yakho, gcina ukuvala kwesembozo lapho kukhona, futhi ungasoze washiya i-laser isebenza ungekho. Izinombolo ayiqala ngazo ilayer ngayinye ziwukubamba nje, hhayi izincomo zanoma iyiphi impahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-okwenziwa-yi-layer-ngayinye\"\u003EKhetha okwenziwa yi-layer ngayinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyonke layer yomdwebo ibe ngumugqa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza\u003C/span\u003E iyibeka ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ESika\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EScore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave lines\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFill shapes\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave picture\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENot sent\u003C/strong\u003E, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmandla %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsivinini mm/min\u003C/span\u003E nenani lo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudlula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFill\u003C/strong\u003E ishisa ingaphakathi kwezimo ezivaliwe ngemigqa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhala somugqa\u003C/span\u003E kusukela komunye, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E, zombili izinhlangothi noma eyodwa, nokuweqa okungaphezu ukuze ikhanda liphume ngejubane lapho i-laser ivulwa; cross-hatch yengeza ukudlula kwesibili ku-90°. Ukuma okunemgodi kuhlala kuvuliwe emgodini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave picture\u003C/strong\u003E iguqula isithombe sibe amachashaza (Floyd–Steinberg, Atkinson, ordered, noma ukumnyama nokumhlophe okulula ngomkhawulo), noma, nge-\u003Cem\u003EGrey levels\u003C/em\u003E, ibe amandla ayaguquguqukayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlelwa: izithombe nokugcwaliswa kuqala, bese ukuthweba imigqa, bese ama-score, bese ukusika, ukuze ingxenye esikiwe inganyakazi ngenkathi ibhalwa. Ngaphakathi kwelayer ngayinye izindlela zihamba \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi-kuqala\u003C/strong\u003E (imgodi ingaphambi kwepuleti eyiyo), eseduze kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buka-bese-ulondoloza\"\u003EBuka, bese ulondoloza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kudweba ukuthi ikhanda lenza ini: imigqa eshisayo ngemibala, ukunyakaza okusheshayo ngegrey, kanye nebhokisi eliluhlaza ozungeze konke okushisayo. Ngaphansi kwalo kukhona usayizi, ubude besishisa nesilinganiso sesikhathi (ngaphandle kokukhawulela; umshini wangempela uthatha isikhathi eside). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-G-code…\u003C/span\u003E ibhala i-GRBL laser-mode G-code: \u003Ccode\u003E$32=1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM4\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003EM3\u003C/code\u003E) ngamanani S, izinyathelo \u003Ccode\u003EG0\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EG1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM5\u003C/code\u003E ekugcineni. X0 Y0 yikhona kwesokunxele esingezansi komsebenzi, ngaphandle uma ukhetha imvelaphi yomdwebo: sethela ziro yomshini wakho lapho. I-G-code ilandela imodi yelaser ye-GRBL okhishwe ngayo; ayikaze ihlolwe kulaser yangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-kusiphequluli\"\u003EThumela kusiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Chrome ne-Edge, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma…\u003C/span\u003E ikucela ukuthi ukhethe i-port ye-USB yelaser. Akukho okuxhumayo noma okuthunyelwayo kuze kucindezelwe inkinobho. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBekela umsebenzi uhlaka\u003C/span\u003E kuqala: ikhanda lilandela ibhokisi lomsebenzi nge-laser \u003Cstrong\u003Eicishe\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ngamandla aphansi owasethayo ukuze ubone) ukuze ubone lapho izoshisa khona. Kuphela-ke \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela umsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E ivuleka, futhi iyavalwa futhi uma ushintsha noma yini. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E imisa ikhanda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E yona iyalimisa, isethe kabusha umlawuli (i-laser iyacisha) bese ithumela \u003Ccode\u003EM5\u003C/code\u003E. Lapho i-Web Serial ingekho (i-Firefox, i-Safari, ne-CadCraft Studio, enegubhu lewebhu elingenayo okwamanje), londoloza i-G-code bese uyithumela ngohlelo lwelaser lakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izifomethi zabalawuli (Ruida, ama-laser e-Marlin, amafayela abakhiqizi), amathebhu nokuhola, ukuphambuka kwe-kerf, imitapo yezinto, ama-eksisi ajikelezayo nama-Z, ukuhlanganisa ngekhamera.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ipaneli Laser iguqula ama-layer omdwebo ibe uhlelo lweLaser oluzosebenza nge-GRBL (oluningi lwamaLaser e-hobby nawezitolo ezincane, ama-diode nama-CO2). Ku-PartCraft, khetha Export › Uhlelo lwelaser…, bese Engeza izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF…: izinkomba nezimbobo kuzofika ku-layer CUT. Amaphethini eshidi lensimbi (anemigqa yokugoba ku-layer BEND) adinga i-exact kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa kwifayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela. Hlola zonke izilungiselelo ezibhodweni elingasetshenziswa kuqala, gqoka izibuko zokuvikela ezifanele i-laser yakho, gcina ukuvala kwesembozo lapho kukhona, futhi ungasoze washiya i-laser isebenza ungekho. Izinombolo ayiqala ngazo ilayer ngayinye ziwukubamba nje, hhayi izincomo zanoma iyiphi impahla. Khetha okwenziwa yi-layer ngayinye Iyonke layer yomdwebo ibe ngumugqa. Yenza iyibeka ibe Sika, Score, Engrave lines, Fill shapes, Engrave picture noma Not sent, nge-Amandla %, Isivinini mm/min nenani lo-Ukudlula. Fill ishisa ingaphakathi kwezimo ezivaliwe ngemigqa, Isikhala somugqa kusukela komunye, ku-I-engeli, zombili izinhlangothi noma eyodwa, nokuweqa okungaphezu ukuze ikhanda liphume ngejubane lapho i-laser ivulwa; cross-hatch yengeza ukudlula kwesibili ku-90°. Ukuma okunemgodi kuhlala kuvuliwe emgodini. Engrave picture iguqula isithombe sibe amachashaza (Floyd–Steinberg, Atkinson, ordered, noma ukumnyama nokumhlophe okulula ngomkhawulo), noma, nge-Grey levels, ibe amandla ayaguquguqukayo. Ukuhlelwa: izithombe nokugcwaliswa kuqala, bese ukuthweba imigqa, bese ama-score, bese ukusika, ukuze ingxenye esikiwe inganyakazi ngenkathi ibhalwa. Ngaphakathi kwelayer ngayinye izindlela zihamba ngaphakathi-kuqala (imgodi ingaphambi kwepuleti eyiyo), eseduze kuqala. Buka, bese ulondoloza Ukubuka kudweba ukuthi ikhanda lenza ini: imigqa eshisayo ngemibala, ukunyakaza okusheshayo ngegrey, kanye nebhokisi eliluhlaza ozungeze konke okushisayo. Ngaphansi kwalo kukhona usayizi, ubude besishisa nesilinganiso sesikhathi (ngaphandle kokukhawulela; umshini wangempela uthatha isikhathi eside). Londoloza i-G-code… ibhala i-GRBL laser-mode G-code: $32=1, M4 (noma M3) ngamanani S, izinyathelo G0 no-G1, M5 ekugcineni. X0 Y0 yikhona kwesokunxele esingezansi komsebenzi, ngaphandle uma ukhetha imvelaphi yomdwebo: sethela ziro yomshini wakho lapho. I-G-code ilandela imodi yelaser ye-GRBL okhishwe ngayo; ayikaze ihlolwe kulaser yangempela. Thumela kusiphequluli Ku-Chrome ne-Edge, Xhuma… ikucela ukuthi ukhethe i-port ye-USB yelaser. Akukho okuxhumayo noma okuthunyelwayo kuze kucindezelwe inkinobho. Cindezela Bekela umsebenzi uhlaka kuqala: ikhanda lilandela ibhokisi lomsebenzi nge-laser icishe (noma ngamandla aphansi owasethayo ukuze ubone) ukuze ubone lapho izoshisa khona. Kuphela-ke Thumela umsebenzi ivuleka, futhi iyavalwa futhi uma ushintsha noma yini. Misa imisa ikhanda, Misa yona iyalimisa, isethe kabusha umlawuli (i-laser iyacisha) bese ithumela M5. Lapho i-Web Serial ingekho (i-Firefox, i-Safari, ne-CadCraft Studio, enegubhu lewebhu elingenayo okwamanje), londoloza i-G-code bese uyithumela ngohlelo lwelaser lakho. Akukakwakhiwa Ezinye izifomethi zabalawuli (Ruida, ama-laser e-Marlin, amafayela abakhiqizi), amathebhu nokuhola, ukuphambuka kwe-kerf, imitapo yezinto, ama-eksisi ajikelezayo nama-Z, ukuhlanganisa ngekhamera.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"threads","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amacingo ezinsimbeni nasemigodini, adwetshiwe noma emodeliwe","summary":"Faka icingo le-ISO metric noma le-trapezoidal kunoma yiliphi ubuso obujikelezayo, insimbi noma umgodi. Ligcine lingumbala wamadrowing noma yenza icingo lehelical langempela ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, nokuhlukana okuzo izingxenye ezi-printed zihlangane.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["icingo","amacingo","icingo elimodeliwe","icingo elimodeliwe","helical","helix","screw","bolt","nut","insimbi","umgodi","icingo langaphandle","icingo langaphakathi","icingo elibukeka kuphela","icingo le-metric","trapezoidal","acme","lead screw","Tr16x4","M10","ukuphrinta nge-3D","print","clearance","fit","isandla sokhohlo","esikiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"faka-icingo-ensimbini-noma-emgodini","text":"Faka icingo ensimbini noma emgodini","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"amacingo-amodeliwe-okuphrinta-nge-3d","text":"Amacingo amodeliwe okuphrinta nge-3D","level":2},{"id":"imigodi-esikiwe","text":"Imigodi esikiwe","level":2},{"id":"lapho-icingo-lingakwazi-ukwakheka","text":"Lapho icingo lingakwazi ukwakheka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUcingo\u003C/span\u003E ibeka icingo ezindaweni ezijikelezayo: ngaphandle kwensimbi (icingo langaphandle) noma ngaphakathi komgodi (icingo langaphakathi). I-PartCraft iyazi ukuthi yiyiphi kusuka ebusweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcingo liqala \u003Cstrong\u003Engokubukeka kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: ubuso buhlala bungashintshiwe, umbono udwetsha icingo njengamasekhele amabili asephuka, nebhodi lombumbo liyaliqopha, njengalokhu &quot;M10×1.5 - 6g, thread 20 long&quot;. Thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EEmodeliwe\u003C/strong\u003E ukusika icingo langempela elihelical ebhodini, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, noma imodeli kudingeka ibukeke kahle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-icingo-ensimbini-noma-emgodini\"\u003EFaka icingo ensimbini noma emgodini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYakha insimbi noma umgodi ngosayizi wecingo: insimbi enesidikiba esingu-Ø10 ye-bolt engu-M10, noma umgodi ongu-Ø8.5 (umgodi wokuqala wokusika) we-nut engu-M10.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obujikelezayo, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUcingo\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ungakakhethi buso obujikelezayo, i-PartCraft iyakucela ukuthi uchofoze izinhlangothi, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli esekhohlo, hlola \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003ELingana nobuso\u003C/strong\u003E ikhetha usayizi ngokwayo: ensimbini, usayizi onobubanzi obukhulu obulingana nobensimbi; emgodini, usayizi onobubanzi obuncane obulingana nomgodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcingo liqala ekugcineni okuvulekile kobuso, lapho ingxenye ingaqhubeki ngomugqa ophakathi: ekugcineni okukhululekile kwensimbi, emlonyeni womgodi. \u003Cstrong\u003EQala kolunye uhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E iyaguqula lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukhethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfomu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO metric (60°), M1.6 kuya ku-M64 coarse; trapezoidal (Tr, 30°), Tr8×1.5 kuya ku-Tr60×9\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO metric\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana nobuso, noma usayizi oyodwa kuhlu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana nobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bonke\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucisha kukuvumela ukunikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EUbude (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, ekalwa kusuka ekuqaleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuthikhiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQala kolunye uhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIcingo lihamba kusuka kolunye uhlangothi lobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsandla\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsandla sokunene noma sokhohlo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsandla sokunene\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmodeliwe\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika icingo langempela elihelical\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClearance (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyabonakala lapho kuthikhiwe i-Emodeliwe: icingo lensimbi lincane kangakanani, nelomgodi likhulu kangakanani, ngazo zonke izinhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi ongalingani nobuso uyakhiqizwa noma kunjalo, uthi ulungiswe ukuze ufanele ubuso, futhi iphaneli iyakushilo, njengokuthi &quot;Insimbi ye-Ø12 mm ayisiyo i-Ø10 mm ye-M10&quot;. Izinhlangothi eziningi zingabelana ngesici esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUcingo\u003C/span\u003E; ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003ELingana nobuso\u003C/strong\u003E, ngayinye ithola usayizi wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amacingo-amodeliwe-okuphrinta-nge-3d\"\u003EAmacingo amodeliwe okuphrinta nge-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcingo elimodeliwe lilandela iphrofayli eyisisekelo ejwayelekile: i-ISO 68-1 kumacingo e-metric (izinkanyezi ezinqamile nezingxenye ezingaphansi, izinhlangothi ezingu-60°), i-ISO 2901 kumacingo e-trapezoidal (izinhlangothi ezingu-30°). Ushintsho lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EClearance\u003C/strong\u003E lunyusa iphrofayli yonke ngaphakathi (insimbi) noma ngaphandle (umgodi), ukuze izingxenye ezi-printed zihlangane ngamacingo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.1 kuya ku-0.2 mm\u003C/strong\u003E kulungele izinkuni eziningi ze-printer. Phrinta i-bolt nenut yokuhlola kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0\u003C/strong\u003E iyiphrofayli ejwayelekile, yezingxenye ezenziwe ngomshini noma zokuhlola ukulingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-bolt ne-nut enesilinganiso esifanayo azikaze zithinte ngohlangothi: igebe phakathi kwazo liphindwe kabili isilinganiso, zonke izinhlangothi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapitshi amancane aphrinta kabi: M3 nangaphansi, noma ipitshi elingaphansi kuka-0.5 mm, lisondele kakhulu kokungazwa kwe-nozzle engu-0.4 mm. Modela amacingo amakhulu, usebenzise i-heat-set insert noma umgodi osikiwe kwawancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcingo elimodeliwe liyingxenye ye-solid: ukuthumela kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP kuyawuthwala, futhi ithuluzi lokulinganisa liyalilinganisa. Lenza ingxenye ibe nzima ukuyakha kabusha: icingo le-M10 elinobude obungu-20 ligcina cishe amathrayangela angu-150,000.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigodi-esikiwe\"\u003EImigodi esikiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmgodi \u003Cstrong\u003ETapped (ISO metric)\u003C/strong\u003E unesiwitshi \u003Cstrong\u003EEmodeliwe\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance\u003C/strong\u003E efanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/holes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/holes\"\u003EBhola imigodi nezimbobo ngamaphoyinti eskethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-icingo-lingakwazi-ukwakheka\"\u003ELapho icingo lingakwazi ukwakheka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Icingo lihamba ebusweni obujikelezayo (isilinda): insimbi noma umgodi.&quot; Ubuso okhethiwe buyisicaba noma bugoqeke ngenye indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Akukho usayizi ojwayelekile ofanele ubuso obujikelezayo obungu-Ø0.6 mm: khetha usayizi.&quot; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana nobuso\u003C/span\u003E ayitholanga lutho ngaphakathi kuka-12 % wobuso. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E, noma shintsha ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ubuso lo icingo labuphezu kwalo sekunyamalele (…). Khetha futhi.&quot; Ushintsho lwangaphambilini lususe ubuso. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmacingo amaduma (UNC, UNF), amacingo epayipi, amacingo athambile, ukuphela kwecingo nokuqala kwecingo elibhevelwe akakakhiwa okwamanje. Ikhenli engempela ibonisa icingo elimodeliwe njengelibukeka kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ucingo ibeka icingo ezindaweni ezijikelezayo: ngaphandle kwensimbi (icingo langaphandle) noma ngaphakathi komgodi (icingo langaphakathi). I-PartCraft iyazi ukuthi yiyiphi kusuka ebusweni. Icingo liqala ngokubukeka kuphela: ubuso buhlala bungashintshiwe, umbono udwetsha icingo njengamasekhele amabili asephuka, nebhodi lombumbo liyaliqopha, njengalokhu \"M10×1.5 - 6g, thread 20 long\". Thikha Emodeliwe ukusika icingo langempela elihelical ebhodini, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, noma imodeli kudingeka ibukeke kahle. Faka icingo ensimbini noma emgodini Yakha insimbi noma umgodi ngosayizi wecingo: insimbi enesidikiba esingu-Ø10 ye-bolt engu-M10, noma umgodi ongu-Ø8.5 (umgodi wokuqala wokusika) we-nut engu-M10. Chofoza ubuso obujikelezayo, bese ukhetha Okwengeziwe › Ucingo. Uma ungakakhethi buso obujikelezayo, i-PartCraft iyakucela ukuthi uchofoze izinhlangothi, bese Kuqediwe. Ephaneli esekhohlo, hlola Usayizi. Lingana nobuso ikhetha usayizi ngokwayo: ensimbini, usayizi onobubanzi obukhulu obulingana nobensimbi; emgodini, usayizi onobubanzi obuncane obulingana nomgodi. Icingo liqala ekugcineni okuvulekile kobuso, lapho ingxenye ingaqhubeki ngomugqa ophakathi: ekugcineni okukhululekile kwensimbi, emlonyeni womgodi. Qala kolunye uhlangothi iyaguqula lokho. Izilungiselelo Isilungiselelo Okukhethwayo Okuzenzakalelayo Ifomu ISO metric (60°), M1.6 kuya ku-M64 coarse; trapezoidal (Tr, 30°), Tr8×1.5 kuya ku-Tr60×9 ISO metric Usayizi Lingana nobuso, noma usayizi oyodwa kuhlu Lingana nobuso Ubuso bonke Ukucisha kukuvumela ukunikeza Ubude (mm), ekalwa kusuka ekuqaleni Kuthikhiwe Qala kolunye uhlangothi Icingo lihamba kusuka kolunye uhlangothi lobuso Kuvaliwe Isandla Isandla sokunene noma sokhohlo Isandla sokunene Emodeliwe Sika icingo langempela elihelical Kuvaliwe Clearance (mm) Iyabonakala lapho kuthikhiwe i-Emodeliwe: icingo lensimbi lincane kangakanani, nelomgodi likhulu kangakanani, ngazo zonke izinhlangothi 0.1 Usayizi ongalingani nobuso uyakhiqizwa noma kunjalo, uthi ulungiswe ukuze ufanele ubuso, futhi iphaneli iyakushilo, njengokuthi \"Insimbi ye-Ø12 mm ayisiyo i-Ø10 mm ye-M10\". Izinhlangothi eziningi zingabelana ngesici esisodwa se-Ucingo; ngo-Lingana nobuso, ngayinye ithola usayizi wayo. Amacingo amodeliwe okuphrinta nge-3D Icingo elimodeliwe lilandela iphrofayli eyisisekelo ejwayelekile: i-ISO 68-1 kumacingo e-metric (izinkanyezi ezinqamile nezingxenye ezingaphansi, izinhlangothi ezingu-60°), i-ISO 2901 kumacingo e-trapezoidal (izinhlangothi ezingu-30°). Ushintsho lwe-Clearance lunyusa iphrofayli yonke ngaphakathi (insimbi) noma ngaphandle (umgodi), ukuze izingxenye ezi-printed zihlangane ngamacingo: 0.1 kuya ku-0.2 mm kulungele izinkuni eziningi ze-printer. Phrinta i-bolt nenut yokuhlola kuqala. 0 iyiphrofayli ejwayelekile, yezingxenye ezenziwe ngomshini noma zokuhlola ukulingana. I-bolt ne-nut enesilinganiso esifanayo azikaze zithinte ngohlangothi: igebe phakathi kwazo liphindwe kabili isilinganiso, zonke izinhlangothi. Amapitshi amancane aphrinta kabi: M3 nangaphansi, noma ipitshi elingaphansi kuka-0.5 mm, lisondele kakhulu kokungazwa kwe-nozzle engu-0.4 mm. Modela amacingo amakhulu, usebenzise i-heat-set insert noma umgodi osikiwe kwawancane. Icingo elimodeliwe liyingxenye ye-solid: ukuthumela kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP kuyawuthwala, futhi ithuluzi lokulinganisa liyalilinganisa. Lenza ingxenye ibe nzima ukuyakha kabusha: icingo le-M10 elinobude obungu-20 ligcina cishe amathrayangela angu-150,000. Imigodi esikiwe Umgodi Tapped (ISO metric) unesiwitshi Emodeliwe nokuthi Clearance efanayo. Bona Bhola imigodi nezimbobo ngamaphoyinti eskethi. Lapho icingo lingakwazi ukwakheka \"Icingo lihamba ebusweni obujikelezayo (isilinda): insimbi noma umgodi.\" Ubuso okhethiwe buyisicaba noma bugoqeke ngenye indlela. \"Akukho usayizi ojwayelekile ofanele ubuso obujikelezayo obungu-Ø0.6 mm: khetha usayizi.\" Lingana nobuso ayitholanga lutho ngaphakathi kuka-12 % wobuso. Khetha Usayizi, noma shintsha ubuso. \"Ubuso lo icingo labuphezu kwalo sekunyamalele (…). Khetha futhi.\" Ushintsho lwangaphambilini lususe ubuso. Chofoza Khetha izinhlangothi bese uchofoza ubuso futhi. Amacingo amaduma (UNC, UNF), amacingo epayipi, amacingo athambile, ukuphela kwecingo nokuqala kwecingo elibhevelwe akakakhiwa okwamanje. Ikhenli engempela ibonisa icingo elimodeliwe njengelibukeka kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"reference-geometry","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amapuleni wesinkomba, ama-axis namaphoyinti","summary":"Yenza amapuleni ahlukaniswe nohlangothi, angaba yi-engeli, adlule kumaphoyinti amathathu, aphakathi, athinte isilinda, abe lilingana nomphetho noma adlule komphetho nephoyinti; ama-axis; amaphoyinti ezinhlamvu zemiphetho, izindawo zokuhlangana kanye namakhoni wamapuleni; hlela esikethini phezu kwawo bese uwasebenzisa njengama-axis okujikeleza, izinkomba zephathini namapuleni e-mirror.","section":"tasks","order":65,"keywords":["datum","phakathi kwezinto","midpoint","iphoyinti lokuhlangana","ipuleni eliphuma ku-edge nephoyinti","ipuleni lesinkomba","ipuleni lokusebenza","ipuleni lokwakha","ipuleni lesisekelo","ipuleni eliphambekile","ipuleni lengeli","midplane","ipuleni elithinta","i-axis yesinkomba","i-axis yokwakha","iphoyinti lesinkomba","iphoyinti lokusebenza","hlela esikethini phezu kwepuleni"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-ipuleni","text":"Yenza ipuleni","level":2},{"id":"hlela-phezu-kwepuleni","text":"Hlela phezu kwepuleni","level":2},{"id":"ama-axis-namaphoyinti","text":"Ama-axis namaphoyinti","level":2},{"id":"uma-inkomba-isinyamalele","text":"Uma inkomba isinyamalele","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIjometri yesinkomba ingumsebenzi wokwakha izici ozakhela phezu kwawo: \u003Cstrong\u003Eipuleni\u003C/strong\u003E lokuhlela phezu kwalo lapho kungekho uhlangothi, \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-axis\u003C/strong\u003E yokujikeleza noma yokuphindaphinda ngayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E lokumisa i-extrude. Ayinampahla yayo. Amapuleni abonakala embonweni njengezikwele ezimhlophe ezikhanyayo, ama-axis njengemigqa enamachashaza, namaphoyinti njengamachashaza amancane; kuzo zonke lezi zintathu kuyajoyina umlando futhi kulandela okwenziwe ngakho uma usayizi wangaphambili eshintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZisendaweni ye-menu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E yeqembu lezici: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndiza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-axis\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ipuleni\"\u003EYenza ipuleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza uhlangothi olusalele, noma ipuleni lesisekelo emlandweni, ukuze uqale kulo (uyakhetha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndiza\u003C/span\u003E. Iqala njengepuleni eliphambanisiwe ngamaphesenti angu-20 osayizi wengxenye kusuka kokukhethile (noma kusuka kwipuleni eliphezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli yesokudla khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E nezinkomba zalo:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkomba\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinombolo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphambanisa kusuka epuleni noma kuhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka kwipuleni\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, elingelinani uma kusohlangothini olunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgengeli, idlula komphetho noma kwi-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka kwipuleni\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJikeleza ngokuzungeza\u003C/strong\u003E (i-axis yomhlaba, isici se-axis, noma umphetho oqondile okhethiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-engeli (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdlula kumaphoyinti amathathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 2\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 3\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleni eliphakathi phakathi kwamabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni lokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni lesibili\u003C/strong\u003E (uma zilinganayo: phakathi kwazo; uma zihlangana: ipuleni elihlukanisa ingeli ngamabili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthinta isilinda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinda\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlangothi lwesilinda), \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti eliseduze\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlangothi oluphi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlingana komphetho, endaweni yephoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEndaweni yephoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E (ipuleni lidlula kuphoyinti lomphetho eliseduze nalo, nakuphoyinti nje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdlula komphetho nephoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho oqondile\u003C/strong\u003E (noma i-axis), \u003Cstrong\u003EIdlula kuphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlingana komphetho esiphakathini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphakathi ubude baw, ulingana nawo lapho), noma uma ungekho umphetho \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 1\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 2\u003C/strong\u003E (ipuleni phakathi kwawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke inkomba inenkinobho ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E: yicindezele, bese uchofoza embonweni. Isiqeshana sepuleni samukela ipuleni lesisekelo, ipuleni lesinkomba noma uhlangothi oluqinile; isiqeshana samaphoyinti samukela ukuphela komphetho (chofoza eduze nalowo mkhawulo), isici sephoyinti, noma indawo ohlangothini; isiqeshana somphetho samukela umphetho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela ukukhetha. \u003Cstrong\u003EGuqula i-normal\u003C/strong\u003E iphendula ipuleni (ukuthi isikethi esihlezi phezu kwalo sibheke ngaphi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule nguqulo, isiqeshana esidinga umphetho noma uhlangothi lwesilinda (Ithinta isilinda, nezi-Edge) siphendula ukuthi &quot;akakakhiwa okwamanje&quot;: sebenzisa amaphoyinti noma i-axis kunalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-phezu-kwepuleni\"\u003EHlela phezu kwepuleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ipuleni (emlandweni noma ngokuchofoza isikwele saso embonweni) bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela phezu kwalo\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yalo. Isikethi silandela ipuleni: uma ushintsha ibanga lepuleni, nesikethi, nazo zonke izici ezisesikethini, ziyanyakaziswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-axis-namaphoyinti\"\u003EAma-axis namaphoyinti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-axis\u003C/span\u003E: idlula kumaphoyinti amabili, i-axis yesilinda noma ye-cone, lapho amapuleni amabili ehlangana, ngomphetho oqondile (noma i-axis yomphetho wesekhanda), noma ilingana nohlangothi ngephoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E: ngokuhlangabezana, endaweni yekhona noma sikhethe kwesikethi, noma ngaphakathi komzimba womphetho wesekhanda, plus amaphoyinti &quot;phakathi kwezinto&quot;:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo lwephoyinti\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkomba\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhakathi komphetho (noma phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphakathi ubude baw, nakuma-arc namajika), noma uma ungekho umphetho \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 1\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti 2\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho umphetho noma i-axis ihlangana nohlangothi noma nepuleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E (oqondile noma ogobile) noma i-axis, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIhlangana nepuleni\u003C/strong\u003E (ipuleni noma uhlangothi oluqinile) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENoma uhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlangothi oluqinile noma isilinda). Isiyingi sihlangana nepuleni kabili, nomugqa udlula kwisilinda kabili: \u003Cstrong\u003EOkunye ukuhlangana\u003C/strong\u003E kuthatha okwesibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho amapuleni amathathu ehlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni lokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni lesibili\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni lesithathu\u003C/strong\u003E (amapuleni noma uhlangothi oluqinile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgamunye wawo uhluleka ngomlayezo olula uma izinkomba zawo zingalingani: umugqa ophambene nepuleni, umugqa ongakhahlanga isilinda, umphetho ongafiki epuleni, amapuleni amathathu angahlanganisi endaweni eyodwa, noma iphoyinti emgqeni okufanele ulungise ipuleni kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZisebenzise kwezinye izici:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha isici se-axis kuhlu (kumele silale kwipuleni lesikethi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphethini ejikelezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E: isici se-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphethini eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela\u003C/strong\u003E: isici se-axis, noma ipuleni (i-normal yalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni le-mirror\u003C/strong\u003E: ipuleni lesinkomba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: Kuze kufike euhlangothini noma epuleni, Kuze kufike ku-vertex (isici sephoyinti). Akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (idinga i-kernel eqinile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpuleni elingathathi hlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-inkomba-isinyamalele\"\u003EUma inkomba isinyamalele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpuleni elenziwe kusuka ohlangothini olungasekho futhi lehluleka ngomlayezo obiza lona, njengo &quot;Uhlangothi lapho lihlezi kulo selusuka ku-Extrude1.&quot; Alisoze lisuswe lingene kolunye uhlangothi. Izikethi nezici ezisephezu kwalo zimakwa &quot;zingakakhiwa&quot; kuze ukhethe inkomba entsha; ingxenye eseleyo ihlala njengoba yayinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELe nguqulo yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, edala amapuleni, ama-axis namaphoyinti kusuka kumapuleni wesisekelo, ohlangothini oluqinile olwenziwe nge-Extrude noma i-Revolve, amaphoyinti esikethi, izixhumanisi nezinye izici zesinkomba. Noma yini edinga umphetho, isiphetho somphetho noma uhlangothi oluthambile idinga i-kernel eqinile: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (&quot;Isebenzisa uhlangothi noma umphetho wesolidi, okungatholakala yi-kernel eqinile kuphela: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo.&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ijometri yesinkomba ingumsebenzi wokwakha izici ozakhela phezu kwawo: ipuleni lokuhlela phezu kwalo lapho kungekho uhlangothi, i-axis yokujikeleza noma yokuphindaphinda ngayo, iphoyinti lokumisa i-extrude. Ayinampahla yayo. Amapuleni abonakala embonweni njengezikwele ezimhlophe ezikhanyayo, ama-axis njengemigqa enamachashaza, namaphoyinti njengamachashaza amancane; kuzo zonke lezi zintathu kuyajoyina umlando futhi kulandela okwenziwe ngakho uma usayizi wangaphambili eshintsha. Zisendaweni ye-menu ye-Okwengeziwe yeqembu lezici: Indiza, I-axis, Iphoyinti. Yenza ipuleni Chofoza uhlangothi olusalele, noma ipuleni lesisekelo emlandweni, ukuze uqale kulo (uyakhetha). Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Indiza. Iqala njengepuleni eliphambanisiwe ngamaphesenti angu-20 osayizi wengxenye kusuka kokukhethile (noma kusuka kwipuleni eliphezulu). Ephaneli yesokudla khetha Uhlobo nezinkomba zalo: Uhlobo Izinkomba Izinombolo Ukuphambanisa kusuka epuleni noma kuhlangothi Kusuka kwipuleni Ibanga (mm), elingelinani uma kusohlangothini olunye Ngengeli, idlula komphetho noma kwi-axis Kusuka kwipuleni, Jikeleza ngokuzungeza (i-axis yomhlaba, isici se-axis, noma umphetho oqondile okhethiwe) I-engeli (°) Idlula kumaphoyinti amathathu Iphoyinti 1, Iphoyinti 2, Iphoyinti 3 — Ipuleni eliphakathi phakathi kwamabili Ipuleni lokuqala, Ipuleni lesibili (uma zilinganayo: phakathi kwazo; uma zihlangana: ipuleni elihlukanisa ingeli ngamabili) — Ithinta isilinda Isilinda (uhlangothi lwesilinda), Iphoyinti eliseduze (uhlangothi oluphi) — Ilingana komphetho, endaweni yephoyinti Umphetho, Endaweni yephoyinti (ipuleni lidlula kuphoyinti lomphetho eliseduze nalo, nakuphoyinti nje) — Idlula komphetho nephoyinti Umphetho oqondile (noma i-axis), Idlula kuphoyinti — Ilingana komphetho esiphakathini Umphetho (ngaphakathi ubude baw, ulingana nawo lapho), noma uma ungekho umphetho Iphoyinti 1 kanye Iphoyinti 2 (ipuleni phakathi kwawo) — Yonke inkomba inenkinobho ye-Khetha: yicindezele, bese uchofoza embonweni. Isiqeshana sepuleni samukela ipuleni lesisekelo, ipuleni lesinkomba noma uhlangothi oluqinile; isiqeshana samaphoyinti samukela ukuphela komphetho (chofoza eduze nalowo mkhawulo), isici sephoyinti, noma indawo ohlangothini; isiqeshana somphetho samukela umphetho. Esc ikhansela ukukhetha. Guqula i-normal iphendula ipuleni (ukuthi isikethi esihlezi phezu kwalo sibheke ngaphi). Kule nguqulo, isiqeshana esidinga umphetho noma uhlangothi lwesilinda (Ithinta isilinda, nezi-Edge) siphendula ukuthi \"akakakhiwa okwamanje\": sebenzisa amaphoyinti noma i-axis kunalokho. Hlela phezu kwepuleni Khetha ipuleni (emlandweni noma ngokuchofoza isikwele saso embonweni) bese ukhetha Isikethi, noma Hlela phezu kwalo ephaneli yalo. Isikethi silandela ipuleni: uma ushintsha ibanga lepuleni, nesikethi, nazo zonke izici ezisesikethini, ziyanyakaziswa. Ama-axis namaphoyinti I-axis: idlula kumaphoyinti amabili, i-axis yesilinda noma ye-cone, lapho amapuleni amabili ehlangana, ngomphetho oqondile (noma i-axis yomphetho wesekhanda), noma ilingana nohlangothi ngephoyinti. Iphoyinti: ngokuhlangabezana, endaweni yekhona noma sikhethe kwesikethi, noma ngaphakathi komzimba womphetho wesekhanda, plus amaphoyinti \"phakathi kwezinto\": Uhlobo lwephoyinti Izinkomba Phakathi komphetho (noma phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili) Umphetho (ngaphakathi ubude baw, nakuma-arc namajika), noma uma ungekho umphetho Iphoyinti 1 kanye Iphoyinti 2 Lapho umphetho noma i-axis ihlangana nohlangothi noma nepuleni Umphetho (oqondile noma ogobile) noma i-axis, kanye Ihlangana nepuleni (ipuleni noma uhlangothi oluqinile) noma Noma uhlangothi (uhlangothi oluqinile noma isilinda). Isiyingi sihlangana nepuleni kabili, nomugqa udlula kwisilinda kabili: Okunye ukuhlangana kuthatha okwesibili Lapho amapuleni amathathu ehlangana Ipuleni lokuqala, Ipuleni lesibili kanye Ipuleni lesithathu (amapuleni noma uhlangothi oluqinile) Ngamunye wawo uhluleka ngomlayezo olula uma izinkomba zawo zingalingani: umugqa ophambene nepuleni, umugqa ongakhahlanga isilinda, umphetho ongafiki epuleni, amapuleni amathathu angahlanganisi endaweni eyodwa, noma iphoyinti emgqeni okufanele ulungise ipuleni kuwo. Zisebenzise kwezinye izici: Lapho Indlela Revolve I-axis: khetha isici se-axis kuhlu (kumele silale kwipuleni lesikethi) Iphethini ejikelezayo I-axis: isici se-axis Iphethini eqondile Indlela: isici se-axis, noma ipuleni (i-normal yalo) Mirror Ipuleni le-mirror: ipuleni lesinkomba Extrude Ukuphela: Kuze kufike euhlangothini noma epuleni, Kuze kufike ku-vertex (isici sephoyinti). Akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (idinga i-kernel eqinile) Draft Ipuleni elingathathi hlangothi Uma inkomba isinyamalele Ipuleni elenziwe kusuka ohlangothini olungasekho futhi lehluleka ngomlayezo obiza lona, njengo \"Uhlangothi lapho lihlezi kulo selusuka ku-Extrude1.\" Alisoze lisuswe lingene kolunye uhlangothi. Izikethi nezici ezisephezu kwalo zimakwa \"zingakakhiwa\" kuze ukhethe inkomba entsha; ingxenye eseleyo ihlala njengoba yayinjalo. Le nguqulo yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, edala amapuleni, ama-axis namaphoyinti kusuka kumapuleni wesisekelo, ohlangothini oluqinile olwenziwe nge-Extrude noma i-Revolve, amaphoyinti esikethi, izixhumanisi nezinye izici zesinkomba. Noma yini edinga umphetho, isiphetho somphetho noma uhlangothi oluthambile idinga i-kernel eqinile: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (\"Isebenzisa uhlangothi noma umphetho wesolidi, okungatholakala yi-kernel eqinile kuphela: akakakhiwa kule nguqulo.\").","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"patterns-mirror","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izici zokuphinda nezibuko","summary":"Phinda izici ngomugqa nge-Olayini, zijikeleze i-axis nge-Ngokujikeleza, futhi ukopishe izici noma umzimba wonke ngaphesheya kwendiza nge-Isibuko.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["phinda","ukuphinda komugqa","ukuphinda okujikelezayo","polar array","uhlu","isibuko","okufanayo","kopisha izici","umjikelezo wamabhawodi","imbewu","isibuko somzimba"],"headings":[{"id":"inkambu-yomugqa","text":"Inkambu yomugqa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-umphetho-njengenkombandlela","text":"Sebenzisa umphetho njengenkombandlela","level":3},{"id":"inkambu-ngokujikeleza","text":"Inkambu ngokujikeleza","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-izimbobo-eziyisishiyagalombili-zefulenji","text":"Isibonelo: izimbobo eziyisishiyagalombili zefulenji","level":3},{"id":"isibuko","text":"Isibuko","level":2},{"id":"imilayezo","text":"Imilayezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinkambu nezibuko zikopisha izici osewuzakhile. Izikopi ziyingxenye yomlando: uma ushintsha okokuqala, izikopi zilandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkukopishwayo kungokwenza isici: inkambu ye-boss yengeza impahla, inkambu yokusika noma yesimbobo iyisusa. Izinkambu zingaphinda zenziwe futhi zibonisiwe futhi. Inqwaba ye-STEP engenisiwe nayo ingakopishwa; ama-fillet, ama-chamfer nama-shell akwazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inkambu-yomugqa\"\u003EInkambu yomugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici okuzokopishwa emlandweni (isibonelo i-Hole noma i-Cut). Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, kusetshenziswa isici esiqinile sokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E. Izikopi ezintathu zivela zihlukaniswe ngama-20 mm ecaleni kwe-X.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlangothini lwesokudla, setha:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici zokukopisha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThikha zonke izici ozozikopisha. Izici ezingaphezulu kwenkambu kuphela ziyabhalwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esikhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkombandlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-X axis, i-Y axis, i-Z axis, umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo kusikethi esingaphambilini, i-axis ye-revolve, noma umphetho okhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-X axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga phakathi kwamakhelwane\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani eliphelele, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubandakanya okokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E (1 kuya ku-1000)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula inkombandlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikopi ziya ngakolunye uhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkuvulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sebenzisa-umphetho-njengenkombandlela\"\u003ESebenzisa umphetho njengenkombandlela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho oqondile wengxenye ku-view. Uhlangothi lwesokudla luthi \u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E futhi lukhombise ubude baw.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E: inkambu ihamba kuleyo mphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma khetha inkambu, khetha umphetho, bese ukhetha &quot;Umphetho okhethiwe (sebenzisa leyo okhethwe manje)&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EInkombandlela\u003C/strong\u003E. Umphetho okhethiwe umi endaweni ngokuqinile: awulandeli izinguquko ezilandelayo. Umugqa wesikethi ulandela isikethi sawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inkambu-ngokujikeleza\"\u003EInkambu ngokujikeleza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici okuzokopishwa (isibonelo isimbobo esisodwa eduze komphetho wediski).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E. Izikopi eziyisithupha zivela zilinganiswe ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici zokukopisha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengakwe-Olayini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esikhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-X, i-Y noma i-Z axis, umugqa wesikethi, i-axis ye-revolve, noma umphetho okhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-axis ye-revolve yokugcina uma ikhona, kungenjalo i-Y axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-engeli (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360 ibeka izikopi ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza. Ngaphansi kwalokho ziyasabalala ngaleyo ngeengeli, okokuqala nokokugcina emaphethelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani eliphelele, kubandakanya okokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula inkombandlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhamba ngakolunye uhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkuvulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-axis omhlaba adlula emvelophezulu. Uma idiski ingagxilile emvelophezulu, sebenzisa umugqa wesisekelo wesikethi noma i-axis ye-revolve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isibonelo-izimbobo-eziyisishiyagalombili-zefulenji\"\u003EIsibonelo: izimbobo eziyisishiyagalombili zefulenji\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJikeleza ifulenji (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/revolve\" data-topic=\"partcraft/revolve\"\u003EJikeleza ingxenye ejikelezayo\u003C/a\u003E) ngokuzungeza i-Y axis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba esikhethweni phezulu kwefulenji, beka iphoyinti emjikelezweni wamabhawodi, bese wenza i-Hole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi i-Hole ikhethiwe, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EI-axis\u003C/strong\u003E isivele ithi &quot;Axis of Revolve1&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E libe \u003Ccode\u003E8\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibuko\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici okuzosibonisa emlandweni, noma ungakhethi lutho ukuze ubonise \u003Cstrong\u003Eumzimba wonke njengoba wakhiwe kuze kube manje\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E. Sibonisa ngaphesheya kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ERight plane\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubonise umzimba wonke ngaphesheya kobuso bengxenye, chofoza leso busweni obuqinile kuqala, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E. (Ukuchofoza ubuso kususa ukukhethwa komlando, ngakho lokhu kubonisa umzimba wonke njalo.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo ohlangothini lwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsibuko\u003C/strong\u003E: thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba wonke (njengoba wakhiwe kuze kube manje)\u003C/strong\u003E, noma ususe lokho bese uthikha izici ozozikopisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza yesibuko\u003C/strong\u003E: Indiza yangaphambili (Front plane), Indiza ephezulu (Top plane), Indiza yesokudla (Right plane), ubuso obusetshenziswa manje (&quot;A face of Extrude1&quot; noma &quot;A fixed plane&quot;), noma &quot;The face picked now&quot;. Ukubonisa izici ezikhethiwe ngaphesheya kobuso: khetha i-Mirror emlandweni, chofoza ubuso ku-view, bese ukhetha &quot;The face picked now&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubonisa umzimba wonke ngaphesheya kobuso kuphindaphinda ingxenye, isibonelo ibhulaketi lohhafu libe ibhulaketi eligcwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imilayezo\"\u003EImilayezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Yakha isici ukuze ukopishe kuqala.&quot; noma &quot;Yakha umzimba oqinile kuqala.&quot; Akukho okuqinile okungakopishwa okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Khetha izici ozozikopisha.&quot; Zonke amabhokisi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzici zokukopisha\u003C/strong\u003E ziyasulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Extrude2 has no solid to copy.&quot; I-Extrude2 ayinawo umzimba oqinile wokukopisha. Leso sici sehlulekile noma sivinjiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Fillet1 changes the body&#039;s edges or walls; it cannot be copied. Copy the features that make solids (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).&quot; Fillet1 ishintsha imiphetho noma izindonga zomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. Kopisha izici ezenza izinto eziqinile (ama-extrude, ama-revolve, izimbobo, okungenisiwe). Ama-fillet, ama-chamfer nama-shell awakwazi ukuphindwa noma ukubonisiwa; phinda kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;There is no body to mirror yet.&quot; Akukho mzimba wokubonisa okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikopi zenkambu azikwazi ukudlulwa ngayinye, futhi inkambu ayikwazi ukulandela ijika lesikethi. Izinkambu zesikethi nezibuko azikakwakhiwa: dweba ijika elipheli ngesandla noma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd by coordinates\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Izinkambu nezibuko zikopisha izici osewuzakhile. Izikopi ziyingxenye yomlando: uma ushintsha okokuqala, izikopi zilandela. Okukopishwayo kungokwenza isici: inkambu ye-boss yengeza impahla, inkambu yokusika noma yesimbobo iyisusa. Izinkambu zingaphinda zenziwe futhi zibonisiwe futhi. Inqwaba ye-STEP engenisiwe nayo ingakopishwa; ama-fillet, ama-chamfer nama-shell akwazi. Inkambu yomugqa Khetha isici okuzokopishwa emlandweni (isibonelo i-Hole noma i-Cut). Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, kusetshenziswa isici esiqinile sokugcina. Khetha Olayini. Izikopi ezintathu zivela zihlukaniswe ngama-20 mm ecaleni kwe-X. Ohlangothini lwesokudla, setha: Isilungiselelo Okwenzayo Okuzenzakalelayo Izici zokukopisha Thikha zonke izici ozozikopisha. Izici ezingaphezulu kwenkambu kuphela ziyabhalwa Isici esikhethiwe Inkombandlela I-X axis, i-Y axis, i-Z axis, umugqa noma umugqa wesisekelo kusikethi esingaphambilini, i-axis ye-revolve, noma umphetho okhethiwe I-X axis Ibanga (mm) Ibanga phakathi kwamakhelwane 20 Inani Inani eliphelele, kubandakanya okokuqala (1 kuya ku-1000) 3 Phendula inkombandlela Izikopi ziya ngakolunye uhlangothi Akuvulekile Sebenzisa umphetho njengenkombandlela Chofoza umphetho oqondile wengxenye ku-view. Uhlangothi lwesokudla luthi Umphetho futhi lukhombise ubude baw. Khetha Olayini: inkambu ihamba kuleyo mphetho. Noma khetha inkambu, khetha umphetho, bese ukhetha \"Umphetho okhethiwe (sebenzisa leyo okhethwe manje)\" ku-Inkombandlela. Umphetho okhethiwe umi endaweni ngokuqinile: awulandeli izinguquko ezilandelayo. Umugqa wesikethi ulandela isikethi sawo. Inkambu ngokujikeleza Khetha isici okuzokopishwa (isibonelo isimbobo esisodwa eduze komphetho wediski). Khetha Ngokujikeleza. Izikopi eziyisithupha zivela zilinganiswe ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza. Setha: Isilungiselelo Okwenzayo Okuzenzakalelayo Izici zokukopisha Njengakwe-Olayini Isici esikhethiwe I-axis I-X, i-Y noma i-Z axis, umugqa wesikethi, i-axis ye-revolve, noma umphetho okhethiwe I-axis ye-revolve yokugcina uma ikhona, kungenjalo i-Y axis I-engeli (°) 360 ibeka izikopi ngokulinganayo ngokuzungeza. Ngaphansi kwalokho ziyasabalala ngaleyo ngeengeli, okokuqala nokokugcina emaphethelweni 360 Inani Inani eliphelele, kubandakanya okokuqala 6 Phendula inkombandlela Ihamba ngakolunye uhlangothi Akuvulekile Ama-axis omhlaba adlula emvelophezulu. Uma idiski ingagxilile emvelophezulu, sebenzisa umugqa wesisekelo wesikethi noma i-axis ye-revolve. Isibonelo: izimbobo eziyisishiyagalombili zefulenji Jikeleza ifulenji (bheka Jikeleza ingxenye ejikelezayo) ngokuzungeza i-Y axis. Dweba esikhethweni phezulu kwefulenji, beka iphoyinti emjikelezweni wamabhawodi, bese wenza i-Hole. Ngenkathi i-Hole ikhethiwe, khetha Ngokujikeleza. I-I-axis isivele ithi \"Axis of Revolve1\". Setha Inani libe 8. Isibuko Khetha isici okuzosibonisa emlandweni, noma ungakhethi lutho ukuze ubonise umzimba wonke njengoba wakhiwe kuze kube manje. Khetha Isibuko. Sibonisa ngaphesheya kwe-Right plane. Ukuze ubonise umzimba wonke ngaphesheya kobuso bengxenye, chofoza leso busweni obuqinile kuqala, bese ukhetha Isibuko. (Ukuchofoza ubuso kususa ukukhethwa komlando, ngakho lokhu kubonisa umzimba wonke njalo.) Izilungiselelo ohlangothini lwesokudla: Isibuko: thikha Umzimba wonke (njengoba wakhiwe kuze kube manje), noma ususe lokho bese uthikha izici ozozikopisha. Indiza yesibuko: Indiza yangaphambili (Front plane), Indiza ephezulu (Top plane), Indiza yesokudla (Right plane), ubuso obusetshenziswa manje (\"A face of Extrude1\" noma \"A fixed plane\"), noma \"The face picked now\". Ukubonisa izici ezikhethiwe ngaphesheya kobuso: khetha i-Mirror emlandweni, chofoza ubuso ku-view, bese ukhetha \"The face picked now\". Ukubonisa umzimba wonke ngaphesheya kobuso kuphindaphinda ingxenye, isibonelo ibhulaketi lohhafu libe ibhulaketi eligcwele. Imilayezo \"Yakha isici ukuze ukopishe kuqala.\" noma \"Yakha umzimba oqinile kuqala.\" Akukho okuqinile okungakopishwa okwamanje. \"Khetha izici ozozikopisha.\" Zonke amabhokisi Izici zokukopisha ziyasulwa. \"Extrude2 has no solid to copy.\" I-Extrude2 ayinawo umzimba oqinile wokukopisha. Leso sici sehlulekile noma sivinjiwe. \"Fillet1 changes the body's edges or walls; it cannot be copied. Copy the features that make solids (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).\" Fillet1 ishintsha imiphetho noma izindonga zomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. Kopisha izici ezenza izinto eziqinile (ama-extrude, ama-revolve, izimbobo, okungenisiwe). Ama-fillet, ama-chamfer nama-shell awakwazi ukuphindwa noma ukubonisiwa; phinda kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet. \"There is no body to mirror yet.\" Akukho mzimba wokubonisa okwamanje. Izikopi zenkambu azikwazi ukudlulwa ngayinye, futhi inkambu ayikwazi ukulandela ijika lesikethi. Izinkambu zesikethi nezibuko azikakwakhiwa: dweba ijika elipheli ngesandla noma nge-Add by coordinates.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"magnet-study","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isifundo sezinsimbi sesikethi","summary":"Guqula imiphetho evaliwe yamaskethi akho ibe imodeli yamagnetic eyisicaba (insimbi, amagnethi, amakhoyili), bone insimu, bese ufunda amandla nokuphenduka emzimbeni okhethiwe.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["magnet","magnetic","magnetostatic","field","flux density","force","torque","coil","yoke","iron","B-H curve","permanent magnet","actuator","motor","solenoid","maxwell"],"headings":[{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E kwi-toolbar yezici › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifundo sezinsimbi zamaskethi…\u003C/span\u003E kungxenye enamaskethi. Ibhalwa ngayinye evaliwe kumaskethi akhethiwe ingumkhakha owodwa wemodeli eyisicaba; isifundo sibala insimu yamagnethi B, amandla nokuphenduka emzimbeni okhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba izimbiwa njengezimo ezivaliwe ku-sketch: iyoki yensimbi, ignethi, ikhoyili. Izimbiwa ezithintana zabelana ngomphetho, ngakho zibeke kuma-sketch ahlukene; izimbiwa ezimi ngokwahlukana, noma ezingenaphakathi kwenye (iwindi kuyoki), zingabelana ngesketch eyodwa. Gcina ama-sketch endizeni efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula isifundo bese ukhetha ama-sketch ozosebenzisa. Umugqa ngamunye uthola umugqa, unombolo. Chaza ukuthi yini: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmoya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsimbi\u003C/span\u003E (i-permeability, noma ivi-B–H ethayiphwe njengamapheya e-B ngamatesla no-H nge-A/m), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmagineti oqhubekayo\u003C/span\u003E (Br ngamatesla, isiqondiso sawo njengengeli kusuka ku-x axis ye-sketch, kanye ne-recoil permeability yawo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhoyili\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqukethwe kwamanje kuwo wonke umkhakha, izikhathi zamaturns ezikhathini ze-ampere; uphawu lubonisa ukuthi ihamba ngaluphi uhlangothi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmandla nokuphenduka kulo mzimba\u003C/span\u003E ezimbizeni ozifunayo. Nika ukujula kwengxenye ngaphandle kwe-sketch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha imesh nomoya ozungeze imodeli, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuminyana kwe-flux |B| ngaphezu kwemodeli, okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka okumnyama okuphansi kuye ebomvu okuphezulu, nemikhakha inezinombolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInsimu enamandla kakhulu nendawo yayo, inani le-triangles, nakulowo nalowo mzimba okhethiwe amandla ku-x no-y, nokuphenduka emaphakathini ayo, ngokujula onikeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza imiphumela (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala izinombolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli eyisicaba, ezinzile: konke kuyisilinganiso ngemitha ngayinye yokujula, akukho ama-eddy currents nokungabi nalo i-hysteresis, negnethi ingumugqa oqondile wokubuyela (ayikwazi ukuphuca amandla).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli ihlala ebhokisini lomoya elinomphetho oyiwali. Qhathanisa usayizi ababili bebhokisi lomoya, nemesh i-Normal ne-Fine: amandla athathwe enkambweni ezungeze umzimba ulungile njengemesh ekuleyo ndawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInsimbi enepermeability kuphela ayisoze igcwale. Uma insimu idlula i-2 T, isifundo siphakamisa ⚠ kuhlu lwezinkinga: nika insimbi ivi-B–H. Izinombolo emgqeni omusha ziyizibonelo (insimbi μr 2000, ignethi enama-1.2 T), hhayi idatha yempahla yangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmzimba udinga indawo ezungezile ukuze uthathe amandla: uma omunye umzimba useduze kakhulu, isifundo siyatshela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye yokusiza ukuqopha, hhayi ukuvunywa kobunjiniyela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EIzinkambu zamagnethi ngo-2-D (isifundo)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Sebenzisa Okwengeziwe kwi-toolbar yezici › Isifundo sezinsimbi zamaskethi… kungxenye enamaskethi. Ibhalwa ngayinye evaliwe kumaskethi akhethiwe ingumkhakha owodwa wemodeli eyisicaba; isifundo sibala insimu yamagnethi B, amandla nokuphenduka emzimbeni okhethile. Izinyathelo Dweba izimbiwa njengezimo ezivaliwe ku-sketch: iyoki yensimbi, ignethi, ikhoyili. Izimbiwa ezithintana zabelana ngomphetho, ngakho zibeke kuma-sketch ahlukene; izimbiwa ezimi ngokwahlukana, noma ezingenaphakathi kwenye (iwindi kuyoki), zingabelana ngesketch eyodwa. Gcina ama-sketch endizeni efanayo. Vula isifundo bese ukhetha ama-sketch ozosebenzisa. Umugqa ngamunye uthola umugqa, unombolo. Chaza ukuthi yini: Umoya, Insimbi (i-permeability, noma ivi-B–H ethayiphwe njengamapheya e-B ngamatesla no-H nge-A/m), Umagineti oqhubekayo (Br ngamatesla, isiqondiso sawo njengengeli kusuka ku-x axis ye-sketch, kanye ne-recoil permeability yawo) noma Ikhoyili (ukuqukethwe kwamanje kuwo wonke umkhakha, izikhathi zamaturns ezikhathini ze-ampere; uphawu lubonisa ukuthi ihamba ngaluphi uhlangothi). Khetha Amandla nokuphenduka kulo mzimba ezimbizeni ozifunayo. Nika ukujula kwengxenye ngaphandle kwe-sketch. Khetha imesh nomoya ozungeze imodeli, bese Qalisa. Okufanele ukubone Ukuminyana kwe-flux |B| ngaphezu kwemodeli, okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka okumnyama okuphansi kuye ebomvu okuphezulu, nemikhakha inezinombolo. Insimu enamandla kakhulu nendawo yayo, inani le-triangles, nakulowo nalowo mzimba okhethiwe amandla ku-x no-y, nokuphenduka emaphakathini ayo, ngokujula onikeziwe. Londoloza imiphumela (CSV) ibhala izinombolo. Okuhle ukwazi Imodeli eyisicaba, ezinzile: konke kuyisilinganiso ngemitha ngayinye yokujula, akukho ama-eddy currents nokungabi nalo i-hysteresis, negnethi ingumugqa oqondile wokubuyela (ayikwazi ukuphuca amandla). Imodeli ihlala ebhokisini lomoya elinomphetho oyiwali. Qhathanisa usayizi ababili bebhokisi lomoya, nemesh i-Normal ne-Fine: amandla athathwe enkambweni ezungeze umzimba ulungile njengemesh ekuleyo ndawo. Insimbi enepermeability kuphela ayisoze igcwale. Uma insimu idlula i-2 T, isifundo siphakamisa ⚠ kuhlu lwezinkinga: nika insimbi ivi-B–H. Izinombolo emgqeni omusha ziyizibonelo (insimbi μr 2000, ignethi enama-1.2 T), hhayi idatha yempahla yangempela. Umzimba udinga indawo ezungezile ukuze uthathe amandla: uma omunye umzimba useduze kakhulu, isifundo siyatshela. Ingxenye yokusiza ukuqopha, hhayi ukuvunywa kobunjiniyela. Okulandelayo Izinkambu zamagnethi ngo-2-D (isifundo)","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bodies","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlanganisa, hambisa neshintsha usayizi wemizimba; imiumo yendlela","summary":"Yenza imizimba ehlukene, bese uyihlanganisa, uyisike noma uyihlanganise ngemva kwalokho, uyihambise, uyijikise, uyilinganise noma uyikopishe, uyishintshe usayizi ngokulinganayo noma nge-X, Y no-Z, bese ukopisha izakhi noma imizimba ngomugqa wejika.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["umzimba","imizimba","imizimba eminingi","umzimba omusha","hlanganisa","boolean","xhuma","sika","hlangana","susa","union","gcina amathuluzi","hambisa umzimba","kopisha umzimba","jikisa umzimba","linganisa","shintsha usayizi","stretch","affine","umumo wendlela","umumo ojikelezayo","uhlelo oluqondiswa ijika"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-umzimba-ohlukile","text":"Yenza umzimba ohlukile","level":2},{"id":"qamba-kabusha-noma-fihla-umzimba","text":"Qamba kabusha noma fihla umzimba","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-imizimba","text":"Hlanganisa imizimba","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-noma-kopisha-umzimba","text":"Hambisa noma kopisha umzimba","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi-womzimba","text":"Shintsha usayizi womzimba","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-ngomugqa","text":"Kopisha ngomugqa","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkakakhiwa kule nguqulo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusebenza nemizimba eminingi kudinga i-exact geometry kernel, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft: yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Esinye salelikhasi sichaza kanjalo njengoba lisebenza ne-exact kernel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ingaba nezinto eziqinile ezingaphezu kwesisodwa. Isiqinile ngasinye esihlukile yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumzimba\u003C/strong\u003E. Izakhi eziningi zengeza noma zisike kuyo yonke imizimba ezithinta; amathuluzi aleli khasi asebenza emizimbeni ephelele oyikhethile. Atholakala emenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E yeqembu lezakhi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa umzimba\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi womzimba\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumo wendlela\u003C/span\u003E. Konke lokhu kudinga i-exact kernel (OpenCascade).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-umzimba-ohlukile\"\u003EYenza umzimba ohlukile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ye-extrude noma ye-revolve ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba omusha\u003C/strong\u003E kuphaneli yayo yesokudla (ama-sweep nama-loft nawo anayo). Isiqinile esisha sihlala sihlukile nalapho sigqumana khona nezinye. \u003Cstrong\u003EHlangana\u003C/strong\u003E igcina kuphela ukugqumana kwesimo esisha nento esikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImizimba iqanjwa ngesakhi esayiqala: &quot;Extrude2&quot;. Ikhophi iqanjwa ngomsuka wayo kanye nesakhi esayikopisha: &quot;Extrude2, copy 1 of Move1&quot;. Amagama ahlala efanayo uma ushintsha usayizi ongaphambili, ngakho izakhi ezisebenzisa umzimba ziqhubeka ziwuthola. Uma kunemizimba emibili noma ngaphezulu, ipheneli lengxenye (chofoza isikhala esingenalutho) liwudwebela ngamavolumu awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qamba-kabusha-noma-fihla-umzimba\"\u003EQamba kabusha noma fihla umzimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza isikhala esingenalutho embonweni ukuze ubone ipheneli lengxenye. Uhlu lomzimba (olubonakala uma ingxenye inemizimba emibili noma ngaphezulu) lunebhokisi lamagama kanye nenkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E emugqeni ngamunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQamba kabusha:\u003C/strong\u003E bhala igama elisha ebhokisini bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze kwenye indawo. Zonke iphaneli bese ziyisebenzisa: Hlanganisa, Hambisa umzimba, imiumo. Sula ibhokisi ukuze ubuyele egameni lesakhi esenze umzimba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFihla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E emugqeni wawo. Umzimba uphuma embonweni, nokuchofoza kudlula kuwo, ngakho ungakhetha izinhlangothi ezisemuva kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E uwubuyisela; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ubuyisela yonke imizimba efihliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkufihla kushintsha umbono kuphela. Umzimba ofihliwe usakhiwa, ubalwa kuvolumu nasemalinganisweni, futhi uyalondolozwa ekuthumeleni kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP. Amagama nemizimba efihliwe alondolozwa efayeleni lengxenye, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-imizimba\"\u003EHlanganisa imizimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ubuso bomzimba \u003Cstrong\u003Ewenjongo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ubuso bomzimba ngamunye \u003Cstrong\u003Ewethuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphaneli yesokudla khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkusebenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmzimba wenjongo kanye namathuluzi kuba umzimba oyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESika\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathuluzi asuswa emzimbeni wenjongo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlangana\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKugcinwa kuphela okwabelwana ngakho umzimba wenjongo namathuluzi onke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba wenjongo\u003C/strong\u003E ye umzimba ogcina igama lawo. Thika noma susa uthiki \u003Cstrong\u003EImizimba yamathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E, noma sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha embonweni\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso bawo. \u003Cstrong\u003EGcina imizimba yamathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E ishiya namathuluzi endaweni yawo (kuyasiza ngesikhunta nomgodi washo). Uma umzimba wethuluzi usuke usetshenziswe yi-Hlanganisa yangaphambili, ipheneli liyasho lokho kunokukhetha omunye umzimba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-noma-kopisha-umzimba\"\u003EHambisa noma kopisha umzimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa umzimba\u003C/span\u003E. Umzimba omusha kakhulu uthikiwe; thika owodwa owufuna ukuwuhambisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EΔX\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EΔY\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E ku-millimeter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti kuya kuphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusukela\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EKuya\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza eduze kwesiphetho sohlangothi, isakhi sephoyinti, noma indawo ebusweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikisa ngokuzungeza i-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E (X, Y, Z, isakhi se-axis, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E: isiphetho esiqondile, indilinga noma isilinda) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa ubuso nobuso noma indiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso okuzohanjiswa\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso obuthe bomzimba), \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso obuthe noma indiza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulinganisa kujikisa umzimba ukuze ubuso bawo bulale phezu kobunye ubuso, ubuso nobuso, bese ubuhambisela kuphela ngokuqondile kwalobo buso. \u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela efanayo\u003C/strong\u003E iyijikisa ngendlela ephambene. \u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha\u003C/strong\u003E igcina okokuqala bese yengeza ikhophi ehanjisiwe njengomzimba omusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-usayizi-womzimba\"\u003EShintsha usayizi womzimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha usayizi womzimba\u003C/span\u003E, bese uthika imizimba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali\u003C/strong\u003E, noma susa uthiki \u003Cstrong\u003EOkulinganayo\u003C/strong\u003E bese ubhala \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali Y\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali Z\u003C/strong\u003E (ngokuya ku-axis yomhlaba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMayelana\u003C/strong\u003E iyiphoyinti elihlala lingashintshi: isikhungo sebhokisi yemizimba, noma iphoyinti olikhethayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha usayizi okulinganayo kuyinembile. Ukushintsha usayizi okungalingani kuguqula izindilinga zibe ama-ellipse: isilinda siba yisilinda se-elliptic, engakabambeki ngubuso bokuhlaziya, ngakho ubuso obugobile buba ubuso be-B-spline obuhlala phakathi kuka-0.0000004 mm kokwakheka okunembile; ubuso obuthe namaphethelo aqondile ahlala enembile. Ipheneli liyatshela ukuthi yenzekile yini. Izinkomba zokushintsha usayizi kumele zibe ngaphezu kuka-zero (esikhundleni salokho sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-ngomugqa\"\u003EKopisha ngomugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhi okufanele sikopishwe emlandweni, noma ungakhethi lutho ukukopisha umzimba omusha kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumo wendlela\u003C/span\u003E. Isikethi esisha kakhulu esingasetshenziswa siyathathwa njengomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphaneli yesokudla setha:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImizimba (ikhophi ngayinye ibe umzimba omusha) noma Izakhi (ixhunyiwe noma isikwe njengokwasekuqaleni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThika izikethi, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha amaphethelo emodeli\u003C/strong\u003E; izingxenye kumele zixhume ekugcineni ngakunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani eliphelele, kubalwa nokokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkulinganayo (kusatshalaliswe kuze kube sekugcineni komugqa ovulekile, noma kuzungeze konke komugqa ovaliwe) noma ibanga elisethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqondiswa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandela umugqa (ikhophi ngayinye ijikeka nawo) noma Okungashintshi (amakhophi ahlala ahambisana)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuqula indlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHamba ngendlela ephambene emugqeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhophi aqala lapho umugqa udlula khona eduze kakhulu nomsuka, futhi ahlukaniswa ngobude ngokuya ejikeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiumo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E nayo ingakopisha imizimba: thika \u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha imizimba\u003C/strong\u003E kuphaneli yayo bese ukhetha imizimba; ikhophi ngayinye ibe umzimba omusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImizimba idinga i-exact kernel; i-mesh kernel igcina isiqinile esisodwa futhi iyakusho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha usayizi okungalingani kwenza ubuso obugobile bube yimibono esondele ye-B-spline (bona ngenhla), kungabi izilinda noma izikhala ezinembile; ubuso obuhlukaniswe akukakwazi ukushintshwa usayizi ngale ndlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulandela umugqa ku-ijika le-3D elijikayo kuthwala ikhophi ngaphandle kokuyiphendula; emigqeni ethe xaxa ukujika kunembile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Hlanganisa isebenza kuzinto eziqinile kuphela. Imizimba yobuso ixhunywa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuthunga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EIzindiza zesethenjwa, ama-axis namaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E ngamaphoyinti nezindiza &quot;phakathi kwezinto&quot;, kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003EIzakhi zomumo nesibuko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Akakakhiwa kule nguqulo. Ukusebenza nemizimba eminingi kudinga i-exact geometry kernel, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft: yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel. Okungakakhiwa kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Esinye salelikhasi sichaza kanjalo njengoba lisebenza ne-exact kernel. Ingxenye ingaba nezinto eziqinile ezingaphezu kwesisodwa. Isiqinile ngasinye esihlukile yi-umzimba. Izakhi eziningi zengeza noma zisike kuyo yonke imizimba ezithinta; amathuluzi aleli khasi asebenza emizimbeni ephelele oyikhethile. Atholakala emenyu ye-Okwengeziwe yeqembu lezakhi: Hlanganisa, Hambisa umzimba, Shintsha usayizi womzimba kanye Umumo wendlela. Konke lokhu kudinga i-exact kernel (OpenCascade). Yenza umzimba ohlukile Setha i-Ukusebenza ye-extrude noma ye-revolve ibe Umzimba omusha kuphaneli yayo yesokudla (ama-sweep nama-loft nawo anayo). Isiqinile esisha sihlala sihlukile nalapho sigqumana khona nezinye. Hlangana igcina kuphela ukugqumana kwesimo esisha nento esikhona. Imizimba iqanjwa ngesakhi esayiqala: \"Extrude2\". Ikhophi iqanjwa ngomsuka wayo kanye nesakhi esayikopisha: \"Extrude2, copy 1 of Move1\". Amagama ahlala efanayo uma ushintsha usayizi ongaphambili, ngakho izakhi ezisebenzisa umzimba ziqhubeka ziwuthola. Uma kunemizimba emibili noma ngaphezulu, ipheneli lengxenye (chofoza isikhala esingenalutho) liwudwebela ngamavolumu awo. Qamba kabusha noma fihla umzimba Chofoza isikhala esingenalutho embonweni ukuze ubone ipheneli lengxenye. Uhlu lomzimba (olubonakala uma ingxenye inemizimba emibili noma ngaphezulu) lunebhokisi lamagama kanye nenkinobho ye-Fihla emugqeni ngamunye. Qamba kabusha: bhala igama elisha ebhokisini bese ucindezela Enter noma uchofoze kwenye indawo. Zonke iphaneli bese ziyisebenzisa: Hlanganisa, Hambisa umzimba, imiumo. Sula ibhokisi ukuze ubuyele egameni lesakhi esenze umzimba. Fihla: chofoza Fihla emugqeni wawo. Umzimba uphuma embonweni, nokuchofoza kudlula kuwo, ngakho ungakhetha izinhlangothi ezisemuva kwawo. Bonisa uwubuyisela; Bonisa konke ubuyisela yonke imizimba efihliwe. Ukufihla kushintsha umbono kuphela. Umzimba ofihliwe usakhiwa, ubalwa kuvolumu nasemalinganisweni, futhi uyalondolozwa ekuthumeleni kwe-STL, 3MF ne-STEP. Amagama nemizimba efihliwe alondolozwa efayeleni lengxenye, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Hlanganisa imizimba Shift+chofoza ubuso bomzimba wenjongo, bese ubuso bomzimba ngamunye wethuluzi. Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Hlanganisa. Kuphaneli yesokudla khetha Ukusebenza: Ukusebenza Umphumela Xhuma Umzimba wenjongo kanye namathuluzi kuba umzimba oyodwa Sika Amathuluzi asuswa emzimbeni wenjongo Hlangana Kugcinwa kuphela okwabelwana ngakho umzimba wenjongo namathuluzi onke Umzimba wenjongo ye umzimba ogcina igama lawo. Thika noma susa uthiki Imizimba yamathuluzi, noma sebenzisa Khetha embonweni bese uchofoza ubuso bawo. Gcina imizimba yamathuluzi ishiya namathuluzi endaweni yawo (kuyasiza ngesikhunta nomgodi washo). Uma umzimba wethuluzi usuke usetshenziswe yi-Hlanganisa yangaphambili, ipheneli liyasho lokho kunokukhetha omunye umzimba. Hambisa noma kopisha umzimba Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Hambisa umzimba. Umzimba omusha kakhulu uthikiwe; thika owodwa owufuna ukuwuhambisa. Khetha uhlobo Hambisa: Hambisa Okusethwayo Hambisa ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ ku-millimeter Iphoyinti kuya kuphoyinti Kusukela kanye Kuya: chofoza eduze kwesiphetho sohlangothi, isakhi sephoyinti, noma indawo ebusweni Jikisa ngokuzungeza i-axis Axis (X, Y, Z, isakhi se-axis, noma Khetha: isiphetho esiqondile, indilinga noma isilinda) kanye Ikona (°) Linganisa ubuso nobuso noma indiza Ubuso okuzohanjiswa (ubuso obuthe bomzimba), Phezu (ubuso obuthe noma indiza) Ukulinganisa kujikisa umzimba ukuze ubuso bawo bulale phezu kobunye ubuso, ubuso nobuso, bese ubuhambisela kuphela ngokuqondile kwalobo buso. Indlela efanayo iyijikisa ngendlela ephambene. Kopisha igcina okokuqala bese yengeza ikhophi ehanjisiwe njengomzimba omusha. Shintsha usayizi womzimba Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Shintsha usayizi womzimba, bese uthika imizimba. Bhala Isikali, noma susa uthiki Okulinganayo bese ubhala Isikali X, Isikali Y kanye Isikali Z (ngokuya ku-axis yomhlaba). Mayelana iyiphoyinti elihlala lingashintshi: isikhungo sebhokisi yemizimba, noma iphoyinti olikhethayo. Ukushintsha usayizi okulinganayo kuyinembile. Ukushintsha usayizi okungalingani kuguqula izindilinga zibe ama-ellipse: isilinda siba yisilinda se-elliptic, engakabambeki ngubuso bokuhlaziya, ngakho ubuso obugobile buba ubuso be-B-spline obuhlala phakathi kuka-0.0000004 mm kokwakheka okunembile; ubuso obuthe namaphethelo aqondile ahlala enembile. Ipheneli liyatshela ukuthi yenzekile yini. Izinkomba zokushintsha usayizi kumele zibe ngaphezu kuka-zero (esikhundleni salokho sebenzisa Isibuko). Kopisha ngomugqa Khetha isakhi okufanele sikopishwe emlandweni, noma ungakhethi lutho ukukopisha umzimba omusha kakhulu. Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Umumo wendlela. Isikethi esisha kakhulu esingasetshenziswa siyathathwa njengomugqa. Kuphaneli yesokudla setha: Okusethwayo Okwenzayo Kopisha Imizimba (ikhophi ngayinye ibe umzimba omusha) noma Izakhi (ixhunyiwe noma isikwe njengokwasekuqaleni) Umugqa Thika izikethi, noma Khetha amaphethelo emodeli; izingxenye kumele zixhume ekugcineni ngakunye Inani Inani eliphelele, kubalwa nokokuqala Ukuhlukaniswa Okulinganayo (kusatshalaliswe kuze kube sekugcineni komugqa ovulekile, noma kuzungeze konke komugqa ovaliwe) noma ibanga elisethiwe Ukuqondiswa Landela umugqa (ikhophi ngayinye ijikeka nawo) noma Okungashintshi (amakhophi ahlala ahambisana) Guqula indlela Hamba ngendlela ephambene emugqeni Amakhophi aqala lapho umugqa udlula khona eduze kakhulu nomsuka, futhi ahlukaniswa ngobude ngokuya ejikeni. Imiumo Olayini kanye Ngokujikeleza nayo ingakopisha imizimba: thika Kopisha imizimba kuphaneli yayo bese ukhetha imizimba; ikhophi ngayinye ibe umzimba omusha. Imikhawulo Imizimba idinga i-exact kernel; i-mesh kernel igcina isiqinile esisodwa futhi iyakusho lokho. Ukushintsha usayizi okungalingani kwenza ubuso obugobile bube yimibono esondele ye-B-spline (bona ngenhla), kungabi izilinda noma izikhala ezinembile; ubuso obuhlukaniswe akukakwazi ukushintshwa usayizi ngale ndlela. Ukulandela umugqa ku-ijika le-3D elijikayo kuthwala ikhophi ngaphandle kokuyiphendula; emigqeni ethe xaxa ukujika kunembile. I-Hlanganisa isebenza kuzinto eziqinile kuphela. Imizimba yobuso ixhunywa nge-Ukuthunga. Bona futhi Izindiza zesethenjwa, ama-axis namaphoyinti ngamaphoyinti nezindiza \"phakathi kwezinto\", kanye Izakhi zomumo nesibuko.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tolerance-stackup","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izakhiwo setholeransi","summary":"Khetha uchungechunge lwezinhlangothi ezidlula ezingxenyeni ze-assembly bese ubona ukuthi igebe ekugcineni laso lingahluka kangakanani, ngokumbi nangokuthi i-RSS, nezinto ezibalulekile kakhulu zibekwe phambili.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["izakhiwo setholeransi","stackup","ukuhlaziywa kwetholeransi","uchungechunge lwetholeransi","uchungechunge lwesilinganiso","loop","igebe","clearance","worst case","rss","root sum square","statistical tolerancing","contributors","sensitivity","gd&t","general tolerance","iso 2768"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-uchungechunge","text":"Khetha uchungechunge","level":2},{"id":"nikeza-ixhumanisi-ngalinye-ithole-lalo","text":"Nikeza ixhumanisi ngalinye ithole lalo","level":2},{"id":"funda-imiphumela","text":"Funda imiphumela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Eizakhiwo setholeransi\u003C/strong\u003E iyangeza izilinganiso ezilandelana kuchungechunge olududuza izingxenye eziningi ukuze ibone ukuthi umphumela, ngokuvamile igebe, ungahluka kangakanani uma yonke ingxenye yenziwa noma ngabe ikuphi phakathi kwetholeransi yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-uchungechunge\"\u003EKhetha uchungechunge\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-assembly bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo setholeransi\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhadi livula phezu kombono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uchungechunge lukhonjwa \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphansi kwa\u003C/strong\u003E: X, Y noma Z ye-assembly, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile kobuso bokuqala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha uchungechunge\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza izinhlangothi uchungechunge eludlula kuzo, \u003Cstrong\u003Engokulandelana\u003C/strong\u003E: qala ohlangothini olulodwa lwegebe, udlule ezingxenyeni, bese uphela ohlangothini olunye legebe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. I-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela ukuchofoza kokugcina; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhansela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza kabili endaweni yengxenye eyodwa kwenza isilinganiso sayo (ibanga layo elihamba kuchungechunge). Ukuchofoza esinye isiqephu kwenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhlangana\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwezingxenye, lapho zihlangana khona; alunawo umkhawulo wetholeransi ngaphandle kokuthi uyibhale. Izixhumanisi ziyangeza noma zikhiphe ngendlela uchungechunge elihamba ngayo, futhi zivala ilupu: igebe elikhishwe yimodeli yileli elibonisiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngakwazi futhi ukuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ixhumanisi\u003C/span\u003E ngesandla bese ubhala inominal yalo, ithole lalo nokuthi lenezela (+) noma lukhipha (−).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nikeza-ixhumanisi-ngalinye-ithole-lalo\"\u003ENikeza ixhumanisi ngalinye ithole lalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIxhumanisi ngalinye linokuphambuka \u003Cstrong\u003Eokuphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E nokuphambuka \u003Cstrong\u003Eokuphansi\u003C/strong\u003E (isibonelo +0.1 no−0.05). \u003Cstrong\u003EThola kusuka ku-\u003C/strong\u003E izigcwalisa ngokusuka engxenyeni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthole elijwayelekile\u003C/strong\u003E: inkambu ye-Tolerance yebhulokhi yesihloko sengxenye (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EUmdwebo ukuya ku-PDF\u003C/a\u003E), uma ifunda ±0.1, +0.2/-0.1 noma ISO 2768-f, -m, -c noma -v (izilinganiso zomugqa ze-ISO 2768-1, ngosayizi womugqa). Ithole eliyisisekelo lengxenye lisetshenziswa ngokushesha lapho uchungechunge likhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGD&amp;T\u003C/strong\u003E: noma yiyiphi incazelo yefreyimu yokulawula ku-drawing yengxenye. Izindawo zesikhundla, zephrofayli nezokuhamba zinika ± ingxenye yethole. Ithole lesimo noma lokuma ngokuvamile lisendaweni yetholeransi yosayizi esevele ikhona: liyengeze kuphela lapho uchungechunge lufinyelela ubuso olulawulwayo. Ngo-Ⓜ noma Ⓛ indawo ithathwa ngosayizi wayo oshiwo; ithole lebhonasi alibalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkubhaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E: noma yiziphi izinombolo oziphrinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-imiphumela\"\u003EFunda imiphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe, inominal\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi, lapho amathole engalingani, \u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe, mean\u003C/strong\u003E — +0.2/−0 no+0/−0.1 zishintsha phakathi kohla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo esibi kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke itholetansi kumkhawulo wayo ngesikhathi esisodwa. Igebe alikwazi ukuphuma kulokhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERSS\u003C/strong\u003E (root sum square): ithole ngalinye lithathwa njengezinga elingu-3 lokuhlukahluka kokusatshalaliswa okuvamile, bese liyengezwa njengengcuba yesamba sezikwele zawo. Imihlangano eminingi ingaphakathi kakhulu esimeni esibi kakhulu; lesi yisilinganiso esijwayelekile zingxenye ezenziwa ngobuningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe okungenani\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe okungenani kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona ukuthi isimo esibi kakhulu sihlala ngaphakathi yini, nokuthi ama-assembly angaki ngesigidi ngo-RSS alindele ukuphuma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkholomu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003E#\u003C/strong\u003E ihlela izixhumanisi ngokwesabelo sazo se-RSS: qinisa okokuqala ukuze wenze umehluko omkhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ibhala izixhumanisi, izabelo zazo nemiphumela. Izakhiwo setholeransi zigcinwa kufayela le-assembly, futhi ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa kwi-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo setholeransi siyindlela eyodwa. Asilandeli ama-engeli noma ukuguquka kuchungechunge, futhi alifundi amatholeosayizi kumadrowing; nikeza lawo njengamathole abhaliwe noma ngebhulokhi yesihloko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-izakhiwo setholeransi iyangeza izilinganiso ezilandelana kuchungechunge olududuza izingxenye eziningi ukuze ibone ukuthi umphumela, ngokuvamile igebe, ungahluka kangakanani uma yonke ingxenye yenziwa noma ngabe ikuphi phakathi kwetholeransi yayo. Khetha uchungechunge Vula i-assembly bese ukhetha Isakhiwo setholeransi eqenjini le-Inhlanganisela. Ikhadi livula phezu kombono. Khetha uchungechunge lukhonjwa ngaphansi kwa: X, Y noma Z ye-assembly, noma Okujwayelekile kobuso bokuqala. Cindezela Khetha uchungechunge bese uchofoza izinhlangothi uchungechunge eludlula kuzo, ngokulandelana: qala ohlangothini olulodwa lwegebe, udlule ezingxenyeni, bese uphela ohlangothini olunye legebe. Cindezela Kuqediwe noma Enter. I-Backspace ibuyisela ukuchofoza kokugcina; Esc iyakhansela. Ukuchofoza kabili endaweni yengxenye eyodwa kwenza isilinganiso sayo (ibanga layo elihamba kuchungechunge). Ukuchofoza esinye isiqephu kwenza ukuhlangana phakathi kwezingxenye, lapho zihlangana khona; alunawo umkhawulo wetholeransi ngaphandle kokuthi uyibhale. Izixhumanisi ziyangeza noma zikhiphe ngendlela uchungechunge elihamba ngayo, futhi zivala ilupu: igebe elikhishwe yimodeli yileli elibonisiwe. Ungakwazi futhi ukuthi Engeza ixhumanisi ngesandla bese ubhala inominal yalo, ithole lalo nokuthi lenezela (+) noma lukhipha (−). Nikeza ixhumanisi ngalinye ithole lalo Ixhumanisi ngalinye linokuphambuka okuphezulu nokuphambuka okuphansi (isibonelo +0.1 no−0.05). Thola kusuka ku- izigcwalisa ngokusuka engxenyeni: Ithole elijwayelekile: inkambu ye-Tolerance yebhulokhi yesihloko sengxenye (bona Umdwebo ukuya ku-PDF), uma ifunda ±0.1, +0.2/-0.1 noma ISO 2768-f, -m, -c noma -v (izilinganiso zomugqa ze-ISO 2768-1, ngosayizi womugqa). Ithole eliyisisekelo lengxenye lisetshenziswa ngokushesha lapho uchungechunge likhethwa. GD&T: noma yiyiphi incazelo yefreyimu yokulawula ku-drawing yengxenye. Izindawo zesikhundla, zephrofayli nezokuhamba zinika ± ingxenye yethole. Ithole lesimo noma lokuma ngokuvamile lisendaweni yetholeransi yosayizi esevele ikhona: liyengeze kuphela lapho uchungechunge lufinyelela ubuso olulawulwayo. Ngo-Ⓜ noma Ⓛ indawo ithathwa ngosayizi wayo oshiwo; ithole lebhonasi alibalwa. Okubhaliwe: noma yiziphi izinombolo oziphrinta. Funda imiphumela Igebe, inominal nokuthi, lapho amathole engalingani, Igebe, mean — +0.2/−0 no+0/−0.1 zishintsha phakathi kohla. Isimo esibi kakhulu: yonke itholetansi kumkhawulo wayo ngesikhathi esisodwa. Igebe alikwazi ukuphuma kulokhu. RSS (root sum square): ithole ngalinye lithathwa njengezinga elingu-3 lokuhlukahluka kokusatshalaliswa okuvamile, bese liyengezwa njengengcuba yesamba sezikwele zawo. Imihlangano eminingi ingaphakathi kakhulu esimeni esibi kakhulu; lesi yisilinganiso esijwayelekile zingxenye ezenziwa ngobuningi. Nikeza Igebe okungenani nokuthi Igebe okungenani kakhulu ukubona ukuthi isimo esibi kakhulu sihlala ngaphakathi yini, nokuthi ama-assembly angaki ngesigidi ngo-RSS alindele ukuphuma. Ikholomu ethi # ihlela izixhumanisi ngokwesabelo sazo se-RSS: qinisa okokuqala ukuze wenze umehluko omkhulu. Londoloza i-CSV ibhala izixhumanisi, izabelo zazo nemiphumela. Izakhiwo setholeransi zigcinwa kufayela le-assembly, futhi ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa kwi-Ctrl+Z. Isakhiwo setholeransi siyindlela eyodwa. Asilandeli ama-engeli noma ukuguquka kuchungechunge, futhi alifundi amatholeosayizi kumadrowing; nikeza lawo njengamathole abhaliwe noma ngebhulokhi yesihloko.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sweep-loft-draft","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sweep, loft nohlaka","summary":"Hambisa iphrofayli evaliwe endleleni yemigqa yeskethi noma yemiphetho yemodeli, loft phakathi kwezigaba ezisezindizeni ezihlukene, futhi wengeze uhlaka ezinhlangothini; nezinketho, imiphumela eqondile nemilayezo.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["sweep","swept boss","swept cut","ipayipi","indlela","loft","lofted boss","blend sections","ruled","draft","draft angle","taper faces","neutral plane","pull direction","molding"],"headings":[{"id":"sweep","text":"Sweep","level":2},{"id":"loft","text":"Loft","level":2},{"id":"imigqa-yokuqondisa","text":"Imigqa yokuqondisa","level":3},{"id":"uhlaka","text":"Uhlaka","level":2},{"id":"imilayezo","text":"Imilayezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKule nguqulo\u003C/strong\u003E i-sweep ne-loft azikakhiwa: zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho; izigaba ze-Sweep ne-Loft zichaza ukuthi zisebenza kanjani nge-kernel eqondile. \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka luyasebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ezindaweni eziyisicaba: i-mesh kernel iyakwakha, nomphumela ofanayo i-kernel eqondile iwunikeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZonke ntathu zisemenywini ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E yeqembu le-Features (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E). Ngayinye ingangeza impahla, iyisuse, igcine kuphela ukuhlangana (\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlangana\u003C/strong\u003E) noma yenze \u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba omusha\u003C/strong\u003E (sweep ne-loft: \u003Cstrong\u003EUkusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sweep\"\u003ESweep\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-sweep ihambisa iphrofayli evaliwe endleleni: amapayipi, amabhande, izipringi zocingo, amarayili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba \u003Cstrong\u003Eindlela\u003C/strong\u003E ngeskethi eyodwa: imigqa namajika ahlanganiswe ekugcineni (noma sebenzisa imiphetho yemodeli, ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphrofayli\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye iskethi, indiza yayo edlula ekuqaleni kwendlela; isibonelo umjikelezo endizeni ephezulu ekuqaleni kwendlela edwetshwe endizeni yangaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iskethi yephrofayli bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E. Eyeskethi yakamuva kakhulu enye ibe yindlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEphaneli:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho esikwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThikha iskethi eyenza indlela (iskethi eziningi zihlanganiswa ekugcineni zibe indlela eyodwa ye-3D); \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha imiphetho yemodeli\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza imiphetho yengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsiqondiso\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandela indlela (okuzenzakalelayo), Frenet, Fixed (izigaba zihlala zilingana nephrofayli), Gcina isiqondiso, Ngokuya kwegogo lomqondisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali sokuphela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrofayli ikhula noma incipha ngokulingana ibe lobu bukhulu ekugcineni (1 = ngokungashintshi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhona abukhali endleleni ahlanganiswa ngendlela ye-mitre. Isangqa esinesidikiba esingu-5 esihamba emgqeni ongu-100 mm singusilinda oyi-2500π mm³ ngokunembile; ngohlangothi lwe-arc yekota enesidikiba esingu-50, kuyi-torus yekota ye-625π² mm³.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"loft\"\u003ELoft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-loft ixuba phakathi kwezigaba ezimbili noma ngaphezulu ezisezindizeni ezihlukene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba isigaba ngasinye ngeskethi yaso (ilupu elilodwa elivaliwe ngalinye), ezindizeni ezisisekelo, ezindizeni zereferensi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EIzindiza zereferensi, ama-axis namaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E) noma ezinhlangothini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke iskethi enelupu elilodwa okungasetshenziswanga iba yisigaba, ngokuya komlando.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEphaneli kudweshwa izigaba ngokulandelana (\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu\u003C/strong\u003E iyazihlela kabusha, \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E isusa eyodwa); \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza iskethi\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza enye iskethi, \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha ubuso\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza ubuso obuyisicaba bengxenye. \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso oqondile\u003C/strong\u003E yenza izinhlangothi eziyisicaba phakathi kwezigaba esikhundleni sokuxuba okubushelelezi. Phakathi kwezikwele ezimbili, zombili ziyi-frustum efanayo (isikwele esingu-40 mm sibe esingu-20 mm ngobude obungu-30 mm: ngokunembile ngu-28000 mm³).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzigaba ezinenani elihlukile lamacala (isikwele kuya kwetriangle) zihlanganiswa yi-OpenCascade, engagoqa izinhlangothi ezisecaleni; isici siyakuxwayisa. Dweba izigaba ezinenani elifanayo lamacala, uqale emakhoneni afanayo, ukuze uthole umphumela ohlanzekile kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"imigqa-yokuqondisa\"\u003EImigqa yokuqondisa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yokuqondisa yizigxobo ezigcina izinhlangothi ze-loft zilandela kusuka esigabeni sokuqala kuya esokugcina, ukuze ufake ukugoba, ukuncipha noma ukukhula okudwetshwe wena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba imigqa emibili noma ngaphezulu: amajika avulekile (imigqa, ama-arc, ama-spline) asuka esigabeni sokuqala aye esokugcina futhi adlule kusigaba ngasinye kanye. Iskethi eyodwa ingaba nemigqa eminingi: lonke uchungechunge olwehlukile kuyo luba ngumgqa wayo. Dweba umgqa ukuze uhlangane ngempela nesigaba ngasinye: sondeza amaphoyinti awo aphelile kumaphoyinti ezigaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yokuqondisa\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli ye-Loft, thikha iziskethi eziwubambayo, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho yemodeli njengemigqa yokuqondisa\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza imiphetho yengxenye (u-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uyaqeda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemigqa yokuqondisa i-loft iba yi-Gordon surface edlula ezigabeni nasemigqeni (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/gordon-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/gordon-surfaces\"\u003EIzindawo ezidlula kunethiwekhi yamajika\u003C/a\u003E), ivalwe ngokuqinile ngamagceke womabili ibe yisolidi. Ipanele ithi ilandela kanjani kahle. Yonke isigaba kumele-ke ibe iskethi (iphoyinti noma ubuso akukwazi ukuthatha umgqa), futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso oqondile\u003C/strong\u003E ayisebenzi. Umgqa ophuthuka isigaba ngaphezu kuka-0.01 mm uyenqatshwa, kuboniswe igebe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhlolwe: amasangqa amabili (20 mm no-10 mm ububanzi phakathi kuka-40 mm) nemigqa eqondile emine inikeza umthamo we-frustum yekhoni ngaphakathi kuka-0.000002 %; ama-arc aphuma ngo-5 mm anikeza ibhegu elilandela yonke imigqa ngaphakathi kuka-0.00001 mm.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlaka\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlaka luthambisa izinhlangothi ukuze ingxenye iphume esikhunjeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E (noma bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoze izinhlangothi kuqala). Uma ungakakhethi lutho usemodi yokukhetha: chofoza ngayinye ubuso ofuna ukuthambisa, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndiza engathathi hlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E (lapho izinhlangothi zigcina usayizi wazo) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsiqondiso sokudonsa\u003C/strong\u003E (ukujika kwendiza engathathi hlangothi ngokuzenzakalelayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkona elihle lithambisa ubuso ngaphakathi endleleni yokudonsa futhi lisuse impahla; elingalungile liyengeza. Indiza engathathi hlangothi iqala njengendiza ethi Top. Kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela zingathanjiswa: isilinda, i-cone noma ubuso be-freeform bathi &quot;Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).&quot; Izinhlangothi ezine zebhulokhi ka-100 × 100 × 50 zithanjiswe nge-5° ngokuzungeza phansi kwayo ziba yi-frustum yangempela h/3·(a² + b² + ab), nge-b = a − 2h·tan 5°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imilayezo\"\u003EImilayezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Indiza yephrofayli kumele idlule kwesinye seziphetho zendlela …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa iskethi yephrofayli ekuqaleni (noma ekugcineni) kwendlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Indlela inesikhala: amajika ayo awahlanganisi ekugcineni …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlanganisa amajika endlela; ezikethini ezihlukene iziphetho kumele zihlangane ngokunembile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Isigaba se-loft kumele sibe nelupu elilodwa elivaliwe&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlukanisa iskethi, noma susa ilupu elengeziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… akukwazi ukuthanjiswa ngale ndiza engathathi hlangothi …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso bulingana nendiza engathathi hlangothi noma abuhlangani nayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso okhethiwe bugoqekile. Susa, uthambise izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkikakhiwa okwamanje: ama-sweep ajikayo, ama-sweep ezindonga ezincane nezindawo, imigqa yokuqondisa ye-loft nokuthinta ekugcineni, uhlaka ezinhlangothini ezisikiwe, ema-cone nasezindaweni ze-freeform.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kule nguqulo i-sweep ne-loft azikakhiwa: zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft. Okungakakhiwa okwamanje kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho; izigaba ze-Sweep ne-Loft zichaza ukuthi zisebenza kanjani nge-kernel eqondile. Uhlaka luyasebenza ezindaweni eziyisicaba: i-mesh kernel iyakwakha, nomphumela ofanayo i-kernel eqondile iwunikeza. Zonke ntathu zisemenywini ethi Okwengeziwe yeqembu le-Features (bona I-mesh kernel). Ngayinye ingangeza impahla, iyisuse, igcine kuphela ukuhlangana (Ukuhlangana) noma yenze Umzimba omusha (sweep ne-loft: Ukusebenza ephaneli). Sweep I-sweep ihambisa iphrofayli evaliwe endleleni: amapayipi, amabhande, izipringi zocingo, amarayili. Dweba indlela ngeskethi eyodwa: imigqa namajika ahlanganiswe ekugcineni (noma sebenzisa imiphetho yemodeli, ngezansi). Dweba iphrofayli kwenye iskethi, indiza yayo edlula ekuqaleni kwendlela; isibonelo umjikelezo endizeni ephezulu ekuqaleni kwendlela edwetshwe endizeni yangaphambili. Khetha iskethi yephrofayli bese ukhetha Okwengeziwe, bese Sweep. Eyeskethi yakamuva kakhulu enye ibe yindlela. Ephaneli: Isilungiselelo Lokho esikwenzayo Indlela Thikha iskethi eyenza indlela (iskethi eziningi zihlanganiswa ekugcineni zibe indlela eyodwa ye-3D); Khetha imiphetho yemodeli yengeza imiphetho yengxenye Isiqondiso Landela indlela (okuzenzakalelayo), Frenet, Fixed (izigaba zihlala zilingana nephrofayli), Gcina isiqondiso, Ngokuya kwegogo lomqondisi Isikali sokuphela Iphrofayli ikhula noma incipha ngokulingana ibe lobu bukhulu ekugcineni (1 = ngokungashintshi) Amakhona abukhali endleleni ahlanganiswa ngendlela ye-mitre. Isangqa esinesidikiba esingu-5 esihamba emgqeni ongu-100 mm singusilinda oyi-2500π mm³ ngokunembile; ngohlangothi lwe-arc yekota enesidikiba esingu-50, kuyi-torus yekota ye-625π² mm³. Loft I-loft ixuba phakathi kwezigaba ezimbili noma ngaphezulu ezisezindizeni ezihlukene. Dweba isigaba ngasinye ngeskethi yaso (ilupu elilodwa elivaliwe ngalinye), ezindizeni ezisisekelo, ezindizeni zereferensi (bona Izindiza zereferensi, ama-axis namaphoyinti) noma ezinhlangothini. Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Loft. Yonke iskethi enelupu elilodwa okungasetshenziswanga iba yisigaba, ngokuya komlando. Ephaneli kudweshwa izigaba ngokulandelana (Phezulu iyazihlela kabusha, Susa isusa eyodwa); Engeza iskethi yengeza enye iskethi, Khetha ubuso yengeza ubuso obuyisicaba bengxenye. Ubuso oqondile yenza izinhlangothi eziyisicaba phakathi kwezigaba esikhundleni sokuxuba okubushelelezi. Phakathi kwezikwele ezimbili, zombili ziyi-frustum efanayo (isikwele esingu-40 mm sibe esingu-20 mm ngobude obungu-30 mm: ngokunembile ngu-28000 mm³). Izigaba ezinenani elihlukile lamacala (isikwele kuya kwetriangle) zihlanganiswa yi-OpenCascade, engagoqa izinhlangothi ezisecaleni; isici siyakuxwayisa. Dweba izigaba ezinenani elifanayo lamacala, uqale emakhoneni afanayo, ukuze uthole umphumela ohlanzekile kakhulu. Imigqa yokuqondisa Imigqa yokuqondisa yizigxobo ezigcina izinhlangothi ze-loft zilandela kusuka esigabeni sokuqala kuya esokugcina, ukuze ufake ukugoba, ukuncipha noma ukukhula okudwetshwe wena. Dweba imigqa emibili noma ngaphezulu: amajika avulekile (imigqa, ama-arc, ama-spline) asuka esigabeni sokuqala aye esokugcina futhi adlule kusigaba ngasinye kanye. Iskethi eyodwa ingaba nemigqa eminingi: lonke uchungechunge olwehlukile kuyo luba ngumgqa wayo. Dweba umgqa ukuze uhlangane ngempela nesigaba ngasinye: sondeza amaphoyinti awo aphelile kumaphoyinti ezigaba. Ngaphansi kwe-Imigqa yokuqondisa ephaneli ye-Loft, thikha iziskethi eziwubambayo, noma chofoza Khetha imiphetho yemodeli njengemigqa yokuqondisa bese uchofoza imiphetho yengxenye (u-Esc uyaqeda). Ngemigqa yokuqondisa i-loft iba yi-Gordon surface edlula ezigabeni nasemigqeni (bona Izindawo ezidlula kunethiwekhi yamajika), ivalwe ngokuqinile ngamagceke womabili ibe yisolidi. Ipanele ithi ilandela kanjani kahle. Yonke isigaba kumele-ke ibe iskethi (iphoyinti noma ubuso akukwazi ukuthatha umgqa), futhi Ubuso oqondile ayisebenzi. Umgqa ophuthuka isigaba ngaphezu kuka-0.01 mm uyenqatshwa, kuboniswe igebe. Kuhlolwe: amasangqa amabili (20 mm no-10 mm ububanzi phakathi kuka-40 mm) nemigqa eqondile emine inikeza umthamo we-frustum yekhoni ngaphakathi kuka-0.000002 %; ama-arc aphuma ngo-5 mm anikeza ibhegu elilandela yonke imigqa ngaphakathi kuka-0.00001 mm. Uhlaka Uhlaka luthambisa izinhlangothi ukuze ingxenye iphume esikhunjeni. Khetha Okwengeziwe, bese Uhlaka (noma bamba Shift uchofoze izinhlangothi kuqala). Uma ungakakhethi lutho usemodi yokukhetha: chofoza ngayinye ubuso ofuna ukuthambisa, bese Kuqediwe. Setha Ikona (°), i-Indiza engathathi hlangothi (lapho izinhlangothi zigcina usayizi wazo) ne-Isiqondiso sokudonsa (ukujika kwendiza engathathi hlangothi ngokuzenzakalelayo). Ikona elihle lithambisa ubuso ngaphakathi endleleni yokudonsa futhi lisuse impahla; elingalungile liyengeza. Indiza engathathi hlangothi iqala njengendiza ethi Top. Kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela zingathanjiswa: isilinda, i-cone noma ubuso be-freeform bathi \"Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).\" Izinhlangothi ezine zebhulokhi ka-100 × 100 × 50 zithanjiswe nge-5° ngokuzungeza phansi kwayo ziba yi-frustum yangempela h/3·(a² + b² + ab), nge-b = a − 2h·tan 5°. Imilayezo Umlayezo Yenzani \"Indiza yephrofayli kumele idlule kwesinye seziphetho zendlela …\" Hambisa iskethi yephrofayli ekuqaleni (noma ekugcineni) kwendlela \"Indlela inesikhala: amajika ayo awahlanganisi ekugcineni …\" Hlanganisa amajika endlela; ezikethini ezihlukene iziphetho kumele zihlangane ngokunembile \"Isigaba se-loft kumele sibe nelupu elilodwa elivaliwe\" Hlukanisa iskethi, noma susa ilupu elengeziwe \"… akukwazi ukuthanjiswa ngale ndiza engathathi hlangothi …\" Ubuso bulingana nendiza engathathi hlangothi noma abuhlangani nayo \"Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).\" Ubuso okhethiwe bugoqekile. Susa, uthambise izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela Akikakhiwa okwamanje: ama-sweep ajikayo, ama-sweep ezindonga ezincane nezindawo, imigqa yokuqondisa ye-loft nokuthinta ekugcineni, uhlaka ezinhlangothini ezisikiwe, ema-cone nasezindaweni ze-freeform.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"fillet-chamfer-shell","scope":"partcraft","title":"Jikeleza, gobisa nokwenza kube yisikhwama nge-Fillet, Chamfer ne-Shell","summary":"Khetha imiphetho bese wengeza ama-fillet anobubanzi obuhlala njalo noma obuguquguqukayo namachamfer alinganayo, amabanga amabili noma ibanga nengonyama; yenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama nge-Shell ngokukhetha izinhlangothi ozovula, shintsha imiphetho noma izinhlangothi isici esizisebenzisayo, bese ulungisa izinkinga ezivamile.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["fillet","jikeleza","hlanganisa","chamfer","gobisa","shell","isikhwama","ubukhulu bodonga","imiphetho","izinhlangothi","khetha imiphetho","shift click","vula ubuso","i-kernel eqondile","i-mesh kernel","akukakhiwa"],"headings":[{"id":"jikeleza-noma-gobisa-imiphetho","text":"Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imiphetho-kuqala","text":"Khetha imiphetho kuqala","level":3},{"id":"noma-engeza-isici-kuqala","text":"Noma engeza isici kuqala","level":3},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":3},{"id":"ama-fillet-aguquguqukayo-nezinhlobo-ze-chamfer","text":"Ama-fillet aguquguqukayo nezinhlobo ze-chamfer","level":3},{"id":"yenza-ingxenye-ibe-yisikhwama","text":"Yenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama","level":2},{"id":"ukuhleleka-kubalulekile","text":"Ukuhleleka kubalulekile","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kwehluleka","text":"Lapho kwehluleka","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKule nguqulo\u003C/strong\u003E i-PartCraft yakha ama-fillet nama-chamfer nge-mesh kernel, kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe: amaphethelo ebhokisi nemiphetho eqondile yokukhipha nokusika, amakhona angaphandle noma angaphakathi (ikhona ngaphakathi lapho kungezwa impahla). Imiphetho ejikelezayo njengemiphetho yemigodi, nobubanzi obushintsha ngaphezu komphetho, akukakhiwa okwamanje. Lapho imiphetho emibili ejikelezayo ihlangana ekhoneni, ukujikeleza kuyasikwa (kuhlangana kumgodi obukhali), kungaxutshwa. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EShell\u003C/strong\u003E nayo isebenza, yakhiwe yi-mesh kernel: ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela, izikhwama zobukhulu bodonga obuhlukene azikakhiwa okwamanje, futhi ishesha kakhulu ezingxenyeni ezinezinhlangothi eziningi ezijikelezayo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ijikeleza imiphetho, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E iyigobisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E yenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama. Zonke ntathu zisebenza emaphethelweni nasezinhlangothini zesolidi futhi zakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Ukujikeleza kwazo kwenziwa ngobuso njengazo zonke izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo (\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ilawula ukuthi zincane kangakanani); izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo yizilinda ongazikhetha futhi ulinganise (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jikeleza-noma-gobisa-imiphetho\"\u003EJikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"khetha-imiphetho-kuqala\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho kuqala\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho wengxenye. Umphetho wonke uyakhanya, futhi iphaneli yangakwesokudla ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo lwawo (Oqondile, Isiyingi noma ihlamvu, Ijika), ubude, nezinhlangothi ayisendiswe phakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkwengeza eminye imiphetho, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza yona. Ngayinye iyamakwa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza umphetho omakiwe ukuze uwuphonse. Ukuqondwa kwephaneli kubala (“imiphetho engu-4”) nebha yesimo ithi &quot;imiphetho engu-4 ikhethiwe. Fillet noma Chamfer ziyijikeleza; Shift+click ikhetha eminye, Esc isula.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E ebhodini lamathuluzi, noma izinkinobho ezifanayo kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici sengezwa ngayo yonke imiphetho ekhethiwe: ukujikeleza kwe-2 mm, noma i-chamfer ye-1 mm. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, &quot;Fillet1 yengeziwe (imiphetho engu-4). Shintsha usayizi wayo kwesokudla; Khetha imiphetho ishintsha ukuthi yiphi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"noma-engeza-isici-kuqala\"\u003ENoma engeza isici kuqala\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphandle kokukhetha lutho, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft ingena ekukhetheni: ukuqondwa kwephaneli yangakwesokudla kuthi &quot;Fillet1: ukukhetha&quot;, ingxenye ibonakala njengoba yayinjalo ngaphambi kwe-fillet (iphaneli iyakusho lokho), futhi ibhodi lamathuluzi libonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho ngamunye ukuze wengeze; uchofoze futhi ukuze uwuphonse. Ibha yesimo iyawabala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe ukukhetha\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli), noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFillet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, okuzenzakalelayo 2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngasemuva komphetho ezinhlangothini zombili, okuzenzakalelayo 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMangaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMangaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu oluseduze ibiza umphetho ngamunye ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nawo, njengo &quot;Umphetho 1: Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side&quot;. \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E ususa elilodwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela ekukhetheni. Ukuchofoza kabili isici komlando kwenza into efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphetho ikhunjulwa ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo, ngakho ihlala emphethweni ofanele uma ushintsha isilinganiso ngaphambili komlando.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ama-fillet-aguquguqukayo-nezinhlobo-ze-chamfer\"\u003EAma-fillet aguquguqukayo nezinhlobo ze-chamfer\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa oguquguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E (fillet): akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (&quot;I-fillet yobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akukakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike umsantsa oyodwa.&quot;). Ngale-kernel eqondile: tick kuwo bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa wokugcina (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E. Umsantsa uguquka ngokulingana kusuka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa\u003C/strong\u003E kolunye uhlangothi lomphetho ngamunye kuya ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa wokugcina\u003C/strong\u003E kolunye; \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha izinhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E uyaphendula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E (chamfer): \u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga elilinganayo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmabanga amabili\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga lesibili\u003C/strong\u003E kolunye ubuso) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga nengonyama\u003C/strong\u003E (ibanga ebusweni obubodwa, ukugoba ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIngonyama (°)\u003C/strong\u003E kuleso sibuso). \u003Cstrong\u003EFlip sides\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka ibanga lokuqala kolunye ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ingxenye-ibe-yisikhwama\"\u003EYenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe ofuna ukungavala, isibonelo phezulu kwebhokisi. Noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza izinhlangothi eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E ebhodini lamathuluzi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell, evula lobu buso\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli yobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye iba udonga olungu-2 mm, izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe zivulekile. Izilungiselelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUdonga (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbukhulu bodonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga zikhula ngaphandle (izinhlangothi zihlala ngaphakathi)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuticiwe: izindonga zengezwa ngaphandle, ngakho ngaphakathi kugcina usayizi wengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe: izindonga ziya ngaphakathi futhi ngaphandle kugcina usayizi wakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlangothi ezivulekile\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMangaki amabuso asusiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphakathi, izindonga zingobukhulu bodonga ngqo: amakhona angaphandle ahlala abukhali, amakhona angaphakathi aphuma ejikelezile (umsantsa = udonga), nomgodi odlula engxenyeni uthola ithubhu lodonga ozungezile. Ngaphandle, izindonga zengezwa ngaphandle kobuso bokuqala, okuba yisikhwama, nemiphetho yangaphandle iphuma ijikelezile. Izinhlangothi zangaphakathi zithathwa amagama ngokuhlukanisa izinhlangothi ezibekwe kuzo, ngakho ungazikhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlangothi ezithe kuphela zingavulwa: ukukhetha eyodwa egobile kuthi &quot;Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).&quot; I-shell ishesha kancane ezingxenyeni ezinezinhlangothi eziningi ezijikelezayo (amasekhondi ambalwa ngamathrayangula azinkulungwane): sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ancane kakhulu uma uklama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E iyashintsha izinhlangothi ezivulekile, ngendlela efanayo nokukhetha imiphetho. Uhlu lubiza ngayinye, njengo &quot;Ubuso 1: Extrude1 end face&quot;. Ishell engenayo izinhlangothi ezivulekile ayivunyelwe: &quot;Khetha izinhlangothi ezizosuswa (ezivulekile), bese wenza i-shell.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhleleka-kubalulekile\"\u003EUkuhleleka kubalulekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzici zakhiwa phezulu kuya phansi. I-fillet ngaphambi kwe-shell ifakwa i-shell kanye nengxenye, ngakho nangaphakathi kuthola amakhona ajikelezile. I-fillet ngemva kwe-shell ijikeleza kuphela imiphetho oyikhethayo. Hambisa izici nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EShintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphethini nezibonakaliso azikwazi ukukopisha i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell: &quot;Fillet1 ishintsha imiphetho noma udonga lomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. Kopisha izici ezenza izolidi (ukukhipha, ukujikeleza, imigodi, okungeniswe).&quot; Yenza iphethini yemigodi noma yokusika kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet kuyo yonke imiphetho yamakhophi ku-fillet eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kwehluleka\"\u003ELapho kwehluleka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufanele wenze\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A 5 mm round does not fit here (it is too big for a face next to one of the edges, or the edges meet in a corner the kernel cannot blend).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Umzimba ojikelezile we-5 mm awulingani lapha (mkhulu kakhulu ebusweni eliseduze nomphetho owodwa, noma imiphetho ihlangana ekhoneni i-kernel engayixuba).&quot; Sebenzisa umsantsa omncane, noma fillet imiphetho embalwa ngesikhathi (izici eziningi zefillet, eyincane kakhulu ekugcineni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Umphetho esiwujikelezayo unyamalele: umphetho phakathi kuka-Extrude1 na-Cut2.&quot; Ushintsho lwangaphambili luwususile lowo mphetho. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E, susa umphetho obomvu bese ukhetha omusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ishell ayikwazanga ukwenziwa ngalobu bukhulu (…).&quot; Udonga lukhulu kunengxenye emincane yemodeli, noma kunomsantsa we-fillet. Yenza udonga lube mncane, noma ama-fillet abe mkhulu kunodonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That face has no name the history can follow; pick another.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lobo buso alinagama umlando olingalandela; khetha elinye.&quot; Khetha ubuso okwenziwe yisici (ubuso obuningi bunjalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.&quot; (futhi Chamfer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet: kule nguqulo emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyawakha). Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho egobile esikethini.&quot; Umphetho okhethiwe ujikelezile, njengomphetho womgodi, noma ulele ebusweni elijikelezile. Wususe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E, bese ujikeleza noma ugobisa leli khona esikethini kunalokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-fillet yobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akukakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike umsantsa oyodwa.&quot; Susa ukukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsantsa oguquguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.&quot; (⚠ komlando)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho ejikelezile ihlangana iyasikwa, ayixutshwa.&quot; Isexwayiso, hhayi iphutha: ingxenye yakhiwe. Imiphetho ekhethiwe ihlangana ekhoneni, nezijikeleko zihlangana khona ngomgoqo obukhali. Fillet imiphetho embalwa, noma wamukele lowo mgoqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).&quot; Ubuso ovulekile ujikelezile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E bese uwususa; vula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule nguqulo ama-fillet nama-chamfer asebenza kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe, nobubanzi obubodwa, nezijikeleko ezihlangana ekhoneni ziyasikwa. Ama-shell avula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela. Ngale-kernel eqondile, i-fillet eguquguqukayo ishintsha ngokulingana kuwo wonke umphetho (umthetho owodwa ngesici; akukho bubanzi obubekwe emaphoyinti asemphethweni). Ama-fillet obuso, ama-fillet agcwele nama-shell anobukhulu bodonga obuhlukene akukakhiwa okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kule nguqulo i-PartCraft yakha ama-fillet nama-chamfer nge-mesh kernel, kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe: amaphethelo ebhokisi nemiphetho eqondile yokukhipha nokusika, amakhona angaphandle noma angaphakathi (ikhona ngaphakathi lapho kungezwa impahla). Imiphetho ejikelezayo njengemiphetho yemigodi, nobubanzi obushintsha ngaphezu komphetho, akukakhiwa okwamanje. Lapho imiphetho emibili ejikelezayo ihlangana ekhoneni, ukujikeleza kuyasikwa (kuhlangana kumgodi obukhali), kungaxutshwa. I-Shell nayo isebenza, yakhiwe yi-mesh kernel: ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela, izikhwama zobukhulu bodonga obuhlukene azikakhiwa okwamanje, futhi ishesha kakhulu ezingxenyeni ezinezinhlangothi eziningi ezijikelezayo. Bheka Akukakhiwa okwamanje. Fillet ijikeleza imiphetho, Chamfer iyigobisa, Shell yenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama. Zonke ntathu zisebenza emaphethelweni nasezinhlangothini zesolidi futhi zakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Ukujikeleza kwazo kwenziwa ngobuso njengazo zonke izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo (Amajika ilawula ukuthi zincane kangakanani); izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo yizilinda ongazikhetha futhi ulinganise (bheka I-mesh kernel). Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho Khetha imiphetho kuqala Chofoza umphetho wengxenye. Umphetho wonke uyakhanya, futhi iphaneli yangakwesokudla ithi Umphetho: uhlobo lwawo (Oqondile, Isiyingi noma ihlamvu, Ijika), ubude, nezinhlangothi ayisendiswe phakathi kwazo. Ukwengeza eminye imiphetho, Shift+chofoza yona. Ngayinye iyamakwa; Shift+chofoza umphetho omakiwe ukuze uwuphonse. Ukuqondwa kwephaneli kubala (“imiphetho engu-4”) nebha yesimo ithi \"imiphetho engu-4 ikhethiwe. Fillet noma Chamfer ziyijikeleza; Shift+click ikhetha eminye, Esc isula.\" Khetha Fillet noma Chamfer ebhodini lamathuluzi, noma izinkinobho ezifanayo kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla. Isici sengezwa ngayo yonke imiphetho ekhethiwe: ukujikeleza kwe-2 mm, noma i-chamfer ye-1 mm. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, \"Fillet1 yengeziwe (imiphetho engu-4). Shintsha usayizi wayo kwesokudla; Khetha imiphetho ishintsha ukuthi yiphi.\" Noma engeza isici kuqala Ngaphandle kokukhetha lutho, khetha Fillet noma Chamfer. I-PartCraft ingena ekukhetheni: ukuqondwa kwephaneli yangakwesokudla kuthi \"Fillet1: ukukhetha\", ingxenye ibonakala njengoba yayinjalo ngaphambi kwe-fillet (iphaneli iyakusho lokho), futhi ibhodi lamathuluzi libonisa Kuqediwe. Chofoza umphetho ngamunye ukuze wengeze; uchofoze futhi ukuze uwuphonse. Ibha yesimo iyawabala. Khetha Kuqediwe (noma Kuqediwe ukukhetha kwiphaneli), noma cindezela Esc noma Enter. Izilungiselelo Isilungiselelo Fillet Chamfer Usayizi Umsantsa (mm), okuzenzakalelayo 2 Ibanga (mm) ngasemuva komphetho ezinhlangothini zombili, okuzenzakalelayo 1 Imiphetho Mangaki Mangaki Uhlu oluseduze ibiza umphetho ngamunye ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nawo, njengo \"Umphetho 1: Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side\". Susa ususa elilodwa. Khetha imiphetho ibuyela ekukhetheni. Ukuchofoza kabili isici komlando kwenza into efanayo. Imiphetho ikhunjulwa ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo, ngakho ihlala emphethweni ofanele uma ushintsha isilinganiso ngaphambili komlando. Ama-fillet aguquguqukayo nezinhlobo ze-chamfer Umsantsa oguquguqukayo (fillet): akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (\"I-fillet yobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akukakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike umsantsa oyodwa.\"). Ngale-kernel eqondile: tick kuwo bese usetha Umsantsa wokugcina (mm). Umsantsa uguquka ngokulingana kusuka ku-Umsantsa kolunye uhlangothi lomphetho ngamunye kuya ku-Umsantsa wokugcina kolunye; Shintsha izinhlangothi uyaphendula. Uhlobo (chamfer): Ibanga elilinganayo, Amabanga amabili (Ibanga lesibili kolunye ubuso) noma Ibanga nengonyama (ibanga ebusweni obubodwa, ukugoba ku-Ingonyama (°) kuleso sibuso). Flip sides ibeka ibanga lokuqala kolunye ubuso. Yenza ingxenye ibe yisikhwama Chofoza ubuso obuthe ofuna ukungavala, isibonelo phezulu kwebhokisi. Noma Shift+chofoza izinhlangothi eziningi. Khetha Shell ebhodini lamathuluzi, noma Shell, evula lobu buso kwiphaneli yobuso. Ingxenye iba udonga olungu-2 mm, izinhlangothi ezikhethiwe zivulekile. Izilungiselelo: Isilungiselelo Okwenzayo Okuzenzakalelayo Udonga (mm) Ubukhulu bodonga 2 Izindonga zikhula ngaphandle (izinhlangothi zihlala ngaphakathi) Kuticiwe: izindonga zengezwa ngaphandle, ngakho ngaphakathi kugcina usayizi wengxenye Kuvalwe: izindonga ziya ngaphakathi futhi ngaphandle kugcina usayizi wakho Izinhlangothi ezivulekile Mangaki amabuso asusiwe Ngaphakathi, izindonga zingobukhulu bodonga ngqo: amakhona angaphandle ahlala abukhali, amakhona angaphakathi aphuma ejikelezile (umsantsa = udonga), nomgodi odlula engxenyeni uthola ithubhu lodonga ozungezile. Ngaphandle, izindonga zengezwa ngaphandle kobuso bokuqala, okuba yisikhwama, nemiphetho yangaphandle iphuma ijikelezile. Izinhlangothi zangaphakathi zithathwa amagama ngokuhlukanisa izinhlangothi ezibekwe kuzo, ngakho ungazikhetha. Izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela zingavulwa: ukukhetha eyodwa egobile kuthi \"Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).\" I-shell ishesha kancane ezingxenyeni ezinezinhlangothi eziningi ezijikelezayo (amasekhondi ambalwa ngamathrayangula azinkulungwane): sebenzisa Amajika ancane kakhulu uma uklama. Khetha izinhlangothi iyashintsha izinhlangothi ezivulekile, ngendlela efanayo nokukhetha imiphetho. Uhlu lubiza ngayinye, njengo \"Ubuso 1: Extrude1 end face\". Ishell engenayo izinhlangothi ezivulekile ayivunyelwe: \"Khetha izinhlangothi ezizosuswa (ezivulekile), bese wenza i-shell.\" Ukuhleleka kubalulekile Izici zakhiwa phezulu kuya phansi. I-fillet ngaphambi kwe-shell ifakwa i-shell kanye nengxenye, ngakho nangaphakathi kuthola amakhona ajikelezile. I-fillet ngemva kwe-shell ijikeleza kuphela imiphetho oyikhethayo. Hambisa izici nge-Hambisa phezulu ne-Hambisa phansi (bheka Shintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo). Amaphethini nezibonakaliso azikwazi ukukopisha i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell: \"Fillet1 ishintsha imiphetho noma udonga lomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. Kopisha izici ezenza izolidi (ukukhipha, ukujikeleza, imigodi, okungeniswe).\" Yenza iphethini yemigodi noma yokusika kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet kuyo yonke imiphetho yamakhophi ku-fillet eyodwa. Lapho kwehluleka Umyalezo Okufanele wenze \"A 5 mm round does not fit here (it is too big for a face next to one of the edges, or the edges meet in a corner the kernel cannot blend).\" \"Umzimba ojikelezile we-5 mm awulingani lapha (mkhulu kakhulu ebusweni eliseduze nomphetho owodwa, noma imiphetho ihlangana ekhoneni i-kernel engayixuba).\" Sebenzisa umsantsa omncane, noma fillet imiphetho embalwa ngesikhathi (izici eziningi zefillet, eyincane kakhulu ekugcineni) \"An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.\" \"Umphetho esiwujikelezayo unyamalele: umphetho phakathi kuka-Extrude1 na-Cut2.\" Ushintsho lwangaphambili luwususile lowo mphetho. Khetha Khetha imiphetho, susa umphetho obomvu bese ukhetha omusha \"The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).\" \"Ishell ayikwazanga ukwenziwa ngalobu bukhulu (…).\" Udonga lukhulu kunengxenye emincane yemodeli, noma kunomsantsa we-fillet. Yenza udonga lube mncane, noma ama-fillet abe mkhulu kunodonga \"That face has no name the history can follow; pick another.\" \"Lobo buso alinagama umlando olingalandela; khetha elinye.\" Khetha ubuso okwenziwe yisici (ubuso obuningi bunjalo) \"Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.\" (futhi Chamfer) \"Fillet: kule nguqulo emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyawakha). Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho egobile esikethini.\" Umphetho okhethiwe ujikelezile, njengomphetho womgodi, noma ulele ebusweni elijikelezile. Wususe nge-Khetha imiphetho, bese ujikeleza noma ugobisa leli khona esikethini kunalokho \"A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.\" \"I-fillet yobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akukakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike umsantsa oyodwa.\" Susa ukukhetha Umsantsa oguquguqukayo \"Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.\" (⚠ komlando) \"I-fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho ejikelezile ihlangana iyasikwa, ayixutshwa.\" Isexwayiso, hhayi iphutha: ingxenye yakhiwe. Imiphetho ekhethiwe ihlangana ekhoneni, nezijikeleko zihlangana khona ngomgoqo obukhali. Fillet imiphetho embalwa, noma wamukele lowo mgoqo \"Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\" \"Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).\" Ubuso ovulekile ujikelezile. Khetha izinhlangothi bese uwususa; vula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela Imikhawulo Kule nguqulo ama-fillet nama-chamfer asebenza kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe, nobubanzi obubodwa, nezijikeleko ezihlangana ekhoneni ziyasikwa. Ama-shell avula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela. Ngale-kernel eqondile, i-fillet eguquguqukayo ishintsha ngokulingana kuwo wonke umphetho (umthetho owodwa ngesici; akukho bubanzi obubekwe emaphoyinti asemphethweni). Ama-fillet obuso, ama-fillet agcwele nama-shell anobukhulu bodonga obuhlukene akukakhiwa okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"import-step","scope":"partcraft","title":"Vula ifayela le-STEP nakha kulo","summary":"Letha imodeli ye-STEP yomhlinzeki noma yenye iprogram ye-CAD ku-PartCraft njengomzimba oqinile, njengengxenye entsha noma yengezwe kwengxenye yamanje, uhlele ukuthi iyiphi indlela ephezulu, bese wengeza amasikethi nezici kuyo.","section":"tasks","order":87,"keywords":["step","stp","ukungenisa","vula i-step","ap203","ap214","ap242","imodeli yomhlinzeki","isolidi elingenamlando","isolidi elingeniswe","indlela ephezulu","z phezulu","y phezulu","izinxantathu","izinhlaka","inhlanganisela ye-step"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ifayela-le-step","text":"Vula ifayela le-STEP","level":2},{"id":"ifayela-le-step-lenhlanganisela","text":"Ifayela le-STEP lenhlanganisela","level":2},{"id":"setha-ukuthi-yiphi-indlela-ephezulu","text":"Setha ukuthi yiphi indlela ephezulu","level":2},{"id":"yakha-phezu-kwalo","text":"Yakha phezu kwalo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kugcinwa-khona","text":"Lapho kugcinwa khona","level":2},{"id":"imilayezo","text":"Imilayezo","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ivula amafayela e-STEP (\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E, AP203, AP214 kanye ne-AP242) njengezindikimba \u003Cstrong\u003Ezomzimba oqinile\u003C/strong\u003E ongakhela phezu kwawo amasikethi, ukusika, ukubhoboza nokuwahlanganisa nezici zakho. Umzimba awunawo umlando wawo: awukwazi ukushintsha izilinganiso ayenziwe ngazo, ungawengeza noma usike kuwo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft lwakha zonke izingxenye ngomshini we-mesh, ngakho ifayela le-STEP \u003Cstrong\u003Elifundwa njengezinxantathu\u003C/strong\u003E: izindawo ezithe tshe ziyahlala zithe tshe, kanti izindawo ezigobile (amasilinda, ama-cone, amabhola, ama-torus, izindawo ze-B-spline) ziba izindawo ezincane eziphansi eziningi. Ivolumu yayo ingaphakathi kwengxenyana yephesenti eliqondile. Ukugcina izindawo ezigobile ngokuqondile kudinga i-exact kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ifayela-le-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese ukhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E. Noma lilahle kumbono we-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft iyalifunda ifayela ibonise okutholiwe, isibonelo: &quot;Ifayela le-AP214: isolidi elingu-1, ubuso obungu-10, lifundwe njengezinxantathu.&quot; Ngezansi kukhona inani lezinxantathu, noma yini eyashiywa noma eyahlanganiswa, nokuthi umphumela uyavaliwa yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kwifayela\u003C/strong\u003E. Ifayela le-STEP litshela iyunithi yalo (amamillimitha, amayintshi, amamitha…); i-PartCraft iyiguqula ibe ngamamillimitha, ngakho \u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi kwifayela\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa Amamillimitha, &quot;ifayela lisho njalo&quot;. \u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu lapha\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ukuthi izoba mkhulu kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula njengomzimba\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole ingxenye engenalutho, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza kule ngxenye\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye entsha\u003C/span\u003E uma ingxenye isivele ineziphawu. Ukungeza kubuza ukuthi \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E yenzeni: engeza, sika, noma gcina ukuhlangana kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici se-\u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E siyavela emlandweni, nebha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, &quot;plate.step ingumzimba oqinile: 57995.937 mm³, izindawo eziphansi ezi-6 ongabhala kuzo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela-le-step-lenhlanganisela\"\u003EIfayela le-STEP lenhlanganisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhlanganisela ifika njengomzimba owodwa ngayo yonke ingxenye lapho ifayela liyibeka khona (&quot;izingxenye ezi-3 ezibekwe kufayela zifika lapho zimi khona&quot;). Ingxenye esetshenziswe kabili ifika kabili. Amagama ezingxenye nesihlahla senhlanganisela ayigcinwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-ukuthi-yiphi-indlela-ephezulu\"\u003ESetha ukuthi yiphi indlela ephezulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD zisebenzisa Z phezulu; i-PartCraft isebenzisa Y phezulu. Ngokuzenzakalelayo i-PartCraft iyiguqula ifayela ukuze i-Z yalo ibheke phezulu lapha. Uma ingxenye ifika ilele ngecala, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kwifayela\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EY phezulu\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi kwifayela\u003C/strong\u003E nelithi \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E nakho kungashintshwa lapho; ngalunye lushintsho lusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yakha-phezu-kwalo\"\u003EYakha phezu kwalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe tshe bomzimba bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch kulobu buso\u003C/span\u003E. Ubuso obuthe tshe besimodeli se-STEP bugcina indawo yabo lapho umzimba wakhiwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza ukusika, izimbobo, izigaxa, amaphethini nezibuko njengakunoma yiyiphi ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola usayizi wayo ebhokisini \u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E: ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuzungeza, ama-chamfer kanye nama-shell kudinga i-exact kernel, njengakuyo yonke ingxenye kulolu hlobo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kugcinwa-khona\"\u003ELapho kugcinwa khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinxantathu zigcinwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E kwefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho ifayela lengxenye liziphelele: awudingi ifayela le-STEP futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imilayezo\"\u003EImilayezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;&quot;part.stp&quot; akuyona ifayela le-STEP (aliqali nge-ISO-10303-21).&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela alisona umbhalo we-STEP ovamile. Cela umthumeli ifayela le-STEP le-AP203, AP214 noma AP242\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ifayela le-STEP alikwazanga ukufundwa: isigaba sedatha sishoda noma senziwe kabi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela liqunjiwe noma lonakele. Likopishe futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ifayela le-STEP alinawo umzimba oqinile noma wobuso: akukho okuzongeniswa.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela liqukethe kuphela imidwebo, amaphoyinti noma idatha. Cela isolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-STEP likhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwe-60 MB) ukuthi lingeniswe lapha.&quot; nezinye izinqumo zomfundi (izingenisi, ubuso, izinxantathu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza imodeli ibe lula emthonjeni, noma uthumele izingxenye ngayinye ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… imigqa elonakele efayelweni yadlulwa.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa ethile ayifundeki; eyasele yeza. Hlola umzimba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… ubuso abuguqulwanga bube yizinxantathu futhi bushiywe ngaphandle.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELobo buso buhlala ngamagalelo, ePartCraft izama ukuwagcwalisa; uma umzimba ungavaleki, awungezwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… ubuso bohlobo olungafundeki (…) buphuthelwe.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo olungavamile lobuso. Cela imodeli enobuso obuthe tshe noma be-B-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ayivali …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso abuyenzi isolidi evaliwe (imodeli yobuso, noma ubuso obushiyiwe). I-PartCraft ibonisa izimbobo futhi ayengezi lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obugobile budwetshwa futhi bulinganiswe njengezinhlaka ezincane, njengakuyo yonke ingxenye lolu hlobo lwakha. I-PartCraft igcina ubuso obuthe tshe, amasilinda, ama-cone, amabhola nama-torus efayela ngomzimba, ngakho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela njengezindawo ezigobile zangempela, izimbobo njengezimbobo, kanye nezici ozengeze. Ubuso efayela elinikezwa njenge-splines, ama-sweep noma izindawo zokujikeleza ihlala iyizinhlaka ekuthumeleni. Ingxenye elondolozwe ngaphambi kuka-0.9.1 ayinawo ubuso olugcinwe: vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze uthole lona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E ngobuso obuthe tshe obukhethiwe ibhala isimbobo esijikayo sefayela njengesiyingi esiqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImibala, amagama emizimba, isakhiwo senhlanganisela kanye ne-PMI (ukubekezelela okusefayelini) akufundwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphandle kwe-STEP, i-PartCraft ivula izimesh ze-STL, OBJ ne-3MF (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, OBJ noma 3MF\u003C/a\u003E) kanye namafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E) njengezimzimba eziqinile. Amafayela e-IGES nawezinye izinhlelo zohlobo lwazo lwendabuko awasekelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye enesolidi ye-STEP eyengeziwe ngenguqulo enomshini oqinile igcina umbhalo we-STEP; le nguqulo iyayeqa leso sici (&quot;akakakhiwa&quot;). Vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze ulingenise njengezinxantathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ivula amafayela e-STEP (.step noma .stp, AP203, AP214 kanye ne-AP242) njengezindikimba zomzimba oqinile ongakhela phezu kwawo amasikethi, ukusika, ukubhoboza nokuwahlanganisa nezici zakho. Umzimba awunawo umlando wawo: awukwazi ukushintsha izilinganiso ayenziwe ngazo, ungawengeza noma usike kuwo kuphela. Lolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft lwakha zonke izingxenye ngomshini we-mesh, ngakho ifayela le-STEP lifundwa njengezinxantathu: izindawo ezithe tshe ziyahlala zithe tshe, kanti izindawo ezigobile (amasilinda, ama-cone, amabhola, ama-torus, izindawo ze-B-spline) ziba izindawo ezincane eziphansi eziningi. Ivolumu yayo ingaphakathi kwengxenyana yephesenti eliqondile. Ukugcina izindawo ezigobile ngokuqondile kudinga i-exact kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo. Vula ifayela le-STEP Khetha Vula noma cindezela Ctrl+O, bese ukhetha ifayela le-.step noma .stp. Noma lilahle kumbono we-3D. I-PartCraft iyalifunda ifayela ibonise okutholiwe, isibonelo: \"Ifayela le-AP214: isolidi elingu-1, ubuso obungu-10, lifundwe njengezinxantathu.\" Ngezansi kukhona inani lezinxantathu, noma yini eyashiywa noma eyahlanganiswa, nokuthi umphumela uyavaliwa yini. Hlola Phezulu kwifayela. Ifayela le-STEP litshela iyunithi yalo (amamillimitha, amayintshi, amamitha…); i-PartCraft iyiguqula ibe ngamamillimitha, ngakho Amayunithi kwifayela ibonisa Amamillimitha, \"ifayela lisho njalo\". Ubukhulu lapha ibonisa ukuthi izoba mkhulu kangakanani. Khetha Vula njengomzimba ukuze uthole ingxenye engenalutho, noma Yengeza kule ngxenye / Ingxenye entsha uma ingxenye isivele ineziphawu. Ukungeza kubuza ukuthi Sebenzisa ukuze yenzeni: engeza, sika, noma gcina ukuhlangana kuphela. Isici se-Imported1 siyavela emlandweni, nebha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, \"plate.step ingumzimba oqinile: 57995.937 mm³, izindawo eziphansi ezi-6 ongabhala kuzo.\" Ifayela le-STEP lenhlanganisela Inhlanganisela ifika njengomzimba owodwa ngayo yonke ingxenye lapho ifayela liyibeka khona (\"izingxenye ezi-3 ezibekwe kufayela zifika lapho zimi khona\"). Ingxenye esetshenziswe kabili ifika kabili. Amagama ezingxenye nesihlahla senhlanganisela ayigcinwa. Setha ukuthi yiphi indlela ephezulu Izinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD zisebenzisa Z phezulu; i-PartCraft isebenzisa Y phezulu. Ngokuzenzakalelayo i-PartCraft iyiguqula ifayela ukuze i-Z yalo ibheke phezulu lapha. Uma ingxenye ifika ilele ngecala, khetha Imported1 bese usetha Phezulu kwifayela ibe Y phezulu. Amayunithi kwifayela nelithi Sebenzisa ukuze nakho kungashintshwa lapho; ngalunye lushintsho lusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Yakha phezu kwalo Chofoza ubuso obuthe tshe bomzimba bese ukhetha Sketch kulobu buso. Ubuso obuthe tshe besimodeli se-STEP bugcina indawo yabo lapho umzimba wakhiwa kabusha. Engeza ukusika, izimbobo, izigaxa, amaphethini nezibuko njengakunoma yiyiphi ingxenye. Hlola usayizi wayo ebhokisini Ingxenye: ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi. Ukuzungeza, ama-chamfer kanye nama-shell kudinga i-exact kernel, njengakuyo yonke ingxenye kulolu hlobo (I-mesh kernel). Lapho kugcinwa khona Izinxantathu zigcinwa phakathi kwefayela le-.partcraft.json, ngakho ifayela lengxenye liziphelele: awudingi ifayela le-STEP futhi. Imilayezo Umlayezo Okusho '\"part.stp\" akuyona ifayela le-STEP (aliqali nge-ISO-10303-21).' Ifayela alisona umbhalo we-STEP ovamile. Cela umthumeli ifayela le-STEP le-AP203, AP214 noma AP242 \"Ifayela le-STEP alikwazanga ukufundwa: isigaba sedatha sishoda noma senziwe kabi.\" Ifayela liqunjiwe noma lonakele. Likopishe futhi \"Ifayela le-STEP alinawo umzimba oqinile noma wobuso: akukho okuzongeniswa.\" Ifayela liqukethe kuphela imidwebo, amaphoyinti noma idatha. Cela isolidi \"Leli fayela le-STEP likhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwe-60 MB) ukuthi lingeniswe lapha.\" nezinye izinqumo zomfundi (izingenisi, ubuso, izinxantathu) Yenza imodeli ibe lula emthonjeni, noma uthumele izingxenye ngayinye ngayinye \"… imigqa elonakele efayelweni yadlulwa.\" Imigqa ethile ayifundeki; eyasele yeza. Hlola umzimba \"… ubuso abuguqulwanga bube yizinxantathu futhi bushiywe ngaphandle.\" Lobo buso buhlala ngamagalelo, ePartCraft izama ukuwagcwalisa; uma umzimba ungavaleki, awungezwa \"… ubuso bohlobo olungafundeki (…) buphuthelwe.\" Uhlobo olungavamile lobuso. Cela imodeli enobuso obuthe tshe noma be-B-spline \"Ayivali …\" Ubuso abuyenzi isolidi evaliwe (imodeli yobuso, noma ubuso obushiyiwe). I-PartCraft ibonisa izimbobo futhi ayengezi lutho Imikhawulo Ubuso obugobile budwetshwa futhi bulinganiswe njengezinhlaka ezincane, njengakuyo yonke ingxenye lolu hlobo lwakha. I-PartCraft igcina ubuso obuthe tshe, amasilinda, ama-cone, amabhola nama-torus efayela ngomzimba, ngakho Thumela › STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile) ibuyisela njengezindawo ezigobile zangempela, izimbobo njengezimbobo, kanye nezici ozengeze. Ubuso efayela elinikezwa njenge-splines, ama-sweep noma izindawo zokujikeleza ihlala iyizinhlaka ekuthumeleni. Ingxenye elondolozwe ngaphambi kuka-0.9.1 ayinawo ubuso olugcinwe: vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze uthole lona. Thumela › DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe ngobuso obuthe tshe obukhethiwe ibhala isimbobo esijikayo sefayela njengesiyingi esiqondile. Imibala, amagama emizimba, isakhiwo senhlanganisela kanye ne-PMI (ukubekezelela okusefayelini) akufundwa. Ngaphandle kwe-STEP, i-PartCraft ivula izimesh ze-STL, OBJ ne-3MF (Vula i-STL, OBJ noma 3MF) kanye namafayela e-.3dm (Vula imodeli ye-.3dm) njengezimzimba eziqinile. Amafayela e-IGES nawezinye izinhlelo zohlobo lwazo lwendabuko awasekelwe. Ingxenye enesolidi ye-STEP eyengeziwe ngenguqulo enomshini oqinile igcina umbhalo we-STEP; le nguqulo iyayeqa leso sici (\"akakakhiwa\"). Vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze ulingenise njengezinxantathu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"solidworks-exchange","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hambisa izingxenye ukuya nokusuka kubenzi bezingxenye abanye","summary":"Thumela ingxenye kumenzi wezingxenye omunye njenge-macro eyakha kabusha ngomugqa wezici ophilayo. I-STEP egciniwe nokuvula uhlu lwezici olubhalwe ngomenzi omunye akukakhiwa kule nguqulo.","section":"tasks","order":88,"keywords":["macro","akukakhiwa","swb","vba","umugqa wezici","buyisela","thumela i-macro","cadcraft-sw.json","i-STEP egciniwe","ap214","izinguquko zomhlaba","izibalo","ukuguqula"],"headings":[{"id":"thumela-ingxenye-njenge-macro","text":"Thumela ingxenye njenge-macro","level":2},{"id":"lokho-okushiyiwe","text":"Lokho okushiyiwe","level":3},{"id":"thumela-i-step-enegama","text":"Thumela i-STEP enegama","level":2},{"id":"buyisa-ingxenye","text":"Buyisa ingxenye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ithumela futhi ibuyisa izingxenye ne-SolidWorks zombili izindlela, ngaphandle kwefomethi yefayela abanye abangayifunda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhandle:\u003C/strong\u003E i-macro (\u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E, umbhalo ovulekile) ye-SolidWorks esebenza ukuyakha ingxenye yayo ngokwayo, isici ngesici, nezikethi zayo, izixhumanisi, izilinganiso, izinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo. Uthola ingxenye yomdabuko enomugqa wezici ophilayo, hhayi isolidi elifile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuya:\u003C/strong\u003E i-macro oyisebenzisa ngaphakathi kwe-SolidWorks ibhala izici nezibalo zengxenye efayeleni \u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-sw.json\u003C/code\u003E. Ukuvula lelo fayela ku-PartCraft akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (kudinga i-exact kernel).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu akukahlolwa ku-SolidWorks. I-SolidWorks isebenza kuphela ku-Windows nangelayisensi, futhi i-PartCraft ayikaze isebenzise lezi ma-macro kuyo. Ama-macro abhalwe ngokwemibhalo ye-API ye-SolidWorks futhi ahlolwa ngokwesakhiwo lapha. Lindele ukubika izinkinga; ilogi i-macro eyibhalayo itshela ukuthi yiliphi isinyathelo esehlulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ayikwazi ukubhala ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.sldprt\u003C/code\u003E: leyo fomethi ivaliwe. I-macro yindlela yokuthola ingxenye yomdabuko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-ingxenye-njenge-macro\"\u003EThumela ingxenye njenge-macro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-macro ye-SolidWorks (.swb)\u003C/span\u003E. I-PartCraft ilanda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.swb\u003C/code\u003E; ibha yesimo ithi yabhalwa &quot;ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxoxo ikutshela ukuthi i-macro yakha izici, izinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo ezingaki, futhi ibala okungafakiwe. Ayikho i-STEP ehamba nayo kule nguqulo: sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E uma udinga eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-SolidWorks, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ETools &gt; Macro &gt; Run\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E bese ulinda. Yenza ingxenye entsha kusuka ku-template yakho yengxenye ezenzakalelayo, ibeke amamilimitha futhi yakhe zonke izici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEkugcineni umyalezo uthi izinyathelo ezingaki eziqedile, eziyizinkinga ezingaki, nokuthi ezingaki zifana nomzimba we-PartCraft. Ilogi egcwele, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; macro log.txt\u003C/code\u003E, ibhalwa eduze kwe-macro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwakhiwa yi-macro:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EI-PartCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngxenyeni entsha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi endizeni yangaphambili, engaphezulu noma yangakwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi kuleyo ndiza, nemigqa, amasumo, amaphoyinti, izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zaso (zibizwa njengakwi-PartCraft, njengo \u003Ccode\u003Ek7\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi ebusweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi ebusweni obufanayo, sikhethwe ngephoyinti kulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi endizeni ebekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndiza yesikhombisi ethi ngamaphoyinti amathathu, nesikethi kuyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude, cut (blind, through all, mid-plane, two directions, taper)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss-extrude noma cut-extrude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve, revolved cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikeleza ngomugqa wesisekelo ofanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHole (simple, counterbore, countersink, tapped)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusika okukodwa noma amabili anezikethi zawo (imbobo ethayiwe iyinhlakula yayo yokuthaya; akukho ucingo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear and circular pattern, mirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear pattern, circular pattern, mirror (izici noma umzimba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, chamfer, shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, chamfer neshell ezimiphetheni nasebusweni obufanayo, okukhethwe ngamaphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParameters and equations\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo ezilinganisweni eziqanjwe kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESuppressed features, the rollback bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvalwe ngendlela efanayo; ibha yokuhlehlisa ibe endaweni efanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kwesici ngasinye solid, i-macro iqhathanisa ivolumu nosayizi womzimba nowe-PartCraft. Uma kwahlukile, iphendula indlela yesici kanye bese ihlola futhi; uma lokho kungcono kancane, iyibuyisela emuva futhi ibhale &quot;Check&quot; ilogini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lokho-okushiyiwe\"\u003ELokho okushiyiwe\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxoxo nesiqalo se-macro sidweba lonke okungaphethwe nesizathu. Okwamanje lokho kuyizinto ezingeniswe njengezixazululo zesolidi (faka i-STEP esikhundleni), i-sweep, i-loft, amadrafti, amaaksi namaphoyinti wereferensi, izimo ze-&quot;up to&quot;, ukukhipha kwezinye kuphela zamakhonco, nanoma yini ecasha kulokho. Ama-spline aba amagculo adlula kumaphoyinti awo. Le nguqulo ayinayo i-exact kernel, ngakho izikethi ebusweni namazici akhetha imiphetho noma ubuso nawo ayashiywa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-i-step-enegama\"\u003EThumela i-STEP enegama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakhiwa kule nguqulo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP ye-SolidWorks (egciniwe, AP214)\u003C/span\u003E idinga i-exact kernel, futhi ukukhetha kwayo kuthi &quot;STEP ye-SolidWorks: akukakhiwa. …&quot;. Nge-exact kernel, ifayela linegama lengxenye, amamilimitha nombala wengxenye, futhi limisa u-Y njengoba i-SolidWorks ikhombisa izingxenye (i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E evamile imisa u-Z). Izinhlamvu ezinamabhokoshi ziyalahleka egameni, nezinye izinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwe-ASCII ziba \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisa-ingxenye\"\u003EBuyisa ingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuvula ifayela ku-PartCraft (isinyathelo 3) akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: kuthi &quot;Ukuvula ukuthunyelwa kwe-SolidWorks: akukakhiwa. …&quot;. Uhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft lusavula ifayela futhi luthathe izikethi zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E &gt; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E &gt; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela le-macro lokubuyisa izingxenye (.swb)\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ulande \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraftExport.swb\u003C/code\u003E, bese uyibeka eduze kwezingxenye zakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-SolidWorks, vula ingxenye, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ETools &gt; Macro &gt; Run\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraftExport.swb\u003C/code\u003E. Ibhala \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.cadcraft-sw.json\u003C/code\u003E eduze kwengxenye futhi ayishintshi lutho kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-PartCraft, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha leyo fayela, noma uyiwise embonakalweni ye-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENge-exact kernel, i-PartCraft yakha kabusha ingxenye isici ngesici futhi ibonisa okwenzile: isibonelo &quot;izici ezi-5 kwezi-5 zithwelwe kusuka ku-SolidWorks (Flange.SLDPRT)&quot;, inani ngalinye elingathwalwanga (&quot;Akuthwelwanga: Sweep1 (Sweep).&quot;), nokuthi ivolumu iyahambisana yini nalena ebhalwe yi-SolidWorks.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYilondoloze njengengxenye ye-PartCraft nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikethi zifika endizeni eyisisekelo uma zikhona, endaweni efanayo yengxenye ebusweni obuthe tshe uma ikhona (ngakho zilandela izinguquko zamuva), futhi endizeni engashintshi uma kungenjalo. Imiphetho nobuso bamafillet, ama-chamfer neshell itholakala ngamaphoyinti futhi igcinwa njengezinkomba ezibizwayo. Izinguquko zomhlaba ziba amapharamitha (amagama anezikhala athola izikhala ezingaphansi: &quot;Bolt count&quot; aba \u003Ccode\u003EBolt_count\u003C/code\u003E) nezibalo ziba yizibalo ezilinganisweni ezifanayo. Akukho okuqagelwayo: okungenayo okufanayo kuyadwetshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft luvula ifayela elifanayo luthathe izikethi zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfomethi yi-\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-sw-export\u003C/code\u003E inguqulo 1, i-JSON evulekile ngamamilimitha namadigri. Ifayela elivela ku-macro entsha, noma elingavumelekile, liyenqatshwa ngesizathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ithumela futhi ibuyisa izingxenye ne-SolidWorks zombili izindlela, ngaphandle kwefomethi yefayela abanye abangayifunda: Phandle: i-macro (.swb, umbhalo ovulekile) ye-SolidWorks esebenza ukuyakha ingxenye yayo ngokwayo, isici ngesici, nezikethi zayo, izixhumanisi, izilinganiso, izinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo. Uthola ingxenye yomdabuko enomugqa wezici ophilayo, hhayi isolidi elifile. Ukubuya: i-macro oyisebenzisa ngaphakathi kwe-SolidWorks ibhala izici nezibalo zengxenye efayeleni .cadcraft-sw.json. Ukuvula lelo fayela ku-PartCraft akukakhiwa kule nguqulo (kudinga i-exact kernel). Lokhu akukahlolwa ku-SolidWorks. I-SolidWorks isebenza kuphela ku-Windows nangelayisensi, futhi i-PartCraft ayikaze isebenzise lezi ma-macro kuyo. Ama-macro abhalwe ngokwemibhalo ye-API ye-SolidWorks futhi ahlolwa ngokwesakhiwo lapha. Lindele ukubika izinkinga; ilogi i-macro eyibhalayo itshela ukuthi yiliphi isinyathelo esehlulekile. I-PartCraft ayikwazi ukubhala ifayela le-.sldprt: leyo fomethi ivaliwe. I-macro yindlela yokuthola ingxenye yomdabuko. Thumela ingxenye njenge-macro Vula ingxenye. Khetha Thumela, bese I-macro ye-SolidWorks (.swb). I-PartCraft ilanda \u003Cpart\u003E.swb; ibha yesimo ithi yabhalwa \"ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel\". Ingxoxo ikutshela ukuthi i-macro yakha izici, izinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo ezingaki, futhi ibala okungafakiwe. Ayikho i-STEP ehamba nayo kule nguqulo: sebenzisa Thumela, bese STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi) uma udinga eyodwa. Ku-SolidWorks, khetha Tools \u003E Macro \u003E Run, khetha ifayela .swb bese ulinda. Yenza ingxenye entsha kusuka ku-template yakho yengxenye ezenzakalelayo, ibeke amamilimitha futhi yakhe zonke izici. Ekugcineni umyalezo uthi izinyathelo ezingaki eziqedile, eziyizinkinga ezingaki, nokuthi ezingaki zifana nomzimba we-PartCraft. Ilogi egcwele, \u003Cpart\u003E macro log.txt, ibhalwa eduze kwe-macro. Okwakhiwa yi-macro: I-PartCraft Engxenyeni entsha Isikethi endizeni yangaphambili, engaphezulu noma yangakwesokudla Isikethi kuleyo ndiza, nemigqa, amasumo, amaphoyinti, izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zaso (zibizwa njengakwi-PartCraft, njengo k7) Isikethi ebusweni Isikethi ebusweni obufanayo, sikhethwe ngephoyinti kulo Isikethi endizeni ebekiwe Indiza yesikhombisi ethi ngamaphoyinti amathathu, nesikethi kuyo Extrude, cut (blind, through all, mid-plane, two directions, taper) Boss-extrude noma cut-extrude Revolve, revolved cut Jikeleza ngomugqa wesisekelo ofanayo Hole (simple, counterbore, countersink, tapped) Ukusika okukodwa noma amabili anezikethi zawo (imbobo ethayiwe iyinhlakula yayo yokuthaya; akukho ucingo) Linear and circular pattern, mirror Linear pattern, circular pattern, mirror (izici noma umzimba) Fillet, chamfer, shell Fillet, chamfer neshell ezimiphetheni nasebusweni obufanayo, okukhethwe ngamaphoyinti Parameters and equations Izinguquko zomhlaba nezibalo ezilinganisweni eziqanjwe kabusha Suppressed features, the rollback bar Ivalwe ngendlela efanayo; ibha yokuhlehlisa ibe endaweni efanayo Ngemva kwesici ngasinye solid, i-macro iqhathanisa ivolumu nosayizi womzimba nowe-PartCraft. Uma kwahlukile, iphendula indlela yesici kanye bese ihlola futhi; uma lokho kungcono kancane, iyibuyisela emuva futhi ibhale \"Check\" ilogini. Lokho okushiyiwe Ingxoxo nesiqalo se-macro sidweba lonke okungaphethwe nesizathu. Okwamanje lokho kuyizinto ezingeniswe njengezixazululo zesolidi (faka i-STEP esikhundleni), i-sweep, i-loft, amadrafti, amaaksi namaphoyinti wereferensi, izimo ze-\"up to\", ukukhipha kwezinye kuphela zamakhonco, nanoma yini ecasha kulokho. Ama-spline aba amagculo adlula kumaphoyinti awo. Le nguqulo ayinayo i-exact kernel, ngakho izikethi ebusweni namazici akhetha imiphetho noma ubuso nawo ayashiywa. Thumela i-STEP enegama Akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: STEP ye-SolidWorks (egciniwe, AP214) idinga i-exact kernel, futhi ukukhetha kwayo kuthi \"STEP ye-SolidWorks: akukakhiwa. …\". Nge-exact kernel, ifayela linegama lengxenye, amamilimitha nombala wengxenye, futhi limisa u-Y njengoba i-SolidWorks ikhombisa izingxenye (i-STEP AP214 (exact solid) evamile imisa u-Z). Izinhlamvu ezinamabhokoshi ziyalahleka egameni, nezinye izinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwe-ASCII ziba _. Buyisa ingxenye Ukuvula ifayela ku-PartCraft (isinyathelo 3) akukakhiwa kule nguqulo: kuthi \"Ukuvula ukuthunyelwa kwe-SolidWorks: akukakhiwa. …\". Uhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft lusavula ifayela futhi luthathe izikethi zalo. Khetha Ifayela \u003E Thumela \u003E Ifayela le-macro lokubuyisa izingxenye (.swb) ukuze ulande CadCraftExport.swb, bese uyibeka eduze kwezingxenye zakho. Ku-SolidWorks, vula ingxenye, khetha Tools \u003E Macro \u003E Run bese ukhetha CadCraftExport.swb. Ibhala \u003Cpart\u003E.cadcraft-sw.json eduze kwengxenye futhi ayishintshi lutho kuyo. Ku-PartCraft, khetha Vula bese ukhetha leyo fayela, noma uyiwise embonakalweni ye-3D. Nge-exact kernel, i-PartCraft yakha kabusha ingxenye isici ngesici futhi ibonisa okwenzile: isibonelo \"izici ezi-5 kwezi-5 zithwelwe kusuka ku-SolidWorks (Flange.SLDPRT)\", inani ngalinye elingathwalwanga (\"Akuthwelwanga: Sweep1 (Sweep).\"), nokuthi ivolumu iyahambisana yini nalena ebhalwe yi-SolidWorks. Yilondoloze njengengxenye ye-PartCraft nge-Londoloza. Izikethi zifika endizeni eyisisekelo uma zikhona, endaweni efanayo yengxenye ebusweni obuthe tshe uma ikhona (ngakho zilandela izinguquko zamuva), futhi endizeni engashintshi uma kungenjalo. Imiphetho nobuso bamafillet, ama-chamfer neshell itholakala ngamaphoyinti futhi igcinwa njengezinkomba ezibizwayo. Izinguquko zomhlaba ziba amapharamitha (amagama anezikhala athola izikhala ezingaphansi: \"Bolt count\" aba Bolt_count) nezibalo ziba yizibalo ezilinganisweni ezifanayo. Akukho okuqagelwayo: okungenayo okufanayo kuyadwetshwa. Uhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft luvula ifayela elifanayo luthathe izikethi zalo. Ifomethi yi-cadcraft-sw-export inguqulo 1, i-JSON evulekile ngamamilimitha namadigri. Ifayela elivela ku-macro entsha, noma elingavumelekile, liyenqatshwa ngesizathu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-meshes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Vula i-STL, i-OBJ noma i-3MF njengomzimba oqinile","summary":"Guqula i-mesh esuka kusikena, kwisayithi lokuphrinta nge-3D noma kolunye uhlelo ibe yi-solid oyingathi, oyingeza kuyo futhi oyisikela kuyo; yini i-PartCraft eyilungisayo, nokuthi yini engayilungisi.","section":"tasks","order":88,"keywords":["stl","obj","3mf","mesh","mesh to solid","convert mesh","scan","watertight","repair","izimbobo","amagebe","iyunithi","phezulu","umzimba ongeniswe","lungisa","izimbobo","ubuso obucaba"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-i-mesh","text":"Vula i-mesh","level":2},{"id":"okulungiswa-yi-partcraft","text":"Okulungiswa yi-PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"lapho-i-mesh-ingavali","text":"Lapho i-mesh ingavali","level":2},{"id":"gcwala-ubuso-obucaba","text":"Gcwala ubuso obucaba","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-kamuva","text":"Shintsha kamuva","level":2},{"id":"lapho-igcinwa-khona","text":"Lapho igcinwa khona","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ivula ama-mesh e-STL, OBJ kanye ne-3MF njengemizimba \u003Cstrong\u003Eeqinile\u003C/strong\u003E. Umzimba usebenza njengoba noma yisiphi isolid: uwusike, uwengeze, uwubhoboze, wenze iphethini kuwo, uwusebenzise kuhlanganiso noma kokukhiqiza, futhi wenze isikethi ezindaweni zawo ezicaba. Awunalo umlando wawo: i-mesh iyizinxantathu kuphela, ngakho usayizi wayo awushintshwa, ungengezwa kuwo noma uwusikwe kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-i-mesh\"\u003EVula i-mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese ukhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E. Noma liwishe ku-3D view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft iyalifunda, ilungise lokho engakwenza ngokuphepha, bese iveza okutholiwe: izinxantathu namaphoyinti angaki, ukulungiswa ngakunye, nokuthi i-mesh manje \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyavala\u003C/strong\u003E yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola \u003Cstrong\u003EIziyunithi kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E. I-STL ne-OBJ azitshelì iziyunithi zazo, ngakho amamilimitha ayisiqagelo; ifayela le-3MF litshela lakho. Umugqa othi \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi lapha\u003C/strong\u003E ubonisa usayizi womzimba ngokukhetha kwakho, ngakho ingxenye eza ingancane ngo-25.4 izikhathi ilula ukuyibona (yayisemayintshini).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ingxenye esikrinini ingenalutho, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula njengomzimba\u003C/span\u003E. Uma isivele inezici, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E (yengeze engxenyeni, sika kuyo, noma gcina okuhlangene kuphela), bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza kule ngxenye\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye entsha\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uqale kabusha nge-mesh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici se-\u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E siyavela emlandweni. Ibha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, &quot;bracket.stl is a solid body: 15200.512 mm³, 14 flat faces to sketch on.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulungiswa-yi-partcraft\"\u003EOkulungiswa yi-PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho ukuthini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhona aphindiwe ahlanganisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL iphinda ikhona ngalinye ngezinxantathu zalo; ahlanganiswa abe iphoyinti elilodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinxantathu ezingenaso ubuso zisusiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingcezu ezincane ezinamakhona awela emugqeni owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinxantathu eziphindiwe zisusiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInxantathu ebhalwe kabili igcinwa kanye; ezimbili ezibheke ngaphambili (udonga lwangaphakathi) zombili ziyasuswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagebe amancane avaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho esondelana (ngaphakathi kwekhulu lengxenye yosayizi wengxenye) ihlanganiswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimbobo ziyagcwaliswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvulwa okuthi umphetho wakho umile ucaba ugcwaliswa noma yisiphi usayizi; okuhle kuphela uma kuncane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinxantathu ziphendulwa zibheke ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinxantathu ezibheke ngendlela engafanele ziphendulwa zihambisane nomakhelwane wazo, nobuso bonke buphenduke buze ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-i-mesh-ingavali\"\u003ELapho i-mesh ingavali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-solid idinga ubuso obungenazo izimbobo. Lapho i-PartCraft ingakwazi ukulivala, inkulumo-ngqo itshela ukuthi zingaki izimbobo nemiphetho evulekile esele, futhi akukho mzimba wokungeza. Vala izimbobo ohlelweni olwenza i-mesh, noma uyidlulisele njenge-mesh evaliwe (ephelele), bese uyivula kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ishiya imbobo ngaphandle uma ukuyigcwalisa kungaba ukuqagela okungalungile: imbobo enkulu egoqekile, noma izimbobo ezimbili endizeni efanayo (ubuso oluyindandatho olungekho, lapho ukugcwalisa umngcele ngamunye kuzovala imbobo ephakathi). Umphetho ohlanganyelwe izinxantathu ezingaphezu kwezimbili nawo uyabikwa: ubuso onjalo abunangaphakathi elicacile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcwala-ubuso-obucaba\"\u003EGcwala ubuso obucaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo ezicaba ezenziwe ngezinxantathu eziningi ziyahlanganiswa zibe \u003Cstrong\u003Eubuso obucaba\u003C/strong\u003E ngalunye, ukuze isikethi sikwazi ukuhlala kuzo: chofoza ubuso bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkeça ebusweni lobu\u003C/span\u003E. Ubuso obusikiwe noma okwengezwe kukho kamuva buhlala bube ubuso. Izindawo ezijikelezayo (imbobo, i-fillet) zihlala zizinxantathu: azikhethwa njengobuso, futhi umbono udweba umkhawulo wazo ngengalo ephakathi kwezinxantathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-kamuva\"\u003EShintsha kamuva\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubone ifayela esuka kulo, ukuthi inezinxantathu zingaki nokuthi yini elungisiwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzyunithi kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E kungashintshwa lapho; ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-igcinwa-khona\"\u003ELapho igcinwa khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-mesh elungisiwe igcinwa \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E kwefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho awudingi ifayela le-mesh futhi. Ifayela lengxenye elinomzimba we-mesh liyinguqulo 5: i-PartCraft endala iyaliyala ngenguqulo yalo. I-mesh enezinxantathu ezingu-200,000 yengeza cishe i-1.2 MB.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphezu kwezinxantathu ezi-3 million namaMB ayi-200 kufayela elilodwa ngeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmzimba owenziwe nge-mesh wakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Nge-kernel eqondile evuliwe (kubathuthukisi kuphela), iyasho futhi ayakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto zeOBJ, izixhumanisi zokwakheka kanye namajika akhululekile ziyashiyeka; imibala, izinto nezinto zokusekela ze-3MF ziyashiyeka (inkulumo-ngqo ithi izinto ezingaki zadlulwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmzimba ulinganisa umesh: i-STL eshumayo inika izindawo ezijikelezayo ezishumayo. Izimbobo oziboboza kuyo zijikeleza njengezici zakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ivula ama-mesh e-STL, OBJ kanye ne-3MF njengemizimba eqinile. Umzimba usebenza njengoba noma yisiphi isolid: uwusike, uwengeze, uwubhoboze, wenze iphethini kuwo, uwusebenzise kuhlanganiso noma kokukhiqiza, futhi wenze isikethi ezindaweni zawo ezicaba. Awunalo umlando wawo: i-mesh iyizinxantathu kuphela, ngakho usayizi wayo awushintshwa, ungengezwa kuwo noma uwusikwe kuwo. Vula i-mesh Khetha Vula noma cindezela Ctrl+O, bese ukhetha ifayela le-.stl, .obj noma .3mf. Noma liwishe ku-3D view. I-PartCraft iyalifunda, ilungise lokho engakwenza ngokuphepha, bese iveza okutholiwe: izinxantathu namaphoyinti angaki, ukulungiswa ngakunye, nokuthi i-mesh manje iyavala yini. Hlola Iziyunithi kufayela kanye Phezulu kufayela. I-STL ne-OBJ azitshelì iziyunithi zazo, ngakho amamilimitha ayisiqagelo; ifayela le-3MF litshela lakho. Umugqa othi Usayizi lapha ubonisa usayizi womzimba ngokukhetha kwakho, ngakho ingxenye eza ingancane ngo-25.4 izikhathi ilula ukuyibona (yayisemayintshini). Uma ingxenye esikrinini ingenalutho, khetha Vula njengomzimba. Uma isivele inezici, khetha Sebenzisa ukuze (yengeze engxenyeni, sika kuyo, noma gcina okuhlangene kuphela), bese Yengeza kule ngxenye, noma Ingxenye entsha ukuze uqale kabusha nge-mesh. Isici se-Imported1 siyavela emlandweni. Ibha yesimo ithi, isibonelo, \"bracket.stl is a solid body: 15200.512 mm³, 14 flat faces to sketch on.\" Okulungiswa yi-PartCraft Ukulungisa Kusho ukuthini Amakhona aphindiwe ahlanganisiwe I-STL iphinda ikhona ngalinye ngezinxantathu zalo; ahlanganiswa abe iphoyinti elilodwa Izinxantathu ezingenaso ubuso zisusiwe Izingcezu ezincane ezinamakhona awela emugqeni owodwa Izinxantathu eziphindiwe zisusiwe Inxantathu ebhalwe kabili igcinwa kanye; ezimbili ezibheke ngaphambili (udonga lwangaphakathi) zombili ziyasuswa Amagebe amancane avaliwe Imiphetho esondelana (ngaphakathi kwekhulu lengxenye yosayizi wengxenye) ihlanganiswa Izimbobo ziyagcwaliswa Ukuvulwa okuthi umphetho wakho umile ucaba ugcwaliswa noma yisiphi usayizi; okuhle kuphela uma kuncane Izinxantathu ziphendulwa zibheke ngaphandle Izinxantathu ezibheke ngendlela engafanele ziphendulwa zihambisane nomakhelwane wazo, nobuso bonke buphenduke buze ngaphandle Lapho i-mesh ingavali I-solid idinga ubuso obungenazo izimbobo. Lapho i-PartCraft ingakwazi ukulivala, inkulumo-ngqo itshela ukuthi zingaki izimbobo nemiphetho evulekile esele, futhi akukho mzimba wokungeza. Vala izimbobo ohlelweni olwenza i-mesh, noma uyidlulisele njenge-mesh evaliwe (ephelele), bese uyivula kabusha. I-PartCraft ishiya imbobo ngaphandle uma ukuyigcwalisa kungaba ukuqagela okungalungile: imbobo enkulu egoqekile, noma izimbobo ezimbili endizeni efanayo (ubuso oluyindandatho olungekho, lapho ukugcwalisa umngcele ngamunye kuzovala imbobo ephakathi). Umphetho ohlanganyelwe izinxantathu ezingaphezu kwezimbili nawo uyabikwa: ubuso onjalo abunangaphakathi elicacile. Gcwala ubuso obucaba Izindawo ezicaba ezenziwe ngezinxantathu eziningi ziyahlanganiswa zibe ubuso obucaba ngalunye, ukuze isikethi sikwazi ukuhlala kuzo: chofoza ubuso bese ukhetha Skeça ebusweni lobu. Ubuso obusikiwe noma okwengezwe kukho kamuva buhlala bube ubuso. Izindawo ezijikelezayo (imbobo, i-fillet) zihlala zizinxantathu: azikhethwa njengobuso, futhi umbono udweba umkhawulo wazo ngengalo ephakathi kwezinxantathu. Shintsha kamuva Khetha Imported1 ukuze ubone ifayela esuka kulo, ukuthi inezinxantathu zingaki nokuthi yini elungisiwe. Izyunithi kufayela, Phezulu kufayela kanye Sebenzisa ukuze kungashintshwa lapho; ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Lapho igcinwa khona I-mesh elungisiwe igcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela le-.partcraft.json, ngakho awudingi ifayela le-mesh futhi. Ifayela lengxenye elinomzimba we-mesh liyinguqulo 5: i-PartCraft endala iyaliyala ngenguqulo yalo. I-mesh enezinxantathu ezingu-200,000 yengeza cishe i-1.2 MB. Imikhawulo Ngaphezu kwezinxantathu ezi-3 million namaMB ayi-200 kufayela elilodwa ngeze. Umzimba owenziwe nge-mesh wakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Nge-kernel eqondile evuliwe (kubathuthukisi kuphela), iyasho futhi ayakhiwa. Izinto zeOBJ, izixhumanisi zokwakheka kanye namajika akhululekile ziyashiyeka; imibala, izinto nezinto zokusekela ze-3MF ziyashiyeka (inkulumo-ngqo ithi izinto ezingaki zadlulwa). Umzimba ulinganisa umesh: i-STL eshumayo inika izindawo ezijikelezayo ezishumayo. Izimbobo oziboboza kuyo zijikeleza njengezici zakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-3dm-files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Vula imodeli ye-.3dm njengomzimba oqinile","summary":"Letha ama-mesh, ama-polysurface namabhlokhi efayela le-.3dm ku-PartCraft njengomzimba oqinile owodwa ongawusika, uwengeze, uwubhoboze futhi wenze isikethi kuwo; izinxantathu zivela kuphi, nokuthi yini eshiyiwe.","section":"tasks","order":89,"keywords":["3dm","nurbs","polysurface","brep","ubuso","render mesh","extrusion","amabhlokhi","import","mesh to solid","iyunithi","umzimba ongeniswe"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ifayela","text":"Vula ifayela","level":2},{"id":"lapho-izinxantathu-zivela-khona","text":"Lapho izinxantathu zivela khona","level":2},{"id":"konke-kufayela-kuba-umzimba-owodwa","text":"Konke kufayela kuba umzimba owodwa","level":2},{"id":"okushiyiwe-nakusho","text":"Okushiyiwe (nakusho)","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ingavali","text":"Lapho ingavali","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ivula amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E njengemizimba \u003Cstrong\u003Eeqinile\u003C/strong\u003E, ngendlela efanayo ivula i-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003Emesh ye-STL, OBJ noma 3MF\u003C/a\u003E. Umzimba usebenza njenganoma yiluphi uqinile: uwusike, uwengeze, uwubhoboze, wenze iphethini kuwo, futhi wenze isikethi ezindaweni zawo ezicaba. Awunalo umlando wawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ifayela\"\u003EVula ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese ukhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E. Noma liwishe ku-3D view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft iyalifunda ibonise okutholiwe: izinto eziningi ezinobuso ezingenayo, ibalo lobuso obuvela ku-mesh elonga kufayela nobuso i-PartCraft ebuhlobile, ukulungiswa ngakunye, nokuthi umphumela \u003Cstrong\u003Euyavala\u003C/strong\u003E yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola \u003Cstrong\u003EIziyunithi kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E (ifayela litshela eyalo; iyunithi i-PartCraft ingayidwebi, njengamayadi, iguqulwa ibe ngamamilimitha) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula njengomzimba\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza kule ngxenye\u003C/span\u003E uma ingxenye isivele inezici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-izinxantathu-zivela-khona\"\u003ELapho izinxantathu zivela khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yakha imizimba kusuka ezinxantathwini kulolu hlobo, ngakho ubuso ngabunye obusefayeleni buba izinhlangothi ezincane ezicaba. Ngakho ngakunye kubuso be-polysurface (nangakunye ukukhishwa) ithatha \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-render mesh elondelwe kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E uma ikhona, uma kungenjalo \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyayilungisa yona\u003C/strong\u003E (amapuleni, ubuso be-NURBS, ubuso bokujikeleza, amajika akhishiwe nokukhishwa, okusikwe ngemiphetho yabo). Ubuso bale polysurface bayabelana ngamaphoyinti emiphetho yabo, ngakho i-polysurface evaliwe ingena ivaliwe. Ubuso ohlobo lwawo i-PartCraft ingakafundi luyashiywa, nemingcingo ikhomba ukuthi bangaki nohlobo lwabo; umphumela ngokuvamile awuvali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"konke-kufayela-kuba-umzimba-owodwa\"\u003EKonke kufayela kuba umzimba owodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke i-mesh ebonakalayo, i-polysurface nokukhishwa, nokuma kwalo nakuwo wonke amabhlokhi, kungena \u003Cstrong\u003Ekumzimba owodwa\u003C/strong\u003E lapho ifayela liwubeka khona. Izinto ezifihliwe, noma ezisesendlini evaliwe, ziyashiyeka. Uma ifayela linama-solid amaningi ahlukene, umzimba unezingcezu eziningi; vula ngayinye kufayela layo uma ufuna izimizimba ezihlukene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okushiyiwe-nakusho\"\u003EOkushiyiwe (nakusho)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmajika, amaphoyinti, amafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso, amahatch nezibani ziyashiyeka: umzimba uthatha ubuso kuphela. Ngokufanayo nezinhlangothi ze-SubD (zishintshe zibe ama-mesh noma ama-polysurface ohlelweni olwazenza kuqala), amabhlokhi axhunyiwe kumafayela awaphuma, nemibala, amasendlana namagama (imizimba ye-PartCraft ayinayo lapha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ingavali\"\u003ELapho ingavali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-polysurface avuliwe nobuso (ubuso obusodwa obusikiwe, noma isimo esinobuso obuncane) alungu-ngaphakathi, ngakho awanakuba yi-solid. Inkulumo-ngqo ithi zingaki izimbobo ezisele futhi ayingezi lutho. Hlanganisa noma uvale isimo ohlelweni olukusenzile, londoloza, bese uvula kabusha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes#when-a-mesh-does-not-close\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\" data-hash=\"when-a-mesh-does-not-close\"\u003ELapho i-mesh ingavali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ivula amafayela .3dm njengemizimba eqinile, ngendlela efanayo ivula i-mesh ye-STL, OBJ noma 3MF. Umzimba usebenza njenganoma yiluphi uqinile: uwusike, uwengeze, uwubhoboze, wenze iphethini kuwo, futhi wenze isikethi ezindaweni zawo ezicaba. Awunalo umlando wawo. Vula ifayela Khetha Vula noma cindezela Ctrl+O, bese ukhetha ifayela le-.3dm. Noma liwishe ku-3D view. I-PartCraft iyalifunda ibonise okutholiwe: izinto eziningi ezinobuso ezingenayo, ibalo lobuso obuvela ku-mesh elonga kufayela nobuso i-PartCraft ebuhlobile, ukulungiswa ngakunye, nokuthi umphumela uyavala yini. Hlola Iziyunithi kufayela (ifayela litshela eyalo; iyunithi i-PartCraft ingayidwebi, njengamayadi, iguqulwa ibe ngamamilimitha) kanye Phezulu kufayela. Khetha Vula njengomzimba, noma Sebenzisa ukuze bese Yengeza kule ngxenye uma ingxenye isivele inezici. Lapho izinxantathu zivela khona I-PartCraft yakha imizimba kusuka ezinxantathwini kulolu hlobo, ngakho ubuso ngabunye obusefayeleni buba izinhlangothi ezincane ezicaba. Ngakho ngakunye kubuso be-polysurface (nangakunye ukukhishwa) ithatha i-render mesh elondelwe kufayela uma ikhona, uma kungenjalo iyayilungisa yona (amapuleni, ubuso be-NURBS, ubuso bokujikeleza, amajika akhishiwe nokukhishwa, okusikwe ngemiphetho yabo). Ubuso bale polysurface bayabelana ngamaphoyinti emiphetho yabo, ngakho i-polysurface evaliwe ingena ivaliwe. Ubuso ohlobo lwawo i-PartCraft ingakafundi luyashiywa, nemingcingo ikhomba ukuthi bangaki nohlobo lwabo; umphumela ngokuvamile awuvali. Konke kufayela kuba umzimba owodwa Yonke i-mesh ebonakalayo, i-polysurface nokukhishwa, nokuma kwalo nakuwo wonke amabhlokhi, kungena kumzimba owodwa lapho ifayela liwubeka khona. Izinto ezifihliwe, noma ezisesendlini evaliwe, ziyashiyeka. Uma ifayela linama-solid amaningi ahlukene, umzimba unezingcezu eziningi; vula ngayinye kufayela layo uma ufuna izimizimba ezihlukene. Okushiyiwe (nakusho) Amajika, amaphoyinti, amafu amaphoyinti, umbhalo, izilinganiso, amahatch nezibani ziyashiyeka: umzimba uthatha ubuso kuphela. Ngokufanayo nezinhlangothi ze-SubD (zishintshe zibe ama-mesh noma ama-polysurface ohlelweni olwazenza kuqala), amabhlokhi axhunyiwe kumafayela awaphuma, nemibala, amasendlana namagama (imizimba ye-PartCraft ayinayo lapha). Lapho ingavali Ama-polysurface avuliwe nobuso (ubuso obusodwa obusikiwe, noma isimo esinobuso obuncane) alungu-ngaphakathi, ngakho awanakuba yi-solid. Inkulumo-ngqo ithi zingaki izimbobo ezisele futhi ayingezi lutho. Hlanganisa noma uvale isimo ohlelweni olukusenzile, londoloza, bese uvula kabusha. Bona Lapho i-mesh ingavali.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"live-3dm-link","scope":"partcraft","title":"Gcina imodeli ye-.3dm iphila","summary":"Shintsha imodeli ohlelweni olwayenza futhi ubone umzimba we-PartCraft ulandela, kusuka ku-Rhino 8 noma kusichazo se-Grasshopper, namasici akho akhiwa kabusha kumumo omusha.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["rhino","grasshopper","live link","ukuxhuma okuphilayo","3dm","nurbs","parametric","link","sync","script","push","umzimba ongenisiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"setha","text":"Setha","level":2},{"id":"kusuka-ku-rhino","text":"Kusuka ku-Rhino","level":2},{"id":"kusuka-ku-grasshopper","text":"Kusuka ku-Grasshopper","level":2},{"id":"lapha-kusebenza-kanjani","text":"Lapha kusebenza kanjani","level":2},{"id":"uma-kukhona-okuhamba-kabi","text":"Uma kukhona okuhamba kabi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQhubeka wenza imodeli lapho uyimodela khona, uyihlole, uyiqinisekise futhi uyibhale lapha. Ushintsho ngalunye ohlelweni olunye lufaka esikhundleni somzimba ongenisiwe ku-PartCraft, nezici ezilandelayo zakhiwe kabusha kumumo omusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuxhuma kudinga i-\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kukhompyutha efanayo. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuxhuma. Akukho okuhamba nge-inthanethi: i-script ikhuluma ne-Studio ku-address yale kompyutha, ngethokheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuxhumana kuhlolwe ngomlobi wamafayela wale script nendawo yohlelo olunye, akukahlolwa ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper. Uma kukhona okungahambi lapho, sitshele ukuthi kuthini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha\"\u003ESetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Studio, vula i-PartCraft. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/span\u003E, thika \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI kanye nama-script basebenzise i-PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EHlela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Studio, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma umsizi\u003C/span\u003E. Ibonisa i-address nethokheni ozoyinamathisela ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanda i-script: \u003Ca href=\"https://getcadcraft.com/assets/link3dm/cadcraft_link.py\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusuka-ku-rhino\"\u003EKusuka ku-Rhino\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalisa \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E kumhleli we-script we-Rhino (i-Python 3 ku-Rhino 8).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkokuqala, namathisela i-address nethokheni. Zigcinwa ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-link.json\u003C/code\u003E kwifolda yakho yasekhaya, hhayi emodelini. I-Studio yenza ithokheni entsha ngesikhathi isiqalisa, ngakho i-script iyabuza futhi lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalisa i-script futhi ukuze uyeke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusuka-ku-grasshopper\"\u003EKusuka ku-Grasshopper\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalisa i-script kanye ku-Rhino kuqala, ukuze i-address nethokheni kugcinwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza i-Script component (Python 3) bese unamathisela konke \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAyinike lezi zokufaka: \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E (ijiyometri, nokufinyelela kuhlu), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (igama, ngokuzikhethela), \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E (iswishi ye-boolean), kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003ETarget\u003C/code\u003E (ngokuzikhethela: \u003Ccode\u003Emodel\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, uma kokubili kuvuliwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E ibe yiqiniso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuxazulula ngalunye kuthumela \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E bese kubhalwa phezu kwalokho okuthunyelwe ngaphambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapha-kusebenza-kanjani\"\u003ELapha kusebenza kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba oyodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Konke okubonakalayo emodelini kuba yisici esisodwa esingeniswe, njengokuvula \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003Eifayela le-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKumele kuvale.\u003C/strong\u003E I-PartCraft igcwalisa izimbobo ezincane nezimbobo ezitshe, futhi uhlelo olunye luyatshelwa ukuthi zingaki. Uma imodeli isengavaleki, i-PartCraft igcina umzimba eyawunawo futhi ibha yesimo iyatshela. Ushintsho olulandelayo oluvalayo luyawubuyekeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQeda okwenzayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-sketch noma kudrowing, izibuyekezo ziyenqatshwa futhi zizama futhi; ziyafika uma usubuyele emodelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlehlisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Izibuyekezo ezingaphakathi kwamasekhondi amabili ngaphansi komunye zabelana ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela lengxenye ligcina ukuxhuma. Qalisa i-script futhi uma uvula kabusha, futhi isici esifanayo siyabuyekezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela eyodwa kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Ushintsho lapha ayibuyi ohlelweni olunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kukhona-okuhamba-kabi\"\u003EUma kukhona okuhamba kabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Akukho ModelCraft noma PartCraft window evumela lokhu&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E yenza isinyathelo 1 sokusetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Studio yenqaba ithokheni&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E i-Studio iqalisiwe kabusha. Kopisha ithokheni entsha bese uqalisa i-script futhi. Ye-Grasshopper, qalisa kuqala ku-Rhino.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Ayikwazi ukufinyelela i-CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E i-Studio ayisebenzi, noma i-address ishintshile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qhubeka wenza imodeli lapho uyimodela khona, uyihlole, uyiqinisekise futhi uyibhale lapha. Ushintsho ngalunye ohlelweni olunye lufaka esikhundleni somzimba ongenisiwe ku-PartCraft, nezici ezilandelayo zakhiwe kabusha kumumo omusha. Ukuxhuma kudinga i-CadCraft Studio kukhompyutha efanayo. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuxhuma. Akukho okuhamba nge-inthanethi: i-script ikhuluma ne-Studio ku-address yale kompyutha, ngethokheni. Lokhu kuxhumana kuhlolwe ngomlobi wamafayela wale script nendawo yohlelo olunye, akukahlolwa ngaphakathi kwe-Rhino noma i-Grasshopper. Uma kukhona okungahambi lapho, sitshele ukuthi kuthini. Setha Ku-Studio, vula i-PartCraft. Ku-Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › Abasizi, thika Vumela abasizi be-AI kanye nama-script basebenzise i-PartCraft, bese Hlela. Ku-Studio, khetha Xhuma umsizi. Ibonisa i-address nethokheni ozoyinamathisela ngezansi. Landa i-script: cadcraft_link.py. Kusuka ku-Rhino Qalisa cadcraft_link.py kumhleli we-script we-Rhino (i-Python 3 ku-Rhino 8). Okokuqala, namathisela i-address nethokheni. Zigcinwa ku-.cadcraft-link.json kwifolda yakho yasekhaya, hhayi emodelini. I-Studio yenza ithokheni entsha ngesikhathi isiqalisa, ngakho i-script iyabuza futhi lapho. Qalisa i-script futhi ukuze uyeke. Kusuka ku-Grasshopper Qalisa i-script kanye ku-Rhino kuqala, ukuze i-address nethokheni kugcinwe. Engeza i-Script component (Python 3) bese unamathisela konke cadcraft_link.py kuyo. Ayinike lezi zokufaka: G (ijiyometri, nokufinyelela kuhlu), N (igama, ngokuzikhethela), On (iswishi ye-boolean), kanye ne-Target (ngokuzikhethela: model noma part, uma kokubili kuvuliwe). Setha On ibe yiqiniso. Ukuxazulula ngalunye kuthumela G bese kubhalwa phezu kwalokho okuthunyelwe ngaphambili. Lapha kusebenza kanjani Umzimba oyodwa. Konke okubonakalayo emodelini kuba yisici esisodwa esingeniswe, njengokuvula ifayela le-.3dm. Kumele kuvale. I-PartCraft igcwalisa izimbobo ezincane nezimbobo ezitshe, futhi uhlelo olunye luyatshelwa ukuthi zingaki. Uma imodeli isengavaleki, i-PartCraft igcina umzimba eyawunawo futhi ibha yesimo iyatshela. Ushintsho olulandelayo oluvalayo luyawubuyekeza. Qeda okwenzayo. Ku-sketch noma kudrowing, izibuyekezo ziyenqatshwa futhi zizama futhi; ziyafika uma usubuyele emodelini. Hlehlisa. Izibuyekezo ezingaphakathi kwamasekhondi amabili ngaphansi komunye zabelana ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Londoloza. Ifayela lengxenye ligcina ukuxhuma. Qalisa i-script futhi uma uvula kabusha, futhi isici esifanayo siyabuyekezwa. Indlela eyodwa kuphela. Ushintsho lapha ayibuyi ohlelweni olunye. Uma kukhona okuhamba kabi \"Akukho ModelCraft noma PartCraft window evumela lokhu\": yenza isinyathelo 1 sokusetha. \"Studio yenqaba ithokheni\": i-Studio iqalisiwe kabusha. Kopisha ithokheni entsha bese uqalisa i-script futhi. Ye-Grasshopper, qalisa kuqala ku-Rhino. \"Ayikwazi ukufinyelela i-CadCraft Studio\": i-Studio ayisebenzi, noma i-address ishintshile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"edit-history","scope":"partcraft","title":"Shintsha ingxenye ngomlando wayo","summary":"Hlela izici nezikethi ngemva kokwenziwa, vimbela, buyisela emuva, faka izici ngaphambili, hlela kabusha, shintsha igama, susa, bese uhlehlisa noma yini kulokho.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["umlando","umthi wezici","umthi wokuklama","hlela isici","hlela isikethi","vimbela","khipha ekuvinjelweni","buyisela emuva","qhubeka phambili","hlela kabusha","hambisa isici","susa","shintsha igama","hlehlisa","phinda wenze","akha kabusha","yakha futhi","umzali nengane","ingxenye enkulu","izici eziningi","ukwakha okuhamba kancane","izici ezingu-750"],"headings":[{"id":"hlela-isici","text":"Hlela isici","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-ukuthi-yimaphi-amaphethelo-noma-izinhlangothi-i-fillet-i-chamfer-noma-i-shell-esebenzisa","text":"Shintsha ukuthi yimaphi amaphethelo noma izinhlangothi i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell esebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"hlela-isikethi","text":"Hlela isikethi","level":2},{"id":"uma-isici-sehluleka","text":"Uma isici sehluleka","level":2},{"id":"vimbela-isici","text":"Vimbela isici","level":2},{"id":"buyisela-emuva","text":"Buyisela emuva","level":2},{"id":"hlela-kabusha-izici","text":"Hlela kabusha izici","level":2},{"id":"susa-isici","text":"Susa isici","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-igama","text":"Shintsha igama","level":2},{"id":"izingxenye-ezinamakhulu-ezici","text":"Izingxenye ezinamakhulu ezici","level":2},{"id":"hlehlisa-nophinda-wenze","text":"Hlehlisa nophinda wenze","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ye-PartCraft ingumlando wayo: uhlu lwamapuleni, izikethi kanye nezici oluseceleni lwesobunxele. I-PartCraft yakha kabusha isolidi kusukela phezulu kwaleli hlu njalo lapho kukhona okushintshayo. Ukushintsha inombolo ekuqaleni kohlu kushintsha yonke into eyakhelwe phezu kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isici\"\u003EHlela isici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isici emlandweni (noma isikethi esingeniswe ngaphansi kwaso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha izilungiselelo zaso ephaneli yesokudla. Yonke inguquko yakha kabusha ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho OK noma Khansela: yonke inguquko iyasebenza. Uma ungayithandi, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-ukuthi-yimaphi-amaphethelo-noma-izinhlangothi-i-fillet-i-chamfer-noma-i-shell-esebenzisa\"\u003EShintsha ukuthi yimaphi amaphethelo noma izinhlangothi i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell esebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza kabili isici emlandweni, noma sikhethe bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E). Chofoza imiphetho noma izinhlangothi ukuze uzengeze noma uzisuse, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EUkuzungeza, ukuhlikihla nokugoqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isikethi\"\u003EHlela isikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili isikethi emlandweni, noma sikhethe bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela isikethi\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokudla (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E kuthulubha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye ibuyela esimweni esabe ikunjalo lapho kwakhiwa isikethi: izici ezilandela sona ziyafihlwa ngenkathi uhlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha ijometri, izixhumanisi noma izilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala isikethi. Ingxenye yonke iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushintshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha usayizi kuphela, akudingeki uvule isikethi. Khetha isici noma isikethi bese ushintsha inombolo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zesikethi\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso ezilawulayo\u003C/strong\u003E) ephaneli yesokudla. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\"\u003EShintsha usayizi ngaphandle kokuvula isikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-isici-sehluleka\"\u003EUma isici sehluleka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma inguquko yenza isici singenakwenzeka, i-PartCraft yakha yonke enye bese imaka inkinga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisici sikhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ iphutha\u003C/strong\u003E emlandweni, nomlayezo waso usephezulu kwephaneli yaso yesokudla (hlanganisa umugqa ukuze uwufunde nawo);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizici ezidinga sona zikhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ akakakhiwa\u003C/strong\u003E, ngomlayezo othi &quot;Udinga Extrude2, okwehlulekayo.&quot;;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eichip yesimo sebha yesimo ithi &quot;izici ezi-1 zehlulekile&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELungisa imbangela (noma hlehlisa), bese ingxenye iyakhiwa futhi. Imilayezo evamile nokuthi yenzeni ichazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vimbela-isici\"\u003EVimbela isici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuvimbela kucima isici ngaphandle kokusisusa: kuwusizo uma uzama ingxenye ngaphandle kwembobo noma iphethini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVimbela\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa waso ukhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eoff\u003C/strong\u003E. Izici ezidinga kona nazo azakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ekuvinjelweni\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyivule futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisela-emuva\"\u003EBuyisela emuva\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuyisela emuva kwakha ingxenye kuze kufike endaweni ethile, ukuze uyibone njengoba yayinjalo, noma wengeze isici ngaphambili emlandweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela lapha\u003C/span\u003E. Lelo sici nakho konke okungaphansi kwalo kuba ngumbala ogxilile futhi kungakhiwa. Umugqa \u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuyisela emuva · qhubeka phambili\u003C/strong\u003E umaka indawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yisiphi isici osengeza manje sifakwa \u003Cstrong\u003Eebhareni\u003C/strong\u003E, phambi kwalezo ezigxilile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuyisela emuva · qhubeka phambili\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze wakhe konke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokubuyisela emuva iyagcinwa efayelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-kabusha-izici\"\u003EHlela kabusha izici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E, noma, uma umugqa wawo womlando ugxilile, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici asikwazi ukuya phezulu kwento esiyisebenzisayo. Inkinobho iba ngumbala ogxilile, bese ukuhamba phezu kwayo (noma ukuzama ukhiye) kunikeza isizathu, isibonelo &quot;Extrude2 isebenzisa Sketch2, ngakho Sketch2 kufanele iqale.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkusetshenziswa yisici: isikethi sawo; uhlangothi isikethi esihlezi phezu kwalo; izici iphethini noma i-mirror ekopisha; umugqa wesikethi noma i-revolve esetshenziswa njengendlela noma njenge-axis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-isici\"\u003ESusa isici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokudla noma kuthulubha, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ezinye izici ziyisebenzisa, i-PartCraft iyabuza: &quot;Extrude3, Hole1 usebenzisa Extrude1 futhi nazo ziyosuswa.&quot; Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa konke\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkususa isici akususi isikethi sawo: isikethi siyavela embonweni njengesikethi esingasetshenziswa, silungele esinye isici. Susa isikethi ngokwahlukana uma ungasidingi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-igama\"\u003EShintsha igama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha isici bese uthayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E elisha ngaphansi kwephaneli yesokudla (kuze kufike ezinhlamvu ezingu-60). Igama lengxenye liphansi ephaneli yesokudla uma kungakhethiwe lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izingxenye-ezinamakhulu-ezici\"\u003EIzingxenye ezinamakhulu ezici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye enamakhulu ezici ivivinywa ku-750. I-PartCraft igcina isolidi eyayinayo ngesikhathi somlando, ngakho inguquko esemuva kohlu yakha kabusha kuphela izici ezilandela yona; inguquko eduze kwaphezulu yakha yonke into eyakhelwe phezu kwayo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kakhulu. Ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze kwakha kabusha kuphela lapho izimo ezimbili zihlukana khona. Ukuze usebenze ngokushesha kingxenye enkulu, buyisela emuva endaweni oyisebenza kuyo (bona Buyisela emuva ngenhla) noma vimbela lokho ongakudingi okwamanje. Izinqamuleli eziningana nezigqoko ezingathintani zisetshenziswa ndawonye, ngakho ingxenye eyakhiwe ngemibobo nezigqoko eziningi eyehlukene yakhiwa ngokushesha kuna inani lezici elibonakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye enkulu yakha kabusha ngasemuva: ibha yokwakha ngaphansi ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIyakhiwa kabusha…\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi sekuqhubekile kangakanani, bese umbono, amaphaneli nemenyu kusasebenza lapho kusebenza. Ingxenye ebonakala esikrinini iyeyokugcina eyakhiwe kuze kube yilapho entsha isilungile. Uma usho okuthile futhi ngesikhathi sokwakha kabusha, i-PartCraft yakha inguqulo yakamuva kakhulu futhi ilahle leyo eyayisaqhubeka. Ingxenye encane ikhiwa kabusha ngokushesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlehlisa-nophinda-wenze\"\u003EHlehlisa nophinda wenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ihlehlisa inguquko yokugcina: isici, izilungiselelo, inguquko yesikethi, ukudonsa. Ibha yesimo ithi kuthini, isibonelo &quot;Ihlehliswe: shintsha isilinganiso.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E iyaphinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft igcina izinyathelo ezingu-200 zokugcina (ingxenye enkulu kakhulu lapho amakhophi angu-200 zingadla imemori eningi igcina ezimbalwa, kodwa njalo ezingaphansi kwezinyathelo ezi-20 ezintsha kakhulu). Izinguquko esikhathini sokudweba (isigaba, uphawu lwe-GD&amp;T olunyakaziswe) zisohlwini olufanayo. Ukuvula ifayela noma ukuqala ingxenye entsha kuyasula lolu hlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Mac, sebenzisa ⇧⌘Z ukuze uphinde wenze. Ku-Safari, ⌘Y ingavula umlando wesiphequluli esikhundleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Ingxenye ye-PartCraft ingumlando wayo: uhlu lwamapuleni, izikethi kanye nezici oluseceleni lwesobunxele. I-PartCraft yakha kabusha isolidi kusukela phezulu kwaleli hlu njalo lapho kukhona okushintshayo. Ukushintsha inombolo ekuqaleni kohlu kushintsha yonke into eyakhelwe phezu kwayo. Hlela isici Chofoza isici emlandweni (noma isikethi esingeniswe ngaphansi kwaso). Shintsha izilungiselelo zaso ephaneli yesokudla. Yonke inguquko yakha kabusha ngokushesha. Akukho OK noma Khansela: yonke inguquko iyasebenza. Uma ungayithandi, cindezela Ctrl+Z. Shintsha ukuthi yimaphi amaphethelo noma izinhlangothi i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell esebenzisa Chofoza kabili isici emlandweni, noma sikhethe bese ukhetha Khetha imiphetho (noma Khetha izinhlangothi). Chofoza imiphetho noma izinhlangothi ukuze uzengeze noma uzisuse, bese ukhetha Kuqediwe noma Esc. Bona Ukuzungeza, ukuhlikihla nokugoqa. Hlela isikethi Chofoza kabili isikethi emlandweni, noma sikhethe bese ukhetha Hlela isikethi ephaneli yesokudla (noma Isikethi kuthulubha). Ingxenye ibuyela esimweni esabe ikunjalo lapho kwakhiwa isikethi: izici ezilandela sona ziyafihlwa ngenkathi uhlela. Shintsha ijometri, izixhumanisi noma izilinganiso. Vala isikethi. Ingxenye yonke iyakhiwa kabusha ngokushintshiwe. Ukushintsha usayizi kuphela, akudingeki uvule isikethi. Khetha isici noma isikethi bese ushintsha inombolo ngaphansi kwe-Izilinganiso zesikethi (noma Izilinganiso ezilawulayo) ephaneli yesokudla. Bona Shintsha usayizi ngaphandle kokuvula isikethi. Uma isici sehluleka Uma inguquko yenza isici singenakwenzeka, i-PartCraft yakha yonke enye bese imaka inkinga: isici sikhombisa ⚠ iphutha emlandweni, nomlayezo waso usephezulu kwephaneli yaso yesokudla (hlanganisa umugqa ukuze uwufunde nawo); izici ezidinga sona zikhombisa ⚠ akakakhiwa, ngomlayezo othi \"Udinga Extrude2, okwehlulekayo.\"; ichip yesimo sebha yesimo ithi \"izici ezi-1 zehlulekile\". Lungisa imbangela (noma hlehlisa), bese ingxenye iyakhiwa futhi. Imilayezo evamile nokuthi yenzeni ichazwe ku-Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Vimbela isici Ukuvimbela kucima isici ngaphandle kokusisusa: kuwusizo uma uzama ingxenye ngaphandle kwembobo noma iphethini. Khetha isici. Khetha Vimbela. Umugqa waso ukhombisa off. Izici ezidinga kona nazo azakhiwa. Khetha Khipha ekuvinjelweni ukuze uyivule futhi. Buyisela emuva Ukubuyisela emuva kwakha ingxenye kuze kufike endaweni ethile, ukuze uyibone njengoba yayinjalo, noma wengeze isici ngaphambili emlandweni. Khetha isici bese ukhetha Buyela lapha. Lelo sici nakho konke okungaphansi kwalo kuba ngumbala ogxilile futhi kungakhiwa. Umugqa Ibha yokubuyisela emuva · qhubeka phambili umaka indawo. Noma yisiphi isici osengeza manje sifakwa ebhareni, phambi kwalezo ezigxilile. Chofoza Ibha yokubuyisela emuva · qhubeka phambili ukuze wakhe konke futhi. Indawo yokubuyisela emuva iyagcinwa efayelini. Hlela kabusha izici Khetha isici. Khetha Hambisa phezulu noma Hambisa phansi, noma, uma umugqa wawo womlando ugxilile, cindezela Alt+↑ noma Alt+↓. Isici asikwazi ukuya phezulu kwento esiyisebenzisayo. Inkinobho iba ngumbala ogxilile, bese ukuhamba phezu kwayo (noma ukuzama ukhiye) kunikeza isizathu, isibonelo \"Extrude2 isebenzisa Sketch2, ngakho Sketch2 kufanele iqale.\" Okusetshenziswa yisici: isikethi sawo; uhlangothi isikethi esihlezi phezu kwalo; izici iphethini noma i-mirror ekopisha; umugqa wesikethi noma i-revolve esetshenziswa njengendlela noma njenge-axis. Susa isici Khetha isici bese ukhetha Susa ephaneli yesokudla noma kuthulubha, noma cindezela Delete. Uma ezinye izici ziyisebenzisa, i-PartCraft iyabuza: \"Extrude3, Hole1 usebenzisa Extrude1 futhi nazo ziyosuswa.\" Khetha Susa konke noma Khansela. Ukususa isici akususi isikethi sawo: isikethi siyavela embonweni njengesikethi esingasetshenziswa, silungele esinye isici. Susa isikethi ngokwahlukana uma ungasidingi. Shintsha igama Khetha isici bese uthayipha Igama elisha ngaphansi kwephaneli yesokudla (kuze kufike ezinhlamvu ezingu-60). Igama lengxenye liphansi ephaneli yesokudla uma kungakhethiwe lutho. Izingxenye ezinamakhulu ezici Ingxenye enamakhulu ezici ivivinywa ku-750. I-PartCraft igcina isolidi eyayinayo ngesikhathi somlando, ngakho inguquko esemuva kohlu yakha kabusha kuphela izici ezilandela yona; inguquko eduze kwaphezulu yakha yonke into eyakhelwe phezu kwayo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kakhulu. Ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze kwakha kabusha kuphela lapho izimo ezimbili zihlukana khona. Ukuze usebenze ngokushesha kingxenye enkulu, buyisela emuva endaweni oyisebenza kuyo (bona Buyisela emuva ngenhla) noma vimbela lokho ongakudingi okwamanje. Izinqamuleli eziningana nezigqoko ezingathintani zisetshenziswa ndawonye, ngakho ingxenye eyakhiwe ngemibobo nezigqoko eziningi eyehlukene yakhiwa ngokushesha kuna inani lezici elibonakala. Ingxenye enkulu yakha kabusha ngasemuva: ibha yokwakha ngaphansi ithi Iyakhiwa kabusha… nokuthi sekuqhubekile kangakanani, bese umbono, amaphaneli nemenyu kusasebenza lapho kusebenza. Ingxenye ebonakala esikrinini iyeyokugcina eyakhiwe kuze kube yilapho entsha isilungile. Uma usho okuthile futhi ngesikhathi sokwakha kabusha, i-PartCraft yakha inguqulo yakamuva kakhulu futhi ilahle leyo eyayisaqhubeka. Ingxenye encane ikhiwa kabusha ngokushesha. Hlehlisa nophinda wenze Ctrl+Z noma Hlehlisa ihlehlisa inguquko yokugcina: isici, izilungiselelo, inguquko yesikethi, ukudonsa. Ibha yesimo ithi kuthini, isibonelo \"Ihlehliswe: shintsha isilinganiso.\" Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+Shift+Z noma Phinda wenze iyaphinda. I-PartCraft igcina izinyathelo ezingu-200 zokugcina (ingxenye enkulu kakhulu lapho amakhophi angu-200 zingadla imemori eningi igcina ezimbalwa, kodwa njalo ezingaphansi kwezinyathelo ezi-20 ezintsha kakhulu). Izinguquko esikhathini sokudweba (isigaba, uphawu lwe-GD&T olunyakaziswe) zisohlwini olufanayo. Ukuvula ifayela noma ukuqala ingxenye entsha kuyasula lolu hlu. Ku-Mac, sebenzisa ⇧⌘Z ukuze uphinde wenze. Ku-Safari, ⌘Y ingavula umlando wesiphequluli esikhundleni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bim-element","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yakha into ye-BimCraft bese uyilondoloza kabusha","summary":"Ingxenye ethunyelwe kusuka ku-BimCraft ivula nesakhiwo esizungezile, sinsundu futhi singafundwa kuphela. Yishintshe, bese uyilondoloza kabusha ukuze i-BimCraft iyamukele isimo esisha.","section":"tasks","order":91,"keywords":["bimcraft","bim","into","thumela","londoloza kabusha","xhuma","isakhiwo","umongo","omakhelwane","sekela","ibhulaketi","ifc","amukele"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenza ngengxenye etholakala kumodeli ye-BimCraft, endaweni yayo esakhiweni, bese uthumela isimo esisha ekhaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-BimCraft khetha into bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzixhumanisi zengxenye\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela ku-PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E. I-PartCraft iyivula njengengxenye entsha. Umugqa wesimo uthi yinto ye-BIM.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezizungeze (ngaphakathi kuka-3 m) zidwetshwe zinsundu. Zikhona ukuze wakhe ngazo. Awukwazi ukuzikhetha noma ukuzishintsha, futhi azigcinwa efayelini lengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha ingxenye njengakunoma yiluphi olunye uhlobo: sika, engeza, bhoboza, mirror. Umsuka kanye nama-axis ayo ayizinto yayo, ngakho ingxenye ibuyela lapho yayimi khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza kabusha ku-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa wesimo ukhombisa ukuthi irevizioni yini oyithumele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-BimCraft into ibonakala njengeshintshiwe kuze kube yilowo muntu ayamukele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye igcina ixhumanisi layo efayelini. Uma uyivula kamuva, umugqa wesimo usatsho ukuthi yinto ye-BIM. Isakhiwo esinsundu siyabuya nje uma isiphequluli sisabambe iphakheji eyathunyelwa ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza futhi kuthumela irevizioni 2, 3 njalo njalo. I-BimCraft igcina eyakamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimo sibuyela njenge-mesh ngamamillimitha, kumaaxis ayo. Izici zihlala ku-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza kabusha ku-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E akwenzi lutho kungxenye engavelanga ku-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye engenasolidi okwamanje ayinalutho lokuthumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZombili izinhlelo kufanele zivulwe kusiphequluli esifanayo: akukho okulayishwa, amakhasi amabili adlulisa into phakathi kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sebenza ngengxenye etholakala kumodeli ye-BimCraft, endaweni yayo esakhiweni, bese uthumela isimo esisha ekhaya. Izinyathelo Ku-BimCraft khetha into bese ukhetha Izixhumanisi zengxenye › Thumela ku-PartCraft. I-PartCraft iyivula njengengxenye entsha. Umugqa wesimo uthi yinto ye-BIM. Izinto ezizungeze (ngaphakathi kuka-3 m) zidwetshwe zinsundu. Zikhona ukuze wakhe ngazo. Awukwazi ukuzikhetha noma ukuzishintsha, futhi azigcinwa efayelini lengxenye. Shintsha ingxenye njengakunoma yiluphi olunye uhlobo: sika, engeza, bhoboza, mirror. Umsuka kanye nama-axis ayo ayizinto yayo, ngakho ingxenye ibuyela lapho yayimi khona. Khetha Ifayela › Thumela › Londoloza kabusha ku-BimCraft. Umugqa wesimo ukhombisa ukuthi irevizioni yini oyithumele. Ku-BimCraft into ibonakala njengeshintshiwe kuze kube yilowo muntu ayamukele. Okufanele ukubone Ingxenye igcina ixhumanisi layo efayelini. Uma uyivula kamuva, umugqa wesimo usatsho ukuthi yinto ye-BIM. Isakhiwo esinsundu siyabuya nje uma isiphequluli sisabambe iphakheji eyathunyelwa ngayo. Ukulondoloza futhi kuthumela irevizioni 2, 3 njalo njalo. I-BimCraft igcina eyakamuva. Okuhle ukwazi Isimo sibuyela njenge-mesh ngamamillimitha, kumaaxis ayo. Izici zihlala ku-PartCraft. Londoloza kabusha ku-BimCraft akwenzi lutho kungxenye engavelanga ku-BimCraft. Ingxenye engenasolidi okwamanje ayinalutho lokuthumela. Zombili izinhlelo kufanele zivulwe kusiphequluli esifanayo: akukho okulayishwa, amakhasi amabili adlulisa into phakathi kwawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rib","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amafini nama-gusset","summary":"Qinisa ingxenye ngefini edwetshwe njengomugqa oyodwa: igcwaliswa kusuka emugqeni kuya ezindongeni, ngobukhulu obusethiwe ngaphesheya kwendiza yesikethi, ohlangothini olukhethayo.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["fini","gusset","web","stiffener","brace","bracket","ukusekela ikhona","udonga olucekeceke","qinisa"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-ifini","text":"Engeza ifini","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"imilayezo","text":"Imilayezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakwakhiwa kule nguqulo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifini idinga i-kernel yejiyomethri echanekile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Ingxenye eseleyo yalelikhasi ichaza kanjalo lapho isebenza nge-kernel echanekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Efini\u003C/strong\u003E (noma i-gusset) iwudonga olucekeceke oqinisa ingxenye, njengonxantathu ngaphakathi kwekhona yebhulaketi ye-L. Udweba umphetho wayo kuphela: i-PartCraft igcwalisa isikhala phakathi kwalowo mugqa nezindonga. Idinga \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-kernel echanekile\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ifini\"\u003EEngeza ifini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza indiza phakathi nendawo lapho ifini izofika khona (ibhulaketi ye-L ejulile engu-40, indiza engu-20 phambi kwesikethi sayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EIzindiza zesisekelo, ama-axis namaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba endizeni \u003Cstrong\u003Eumugqa owodwa\u003C/strong\u003E usuka odongeni uye kodonga — noma imigqa embalwa exhunyiwe ukuze ibe umphetho ogobile wefini. Umugqa ungamisa ngaphambi kwezindonga: amaphethelo awo aqhubeka kuze kuhlangane nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isikethi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfini\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfini igcwaliswa kusuka emugqeni iye ezindongeni ngakolunye uhlangothi oluya emaphakathini wengxenye, ngakho i-gusset ihlala ekhoneni langaphakathi. Uma lolo hlangothi livulekile kanti olunye livaliwe, i-PartCraft iyiphendulela wena futhi iyatshela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E buwubukhulu befini ngaphesheya kwendiza yesikethi. Bungalawulwa yiparamitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu\u003C/strong\u003E (ukukhetha okungaphansi kwalo): \u003Cstrong\u003EKumaphakathi endizeni yesikethi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhambi kwendiza\u003C/strong\u003E (ngokuhamba i-normal yayo) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENgemuva kwendiza\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula\u003C/strong\u003E igcwalisa olunye uhlangothi lomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imilayezo\"\u003EImilayezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgalolu hlangothi umphetho wefini awuhlangani nomzimba\u003C/strong\u003E — akukho okuvala isikhala kulolo hlangothi: khetha noma susa \u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula\u003C/strong\u003E, noma hambisa umugqa ukuze izindonga ziwuvale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfini idinga ukhetho lomugqa oluvulekile oyodwa esikethini\u003C/strong\u003E — isikethi sinesimo esivaliwe, i-arc noma i-spline, noma imigqa engahlanganisi ngokuphela kuya kokuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho wefini uhamba ngaphakathi komzimba lapho\u003C/strong\u003E — umugqa ulele ngaphakathi kwe-solid; wudwebe esikhaleni esivulekile phakathi kwezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Akukakwakhiwa kule nguqulo. Ifini idinga i-kernel yejiyomethri echanekile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel. Okungakakwakhiwa kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Ingxenye eseleyo yalelikhasi ichaza kanjalo lapho isebenza nge-kernel echanekile. I-fini (noma i-gusset) iwudonga olucekeceke oqinisa ingxenye, njengonxantathu ngaphakathi kwekhona yebhulaketi ye-L. Udweba umphetho wayo kuphela: i-PartCraft igcwalisa isikhala phakathi kwalowo mugqa nezindonga. Idinga i-kernel echanekile (bheka I-mesh kernel). Engeza ifini Yenza indiza phakathi nendawo lapho ifini izofika khona (ibhulaketi ye-L ejulile engu-40, indiza engu-20 phambi kwesikethi sayo: bheka Izindiza zesisekelo, ama-axis namaphoyinti). Dweba endizeni umugqa owodwa usuka odongeni uye kodonga — noma imigqa embalwa exhunyiwe ukuze ibe umphetho ogobile wefini. Umugqa ungamisa ngaphambi kwezindonga: amaphethelo awo aqhubeka kuze kuhlangane nazo. Khetha isikethi bese ukhetha Okwengeziwe › Ifini. Ifini igcwaliswa kusuka emugqeni iye ezindongeni ngakolunye uhlangothi oluya emaphakathini wengxenye, ngakho i-gusset ihlala ekhoneni langaphakathi. Uma lolo hlangothi livulekile kanti olunye livaliwe, i-PartCraft iyiphendulela wena futhi iyatshela. Izilungiselelo Ubukhulu (mm) buwubukhulu befini ngaphesheya kwendiza yesikethi. Bungalawulwa yiparamitha. Ubukhulu (ukukhetha okungaphansi kwalo): Kumaphakathi endizeni yesikethi, Phambi kwendiza (ngokuhamba i-normal yayo) noma Ngemuva kwendiza. Phendula igcwalisa olunye uhlangothi lomugqa. Imilayezo Ngalolu hlangothi umphetho wefini awuhlangani nomzimba — akukho okuvala isikhala kulolo hlangothi: khetha noma susa Phendula, noma hambisa umugqa ukuze izindonga ziwuvale. Ifini idinga ukhetho lomugqa oluvulekile oyodwa esikethini — isikethi sinesimo esivaliwe, i-arc noma i-spline, noma imigqa engahlanganisi ngokuphela kuya kokuphela. Umphetho wefini uhamba ngaphakathi komzimba lapho — umugqa ulele ngaphakathi kwe-solid; wudwebe esikhaleni esivulekile phakathi kwezindonga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rollback","scope":"partcraft","title":"Buyela emuva nphambili emlandweni","summary":"Hambisa ibha yokubuyela phezulu nphansi isici esisodwa ngesikhathi ukubuke ingxenye ikhiwa, faka izici phakathi, bese ubuyela ekupheleni.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["rollback","buyela emuva","buyela phambili","ibha yokubuyela","hambisa emlandweni","faka isici","freeze","umlando"],"headings":[{"id":"hamba-isici-esisodwa-ngesikhathi","text":"Hamba isici esisodwa ngesikhathi","level":2},{"id":"faka-isici-phakathi","text":"Faka isici phakathi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIbha yokubuyela inquma ukuthi imlando eningi kangakanani yakhiwe. Izici ezingaphansi kwayo ziyizimnyama futhi azakhiwe; izici ezintsha zingena ebhareni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba-isici-esisodwa-ngesikhathi\"\u003EHamba isici esisodwa ngesikhathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ingxenye isesikrinini (akukho sikethi noma umdwebo ovuliwe):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma inkinobho yomcibisholo ophezulu eduze kwegama lengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha inyuka isici esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma inkinobho yomcibisholo ophansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yehla isici esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma inkinobho yebha iye ekupheleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZonke izici ziyakhiwa futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-status bar ithi ibha isiphi, isibonelo &quot;Ibha yokubuyela ngemva kuka-Sketch1: izici ezingu-1 kwezingu-2 zakhiwe&quot;. Izinkinobho ziyacima uma ibha ingahambi ngaphezulu ngaleyo ndlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela lapha\u003C/span\u003E kunoma isici, noma uchofoze \u003Cstrong\u003ERollback bar · roll forward\u003C/strong\u003E emlandweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-isici-phakathi\"\u003EFaka isici phakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ibha emuva ize ihlale lapho isici esisha kufanele khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza isici: sigena ebhareni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze wakhe lonke umlando ngaphezu kwalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKulo lonke ukuhamba kwebha kuyisinyathelo ongasihlehlisa ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Indawo yebha igcinwa kufayela, ngakho ingxenye ingathunyelwa ibuyile emuva. Ithuluzi lomugqa womyalo nalo liyayihambisa: \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft rollback part.json\u003C/code\u003E ne \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft forward part.json --end\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ibha yokubuyela inquma ukuthi imlando eningi kangakanani yakhiwe. Izici ezingaphansi kwayo ziyizimnyama futhi azakhiwe; izici ezintsha zingena ebhareni. Hamba isici esisodwa ngesikhathi Uma ingxenye isesikrinini (akukho sikethi noma umdwebo ovuliwe): Yenza Umphumela [ noma inkinobho yomcibisholo ophezulu eduze kwegama lengxenye Ibha inyuka isici esisodwa ] noma inkinobho yomcibisholo ophansi Ibha yehla isici esisodwa End noma inkinobho yebha iye ekupheleni Zonke izici ziyakhiwa futhi I-status bar ithi ibha isiphi, isibonelo \"Ibha yokubuyela ngemva kuka-Sketch1: izici ezingu-1 kwezingu-2 zakhiwe\". Izinkinobho ziyacima uma ibha ingahambi ngaphezulu ngaleyo ndlela. Ungakhetha futhi Buyela lapha kunoma isici, noma uchofoze Rollback bar · roll forward emlandweni. Faka isici phakathi Hambisa ibha emuva ize ihlale lapho isici esisha kufanele khona. Engeza isici: sigena ebhareni. Cindezela End ukuze wakhe lonke umlando ngaphezu kwalokho. Kulo lonke ukuhamba kwebha kuyisinyathelo ongasihlehlisa ngo-Ctrl+Z. Indawo yebha igcinwa kufayela, ngakho ingxenye ingathunyelwa ibuyile emuva. Ithuluzi lomugqa womyalo nalo liyayihambisa: partcraft rollback part.json ne partcraft forward part.json --end.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"form-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izakhiwo ezigobile ngeFomu, nezici zobuso","summary":"Phusha nokoke ikheji elibushelelezi lokulawula ku-workspace yeFomu, gobela imiphetho, sebenzisa ukulingana, hlola bese uqeda ibe yisisekelo esiqondile noma ubuso obuqondile, bese uqhobosha, ulayishe, uluka, ujiyise, ukhulise futhi usike ubuso ku-Design. Okuqondile nokulinganiselwe.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["fomu","ezigobile","t-spline","subdivision","catmull-clark","ikheji","quadball","umphetho","ukulingana","izibuthanwe","ukugoba","ubuso","ukugqoka","ukugcwalisa","ubuso bokulayisha","ukuthunga","ukusewula","ukujiyisa","ubuso bokusumaza","ukwelula","ukusika"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-i-cage","text":"Qala i-cage","level":2},{"id":"khetha-bese-uhambisa","text":"Khetha bese uhambisa","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-i-cage","text":"Shintsha i-cage","level":2},{"id":"imiphetho-ebukhali-ukulingana-nokubonakala","text":"Imiphetho ebukhali, ukulingana nokubonakala","level":2},{"id":"hlola-bese-uqeda","text":"Hlola bese uqeda","level":2},{"id":"okuqondile-nokulinganiselwe","text":"Okuqondile nokulinganiselwe","level":2},{"id":"izici-zobuso-ku-design","text":"Izici zobuso ku-Design","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakwakhiwa okwamanje kulolu hlobo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuqedela ifomu ngaphakathi engxenyeni, nezici zobuso, kudinga ikhestelo lejiyometri eliqondile, okungelona elaseleyo kulolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye ngekhestelo le-mesh. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Lo khasi usala uchaza kanjani lokhu kusebenza ngekhestelo eliqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-workspace ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EForm\u003C/strong\u003E yakha izimo ezingahlelekile. Uhlela i-\u003Cstrong\u003Ecage\u003C/strong\u003E, inethiwekhi eyinhlamvu yamakhona, imiphetho nezinhlangothi. Isimo yiso ubuso obushelelezi okulawulwa yi-cage (ubuso bayo be-Catmull–Clark limit), ngakho ukuhudula ikhona kancane ibuthanise ubuso ozungezile. Lapho sekukuhle, \u003Cstrong\u003EFinish\u003C/strong\u003E iyengeza emlandweni wengxenye njengesici se-\u003Cem\u003EForm\u003C/em\u003E, futhi ikhestelo eliqondile liyiguqula libe ubuso be-B-spline begalelo. Usuke ungayilungisa ngefillet, uyisike, uyihlanganise nezici zangaphambili futhi uyiphume njenge-STEP.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EForm\u003C/strong\u003E kuhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesobunxele se-toolbar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-i-cage\"\u003EQala i-cage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EDivisions\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla iphaneli. I-Divisions yinani lezinhlangothi ezinikezwa ngalinye uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBox\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuadball\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlane\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar. Iphaneli inayo futhi i-\u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003ETorus\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EFaces by clicks\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Equadball\u003C/strong\u003E iyi-cage yebhokisi elilingana ngendlela yokuthi amaphoyinti amakhona ahlala ebhodweni. Phakathi kwala maphoyinti ubuso buhlala kancane ngaphakathi kwebhola: cishe ngama-0.4 % wevolumu encane ngama-divisions amabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Eplane\u003C/strong\u003E ivulekile, ngakho iba ngumzimba wobuso (bheka &quot;Surface features in Design&quot; ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaces by clicks\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza amaphoyinti ama-4 ephlanethi eyisisekelo (phansi) noma emakhoneni e-cage ukuze wenze ubuso obubodwa. Ubuso obuhlanganyela amakhona ayahlanganiswa. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngemva kwamaphoyinti ama-3 ukuze uthole unxantathu, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-cage yakho engakaqedi igcinwa ngefayela lengxenye, ngakho ungavala ifayela bese uqhubeka kamuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-bese-uhambisa\"\u003EKhetha bese uhambisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona, umphetho noma ubuso be-cage. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza yengeza noma yehlisa izinto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isula ukukhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-gizmo ivela phakathi kokukhethiwe. Donsa umcibisholo ukuze uhambe ngawo, noma isikwele ukuze uhambe endizeni yaso. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uhambe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uzungeze no \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ulinganise, noma sebenzisa izinkinobho eziphaneli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGizmo\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar idlulisa kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoft falloff\u003C/strong\u003E (mm) nayo idonsa amakhona aphakathi kwalobo bude, ancipha kancane aze anyamalale emkhawulweni walobo bude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke idonsa iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Y\"\u003E⌃Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisebenza njengoba zijwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-i-cage\"\u003EShintsha i-cage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho ze-\u003Cstrong\u003EModify\u003C/strong\u003E eziphaneli zisebenza ngokukhethiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtrude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso okukhethwe ngabo buphuma ngesilinganiso se-\u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude distance\u003C/strong\u003E, ngokuya ku-normal yabo, nobuso bohlangothi obusha. Imiphetho evulekile ekhethiwe ikhulisa ubuso obusha ngaphandle.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge loop\u003C/span\u003E / Insert edge loop\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlukanisa umsele wobuso obuneziqu okuwela umphetho okhethiwe, kuhhafu wendlela. Imisele eminingi yenza amajika aqinile kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsert point\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza ikhona emaphakathi somphetho okhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESubdivide\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlukanisa ubuso ngabunye okukhethiwe ibe ubuso obuneziqu obuzungeze maphakathi nabo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBridge\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanganisa ubuso ababili okukhethiwe, noma imbobo ababili (khetha umphetho ovulekile oyodwa ngamunye), ngomsele wobuso. Bobabili badinga inani elifanayo lemiphetho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFill hole\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvala imbobo ngomphetho ovulekile okhethiwe ngobuso obubodwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeld\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanganisa amakhona akhethiwe abe yodwa, emaphakathini awo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFlatten\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisa amakhona akhethiwe ephlanethini elilingana kangcono nawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsusa ubuso, imiphetho (ubuso ababili buhlangana) noma amakhona akhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imiphetho-ebukhali-ukulingana-nokubonakala\"\u003EImiphetho ebukhali, ukulingana nokubonakala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E yenza imiphetho ekhethiwe ibe mibukhali. \u003Cstrong\u003ECrease weight\u003C/strong\u003E ka-10 ibukhali ngokugcwele. Isisindo esincane sihlala sibukhali amanyathelo amaningana okucacisa bese sithamba, okunikeza ijika elibukhali esikhundleni sokugoqa okuqinile. \u003Cstrong\u003EUncrease\u003C/strong\u003E iyenza ibushelelezi futhi. \u003Cstrong\u003ESharp vertex\u003C/strong\u003E iphinde ikhona ukuze ubuso budlule kuyo ngephoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESymmetry\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa i-cage ngokuphambene ku-X, Y noma Z = 0. Igcina uhlangothi olumahhala, ilibonise, bese ihlanganisa izingxenye ezimbili. Ngemuva kwalokho, ukuhlela ohlangothini olulodwa kwenzeka ezinhlangothini zombili. Amakhona endizeni yokubonisa ahlala kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDisplay\u003C/span\u003E iguqula phakathi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESmooth\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso isici sizoba kuso) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EBox\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso be-cage ngokwabo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAnalysis\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EZebra stripes\u003C/strong\u003E zibonisa ukukhanya okunemigqa kusuka ekubukeni kwamanje. Zigoba kancane ebusweni obushelelezi futhi ziphuke emphethweni ogobile. \u003Cstrong\u003EMean curvature\u003C/strong\u003E ikhanyisa izindawo ezigobile zibe bomvu, izindawo ezingena ngaphakathi zibe mpunga, nezindawo ezilingana zibe mhlophe. Ilinganiswa ku-mesh ebonisiwe ngefomula ye-cotangent, ngakho ingumhlahlandlela, hhayi ukulinganisa okuqinile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-bese-uqeda\"\u003EHlola bese uqeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck exact\u003C/strong\u003E iguqula i-cage ekhestelweni eliqondile ngaphandle kokushintsha ingxenye yakho. Ibika ukuthi i-cage yenza izingxenye zeB-spline ezingaki, ezingaki ezinembile, nokuthi umphumela uyisisekelo esivaliwe nesisebenzayo yini nevolumu yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E yengeza isici se-\u003Cem\u003EForm\u003C/em\u003E emlandweni, noma ibuyekeze ifomu owayehlela, bese ikubuyisela ku-Design. I-cage evaliwe iba yisisekelo esiqinile. Ukusebenza kwayo \u003Cstrong\u003EOperation\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli ye-Design kungaba New body, Join, Cut noma Intersect. I-cage evulekile iba umzimba wobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha ifomu kamuva, khetha kumlando bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit in Form\u003C/strong\u003E. Umzimba owakhiwe ufihliwe lapho uhlela i-cage yawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiscard\u003C/strong\u003E ilahla i-cage ngaphandle kokuthinta umlando.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuqondile-nokulinganiselwe\"\u003EOkuqondile nokulinganiselwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso ngabunye obune-ngaseceleni ezine be-cage, uma kudingeka buhlanganiswe kabusha, bube yi-bicubic B-spline patch eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho wonke amakhona obuso eyi-\u003Cem\u003Eregular\u003C/em\u003E (imiphetho emine ihlangana ngaphakathi kobuso, noma emithathu emphethweni ovulekile noma ngaphansi kwegoqa), i-patch \u003Cstrong\u003Engokuqondile\u003C/strong\u003E iyi-subdivision surface. Izivivinyo zihlola lokhu kuze kube ngu-1e-9 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzungeze \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti elingajwayelekile\u003C/strong\u003E (imiphetho emithathu, emihlanu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana, ikhona yobuso obunezinhlangothi ezintathu noma ezinhlanu, noma ukuphela kwegoqa) akukho patch yepolynomial eqondile. Lapho i-patch ithatha iphoyinti eliqondile kanye nendiza yokuthinta kulowo khona, nemigqa yomakhelwane yemiphetho, ngakho ama-patch ahlangana ngaphandle kwesikhala. Ukuthinta okuqhubekayo emiphetheni ehlangana kuleliphoyinti kuyinganiselo. Iphaneli ye-Form neyesici ibonisa i-engeli enkulu kakhulu, ngokuvamile ngaphansi kuka-2°. I-\u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E ephezulu kuphaneli yesici yenza lawo ma-patch abe mancane futhi aseduze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUgobo olubukhali liyimiphetho yangempela yesisekelo, ngakho ungayilungisa ngefillet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpatch ngalinye lingubuso bayo, ngakho ifomu linobuso obuningi futhi imigqa itshalwa phakathi kwabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izici-zobuso-ku-design\"\u003EIzici zobuso ku-Design\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo yobuso itholakala ku-menyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ye-Design, ngaphansi kwezici. Idinga ikhestelo eliqondile. Imizimba yobuso idwetshwa ibonakala ngokuqhamuka ngombala oluhlaza. Abayisici sesisekelo size usibambe ngokuthunga noma ukujiyisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPatch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgcwalisa umjikelezo ovaliwe wemiphetho. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza imiphetho yesisekelo kuqala, noma khetha umzimba wobuso ukuze ugcwalise imbobo yawo. \u003Cstrong\u003ETangent (G1)\u003C/strong\u003E yenza i-patch ihlangane nalobo buso ngokubushelelezi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELoft surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso oludlula kuchungechunge olulodwa lwamajika ngesikethi ngasinye (oluvulekile noma olu valiwe), ngokuhlelwa komlando.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStitch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthungela izimbobo zobuso ngemiphetho yabo ehlanganyelwe. Uma zivala, umphumela uba yisisekelo, nge-Operation njengezinye izici.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThicken\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInika umzimba wobuso ukuqina: ngokuya ku-normal yawo, ngokumelene nawo, noma ingxenye ngayinye ngaseceleni. Umphumela uyisisekelo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi yomzimba wobuso ehanjiswe ngokuya ku-normals zawo. Ukuqala kuyahlala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtend surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYandisa ubuso obunobuso bubodwa ngaphesheya kwemiphetho ekhethwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrim surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsika umzimba wobuso lapho umzimba wobuso omunye, noma isisekelo, udlula kuwo. Chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EPick a point on the piece\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukhethe ingxenye ogcina yona, noma gcina konke okunye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStitch, Thicken, Extend ne-Trim zisebenzisa umzimba wobuso oqala kuwo. Izici ezilandelayo zisebenzisa okusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImikhawulo yamanje: amafomu ahlanganisa izingxenye eziningana ezivaliwe ngeke aguquke ube yisisekelo esisodwa; izindawo ezijwayelekile azihlanganiswa zibe ubuso obukhulu; futhi bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje kulolu hlobo. Ukuqedela ifomu ngaphakathi engxenyeni, nezici zobuso, kudinga ikhestelo lejiyometri eliqondile, okungelona elaseleyo kulolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye ngekhestelo le-mesh. Okungakakwakhiwa kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Lo khasi usala uchaza kanjani lokhu kusebenza ngekhestelo eliqondile. I-workspace ye-Form yakha izimo ezingahlelekile. Uhlela i-cage, inethiwekhi eyinhlamvu yamakhona, imiphetho nezinhlangothi. Isimo yiso ubuso obushelelezi okulawulwa yi-cage (ubuso bayo be-Catmull–Clark limit), ngakho ukuhudula ikhona kancane ibuthanise ubuso ozungezile. Lapho sekukuhle, Finish iyengeza emlandweni wengxenye njengesici se-Form, futhi ikhestelo eliqondile liyiguqula libe ubuso be-B-spline begalelo. Usuke ungayilungisa ngefillet, uyisike, uyihlanganise nezici zangaphambili futhi uyiphume njenge-STEP. Khetha Form kuhlu lwe-Workspace ngakwesobunxele se-toolbar. Qala i-cage Setha Size ne-Divisions ngakwesokudla iphaneli. I-Divisions yinani lezinhlangothi ezinikezwa ngalinye uhlangothi. Chofoza Box, Quadball noma Plane ku-toolbar. Iphaneli inayo futhi i-Cylinder, i-Torus ne-Faces by clicks. I-quadball iyi-cage yebhokisi elilingana ngendlela yokuthi amaphoyinti amakhona ahlala ebhodweni. Phakathi kwala maphoyinti ubuso buhlala kancane ngaphakathi kwebhola: cishe ngama-0.4 % wevolumu encane ngama-divisions amabili. I-plane ivulekile, ngakho iba ngumzimba wobuso (bheka \"Surface features in Design\" ngezansi). Faces by clicks: chofoza amaphoyinti ama-4 ephlanethi eyisisekelo (phansi) noma emakhoneni e-cage ukuze wenze ubuso obubodwa. Ubuso obuhlanganyela amakhona ayahlanganiswa. Cindezela Enter ngemva kwamaphoyinti ama-3 ukuze uthole unxantathu, noma Esc ukuze umise. I-cage yakho engakaqedi igcinwa ngefayela lengxenye, ngakho ungavala ifayela bese uqhubeka kamuva. Khetha bese uhambisa Chofoza ikhona, umphetho noma ubuso be-cage. Shift+chofoza yengeza noma yehlisa izinto. Esc isula ukukhetha. I-gizmo ivela phakathi kokukhethiwe. Donsa umcibisholo ukuze uhambe ngawo, noma isikwele ukuze uhambe endizeni yaso. Cindezela W ukuze uhambe, E ukuze uzungeze no R ukuze ulinganise, noma sebenzisa izinkinobho eziphaneli. Gizmo ku-toolbar idlulisa kuzo. Soft falloff (mm) nayo idonsa amakhona aphakathi kwalobo bude, ancipha kancane aze anyamalale emkhawulweni walobo bude. Yonke idonsa iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: Ctrl+Z no-Ctrl+Y zisebenza njengoba zijwayelekile. Shintsha i-cage Izinkinobho ze-Modify eziphaneli zisebenza ngokukhethiwe: Inkinobho Yenzani Extrude Ubuso okukhethwe ngabo buphuma ngesilinganiso se-Extrude distance, ngokuya ku-normal yabo, nobuso bohlangothi obusha. Imiphetho evulekile ekhethiwe ikhulisa ubuso obusha ngaphandle. Edge loop / Insert edge loop Ihlukanisa umsele wobuso obuneziqu okuwela umphetho okhethiwe, kuhhafu wendlela. Imisele eminingi yenza amajika aqinile kakhulu. Insert point Yengeza ikhona emaphakathi somphetho okhethiwe. Subdivide Ihlukanisa ubuso ngabunye okukhethiwe ibe ubuso obuneziqu obuzungeze maphakathi nabo. Bridge Ihlanganisa ubuso ababili okukhethiwe, noma imbobo ababili (khetha umphetho ovulekile oyodwa ngamunye), ngomsele wobuso. Bobabili badinga inani elifanayo lemiphetho. Fill hole Ivala imbobo ngomphetho ovulekile okhethiwe ngobuso obubodwa. Weld Ihlanganisa amakhona akhethiwe abe yodwa, emaphakathini awo. Flatten Ihambisa amakhona akhethiwe ephlanethini elilingana kangcono nawo. Delete Isusa ubuso, imiphetho (ubuso ababili buhlangana) noma amakhona akhethiwe. Imiphetho ebukhali, ukulingana nokubonakala Crease yenza imiphetho ekhethiwe ibe mibukhali. Crease weight ka-10 ibukhali ngokugcwele. Isisindo esincane sihlala sibukhali amanyathelo amaningana okucacisa bese sithamba, okunikeza ijika elibukhali esikhundleni sokugoqa okuqinile. Uncrease iyenza ibushelelezi futhi. Sharp vertex iphinde ikhona ukuze ubuso budlule kuyo ngephoyinti. Symmetry ibonisa i-cage ngokuphambene ku-X, Y noma Z = 0. Igcina uhlangothi olumahhala, ilibonise, bese ihlanganisa izingxenye ezimbili. Ngemuva kwalokho, ukuhlela ohlangothini olulodwa kwenzeka ezinhlangothini zombili. Amakhona endizeni yokubonisa ahlala kuyo. Display iguqula phakathi kwe-Smooth (ubuso isici sizoba kuso) ne-Box (ubuso be-cage ngokwabo). Analysis: Zebra stripes zibonisa ukukhanya okunemigqa kusuka ekubukeni kwamanje. Zigoba kancane ebusweni obushelelezi futhi ziphuke emphethweni ogobile. Mean curvature ikhanyisa izindawo ezigobile zibe bomvu, izindawo ezingena ngaphakathi zibe mpunga, nezindawo ezilingana zibe mhlophe. Ilinganiswa ku-mesh ebonisiwe ngefomula ye-cotangent, ngakho ingumhlahlandlela, hhayi ukulinganisa okuqinile. Hlola bese uqeda Check exact iguqula i-cage ekhestelweni eliqondile ngaphandle kokushintsha ingxenye yakho. Ibika ukuthi i-cage yenza izingxenye zeB-spline ezingaki, ezingaki ezinembile, nokuthi umphumela uyisisekelo esivaliwe nesisebenzayo yini nevolumu yaso. Finish yengeza isici se-Form emlandweni, noma ibuyekeze ifomu owayehlela, bese ikubuyisela ku-Design. I-cage evaliwe iba yisisekelo esiqinile. Ukusebenza kwayo Operation ephaneli ye-Design kungaba New body, Join, Cut noma Intersect. I-cage evulekile iba umzimba wobuso. Ukushintsha ifomu kamuva, khetha kumlando bese uchofoza Edit in Form. Umzimba owakhiwe ufihliwe lapho uhlela i-cage yawo. Discard ilahla i-cage ngaphandle kokuthinta umlando. Okuqondile nokulinganiselwe Ubuso ngabunye obune-ngaseceleni ezine be-cage, uma kudingeka buhlanganiswe kabusha, bube yi-bicubic B-spline patch eyodwa. Lapho wonke amakhona obuso eyi-regular (imiphetho emine ihlangana ngaphakathi kobuso, noma emithathu emphethweni ovulekile noma ngaphansi kwegoqa), i-patch ngokuqondile iyi-subdivision surface. Izivivinyo zihlola lokhu kuze kube ngu-1e-9 mm. Ezungeze iphoyinti elingajwayelekile (imiphetho emithathu, emihlanu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana, ikhona yobuso obunezinhlangothi ezintathu noma ezinhlanu, noma ukuphela kwegoqa) akukho patch yepolynomial eqondile. Lapho i-patch ithatha iphoyinti eliqondile kanye nendiza yokuthinta kulowo khona, nemigqa yomakhelwane yemiphetho, ngakho ama-patch ahlangana ngaphandle kwesikhala. Ukuthinta okuqhubekayo emiphetheni ehlangana kuleliphoyinti kuyinganiselo. Iphaneli ye-Form neyesici ibonisa i-engeli enkulu kakhulu, ngokuvamile ngaphansi kuka-2°. I-Level ephezulu kuphaneli yesici yenza lawo ma-patch abe mancane futhi aseduze. Ugobo olubukhali liyimiphetho yangempela yesisekelo, ngakho ungayilungisa ngefillet. Ipatch ngalinye lingubuso bayo, ngakho ifomu linobuso obuningi futhi imigqa itshalwa phakathi kwabo. Izici zobuso ku-Design Imiyalo yobuso itholakala ku-menyu ye-More ye-Design, ngaphansi kwezici. Idinga ikhestelo eliqondile. Imizimba yobuso idwetshwa ibonakala ngokuqhamuka ngombala oluhlaza. Abayisici sesisekelo size usibambe ngokuthunga noma ukujiyisa. Umyalo Wenzani Patch Igcwalisa umjikelezo ovaliwe wemiphetho. Cindezela Shift+chofoza imiphetho yesisekelo kuqala, noma khetha umzimba wobuso ukuze ugcwalise imbobo yawo. Tangent (G1) yenza i-patch ihlangane nalobo buso ngokubushelelezi. Loft surface Ubuso oludlula kuchungechunge olulodwa lwamajika ngesikethi ngasinye (oluvulekile noma olu valiwe), ngokuhlelwa komlando. Stitch Ithungela izimbobo zobuso ngemiphetho yabo ehlanganyelwe. Uma zivala, umphumela uba yisisekelo, nge-Operation njengezinye izici. Thicken Inika umzimba wobuso ukuqina: ngokuya ku-normal yawo, ngokumelene nawo, noma ingxenye ngayinye ngaseceleni. Umphumela uyisisekelo. Offset surface Ikhophi yomzimba wobuso ehanjiswe ngokuya ku-normals zawo. Ukuqala kuyahlala. Extend surface Yandisa ubuso obunobuso bubodwa ngaphesheya kwemiphetho ekhethwe. Trim surface Isika umzimba wobuso lapho umzimba wobuso omunye, noma isisekelo, udlula kuwo. Chofoza Pick a point on the piece ukuze ukhethe ingxenye ogcina yona, noma gcina konke okunye. Stitch, Thicken, Extend ne-Trim zisebenzisa umzimba wobuso oqala kuwo. Izici ezilandelayo zisebenzisa okusha. Imikhawulo yamanje: amafomu ahlanganisa izingxenye eziningana ezivaliwe ngeke aguquke ube yisisekelo esisodwa; izindawo ezijwayelekile azihlanganiswa zibe ubuso obukhulu; futhi bheka Okungakakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"gordon-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izindawo ngomnatha wamajika (ubuso be-Gordon)","summary":"Yenza ubuso obubodwa obushelelezi obudlula kugridi yamajika eprofayili nemihlahlandlela edwetshwe kuma-sketch noma athathwe emiphetheni yemodeli; uwavale abe yisisekelo uma eprofayili evaliwe, nokuthi yini eqondile, yini elingana, nemilayezo lapho umnatha ungalingani.","section":"tasks","order":93,"keywords":["ethintayo","ukuthinteka","g1","ukuthinta okuqhubekayo","indiza yokubonisa","ubuso be-gordon","umnatha wamajika","ubuso bomngcele","ubuso womnatha","eprofayili","imihlahlandlela","amajika ahamba nomhlahlandlela","imihlahlandlela yokuhamba","skin","transfinite","coons","ubuso be-B-spline","ubuso obungahlelekile"],"headings":[{"id":"dweba-umnatha","text":"Dweba umnatha","level":2},{"id":"yenza-ubuso","text":"Yenza ubuso","level":2},{"id":"yivale-ibe-yisisekelo","text":"Yivale ibe yisisekelo","level":3},{"id":"thintela-endizeni-ngomphetho","text":"Thintela endizeni ngomphetho","level":2},{"id":"okuqondile-nokulinganiswayo","text":"Okuqondile nokulinganiswayo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-umnatha-ungalingani","text":"Lapho umnatha ungalingani","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakwakhiwa okwamanje kulolu hlobo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ubuso be-Gordon budinga ikhestelo eliqondile lejiyometri, okungelona elaseleyo kulolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye ngekhestelo le-mesh. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Lo khasi usala uchaza kanjani lokhu kusebenza ngekhestelo eliqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003EGordon surface\u003C/strong\u003E iyiyo ubuso obubodwa obudlula kuwo wonke amajika womnatha: isethi ye-\u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E ehamba ngendlela eyodwa nesethi ye-\u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E ehamba ngenye, edlula kwenye njengezintambo zenethi. Yindlela yokwakha uqweqwe lomkhumbi, ifenda noma isibambo ngamajika ambalwa osewalawula ngqo. Idinga \u003Cstrong\u003Eikhestelo eliqondile\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EIkhestelo le-mesh\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-umnatha\"\u003EDweba umnatha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E: amajika amabili noma ngaphezulu ahamba eceleni kwenye, njengezigaba ezingabhekene ndiza ezilinganayo. Imigqa, amajika, izindilinga nama-splines konke kuyasebenza, futhi uchungechunge lwamajika ahlanganiswe ekugcineni ngakunye lubalwa njengejika elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E: amajika amabili noma ngaphezulu ahamba ahambise amaprofayili. Umhlahlandlela ngamunye kumele adlule kuyo yonke i-profile kanye, nayo yonke i-profile kanye ngayinye guide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza amajika ahlangane ngempela. Dweba i-sketch yomhlahlandlela ukuze ijika lawo ladlule emaphoyinteni e-profiles (ngokuhlanganisa namaphoyinti aprojektiwe, noma uthayipha izixhumanisi). Umnatha wamukela izikhala ezikuya ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ETolerance\u003C/strong\u003E (0.01 mm ukuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsketshi eyodwa ingabamba amajika amaningi: ichungechunge ngalinye elihlukile kuyo liyijika lalo. Ngakho ungadweba yonke imihlahlandlela kwisketshi eyodwa endizeni ephezulu, ngesibonelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ubuso\"\u003EYenza ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Features, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGordon surface\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft ithatha ama-sketch ongekho owasebenzisayo: lawo asendizeni ezilingana nowokuqala aba \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E, amanye aba \u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E. Hlola uhlu oluseningizimu bese usetha ngalinye ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EProfiles\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGuides\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENot used\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze usebenzise imiphetho yengxenye, chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EPick edges as profiles\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eas guides\u003C/strong\u003E), chofoza imiphetho embonweni, bese ucindezela Esc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Esurface body\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E iyiguqula ibe yisisekelo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E iyithungela ezinye izindawo, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim surface\u003C/span\u003E iyasika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"yivale-ibe-yisisekelo\"\u003EYivale ibe yisisekelo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma amaprofayili eyimigqa evaliwe (amajika, ama-splines avaliwe, uchungechunge oluvaliwe) futhi i-profile yokuqala nokugcina ngalinye lilele phansi endizeni, hlola \u003Cstrong\u003EClose to a solid\u003C/strong\u003E. Iziphetho ziyavalwa ngobuso obuqondile futhi ibhokisi evaliwe iyahlanganiswa, iyasikwa, ihlanganiswe noma iba umzimba omusha njengesinye isici. Yile ndlela yokwenza loft elandela imihlahlandlela yamajika. Iyasebenza nakwezimhlahlandlela ezivaliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thintela-endizeni-ngomphetho\"\u003EThintela endizeni ngomphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso be-Gordon budlula ezigodini zawo, kodwa ngokwalo abuhambisani nokwenyuka kwalokho okuhlangana nakho. Ukuze lushiye umphetho lu\u003Cstrong\u003Ethintile\u003C/strong\u003E endizeni (G1), njengendiza yokubonisa, ukuze ikhophi ebonisiwe ihlanganiswe ngaphandle kokugoba, noma ubuso obuqondile okukhula kuwo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici se-Gordon. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ETangent to\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha indiza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a plane…\u003C/span\u003E (Front, Top, Right noma indiza yesethulo), noma khetha ubuso obuqondile embonweni bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the picked flat face\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PartCraft ithola ijika lomngcele womnatha olilele kuleyo ndiza, bese ubuso buthinta lowo jika endizeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma indiza ibamba amajika omngcele amabili (uphansi phezu kwazo zombili izinhlangothi), yengeze kabili: ikhophi ngayinye ithatha elilandelayo. Kufika kwezine, indiza eyodwa ngomphetho ngamunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbiko ukhombisa ukuthi ithinte ijika liphi endizeni nokuthi ubuso budlule kanjani kuleyo ndiza ngaphambi kwalokho. Imihlahlandlela esivele ithinta lelo jika ngokuqondile iyalandelwa ngempela. Imihlahlandlela eyenyuka isuke kuleyo jika igoba emaphethelweni amancane eduze komphetho, futhi inani elithi &quot;follows every curve within&quot; embikweni lisho ukuthi kangakanani: dweba imihlahlandlela ishiya umphetho ubuqondile ukuze uthole ukulingana okuqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuqondile-nokulinganiswayo\"\u003EOkuqondile nokulinganiswayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli isho ukuthi yiyiphi kulezi ezisebenza, nokuthi ubuso buphambuka kangakanani ekujikeni kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExact\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho wonke amajika eyi-polynomial (imigqa, ama-splines nochungechunge lwawo) nemihlahlandlela ihlanganisa zonke izinhlangothi ngamapharamitha afanayo, ubuso buqondile ngempela njengobuso be-Gordon walawo majika. Umnatha wamajika ama-isoline acwiliswe kubuso be-bicubic uyawubuyisela lowo buso, futhi imigqa emine eqondile inikeza i-patch eqondile noma egoqekile (bilinear).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFitted\u003C/strong\u003E: amaseki, izindilinga nemiphetho yengxenye akuyona i-polynomial, nemajika ahlanganisa ngamapharamitha ahlukile kudingeka aphinde akalwe ukuze ukuhlangana kuhambisane. Lawo majika alingene ngama-cubic B-splines kungakapheli ngomkhawulo owu-ten-millionth wosayizi womnatha (cishe 0.00001 mm yengxenye engu-100 mm). I-patch yesilinda eyenziwe ngamaseki nemigqa ihlala ngaphakathi kwe-0.00001 mm kwesilinda sangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhakathi kwamajika ubuso yilokho indlela ekunikeza: amaprofayili ahlanganiswa phakathi, kanye nemihlahlandlela ehlanganiswa phakathi, ngaphandle kokuhlanganiswa kwamaphoyinti awo ahlanganayo. Ibushelelezi endaweni yonke ngaphandle kwalapho ijika linekhona ebukhali. Lapho ama-Gordon surfaces amabili ahlangana umngcele wejika linye ahlangana emaphethelweni (G0), kungekhona ngokuthintana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-umnatha-ungalingani\"\u003ELapho umnatha ungalingani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… do not meet: they pass 0.4 mm apart&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza leyo profile nomhlahlandlela ahlanganise, noma phakamisa i-Tolerance\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… meets … 2 times&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmhlahlandlela ungadlula kuyo yonke i-profile kanye kuphela: hlukanisa ijika elijikelezayo, noma sebenzisa amaprofayili ambalwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… in a different order&quot; noma &quot;folds over itself&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImihlahlandlela ihlangana omunye (noma amaprofayili amabili ahlangana). Imindeni kumele ihambe eceleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;at least two profiles and two guides&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza amajika, noma setha ama-sketch amaningi ukuze abe ngamaProfayili noma ngamaGuides\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;mix open and closed curves&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza wonke amaprofayili avulekile noma wonke avaliwe (kanjalo nemihlahlandlela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An end … is not flat, so it cannot be capped&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba i-profile yokuqala nokugcina evaliwe endizeni eyodwa ngayinye, noma ushiye Close to a solid ingavulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-B-spline face eyodwa ngomnatha ngamunye: akukho G1 noma G2 ukuthinta kubuso obuseduze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmphetho womnatha ovaliwe, endaweni yomhlahlandlela wokuqala, uhlanganiswa ngemiphetho kodwa awuthintanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsici se-Loft ngokwaso asinamahlahlandlela ahamba ngaphansi; sebenzisa ubuso be-Gordon olusetshenziswe lwavaliwa lube yisisekelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmajika agobile kakhulu, noma ukudlula okubekwe kabi kakhulu esijikeni esisodwa uma kuqhathaniswa nesinye, kungadinga amaphoyinti amaningi ukuze alingane; isici sizosho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje kulolu hlobo. Ubuso be-Gordon budinga ikhestelo eliqondile lejiyometri, okungelona elaseleyo kulolu hlobo lwe-PartCraft: yakha zonke izingxenye ngekhestelo le-mesh. Okungakakwakhiwa kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho. Lo khasi usala uchaza kanjani lokhu kusebenza ngekhestelo eliqondile. I-Gordon surface iyiyo ubuso obubodwa obudlula kuwo wonke amajika womnatha: isethi ye-profiles ehamba ngendlela eyodwa nesethi ye-guides ehamba ngenye, edlula kwenye njengezintambo zenethi. Yindlela yokwakha uqweqwe lomkhumbi, ifenda noma isibambo ngamajika ambalwa osewalawula ngqo. Idinga ikhestelo eliqondile (bheka Ikhestelo le-mesh). Dweba umnatha Dweba i-profiles: amajika amabili noma ngaphezulu ahamba eceleni kwenye, njengezigaba ezingabhekene ndiza ezilinganayo. Imigqa, amajika, izindilinga nama-splines konke kuyasebenza, futhi uchungechunge lwamajika ahlanganiswe ekugcineni ngakunye lubalwa njengejika elilodwa. Dweba i-guides: amajika amabili noma ngaphezulu ahamba ahambise amaprofayili. Umhlahlandlela ngamunye kumele adlule kuyo yonke i-profile kanye, nayo yonke i-profile kanye ngayinye guide. Yenza amajika ahlangane ngempela. Dweba i-sketch yomhlahlandlela ukuze ijika lawo ladlule emaphoyinteni e-profiles (ngokuhlanganisa namaphoyinti aprojektiwe, noma uthayipha izixhumanisi). Umnatha wamukela izikhala ezikuya ku-Tolerance (0.01 mm ukuqala). Isketshi eyodwa ingabamba amajika amaningi: ichungechunge ngalinye elihlukile kuyo liyijika lalo. Ngakho ungadweba yonke imihlahlandlela kwisketshi eyodwa endizeni ephezulu, ngesibonelo. Yenza ubuso Khetha More eqenjini le-Features, bese Gordon surface. I-PartCraft ithatha ama-sketch ongekho owasebenzisayo: lawo asendizeni ezilingana nowokuqala aba profiles, amanye aba guides. Hlola uhlu oluseningizimu bese usetha ngalinye ibe Profiles, Guides noma Not used. Ukuze usebenzise imiphetho yengxenye, chofoza Pick edges as profiles (noma as guides), chofoza imiphetho embonweni, bese ucindezela Esc. Umphumela uyi-surface body. Thicken iyiguqula ibe yisisekelo, Stitch iyithungela ezinye izindawo, futhi Trim surface iyasika. Yivale ibe yisisekelo Uma amaprofayili eyimigqa evaliwe (amajika, ama-splines avaliwe, uchungechunge oluvaliwe) futhi i-profile yokuqala nokugcina ngalinye lilele phansi endizeni, hlola Close to a solid. Iziphetho ziyavalwa ngobuso obuqondile futhi ibhokisi evaliwe iyahlanganiswa, iyasikwa, ihlanganiswe noma iba umzimba omusha njengesinye isici. Yile ndlela yokwenza loft elandela imihlahlandlela yamajika. Iyasebenza nakwezimhlahlandlela ezivaliwe. Thintela endizeni ngomphetho Ubuso be-Gordon budlula ezigodini zawo, kodwa ngokwalo abuhambisani nokwenyuka kwalokho okuhlangana nakho. Ukuze lushiye umphetho luthintile endizeni (G1), njengendiza yokubonisa, ukuze ikhophi ebonisiwe ihlanganiswe ngaphandle kokugoba, noma ubuso obuqondile okukhula kuwo: Khetha isici se-Gordon. Ngaphansi kwe-Tangent to, khetha indiza ku-Add a plane… (Front, Top, Right noma indiza yesethulo), noma khetha ubuso obuqondile embonweni bese ucindezela Add the picked flat face. I-PartCraft ithola ijika lomngcele womnatha olilele kuleyo ndiza, bese ubuso buthinta lowo jika endizeni. Uma indiza ibamba amajika omngcele amabili (uphansi phezu kwazo zombili izinhlangothi), yengeze kabili: ikhophi ngayinye ithatha elilandelayo. Kufika kwezine, indiza eyodwa ngomphetho ngamunye. Umbiko ukhombisa ukuthi ithinte ijika liphi endizeni nokuthi ubuso budlule kanjani kuleyo ndiza ngaphambi kwalokho. Imihlahlandlela esivele ithinta lelo jika ngokuqondile iyalandelwa ngempela. Imihlahlandlela eyenyuka isuke kuleyo jika igoba emaphethelweni amancane eduze komphetho, futhi inani elithi \"follows every curve within\" embikweni lisho ukuthi kangakanani: dweba imihlahlandlela ishiya umphetho ubuqondile ukuze uthole ukulingana okuqondile. Okuqondile nokulinganiswayo Ipaneli isho ukuthi yiyiphi kulezi ezisebenza, nokuthi ubuso buphambuka kangakanani ekujikeni kwakho. Exact: lapho wonke amajika eyi-polynomial (imigqa, ama-splines nochungechunge lwawo) nemihlahlandlela ihlanganisa zonke izinhlangothi ngamapharamitha afanayo, ubuso buqondile ngempela njengobuso be-Gordon walawo majika. Umnatha wamajika ama-isoline acwiliswe kubuso be-bicubic uyawubuyisela lowo buso, futhi imigqa emine eqondile inikeza i-patch eqondile noma egoqekile (bilinear). Fitted: amaseki, izindilinga nemiphetho yengxenye akuyona i-polynomial, nemajika ahlanganisa ngamapharamitha ahlukile kudingeka aphinde akalwe ukuze ukuhlangana kuhambisane. Lawo majika alingene ngama-cubic B-splines kungakapheli ngomkhawulo owu-ten-millionth wosayizi womnatha (cishe 0.00001 mm yengxenye engu-100 mm). I-patch yesilinda eyenziwe ngamaseki nemigqa ihlala ngaphakathi kwe-0.00001 mm kwesilinda sangempela. Phakathi kwamajika ubuso yilokho indlela ekunikeza: amaprofayili ahlanganiswa phakathi, kanye nemihlahlandlela ehlanganiswa phakathi, ngaphandle kokuhlanganiswa kwamaphoyinti awo ahlanganayo. Ibushelelezi endaweni yonke ngaphandle kwalapho ijika linekhona ebukhali. Lapho ama-Gordon surfaces amabili ahlangana umngcele wejika linye ahlangana emaphethelweni (G0), kungekhona ngokuthintana. Lapho umnatha ungalingani Umlayezo Yenzani \"… do not meet: they pass 0.4 mm apart\" Yenza leyo profile nomhlahlandlela ahlanganise, noma phakamisa i-Tolerance \"… meets … 2 times\" Umhlahlandlela ungadlula kuyo yonke i-profile kanye kuphela: hlukanisa ijika elijikelezayo, noma sebenzisa amaprofayili ambalwa \"… in a different order\" noma \"folds over itself\" Imihlahlandlela ihlangana omunye (noma amaprofayili amabili ahlangana). Imindeni kumele ihambe eceleni \"at least two profiles and two guides\" Engeza amajika, noma setha ama-sketch amaningi ukuze abe ngamaProfayili noma ngamaGuides \"mix open and closed curves\" Yenza wonke amaprofayili avulekile noma wonke avaliwe (kanjalo nemihlahlandlela) \"An end … is not flat, so it cannot be capped\" Dweba i-profile yokuqala nokugcina evaliwe endizeni eyodwa ngayinye, noma ushiye Close to a solid ingavulekile Imikhawulo I-B-spline face eyodwa ngomnatha ngamunye: akukho G1 noma G2 ukuthinta kubuso obuseduze. Umphetho womnatha ovaliwe, endaweni yomhlahlandlela wokuqala, uhlanganiswa ngemiphetho kodwa awuthintanga. Isici se-Loft ngokwaso asinamahlahlandlela ahamba ngaphansi; sebenzisa ubuso be-Gordon olusetshenziswe lwavaliwa lube yisisekelo. Amajika agobile kakhulu, noma ukudlula okubekwe kabi kakhulu esijikeni esisodwa uma kuqhathaniswa nesinye, kungadinga amaphoyinti amaningi ukuze alingane; isici sizosho lokho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"structural-members","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izinhlaka zensimbi kusuka ezigaxeni","summary":"Beka izigaxa zensimbi emigqeni yesikethi esisodwa noma eziningi ukuze wenze uhlaka oluwelde: amakhona angama-mitre noma abukhali, izingxenye ezisikwe ukuze zifake lapho zihlangana, amakepisi emiphetho, ama-gusset nohlu lokusika olunobude nezingosi zomphetho.","section":"tasks","order":93,"keywords":["weldment","ingxenye yesakhiwo","uhlaka","uhlaka lwensimbi","ithubhu","ithubhu elisikwele","hss","rhs","shs","ipayipi","chs","wide flange","i-beam","w beam","ipe","hea","heb","channel","upn","angle","mitre","butt joint","cope","end cap","gusset","uhlu lokusika"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-uhlaka","text":"Yenza uhlaka","level":2},{"id":"uhlaka-ku-3d","text":"Uhlaka ku-3D","level":3},{"id":"beka-isigaxa-emugqeni-wso","text":"Beka isigaxa emugqeni wso","level":2},{"id":"amakhona-nezixhumanisi","text":"Amakhona nezixhumanisi","level":2},{"id":"amakepisi-emiphetho-nama-gusset","text":"Amakepisi emiphetho nama-gusset","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lokusika","text":"Uhlu lokusika","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye yesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka isigaxa sensimbi emugqeni ngamunye wesikethi osikhethile. Dweba uhlaka njengemigqa esikethini (umugqa ngamunye uyingxenye eyodwa), bese ukhetha isigaxa: izingxenye ziyakhiwa, amakhona ayasikwa futhi aelulwe, futhi uhlu lokusika luyakutshela ukuthi usike ubude bokuthi ngayinye nangayiphi ingosi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-uhlaka\"\u003EYenza uhlaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba uhlaka njengemigqa esikethini, isibonelo irektangili endizeni engaphezulu. Imigqa emakiwe njengokwakha ishiywa ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENesikethi sikhethiwe, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye yesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa ngamunye wesikethi uthola ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEpanelini, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmndeni\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E wesigaxa. Imindeni iyizithebhulu ze-AISC (W, S, C, L, amathubhu HSS, Pipe) kanye ne-EN 10365 (IPE, HEA, HEB, UPN).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"uhlaka-ku-3d\"\u003EUhlaka ku-3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa evela kuzikethi eziningi yenza uhlaka olulodwa: irektangili eyisikethi phezulu endizeni ekhuphuka, nemilenze edwetshwe endizeni emi ngqo, ihlangana ngamaphethelo ayo ku-3D. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENgokulandela imigqa\u003C/strong\u003E epanelini, thikha isikethi ngasinye okulandelwa yimigqa yaso. Amaphethelo ahlangana ngaphakathi kwe-micrometer eyodwa ayahlanganiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isigaxa-emugqeni-wso\"\u003EBeka isigaxa emugqeni wso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZungeza (°)\u003C/strong\u003E ijikeleza isigaxa ngokuzungeza umugqa wso. Ingxenye emile ngokujulile kwayo ngqo (kwingxenye ethi ngqo, ukujula kwayo kuqonde phambili).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmugqeni\u003C/strong\u003E ikhetha iphoyinti lesigaxa elihlala emugqeni: isikhungo, noma ikhona noma uhlangothi oluphakathi kwe-outline yesigaxa. &quot;Phansi phakathi&quot; ibeka uhlaka phezu kwendiza yesikethi esikhundleni sokudlula kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhona-nezixhumanisi\"\u003EAmakhona nezixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho izingxenye zihlangana\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini eyenzeka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngomphetho, \u003Cstrong\u003ECorners: Mitred\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZombili zisikwa endizeni ephakathi kwazo, njengohlaka lwesithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngomphetho, \u003Cstrong\u003ECorners: Butt\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye yokuqala iqhubeka kuze kufike ubuso obude bokwesibili; eyesibili isikwa isikwele ebusweni obuseduze bokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye iphela phakathi kwenye (i-T)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikwa ukuze silingane nangaphandle kwengxenye enye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye ezintathu noma ngaphezulu ziphela endaweni eyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyokuqala iqhubeka ngqo idlule ezinye; ezinye zisikwa zilingane nayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye yokuqala ngeyomugqa ofika kuqala: imigqa igcina ukulandelana okwadwetshwa ngakho, isikethi ngesikethi ngokulandelana kwezikethi ezathikwa ngakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakepisi-emiphetho-nama-gusset\"\u003EAmakepisi emiphetho nama-gusset\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakepisi emiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E avala wonke amaphethelo akhululekile ngepuleti le-outline yesigaxa, ubukhulu obusethile, ngaphandle komphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-gusset\u003C/strong\u003E abeka ipuleti elinxantathu ekhoneni ngalinye lapho izingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngengosi: \u003Cstrong\u003EUbude be-gusset\u003C/strong\u003E ngendlela ngayinye ngokusuka ekhoneni, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqina kwe-gusset\u003C/strong\u003E ngokuqinile, kugxilwe endizeni yekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lokusika\"\u003EUhlu lokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpanele liluhlu lwayo yonke ingxenye, ezifanayo ziqoqwe ndawonye: isigaxa, ubude (kusuka kuphoyinti elide kuya kophoyinti elide, njengoba ukumaka kwesaw), indlela ngayinye yomphetho esikwa ngayo (isikwele, ingosi ekhishwe kusikwele, noma isikwa ukuze silingane), nezingxenye ezibhekiselwe kuzo. Amakepisi emiphetho nama-gusset ayalandwa nosayizi bawo. \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza uhlu lokusika (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E iyigcina ukuze kusetshenziswe ku-spreadsheet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye esikwe ukuze ilingane nethubhu elinamakhona ajikelezile ingena kancane emsakazweni wekhona lalelo thubhu, ngakho ubude bayo obude-phoyinti buyisisekelo esingamamilimitha ambalwa ngaphezu kwegebe phakathi kwezindawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye zilandela imigqa eqondile kuphela; amasumo namagculo esikethini ayashiywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi zisikwa, azishiswa: awukho umqwabu wokushisela owadwetshwa, futhi uhlaka lulodwa solid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzigaxa zidweshwe ngobukhulu betafula: izakhiwo ze-W nomsila wayo wempande, S namachannels anamaflenji alinganayo, amathubhu namakhona ajikelezile; izimbobo, ukulungiswa kwamaphethelo nezikhala zokushisela akwenziwa ngawe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye zesakhiwo zakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Nge-exact kernel evuliwe (abaqambi kuphela), zithi kanjalo futhi azakhiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ingxenye yesakhiwo ibeka isigaxa sensimbi emugqeni ngamunye wesikethi osikhethile. Dweba uhlaka njengemigqa esikethini (umugqa ngamunye uyingxenye eyodwa), bese ukhetha isigaxa: izingxenye ziyakhiwa, amakhona ayasikwa futhi aelulwe, futhi uhlu lokusika luyakutshela ukuthi usike ubude bokuthi ngayinye nangayiphi ingosi. Yenza uhlaka Dweba uhlaka njengemigqa esikethini, isibonelo irektangili endizeni engaphezulu. Imigqa emakiwe njengokwakha ishiywa ngaphandle. Nesikethi sikhethiwe, khetha Okwengeziwe › Ingxenye yesakhiwo. Umugqa ngamunye wesikethi uthola ingxenye. Epanelini, khetha Umndeni kanye Usayizi wesigaxa. Imindeni iyizithebhulu ze-AISC (W, S, C, L, amathubhu HSS, Pipe) kanye ne-EN 10365 (IPE, HEA, HEB, UPN). Uhlaka ku-3D Imigqa evela kuzikethi eziningi yenza uhlaka olulodwa: irektangili eyisikethi phezulu endizeni ekhuphuka, nemilenze edwetshwe endizeni emi ngqo, ihlangana ngamaphethelo ayo ku-3D. Ngaphansi kwe-Ngokulandela imigqa epanelini, thikha isikethi ngasinye okulandelwa yimigqa yaso. Amaphethelo ahlangana ngaphakathi kwe-micrometer eyodwa ayahlanganiswa. Beka isigaxa emugqeni wso Zungeza (°) ijikeleza isigaxa ngokuzungeza umugqa wso. Ingxenye emile ngokujulile kwayo ngqo (kwingxenye ethi ngqo, ukujula kwayo kuqonde phambili). Emugqeni ikhetha iphoyinti lesigaxa elihlala emugqeni: isikhungo, noma ikhona noma uhlangothi oluphakathi kwe-outline yesigaxa. \"Phansi phakathi\" ibeka uhlaka phezu kwendiza yesikethi esikhundleni sokudlula kuyo. Amakhona nezixhumanisi Lapho izingxenye zihlangana Yini eyenzeka Izingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngomphetho, Corners: Mitred Zombili zisikwa endizeni ephakathi kwazo, njengohlaka lwesithombe Izingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngomphetho, Corners: Butt Ingxenye yokuqala iqhubeka kuze kufike ubuso obude bokwesibili; eyesibili isikwa isikwele ebusweni obuseduze bokuqala Ingxenye iphela phakathi kwenye (i-T) Isikwa ukuze silingane nangaphandle kwengxenye enye Izingxenye ezintathu noma ngaphezulu ziphela endaweni eyodwa Eyokuqala iqhubeka ngqo idlule ezinye; ezinye zisikwa zilingane nayo Ingxenye yokuqala ngeyomugqa ofika kuqala: imigqa igcina ukulandelana okwadwetshwa ngakho, isikethi ngesikethi ngokulandelana kwezikethi ezathikwa ngakho. Amakepisi emiphetho nama-gusset Amakepisi emiphetho avala wonke amaphethelo akhululekile ngepuleti le-outline yesigaxa, ubukhulu obusethile, ngaphandle komphetho. Ama-gusset abeka ipuleti elinxantathu ekhoneni ngalinye lapho izingxenye ezimbili zihlangana ngengosi: Ubude be-gusset ngendlela ngayinye ngokusuka ekhoneni, Ukuqina kwe-gusset ngokuqinile, kugxilwe endizeni yekhona. Uhlu lokusika Ipanele liluhlu lwayo yonke ingxenye, ezifanayo ziqoqwe ndawonye: isigaxa, ubude (kusuka kuphoyinti elide kuya kophoyinti elide, njengoba ukumaka kwesaw), indlela ngayinye yomphetho esikwa ngayo (isikwele, ingosi ekhishwe kusikwele, noma isikwa ukuze silingane), nezingxenye ezibhekiselwe kuzo. Amakepisi emiphetho nama-gusset ayalandwa nosayizi bawo. Londoloza uhlu lokusika (CSV) iyigcina ukuze kusetshenziswe ku-spreadsheet. Ingxenye esikwe ukuze ilingane nethubhu elinamakhona ajikelezile ingena kancane emsakazweni wekhona lalelo thubhu, ngakho ubude bayo obude-phoyinti buyisisekelo esingamamilimitha ambalwa ngaphezu kwegebe phakathi kwezindawo. Imikhawulo Izingxenye zilandela imigqa eqondile kuphela; amasumo namagculo esikethini ayashiywa. Izixhumanisi zisikwa, azishiswa: awukho umqwabu wokushisela owadwetshwa, futhi uhlaka lulodwa solid. Izigaxa zidweshwe ngobukhulu betafula: izakhiwo ze-W nomsila wayo wempande, S namachannels anamaflenji alinganayo, amathubhu namakhona ajikelezile; izimbobo, ukulungiswa kwamaphethelo nezikhala zokushisela akwenziwa ngawe. Izingxenye zesakhiwo zakhiwa yi-mesh kernel. Nge-exact kernel evuliwe (abaqambi kuphela), zithi kanjalo futhi azakhiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sheet-metal","scope":"partcraft","title":"Insimbi yeshidi: amaflange nephethini eyisicaba","summary":"Qala ingxenye yensimbi yeshidi ngesikethi (ipuleti eliyisicaba noma iphrofayili egobile), setha ubukhulu bayo, iradiyasi yokugoba ne-K-factor kanye, goba amaflange phezulu emaphethelweni ayo nezinciphisi zokugoba, bese uyilinganisa ibe yi-DXF yokusika.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["iphethini eyisicaba","ukuvula","ukuthuthukiswa","ubude obuthuthukisiwe","umugqa wokugoba","i-DXF yelaser","ukusika nge-laser","insimbi yeshidi","iflange yesisekelo","iflange yomphetho","iflange","ukugoba","iradiyasi yokugoba","k-factor","ubukhulu","igeyji","ukuphumuza","bend relief","ichaneli","ibhulaketi","ivalo","ishidi eligobile"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-ngeflange-yesisekelo","text":"Qala ngeflange yesisekelo","level":2},{"id":"goba-iflange-yomphetho","text":"Goba iflange yomphetho","level":2},{"id":"yilinganise","text":"Yilinganise","level":2},{"id":"imilayezo","text":"Imilayezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukakwakhiwa kulolu hlobo.\u003C/strong\u003E Insimbi yeshidi idinga i-geometry kernel eqondile, into le-PartCraft le-weqo elingayinaki: yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni. Leli khasi elisele lichaza njengoba lisebenza nge-exact kernel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye zensimbi yeshidi ziqala nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EIflange yesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E. Iseta ishidi lengxenye yonke: \u003Cstrong\u003Eubukhulu\u003C/strong\u003E bayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eiradiyasi yokugoba yangaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EK-factor\u003C/strong\u003E. Yonke \u003Cstrong\u003EIflange yomphetho\u003C/strong\u003E elandelayo igoba ngalezo zinombolo ezifanayo, ngakho ingxenye ihlala iyishidi elilodwa elingavulwa. Zombili zidinga i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eexact kernel\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-ngeflange-yesisekelo\"\u003EQala ngeflange yesisekelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba isikethi. Sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphrofayili evaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E ipuleti eliyisicaba (irektangela, noma noma yisiphi isakhiwo esivaliwe nezimbobo). Sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eishena eyodwa evulekile yemigqa\u003C/strong\u003E weshidi elogobile, njengo-L, U noma Z odwetshwe njengombono wephethelo lweshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isikethi komlando wezici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Features bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase flange\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwipaneli esesigabeni sakwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngukuthi igeyji yeshidi ibukeka kanjani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIradiyasi yokugoba (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ingu-iradiyasi yangaphakathi yakho konke ukugoba. 0 inikeza ikhona elibukhali elingaphakathi; ngaphandle kugingqa nakho ngeradiyasi yobukhulu obubodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EK-factor\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa lapho ungqimba olungathathi hlangothi luhlezi khona ngaphakathi kweshidi, kusukela ku-0 (ubuso bangaphakathi) kuya ku-0.5 (maphakathi). Inquma ukuthi ishidi lide kangakanani lapho lilinganiswa libe ngumbhalo osicaba. I-0.44 ngeyokuzenzakalelayo; umkhiqizi wakho noma umhlinzeki wezinto zakho angakunika owakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngukuthi iphrofayili egobile imile kangakanani kusuka endizeni yesikethi. Ipuleti alinaki lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu ngaphandle kwezigoba\u003C/strong\u003E: iphrofayili evulekile iyinhlangothi eyodwa yeshidi. Ngokuzenzakalelayo ubukhulu bubekwa ngaphakathi kokugoba kokuqala, ngakho imigqa oyidwetshe iwumphetho wangaphandle wechaneli. Khetha ukuze ubeke imigqa ngaphakathi. Impendulo ifanayo noma ukudweba usuka kuphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ikhona lesishena evulekile liba ukugoba. Umugqa omfushane kakhulu ukuba ubambe izigoba zawo uyakutshela, nobude obudingekayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goba-iflange-yomphetho\"\u003EGoba iflange yomphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphetho oqondile wobuso obuphezulu noma obuphansi beshidi (imiphetho emide, hhayi eminyene).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge flange\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kungakhethwanga umphetho, i-PartCraft ilinda uchofoze omunye; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhansela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIflange igoba iphuma ebusweni balowo mphetho ngokuzungeza iradiyasi yangaphakathi yeshidi, bese iqonde. Kwipaneli:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E ngukuthi igoba kangakanani, kusukela ku-1 kuya ku-180. 90 iyiflange yesikwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngumlenze oqondile ngemva kokugoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoba ngolunye uhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E igoba isuka ebusweni obunye (phansi esikhundleni sokuphezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintshwa ekuqaleni\u003C/strong\u003E nokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintshwa ekugcineni\u003C/strong\u003E kufinyeza iflange kusuka emaphethelweni womphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphumuza ukugoba\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho kushintshwa umphetho, kusikwa isilotha esiseduze kweshidi ukuze ukugoba kungadweshuli insimbi lapho. \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi bokuphumuza\u003C/strong\u003E bumisa ububanzi besilotha; ukujula kwayo kungu-iradiyasi yokugoba kanye nobukhulu. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELutho\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ushiye ikhona lingasikiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha umphetho kamuva, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick\u003C/span\u003E kwipaneli bese uchofoza omunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa amapharamitha obukhulu neradiyasi (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EAmapharamitha nezibalo\u003C/a\u003E) ukuze ushintsho lwegeyji lubuyekeze ama-flange onke ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yilinganise\"\u003EYilinganise\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izipaneli ziphela nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EIphethini eyisicaba\u003C/strong\u003E. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELay flat\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubuka kuqala kukhombisa ishidi eliguqukile, nomugqa wephakathi wokugoba ngamunye udashiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo\u003C/strong\u003E yesampula eyisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugoba ngakunye kudwetshwe nendlela yakho (\u003Cstrong\u003Ephezulu\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Ephansi\u003C/strong\u003E, kubonwa kusuka ohlangothini lwesikethi seflange yesisekelo), ikona neradiyasi yangaphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugoba ngakunye kuthatha ubude bongqimba olungathathi hlangothi lweshidi kuwo, i-\u003Cstrong\u003Ebend allowance\u003C/strong\u003E: ikona (ngama-radian) × (iradiyasi yangaphakathi + K-factor × ubukhulu). Ngakho ukugoba kwe-90° kweshidi lama-2 mm, neradiyasi engu-2 mm ne-K-factor engu-0.44 kwengeza i-4.52 mm yeshidi elicabile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKupuleti eliyisicaba, izimbobo, izinsika nezinciphisi zokugoba zibonakala ephethini eyisicaba lapho zikhona ngempela, kubandakanya izimbobo ezidlula kuflange.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusika izinto eziningi, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENest on sheets…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephethini eyisicaba: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\"\u003EHlela izingxenye ezicabile ezishidini\u003C/a\u003E. Iflange yesisekelo egobile ilinganiswa ibe yirektangela eyodwa: ubude bayo obuthuthukisiwe × ukujula kwayo, nomugqa wokugoba ngakunye ekhoneni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave DXF\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza iphethini eyisicaba yelaser, ipontshi noma i-waterjet, ngamamilimitha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumbandela ongqimbeni \u003Cstrong\u003EOUTLINE\u003C/strong\u003E, njengemigqa, imimnsalo nezindilinga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eimigqa yokugoba ongqimbeni \u003Cstrong\u003EBEND\u003C/strong\u003E, edashiwe;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einothi ekugobeni ngakunye ongqimbeni \u003Cstrong\u003EBEND_NOTES\u003C/strong\u003E, njengo &quot;UP 90° R2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha noma yini bese iphethini eyisicaba iyanyamalala; cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELay flat\u003C/span\u003E futhi ukuze uthole entsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola i-K-factor nomkhiqizi wakho ngaphambi kokusika: ubude beshidi elicabile luncike kuyo, futhi luyahluka ngezinto, ubukhulu nezinsimbi zokusebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imilayezo\"\u003EImilayezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsimbi yeshidi idinga iflange yesisekelo ngaphambi kwayo\u003C/strong\u003E — iflange yomphetho yengezwe ngaphambi kwanoma yiliphi iflange yesisekelo. Yehlisela ngaphansi kwesisekelo, noma engeza iflange yesisekelo kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIflange yomphetho idinga umphetho oqondile\u003C/strong\u003E — ama-flange agoba emigqeni kuphela; imiphetho egobile ayikwazi ukuwamukela okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELowo mphetho awusebusweni bobukhulu beshidi\u003C/strong\u003E — umphetho ungowobuso obungakhi phezulu noma phansi kweshidi (isibonelo udonga lwesimbobo). Khetha umphetho webuso eliphezulu noma elingezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintshwa akushiyi lutho womphetho\u003C/strong\u003E — ukushintshwa kwombili kwenza umphetho wonke noma ngaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-flange omphetho ku-flange yesisekelo egobile akakwazi ukulinganiswa okwamanje\u003C/strong\u003E — qala ngepuleti eliyisicaba bese ugoba konke phezulu ngama-flange omphetho, avulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsika nezimbobo ezenziwe ngemva kwe-flange yesisekelo egobile akukakabonakali ephethini yayo eyisicaba\u003C/strong\u003E — iphethini eyisicaba yephrofayili egobile iyirektangela yayo ethuthukisiwe kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Akukakwakhiwa kulolu hlobo. Insimbi yeshidi idinga i-geometry kernel eqondile, into le-PartCraft le-weqo elingayinaki: yakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel. Okungakakwakhiwa kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni. Leli khasi elisele lichaza njengoba lisebenza nge-exact kernel. Izingxenye zensimbi yeshidi ziqala nge-Iflange yesisekelo. Iseta ishidi lengxenye yonke: ubukhulu bayo, iradiyasi yokugoba yangaphakathi ne-K-factor. Yonke Iflange yomphetho elandelayo igoba ngalezo zinombolo ezifanayo, ngakho ingxenye ihlala iyishidi elilodwa elingavulwa. Zombili zidinga i-exact kernel (bheka I-mesh kernel). Qala ngeflange yesisekelo Dweba isikethi. Sebenzisa iphrofayili evaliwe ipuleti eliyisicaba (irektangela, noma noma yisiphi isakhiwo esivaliwe nezimbobo). Sebenzisa ishena eyodwa evulekile yemigqa weshidi elogobile, njengo-L, U noma Z odwetshwe njengombono wephethelo lweshidi. Khetha isikethi komlando wezici. Vula More eqenjini le-Features bese ukhetha Base flange. Kwipaneli esesigabeni sakwesokudla: Ubukhulu (mm) ngukuthi igeyji yeshidi ibukeka kanjani. Iradiyasi yokugoba (mm) ingu-iradiyasi yangaphakathi yakho konke ukugoba. 0 inikeza ikhona elibukhali elingaphakathi; ngaphandle kugingqa nakho ngeradiyasi yobukhulu obubodwa. K-factor ibonisa lapho ungqimba olungathathi hlangothi luhlezi khona ngaphakathi kweshidi, kusukela ku-0 (ubuso bangaphakathi) kuya ku-0.5 (maphakathi). Inquma ukuthi ishidi lide kangakanani lapho lilinganiswa libe ngumbhalo osicaba. I-0.44 ngeyokuzenzakalelayo; umkhiqizi wakho noma umhlinzeki wezinto zakho angakunika owakhe. Ukujula (mm) ngukuthi iphrofayili egobile imile kangakanani kusuka endizeni yesikethi. Ipuleti alinaki lokho. Ubukhulu ngaphandle kwezigoba: iphrofayili evulekile iyinhlangothi eyodwa yeshidi. Ngokuzenzakalelayo ubukhulu bubekwa ngaphakathi kokugoba kokuqala, ngakho imigqa oyidwetshe iwumphetho wangaphandle wechaneli. Khetha ukuze ubeke imigqa ngaphakathi. Impendulo ifanayo noma ukudweba usuka kuphi. Yonke ikhona lesishena evulekile liba ukugoba. Umugqa omfushane kakhulu ukuba ubambe izigoba zawo uyakutshela, nobude obudingekayo. Goba iflange yomphetho Chofoza umphetho oqondile wobuso obuphezulu noma obuphansi beshidi (imiphetho emide, hhayi eminyene). Khetha More › Edge flange. Uma kungakhethwanga umphetho, i-PartCraft ilinda uchofoze omunye; Esc iyakhansela. Iflange igoba iphuma ebusweni balowo mphetho ngokuzungeza iradiyasi yangaphakathi yeshidi, bese iqonde. Kwipaneli: Ikona (°) ngukuthi igoba kangakanani, kusukela ku-1 kuya ku-180. 90 iyiflange yesikwele. Ubude (mm) ngumlenze oqondile ngemva kokugoba. Goba ngolunye uhlangothi igoba isuka ebusweni obunye (phansi esikhundleni sokuphezulu). Ukushintshwa ekuqaleni nokuthi Ukushintshwa ekugcineni kufinyeza iflange kusuka emaphethelweni womphetho. Ukuphumuza ukugoba: lapho kushintshwa umphetho, kusikwa isilotha esiseduze kweshidi ukuze ukugoba kungadweshuli insimbi lapho. Ububanzi bokuphumuza bumisa ububanzi besilotha; ukujula kwayo kungu-iradiyasi yokugoba kanye nobukhulu. Khetha Lutho ukuze ushiye ikhona lingasikiwe. Ukushintsha umphetho kamuva, cindezela Pick kwipaneli bese uchofoza omunye. Sebenzisa amapharamitha obukhulu neradiyasi (bheka Amapharamitha nezibalo) ukuze ushintsho lwegeyji lubuyekeze ama-flange onke ngesikhathi esisodwa. Yilinganise Zombili izipaneli ziphela nge-Iphethini eyisicaba. Cindezela Lay flat: Ukubuka kuqala kukhombisa ishidi eliguqukile, nomugqa wephakathi wokugoba ngamunye udashiwe. Usayizi ne-Indawo yesampula eyisicaba. Ukugoba ngakunye kudwetshwe nendlela yakho (phezulu noma phansi, kubonwa kusuka ohlangothini lwesikethi seflange yesisekelo), ikona neradiyasi yangaphakathi. Ukugoba ngakunye kuthatha ubude bongqimba olungathathi hlangothi lweshidi kuwo, i-bend allowance: ikona (ngama-radian) × (iradiyasi yangaphakathi + K-factor × ubukhulu). Ngakho ukugoba kwe-90° kweshidi lama-2 mm, neradiyasi engu-2 mm ne-K-factor engu-0.44 kwengeza i-4.52 mm yeshidi elicabile. Kupuleti eliyisicaba, izimbobo, izinsika nezinciphisi zokugoba zibonakala ephethini eyisicaba lapho zikhona ngempela, kubandakanya izimbobo ezidlula kuflange. Ukusika izinto eziningi, cindezela Nest on sheets… ngaphansi kwephethini eyisicaba: bheka Hlela izingxenye ezicabile ezishidini. Iflange yesisekelo egobile ilinganiswa ibe yirektangela eyodwa: ubude bayo obuthuthukisiwe × ukujula kwayo, nomugqa wokugoba ngakunye ekhoneni. Save DXF ilondoloza iphethini eyisicaba yelaser, ipontshi noma i-waterjet, ngamamilimitha: umbandela ongqimbeni OUTLINE, njengemigqa, imimnsalo nezindilinga; imigqa yokugoba ongqimbeni BEND, edashiwe; inothi ekugobeni ngakunye ongqimbeni BEND_NOTES, njengo \"UP 90° R2\". Shintsha noma yini bese iphethini eyisicaba iyanyamalala; cindezela Lay flat futhi ukuze uthole entsha. Hlola i-K-factor nomkhiqizi wakho ngaphambi kokusika: ubude beshidi elicabile luncike kuyo, futhi luyahluka ngezinto, ubukhulu nezinsimbi zokusebenza. Imilayezo Insimbi yeshidi idinga iflange yesisekelo ngaphambi kwayo — iflange yomphetho yengezwe ngaphambi kwanoma yiliphi iflange yesisekelo. Yehlisela ngaphansi kwesisekelo, noma engeza iflange yesisekelo kuqala. Iflange yomphetho idinga umphetho oqondile — ama-flange agoba emigqeni kuphela; imiphetho egobile ayikwazi ukuwamukela okwamanje. Lowo mphetho awusebusweni bobukhulu beshidi — umphetho ungowobuso obungakhi phezulu noma phansi kweshidi (isibonelo udonga lwesimbobo). Khetha umphetho webuso eliphezulu noma elingezansi. Ukushintshwa akushiyi lutho womphetho — ukushintshwa kwombili kwenza umphetho wonke noma ngaphezulu. Ama-flange omphetho ku-flange yesisekelo egobile akakwazi ukulinganiswa okwamanje — qala ngepuleti eliyisicaba bese ugoba konke phezulu ngama-flange omphetho, avulwa. Izinsika nezimbobo ezenziwe ngemva kwe-flange yesisekelo egobile akukakabonakali ephethini yayo eyisicaba — iphethini eyisicaba yephrofayili egobile iyirektangela yayo ethuthukisiwe kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nurbs-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ubuso obukhululekile (NURBS)","summary":"Amajika nobuso obubushelelezi ngaphandle kwengxenye — loft, sweep, amanethiwekhi amajika, amapetshi amaphethelo amane, ukuxuba, ukusika — nokuvumelana kwe-G0, G1 kanye ne-G2 okulinganiswe ebusweni obuqondile, ama-solid anokuhlanganisa, ukususa nokuhlangana aphekwe engxenyeni, imibono ye-zebra nokugoqeka kwamajika, nobuso obufakwe kusikeni nephutha elilinganiswe, namafayela e-STEP noma e-IGES. Kugcinwa efayelini lengxenye.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["nurbs","skena","ukuhlaziya okuphambene","fit","mesh to surface","point cloud","stl","trim","trimmed","imbobo","sika","solid","solids","boolean","union","subtract","intersect","difference","sew","closed","bake","freeform","free-form","surface","surfaces","b-spline","bspline","curve","spline","loft","sweep","rail","network","coons","patch","blend","match","continuity","g0","g1","g2","tangent","curvature","zebra","control points","knots","degree","step","iges","class a","hull","fairing"],"headings":[{"id":"amajika","text":"Amajika","level":2},{"id":"ubuso","text":"Ubuso","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlola-ikhwalithi","text":"Ukuhlola ikhwalithi","level":2},{"id":"sika-ubuso","text":"Sika ubuso","level":2},{"id":"ama-solid-nama-boolean","text":"Ama-solid nama-Boolean","level":2},{"id":"ama-fillet-nokujiyisa","text":"Ama-fillet nokujiyisa","level":2},{"id":"gcina-i-solid-engxenyeni","text":"Gcina i-solid engxenyeni","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2},{"id":"iphrofayili-yesikhumba-somkhumbi","text":"Iphrofayili yesikhumba somkhumbi","level":2},{"id":"ubuso-kusuka-ekuskeneni-ukuhlaziya-okuphambene","text":"Ubuso kusuka ekuskeneni (ukuhlaziya okuphambene)","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E yenza amajika nobuso obubushelelezi bohlobo olusetshenziswa ezigqoko zomkhiqizo, izakhiwo zezimoto nezinqamu zemikhumbi: NURBS, izibalo ezifanayo nabanye abenzi bobuso. Konke kulinganiswa ebusweni eliqondile, hhayi ezinxantathu obuzibona. Usayizi ungamamilimitha, njengakwezinye zePartCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithuluzi lisinika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgoqekile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisana\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZebra\u003C/span\u003E; yonke imiyalo isephaneli esekudla. Umyalo ngamunye ukhomba okudingayo: chofoza amajika noma ubuso kumbono (eduze komphetho noma ekugcineni uma ucelwa lowo) noma ukhethe ohlwini; thayipha amaphoyinti, noma uwachofoze ebusweni bengxenye (ngaphandle kwengxenye ahlala endizeni yomhlabathi), bese ucindezela Enter.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmajika nobuso kugcinwa efayelini lengxenye eceleni kwe-solid. Awashintshi izici zengxenye: ephaneli inayo yayo i-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/strong\u003E, isinyathelo esisodwa ngomyalo ngamunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amajika\"\u003EAmajika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIjika eledlula kumaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E ledlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti ochofozayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EIjika ngamaphoyinti okulawula\u003C/strong\u003E ilandela ikheshi lamaphoyinti kunalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaka isiphethu\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhakamisa idigri\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EEhlisa idigri\u003C/strong\u003E zishintsha indlela ijika elichazwa ngayo ngaphandle kokulinyakazisa (ukwehlisa kwenqatshwa uma ijika lingalinyazwa ngaphezu kwetholerensi). \u003Cstrong\u003EAkha kabusha ijika\u003C/strong\u003E linika inani elisha lamaphoyinti okulawula bese lisho ukuthi ilinyazwe kangakanani. \u003Cstrong\u003EIjika elihambisanayo\u003C/strong\u003E lenza umphetho wijika elodwa ludlule kolunye ngo-G0 (ukuthintana), G1 (indlela efanayo) noma G2 (futhi ukugoqeka okufanayo). \u003Cstrong\u003EIjika elixubile\u003C/strong\u003E lengeza ijika elisha phakathi kwemiphetho emibili, G1 noma G2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphezu kwamajika amabili noma ngaphezulu, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso oluyisigaxa\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwamabili, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhuma ijika\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJikeleza ijika\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESweep ngerela elilodwa\u003C/strong\u003E ithwala iphrofayili ngendlela ngaphandle kokuyigoqa, \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep ngamarela amabili\u003C/strong\u003E igcina izinsipha zeprofayili ezindlini zombili. Ama-sweep ayalinganiswa: umphumela utshela ukuthi uhlale eduze kangakanani nesweep langempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso kusuka kunethiwekhi yamajika\u003C/strong\u003E lidlula ngegridi yamajika (ngalinye liwela kwelinye ngalinye kanye). \u003Cstrong\u003EIpetshi kusuka emaphethelweni amane\u003C/strong\u003Eligcwalisa amajika amane ahlangana ezikhonweni zawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch surface\u003C/strong\u003E yenza umphetho wobuso uhlangane nomakhelwane nge-G0, G1 noma G2; \u003Cstrong\u003EBlend surface\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza ubuso phakathi kwemiphetho emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOffset surface\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EExtend surface\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso buqhubeka njengoba bebehamba), \u003Cstrong\u003ERebuild surface\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlola-ikhwalithi\"\u003EUkuhlola ikhwalithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula \u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho ehlanganyelwe\u003C/strong\u003E libala yonke imiphetho ezimbili zobuso ezihlanganyelwa yona, nesikhala (mm), i-engeli phakathi kwazo (°) nokuhlehla kokugoqeka (1/mm), kanye nokuthi lokho kwenza yini i-G0, G1 noma G2. Umphetho owedlula okucelile uvela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E ne-fix ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisana\u003C/strong\u003E. Imigqa ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EZebra\u003C/strong\u003E nemibala ye-\u003Cstrong\u003Ecurvature\u003C/strong\u003E ivela kubuso obuqondile: imigqa engaphuli phezu komphetho isho i-G1; imigqa egcina nobubanzi bayo isho i-G2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-G0–G2 iyalinganiswa, ngamaphoyinti angu-33 ngomphetho ngamunye. \u003Cstrong\u003EI-G3 nekhwalithi &quot;class A&quot; akulinganiswa\u003C/strong\u003E futhi akuthathwa njengokufakazelwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-ubuso\"\u003ESika ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003ESika\u003C/strong\u003E lisika ubuso ngaphandle kokushintsha isimo sawo: ubuso ugcina wonke amaphoyinti awo okulawula, kuboniswa, kubalwe kanye kubhalwe ingxenye kuphela ngaphakathi komugqa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ngesikwele\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ngesiyingi\u003C/strong\u003E zisebenza ngesabelo (0 kuya ku-1) sobuso kuyo yonke indlela, ngakho azidingi ukukhethwa kumbono; \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ngejika\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha ijika elivaliwe elilele ebusweni (liyaprojektwa libe ebusweni, futhi lenqatshwa ngamazwi uma livulekile noma likude ngaphezu kwetholerensi). Faka i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESika imbobo\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ususe ingaphakathi komugqa; uyishiye ukuze ugcine ingaphakathi kuphela. Ubuso bungaba nomugqa oyodwa ogcinwayo namanye amanani embobo; umugqa ohlanganayo nomunye unqatshwa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa ukusika\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ubuso bonke futhi. I-Undo yephaneli ithatha ukusika njengesinye isinyathelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-STEP ithwala ukusika njengemingcele yobuso kanti i-IGES njengobuso obusikiwe (entity 144); zombili ziyakufunda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-solid-nama-boolean\"\u003EAma-solid nama-Boolean\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolid\u003C/strong\u003E liguqula ubuso bube yimizimba evaliwe futhi lihlanganise. I-solid lapha isethi yobuso bephaneli ehlangene evala ivolumu; ubuso bayo bugcina bungu-NURBS oqinile ngemingcele yabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E zenza enye ngosayizi abhalwe (ku-mm): ibhokisi lobuso obucaba eyisithupha, isilinda sohlangothi oluzungezile namaphethelo amabili acaba asikwe ngomjikelezo, nebhola lobuso obuyodwa oluhlehliswe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolid kusuka kubuso\u003C/strong\u003E ihlanganisa ubuso owenzile wena. Khetha, noma ungakhethi lutho ukuze usebenzise bonke ubuso obubonakalayo okungekho ku-solid. Bahlanganiswa ngaphakathi kwetholerensi: uma bengavali, akukho lutho olushintshayo futhi iphaneli ithi izinkinga zamaphethelo angaphansi zingaki nokuthi kufanele zihlangane kanjani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnion\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtract\u003C/strong\u003E (i-solid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIntersect\u003C/strong\u003E (kuphela okwabelwana ngakho bobabili) zithatha ama-solid amabili: chofoza ubuso ngalunye kumbono, noma cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolid\u003C/strong\u003E. Faka \u003Cstrong\u003EGcina ama-solid amabili\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uwagcine eceleni komphumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Boolean igcina bonke ubuso ebusweni balo eliqondile futhi iyasika ngemigqa emisha yokusika ngokuhlangana. Umugqa womphumela unikeza izinombolo ezilinganisiwe: ukuthi amaphoyinti e-solid engine adinga ukunyakaza kangakanani ukuze ahlale ebusweni eliqondile (ngaphezu kwetholerensi), ukuthi amaphoyinti okuhlangana ahlale eduze kangakanani kubobabili ubuso (ngokuvamile amaphesenti ezigidi zomilimitha), ivolumu, nokuthi ubuso obusha buyavala yini uma buhlanganiswa kabusha kusuka ebusweni baleyo ngqo. Amavolumu alinganiswa ezinxantathu ngaphakathi kwetholerensi (0.05 mm ngaphandle uma usetha enye), ngakho ivolumu yebhola noma yesilinda ifundeka ngaphansi kancane kwe-eyeqondile: ithole elincane liyasondela. I-Boolean engenziwa ngokuhlanzekile (ama-solid awabelani lutho, umugqa ungaziqanda) inqatshwa ngamazwi futhi ayishintshi lutho. I-Boolean eyodwa iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo\u003C/strong\u003E yephaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOhlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUngroup\u003C/strong\u003E igcina ubuso njengobuso obujwayelekile; ibhini liyasusa i-solid kanye nobuso bayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-fillet-nokujiyisa\"\u003EAma-fillet nokujiyisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E ijikeleza umphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili ze-solid eyodwa zihlangana: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili (embonweni, noma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini), thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003Eiradiyasi\u003C/strong\u003E kanye, uma iradiyasi ishintsha ngomphetho, \u003Cstrong\u003Eiradiyasi ekugcineni\u003C/strong\u003E (0 igcina iradiyasi eyodwa). Ibhola lale radiyasi liyagudluzwa ngomphetho lithinta zombili izinhlangothi; i-fillet iwumjikelezo oqondile okusala kuwo wonke amaphoyinti, uhlanganiswe ube bubuso bodwa, nezinhlangothi zombili zisikwe lapho ibhola lithinta khona. Umphetho wangaphandle ulahlekelwa yimpahla, ikhona yangaphakathi iyanda. Umugqa womphumela unikeza okwalinganiswa: ubuso be-fillet bukude kangakanani nebhola elishayelayo phakathi kwamaphoyinti okwakhiwa kuwo (amaphoyinti ayengezwa uze ufike ku-quarter yetholerensi), i-engeli enkulu kakhulu phakathi kwe-fillet nakuyo yonke inhlangothi emigqeni yokuthinta, nezinombolo ezifanayo nakwe-Union. Iradiyasi engafaneli (ibhola lingashiya inhlangothi, noma inhlangothi igoqa ngaphezu kwe-radius) inqatshwa ngokubiza inhlangothi, futhi ayishintshi lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet several edges\u003C/strong\u003E ijikeleza imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho wokuqala, bese izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho olandelayo, njalo njalo (inhlangothi ingaba ezinhlanganisweni eziningi, njengohlangothi lwaphezulu lwebhokisi ezine kuzo); yonke imiphetho ithola iradiyasi oyithayipha. Ukujikeleza ngakunye kwenziwa ku-solid njengoba kwakunjalo, bese kusikwa ngolandelelwano, ngakho i-odolo ayibaluleki. Lapho imiphetho emibili egoqiwe ihlangana esikhonweni lapho eminye imiphetho ihlala ibukhali, ama-fillet amabili ayahlangana ngomjikelezo wokuhlangana kwawo (i-crease). Lapho imiphetho yangaphandle emithathu egoqiwe yezinhlangothi ezintathu ezicaba ezihlangana ngesikwele ngeradiyasi eyodwa, isikhonco sibe yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Esphere patch\u003C/strong\u003E ethintana nazo zonke ntathu ama-fillet (susa ukumaka \u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhonco\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole isikhonco esinamawele esikhundleni salo); umphetho kumele ube ude okungenani kabili iradiyasi lapho zombili izinhlangothi zawo zingala sikhonco esinjalo. Umugqa womphumela ushho ukuthi imiphetho emingaki igoqwe nokuthi izikhonco zaphuma kanjani. Imiphetho yangaphakathi nayo ingagoqwa ndawonye, kodwa umphumela ongavali kabusha udlulisa umlayezo kuphela (umugqa uyashoma), ngakho uhlole.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThicken into a solid\u003C/strong\u003E inika ubuso ukuqina: khetha lo buso, thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuqina\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ufake \u003Cstrong\u003EEnye uhlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukhule ngenye indlela. Ubuso obusukile buyafakwa busuka kubuso futhi buyalinganiswa nakho (umugqa womphumela unikeza umehluko omkhulu kakhulu kusuka kokuqina); izindonga zilandela yonke imiphetho nayo yonke imigqa yokusika. Uma ubuso bugoqa ngaphezu kokuqina kulolo hlangothi, noma enye ingxenye yabo ilele eduze kunokuqina, iyanqatshwa, ibize ubuso nendawo, futhi ayishintshi lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-i-solid-engxenyeni\"\u003EGcina i-solid engxenyeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBake\u003C/strong\u003E (kwithuluzi le-Ubuso), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EGcina engxenyeni\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolid\u003C/strong\u003E, yenza i-solid umzimba wengxenye, njengoba i-STL evuliwe iba yiyo: khetha i-solid, ukuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eyengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E engxenyeni, \u003Cstrong\u003Eisikiwe\u003C/strong\u003E kuyo noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eihlanganiswe\u003C/strong\u003E nayo, kanye netholerensi (ukuthi izinxantathu zingakhashelwa kangakanani ebusweni eliqondile). Iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo yengxenye bese ivela ohlwini lwezici njengokungeniswa okuqanjwe ngegama le-solid. Ingxenye igcina izinxantathu, ngakho ivulwa futhi yakhiwe kabusha ngaphandle kobuso; i-solid eqondile ihlala ku-Ubuso, ngakho ungayibhaka futhi emva kokushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThumela i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP\u003C/strong\u003E (AP242) noma i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIGES\u003C/strong\u003E namajika nobuso ngendlela eqondile (amajika e-B-spline nobuso, kungabi kube izinxantathu). Ubuso ngalunye buyinhlangothi yalo, nokusika kwalo; i-solid ibhalwa njengegobolo elilodwa elivaliwe, umphetho ngamunye wabelwana ngabo bobabili ubuso njengoba ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD zilindele (umugqa wesimo ukhomba ukuthi ama-solid angaki aphumile ngale ndlela). Ku-IGES leyo solid ingumzimba omunye we-B-rep oqinile (entity 186 kuqhubeka igobolo elivaliwe 514, ubuso 510, amalupu 508, uhlu lwemiphetho 504 kanye nohlu lwamaphoyinti 502); i-solid engabhangqi ubuso bayo ngomphetho ngomphetho ibhalwa njengobuso obuhlukene, nomugqa uyakushoma. Ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa…\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda i-solid efana nalokho njenge-solid, kusuka ku-STEP nasku-IGES.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iphrofayili-yesikhumba-somkhumbi\"\u003EIphrofayili yesikhumba somkhumbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFair\u003C/strong\u003E (kwithuluzi le-Ubuso) ilinganisa wonke amajika ngesimo sawo eqondile: izimpendulo (lapho ishintsha ukugoba kwenye indlela iye kwenye), ukugoqeka okukhulu kakhulu, ukuhlehla kokugoqeka emaphuzwini awo okuphula kanye nokuqina kwawo — bese ibuyisela amajika anezimpendulo noma ukuhlehla ngamaphoyinti okulawula amancane ahlala ngaphakathi kwetholerensi oyinikezayo futhi angeqi kukho umpendulo. Dweba izitishi, amanzi nama-buttock njengamajika, awenze ahlanzeke ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EFair\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E isikhumba ngezitishi bese uhlola ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EZebra\u003C/strong\u003E. Amajika angahlanzekile avela futhi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E nge-fix ethi \u003Cstrong\u003ELungisa leli jika\u003C/strong\u003E. Ijika elifanele ukushintsha isiqondiso (isigaba esinomumo we-S) ligcina lowo mpendulo oyodwa. Ukuzinza, izikhungo nama-righting arms wesikhumba kusuka engxenyeni ye-solid: bona ithuluzi le-hydrostatics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuso-kusuka-ekuskeneni-ukuhlaziya-okuphambene\"\u003EUbuso kusuka ekuskeneni (ukuhlaziya okuphambene)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ingxenye enomesh oskenwe (i-STL evuliwe noma umzimba obhakiwe), khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E, bese kuqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFit surfaces to the scan\u003C/strong\u003E; umesh owakhiwe yingxenye uyiskena. Ithuluzi lifuna \u003Cstrong\u003Eizindiza\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamasilinda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamabhola\u003C/strong\u003E namakhoni (ubuso obuqondile okwakhiwa ngabo ingxenye emshinini; ngayinye ibonisa iradiyasi noma i-engeli ehhafu ayifumanile), lithole \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet\u003C/strong\u003E (imiphetho nezikhonco ezigoqiwe: isilinda esincane noma ibhola elithinta ngokuthintana kwezinhlangothi ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, eliboniswa ngeradiyasi nezinhlangothi elizihlanganisayo), \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet emaphethelweni\u003C/strong\u003E (i-torus: umphetho ogoqiwe lapho inhlangothi ecaba ihlangana nesilinda noma ikhoni, eboniswa ngeradiyasi yayo nangeradiyasi yesiyingi sayo) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet ashintshayo\u003C/strong\u003E (umphetho ogoqiwe lapho iradiyasi ishintsha khona, eboniswa ngeradiyasi kokubili amaphethelo), ifake \u003Cstrong\u003Eipetshi lobuso oluyodwa obubushelelezi\u003C/strong\u003E endaweni ebushelelezi, enamafinyila amancane, futhi isike yonke inhlangothi ngomugqa wengxenye yokuskena eyavela kuyo, ngakho imingxunyeni nezikhonco kuyahlala. Izinketho: \u003Cstrong\u003Eitholerensi\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuthi ingakanani ngamamilimitha ipoyinti lokuskena elingaba kude nendiza noma isilinda futhi lisabe lawo, nento ehlosiwe yepetshi lobuso oluhle), \u003Cstrong\u003Eingxenye encane kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E (isabelo sendawo yobuso) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enobuso obuningi kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuskena okufanayo nezinketho ezifanayo zinikeza ubuso obufanayo njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyithebula, umugqa owodwa ngobuso ngabunye: uhlobo lwalo, izinxantathu ezivela kuzo, nephutha \u003Cstrong\u003Eelilinganiswa ukusuka kokuskenwe kuya ebusweni\u003C/strong\u003E (i-rms, eyona enkulu, nesabelo samaphoyinti angaphakathi kwetholerensi). Amaphoyinti alinganiswayo ngamaphoyinti okuskena nephakathi kwenxantathu ngayinye. Iphutha alilinganiswa ngakolunye uhlangothi (ubuso kuya ekuskeneni), ngakho ubuso obudlula ekuskeneni ngeke buvele. Inothi ngaphansi kwethebula lishoma nokuthi yingakanani indawo eyayincane kakhulu ukuthi ingalingana. Ebonweni, amaphoyinti okuskena anemibala ngemephu yawo \u003Cstrong\u003Eyokukhuba\u003C/strong\u003E: eluhlaza emsebenzini, eluhlaza okotshani emaphakathi kwetholerensi, ebomvu etholerensini noma ngaphezulu (ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa imephu yokukhuba\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uyifihle). Izingxenye ezigoqeka emuva kwazo (ithubu evaliwe efakwe ngamapetshi obuso obubushelelezi, njengesibonelo) zidweshwa njengezingafakiwe, azikaphoqwa ibe yiyodwa ibe yiyodwa ubuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStitch the surfaces to a solid\u003C/strong\u003E isebenza zonke izindawo ezibonakalayo ezingasesolidini ibe yisolid evaliwe eyodwa. Ubuso oskenwe buhlangana kuphela ngaphakathi kwephutha lokuskena ngokwalo, ngakho izama umkhawulo omncane wokuhlangana ovala (ungaphezu kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Estitch distance\u003C/strong\u003E osethe kuwo) futhi inqaba ngamazwi lapho ubuso bungavali. Ayikaze ihlanganise igebe. I-\u003Cstrong\u003Ebokisi\u003C/strong\u003E enamaphethelo agoqiwe iyahlanganiswa uma ama-fillet ayo atholakala njengobuso bawo; umkhawulo wokuhlanganisa owavala uvela emphumeni. Isolid isebenza ngoku-Union, Subtract, Intersect no-\u003Cstrong\u003EBake into the part\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungakwenzi: \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet emaphethelweni\u003C/strong\u003E (i-torus) afunwa kuphela ezungeze i-axis yesilinda noma ikhoni esele litholakele, kanti \u003Cstrong\u003Eama-fillet ashintshayo\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela ngomphetho omuncu ngokuqondile (izigaxa zawo zisikwa zingazuzanga ngokuqondile kwenye indlela); ezinye izindawo ziphuma njengamapetshi obuso obubushelelezi uma ebushelelezi ngokwanele, futhi zishiywe uma zingenjalo; izindawo, amakhoni nama-fillet afunwa ngokukhetha okungahleliwe, ngakho okuncane kakhulu (izinxantathu ezimbalwa) kungaphuthelwa; imephu yokukhuba ikhombisa ibanga kusukela ekuskeneni kuya ebusweni, hhayi okulandelayo; izikena ezinkulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwezinxantathu ezingu-300,000) zenqatshwa lapha. Ubuso besilinda esijikeleza ngokuphelele busikwa buzungeze izimbobo, nosiko ubekwe lapho kungekho mbobo. Hlola bonke ubuso ngokuskena kwakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kukho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkugoqa imiphetho ehlangana esikhonweni sobuso obujikelezayo noma ngamaradiyasi ahlukene (ukuxuba kwamaphoyinti), i-fillet phakathi kobuso obungahlanganisi, i-fillet yangaphakathi ephela kubuso oluthambekile noma olujikelezayo, ama-Boolean nama-fillet abalwa ebusweni ngaphandle kwezinxantathu (lapha i-solid engine isebenza ngezinxantathu ngaphakathi kwetholerensi, bese kuthi wonke amaphoyinti abuyiselwe ebusweni eliqondile), umzimba obhakiwe olandela ubuso uma lushintsha, ukusika ubuso ngobunye ubuso ngaphandle kwe-Boolean, ukugcwalisa izimbobo ezinezinhlangothi ezingaphezu kwezine, ukuprojekthela amajika ebusweni.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indawo yokusebenza ethi Ubuso yenza amajika nobuso obubushelelezi bohlobo olusetshenziswa ezigqoko zomkhiqizo, izakhiwo zezimoto nezinqamu zemikhumbi: NURBS, izibalo ezifanayo nabanye abenzi bobuso. Konke kulinganiswa ebusweni eliqondile, hhayi ezinxantathu obuzibona. Usayizi ungamamilimitha, njengakwezinye zePartCraft. Khetha Ubuso ebhokisini le-Indawo yokusebenza. Ithuluzi lisinika Igoqekile, Loft, Sweep, Hambisana kanye Zebra; yonke imiyalo isephaneli esekudla. Umyalo ngamunye ukhomba okudingayo: chofoza amajika noma ubuso kumbono (eduze komphetho noma ekugcineni uma ucelwa lowo) noma ukhethe ohlwini; thayipha amaphoyinti, noma uwachofoze ebusweni bengxenye (ngaphandle kwengxenye ahlala endizeni yomhlabathi), bese ucindezela Enter. Amajika nobuso kugcinwa efayelini lengxenye eceleni kwe-solid. Awashintshi izici zengxenye: ephaneli inayo yayo i-Hlehlisa ne-Phinda wenze, isinyathelo esisodwa ngomyalo ngamunye. Amajika Ijika eledlula kumaphoyinti ledlula kuwo wonke amaphoyinti ochofozayo. Ijika ngamaphoyinti okulawula ilandela ikheshi lamaphoyinti kunalokho. Faka isiphethu, Phakamisa idigri kanye Ehlisa idigri zishintsha indlela ijika elichazwa ngayo ngaphandle kokulinyakazisa (ukwehlisa kwenqatshwa uma ijika lingalinyazwa ngaphezu kwetholerensi). Akha kabusha ijika linika inani elisha lamaphoyinti okulawula bese lisho ukuthi ilinyazwe kangakanani. Ijika elihambisanayo lenza umphetho wijika elodwa ludlule kolunye ngo-G0 (ukuthintana), G1 (indlela efanayo) noma G2 (futhi ukugoqeka okufanayo). Ijika elixubile lengeza ijika elisha phakathi kwemiphetho emibili, G1 noma G2. Ubuso Loft ngaphezu kwamajika amabili noma ngaphezulu, Ubuso oluyisigaxa phakathi kwamabili, Phuma ijika, Jikeleza ijika. Sweep ngerela elilodwa ithwala iphrofayili ngendlela ngaphandle kokuyigoqa, Sweep ngamarela amabili igcina izinsipha zeprofayili ezindlini zombili. Ama-sweep ayalinganiswa: umphumela utshela ukuthi uhlale eduze kangakanani nesweep langempela. Ubuso kusuka kunethiwekhi yamajika lidlula ngegridi yamajika (ngalinye liwela kwelinye ngalinye kanye). Ipetshi kusuka emaphethelweni amaneligcwalisa amajika amane ahlangana ezikhonweni zawo. Match surface yenza umphetho wobuso uhlangane nomakhelwane nge-G0, G1 noma G2; Blend surface yengeza ubuso phakathi kwemiphetho emibili. Offset surface, Extend surface (ubuso buqhubeka njengoba bebehamba), Rebuild surface. Ukuhlola ikhwalithi Ithebula Imiphetho ehlanganyelwe libala yonke imiphetho ezimbili zobuso ezihlanganyelwa yona, nesikhala (mm), i-engeli phakathi kwazo (°) nokuhlehla kokugoqeka (1/mm), kanye nokuthi lokho kwenza yini i-G0, G1 noma G2. Umphetho owedlula okucelile uvela ku-Izinkinga ne-fix ethi Hambisana. Imigqa ye-Zebra nemibala ye-curvature ivela kubuso obuqondile: imigqa engaphuli phezu komphetho isho i-G1; imigqa egcina nobubanzi bayo isho i-G2. I-G0–G2 iyalinganiswa, ngamaphoyinti angu-33 ngomphetho ngamunye. I-G3 nekhwalithi \"class A\" akulinganiswa futhi akuthathwa njengokufakazelwe. Sika ubuso Iqembu le-Sika lisika ubuso ngaphandle kokushintsha isimo sawo: ubuso ugcina wonke amaphoyinti awo okulawula, kuboniswa, kubalwe kanye kubhalwe ingxenye kuphela ngaphakathi komugqa. Sika ngesikwele kanye Sika ngesiyingi zisebenza ngesabelo (0 kuya ku-1) sobuso kuyo yonke indlela, ngakho azidingi ukukhethwa kumbono; Sika ngejika ithatha ijika elivaliwe elilele ebusweni (liyaprojektwa libe ebusweni, futhi lenqatshwa ngamazwi uma livulekile noma likude ngaphezu kwetholerensi). Faka i-Sika imbobo ukuze ususe ingaphakathi komugqa; uyishiye ukuze ugcine ingaphakathi kuphela. Ubuso bungaba nomugqa oyodwa ogcinwayo namanye amanani embobo; umugqa ohlanganayo nomunye unqatshwa. Susa ukusika ibonisa ubuso bonke futhi. I-Undo yephaneli ithatha ukusika njengesinye isinyathelo. I-STEP ithwala ukusika njengemingcele yobuso kanti i-IGES njengobuso obusikiwe (entity 144); zombili ziyakufunda. Ama-solid nama-Boolean Iqembu le-Amasolid liguqula ubuso bube yimizimba evaliwe futhi lihlanganise. I-solid lapha isethi yobuso bephaneli ehlangene evala ivolumu; ubuso bayo bugcina bungu-NURBS oqinile ngemingcele yabo. Box solid, Cylinder solid kanye Sphere solid zenza enye ngosayizi abhalwe (ku-mm): ibhokisi lobuso obucaba eyisithupha, isilinda sohlangothi oluzungezile namaphethelo amabili acaba asikwe ngomjikelezo, nebhola lobuso obuyodwa oluhlehliswe. Solid kusuka kubuso ihlanganisa ubuso owenzile wena. Khetha, noma ungakhethi lutho ukuze usebenzise bonke ubuso obubonakalayo okungekho ku-solid. Bahlanganiswa ngaphakathi kwetholerensi: uma bengavali, akukho lutho olushintshayo futhi iphaneli ithi izinkinga zamaphethelo angaphansi zingaki nokuthi kufanele zihlangane kanjani. Union, Subtract (i-solid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala) kanye Intersect (kuphela okwabelwana ngakho bobabili) zithatha ama-solid amabili: chofoza ubuso ngalunye kumbono, noma cindezela Khetha ohlwini lwe-Amasolid. Faka Gcina ama-solid amabili ukuze uwagcine eceleni komphumela. I-Boolean igcina bonke ubuso ebusweni balo eliqondile futhi iyasika ngemigqa emisha yokusika ngokuhlangana. Umugqa womphumela unikeza izinombolo ezilinganisiwe: ukuthi amaphoyinti e-solid engine adinga ukunyakaza kangakanani ukuze ahlale ebusweni eliqondile (ngaphezu kwetholerensi), ukuthi amaphoyinti okuhlangana ahlale eduze kangakanani kubobabili ubuso (ngokuvamile amaphesenti ezigidi zomilimitha), ivolumu, nokuthi ubuso obusha buyavala yini uma buhlanganiswa kabusha kusuka ebusweni baleyo ngqo. Amavolumu alinganiswa ezinxantathu ngaphakathi kwetholerensi (0.05 mm ngaphandle uma usetha enye), ngakho ivolumu yebhola noma yesilinda ifundeka ngaphansi kancane kwe-eyeqondile: ithole elincane liyasondela. I-Boolean engenziwa ngokuhlanzekile (ama-solid awabelani lutho, umugqa ungaziqanda) inqatshwa ngamazwi futhi ayishintshi lutho. I-Boolean eyodwa iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo yephaneli. Ohlwini lwe-Amasolid, Ungroup igcina ubuso njengobuso obujwayelekile; ibhini liyasusa i-solid kanye nobuso bayo. Ama-fillet nokujiyisa Fillet between faces ijikeleza umphetho lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili ze-solid eyodwa zihlangana: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili (embonweni, noma nge-Khetha ohlwini), thayipha iradiyasi kanye, uma iradiyasi ishintsha ngomphetho, iradiyasi ekugcineni (0 igcina iradiyasi eyodwa). Ibhola lale radiyasi liyagudluzwa ngomphetho lithinta zombili izinhlangothi; i-fillet iwumjikelezo oqondile okusala kuwo wonke amaphoyinti, uhlanganiswe ube bubuso bodwa, nezinhlangothi zombili zisikwe lapho ibhola lithinta khona. Umphetho wangaphandle ulahlekelwa yimpahla, ikhona yangaphakathi iyanda. Umugqa womphumela unikeza okwalinganiswa: ubuso be-fillet bukude kangakanani nebhola elishayelayo phakathi kwamaphoyinti okwakhiwa kuwo (amaphoyinti ayengezwa uze ufike ku-quarter yetholerensi), i-engeli enkulu kakhulu phakathi kwe-fillet nakuyo yonke inhlangothi emigqeni yokuthinta, nezinombolo ezifanayo nakwe-Union. Iradiyasi engafaneli (ibhola lingashiya inhlangothi, noma inhlangothi igoqa ngaphezu kwe-radius) inqatshwa ngokubiza inhlangothi, futhi ayishintshi lutho. Fillet several edges ijikeleza imiphetho eminingi ngesinyathelo esisodwa: khetha izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho wokuqala, bese izinhlangothi ezimbili zomphetho olandelayo, njalo njalo (inhlangothi ingaba ezinhlanganisweni eziningi, njengohlangothi lwaphezulu lwebhokisi ezine kuzo); yonke imiphetho ithola iradiyasi oyithayipha. Ukujikeleza ngakunye kwenziwa ku-solid njengoba kwakunjalo, bese kusikwa ngolandelelwano, ngakho i-odolo ayibaluleki. Lapho imiphetho emibili egoqiwe ihlangana esikhonweni lapho eminye imiphetho ihlala ibukhali, ama-fillet amabili ayahlangana ngomjikelezo wokuhlangana kwawo (i-crease). Lapho imiphetho yangaphandle emithathu egoqiwe yezinhlangothi ezintathu ezicaba ezihlangana ngesikwele ngeradiyasi eyodwa, isikhonco sibe yi-sphere patch ethintana nazo zonke ntathu ama-fillet (susa ukumaka Izikhonco ukuze uthole isikhonco esinamawele esikhundleni salo); umphetho kumele ube ude okungenani kabili iradiyasi lapho zombili izinhlangothi zawo zingala sikhonco esinjalo. Umugqa womphumela ushho ukuthi imiphetho emingaki igoqwe nokuthi izikhonco zaphuma kanjani. Imiphetho yangaphakathi nayo ingagoqwa ndawonye, kodwa umphumela ongavali kabusha udlulisa umlayezo kuphela (umugqa uyashoma), ngakho uhlole. Thicken into a solid inika ubuso ukuqina: khetha lo buso, thayipha ukuqina, futhi ufake Enye uhlangothi ukuze ukhule ngenye indlela. Ubuso obusukile buyafakwa busuka kubuso futhi buyalinganiswa nakho (umugqa womphumela unikeza umehluko omkhulu kakhulu kusuka kokuqina); izindonga zilandela yonke imiphetho nayo yonke imigqa yokusika. Uma ubuso bugoqa ngaphezu kokuqina kulolo hlangothi, noma enye ingxenye yabo ilele eduze kunokuqina, iyanqatshwa, ibize ubuso nendawo, futhi ayishintshi lutho. Gcina i-solid engxenyeni Bake (kwithuluzi le-Ubuso), noma Gcina engxenyeni ohlwini lwe-Amasolid, yenza i-solid umzimba wengxenye, njengoba i-STL evuliwe iba yiyo: khetha i-solid, ukuthi yengeziwe engxenyeni, isikiwe kuyo noma ihlanganiswe nayo, kanye netholerensi (ukuthi izinxantathu zingakhashelwa kangakanani ebusweni eliqondile). Iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo yengxenye bese ivela ohlwini lwezici njengokungeniswa okuqanjwe ngegama le-solid. Ingxenye igcina izinxantathu, ngakho ivulwa futhi yakhiwe kabusha ngaphandle kobuso; i-solid eqondile ihlala ku-Ubuso, ngakho ungayibhaka futhi emva kokushintsha. Amafayela Thumela i-STEP (AP242) noma i-IGES namajika nobuso ngendlela eqondile (amajika e-B-spline nobuso, kungabi kube izinxantathu). Ubuso ngalunye buyinhlangothi yalo, nokusika kwalo; i-solid ibhalwa njengegobolo elilodwa elivaliwe, umphetho ngamunye wabelwana ngabo bobabili ubuso njengoba ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD zilindele (umugqa wesimo ukhomba ukuthi ama-solid angaki aphumile ngale ndlela). Ku-IGES leyo solid ingumzimba omunye we-B-rep oqinile (entity 186 kuqhubeka igobolo elivaliwe 514, ubuso 510, amalupu 508, uhlu lwemiphetho 504 kanye nohlu lwamaphoyinti 502); i-solid engabhangqi ubuso bayo ngomphetho ngomphetho ibhalwa njengobuso obuhlukene, nomugqa uyakushoma. Ku-Ngenisa… ifunda i-solid efana nalokho njenge-solid, kusuka ku-STEP nasku-IGES. Iphrofayili yesikhumba somkhumbi Fair (kwithuluzi le-Ubuso) ilinganisa wonke amajika ngesimo sawo eqondile: izimpendulo (lapho ishintsha ukugoba kwenye indlela iye kwenye), ukugoqeka okukhulu kakhulu, ukuhlehla kokugoqeka emaphuzwini awo okuphula kanye nokuqina kwawo — bese ibuyisela amajika anezimpendulo noma ukuhlehla ngamaphoyinti okulawula amancane ahlala ngaphakathi kwetholerensi oyinikezayo futhi angeqi kukho umpendulo. Dweba izitishi, amanzi nama-buttock njengamajika, awenze ahlanzeke ngokuthi Fair, bese Loft isikhumba ngezitishi bese uhlola ngo-Zebra. Amajika angahlanzekile avela futhi ku-Izinkinga nge-fix ethi Lungisa leli jika. Ijika elifanele ukushintsha isiqondiso (isigaba esinomumo we-S) ligcina lowo mpendulo oyodwa. Ukuzinza, izikhungo nama-righting arms wesikhumba kusuka engxenyeni ye-solid: bona ithuluzi le-hydrostatics. Ubuso kusuka ekuskeneni (ukuhlaziya okuphambene) Vula ingxenye enomesh oskenwe (i-STL evuliwe noma umzimba obhakiwe), khetha Ubuso ebhokisini le-Indawo yokusebenza, bese kuqembu le-Scan khetha Fit surfaces to the scan; umesh owakhiwe yingxenye uyiskena. Ithuluzi lifuna izindiza, amasilinda, amabhola namakhoni (ubuso obuqondile okwakhiwa ngabo ingxenye emshinini; ngayinye ibonisa iradiyasi noma i-engeli ehhafu ayifumanile), lithole ama-fillet (imiphetho nezikhonco ezigoqiwe: isilinda esincane noma ibhola elithinta ngokuthintana kwezinhlangothi ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, eliboniswa ngeradiyasi nezinhlangothi elizihlanganisayo), ama-fillet emaphethelweni (i-torus: umphetho ogoqiwe lapho inhlangothi ecaba ihlangana nesilinda noma ikhoni, eboniswa ngeradiyasi yayo nangeradiyasi yesiyingi sayo) kanye ama-fillet ashintshayo (umphetho ogoqiwe lapho iradiyasi ishintsha khona, eboniswa ngeradiyasi kokubili amaphethelo), ifake ipetshi lobuso oluyodwa obubushelelezi endaweni ebushelelezi, enamafinyila amancane, futhi isike yonke inhlangothi ngomugqa wengxenye yokuskena eyavela kuyo, ngakho imingxunyeni nezikhonco kuyahlala. Izinketho: itholerensi (ukuthi ingakanani ngamamilimitha ipoyinti lokuskena elingaba kude nendiza noma isilinda futhi lisabe lawo, nento ehlosiwe yepetshi lobuso oluhle), ingxenye encane kakhulu (isabelo sendawo yobuso) kanye nobuso obuningi kakhulu. Ukuskena okufanayo nezinketho ezifanayo zinikeza ubuso obufanayo njalo. Umphumela uyithebula, umugqa owodwa ngobuso ngabunye: uhlobo lwalo, izinxantathu ezivela kuzo, nephutha elilinganiswa ukusuka kokuskenwe kuya ebusweni (i-rms, eyona enkulu, nesabelo samaphoyinti angaphakathi kwetholerensi). Amaphoyinti alinganiswayo ngamaphoyinti okuskena nephakathi kwenxantathu ngayinye. Iphutha alilinganiswa ngakolunye uhlangothi (ubuso kuya ekuskeneni), ngakho ubuso obudlula ekuskeneni ngeke buvele. Inothi ngaphansi kwethebula lishoma nokuthi yingakanani indawo eyayincane kakhulu ukuthi ingalingana. Ebonweni, amaphoyinti okuskena anemibala ngemephu yawo yokukhuba: eluhlaza emsebenzini, eluhlaza okotshani emaphakathi kwetholerensi, ebomvu etholerensini noma ngaphezulu (ukhetha Bonisa imephu yokukhuba ukuze uyifihle). Izingxenye ezigoqeka emuva kwazo (ithubu evaliwe efakwe ngamapetshi obuso obubushelelezi, njengesibonelo) zidweshwa njengezingafakiwe, azikaphoqwa ibe yiyodwa ibe yiyodwa ubuso. Stitch the surfaces to a solid isebenza zonke izindawo ezibonakalayo ezingasesolidini ibe yisolid evaliwe eyodwa. Ubuso oskenwe buhlangana kuphela ngaphakathi kwephutha lokuskena ngokwalo, ngakho izama umkhawulo omncane wokuhlangana ovala (ungaphezu kwe-stitch distance osethe kuwo) futhi inqaba ngamazwi lapho ubuso bungavali. Ayikaze ihlanganise igebe. I-bokisi enamaphethelo agoqiwe iyahlanganiswa uma ama-fillet ayo atholakala njengobuso bawo; umkhawulo wokuhlanganisa owavala uvela emphumeni. Isolid isebenza ngoku-Union, Subtract, Intersect no-Bake into the part. Okungakwenzi: ama-fillet emaphethelweni (i-torus) afunwa kuphela ezungeze i-axis yesilinda noma ikhoni esele litholakele, kanti ama-fillet ashintshayo kuphela ngomphetho omuncu ngokuqondile (izigaxa zawo zisikwa zingazuzanga ngokuqondile kwenye indlela); ezinye izindawo ziphuma njengamapetshi obuso obubushelelezi uma ebushelelezi ngokwanele, futhi zishiywe uma zingenjalo; izindawo, amakhoni nama-fillet afunwa ngokukhetha okungahleliwe, ngakho okuncane kakhulu (izinxantathu ezimbalwa) kungaphuthelwa; imephu yokukhuba ikhombisa ibanga kusukela ekuskeneni kuya ebusweni, hhayi okulandelayo; izikena ezinkulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwezinxantathu ezingu-300,000) zenqatshwa lapha. Ubuso besilinda esijikeleza ngokuphelele busikwa buzungeze izimbobo, nosiko ubekwe lapho kungekho mbobo. Hlola bonke ubuso ngokuskena kwakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kukho. Akukakwakhiwa Ukugoqa imiphetho ehlangana esikhonweni sobuso obujikelezayo noma ngamaradiyasi ahlukene (ukuxuba kwamaphoyinti), i-fillet phakathi kobuso obungahlanganisi, i-fillet yangaphakathi ephela kubuso oluthambekile noma olujikelezayo, ama-Boolean nama-fillet abalwa ebusweni ngaphandle kwezinxantathu (lapha i-solid engine isebenza ngezinxantathu ngaphakathi kwetholerensi, bese kuthi wonke amaphoyinti abuyiselwe ebusweni eliqondile), umzimba obhakiwe olandela ubuso uma lushintsha, ukusika ubuso ngobunye ubuso ngaphandle kwe-Boolean, ukugcwalisa izimbobo ezinezinhlangothi ezingaphezu kwezine, ukuprojekthela amajika ebusweni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nest-flat-parts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini","summary":"Beka izingxenye ezibhethiwe ephepheni noma ekoyini ngempahla encane kakhulu ePartCraft ingayithola, ingasondelani kakhulu kunebanga olinikezayo, bese ulondoloza ukuhlelwa njenge-DXF yomshini wokusika nge-laser, plasma, waterjet noma router.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["ukuhlela","hlela","ishidi","ipuleti","irola","laser","plasma","waterjet","router","ukusika","isivuno","ukusetshenziswa kwempahla","imfucuza","inkunkuma","ibanga","ububanzi bokusika","uhlangothi lokuqondisa","dxf","iphathini eliyisicaba","izinkomba"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuvula","text":"Ukuvula","level":2},{"id":"setha","text":"Setha","level":2},{"id":"londoloza","text":"Londoloza","level":2},{"id":"sika-amashidi-g-code","text":"Sika amashidi (G-code)","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-uhlole","text":"Okufanele uhlole","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlela\u003C/strong\u003E kubeka izingxenye eziningi ephepheni ukuze kushiyeke impahla encane kakhulu. I-PartCraft ibeka izingxenye ngayinye ngayinye, ngayinye lapho igcina khona ubude obufishane kakhulu bebhodi, izama ukuhlelwa okuningana futhi iqede emasekhondini ambalwa, bese igcina okuhle kakhulu. Izingxenye zingahlala emgodini wezinye nasemgodini we-L noma i-U.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula\"\u003EUkuvula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini…\u003C/span\u003E ivula ngephathini eliyisicaba lengxenye, noma — kumhlangano — ngamaphathini aliyisicaba wazo zonke izingxenye zeshidi lensimbi, njengamakhophi amaningi njengoba kukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-ingxenye yeshidi lensimbi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ezishidini…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephathini eliyisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza zonke izinkomba ezivaliwe ku-DXF njengezingxenye: umdwebo ovela ku-CadCraft olondolozwe njenge-DXF, noma ifayela elivela kwisofthiwe yomshini wakho wokusika. Inkomba ngaphakathi kwenye iba yimbobo kuyo. Imigqa nemisongo ehlanganiswa ngokuphela ngokuphela ibalwa njengenkomba eyodwa. Amafayela ngamayintshi, amasentimitha noma amamitha ashintshelwa ku-mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubeka ishidi lensimbi libheke phansi kudinga i-geometry kernel eqondile (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sheet-metal\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sheet-metal\"\u003EIshidi lensimbi\u003C/a\u003E). Izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF zihlala zisebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha\"\u003ESetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-ingxenye ngayinye nikeza \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuthi udinga zingaki\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enomqondo\u003C/strong\u003E wayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENoma yiluphi uhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengoba kudwetshiwe ishidi\u003C/span\u003E lelo shidi elishiwe noma elizungezwe okufanele lihambe ngohlangothi olulodwa, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokuphambene nesishidi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla etholakalayo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapuleti\u003C/span\u003E abude nobubanzi obunikeziwe (nenani olinalo; 0 = njengoba kudingeka), noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrola\u003C/span\u003E lobubanzi obunikeziwe, lude njengoba kudingeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo wemaphethelo\u003C/strong\u003E ugcinwa uvalekile emaphethelweni ayo onke eshidini (ngamaklampu noma iphethelo elingalingene).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga phakathi kwezingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E yibanga elincane kakhulu phakathi kwemigqa emibili yokusika: okungenani ububanzi bokusika komshini wakho, kanye nalokho impahla edingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujikeleza\u003C/strong\u003E: izinkombandlela ingxenye engajikelezwa kuzo, zonke ngama-90° ngokuzenzakalela. Ukujikeleza okumbalwa kusebenza ngokushesha; okuningi kungasebenzisa ishidi ngcono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye zingaguqulwa\u003C/strong\u003E kuvumela ingxenye ibekwe iphenduke. Yishiye kungasetshenziswa ishidi lensimbi: iphathini eliyisicaba elibekwe liguquliwe ligoba ngakolunye uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E. Ukubuka kwangaphambili kukhombisa wonke amashidi; okuqukethwe kutshela ukuthi zingaki izipuleti (noma yingakanani irola elisetshenzisiwe) nokuthi izingxenye zithatha impahla engakanani. Okungafakeki kuyabhalwa ngegama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-DXF\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ukuhlelwa njenge-DXF (R12, mm), ishidi ngalinye ngaphansi kwelilandelayo: imigqa yamashidi ku-ungqimba SHEET, izingxenye ku-PARTS (imisongo igcinwa njengemisongo), futhi igama lengxenye ngayinye ku-LABELS.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuxuba izingxenye eziningi kuvame ukuhlela ngcono kunamakhophi amaningi engxenye eyodwa: izingxenye ezincane zigcwalisa izikhala phakathi kwezinkulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-amashidi-g-code\"\u003ESika amashidi (G-code)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › Amashidi ahlelwe ku-G-code\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda i-DXF ehlelwe (leyo, noma amashidi we-add-on ye-Cabinets ku-CadCraft) futhi yenze uhlelo olulodwa ngeshidi ngalinye ngokusebenzisa i-post oyikhethayo: izimbobo nezikhala kuqala, bese izinkomba, ngayinye isikwe ngeradiyasi yethuluzi ngaphandle kwengxenye, ngaphuthelwa ishidi kanye ne-1 mm ngaphezulu, nemigqa yokubambelela uma uyicela. Uhlu lwama-post lufaka ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi kanye nawesifundo sakho se-Manufacture. Hlola ngayinye imikhondo kusimulator ngaphambi kokuyisebenzisa: ukubhola namacavity akwenziwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-uhlole\"\u003EOkufanele uhlole\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ihlola lonke uhlelo futhi kumabanga angempela (hhayi igridi eyasetshenziswa ukusesha): akukho zingxenye ezimbili eziseduze kakhulu kunebanga, nalutho emikhawulweni. Ayihleli ukusika: ukungena, ukuhleleka kokusika, ukusika imiphetho eyabelwanwe kanye nokugcina ishidi elisalayo kungumsebenzi wesofthiwe yomshini wakho wokusika. Hlola i-DXF khona ngaphambi kokusika.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukuhlela kubeka izingxenye eziningi ephepheni ukuze kushiyeke impahla encane kakhulu. I-PartCraft ibeka izingxenye ngayinye ngayinye, ngayinye lapho igcina khona ubude obufishane kakhulu bebhodi, izama ukuhlelwa okuningana futhi iqede emasekhondini ambalwa, bese igcina okuhle kakhulu. Izingxenye zingahlala emgodini wezinye nasemgodini we-L noma i-U. Ukuvula Thumela › Hlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini… ivula ngephathini eliyisicaba lengxenye, noma — kumhlangano — ngamaphathini aliyisicaba wazo zonke izingxenye zeshidi lensimbi, njengamakhophi amaningi njengoba kukhona. Ku-ingxenye yeshidi lensimbi, Linganisa bese Hlela ezishidini… ngaphansi kwephathini eliyisicaba. Engeza izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF… yengeza zonke izinkomba ezivaliwe ku-DXF njengezingxenye: umdwebo ovela ku-CadCraft olondolozwe njenge-DXF, noma ifayela elivela kwisofthiwe yomshini wakho wokusika. Inkomba ngaphakathi kwenye iba yimbobo kuyo. Imigqa nemisongo ehlanganiswa ngokuphela ngokuphela ibalwa njengenkomba eyodwa. Amafayela ngamayintshi, amasentimitha noma amamitha ashintshelwa ku-mm. Ukubeka ishidi lensimbi libheke phansi kudinga i-geometry kernel eqondile (bona Ishidi lensimbi). Izinkomba ezivela ku-DXF zihlala zisebenza. Setha Ku-ingxenye ngayinye nikeza ukuthi udinga zingaki kanye nomqondo wayo: Noma yiluphi uhlangothi, Njengoba kudwetshiwe ishidi lelo shidi elishiwe noma elizungezwe okufanele lihambe ngohlangothi olulodwa, noma Ngokuphambene nesishidi. Ngaphansi kwe-Amashidi: Impahla etholakalayo: Amapuleti abude nobubanzi obunikeziwe (nenani olinalo; 0 = njengoba kudingeka), noma Irola lobubanzi obunikeziwe, lude njengoba kudingeka. Umkhawulo wemaphethelo ugcinwa uvalekile emaphethelweni ayo onke eshidini (ngamaklampu noma iphethelo elingalingene). Ibanga phakathi kwezingxenye yibanga elincane kakhulu phakathi kwemigqa emibili yokusika: okungenani ububanzi bokusika komshini wakho, kanye nalokho impahla edingayo. Ukujikeleza: izinkombandlela ingxenye engajikelezwa kuzo, zonke ngama-90° ngokuzenzakalela. Ukujikeleza okumbalwa kusebenza ngokushesha; okuningi kungasebenzisa ishidi ngcono. Izingxenye zingaguqulwa kuvumela ingxenye ibekwe iphenduke. Yishiye kungasetshenziswa ishidi lensimbi: iphathini eliyisicaba elibekwe liguquliwe ligoba ngakolunye uhlangothi. Cindezela Hlela. Ukubuka kwangaphambili kukhombisa wonke amashidi; okuqukethwe kutshela ukuthi zingaki izipuleti (noma yingakanani irola elisetshenzisiwe) nokuthi izingxenye zithatha impahla engakanani. Okungafakeki kuyabhalwa ngegama. Londoloza Londoloza i-DXF ibhala ukuhlelwa njenge-DXF (R12, mm), ishidi ngalinye ngaphansi kwelilandelayo: imigqa yamashidi ku-ungqimba SHEET, izingxenye ku-PARTS (imisongo igcinwa njengemisongo), futhi igama lengxenye ngayinye ku-LABELS. Ukuxuba izingxenye eziningi kuvame ukuhlela ngcono kunamakhophi amaningi engxenye eyodwa: izingxenye ezincane zigcwalisa izikhala phakathi kwezinkulu. Sika amashidi (G-code) Thumela › Amashidi ahlelwe ku-G-code ifunda i-DXF ehlelwe (leyo, noma amashidi we-add-on ye-Cabinets ku-CadCraft) futhi yenze uhlelo olulodwa ngeshidi ngalinye ngokusebenzisa i-post oyikhethayo: izimbobo nezikhala kuqala, bese izinkomba, ngayinye isikwe ngeradiyasi yethuluzi ngaphandle kwengxenye, ngaphuthelwa ishidi kanye ne-1 mm ngaphezulu, nemigqa yokubambelela uma uyicela. Uhlu lwama-post lufaka ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi kanye nawesifundo sakho se-Manufacture. Hlola ngayinye imikhondo kusimulator ngaphambi kokuyisebenzisa: ukubhola namacavity akwenziwa. Okufanele uhlole I-PartCraft ihlola lonke uhlelo futhi kumabanga angempela (hhayi igridi eyasetshenziswa ukusesha): akukho zingxenye ezimbili eziseduze kakhulu kunebanga, nalutho emikhawulweni. Ayihleli ukusika: ukungena, ukuhleleka kokusika, ukusika imiphetho eyabelwanwe kanye nokugcina ishidi elisalayo kungumsebenzi wesofthiwe yomshini wakho wokusika. Hlola i-DXF khona ngaphambi kokusika.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde","summary":"Kopisha i-geometry yesikethi, izakhi nezingxenye zenhlanganisela; namathisela lapho ucofoza noma endaweni efanayo; phinda ngesinyathelo esisodwa; nokuthi yini eyeza nekhophi nokuthi yini engeyeza.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["kopisha","namathisela","sika","phinda","ibhodi lokukopisha","namathisela endaweni","khetha konke","khetha lutho","susa","ctrl c","ctrl v","ctrl d","isibonelo","ingxenye","kopisha isikethi","kopisha isakhi","kopisha ingxenye"],"headings":[{"id":"esikethini","text":"Esikethini","level":2},{"id":"emlandweni","text":"Emlandweni","level":2},{"id":"enhlanganiselweni","text":"Enhlanganiselweni","level":2},{"id":"ibhodi-lokukopisha","text":"Ibhodi lokukopisha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E kwisisetshenziswa linezinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E kanye nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E enale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/span\u003E, ngalinye nokhiye walo. Okukopishwayo kuncike lapho ukhona: i-geometry esikethini esivuliwe, isakhi emlandweni, noma ingxenye enhlanganiselweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto engamnyama (impunga) ayikwazi ukusebenza njengamanje. Mamatheka phezu kwayo: itulo lencazelo lithi kungani, isibonelo &quot;Khetha i-geometry yesikethi kuqala&quot; noma &quot;Ibhodi lokukopisha libamba Sketch2 no-Extrude2: izakhi ziyanamathela emlandweni, ngakho phuma kusikethi kuqala&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikethini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEmlandweni\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEnhlanganiselweni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti namajika akhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi, i-extrude, i-revolve noma umgodi okhethiwe (kanye nesikethi sawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ekhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha, bese uyasusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha, bese usula isakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha, bese ususa ingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi ilandela inkomba; chofoza lapho iya khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza ikhophi ekugcineni komlando\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi entsha eceleni kwezinye izingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzixhumanisweni ezifanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengo-Namathisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEndaweni efanayo nengxenye ekopishiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha uhambise ngesinyathelo esisodwa; ibhodi lokukopisha alishintshwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi yesibili ngemuva kwakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi yesibili eceleni kwezinye izingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhi (ibuza uma ezinye zisisebenzisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye noma uxhumanisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke esikethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsula okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsula okukhethiwe nokukhethwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsula okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke ukunamathisela, ukuphinda nokusika kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ohlwini lokuHlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakuhlehlisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakubuyisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikethini\"\u003EEsikethini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okufanele kukopishwe: chofoza kukho, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ukuze wengeze, donsa iwindi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha yesimo itshela okukopishiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhophi enemigqa eyiqhezu ilandela inkomba, ibanjwe ngephakathi layo. Iyabambelela emaphoyinteni: beka isikhungo sendilinga ekopishiwe kuphoyinti ngokuchofoza lelo phoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho iya khona. I-geometry enamathisiwe ihlala ikhethiwe, ngakho ungayidonsa noma wengeze ukuxhumana kuyo ngokushesha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela ukunamathisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuza nayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa, indilinga noma ibhengezi ekopishiwe iletha amaphoyinti ayo okuphela kanye nesikhungo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana nezilinganiso \u003Cstrong\u003Ephakathi kwezinto ezikopishiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ziyeza: irektangula ekopishiwe isahlala iyirektangula, nosayizi bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana \u003Cstrong\u003Enejiyomethri ongayikopishanga\u003C/strong\u003E, nasemsukeni, kuyalahlwa. Ibha yesimo iyazibala: &quot;Ukuxhumana okungu-2 nejiyomethri ngaphandle kwekhophi ngeke kuze.&quot; Ngakho ikhophi enamathisiwe ikhululekile ukuhamba kuze kube yilapho uyixhuma ngokuxhumana noma ngezilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphoyinti elibotshiwe lihlala libotshiwe endaweni yalo entsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E ibeka ikhophi ngqo ezixhumanisweni zokuqala, kulesi sikethi noma kwesinye: iyasiza ukuletha iphrofayili esikethini esisodwa iyise kwesinye. Esikethini esifanayo ikhophi ilele phezu kokuqala; yidonse ukuyikhipha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ikopisha okukhethiwe iqale ukuyibeka ngokushesha, ingathinti okusebhodini lokukopisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphinda isikhungo somgodi noma isilotsha izikhathi eziningi, kopisha kanye bese unamathisela izikhathi eziningi: yonke \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqala ikhophi entsha elandela inkomba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"emlandweni\"\u003EEmlandweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isikethi, i-extrude, i-revolve noma umgodi emlandweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasikopisha. Isakhi esisekelwe esikethini sikopishwa kanye nesikethi sawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yengeza ikhophi ekugcineni komlando (ebhalwe ngebha yokubuyela emuva uma ubuyele emuva), ngamagama amasha afana ne-Sketch3 ne-Extrude2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhophi ihlala endizeni noma ebusweni obufanayo nokokuqala, ngakho yakhiwa phezu kwawo futhi ingxenye ibukeka ifanayo. Khetha isikethi esisha bese ushintsha indiza yaso kuphaneli yesokudla, noma uyivule bese udonsa noma ulinganise kabusha iphrofayili, ukuze uhambise ikhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENamathisela \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwenye ingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E: vula leyo ngxenye bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Uma isikethi sekhophi sasebusweni ingxenye engenalo, siyahamba siye endizeni engaphambili, futhi ibha yesimo iyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E yenza ukukopisha nokunamathisela ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ngaphakathi kwengxenye efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha isakhi, bese ilisusa (ibuza kuqala uma ezinye izakhi zilisebenzisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiumo, izibuko, ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell nezinto eziqinile ezilethwe azikwazi ukukopishwa: zincike emaphethelweni, ezindaweni noma ezakhini ezikhethwe kule ngxenye. Kopisha isikethi noma isakhi azakhiwe kuso kunalokho, noma yenza umumo wakho ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enhlanganiselweni\"\u003EEnhlanganiselweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ingxenye embonweni noma ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhophi entsha iyingxenye \u003Cstrong\u003Eefanayo\u003C/strong\u003E: hlela eyodwa bese zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha. Iveza ama-20 mm ngakwesokudla kwakho konke okuseNhlanganiselweni, iphendulwe ngendlela efanayo nekhophi, futhi ihlala lapho kuze kube yilapho uxhumanisi eyibeka khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyibeka ngqo lapho kukhona ingxenye ekopishiwe; yixhume ukuze uyihambise (ukuhlehliswa kuxhumanisi wesilayidi kuyiphusha phambili).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkunamathisela ingxenye ekopishwe kwenye inhlanganisela kuletha ingxenye, njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka\u003C/span\u003E kusuka efayelini layo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E yenza okufanayo ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E, futhi isebenza nalapho kungakhethwe lutho (ikopisha ingxenye yokugcina).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibhodi-lokukopisha\"\u003EIbhodi lokukopisha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyibhodi lokukopisha le-PartCraft uqobo, hhayi elekhompyutha: awukwazi ukunamathisela i-geometry ye-PartCraft kwenye iphrogramu, noma umbhalo emibonweni ye-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELigcinwa kulesi sibhanselwa, ukuze elinye ithebhu le-PartCraft linamathisele lokho okukopishile. Liyafundwa bese lihlolwa njengefayela elivuliwe; noma yini elimele noma evela kwenye inguqulo iyenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye enefayela elikhulu le-STEP elingenisiwe ingase ibe nkulu kakhulu isibhanselwa singayigcina: khona-ke inamathela kuphela kule thebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsibhokisini senombolo noma kusesisesi sosizo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zikopisha futhi zinamathisele umbhalo njengoba kujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikhashini somdwebo, ukukopisha nokunamathisela akukatholakali; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/span\u003E zisebenza ophawuleni okhethiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iqembu le-Hlela kwisisetshenziswa linezinkinobho ze-Hlehlisa, Phinda wenze, Kopisha, Namathisela kanye nemenyu ye-Okwengeziwe enale Sika, Kopisha, Namathisela, Namathisela endaweni, Phinda, Susa, Khetha konke kanye Khetha lutho, ngalinye nokhiye walo. Okukopishwayo kuncike lapho ukhona: i-geometry esikethini esivuliwe, isakhi emlandweni, noma ingxenye enhlanganiselweni. Into engamnyama (impunga) ayikwazi ukusebenza njengamanje. Mamatheka phezu kwayo: itulo lencazelo lithi kungani, isibonelo \"Khetha i-geometry yesikethi kuqala\" noma \"Ibhodi lokukopisha libamba Sketch2 no-Extrude2: izakhi ziyanamathela emlandweni, ngakho phuma kusikethi kuqala\". Isenzo Ukhiye Esikethini Emlandweni Enhlanganiselweni Kopisha Ctrl+C Amaphoyinti namajika akhethiwe Isikethi, i-extrude, i-revolve noma umgodi okhethiwe (kanye nesikethi sawo) Ingxenye ekhethiwe Sika Ctrl+X Kopisha, bese uyasusa Kopisha, bese usula isakhi Kopisha, bese ususa ingxenye Namathisela Ctrl+V Ikhophi ilandela inkomba; chofoza lapho iya khona Yengeza ikhophi ekugcineni komlando Ikhophi entsha eceleni kwezinye izingxenye Namathisela endaweni Ctrl+Shift+V Ezixhumanisweni ezifanayo Njengo-Namathisela Endaweni efanayo nengxenye ekopishiwe Phinda Ctrl+D Kopisha uhambise ngesinyathelo esisodwa; ibhodi lokukopisha alishintshwa Ikhophi yesibili ngemuva kwakho Ikhophi yesibili eceleni kwezinye izingxenye Susa Delete Okukhethiwe Isakhi (ibuza uma ezinye zisisebenzisa) Ingxenye noma uxhumanisi Khetha konke Ctrl+A Konke esikethini Akutholakali Akutholakali Khetha lutho Esc Isula okukhethiwe Isula okukhethiwe nokukhethwa Isula okukhethiwe Konke ukunamathisela, ukuphinda nokusika kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ohlwini lokuHlehlisa: Ctrl+Z iyakuhlehlisa, Ctrl+Y iyakubuyisela. Esikethini Khetha okufanele kukopishwe: chofoza kukho, Shift+chofoza ukuze wengeze, donsa iwindi, noma cindezela Ctrl+A ukuze uthole konke. Cindezela Ctrl+C noma khetha Kopisha. Ibha yesimo itshela okukopishiwe. Cindezela Ctrl+V noma khetha Namathisela. Ikhophi enemigqa eyiqhezu ilandela inkomba, ibanjwe ngephakathi layo. Iyabambelela emaphoyinteni: beka isikhungo sendilinga ekopishiwe kuphoyinti ngokuchofoza lelo phoyinti. Chofoza lapho iya khona. I-geometry enamathisiwe ihlala ikhethiwe, ngakho ungayidonsa noma wengeze ukuxhumana kuyo ngokushesha. Esc ikhansela ukunamathisela. Okuza nayo: Umugqa, indilinga noma ibhengezi ekopishiwe iletha amaphoyinti ayo okuphela kanye nesikhungo. Ukuxhumana nezilinganiso phakathi kwezinto ezikopishiwe ziyeza: irektangula ekopishiwe isahlala iyirektangula, nosayizi bayo. Ukuxhumana nejiyomethri ongayikopishanga, nasemsukeni, kuyalahlwa. Ibha yesimo iyazibala: \"Ukuxhumana okungu-2 nejiyomethri ngaphandle kwekhophi ngeke kuze.\" Ngakho ikhophi enamathisiwe ikhululekile ukuhamba kuze kube yilapho uyixhuma ngokuxhumana noma ngezilinganiso. Iphoyinti elibotshiwe lihlala libotshiwe endaweni yalo entsha. Namathisela endaweni ibeka ikhophi ngqo ezixhumanisweni zokuqala, kulesi sikethi noma kwesinye: iyasiza ukuletha iphrofayili esikethini esisodwa iyise kwesinye. Esikethini esifanayo ikhophi ilele phezu kokuqala; yidonse ukuyikhipha. Phinda (Ctrl+D) ikopisha okukhethiwe iqale ukuyibeka ngokushesha, ingathinti okusebhodini lokukopisha. Ukuphinda isikhungo somgodi noma isilotsha izikhathi eziningi, kopisha kanye bese unamathisela izikhathi eziningi: yonke Ctrl+V iqala ikhophi entsha elandela inkomba. Emlandweni Chofoza isikethi, i-extrude, i-revolve noma umgodi emlandweni. Ctrl+C iyasikopisha. Isakhi esisekelwe esikethini sikopishwa kanye nesikethi sawo. Ctrl+V yengeza ikhophi ekugcineni komlando (ebhalwe ngebha yokubuyela emuva uma ubuyele emuva), ngamagama amasha afana ne-Sketch3 ne-Extrude2. Ikhophi ihlala endizeni noma ebusweni obufanayo nokokuqala, ngakho yakhiwa phezu kwawo futhi ingxenye ibukeka ifanayo. Khetha isikethi esisha bese ushintsha indiza yaso kuphaneli yesokudla, noma uyivule bese udonsa noma ulinganise kabusha iphrofayili, ukuze uhambise ikhophi. Namathisela kwenye ingxenye: vula leyo ngxenye bese ucindezela Ctrl+V. Uma isikethi sekhophi sasebusweni ingxenye engenalo, siyahamba siye endizeni engaphambili, futhi ibha yesimo iyasho lokho. Phinda yenza ukukopisha nokunamathisela ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ngaphakathi kwengxenye efanayo. Sika ikopisha isakhi, bese ilisusa (ibuza kuqala uma ezinye izakhi zilisebenzisa). Imiumo, izibuko, ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell nezinto eziqinile ezilethwe azikwazi ukukopishwa: zincike emaphethelweni, ezindaweni noma ezakhini ezikhethwe kule ngxenye. Kopisha isikethi noma isakhi azakhiwe kuso kunalokho, noma yenza umumo wakho ngo-Olayini noma Ngokujikeleza. Enhlanganiselweni Chofoza ingxenye embonweni noma ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele. Khetha Phinda (Ctrl+D), noma Ctrl+C bese Ctrl+V. Ikhophi entsha iyingxenye efanayo: hlela eyodwa bese zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha. Iveza ama-20 mm ngakwesokudla kwakho konke okuseNhlanganiselweni, iphendulwe ngendlela efanayo nekhophi, futhi ihlala lapho kuze kube yilapho uxhumanisi eyibeka khona. Namathisela endaweni (Ctrl+Shift+V) iyibeka ngqo lapho kukhona ingxenye ekopishiwe; yixhume ukuze uyihambise (ukuhlehliswa kuxhumanisi wesilayidi kuyiphusha phambili). Ukunamathisela ingxenye ekopishwe kwenye inhlanganisela kuletha ingxenye, njengo-Faka kusuka efayelini layo. Engeza ikopi eqenjini le-Inhlanganisela yenza okufanayo ne-Phinda, futhi isebenza nalapho kungakhethwe lutho (ikopisha ingxenye yokugcina). Ibhodi lokukopisha Liyibhodi lokukopisha le-PartCraft uqobo, hhayi elekhompyutha: awukwazi ukunamathisela i-geometry ye-PartCraft kwenye iphrogramu, noma umbhalo emibonweni ye-PartCraft. Ligcinwa kulesi sibhanselwa, ukuze elinye ithebhu le-PartCraft linamathisele lokho okukopishile. Liyafundwa bese lihlolwa njengefayela elivuliwe; noma yini elimele noma evela kwenye inguqulo iyenqatshwa. Ingxenye enefayela elikhulu le-STEP elingenisiwe ingase ibe nkulu kakhulu isibhanselwa singayigcina: khona-ke inamathela kuphela kule thebhu. Esibhokisini senombolo noma kusesisesi sosizo, Ctrl+C kanye Ctrl+V zikopisha futhi zinamathisele umbhalo njengoba kujwayelekile. Esikhashini somdwebo, ukukopisha nokunamathisela akukatholakali; Susa kanye Khetha lutho zisebenza ophawuleni okhethiwe. Bona Okungakakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"draft-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlola uhlaka lokubumba nokuthulula","summary":"Kholisa ingxenye ngengosi yohlaka lwayo ngokuqondene nesiqondo sokuhudula kwesikhunta, bona iziphethu ezikhululeka, ezidinga uhlaka oluningi nezikhululeka kolunye uhhafu lwesikhunta, nesabelo sendawo sakho ngakunye.","section":"tasks","order":96,"keywords":["uhlaka lokuhlaziya","uhlaka","ukuthambeka","isikhunta","ukubumba ngomjovo","ukuthulula isikhunta","isiqondo sokuhudula","umugqa wokuhlukanisa","ukusikeka ngaphansi","ukukhululeka","hlola uhlaka"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuyivula","text":"Ukuyivula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye ezenziwe ngesikhunta, ngedayi noma ngokuthulula ngesihlabathi zidinga \u003Cstrong\u003Euhlaka\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga ezithambekile kancane ukuze ingxenye iphume kalula. \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka lokuhlaziya\u003C/strong\u003E luyakholisa iziphethu ngazinye ngokuthi zithambekela kangakanani ngokuqondene nesiqondo esivula ngaso isikhunta (\u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhudula\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuyivula\"\u003EUkuyivula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-workspace ye-Idizayini, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya kohlaka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula\u003C/strong\u003E: isiqondo esivula ngaso isikhunta, ecaleni le-X, Y noma Z ngakunoma iyiphi indlela, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EOkuyisikwele nohlangothi olukhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha uhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza uhlangothi olusheshile lwengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka oluncane\u003C/strong\u003E, ngamadigri: ukuthambeka okuncane inqubo yakho edinga (imvamisa u-1° kuya ku-3°).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye iyakholiswa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELuhlaza: \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka olulungile\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELuthambekele ohlangothini lokuhudula ngokungenani okuncane: lukhululeka kulolu hhafu lwesikhunta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMpunga: \u003Cstrong\u003EKudinga uhlaka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphakathi kokuncane kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi, njengodonga oluqondile: engeza uhlaka lapha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBomvu: \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlaka olungalungile\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELuthambekele ngaphandle kokuhudula okungenani okuncane: lukhululeka kwelinye uhhafu, noma lusikeka ngaphansi uma ingxenye kufanele iphume kuhhafu elilodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsabelo sendawo yengxenye yalo kilasi sikhonjiswa eduze kwalo. \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha isiqondo sokuhudula\u003C/strong\u003E libuka kusuka ohlangothini olunye lwesikhunta: okuluhlaza nokubomvu kuyashintshana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIziphethu ezigobile zihlolwa ngephuzu ngephuzu, ngakho isilinda esilele phansi kwesiqondo sokuhudula sibonisa ibhendi edinga uhlaka ezinhlangothini zayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImibala ilandela ingxenye njengoba uyishintsha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ivala ukuhlaziya; akukho okulondolozwa engxenyeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wengeze uhlaka, sebenzisa isici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E ezindaweni ezimpunga (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft and draft\u003C/a\u003E), bese uhlola futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Izingxenye ezenziwe ngesikhunta, ngedayi noma ngokuthulula ngesihlabathi zidinga uhlaka: izindonga ezithambekile kancane ukuze ingxenye iphume kalula. Uhlaka lokuhlaziya luyakholisa iziphethu ngazinye ngokuthi zithambekela kangakanani ngokuqondene nesiqondo esivula ngaso isikhunta (ukuhudula). Ukuyivula Ku-workspace ye-Idizayini, vula Imibono bese ukhetha Ukuhlaziya kohlaka. Setha Ukuhudula: isiqondo esivula ngaso isikhunta, ecaleni le-X, Y noma Z ngakunoma iyiphi indlela, noma Okuyisikwele nohlangothi olukhethiwe: cindezela Khetha uhlangothi bese uchofoza uhlangothi olusheshile lwengxenye. Setha Uhlaka oluncane, ngamadigri: ukuthambeka okuncane inqubo yakho edinga (imvamisa u-1° kuya ku-3°). Ingxenye iyakholiswa: Umbala Okusho Luhlaza: Uhlaka olulungile Luthambekele ohlangothini lokuhudula ngokungenani okuncane: lukhululeka kulolu hhafu lwesikhunta Mpunga: Kudinga uhlaka Ngaphakathi kokuncane kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi, njengodonga oluqondile: engeza uhlaka lapha Bomvu: Uhlaka olungalungile Luthambekele ngaphandle kokuhudula okungenani okuncane: lukhululeka kwelinye uhhafu, noma lusikeka ngaphansi uma ingxenye kufanele iphume kuhhafu elilodwa Isabelo sendawo yengxenye yalo kilasi sikhonjiswa eduze kwalo. Shintsha isiqondo sokuhudula libuka kusuka ohlangothini olunye lwesikhunta: okuluhlaza nokubomvu kuyashintshana. Iziphethu ezigobile zihlolwa ngephuzu ngephuzu, ngakho isilinda esilele phansi kwesiqondo sokuhudula sibonisa ibhendi edinga uhlaka ezinhlangothini zayo. Imibala ilandela ingxenye njengoba uyishintsha. Esc noma Vala ivala ukuhlaziya; akukho okulondolozwa engxenyeni. Ukuze wengeze uhlaka, sebenzisa isici Draft ezindaweni ezimpunga (bheka Sweep, loft and draft), bese uhlola futhi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"surface-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Imigqa ye-zebra nokugoba","summary":"Hlola ukuthi izinhlangothi zengxenye ngayinye zihlangana kanjani kahle, ngemigqa ye-zebra elandela umbono noma ngomephu wombala wokugoba kwesilinganiso, kusukela kumenyu ethi Imibono.","section":"tasks","order":97,"keywords":["zebra","imigqa ye-zebra","imigqa yokubonakala","ukugoba","umephu wokugoba","ukugoba kwesilinganiso","ikhwalithi yobuso","ukuqhubeka","tangent","g1","g2","bushelelezi","umgoqo","imigqa ekhanyayo"],"headings":[{"id":"imigqa-ye-zebra","text":"Imigqa ye-zebra","level":2},{"id":"ukugoba","text":"Ukugoba","level":2},{"id":"ikhadi","text":"Ikhadi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlolovo ezimbili ezisheshayo zokubona ukuthi izinhlangothi zengxenye zibushelelezi kangakanani, kunoma yiyiphi ingxenye ku-Design workspace (i-Form workspace inayo yayo, yefomu oyihleli: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/form-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/form-surfaces\"\u003EIzimo ezingaqondile nge-Form\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigqa-ye-zebra\"\u003EImigqa ye-zebra\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa ye-zebra\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxenye ibonisa ukubonakala kwesibani esinemigqa, njengoba nobuso obucwebile bukwenza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho izinhlangothi ezimbili zihlangana \u003Cstrong\u003Engokuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E (i-fillet phezu kwendawo eyisicaba, indawo ebushelelezi ye-Gordon), imigqa iqhubeka ihamba phezu kwendawo yokuhlangana ngokugoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho zihlangana ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumgoqo\u003C/strong\u003E oqinile, imigqa iyaphuka igxume.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho nokugoba kuvumelana (G2), imigqa igeleza ngaphandle nje kokugoba okuncane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhendula umbono (ngokudonsa, noma ngobuso be-view-cube): imigqa idwetshwa kabusha isuka endleleni entsha. \u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa\u003C/strong\u003E isetha ukuthi zingaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugoba\"\u003EUkugoba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugoba\u003C/span\u003E kwimenyu efanayo. Ingxenye iphenjulwa ngombala ngokugoba kwayo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwesilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E: kuluhlaza lapho ingena ngaphakathi, kukhanyayo lapho ilingana, kubomvu lapho iphuma ngaphandle. Ikhadi lithi ukugoba kuphi lapho imibala ifinyelela amandla aphelele, ngo-1/mm nangokuyisibonakaliso sexhoku. Imiphetho ebukhali ibalwa njengegoqekile kakhulu, ngakho ibonisa ngamandla; bheka izinhlangothi eziphakathi kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhadi\"\u003EIkhadi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWomabili avula ikhadi lokuhlaziya eliphansi kwesobunxele sombono, elibamba nokuhlaziya kohlaka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/draft-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/draft-analysis\"\u003Eukuhlaziya kohlaka\u003C/a\u003E). Shintsha phakathi kwabo nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukukhetha okuvuliwe futhi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E noma ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyicisha. Imibala ilandela ingxenye njengoba uyishintsha; akukho okulondolozwa engxenyeni.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinhlolovo ezimbili ezisheshayo zokubona ukuthi izinhlangothi zengxenye zibushelelezi kangakanani, kunoma yiyiphi ingxenye ku-Design workspace (i-Form workspace inayo yayo, yefomu oyihleli: bona Izimo ezingaqondile nge-Form). Imigqa ye-zebra Vula Imibono bese ukhetha Imigqa ye-zebra. Ingxenye ibonisa ukubonakala kwesibani esinemigqa, njengoba nobuso obucwebile bukwenza: Lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili zihlangana ngokuthinta (i-fillet phezu kwendawo eyisicaba, indawo ebushelelezi ye-Gordon), imigqa iqhubeka ihamba phezu kwendawo yokuhlangana ngokugoba. Lapho zihlangana ku-umgoqo oqinile, imigqa iyaphuka igxume. Lapho nokugoba kuvumelana (G2), imigqa igeleza ngaphandle nje kokugoba okuncane. Phendula umbono (ngokudonsa, noma ngobuso be-view-cube): imigqa idwetshwa kabusha isuka endleleni entsha. Imigqa isetha ukuthi zingaki. Ukugoba Khetha Ukugoba kwimenyu efanayo. Ingxenye iphenjulwa ngombala ngokugoba kwayo kwesilinganiso: kuluhlaza lapho ingena ngaphakathi, kukhanyayo lapho ilingana, kubomvu lapho iphuma ngaphandle. Ikhadi lithi ukugoba kuphi lapho imibala ifinyelela amandla aphelele, ngo-1/mm nangokuyisibonakaliso sexhoku. Imiphetho ebukhali ibalwa njengegoqekile kakhulu, ngakho ibonisa ngamandla; bheka izinhlangothi eziphakathi kwayo. Ikhadi Womabili avula ikhadi lokuhlaziya eliphansi kwesobunxele sombono, elibamba nokuhlaziya kohlaka (ukuhlaziya kohlaka). Shintsha phakathi kwabo nge-Bonisa. Ukukhetha okuvuliwe futhi ku-Imibono, ku-Vala noma ku-Esc kuyicisha. Imibala ilandela ingxenye njengoba uyishintsha; akukho okulondolozwa engxenyeni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"change-sizes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Shintsha usayizi ngaphandle kokuvula isikethi","summary":"Shayela ingxenye ngezinombolo ephaneli yesokudla: izilinganiso zesikethi, ukujula, izinani nama-engeli, indlela yokuhlela ingxenye ukuze izinombolo ezifanele zishayele, kanye nalapho amapharamitha nezibalo zithatha khona.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["amapharamitha","izilinganiso zokushayela","injongo yokwakha","shintsha usayizi","izibalo","izinguquki zomhlaba wonke","ithebhu yokwakha","ukucushwa","shintsha usayizi","guqula isilinganiso"],"headings":[{"id":"shintsha-isilinganiso-sesikethi-kusuka-ephanelini","text":"Shintsha isilinganiso sesikethi kusuka ephanelini","level":2},{"id":"faka-inombolo-enkulu-ngokushesha","text":"Faka inombolo enkulu ngokushesha","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-inombolo-emlandweni","text":"Shintsha inombolo emlandweni","level":2},{"id":"donsa-embonweni","text":"Donsa embonweni","level":2},{"id":"izinombolo-ezishayela-ingxenye","text":"Izinombolo ezishayela ingxenye","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ingxenye-ukuze-izinombolo-ezifanele-zishayele","text":"Hlela ingxenye ukuze izinombolo ezifanele zishayele","level":2},{"id":"ngaphezu-kwezinombolo-ezingodwa","text":"Ngaphezu kwezinombolo ezingodwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELonke usayizi kwingxenye ye-PartCraft yinombolo ongayishintsha kamuva: izilinganiso ezisezikethini zayo nezilungiselelo zezakhi zayo. Akudingeki uvule isikethi ukuze ushintshe izilinganiso zaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-isilinganiso-sesikethi-kusuka-ephanelini\"\u003EShintsha isilinganiso sesikethi kusuka ephanelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isakhi emlandweni, isibonelo &quot;Extrude1&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwezilungiselelo ze-extrude yayo, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zesikethi (Sketch1)\u003C/strong\u003E zidwebela yonke isilinganiso sesikethi sayo: &quot;Ibanga&quot;, &quot;Idayamitha&quot;, &quot;Ikona (°)&quot; njalo njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala inani elisha kubhokisi elilodwa bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikethi sixazulula ngenani elisha, bese ingxenye yonke iyakhiwa kabusha. Ukukhetha isikethi ngokwaso kubonisa uhlu olufanayo njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zokushayela\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsakazo noma idayamitha kumele kube ngaphezu kuka-zero, nama-engeli abe phakathi kuka-0 no-180 degrees; ibha yesimo iyasho uma kungenjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi ngalinye yiliphi? Amabhokisi adwetshwa ngokulandelana kwezilinganiso ezenziwe ngakho. Uma ungaqinisekile, vula isikethi (chofoza kabili kuso), chofoza kabili isilinganiso endaweni yokudweba, bese ushintsha lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-inombolo-enkulu-ngokushesha\"\u003EFaka inombolo enkulu ngokushesha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha isakhi emlandweni (noma uengeze kuphela) bese uthayipha inombolo: iya ebhokisini elikhulu lesakhi, elishintsha kakhulu (\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula\u003C/strong\u003E kwe-Extrude, \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona\u003C/strong\u003E ye-Revolve, \u003Cstrong\u003EIdayamitha\u003C/strong\u003E yomgodi, \u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E lomumo, \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/strong\u003E we-Fillet, udonga lwe-Shell). Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyisete, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ugcine eyakudala. Ukungeza i-Extrude kutshelwa ibha yesimo: &quot;Extrude1 yengeziwe. Shintsha izinombolo zayo ngakwesokudla, noma thayipha inombolo manje ngokujula kwayo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-inombolo-emlandweni\"\u003EShintsha inombolo emlandweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ngamunye wesakhi emlandweni ubonisa inombolo yawo eyinhloko eceleni kwegama lawo: &quot;Extrude1 25 mm&quot;, &quot;Hole1 Ø6.6 thru&quot;, &quot;Fillet1 R2&quot;, &quot;LPattern1 4 × 20 mm&quot;. Chofoza kabili inombolo (noma khetha umugqa bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese kuvulwa ibhokisi lapho. Thayipha inani elisha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina eyakudala. Lisebenza njengebhokisi lesakhi ngakwesokudla: imikhawulo efanayo, \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthayiphe isibalo njengalesi \u003Ccode\u003E=width/2\u003C/code\u003E, nesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Extrude, Hole noma kumumo, ukuchofoza kabili noma kuphi emugqeni kuvula ibhokisi. Ku-Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Uhlaka noma Thread ukuchofoza kabili egameni kusakhetha amaphethelo noma ubuso bawo, ngakho chofoza kabili inombolo ngokwayo. Izikethi azinayo inombolo emugqeni: ukuchofoza kabili kuvula isikethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"donsa-embonweni\"\u003EDonsa embonweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha i-Extrude emlandweni (noma uyichofoze embonweni, bese umugqa wayo) kuthi umcibisholo we-orenji umi ebusweni bawo bokugcina, nokujula kubhokisi eliseceleni kwawo. Donsa umcibisholo: ingxenye iyalandela ngesikhathi udonsa, futhi uma uyeqa, kusetha ukujula okusha njengesinyathelo esisodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyambuyisela). Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi udonsa ukuze ubuyele lapho uqale khona. Ukujula kunyakaza ngezinyathelo zengxenye eyodwa kwelishumi lobukhulu bayo: i-1 mm ku-Extrude engu-25 mm, i-0.1 mm kwengu-3 mm.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Revolve ithola umcibisholo ogobile ekugcineni kokujikeka kwayo: wudonse uzungeze i-axis ukuze uguqule ikona, ngamadigri aphelele kusukela ku-1° kuya ku-360°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma chofoza ebhokisini eliseceleni komcibisholo, uthayiphe inani (noma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E nesibalo) bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Akukho mcibisholo ku-Extrude edlula \u003Cstrong\u003EDlula konke\u003C/strong\u003E noma ifika ebusweni, noma kunani elilawulwa yisibalo: shintsha lezo ngakwesokudla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinombolo-ezishayela-ingxenye\"\u003EIzinombolo ezishayela ingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkungashintshwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZonke izilinganiso: ubude, amabanga, imisakazo, idayamitha, ama-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude ne-Sika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula, isimo sokuphela, indlela, i-boss noma ukusika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve kanye nokusika okujikelezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona, i-axis, i-boss noma ukusika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmgodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdayamitha, ukujula, dlula konke, idayamitha nokujula kwe-counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, Chamfer, Shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo, ibanga, ukuqina kodonga nendlela, namaphethelo noma ubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOlayini kanye Ngokujikeleza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani, ukuhlukaniswa noma ikona, indlela noma i-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmajika (ukuthi imibumbo ejikelezayo ihlukaniswa kahle kangakanani)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho isigaba sisika khona, usayizi nesikali sesiqephu, amanani e-GD&amp;T\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-ingxenye-ukuze-izinombolo-ezifanele-zishayele\"\u003EHlela ingxenye ukuze izinombolo ezifanele zishayele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinombolo onikeza zona yizona ongazishintsha. Izinkambiso ezimbalwa zenza ushintsho lwamuva luziphathe kahle:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa okubalulekile emsebenzini.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma umgodi kumele uhlale ama-15 mm ukusuka emaphethelweni, uwulinganise ukusuka kuleyo mphetheloe, hhayi emsukeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChaza izikethi ngokuphelele.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngakho ushintsho luhambisa okufanele kuphela (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza isikethi ngokuphelele\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ukuxhumana ngenjongo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukulingana kumigodi emibili kusho ukuthi idayamitha eyodwa ishayela bobabili. Izimo ezilinganayo: beka i-origin emugqeni wesikhungo, noma sebenzisa Midpoint.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDweba izikethi ezisebusweni obenziwe yizakhi.\u003C/strong\u003E Isikethi esisebusweni bokugcina be-extrude siyanyakaza uma ujula ushintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa umumo esikhundleni sokukopisha.\u003C/strong\u003E Umgodi owodwa owenziwe umumo kayisishiyagalombili unedayamitha eyodwa yokushintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphezu-kwezinombolo-ezingodwa\"\u003ENgaphezu kwezinombolo ezingodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInombolo eyodwa eshayela okuningi:\u003C/strong\u003E sebenzisa amapharamitha nezibalo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EShayela ingxenye ngamapharamitha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlobo eziningi zengxenye eyodwa:\u003C/strong\u003E londoloza ngayinye njenge \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003Eukucushwa\u003C/a\u003E; zigcinwa efayeleni lengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibalo ebhokisini lenombolo:\u003C/strong\u003E thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E=40/2\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E=width / 2\u003C/code\u003E. Lokho kwenza isibalo; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/equations-two-way\" data-topic=\"partcraft/equations-two-way\"\u003EIzibalo ezindleleni zombili\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi e-inch:\u003C/strong\u003E ingxenye ibonisa ama-millimeter. Ebhokisini lenombolo elinesimpawu \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, noma kupharamitha, i-\u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E iguqulwa ibe ngu-50.8.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lonke usayizi kwingxenye ye-PartCraft yinombolo ongayishintsha kamuva: izilinganiso ezisezikethini zayo nezilungiselelo zezakhi zayo. Akudingeki uvule isikethi ukuze ushintshe izilinganiso zaso. Shintsha isilinganiso sesikethi kusuka ephanelini Chofoza isakhi emlandweni, isibonelo \"Extrude1\". Ngaphansi kwezilungiselelo ze-extrude yayo, Izilinganiso zesikethi (Sketch1) zidwebela yonke isilinganiso sesikethi sayo: \"Ibanga\", \"Idayamitha\", \"Ikona (°)\" njalo njalo. Bhala inani elisha kubhokisi elilodwa bese ucindezela Enter noma Tab. Isikethi sixazulula ngenani elisha, bese ingxenye yonke iyakhiwa kabusha. Ukukhetha isikethi ngokwaso kubonisa uhlu olufanayo njenge-Izilinganiso zokushayela. Umsakazo noma idayamitha kumele kube ngaphezu kuka-zero, nama-engeli abe phakathi kuka-0 no-180 degrees; ibha yesimo iyasho uma kungenjalo. Ibhokisi ngalinye yiliphi? Amabhokisi adwetshwa ngokulandelana kwezilinganiso ezenziwe ngakho. Uma ungaqinisekile, vula isikethi (chofoza kabili kuso), chofoza kabili isilinganiso endaweni yokudweba, bese ushintsha lapho. Faka inombolo enkulu ngokushesha Khetha isakhi emlandweni (noma uengeze kuphela) bese uthayipha inombolo: iya ebhokisini elikhulu lesakhi, elishintsha kakhulu (Ukujula kwe-Extrude, Ikona ye-Revolve, Idayamitha yomgodi, Inani lomumo, Umsakazo we-Fillet, udonga lwe-Shell). Cindezela Enter ukuze uyisete, noma Esc ukuze ugcine eyakudala. Ukungeza i-Extrude kutshelwa ibha yesimo: \"Extrude1 yengeziwe. Shintsha izinombolo zayo ngakwesokudla, noma thayipha inombolo manje ngokujula kwayo.\" Shintsha inombolo emlandweni Umugqa ngamunye wesakhi emlandweni ubonisa inombolo yawo eyinhloko eceleni kwegama lawo: \"Extrude1 25 mm\", \"Hole1 Ø6.6 thru\", \"Fillet1 R2\", \"LPattern1 4 × 20 mm\". Chofoza kabili inombolo (noma khetha umugqa bese ucindezela F2) bese kuvulwa ibhokisi lapho. Thayipha inani elisha bese ucindezela Enter; Esc igcina eyakudala. Lisebenza njengebhokisi lesakhi ngakwesokudla: imikhawulo efanayo, = ukuze uthayiphe isibalo njengalesi =width/2, nesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Ku-Extrude, Hole noma kumumo, ukuchofoza kabili noma kuphi emugqeni kuvula ibhokisi. Ku-Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Uhlaka noma Thread ukuchofoza kabili egameni kusakhetha amaphethelo noma ubuso bawo, ngakho chofoza kabili inombolo ngokwayo. Izikethi azinayo inombolo emugqeni: ukuchofoza kabili kuvula isikethi. Donsa embonweni Khetha i-Extrude emlandweni (noma uyichofoze embonweni, bese umugqa wayo) kuthi umcibisholo we-orenji umi ebusweni bawo bokugcina, nokujula kubhokisi eliseceleni kwawo. Donsa umcibisholo: ingxenye iyalandela ngesikhathi udonsa, futhi uma uyeqa, kusetha ukujula okusha njengesinyathelo esisodwa (Ctrl+Z iyambuyisela). Cindezela Esc ngesikhathi udonsa ukuze ubuyele lapho uqale khona. Ukujula kunyakaza ngezinyathelo zengxenye eyodwa kwelishumi lobukhulu bayo: i-1 mm ku-Extrude engu-25 mm, i-0.1 mm kwengu-3 mm. I-Revolve ithola umcibisholo ogobile ekugcineni kokujikeka kwayo: wudonse uzungeze i-axis ukuze uguqule ikona, ngamadigri aphelele kusukela ku-1° kuya ku-360°. Noma chofoza ebhokisini eliseceleni komcibisholo, uthayiphe inani (noma = nesibalo) bese ucindezela Enter. Akukho mcibisholo ku-Extrude edlula Dlula konke noma ifika ebusweni, noma kunani elilawulwa yisibalo: shintsha lezo ngakwesokudla. Izinombolo ezishayela ingxenye Lapho Okungashintshwa Isikethi Zonke izilinganiso: ubude, amabanga, imisakazo, idayamitha, ama-engeli Extrude ne-Sika Ukujula, isimo sokuphela, indlela, i-boss noma ukusika Revolve kanye nokusika okujikelezayo Ikona, i-axis, i-boss noma ukusika Umgodi Idayamitha, ukujula, dlula konke, idayamitha nokujula kwe-counterbore Fillet, Chamfer, Shell Umsakazo, ibanga, ukuqina kodonga nendlela, namaphethelo noma ubuso Olayini kanye Ngokujikeleza Inani, ukuhlukaniswa noma ikona, indlela noma i-axis Ingxenye Amajika (ukuthi imibumbo ejikelezayo ihlukaniswa kahle kangakanani) Umdwebo Lapho isigaba sisika khona, usayizi nesikali sesiqephu, amanani e-GD&T Hlela ingxenye ukuze izinombolo ezifanele zishayele Izinombolo onikeza zona yizona ongazishintsha. Izinkambiso ezimbalwa zenza ushintsho lwamuva luziphathe kahle: Linganisa okubalulekile emsebenzini. Uma umgodi kumele uhlale ama-15 mm ukusuka emaphethelweni, uwulinganise ukusuka kuleyo mphetheloe, hhayi emsukeni. Chaza izikethi ngokuphelele. Ngakho ushintsho luhambisa okufanele kuphela (bona Chaza isikethi ngokuphelele). Sebenzisa ukuxhumana ngenjongo. Ukulingana kumigodi emibili kusho ukuthi idayamitha eyodwa ishayela bobabili. Izimo ezilinganayo: beka i-origin emugqeni wesikhungo, noma sebenzisa Midpoint. Dweba izikethi ezisebusweni obenziwe yizakhi. Isikethi esisebusweni bokugcina be-extrude siyanyakaza uma ujula ushintsha. Sebenzisa umumo esikhundleni sokukopisha. Umgodi owodwa owenziwe umumo kayisishiyagalombili unedayamitha eyodwa yokushintsha. Ngaphezu kwezinombolo ezingodwa Inombolo eyodwa eshayela okuningi: sebenzisa amapharamitha nezibalo: Shayela ingxenye ngamapharamitha. Izinhlobo eziningi zengxenye eyodwa: londoloza ngayinye njenge ukucushwa; zigcinwa efayeleni lengxenye. Izibalo ebhokisini lenombolo: thayipha =40/2 noma =width / 2. Lokho kwenza isibalo; bona Izibalo ezindleleni zombili. Amayunithi e-inch: ingxenye ibonisa ama-millimeter. Ebhokisini lenombolo elinesimpawu =, noma kupharamitha, i-2in iguqulwa ibe ngu-50.8. Bona Okungakakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"parameters","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qhuba ingxenye ngemingcele","summary":"Qamba izilinganiso ezibalulekile (ububanzi, ukuqina, usayizi wesikulufo), uxhumanise noma yiluphi inombolo yesici noma isilinganiso seskethi kuzo nge-=, bese uguqula yonke ingxenye kusuka etafuleni elilodwa.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["imingcele","lapho kusetshenziswa","okusetshenziswa yi","imingcele yomhlaba wonke","izinguquki","izibalo","inhloso yedizayini","izilinganiso eziqhubayo","xhuma","isisho","qamba isilinganiso","izinani ezixhunyiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-imingcele","text":"Engeza imingcele","level":2},{"id":"xhumanisa-inombolo-nengcele","text":"Xhumanisa inombolo nengcele","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-ingcele","text":"Shintsha ingcele","level":2},{"id":"bona-lapho-ingcele-isetshenziswa-khona","text":"Bona lapho ingcele isetshenziswa khona","level":2},{"id":"xhumula-qamba-kabusha-susa","text":"Xhumula, qamba kabusha, susa","level":2},{"id":"izisho","text":"Izisho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIngcele ayinombolo eqanjiwe, njengo \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth = 120\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Emargin = bolt * 1.5\u003C/code\u003E. Xhumanisa ukujula, ububanzi bembobo, inani lephethini noma isilinganiso seskethi kuyo, bese ushintsha imingcele, ushintsha konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Yiyo lena indlela yokugcina inhloso yedizayini engxenyeni kunasekhanda lakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-imingcele\"\u003EEngeza imingcele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli esekudla, chofoza ithebhu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquki\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha igama ebhokisini &quot;igama&quot;, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha inani lalo ebhokisini elilandelayo, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma uchofoze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani lingaba yinombolo noma isisho sezinye izingcele: \u003Ccode\u003Ebolt * 1.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth / 2 - 10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif(width &gt; 100, 6, 4)\u003C/code\u003E. Ikholomu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EInani\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa lokho okuphuma kukho. Igama liqala ngohlamvu noma \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E futhi linezinhlamvu, izinombolo kanye \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E kuphela; amagama wemisebenzi nezinyunithi (\u003Ccode\u003Esin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E) ayenqatshwa, futhi kanjalo nokuzungeza okufana no \u003Ccode\u003Ea = b\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Eb = a\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhumanisa-inombolo-nengcele\"\u003EXhumanisa inombolo nengcele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isici emlandweni, isibonelo &quot;Extrude1&quot;. Izilungiselelo zaso zibonakala ethebhulethini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbhokisini lenombolo, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E kanye nesisho: \u003Ccode\u003E=thick\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E=width / 4\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi manje likhombisa umphumela, futhi inkinobho ye-\u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E ivela eceleni kwelebula layo. Chofoza phezu kwayo ukuze ubone isibalo. Izilinganiso zeskethi zisebenza ngendlela efanayo, kokubili kuhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zeskethi\u003C/strong\u003E lwesici nasebhokisini lesilinganiso seskethi evuliwe (chofoza kabili isilinganiso, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E=width\u003C/code\u003E, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinombolo ongazixhumanisa: ukujula kwe-extrude, ikhono le-revolve, ububanzi bembobo, ubujula nosayizi wecounterbore, inani lephethini, ibanga nekhona lephethini, iradiyasi ye-fillet, ibanga le-chamfer, ukuqina kodonga le-shell, yonke into eseskethini, nosayizi wezici ezintsha (ujula lwesibili, ukuncipha, i-countersink, ibanga lendiza yereferensi, i-engeli ye-draft nezinye).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-ingcele\"\u003EShintsha ingcele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEthebhulethini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha inani elisha noma isisho ekholomini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsisho\u003C/strong\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Konke okuxhunyiwe kuyashintsha futhi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha, njengesinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha inombolo ngokuphambene, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/equations-two-way\" data-topic=\"partcraft/equations-two-way\"\u003EIzibalo ngazo zombili izindlela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-lapho-ingcele-isetshenziswa-khona\"\u003EBona lapho ingcele isetshenziswa khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwengcele ngayinye ethebhulethini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E, umugqa uthi yini esiyisebenzisayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinombolo eziqhubayo, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude1 depth\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ESketch1 D2 (distance)\u003C/strong\u003E. Chofoza enye ukuze ukhethe isici bese ubonisa izakhiwo zaso;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinombolo eziqhubayo \u003Cstrong\u003Engokudlula\u003C/strong\u003E kwezinye izingcele, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EHole1 diameter (through h, d)\u003C/strong\u003E lapho \u003Ccode\u003Ed = h + 2\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003Eh = w / 2\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eizingcele\u003C/strong\u003E ezisebenzisa isisho sayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eukulungiselelwa\u003C/strong\u003E okuyisethayo, nama-\u003Cstrong\u003Escript\u003C/strong\u003E afunda kuyo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EWrite and run scripts\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Not used yet.&quot; kusho ukuthi akukho okusebenzisayo: ungayisusa ngaphandle kokubuza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhumula-qamba-kabusha-susa\"\u003EXhumula, qamba kabusha, susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhumula inombolo:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza inkinobho yayo ye-\u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhumula\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibalo\u003C/strong\u003E. Igcina inani lalo lamanje futhi akusekho ngcele eyishintshayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQamba kabusha ingcele:\u003C/strong\u003E thayipha igama elisha ebhokisini layo le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E. Yonke isisho esiyisebenzisayo siyabhalwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa ingcele:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza × emugqeni wayo. Uma okuthile kuyisebenzisa, i-PartCraft iyabuza ukuthi ibhale inani layo lamanje kuyo yonke lezo zisho kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkususa isici\u003C/strong\u003E kususa izibalo zezinombolo zaso; ibha yesimo ithi yiziphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImingcele igcinwa efayelini le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E (njengenguqulo yefayela 3). Ingxenye engenamingcele igcinwa njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izisho\"\u003EIzisho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBhala\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einombolo (amamilimitha, noma amadigri kwi-engeli)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5cm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.2m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude ngezinye iziyunithi, eguqulwa ibe ngamamilimitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30deg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5rad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ei-engeli, eguqulwa ibe ngamadigri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / %\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizibalo; \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E ingamandla, \u003Ccode\u003E-2^2\u003C/code\u003E ngu −4\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esin cos tan asin acos atan atan2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ei-trigonometry ngamadigri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esqrt pow exp ln log abs sign\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEminye imisebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil floor int round(x, digits) min max\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukuzungeza nemikhawulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eif(test, a, b)\u003C/code\u003E nge \u003Ccode\u003E&lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;= == !=\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukukhetha: \u003Ccode\u003Eif(bolt &gt;= 16, 6, 8)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.14159…\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmagama acwaninga uhlamvu: \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth\u003C/code\u003E yimingcele emibili ehlukene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EIzinhlobo nethebhula lemiklamo\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EAma-script nomugqa womyalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ingcele ayinombolo eqanjiwe, njengo width = 120 noma margin = bolt * 1.5. Xhumanisa ukujula, ububanzi bembobo, inani lephethini noma isilinganiso seskethi kuyo, bese ushintsha imingcele, ushintsha konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Yiyo lena indlela yokugcina inhloso yedizayini engxenyeni kunasekhanda lakho. Engeza imingcele Ephaneli esekudla, chofoza ithebhu le-Imingcele. Ngaphansi kwe-Izinguquki, thayipha igama ebhokisini \"igama\", isibonelo width. Thayipha inani lalo ebhokisini elilandelayo, isibonelo 120, bese ucindezela Enter (noma uchofoze Engeza). Inani lingaba yinombolo noma isisho sezinye izingcele: bolt * 1.5, width / 2 - 10, if(width \u003E 100, 6, 4). Ikholomu ye-Inani ibonisa lokho okuphuma kukho. Igama liqala ngohlamvu noma _ futhi linezinhlamvu, izinombolo kanye _ kuphela; amagama wemisebenzi nezinyunithi (sin, mm, pi) ayenqatshwa, futhi kanjalo nokuzungeza okufana no a = b no b = a. Xhumanisa inombolo nengcele Chofoza isici emlandweni, isibonelo \"Extrude1\". Izilungiselelo zaso zibonakala ethebhulethini le-Izakhiwo. Ebhokisini lenombolo, njengo Ukujula (mm), thayipha = kanye nesisho: =thick noma =width / 4. Cindezela Enter. Ibhokisi manje likhombisa umphumela, futhi inkinobho ye-ƒ ivela eceleni kwelebula layo. Chofoza phezu kwayo ukuze ubone isibalo. Izilinganiso zeskethi zisebenza ngendlela efanayo, kokubili kuhlu lwe-Izilinganiso zeskethi lwesici nasebhokisini lesilinganiso seskethi evuliwe (chofoza kabili isilinganiso, thayipha =width, cindezela Enter). Izinombolo ongazixhumanisa: ukujula kwe-extrude, ikhono le-revolve, ububanzi bembobo, ubujula nosayizi wecounterbore, inani lephethini, ibanga nekhona lephethini, iradiyasi ye-fillet, ibanga le-chamfer, ukuqina kodonga le-shell, yonke into eseskethini, nosayizi wezici ezintsha (ujula lwesibili, ukuncipha, i-countersink, ibanga lendiza yereferensi, i-engeli ye-draft nezinye). Shintsha ingcele Ethebhulethini le-Imingcele, thayipha inani elisha noma isisho ekholomini le-Isisho bese ucindezela Enter. Konke okuxhunyiwe kuyashintsha futhi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha, njengesinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyakuhlehlisa. Ukushintsha inombolo ngokuphambene, bona Izibalo ngazo zombili izindlela. Bona lapho ingcele isetshenziswa khona Ngaphansi kwengcele ngayinye ethebhulethini le-Imingcele, umugqa uthi yini esiyisebenzisayo: izinombolo eziqhubayo, njengo Extrude1 depth noma Sketch1 D2 (distance). Chofoza enye ukuze ukhethe isici bese ubonisa izakhiwo zaso; izinombolo eziqhubayo ngokudlula kwezinye izingcele, njengo Hole1 diameter (through h, d) lapho d = h + 2 kanye h = w / 2; izingcele ezisebenzisa isisho sayo, ukulungiselelwa okuyisethayo, nama-script afunda kuyo (bona Write and run scripts). \"Not used yet.\" kusho ukuthi akukho okusebenzisayo: ungayisusa ngaphandle kokubuza. Xhumula, qamba kabusha, susa Xhumula inombolo: chofoza inkinobho yayo ye-ƒ, noma Xhumula ohlwini lwe-Izibalo. Igcina inani lalo lamanje futhi akusekho ngcele eyishintshayo. Qamba kabusha ingcele: thayipha igama elisha ebhokisini layo le-Igama. Yonke isisho esiyisebenzisayo siyabhalwa kabusha. Susa ingcele: chofoza × emugqeni wayo. Uma okuthile kuyisebenzisa, i-PartCraft iyabuza ukuthi ibhale inani layo lamanje kuyo yonke lezo zisho kuqala. Ukususa isici kususa izibalo zezinombolo zaso; ibha yesimo ithi yiziphi. Imingcele igcinwa efayelini le-.partcraft.json (njengenguqulo yefayela 3). Ingxenye engenamingcele igcinwa njengakuqala. Izisho Bhala Kusho 120, 12.5, 1e3 inombolo (amamilimitha, noma amadigri kwi-engeli) 2in, 1ft, 3\", 1.5cm, 0.2m ubude ngezinye iziyunithi, eguqulwa ibe ngamamilimitha 30deg, 0.5rad i-engeli, eguqulwa ibe ngamadigri + - * / % kanye ^ izibalo; ^ ingamandla, -2^2 ngu −4 sin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 i-trigonometry ngamadigri sqrt pow exp ln log abs sign Eminye imisebenzi ceil floor int round(x, digits) min max ukuzungeza nemikhawulo if(test, a, b) nge \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E= == != ukukhetha: if(bolt \u003E= 16, 6, 8) pi 3.14159… Amagama acwaninga uhlamvu: Width no width yimingcele emibili ehlukene. Bona futhi Izinhlobo nethebhula lemiklamo kanye Ama-script nomugqa womyalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"equations-two-way","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izibalo ngazo zombili izindlela","summary":"Shintsha ipharamitha, ingxenye iyalandela; faka usayizi omusha enombolweni eshayelwayo futhi i-PartCraft iyabala ipharamitha ngemuva kwayo, ibuze ukuthi iyiphi uma kungaba eminingi ingashintsha.","section":"tasks","order":104,"keywords":["izibalo","xazulula ngemuva","inombolo eshayelwayo","izindlela ezimbili","buyela emuva","ukuqagela","amapharamitha","amanani axhunyiwe","iyiphi ipharamitha"],"headings":[{"id":"phambili-shintsha-ipharamitha","text":"Phambili: shintsha ipharamitha","level":2},{"id":"emuva-shintsha-inombolo-eshayelwayo","text":"Emuva: shintsha inombolo eshayelwayo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kungenzeki","text":"Lapho kungenzeki","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsibalo esifana ne \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude1 depth = thick + extra\u003C/strong\u003E siyasebenza ezindleleni zombili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phambili-shintsha-ipharamitha\"\u003EPhambili: shintsha ipharamitha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEthebhini elithi \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, shintsha \u003Ccode\u003Ethick\u003C/code\u003E kusuka ku-20 kuya ku-30. Ukujula kwe-Extrude1 kuba 30 + extra, futhi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"emuva-shintsha-inombolo-eshayelwayo\"\u003EEmuva: shintsha inombolo eshayelwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza &quot;Extrude1&quot; emlandweni. Ibhokisi layo \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E libonisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E: isibalo siyayishayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha usayizi ofunayo, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E40\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ixazulula ipharamitha ngemuva kwesibalo, ngezinyathelo eziningi njengoba kudingeka (\u003Ccode\u003Edepth = hub_h\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehub_h = disc_t + 50\u003C/code\u003E: ukuthayipha ubude kushintsha \u003Ccode\u003Edisc_t\u003C/code\u003E). Ibha yesimo ithi yini eshintshile, isibonelo ukuthi extra ishintshe isuka ku-5 iya ku-15.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ipharamitha ezimbili noma ngaphezulu zishayela inombolo, ibhokisi libuza \u003Cstrong\u003EIyiphi ipharamitha kufanele ishintshe?\u003C/strong\u003E futhi libale lezo. Chofoza eyodwa; ezinye zigcina amanani azo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E ayishintshi lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkufanayo kusebenza kusikethi: chofoza kabili izilinganiso ezishayelwayo, thayipha inani, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kusebenza nasekholomini \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E ethebhileni lamapharamitha, kupharamitha engumbhalo wefomula ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kungenzeki\"\u003ELapho kungenzeki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInombolo okufanele ibe yinombolo ephelele (inani lephethini) noma ihlale ngaphakathi kobubanzi (i-engeli kuya ku-360°) inqatshwa ngaphambi kokuthi kushintshe lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsibalo sezinombolo ezingashintshi kuphela (\u003Ccode\u003E=40\u003C/code\u003E) alinayo ipharamitha yokushintsha: inombolo oyithayipha ithatha indawo yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungekho nani lepharamitha elinikeza usayizi owuthayiphile, ibha yesimo iyakutshela futhi akushintshi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikethi esingenakuxazululwa ngenani elisha sigcina amanani asendulo, futhi ibha yesimo iyasiqamba igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okushintshiwe, kunoma iyiphi indlela, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sika \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isibalo esifana ne Extrude1 depth = thick + extra siyasebenza ezindleleni zombili. Phambili: shintsha ipharamitha Ethebhini elithi Imingcele, shintsha thick kusuka ku-20 kuya ku-30. Ukujula kwe-Extrude1 kuba 30 + extra, futhi ingxenye iyakhiwa kabusha. Emuva: shintsha inombolo eshayelwayo Chofoza \"Extrude1\" emlandweni. Ibhokisi layo Ukujula (mm) libonisa ƒ: isibalo siyayishayela. Thayipha usayizi ofunayo, isibonelo 40, bese ucindezela Enter. I-PartCraft ixazulula ipharamitha ngemuva kwesibalo, ngezinyathelo eziningi njengoba kudingeka (depth = hub_h, hub_h = disc_t + 50: ukuthayipha ubude kushintsha disc_t). Ibha yesimo ithi yini eshintshile, isibonelo ukuthi extra ishintshe isuka ku-5 iya ku-15. Uma ipharamitha ezimbili noma ngaphezulu zishayela inombolo, ibhokisi libuza Iyiphi ipharamitha kufanele ishintshe? futhi libale lezo. Chofoza eyodwa; ezinye zigcina amanani azo. Khansela ayishintshi lutho. Okufanayo kusebenza kusikethi: chofoza kabili izilinganiso ezishayelwayo, thayipha inani, bese ucindezela Enter. Kusebenza nasekholomini Value ethebhileni lamapharamitha, kupharamitha engumbhalo wefomula ngokwayo. Lapho kungenzeki Inombolo okufanele ibe yinombolo ephelele (inani lephethini) noma ihlale ngaphakathi kobubanzi (i-engeli kuya ku-360°) inqatshwa ngaphambi kokuthi kushintshe lutho. Isibalo sezinombolo ezingashintshi kuphela (=40) alinayo ipharamitha yokushintsha: inombolo oyithayipha ithatha indawo yaso. Uma kungekho nani lepharamitha elinikeza usayizi owuthayiphile, ibha yesimo iyakutshela futhi akushintshi lutho. Isikethi esingenakuxazululwa ngenani elisha sigcina amanani asendulo, futhi ibha yesimo iyasiqamba igama. Konke okushintshiwe, kunoma iyiphi indlela, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sika Ctrl+Z no Ctrl+Y.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"design-tables","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukucushwa namathebhula edizayini","summary":"Gcina usayizi nezinguqulo eziningana zengxenye eyodwa njengokucushwa okuqanjiwe okugcinwe kufayela lengxenye, nezici ezivalwa noma ezivulwa kokunye ngakunye, shintshela phakathi kwazo ngokuchofoza kanye, zilethe noma uzikhiphe njengethebhula ledizayini le-CSV, noma uzakhe zonke ku-command line.","section":"tasks","order":106,"keywords":["ithebhula ledizayini","ukucushwa","izinga","izinkulumo","umndeni wezingxenye","csv","ishidi lezibalo","izinguqulo","ithebhula elibusa","umndeni wengxenye","vimbela","suppressed","vala isici","izinketho","nganoma ngaphandle","configurator"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-ukucushwa","text":"Londoloza ukucushwa","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-buyekeza-qamba-kabusha-susa","text":"Shintsha, buyekeza, qamba kabusha, susa","level":2},{"id":"vula-noma-uvale-izici-ekucushweni","text":"Vula noma uvale izici ekucushweni","level":2},{"id":"ngenisa-noma-ukhiphe-ithebhula-ledizayini","text":"Ngenisa noma ukhiphe ithebhula ledizayini","level":2},{"id":"konke-ngesikhathi-esisodwa","text":"Konke ngesikhathi esisodwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Eukucushwa\u003C/strong\u003E ingusayizi owodwa wengxenye: isethi equmbile yamanani emingcele yayo. Ingxenye igcina ukucushwa kwayo kufayela layo, ngakho zihamba nayo. I-\u003Cstrong\u003Eithebhula ledizayini\u003C/strong\u003E iyinto efanayo njengefayela le-CSV, umugqa ngamunye wokucushwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkucushwa kusetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eimingcele\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho yengeza leyo kuqala (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EQhuba ingxenye ngemingcele\u003C/a\u003E). Ukucushwa kugcina imingcele eyizinombolo evamile; imingcele eqagelwa kwezinye (njengo \u003Ccode\u003Earea = w * d\u003C/code\u003E) ilandela yodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-ukucushwa\"\u003ELondoloza ukucushwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEthebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E, setha imingcele yosayizi owodwa wengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucushwa\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha igama (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EEnkulu\u003C/code\u003E) bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza amanani wamanje\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkucushwa okusha kumakwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuyasebenza\u003C/strong\u003E. Shintsha umngcele ngemva kwalokho futhi kuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuyasebenza, kushintshiwe kusukela\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze wazi ukuthi ingxenye ayisahambisani nakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-buyekeza-qamba-kabusha-susa\"\u003EShintsha, buyekeza, qamba kabusha, susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E isetha imingcele ibe yiwo amanani alokho kucushwa futhi yakhe kabusha ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/span\u003E igcina amanani wamanje kuleyo kucushwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqamba kabusha okukodwa, thayipha igama elisha ebhokisini lawo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E isusa ukucushwa. Imingcele igcina amanani ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkunye nakunye kulokhu yisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyela emuva. Uma uqamba kabusha umngcele, konke ukucushwa kulandela igama elisha; uma ususa okukodwa, ikhishwa kukho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-noma-uvale-izici-ekucushweni\"\u003EVula noma uvale izici ekucushweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkucushwa futhi kugcina ukuthi yiziphi izici ezivaliwe, ngakho ingxenye eyodwa ingaba nezinguqulo \u003Cstrong\u003Eezinento\u003C/strong\u003E nezinguqulo \u003Cstrong\u003Eezingenayo\u003C/strong\u003E: izimbobo zokufaka, i-chamfer, i-boss.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala isici: chofoza kumlando, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVimbela\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcina ukucushwa njengokujwayelekile, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EAkukho mgodi\u003C/code\u003E. Umugqa waso uthi yiziphi ezivalwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula kabusha isici (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ekuvinjelweni\u003C/span\u003E) bese ugcina olunye ukucushwa, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003ENemigodi\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma noma yikuphi ukucushwa kuvala isici, ukusebenzisa ukucushwa kuvala izici zalo \u003Cstrong\u003Enezici zonke ezinye zivulwe\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye namanani emingcele, esinyathelweni esisodwa. Ukucushwa okugcinwe ngaphambi kokuvalwa kwezici kubalwa njengokuthi &quot;konke kuvuliwe&quot;. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/span\u003E igcina izici njengoba zinjalo manje, namanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye okucushwa kwayo kuvala izici igcinwa njengenguqulo entsha yefayela: i-PartCraft endala ithi ifayela livela enguqulweni entsha kunokuvula lingenazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhula ledizayini le-CSV liphatha amanani emingcele kuphela. Ukungenisa ithebhula phezu kokucushwa kushintsha amanani alo futhi kugcina izici ezivalayo; i-\u003Ccode\u003E--table\u003C/code\u003E yomugqa womyalo yakha amanani kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lengxenye ligcinwa nokucushwa nanoma yikuphi okwakusebenza. Ingxenye ivula ngamanani ayo agcinwe nawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa-noma-ukhiphe-ithebhula-ledizayini\"\u003ENgenisa noma ukhiphe ithebhula ledizayini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhula ledizayini liyifayela le-CSV elinekholomu ngayinye yomngcele nomugqa ngamunye wokucushwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename,width,thick,bolt\nsmall,100,6,6.6\nmedium,140,8,8.5\nlarge,200,12,13\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkholomu yokuqala ingabizwa \u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Econfig\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Econfiguration\u003C/code\u003E; zonke ezinye kumele zibe igama lomngcele wengxenye. Amaseli angamanani, namayunithi uma uthanda (\u003Ccode\u003E8in\u003C/code\u003E). Iseli elingenalutho lishiya lowo mngcele ngaphandle komugqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E yengeza umugqa ngamunye njengokucushwa. Umugqa onegama lokucushwa okukhona uyawushintsha. Ukungenisa kuyisinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ukucushwa ngaphandle. Uma kungekho lutho okwamanje, ibhala umugqa owodwa wamanani wamanje, indawo yokuqala ye-ishidi lezibalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama lokucushwa ishidi lezibalo elingalifunda njengefomula (eliqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) libhalwa linesiqalo \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"konke-ngesikhathi-esisodwa\"\u003EKonke ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphekhi yamavarianti…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucushwa\u003C/strong\u003E yakha wonke ukucushwa, noma okukhethiwe, njenge-STEP, IFC, DWG nokubukwa kwangaphambili kuzip eyodwa, nethebhula lemingcele yakho: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EYenza iphekhi yamavarianti kokucushwa kwakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lomugqa womyalo yakha ifayela elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye wethebhula ledizayini le-CSV:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs build bracket.pcscript --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes --format step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThumela ukucushwa njenge-CSV kuqala, bese udlulisa leyo fayela nge-\u003Ccode\u003E--table\u003C/code\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EAma-script nomugqa womyalo\u003C/a\u003E. Ingxenye egcinwe njenge-script igcina ukucushwa kwayo emgqeni we-\u003Ccode\u003Econfigs json …\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-ukucushwa ingusayizi owodwa wengxenye: isethi equmbile yamanani emingcele yayo. Ingxenye igcina ukucushwa kwayo kufayela layo, ngakho zihamba nayo. I-ithebhula ledizayini iyinto efanayo njengefayela le-CSV, umugqa ngamunye wokucushwa. Ukucushwa kusetha imingcele, ngakho yengeza leyo kuqala (bheka Qhuba ingxenye ngemingcele). Ukucushwa kugcina imingcele eyizinombolo evamile; imingcele eqagelwa kwezinye (njengo area = w * d) ilandela yodwa. Londoloza ukucushwa Ethebhini le-Imingcele, setha imingcele yosayizi owodwa wengxenye. Ngaphansi kwe-Ukucushwa, thayipha igama (isibonelo Enkulu) bese ucindezela Londoloza amanani wamanje noma Enter. Ukucushwa okusha kumakwa kuyasebenza. Shintsha umngcele ngemva kwalokho futhi kuthi kuyasebenza, kushintshiwe kusukela, ukuze wazi ukuthi ingxenye ayisahambisani nakho. Shintsha, buyekeza, qamba kabusha, susa Sebenzisa isetha imingcele ibe yiwo amanani alokho kucushwa futhi yakhe kabusha ingxenye. Buyekeza igcina amanani wamanje kuleyo kucushwa. Ukuqamba kabusha okukodwa, thayipha igama elisha ebhokisini lawo bese ucindezela Enter. Susa isusa ukucushwa. Imingcele igcina amanani ayo. Okunye nakunye kulokhu yisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z ibuyela emuva. Uma uqamba kabusha umngcele, konke ukucushwa kulandela igama elisha; uma ususa okukodwa, ikhishwa kukho. Vula noma uvale izici ekucushweni Ukucushwa futhi kugcina ukuthi yiziphi izici ezivaliwe, ngakho ingxenye eyodwa ingaba nezinguqulo ezinento nezinguqulo ezingenayo: izimbobo zokufaka, i-chamfer, i-boss. Vala isici: chofoza kumlando, bese Vimbela ku-Izakhiwo. Gcina ukucushwa njengokujwayelekile, isibonelo Akukho mgodi. Umugqa waso uthi yiziphi ezivalwayo. Vula kabusha isici (Khipha ekuvinjelweni) bese ugcina olunye ukucushwa, isibonelo Nemigodi. Uma noma yikuphi ukucushwa kuvala isici, ukusebenzisa ukucushwa kuvala izici zalo nezici zonke ezinye zivulwe, kanye namanani emingcele, esinyathelweni esisodwa. Ukucushwa okugcinwe ngaphambi kokuvalwa kwezici kubalwa njengokuthi \"konke kuvuliwe\". Buyekeza igcina izici njengoba zinjalo manje, namanani. Ingxenye okucushwa kwayo kuvala izici igcinwa njengenguqulo entsha yefayela: i-PartCraft endala ithi ifayela livela enguqulweni entsha kunokuvula lingenazo. Ithebhula ledizayini le-CSV liphatha amanani emingcele kuphela. Ukungenisa ithebhula phezu kokucushwa kushintsha amanani alo futhi kugcina izici ezivalayo; i---table yomugqa womyalo yakha amanani kuphela. Ifayela lengxenye ligcinwa nokucushwa nanoma yikuphi okwakusebenza. Ingxenye ivula ngamanani ayo agcinwe nawo. Ngenisa noma ukhiphe ithebhula ledizayini Ithebhula ledizayini liyifayela le-CSV elinekholomu ngayinye yomngcele nomugqa ngamunye wokucushwa: name,width,thick,bolt small,100,6,6.6 medium,140,8,8.5 large,200,12,13 Ikholomu yokuqala ingabizwa name, config noma configuration; zonke ezinye kumele zibe igama lomngcele wengxenye. Amaseli angamanani, namayunithi uma uthanda (8in). Iseli elingenalutho lishiya lowo mngcele ngaphandle komugqa. Ngenisa i-CSV yengeza umugqa ngamunye njengokucushwa. Umugqa onegama lokucushwa okukhona uyawushintsha. Ukungenisa kuyisinyathelo esisodwa. Thumela i-CSV ibhala ukucushwa ngaphandle. Uma kungekho lutho okwamanje, ibhala umugqa owodwa wamanani wamanje, indawo yokuqala ye-ishidi lezibalo. Igama lokucushwa ishidi lezibalo elingalifunda njengefomula (eliqala nge-=, +, - noma @) libhalwa linesiqalo '. Konke ngesikhathi esisodwa Iphekhi yamavarianti… ngaphansi kwe-Ukucushwa yakha wonke ukucushwa, noma okukhethiwe, njenge-STEP, IFC, DWG nokubukwa kwangaphambili kuzip eyodwa, nethebhula lemingcele yakho: bheka Yenza iphekhi yamavarianti kokucushwa kwakho. Ithuluzi lomugqa womyalo yakha ifayela elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye wethebhula ledizayini le-CSV: node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs build bracket.pcscript --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes --format step Thumela ukucushwa njenge-CSV kuqala, bese udlulisa leyo fayela nge---table. Bheka Ama-script nomugqa womyalo. Ingxenye egcinwe njenge-script igcina ukucushwa kwayo emgqeni we-configs json ….","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"standard-parts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Vula ingxenye ejwayelekile","summary":"Qala ingxenye ngebhawu, iskrubu, ukhuni, iwashela, ipini, ibheringi noma ukhiye, osayizi bawo bavela ezingeni labo, nosayizi wonke wethebula yezinga njengokucushwa.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["ingxenye ejwayelekile","izingxenye ezijwayelekile","ibhawu","iskrubu","hex","ukhuni","iwashela","ipini","dowel","ibheringi","ibheringi lebhola","ukhiye","fastener","iso 4017","iso 4014","iso 4032","iso 7089","iso 2338","iso 15","din 6885","asme","isifanekiso","umtapo"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-eyodwa","text":"Vula eyodwa","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-usayizi","text":"Shintsha usayizi","level":2},{"id":"okumodeliwe","text":"Okumodeliwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ivula izingxenye zomshini ezivamile zilungele: izilinganiso zivela ezithebhulini zezinga, futhi wonke usayizi kuthebhu ungukucushwa ongashintshela kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-eyodwa\"\u003EVula eyodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye ejwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngxenye\u003C/span\u003E, khetha uhlobo, isibonelo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIskrubu enekhanda le-hex (ISO 4017)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E, khetha usayizi, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EM10 × 40\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ivula njengengxenye entsha, engakalondolozwa. Yilondoloze ukuze uyigcine (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIngxenye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIskrubu enekhanda le-hex, ibhawu le-hex\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 4017, ISO 4014, ASME B18.2.1 (inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E ubukhulu be-thread, \u003Ccode\u003Es\u003C/code\u003E ububanzi bamaflethi, \u003Ccode\u003Ek\u003C/code\u003E ukuphakama kwekhanda, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E ubude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhuni ohexagonal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 4032, ASME B18.2.2 (inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Es\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheight\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwashela elivamile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 7089\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed1\u003C/code\u003E ngaphakathi, \u003Ccode\u003Ed2\u003C/code\u003E ngaphandle, \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E ukuqina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpini elilinganayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 2338\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbheringi lebhola lomsele ojulile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 15\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E umgodi wangaphakathi, \u003Ccode\u003ED\u003C/code\u003E ngaphandle, \u003Ccode\u003EB\u003C/code\u003E ububanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhiye ohambisanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDIN 6885-1, uhlobo A\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eb\u003C/code\u003E ububanzi, \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E ukuphakama, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E ubude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-usayizi\"\u003EShintsha usayizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke usayizi ungukucushwa (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EUkucushwa nethebula zokwakha\u003C/a\u003E): vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha elinye, noma shintsha ipharamitha, njengo \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E weskrubu ende, bese uyigcina njengokucushwa kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okumodeliwe\"\u003EOkumodeliwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIskrubu namabhawu: ikhanda le-hexagon nomzimba olula. Okhuni: i-hexagon nembobo yobukhulu obuyisisekelo bocingo. Ucingo akumodelwanga; engeza nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUcingo\u003C/span\u003E uma udinga (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EUcingo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmapini: isilinda esilula; ama-chamfer wamaphethelo ashiywe ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmabheringi: impahla yangaphandle kuphela (umgodi wangaphakathi, ububanzi bangaphandle nobubanzi), okudingekayo ukuze uwabeke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye: ukhiye onomkhawulo ojikelezile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImpahla yengxenye iyinsimbi, ngakho ipanele lesisindo likhombisa isisindo sayo. Amagiya awikho okwamanje: i-PartCraft ayinayo isici samazinyo, nediski akuyona igiya. I-CadCraft idweba amagiya ngokwesivumelwano sokudweba, futhi umtapo unawo njengemidwebo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ivula izingxenye zomshini ezivamile zilungele: izilinganiso zivela ezithebhulini zezinga, futhi wonke usayizi kuthebhu ungukucushwa ongashintshela kuwo. Vula eyodwa Chofoza Ingxenye ejwayelekile eqenjini elithi Ifayela. Ku-Ingxenye, khetha uhlobo, isibonelo Iskrubu enekhanda le-hex (ISO 4017). Ku-Usayizi, khetha usayizi, isibonelo M10 × 40. Chofoza Vula. Ingxenye ivula njengengxenye entsha, engakalondolozwa. Yilondoloze ukuze uyigcine (Ctrl+S). Ingxenye Izinga Imingcele Iskrubu enekhanda le-hex, ibhawu le-hex ISO 4017, ISO 4014, ASME B18.2.1 (inch) d ubukhulu be-thread, s ububanzi bamaflethi, k ukuphakama kwekhanda, l ubude Ukhuni ohexagonal ISO 4032, ASME B18.2.2 (inch) d, s, height Iwashela elivamile ISO 7089 d1 ngaphakathi, d2 ngaphandle, h ukuqina Ipini elilinganayo ISO 2338 d, l Ibheringi lebhola lomsele ojulile ISO 15 d umgodi wangaphakathi, D ngaphandle, B ububanzi Ukhiye ohambisanayo DIN 6885-1, uhlobo A b ububanzi, h ukuphakama, l ubude Shintsha usayizi Wonke usayizi ungukucushwa (bona Ukucushwa nethebula zokwakha): vula Imingcele bese ukhetha elinye, noma shintsha ipharamitha, njengo l weskrubu ende, bese uyigcina njengokucushwa kwakho. Okumodeliwe Iskrubu namabhawu: ikhanda le-hexagon nomzimba olula. Okhuni: i-hexagon nembobo yobukhulu obuyisisekelo bocingo. Ucingo akumodelwanga; engeza nge-Ucingo uma udinga (bona Ucingo). Amapini: isilinda esilula; ama-chamfer wamaphethelo ashiywe ngaphandle. Amabheringi: impahla yangaphandle kuphela (umgodi wangaphakathi, ububanzi bangaphandle nobubanzi), okudingekayo ukuze uwabeke. Okhiye: ukhiye onomkhawulo ojikelezile. Impahla yengxenye iyinsimbi, ngakho ipanele lesisindo likhombisa isisindo sayo. Amagiya awikho okwamanje: i-PartCraft ayinayo isici samazinyo, nediski akuyona igiya. I-CadCraft idweba amagiya ngokwesivumelwano sokudweba, futhi umtapo unawo njengemidwebo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"variant-pack","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yenza iphekhi yamavarianti kusuka ezilungiselelweni zakho","summary":"Yakha yonke ukulungiselelwa kwengxenye, noma eziningana ozikhethele, ngesikhathi esisodwa njenge-STEP, IFC, DWG kanye nesibonelo ngasinye, nethebula lezimingcele zazo, nengxenye njengento eyodwa yomtapo nezivarianti zayo.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["iphekhi yamavarianti","amavarianti","ukulungiselela","umndeni wezingxenye","ukuthumela ngebhetshi","zonke usayizi","step","ifc","dwg","isibonelo","ithebula","csv","json","umtapo","umlungiseleli","ikhathalogu","item json"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okusemgodini-we-zip","text":"Okusemgodini we-zip","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"faka-amavarianti-ekhasini-lomtapo","text":"Faka amavarianti ekhasini lomtapo","level":2},{"id":"ku-command-line","text":"Ku-command line","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENikeza \u003Cstrong\u003Eyonke usayizi wengxenye ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: i-STEP, i-IFC ne-DWG eyodwa kanye nesithombe sokulungiselelwa ngakunye, ithebula elisho ukuthi yiliphi ngalinye, nento yomtapo esanda konke ekhasini elilodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdinga ingxenye enokulungiselelwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuqala\u003C/strong\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EUkulungiselelwa namathebula okuklama\u003C/a\u003E). Ukulungiselelwa okuvala isakhiwo, njengepuleti elinemigodi nelingenayo, kuba yivarianti yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ingxenye. Ku-thebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E, thola \u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungiselelwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphekhi yamavarianti…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThika ukulungiselelwa okuzokwakhiwa (konke kuthikiwe) nemafayela okuzobhalwa: STEP, IFC, DWG, isibonelo, nento yomtapo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza iphekhi\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa wesimo ubala amavarianti njengoba eyakhiwa; ingxenye yakho ayishintshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKulandwa i-zip eyodwa: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; variants.zip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusemgodini-we-zip\"\u003EOkusemgodini we-zip\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulungiselelwa njengesolidi ye-STEP.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-IFC4, isakhiwo esisodwa esinomzimba owakhiwe nezimingcele zengxenye njengezakhiwo; inani ngalinye liyelalokho kulungiselelwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dwg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibono ephambili, ephezulu, yesokudla kanye ne-isometric njengeshidi lokudweba ngosayizi ogcwele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.svg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe somugqa we-isometric salo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Evariants.csv\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Evariants.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebula lezimingcele: i-id yevarianti ngayinye, igama, inani lazo zonke izimingcele, izakhiwo ezivalwa yiyo, amafayela ayo, ivolumu yayo nosayizi wayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.item.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye njengento eyodwa yomtapo nezivarianti zayo (bona ngezansi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EREADME.txt\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkwenziwe, izinikezo ezingezansi, nanoma yini engakhiwanga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela anikezwa amagama ngokulungiselelwa. Ukulungiselelwa okungakhiwa (isakhiwo esingenziwa ngalezo zinani) akufakwa emafayeleni nasethebuleni, kudweshwe ku-README nasemyalezweni ngemva kokugcinwa kwe-zip; ezinye zisabhalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-STEP\u003C/strong\u003E iyinembile uma i-exact kernel ivuliwe kulolu hlobo. Ngaphandle kwayo i-STEP ibhikiwe (izinxantathu eziqondile), futhi i-README iyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-DWG\u003C/strong\u003E ingeshidi lokudweba, hhayi imodeli ye-3D. Imigqa yayo ivela ku-mesh, ngakho umphetho ojikelezayo ungemigqa emifushane eminingi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto yomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E iphethe umzimba owodwa nesisekelo esisodwa ngevarianti ngayinye, ngokwamagatsha womtapo: Z ephezulu, ingaphambili ibheke −Y, nendawo yokufaka iphakathi kwasemuva, ngaphansi. Ipulani iyinxande ozungezile levarianti ngayinye. Into ikhawulelwe ku-8 MB, ngakho ivarianti esindayo kakhulu iba yibhokisi losayizi walo, futhi i-README ithi zingaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulungiselelwa okusebenzayo kwengxenye kuyiyona varianti ezenzakalelayo yento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmachweba (izindawo zokuxhuma zamapayipi namadakhithi) akasethwa kusuka ku-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-amavarianti-ekhasini-lomtapo\"\u003EFaka amavarianti ekhasini lomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayisha \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.item.json\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo › Layisha\u003C/strong\u003E kuwebhusayithi. Khetha isigaba sayo, ilayisense nombolo yakho yokunikela, bese iba yinto yomtapo enamavarianti ayo. Ku-BimCraft, ukuyibeka kubuza ukuthi yiyiphi ivarianti, futhi i-Shintsha inikeza ezinye. Ikhasi lapho izivakashi zikhetha izinketho, zibone i-3D futhi zilande ivarianti, kuwukubuka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwesibonelo sabasebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E okwamanje: alivulelwe abantu bonke okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-command-line\"\u003EKu-command line\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --out-dir plate-variants\nnode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --only &quot;Small,Large&quot; --formats step,preview --zip plate.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E--only\u003C/code\u003E iqamba izilungiselelo, \u003Ccode\u003E--formats\u003C/code\u003E noma yiluphi kwalezi: \u003Ccode\u003Estep\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edwg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epreview\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003E--no-item\u003C/code\u003E ishiya into yomtapo ngaphandle. Ibhala ifolda, i-zip noma zombili, futhi iphuma ngo-1 uma ivarianti yehlulekile ukwakhiwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EIzikripthi nomugqa womyalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Nikeza yonke usayizi wengxenye ngesikhathi esisodwa: i-STEP, i-IFC ne-DWG eyodwa kanye nesithombe sokulungiselelwa ngakunye, ithebula elisho ukuthi yiliphi ngalinye, nento yomtapo esanda konke ekhasini elilodwa. Udinga ingxenye enokulungiselelwa kuqala (bona Ukulungiselelwa namathebula okuklama). Ukulungiselelwa okuvala isakhiwo, njengepuleti elinemigodi nelingenayo, kuba yivarianti yalo. Izinyathelo Vula ingxenye. Ku-thebhu ye-Imingcele, thola Ukulungiselelwa. Chofoza Iphekhi yamavarianti…. Thika ukulungiselelwa okuzokwakhiwa (konke kuthikiwe) nemafayela okuzobhalwa: STEP, IFC, DWG, isibonelo, nento yomtapo. Chofoza Yenza iphekhi. Umugqa wesimo ubala amavarianti njengoba eyakhiwa; ingxenye yakho ayishintshwa. Kulandwa i-zip eyodwa: \u003Cpart\u003E variants.zip. Okusemgodini we-zip Ifayela Yini \u003Cname\u003E.step Ukulungiselelwa njengesolidi ye-STEP. \u003Cname\u003E.ifc I-IFC4, isakhiwo esisodwa esinomzimba owakhiwe nezimingcele zengxenye njengezakhiwo; inani ngalinye liyelalokho kulungiselelwa. \u003Cname\u003E.dwg Imibono ephambili, ephezulu, yesokudla kanye ne-isometric njengeshidi lokudweba ngosayizi ogcwele. \u003Cname\u003E.svg Isithombe somugqa we-isometric salo. variants.csv, variants.json Ithebula lezimingcele: i-id yevarianti ngayinye, igama, inani lazo zonke izimingcele, izakhiwo ezivalwa yiyo, amafayela ayo, ivolumu yayo nosayizi wayo. \u003Cpart\u003E.item.json Ingxenye njengento eyodwa yomtapo nezivarianti zayo (bona ngezansi). README.txt Okwenziwe, izinikezo ezingezansi, nanoma yini engakhiwanga. Amafayela anikezwa amagama ngokulungiselelwa. Ukulungiselelwa okungakhiwa (isakhiwo esingenziwa ngalezo zinani) akufakwa emafayeleni nasethebuleni, kudweshwe ku-README nasemyalezweni ngemva kokugcinwa kwe-zip; ezinye zisabhalwa. Okufanele ukwazi I-STEP iyinembile uma i-exact kernel ivuliwe kulolu hlobo. Ngaphandle kwayo i-STEP ibhikiwe (izinxantathu eziqondile), futhi i-README iyasho lokho. I-DWG ingeshidi lokudweba, hhayi imodeli ye-3D. Imigqa yayo ivela ku-mesh, ngakho umphetho ojikelezayo ungemigqa emifushane eminingi. Into yomtapo iphethe umzimba owodwa nesisekelo esisodwa ngevarianti ngayinye, ngokwamagatsha womtapo: Z ephezulu, ingaphambili ibheke −Y, nendawo yokufaka iphakathi kwasemuva, ngaphansi. Ipulani iyinxande ozungezile levarianti ngayinye. Into ikhawulelwe ku-8 MB, ngakho ivarianti esindayo kakhulu iba yibhokisi losayizi walo, futhi i-README ithi zingaki. Ukulungiselelwa okusebenzayo kwengxenye kuyiyona varianti ezenzakalelayo yento. Amachweba (izindawo zokuxhuma zamapayipi namadakhithi) akasethwa kusuka ku-PartCraft. Faka amavarianti ekhasini lomtapo Layisha \u003Cpart\u003E.item.json ku-Umtapo › Layisha kuwebhusayithi. Khetha isigaba sayo, ilayisense nombolo yakho yokunikela, bese iba yinto yomtapo enamavarianti ayo. Ku-BimCraft, ukuyibeka kubuza ukuthi yiyiphi ivarianti, futhi i-Shintsha inikeza ezinye. Ikhasi lapho izivakashi zikhetha izinketho, zibone i-3D futhi zilande ivarianti, kuwukubuka kwesibonelo sabasebenzi okwamanje: alivulelwe abantu bonke okwamanje. Ku-command line node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --out-dir plate-variants node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --only \"Small,Large\" --formats step,preview --zip plate.zip --only iqamba izilungiselelo, --formats noma yiluphi kwalezi: step, ifc, dwg, preview; --no-item ishiya into yomtapo ngaphandle. Ibhala ifolda, i-zip noma zombili, futhi iphuma ngo-1 uma ivarianti yehlulekile ukwakhiwa. Bona Izikripthi nomugqa womyalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"nodes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ama-node: akha imodeli ngokuxhuma","summary":"Xhuma izinombolo zibe amaphoyinti, amaphoyinti zibe amajika, amajika zibe ubuso. Shintsha inombolo bese konke okulandelayo kuyakhiwa kabusha. Ngayinye i-node nayo ingumugqa we-CraftScript, futhi igrafu igcinwa efayelini.","section":"tasks","order":108,"keywords":["ama-node","umhleli we-node","uhlelo olubonakalayo","parametric","igrafu","izintambo","amachweba","freeform","nurbs","loft","extrude","revolve","isongo","ijika","ubuso","uchungechunge","uhla","okungahleliwe","uhlu","script","craftscript","grasshopper"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuxhuma","text":"Ukuxhuma","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-neziyunithi","text":"Izinhlobo neziyunithi","level":2},{"id":"ama-solid-njengama-node","text":"Ama-solid njengama-node","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha","text":"Amaphutha","level":2},{"id":"yonke-i-node-ingumugqa-wescript","text":"Yonke i-node ingumugqa wescript","level":2},{"id":"igcinwe-nefayela","text":"Igcinwe nefayela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmhleli we-Nodes\u003C/strong\u003E wakha ijometri ngokuxhuma amabhokisi ndawonye. Ibhokisi ngalinye (i-node) lenza umsebenzi omncane: lenza inombolo, iphoyinti, isongo, i-loft. Uxhumanisa umphumela womunye kokungenayo komunye, bese imodeli iyalandela uma ushintsha inombolo esiqalweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula kusuka ohlwini lwe-workspace: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAma-node\u003C/span\u003E. Ivula iwindi lomhleli. Ingxenye esinegrafu isivele iyiboniswa uma uvula i-workspace. Kuyiwindi phezu kwe-3D view: hudula ibha yesihloko ukuze uyinyakazise, hudula ikhona ukuze uyilungise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuxhuma\"\u003EUkuxhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-node ohlwini oluseceleni kwesobunxele (thayipha ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze uncishise, &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; yengeza okokuqala okufanayo). Iveza phakathi kwe-canvas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula kusuka kwiqhezu elijikelezayo \u003Cstrong\u003Eelikhiphayo\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla kwe-node eyodwa uye kwiqhezu elijikelezayo \u003Cstrong\u003Eelingenayo\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokunxele kwenye. Liba luhlaza uma lifanele, libe bomvu uma lingafaneli; beka isikhombi phezu kwalo ukuze ubone isizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungena okungaxhunyiwe kubonisa ibhokisi lenani elithayiphiwe. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela &lt;kbd&gt;Tab&lt;/kbd&gt;: umphumela uyakhiwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiyingi esincane esisesihlokweni se-node yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eeye\u003C/strong\u003E yayo. I-node enelihlo elivulekile idwetshwa ku-3D view: njengemigqa yamajika, ishadiwe ngobuso, namachashaza wamaphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula i-node ngebha yesihloko sayo. Hudula ingemuva ukuze uhambe, phendula ivili lemouse ukuze usondeze. &lt;kbd&gt;Delete&lt;/kbd&gt; isusa i-node ekhethiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E ihlela ama-node ezikholomu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E iwalethe wonke ebonakalweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E zihamba phakathi kokuhlelwa kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-neziyunithi\"\u003EIzinhlobo neziyunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmachweba anohlobo: inombolo, yebo/cha, iphoyinti, ivekthafu, ijika, ubuso, imesh, isolid, noma &quot;geometry&quot; kunanoma yiliphi kulawa. Iphoyinti lingadlulisela kokungenayo kwevekthafu nakubuyela emuva. Izinombolo zinayunithi: \u003Cstrong\u003Eubude\u003C/strong\u003E kumamilimitha, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-engeli\u003C/strong\u003E kumadigri. Ubude alungadlulisi kwi-engeli, futhi ubude ophindwe ubude (indawo) buyalaleka, ngakho intambo engalungile iyamiswa uma uyenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqhezu elisikwele liyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Euhlu\u003C/strong\u003E. Uma uhlu lufika kokungenayo kwenani elilodwa, i-node isebenza kanye ngalinye lezinto zohlu, futhi umphumela wayo uba uhlu. Uhlu olufishane luphinda into yalo yokugcina. Isibonelo, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EUchungechunge\u003C/strong\u003E lobude be-\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa\u003C/strong\u003E lenza isitaki samakhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-solid-njengama-node\"\u003EAma-solid njengama-node\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu \u003Cstrong\u003EAmasolid\u003C/strong\u003E lenza amavolumu avaliwe kusuka kuziphetho ezifanayo nephaneli ye-Ubuso: \u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E (usayizi ku-mm), \u003Cstrong\u003EUnion\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtract\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIntersect\u003C/strong\u003E (isolid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala; ukubekezelela kuyibanga isolid engine ongakwazi ukuphambuka ngalo kuziphetho eziqondile), \u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E (izinhlangothi ngenombolo yazo ku-solid, u-1 kowokuqala; iradiyasi nalapho ingaphezu kuka-0, iradiyasi yokugcina), \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid volume\u003C/strong\u003E (mm³) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid to mesh\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuze ubone noma uyigcine). I-solid inohlobo lwayo lwechweba: iphoyinti noma inombolo akuxhunyiwa kokungenayo kwe-solid, futhi iqhezu lihlala libomvu. Ama-node we-Boolean ne-Fillet asebenzisa isolid engine yohlelo, elayishwa okokuqala lapho umhleli uvulwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha\"\u003EAmaphutha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-node engakwazi ukwenza umsebenzi wayo ikhombisa ukuthi kungani ngaphansi kwegama layo, ngombala obomvu (&quot;Iradiyasi kufanele ibe ngaphezu kwezero.&quot;), nama-node alandelayo ayalinda. Lo mlayezo ufana nenkinga ephaneli yeZinkinga, ngakho ungawuthola kulapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yonke-i-node-ingumugqa-wescript\"\u003EYonke i-node ingumugqa wescript\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikripthi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone igrafu njenge-CraftScript: umugqa owodwa ngayinye i-node, njengo \u003Ccode\u003En3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);\u003C/code\u003E. Hlela umbhalo bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza igrafu kulesi sikripthi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uwubuyisele ube yigrafu. Imisebenzi efanayo ye-\u003Ccode\u003End_\u003C/code\u003E isebenza nakuscript ye-CraftScript ku-PartCraft, ngakho igrafu ingasebenza, iphindwe noma ihlolwe khona. Izinombolo ezingahleliwe zihlala zithatha i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eseed\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze igrafu efanayo inikeze umphumela ofanayo kuwo wonke amakhompyutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igcinwe-nefayela\"\u003EIgcinwe nefayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgrafu igcinwa efayelini lengxenye (hhayi emlandweni, ngakho i-Hlehlisa kumhleli ingeyayo). Ama-node akha amajika, ubuso namamesh eceleni kwe-solid: awashintshi izici zengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Umhleli we-Nodes wakha ijometri ngokuxhuma amabhokisi ndawonye. Ibhokisi ngalinye (i-node) lenza umsebenzi omncane: lenza inombolo, iphoyinti, isongo, i-loft. Uxhumanisa umphumela womunye kokungenayo komunye, bese imodeli iyalandela uma ushintsha inombolo esiqalweni. Vula kusuka ohlwini lwe-workspace: Ama-node. Ivula iwindi lomhleli. Ingxenye esinegrafu isivele iyiboniswa uma uvula i-workspace. Kuyiwindi phezu kwe-3D view: hudula ibha yesihloko ukuze uyinyakazise, hudula ikhona ukuze uyilungise. Ukuxhuma Khetha i-node ohlwini oluseceleni kwesobunxele (thayipha ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze uncishise, \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E yengeza okokuqala okufanayo). Iveza phakathi kwe-canvas. Hudula kusuka kwiqhezu elijikelezayo elikhiphayo ngakwesokudla kwe-node eyodwa uye kwiqhezu elijikelezayo elingenayo ngakwesokunxele kwenye. Liba luhlaza uma lifanele, libe bomvu uma lingafaneli; beka isikhombi phezu kwalo ukuze ubone isizathu. Ukungena okungaxhunyiwe kubonisa ibhokisi lenani elithayiphiwe. Thayipha inombolo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd\u003ETab\u003C/kbd\u003E: umphumela uyakhiwa kabusha. Isiyingi esincane esisesihlokweni se-node yi-eye yayo. I-node enelihlo elivulekile idwetshwa ku-3D view: njengemigqa yamajika, ishadiwe ngobuso, namachashaza wamaphoyinti. Hudula i-node ngebha yesihloko sayo. Hudula ingemuva ukuze uhambe, phendula ivili lemouse ukuze usondeze. \u003Ckbd\u003EDelete\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa i-node ekhethiwe. Hlela ihlela ama-node ezikholomu, Lingana iwalethe wonke ebonakalweni, Hlehlisa kanye Phinda wenze zihamba phakathi kokuhlelwa kwakho. Izinhlobo neziyunithi Amachweba anohlobo: inombolo, yebo/cha, iphoyinti, ivekthafu, ijika, ubuso, imesh, isolid, noma \"geometry\" kunanoma yiliphi kulawa. Iphoyinti lingadlulisela kokungenayo kwevekthafu nakubuyela emuva. Izinombolo zinayunithi: ubude kumamilimitha, futhi i-engeli kumadigri. Ubude alungadlulisi kwi-engeli, futhi ubude ophindwe ubude (indawo) buyalaleka, ngakho intambo engalungile iyamiswa uma uyenza. Iqhezu elisikwele liyi-uhlu. Uma uhlu lufika kokungenayo kwenani elilodwa, i-node isebenza kanye ngalinye lezinto zohlu, futhi umphumela wayo uba uhlu. Uhlu olufishane luphinda into yalo yokugcina. Isibonelo, i-Uchungechunge lobude be-Hambisa lenza isitaki samakhophi. Ama-solid njengama-node Iqembu Amasolid lenza amavolumu avaliwe kusuka kuziphetho ezifanayo nephaneli ye-Ubuso: Box solid, Cylinder solid kanye Sphere solid (usayizi ku-mm), Union, Subtract kanye Intersect (isolid yesibili ithathwa kowokuqala; ukubekezelela kuyibanga isolid engine ongakwazi ukuphambuka ngalo kuziphetho eziqondile), Fillet between faces (izinhlangothi ngenombolo yazo ku-solid, u-1 kowokuqala; iradiyasi nalapho ingaphezu kuka-0, iradiyasi yokugcina), Solid volume (mm³) kanye Solid to mesh (ukuze ubone noma uyigcine). I-solid inohlobo lwayo lwechweba: iphoyinti noma inombolo akuxhunyiwa kokungenayo kwe-solid, futhi iqhezu lihlala libomvu. Ama-node we-Boolean ne-Fillet asebenzisa isolid engine yohlelo, elayishwa okokuqala lapho umhleli uvulwa. Amaphutha I-node engakwazi ukwenza umsebenzi wayo ikhombisa ukuthi kungani ngaphansi kwegama layo, ngombala obomvu (\"Iradiyasi kufanele ibe ngaphezu kwezero.\"), nama-node alandelayo ayalinda. Lo mlayezo ufana nenkinga ephaneli yeZinkinga, ngakho ungawuthola kulapho. Yonke i-node ingumugqa wescript Cindezela Isikripthi ukuze ubone igrafu njenge-CraftScript: umugqa owodwa ngayinye i-node, njengo n3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);. Hlela umbhalo bese ucindezela Yenza igrafu kulesi sikripthi ukuze uwubuyisele ube yigrafu. Imisebenzi efanayo ye-nd_ isebenza nakuscript ye-CraftScript ku-PartCraft, ngakho igrafu ingasebenza, iphindwe noma ihlolwe khona. Izinombolo ezingahleliwe zihlala zithatha i-seed, ukuze igrafu efanayo inikeze umphumela ofanayo kuwo wonke amakhompyutha. Igcinwe nefayela Igrafu igcinwa efayelini lengxenye (hhayi emlandweni, ngakho i-Hlehlisa kumhleli ingeyayo). Ama-node akha amajika, ubuso namamesh eceleni kwe-solid: awashintshi izici zengxenye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"build-assembly","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yakha inhlanganisela ngezixhumanisi","summary":"Qala inhlanganisela kusuka engxenyeni, faka amakhophi nezinye amafayela engxenye, uxhume ngezixhumanisi eziqinile, ezijikelezayo, ezihambayo, ezisilindrikhali, ezindizeni, ezibholeni nezikhonkwane emigodini, ugxile izixhumanisi ku-axis, uhlele ingxenye endaweni bese ulondoloza inhlanganisela.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["inhlanganisela","ukuxhuma","uxhumanisi","umjikelezo","umjikelezo ovaliwe","uxhumo","umshini","eqinile","ejikelezayo","isilayidi","esilindrikhali","endizeni","ibhola","uxhumanisi webhola","esiphambene","isikhonkwane emgodini","faka isakhi","emisiwe","ethi nqo","ezigxile","ehlangene","hlela ingxenye","endaweni","partcraft-asm"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-inhlanganisela","text":"Qala inhlanganisela","level":2},{"id":"faka-izingxenye","text":"Faka izingxenye","level":2},{"id":"xhuma-izingxenye-ezimbili","text":"Xhuma izingxenye ezimbili","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo-zoxhumanisi","text":"Izilungiselelo zoxhumanisi","level":3},{"id":"isibonelo-ama-flange-amabili-abotshwe-ubuso-nobuso","text":"Isibonelo: ama-flange amabili abotshwe ubuso nobuso","level":3},{"id":"imijikelezo-evaliwe-izixhumo","text":"Imijikelezo evaliwe: izixhumo","level":2},{"id":"sebenza-nezingxenye","text":"Sebenza nezingxenye","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ingxenye-endaweni","text":"Hlela ingxenye endaweni","level":3},{"id":"hlehlisa-londoloza-nevala","text":"Hlehlisa, londoloza nevala","level":2},{"id":"izinhlanganisela-ezinkulu","text":"Izinhlanganisela ezinkulu","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zoxhumanisi","text":"Izinkinga zoxhumanisi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EInhlanganisela ihlanganisa izingxenye. Ku-PartCraft, \u003Cstrong\u003Eizixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E zibeka izingxenye: uxhumanisi ngamunye uhlala ebusweni obuthe bezingxenye ezimbili ngayinye bese ubeka ubuso nobuso. Uxhumanisi ojikelezayo uvumela ingxenye eyodwa ukuthi ijikeke, isilayidi siyivumela ukuthi ihambe, uxhumanisi oqinile uyibamba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-inhlanganisela\"\u003EQala inhlanganisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYakha ingxenye enesiqinile (ingxenye engenalutho ayikwazi ukungena enhlanganiselweni: &quot;Yakha okokuqala isiqinile, bese uyifaka enhlanganiselweni.&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E kwisisetshenziswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ithi &quot;Inhlanganisela iqalile ne-Part1 njengengxenye emisiwe. Faka ezinye izingxenye (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka\u003C/span\u003E, noma Hlela › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E), bese uzihlanganisa.&quot; Ipheneli lesobunxele manje lidwebela \u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E, nesisetshenziswa sibonisa amathuluzi enhlanganisela. Amathuluzi esikethi nesakhi ayafihleka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye yokuqala \u003Cstrong\u003Eimisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ayikaze inyakaze, nakho konke okunye kubekwa ngokuhlobene nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-izingxenye\"\u003EFaka izingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E ifaka enye ikhophi yengxenye ekhethiwe (noma eyokugcina). Amakhophi abelana ngengxenye eyodwa: uma uyihlela, zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) eqenjini le-Hlela yenza okufanayo ngengxenye ekhethiwe. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zikopisha ingxenye bese zinamathisela eceleni kwezinye, kule nhlanganisela noma kwenye; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inamathisela endaweni efanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka\u003C/span\u003E ifaka ingxenye kusuka efayelini le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E kukhompyutha yakho. Ingxenye ikopishelwa enhlanganiselweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye ezintsha zivela ama-20 mm ngakwesokudla kwakho konke okuseduze, futhi zihlala lapho kuze kube yilapho uxhumanisi ezibeka. Ingxenye engenaxhumanisi nayo ingahanjiswa ngesandla: izinani ozibhalayo noma imicibisholo oyidonsayo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003EUhlu lwezingxenye, imibono echazwayo nokuhamba kwezingxenye\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhuma-izingxenye-ezimbili\"\u003EXhuma izingxenye ezimbili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ipheneli lesokudla lithi \u003Cstrong\u003EUxhumanisi omusha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe engxenyeni yokuqala. Buyakhanyisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe engxenyeni yesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye yesibili iyagxuma ukuze ubuso bayo bulale ngokuchaza ubuso bengxenye yokuqala. Uxhumanisi uvela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E, isibonelo &quot;Revolute1&quot;, futhi ipheneli lesokudla likhombisa izilungiselelo zawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma zombili ubuso zenziwe ngama-revolve, uxhumanisi uqala njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eejikelezayo\u003C/strong\u003E; ngaphandle kwalokho \u003Cstrong\u003Eeqinile\u003C/strong\u003E. Shintsha kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obugobile abukwazi ukukhethwa: &quot;Lobo buso bugobile. Khetha ubuso obuthe (ukuze ujikise ngokuzungeza umgodi noma i-axis ye-revolve, yikhethe kuxhumanisi kamuva).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela uxhumanisi oqalile (noma chofoza ingxenye ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izilungiselelo-zoxhumanisi\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zoxhumanisi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnye yezixhumanisi ethebhuleni elingezansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjikisa ingxenye yesibili ngokuzungeza i-axis kaxhumanisi (ilingene ezindaweni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlehliswa (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisa ingxenye yesibili ngokuya ku-axis, ikude nobuso (amanani angaphansi kwe-zero ayicindezela ngaphakathi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgokuya ku-X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENgokuya ku-Y\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EThambekisa ngokuzungeza X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EThambekisa ngokuzungeza Y\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENgokuya emgodini\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela yomgodi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanye amanani, abonakala kuzixhumanisi eziwasebenzisayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E (ohlangothini ngalunye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho i-axis kaxhumanisi ihlangana khona nobuso: &quot;I-origin yobuso uqobo&quot;, i-axis ye-revolve (&quot;Axis of Revolve1&quot;) noma i-axis yomgodi owodwa (&quot;Hole1, hole 2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani ngalinye uxhumanisi ovumela ukuthi lihambe linesilayidi sokudonsa ngaphansi kwebhokisi lalo; amanye asethwa kanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUxhumanisi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuhambayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusethwa kanye\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEqinile\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona, Ukuhlehliswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEjikelezayo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona (isibambi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlehliswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilayidi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlehliswa (isiqhwaqho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEsilindrikhali\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona nokuhlehliswa (intshaphu ebhalulini elilula)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEndizeni\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokuya ku-X, ngokuya ku-Y kuwo wonke ubuso, nekona (ingxenye eshelela etafuleni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhola\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona (ukujikeleza) kanye nokuthambekisa ngokuzungeza X no-Y, ngokuzungeza isikhungo sexhumanisi (uxhumanisi webhola)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhonkwane emgodini\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokuya emgodini kanye nekona (isikhonkwane emgodini ongqondile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndlela yomgodi: ikona yomgodi kusukela ku-X webuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-X ne-Y yobuso ziyizo zobuso bengxenye yokuqala; isikhungo sexhumanisi sisethwa yi-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;I-origin yobuso uqobo&quot; iyi-origin yengxenye eprojektwe ebusweni, okuvamise ukungabi lapho ofuna ukuthi izingxenye zihlelelane khona. Ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo nezikhonkwane, setha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E ku-axis ye-revolve noma yomgodi zombili izinhlangothi: ama-axis asehlelana, njengokuxhuma okugxile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isibonelo-ama-flange-amabili-abotshwe-ubuso-nobuso\"\u003EIsibonelo: ama-flange amabili abotshwe ubuso nobuso\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ingxenye ye-flange (i-revolve enomumo wezimbobo ojikelezayo) bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza ubuso obuthe edisikini le-flange yokuqala (ubuso izimbobo zamabhawodi eziqala kuwo), bese kuba ubuso obufanayo kwi-flange yesibili. Ubuso benziwe yi-revolve, ngakho uxhumanisi uyi-ejikelezayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E ku &quot;Axis of Revolve1&quot; ngazozombili izinhlangothi. Ama-flange manje abelana nge-axis eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uhlelelanise izimbobo zamabhawodi, noma donsa isilayidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imijikelezo-evaliwe-izixhumo\"\u003EImijikelezo evaliwe: izixhumo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye ezixhunywe ngendandatho (uxhumo lwamabha amane, ikhilakhila nesilayidi, uhlaka oqinisiwe ohlangothini ngalunye) zakha i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumjikelezo\u003C/strong\u003E. I-PartCraft ixazulula yonke imijikelezo ukuze ivale: izixhumanisi kuyo zithatha amanani agxilisa indandatho, zinyakaza kancane kangangoba zingakwazi kusukela lapho zazikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESetha noma donsa\u003C/strong\u003E inani loxhumanisi kumjikelezo bese enye yonke imjikelezo iyalandela. Kuxhumo lwamabha amane, donsa \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona\u003C/strong\u003E yekhilakhila futhi ukuxhuma nesiqomo nakho kuyanyakaza. Inani osetha liyagcinwa; amanye aphenywa kulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlwini, uxhumanisi kumjikelezo osengakwazi ukunyakaza uba \u003Cstrong\u003Eluhlaza\u003C/strong\u003E: esinye inani lingasethwa. Umjikelezo ongeke unyakaze (uhlaka oqinisiwe) uhlala umnyama. Umjikelezo ongakwazi ukuvala ubomvu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E likhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003EImijikelezo\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuthi zingaki ezivaliwe nokuthi amanani angaki angasanyakazayo, isibonelo &quot;1 ivaliwe; inani eli-1 lisangahamba&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E izula uxhumanisi emjikelezweni ngomjikelezo ulandela, sinyathelo ngesinyathelo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\"\u003EHlola inhlanganisela ngokungqubuzana nokunyakaza\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUxhumo lwendiza oluphindwe kumabha athambile kumele luvumelane ngokujula: izingxenye ezimbili ezixhunywe ubuso nobuso ezinhlangothini zombili zendandatho zidinga ukuphakama kwesitaki okufanayo ngazo zombili izindlela. Sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlehliswa\u003C/strong\u003E koxhumanisi ukuphakamisa ingxenye lapho isitaki singalingani, noma umjikelezo ungeke uvale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenza-nezingxenye\"\u003ESebenza nezingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza ingxenye embonweni noma ohlwini ukuze uyikhethe. Ipheneli lesokudla likhombisa igama lengxenye, izikhophi eziningi ezikhona, ivolumu yayo, izixhumanisi zayo, nokuthi iyimisiwe, ibekwe izixhumanisi zayo, noma &quot;Ayixhunyiwe: ihlala lapho yabekwa khona&quot;. Izinkinobho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela le ngxenye\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E kwisisetshenziswa, noma chofoza kabili ingxenye ohlwini): ivula ingxenye ukuze iguqulwe;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ikopi\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ingxenye emisiwe\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E: iphinde isuse nezixhumanisi zayo, emva kokubuza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhlanganisela igcina ingxenye eyodwa okungenani: &quot;Inhlanganisela igcina ingxenye eyodwa okungenani. Yivale esikhundleni salokho.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"hlela-ingxenye-endaweni\"\u003EHlela ingxenye endaweni\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ingxenye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxenye ivulwa nomlando wayo; ikhanda lithi &quot;Bracket (in Bracket assembly)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYiguqule njengengxenye yanoma yiluphi uhlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E kwisisetshenziswa. Inhlanganisela iyabuyekezwa: yonke ikhophi yalengxenye iyashintsha, nezixhumanisi ezisebusweni obenziwe ngamaphethelo esikethi ziyalandela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuyisa lolu shintsho kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ohlwini lokuHlehlisa lwenhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlehlisa-londoloza-nevala\"\u003EHlehlisa, londoloza nevala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInhlanganisela inohlu lwayo lokuHlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisebenza ezixhumanisini, ezifakwayo nezilungiselelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idawuniloda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;igama lenhlanganisela&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E, nayo yonke ingxenye ngaphakathi kwayo. Yivule kamuva ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ivala inhlanganisela ibuyele engxenyeni owaqala ngayo. Uma inhlanganisela ingalondolozwanga iyabuza: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELahla inhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza kuqala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqamba kabusha inhlanganisela, chofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho bese ushintsha \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E kuphaneli yesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlanganisela-ezinkulu\"\u003EIzinhlanganisela ezinkulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhlanganisela ingabamba izinkulungwane zamakhophi wezingxenye ezimbalwa. Amakhophi engxenye eyodwa adwetshwa ndawonye, uxhumanisi ojikelezayo wehlisa izingxenye ngemuva kwakhe kuphela, nohlu lwezingxenye lubonisa imigqa yalo yokuqala nenkinobho ethi &quot;Bonisa okwengeziwe&quot; ngaphansi kwayo (ingxenye ekhethiwe ihlala ibhalwe).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ujikisa noma usondeza umbono, inhlanganisela enama-triangle angaphezu kuka-300,000 idwetshwa njengebhokisi elilodwa ngengxenye, bese igcwala ngemva kwesikhashana uma usuyeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubonisa okulula\u003C/span\u003E igcina amabhokisi njalo. Ukukhetha ingxenye nezixhumanisi kusasebenzisa izingxenye zangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthi ijikeka ngokushesha kangakanani kuncike nakho ikhadi lakho lezithombe. Izinombolo i-PartCraft eziyilinganisile zisezincwadini zokukhishwa kanye nomshini ezavela kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zoxhumanisi\"\u003EIzinkinga zoxhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye engafinyeleli xhumanisi ibhalwa njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Emahhala\u003C/strong\u003E nephaneli ithi &quot;Bracket2 aixhunyiwe engxenyeni emisiwe, ngakho ihlala lapho yabekwa khona.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmjikelezo ongeke uvale (izinde azifiki, imkhawulo ivimbela uxhumanisi, ubuso abuvumelani ngokujula): &quot;Revolute3 ivala umjikelezo ongeke uvale: ukuphambuka ngo-2.000 mm. Hlola ubuso, ukuhlehliswa kanye nemikhawulo yezixhumanisi zomjikelezo.&quot; Izixhumanisi zakhe ziba bomvu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ubuso noma i-axis esetshenziswa uxhumanisi sekunyamalele ngemva kokuhlela ingxenye: &quot;Ubuso esebenziswa yilo xhumanisi buye bunyamalala ku-Bracket.&quot; Susa uxhumanisi bese uyenza futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkulandelayo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\"\u003EHlola inhlanganisela ngokungqubuzana nokunyakaza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Inhlanganisela ihlanganisa izingxenye. Ku-PartCraft, izixhumanisi zibeka izingxenye: uxhumanisi ngamunye uhlala ebusweni obuthe bezingxenye ezimbili ngayinye bese ubeka ubuso nobuso. Uxhumanisi ojikelezayo uvumela ingxenye eyodwa ukuthi ijikeke, isilayidi siyivumela ukuthi ihambe, uxhumanisi oqinile uyibamba. Qala inhlanganisela Yakha ingxenye enesiqinile (ingxenye engenalutho ayikwazi ukungena enhlanganiselweni: \"Yakha okokuqala isiqinile, bese uyifaka enhlanganiselweni.\"). Khetha Inhlanganisela kwisisetshenziswa. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Inhlanganisela iqalile ne-Part1 njengengxenye emisiwe. Faka ezinye izingxenye (Engeza ikopi, Faka, noma Hlela › Phinda), bese uzihlanganisa.\" Ipheneli lesobunxele manje lidwebela Izingxenye no-Izixhumanisi, nesisetshenziswa sibonisa amathuluzi enhlanganisela. Amathuluzi esikethi nesakhi ayafihleka. Ingxenye yokuqala imisiwe: ayikaze inyakaze, nakho konke okunye kubekwa ngokuhlobene nayo. Faka izingxenye Engeza ikopi ifaka enye ikhophi yengxenye ekhethiwe (noma eyokugcina). Amakhophi abelana ngengxenye eyodwa: uma uyihlela, zonke izikhophi ziyashintsha. Phinda (Ctrl+D) eqenjini le-Hlela yenza okufanayo ngengxenye ekhethiwe. Ctrl+C kanye Ctrl+V zikopisha ingxenye bese zinamathisela eceleni kwezinye, kule nhlanganisela noma kwenye; Ctrl+Shift+V inamathisela endaweni efanayo. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde. Faka ifaka ingxenye kusuka efayelini le-.partcraft.json kukhompyutha yakho. Ingxenye ikopishelwa enhlanganiselweni. Izingxenye ezintsha zivela ama-20 mm ngakwesokudla kwakho konke okuseduze, futhi zihlala lapho kuze kube yilapho uxhumanisi ezibeka. Ingxenye engenaxhumanisi nayo ingahanjiswa ngesandla: izinani ozibhalayo noma imicibisholo oyidonsayo (bona Uhlu lwezingxenye, imibono echazwayo nokuhamba kwezingxenye). Xhuma izingxenye ezimbili Khetha Hlanganisa noma cindezela J. Ipheneli lesokudla lithi Uxhumanisi omusha. Chofoza ubuso obuthe engxenyeni yokuqala. Buyakhanyisa. Chofoza ubuso obuthe engxenyeni yesibili. Ingxenye yesibili iyagxuma ukuze ubuso bayo bulale ngokuchaza ubuso bengxenye yokuqala. Uxhumanisi uvela ngaphansi kwe-Izixhumanisi, isibonelo \"Revolute1\", futhi ipheneli lesokudla likhombisa izilungiselelo zawo. Uma zombili ubuso zenziwe ngama-revolve, uxhumanisi uqala njenge-ejikelezayo; ngaphandle kwalokho eqinile. Shintsha kamuva. Ubuso obugobile abukwazi ukukhethwa: \"Lobo buso bugobile. Khetha ubuso obuthe (ukuze ujikise ngokuzungeza umgodi noma i-axis ye-revolve, yikhethe kuxhumanisi kamuva).\" Esc ikhansela uxhumanisi oqalile (noma chofoza ingxenye ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele). Izilungiselelo zoxhumanisi Okusethwayo Okwenzayo Uhlobo Enye yezixhumanisi ethebhuleni elingezansi Ikona (°) Ijikisa ingxenye yesibili ngokuzungeza i-axis kaxhumanisi (ilingene ezindaweni) Ukuhlehliswa (mm) Ihambisa ingxenye yesibili ngokuya ku-axis, ikude nobuso (amanani angaphansi kwe-zero ayicindezela ngaphakathi) Ngokuya ku-X, Ngokuya ku-Y, Thambekisa ngokuzungeza X, Thambekisa ngokuzungeza Y, Ngokuya emgodini, Indlela yomgodi Amanye amanani, abonakala kuzixhumanisi eziwasebenzisayo Isikhungo (ohlangothini ngalunye) Lapho i-axis kaxhumanisi ihlangana khona nobuso: \"I-origin yobuso uqobo\", i-axis ye-revolve (\"Axis of Revolve1\") noma i-axis yomgodi owodwa (\"Hole1, hole 2\") Inani ngalinye uxhumanisi ovumela ukuthi lihambe linesilayidi sokudonsa ngaphansi kwebhokisi lalo; amanye asethwa kanye. Uxhumanisi Okuhambayo Kusethwa kanye Eqinile Akukho lutho Ikona, Ukuhlehliswa Ejikelezayo Ikona (isibambi) Ukuhlehliswa Isilayidi Ukuhlehliswa (isiqhwaqho) Ikona Esilindrikhali Ikona nokuhlehliswa (intshaphu ebhalulini elilula) Endizeni Ngokuya ku-X, ngokuya ku-Y kuwo wonke ubuso, nekona (ingxenye eshelela etafuleni) Ibhola Ikona (ukujikeleza) kanye nokuthambekisa ngokuzungeza X no-Y, ngokuzungeza isikhungo sexhumanisi (uxhumanisi webhola) Isikhonkwane emgodini Ngokuya emgodini kanye nekona (isikhonkwane emgodini ongqondile) Indlela yomgodi: ikona yomgodi kusukela ku-X webuso I-X ne-Y yobuso ziyizo zobuso bengxenye yokuqala; isikhungo sexhumanisi sisethwa yi-Isikhungo. \"I-origin yobuso uqobo\" iyi-origin yengxenye eprojektwe ebusweni, okuvamise ukungabi lapho ofuna ukuthi izingxenye zihlelelane khona. Ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo nezikhonkwane, setha Isikhungo ku-axis ye-revolve noma yomgodi zombili izinhlangothi: ama-axis asehlelana, njengokuxhuma okugxile. Isibonelo: ama-flange amabili abotshwe ubuso nobuso Vula ingxenye ye-flange (i-revolve enomumo wezimbobo ojikelezayo) bese ukhetha Inhlanganisela. Khetha Engeza ikopi. Cindezela J, chofoza ubuso obuthe edisikini le-flange yokuqala (ubuso izimbobo zamabhawodi eziqala kuwo), bese kuba ubuso obufanayo kwi-flange yesibili. Ubuso benziwe yi-revolve, ngakho uxhumanisi uyi-ejikelezayo. Setha Isikhungo ku \"Axis of Revolve1\" ngazozombili izinhlangothi. Ama-flange manje abelana nge-axis eyodwa. Bhala 22.5 ku-Ikona (°) ukuze uhlelelanise izimbobo zamabhawodi, noma donsa isilayidi. Imijikelezo evaliwe: izixhumo Izingxenye ezixhunywe ngendandatho (uxhumo lwamabha amane, ikhilakhila nesilayidi, uhlaka oqinisiwe ohlangothini ngalunye) zakha i-umjikelezo. I-PartCraft ixazulula yonke imijikelezo ukuze ivale: izixhumanisi kuyo zithatha amanani agxilisa indandatho, zinyakaza kancane kangangoba zingakwazi kusukela lapho zazikhona. Setha noma donsa inani loxhumanisi kumjikelezo bese enye yonke imjikelezo iyalandela. Kuxhumo lwamabha amane, donsa Ikona yekhilakhila futhi ukuxhuma nesiqomo nakho kuyanyakaza. Inani osetha liyagcinwa; amanye aphenywa kulo. Ohlwini, uxhumanisi kumjikelezo osengakwazi ukunyakaza uba luhlaza: esinye inani lingasethwa. Umjikelezo ongeke unyakaze (uhlaka oqinisiwe) uhlala umnyama. Umjikelezo ongakwazi ukuvala ubomvu. Ibhokisi le-Ingxenye likhombisa Imijikelezo: ukuthi zingaki ezivaliwe nokuthi amanani angaki angasanyakazayo, isibonelo \"1 ivaliwe; inani eli-1 lisangahamba\". Hlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana izula uxhumanisi emjikelezweni ngomjikelezo ulandela, sinyathelo ngesinyathelo (bona Hlola inhlanganisela ngokungqubuzana nokunyakaza). Uxhumo lwendiza oluphindwe kumabha athambile kumele luvumelane ngokujula: izingxenye ezimbili ezixhunywe ubuso nobuso ezinhlangothini zombili zendandatho zidinga ukuphakama kwesitaki okufanayo ngazo zombili izindlela. Sebenzisa Ukuhlehliswa koxhumanisi ukuphakamisa ingxenye lapho isitaki singalingani, noma umjikelezo ungeke uvale. Sebenza nezingxenye Chofoza ingxenye embonweni noma ohlwini ukuze uyikhethe. Ipheneli lesokudla likhombisa igama lengxenye, izikhophi eziningi ezikhona, ivolumu yayo, izixhumanisi zayo, nokuthi iyimisiwe, ibekwe izixhumanisi zayo, noma \"Ayixhunyiwe: ihlala lapho yabekwa khona\". Izinkinobho: Hlela le ngxenye (noma Hlela ingxenye kwisisetshenziswa, noma chofoza kabili ingxenye ohlwini): ivula ingxenye ukuze iguqulwe; Faka ikopi; Yenza ingxenye emisiwe; Susa: iphinde isuse nezixhumanisi zayo, emva kokubuza. Inhlanganisela igcina ingxenye eyodwa okungenani: \"Inhlanganisela igcina ingxenye eyodwa okungenani. Yivale esikhundleni salokho.\" Hlela ingxenye endaweni Khetha ingxenye bese ukhetha Hlela ingxenye. Ingxenye ivulwa nomlando wayo; ikhanda lithi \"Bracket (in Bracket assembly)\". Yiguqule njengengxenye yanoma yiluphi uhlobo. Khetha Emuva kwisisetshenziswa. Inhlanganisela iyabuyekezwa: yonke ikhophi yalengxenye iyashintsha, nezixhumanisi ezisebusweni obenziwe ngamaphethelo esikethi ziyalandela. Ukubuyisa lolu shintsho kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ohlwini lokuHlehlisa lwenhlanganisela. Hlehlisa, londoloza nevala Inhlanganisela inohlu lwayo lokuHlehlisa: Ctrl+Z kanye Ctrl+Y zisebenza ezixhumanisini, ezifakwayo nezilungiselelo. Londoloza noma Ctrl+S idawuniloda \u003Cigama lenhlanganisela\u003E.partcraft-asm.json, nayo yonke ingxenye ngaphakathi kwayo. Yivule kamuva ngo-Vula. Vala ivala inhlanganisela ibuyele engxenyeni owaqala ngayo. Uma inhlanganisela ingalondolozwanga iyabuza: Khansela, Lahla inhlanganisela noma Londoloza kuqala. Ukuqamba kabusha inhlanganisela, chofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho bese ushintsha Igama kuphaneli yesokudla. Izinhlanganisela ezinkulu Inhlanganisela ingabamba izinkulungwane zamakhophi wezingxenye ezimbalwa. Amakhophi engxenye eyodwa adwetshwa ndawonye, uxhumanisi ojikelezayo wehlisa izingxenye ngemuva kwakhe kuphela, nohlu lwezingxenye lubonisa imigqa yalo yokuqala nenkinobho ethi \"Bonisa okwengeziwe\" ngaphansi kwayo (ingxenye ekhethiwe ihlala ibhalwe). Lapho ujikisa noma usondeza umbono, inhlanganisela enama-triangle angaphezu kuka-300,000 idwetshwa njengebhokisi elilodwa ngengxenye, bese igcwala ngemva kwesikhashana uma usuyeka. Imibono › Ukubonisa okulula igcina amabhokisi njalo. Ukukhetha ingxenye nezixhumanisi kusasebenzisa izingxenye zangempela. Ukuthi ijikeka ngokushesha kangakanani kuncike nakho ikhadi lakho lezithombe. Izinombolo i-PartCraft eziyilinganisile zisezincwadini zokukhishwa kanye nomshini ezavela kuwo. Izinkinga zoxhumanisi Ingxenye engafinyeleli xhumanisi ibhalwa njenge-mahhala nephaneli ithi \"Bracket2 aixhunyiwe engxenyeni emisiwe, ngakho ihlala lapho yabekwa khona.\" Umjikelezo ongeke uvale (izinde azifiki, imkhawulo ivimbela uxhumanisi, ubuso abuvumelani ngokujula): \"Revolute3 ivala umjikelezo ongeke uvale: ukuphambuka ngo-2.000 mm. Hlola ubuso, ukuhlehliswa kanye nemikhawulo yezixhumanisi zomjikelezo.\" Izixhumanisi zakhe ziba bomvu. Uma ubuso noma i-axis esetshenziswa uxhumanisi sekunyamalele ngemva kokuhlela ingxenye: \"Ubuso esebenziswa yilo xhumanisi buye bunyamalala ku-Bracket.\" Susa uxhumanisi bese uyenza futhi. Okulandelayo: Hlola inhlanganisela ngokungqubuzana nokunyakaza.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"assembly-bom-explode","scope":"partcraft","title":"Uhlu lwezingxenye, imibono echazwayo kanye nokuhamba kwezingxenye","summary":"Nikeza izingxenye zenhlanganisela inombolo, incazelo nempahla, funda futhi uthathe uhlu lwezinto, yenza imibono echazwayo ngezinyathelo noma ngokuzenzakalelayo, hambisa ngesandla izingxenye ezingaxhunyiwe, setha imikhawulo yezixhumanisi, bese uthumela inhlanganisela yonke njenge-STL, 3MF noma uhlu lwezinto.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["uhlu lwezinto","inombolo yengxenye","impahla","ukuminyana","csv","imbono echazwayo","chaza","goqa","imigqa yokuhamba","hambisa ingxenye","donsa","gizmo","hambisa","zungezisa","imikhawulo yezixhumanisi","ukuthumela inhlanganisela","izinyathelo zenhlanganisela","umdwebo wenhlanganisela","amabhaluni"],"headings":[{"id":"izakhiwo-zengxenye","text":"Izakhiwo zengxenye","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lwezinto","text":"Uhlu lwezinto","level":2},{"id":"imibono-echazwayo","text":"Imibono echazwayo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ingxenye-ngesandla","text":"Hambisa ingxenye ngesandla","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo-yezixhumanisi","text":"Imikhawulo yezixhumanisi","level":2},{"id":"thumela-yonke-inhlanganisela","text":"Thumela yonke inhlanganisela","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELezi zakhi zisekhoneni lesokudla senhlanganisela (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EYakha inhlanganisela\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izakhiwo-zengxenye\"\u003EIzakhiwo zengxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ingxenye ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo zengxenye\u003C/strong\u003E setha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInombolo yengxenye\u003C/strong\u003E (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-40) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enencazelo\u003C/strong\u003E (kuze kube ezingu-200).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E: impahla ejwayelekile nokuminyana kwayo, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuminyana okwenziwe…\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthayiphe okunye ku-g/cm³. Ipheneli bese likhombisa ubunzima bengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzakhiwo zengxenye, ngakho zonke izikhophi zizabelana ngazo. Zilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lwezinto\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungekho lutho okhethiwe (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ipheneli likhombisa i-\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa owodwa ngengxenye ngayinye, nenombolo yayo yento, inani (izikhophi ezingaki), inombolo yengxenye, igama, impahla kanye nobunzima ngayinye. Izinombolo zento zilandela uhla lapho izingxenye zivela khona okokuqala ohlwini. Ubunzima busebenzisa ivolumu yengxenye ngayinye (yesiqinile esinamaphethelo esakhiwe yi-mesh kernel, esibonakala sincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo) kanye nempahla yayo. Ingxenye engenampahla ayinabunzima, ngakho ngeke kube khona isamba esiphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza uhlu njengefayela le-CSV (futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › Uhlu lwezinto (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E). Livuleka kunoma iyiphi i-spreadsheet; umbhalo oqala nge-= noma + uthola i-apostrofi phambili ukuze i-spreadsheet ingawusebenzisi njengefomula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imibono-echazwayo\"\u003EImibono echazwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbono echazwayo ihlukanisa izingxenye ukuze kwenziwe izithombe. Ayikaze iguqule izixhumanisi noma lapho izingxenye zikhona ngempela: ukulondoloza, ukuhlola ukungqubuzana kanye nokuthumela kusebenzisa izindawo zangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungekho lutho okhethiwe, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbono omusha\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImibono echazwayo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza isinyathelo\u003C/strong\u003E, tshela izingxenye isinyathelo esizihambisayo, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela\u003C/strong\u003E (+X … −Z, i-normal yobuso oluchofozayo, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa umcibisholo embonweni\u003C/strong\u003E) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isinyathelo\u003C/span\u003E. Ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa\u003C/strong\u003E, donsa umcibisholo bese uyeqa: isinyathelo sithatha indlela nebanga owadonsile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza ezinye izinyathelo. Zidlala ngokulandelana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa isilayida phakathi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIhlanganisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EEchazwayo\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze wenze imbono ibe nesithombe esinyakazayo. Imigqa yemicibisho eyisiqephu ihamba isuka endaweni yokuphumula yengxenye ngayinye iye lapho ikhona manje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuzenzekelayo (okuqondile)\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa zonke izingxenye ngaphandle kwengxenye emisiwe, zisuke phakathi kwenhlanganisela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuzenzekelayo (okuxhumile)\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa ingxenye ngayinye exhunyiwe (kanye nakho konke okuxhunywe ngaphansi kwayo) iphume ngokuqondile kwe-normal yobuso bozixhumanisi bayo. Ungagcina imibono eminingi equmbethwe amagama; khetha enye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIhlanganisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ukubuyisela izingxenye endaweni yazo. Imibono ilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ingxenye-ngesandla\"\u003EHambisa ingxenye ngesandla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye engenaxhumanisi nengxenye emisiwe kuphela ihamba ngesandla (ingxenye emisiwe ayinyakazi; izixhumanisi zibeka ezinye). Yikhethe bese, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ngesandla\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EΔX, ΔY, ΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha i-axis kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikisa\u003C/span\u003E (ozungeze maphakathi engxenye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDonsa ukuze uhambise\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa imicibisholo engxenyeni: donsa umcibisholo ukuze uhambe ngale axis, noma isikwele ukuze uhambe endizeni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDonsa ukuze ujikise\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa izindandatho zokujikisa. Ukudonsa ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ifihla imicibisholo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo-yezixhumanisi\"\u003EImikhawulo yezixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uxhumanisi ohambayo bese, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/strong\u003E, thika \u003Cstrong\u003EBamba … phakathi kwemikhawulo\u003C/strong\u003E kunoma yiziphi izinani zawo, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003E Okuncane\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EOkukhulu\u003C/strong\u003E. Inani ngalinye libanjwe ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo yalo, isilayida salo sihlanganisa lolo banga kuphela, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EHlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana\u003C/strong\u003E izula phakathi kwazo kuphela. Uxhumanisi wesilinda angakhawulela ikona yakhe, ukuhlehliswa kwakhe noma kokubili. Ukushintsha uhlobo lukaxhumanisi kususa imikhawulo yezinani uhlobo olusha olungenazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-yonke-inhlanganisela\"\u003EThumela yonke inhlanganisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwinhlanganisela, imenyu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala yonke inhlanganisela ngayo yonke ingxenye endaweni eyibekwe kuyo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP AP242 / AP214\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo (PDF)\u003C/strong\u003E akakakhiwa kule nguqulo: zidinga i-exact kernel, ngakho zimpunga. Thumela i-STEP yengxenye ngayinye (isiqinile esinembile) ngokusuka engxenyeni kunalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E: i-mesh eyodwa yazo zonke izingxenye. \u003Cstrong\u003E3MF\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye ngayinye kanye, ibekwe kanye ngekhophi ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwezinto (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo wenhlanganisela kanye ne-STEP yenhlanganisela akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (zidinga i-exact kernel). Imibono echazwayo yizithombe ezibonakala esikrinini kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lezi zakhi zisekhoneni lesokudla senhlanganisela (bona Yakha inhlanganisela). Izakhiwo zengxenye Khetha ingxenye ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele. Ngaphansi kwe-Izakhiwo zengxenye setha: Inombolo yengxenye (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-40) kanye nencazelo (kuze kube ezingu-200). Impahla: impahla ejwayelekile nokuminyana kwayo, noma Ukuminyana okwenziwe… ukuze uthayiphe okunye ku-g/cm³. Ipheneli bese likhombisa ubunzima bengxenye. Izakhiwo zengxenye, ngakho zonke izikhophi zizabelana ngazo. Zilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela. Uhlu lwezinto Uma kungekho lutho okhethiwe (Esc), ipheneli likhombisa i-Uhlu lwezinto: umugqa owodwa ngengxenye ngayinye, nenombolo yayo yento, inani (izikhophi ezingaki), inombolo yengxenye, igama, impahla kanye nobunzima ngayinye. Izinombolo zento zilandela uhla lapho izingxenye zivela khona okokuqala ohlwini. Ubunzima busebenzisa ivolumu yengxenye ngayinye (yesiqinile esinamaphethelo esakhiwe yi-mesh kernel, esibonakala sincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo) kanye nempahla yayo. Ingxenye engenampahla ayinabunzima, ngakho ngeke kube khona isamba esiphelele. Landa i-CSV ilondoloza uhlu njengefayela le-CSV (futhi Thumela › Uhlu lwezinto (CSV)). Livuleka kunoma iyiphi i-spreadsheet; umbhalo oqala nge-= noma + uthola i-apostrofi phambili ukuze i-spreadsheet ingawusebenzisi njengefomula. Imibono echazwayo Imbono echazwayo ihlukanisa izingxenye ukuze kwenziwe izithombe. Ayikaze iguqule izixhumanisi noma lapho izingxenye zikhona ngempela: ukulondoloza, ukuhlola ukungqubuzana kanye nokuthumela kusebenzisa izindawo zangempela. Uma kungekho lutho okhethiwe, khetha Umbono omusha ngaphansi kwe-Imibono echazwayo. Ngaphansi kwe-Engeza isinyathelo, tshela izingxenye isinyathelo esizihambisayo, khetha Indlela (+X … −Z, i-normal yobuso oluchofozayo, noma Donsa umcibisholo embonweni) kanye Ibanga, bese Engeza isinyathelo. Ngo-Donsa, donsa umcibisholo bese uyeqa: isinyathelo sithatha indlela nebanga owadonsile. Engeza ezinye izinyathelo. Zidlala ngokulandelana. Donsa isilayida phakathi kwe-Ihlanganisiwe ne-Echazwayo ukuze wenze imbono ibe nesithombe esinyakazayo. Imigqa yemicibisho eyisiqephu ihamba isuka endaweni yokuphumula yengxenye ngayinye iye lapho ikhona manje. Okuzenzekelayo (okuqondile) ihambisa zonke izingxenye ngaphandle kwengxenye emisiwe, zisuke phakathi kwenhlanganisela. Okuzenzekelayo (okuxhumile) ihambisa ingxenye ngayinye exhunyiwe (kanye nakho konke okuxhunywe ngaphansi kwayo) iphume ngokuqondile kwe-normal yobuso bozixhumanisi bayo. Ungagcina imibono eminingi equmbethwe amagama; khetha enye ku-Ukubuka, noma Ihlanganisiwe ukubuyisela izingxenye endaweni yazo. Imibono ilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela. Hambisa ingxenye ngesandla Ingxenye engenaxhumanisi nengxenye emisiwe kuphela ihamba ngesandla (ingxenye emisiwe ayinyakazi; izixhumanisi zibeka ezinye). Yikhethe bese, ngaphansi kwe-Hambisa ngesandla: Bhala ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ bese ukhetha Hambisa, noma khetha i-axis kanye Ikona (°) bese Jikisa (ozungeze maphakathi engxenye). Donsa ukuze uhambise ibonisa imicibisholo engxenyeni: donsa umcibisholo ukuze uhambe ngale axis, noma isikwele ukuze uhambe endizeni. Donsa ukuze ujikise ibonisa izindandatho zokujikisa. Ukudonsa ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Esc ifihla imicibisholo. Imikhawulo yezixhumanisi Khetha uxhumanisi ohambayo bese, ngaphansi kwe-Imikhawulo, thika Bamba … phakathi kwemikhawulo kunoma yiziphi izinani zawo, bese usetha Okuncane kanye Okukhulu. Inani ngalinye libanjwe ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo yalo, isilayida salo sihlanganisa lolo banga kuphela, futhi Hlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana izula phakathi kwazo kuphela. Uxhumanisi wesilinda angakhawulela ikona yakhe, ukuhlehliswa kwakhe noma kokubili. Ukushintsha uhlobo lukaxhumanisi kususa imikhawulo yezinani uhlobo olusha olungenazo. Thumela yonke inhlanganisela Kwinhlanganisela, imenyu ye-Thumela ibhala yonke inhlanganisela ngayo yonke ingxenye endaweni eyibekwe kuyo: STEP AP242 / AP214 kanye Umdwebo (PDF) akakakhiwa kule nguqulo: zidinga i-exact kernel, ngakho zimpunga. Thumela i-STEP yengxenye ngayinye (isiqinile esinembile) ngokusuka engxenyeni kunalokho. STL: i-mesh eyodwa yazo zonke izingxenye. 3MF: ingxenye ngayinye kanye, ibekwe kanye ngekhophi ngayinye. Uhlu lwezinto (CSV). Imikhawulo Umdwebo wenhlanganisela kanye ne-STEP yenhlanganisela akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (zidinga i-exact kernel). Imibono echazwayo yizithombe ezibonakala esikrinini kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"documents-walkthrough","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amadokhumenti nokuguqulwa (isitoreji)","summary":"Uhambo oluyinyathelo ngesinyathelo ngomsebenzi oyisibonelo: beka ifolda yephrojekthi yezingxenye nezihlanganisela ngaphansi kolawulo, phuma ingxenye, uyishintshe, uyingenise ngenothi, uyikhulule, ubone ukuthi yini esetshenziswa yona kanye nohlu lwezinto, nokuthi umuntu wesibili ubona yini uma le fayela livaliwe, nokuthi isebenza kanjani namafolda efu.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["isitoreji","amadokhumenti","uhambo","ifundo","phuma","ngenisa","ukuguqulwa","khulula","vuma","ukukhiya","umlando","lapho kusetshenziswa","uhlu lwezinto","bom","inhlanganisela","ifolda yefu","ifolda yephrojekthi","abantu ababili","ifolda ehlanganyelwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzoyenza","text":"Okuzoyenza","level":2},{"id":"1-lungiselela-ifolda-yephrojekthi","text":"1. Lungiselela ifolda yephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"2-lethe-ifayela-ngaphansi-kolawulo","text":"2. Lethe ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo","level":2},{"id":"3-phuma-shintsha-ngenisa","text":"3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa","level":2},{"id":"4-buka-bese-ukhulula","text":"4. Buka bese ukhulula","level":2},{"id":"5-ukuguqulwa-okusha","text":"5. Ukuguqulwa okusha","level":2},{"id":"6-bona-okwenzekile","text":"6. Bona okwenzekile","level":2},{"id":"amahlanganisela-okusetshenziswayo-nohlu-lwezinto","text":"Amahlanganisela: okusetshenziswayo nohlu lwezinto","level":2},{"id":"7-okubona-uben-uma-ubamba-ifayela","text":"7. Okubona uBen uma ubamba ifayela","level":2},{"id":"8-amafolda-efu","text":"8. Amafolda efu","level":2},{"id":"zama","text":"Zama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzoyenza\"\u003EOkuzoyenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnguAna, usebenza ku-Riverside Clinic nomsebenzisani wakho uBen. Izingxenye nezihlanganisela zephrojekthi zihlala efolda eyodwa enifinyelela kuyo nobabili (idrayivu ehlanganyelwe, ifolda ehlanganisiwe, noma ifolda yefu). Ekugcineni, ifayela eliyodwa liye livela ekukopisheni kwalo kokuqala laya ekuguqulweni okukhululiwe \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, base lishintshwa futhi njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, ubone ukuthi ubani wenze yini, futhi ubone ukuthi uBen ubona yini uma ubamba leli fayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kugcinwa ku-folda efihliwe ethi \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault\u003C/code\u003E eseduze kwamafayela akho: alukho iseva, akulayishwa lutho (ifolda yefu iyisiphambano, bheka isinyathelo sokugcina). Ukuze uthole wonke amacala nemithetho endaweni eyodwa, bheka isihloko \u003Cem\u003EDocuments: check out, revisions and release\u003C/em\u003E lapho uhlelo lwakho lunaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-lungiselela-ifolda-yephrojekthi\"\u003E1. Lungiselela ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti…\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela\u003C/strong\u003E ebhalweni lamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe izingxenye nezihlanganisela zephrojekthi. (Amafolda ephrojekthi asebenza ku-Studio nasebhulawuzeni angavula ifolda, njenge-Chrome ne-Edge. Kwamanye amabhulawuza iphaneli iyakutshela lokho.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EWena:\u003C/strong\u003E bese uthayipha igama lakho, \u003Ccode\u003EAna\u003C/code\u003E (uma kubuza, negama lalo kompyutha). Iphaneli manje ithi \u003Cem\u003EWena: Ana on\u003C/em\u003E nekhompyutha yakho. Igama lakho lifakwa kukho konke okwenzayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala isitoreji kule folda\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha igama lephrojekthi, \u003Ccode\u003ERiverside clinic\u003C/code\u003E. Iphaneli ithi \u003Cem\u003EIsitoreji siqalisiwe ku-Riverside clinic.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-lethe-ifayela-ngaphansi-kolawulo\"\u003E2. Lethe ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela angekho esitoreji\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Eplates/Bracket.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyavela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela esitoreji\u003C/strong\u003E ngokuguqulwa \u003Cstrong\u003EA.1\u003C/strong\u003E, nesimo \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi uyaqhubeka\u003C/strong\u003E. A.1 iyikhophi layo lokuqala; isitoreji sigcina ikhophi lokuguqulwa ngakunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-phuma-shintsha-ngenisa\"\u003E3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Eplates/Bracket.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Ingxenye ivulwa ku-PartCraft futhi iphaneli iyavaleka ukuze ubone. Vula iphaneli futhi kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula futhi iphaneli bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa manje uthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIphumele kuwe\u003C/strong\u003E. Kudalwe ifayela lokukhiya ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/locks\u003C/code\u003E; akekho omunye ongaphuma ifayela le kuze kube yilapho ulingenisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha ingxenye: hlela ubude, engeza umgodi. Ukulondoloza kuyenqatshwa ngaphandle kokuthi ifayela liphumele kuwe, futhi kutshela ukuthi kungani; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E isebenza njalo ngekhophi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula iphaneli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha okushintshile (\u003Ccode\u003EMoved the door\u003C/code\u003E). Iphaneli ithi \u003Cem\u003Eingenisiwe njenge-A.2\u003C/em\u003E. Ifayela ku-folda yephrojekthi manje yingxenye oyivulile, nokukhiya kususiwe. Ukungenisa ngaphandle kokushintsha kugcina ukuguqulwa okufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ushintsha umqondo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela ifayela ngaphandle kokuguqulwa okusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-buka-bese-ukhulula\"\u003E4. Buka bese ukhulula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela ukuze ibukwe\u003C/span\u003E. Isimo sishintshela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuze ibukwe\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ifayela lifundeka kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphambi kokuvuma, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E bese ubhala ukuthi ubani angavuma (igama elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye), isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EBen\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003ECarla\u003C/code\u003E, bese uthikha umthetho wokuthi umvumi kufanele abe omunye umuntu hhayi umbhali. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza izilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Manje isitoreji ngokwaso siyavimbela omunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU-Ben (noma u-Carla) khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVuma\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha igama lomvumi. Isimo sishintshela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhuliwe\u003C/strong\u003E nokuguqulwa kube \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, nomugqa othi \u003Cem\u003EIgunyazwe ngu-\u003C/em\u003E negama. Ifayela elikhuliwe lifundeka kuphela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela\u003C/span\u003E bekuyibuyisela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi uyaqhubeka\u003C/strong\u003E, nesizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama lomvumi ngelombhalo kuphaneli; liwukurekhoda ukuthi ubani usayine, hhayi ubufakazi bokuthi ungubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-ukuguqulwa-okusha\"\u003E5. Ukuguqulwa okusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela elikhuliwe, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInguqulo entsha\u003C/span\u003E. Uyilondoloza ukuze uthole inhlamvu elandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYishintshe, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuguqulwa kuba \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, umsebenzi uyaqhubeka. Yikhulule ngendlela efanayo futhi iba \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokungenisa kokuqala kusishiya ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu zokuguqulwa zilandelana A, B … Z, AA, AB. Uma izinga lakho lishiya ezinye izinhlamvu, izilungiselelo zephrojekthi \u003Cem\u003ESebenzisa ukulandelana kwe-ASME Y14.35\u003C/em\u003E zidlula I, O, Q, S, X kanye no-Z kokuguqulwa okulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"6-bona-okwenzekile\"\u003E6. Bona okwenzekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha igama lefayela ukuvula imininingwane yalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmlando\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke imicimbi, eyisha kuqala, nokuthi ubani, iyiphi ikhompyutha nesikhathi: \u003Cem\u003EIngenisiwe A.2\u003C/em\u003E ngu-Ana, \u003Cem\u003EIkhuliwe\u003C/em\u003E ngu-Ben, njll.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuguqulwa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ithebula lokuguqulwa: wonke amakhophi okuguqulwa agciniwe, nedethi yawo, ubani wawungenisa, inothi, nokuthi ubani wawuvuma. Isitoreji sigcina ikhophi ngayinye ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/revs\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusetshenziswa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: izingxenye zehlanganisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusetshenziswa ngu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlu lwawo wonke amahlanganisela esitoreji aqukethe le ngxenye: uma ushintsha isibambi, uyazi ukuthi yiziphi izinhlanganisela ezifanele ukuhlolwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amahlanganisela-okusetshenziswayo-nohlu-lwezinto\"\u003EAmahlanganisela: okusetshenziswayo nohlu lwezinto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaka ihlanganisela (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, elondolozwe kusuka kumodi yeInhlanganisela) efolda bese uyengeza. Khetha igama layo: \u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa\u003C/strong\u003E lohlu izingxenye eziqukethe, nokuguqulwa nesimo sengxenye ngayinye; \u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa ngu\u003C/strong\u003E kwingxenye ohlu wonke amahlanganisela eliqukethe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E longa uhlu lwazo zonke izingxenye, izinga ngezinga, nobuningi, izinguqulo nezimo, ukuze kusetshenziswe kuspredishithi. Shintsha isibambi, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa ngu\u003C/strong\u003E ikutshela amahlanganisela okufanele ubheke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"7-okubona-uben-uma-ubamba-ifayela\"\u003E7. Okubona uBen uma ubamba ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EManje phuma ifayela futhi, bese ucela uBen ukuthi avule ifolda efanayo yephrojekthi ekhompyutheni yakhe bese evula iphaneli. Esihlahleni sefayela ubona \u003Cstrong\u003EIphumelwe ngu-Ana kukhompyutha yakho kusukela\u003C/strong\u003E isikhathi, futhi akabonanga inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ezama noma kunjalo isitoreji siyenqaba: ukukhiya kuyifayela uhlelo olungeke lilenze kabili, ngakho abantu ababili abakwazi ukubamba ifayela ngesikhathi esifanayo, nangokushesha okufanayo, uma ifolda isendisikhi ku-Studio. (Kusibhulawuza ifolda inikeza okungenzeka kuphela, futhi iphaneli iyakutshela lokho ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder\u003C/strong\u003E.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma u-Ana engekho futhi uBen edinga ifayela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhula ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E liyakukhulula. Kufanele abhale isizathu; sifakwa elogini kanye nokuthi ukuphuma kwakungokukabani. Uma ephrojekthi inabalawuli abadweliwe, bona kuphela abangakwenza lokho. Ukuphuma okudlule umkhawulo wokuphelelwa yisikhathi (izinsuku ezingu-14 ngokuzenzakalela) kumakwa ngokuthi \u003Cem\u003Eisikhathi eside\u003C/em\u003E. Ngemva kokuphula, ukungenisa kuka-Ana okwephuzile kuyenqatshwa, ngakho nina ningakwazi ukubhalela phezu komunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"8-amafolda-efu\"\u003E8. Amafolda efu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfolda yefu iyifolda yephrojekthi egcinwe kusitoreji sefu seqembu lakho, ngakho iqembu alidingi idrayivu ehlanganyelwe. Ku-Studio, ungene ku-akhawunti yakho ye-CadCraft, iphaneli ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda yefu\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E. Yikhethe bese ukhetha ifolda, ohlwini oluthi isikhala sokusebenza / ifolda. Umnikazi wesikhala sokusebenza udala ifolda kuqala, futhi kufanele isitoreji sefu seqembu sisebenze. Konke okungenhla kusebenza ngendlela efanayo; iseva yenza ukukhiya, okuqinile phakathi kwabantu. Uma ungakangeni, iphaneli iyakutshela ukuthi ungene. Ethebhini lesiphequluli elijwayelekile inkinobho yefu ayitholakali; sebenzisa i-Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zama\"\u003EZama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza izinyathelo ezingu-8 ngenkopi yefayela langempela. Ezinyathelweni zabantu ababili udinga omunye umuntu, noma amawindi amabili ngamagama amabili. Uma uzama nge-folda eyangempela ehlanganyelwe, ikhasi lokuhlola lomphakathi liqukethe ukuhlola okubuza lokhu ngqo, futhi lamukela imiphumela.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzoyenza UnguAna, usebenza ku-Riverside Clinic nomsebenzisani wakho uBen. Izingxenye nezihlanganisela zephrojekthi zihlala efolda eyodwa enifinyelela kuyo nobabili (idrayivu ehlanganyelwe, ifolda ehlanganisiwe, noma ifolda yefu). Ekugcineni, ifayela eliyodwa liye livela ekukopisheni kwalo kokuqala laya ekuguqulweni okukhululiwe A, base lishintshwa futhi njenge-B.1, ubone ukuthi ubani wenze yini, futhi ubone ukuthi uBen ubona yini uma ubamba leli fayela. Konke kugcinwa ku-folda efihliwe ethi .ccvault eseduze kwamafayela akho: alukho iseva, akulayishwa lutho (ifolda yefu iyisiphambano, bheka isinyathelo sokugcina). Ukuze uthole wonke amacala nemithetho endaweni eyodwa, bheka isihloko Documents: check out, revisions and release lapho uhlelo lwakho lunaso. 1. Lungiselela ifolda yephrojekthi Khetha Amadokhumenti… eqenjini Ifayela ebhalweni lamathuluzi. Khetha Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe izingxenye nezihlanganisela zephrojekthi. (Amafolda ephrojekthi asebenza ku-Studio nasebhulawuzeni angavula ifolda, njenge-Chrome ne-Edge. Kwamanye amabhulawuza iphaneli iyakutshela lokho.) Khetha Shintsha eduze kwe-Wena: bese uthayipha igama lakho, Ana (uma kubuza, negama lalo kompyutha). Iphaneli manje ithi Wena: Ana on nekhompyutha yakho. Igama lakho lifakwa kukho konke okwenzayo. Khetha Qala isitoreji kule folda bese uthayipha igama lephrojekthi, Riverside clinic. Iphaneli ithi Isitoreji siqalisiwe ku-Riverside clinic. 2. Lethe ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo Vula Amafayela angekho esitoreji bese ukhetha Engeza eduze kwe-plates/Bracket.partcraft.json. Liyavela ngaphansi kwe-Amafayela esitoreji ngokuguqulwa A.1, nesimo Umsebenzi uyaqhubeka. A.1 iyikhophi layo lokuqala; isitoreji sigcina ikhophi lokuguqulwa ngakunye. 3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa Khetha Vula eduze kwe-plates/Bracket.partcraft.json. Ingxenye ivulwa ku-PartCraft futhi iphaneli iyavaleka ukuze ubone. Vula iphaneli futhi kusuka ku-Amadokhumenti…. Vula futhi iphaneli bese ukhetha Phuma. Umugqa manje uthi Iphumele kuwe. Kudalwe ifayela lokukhiya ku-.ccvault/locks; akekho omunye ongaphuma ifayela le kuze kube yilapho ulingenisa. Shintsha ingxenye: hlela ubude, engeza umgodi. Ukulondoloza kuyenqatshwa ngaphandle kokuthi ifayela liphumele kuwe, futhi kutshela ukuthi kungani; Londoloza njenge isebenza njalo ngekhophi yakho. Vula iphaneli, khetha Ngenisa bese uthayipha okushintshile (Moved the door). Iphaneli ithi ingenisiwe njenge-A.2. Ifayela ku-folda yephrojekthi manje yingxenye oyivulile, nokukhiya kususiwe. Ukungenisa ngaphandle kokushintsha kugcina ukuguqulwa okufanayo. Uma ushintsha umqondo, Hlehlisa ukuphuma ibuyisela ifayela ngaphandle kokuguqulwa okusha. 4. Buka bese ukhulula Khetha Thumela ukuze ibukwe. Isimo sishintshela ku-Ukuze ibukwe futhi ifayela lifundeka kuphela. Ngaphambi kokuvuma, khetha Izilungiselelo zephrojekthi bese ubhala ukuthi ubani angavuma (igama elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye), isibonelo Ben no Carla, bese uthikha umthetho wokuthi umvumi kufanele abe omunye umuntu hhayi umbhali. Khetha Londoloza izilungiselelo. Manje isitoreji ngokwaso siyavimbela omunye. U-Ben (noma u-Carla) khetha Vuma bese uthayipha igama lomvumi. Isimo sishintshela ku-Ikhuliwe nokuguqulwa kube A, nomugqa othi Igunyazwe ngu- negama. Ifayela elikhuliwe lifundeka kuphela. Buyisela bekuyibuyisela ku-Umsebenzi uyaqhubeka, nesizathu. Igama lomvumi ngelombhalo kuphaneli; liwukurekhoda ukuthi ubani usayine, hhayi ubufakazi bokuthi ungubani. 5. Ukuguqulwa okusha Kufayela elikhuliwe, khetha Inguqulo entsha. Uyilondoloza ukuze uthole inhlamvu elandelayo. Yishintshe, bese Ngenisa. Ukuguqulwa kuba B.1, umsebenzi uyaqhubeka. Yikhulule ngendlela efanayo futhi iba B. Hlehlisa ukuphuma ngaphambi kokungenisa kokuqala kusishiya ku-A. Izinhlamvu zokuguqulwa zilandelana A, B … Z, AA, AB. Uma izinga lakho lishiya ezinye izinhlamvu, izilungiselelo zephrojekthi Sebenzisa ukulandelana kwe-ASME Y14.35 zidlula I, O, Q, S, X kanye no-Z kokuguqulwa okulandelayo. 6. Bona okwenzekile Khetha igama lefayela ukuvula imininingwane yalo: Umlando: yonke imicimbi, eyisha kuqala, nokuthi ubani, iyiphi ikhompyutha nesikhathi: Ingenisiwe A.2 ngu-Ana, Ikhuliwe ngu-Ben, njll. Ukuguqulwa: ithebula lokuguqulwa: wonke amakhophi okuguqulwa agciniwe, nedethi yawo, ubani wawungenisa, inothi, nokuthi ubani wawuvuma. Isitoreji sigcina ikhophi ngayinye ku-.ccvault/revs. Kusetshenziswa: izingxenye zehlanganisela. Kusetshenziswa ngu: uhlu lwawo wonke amahlanganisela esitoreji aqukethe le ngxenye: uma ushintsha isibambi, uyazi ukuthi yiziphi izinhlanganisela ezifanele ukuhlolwa. Amahlanganisela: okusetshenziswayo nohlu lwezinto Faka ihlanganisela (.partcraft.json, elondolozwe kusuka kumodi yeInhlanganisela) efolda bese uyengeza. Khetha igama layo: Kusetshenziswa lohlu izingxenye eziqukethe, nokuguqulwa nesimo sengxenye ngayinye; Kusetshenziswa ngu kwingxenye ohlu wonke amahlanganisela eliqukethe. Uhlu lwezinto (CSV) longa uhlu lwazo zonke izingxenye, izinga ngezinga, nobuningi, izinguqulo nezimo, ukuze kusetshenziswe kuspredishithi. Shintsha isibambi, bese Kusetshenziswa ngu ikutshela amahlanganisela okufanele ubheke. 7. Okubona uBen uma ubamba ifayela Manje phuma ifayela futhi, bese ucela uBen ukuthi avule ifolda efanayo yephrojekthi ekhompyutheni yakhe bese evula iphaneli. Esihlahleni sefayela ubona Iphumelwe ngu-Ana kukhompyutha yakho kusukela isikhathi, futhi akabonanga inkinobho ethi Phuma. Uma ezama noma kunjalo isitoreji siyenqaba: ukukhiya kuyifayela uhlelo olungeke lilenze kabili, ngakho abantu ababili abakwazi ukubamba ifayela ngesikhathi esifanayo, nangokushesha okufanayo, uma ifolda isendisikhi ku-Studio. (Kusibhulawuza ifolda inikeza okungenzeka kuphela, futhi iphaneli iyakutshela lokho ngaphansi kwe-Folder.) Uma u-Ana engekho futhi uBen edinga ifayela, Phula ukuphuma liyakukhulula. Kufanele abhale isizathu; sifakwa elogini kanye nokuthi ukuphuma kwakungokukabani. Uma ephrojekthi inabalawuli abadweliwe, bona kuphela abangakwenza lokho. Ukuphuma okudlule umkhawulo wokuphelelwa yisikhathi (izinsuku ezingu-14 ngokuzenzakalela) kumakwa ngokuthi isikhathi eside. Ngemva kokuphula, ukungenisa kuka-Ana okwephuzile kuyenqatshwa, ngakho nina ningakwazi ukubhalela phezu komunye. 8. Amafolda efu Ifolda yefu iyifolda yephrojekthi egcinwe kusitoreji sefu seqembu lakho, ngakho iqembu alidingi idrayivu ehlanganyelwe. Ku-Studio, ungene ku-akhawunti yakho ye-CadCraft, iphaneli ibonisa Vula ifolda yefu eduze kwe-Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi. Yikhethe bese ukhetha ifolda, ohlwini oluthi isikhala sokusebenza / ifolda. Umnikazi wesikhala sokusebenza udala ifolda kuqala, futhi kufanele isitoreji sefu seqembu sisebenze. Konke okungenhla kusebenza ngendlela efanayo; iseva yenza ukukhiya, okuqinile phakathi kwabantu. Uma ungakangeni, iphaneli iyakutshela ukuthi ungene. Ethebhini lesiphequluli elijwayelekile inkinobho yefu ayitholakali; sebenzisa i-Studio. Zama Yenza izinyathelo ezingu-8 ngenkopi yefayela langempela. Ezinyathelweni zabantu ababili udinga omunye umuntu, noma amawindi amabili ngamagama amabili. Uma uzama nge-folda eyangempela ehlanganyelwe, ikhasi lokuhlola lomphakathi liqukethe ukuhlola okubuza lokhu ngqo, futhi lamukela imiphumela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-assembly","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlola inhlanganisela ngokungqubuzana nokunyakaza","summary":"Thola izingxenye ezigqumana nge-Ukugqekeza, donsa noma yiziphi izinani zezixhumanisi ukubona ukunyakaza, bese uzula uxhumanisi kuso sonke ububanzi bawo ukuze uthole lapho izingxenye zishayisana khona.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["ukuphazamiseka","ukutholwa kokuphazamiseka","ukugqekeza","ukushaywa","ukugqumana","ukulingana kocingo","ukungalingani kokujula kocingo","ubuso obuthinta","fihla","isihlungi","ukunyakaza","ucwaningo lokunyakaza","zula","ububanzi bokunyakaza","hlola"],"headings":[{"id":"hlola-ukuphazamiseka","text":"Hlola ukuphazamiseka","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-zemiphumela","text":"Izinhlobo zemiphumela","level":3},{"id":"fihla-lokho-ongadingi-ukukubona","text":"Fihla lokho ongadingi ukukubona","level":3},{"id":"bheka-ukunyakaza","text":"Bheka ukunyakaza","level":2},{"id":"zula-uxhumanisi-ukuze-uthole-ukugqekeza","text":"Zula uxhumanisi ukuze uthole ukugqekeza","level":2},{"id":"ucwaningo-lokunyakaza","text":"Ucwaningo lokunyakaza","level":2},{"id":"ucwaningo-lokuxhumana","text":"Ucwaningo lokuxhumana","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlolwa kwemibili kwenziwa ezingxenyeni njengoba zibekiwe: \u003Cstrong\u003EUkugqekeza\u003C/strong\u003E kubheka izinto ezigqumanayo manje, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhlola kokunyakaza\u003C/strong\u003E kuhambisa uxhumanisi owodwa ngaso sonke ububanzi bawo kubheke ukugqumana ngendlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-ukuphazamiseka\"\u003EHlola ukuphazamiseka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula noma yakha inhlanganisela (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EYakha inhlanganisela\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugqekeza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha yesimo ibika umphumela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Akukho ukuphazamiseka phakathi kwezingxenye ezi-3 (… ms).&quot; Akukho okugqumanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ukuphazamiseka: Flange1 kanye Flange2: Ukugqumana, 2.5 mm³.&quot; Ngayinye yamapheya, uhlobo lomphumela nevolumu abelana ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/strong\u003E yesobunxele likhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphazamiseka\u003C/strong\u003E: &quot;Akukho&quot;, &quot;imiphumela engu-2&quot; (eyiboniswayo), noma &quot;Akuhlolwanga&quot;. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, ipheneli lesokudla lidwebela wonke umphumela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphazamiseka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyasulwa noma nini lapho inhlanganisela ishintsha. Phinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugqekeza\u003C/span\u003E ngemva kokuhambisa uxhumanisi. Zonke amapheya ezingxenye zihlolwa nezinye ngayinye, ngakho izinhlanganisela ezinkulu zithatha isikhathi eside.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izinhlobo-zemiphumela\"\u003EIzinhlobo zemiphumela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugqumana\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye zabelana ngevolumu: ukugqekeza kwangempela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkungalingani kokujula kocingo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvolumu eyabelwanwayo isemcingweni wengxenye eyodwa kodwa ingaphezu kwowesinye: ibhawodi elifakwe ocingweni lujulile kunomgodi walo, noma inqamu engenacingo emgodini onocingo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingana kocingo (imicingo yokuhlobisa)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvolumu eyabelwanwayo isemcingweni wezingxenye zombili: ibhawodi emgodini onocingo. Imicingo yokuhlobisa idwetshwa ngosayizi ophelele wocingo, ngakho ihlala igqumana kancane.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso obuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho volumu eyabelanwayo, kodwa ubuso buthintana (phakathi kuka-0.001 mm).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImicingo emodelwe (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EImicingo kumashafthi nasemigodini, edwetshiwe noma emodelwe\u003C/a\u003E) iyijiyomethri yangempela: lokho abelana ngakho kungu-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugqumana\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fihla-lokho-ongadingi-ukukubona\"\u003EFihla lokho ongadingi ukukubona\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphazamiseka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa\u003C/strong\u003E inebhokisi ngalinye lohlobo: susa ukuthikwa kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingana kocingo\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso obuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubone kuphela ukugqekeza okubalulekile. \u003Cstrong\u003EFihla lolu bhangqa\u003C/strong\u003E eduze komphumela ufihla lelo bhangqa lezingxenye noma yiluphi uhlobo lwalo. Imiphumela efihliwe iyabalwa (&quot;imiphumela engu-2 ifihlwe yilezi zihlungi&quot;), futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa amapheya afihliwe futhi\u003C/strong\u003E uwabuyisela. Ibha yesimo iphinde ibale imiphumela efihliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzihlungi zilondolozwa nenhlanganisela, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EZula uxhumanisi ukuze uthole ukugqekeza\u003C/strong\u003E (ngezansi) nazo ziyazisebenzisa. Inhlanganisela enezihlungi ilondolozwa njengenguqulo engu-4, eyenqaba ukuvulwa yizinguqulo zangaphambili ze-PartCraft kunokulahlekelwa yizihlungi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-ukunyakaza\"\u003EBheka ukunyakaza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uxhumanisi onyakazayo (noma yiluphi ngaphandle kwe-eqinile) ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa isilayidi ngaphansi komunye wamanani awo, njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlehliswa (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingxenye iyanyakaza ngesikhathi udonsa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYeqa. Indawo entsha iyagcinwa futhi ingahlehliswa nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngabhala futhi ikona noma ukuhlehliswa ebhokisini bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUxhumanisi emjikelezweni ovaliwe (uxhumo) uhambisa umjikelezo wonke: inani odonsayo liyagcinwa nezixhumanisi zomjikelezo ezinye ziyalandela (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly#closed-loops-linkages\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\" data-hash=\"closed-loops-linkages\"\u003EImijikelezo evaliwe\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zula-uxhumanisi-ukuze-uthole-ukugqekeza\"\u003EZula uxhumanisi ukuze uthole ukugqekeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uxhumanisi onyakazayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgoxhumanisi onamanani amaningi (esilindrikhali, endizeni, ebhola, isikhonkwane emgodini), khetha okuzulwayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola izinyathelo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ihambisa leli nani ezindaweni ezingu-25 ngezinyathelo ezingu-24 ezilinganayo, amanye ahlala njengoba enjalo: ikona kusukela ku−180° kuya ku-180° (ukuthambeka kusukela ku−90° kuya ku-90°), ubude kusukela ekukhishweni kuya ekungeni usayizi wengxenye enkulu kunazo. Ibika:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Akukho kugqekeza noma kuphi ku-Ikona (°) kusuka ku−180 kuya ku-180 (izindawo ezingu-25 zihloliwe).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Izindawo ezi-6 kwezingu-25 ziyagqekeza, okokuqala ku-Ikona (°) 45 (12.4 mm³).&quot; Indawo yokuqala egqekezayo kanye nokugqumana lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ibe mpunga ngoxhumanisi oqinile, obungahambi. Ukuzula kuhlola izindawo kuphela, hhayi indlela phakathi kwazo: ingxenye encane ingadlula kwenye phakathi kwezinyathelo ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuxhumana nokudonsela phansi akukakhiwa. Ngaphandle kwemikhawulo ukuzula kumboza wonke ububanzi; nika inani \u003Cstrong\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/strong\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003EUhlu lwezingxenye, imibono echazwayo nokuhambisa kwezingxenye\u003C/a\u003E) bese ukuzula kumboza lowo mikhawulo kuphela, ngakho isibambi esivula ngama-90° sihlolwa ngama-90°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ucwaningo-lokunyakaza\"\u003EUcwaningo lokunyakaza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela › Ukunyakaza\u003C/strong\u003E iqhuba inani loxhumanisi owodwa kusukela ekuqaleni kuya ekugcineni phezu kwesikhathi onikezayo (isivinini esihlala sinjalo, esithambile, i-sine, noma phuma bese ubuyela), ibeka inhlanganisela kwisinyathelo ngasinye ngezixhumanisi zayo nemijikelezo evaliwe, futhi ibika ukuthi yiziphi izingqubuzano nokuthi izingxenye zisondela kangakanani. \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza iphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E ilandela maphakathi ingxenye noma iphoyinti oyichofozayo kuyo, futhi ikhadi lidweba indawo yalo, isivinini nokushesha, inani loxhumanisi kanye nesikhala esisele ngesikhathi. \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza i-CSV\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza ishadi\u003C/strong\u003E ziyabhala lokho. Isivinini nokushesha kuphuma ezindaweni ezirekhodiwe, ngakho ipiki elibukhali phakathi kwezinyathelo lifundeka lincane: sebenzisa izinyathelo eziningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EQala\u003C/strong\u003E, ibha ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EHamba phakathi kokuqhutshwa\u003C/strong\u003E ihambisa inhlanganisela kunoma yisiphi isinyathelo (isikhathi, inani kanye nokuthi izingxenye zigqekeza yini lapho zibonakala eduze kwayo); uxhumanisi ugcina inani lawo, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyela kumodeli\u003C/strong\u003E ibuyisela inhlanganisela. Izilungiselelo zocwaningo zilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela; imiphumela yazo yenziwa kabusha yi-\u003Cstrong\u003EQala\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ucwaningo-lokuxhumana\"\u003EUcwaningo lokuxhumana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela › Ukuxhumana\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa ukuthi inhlanganisela ithwala kanjani imithwalo lapho izingxenye zicindezelana. Ingxenye ngayinye iletha izisekelo, imithwalo nempahla yayo esuka kocwaningo lwayo lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso oluqinile kwengxenye eyodwa, amandla kwenye); lapha ukhetha amapheya. \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza ipheya\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha uhlangothi A\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso bengxenye eyodwa, \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha uhlangothi B\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso bengxenye ehlukile (ukuchofoza ubuso okukhethiwe kususa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKwenziwe\u003C/strong\u003E iphetha ukukhetha). Ipheya lingu-\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphandle kokungqubuzana\u003C/strong\u003E (izingxenye ziyacindezelana kodwa ziyashelela) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ELibotshiwe\u003C/strong\u003E (zihlala zindawonye); inani lokuqina libeka ukuthi ukuxhumana kumelana kanjani nokuhlezi (u-20 ukuqala okuhle, u-1000 kwesitaki sensimbi eqinile).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXazulula\u003C/strong\u003E iqhuba umthwalo ngezinyathelo futhi ibonise amandla okuxhumana, ukuhlezi okujulile kakhulu, ukunyakaza okukhulu kakhulu nokucindezeleka okukhulu kakhulu. Ingxenye engenaphayi ishiywa ngaphandle futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho. Ukuxhumana okungenakungqubuzana akuphathi ingxenye ngasohlangothini: nika yonke ingxenye isisekelo kocwaningo lwayo lwe-Simulation, noma yibophe, kungenjalo izinyathelo zingazinzi. Amapheya nezilungiselelo ziyalondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela i-CalculiX deck\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala imodeli efanayo njengefayela lokufaka le-CalculiX (.inp). I-CalculiX iwuhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa lona bese uluqalisa wena ngokwakho; \u003Cstrong\u003EFunda imiphumela ye-CalculiX (.frd)\u003C/strong\u003E bese ifunda ukunyakaza ku-mesh yale nhlanganisela futhi yenqaba ifayela elenziwe ye-mesh enye. Isixazululi lapha singasebenzisa ukuguqulwa okungabuyi, kodwa hhayi i-explicit dynamics, futhi lapha akukho ukuhlaziywa okuqinisekisiwe: umhlahlandlela ohlola noma yini ebalulekile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukuhlolwa kwemibili kwenziwa ezingxenyeni njengoba zibekiwe: Ukugqekeza kubheka izinto ezigqumanayo manje, futhi ukuhlola kokunyakaza kuhambisa uxhumanisi owodwa ngaso sonke ububanzi bawo kubheke ukugqumana ngendlela. Hlola ukuphazamiseka Vula noma yakha inhlanganisela (bona Yakha inhlanganisela). Khetha Ukugqekeza. Ibha yesimo ibika umphumela: \"Akukho ukuphazamiseka phakathi kwezingxenye ezi-3 (… ms).\" Akukho okugqumanayo. \"Ukuphazamiseka: Flange1 kanye Flange2: Ukugqumana, 2.5 mm³.\" Ngayinye yamapheya, uhlobo lomphumela nevolumu abelana ngayo. Ibhokisi le-Inhlanganisela yesobunxele likhombisa Ukuphazamiseka: \"Akukho\", \"imiphumela engu-2\" (eyiboniswayo), noma \"Akuhlolwanga\". Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, ipheneli lesokudla lidwebela wonke umphumela ngaphansi kwe-Ukuphazamiseka. Umphumela uyasulwa noma nini lapho inhlanganisela ishintsha. Phinda Ukugqekeza ngemva kokuhambisa uxhumanisi. Zonke amapheya ezingxenye zihlolwa nezinye ngayinye, ngakho izinhlanganisela ezinkulu zithatha isikhathi eside. Izinhlobo zemiphumela Uhlobo Kusho Ukugqumana Izingxenye zabelana ngevolumu: ukugqekeza kwangempela. Ukungalingani kokujula kocingo Ivolumu eyabelwanwayo isemcingweni wengxenye eyodwa kodwa ingaphezu kwowesinye: ibhawodi elifakwe ocingweni lujulile kunomgodi walo, noma inqamu engenacingo emgodini onocingo. Ukulingana kocingo (imicingo yokuhlobisa) Ivolumu eyabelwanwayo isemcingweni wezingxenye zombili: ibhawodi emgodini onocingo. Imicingo yokuhlobisa idwetshwa ngosayizi ophelele wocingo, ngakho ihlala igqumana kancane. Ubuso obuthinta Akukho volumu eyabelanwayo, kodwa ubuso buthintana (phakathi kuka-0.001 mm). Imicingo emodelwe (bona Imicingo kumashafthi nasemigodini, edwetshiwe noma emodelwe) iyijiyomethri yangempela: lokho abelana ngakho kungu-Ukugqumana. Fihla lokho ongadingi ukukubona Ngaphansi kwe-Ukuphazamiseka, Bonisa inebhokisi ngalinye lohlobo: susa ukuthikwa kwe-Ukulingana kocingo kanye Ubuso obuthinta ukuze ubone kuphela ukugqekeza okubalulekile. Fihla lolu bhangqa eduze komphumela ufihla lelo bhangqa lezingxenye noma yiluphi uhlobo lwalo. Imiphumela efihliwe iyabalwa (\"imiphumela engu-2 ifihlwe yilezi zihlungi\"), futhi Bonisa amapheya afihliwe futhi uwabuyisela. Ibha yesimo iphinde ibale imiphumela efihliwe. Izihlungi zilondolozwa nenhlanganisela, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-Ctrl+Z. Zula uxhumanisi ukuze uthole ukugqekeza (ngezansi) nazo ziyazisebenzisa. Inhlanganisela enezihlungi ilondolozwa njengenguqulo engu-4, eyenqaba ukuvulwa yizinguqulo zangaphambili ze-PartCraft kunokulahlekelwa yizihlungi. Bheka ukunyakaza Khetha uxhumanisi onyakazayo (noma yiluphi ngaphandle kwe-eqinile) ohlwini oluseceleni lwesobunxele. Donsa isilayidi ngaphansi komunye wamanani awo, njenge-Ikona (°) noma Ukuhlehliswa (mm). Ingxenye iyanyakaza ngesikhathi udonsa. Yeqa. Indawo entsha iyagcinwa futhi ingahlehliswa nge-Ctrl+Z. Ungabhala futhi ikona noma ukuhlehliswa ebhokisini bese ucindezela Enter. Uxhumanisi emjikelezweni ovaliwe (uxhumo) uhambisa umjikelezo wonke: inani odonsayo liyagcinwa nezixhumanisi zomjikelezo ezinye ziyalandela (bona Imijikelezo evaliwe). Zula uxhumanisi ukuze uthole ukugqekeza Khetha uxhumanisi onyakazayo. Ngoxhumanisi onamanani amaningi (esilindrikhali, endizeni, ebhola, isikhonkwane emgodini), khetha okuzulwayo ku-Hlola izinyathelo. Khetha Hlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana. I-PartCraft ihambisa leli nani ezindaweni ezingu-25 ngezinyathelo ezingu-24 ezilinganayo, amanye ahlala njengoba enjalo: ikona kusukela ku−180° kuya ku-180° (ukuthambeka kusukela ku−90° kuya ku-90°), ubude kusukela ekukhishweni kuya ekungeni usayizi wengxenye enkulu kunazo. Ibika: \"Akukho kugqekeza noma kuphi ku-Ikona (°) kusuka ku−180 kuya ku-180 (izindawo ezingu-25 zihloliwe).\" \"Izindawo ezi-6 kwezingu-25 ziyagqekeza, okokuqala ku-Ikona (°) 45 (12.4 mm³).\" Indawo yokuqala egqekezayo kanye nokugqumana lapho. Inkinobho ibe mpunga ngoxhumanisi oqinile, obungahambi. Ukuzula kuhlola izindawo kuphela, hhayi indlela phakathi kwazo: ingxenye encane ingadlula kwenye phakathi kwezinyathelo ezimbili. Ukuxhumana nokudonsela phansi akukakhiwa. Ngaphandle kwemikhawulo ukuzula kumboza wonke ububanzi; nika inani Imikhawulo (bona Uhlu lwezingxenye, imibono echazwayo nokuhambisa kwezingxenye) bese ukuzula kumboza lowo mikhawulo kuphela, ngakho isibambi esivula ngama-90° sihlolwa ngama-90°. Ucwaningo lokunyakaza Inhlanganisela › Ukunyakaza iqhuba inani loxhumanisi owodwa kusukela ekuqaleni kuya ekugcineni phezu kwesikhathi onikezayo (isivinini esihlala sinjalo, esithambile, i-sine, noma phuma bese ubuyela), ibeka inhlanganisela kwisinyathelo ngasinye ngezixhumanisi zayo nemijikelezo evaliwe, futhi ibika ukuthi yiziphi izingqubuzano nokuthi izingxenye zisondela kangakanani. Engeza iphoyinti ilandela maphakathi ingxenye noma iphoyinti oyichofozayo kuyo, futhi ikhadi lidweba indawo yalo, isivinini nokushesha, inani loxhumanisi kanye nesikhala esisele ngesikhathi. Londoloza i-CSV kanye Londoloza ishadi ziyabhala lokho. Isivinini nokushesha kuphuma ezindaweni ezirekhodiwe, ngakho ipiki elibukhali phakathi kwezinyathelo lifundeka lincane: sebenzisa izinyathelo eziningi. Ngemva kwe-Qala, ibha ye-Hamba phakathi kokuqhutshwa ihambisa inhlanganisela kunoma yisiphi isinyathelo (isikhathi, inani kanye nokuthi izingxenye zigqekeza yini lapho zibonakala eduze kwayo); uxhumanisi ugcina inani lawo, futhi Buyela kumodeli ibuyisela inhlanganisela. Izilungiselelo zocwaningo zilondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela; imiphumela yazo yenziwa kabusha yi-Qala. Ucwaningo lokuxhumana Inhlanganisela › Ukuxhumana ikhombisa ukuthi inhlanganisela ithwala kanjani imithwalo lapho izingxenye zicindezelana. Ingxenye ngayinye iletha izisekelo, imithwalo nempahla yayo esuka kocwaningo lwayo lwe-Simulation (ubuso oluqinile kwengxenye eyodwa, amandla kwenye); lapha ukhetha amapheya. Engeza ipheya, bese Khetha uhlangothi A bese uchofoza ubuso bengxenye eyodwa, Khetha uhlangothi B bese uchofoza ubuso bengxenye ehlukile (ukuchofoza ubuso okukhethiwe kususa; Esc noma Kwenziwe iphetha ukukhetha). Ipheya lingu-Ngaphandle kokungqubuzana (izingxenye ziyacindezelana kodwa ziyashelela) noma Libotshiwe (zihlala zindawonye); inani lokuqina libeka ukuthi ukuxhumana kumelana kanjani nokuhlezi (u-20 ukuqala okuhle, u-1000 kwesitaki sensimbi eqinile). Xazulula iqhuba umthwalo ngezinyathelo futhi ibonise amandla okuxhumana, ukuhlezi okujulile kakhulu, ukunyakaza okukhulu kakhulu nokucindezeleka okukhulu kakhulu. Ingxenye engenaphayi ishiywa ngaphandle futhi ikhadi liyasho lokho. Ukuxhumana okungenakungqubuzana akuphathi ingxenye ngasohlangothini: nika yonke ingxenye isisekelo kocwaningo lwayo lwe-Simulation, noma yibophe, kungenjalo izinyathelo zingazinzi. Amapheya nezilungiselelo ziyalondolozwa efayeleni lenhlanganisela. Thumela i-CalculiX deck ibhala imodeli efanayo njengefayela lokufaka le-CalculiX (.inp). I-CalculiX iwuhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa lona bese uluqalisa wena ngokwakho; Funda imiphumela ye-CalculiX (.frd) bese ifunda ukunyakaza ku-mesh yale nhlanganisela futhi yenqaba ifayela elenziwe ye-mesh enye. Isixazululi lapha singasebenzisa ukuguqulwa okungabuyi, kodwa hhayi i-explicit dynamics, futhi lapha akukho ukuhlaziywa okuqinisekisiwe: umhlahlandlela ohlola noma yini ebalulekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure","scope":"partcraft","title":"Linganisa amakhaza, ama-engeli nobuningi","summary":"Chofoza izinto ezimbili ku-view ukuze uthole ibanga elincane, i-engeli ne-ΔX ΔY ΔZ; funda ubude bomphetho, ububanzi besimbobo, indawo yobuso noma izixhumanisi zephoyinti; thola ivolumu, ubuningi, isikhungo sobuningi nokungabi nasizinda kwengxenye noma kuhlanganiso.","section":"tasks","order":125,"keywords":["measure","distance","minimum distance","angle","length","radius","diameter","area","coordinates","delta","inspect","mass properties","mass","weight","center of mass","centre of mass","inertia","moment of inertia","density","material"],"headings":[{"id":"linganisa-into-eyodwa","text":"Linganisa into eyodwa","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-phakathi-kwezinto-ezimbili","text":"Linganisa phakathi kwezinto ezimbili","level":2},{"id":"ukunemba-kwalo","text":"Ukunemba kwalo","level":3},{"id":"izinkomba-zobuningi","text":"Izinkomba zobuningi","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa\u003C/strong\u003E lisebenza kumodeli kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza (Design, Form, Simulation, Generative, Manufacture) nakuhlanganiso. Itholakala kumenyu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EView\u003C/strong\u003E kwiqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ikhadi livulekela phezulu ngakwesobunxele kwe-view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-into-eyodwa\"\u003ELinganisa into eyodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza i-vertex, umphetho noma ubuso. Ikhadi libonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E (i-vertex, inkabazwe yomphetho noma isikhungo sendilinga): i-X, Y, Z yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmphetho\u003C/strong\u003E: oqondile, indilinga noma ijika, nobude balo; kwendilinga futhi iradiyasi, ububanzi nesikhungo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso\u003C/strong\u003E: obuthe batshe, isilinda, ikhoni njalo njalo, nendawo yalo; i-normal yobuso obuthe batshe; iradiyasi nobubanzi besilinda (usayizi wesimbobo). Izindawo zezinhlangothi ezibalwa yi-mesh kernel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmzimba wonke\u003C/strong\u003E: bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoze ingxenye. Uthola ivolumu yawo, indawo, ubuningi nokungabi nasizinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpoyinta ibamba ama-vertex, izinkabazwe zemiphetho nezikhungo zendilinga ngaphakathi kwamapikseli angu-10; ichashaza eliluhlaza elincane libonisa ukubanjwa ngaphambi kokuchofoza. Ukuze ukhethe isikhungo sesimbobo, bheka phakathi kwaso; ukuze ukhethe umphetho wayo (indilinga), bheka emphethweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-phakathi-kwezinto-ezimbili\"\u003ELinganisa phakathi kwezinto ezimbili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza into yesibili. Ikhadi lengeza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga elincane\u003C/strong\u003E kanye nezindawo ezimbili ezisondele kakhulu, ezidwetshwe ku-view ngomugqa phakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EΔX, ΔY, ΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E kusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala eliseduze kuya kwesesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeli\u003C/strong\u003E phakathi kwezindawo ezimbili ezibhodlwe (phakathi kwama-normal azo, 0–180°), phakathi kwemigqa emibili eqondile noma ama-eksisi (0–90°), noma phakathi komphetho nobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe phakathi kwamapuleni\u003C/strong\u003E kubuso obubili obuthe batshe obuhambisanayo, \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre to centre\u003C/strong\u003E kwezindilinga noma izimbobo ezimbili, \u003Cstrong\u003EAxis to axis\u003C/strong\u003E kwezimbobo noma izilinda ezimbili ezihambisanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza okwesithathu kuqala ukukhetha okusha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isula ukukhetha; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E) iyavala Ukulinganisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E ifaka imiphumela ku-clipboard njengombhalo onamathebhu, ulungele ukunamathisela ku-spreadsheet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukunemba-kwalo\"\u003EUkunemba kwalo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yakha ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, ngakho amabanga athathwa ezindaweni ezincane zemesh, nekhadi lithi \u003Cstrong\u003Eapproximate: of the facets\u003C/strong\u003E: kulungile kubuso obuthe batshe nasezinhlanganweni phakathi kwama-vertex, kancane kancane kukhubazeka ezindaweni ezigobile. Isethingi elinemininingwane \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E elicinisiwe lisondeza. Ukulinganisa okunembile ezindaweni zangempela kudinga i-exact kernel: akwakhiwa kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkomba-zobuningi\"\u003EIzinkomba zobuningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhiwo zobuningi\u003C/span\u003E ekhadini noma kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E. Kungxenye, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E ekhadini (insimbi, i-aluminium, amapulasitiki nezinye ezinobuningi bazo obuvamile). Kuhlanganiso ingxenye ngayinye isebenzisa impahla esethwe ezakhiweni zayo (khetha ingxenye, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E), nomphumela uyawo wonke amaxhathi ndawonye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhadi libonisa ubuningi, ivolumu, indawo, isikhungo sobuningi, i-inertia tensor (Ixx, Iyy, Izz nemikhiqizo Ixy, Iyz, Ixz, ku-kg·mm², mayelana nesikhungo sobuningi ngama-eksisi womhlaba) nezinkathi eziyinhloko. Ngaphandle kwempahla ibonisa okufanayo ngoku-density yeyunithi (mm⁵) akukho buningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinombolo ziyinembile kusolidi we-tessellated owakhiwa yi-mesh kernel (amabanga egobile njengezinhlamvu), ngakho ingxenye egobile iphuma incane kancane, nekhadi liyasho lokho. Ubuningi bezinto buyizinhlamvu zesimo esivamile sencwadi; impahla noma i-grade yangempela ingahluka ngamaphesenti ambalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlamvu zokubamba zingathola iphoyinti elifihliwe ngemuva kwezinye izinto; hlola ukuthi ikhadi libonisa okubhekisele kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinganisa liyavalwa uma uvula isketch noma ishidi lokudweba, noma ushintsha indawo yokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Linganisa lisebenza kumodeli kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza (Design, Form, Simulation, Generative, Manufacture) nakuhlanganiso. Itholakala kumenyu ye-View kwiqembu Imibono, noma cindezela M. Ikhadi livulekela phezulu ngakwesobunxele kwe-view. Linganisa into eyodwa Chofoza i-vertex, umphetho noma ubuso. Ikhadi libonisa: Iphoyinti (i-vertex, inkabazwe yomphetho noma isikhungo sendilinga): i-X, Y, Z yalo. Umphetho: oqondile, indilinga noma ijika, nobude balo; kwendilinga futhi iradiyasi, ububanzi nesikhungo. Ubuso: obuthe batshe, isilinda, ikhoni njalo njalo, nendawo yalo; i-normal yobuso obuthe batshe; iradiyasi nobubanzi besilinda (usayizi wesimbobo). Izindawo zezinhlangothi ezibalwa yi-mesh kernel. Umzimba wonke: bamba Shift uchofoze ingxenye. Uthola ivolumu yawo, indawo, ubuningi nokungabi nasizinda. Ipoyinta ibamba ama-vertex, izinkabazwe zemiphetho nezikhungo zendilinga ngaphakathi kwamapikseli angu-10; ichashaza eliluhlaza elincane libonisa ukubanjwa ngaphambi kokuchofoza. Ukuze ukhethe isikhungo sesimbobo, bheka phakathi kwaso; ukuze ukhethe umphetho wayo (indilinga), bheka emphethweni. Linganisa phakathi kwezinto ezimbili Chofoza into yesibili. Ikhadi lengeza: Ibanga elincane kanye nezindawo ezimbili ezisondele kakhulu, ezidwetshwe ku-view ngomugqa phakathi kwazo. ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ kusuka kwiphoyinti lokuqala eliseduze kuya kwesesibili. Engeli phakathi kwezindawo ezimbili ezibhodlwe (phakathi kwama-normal azo, 0–180°), phakathi kwemigqa emibili eqondile noma ama-eksisi (0–90°), noma phakathi komphetho nobuso. Igebe phakathi kwamapuleni kubuso obubili obuthe batshe obuhambisanayo, Centre to centre kwezindilinga noma izimbobo ezimbili, Axis to axis kwezimbobo noma izilinda ezimbili ezihambisanayo. Ukuchofoza okwesithathu kuqala ukukhetha okusha. Esc isula ukukhetha; Esc futhi (noma Vala) iyavala Ukulinganisa. Kopisha ifaka imiphumela ku-clipboard njengombhalo onamathebhu, ulungele ukunamathisela ku-spreadsheet. Ukunemba kwalo I-PartCraft yakha ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, ngakho amabanga athathwa ezindaweni ezincane zemesh, nekhadi lithi approximate: of the facets: kulungile kubuso obuthe batshe nasezinhlanganweni phakathi kwama-vertex, kancane kancane kukhubazeka ezindaweni ezigobile. Isethingi elinemininingwane Curves elicinisiwe lisondeza. Ukulinganisa okunembile ezindaweni zangempela kudinga i-exact kernel: akwakhiwa kulolu hlobo lwalolu hlelo. Izinkomba zobuningi Khetha Izakhiwo zobuningi ekhadini noma kumenyu ye-Imibono. Kungxenye, khetha Material ekhadini (insimbi, i-aluminium, amapulasitiki nezinye ezinobuningi bazo obuvamile). Kuhlanganiso ingxenye ngayinye isebenzisa impahla esethwe ezakhiweni zayo (khetha ingxenye, bese Material), nomphumela uyawo wonke amaxhathi ndawonye. Ikhadi libonisa ubuningi, ivolumu, indawo, isikhungo sobuningi, i-inertia tensor (Ixx, Iyy, Izz nemikhiqizo Ixy, Iyz, Ixz, ku-kg·mm², mayelana nesikhungo sobuningi ngama-eksisi womhlaba) nezinkathi eziyinhloko. Ngaphandle kwempahla ibonisa okufanayo ngoku-density yeyunithi (mm⁵) akukho buningi. Izinombolo ziyinembile kusolidi we-tessellated owakhiwa yi-mesh kernel (amabanga egobile njengezinhlamvu), ngakho ingxenye egobile iphuma incane kancane, nekhadi liyasho lokho. Ubuningi bezinto buyizinhlamvu zesimo esivamile sencwadi; impahla noma i-grade yangempela ingahluka ngamaphesenti ambalwa. Imikhawulo Izinhlamvu zokubamba zingathola iphoyinti elifihliwe ngemuva kwezinye izinto; hlola ukuthi ikhadi libonisa okubhekisele kuwo. Linganisa liyavalwa uma uvula isketch noma ishidi lokudweba, noma ushintsha indawo yokusebenza.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"section-view","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bheka ngaphakathi ngombono wesigaba","summary":"Sika ingxenye noma inhlanganisela ngendiza ukuze ubone ngaphakathi, nezinhlangothi ezisikiwe zigcwaliswe. Hambisa indiza nge-slider, sika ebusweni obuchofoziwe, futhi ushintshe uhlangothi olusikwayo.","section":"tasks","order":126,"keywords":["isigaba","umbono wesigaba","sika","ukusikwa","isigaba esinqunyiwe","ukusika","ngaphakathi","islayisi","indiza","izigqoko","imigqa yokufiphaza","isigaba sokuhlanganisela"],"headings":[{"id":"sika-phakathi","text":"Sika phakathi","level":2},{"id":"sika-ebusweni","text":"Sika ebusweni","level":2},{"id":"ukuchofoza-nokusika","text":"Ukuchofoza nokusika","level":2},{"id":"vala","text":"Vala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumbono wesigaba\u003C/strong\u003E isika imodeli ngendiza ukuze ubone ngaphakathi: izimbobo, izikhala, ukuwuqinisa kwezindonga, nokuthi izingxenye zihlangana kanjani enhlanganisela. Isebenza kuwo wonke ama-workspace nakunhlanganisela. Vula kusuka kumenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection view\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ikhadi livuleka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokunxele kwendawo yokubuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbono kuphela uyasikwa. Ingxenye, ivolumu yayo, izilinganiso nokuthunyelwa kuhlala kuphelele, futhi akukho okulondolozwa efayeleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-phakathi\"\u003ESika phakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ingxenye isikwa yindiza yangaphambili phakathi kwayo, nezinhlangothi ezisikiwe zigcwaliswe ngombala oshaziwe kancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula i-slider ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPosition\u003C/span\u003E, noma thayipha ibanga ku-mm, ukuze unyakazise ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha enye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlane\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront (XY)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop (XZ)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight (YZ)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut away the other side\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ugcine uhhafu owasikwa esikhundleni salowo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-ebusweni\"\u003ESika ebusweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a face\u003C/span\u003E ekhadini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuqondile ekubukeni. Ukusika kuqala kulingane nalo, indiza isendaweni yalobo buso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPosition\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ungene ngokujulile. Inombolo iyibanga elihamba endleleni ephuma ngayo ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuchofoza-nokusika\"\u003EUkuchofoza nokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza ekubukeni kuya kokusele emva kokusika, ngakho ungakhetha ubuso noma umphetho ngaphakathi kwengxenye, uqale isikethi kuwo, noma ulinganise ngaphesheya kwawo. Susa ukukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFill the cut faces\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone ngaphesheya kokusika ezingxenyeni ezingenalutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vala\"\u003EVala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuvula isikethi noma ishidi lomdwebo nakho kuyasivala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthole isigaba eshidini lomdwebo (esinemigqa yokufiphaza nomugqa wendiza yokusika), sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EDala umdwebo (PDF)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-umbono wesigaba isika imodeli ngendiza ukuze ubone ngaphakathi: izimbobo, izikhala, ukuwuqinisa kwezindonga, nokuthi izingxenye zihlangana kanjani enhlanganisela. Isebenza kuwo wonke ama-workspace nakunhlanganisela. Vula kusuka kumenyu ethi Views eqenjini Ukubuka, Section view, noma cindezela X. Ikhadi livuleka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokunxele kwendawo yokubuka. Umbono kuphela uyasikwa. Ingxenye, ivolumu yayo, izilinganiso nokuthunyelwa kuhlala kuphelele, futhi akukho okulondolozwa efayeleni. Sika phakathi Cindezela X. Ingxenye isikwa yindiza yangaphambili phakathi kwayo, nezinhlangothi ezisikiwe zigcwaliswe ngombala oshaziwe kancane. Hudula i-slider ethi Position, noma thayipha ibanga ku-mm, ukuze unyakazise ukusika. Khetha enye Plane: Front (XY), Top (XZ) noma Right (YZ). Khetha Cut away the other side ukuze ugcine uhhafu owasikwa esikhundleni salowo. Sika ebusweni Chofoza Pick a face ekhadini. Chofoza ubuso obuqondile ekubukeni. Ukusika kuqala kulingane nalo, indiza isendaweni yalobo buso. Hambisa Position ukuze ungene ngokujulile. Inombolo iyibanga elihamba endleleni ephuma ngayo ubuso. Ukuchofoza nokusika Ukuchofoza ekubukeni kuya kokusele emva kokusika, ngakho ungakhetha ubuso noma umphetho ngaphakathi kwengxenye, uqale isikethi kuwo, noma ulinganise ngaphesheya kwawo. Susa ukukhetha Fill the cut faces ukuze ubone ngaphesheya kokusika ezingxenyeni ezingenalutho. Vala Cindezela Esc, cindezela X futhi, noma chofoza Close. Ukuvula isikethi noma ishidi lomdwebo nakho kuyasivala. Ukuze uthole isigaba eshidini lomdwebo (esinemigqa yokufiphaza nomugqa wendiza yokusika), sebenzisa Drawing: bheka Dala umdwebo (PDF).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"export-files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Khipha ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF","summary":"Khipha ingxenye njenge-STL noma 3MF ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D, njenge-STEP eqondile yezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD ne-CAM, nesikethi noma ubuso obuthe njenge-DXF ukuze kusikwe nge-laser nangommese wamanzi.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["khipha","londoloza njenge","ifc","bim","amasethi wezakhiwo","stl","3mf","ukuphrinta nge-3d","slicer","step","stp","step eqondile","b-rep","ap242","ap214","cam","incwadi yomshini","ukugaya","dxf","laser","ummese wamanzi","cnc","iphrofayili yobuso","iphrofayili","imesh","ngobuso"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuze-kuphrintwe-nge-3d-stl-noma-3mf","text":"Ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D: STL noma 3MF","level":2},{"id":"ezinye-izinhlelo-ze-cad-step","text":"Ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD: STEP","level":2},{"id":"zezinhlelo-ze-bim-ifc-nazo-zonke-izici","text":"Zezinhlelo ze-BIM: IFC nazo zonke izici","level":2},{"id":"amaphrofayili-we-laser-wamanzi-noma-we-cnc-dxf","text":"Amaphrofayili we-laser, wamanzi noma we-CNC: DXF","level":2},{"id":"isikethi","text":"Isikethi","level":3},{"id":"ubuso-obuthe-besolidi","text":"Ubuso obuthe besolidi","level":3},{"id":"umdwebo","text":"Umdwebo","level":2},{"id":"amafomethi-angatholakali","text":"Amafomethi angatholakali","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkukhipha kuyizikopi ngamanye amafomethi. Gcina nefayela \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E: yilo kuphela ifayela i-PartCraft engayivula futhi iyihlele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke ukukhipha kusebenza ngengxenye esesikrinini, ngamamilimitha. Kwinhlanganisela, i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP nomdwebo (PDF) zikhipha yonke inhlanganisela: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003EUhlu lwezingxenye, izibonakaliso ezihlukaniswe nezingxenye ezinyakazayo\u003C/a\u003E. Uma ingekho isolidi okwamanje: &quot;Akukho isolidi okungakhishwa okwamanje.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuze-kuphrintwe-nge-3d-stl-noma-3mf\"\u003EUkuze kuphrintwe nge-3D: STL noma 3MF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kufunwa: ukuze kube bushelelezi ezindaweni ezijikelezayo, chofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhle (128 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/strong\u003E kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla. I-STL ne-3MF zihlala zenziwe ngamatriyangula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyalandwa. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, &quot;Ikhishiwe Part1.stl (binary, mm, Z up, 1536 triangles).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izifomethi zi-\u003Cstrong\u003EZ up\u003C/strong\u003E, njengoba iziphrinta nama-slicer edinga. Umhlaba we-PartCraft uyi-Y up, ngakho ukukhipha kujikisa ingxenye: okuphakanyelwa phezulu ku-PartCraft (kuhlangana nepulani le-Top) kuphakanyelwa phezulu ku-slicer, nengxenye edwetshwe kupulani le-Top ilele phansi ebhedini. Setha ukuma kokugcina ku-slicer yakho uma kudingeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-3MF iyifomethi entsha, encane, abafundi bama-slicer bayifunda ineziyunithi zayo ngaphakathi. Sebenzisa i-STL uma uhlelo lungayamukeli i-3MF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uqinisekise kuqala ukuthi ingxenye ivaliwe, ilingana ibhedi yesiphrinta sakho futhi imi phezu kobuso obuthe, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003ELungiselela ingxenye ukuze iphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezinye-izinhlelo-ze-cad-step\"\u003EEzinye izinhlelo ze-CAD: STEP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E. Ibhala ingxenye njengesolidi eyodwa eqondile, ngamamilimitha, ijikiswe ibe yi-Z up. Izindawo ezijikelezayo zibhalwa njengamasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi eqondile, nemiphetho yawo eyimijikelezo eqondile, ukuze olunye uhlelo lukwazi ukukhetha umgodi njengomgodi. Indiki evulwe kufayela le-STEP igcina ubuso bayo obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi ayo, ngakho nawo aphuma eqondile. Ubuso ongenalezo zindawo (uhlangothi lwe-spline, unembe owenziwe, indiki evela kumeshi we-STL, OBJ noma 3MF, i-spline yefayela le-STEP, ubuso oluhanjisiwe nolujikelezayo) luhlala lungamafasethi amancane abuthe kulesisolidi efanayo, futhi ibha yesimo ithi kangaki. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, &quot;Ikhishiwe Flange.step (AP242, isolidi eqondile, mm, Z up): izinhlangothi ezingu-14 ezisezindaweni zazo zangempela (10 zesilinda, 1 eyikhoni, 0 zesfere, 0 zetoyi), amajika emiphetho afanele angu-0.&quot; Iqukethe isolidi kuphela: akukho mlando, akukho zikethi, akukho mdwebo. Uma olunye uhlelo lufunda i-AP214 kuphela, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E: isolidi efanayo kuleso sakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuqondile nokungaqondile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obuthe, amasilinda (imigodi, amabhosi, amafilethi emiphetho eqondile), amakhoni (imigodi ekhonkayo, ama-taper), amasfere namathoyi kuqondile, kanjalo nemiphetho yawo eqondile, eyisiyingi nemiphetho ye-elliptical. Isilungiselelo \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E asiwashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho izinhlangothi ezimbili ezijikelezayo zihlangana (umgodi obhodlwe ngaphezu kwesampu), umphetho uba ijika elibushelelezi elilingene kuzo zombili izindawo ngaphakathi kwe-0.00001 mm; &quot;amajika emiphetho afanele&quot; ayawubala lowo mahlule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmgodi ovaliwe ngaphakathi kwengxenye ubhalwa njengendawo engenalutho esolidini. Izingxenye ezihlukene eziningi zibhalwa njengezolidi eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInhlanganisela aikabhalwa njenge-STEP eqondile okwamanje: khipha ingxenye ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIhlolwe ngokufunda amafayela ngokuphindela emuva ku-OpenCascade, ebika izolidi ezisebenzayo nevolumu ezibalwe ngesandla. Ayikavulwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CAD noma ze-CAM; uma enye yenqaba ifayela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ukwakheka okufanayo njengobuso obuthe (ku-eksisi zePartCraft, Y up), futhi sicela usitshele nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBika inkinga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze kugaywe, i-Manufacture nayo ibhala isolidi eqondile ngokuhlelwa komsebenzi wokusetha: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#exact-step-for-the-shop\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"exact-step-for-the-shop\"\u003EYenza ama-toolpath ne-G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zezinhlelo-ze-bim-ifc-nazo-zonke-izici\"\u003EZezinhlelo ze-BIM: IFC nazo zonke izici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC 4 (ngazo zonke izici)\u003C/span\u003E. Ibhala ingxenye njengento ye-IFC 4 yamamodeli wezakhiwo nezitshalo, ukwakheka kwayo njengamatriyangula (Z up, amamilimitha), nolwazi lwe-PartCraft olunalo ngayo njengamasethi wezakhiwo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsethi yezakhiwo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqukethe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Part\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, impahla nokuminyana kwayo, ukucushwa okusebenzayo, inani lezidumbu; kwinhlanganisela futhi inombolo yengxenye nencazelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Parameters\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke iparamitha yengxenye nenani layo; ifomula nenothi kuncazelo yezakhiwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_TitleBlock\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkambu zebhulokhi yesihloko somdwebo ozigcwalisile (isihloko, inombolo yomdwebo, ukubuyekezwa, inkampani, odwetshiwe, ohlolwe futhi ovunyelwe ngu-, usuku, ukuqeda, ukubekezelela okujwayelekile) nosayizi weshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQto_BuildingElementProxyQuantities\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Quantities\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvolumu, indawo yobuso, ubunzima (nempahla) nosayizi jikelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImpahla inamathiselwa njengempahla ye-IFC, futhi inombolo yomdwebo iyithegi yento. Kwinhlanganisela, ingxenye ngayinye ibhalwa kanye njengohlobo oluphethe izakhiwo zayo, nekhophi ngayinye ibekwa lapho inhlanganisela iyibeka khona, nenani layo siqu ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Instance\u003C/strong\u003E: igama layo, inombolo yayo ohlwini lwempahla, nokuthi iyingxenye eyisisekelo noma cha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphrofayili-we-laser-wamanzi-noma-we-cnc-dxf\"\u003EAmaphrofayili we-laser, wamanzi noma we-CNC: DXF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo ezimbili ze-DXF, zombili inguqulo ye-R12, ezivulwa yonke izinhlelo ze-CAD ne-CAM:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isikethi\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isikethi komlando (noma sivulekile).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E. (Iphaneli yangakwesokudla yesikethi nayo inayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha njenge-DXF\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthola \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; - &lt;sketch&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E ngokuhlelwa kwesikethi sayo: imigqa, amasongo aqondile nezindilinga ku-ungqimba \u003Cstrong\u003EPROFILE\u003C/strong\u003E, ijiyometri yokwakha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ECONSTRUCTION\u003C/strong\u003E, namaphoyinti angalungiswanga ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EPOINTS\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ubuso-obuthe-besolidi\"\u003EUbuso obuthe besolidi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ubuso obuthe embonweni (isibonelo, phezulu kwephuleti elinemigodi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ubuso njenge-DXF\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthola \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; - face.dxf\u003C/code\u003E: imbobo yobuso nayo yonke imigodi kuyo. Umgodi ojikelezayo (isiyingi esiphelele lapho isilinda sihlangana nobuso: umgodi obhodliwe, noma umgodi wefayela le-STEP elivuliwe) ubhalwa njengendilinga eqondile ngesikhungo nobubanzi bomgodi uqobo. Yonke enye imbobo iyiphoyilayini evaliwe, namaphethelo ayo ajikelezayo (amakhona amafilethi, izikhala, amasongo) ayizinhlangothi zayo, ngakho setha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhle\u003C/strong\u003E kuqala uma umbheki elandela kuwo ngokuseduze. Ibha yesimo ithi kangaki imbobo, kangaki kuzo eziyizindilinga eziqondile, nendawo yobuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungakhethiwe isikethi noma ubuso obuthe: &quot;Vula noma khetha isikethi, noma khetha ubuso obuthe, ukuze ukhiphe i-DXF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umdwebo\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo we-PDF unesiqondiso sawo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EYenza ishidi lomdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafomethi-angatholakali\"\u003EAmafomethi angatholakali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAyikhishwa kulesi sakhiwo: glTF, OBJ, IGES ne-Parasolid. I-DWG ibhalwa kuphela yiphakheji yezinguqulo, njengeshidi lomdwebo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EYenza iphakheji yezinguqulo kokucushwa kwakho\u003C/a\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"partcraft/file-formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafayela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukukhipha kuyizikopi ngamanye amafomethi. Gcina nefayela .partcraft.json: yilo kuphela ifayela i-PartCraft engayivula futhi iyihlele. Konke ukukhipha kusebenza ngengxenye esesikrinini, ngamamilimitha. Kwinhlanganisela, i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP nomdwebo (PDF) zikhipha yonke inhlanganisela: bheka Uhlu lwezingxenye, izibonakaliso ezihlukaniswe nezingxenye ezinyakazayo. Uma ingekho isolidi okwamanje: \"Akukho isolidi okungakhishwa okwamanje.\" Ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D: STL noma 3MF Uma kufunwa: ukuze kube bushelelezi ezindaweni ezijikelezayo, chofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho bese usetha Amajika ibe Kuhle (128 ngokujikeleza) noma Kuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza) kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla. I-STL ne-3MF zihlala zenziwe ngamatriyangula. Khetha Thumela, bese STL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D noma 3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D. Ifayela liyalandwa. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, \"Ikhishiwe Part1.stl (binary, mm, Z up, 1536 triangles).\" Zombili izifomethi zi-Z up, njengoba iziphrinta nama-slicer edinga. Umhlaba we-PartCraft uyi-Y up, ngakho ukukhipha kujikisa ingxenye: okuphakanyelwa phezulu ku-PartCraft (kuhlangana nepulani le-Top) kuphakanyelwa phezulu ku-slicer, nengxenye edwetshwe kupulani le-Top ilele phansi ebhedini. Setha ukuma kokugcina ku-slicer yakho uma kudingeka. I-3MF iyifomethi entsha, encane, abafundi bama-slicer bayifunda ineziyunithi zayo ngaphakathi. Sebenzisa i-STL uma uhlelo lungayamukeli i-3MF. Ukuze uqinisekise kuqala ukuthi ingxenye ivaliwe, ilingana ibhedi yesiphrinta sakho futhi imi phezu kobuso obuthe, sebenzisa Thumela › Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…: bheka Lungiselela ingxenye ukuze iphrintwe nge-3D. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD: STEP Khetha Thumela, bese STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile). Ibhala ingxenye njengesolidi eyodwa eqondile, ngamamilimitha, ijikiswe ibe yi-Z up. Izindawo ezijikelezayo zibhalwa njengamasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi eqondile, nemiphetho yawo eyimijikelezo eqondile, ukuze olunye uhlelo lukwazi ukukhetha umgodi njengomgodi. Indiki evulwe kufayela le-STEP igcina ubuso bayo obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi ayo, ngakho nawo aphuma eqondile. Ubuso ongenalezo zindawo (uhlangothi lwe-spline, unembe owenziwe, indiki evela kumeshi we-STL, OBJ noma 3MF, i-spline yefayela le-STEP, ubuso oluhanjisiwe nolujikelezayo) luhlala lungamafasethi amancane abuthe kulesisolidi efanayo, futhi ibha yesimo ithi kangaki. Ibha yesimo ithi, ngokwesibonelo, \"Ikhishiwe Flange.step (AP242, isolidi eqondile, mm, Z up): izinhlangothi ezingu-14 ezisezindaweni zazo zangempela (10 zesilinda, 1 eyikhoni, 0 zesfere, 0 zetoyi), amajika emiphetho afanele angu-0.\" Iqukethe isolidi kuphela: akukho mlando, akukho zikethi, akukho mdwebo. Uma olunye uhlelo lufunda i-AP214 kuphela, khetha STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile): isolidi efanayo kuleso sakhiwo sakudala. Okuqondile nokungaqondile: Ubuso obuthe, amasilinda (imigodi, amabhosi, amafilethi emiphetho eqondile), amakhoni (imigodi ekhonkayo, ama-taper), amasfere namathoyi kuqondile, kanjalo nemiphetho yawo eqondile, eyisiyingi nemiphetho ye-elliptical. Isilungiselelo Amajika asiwashintshi. Lapho izinhlangothi ezimbili ezijikelezayo zihlangana (umgodi obhodlwe ngaphezu kwesampu), umphetho uba ijika elibushelelezi elilingene kuzo zombili izindawo ngaphakathi kwe-0.00001 mm; \"amajika emiphetho afanele\" ayawubala lowo mahlule. Umgodi ovaliwe ngaphakathi kwengxenye ubhalwa njengendawo engenalutho esolidini. Izingxenye ezihlukene eziningi zibhalwa njengezolidi eziningi. Inhlanganisela aikabhalwa njenge-STEP eqondile okwamanje: khipha ingxenye ngayinye. Ihlolwe ngokufunda amafayela ngokuphindela emuva ku-OpenCascade, ebika izolidi ezisebenzayo nevolumu ezibalwe ngesandla. Ayikavulwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CAD noma ze-CAM; uma enye yenqaba ifayela, STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi) ibhala ukwakheka okufanayo njengobuso obuthe (ku-eksisi zePartCraft, Y up), futhi sicela usitshele nge-Usizo › Bika inkinga. Ukuze kugaywe, i-Manufacture nayo ibhala isolidi eqondile ngokuhlelwa komsebenzi wokusetha: bheka Yenza ama-toolpath ne-G-code. Zezinhlelo ze-BIM: IFC nazo zonke izici Khetha Thumela, bese IFC 4 (ngazo zonke izici). Ibhala ingxenye njengento ye-IFC 4 yamamodeli wezakhiwo nezitshalo, ukwakheka kwayo njengamatriyangula (Z up, amamilimitha), nolwazi lwe-PartCraft olunalo ngayo njengamasethi wezakhiwo: Isethi yezakhiwo Iqukethe PartCraft_Part Igama, impahla nokuminyana kwayo, ukucushwa okusebenzayo, inani lezidumbu; kwinhlanganisela futhi inombolo yengxenye nencazelo PartCraft_Parameters Yonke iparamitha yengxenye nenani layo; ifomula nenothi kuncazelo yezakhiwo PartCraft_TitleBlock Izinkambu zebhulokhi yesihloko somdwebo ozigcwalisile (isihloko, inombolo yomdwebo, ukubuyekezwa, inkampani, odwetshiwe, ohlolwe futhi ovunyelwe ngu-, usuku, ukuqeda, ukubekezelela okujwayelekile) nosayizi weshidi Qto_BuildingElementProxyQuantities, PartCraft_Quantities Ivolumu, indawo yobuso, ubunzima (nempahla) nosayizi jikelele Impahla inamathiselwa njengempahla ye-IFC, futhi inombolo yomdwebo iyithegi yento. Kwinhlanganisela, ingxenye ngayinye ibhalwa kanye njengohlobo oluphethe izakhiwo zayo, nekhophi ngayinye ibekwa lapho inhlanganisela iyibeka khona, nenani layo siqu ku-PartCraft_Instance: igama layo, inombolo yayo ohlwini lwempahla, nokuthi iyingxenye eyisisekelo noma cha. Amaphrofayili we-laser, wamanzi noma we-CNC: DXF Izinhlobo ezimbili ze-DXF, zombili inguqulo ye-R12, ezivulwa yonke izinhlelo ze-CAD ne-CAM: Isikethi Khetha isikethi komlando (noma sivulekile). Khetha Thumela, bese DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe. (Iphaneli yangakwesokudla yesikethi nayo inayo Khipha njenge-DXF.) Uthola \u003Cpart\u003E - \u003Csketch\u003E.dxf ngokuhlelwa kwesikethi sayo: imigqa, amasongo aqondile nezindilinga ku-ungqimba PROFILE, ijiyometri yokwakha ku-CONSTRUCTION, namaphoyinti angalungiswanga ku-POINTS. Ubuso obuthe besolidi Chofoza ubuso obuthe embonweni (isibonelo, phezulu kwephuleti elinemigodi). Khetha Khipha ubuso njenge-DXF kwiphaneli yangakwesokudla, noma Thumela, bese DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe. Uthola \u003Cpart\u003E - face.dxf: imbobo yobuso nayo yonke imigodi kuyo. Umgodi ojikelezayo (isiyingi esiphelele lapho isilinda sihlangana nobuso: umgodi obhodliwe, noma umgodi wefayela le-STEP elivuliwe) ubhalwa njengendilinga eqondile ngesikhungo nobubanzi bomgodi uqobo. Yonke enye imbobo iyiphoyilayini evaliwe, namaphethelo ayo ajikelezayo (amakhona amafilethi, izikhala, amasongo) ayizinhlangothi zayo, ngakho setha Amajika ibe Kuhle kuqala uma umbheki elandela kuwo ngokuseduze. Ibha yesimo ithi kangaki imbobo, kangaki kuzo eziyizindilinga eziqondile, nendawo yobuso. Uma kungakhethiwe isikethi noma ubuso obuthe: \"Vula noma khetha isikethi, noma khetha ubuso obuthe, ukuze ukhiphe i-DXF.\" Umdwebo Umdwebo we-PDF unesiqondiso sawo: Yenza ishidi lomdwebo. Amafomethi angatholakali Ayikhishwa kulesi sakhiwo: glTF, OBJ, IGES ne-Parasolid. I-DWG ibhalwa kuphela yiphakheji yezinguqulo, njengeshidi lomdwebo: bheka Yenza iphakheji yezinguqulo kokucushwa kwakho. Bheka Amafomethi amafayela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Lungiselela ingxenye ukuze iprintwe nge-3D","summary":"Hlola ukuthi ingxenye noma i-assembly ivaliwe, ilingana nomshini wakho wokuprinta futhi imi phezu kwesisekelo, bese uyilanda njenge-STL noma i-3MF ye-slicer yakho.","section":"tasks","order":131,"keywords":["print 3d","ukuprinta nge-3d","iprinta","ukuprinta","slicer","stl","3mf","ivaliwe","vala","manifold","ibhedi","usayizi webhedi","ipuleti lokwakha","ukuqhamuka","izinsekelo","isisekelo","amamilimitha","ukuthumela","izintambo","ikhilaransi"],"headings":[{"id":"hlola-ulande","text":"Hlola ulande","level":2},{"id":"okungathi-ingxoxo-ingakusho","text":"Okungathi ingxoxo ingakusho","level":2},{"id":"izintambo-eziprintwayo","text":"Izintambo eziprintwayo","level":2},{"id":"bushelelezi-ubuso-obujikelezayo","text":"Bushelelezi ubuso obujikelezayo","level":2},{"id":"okukhulu-okuncane-noma-ngezingcezu","text":"Okukhulu, okuncane, noma ngezingcezu","level":2},{"id":"akuhlolwanga","text":"Akuhlolwanga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-slicer idinga isimo esivaliwe: akukho zimbobo, zonke izindawo zibheke ngaphandle, akukho okudlula kuso. Izingxenye ezakhiwe yi-PartCraft zivaliwe ngokwakhiwa, ngakho ukuhlola kakhulu kukutshela usayizi, ukuthi ingxenye iyalingana yini nebhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta, ukuthi imi phezu kobuso obulingene yini, nokuthi iqhamuka kangakanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-ulande\"\u003EHlola ulande\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkungakhethwa, kanye kuphela: setha ibhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › PartCraft › \u003Cstrong\u003E3D printer\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama ngamamilimitha. Zishiye zingenalutho ukuze udlule kulolo hlolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi lithi &quot;Ilungele ukuprinta&quot; noma &quot;Ayilungele ukuprinta&quot;, ibala okungalungile, futhi linikeza usayizi ebhedini (X × Y × Z, ngamamilimitha), ivolumu nenani lamatriyangela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload 3MF\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload STL\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela lifana ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-assembly, ukuhlola namafayela kuthatha i-assembly yonke, zonke izikopi lapho zibekwe khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ihlolwa imi njengoba ukuthumela kuyibhala: okubheka phezulu ku-PartCraft (kuqondile ku-Top plane) kubheka phezulu ebhedini. Ingxenye edwetshwe ku-Top plane ilala phansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungathi-ingxoxo-ingakusho\"\u003EOkungathi ingxoxo ingakusho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAyilungele ukuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E (i-slicer ingayenqaba noma ingayiprinta ngokungalungile): izimbobo (imiphetho enobuso ohlangothini olulodwa kuphela), imiphetho eyabelwana ngezindawo ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, izindawo ezibheke ngakolunye uhlangothi, umzimba ophenduliwe, noma umzimba udlula kuwo wona. Ingxenye eyakhelwe ku-PartCraft akufanele iwabonise lawa; uma kukhona, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzexwayiso\u003C/strong\u003E (iyaprinta, kodwa bheka kuqala):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhulu kunebhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta\u003C/strong\u003E, noma uma ijikelezwe ngama-90° kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho lapho ilala phansi ngokuthe xaxa\u003C/strong\u003E: jikeleza ingxenye ku-slicer yakho ukuze ubuso buhlale ebhedini, noma kuzodingeka izinsekelo noma i-raft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIyathambekela ngaphezu kuka-45° ngaphandle kokuma ngqo\u003C/strong\u003E: lezo zindawo zidinga ukusekelwa, ngokuma njengoba kunjalo. Enye indlela yokuma ingadinga okuncane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImizimba ehlukene iyahlanganisa\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eihlangana ngobuso\u003C/strong\u003E: ama-slicer ngokuvamile ayahlanganisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E ku-Features › More ihlanganisa ibe umzimba owodwa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/bodies\" data-topic=\"partcraft/bodies\"\u003EImizimba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphansi kwe-1 mm ubude bonke\u003C/strong\u003E: hlola usayizi wengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izintambo-eziprintwayo\"\u003EIzintambo eziprintwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntambo emodelwe iprinta njengentambo yangempela. Yinike \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhilaransi\u003C/strong\u003E ethile ukuze i-bolt eprintiwe ingene ku-nut eprintiwe: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EIzintambo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bushelelezi-ubuso-obujikelezayo\"\u003EBushelelezi ubuso obujikelezayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-STL ne-3MF yakhiwe ngonxantathu. Ukuze uthole ubuso obujikelezayo obushelelezi, chofoza endaweni engenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhle (128 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/strong\u003E ohlangothini lwesokudla ngaphambi kokuthumela. Onxantathu abaningi benza amafayela amakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhulu-okuncane-noma-ngezingcezu\"\u003EOkukhulu, okuncane, noma ngezingcezu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › Linganisa ukuze kuprintwe (STL noma 3MF)…\u003C/strong\u003E igcina ingxenye ilinganiswe ngamanani ngokwe-axis ngaphandle kokuyishintsha: \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuvumela ukuncipha\u003C/strong\u003E ngamaphesenti (usayizi × (1 + s), noma usayizi oqondile ÷ (1 − s)) ye-casting pattern, noma izinto ezilula, ezungeze maphakathi, esisekelweni esiphansi, phakathi nobuso obuphansi noma emvelophezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › Hlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe (izingcezu ku-zip)…\u003C/strong\u003E isika ingxenye enkulu kakhulu kumshini wakho wokuprinta ibe yizingcezu ezilingana ngabanye nebhedi oyinikezayo, ezixhunywe ngezikhonkwane, izikhiye, ama-dovetail, izimbobo ze-dowel noma izikhala zamagnethi (ngekhilaransi osethile), kuthi isiqephu ngasinye nendawo yokuhlangana zibalwe, futhi izingcezu zigcinwe njenge-STL noma i-3MF ku-zip nephepha le-assembly. Ingxenye ngokwayo ayishintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akuhlolwanga\"\u003EAkuhlolwanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuminyana kwezindonga, imininingwane emincane kunenozzle yakho ngaphandle kokuthi ingayidweba, nokuthi i-slicer izobeka kanjani izinsekelo. I-slicer yakho iyazibonisa lezo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-slicer idinga isimo esivaliwe: akukho zimbobo, zonke izindawo zibheke ngaphandle, akukho okudlula kuso. Izingxenye ezakhiwe yi-PartCraft zivaliwe ngokwakhiwa, ngakho ukuhlola kakhulu kukutshela usayizi, ukuthi ingxenye iyalingana yini nebhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta, ukuthi imi phezu kobuso obulingene yini, nokuthi iqhamuka kangakanani. Hlola ulande Okungakhethwa, kanye kuphela: setha ibhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta ku-Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › 3D printer: ububanzi, ukujula nokuphakama ngamamilimitha. Zishiye zingenalutho ukuze udlule kulolo hlolo. Khetha Thumela, bese Hlola ukuprinta nge-3D (STL noma 3MF)…. Ibhokisi lithi \"Ilungele ukuprinta\" noma \"Ayilungele ukuprinta\", ibala okungalungile, futhi linikeza usayizi ebhedini (X × Y × Z, ngamamilimitha), ivolumu nenani lamatriyangela. Chofoza Download 3MF noma Download STL. Ifayela lifana ne-Thumela › 3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D noma STL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D. Ku-assembly, ukuhlola namafayela kuthatha i-assembly yonke, zonke izikopi lapho zibekwe khona. Ingxenye ihlolwa imi njengoba ukuthumela kuyibhala: okubheka phezulu ku-PartCraft (kuqondile ku-Top plane) kubheka phezulu ebhedini. Ingxenye edwetshwe ku-Top plane ilala phansi. Okungathi ingxoxo ingakusho Ayilungele ukuprinta (i-slicer ingayenqaba noma ingayiprinta ngokungalungile): izimbobo (imiphetho enobuso ohlangothini olulodwa kuphela), imiphetho eyabelwana ngezindawo ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, izindawo ezibheke ngakolunye uhlangothi, umzimba ophenduliwe, noma umzimba udlula kuwo wona. Ingxenye eyakhelwe ku-PartCraft akufanele iwabonise lawa; uma kukhona, bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Izexwayiso (iyaprinta, kodwa bheka kuqala): Ikhulu kunebhedi lomshini wakho wokuprinta, noma uma ijikelezwe ngama-90° kuyo. Akukho lapho ilala phansi ngokuthe xaxa: jikeleza ingxenye ku-slicer yakho ukuze ubuso buhlale ebhedini, noma kuzodingeka izinsekelo noma i-raft. Iyathambekela ngaphezu kuka-45° ngaphandle kokuma ngqo: lezo zindawo zidinga ukusekelwa, ngokuma njengoba kunjalo. Enye indlela yokuma ingadinga okuncane. Imizimba ehlukene iyahlanganisa noma ihlangana ngobuso: ama-slicer ngokuvamile ayahlanganisa. Hlanganisa ku-Features › More ihlanganisa ibe umzimba owodwa. Bheka Imizimba. Ngaphansi kwe-1 mm ubude bonke: hlola usayizi wengxenye. Izintambo eziprintwayo Intambo emodelwe iprinta njengentambo yangempela. Yinike Ikhilaransi ethile ukuze i-bolt eprintiwe ingene ku-nut eprintiwe: bheka Izintambo. Bushelelezi ubuso obujikelezayo I-STL ne-3MF yakhiwe ngonxantathu. Ukuze uthole ubuso obujikelezayo obushelelezi, chofoza endaweni engenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese usetha Amajika ibe Kuhle (128 ngokujikeleza) noma Kuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza) ohlangothini lwesokudla ngaphambi kokuthumela. Onxantathu abaningi benza amafayela amakhulu. Okukhulu, okuncane, noma ngezingcezu Thumela › Linganisa ukuze kuprintwe (STL noma 3MF)… igcina ingxenye ilinganiswe ngamanani ngokwe-axis ngaphandle kokuyishintsha: ukuvumela ukuncipha ngamaphesenti (usayizi × (1 + s), noma usayizi oqondile ÷ (1 − s)) ye-casting pattern, noma izinto ezilula, ezungeze maphakathi, esisekelweni esiphansi, phakathi nobuso obuphansi noma emvelophezulu. Thumela › Hlukanisa ukuze kuprintwe (izingcezu ku-zip)… isika ingxenye enkulu kakhulu kumshini wakho wokuprinta ibe yizingcezu ezilingana ngabanye nebhedi oyinikezayo, ezixhunywe ngezikhonkwane, izikhiye, ama-dovetail, izimbobo ze-dowel noma izikhala zamagnethi (ngekhilaransi osethile), kuthi isiqephu ngasinye nendawo yokuhlangana zibalwe, futhi izingcezu zigcinwe njenge-STL noma i-3MF ku-zip nephepha le-assembly. Ingxenye ngokwayo ayishintshi. Akuhlolwanga Ukuminyana kwezindonga, imininingwane emincane kunenozzle yakho ngaphandle kokuthi ingayidweba, nokuthi i-slicer izobeka kanjani izinsekelo. I-slicer yakho iyazibonisa lezo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"solid-fem-check","scope":"partcraft","title":"Solid FEM: ukuhlola kwesisindo sengxenye eyodwa","summary":"Vula i-add-on ye-Solid FEM, yenza i-mesh engxenyeni, khetha izindawo ezibanjiwe nomthwalo kumbonakalo we-3D, xazulula, bese ufunda ukuhamba nesisindo se-von Mises emodelini.","section":"tasks","order":132,"keywords":["solid fem","finite element","fea","uxinzelelo","von mises","ukuhamba","ubuso obubanjiwe","umthwalo","uxinzelelo lomoya","isisindo","amafrikhwensi wemvelo","ukubukeka kwemodi","i-mesh","okwengeziwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola isolidi elilodwa ngaphansi komthwalo: lapho lihamba khona nokuthi uxinzelelo luphakeme kakhulu kuphi. Isifundo silinear futhi sinwebeka, ngakho siyisisiza sokuhlola; unjiniyela wakho ubheka imiphumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E (ivalwe kuze uyivule). Vula ithebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E epanelini elingakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwesigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E khetha eyodwa, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokwezifiso\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha i-Poisson ratio, ukuminyana nokuqina kokuqala (yield stress).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ubuso obubanjiwe\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza ubuso obubanjiwe embonakalweni ye-3D, bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe ukukhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza umthwalo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amandla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza uxinzelelo\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isisindo\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ubuso bawo ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza i-mesh ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXazulula\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafrikhwensi wemvelo\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUcwaningo\u003C/span\u003E kuqala uma ufuna amafrikhwensi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphumela\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzexwayiso\u003C/span\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhombisa emodelini\u003C/span\u003E ukuze udwebe uxinzelelo lwe-von Mises, ukuhamba noma ukubukeka kwemodi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ipuloti\u003C/span\u003E iyakususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi lixazulula kuze kufike inani elisethiwe lezinhlaka; umugqa wesimo ukhombisa lapho usayizi wakho wenhlaka usemncane kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUxinzelelo ezindaweni ezibanjiwe, emaphoyinteni womthwalo nasemakhoneni abukhali luyakhula njengoba i-mesh ithuthukiswa. Thuthukisa uqhathanise ngaphambi kokuthembela ekuphakameni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELonke ushintsho lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi izilungiselelo zigcinwa efayeleni lengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgezifundo zokuthobeka nokuxhumana bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola uxinzelelo nokugoba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlola isolidi elilodwa ngaphansi komthwalo: lapho lihamba khona nokuthi uxinzelelo luphakeme kakhulu kuphi. Isifundo silinear futhi sinwebeka, ngakho siyisisiza sokuhlola; unjiniyela wakho ubheka imiphumela. Izinyathelo Khetha Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe bese uvula Solid FEM (ivalwe kuze uyivule). Vula ithebhu Solid FEM epanelini elingakwesokudla. Ngaphansi kwesigaba Impahla yokwakha khetha eyodwa, noma Ngokwezifiso bese uthayipha i-Poisson ratio, ukuminyana nokuqina kokuqala (yield stress). Cindezela Engeza ubuso obubanjiwe, chofoza ubuso obubanjiwe embonakalweni ye-3D, bese ucindezela Kuqediwe ukukhetha. Engeza umthwalo nge-Engeza amandla, Engeza uxinzelelo noma Engeza isisindo bese ukhetha ubuso bawo ngendlela efanayo. Cindezela Yenza i-mesh ingxenye, bese Xazulula. Khetha Amafrikhwensi wemvelo ngaphansi kwesigaba Ucwaningo kuqala uma ufuna amafrikhwensi. Funda Imiphumela kanye Izexwayiso, bese ucindezela Khombisa emodelini ukuze udwebe uxinzelelo lwe-von Mises, ukuhamba noma ukubukeka kwemodi; Susa ipuloti iyakususa. Amanothi Ikhasi lixazulula kuze kufike inani elisethiwe lezinhlaka; umugqa wesimo ukhombisa lapho usayizi wakho wenhlaka usemncane kakhulu. Uxinzelelo ezindaweni ezibanjiwe, emaphoyinteni womthwalo nasemakhoneni abukhali luyakhula njengoba i-mesh ithuthukiswa. Thuthukisa uqhathanise ngaphambi kokuthembela ekuphakameni. Lonke ushintsho lungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi izilungiselelo zigcinwa efayeleni lengxenye. Ngezifundo zokuthobeka nokuxhumana bona Hlola uxinzelelo nokugoba.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuthumela ingxenye noma inhlanganisela njenge-USD","summary":"Bhala ingxenye, noma inhlanganisela yonke ngengxenye ngayinye ibhalwe kanye kanye nakho konke ukukopiwa kubekwe, njengephakheji ye-USD.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","thumela","inhlanganisela","iphakheji","ukurenda","isigcawu"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKungxenye, ifayela libamba isolidi yengxenye ngempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuhlanganisela, ingxenye ngayinye ibhalwa kanye kanye, futhi yonke ikhophi ibekwa lapho inhlanganisela iyibeka khona, ngakho ifayela lihlala lincane noma kunjani amakhophi amaningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft isebenza ngamamilimitha ne-Y ephezulu; ifayela le-USD lingamamitha ne-Z ephezulu, njengoba izinhlelo eziningi ze-3D zilindele.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Khetha Thumela › Iphakheji ye-USD (.usdz). Kungxenye, ifayela libamba isolidi yengxenye ngempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima. Kuhlanganisela, ingxenye ngayinye ibhalwa kanye kanye, futhi yonke ikhophi ibekwa lapho inhlanganisela iyibeka khona, ngakho ifayela lihlala lincane noma kunjani amakhophi amaningi. PartCraft isebenza ngamamilimitha ne-Y ephezulu; ifayela le-USD lingamamitha ne-Z ephezulu, njengoba izinhlelo eziningi ze-3D zilindele.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"manufacture","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yenza izindlela zethuluzi ne-G-code (Ukukhiqiza)","summary":"Setha isitoko nemvelaphi yomsebenzi, khetha amathuluzi, engeza imisebenzi yobuso, i-pocket, i-contour, ukubhoboza nokusika i-chamfer ngokukhetha ubuso, qeda imodeli yonke nge-3D (nxande, iskalobhu), lingisa isitoko namodeli ukuze uthole ukugawuka nesikhathi sokusebenza, bese uyalanda i-G-code kusuka kwezimbili ezakhelwe ngaphakathi noma kuhlelo oluhlelwe nguwe.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["exact step","step wokusebenza","izixhumanisi zomsebenzi","ukudlulisa kwe-cam","nxande","iskalobhu","ukuqedwa nge-3d","ukuqeda","ibhola","umtapo wamathuluzi","hlela i-post","post engokwezifiso","umhleli we-post","adaptive","ukususwa okuhlala njalo","trochoidal","hsm","ukukhiqiza ngesivinini esikhulu","manufacture","CAM","indlela yethuluzi","G-code","NC","CNC","mill","milling","pocket","contour","profile","ukuhlanza ubuso","ukubhoboza","peck","G83","G81","G73","chamfer","isitoko","ukushintshwa komsebenzi","G54","post processor","GRBL","LinuxCNC","izinga lokondla nesivinini","ukulingisa","ukugawuka","isikhathi sokusebenza"],"headings":[{"id":"setha","text":"Setha","level":2},{"id":"amathuluzi","text":"Amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"engeza-imisebenzi","text":"Engeza imisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"lingisa","text":"Lingisa","level":2},{"id":"post-i-g-code","text":"Post i-G-code","level":2},{"id":"i-g-code-yesitolo-ye-exact-step","text":"I-G-code yesitolo ye-Exact STEP","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2},{"id":"thumela-uhlelo-emshinini","text":"Thumela uhlelo emshinini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsikhala sokusebenza se-Manufacture sishintsha imodeli ibe yizindlela zethuluzi bese isibhala njenge-G-code. Imisebenzi eminingi ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003Emilling engu-2.5-eksisi\u003C/strong\u003E: ithuluzi lihlala limile, izindonga zisikwa ziqonde phansi nezindonga zibe nezisekelo ezisicaba. I-\u003Cstrong\u003E3D rough\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ERest\u003C/strong\u003E zihlanza izingxenye ezigobile ngo-3D (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003EUkuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele\u003C/a\u003E); i-\u003Cstrong\u003EParallel\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EScallop\u003C/strong\u003E ziqeda zona (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E). Emshinini onama-eksisi azungezayo, noma yimuphi umsebenzi ungaba nethuluzi elithambekile, futhi imisebenzi emibili ihambisa ama-eksisi azungezayo ngenkathi isika (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\"\u003EUkusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5\u003C/a\u003E). Kukhona imisebenzi yomshini wokuthenda (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/turning\" data-topic=\"partcraft/turning\"\u003EUkuthenda\u003C/a\u003E) nowephrobhu lokuthinta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/probing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/probing\"\u003EIprobhu\u003C/a\u003E). Isebenza ngobuso obubizwe ngamagama i-kernel ye-mesh inikeza ingxenye (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwakhiwa kwelabhorethri: hlola yonke inhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha\"\u003ESetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EManufacture\u003C/strong\u003E kwisishintshi sesikhala sokusebenza, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew setup\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEthebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003ESetup\u003C/strong\u003E khetha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-eksisi yethuluzi (+Z)\u003C/strong\u003E: ithuluzi libheke ngasiphi isiqondiso engxenyeni. I-World +Y (ephezulu ye-PartCraft) yiyona ezenzakalelayo; i-X yomshini ibe yi-X yomhlaba, ne-Y yomshini ibe yi−Z yomhlaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImvelaphi yomsebenzi (G54)\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhona yesitoko noma maphakathi, phezulu noma phansi, maphakathi kophezulu wemodeli, noma imvelaphi yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko\u003C/strong\u003E: ibhokisi noma isilinda, noma imodeli plus okuseduze (ezinhlangothini, phezulu, phansi) noma usayizi osethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E (isetha izinga lokuqala lokondla nesivinini), i-\u003Cstrong\u003Epost\u003C/strong\u003E (umlawuli), isivinini esikhulu sesipindle yomshini, izinga lokuhamba ngokushesha nesikhathi sokushintsha ithuluzi, i-coolant nenombolo yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E iqukethe umtapo: ama-end mill athambile, abhola nama-bull nose, amadrill, amamilling e-chamfer namamilling obuso, ngalinye linenombolo ye-T, ububanzi, ama-flute nobude be-flute (kanye ne-corner radius, i-point noma i-chamfer angle lapho zisebenza khona).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi ami angalondolozwa esiphequluli futhi ahanjiswe phakathi kwamakhompyutha njengefayela: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tool-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tool-library\"\u003EUmtapo wamathuluzi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsivinini sespindle nokondla kuvela ezintweni: n = 1000 × isivinini sokusika / (π × ububanzi), ukondla = n × ama-flute × i-chip load (ama-drill: n × ukondla ngokuzungeza). Lezi yizinombolo ezilondekile zokuqala ezivela emikhawulweni ebhaliwe, hhayi ezilungiselelwe umshini wakho; thayipha isivinini sokusika, i-chip load, i-rpm noma ukondla okusuka kumenzi wethuluzi lakho ukuze ukushintshe. Lapho isivinini sedlula okukhulu komshini kuyabanjwa lapho futhi ukondla kulandela, kugcinwa i-chip load.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-imisebenzi\"\u003EEngeza imisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqhosha ngalinye ethuluzini lengeza umsebenzi, futhi lapho kudingeka ijiyometri, liyaqala ukukhetha: chofoza ubuso noma imiphetho embonweni (chofoza futhi ukuze wehlise elinye), bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone picking\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindlela ze-zig-zag phezu kwesitoko sonke, ngaphesheya kwemiphetho yaso, ziye kophezulu womodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPocket\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubuso obusicaba bomgodi, umgodi ongaphansi, noma ushintsho oluvaliwe lwemiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanza indawo ngokudlula kwe-offset ngaphakathi-ngaphandle, ekunyuseni ngakunye kwe-step-down; izihlahla (ubuso obuma phezulu ngaphakathi kwesicaba) ziyashiywa; isicaba esivulekile ngokuzungezile (akukho okuphakeme ngaphandle kwaso) siyahlanzwa kuze kufike emphethelweni wesitoko\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdaptive\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokufanayo ne-Pocket\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanza indawo efanayo ngezindlela ezisika ububanzi obuthile ngakunye (\u003Cstrong\u003EEngagement\u003C/strong\u003E, ingxenye yobubanzi), ukuze ithuluzi lingalokothi lithathe isikhala esigcwele ububanzi, ngisho emakhoneni; lingena ngohelikhi bese liqeda izindonga ngakunye kwezinga. Ukusika okuncane kuvumela i-step-down ejulile nokondla okukhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContour\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubuso obusicaba (umbonakalo wabo), ubuso obuzungezile, noma imiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIland&#039;umbonakalo ofakwe ngobubanzi bethuluzi, ngaphandle noma ngaphakathi, nama-arc okungena nokuphuma nama-tab ongakhetha kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizimbobo (chofoza udonga lwembobo noma umphetho wayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhoboza imbobo ngayinye ngomjikelezo oqinile: peck (G83), drill (G81) noma chip break (G73); noma nikeza ububanzi ukuze ubhobozele zonke izimbobo zalobo bubanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbonakalo wobuso noma imiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhambisa i-chamfer mill emphethelweni ukuze isike ububanzi obusethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParallel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elutho (imodeli yonke)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D ngemigqa enxande ngayo yonke i-engeli, ilandela umphezulu ngebhola, i-bull-nose noma i-end mill esicaba. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScallop\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elutho (imodeli yonke)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D ngamapasi ahlukaniswe ngebanga elithile phezu komphezulu, ukuze igquma eliphakathi kwawo libe nokuphakama oyikhethayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha umsebenzi kuhlu ukuze ushintshe ithuluzi walo, izinga lokuphakama (ukuhlukanisa, ukubuyela, izinga lokondla, phezulu, phansi), i-step-down, i-stepover, isitoko esizoshiya, ipasi lokuqeda, ukungena (uhelikhi, iramp noma plunge), ukugaya ngokukhwela, ama-tab noma umjikelezo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUp\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDown\u003C/span\u003E zihlela kabusha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESuppress\u003C/span\u003E iyishiya ngaphandle, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E iyasusa. Konke kusemlandweni wokuhlehla futhi kulondolozwa efayelini lengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbuso be-stepover ye-pocket bungaba ngaphansi kwesigamu sobubanzi bethuluzi, ukuze wonke amaphuzu esicaba aseduze nekhulu lethuluzi elilodwa lendlela. Amakhona angaphakathi agcina umsakazo wethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlanza okuguquguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E kugcina ukungena kwe-cutter iseduze nenani elilodwa. Ukungena okungu-0.15 kobubanzi kuyi-engeli yokungena engaba ngu-46°: indilinga yomphetho wecutter ezintweni. I-offset pocket, ngokuphambene, isika ububanzi obugcwele ekudlulweni kwayo kokuqala futhi ibhinca kakhulu emakhoneni angaphakathi ngamunye. Phakathi kwamapasi ithuluzi lihlala lingene lapho lidlula emoyeni osikiwe, bese liyaphakama liphinde lehle emoyeni osikiwe kwezinye izindawo. Amapasi asetshenziswa kugridi ebucayi phezu kwesifunda (amaseli acishe abe yi-twelfth yomsakazo wethuluzi), ngakho ukungena kungadlula kancane kancane amaseli amabili obubanzi obusetshenzisiwe; izindonga ziqedwa ngokunembile. Indawo evulekile ekhulu yenza uhlelo olude olunemigqa emifushane eminingi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lingisa\"\u003ELingisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindlela zethuluzi zenziwa futhi ngemva kokushintsha ngakunye (nengxenye yakho). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimulate\u003C/span\u003E futhi ibonisa isitoko esisele ngemva kwawo wonke uhlelo. Iphaneli ibonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi sokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E: izinyathelo zokondla zihamba ngokondla kwazo, izinyathelo ezisheshayo zingamamugqa aqondile ngezinga lokuhamba ngokushesha kusethingi, kanye nesikhathi sokushintsha ithuluzi. Imishini yangempela iyashesha, ngakho ithatha isikhathi eside.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugawuka\u003C/strong\u003E: izindawo lapho ithuluzi lehla khona ngaphezu kuka-0.02 mm ngaphansi kobuso bengxenye. Imikhomba ebomvu iyawakhombisa embonweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko esisele engxenyeni\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitoko siyimephu yokuphakama yophezulu (Z-map), ngakho asikwazi ukubonisa ukugoba okungaphansi. Hudula i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPlayback\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uhambise ithuluzi uhlelo lwonke. Embonweni, izinyathelo zokondla zimile, nezinyathelo ezisheshayo zimile ngemigqa, kube nombala owodwa ngokusebenza ngakunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-\u003Cstrong\u003EShow the simulated stock\u003C/strong\u003E ivuliwe, isitoko sinombala ngokumelene nemodeli, iseli ngeseli: \u003Cstrong\u003Eluhlaza\u003C/strong\u003E lapho sikhona emodelini (phakathi kuka-0.02 mm), \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubomvu\u003C/strong\u003E lapho ithuluzi lisike emodelini, futhi lapho kusele isitoko emodelini \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwesasawu\u003C/strong\u003E ngesikhumba esincane, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuwolintshi\u003C/strong\u003E ngokwengeziwe, kuguquke kube \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwegrey\u003C/strong\u003E yesitoko esingasikiwe ku-1 mm noma ngaphezulu. Imibala yenziwa futhi ngalo lonke ushintsho, ngemephu yokuphakama efanayo nezinombolo ephaneli, ngakho okuluhlaza nokubomvu kuvumelana nomugqa wokugawuka. Ishintshi lisika emodelini ngamabomu futhi libonisa okubomvu emaphethelweni alo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"post-i-g-code\"\u003EPost i-G-code\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha umlawuli ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPost\u003C/strong\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload G-code\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPost\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yamathuluzi):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlawuli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFanuc-style ISO\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.nc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E%, inombolo ye-O, izinombolo zomugqa, T M6 nge-G43 H, imijikelezo eqinile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGRBL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.nc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho umshintshi wethuluzi noma imijikelezo eqinile: ukushintsha kwethuluzi kuma nge-M0, ukubhoboza kubhalwa njengezinyathelo ezilula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinuxCNC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.ngc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET M6 nge-G43 H, imijikelezo eqinile, M2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFanuc-style lathe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.nc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinhlelweni zokuthenda: X njengobubanzi, ukondla ngokuzungeza, G96 ngaphansi komkhawulo we-G50, ukuthungwa kwe-G32\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinuxCNC lathe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.ngc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinhlelweni zokuthenda: ububanzi be-G7, G95, G96, ukuthungwa kwe-G33; ayibhali inyathelo lokubuyela ekhaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkwakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enoma yini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-post oyibhaliyo noma oyishintshile: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit post…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew post…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport post file…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke amafayela aqala ngamakhomenti ohlelo, isitoko, ukushintshwa komsebenzi namathuluzi. Izindlela zisemamilimitha ngamanani angu-3 amasentimitha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolpath CSV\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolpath JSON\u003C/span\u003E zihambisa izinyathelo ngokwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala.\u003C/strong\u003E Ama-post amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi ayizisekelo ezilandela imiyalo ebhalwe yomlawuli; awazange afakazelwe emshinini othile. I-post oyishintshile iyeyakho ukuyifakazela. Indlela yokubhala enye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EAma-post processor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-g-code-yesitolo-ye-exact-step\"\u003EI-G-code yesitolo ye-Exact STEP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwamaqhosha e-G-code ethebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOperations\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExact STEP (work coordinates)\u003C/span\u003E ilanda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;ingxenye&gt;-work.step\u003C/code\u003E: ingxenye njengesolidi eqondile (izinsimbi zangempela zemibhobo nezigidi, nezindilinga zangempela zamaphethelo awo) nemvelaphi yayo ku-work origin yalo setup kanye no-Z ngokuhamba nge-eksisi yethuluzi. Lezi yizixhumanisi ezisetshenziswa yi-G-code, ngakho umsebenzi we-CAM noma umhloli wesitolo ubeka imodeli ngokufanele nohlelo ngaphandle kokuyinyakazisa. Ifayela lingokwengxenye kuphela, hhayi isitoko noma izindlela zethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala isolidi efanayo endaweni yengxenye yayo (Z ephezulu): bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EUkuthumela ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-pocket, ama-contour, ukubhoboza namachamfer angama-2.5-eksisi. Izingxenye ezigobile zihlanzwa futhi ziqedwe nge-3D yimisebenzi yazo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003EUkuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E). I-adaptive clearing iyi-2D (izisekelo ezisicaba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi athambekile, ukuqedwa kwe-5-eksisi nekwe-4th-axis, ukuthenda nokuhlola ziyakhona, ngakunye nemikhawulo yakho, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eakukho lolu hlobo olusetshenziswe emshinini\u003C/strong\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\"\u003EUkusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/turning\" data-topic=\"partcraft/turning\"\u003EUkuthenda\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/probing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/probing\"\u003EIprobhu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmabanga nezinhlobo zamathuluzi akahlolwa ukuthi awabangani; isexwayiso sivela uma ukusika kujule kunobude be-flute.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkondla nesivinini kungamanani okuqala. I-post ingombhalo ongawuhlela, kodwa iphethe kuphela ukubhalwa kwezinyathelo; ayikwazi ukushintsha indlela yethuluzi, ukungeza ama-eksisi noma ukwazi umshini wakho (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EAma-post processor\u003C/a\u003E ibhala okungenzeki).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-uhlelo-emshinini\"\u003EThumela uhlelo emshinini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio ku-desktop, nomshini osethwe ku-Studio, i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESend to a machine…\u003C/strong\u003E ivela eduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EDownload G-code\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ilayishe lolu hlelo oluphambili emshinini ongaku-netiweki yakho. Ayiqali ngaphakathi kwe-PartCraft: uqala emshinini lapho usucace khona. Kusiphequluli, iqhosha alibonakali (ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukufinyelela umshini kunethiwekhi yakho): landa uhlelo kunalokho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isikhala sokusebenza se-Manufacture sishintsha imodeli ibe yizindlela zethuluzi bese isibhala njenge-G-code. Imisebenzi eminingi ngu-milling engu-2.5-eksisi: ithuluzi lihlala limile, izindonga zisikwa ziqonde phansi nezindonga zibe nezisekelo ezisicaba. I-3D rough ne-Rest zihlanza izingxenye ezigobile ngo-3D (Ukuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele); i-Parallel ne-Scallop ziqeda zona (Ukuqedwa nge-3D). Emshinini onama-eksisi azungezayo, noma yimuphi umsebenzi ungaba nethuluzi elithambekile, futhi imisebenzi emibili ihambisa ama-eksisi azungezayo ngenkathi isika (Ukusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5). Kukhona imisebenzi yomshini wokuthenda (Ukuthenda) nowephrobhu lokuthinta (Iprobhu). Isebenza ngobuso obubizwe ngamagama i-kernel ye-mesh inikeza ingxenye (bona I-mesh kernel). Ukwakhiwa kwelabhorethri: hlola yonke inhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala. Setha Khetha Manufacture kwisishintshi sesikhala sokusebenza, bese New setup. Ethebhini le-Setup khetha: I-eksisi yethuluzi (+Z): ithuluzi libheke ngasiphi isiqondiso engxenyeni. I-World +Y (ephezulu ye-PartCraft) yiyona ezenzakalelayo; i-X yomshini ibe yi-X yomhlaba, ne-Y yomshini ibe yi−Z yomhlaba. Imvelaphi yomsebenzi (G54): ikhona yesitoko noma maphakathi, phezulu noma phansi, maphakathi kophezulu wemodeli, noma imvelaphi yemodeli. Isitoko: ibhokisi noma isilinda, noma imodeli plus okuseduze (ezinhlangothini, phezulu, phansi) noma usayizi osethiwe. Impahla (isetha izinga lokuqala lokondla nesivinini), i-post (umlawuli), isivinini esikhulu sesipindle yomshini, izinga lokuhamba ngokushesha nesikhathi sokushintsha ithuluzi, i-coolant nenombolo yohlelo. Amathuluzi Ithebhu ethi Amathuluzi iqukethe umtapo: ama-end mill athambile, abhola nama-bull nose, amadrill, amamilling e-chamfer namamilling obuso, ngalinye linenombolo ye-T, ububanzi, ama-flute nobude be-flute (kanye ne-corner radius, i-point noma i-chamfer angle lapho zisebenza khona). Amathuluzi ami angalondolozwa esiphequluli futhi ahanjiswe phakathi kwamakhompyutha njengefayela: bona Umtapo wamathuluzi. Isivinini sespindle nokondla kuvela ezintweni: n = 1000 × isivinini sokusika / (π × ububanzi), ukondla = n × ama-flute × i-chip load (ama-drill: n × ukondla ngokuzungeza). Lezi yizinombolo ezilondekile zokuqala ezivela emikhawulweni ebhaliwe, hhayi ezilungiselelwe umshini wakho; thayipha isivinini sokusika, i-chip load, i-rpm noma ukondla okusuka kumenzi wethuluzi lakho ukuze ukushintshe. Lapho isivinini sedlula okukhulu komshini kuyabanjwa lapho futhi ukondla kulandela, kugcinwa i-chip load. Engeza imisebenzi Iqhosha ngalinye ethuluzini lengeza umsebenzi, futhi lapho kudingeka ijiyometri, liyaqala ukukhetha: chofoza ubuso noma imiphetho embonweni (chofoza futhi ukuze wehlise elinye), bese Done picking noma Esc. Umsebenzi Khetha Yenzani Face lutho Izindlela ze-zig-zag phezu kwesitoko sonke, ngaphesheya kwemiphetho yaso, ziye kophezulu womodeli Pocket ubuso obusicaba bomgodi, umgodi ongaphansi, noma ushintsho oluvaliwe lwemiphetho Ihlanza indawo ngokudlula kwe-offset ngaphakathi-ngaphandle, ekunyuseni ngakunye kwe-step-down; izihlahla (ubuso obuma phezulu ngaphakathi kwesicaba) ziyashiywa; isicaba esivulekile ngokuzungezile (akukho okuphakeme ngaphandle kwaso) siyahlanzwa kuze kufike emphethelweni wesitoko Adaptive okufanayo ne-Pocket Ihlanza indawo efanayo ngezindlela ezisika ububanzi obuthile ngakunye (Engagement, ingxenye yobubanzi), ukuze ithuluzi lingalokothi lithathe isikhala esigcwele ububanzi, ngisho emakhoneni; lingena ngohelikhi bese liqeda izindonga ngakunye kwezinga. Ukusika okuncane kuvumela i-step-down ejulile nokondla okukhulu Contour ubuso obusicaba (umbonakalo wabo), ubuso obuzungezile, noma imiphetho Iland'umbonakalo ofakwe ngobubanzi bethuluzi, ngaphandle noma ngaphakathi, nama-arc okungena nokuphuma nama-tab ongakhetha kuwo Drill izimbobo (chofoza udonga lwembobo noma umphetho wayo) Ibhoboza imbobo ngayinye ngomjikelezo oqinile: peck (G83), drill (G81) noma chip break (G73); noma nikeza ububanzi ukuze ubhobozele zonke izimbobo zalobo bubanzi Chamfer umbonakalo wobuso noma imiphetho Ihambisa i-chamfer mill emphethelweni ukuze isike ububanzi obusethiwe Parallel lutho (imodeli yonke) Ukuqedwa nge-3D ngemigqa enxande ngayo yonke i-engeli, ilandela umphezulu ngebhola, i-bull-nose noma i-end mill esicaba. Bona Ukuqedwa nge-3D Scallop lutho (imodeli yonke) Ukuqedwa nge-3D ngamapasi ahlukaniswe ngebanga elithile phezu komphezulu, ukuze igquma eliphakathi kwawo libe nokuphakama oyikhethayo Khetha umsebenzi kuhlu ukuze ushintshe ithuluzi walo, izinga lokuphakama (ukuhlukanisa, ukubuyela, izinga lokondla, phezulu, phansi), i-step-down, i-stepover, isitoko esizoshiya, ipasi lokuqeda, ukungena (uhelikhi, iramp noma plunge), ukugaya ngokukhwela, ama-tab noma umjikelezo. Up no Down zihlela kabusha, Suppress iyishiya ngaphandle, Delete iyasusa. Konke kusemlandweni wokuhlehla futhi kulondolozwa efayelini lengxenye. Ubuso be-stepover ye-pocket bungaba ngaphansi kwesigamu sobubanzi bethuluzi, ukuze wonke amaphuzu esicaba aseduze nekhulu lethuluzi elilodwa lendlela. Amakhona angaphakathi agcina umsakazo wethuluzi. Ukuhlanza okuguquguqukayo kugcina ukungena kwe-cutter iseduze nenani elilodwa. Ukungena okungu-0.15 kobubanzi kuyi-engeli yokungena engaba ngu-46°: indilinga yomphetho wecutter ezintweni. I-offset pocket, ngokuphambene, isika ububanzi obugcwele ekudlulweni kwayo kokuqala futhi ibhinca kakhulu emakhoneni angaphakathi ngamunye. Phakathi kwamapasi ithuluzi lihlala lingene lapho lidlula emoyeni osikiwe, bese liyaphakama liphinde lehle emoyeni osikiwe kwezinye izindawo. Amapasi asetshenziswa kugridi ebucayi phezu kwesifunda (amaseli acishe abe yi-twelfth yomsakazo wethuluzi), ngakho ukungena kungadlula kancane kancane amaseli amabili obubanzi obusetshenzisiwe; izindonga ziqedwa ngokunembile. Indawo evulekile ekhulu yenza uhlelo olude olunemigqa emifushane eminingi. Lingisa Izindlela zethuluzi zenziwa futhi ngemva kokushintsha ngakunye (nengxenye yakho). Simulate futhi ibonisa isitoko esisele ngemva kwawo wonke uhlelo. Iphaneli ibonisa: Isikhathi sokusebenza: izinyathelo zokondla zihamba ngokondla kwazo, izinyathelo ezisheshayo zingamamugqa aqondile ngezinga lokuhamba ngokushesha kusethingi, kanye nesikhathi sokushintsha ithuluzi. Imishini yangempela iyashesha, ngakho ithatha isikhathi eside. Ukugawuka: izindawo lapho ithuluzi lehla khona ngaphezu kuka-0.02 mm ngaphansi kobuso bengxenye. Imikhomba ebomvu iyawakhombisa embonweni. Isitoko esisele engxenyeni. Isitoko siyimephu yokuphakama yophezulu (Z-map), ngakho asikwazi ukubonisa ukugoba okungaphansi. Hudula i-Playback ukuze uhambise ithuluzi uhlelo lwonke. Embonweni, izinyathelo zokondla zimile, nezinyathelo ezisheshayo zimile ngemigqa, kube nombala owodwa ngokusebenza ngakunye. Uma i-Show the simulated stock ivuliwe, isitoko sinombala ngokumelene nemodeli, iseli ngeseli: luhlaza lapho sikhona emodelini (phakathi kuka-0.02 mm), kubomvu lapho ithuluzi lisike emodelini, futhi lapho kusele isitoko emodelini kwesasawu ngesikhumba esincane, kuwolintshi ngokwengeziwe, kuguquke kube kwegrey yesitoko esingasikiwe ku-1 mm noma ngaphezulu. Imibala yenziwa futhi ngalo lonke ushintsho, ngemephu yokuphakama efanayo nezinombolo ephaneli, ngakho okuluhlaza nokubomvu kuvumelana nomugqa wokugawuka. Ishintshi lisika emodelini ngamabomu futhi libonisa okubomvu emaphethelweni alo. Post i-G-code Khetha umlawuli ngaphansi kwe-Post bese ucindezela Download G-code (noma Post kwibha yamathuluzi): Umlawuli Ifayela Amanothi Fanuc-style ISO .nc %, inombolo ye-O, izinombolo zomugqa, T M6 nge-G43 H, imijikelezo eqinile GRBL .nc Akukho umshintshi wethuluzi noma imijikelezo eqinile: ukushintsha kwethuluzi kuma nge-M0, ukubhoboza kubhalwa njengezinyathelo ezilula LinuxCNC .ngc T M6 nge-G43 H, imijikelezo eqinile, M2 Fanuc-style lathe .nc Ezinhlelweni zokuthenda: X njengobubanzi, ukondla ngokuzungeza, G96 ngaphansi komkhawulo we-G50, ukuthungwa kwe-G32 LinuxCNC lathe .ngc Ezinhlelweni zokuthenda: ububanzi be-G7, G95, G96, ukuthungwa kwe-G33; ayibhali inyathelo lokubuyela ekhaya Okwakho noma yini I-post oyibhaliyo noma oyishintshile: Edit post…, New post…, Import post file… Wonke amafayela aqala ngamakhomenti ohlelo, isitoko, ukushintshwa komsebenzi namathuluzi. Izindlela zisemamilimitha ngamanani angu-3 amasentimitha. Toolpath CSV no Toolpath JSON zihambisa izinyathelo ngokwazo. Hlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala. Ama-post amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi ayizisekelo ezilandela imiyalo ebhalwe yomlawuli; awazange afakazelwe emshinini othile. I-post oyishintshile iyeyakho ukuyifakazela. Indlela yokubhala enye: Ama-post processor. I-G-code yesitolo ye-Exact STEP Ngaphansi kwamaqhosha e-G-code ethebhini le-Operations, Exact STEP (work coordinates) ilanda \u003Cingxenye\u003E-work.step: ingxenye njengesolidi eqondile (izinsimbi zangempela zemibhobo nezigidi, nezindilinga zangempela zamaphethelo awo) nemvelaphi yayo ku-work origin yalo setup kanye no-Z ngokuhamba nge-eksisi yethuluzi. Lezi yizixhumanisi ezisetshenziswa yi-G-code, ngakho umsebenzi we-CAM noma umhloli wesitolo ubeka imodeli ngokufanele nohlelo ngaphandle kokuyinyakazisa. Ifayela lingokwengxenye kuphela, hhayi isitoko noma izindlela zethuluzi. Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) ibhala isolidi efanayo endaweni yengxenye yayo (Z ephezulu): bona Ukuthumela ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF. Imikhawulo Ama-pocket, ama-contour, ukubhoboza namachamfer angama-2.5-eksisi. Izingxenye ezigobile zihlanzwa futhi ziqedwe nge-3D yimisebenzi yazo (Ukuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele, Ukuqedwa nge-3D). I-adaptive clearing iyi-2D (izisekelo ezisicaba). Amathuluzi athambekile, ukuqedwa kwe-5-eksisi nekwe-4th-axis, ukuthenda nokuhlola ziyakhona, ngakunye nemikhawulo yakho, futhi akukho lolu hlobo olusetshenziswe emshinini: bona Ukusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5, Ukuthenda no-Iprobhu. Amabanga nezinhlobo zamathuluzi akahlolwa ukuthi awabangani; isexwayiso sivela uma ukusika kujule kunobude be-flute. Ukondla nesivinini kungamanani okuqala. I-post ingombhalo ongawuhlela, kodwa iphethe kuphela ukubhalwa kwezinyathelo; ayikwazi ukushintsha indlela yethuluzi, ukungeza ama-eksisi noma ukwazi umshini wakho (Ama-post processor ibhala okungenzeki). Thumela uhlelo emshinini Ku-CadCraft Studio ku-desktop, nomshini osethwe ku-Studio, i-Send to a machine… ivela eduze kwe-Download G-code futhi ilayishe lolu hlelo oluphambili emshinini ongaku-netiweki yakho. Ayiqali ngaphakathi kwe-PartCraft: uqala emshinini lapho usucace khona. Kusiphequluli, iqhosha alibonakali (ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukufinyelela umshini kunethiwekhi yakho): landa uhlelo kunalokho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"drawing-pdf","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yenza umdwebo nemibono, isigaba kanye ne-GD&T","summary":"Vula ishidi lomdwebo, engeza isigaba nombono wemininingwane, beka ama-datum, izimpawu zefreyimu nezokuqeda ubuso, khetha usayizi weshidi, gcwalisa ibhokisi lesihloko namaguquko, bese uthumela leshidi njenge-PDF.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["ithebula lemigodi","izindawo zemigodi","amathegi","umdwebo","ishidi","usayizi weshidi","a4","a3","a2","a1","a0","ansi","ibhokisi lesihloko","ukuguqulwa","inombolo yomdwebo","impahla yokwakha","pdf","imibono","isigaba","umbono wemininingwane","gd&t","datum","ifreyimu yezici","ukubekezelela","indawo","ukuqedwa kobuso","ukuqina kobuso","ukuphrinta"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ishidi-lomdwebo","text":"Vula ishidi lomdwebo","level":2},{"id":"okusemshidini","text":"Okusemshidini","level":2},{"id":"khetha-usayizi-weshidi","text":"Khetha usayizi weshidi","level":2},{"id":"gcwalisa-ibhokisi-lesihloko","text":"Gcwalisa ibhokisi lesihloko","level":2},{"id":"engeza-ukuguqulwa","text":"Engeza ukuguqulwa","level":2},{"id":"engeza-umbono-wesigaba","text":"Engeza umbono wesigaba","level":2},{"id":"engeza-umbono-wemininingwane","text":"Engeza umbono wemininingwane","level":2},{"id":"engeza-ithebula-lemigodi","text":"Engeza ithebula lemigodi","level":2},{"id":"beka-izimpawu-ze-gd-t-nezokuqeda-ubuso","text":"Beka izimpawu ze-GD&T nezokuqeda ubuso","level":2},{"id":"idatamu","text":"Idatamu","level":3},{"id":"ifreyimu-yokulawula-isici","text":"Ifreyimu yokulawula isici","level":3},{"id":"ukuqeda-ubuso","text":"Ukuqeda ubuso","level":3},{"id":"thumela-i-pdf","text":"Thumela i-PDF","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2},{"id":"vumela-ishidi-lenze-lokho","text":"Vumela ishidi lenze lokho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yenza ishidi lomdwebo kusuka engxenyeni: imibono ephambili, ephezulu nesokudla ngeprojekshini yekona yesithathu, umbono we-isometric, usayizi jikelele nebhokisi lesihloko eshidini elisuka ku-A4 kuya ku-A0 noma ku-ANSI A kuya ku-E. Ngaphezu kwalokho ungangeza isigaba, umbono wemininingwane kanye nezimpawu ze-GD&amp;T. Ishidi liyavuselelwa lapho ingxenye ishintsha, nezilungiselelo zalo zigcinwa kufayela lengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ishidi-lomdwebo\"\u003EVula ishidi lomdwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYakha ingxenye. (Uma kungakakhiwa lutho: &quot;Yakha isolid kuqala, bese wenza umdwebo wayo.&quot;)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ye-3D ithathelwa indawo yishidi. Ibha yamathuluzi ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdatamu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfreyimu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqeda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E, nephaneli esokudla inesihloko \u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi indlela imibono eyenziwe ngayo: &quot;Umdwebo (amajika adwetshwa njengama-facet). Idatamu, Ifreyimu kanye Nokuqeda kubeka i-GD&amp;T embonweni; iphaneli isetha isigaba nombono wemininingwane.&quot; Imibono idwetshwa kusuka kuma-facet e-mesh kernel, ngakho imiphetho eyindilinga iba yimigqa emifushane eqondile; ama-arc eqondile adinga i-kernel eqondile, into lolu hlobo lolu alunayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZulazula eshidini: skrola ukuze usondeze, donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi ukuze ushelelise, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ulinganise ishidi. Lapho ishidi ligxile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisondeza, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nezinkinobho zomcibisholo zishelelisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (lapho kungekho okukhethiwe futhi nethuluzi lingasebenzi) ukuze ubuyele kumodeli ye-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusemshidini\"\u003EOkusemshidini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIshidi oliyikhethayo\u003C/strong\u003E, lelandiscape (i-A3 uma ungakhethi elinye), linomngcele nebhokisi lesihloko: isihloko, inkampani, inombolo yomdwebo, ukuguqulwa, impahla yokwakha, kudwetshwe / kuhlolwe / kugunyazwe ngu-, usuku, isikali, usayizi weshidi, &quot;Izinyunithi: amamilimitha · Ukuprojekta kwekona yesithathu&quot;, nokuthi imibono ichanekile noma inama-facet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhulokhi lokuguqulwa\u003C/strong\u003E esikhonkwaneni esingenhla kwesokudla uma usuwengezile ukuguqulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibono yangaphambili, yangaphezulu nesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E: umbono wangaphezulu ngaphezulu kombono wangaphambili, nowesokudla ngakwesokudla kwawo. Imigqa efihliwe idashiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono we-isometric\u003C/strong\u003E lapho kukhona indawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi jikelele\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi nobude embonweni wangaphambili, ukujula embonweni wangaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali esisodwa\u003C/strong\u003E semibono eyinhloko esuka kuthotho lwe-ISO (1:1, 1:2, 1:5 … 2:1, 5:1, 10:1), okukhethwa ukuze zilingane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-usayizi-weshidi\"\u003EKhetha usayizi weshidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEshidini lomdwebo, ngaphandle kokukhethwa kwanoma yini, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIshidi\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli esokudla: \u003Cstrong\u003EA4, A3, A2, A1, A0\u003C/strong\u003E (ISO 216) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EANSI A, B, C, D, E\u003C/strong\u003E (11 × 8.5 kuya ku-44 × 34 in). Imibono iyahlelwa kabusha ngesikali se-ISO esikhulu kakhulu esilingana, ngakho ishidi elikhulu lingabonisa ingxenye ikhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcwalisa-ibhokisi-lesihloko\"\u003EGcwalisa ibhokisi lesihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkambu ze-\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lesihloko\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli esokudla ziya ngqo eshidini: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsihloko\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInombolo yomdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuguqulwa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInkampani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdwetshwe ngu-\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIhlolwe ngu-\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgunyazwe ngu-\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsuku\u003C/span\u003E (unyaka-inyanga-usuku), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubekezelela okujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqeda\u003C/span\u003E (lezi ezimbili zishicilelwa ngaphezulu kwebhokisi lesihloko). Bhala ebhokisini bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze kwenye indawo. Ibhokisi elingenalutho lishiya iseli lalo lingenalutho, ngaphandle kwalezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsihloko\u003C/strong\u003E sibonisa igama lengxenye kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsuku\u003C/strong\u003E lubonisa usuku lwanamuhla kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuguqulwa\u003C/strong\u003E kubonisa ukuguqulwa okusha kakhulu kuhlu kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/strong\u003E ivela engxenyeni: chofoza esikhaleni esingenalutho kumodeli, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yengxenye. Impahla efanayo inika izici zobunzima ze-Measure ukuminyana kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ukuguqulwa\"\u003EEngeza ukuguqulwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuguqulwa\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukuguqulwa\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa ngamunye omusha uthatha inhlamvu elandelayo (A, B, C …; ngemva kwe-Z kuza i-AA) nosuku lwanamuhla. Bhala okushintshile nowenze ushintsho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E isusa umugqa. Ibhulokhi lokuguqulwa esikhonkwaneni esingenhla kwesokudla leshidi liwudrowa ohlwini, owadalwa kuqala, kuze kube ngu-20.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi weshidi, ibhokisi lesihloko, ukuguqulwa nempahla kugcinwa kufayela lengxenye, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-umbono-wesigaba\"\u003EEngeza umbono wesigaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye inqunywa indiza futhi ukusikeka kugedadiwe. Njengemibono yonke, isigaba sidwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet, ngakho imiphetho eyindilinga iba yimigqa emifushane eqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli esokudla, setha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba A-A\u003C/strong\u003E sibe \u003Cstrong\u003EEmbonweni wangaphambili\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEmbonweni wangaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EEmbonweni wesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsigaba sivela eshidini, sigedadiwe lapho ukusika kudlula ezintweni, nomugqa wokusika kanye nemicibisholo &quot;A&quot; embonweni okuthathwe kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ku (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uhambise indiza yokusika. Iqala iphakathi kwengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba A-A\u003C/strong\u003E sibe \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uyisuse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-umbono-wemininingwane\"\u003EEngeza umbono wemininingwane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EImininingwane B\u003C/strong\u003E embonweni okuzokhuliswa (noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lamathuluzi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza phakathi kwendawo okuzokhuliswa, embonweni lowo. Isiyingi esimakwe &quot;B&quot; siyachaza, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EImininingwane B\u003C/strong\u003E elikhuliwe livela eshidini ngesikali sayo, isibonelo &quot;Detail B (2:1)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EDetail radius (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ngosayizi wesiyingi kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EDetail scale\u003C/strong\u003E ngokukhula: 2, 4, 5 noma 10 × ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImininingwane ingathathwa emibonweni yangaphambili, yangaphezulu, yesokudla noma yesigaba, hhayi kumbono we-isometric. Uma kungekho ndawo yazo zonke imibono, iphaneli ithi &quot;No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ithebula-lemigodi\"\u003EEngeza ithebula lemigodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula lemigodi liluhlu lwemigodi yengxenye nezindawo zayo, ukuze kubholwe noma kwenziwe i-CNC: khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIthebula lemigodi\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EEmbonweni wangaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E (noma wangaphambili, noma wesokudla) ephaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke imigodi ebonakala ngokuqondile kulowo mbono ithola ithegi eseceleni kwayo: \u003Cstrong\u003EA1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EA2\u003C/strong\u003E … ngosayizi wokuqala, \u003Cstrong\u003EB1\u003C/strong\u003E … ngolandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthebula lidwetsha ithegi ngalinye, \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E ngamamilimitha, nosayizi wayo: &quot;Ø14 THRU&quot;, &quot;Ø6.6 × 10 DEEP&quot;, i-counterbore noma i-countersink, noma incazelo yezinga lomgodi othrediwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EX no-Y zilinganiswa kusukela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lomphambili wombono, okumakwe \u003Cstrong\u003EX0 Y0\u003C/strong\u003E eshidini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigodi eyenziwe ngamaphethini ifakiwe. Imigodi engakahlali ngokuqondile kumbono ibalwa ephaneli futhi ayifakwa ethebhulini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula liyabekwa endaweni engenalutho eshidini nakuPDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-izimpawu-ze-gd-t-nezokuqeda-ubuso\"\u003EBeka izimpawu ze-GD&amp;T nezokuqeda ubuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdatamu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfreyimu\u003C/span\u003E (ifreyimu yokulawula isici) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqeda\u003C/span\u003E (uphawu lokuqeda ubuso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphuzu embonweni lapho kufanele lihlanganiswe. Liyakhomba eyona mugqa edwetshiwe eseduze ngaphakathi kwe-2.5 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUphawu luvela linomugqa, likhethiwe, nephaneli esokudla ibonisa izilungiselelo zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula uphawu ukuze uhambise; umugqa uhlala endaweni yephoyinti. Ngophawu olukhethiwe, izinkinobho zomcibisholo zilihambisa ngo-1 mm. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli) iyasusa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayikhipha ekukhethweni. Konke kushintsha kuhlu lokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"idatamu\"\u003EIdatamu\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlamvu\u003C/strong\u003E: u-A kuya ku-Z, ngaphandle kwe-I, O no-Q (zifundeka njengo-1, 0 no-O). Idatamu ngalinye lithatha inhlamvu elandelayo engasetshenziswanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ifreyimu-yokulawula-isici\"\u003EIfreyimu yokulawula isici\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukhethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETolerance\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStraightness, Flatness, Circularity, Cylindricity, Profile of a line, Profile of a surface, Perpendicularity, Angularity, Parallelism, Position, Concentricity and Symmetry (kokubili kususiwe ku-Y14.5-2018, kumakwe njalo), Circular runout, Total runout\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZone (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lokubekezelela, okuzenzakalelayo 0.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter zone (⌀)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzici ezinendawo esilindrikhalini; ivulekile ngokuzenzakalela ku-Position\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERFS (akukho), MMC (Ⓜ), LMC (Ⓛ), lapho isici sivumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrimary / Secondary / Tertiary datum\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKufika kuma-datum amathathu ayinhlamvu, ngayinye nge-\u003Cstrong\u003E… modifier\u003C/strong\u003E (MMB, LMB) lapho livunyelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ihlola ifreyimu ngemithetho ye-ASME Y14.5 futhi itshela okungalungile phezulu kwephaneli, isibonelo &quot;Flatness is a form tolerance: it takes no datum references.&quot; noma &quot;Position needs at least one datum reference.&quot; Umugqa othi \u003Cstrong\u003EIfundwa\u003C/strong\u003E uchaza ifreyimu ngamagama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuqeda-ubuso\"\u003EUkuqeda ubuso\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukhethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERa (µm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqina okuphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProcess\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enoma yiyiphi inqubo, ukucutshungulwa, akukho impahla esusiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukucutshungulwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENote\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuya kumabhoksi angu-40, njengolayini noma inqubo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kokukhethwa, iphaneli ibala \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinothi eshidini\u003C/strong\u003E, nganye no \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-i-pdf\"\u003EThumela i-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lamathuluzi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E kumodeli. I-PDF iyalandelwa njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part name&gt; - drawing.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, nebha yesimo ibala okuqukethwe kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhrinta ngo-&quot;Usayizi wangempela&quot; ephepheni losayizi weshidi ukuze isikali sihlale siqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ngaphandle kwezinhlobo ezintathu zosayizi jikelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZengeze ku-PDF ngohlelo lokumaka, noma thumela isikethi noma ubuso njenge-DXF bese ulinganisa kuhlelo lwe-2D CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwesigaba noma imininingwane eyodwa; imibono ehlukaniswe, engeziwe nephrojektiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIprojekshini yekona yokuqala, imibono ehambayo, amashidi aphakanyisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkona yesithathu, ukuhlelwa okuzenzakalelayo, ububanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinothi zombhalo ongakhethiwe nethebula eshidini (ngaphandle kwamabhokisi esihloko nokuguqulwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa inothi lokuqeda, noma engeza umbhalo ku-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo yamahlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwesethi yaseNtshonalanga Yurophu zishicilelwa njenge &quot;?&quot; (i-PDF isebenzisa i-Helvetica yomfundi). Izimpawu ze-GD&amp;T zidwetshwa njengemigqa, ngakho ziphrintwa kunoma yimuphi umfundi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vumela-ishidi-lenze-lokho\"\u003EVumela ishidi lenze lokho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIshidi › Okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E likhetha iphepha ngawe: isikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esiphansi noma esilingana no-1:1, ishidi elincane kakhulu le-A elibamba imibono kulesi sikali (uhlu lukhombisa okukhethiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa imigodi\u003C/strong\u003E lilinganisa imigodi embonweni obona kakhulu kuyo ngokuqondile: uphawu lwesikhungo kwelinye ngalinye, isiyingi esisodwa ngosayizi (&quot;2× Ø6 THRU&quot; nomugqa wokukhomba), nezindawo zazo ezilinganiswa kusukela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lombono. Ububanzi, ubude nokujula jikelele kuhlala kukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft yenza ishidi lomdwebo kusuka engxenyeni: imibono ephambili, ephezulu nesokudla ngeprojekshini yekona yesithathu, umbono we-isometric, usayizi jikelele nebhokisi lesihloko eshidini elisuka ku-A4 kuya ku-A0 noma ku-ANSI A kuya ku-E. Ngaphezu kwalokho ungangeza isigaba, umbono wemininingwane kanye nezimpawu ze-GD&T. Ishidi liyavuselelwa lapho ingxenye ishintsha, nezilungiselelo zalo zigcinwa kufayela lengxenye. Vula ishidi lomdwebo Yakha ingxenye. (Uma kungakakhiwa lutho: \"Yakha isolid kuqala, bese wenza umdwebo wayo.\") Khetha Umdwebo ebhalweni lamathuluzi. Imodeli ye-3D ithathelwa indawo yishidi. Ibha yamathuluzi ibonisa Idatamu, Ifreyimu, Ukuqeda, Imininingwane, PDF no Emuva, nephaneli esokudla inesihloko Umdwebo. Ibha yesimo ithi indlela imibono eyenziwe ngayo: \"Umdwebo (amajika adwetshwa njengama-facet). Idatamu, Ifreyimu kanye Nokuqeda kubeka i-GD&T embonweni; iphaneli isetha isigaba nombono wemininingwane.\" Imibono idwetshwa kusuka kuma-facet e-mesh kernel, ngakho imiphetho eyindilinga iba yimigqa emifushane eqondile; ama-arc eqondile adinga i-kernel eqondile, into lolu hlobo lolu alunayo. Zulazula eshidini: skrola ukuze usondeze, donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi ukuze ushelelise, cindezela F ukuze ulinganise ishidi. Lapho ishidi ligxile, + no − zisondeza, futhi Shift kanye nezinkinobho zomcibisholo zishelelisa. Khetha Emuva, Buyela kumodeli noma cindezela Esc (lapho kungekho okukhethiwe futhi nethuluzi lingasebenzi) ukuze ubuyele kumodeli ye-3D. Okusemshidini Ishidi oliyikhethayo, lelandiscape (i-A3 uma ungakhethi elinye), linomngcele nebhokisi lesihloko: isihloko, inkampani, inombolo yomdwebo, ukuguqulwa, impahla yokwakha, kudwetshwe / kuhlolwe / kugunyazwe ngu-, usuku, isikali, usayizi weshidi, \"Izinyunithi: amamilimitha · Ukuprojekta kwekona yesithathu\", nokuthi imibono ichanekile noma inama-facet. Ibhulokhi lokuguqulwa esikhonkwaneni esingenhla kwesokudla uma usuwengezile ukuguqulwa. Imibono yangaphambili, yangaphezulu nesokudla: umbono wangaphezulu ngaphezulu kombono wangaphambili, nowesokudla ngakwesokudla kwawo. Imigqa efihliwe idashiwe. Umbono we-isometric lapho kukhona indawo. Usayizi jikelele: ububanzi nobude embonweni wangaphambili, ukujula embonweni wangaphezulu. Isikali esisodwa semibono eyinhloko esuka kuthotho lwe-ISO (1:1, 1:2, 1:5 … 2:1, 5:1, 10:1), okukhethwa ukuze zilingane. Khetha usayizi weshidi Eshidini lomdwebo, ngaphandle kokukhethwa kwanoma yini, khetha Ishidi ephaneli esokudla: A4, A3, A2, A1, A0 (ISO 216) noma ANSI A, B, C, D, E (11 × 8.5 kuya ku-44 × 34 in). Imibono iyahlelwa kabusha ngesikali se-ISO esikhulu kakhulu esilingana, ngakho ishidi elikhulu lingabonisa ingxenye ikhulu. Gcwalisa ibhokisi lesihloko Izinkambu ze-Ibhokisi lesihloko ephaneli esokudla ziya ngqo eshidini: Isihloko, Inombolo yomdwebo, Ukuguqulwa, Inkampani, Idwetshwe ngu-, Ihlolwe ngu-, Igunyazwe ngu-, Usuku (unyaka-inyanga-usuku), Ukubekezelela okujwayelekile kanye Ukuqeda (lezi ezimbili zishicilelwa ngaphezulu kwebhokisi lesihloko). Bhala ebhokisini bese ucindezela Enter noma uchofoze kwenye indawo. Ibhokisi elingenalutho lishiya iseli lalo lingenalutho, ngaphandle kwalezi: Isihloko sibonisa igama lengxenye kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye. Usuku lubonisa usuku lwanamuhla kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye. Ukuguqulwa kubonisa ukuguqulwa okusha kakhulu kuhlu kuze kube yilapho ubhala elinye. Impahla yokwakha ivela engxenyeni: chofoza esikhaleni esingenalutho kumodeli, bese ukhetha Impahla yokwakha ephaneli yengxenye. Impahla efanayo inika izici zobunzima ze-Measure ukuminyana kwayo. Engeza ukuguqulwa Ngaphansi kwe-Ukuguqulwa, chofoza Engeza ukuguqulwa. Umugqa ngamunye omusha uthatha inhlamvu elandelayo (A, B, C …; ngemva kwe-Z kuza i-AA) nosuku lwanamuhla. Bhala okushintshile nowenze ushintsho. Susa isusa umugqa. Ibhulokhi lokuguqulwa esikhonkwaneni esingenhla kwesokudla leshidi liwudrowa ohlwini, owadalwa kuqala, kuze kube ngu-20. Usayizi weshidi, ibhokisi lesihloko, ukuguqulwa nempahla kugcinwa kufayela lengxenye, futhi noshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Engeza umbono wesigaba Ingxenye inqunywa indiza futhi ukusikeka kugedadiwe. Njengemibono yonke, isigaba sidwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet, ngakho imiphetho eyindilinga iba yimigqa emifushane eqondile. Ephaneli esokudla, setha Isigaba A-A sibe Embonweni wangaphambili, Embonweni wangaphezulu noma Embonweni wesokudla. Isigaba sivela eshidini, sigedadiwe lapho ukusika kudlula ezintweni, nomugqa wokusika kanye nemicibisholo \"A\" embonweni okuthathwe kuwo. Setha Sika ku (mm) ukuze uhambise indiza yokusika. Iqala iphakathi kwengxenye. Setha Isigaba A-A sibe Akukho ukuze uyisuse. Engeza umbono wemininingwane Setha Imininingwane B embonweni okuzokhuliswa (noma khetha Imininingwane ebhalweni lamathuluzi). Chofoza phakathi kwendawo okuzokhuliswa, embonweni lowo. Isiyingi esimakwe \"B\" siyachaza, futhi Imininingwane B elikhuliwe livela eshidini ngesikali sayo, isibonelo \"Detail B (2:1)\". Setha Detail radius (mm) ngosayizi wesiyingi kanye Detail scale ngokukhula: 2, 4, 5 noma 10 × ishidi. Imininingwane ingathathwa emibonweni yangaphambili, yangaphezulu, yesokudla noma yesigaba, hhayi kumbono we-isometric. Uma kungekho ndawo yazo zonke imibono, iphaneli ithi \"No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.\" Engeza ithebula lemigodi Ithebula lemigodi liluhlu lwemigodi yengxenye nezindawo zayo, ukuze kubholwe noma kwenziwe i-CNC: khetha Ithebula lemigodi › Embonweni wangaphezulu (noma wangaphambili, noma wesokudla) ephaneli. Yonke imigodi ebonakala ngokuqondile kulowo mbono ithola ithegi eseceleni kwayo: A1, A2 … ngosayizi wokuqala, B1 … ngolandelayo. Ithebula lidwetsha ithegi ngalinye, X no Y ngamamilimitha, nosayizi wayo: \"Ø14 THRU\", \"Ø6.6 × 10 DEEP\", i-counterbore noma i-countersink, noma incazelo yezinga lomgodi othrediwe. X no-Y zilinganiswa kusukela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lomphambili wombono, okumakwe X0 Y0 eshidini. Imigodi eyenziwe ngamaphethini ifakiwe. Imigodi engakahlali ngokuqondile kumbono ibalwa ephaneli futhi ayifakwa ethebhulini. Ithebula liyabekwa endaweni engenalutho eshidini nakuPDF. Beka izimpawu ze-GD&T nezokuqeda ubuso Khetha Idatamu, Ifreyimu (ifreyimu yokulawula isici) noma Ukuqeda (uphawu lokuqeda ubuso). Chofoza iphuzu embonweni lapho kufanele lihlanganiswe. Liyakhomba eyona mugqa edwetshiwe eseduze ngaphakathi kwe-2.5 mm. Uphawu luvela linomugqa, likhethiwe, nephaneli esokudla ibonisa izilungiselelo zalo. Hudula uphawu ukuze uhambise; umugqa uhlala endaweni yephoyinti. Ngophawu olukhethiwe, izinkinobho zomcibisholo zilihambisa ngo-1 mm. Delete noma Backspace (noma Susa ephaneli) iyasusa; Kuqediwe noma Esc iyayikhipha ekukhethweni. Konke kushintsha kuhlu lokuhlehlisa. Idatamu Inhlamvu: u-A kuya ku-Z, ngaphandle kwe-I, O no-Q (zifundeka njengo-1, 0 no-O). Idatamu ngalinye lithatha inhlamvu elandelayo engasetshenziswanga. Ifreyimu yokulawula isici Izilungiselelo Okukhethwayo Tolerance Straightness, Flatness, Circularity, Cylindricity, Profile of a line, Profile of a surface, Perpendicularity, Angularity, Parallelism, Position, Concentricity and Symmetry (kokubili kususiwe ku-Y14.5-2018, kumakwe njalo), Circular runout, Total runout Zone (mm) Inani lokubekezelela, okuzenzakalelayo 0.1 Diameter zone (⌀) Ezici ezinendawo esilindrikhalini; ivulekile ngokuzenzakalela ku-Position Material RFS (akukho), MMC (Ⓜ), LMC (Ⓛ), lapho isici sivumela Primary / Secondary / Tertiary datum Kufika kuma-datum amathathu ayinhlamvu, ngayinye nge-… modifier (MMB, LMB) lapho livunyelwe I-PartCraft ihlola ifreyimu ngemithetho ye-ASME Y14.5 futhi itshela okungalungile phezulu kwephaneli, isibonelo \"Flatness is a form tolerance: it takes no datum references.\" noma \"Position needs at least one datum reference.\" Umugqa othi Ifundwa uchaza ifreyimu ngamagama. Ukuqeda ubuso Izilungiselelo Okukhethwayo Okuzenzakalelayo Ra (µm) Ukuqina okuphakathi 1.6 Process noma yiyiphi inqubo, ukucutshungulwa, akukho impahla esusiwe ukucutshungulwa Note Kuya kumabhoksi angu-40, njengolayini noma inqubo Ngaphandle kokukhethwa, iphaneli ibala Izinothi eshidini, nganye no Khetha. Thumela i-PDF Khetha PDF ebhalweni lamathuluzi, Thumela i-PDF ephaneli, noma Thumela, bese Umdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&T kumodeli. I-PDF iyalandelwa njenge-\u003Cpart name\u003E - drawing.pdf, nebha yesimo ibala okuqukethwe kuyo. Phrinta ngo-\"Usayizi wangempela\" ephepheni losayizi weshidi ukuze isikali sihlale siqondile. Imikhawulo Akukakwakhiwa Yenza lokhu namuhla Izilinganiso ngaphandle kwezinhlobo ezintathu zosayizi jikelele Zengeze ku-PDF ngohlelo lokumaka, noma thumela isikethi noma ubuso njenge-DXF bese ulinganisa kuhlelo lwe-2D CAD Ngaphezu kwesigaba noma imininingwane eyodwa; imibono ehlukaniswe, engeziwe nephrojektiwe Akutholakali Iprojekshini yekona yokuqala, imibono ehambayo, amashidi aphakanyisiwe Ikona yesithathu, ukuhlelwa okuzenzakalelayo, ububanzi Izinothi zombhalo ongakhethiwe nethebula eshidini (ngaphandle kwamabhokisi esihloko nokuguqulwa) Sebenzisa inothi lokuqeda, noma engeza umbhalo ku-PDF Imidwebo yamahlanganisela Akutholakali Izinhlamvu ezingaphandle kwesethi yaseNtshonalanga Yurophu zishicilelwa njenge \"?\" (i-PDF isebenzisa i-Helvetica yomfundi). Izimpawu ze-GD&T zidwetshwa njengemigqa, ngakho ziphrintwa kunoma yimuphi umfundi. Vumela ishidi lenze lokho Ishidi › Okuzenzakalelayo likhetha iphepha ngawe: isikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esiphansi noma esilingana no-1:1, ishidi elincane kakhulu le-A elibamba imibono kulesi sikali (uhlu lukhombisa okukhethiwe). Linganisa imigodi lilinganisa imigodi embonweni obona kakhulu kuyo ngokuqondile: uphawu lwesikhungo kwelinye ngalinye, isiyingi esisodwa ngosayizi (\"2× Ø6 THRU\" nomugqa wokukhomba), nezindawo zazo ezilinganiswa kusukela ekhoneni elingezansi kwesobunxele lombono. Ububanzi, ubude nokujula jikelele kuhlala kukhona.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"post-processors","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ama-post processor ongawahlela","summary":"I-post iyifayela lombhalo elifushane elishintsha indlela yethuluzi ibe yi-G-code yomlawuli wakho. Kopisha enye yama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi, shintsha imigqa oyidingayo (izinombolo zemigqa, ukushintsha kwethuluzi, izinyathelo zokubuyela ekhaya, ikhodi yokuphetha), bona i-G-code ebhalwayo njengoba uthayipha, bese uyigcina ngengxenye.","section":"tasks","order":141,"keywords":["post","post processor","postprocessor","G-code","NC","GRBL","LinuxCNC","hlela i-post","post engokwezifiso","cpost","ukushintsha kwethuluzi","M6","G43","umjikelezo oqinile","izinombolo zemigqa","modal","umcimbi","okuguquguqukayo"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-eyakho","text":"Yenza eyakho","level":2},{"id":"ibukeka-kanjani-i-post","text":"Ibukeka kanjani i-post","level":2},{"id":"izehlakalo","text":"Izehlakalo","level":2},{"id":"izitatimende","text":"Izitatimende","level":2},{"id":"okungenziwa-yi-post","text":"Okungenziwa yi-post","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIndlela efanayo yethuluzi kumele ibhalwe ngokwehlukile kubalawuli abehlukene: izinombolo zemigqa noma ezingekho, \u003Ccode\u003EM6\u003C/code\u003E noma ukuma, \u003Ccode\u003EG28\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EG53\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM30\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EM2\u003C/code\u003E. I-\u003Cstrong\u003Epost\u003C/strong\u003E ngumbhalo omfushane otshela ukuthi kanjani. Ama-post amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi e-PartCraft (i-Fanuc-style, i-GRBL ne-LinuxCNC) abhalwe kule fomethi, ngakho i-post yakho ingaqala njengekhophi yenye yazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala. Ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi abhala kanye lokho abekubhala ngaphambi kwalesi fomethi (izivivinyo zifanisa okuphumayo kwazo ngokuthi biti ngebhithi ezinhlelweni eziningi), kodwa lutho lapha lufakazelwe emshinini wakho, futhi i-post oyishintshile iyeyakho ukuyifakazela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-eyakho\"\u003EYenza eyakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Manufacture, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPost\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit post…\u003C/span\u003E ku-control akhelwe ngaphakathi ivula \u003Cstrong\u003Eikhophi yakho\u003C/strong\u003E yayo. Kwepost yakho ivula leyo post.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew post…\u003C/span\u003E iqala kusuka ku-post emhlophe esincane enazo zonke izehlakalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport post file…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ifayela lombhalo le-\u003Ccode\u003E.cpost\u003C/code\u003E (ifayela oliphuthayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESave as a file…\u003C/strong\u003E kumhleli).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmhleli ubonisa umbhalo, umugqa otshela ukuthi uyafundeka yini (nokuthi yiluphi umugqa ongalungile), kanye ne-G-code ebhalwa yi-post njengoba uthayipha. \u003Cstrong\u003EPreview with\u003C/strong\u003E ikhetha uhlelo oluncane lwesampula elisebenzisa zonke izehlakalo, noma uhlelo lwalesi ngxenye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E igcina i-post efayelini lengxenye (ama-post angu-20 kuwo) futhi iyikhethe njengomlawuli. Ama-post ahamba nengxenye; ukuze uyisebenzise kwenye ingxenye, yigcine njengefayela bese uyingenisa lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibukeka-kanjani-i-post\"\u003EIbukeka kanjani i-post\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epost mymill\nname Umshini wami (.nc)\nextension nc\nline-numbers off\ndecimal-point no\ncanned-cycles no\nmodal motion G0 G1 G2 G3\n\non start\n  comment Uhlelo {program}: {name}\n  emit G21 G90 G17\nend\n\non tool-change\n  emit T{tool.number} M6\nend\n\non rapid\n  if moved\n    emit G0~ X{x}~ Y{y}~ Z{z}~\n  end\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa eqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003E//\u003C/code\u003E nemigqa ethe xaxa iyashaywa. Ekuqaleni kuza izilungiselelo; bese kukhona ibhoku elilodwa le-\u003Ccode\u003Eon &lt;event&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ngalinye, eliphethwe nge-\u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E. Isehlakalo ososuke ukusishiyile ayibhali lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkusetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epost &lt;id&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-id ye-post: izinhlamvu, izinombolo, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename &lt;text&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELokho uhlu lwe-Control olukhombisayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eextension &lt;ext&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsandiso sefayela: nc, ngc, tap …\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eline-numbers 10\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eoff\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EN20\u003C/code\u003E … kulo lonke umugqa we-\u003Ccode\u003Eemit\u003C/code\u003E, noma akukho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edecimal-point yes\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10.\u003C/code\u003E esikhundleni se-\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E (amakhomenti kawakaze agcine ichashazi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecanned-cycles yes\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E: izimbobo zibhalwa njengezinyathelo ze-G0/G1 ezimelelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodal &lt;group&gt; &lt;words&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagama eqembu (\u003Ccode\u003Emodal motion G0 G1 G2 G3\u003C/code\u003E) abhalwa kuphela lapho eshintsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izehlakalo\"\u003EIzehlakalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZisebenza ngalolu hlelo lohlelo: \u003Ccode\u003Estart\u003C/code\u003E; bese ngomsebenzi ngamunye \u003Ccode\u003Eoperation\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool-change\u003C/code\u003E (lapho ithuluzi lishintsha), \u003Ccode\u003Espindle\u003C/code\u003E (lapho isivinini sishintsha), \u003Ccode\u003Eapproach\u003C/code\u003E (ukunyuka kuya ekuqaleni kokuqala, ngaphambi kwe-rapid yokuqala), \u003Ccode\u003Ecoolant-on\u003C/code\u003E, bese izinyathelo zawo njenge-\u003Ccode\u003Erapid\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Earc\u003C/code\u003E, nomjikelezo ngamunye oqinile njenge-\u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-start\u003C/code\u003E, i-\u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-hole\u003C/code\u003E ngembobo ngayinye kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-end\u003C/code\u003E; ekugcineni \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzehlakalo eziningi, zamaeksisi angaphezu kwamathathu (i-post engenayo lezi yenqaba uhlelo oluthile futhi ibhale igama lesehlakalo elingelo):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsehlakalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuguquguqukayo kwaso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eindex\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphambi komsebenzi okungahluki isiqondiso sawo sethuluzi kuleso sokugcina, nangaphambi komsebenzi wokuqala emshinini onama-eksisi azungezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erot.a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.c\u003C/code\u003E (izikhundla okufanele ziye kuzo; zingenalutho ye-eksisi umshini ongenayo), \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.z\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erapid-rotary\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed-rotary\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinyathelo zomsebenzi lapho ama-eksisi azungezayo ahamba ngenkathi isika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.c\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.moved\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einverse\u003C/code\u003E (yebo lapho ukondla kufanele kube kwesikhathi esiphambene), \u003Ccode\u003Einvf\u003C/code\u003E (1/iminithi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erotary-end\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgemva komsebenzi onjalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-move\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInyathelo elime lapho iprobhu iqeda ukuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.n\u003C/code\u003E (1 kuya ku-4), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.axis\u003C/code\u003E (x, y noma z), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.k\u003C/code\u003E (1, 2 noma 3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-set\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgemva kokuthintwa kwemijikelezo eyodwa yokuhlola\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.kind\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;z&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;x&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;y&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Ecentre\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.action\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eset\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Emeasure\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.expect\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.cx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.cy\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ethread\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInyathelo lokuthunga emshinini wokuthenda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ethread.lead\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuthi kuwo wonke umcimbi: \u003Ccode\u003Ekin\u003C/code\u003E (none, a, b, ac, bc), \u003Ccode\u003Erotary\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Etcp\u003C/code\u003E (yebo noma cha, kumshini kuSetup), \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eop.tilt\u003C/code\u003E nomsebenzi \u003Ccode\u003Eop.turn\u003C/code\u003E, nasemshinini wokuthenda \u003Ccode\u003Espin.mode\u003C/code\u003E (css noma rpm), \u003Ccode\u003Espin.css\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Espin.max\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003Etool.nose\u003C/code\u003E. Igama lamagama elinenani elingenalutho, njenge-\u003Ccode\u003EA{rot.a}\u003C/code\u003E emshinini ongenayo i-eksisi ye-A, liyashiywa emugqeni. Qhathanisa ne-x, y no-z njengombhalo phakathi kwezinkomba (\u003Ccode\u003Eif probe.kind == &quot;z&quot;\u003C/code\u003E): ngaphandle kwazo, ziyizinombolo zokunyakaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa emibili engaphezulu kwe-post eyenza ibe yi-post yomshini wokuthenda: \u003Ccode\u003Emachine lathe\u003C/code\u003E (bese ibhala u-X no-Z kuphela futhi yenqaba izindlela zokugaya njengoba i-post yokugaya yenqaba izindlela zokuthenda) ne-\u003Ccode\u003Elathe-x diameter\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Elathe-x radius\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsehlakalo ngasinye singasebenzisa okuguquguqukayo kohlobo lwaso lokuhamba, kubhalwe \u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E: uhlelo (\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprogram\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.axis\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.origin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.coolant\u003C/code\u003E), isitoko (\u003Ccode\u003Estock.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sy\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.minx\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Estock.maxz\u003C/code\u003E), ithuluzi (\u003Ccode\u003Etool.number\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.desc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.flutes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.fluteLen\u003C/code\u003E), umsebenzi (\u003Ccode\u003Eop.name\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eop.type\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Erpm\u003C/code\u003E, indawo yokuhamba (\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, ne-\u003Ccode\u003Emoved\u003C/code\u003E: true uma i-eksisi yodwa iguqukile), ama-arc (\u003Ccode\u003Earc.g\u003C/code\u003E 2 noma 3, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.i\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.j\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.cx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.cy\u003C/code\u003E) nemigodi (\u003Ccode\u003Ehole.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.r\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.q\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.return\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.first\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle.init\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed\u003C/code\u003E). Uhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEvents and variables\u003C/strong\u003E kumhleli lubonisa ukuthi isehlakalo ngasinye sibona ini. Isimo ongasifunda usethe: \u003Ccode\u003Ecool\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eoffset\u003C/code\u003E, kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eat.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.f\u003C/code\u003E (amanani okugcina abhalwe).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitatimende\"\u003EIzitatimende\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsitatimende\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eraw TEXT\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa uthayipheke ngokuqondile (ngaphandle kwenombolo yomugqa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecomment TEXT\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(TEXT)\u003C/code\u003E nezinhlamvu ezingesiyo ze-ASCII nezibambeli zisuswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eemit WORD WORD …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wamagama; amagama aphuma engenalutho ayashiywa; ngaphandle kwamagama, ngeke kubhalwe umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eword WORD …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza amagama emugqeni okhiwayo; i-\u003Ccode\u003Eemit\u003C/code\u003E eyodwa iyawuvala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eif EXPR\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eelse\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimo: \u003Ccode\u003Ea == b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea != b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea and b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea or b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea??b\u003C/code\u003E (a, uma kungenjalo b)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efor tool in tools\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKanye kwethuluzi ngalinye elisetshenziswa ohlelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eset NAME EXPR\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina inani (\u003Ccode\u003Eset offset tool.number\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ereset NAME …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhohlwa amagama amodal (iqembu, inhlamvu yekheli efana no-\u003Ccode\u003EZ\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003Eat.z\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edo rapid X Y Z\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa isehlakalo se-\u003Ccode\u003Erapid\u003C/code\u003E ngephoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama ngumbhalo othayipiwe onezimbobo ze-\u003Ccode\u003E{variable|filter}\u003C/code\u003E. Ama-filter yi-\u003Ccode\u003Eupper\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elower\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epad:N\u003C/code\u003E (ukugcwalisa ngo-zero), \u003Ccode\u003Ecut:N\u003C/code\u003E (izinhlamvu ezingu-N zokuqala), \u003Ccode\u003Esafe\u003C/code\u003E (ASCII ephephile kumakhomenti) ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eint\u003C/code\u003E. Igama elisiphela nge-\u003Ccode\u003E~\u003C/code\u003E liyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Emodal\u003C/strong\u003E: libhalwa kuphela uma lihlukile kulokho okubhalwe ekugcineni (\u003Ccode\u003EG1~\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EX{x}~\u003C/code\u003E). Igama elisiphela nge-\u003Ccode\u003E~!\u003C/code\u003E libhalwa njalo futhi liyakhunjulwa. Igama elingeyona okuguquguqukayo liyisicu esingumbhalo (\u003Ccode\u003EG81\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emist\u003C/code\u003E). Izinombolo ziyazungezwa kuya ku-0.001 mm futhi zibhalwa ngaphandle kwamazero asele emuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungenziwa-yi-post\"\u003EOkungenziwa yi-post\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInquma indlela yokubhala izinyathelo, akukho ngaphezu. Ayikwazi ukushintsha indlela yethuluzi, ukuhlela imisebenzi, ukwahlukanisa i-arc, ukungeza i-eksisi, ukwazi ukuhamba nokuhlanganiswa komshini wakho, noma ukwenza ukubalwa kwama-coordinate (akukho \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E). Izikhundla ezijikelezayo ngokwazo zivela emshinini ochazwe ku-Setup, hhayi ku-post: i-post ingashintsha uphawu lwazo noma amagama, kodwa hhayi ukuhamba kwayo. Ukuphila kwethuluzi nemijikelezo yezinhlelo ezincane akwakhiwe. Ifayela le-post lesitayela se-\u003Ccode\u003E.cps\u003C/code\u003E esivela kolunye uhlelo alikwazi ukulayishwa: le ifomethi ehlukile futhi elula.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indlela efanayo yethuluzi kumele ibhalwe ngokwehlukile kubalawuli abehlukene: izinombolo zemigqa noma ezingekho, M6 noma ukuma, G28 noma G53, M30 noma M2. I-post ngumbhalo omfushane otshela ukuthi kanjani. Ama-post amathathu akhelwe ngaphakathi e-PartCraft (i-Fanuc-style, i-GRBL ne-LinuxCNC) abhalwe kule fomethi, ngakho i-post yakho ingaqala njengekhophi yenye yazo. Hlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika, futhi uyiqhube emoyeni ngaphezu kwesitoko kuqala. Ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi abhala kanye lokho abekubhala ngaphambi kwalesi fomethi (izivivinyo zifanisa okuphumayo kwazo ngokuthi biti ngebhithi ezinhlelweni eziningi), kodwa lutho lapha lufakazelwe emshinini wakho, futhi i-post oyishintshile iyeyakho ukuyifakazela. Yenza eyakho Ku-Manufacture, ngaphansi kwe-Post: Edit post… ku-control akhelwe ngaphakathi ivula ikhophi yakho yayo. Kwepost yakho ivula leyo post. New post… iqala kusuka ku-post emhlophe esincane enazo zonke izehlakalo. Import post file… ifunda ifayela lombhalo le-.cpost (ifayela oliphuthayo ku-Save as a file… kumhleli). Umhleli ubonisa umbhalo, umugqa otshela ukuthi uyafundeka yini (nokuthi yiluphi umugqa ongalungile), kanye ne-G-code ebhalwa yi-post njengoba uthayipha. Preview with ikhetha uhlelo oluncane lwesampula elisebenzisa zonke izehlakalo, noma uhlelo lwalesi ngxenye. Save igcina i-post efayelini lengxenye (ama-post angu-20 kuwo) futhi iyikhethe njengomlawuli. Ama-post ahamba nengxenye; ukuze uyisebenzise kwenye ingxenye, yigcine njengefayela bese uyingenisa lapho. Ibukeka kanjani i-post post mymill name Umshini wami (.nc) extension nc line-numbers off decimal-point no canned-cycles no modal motion G0 G1 G2 G3 on start comment Uhlelo {program}: {name} emit G21 G90 G17 end on tool-change emit T{tool.number} M6 end on rapid if moved emit G0~ X{x}~ Y{y}~ Z{z}~ end end Imigqa eqala nge-// nemigqa ethe xaxa iyashaywa. Ekuqaleni kuza izilungiselelo; bese kukhona ibhoku elilodwa le-on \u003Cevent\u003E ngalinye, eliphethwe nge-end. Isehlakalo ososuke ukusishiyile ayibhali lutho. Ukusetha Incazelo post \u003Cid\u003E I-id ye-post: izinhlamvu, izinombolo, - no-_ name \u003Ctext\u003E Lokho uhlu lwe-Control olukhombisayo extension \u003Cext\u003E Isandiso sefayela: nc, ngc, tap … line-numbers 10 / off N10, N20 … kulo lonke umugqa we-emit, noma akukho decimal-point yes / no 10. esikhundleni se-10 (amakhomenti kawakaze agcine ichashazi) canned-cycles yes / no no: izimbobo zibhalwa njengezinyathelo ze-G0/G1 ezimelelwe modal \u003Cgroup\u003E \u003Cwords\u003E Amagama eqembu (modal motion G0 G1 G2 G3) abhalwa kuphela lapho eshintsha Izehlakalo Zisebenza ngalolu hlelo lohlelo: start; bese ngomsebenzi ngamunye operation, tool-change (lapho ithuluzi lishintsha), spindle (lapho isivinini sishintsha), approach (ukunyuka kuya ekuqaleni kokuqala, ngaphambi kwe-rapid yokuqala), coolant-on, bese izinyathelo zawo njenge-rapid, feed ne-arc, nomjikelezo ngamunye oqinile njenge-cycle-start, i-cycle-hole ngembobo ngayinye kanye ne-cycle-end; ekugcineni end. Izehlakalo eziningi, zamaeksisi angaphezu kwamathathu (i-post engenayo lezi yenqaba uhlelo oluthile futhi ibhale igama lesehlakalo elingelo): Isehlakalo Lapho Okuguquguqukayo kwaso index Ngaphambi komsebenzi okungahluki isiqondiso sawo sethuluzi kuleso sokugcina, nangaphambi komsebenzi wokuqala emshinini onama-eksisi azungezayo rot.a, rot.b, rot.c (izikhundla okufanele ziye kuzo; zingenalutho ye-eksisi umshini ongenayo), first.x, first.y, first.z rapid-rotary, feed-rotary Izinyathelo zomsebenzi lapho ama-eksisi azungezayo ahamba ngenkathi isika x, y, z, rot.a, rot.b, rot.c, f, rot.moved, inverse (yebo lapho ukondla kufanele kube kwesikhathi esiphambene), invf (1/iminithi) rotary-end Ngemva komsebenzi onjalo probe-move Inyathelo elime lapho iprobhu iqeda ukuthinta x, y, z, f, probe.n (1 kuya ku-4), probe.axis (x, y noma z), probe.k (1, 2 noma 3) probe-set Ngemva kokuthintwa kwemijikelezo eyodwa yokuhlola probe.kind (\"z\", \"x\", \"y\" noma centre), probe.action (set noma measure), probe.expect, probe.cx, probe.cy thread Inyathelo lokuthunga emshinini wokuthenda x, z, thread.lead Futhi kuwo wonke umcimbi: kin (none, a, b, ac, bc), rotary ne-tcp (yebo noma cha, kumshini kuSetup), pivot.x, pivot.y, pivot.z, op.tilt nomsebenzi op.turn, nasemshinini wokuthenda spin.mode (css noma rpm), spin.css, spin.max no-tool.nose. Igama lamagama elinenani elingenalutho, njenge-A{rot.a} emshinini ongenayo i-eksisi ye-A, liyashiywa emugqeni. Qhathanisa ne-x, y no-z njengombhalo phakathi kwezinkomba (if probe.kind == \"z\"): ngaphandle kwazo, ziyizinombolo zokunyakaza. Imigqa emibili engaphezulu kwe-post eyenza ibe yi-post yomshini wokuthenda: machine lathe (bese ibhala u-X no-Z kuphela futhi yenqaba izindlela zokugaya njengoba i-post yokugaya yenqaba izindlela zokuthenda) ne-lathe-x diameter noma lathe-x radius. Isehlakalo ngasinye singasebenzisa okuguquguqukayo kohlobo lwaso lokuhamba, kubhalwe {name}: uhlelo (name, program, setup.axis, setup.origin, setup.coolant), isitoko (stock.kind, stock.d, stock.sx, stock.sy, stock.sz, stock.minx … stock.maxz), ithuluzi (tool.number, tool.desc, tool.kind, tool.d, tool.flutes, tool.fluteLen), umsebenzi (op.name, op.type), rpm, indawo yokuhamba (x, y, z, f, ne-moved: true uma i-eksisi yodwa iguqukile), ama-arc (arc.g 2 noma 3, arc.i, arc.j, arc.cx, arc.cy) nemigodi (hole.x, hole.y, hole.z, hole.r, hole.q, hole.return, hole.first, cycle.kind, cycle.init, feed). Uhlu lwe-Events and variables kumhleli lubonisa ukuthi isehlakalo ngasinye sibona ini. Isimo ongasifunda usethe: cool, offset, kanye ne-at.x, at.y, at.z, at.f (amanani okugcina abhalwe). Izitatimende Isitatimende Esikwenzayo raw TEXT Umugqa uthayipheke ngokuqondile (ngaphandle kwenombolo yomugqa) comment TEXT (TEXT) nezinhlamvu ezingesiyo ze-ASCII nezibambeli zisuswa emit WORD WORD … Umugqa wamagama; amagama aphuma engenalutho ayashiywa; ngaphandle kwamagama, ngeke kubhalwe umugqa word WORD … Engeza amagama emugqeni okhiwayo; i-emit eyodwa iyawuvala if EXPR … else … end Izimo: a == b, a != b, not a, a and b, a or b, a??b (a, uma kungenjalo b) for tool in tools … end Kanye kwethuluzi ngalinye elisetshenziswa ohlelweni set NAME EXPR Gcina inani (set offset tool.number) reset NAME … Khohlwa amagama amodal (iqembu, inhlamvu yekheli efana no-Z, noma at.z) do rapid X Y Z Sebenzisa isehlakalo se-rapid ngephoyinti Igama ngumbhalo othayipiwe onezimbobo ze-{variable|filter}. Ama-filter yi-upper, lower, pad:N (ukugcwalisa ngo-zero), cut:N (izinhlamvu ezingu-N zokuqala), safe (ASCII ephephile kumakhomenti) ne-int. Igama elisiphela nge-~ liyi-modal: libhalwa kuphela uma lihlukile kulokho okubhalwe ekugcineni (G1~, X{x}~). Igama elisiphela nge-~! libhalwa njalo futhi liyakhunjulwa. Igama elingeyona okuguquguqukayo liyisicu esingumbhalo (G81, mist). Izinombolo ziyazungezwa kuya ku-0.001 mm futhi zibhalwa ngaphandle kwamazero asele emuva. Okungenziwa yi-post Inquma indlela yokubhala izinyathelo, akukho ngaphezu. Ayikwazi ukushintsha indlela yethuluzi, ukuhlela imisebenzi, ukwahlukanisa i-arc, ukungeza i-eksisi, ukwazi ukuhamba nokuhlanganiswa komshini wakho, noma ukwenza ukubalwa kwama-coordinate (akukho +). Izikhundla ezijikelezayo ngokwazo zivela emshinini ochazwe ku-Setup, hhayi ku-post: i-post ingashintsha uphawu lwazo noma amagama, kodwa hhayi ukuhamba kwayo. Ukuphila kwethuluzi nemijikelezo yezinhlelo ezincane akwakhiwe. Ifayela le-post lesitayela se-.cps esivela kolunye uhlelo alikwazi ukulayishwa: le ifomethi ehlukile futhi elula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"simulation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hlola ukucindezeleka nokuguquka (Simulation)","summary":"Khetha impahla, bamba ubuso, engeza amandla, ingcindezi noma isisindo sengxenye, xazulula, bese ufunda ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises, ukuguquka, isilinganiso sokuphepha, okuphendulwayo nezinkomba zefrikhwensi yemvelo kumodeli, nalokho indlela engakutshela khona nokungakutshela khona.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["simulation","FEA","ukuhlaziya okuphilayo","buyekeza ngenkathi uhlela","yiphule","isinyathelo somthwalo","okungelona ulayini","ukukhiqiza kwepulasitiki","bilinear","ukuxhumana","ipheya lokuxhumana","penalty","bonded","ukuxhumana okungenakho ukungqubuzana","CalculiX",".inp",".frd","finite element","ukucindezeleka","strain","von Mises","ukuguquka","ukuphambuka","isilinganiso sokuphepha","factor of safety","ukukhiqiza","ukuphendula","umthwalo","amandla","ingcindezi","isisindo","okubanjiwe","ukungqubuzana","isekelo","ukuvinjwa","impahla","insimbi","i-aluminium","i-titanium","ABS","PLA","nylon","ifrikhwensi yemvelo","modal","ukudlidlizela","imeshi","usayizi wesakhi","tetrahedral","tet mesh","voxel","ikhwalithi yemeshi","ukucindezeleka okuyinhloko","principal stress","isilinganiso sephutha","iphutha lobuso obugobile","izimbobo","ama-fillet","okuzenzakalelayo","ukulungisa ngokuzenzakalela","h-adaptive","ukuhlangana","ukuhlangana kwemeshi","ubuso obuqondile","isiyingi","ikhoni","torus","spline","ubuso okhululekile"],"headings":[{"id":"setha-ucwaningo","text":"Setha ucwaningo","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-ngokuzenzakalela","text":"Lungisa ngokuzenzakalela","level":3},{"id":"bamba-bese-uyilayisha","text":"Bamba bese uyilayisha","level":2},{"id":"xazulula-bese-ufunda-imiphumela","text":"Xazulula bese ufunda imiphumela","level":2},{"id":"ukukhiqiza-nokuxhumana-izifundo-ezingelona-ulayini","text":"Ukukhiqiza nokuxhumana (izifundo ezingelona ulayini)","level":2},{"id":"yisebenzise-ku-calculix","text":"Yisebenzise ku-CalculiX","level":2},{"id":"ukuthembeka-kwayo-kangakanani","text":"Ukuthembeka kwayo kangakanani","level":2},{"id":"buyekeza-ngenkathi-uhlela-live","text":"Buyekeza ngenkathi uhlela (Live)","level":2},{"id":"thola-ukuthi-yini-ephulayo-kuqala-yiphule","text":"Thola ukuthi yini ephulayo kuqala (Yiphule)","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza yakwa-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingisa\u003C/strong\u003E iphendula umbuzo &quot;ingabe izogoba noma iphuke ngaphansi kwalo mthwalo?&quot; ngengxenye oyimodela. Ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003Elinear static\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuguquka okuncane, impahla ihlala ibuyela ngemva) noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eucwaningo lwefrikhwensi yemvelo\u003C/strong\u003E, oxazululwa kumeshi yama-tetrahedra e-quadratic alandela ubuso bengxenye (noma, uma ukhetha, amakhyubhu amancane alinganayo). Lusebenza ezindaweni ezinikezwa yi-mesh kernel engxenyeni (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingisa\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini elisekhohlakalweni letuluzi eliphezulu. Ingxenye yakho ayishintshwa; ucwaningo lugcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela lengxenye, futhi noma yiluphi ushintsho lwalo lungahlehliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-ucwaningo\"\u003ESetha ucwaningo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EUcwaningo olusha\u003C/strong\u003E esigabeni sakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E. Ipaneli ikhombisa ukuqina kwayo (E), inani lika-Poisson, ukuminyana namandla okukhiqiza. Lezi izinombolo ezijwayelekile zencwadi; izinombolo ezingaqinisekisiwe zomhlinzeki wakho zingahluka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EImeshi\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Tetrahedral (ecacile)\u003C/strong\u003E, okuzenzakalelayo: ama-tetrahedra enodi lesi-10 anezindonga zangaphandle ezilala ebusweni bengxenye, nemiphetho egobile ezimbobeni, ku-fillet nakwezinye izindawo ezizungezile. Amanodi ezindaweni ezilinganayo, ezisilindrikhi, ezikhonini, ezisiyingini nasezindaweni ezinkulu ezijikelezayo, nakubuso be-freeform (B-spline) ahlala ebusweni obuqondile; noma yiluphi olunye uhlobo lobuso lulandela imeshi yalo yokubonisa, nethebula lemiphumela lisho ukuthi yimingaki izindawo ezenze lokho. Imeshi yenziwa ibe mihle yodwa eduze kwezindawo ezigobile, izindonga ezincane nemiphetho ebukhali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhyubhu e-voxel (asheshayo)\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye egcwaliswe ngamakhyubhu alinganayo. Asheshayo, kodwa ubuso obugobile buba izinyathelo. Ucwaningo olugcinwe ngaphambi kokuba kube khona imeshi ye-tetrahedral luqhubeka lunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wesakhi\u003C/strong\u003E ungenalutho ukuze uthole usayizi ozenzakalelayo (cishe ama-tetrahedra ayi-12,000, noma amakhyubhu ayi-20,000), noma thayipha enye ngamamilimitha. Ipaneli ikhombisa cishe izakhi eziningi ezizokwenza lokho ngaphambi kokungeza izindawo ezincane. Ngama-tetrahedra, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhi ezincane ezindaweni ezigobile\u003C/strong\u003E (ivuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo) zilungisa izimbobo nama-fillet, lapho ukucindezeleka kuvame ukuphakama khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lungisa-ngokuzenzakalela\"\u003ELungisa ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgama-tetrahedra, ucwaningo oluqinile noma lokuwohloka (ngaphandle komthwalo oshisayo), ucwaningo lwefrikhwensi yemvelo nocwaningo lokushisa olumile banikeza \u003Cstrong\u003ELungisa ngokuzenzakalela (ngokuguquguqukayo)\u003C/strong\u003E. Yikhetha bese usetha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphutha elihlosiwe (%)\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuxazulula kuyama uma iphutha elilinganisiwe lingaphansi kwalo (1 % ukuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzigaba eziningi kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: izixazululo eziningi kakhulu ezingasebenza (5 ukuqala, okungafika ku-10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba ngasinye sixazulula, sithole izakhi ezinephutha elilinganisiwe elikhulu kakhulu, sizihlukanise (kanye nezakhi ezimbalwa eziseduze ezidingekayo ukugcina imeshi iphelele), bese siphinda sixazulule. Amanodi amasha ezindaweni ezigobile aya ebusweni obuqondile. Imiphumela bese ibonisa ithebula nechathi enezakhi, izingaziwa, iphutha elilinganisiwe, ukucindezeleka okuphezulu (noma izinga lokushisa) nokuguquka (noma ukugeleza kokushisa) ngesigaba ngasinye, nomugqa ochaza ukuthi kungani kumile: umgomo ufinyelelwe, izigaba seziphelile, imeshi elandelayo yayiyoba inkulu kakhulu, noma isigaba sehlulekile (bese ubona isigaba sokugcina esiphumelele).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda isilinganiso njengesilinganiso. Siqhathaniswa nezimpendulo ezinembile, siyafunda cishe ku-0.6 kuya ku-0.95 wephutha langempela (i-Zienkiewicz–Zhu), siphimisa iphutha \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwingxenye yonke\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho ukucindezeleka okuphezulu esimeni sesimbobo noma i-fillet kuvame ukusalokhu kuphambuka kancane lapho isilinganiso sibukeka sincane: ngokucindezeleka kokugoba, setha umkhawulo ngaphansi kwe-1 % bese ubona ukucindezeleka kuzinza kusuka esigabeni kuya kwesilandelayo. Ekhoneni elibukhali langaphakathi noma emphethweni wobuso obubanjiwe ukucindezeleka langempela kungapheli, ngakho isilinganiso asikaze sifinyelele lapho: izigaba ziphela kunalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfrikhwensi yemvelo nokuwohloka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ocwaningweni lwefrikhwensi yemvelo isilinganiso sihlanganisa zonke izimo ozicelile, ngayinye ibalwa ngokufanayo; ithebula nochathi kulandela ifrikhwensi mbili zokuqala. Engxenyeni enobuso obuqondile kuphela, ifrikhwensi ingehla kuphela kusuka esigabeni kuya kwesilandelayo (imeshi ngayinye igcina eyandulele); ubuso obugobile nabo buya busondela esimweni sabo sangempela, okungashintsha ifrikhwensi kancane ngaloluphi uhlangothi. Ngokuwohloka isilinganiso sihlanganisa ukucindezeleka kwangaphambili nezimo zokuwohloka, nethebula lilandela izilinganiso zomthwalo. Kuhlolwe kwibha yensimbi engu-100 × 10 × 10 mm: ifrikhwensi yokuqala izinza kusuka ku-812.4 kuya ku-811.9 Hz phezu kwezigaba ezine, ingaphansi ka-0.4 % kwe-Euler–Bernoulli (engakunaki ukusika), kanti isilinganiso somthwalo wekholomu sisebangeni le-0.5 % le-Euler.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bamba-bese-uyilayisha\"\u003EBamba bese uyilayisha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ucwaningo budinga okungenani isekelo elilodwa, kanti ukucindezeleka kudinga umthwalo owodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFixed\u003C/span\u003E kubha yamathuluzi. Isekelo elisha likhethiwe futhi lilinde ubuso: chofoza ubuso obuqinile (chofoza ubuso futhi ukhiphe). Cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EQedela ukukhetha\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma uqedile. Amakhoni amabhlu aphawula ubuso obubanjiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForce\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso umthwalo osebenza kuwo. Ku-ipaneli thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmandla aphelele\u003C/strong\u003E ngama-newton bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela\u003C/strong\u003E: ngena ebusweni, noma ngokuhambisana nomugqa. Amandla ahlukaniswa phezu kobuso obukhethiwe ngokusebenzisa indawo. Izimpini ezi-orenji zibonisa lokhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPressure\u003C/span\u003E ngengcindezi ngama-MPa (N/mm²) ecindezela kubuso obukhethiwe; ingcindezi engemihle idonsa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo ezengeziwe zisohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza\u003C/strong\u003E kwipaneli: \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso obungenakho ukungqubuzana\u003C/strong\u003E (ubuso bungashelela buzungeze uqobo kodwa ngeke buhambe bukhuphuke kuwo — lusebenzise ezindizeni zokulingana nasezisekelweni ezibushelelezi) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ENokudonsa komhlaba\u003C/strong\u003E (isisindo sengxenye siqu, 9.81 m/s², endleleni okhetha yona).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsekelo elishiya ingxenye ikhululekile ukushelela noma ukujikeleza liyanqatshelwa, lisho ukunyakaza okushiyiwe okukhululekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xazulula-bese-ufunda-imiphumela\"\u003EXazulula bese ufunda imiphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolve\u003C/span\u003E. Umsebenzi usebenza ngasemuva; \u003Cstrong\u003EMisa\u003C/strong\u003E uyayikhansela. Bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye iphenduka umbala ngokucindezeleka kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Evon Mises\u003C/strong\u003E; khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuguquka\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso sokuphepha\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa\u003C/strong\u003E. Isici sinikeza isikali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhomba engxenyeni ukuze ufunde izinani ngaphansi kwesikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo esigobile\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona ingxenye igobile (ukunyakaza kukhulisiwe ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali\u003C/strong\u003E; eyangempela ingeyethebula).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthebula lidweba ukucindezeleka okukhulu nokuthi kuphi, ukuguquka okukhulu, \u003Cstrong\u003Eisilinganiso sokuphepha\u003C/strong\u003E esincane (amandla okukhiqiza ÷ ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises; ngaphansi kwe-1 impahla iyakhiqiza), umthwalo osetshenzisiwe kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enokuphendula\u003C/strong\u003E ezisekelweni (ziyalinganisa umthwalo), nemeshi esetshenzisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgefrikhwensi yemvelo, khetha lolo \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E, setha ukuthi yimingaki \u003Cstrong\u003EIzimo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uxazulula. Isimo ngasinye sibonisa ifrikhwensi nesimo sayo (izimo zilinganiswa zibe ngu-1 ekunyakazeni kwazo okukhulu kakhulu).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ushintsha ingxenye, imiphumela imaketwa ingasasebenzi: xazulula futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhiqiza-nokuxhumana-izifundo-ezingelona-ulayini\"\u003EUkukhiqiza nokuxhumana (izifundo ezingelona ulayini)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo ezimbili zocwaningo ezengeziwe zidlula ku-&quot;impahla ihlala iguquguquka&quot;:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungelona ulayini (impahla iyakhiqiza)\u003C/strong\u003E ilandela umugqa oqondile wempahla kuze kufike ekucindezelekeni kokukhiqiza, bese kuba nokuthambeka okuncane (\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthambeka ngemva kokukhiqiza\u003C/strong\u003E, 1 % ye-E uma kushiyiwe ingenalutho). Umthwalo uqhubeka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyathelo zomthwalo\u003C/strong\u003E; isinyathelo esingazinzi siyehlukaniswa ngesikhathi sodwa. Imiphumela yengeza \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuncipha kwepulasitiki\u003C/strong\u003E emapulotini futhi ikhombise ukuthi umthwalo oningi kangakanani wathwalwa. Uma isinyathelo bese singazinzi, ucwaningo luyama esinyathelweni sokugcina esiphumelele kanti ipaneli ⚠ \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E ikhomba lapho: ingxenye iphelelwe amandla khona (ukuwa), noma izinyathelo zinkulu kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxhumana phakathi kwezingcezu\u003C/strong\u003E kuvumela izingcezu ezihlukene zengxenye zicindezelane. Engeza \u003Cstrong\u003EIpheya lokuxhumana\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha ubuso be-A (ubuso ocindezelayo) ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E, bese i-B ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick side B faces\u003C/span\u003E. Izingcezu \u003Cstrong\u003Eezingenakho ukungqubuzana\u003C/strong\u003E ziyacindezela, zishelele futhi zihlukane; izingcezu \u003Cstrong\u003Eezibambelelene\u003C/strong\u003E ziyahlala zibambelelene. Ingcezu ngayinye yenziwa imeshi yayo, ngakho igebe elincane phakathi kwazo lilungile. Ukuxhumana kuyindlela yesijeziso: izingcezu zicwila kancane ngaphakathi kwezinye (i-\u003Cstrong\u003Epenalty factor\u003C/strong\u003E × E ÷ usayizi wesakhi isetha ukuthi ukuxhumana kuqinile kangakanani). Ithebula likhombisa ukucwila okujulile kakhulu, nepaneli Izinkinga iyaxwayisa uma kungaphezu kuka-1 % wosayizi wesakhi: khuphula inkomba noma sebenzisa izakhi ezincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili zisebenzisa imeshi ye-tetrahedral. Ukungqubuzana, ukushelela okukhulu nokujikeleza okukhulu akuxazululwa lapha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yisebenzise-ku-calculix\"\u003EYisebenzise ku-CalculiX\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › CalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave a CalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/span\u003E kwipaneli) ilondoloza ucwaningo njengedeki lokufaka le-CalculiX, uhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa futhi olusetshenziswa wena: imeshi efanayo, impahla, izisekelo, imithwalo namapheya okuxhumana, ngama-mm, N kanye nama-MPa. Yisebenzise, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EThumela › imiphumela ye-CalculiX (.frd)\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda ifayela lalo lemiphumela libuyele kulimeshi efanayo ibonise ukuguquka (nokucindezeleka kwe-von Mises uma ifayela linokucindezeleka). Uma uguqule ingxenye noma usayizi wesakhi phakathi, imeshi ayifani futhi i-PartCraft iyakutshela: londoloza idekhi entsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthembeka-kwayo-kangakanani\"\u003EUkuthembeka kwayo kangakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ihlola isixazululi sayo ngamafomula ngesandla (ukuguquka kwesiphetho se-cantilever PL³/3EI ngaphakathi kwe-1 %, ukweluka kwebha PL/AE ngokuqondile, ifrikhwensi yokuqala ye-cantilever ngaphakathi kwe-3 %, ukucindezeleka ozungezile isimbobo kupuleti). Nokho, gcina lezi zinkawu zengqondo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImeshi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngama-tetrahedra, i-PartCraft ihlola ukuguquka kwe-cantilever nokucindezeleka kokugoba (ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 %), ukucindezeleka esimbobeni kupuleti (Kt, ngaphakathi cishe kuka-1 %), ithubhu elijulile ngaphansi kwengcindezi (Lamé, ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 %) nefrikhwensi yokuqala (ngaphakathi kuka-0.4 %). Ithebula likhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eikhwalithi yemeshi\u003C/strong\u003E (amakona amancane nakakhulu phakathi kobuso bezakhi; ngaphansi cishe kuka-10° isakhi siyimpuphu) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enephutha lokucindezeleka elilinganisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: uma likhulu kuno-amaphesenti ambalwa, xazulula futhi ngosayizi wesakhi omncane, noma vumela \u003Cstrong\u003ELungisa ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E kukwenze. Kupuleti elinesimbobo nebha elinemigoqo emibili emaphethelweni, ukulungisa ngokuzenzakalela kwafinyelela ngaphakathi kuka-1 % we-Kt yencwadi cishe ngesithupha sezingaziwa ezadingwa ukwenza imeshi yonke ibe mncane. Ngamakhyubhu e-voxel, isimbobo noma i-fillet iba yindiza enamasitebhisi ngosayizi wekhyubhu, ngakho ukucindezeleka lapho kuba nzima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhona abukhali angaphakathi nemiphetho yobuso obubanjiwe awanawo amandla aphakeme langempela.\u003C/strong\u003E Inani lapho liqhubeka likhula njengoba izakhi zincipha. Funda ukucindezeleka kancane kude nalezi zindawo, noma gobisa ikhona kumodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphumela okufanele uyifunde.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphandle kokucindezeleka kwe-von Mises, ukuguquka nesilinganiso sokuphepha, ucwaningo lwe-tetrahedral lubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eukucindezeleka okukhulu nokuncane kwe-principal\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuqina nokucindezela) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enokuguquka okulinganayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa imeshi\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona izakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzifundo ezimile zingelona ulayini futhi ziyaguquguquka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukukhiqiza nokuxhumana sebenzisa izinhlobo zocwaningo ezingelona ulayini ezingenhla; ukuguquka okukhulu nokukhathala akuxazululwa. Ukushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka komugqa kungezinye izinhlobo zocwaningo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EUkushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke impahla ifana kuzo zonke izindlela.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinto zepulasitiki ezikhiwe nge-3D zibuthakathaka ngokusontela izungu lazo, ngokuvamile ngesithathu noma ngaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELesi yinguqulo yelabhorethri: hlola izingxenye ezibalulekile ngenye indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyekeza-ngenkathi-uhlela-live\"\u003EBuyekeza ngenkathi uhlela (Live)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyekeza ngenkathi ngihlela\u003C/strong\u003E kwibhlogo ye-Solve bese izimpendulo zeSimulation zilandela ukuhlela kwakho. Shintsha isilinganiso, umthwalo, impahla noma indawo, bese \u003Cstrong\u003Eimpendulo esheshayo\u003C/strong\u003E ivela masinyane, yenziwe ngezakhi ezine zinkulu kunezocwaningo; uma uyama isikhashana (isekhondi noma cishe), \u003Cstrong\u003Eimpendulo ehlaziywe\u003C/strong\u003E yocwaningo siyayithatha indawo. Imiphumela ikhombisa ukuthi ubheka eyiphi (&quot;Impendulo esheshayo&quot; noma &quot;Impendulo ehlaziywe&quot;) nosayizi wesakhi. Impendulo esheshayo ilungele isiqondiso nosayizi: ku-cantilever yensimbi yayiphakathi kuka-1 % ngokuguquka nasekuzeni ka-4 % ngokucindezeleka kweyehlaziywe. Thembela kweyehlaziywe ngezinombolo ozozisebenzisa. Izifundo ezimile, zefrikhwensi yemvelo, zokushisa nokuwohloka zisebenza ngale ndlela; i-Live iyisilungiselelo sokubuka futhi ayigcinwa engxenyeni. Ukuxazulula ocindezela wena kuhlala kunjalo kuze kube yilolo shintsho olulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-ukuthi-yini-ephulayo-kuqala-yiphule\"\u003EThola ukuthi yini ephulayo kuqala (Yiphule)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOcwaningweni lokuqina noma lokuwohloka, cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EYini ephulayo kuqala?\u003C/strong\u003E kwibhlogo ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EYiphule\u003C/strong\u003E. I-PartCraft ilinganisa imithwalo yocwaningo (amandla, ingcindezi nesisindo ndawonye)ize ingxenye inikele, bese ibhala, okubi kakhulu kuqala, \u003Cstrong\u003Eisilinganiso somthwalo ekukhiqizeni kokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E (isilinganiso semithwalo yanamuhla lapho ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises okuphezulu kufinyelela ukukhiqiza kwempahla, kunophawu obubomvu lapho kwenzeka khona) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enesilinganiso somthwalo ekuwohlokeni\u003C/strong\u003E ngezisekelo nemithwalo efanayo. Isilinganiso se-4.3 sisho ukuthi ingxenye ithwala izikhathi ezi-4.3 umthwalo wayo ngaphambi kokukhiqiza; \u003Cstrong\u003Eisilinganiso esingaphansi kwe-1 sisho ukuthi sesinikele ngenxa yomthwalo osuvele ulayishiwe\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi lokho kuvela kuhlu lweZinkinga njengephutha (ukutholakala okubuthakathaka kakhulu kuboniswa njengenothi noma kwenzeka konke kugcina). Izilinganiso zivela kucwaningo olulinganayo ku-tetrahedra ngosayizi wesakhi wakho, ngakho zinhle njengalolo cwaningo: ukucindezeleka esibindeni esilungisiwe noma ekhoneni elibukhali akunawo amandla aphakeme langempela (bheka ngezansi), futhi isilinganiso sokukhiqiza sizoba ngehlangothi elicwebezelayo lapho. Umsizi wakho angenza lokhu kuhlolwa ngethuluzi \u003Ccode\u003Ebreak_run\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EUkushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/generative-design\" data-topic=\"partcraft/generative-design\"\u003EKhulisa isimo kusuka emithwalweni (Generative)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"partcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa izibalo, ama-engeli nobunzima\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Indawo yokusebenza yakwa-Ukulingisa iphendula umbuzo \"ingabe izogoba noma iphuke ngaphansi kwalo mthwalo?\" ngengxenye oyimodela. Ngu-linear static (ukuguquka okuncane, impahla ihlala ibuyela ngemva) noma ucwaningo lwefrikhwensi yemvelo, oxazululwa kumeshi yama-tetrahedra e-quadratic alandela ubuso bengxenye (noma, uma ukhetha, amakhyubhu amancane alinganayo). Lusebenza ezindaweni ezinikezwa yi-mesh kernel engxenyeni (bheka I-mesh kernel). Khetha Ukulingisa ku-Indawo yokusebenza ebhokisini elisekhohlakalweni letuluzi eliphezulu. Ingxenye yakho ayishintshwa; ucwaningo lugcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela lengxenye, futhi noma yiluphi ushintsho lwalo lungahlehliswa. Setha ucwaningo Cindezela Ucwaningo olusha esigabeni sakwesokudla. Khetha Impahla. Ipaneli ikhombisa ukuqina kwayo (E), inani lika-Poisson, ukuminyana namandla okukhiqiza. Lezi izinombolo ezijwayelekile zencwadi; izinombolo ezingaqinisekisiwe zomhlinzeki wakho zingahluka. Khetha Imeshi: I-Tetrahedral (ecacile), okuzenzakalelayo: ama-tetrahedra enodi lesi-10 anezindonga zangaphandle ezilala ebusweni bengxenye, nemiphetho egobile ezimbobeni, ku-fillet nakwezinye izindawo ezizungezile. Amanodi ezindaweni ezilinganayo, ezisilindrikhi, ezikhonini, ezisiyingini nasezindaweni ezinkulu ezijikelezayo, nakubuso be-freeform (B-spline) ahlala ebusweni obuqondile; noma yiluphi olunye uhlobo lobuso lulandela imeshi yalo yokubonisa, nethebula lemiphumela lisho ukuthi yimingaki izindawo ezenze lokho. Imeshi yenziwa ibe mihle yodwa eduze kwezindawo ezigobile, izindonga ezincane nemiphetho ebukhali. Amakhyubhu e-voxel (asheshayo): ingxenye egcwaliswe ngamakhyubhu alinganayo. Asheshayo, kodwa ubuso obugobile buba izinyathelo. Ucwaningo olugcinwe ngaphambi kokuba kube khona imeshi ye-tetrahedral luqhubeka lunjalo. Shiya Usayizi wesakhi ungenalutho ukuze uthole usayizi ozenzakalelayo (cishe ama-tetrahedra ayi-12,000, noma amakhyubhu ayi-20,000), noma thayipha enye ngamamilimitha. Ipaneli ikhombisa cishe izakhi eziningi ezizokwenza lokho ngaphambi kokungeza izindawo ezincane. Ngama-tetrahedra, Izakhi ezincane ezindaweni ezigobile (ivuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo) zilungisa izimbobo nama-fillet, lapho ukucindezeleka kuvame ukuphakama khona. Lungisa ngokuzenzakalela Ngama-tetrahedra, ucwaningo oluqinile noma lokuwohloka (ngaphandle komthwalo oshisayo), ucwaningo lwefrikhwensi yemvelo nocwaningo lokushisa olumile banikeza Lungisa ngokuzenzakalela (ngokuguquguqukayo). Yikhetha bese usetha: Iphutha elihlosiwe (%): ukuxazulula kuyama uma iphutha elilinganisiwe lingaphansi kwalo (1 % ukuqala). Izigaba eziningi kakhulu: izixazululo eziningi kakhulu ezingasebenza (5 ukuqala, okungafika ku-10). Isigaba ngasinye sixazulula, sithole izakhi ezinephutha elilinganisiwe elikhulu kakhulu, sizihlukanise (kanye nezakhi ezimbalwa eziseduze ezidingekayo ukugcina imeshi iphelele), bese siphinda sixazulule. Amanodi amasha ezindaweni ezigobile aya ebusweni obuqondile. Imiphumela bese ibonisa ithebula nechathi enezakhi, izingaziwa, iphutha elilinganisiwe, ukucindezeleka okuphezulu (noma izinga lokushisa) nokuguquka (noma ukugeleza kokushisa) ngesigaba ngasinye, nomugqa ochaza ukuthi kungani kumile: umgomo ufinyelelwe, izigaba seziphelile, imeshi elandelayo yayiyoba inkulu kakhulu, noma isigaba sehlulekile (bese ubona isigaba sokugcina esiphumelele). Funda isilinganiso njengesilinganiso. Siqhathaniswa nezimpendulo ezinembile, siyafunda cishe ku-0.6 kuya ku-0.95 wephutha langempela (i-Zienkiewicz–Zhu), siphimisa iphutha kwingxenye yonke, ngakho ukucindezeleka okuphezulu esimeni sesimbobo noma i-fillet kuvame ukusalokhu kuphambuka kancane lapho isilinganiso sibukeka sincane: ngokucindezeleka kokugoba, setha umkhawulo ngaphansi kwe-1 % bese ubona ukucindezeleka kuzinza kusuka esigabeni kuya kwesilandelayo. Ekhoneni elibukhali langaphakathi noma emphethweni wobuso obubanjiwe ukucindezeleka langempela kungapheli, ngakho isilinganiso asikaze sifinyelele lapho: izigaba ziphela kunalokho. Ifrikhwensi yemvelo nokuwohloka. Ocwaningweni lwefrikhwensi yemvelo isilinganiso sihlanganisa zonke izimo ozicelile, ngayinye ibalwa ngokufanayo; ithebula nochathi kulandela ifrikhwensi mbili zokuqala. Engxenyeni enobuso obuqondile kuphela, ifrikhwensi ingehla kuphela kusuka esigabeni kuya kwesilandelayo (imeshi ngayinye igcina eyandulele); ubuso obugobile nabo buya busondela esimweni sabo sangempela, okungashintsha ifrikhwensi kancane ngaloluphi uhlangothi. Ngokuwohloka isilinganiso sihlanganisa ukucindezeleka kwangaphambili nezimo zokuwohloka, nethebula lilandela izilinganiso zomthwalo. Kuhlolwe kwibha yensimbi engu-100 × 10 × 10 mm: ifrikhwensi yokuqala izinza kusuka ku-812.4 kuya ku-811.9 Hz phezu kwezigaba ezine, ingaphansi ka-0.4 % kwe-Euler–Bernoulli (engakunaki ukusika), kanti isilinganiso somthwalo wekholomu sisebangeni le-0.5 % le-Euler. Bamba bese uyilayisha Yonke ucwaningo budinga okungenani isekelo elilodwa, kanti ukucindezeleka kudinga umthwalo owodwa. Cindezela Fixed kubha yamathuluzi. Isekelo elisha likhethiwe futhi lilinde ubuso: chofoza ubuso obuqinile (chofoza ubuso futhi ukhiphe). Cindezela Qedela ukukhetha noma Esc uma uqedile. Amakhoni amabhlu aphawula ubuso obubanjiwe. Cindezela Force bese uchofoza ubuso umthwalo osebenza kuwo. Ku-ipaneli thayipha Amandla aphelele ngama-newton bese ukhetha Indlela: ngena ebusweni, noma ngokuhambisana nomugqa. Amandla ahlukaniswa phezu kobuso obukhethiwe ngokusebenzisa indawo. Izimpini ezi-orenji zibonisa lokhu. Cindezela Pressure ngengcindezi ngama-MPa (N/mm²) ecindezela kubuso obukhethiwe; ingcindezi engemihle idonsa. Izinhlobo ezengeziwe zisohlwini lwe-Engeza kwipaneli: Ubuso obungenakho ukungqubuzana (ubuso bungashelela buzungeze uqobo kodwa ngeke buhambe bukhuphuke kuwo — lusebenzise ezindizeni zokulingana nasezisekelweni ezibushelelezi) kanye Nokudonsa komhlaba (isisindo sengxenye siqu, 9.81 m/s², endleleni okhetha yona). Isekelo elishiya ingxenye ikhululekile ukushelela noma ukujikeleza liyanqatshelwa, lisho ukunyakaza okushiyiwe okukhululekile. Xazulula bese ufunda imiphumela Cindezela Solve. Umsebenzi usebenza ngasemuva; Misa uyayikhansela. Bese: Ingxenye iphenduka umbala ngokucindezeleka kwe-von Mises; khetha Ukuguquka noma Isilinganiso sokuphepha ku-Bonisa. Isici sinikeza isikali. Khomba engxenyeni ukuze ufunde izinani ngaphansi kwesikhombi. Khetha Isimo esigobile ukubona ingxenye igobile (ukunyakaza kukhulisiwe ngu-Isikali; eyangempela ingeyethebula). Ithebula lidweba ukucindezeleka okukhulu nokuthi kuphi, ukuguquka okukhulu, isilinganiso sokuphepha esincane (amandla okukhiqiza ÷ ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises; ngaphansi kwe-1 impahla iyakhiqiza), umthwalo osetshenzisiwe kanye nokuphendula ezisekelweni (ziyalinganisa umthwalo), nemeshi esetshenzisiwe. Ngefrikhwensi yemvelo, khetha lolo Uhlobo, setha ukuthi yimingaki Izimo, bese uxazulula. Isimo ngasinye sibonisa ifrikhwensi nesimo sayo (izimo zilinganiswa zibe ngu-1 ekunyakazeni kwazo okukhulu kakhulu). Uma ushintsha ingxenye, imiphumela imaketwa ingasasebenzi: xazulula futhi. Ukukhiqiza nokuxhumana (izifundo ezingelona ulayini) Izinhlobo ezimbili zocwaningo ezengeziwe zidlula ku-\"impahla ihlala iguquguquka\": Okungelona ulayini (impahla iyakhiqiza) ilandela umugqa oqondile wempahla kuze kufike ekucindezelekeni kokukhiqiza, bese kuba nokuthambeka okuncane (Ukuthambeka ngemva kokukhiqiza, 1 % ye-E uma kushiyiwe ingenalutho). Umthwalo uqhubeka ku-Izinyathelo zomthwalo; isinyathelo esingazinzi siyehlukaniswa ngesikhathi sodwa. Imiphumela yengeza Ukuncipha kwepulasitiki emapulotini futhi ikhombise ukuthi umthwalo oningi kangakanani wathwalwa. Uma isinyathelo bese singazinzi, ucwaningo luyama esinyathelweni sokugcina esiphumelele kanti ipaneli ⚠ Izinkinga ikhomba lapho: ingxenye iphelelwe amandla khona (ukuwa), noma izinyathelo zinkulu kakhulu. Ukuxhumana phakathi kwezingcezu kuvumela izingcezu ezihlukene zengxenye zicindezelane. Engeza Ipheya lokuxhumana, khetha ubuso be-A (ubuso ocindezelayo) ngokuthi Pick faces, bese i-B ngokuthi Pick side B faces. Izingcezu ezingenakho ukungqubuzana ziyacindezela, zishelele futhi zihlukane; izingcezu ezibambelelene ziyahlala zibambelelene. Ingcezu ngayinye yenziwa imeshi yayo, ngakho igebe elincane phakathi kwazo lilungile. Ukuxhumana kuyindlela yesijeziso: izingcezu zicwila kancane ngaphakathi kwezinye (i-penalty factor × E ÷ usayizi wesakhi isetha ukuthi ukuxhumana kuqinile kangakanani). Ithebula likhombisa ukucwila okujulile kakhulu, nepaneli Izinkinga iyaxwayisa uma kungaphezu kuka-1 % wosayizi wesakhi: khuphula inkomba noma sebenzisa izakhi ezincane. Zombili zisebenzisa imeshi ye-tetrahedral. Ukungqubuzana, ukushelela okukhulu nokujikeleza okukhulu akuxazululwa lapha. Yisebenzise ku-CalculiX Thumela › CalculiX deck (.inp) (noma Save a CalculiX deck (.inp) kwipaneli) ilondoloza ucwaningo njengedeki lokufaka le-CalculiX, uhlelo olwehlukile olufakwa futhi olusetshenziswa wena: imeshi efanayo, impahla, izisekelo, imithwalo namapheya okuxhumana, ngama-mm, N kanye nama-MPa. Yisebenzise, bese Thumela › imiphumela ye-CalculiX (.frd) ifunda ifayela lalo lemiphumela libuyele kulimeshi efanayo ibonise ukuguquka (nokucindezeleka kwe-von Mises uma ifayela linokucindezeleka). Uma uguqule ingxenye noma usayizi wesakhi phakathi, imeshi ayifani futhi i-PartCraft iyakutshela: londoloza idekhi entsha. Ukuthembeka kwayo kangakanani I-PartCraft ihlola isixazululi sayo ngamafomula ngesandla (ukuguquka kwesiphetho se-cantilever PL³/3EI ngaphakathi kwe-1 %, ukweluka kwebha PL/AE ngokuqondile, ifrikhwensi yokuqala ye-cantilever ngaphakathi kwe-3 %, ukucindezeleka ozungezile isimbobo kupuleti). Nokho, gcina lezi zinkawu zengqondo: Imeshi. Ngama-tetrahedra, i-PartCraft ihlola ukuguquka kwe-cantilever nokucindezeleka kokugoba (ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 %), ukucindezeleka esimbobeni kupuleti (Kt, ngaphakathi cishe kuka-1 %), ithubhu elijulile ngaphansi kwengcindezi (Lamé, ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 %) nefrikhwensi yokuqala (ngaphakathi kuka-0.4 %). Ithebula likhombisa ikhwalithi yemeshi (amakona amancane nakakhulu phakathi kobuso bezakhi; ngaphansi cishe kuka-10° isakhi siyimpuphu) kanye nephutha lokucindezeleka elilinganisiwe: uma likhulu kuno-amaphesenti ambalwa, xazulula futhi ngosayizi wesakhi omncane, noma vumela Lungisa ngokuzenzakalela kukwenze. Kupuleti elinesimbobo nebha elinemigoqo emibili emaphethelweni, ukulungisa ngokuzenzakalela kwafinyelela ngaphakathi kuka-1 % we-Kt yencwadi cishe ngesithupha sezingaziwa ezadingwa ukwenza imeshi yonke ibe mncane. Ngamakhyubhu e-voxel, isimbobo noma i-fillet iba yindiza enamasitebhisi ngosayizi wekhyubhu, ngakho ukucindezeleka lapho kuba nzima. Amakhona abukhali angaphakathi nemiphetho yobuso obubanjiwe awanawo amandla aphakeme langempela. Inani lapho liqhubeka likhula njengoba izakhi zincipha. Funda ukucindezeleka kancane kude nalezi zindawo, noma gobisa ikhona kumodeli. Imiphumela okufanele uyifunde. Ngaphandle kokucindezeleka kwe-von Mises, ukuguquka nesilinganiso sokuphepha, ucwaningo lwe-tetrahedral lubonisa ukucindezeleka okukhulu nokuncane kwe-principal (ukuqina nokucindezela) kanye nokuguquka okulinganayo. Khetha Bonisa imeshi ukubona izakhi. Izifundo ezimile zingelona ulayini futhi ziyaguquguquka. Ukukhiqiza nokuxhumana sebenzisa izinhlobo zocwaningo ezingelona ulayini ezingenhla; ukuguquka okukhulu nokukhathala akuxazululwa. Ukushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka komugqa kungezinye izinhlobo zocwaningo: bheka Ukushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka. Yonke impahla ifana kuzo zonke izindlela. Izinto zepulasitiki ezikhiwe nge-3D zibuthakathaka ngokusontela izungu lazo, ngokuvamile ngesithathu noma ngaphezulu. Lesi yinguqulo yelabhorethri: hlola izingxenye ezibalulekile ngenye indlela. Buyekeza ngenkathi uhlela (Live) Khetha Buyekeza ngenkathi ngihlela kwibhlogo ye-Solve bese izimpendulo zeSimulation zilandela ukuhlela kwakho. Shintsha isilinganiso, umthwalo, impahla noma indawo, bese impendulo esheshayo ivela masinyane, yenziwe ngezakhi ezine zinkulu kunezocwaningo; uma uyama isikhashana (isekhondi noma cishe), impendulo ehlaziywe yocwaningo siyayithatha indawo. Imiphumela ikhombisa ukuthi ubheka eyiphi (\"Impendulo esheshayo\" noma \"Impendulo ehlaziywe\") nosayizi wesakhi. Impendulo esheshayo ilungele isiqondiso nosayizi: ku-cantilever yensimbi yayiphakathi kuka-1 % ngokuguquka nasekuzeni ka-4 % ngokucindezeleka kweyehlaziywe. Thembela kweyehlaziywe ngezinombolo ozozisebenzisa. Izifundo ezimile, zefrikhwensi yemvelo, zokushisa nokuwohloka zisebenza ngale ndlela; i-Live iyisilungiselelo sokubuka futhi ayigcinwa engxenyeni. Ukuxazulula ocindezela wena kuhlala kunjalo kuze kube yilolo shintsho olulandelayo. Thola ukuthi yini ephulayo kuqala (Yiphule) Ocwaningweni lokuqina noma lokuwohloka, cindezela Yini ephulayo kuqala? kwibhlogo ethi Yiphule. I-PartCraft ilinganisa imithwalo yocwaningo (amandla, ingcindezi nesisindo ndawonye)ize ingxenye inikele, bese ibhala, okubi kakhulu kuqala, isilinganiso somthwalo ekukhiqizeni kokuqala (isilinganiso semithwalo yanamuhla lapho ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises okuphezulu kufinyelela ukukhiqiza kwempahla, kunophawu obubomvu lapho kwenzeka khona) kanye nesilinganiso somthwalo ekuwohlokeni ngezisekelo nemithwalo efanayo. Isilinganiso se-4.3 sisho ukuthi ingxenye ithwala izikhathi ezi-4.3 umthwalo wayo ngaphambi kokukhiqiza; isilinganiso esingaphansi kwe-1 sisho ukuthi sesinikele ngenxa yomthwalo osuvele ulayishiwe, futhi lokho kuvela kuhlu lweZinkinga njengephutha (ukutholakala okubuthakathaka kakhulu kuboniswa njengenothi noma kwenzeka konke kugcina). Izilinganiso zivela kucwaningo olulinganayo ku-tetrahedra ngosayizi wesakhi wakho, ngakho zinhle njengalolo cwaningo: ukucindezeleka esibindeni esilungisiwe noma ekhoneni elibukhali akunawo amandla aphakeme langempela (bheka ngezansi), futhi isilinganiso sokukhiqiza sizoba ngehlangothi elicwebezelayo lapho. Umsizi wakho angenza lokhu kuhlolwa ngethuluzi break_run. Okuhlobene Ukushisa, ukucindezeleka okushisayo nokuwohloka Khulisa isimo kusuka emithwalweni (Generative) Linganisa izibalo, ama-engeli nobunzima Okungakakwakhiwa","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"finish-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuqedwa kwe-3D: Nxande ne-Iskalobhu","summary":"Qeda umphezulu ogobile wemodeli yonke ngebhola, i-bull-nose noma isiphetho esiyisicaba, ngemigqa enxande ngayo yonke i-engeli noma ngamapasi ahlukaniswe ngebanga elithile ukuze amagquma aphakathi kwawo agcine ukuphakama ocelayo. Okwenziwa yizindlela ezikuqinisekisayo, nokungakwenzi.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["ukuqedwa kwe-3D","ukuqeda","nxande","raster","scallop","iskalobhu","cusp","ibhola","bull nose","umphezulu","ukubekezelela","isinyathelo","ithambeka","insalela yokuhlala","drop cutter","gouge"],"headings":[{"id":"nxande","text":"Nxande","level":2},{"id":"scallop","text":"Scallop","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-izindlela-zinhle-kangakanani","text":"Ukuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi emibili kwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManufacture\u003C/span\u003E isika umphezulu wemodeli yonke ngethuluzi elibekwe lime (ama-eksisi amathathu). Azidingi ukukhetha: zisebenza kukho konke okwemodeli okubonakala sekusuka phezulu. Qala ngokuhlanza ingxenye kuqala (adaptive noma pocket); ukudlula kokuqeda phezu kwesitoko esingakasikwa kuxwayisa ukuthi kuzosika kujule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nxande\"\u003ENxande\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa eqondile ikhathazeke emodelini ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003Eengeli\u003C/strong\u003E osethayo, ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003Estepover\u003C/strong\u003E ngayinye (ingxenyana yobubanzi bethuluzi). Umugqa ngamunye ulandela umphezulu: ingcino yethuluzi iphakama kangangoba kufanele ukuze akukho ngxenye yesikhangiswa esehla ngaphansi kwemodeli, futhi umugqa usikwa kahle kakhulu lapho umphezulu ugoba khona. Uma i-\u003Cstrong\u003EZig-zag\u003C/strong\u003E ivuliwe, ithuluzi lihlala lingene phakathi kwemigqa lapho lingakwenza ngokuphepha (lihlolwa ngakho konke ukuhamba); ngaphandle kwalokho liyaphakama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubekezelela\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuthi ingxenye eqondile yomugqa ingaba kude kangakanani nokuphakama kwecino langempela (uhhafu walo usetshenziswa njengomkhawulo maphakathi nengxenye ngayinye). Okuzenzakalelayo ngu-0.01 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuphela lapho umphezulu usuka ku-… kuya ku-… (°)\u003C/strong\u003E: qeda izindawo ezincane kuphela noma ezinamathambeka kuphela. Lapho umphezulu ungaphandle kwalobo bubanzi, umugqa uyashiywa futhi ithuluzi liyaphakama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko esizoshiya\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli ehlanganiswe ngalobo bubanzi (ithuluzi lithanda ukukhula ngalo: liyalungela amabhola nama-bull-nose; ithuluzi elingalingene lishiya okungenani lowo mthamo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEzansi\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho okusikwa ngaphansi kwalolu z.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scallop\"\u003EScallop\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapasi agcina ibanga elingashintshi phezu komphezulu kusuka komunye, ukuze igquma (i-scallop) eshiywe phakathi kwamapasi amabili amakhelwane libe \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuphakama\u003C/strong\u003E oyicelayo. Ibanga lilandela ukuphakama kanye nomsakazo webhola: s = 2·√(2·R·h − h²), isibonelo cishe 0.69 mm phakathi kwamapasi ngebhola Ø6 negquma elingu-0.02 mm. I-bull-nose isebenzisa umsakazo wekhoni layo. Isiphetho esiyisicaba siyenqatshelwa: asinagquma lokulinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapasi aqala \u003Cstrong\u003Eemphethelweni wemodeli, ngena ngaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Engaphezulu kwemodeli, ehla phansi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ayizinxanxathela zebanga phezu komphezulu (hhayi zokuphakama), ngakho ethambekile aseduze ngepulani, nasesihlahleni abanda. Ibanga linqunywa ku-grid phezu komphezulu futhi linemiphumela ecishe ibe ngu-1 %; ukuphakama kwegquma kuqondile lapho umphezulu uyisicaba noma ugoba kancane, kuseduze lapho ugoba ngokushesha. \u003Cstrong\u003EClimb\u003C/strong\u003E igcina uhlangothi oluphezulu lomphezulu ngakwesokudla sethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-izindlela-zinhle-kangakanani\"\u003EUkuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlolwayo yilokho okuhlolwa ngezibalo ezivaliwe noma ngokusesha okuzimele kwesikhala sethuluzi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphakama kwecino ngaphansi kwethuluzi kuqondile kwebhola, kwe-bull-nose nakwesiyisicaba ezindaweni, emaphethelweni nasemakhoneni e-mesh, futhi akusoze kube phezulu kunokuphakama kwangempela; kwemigqa enxande indlela ihlala ngaphakathi kokubekezelela kwayo, ingekho ukugawuka okujule kunalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbude bezindlela ebhodweni elithambekile buvumelana nesibalo esivaliwe; amapasi e-scallop esicaba ahlukaniswe ngebanga elicelwe, negquma phakathi kwawo liphuma ngokuphakama okucelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulingiswa kwesitoko akubonisi ukugawuka ngemva kwedlulo futhi kubonisa amagquma asele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zindlela akuzona: ziyizindlela zokuqeda ezilula, hhayi konke okunikezwa uhlelo lokukhiqiza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukakhiwa: ukuqeda ngomugqa wokuphakama okungashintshi (constant z), ukuhlanza ngepensela nasemakhoneni, amapasi aphuma emagqumeni, ukuprojekta ivini phezu komphezulu, ukuthola izindawo ezicishe zibe nesicaba, nokuhlola ukushaywa kwesibambi nesiqu. Ukuhlanza nokusala okusele kuyimisebenzi yabo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003EUkuhlanza nge-3D nokusala okusele\u003C/a\u003E; ithuluzi elithambekayo lingu-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#5-axis-finishing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"5-axis-finishing\"\u003EUkuqedwa kwe-5-eksisi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhungo sethuluzi sihlala phezu kwemodeli: izindlela ziyama emaphethelweni emodeli esikhundleni sokuqhubeka zingaphandle kwayo, ngakho udonga oluma ngqo ngasemphethelweni alugcini kuze kufike ezansi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugoba okungaphansi akubonwa (umphezulu uwukuthi ithuluzi lihlangana nawo lisuka phezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli iyi-mesh evela ku-kernel, ngakho izindlela zilandela i-mesh (ukubekezelela kwayo kwe-chord cishe 0.0002 wedayagonali yengxenye), hhayi umphezulu oqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda imodeli enkulu ngokubekezelela okuncane kwenza uhlelo olude olunemigqa emifushane eminingi. Hlola okuphumayo kusimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Imisebenzi emibili kwi-Manufacture isika umphezulu wemodeli yonke ngethuluzi elibekwe lime (ama-eksisi amathathu). Azidingi ukukhetha: zisebenza kukho konke okwemodeli okubonakala sekusuka phezulu. Qala ngokuhlanza ingxenye kuqala (adaptive noma pocket); ukudlula kokuqeda phezu kwesitoko esingakasikwa kuxwayisa ukuthi kuzosika kujule. Nxande Imigqa eqondile ikhathazeke emodelini ngo-engeli osethayo, ngo-stepover ngayinye (ingxenyana yobubanzi bethuluzi). Umugqa ngamunye ulandela umphezulu: ingcino yethuluzi iphakama kangangoba kufanele ukuze akukho ngxenye yesikhangiswa esehla ngaphansi kwemodeli, futhi umugqa usikwa kahle kakhulu lapho umphezulu ugoba khona. Uma i-Zig-zag ivuliwe, ithuluzi lihlala lingene phakathi kwemigqa lapho lingakwenza ngokuphepha (lihlolwa ngakho konke ukuhamba); ngaphandle kwalokho liyaphakama. Ukubekezelela: ukuthi ingxenye eqondile yomugqa ingaba kude kangakanani nokuphakama kwecino langempela (uhhafu walo usetshenziswa njengomkhawulo maphakathi nengxenye ngayinye). Okuzenzakalelayo ngu-0.01 mm. Kuphela lapho umphezulu usuka ku-… kuya ku-… (°): qeda izindawo ezincane kuphela noma ezinamathambeka kuphela. Lapho umphezulu ungaphandle kwalobo bubanzi, umugqa uyashiywa futhi ithuluzi liyaphakama. Isitoko esizoshiya: imodeli ehlanganiswe ngalobo bubanzi (ithuluzi lithanda ukukhula ngalo: liyalungela amabhola nama-bull-nose; ithuluzi elingalingene lishiya okungenani lowo mthamo). Ezansi: akukho okusikwa ngaphansi kwalolu z. Scallop Amapasi agcina ibanga elingashintshi phezu komphezulu kusuka komunye, ukuze igquma (i-scallop) eshiywe phakathi kwamapasi amabili amakhelwane libe ukuphakama oyicelayo. Ibanga lilandela ukuphakama kanye nomsakazo webhola: s = 2·√(2·R·h − h²), isibonelo cishe 0.69 mm phakathi kwamapasi ngebhola Ø6 negquma elingu-0.02 mm. I-bull-nose isebenzisa umsakazo wekhoni layo. Isiphetho esiyisicaba siyenqatshelwa: asinagquma lokulinganisa. Amapasi aqala emphethelweni wemodeli, ngena ngaphakathi noma ngaphezulu kwemodeli, ehla phansi. Ayizinxanxathela zebanga phezu komphezulu (hhayi zokuphakama), ngakho ethambekile aseduze ngepulani, nasesihlahleni abanda. Ibanga linqunywa ku-grid phezu komphezulu futhi linemiphumela ecishe ibe ngu-1 %; ukuphakama kwegquma kuqondile lapho umphezulu uyisicaba noma ugoba kancane, kuseduze lapho ugoba ngokushesha. Climb igcina uhlangothi oluphezulu lomphezulu ngakwesokudla sethuluzi. Ukuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani Okuhlolwayo yilokho okuhlolwa ngezibalo ezivaliwe noma ngokusesha okuzimele kwesikhala sethuluzi: Ukuphakama kwecino ngaphansi kwethuluzi kuqondile kwebhola, kwe-bull-nose nakwesiyisicaba ezindaweni, emaphethelweni nasemakhoneni e-mesh, futhi akusoze kube phezulu kunokuphakama kwangempela; kwemigqa enxande indlela ihlala ngaphakathi kokubekezelela kwayo, ingekho ukugawuka okujule kunalokho. Ubude bezindlela ebhodweni elithambekile buvumelana nesibalo esivaliwe; amapasi e-scallop esicaba ahlukaniswe ngebanga elicelwe, negquma phakathi kwawo liphuma ngokuphakama okucelwe. Ukulingiswa kwesitoko akubonisi ukugawuka ngemva kwedlulo futhi kubonisa amagquma asele. Lezi zindlela akuzona: ziyizindlela zokuqeda ezilula, hhayi konke okunikezwa uhlelo lokukhiqiza. Akukakhiwa: ukuqeda ngomugqa wokuphakama okungashintshi (constant z), ukuhlanza ngepensela nasemakhoneni, amapasi aphuma emagqumeni, ukuprojekta ivini phezu komphezulu, ukuthola izindawo ezicishe zibe nesicaba, nokuhlola ukushaywa kwesibambi nesiqu. Ukuhlanza nokusala okusele kuyimisebenzi yabo Ukuhlanza nge-3D nokusala okusele; ithuluzi elithambekayo lingu-Ukuqedwa kwe-5-eksisi. Isikhungo sethuluzi sihlala phezu kwemodeli: izindlela ziyama emaphethelweni emodeli esikhundleni sokuqhubeka zingaphandle kwayo, ngakho udonga oluma ngqo ngasemphethelweni alugcini kuze kufike ezansi kwalo. Ukugoba okungaphansi akubonwa (umphezulu uwukuthi ithuluzi lihlangana nawo lisuka phezulu). Imodeli iyi-mesh evela ku-kernel, ngakho izindlela zilandela i-mesh (ukubekezelela kwayo kwe-chord cishe 0.0002 wedayagonali yengxenye), hhayi umphezulu oqondile. Ukuqeda imodeli enkulu ngokubekezelela okuncane kwenza uhlelo olude olunemigqa emifushane eminingi. Hlola okuphumayo kusimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"thermal-and-buckling","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukushisa, uxinezelo lokushisa nokuphambuka","summary":"Thola izinga lokushisa engxenyeni kusukela ezingeni elisethiwe lokushisa, ukugeleza kokushisa, amandla okushisa, ukuhamba komoya nemisebe (okuzinzile noma ngesikhathi), layisha isifundo sokucindezeleka ngokukhuphuka kwezinga lokushisa, bese uthola umthwalo lapho ingxenye emincane ephambuka khona, nokuthi yiziphi izinto ezingakutshela zona.","section":"tasks","order":143,"keywords":["thermal","ukudluliswa kokushisa","ukushisa","izinga lokushisa","ukuqhutshwa","ukuhamba komoya","convection","film coefficient","imisebe","radiation","emissivity","ukugeleza kokushisa","amandla okushisa","ukukhiqizwa kokushisa","heat sink","transient","isikhathi","ukupholisa","ukushisa","Crank-Nicolson","implicit Euler","ibalansi yokushisa","uxinezelo lokushisa","uxinezelo lokushisa ngesikhathi","transient thermal stress","quench","thermal shock","umlando woxinezelo","isikhathi esibi kakhulu","ukunwebeka kokushisa","ikhoyifisheni yokunwebeka","ukuphambuka","ukuphambuka kuka-Euler","load factor","umthwalo ovamile","column","slender","eigenvalue"],"headings":[{"id":"ukushisa-umshisa-uya-kuphi","text":"Ukushisa: umshisa uya kuphi?","level":2},{"id":"ngokuhamba-kwesikhathi-transient","text":"Ngokuhamba kwesikhathi (transient)","level":3},{"id":"uxinezelo-lokushisa-ushintsho-lwezinga-lokushisa-lwenzani-engxenyeni","text":"Uxinezelo lokushisa: ushintsho lwezinga lokushisa lwenzani engxenyeni?","level":2},{"id":"ukuphambuka-ingxenye-emincane-iphela-nini","text":"Ukuphambuka: ingxenye emincane iphela nini?","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-ungakwethemba-kangakanani","text":"Ukuthi ungakwethemba kangakanani","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELezi zifundo zihlala ku-Simulation workspace eduze koxinezelo oluzinzile nemvamisa yemvelo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola uxinezelo nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E). Zikhethwe ebhokisini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E lephaneli. Zisebenzisa imeshi efanayo yamakhyubhu amancane nohlu lwezinto olufanayo; zonke izinto zomtapo zinendlela yokudlulisa ukushisa, ukushisa okuthile nekhoyifisheni yokunwebeka (amanani ajwayelekile esimisweni, akhonjiswa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukushisa-umshisa-uya-kuphi\"\u003EUkushisa: umshisa uya kuphi?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EThermal (heat transfer)\u003C/strong\u003E njengohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza izimo zokushisa kusuka ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza\u003C/strong\u003E lephaneli, bese uchofoza izinhlangothi zazo (njengasezisekelweni nasemithwalweni):\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFixed temperature\u003C/strong\u003E: ubuso bubanjwe ezingeni lokushisa, ngo-°C.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat flux\u003C/strong\u003E: W/m² ogeleza ngaphakathi kubuso (okuyinegative kuphuma). Lusebenza ngendawo yangempela yobuso, nanxa amakhyubhu enza isitebhisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat power\u003C/strong\u003E: inani eliphelele ngama-watt, lihlukaniswe phezu kwezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe ngokwendawo. Usisebenzisela isishisi noma ichip enamandla aziwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConvection\u003C/strong\u003E: umoya noma uketshezi olunezinga lokushisa lususa ukushisa ngo-h W/(m²·K). Ama-h ajwayelekile: umoya ongenayo ukunyakaza 5–10, ifeni 25–100, amanzi 500–10,000. I-PartCraft ayibali h: kulesi sifundo akukho ukugeleza koketshezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadiation\u003C/strong\u003E: ubuso bukhipha imisebe ezindaweni ezizungezile ngezinga lokushisa, nge-emissivity esuka ku-0 kuya ku-1. Ilinearisiwe: imisebe ibhalwa njengecoefficient eshintsha ngezinga lokushisa futhi ixazululwe kabushaize izinze. Iya ezindaweni ezizungezile kuphela: ubuso abushintshi ukushisa omunye nomunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat generation\u003C/strong\u003E (W/m³) ishisa yonke ingxenye ngaphakathi, isibonelo ingxenye enokumelana kagesi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EXazulula\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingxenye iyakhanyisa ngokuya ngezinga lokushisa; khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EHeat flux\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona lapho ukushisa kugeleza khona. Yiyisa isikhombisi engxenyeni ukuze ufunde kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushisa okuzinzile kudinga indawo lapho kuhamba khona: okungenani izinga lokushisa elisethiwe elilodwa, ukuhamba komoya noma imisebe. Ingxenye ethatha ukushisa kuphela ayinasimo esizinzile; yenze i-transient.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula linikeza izinga lokushisa eliphansi naleliphezulu nendawo yazo, ukugeleza okukhulu kokushisa, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enebhalansi yokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E (heat balance): ukushisa okungena noma okuphuma kwisimo ngasinye (izinga lokushisa elisethiwe liyabala ukushisa okufanele lukuhlinzeke noma lukumunce), ukushisa okukhiqizwayo, izinkomba zonke zokungena nokuphuma, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enokungalingani\u003C/strong\u003E (imbalance). Ukungalingani kufanele kube ingxenyana encane kakhulu yokushisa okungenayo; okukhulu kusho ukuthi umphumela awuthenjwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ngokuhamba-kwesikhathi-transient\"\u003ENgokuhamba kwesikhathi (transient)\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThikha \u003Cstrong\u003ETransient\u003C/strong\u003E bese unikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokuqala lokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E (yonke ingxenye iqala lapho), \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi besikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E nenani le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyathelo zesikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EImplicit Euler\u003C/strong\u003E iqinile; \u003Cstrong\u003ECrank–Nicolson\u003C/strong\u003E inembile kakhulu ngezinyathelo ezifanayo kodwa ingaba nokuzamazama ngemva koshintsho olusheshayo. Ngemva kokuxazulula, hudula isilayidi se-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona izinga lokushisa ngesikhathi ngasinye (isikali sombala sihlala sifanayo ngayo yonke imizuzu). Ibhalansi yokushisa ifaka-ke nokushisa okugcinwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uxinezelo-lokushisa-ushintsho-lwezinga-lokushisa-lwenzani-engxenyeni\"\u003EUxinezelo lokushisa: ushintsho lwezinga lokushisa lwenzani engxenyeni?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsifundweni se-\u003Cstrong\u003EStatic stress\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EBuckling\u003C/strong\u003E), setha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmthwalo wokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUshintsho lwezinga lokushisa olufanayo\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke ingxenye iyafudumala (noma ipholile, uma inani liyinegative) ngalelo nani lama-kelvin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokushisa kusuka ezimweni zokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E: engeza izimo zokushisa esifundweni esifanayo; amazinga okushisa azinzile axazululwa kuqala kwimeshi efanayo, bese ingxenye inwebeka ngo α·(T − \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinga lokushisa elingenaxinezelo\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokushisa ngesikhathi (ukusebenza kwe-transient)\u003C/strong\u003E: engeza izimo zokushisa, bese unikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokuqala lokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi besikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyathelo zesikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003EUkwenyuka kwesikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E njengakokushisa okungaguquki. Amazinga okushisa axazululwa ngesikhathi kwimeshi efanayo (amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedra), futhi ukuxazulula okuzinzile ngamazinga okushisa kwesikhathi ngasinye kunikeza uxinezelo lwalowo mzuzu. \u003Cstrong\u003EUxinezelo ku-\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi esibi kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuqala): \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxazulula uxinezelo\u003C/strong\u003E kwenza izikhathi ezisatshalaliswe ngokulinganayo kuwo wonke umsebenzi, kuhlanganise nokuqala (ama-21 ngaphandle uma uwashintsha, afika kuma-51). Imiphumela ivula esikhathini esinoxinezelo lwe-von Mises olukhulu kakhulu; ithebula liyabiza ngegama, ichart elincane likhombisa uxinezelo oluphezulu ngesikhathi, futhi isilayidi se-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E sikhombisa uxinezelo kuzo zonke izikhathi ezixazululiwe (isikali sombala sihlala sesikhathi esibi kakhulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi esisodwa esikhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: umzuzu owodwa, isinyathelo sesikhathi esiseduze kakhulu ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi (s)\u003C/strong\u003E oyinikezayo. Ukuphambuka kuhlala kusikhathi esikhethiwe ngokuphelele (ukuphela komsebenzi uma ungasethi esinye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ecwiliswe (ishisa iphuma ibe ebandeni) noma eshiswe ngokushesha inikezwa uxinezelo olukhulu kakhulu lapho ingaphakathi nobuso kuhluke kakhulu: ngokuvamile ekuqaleni kakhulu. Izinga lokushisa elibanjiwe lisebenza kusukela esikhashana sokuqala, njengoshintsho olusheshayo, ngakho uxinezelo ekuqaleni ncamashi luncike ebukhulwini be-element (ama-element ambalwa kuphela abona ushintsho). Lufunde njengokuthi &quot;kuphezulu kakhulu&quot;, bese ubheka izikhathi ezilandelayo esilayidini ukuze uthole amanani imeshi ayakwazi ukubona. Uxinezelo luyi-quasi-static: akukho inertia, akukho ukunyakaza kwamavibrations ngenxa yoshintsho olusheshayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye enganwebeka ikhululekile ayinaxinezelo lokushisa: yibambe kuphela ngokwanele ukuvimbela ukunyakaza (isibonelo izinhlangothi ezintathu ezingenangqubuzano ezingqamanayo ngama-engeli amajamo). Ibanjwe phakathi kwezindonga ezimbili icindezelwa: ibha yensimbi efudunyezwe ngo-50 K phakathi kwezindonga eziqinile iphatha cishe ama-117 MPa. Imithwalo yokushisa iyazilinganisa, ngakho ukuphendula kusalingana kuphela nemithwalo yemishini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuphambuka-ingxenye-emincane-iphela-nini\"\u003EUkuphambuka: ingxenye emincane iphela nini?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBuckling (linear)\u003C/strong\u003E njengohlobo, bese wengeza izisekelo nemithwalo njengasekufundweni okuzinzile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad factors to find\u003C/strong\u003E (izindlela eziningi zokuphambuka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EXazulula\u003C/strong\u003E. Imodi ngayinye inento ethi \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor\u003C/strong\u003E: inani lemithwalo yakho lapho ingxenye engcono ephambuka khona. Load factor engu-3 kusho izikhathi ezintathu zemithwalo yakho; \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor engaphansi kuka-1 kusho ukuthi iphambuka ngaphansi kwemithwalo osuyisebenzisile\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebula linikeza futhi umthwalo ophelele kunoma iyiphi i-factor. Ukwakheka kwemodi kukhombisa ukuthi iphambuka kanjani (usayizi wayo awusho lutho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphambuka okulinear kukhombisa ngokweqile umthwalo wangempela wokuphambuka.\u003C/strong\u003E Kucabanga ingxenye ephelele: eqondile ngokuphelele, engenaxinezelo olusele, futhi eyinsiyo. Izingxenye zangempela zinezinkinga ezincane futhi zingathamba ngaphambi kokuphambuka, nezigqoko ezinezindonga ezincane zingaphambuka ngengxenyana yenani elilinear. Sebenzisa umkhawulo omkhulu, bese uthatha i-load factor eseduze noma ephansi ka-3 ngesigqoko esincane njengesixwayiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-ungakwethemba-kangakanani\"\u003EUkuthi ungakwethemba kangakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft ihlola lezi zixazululi ngamafomula esandleni: ibha phakathi kwamazinga okushisa amabili (ngokunembile), ifini elipholayo (ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 K), isilabhu esishisa ngokwaso (ngokunembile), ikhyubhu elipholayo ngesikhathi (ngaphakathi kuka-0.1 % nge-Crank–Nicolson), ibha eshiswe ngokushesha ekugcineni elilodwa, ibha ekhululekile efudunyeziwe (akukho xinezelo, ΔL = αLΔT), ibha ebanjwe phakathi kwezindonga (σ = −EαΔT), ipuleti elicwiliswayo ngesikhathi ngokuqhathaniswa nesixazululo sakudala se-series (ngaphakathi kuka-1 % emakhyubhini, 2.1 % kuma-tetrahedra esikhungweni salo; 0.5 % ebusweni balo), izinyathelo zokugcina zokusebenza isikhathi eside ngokuqhathaniswa noxinezelo oluzinzile lokushisa (kufana kuze kube yisigidi), nezinsimbi zika-Euler (ngaphakathi kuka-1 % kubanjwe–kukhululekile, 1.5 % kubanjwe–kubanjwe). Gcina lokhu engqondweni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani ezinto angaguquki.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile nokunwebeka akushintshi lapha ngezinga lokushisa; ezinhlamvwini ezimbalwa zamadigri zingashintsha ngo-10–30 %. Ukuqina nakho akushintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUxinezelo ngesikhathi bungu-quasi-static futhi buyinsimbi\u003C/strong\u003E: umzuzu ngamunye ukuxazulula okuzinzile (akukho inertia), futhi akukho ukuthamba, ngakho ukucwiliswa okuzothambisa ubuso kubonisa uxinezelo ngaphezu kokuthamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-coefficient okuhamba komoya ngumnikelo wakho\u003C/strong\u003E, akabalwa ekugeleni komoya noma kwamanzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ukumelana kokuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye iyisolidi eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphambuka okulinear kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho ukungaphelele, akukho ukuthamba, akukho ukuziphatha ngemva kokuphambuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitebhisi semikhawulo yamakhyubhu nama-engeli angaphakathi abukhali kuthinta uxinezelo lokushisa ngendlela efanayo nokunye ukucindezeleka (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola uxinezelo nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELena ibuildi lelabhorethri: hlola izingxenye ezibalulekile ngenye indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola uxinezelo nokuguquka (Simulation)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lezi zifundo zihlala ku-Simulation workspace eduze koxinezelo oluzinzile nemvamisa yemvelo (bona Hlola uxinezelo nokuguquka). Zikhethwe ebhokisini le-Uhlobo lephaneli. Zisebenzisa imeshi efanayo yamakhyubhu amancane nohlu lwezinto olufanayo; zonke izinto zomtapo zinendlela yokudlulisa ukushisa, ukushisa okuthile nekhoyifisheni yokunwebeka (amanani ajwayelekile esimisweni, akhonjiswa ngaphansi kwe-Izakhiwo). Ukushisa: umshisa uya kuphi? Khetha Thermal (heat transfer) njengohlobo. Engeza izimo zokushisa kusuka ohlwini lwe-Engeza lephaneli, bese uchofoza izinhlangothi zazo (njengasezisekelweni nasemithwalweni): Fixed temperature: ubuso bubanjwe ezingeni lokushisa, ngo-°C. Heat flux: W/m² ogeleza ngaphakathi kubuso (okuyinegative kuphuma). Lusebenza ngendawo yangempela yobuso, nanxa amakhyubhu enza isitebhisi. Heat power: inani eliphelele ngama-watt, lihlukaniswe phezu kwezinhlangothi ezikhethiwe ngokwendawo. Usisebenzisela isishisi noma ichip enamandla aziwayo. Convection: umoya noma uketshezi olunezinga lokushisa lususa ukushisa ngo-h W/(m²·K). Ama-h ajwayelekile: umoya ongenayo ukunyakaza 5–10, ifeni 25–100, amanzi 500–10,000. I-PartCraft ayibali h: kulesi sifundo akukho ukugeleza koketshezi. Radiation: ubuso bukhipha imisebe ezindaweni ezizungezile ngezinga lokushisa, nge-emissivity esuka ku-0 kuya ku-1. Ilinearisiwe: imisebe ibhalwa njengecoefficient eshintsha ngezinga lokushisa futhi ixazululwe kabushaize izinze. Iya ezindaweni ezizungezile kuphela: ubuso abushintshi ukushisa omunye nomunye. Heat generation (W/m³) ishisa yonke ingxenye ngaphakathi, isibonelo ingxenye enokumelana kagesi. Cindezela Xazulula. Ingxenye iyakhanyisa ngokuya ngezinga lokushisa; khetha Heat flux ku-Bonisa ukubona lapho ukushisa kugeleza khona. Yiyisa isikhombisi engxenyeni ukuze ufunde kokubili. Ukushisa okuzinzile kudinga indawo lapho kuhamba khona: okungenani izinga lokushisa elisethiwe elilodwa, ukuhamba komoya noma imisebe. Ingxenye ethatha ukushisa kuphela ayinasimo esizinzile; yenze i-transient. Ithebula linikeza izinga lokushisa eliphansi naleliphezulu nendawo yazo, ukugeleza okukhulu kokushisa, kanye nebhalansi yokushisa (heat balance): ukushisa okungena noma okuphuma kwisimo ngasinye (izinga lokushisa elisethiwe liyabala ukushisa okufanele lukuhlinzeke noma lukumunce), ukushisa okukhiqizwayo, izinkomba zonke zokungena nokuphuma, kanye nokungalingani (imbalance). Ukungalingani kufanele kube ingxenyana encane kakhulu yokushisa okungenayo; okukhulu kusho ukuthi umphumela awuthenjwa. Ngokuhamba kwesikhathi (transient) Thikha Transient bese unikeza Izinga lokuqala lokushisa (yonke ingxenye iqala lapho), Ububanzi besikhathi nenani le-Izinyathelo zesikhathi. Implicit Euler iqinile; Crank–Nicolson inembile kakhulu ngezinyathelo ezifanayo kodwa ingaba nokuzamazama ngemva koshintsho olusheshayo. Ngemva kokuxazulula, hudula isilayidi se-Isikhathi ukubona izinga lokushisa ngesikhathi ngasinye (isikali sombala sihlala sifanayo ngayo yonke imizuzu). Ibhalansi yokushisa ifaka-ke nokushisa okugcinwayo. Uxinezelo lokushisa: ushintsho lwezinga lokushisa lwenzani engxenyeni? Esifundweni se-Static stress (noma Buckling), setha Umthwalo wokushisa: Ushintsho lwezinga lokushisa olufanayo: yonke ingxenye iyafudumala (noma ipholile, uma inani liyinegative) ngalelo nani lama-kelvin. Izinga lokushisa kusuka ezimweni zokushisa: engeza izimo zokushisa esifundweni esifanayo; amazinga okushisa azinzile axazululwa kuqala kwimeshi efanayo, bese ingxenye inwebeka ngo α·(T − izinga lokushisa elingenaxinezelo). Izinga lokushisa ngesikhathi (ukusebenza kwe-transient): engeza izimo zokushisa, bese unikeza Izinga lokuqala lokushisa, Ububanzi besikhathi, Izinyathelo zesikhathi no Ukwenyuka kwesikhathi njengakokushisa okungaguquki. Amazinga okushisa axazululwa ngesikhathi kwimeshi efanayo (amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedra), futhi ukuxazulula okuzinzile ngamazinga okushisa kwesikhathi ngasinye kunikeza uxinezelo lwalowo mzuzu. Uxinezelo ku-: Isikhathi esibi kakhulu (ukuqala): Ukuxazulula uxinezelo kwenza izikhathi ezisatshalaliswe ngokulinganayo kuwo wonke umsebenzi, kuhlanganise nokuqala (ama-21 ngaphandle uma uwashintsha, afika kuma-51). Imiphumela ivula esikhathini esinoxinezelo lwe-von Mises olukhulu kakhulu; ithebula liyabiza ngegama, ichart elincane likhombisa uxinezelo oluphezulu ngesikhathi, futhi isilayidi se-Isikhathi sikhombisa uxinezelo kuzo zonke izikhathi ezixazululiwe (isikali sombala sihlala sesikhathi esibi kakhulu). Isikhathi esisodwa esikhethiwe: umzuzu owodwa, isinyathelo sesikhathi esiseduze kakhulu ne-Isikhathi (s) oyinikezayo. Ukuphambuka kuhlala kusikhathi esikhethiwe ngokuphelele (ukuphela komsebenzi uma ungasethi esinye). Ingxenye ecwiliswe (ishisa iphuma ibe ebandeni) noma eshiswe ngokushesha inikezwa uxinezelo olukhulu kakhulu lapho ingaphakathi nobuso kuhluke kakhulu: ngokuvamile ekuqaleni kakhulu. Izinga lokushisa elibanjiwe lisebenza kusukela esikhashana sokuqala, njengoshintsho olusheshayo, ngakho uxinezelo ekuqaleni ncamashi luncike ebukhulwini be-element (ama-element ambalwa kuphela abona ushintsho). Lufunde njengokuthi \"kuphezulu kakhulu\", bese ubheka izikhathi ezilandelayo esilayidini ukuze uthole amanani imeshi ayakwazi ukubona. Uxinezelo luyi-quasi-static: akukho inertia, akukho ukunyakaza kwamavibrations ngenxa yoshintsho olusheshayo. Ingxenye enganwebeka ikhululekile ayinaxinezelo lokushisa: yibambe kuphela ngokwanele ukuvimbela ukunyakaza (isibonelo izinhlangothi ezintathu ezingenangqubuzano ezingqamanayo ngama-engeli amajamo). Ibanjwe phakathi kwezindonga ezimbili icindezelwa: ibha yensimbi efudunyezwe ngo-50 K phakathi kwezindonga eziqinile iphatha cishe ama-117 MPa. Imithwalo yokushisa iyazilinganisa, ngakho ukuphendula kusalingana kuphela nemithwalo yemishini. Ukuphambuka: ingxenye emincane iphela nini? Khetha Buckling (linear) njengohlobo, bese wengeza izisekelo nemithwalo njengasekufundweni okuzinzile. Setha Load factors to find (izindlela eziningi zokuphambuka). Cindezela Xazulula. Imodi ngayinye inento ethi load factor: inani lemithwalo yakho lapho ingxenye engcono ephambuka khona. Load factor engu-3 kusho izikhathi ezintathu zemithwalo yakho; load factor engaphansi kuka-1 kusho ukuthi iphambuka ngaphansi kwemithwalo osuyisebenzisile. Ithebula linikeza futhi umthwalo ophelele kunoma iyiphi i-factor. Ukwakheka kwemodi kukhombisa ukuthi iphambuka kanjani (usayizi wayo awusho lutho). Ukuphambuka okulinear kukhombisa ngokweqile umthwalo wangempela wokuphambuka. Kucabanga ingxenye ephelele: eqondile ngokuphelele, engenaxinezelo olusele, futhi eyinsiyo. Izingxenye zangempela zinezinkinga ezincane futhi zingathamba ngaphambi kokuphambuka, nezigqoko ezinezindonga ezincane zingaphambuka ngengxenyana yenani elilinear. Sebenzisa umkhawulo omkhulu, bese uthatha i-load factor eseduze noma ephansi ka-3 ngesigqoko esincane njengesixwayiso. Ukuthi ungakwethemba kangakanani PartCraft ihlola lezi zixazululi ngamafomula esandleni: ibha phakathi kwamazinga okushisa amabili (ngokunembile), ifini elipholayo (ngaphakathi kuka-0.3 K), isilabhu esishisa ngokwaso (ngokunembile), ikhyubhu elipholayo ngesikhathi (ngaphakathi kuka-0.1 % nge-Crank–Nicolson), ibha eshiswe ngokushesha ekugcineni elilodwa, ibha ekhululekile efudunyeziwe (akukho xinezelo, ΔL = αLΔT), ibha ebanjwe phakathi kwezindonga (σ = −EαΔT), ipuleti elicwiliswayo ngesikhathi ngokuqhathaniswa nesixazululo sakudala se-series (ngaphakathi kuka-1 % emakhyubhini, 2.1 % kuma-tetrahedra esikhungweni salo; 0.5 % ebusweni balo), izinyathelo zokugcina zokusebenza isikhathi eside ngokuqhathaniswa noxinezelo oluzinzile lokushisa (kufana kuze kube yisigidi), nezinsimbi zika-Euler (ngaphakathi kuka-1 % kubanjwe–kukhululekile, 1.5 % kubanjwe–kubanjwe). Gcina lokhu engqondweni: Amanani ezinto angaguquki. Ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile nokunwebeka akushintshi lapha ngezinga lokushisa; ezinhlamvwini ezimbalwa zamadigri zingashintsha ngo-10–30 %. Ukuqina nakho akushintshi. Uxinezelo ngesikhathi bungu-quasi-static futhi buyinsimbi: umzuzu ngamunye ukuxazulula okuzinzile (akukho inertia), futhi akukho ukuthamba, ngakho ukucwiliswa okuzothambisa ubuso kubonisa uxinezelo ngaphezu kokuthamba. Ama-coefficient okuhamba komoya ngumnikelo wakho, akabalwa ekugeleni komoya noma kwamanzi. Akukho ukumelana kokuthinta: ingxenye iyisolidi eyodwa. Ukuphambuka okulinear kuphela: akukho ukungaphelele, akukho ukuthamba, akukho ukuziphatha ngemva kokuphambuka. Isitebhisi semikhawulo yamakhyubhu nama-engeli angaphakathi abukhali kuthinta uxinezelo lokushisa ngendlela efanayo nokunye ukucindezeleka (bona Hlola uxinezelo nokuguquka). Lena ibuildi lelabhorethri: hlola izingxenye ezibalulekile ngenye indlela. Okuhlobene Hlola uxinezelo nokuguquka (Simulation) Okungakakhiwa okwamanje","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tool-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Umtapo wamathuluzi","summary":"Londoloza amathuluzi osebenzisa kusiphequluli ukuze wonke amapart abe nawo, futhi uhambise imitapo yamathuluzi phakathi kwamakhompyutha njengefayela le-JSON.","section":"tasks","order":143,"keywords":["umtapo wamathuluzi","amathuluzi","export","import","JSON","londoloza amathuluzi","inombolo ye-T","end mill","amathuluzi esitolo"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E ye-Manufacture ilanda amathuluzi engxenye. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo wamathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E ungagcina amathuluzi akho ngaphezu kwengxenye eyodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza leli thuluzi\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ithuluzi elikhethiwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ami alondoloziwe\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza wonke amathuluzi alengxenye\u003C/span\u003E yengeza wonke. Amathuluzi ami alondoloziwe agcinwa kulesi siphequluli futhi atholakala kuyo yonke ingxenye. Ithuluzi osele uliloondoloze (uhlobo, usayizi, izigxobo nokuguqula okuthayiphile) alikaphindwa kabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza kule ngxenye\u003C/span\u003E ufaka ithuluzi elilondoloziwe elikhethiwe engxenyeni. Uma inombolo yalo ye-T isuvele isetshenziswa ithuluzi elinye engxenyeni, luthola inombolo elandelayo etholakalayo, futhi iphaneli iyakusho lokho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa emtapweni wami\u003C/span\u003E iyasisusa ohlwini oluloondoloziwe (hhayi ezinxenyeni ezisevele zinalo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela amathuluzi…\u003C/span\u003E ibhala amathuluzi engxenye njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa amathuluzi…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza amathuluzi alelo fayela engxenyeni, ngemithetho efanayo (ithuluzi elisevele likhona liyashiywa, inombolo ye-T esetshenzisiwe iyashintsha). Ifayela libamba usayizi, izigxobo, izinto, nokuguqula kwesivinini nokudla okuthayiphile; alinazo izitembu (ids). Lisebenziseka ukudlulisa amathuluzi esitolo kukhompyutha esilandelayo, noma ukuwanikeza umngane wakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isiphequluli singagcini umtapo (isitoreji siyavalwa noma sigcwele), ukulondoloza kuyakusho lokho, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EThumela amathuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E iyindlela yokugcina ifayela. Ifayela kumele libe umtapo wamathuluzi we-PartCraft walesi sivivinyo noma owendala, unamathuluzi angaphansi kuka-500 anosayizi ovumelekile; okunye konke kuyenqatshwa ngesizathu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinga lokusika nama-chip load ahambisana nethuluzi ngalinye ngamanani okuqala; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003EYenza ama-toolpath kanye ne-G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ithebhu ethi Amathuluzi ye-Manufacture ilanda amathuluzi engxenye. Ngaphansi kwe-Umtapo wamathuluzi ungagcina amathuluzi akho ngaphezu kwengxenye eyodwa: Londoloza leli thuluzi yengeza ithuluzi elikhethiwe ku-Amathuluzi ami alondoloziwe; Londoloza wonke amathuluzi alengxenye yengeza wonke. Amathuluzi ami alondoloziwe agcinwa kulesi siphequluli futhi atholakala kuyo yonke ingxenye. Ithuluzi osele uliloondoloze (uhlobo, usayizi, izigxobo nokuguqula okuthayiphile) alikaphindwa kabili. Yengeza kule ngxenye ufaka ithuluzi elilondoloziwe elikhethiwe engxenyeni. Uma inombolo yalo ye-T isuvele isetshenziswa ithuluzi elinye engxenyeni, luthola inombolo elandelayo etholakalayo, futhi iphaneli iyakusho lokho. Susa emtapweni wami iyasisusa ohlwini oluloondoloziwe (hhayi ezinxenyeni ezisevele zinalo). Thumela amathuluzi… ibhala amathuluzi engxenye njengefayela le-.json; Ngenisa amathuluzi… yengeza amathuluzi alelo fayela engxenyeni, ngemithetho efanayo (ithuluzi elisevele likhona liyashiywa, inombolo ye-T esetshenzisiwe iyashintsha). Ifayela libamba usayizi, izigxobo, izinto, nokuguqula kwesivinini nokudla okuthayiphile; alinazo izitembu (ids). Lisebenziseka ukudlulisa amathuluzi esitolo kukhompyutha esilandelayo, noma ukuwanikeza umngane wakho. Uma isiphequluli singagcini umtapo (isitoreji siyavalwa noma sigcwele), ukulondoloza kuyakusho lokho, futhi Thumela amathuluzi iyindlela yokugcina ifayela. Ifayela kumele libe umtapo wamathuluzi we-PartCraft walesi sivivinyo noma owendala, unamathuluzi angaphansi kuka-500 anosayizi ovumelekile; okunye konke kuyenqatshwa ngesizathu. Izinga lokusika nama-chip load ahambisana nethuluzi ngalinye ngamanani okuqala; bona Yenza ama-toolpath kanye ne-G-code.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"generative-design","scope":"partcraft","title":"Khulisa isimo ngemithwalo (Generative)","summary":"Khetha ubuso obubanjiwe nobulayishwe, izindawo ezigcinwa nezigcinwa zicwebile, ama-ivolumu anjongiwe nezinto zokwakha, bese uzikhiqiza: izimo eziqinile kakhulu ezitholakala ngevolumu ngayinye, ezihlolwa futhi njengezisekelo, ziqhathaniswe ethebuleni bese ziphakanyiselwa nge-STL, STEP noma ingxenye entsha.","section":"tasks","order":144,"keywords":["ukwakha okungeziwe","ukulungiswa kwetopology","SIMP","ukukhanya","lattice","isimo sezinto eziphilayo","imiphumela","qhathanisa","ubuningi","inani le-volumu","gcina","gcina ngaphakathi","isithiyo","gcina ngaphandle","indawo yokwakha","usayizi omncane wesakhiwo","STL","ukuphrinta ngo-3D"],"headings":[{"id":"setha-isifundo","text":"Setha isifundo","level":2},{"id":"izinhloso","text":"Izinhloso","level":2},{"id":"khiqiza-bese-uqhathanisa","text":"Khiqiza bese uqhathanisa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-umphumela","text":"Sebenzisa umphumela","level":2},{"id":"ukwethemba-kangakanani","text":"Ukwethemba kangakanani","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-workspace ye-Generative isusa izinto ezingadingeki imithwalo. Uthi ingxenye ibanjwe kuphi futhi ilayishwe kuphi, yini okufanele ihlale ibambekile nokufanele ihlale ingenalutho; i-PartCraft ithola isimo esiqinile kakhulu ngevolumu ngayinye enjongiwe (\u003Cstrong\u003Etopology optimisation\u003C/strong\u003E), siphinde sihlolwe njengesisekelo nezinto zangempela, bese imiphumela ibonakala ndawonye. Isebenza ezinhlangothini ezibizwa ngamagama ikhestelo le-mesh elinikeza ingxenye (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EIkhestelo le-mesh\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EGenerative\u003C/strong\u003E kubhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingxenye yakho ayishintshi; isifundo sigcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela lengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-isifundo\"\u003ESetha isifundo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003ENew study\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpace\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cem\u003EThe part as it is\u003C/em\u003E isusa izinto engxenyeni yakho; \u003Cem\u003EA box around the part\u003C/em\u003E ikhulisa isimo ngaphakathi kwebhokisi elikhulu kunengxenye ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EBox margin\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EElement size\u003C/strong\u003E: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube usayizi ozenzakalelayo (cishe amaqembu ama-8,000), noma uthayiphe owodwa. Usayizi omncane unika izimo ezinemininingwane eminingi kodwa uthatha isikhathi eside.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMinimum member\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ezincane kakhulu kunalokhu cishe kabili azakhiwa. Ukungabi nalutho kusho amaseli ayisigamu nesisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza okungu-1 kuya kwayisithupha \u003Cstrong\u003ETarget volumes\u003C/strong\u003E (ingxenye yesikhala sokwakha isimo esingagcwalisa) nezinto ezingu-1 kuya kwezine \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterials\u003C/strong\u003E. Ivolumu ngayinye ikhiqizwa kanye; ngayinye yezinto ihlolwa ngalowo mumo (isimo esiqinile kakhulu aseshintshi ngenxa yezinto, kodwa ubuningi bayo, uxinzelelo kanye nesilinganiso sokuphepha kuyashintsha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhloso\"\u003EIzinhloso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFixed\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ubuso obubanjiwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EFrictionless face\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd\u003C/strong\u003E lwephaneli ibamba ubuso kuphela ngokwawo (isebenzise ezindizeni zokulingana).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForce\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ubuso obulayishwe, bese uthayipha amandla aphelele bese ukhetha indlela yawo ephaneli. \u003Cstrong\u003EPressure\u003C/strong\u003E isohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreserve\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ubuso okufanele izindawo zalo ezizungezile zihlale ziqinile, bese usetha ukuthi zijule kangakanani (\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep solid within\u003C/strong\u003E) — isibonelo ezungeze izimbobo zamabhawodi. Ubuso obubanjiwe noma obulayishwe buhlala bugcinwa njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EObstacle\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ubuso okufanele izindawo zalo ezizungezile zihlale zingenalutho, bese usetha ukuthi kude kangakanani (\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep empty within\u003C/strong\u003E) — indawo yesiphambano noma ithuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003EDone picking\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngemva kokuchofoza ubuso. Imibala eluhlaza nebomvu ikhombisa izindawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khiqiza-bese-uqhathanisa\"\u003EKhiqiza bese uqhathanisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGenerate\u003C/span\u003E. Iphaneli ikhombisa intuthuko nesikhathi esisele; \u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E iyayiphelisa. Umphumela ngamunye uvela ethebuleni le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOutcomes\u003C/strong\u003E: ivolumu enjongiwe, into, \u003Cstrong\u003Emass\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Elargest stress\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Elargest displacement\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Esafety factor\u003C/strong\u003E (yield ÷ stress), konke ngokuphinda kuxazulule isimo esiphelile njengamaseli aqinile nezinto zangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha umphumela ukuze uwubone embonweni (ingxenye iyafihlwa; ticka \u003Cstrong\u003EShow the part through it\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubone kokubili). Ngaphansi kwethebula: ukuthi kuthathe izinyathelo ezingaki nokuthi kuzinze yini, ukuqina kwawo njengesisekelo ngokumelene nesibalo somlungisi, nobuso bawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-umphumela\"\u003ESebenzisa umphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E: imeshi yonxantathu evaliwe, ilungele ukuphrinta nge-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP (faceted)\u003C/strong\u003E: ubuso obufanayo njengesisekelo se-STEP esenziwe ngobuso obuqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew part file\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye ye-PartCraft lapho isici sayo esisodwa umphumela njengesisekelo esiphuthunjwe. Yivule ukuze uhlele kuwo, usike izimbobo noma uhlole ku-Simulation. Yenziwe ngobuso obuqondile (izinkulungwane zobuso obuqondile), hhayi isimo esihleleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/strong\u003E ihlanganisa umphumela engxenyeni; ivulwa kuphela ebhokisini lokwakha (ngengxenye ngokwayo njengesikhala, umphumela uhlala ngaphakathi engxenyeni).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew part file\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/strong\u003E akukakwakhiwa kulolu hlobo: umphumela uba yisisekelo esiphuthunjwe, okudinga ikhestelo eliqondile. Ukulandwa kwe-STL nemifaniswano ye-STEP (faceted) kuyasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwethemba-kangakanani\"\u003EUkwethemba kangakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlungisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuqina\u003C/strong\u003E ngevolumu enikeziwe. Ayikho imikhawulo yokucindezeleka nemithetho yokukhiqiza (okuphuma, izindlela zokusila, usayizi omncane wezimbobo) okwamanje: hlola umphumela okhethiwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EUkulingisa\u003C/a\u003E bese uguqula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezibhityile ezinamaseli amabili noma amathathu ububanzi ziyisilinganiso: sebenzisa usayizi omncane weseli ezingxenyeni ezincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndlela iyi-SIMP enesihlungi sokuminyana, ukuprojekta kothenjwa nokuvuselelwa kwezinqumo ezilungile; ukucindezeleka nokuguqukela okubikwayo kwalokho okuphumayo njengamaseli, okuqinisekile kodwa okungakahlelwa emakhoneni abukhali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola ukucindezeleka nokuguquka (Ukulingisa)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\"\u003EHlinzeka ngokuphrinta, i-STEP ne-DXF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-workspace ye-Generative isusa izinto ezingadingeki imithwalo. Uthi ingxenye ibanjwe kuphi futhi ilayishwe kuphi, yini okufanele ihlale ibambekile nokufanele ihlale ingenalutho; i-PartCraft ithola isimo esiqinile kakhulu ngevolumu ngayinye enjongiwe (topology optimisation), siphinde sihlolwe njengesisekelo nezinto zangempela, bese imiphumela ibonakala ndawonye. Isebenza ezinhlangothini ezibizwa ngamagama ikhestelo le-mesh elinikeza ingxenye (bheka Ikhestelo le-mesh). Khetha Generative kubhokisi le-Workspace. Ingxenye yakho ayishintshi; isifundo sigcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela lengxenye. Setha isifundo Cindezela New study ephaneli ngakwesokudla. Space: The part as it is isusa izinto engxenyeni yakho; A box around the part ikhulisa isimo ngaphakathi kwebhokisi elikhulu kunengxenye ngo-Box margin. Element size: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube usayizi ozenzakalelayo (cishe amaqembu ama-8,000), noma uthayiphe owodwa. Usayizi omncane unika izimo ezinemininingwane eminingi kodwa uthatha isikhathi eside. Minimum member: izinto ezincane kakhulu kunalokhu cishe kabili azakhiwa. Ukungabi nalutho kusho amaseli ayisigamu nesisodwa. Chofoza okungu-1 kuya kwayisithupha Target volumes (ingxenye yesikhala sokwakha isimo esingagcwalisa) nezinto ezingu-1 kuya kwezine Materials. Ivolumu ngayinye ikhiqizwa kanye; ngayinye yezinto ihlolwa ngalowo mumo (isimo esiqinile kakhulu aseshintshi ngenxa yezinto, kodwa ubuningi bayo, uxinzelelo kanye nesilinganiso sokuphepha kuyashintsha). Izinhloso Fixed: chofoza ubuso obubanjiwe. Frictionless face ohlwini lwe-Add lwephaneli ibamba ubuso kuphela ngokwawo (isebenzise ezindizeni zokulingana). Force: chofoza ubuso obulayishwe, bese uthayipha amandla aphelele bese ukhetha indlela yawo ephaneli. Pressure isohlwini lwe-Add. Preserve: chofoza ubuso okufanele izindawo zalo ezizungezile zihlale ziqinile, bese usetha ukuthi zijule kangakanani (Keep solid within) — isibonelo ezungeze izimbobo zamabhawodi. Ubuso obubanjiwe noma obulayishwe buhlala bugcinwa njalo. Obstacle: chofoza ubuso okufanele izindawo zalo ezizungezile zihlale zingenalutho, bese usetha ukuthi kude kangakanani (Keep empty within) — indawo yesiphambano noma ithuluzi. Cindezela Done picking noma Esc ngemva kokuchofoza ubuso. Imibala eluhlaza nebomvu ikhombisa izindawo. Khiqiza bese uqhathanisa Cindezela Generate. Iphaneli ikhombisa intuthuko nesikhathi esisele; Stop iyayiphelisa. Umphumela ngamunye uvela ethebuleni le-Outcomes: ivolumu enjongiwe, into, mass, largest stress, largest displacement kanye safety factor (yield ÷ stress), konke ngokuphinda kuxazulule isimo esiphelile njengamaseli aqinile nezinto zangempela. Khetha umphumela ukuze uwubone embonweni (ingxenye iyafihlwa; ticka Show the part through it ukuze ubone kokubili). Ngaphansi kwethebula: ukuthi kuthathe izinyathelo ezingaki nokuthi kuzinze yini, ukuqina kwawo njengesisekelo ngokumelene nesibalo somlungisi, nobuso bawo. Sebenzisa umphumela STL: imeshi yonxantathu evaliwe, ilungele ukuphrinta nge-3D. STEP (faceted): ubuso obufanayo njengesisekelo se-STEP esenziwe ngobuso obuqondile. New part file: ingxenye ye-PartCraft lapho isici sayo esisodwa umphumela njengesisekelo esiphuthunjwe. Yivule ukuze uhlele kuwo, usike izimbobo noma uhlole ku-Simulation. Yenziwe ngobuso obuqondile (izinkulungwane zobuso obuqondile), hhayi isimo esihleleka. Add to this part ihlanganisa umphumela engxenyeni; ivulwa kuphela ebhokisini lokwakha (ngengxenye ngokwayo njengesikhala, umphumela uhlala ngaphakathi engxenyeni). New part file no Add to this part akukakwakhiwa kulolu hlobo: umphumela uba yisisekelo esiphuthunjwe, okudinga ikhestelo eliqondile. Ukulandwa kwe-STL nemifaniswano ye-STEP (faceted) kuyasebenza. Ukwethemba kangakanani Ilungisa ukuqina ngevolumu enikeziwe. Ayikho imikhawulo yokucindezeleka nemithetho yokukhiqiza (okuphuma, izindlela zokusila, usayizi omncane wezimbobo) okwamanje: hlola umphumela okhethiwe ku-Ukulingisa bese uguqula. Izinto ezibhityile ezinamaseli amabili noma amathathu ububanzi ziyisilinganiso: sebenzisa usayizi omncane weseli ezingxenyeni ezincane. Indlela iyi-SIMP enesihlungi sokuminyana, ukuprojekta kothenjwa nokuvuselelwa kwezinqumo ezilungile; ukucindezeleka nokuguqukela okubikwayo kwalokho okuphumayo njengamaseli, okuqinisekile kodwa okungakahlelwa emakhoneni abukhali. Okuhlobene Hlola ukucindezeleka nokuguquka (Ukulingisa) Hlinzeka ngokuphrinta, i-STEP ne-DXF Okungakakwakhiwa","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bhala futhi uqhube ama-script (i-Script workspace)","summary":"I-Script workspace ngesinyathelo ngesinyathelo: bhala i-script ye-CraftScript noma ye-Lua, uyiqhube ngo-F5, funda ikhonsoli, gcina imiphumela kokuguquguqukayo ze-script elandelayo, bonisa imesh, izinsimu namagrafu, misa ukuqhuba, bese ugcina ama-script ngengxenye.","section":"tasks","order":145,"keywords":["script","ukubhala ama-script","ama-script ngesikhathi somklamo","khipha","isikrini sesibili","second monitor","param","params","imingcele ku-scripts","CraftScript","Lua","ikhodi","uhlelo","umhleli","ikhonsoli","REPL","command line","qhuba","F5","qhuba okukhethiwe","misa","okuguquguqukayo","workspace","igrafu","insimu","imesh","legend","sub-display","ukuhlaziya","ukwenza ngokuzenzakalelayo","matrix","izibalo"],"headings":[{"id":"script-ngesikhathi-somklamo","text":"Script ngesikhathi somklamo","level":2},{"id":"qhuba-i-script-yakho-yokuqala","text":"Qhuba i-script yakho yokuqala","level":2},{"id":"thola-goqa-uphelelise","text":"Thola, goqa, uphelelise","level":2},{"id":"uma-kukhona-okungahambi-kahle","text":"Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle","level":2},{"id":"okuguquguqukayo-kudlulela-kwi-script-ukuya-kwenye","text":"Okuguquguqukayo kudlulela kwi-script ukuya kwenye","level":2},{"id":"imesh-izinsimu-namagrafu","text":"Imesh, izinsimu namagrafu","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2},{"id":"funda-imingcele-yengxenye","text":"Funda imingcele yengxenye","level":2},{"id":"ama-script-agcinwa-engxenyeni","text":"Ama-script agcinwa engxenyeni","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka kuqala.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukubhala ama-script kusha ku-PartCraft 0.3 futhi kungumbukiso wokuqala: ulimi, umtapo nendlela ama-script agcinwa ngayo kungashintsha, futhi ama-script abhalwe manje angase adinge ukuhlelwa okuncane kamuva. Sitshele okuphuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Script workspace iqhuba izibalo zakho eduze kwengxenye: izifingqo ezincane, ukuhlaziya okuphelele, noma ama-script \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Eomtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/a\u003E. Ama-script abhalwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ECraftScript\u003C/strong\u003E (ulimi lwe-matrix olufana kakhulu ne-MATLAB, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003EUlimi lwe-CraftScript\u003C/a\u003E) noma ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ELua\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EAma-script ku-Lua\u003C/a\u003E) noma ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EPython\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EAma-script ku-Python\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EScript\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesobunxele se-toolbar. Ingxenye ayishintshwa. Iphaneli yesokudla iba yiphaneli ye-script (ibanzi kunavamile; hudula umphetho wayo ukuze uyishintshe, noma uyidlulisele esikrinini sesibili nge-menyu yayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"script-ngesikhathi-somklamo\"\u003EScript ngesikhathi somklamo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkudingeki uphume ku-Umklamo workspace ukuze ubhale i-script. Ku-Umklamo, ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli yesokudla ibamba umhleli, ikhonsoli, okuguquguqukayo nomtapo ofanayo, nama-script afanayo. Umuthi wezici nombono kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza: chofoza isici ukuze uyikhethe, cofa kabili isikethi ukuze uhlele, guqula umbono, bese ubuyela ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E uphinde ucindezele \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkubonisiwe yi-script (imesh, izinsimu, amagrafu, amathebula) akudwetshwa phezu komodeli yakho ku-Umklamo: ikhonsoli iyasho lokho, futhi i-Script workspace inakho konke lapho ushintsha kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E, eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E, ihambisa iphaneli yonke iye kwiwindow layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili, ukuze umhleli nombono ogcwele kuhlale ecaleni komunye nomunye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela\u003C/span\u003E iyifake futhi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qhuba-i-script-yakho-yokuqala\"\u003EQhuba i-script yakho yokuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha emhleleni, isibonelo:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E``\u003Ccode\u003E x = linspace(0, 2*pi, 50); y = sin(x); plot(x, y, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;Igrafu ye-sine&#039;) disp(max(y)) \u003C/code\u003E``\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E). Ikhonsoli ngaphansi komhleli ibonisa okuphrintwe yi-script, ne-&quot;Kuqediwe ku… s&quot;. Igrafu ivela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Esub-displays\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kombono we-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongenalo \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E ubonisa inani lawo, njenge-MATLAB: \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E ibonisa \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3;\u003C/code\u003E ayibonisi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqhuba ingxenye ye-script kuphela, khetha imigqa bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E). Uma kungakhethwanga lutho iqhuba umugqa okhethwe yi-cursor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwekhonsoli (ngemva kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E&gt;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) uqhuba isitatimende esisodwa uma ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zibuyisa imigqa yangaphambilini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-goqa-uphelelise\"\u003EThola, goqa, uphelelise\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThola nshintsha.\u003C/strong\u003E Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command F\"\u003E⌘F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command H\"\u003E⌘H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze nashintsha). Ibha ivula phezu kwekhodi: thayipha okuzofunwa; okufanayo kuyakhanya futhi inani likutshela lapho oyikhona. Izinkinobho ezisecaleni kwebhokisi zifanisa icala (\u003Cstrong\u003EAa\u003C/strong\u003E), zithola amagama aphelele kuphela (\u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E) futhi zisebenzisa i-regular expression (\u003Cstrong\u003E.\\\u003C/strong\u003E*; ekushintshweni, \u003Ccode\u003E$1\u003C/code\u003E ibuyisela lokho igrubu lokuqala lalifanisa). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha okufanayo okwamanje, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha okufanayo konke njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugoqa.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza ▾ eduze kwenombolo yomugqa, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command [\"\u003E⇧⌘[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhombi ku-umugqa we-\u003Ccode\u003Efunction\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewhile\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eswitch\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Etry\u003C/code\u003E (Lua: \u003Ccode\u003Efunction\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edo\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erepeat\u003C/code\u003E), ukuze ufihle imigqa yangaphakathi; umugqa uthi zingaki. ▸ noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command ]\"\u003E⇧⌘]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyavula futhi. Ukugoqa kufihla imigqa kuphela: Run, Londoloza, ukukopisha nezinombolo zemigqa konke kubala yonke imigqa, nokuthayipha emugqeni ogoqiwe kuqala kuyawuvula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphelelisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Thayipha izinhlamvu ezimbili zegama, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Space\"\u003E⌘ Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: uhlu lubonisa okuguquguqukayo onakho, imisebenzi yolimi (nezimpikiswano zayo), amagama okhiye namagama asevele ku-script. Khetha ngamacibisholo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kukhona-okungahambi-kahle\"\u003EUma kukhona okungahambi kahle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphutha lichaza inkinga nomugqa wayo: umugqa umakwa mpofu emhleleni, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa n\u003C/strong\u003E ekhonsoleni ikuyisa lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlophu engaphelelwa: cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E (i-toolbar noma iphaneli). I-script imisa ngokushesha; okuguquguqukayo kugcina amanani ayenawo ngaphambi kwalokho kuqhuba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqhuba ngakunye kunesabelo sezinyathelo (izinyathelo ezi-2 billion ngokuzenzakalela; shintsha ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinketho zokuqhuba\u003C/strong\u003E kwiphaneli). Ukuqhuba okudlula kuso kuyima ngomyalezo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuguquguqukayo-kudlulela-kwi-script-ukuya-kwenye\"\u003EOkuguquguqukayo kudlulela kwi-script ukuya kwenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okuguquguqukayo okwenziwe yi-script kufika ethebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuguquguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E (igama, uhlobo, usayizi, inani elincane nelikhulu) kuhlale lapho kwi-script elandelayo, kunoma yiluphi ulimi. Ngale ndlela enye i-script yenza imesh, leyo elandelayo ixazulule, nesithathu ifake amagrafu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza okuguquguqukayo ukuze ukubonise: imesh, izinsimu nemodeli embonweni we-3D, ama-array njengethebhula (kanye negrafu yomugqa we-vector noma imephu yemibala ye-matrix) kuma-sub-display.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-JSON\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-CSV\u003C/span\u003E (ithebhula lezinombolo) ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-HDF5\u003C/span\u003E ziyilanda; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E iyisusa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula konke\u003C/span\u003E ihlanza i-workspace.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza okuguquguqukayo nengxenye\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uzigcine kufayela lengxenye (kuze kube ngama-32 MB; okukhulu kuhlala lapho lokhu kuvakasha kuphela). Uma uvula ingxenye enjalo, iphaneli inikeza ukuyilayisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imesh-izinsimu-namagrafu\"\u003EImesh, izinsimu namagrafu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eshow(m)\u003C/code\u003E idweba imesh; \u003Ccode\u003Eshow(f)\u003C/code\u003E idaya insimu ebusweni bayo ngelejendi. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkubonisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E oluphezulu kwesobunxele sombono luyafihla (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eihlo\u003C/span\u003E) noma lususe ngalunye, futhi luyafihla noma libonise ingxenye ngokwayo. Ngaphansi kwe-legend, thayipha ububanzi (\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuya\u003C/strong\u003E) noma cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E; i-vector noma insimu yokucindezeleka nayo inikeza ukuthi yiliphi icala okufanele libonakale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eshow(f, &#039;deform&#039;, u, &#039;scale&#039;, 50)\u003C/code\u003E idweba imesh ehanjiswe yinsimu yokunyakaza \u003Ccode\u003Eu\u003C/code\u003E, ikhulisiwe izikhathi ezingu-50 (ngaphandle kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E, cishe ama-8 %osayizi wemodeli).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza imesh ebonisiwe: i-node eseduze, isakhi namanani ensimu lapho avela ku-sub-displays (\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eplot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eimagesc\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Etable\u003C/code\u003E zibeka igrafu yomugqa, imephu yemibala ye-array ye-2-D noma ithebhula ku-sub-displays. Igrafu enesi-\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;id&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (noma isihloko) esifanayo nesangaphambili iyayishintsha, ngakho ilophu ingavuselela igrafu eyodwa yokuhlangana; \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;append&#039;, true\u003C/code\u003E yengeza ijika kuyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E ihlanza ama-sub-display; umcibisholo uwagoqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kukhona amagrafu amabili noma ngaphezulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgaseceleni nangaseceleni\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa wonke kanye (ayisithupha yakamuva); ukuchofoza ithebhu yethebhula noma yesithombe kubonisa lowo kuphela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgrafu ngayinye inazo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESVG\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwayo. I-PNG ne-SVG ziyishicilela ngesimo esimhlophe ngemibala yephepha, nanoma yisiphi isihloko (i-PNG ama-pixel angu-1600 × 1000; i-SVG iyanda ngaphandle kokuthambisa); i-CSV igcina izinombolo zayo ngawo wonke amadijithi: ikholomu eyodwa ye-x nekholomu ngejika uma amajika ehlanganyela i-x, kungenjalo umugqa ngamunye ngephoyinti ngalinye negama lejika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa umbono kokubonisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Script (noma wehlise amafayela embonweni noma ephaneli): amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.craft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.lua\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003E.py\u003C/code\u003E avulwa njengama-script amasha (awaqhubi); amafayela edatha (STL, OBJ, CSV, JSON, NPY, HDF5) alayishela okuguquguqukayo ngaphansi kwegama lefayela lawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Script ilanda i-script yamanje njengefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Script (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwamathebhu) iqala enye i-script. Cofa kabili ithebhu ukuze uyiqamba kabusha; i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E yayo iyisusa (ungayihlehlisa lokho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-imingcele-yengxenye\"\u003EFunda imingcele yengxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-script ifunda imingcele yengxenye (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EQhuba ingxenye ngemingcele\u003C/a\u003E) ngegama:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ew = param(&#039;width&#039;);     % inani lengcele eyodwa, ngo-mm (noma amadigri, noma inombolo evamile)\np = params();           % zonke, njenge-struct: p.width, p.height\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Lua ne-Python zithi \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.param(&#039;width&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.params()\u003C/code\u003E. Ama-script afunda imingcele kuphela: shintsha kuthebhu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E. Ngaphansi kwethebhu ye-script, umugqa uhlu lwemingcele eyifundayo nge-\u003Ccode\u003Eparam(&#039;…&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E, futhi umaka noma yimuphi ongekho engxenyeni; ithebhu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/span\u003E ihlu le-script ngaphansi kwalowo nalowo. Igama elakhiwa ngenkathi i-script iqhuba, njenge-\u003Ccode\u003Eparam(name)\u003C/code\u003E, alibhalwanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-script-agcinwa-engxenyeni\"\u003EAma-script agcinwa engxenyeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke i-script ezithebhini igcinwa engxenyeni, ngakho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini Lefayela iyagcina nazo nezinguquko zazo zingahlehliswa. Ukuvula ingxenye \u003Cstrong\u003Eakuqhubi ama-script ayo\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhonsoli ithi zingaki ezithwele, futhi ziqhuba kuphela lapho ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxenye evela komunye umuntu ingaba nanoma yiluphi uhlelo: yifunde ngaphambi kokuqhuba. Ama-script aqhuba ngemuva kwalolu khompyutha ngaphandle kokufinyelela kwenethiwekhi futhi awakwazi ukuthinta ikhasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003EUlimi lwe-CraftScript\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EAma-script ku-Lua\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EAma-script ku-Python\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003EUmtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-own-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-own-analysis\"\u003EBhala ukuhlaziya kwakho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ukubuka kuqala. Ukubhala ama-script kusha ku-PartCraft 0.3 futhi kungumbukiso wokuqala: ulimi, umtapo nendlela ama-script agcinwa ngayo kungashintsha, futhi ama-script abhalwe manje angase adinge ukuhlelwa okuncane kamuva. Sitshele okuphuka. I-Script workspace iqhuba izibalo zakho eduze kwengxenye: izifingqo ezincane, ukuhlaziya okuphelele, noma ama-script omtapo wokuhlaziya. Ama-script abhalwa ku-CraftScript (ulimi lwe-matrix olufana kakhulu ne-MATLAB, bheka Ulimi lwe-CraftScript) noma ku-Lua (bheka Ama-script ku-Lua) noma ku-Python (bheka Ama-script ku-Python). Khetha Script ebhokisini le-Workspace ngakwesobunxele se-toolbar. Ingxenye ayishintshwa. Iphaneli yesokudla iba yiphaneli ye-script (ibanzi kunavamile; hudula umphetho wayo ukuze uyishintshe, noma uyidlulisele esikrinini sesibili nge-menyu yayo ⋯, bheka Hlela amaphaneli). Script ngesikhathi somklamo Akudingeki uphume ku-Umklamo workspace ukuze ubhale i-script. Ku-Umklamo, ithebhu ethi Script yephaneli yesokudla ibamba umhleli, ikhonsoli, okuguquguqukayo nomtapo ofanayo, nama-script afanayo. Umuthi wezici nombono kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza: chofoza isici ukuze uyikhethe, cofa kabili isikethi ukuze uhlele, guqula umbono, bese ubuyela ethebhini le-Script uphinde ucindezele F5. Okubonisiwe yi-script (imesh, izinsimu, amagrafu, amathebula) akudwetshwa phezu komodeli yakho ku-Umklamo: ikhonsoli iyasho lokho, futhi i-Script workspace inakho konke lapho ushintsha kuyo. Khipha, eduze kwe-Qalisa, ihambisa iphaneli yonke iye kwiwindow layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili, ukuze umhleli nombono ogcwele kuhlale ecaleni komunye nomunye. Buyisela iyifake futhi. Bheka Hlela amaphaneli. Qhuba i-script yakho yokuqala Thayipha emhleleni, isibonelo: `` x = linspace(0, 2*pi, 50); y = sin(x); plot(x, y, 'title', 'Igrafu ye-sine') disp(max(y)) `` Cindezela F5 (noma Qalisa). Ikhonsoli ngaphansi komhleli ibonisa okuphrintwe yi-script, ne-\"Kuqediwe ku… s\". Igrafu ivela ku-sub-displays ngaphansi kombono we-3D. Umugqa ongenalo ; ubonisa inani lawo, njenge-MATLAB: a = 3 ibonisa a = 3; a = 3; ayibonisi lutho. Ukuqhuba ingxenye ye-script kuphela, khetha imigqa bese ucindezela Ctrl+Enter (Okukhethiwe). Uma kungakhethwanga lutho iqhuba umugqa okhethwe yi-cursor. Umugqa ongaphansi kwekhonsoli (ngemva kwe-\u003E\u003E) uqhuba isitatimende esisodwa uma ucindezela Enter. ↑ no ↓ zibuyisa imigqa yangaphambilini. Thola, goqa, uphelelise Thola nshintsha. Cindezela Ctrl+F (noma Ctrl+H ukuze nashintsha). Ibha ivula phezu kwekhodi: thayipha okuzofunwa; okufanayo kuyakhanya futhi inani likutshela lapho oyikhona. Izinkinobho ezisecaleni kwebhokisi zifanisa icala (Aa), zithola amagama aphelele kuphela (W) futhi zisebenzisa i-regular expression (.\\*; ekushintshweni, $1 ibuyisela lokho igrubu lokuqala lalifanisa). Shintsha ishintsha okufanayo okwamanje, Konke ishintsha okufanayo konke njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-Ctrl+Z. Ukugoqa. Chofoza ▾ eduze kwenombolo yomugqa, noma cindezela Ctrl+Shift+[ ngesikhombi ku-umugqa we-function, if, for, while, switch noma try (Lua: function, do, if, repeat), ukuze ufihle imigqa yangaphakathi; umugqa uthi zingaki. ▸ noma Ctrl+Shift+] iyavula futhi. Ukugoqa kufihla imigqa kuphela: Run, Londoloza, ukukopisha nezinombolo zemigqa konke kubala yonke imigqa, nokuthayipha emugqeni ogoqiwe kuqala kuyawuvula. Ukuphelelisa. Thayipha izinhlamvu ezimbili zegama, noma cindezela Ctrl+Space: uhlu lubonisa okuguquguqukayo onakho, imisebenzi yolimi (nezimpikiswano zayo), amagama okhiye namagama asevele ku-script. Khetha ngamacibisholo bese ucindezela Enter noma Tab. Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle Iphutha lichaza inkinga nomugqa wayo: umugqa umakwa mpofu emhleleni, futhi Umugqa n ekhonsoleni ikuyisa lapho. Ilophu engaphelelwa: cindezela Misa (i-toolbar noma iphaneli). I-script imisa ngokushesha; okuguquguqukayo kugcina amanani ayenawo ngaphambi kwalokho kuqhuba. Ukuqhuba ngakunye kunesabelo sezinyathelo (izinyathelo ezi-2 billion ngokuzenzakalela; shintsha ngaphansi kwe-Izinketho zokuqhuba kwiphaneli). Ukuqhuba okudlula kuso kuyima ngomyalezo. Okuguquguqukayo kudlulela kwi-script ukuya kwenye Konke okuguquguqukayo okwenziwe yi-script kufika ethebhini le-Okuguquguqukayo (igama, uhlobo, usayizi, inani elincane nelikhulu) kuhlale lapho kwi-script elandelayo, kunoma yiluphi ulimi. Ngale ndlela enye i-script yenza imesh, leyo elandelayo ixazulule, nesithathu ifake amagrafu. Chofoza okuguquguqukayo ukuze ukubonise: imesh, izinsimu nemodeli embonweni we-3D, ama-array njengethebhula (kanye negrafu yomugqa we-vector noma imephu yemibala ye-matrix) kuma-sub-display. Londoloza njenge-JSON, Londoloza njenge-CSV (ithebhula lezinombolo) ne-Londoloza njenge-HDF5 ziyilanda; Susa iyisusa; Sula konke ihlanza i-workspace. Khetha Londoloza okuguquguqukayo nengxenye ukuze uzigcine kufayela lengxenye (kuze kube ngama-32 MB; okukhulu kuhlala lapho lokhu kuvakasha kuphela). Uma uvula ingxenye enjalo, iphaneli inikeza ukuyilayisha. Imesh, izinsimu namagrafu show(m) idweba imesh; show(f) idaya insimu ebusweni bayo ngelejendi. Uhlu lwe-Okubonisiwe oluphezulu kwesobunxele sombono luyafihla (ihlo) noma lususe ngalunye, futhi luyafihla noma libonise ingxenye ngokwayo. Ngaphansi kwe-legend, thayipha ububanzi (Kusuka, kuya) noma cindezela Ozenzakalelayo; i-vector noma insimu yokucindezeleka nayo inikeza ukuthi yiliphi icala okufanele libonakale. show(f, 'deform', u, 'scale', 50) idweba imesh ehanjiswe yinsimu yokunyakaza u, ikhulisiwe izikhathi ezingu-50 (ngaphandle kwe-scale, cishe ama-8 %osayizi wemodeli). Chofoza imesh ebonisiwe: i-node eseduze, isakhi namanani ensimu lapho avela ku-sub-displays (Ikhethiwe). plot, imagesc no table zibeka igrafu yomugqa, imephu yemibala ye-array ye-2-D noma ithebhula ku-sub-displays. Igrafu enesi-'id' (noma isihloko) esifanayo nesangaphambili iyayishintsha, ngakho ilophu ingavuselela igrafu eyodwa yokuhlangana; 'append', true yengeza ijika kuyo. Sula ihlanza ama-sub-display; umcibisholo uwagoqa. Uma kukhona amagrafu amabili noma ngaphezulu, Ngaseceleni nangaseceleni ibonisa wonke kanye (ayisithupha yakamuva); ukuchofoza ithebhu yethebhula noma yesithombe kubonisa lowo kuphela futhi. Igrafu ngayinye inazo PNG, SVG no CSV ngaphansi kwayo. I-PNG ne-SVG ziyishicilela ngesimo esimhlophe ngemibala yephepha, nanoma yisiphi isihloko (i-PNG ama-pixel angu-1600 × 1000; i-SVG iyanda ngaphandle kokuthambisa); i-CSV igcina izinombolo zayo ngawo wonke amadijithi: ikholomu eyodwa ye-x nekholomu ngejika uma amajika ehlanganyela i-x, kungenjalo umugqa ngamunye ngephoyinti ngalinye negama lejika. F noma Lingana ilinganisa umbono kokubonisiwe. Amafayela Vula eqenjini le-Script (noma wehlise amafayela embonweni noma ephaneli): amafayela .craft, .lua no .py avulwa njengama-script amasha (awaqhubi); amafayela edatha (STL, OBJ, CSV, JSON, NPY, HDF5) alayishela okuguquguqukayo ngaphansi kwegama lefayela lawo. Londoloza eqenjini le-Script ilanda i-script yamanje njengefayela. Okusha eqenjini le-Script (noma + eduze kwamathebhu) iqala enye i-script. Cofa kabili ithebhu ukuze uyiqamba kabusha; i-× yayo iyisusa (ungayihlehlisa lokho). Funda imingcele yengxenye I-script ifunda imingcele yengxenye (bheka Qhuba ingxenye ngemingcele) ngegama: w = param('width'); % inani lengcele eyodwa, ngo-mm (noma amadigri, noma inombolo evamile) p = params(); % zonke, njenge-struct: p.width, p.height Ku-Lua ne-Python zithi cs.param('width') no cs.params(). Ama-script afunda imingcele kuphela: shintsha kuthebhu le-Imingcele. Ngaphansi kwethebhu ye-script, umugqa uhlu lwemingcele eyifundayo nge-param('…'), futhi umaka noma yimuphi ongekho engxenyeni; ithebhu le-Imingcele ihlu le-script ngaphansi kwalowo nalowo. Igama elakhiwa ngenkathi i-script iqhuba, njenge-param(name), alibhalwanga. Ama-script agcinwa engxenyeni Yonke i-script ezithebhini igcinwa engxenyeni, ngakho Londoloza eqenjini Lefayela iyagcina nazo nezinguquko zazo zingahlehliswa. Ukuvula ingxenye akuqhubi ama-script ayo: ikhonsoli ithi zingaki ezithwele, futhi ziqhuba kuphela lapho ucindezela Qalisa. Ingxenye evela komunye umuntu ingaba nanoma yiluphi uhlelo: yifunde ngaphambi kokuqhuba. Ama-script aqhuba ngemuva kwalolu khompyutha ngaphandle kokufinyelela kwenethiwekhi futhi awakwazi ukuthinta ikhasi. Okuhlobene Ulimi lwe-CraftScript Ama-script ku-Lua Ama-script ku-Python Umtapo wokuhlaziya Bhala ukuhlaziya kwakho","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"flow-simulation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Linganisa ukugeleza koketshezi (isifundo sokugeleza)","summary":"Ukugeleza ngemisele eseceleni kwengxenye noma ozungezile ebhokisini: izindawo zokungena nokuphuma, umoya, amanzi noma uketshezi lwakho, bese ujubane nengcindezi endizeni yokusika enyakazayo, imigqa yokugeleza, ingcindezi yobuso, ukwehla kwengcindezi, ukulinganisa ubuningi, i-drag ne-lift, kanye nokuthi indlela ye-laminar ingakutshela yini nokuthi ayikutshele yini.","section":"tasks","order":145,"keywords":["ukugeleza","CFD","uketshezi","ukulingisa ukugeleza koketshezi","ukulingisa ukugeleza","umoya","amanzi","ukunamathela","ukuminyana","inombolo ka-Reynolds","laminar","turbulent","ukwehla kwengcindezi","ukulahleka kwekhanda","ukungena","ukuphuma","isivalo","ikepisi","ijubane","izinga lokugeleza","ivolumu yokugeleza","amalitha ngomzuzu","ingcindezi emile","imigqa yokugeleza","indiza yokusika","drag","lift","isilinganiso se-drag","isilinganiso se-lift","indawo ebhekene nomoya","ukugeleza kwangaphandle","ukugeleza kwangaphakathi","ipayipi","umsele","i-manifold","i-nozzle","lattice Boltzmann","okuseleyo","ukuhlangana"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-uketshezi-namaseli","text":"Khetha uketshezi namaseli","level":2},{"id":"ukugeleza-ngaphakathi-engxenyeni","text":"Ukugeleza ngaphakathi engxenyeni","level":2},{"id":"ukugeleza-ozungezile-engxenyeni","text":"Ukugeleza ozungezile engxenyeni","level":2},{"id":"xazulula-bese-ufunda-imiphumela","text":"Xazulula bese ufunda imiphumela","level":2},{"id":"ukugeleza-okuphazamisayo-kuyazama","text":"Ukugeleza okuphazamisayo (kuyazama)","level":2},{"id":"okungasitshela-kona-nokungasitshelayo","text":"Okungasitshela kona nokungasitshelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsifundo se-\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E sibala ukuthi uketshezi lunyakaza kanjani emisele ekhona ngaphakathi engxenyeni yakho (\u003Cstrong\u003Einternal\u003C/strong\u003E) noma ozungezile (\u003Cstrong\u003Eexternal\u003C/strong\u003E). Ngokuzenzakalelayo kuba \u003Cstrong\u003Elaminar, incompressible, isothermal and Newtonian\u003C/strong\u003E: ukugeleza okubushelelezi koketshezi olunobuningi nokunamathela okumile, ngaphandle kokushisa, ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka nangaphandle kokudonsa kwe-gravity. Kukhona nemodeli \u003Cstrong\u003Eyokuzama\u003C/strong\u003E ephazamisayo, eyokubonisa izindlela kuphela (bheka ngezansi). Isebenza ezinhlangothini ezibizwa ngamagama ikhestelo le-mesh elinikeza ingxenye (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EIkhestelo le-mesh\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkulingisa\u003C/strong\u003E kubhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E, cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003ENew study\u003C/strong\u003E uma kungekho lutho, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow (CFD)\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow model\u003C/strong\u003E yi-\u003Cstrong\u003ELaminar\u003C/strong\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ETurbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental)\u003C/strong\u003E: bheka \u003Cstrong\u003EUkugeleza okuphazamisayo (kuyazama)\u003C/strong\u003E ngezansi. Izilungiselelo zesakhiwo sesifundo ziyagcinwa, ngakho ungabuyela emuva. Izilungiselelo zokugeleza ziyagcinwa efayelweni lengxenye, futhi noma yiliphi utshintsho lungahlehliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-uketshezi-namaseli\"\u003EKhetha uketshezi namaseli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFluid\u003C/strong\u003E: umoya noma amanzi ngo-20 °C, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ECustom\u003C/strong\u003E nobuningi bakho (kg/m³) nokunamathela kwawo okuphelele (Pa·s). Umoya usebenzisa umthetho wegesi elifanele kanye nomthetho ka-Sutherland (1.204 kg/m³, 1.813 × 10⁻⁵ Pa·s); amanzi asebenzisa amanani e-IAPWS (998.21 kg/m³, 1.0016 mPa·s).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECell size\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhala koketshezi sigcwaliswa ngama-ikhyubhu alingana. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube usayizi ozenzakalelayo; iphaneli iveza ugridi. Yonke imbobo nomsele kufanele ube \u003Cstrong\u003Ebyi-8 kuya kwele-10 amaseli ububanzi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze kube nezinombolo ezisebenzayo; amaseli amancane anembe kakhulu kodwa ayahamba kancane (okuphindwe kabili ngokuncane kwenza umsebenzi ongaba ngu-16 ngaphezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalls\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EInterpolated\u003C/strong\u003E ilandela izindonga ezigobile phakathi kwamaseli (okuzenzakalelayo); \u003Cstrong\u003EBounce-back\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha izindonga njengesakhiwo se-ikhyubhu esinezinyathelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugeleza-ngaphakathi-engxenyeni\"\u003EUkugeleza ngaphakathi engxenyeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikhala sikaketshezi kumele sivaleke. Engeza \u003Cstrong\u003EInlet\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EOutlet\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli, bese ucindezela ubuso babo kumbono:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso obubukhulu obuzungeze imbobo\u003C/strong\u003E — umphetho ekugcineni kwepayipi, ubuso besibambi. I-PartCraft ivala umgodi walowo mbobo ngesivalo. Yonke imbobo kulobo buso yeyalowo mbobo, ngakho uma ukungena nokuphuma kuvulelwa ebusweni obufanayo, yenza ikepisi elincane phezu kwenye yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangaphakathi besivalo\u003C/strong\u003E — njengakwamanye amathuluzi e-CAD: yenza ipuleti elincane (i-extrude) phezu kwembobo bese ukhetha ubuso bayo obuthinta uketshezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkungena, setha \u003Cstrong\u003Evelocity\u003C/strong\u003E (m/s, ilingana kulo lonke ubukhulu bembobo, ingena engxenyeni) noma \u003Cstrong\u003Evolume flow\u003C/strong\u003E (L/min). Ukuphuma, setha \u003Cstrong\u003Estatic pressure\u003C/strong\u003E (Pa, gauge). Uma imbobo ishiywe ivulekile, noma uma udonga lumncane kunesele, ingaphakathi lihlangana nangaphandle futhi ukuxazulula kuyama nombhalo othi &quot;No closed fluid space&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugeleza-ozungezile-engxenyeni\"\u003EUkugeleza ozungezile engxenyeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EExternal\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESpeed\u003C/strong\u003E, indlela okugelezela kuyo, nokuthi ibhokisi lifika kangakanani phambili, emuva nasemaceleni (ngaphandle: 1, 3 no-1 izikhathi zosayizi omkhulu wengxenye). Ubuso bebhokisi okungena ngabo ukugeleza buyi-inflow, ubuso okuphuma ngabo buyi-outflow ku-0 Pa, nezinhlangothi ezihamba nokugeleza ziyashelela. Ibhokisi elincane kakhulu lifaka ukugeleza ngaseceleni kwengxenye futhi likhulisa i-drag. \u003Cstrong\u003EReference area\u003C/strong\u003E yindawo esetshenziswa yi-drag ne-lift coefficients (ngaphandle: indawo ebhekene nomoya ebonakala ngokugeleza); i-lift ilinganiswa ngo +Y ngaphandle uma ukhetha enye indlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xazulula-bese-ufunda-imiphumela\"\u003EXazulula bese ufunda imiphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cstrong\u003ESolve\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuxazulula kusebenza ngemuva ngenani lezinyathelo, okuseleyo nesithombe sokuseleyo; \u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E iyayiphelisa. Iyama lapho okuseleyo (ukuthi inkambu yejubane ishintsha kangakanani ngesinyathelo ngasinye) ingaphansi kwenhloso futhi ukwehla kwengcindezi noma i-drag sekuzinzile. Uma ifinyelela umkhawulo wezinyathelo kuqala, iphaneli ithi \u003Cstrong\u003ENot converged\u003C/strong\u003E ngombala obomvu: izinombolo ziyisimo sokugcina, hhayi impendulo ezinzile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECut plane\u003C/strong\u003E: ijubane noma ingcindezi emile endizeni edlula emodelini; khetha i-normal yayo (X, Y noma Z) bese uhudula i-slider ukuze uyinyakazise. Hambisa iphoyinti phezu kwayo ukuze ufunde izinani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStreamlines\u003C/strong\u003E: kusuka ezindaweni zokungena (internal) noma kusuka kurake ohlangothini lokungena lwebhokisi endizeni yokusika (external).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPart\u003C/strong\u003E: okuqinile, okubonakalayo ngaphakathi (ukuze ubone indiza ngaphakathi), ingcindezi yobuso, noma okufihliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETable\u003C/strong\u003E: inombolo ka-Reynolds, ukwehla kwengcindezi (ingcindezi emile ephakathi ezindaweni zokungena ukususa ingcindezi emile ephakathi ezindaweni zokuphuma), ukugeleza nengcindezi emaphakathi yembobo ngayinye, amandla engxenyeni, i-drag ne-lift kanye nezilinganiso zazo nendawo yesilinganiso (ngaphandle), ukulinganisa ubuningi (ukungena kuqhathaniswa nokuphuma), i-mesh nesixazululi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugeleza-okuphazamisayo-kuyazama\"\u003EUkugeleza okuphazamisayo (kuyazama)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow model › Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental)\u003C/strong\u003E ixazulula ukugeleza okuphazamisayo okuhlanganisiwe ngesikhathi (steady RANS): imodeli ye-Spalart–Allmaras inikeza ukunamathela kwe-eddy kuseli ngayinye, futhi amaseli aseduze nezindonga asebenzisa umthetho ka-Spalding wodonga esikhundleni sokuxazulula ungqimba olumncane lapho. Iphazamiseka yonke indawo (akukho zindawo ze-laminar, akukho ukuguquka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuzange idlule emahlolweni wayo wokunemba.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli, imiphumela nethebula kuyakusho lokho kukho yonke isifundo esiphazamisayo, futhi isexwayiso asikwazi ukuvalwa. Yisebenzise ngemibono yokugeleza yesimo — lapho ukugeleza kuhlukana, kujikeleze noma kusheshe — \u003Cstrong\u003Ehhayi izinombolo zokuklama\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuhlola\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsisekelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkumelana komsele omncane, iseli lokuqala ku-y⁺ 49 / 98\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa kuka-Dean\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+3.3 % / +4.7 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsele onodonga oxazululiwe (y⁺ ≈ 3), Re_τ 180: ijubane elikhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoser, Kim &amp; Mansour DNS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E−1 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsele omncane, y⁺ 7–15 noma 190–380\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa kuka-Dean\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+9 kuya ku-+22 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkumelana kwepayipi ngamaseli e-ikhyubhu, ngokugcwele, 10–30 amaseli ububanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColebrook\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 kuya ku-34 % ephezulu kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuyela ngemuva kwesinyathelo esibheke emuva, amaseli 6–14 ngobude besinyathelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDriver &amp; Seegmiller, izinyathelo ezingu-6.26\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21 kuya ku-39 % kufushane kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphumela ithuthuka kancane kuphela ngamaseli amancane. Ngemva kokuxazulula, ithebula likhombisa i-\u003Cstrong\u003Ey⁺ yeseli lokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E (ephansi, eyesilinganiso naphezulu phezu kwamaseli odonga) futhi lisho isexwayiso uma ingaphandle kohlu oluhlolwe lwe-1 kuya ku-400; hlose cishe ku-30 kuya ku-300. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi sokusebenza:\u003C/strong\u003E amaseli azenzakalelayo alingana nemizuzu embalwa kuphela kwi-core eyodwa yelaptop (iphaneli ikhombisa isimo esibi kakhulu sogridi nomkhawulo wezinyathelo; ipayipi elincane lizinza ngaphansi kwemizuzwana engu-20). Ukunciphisa usayizi weseli ngesigamu kubiza cishe izikhathi ezingu-16 isikhathi eside. Amandla engxenyeni avela ekulinganisweni kwe-momentum phezu kwembobo noma phezu kwebhokisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwenziwe kuze kube manje:\u003C/strong\u003E amaseli odonga manje ahambisana nokucindezeleka kwawo kokugoqa nomthetho wodonga, okwehlise amaphutha epayipi nesinyathelo ukuya ezibalweni ezingenhla ngaphandle kokushintsha imiphumela yomsele omncane. Lokho akwanele izinombolo zokuklama. Isinyathelo esilandelayo ngamaseli amancane eduze nezindonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungasitshela-kona-nokungasitshelayo\"\u003EOkungasitshela kona nokungasitshelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli ye-laminar\u003C/strong\u003E iyi-laminar kuphela. Emapayipini ukugeleza kuguquka kube phazamisayo ngaphezu kwenombolo ka-Reynolds engaba ngu-2,000 kuya ku-4,000; ngemuva kwezinto ezinkulu ezingagudlwa umoya, i-wake iqala ukukhipha izinyosi ngaphezu kwengu-50. Iphaneli iyasixwayisa ngalezi zindawo. Umphumela we-laminar wokugeleza okuphazamisayo uncishisa ukwehla kwengcindezi futhi ubala i-drag ngendlela engalungile. Imodeli ephazamisayo ekuyazama (ngenhla) ibonisa ukugeleza okuphazamisayo ngokwesimo; izinombolo zayo azithembekile okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela:\u003C/strong\u003E indlela ye-lattice Boltzmann (D3Q19, ukuhlangana kwesikhathi kabili) eya esimweni esizinzile. Iphazamiseka kancane ngaphakathi; i-PartCraft igcina ukuguquka kobuningi kumaphesenti ambalwa. Uma ukugeleza kusheshe kakhulu kumaseli, ayikwenqabi ukuqala futhi itshela ukuthi amaseli kumele ancipheke kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIhlolwe ngokumelene:\u003C/strong\u003E ukugeleza kuka-Hagen–Poiseuille epayipini ngaphakathi kengxenye (ukuguquka kwengcindezi ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ku-20 amaseli ububanzi), i-lid-driven cavity ka-Ghia et al. (ngaphakathi kuka-0.75 % wejubane lesivalo), nesisekelo se-silinda sika-Schäfer–Turek (drag ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ku-10 amaseli ngedayamitha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkumodeliwe: ukudluliswa kokushisa, ukuphazamiseka nokunemba kokwakha (imodeli ephazamisayo iyazama), izindawo zamanzi ezivulekile, i-cavitation, i-gravity, izingxenye ezinyakazayo, uketshezi olungeyona i-Newtonian, nezindonga ezingalingani. Lokhu kuyibhilidi lelabhoratri: hlola imiphumela ebalulekile ngenye indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isifundo se-Flow sibala ukuthi uketshezi lunyakaza kanjani emisele ekhona ngaphakathi engxenyeni yakho (internal) noma ozungezile (external). Ngokuzenzakalelayo kuba laminar, incompressible, isothermal and Newtonian: ukugeleza okubushelelezi koketshezi olunobuningi nokunamathela okumile, ngaphandle kokushisa, ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka nangaphandle kokudonsa kwe-gravity. Kukhona nemodeli yokuzama ephazamisayo, eyokubonisa izindlela kuphela (bheka ngezansi). Isebenza ezinhlangothini ezibizwa ngamagama ikhestelo le-mesh elinikeza ingxenye (bheka Ikhestelo le-mesh). Khetha Ukulingisa kubhokisi le-Workspace, cindezela New study uma kungekho lutho, bese usetha Type ibe Flow (CFD). Flow model yi-Laminar (okuzenzakalelayo) noma Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental): bheka Ukugeleza okuphazamisayo (kuyazama) ngezansi. Izilungiselelo zesakhiwo sesifundo ziyagcinwa, ngakho ungabuyela emuva. Izilungiselelo zokugeleza ziyagcinwa efayelweni lengxenye, futhi noma yiliphi utshintsho lungahlehliswa. Khetha uketshezi namaseli Fluid: umoya noma amanzi ngo-20 °C, noma Custom nobuningi bakho (kg/m³) nokunamathela kwawo okuphelele (Pa·s). Umoya usebenzisa umthetho wegesi elifanele kanye nomthetho ka-Sutherland (1.204 kg/m³, 1.813 × 10⁻⁵ Pa·s); amanzi asebenzisa amanani e-IAPWS (998.21 kg/m³, 1.0016 mPa·s). Cell size: isikhala koketshezi sigcwaliswa ngama-ikhyubhu alingana. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube usayizi ozenzakalelayo; iphaneli iveza ugridi. Yonke imbobo nomsele kufanele ube byi-8 kuya kwele-10 amaseli ububanzi ukuze kube nezinombolo ezisebenzayo; amaseli amancane anembe kakhulu kodwa ayahamba kancane (okuphindwe kabili ngokuncane kwenza umsebenzi ongaba ngu-16 ngaphezulu). Walls: Interpolated ilandela izindonga ezigobile phakathi kwamaseli (okuzenzakalelayo); Bounce-back ithatha izindonga njengesakhiwo se-ikhyubhu esinezinyathelo. Ukugeleza ngaphakathi engxenyeni Isikhala sikaketshezi kumele sivaleke. Engeza Inlet ne-Outlet ephaneli, bese ucindezela ubuso babo kumbono: Ubuso obubukhulu obuzungeze imbobo — umphetho ekugcineni kwepayipi, ubuso besibambi. I-PartCraft ivala umgodi walowo mbobo ngesivalo. Yonke imbobo kulobo buso yeyalowo mbobo, ngakho uma ukungena nokuphuma kuvulelwa ebusweni obufanayo, yenza ikepisi elincane phezu kwenye yazo. Ubuso bangaphakathi besivalo — njengakwamanye amathuluzi e-CAD: yenza ipuleti elincane (i-extrude) phezu kwembobo bese ukhetha ubuso bayo obuthinta uketshezi. Ukungena, setha velocity (m/s, ilingana kulo lonke ubukhulu bembobo, ingena engxenyeni) noma volume flow (L/min). Ukuphuma, setha static pressure (Pa, gauge). Uma imbobo ishiywe ivulekile, noma uma udonga lumncane kunesele, ingaphakathi lihlangana nangaphandle futhi ukuxazulula kuyama nombhalo othi \"No closed fluid space\". Ukugeleza ozungezile engxenyeni Setha Flow ibe External, Speed, indlela okugelezela kuyo, nokuthi ibhokisi lifika kangakanani phambili, emuva nasemaceleni (ngaphandle: 1, 3 no-1 izikhathi zosayizi omkhulu wengxenye). Ubuso bebhokisi okungena ngabo ukugeleza buyi-inflow, ubuso okuphuma ngabo buyi-outflow ku-0 Pa, nezinhlangothi ezihamba nokugeleza ziyashelela. Ibhokisi elincane kakhulu lifaka ukugeleza ngaseceleni kwengxenye futhi likhulisa i-drag. Reference area yindawo esetshenziswa yi-drag ne-lift coefficients (ngaphandle: indawo ebhekene nomoya ebonakala ngokugeleza); i-lift ilinganiswa ngo +Y ngaphandle uma ukhetha enye indlela. Xazulula bese ufunda imiphumela Cindezela Solve. Ukuxazulula kusebenza ngemuva ngenani lezinyathelo, okuseleyo nesithombe sokuseleyo; Stop iyayiphelisa. Iyama lapho okuseleyo (ukuthi inkambu yejubane ishintsha kangakanani ngesinyathelo ngasinye) ingaphansi kwenhloso futhi ukwehla kwengcindezi noma i-drag sekuzinzile. Uma ifinyelela umkhawulo wezinyathelo kuqala, iphaneli ithi Not converged ngombala obomvu: izinombolo ziyisimo sokugcina, hhayi impendulo ezinzile. Cut plane: ijubane noma ingcindezi emile endizeni edlula emodelini; khetha i-normal yayo (X, Y noma Z) bese uhudula i-slider ukuze uyinyakazise. Hambisa iphoyinti phezu kwayo ukuze ufunde izinani. Streamlines: kusuka ezindaweni zokungena (internal) noma kusuka kurake ohlangothini lokungena lwebhokisi endizeni yokusika (external). Part: okuqinile, okubonakalayo ngaphakathi (ukuze ubone indiza ngaphakathi), ingcindezi yobuso, noma okufihliwe. Table: inombolo ka-Reynolds, ukwehla kwengcindezi (ingcindezi emile ephakathi ezindaweni zokungena ukususa ingcindezi emile ephakathi ezindaweni zokuphuma), ukugeleza nengcindezi emaphakathi yembobo ngayinye, amandla engxenyeni, i-drag ne-lift kanye nezilinganiso zazo nendawo yesilinganiso (ngaphandle), ukulinganisa ubuningi (ukungena kuqhathaniswa nokuphuma), i-mesh nesixazululi. Ukugeleza okuphazamisayo (kuyazama) Flow model › Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental) ixazulula ukugeleza okuphazamisayo okuhlanganisiwe ngesikhathi (steady RANS): imodeli ye-Spalart–Allmaras inikeza ukunamathela kwe-eddy kuseli ngayinye, futhi amaseli aseduze nezindonga asebenzisa umthetho ka-Spalding wodonga esikhundleni sokuxazulula ungqimba olumncane lapho. Iphazamiseka yonke indawo (akukho zindawo ze-laminar, akukho ukuguquka). Akuzange idlule emahlolweni wayo wokunemba. Iphaneli, imiphumela nethebula kuyakusho lokho kukho yonke isifundo esiphazamisayo, futhi isexwayiso asikwazi ukuvalwa. Yisebenzise ngemibono yokugeleza yesimo — lapho ukugeleza kuhlukana, kujikeleze noma kusheshe — hhayi izinombolo zokuklama. Ukuhlola Isisekelo Umphumela Ukumelana komsele omncane, iseli lokuqala ku-y⁺ 49 / 98 Ukulinganisa kuka-Dean +3.3 % / +4.7 % Umsele onodonga oxazululiwe (y⁺ ≈ 3), Re_τ 180: ijubane elikhulu Moser, Kim & Mansour DNS −1 % Umsele omncane, y⁺ 7–15 noma 190–380 Ukulinganisa kuka-Dean +9 kuya ku-+22 % Ukumelana kwepayipi ngamaseli e-ikhyubhu, ngokugcwele, 10–30 amaseli ububanzi Colebrook 30 kuya ku-34 % ephezulu kakhulu Ukubuyela ngemuva kwesinyathelo esibheke emuva, amaseli 6–14 ngobude besinyathelo Driver & Seegmiller, izinyathelo ezingu-6.26 21 kuya ku-39 % kufushane kakhulu Imiphumela ithuthuka kancane kuphela ngamaseli amancane. Ngemva kokuxazulula, ithebula likhombisa i-y⁺ yeseli lokuqala (ephansi, eyesilinganiso naphezulu phezu kwamaseli odonga) futhi lisho isexwayiso uma ingaphandle kohlu oluhlolwe lwe-1 kuya ku-400; hlose cishe ku-30 kuya ku-300. Isikhathi sokusebenza: amaseli azenzakalelayo alingana nemizuzu embalwa kuphela kwi-core eyodwa yelaptop (iphaneli ikhombisa isimo esibi kakhulu sogridi nomkhawulo wezinyathelo; ipayipi elincane lizinza ngaphansi kwemizuzwana engu-20). Ukunciphisa usayizi weseli ngesigamu kubiza cishe izikhathi ezingu-16 isikhathi eside. Amandla engxenyeni avela ekulinganisweni kwe-momentum phezu kwembobo noma phezu kwebhokisi. Okwenziwe kuze kube manje: amaseli odonga manje ahambisana nokucindezeleka kwawo kokugoqa nomthetho wodonga, okwehlise amaphutha epayipi nesinyathelo ukuya ezibalweni ezingenhla ngaphandle kokushintsha imiphumela yomsele omncane. Lokho akwanele izinombolo zokuklama. Isinyathelo esilandelayo ngamaseli amancane eduze nezindonga. Okungasitshela kona nokungasitshelayo Imodeli ye-laminar iyi-laminar kuphela. Emapayipini ukugeleza kuguquka kube phazamisayo ngaphezu kwenombolo ka-Reynolds engaba ngu-2,000 kuya ku-4,000; ngemuva kwezinto ezinkulu ezingagudlwa umoya, i-wake iqala ukukhipha izinyosi ngaphezu kwengu-50. Iphaneli iyasixwayisa ngalezi zindawo. Umphumela we-laminar wokugeleza okuphazamisayo uncishisa ukwehla kwengcindezi futhi ubala i-drag ngendlela engalungile. Imodeli ephazamisayo ekuyazama (ngenhla) ibonisa ukugeleza okuphazamisayo ngokwesimo; izinombolo zayo azithembekile okwamanje. Indlela: indlela ye-lattice Boltzmann (D3Q19, ukuhlangana kwesikhathi kabili) eya esimweni esizinzile. Iphazamiseka kancane ngaphakathi; i-PartCraft igcina ukuguquka kobuningi kumaphesenti ambalwa. Uma ukugeleza kusheshe kakhulu kumaseli, ayikwenqabi ukuqala futhi itshela ukuthi amaseli kumele ancipheke kangakanani. Ihlolwe ngokumelene: ukugeleza kuka-Hagen–Poiseuille epayipini ngaphakathi kengxenye (ukuguquka kwengcindezi ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ku-20 amaseli ububanzi), i-lid-driven cavity ka-Ghia et al. (ngaphakathi kuka-0.75 % wejubane lesivalo), nesisekelo se-silinda sika-Schäfer–Turek (drag ngaphakathi kuka-1 % ku-10 amaseli ngedayamitha). Akumodeliwe: ukudluliswa kokushisa, ukuphazamiseka nokunemba kokwakha (imodeli ephazamisayo iyazama), izindawo zamanzi ezivulekile, i-cavitation, i-gravity, izingxenye ezinyakazayo, uketshezi olungeyona i-Newtonian, nezindonga ezingalingani. Lokhu kuyibhilidi lelabhoratri: hlola imiphumela ebalulekile ngenye indlela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Umtapo wokuhlaziya","summary":"Umtapo wama-script afundeka ku-Script workspace: okutholakala eqenjini ngalinye, ukuvula umsebenzi ngokufunda kuphela, inhloko yawo nendlela, izinkomba nokuhlola, ukwenza ikopi yakho, nokuthi ikopi ithatha kanjani esikhundleni somsebenzi womtapo.","section":"tasks","order":146,"keywords":["umtapo","craftlib","ukuhlaziya","electromagnet","static","modal","thermal","ukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo","top88","SIMP","electromagnetics","electrostatics","magnetostatics","fluid","lattice Boltzmann","LBM","mesh","voxel","tetrahedra","izinkomba","ukuhlola","ukuqinisekisa","ikopi","isithunzi"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-ngesibonelo","text":"Qala ngesibonelo","level":2},{"id":"amaqembu","text":"Amaqembu","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlola-umtapo","text":"Ukuhlola umtapo","level":2},{"id":"funda-umsebenzi","text":"Funda umsebenzi","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-eyodwa","text":"Shintsha eyodwa","level":2},{"id":"yisebenzisa","text":"Yisebenzisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmtapo wokuhlaziya uyisethi yama-script, ngamunye umsebenzi ongawufunda kusukela phezulu kuya phansi: indlela i-stiffness matrix eyakhiwa ngayo, lapho imibandela yomkhawulo ifakwa khona, isixazululi esisebenza, nendlela imiphumela eqagelwa ngayo. Akukho lutho oluvalelwe ngaphakathi kwebhokisi elimnyama; kuphela izingxenye ezisheshayo (izinhlamvu zezakhiwo, izixazululi ze-sparse, ukwakha imesh) ezakhelwe ngaphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-ngesibonelo\"\u003EQala ngesibonelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibonelo\u003C/strong\u003E linama-script amahlanu amafushane asebenzisa umtapo ngokuphelele. Chofoza eyodwa, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula (ukufunda kuphela)\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ngayinye ihlanza umbono, ibonise umphumela ku-canvas negrafu kuma-sub-display.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkubonisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucindezeleka kwe-cantilever\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yensimbi engu-100 × 10 × 10 mm ngaphansi komthwalo wethiphu ongu-100 N: ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises ebhalini eguquliwe, nokuphambuka kwethiphu kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha ezingeni lezakhi ezine (kuhlelwe ngegrafu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo se-MBB beam\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo okuyisiko elingu-60 × 20: ukwakheka kwedizayini, ukwehla kwe-compliance, uhlelo lokugcina (ukuphindaphinda okungu-94, compliance 203.19)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsimu ye-capacitor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapuleti amabili anobubanzi be-4 mm, ahlukene ngo-1 mm: amandla kagesi nensimu, i-capacitance enemiphetho iqhathaniswa nenani elifanele nefomula ka-Palmer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugeleza komsele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugeleza kwe-lattice Boltzmann kudlule into emsele: insimu yejubane nomlando wokuhlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-electromagnet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngodo yensimbi enesimo se-C, enegebe lomoya nekhoyili: ukuminyana kwe-flux, insimu egebeni iqhathaniswa nefomula yesekethe yomagnethi, i-inductance nokudonsa egebeni. Ichazwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EIzinkambu zomagnethi ku-2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmagnethi ohlala njalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngodo efanayo kodwa nomagnethi ohlala njalo esikhundleni sekhoyili: indawo yokusebenza yomagnethi, insimu egebeni iqhathaniswa nesekethe yomagnethi, ukuthi i-flux ivuza kangakanani, nokudonsa. Ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d#permanent-magnets\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-hash=\"permanent-magnets\"\u003EIzinkambu zomagnethi ku-2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaqembu\"\u003EAmaqembu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImisebenzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwakha imesh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebox_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecylinder_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Evoxel_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etet_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emesh_quality\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enodes_at\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface_nodes\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmabhokisi nama-silinda njengama-hexahedron, amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedron; amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedron wanoma iyiphi imodeli (ingxenye, umzimba, i-STL elayishiwe); amavolumu wezakhi nekhwalithi; ukukhetha ama-node endizeni noma ebusweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucindezeleka okuzinzile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Estatic_voxel\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucindezeleka okuzinzile okulinganayo kumakhyubhu noma kuma-tetrahedron ane-node eyi-10: ukunyakaza, ukucindezeleka, von Mises, izimpendulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eframe3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlaka ze-3D zamabhimu, izinsika nezinhlaka ngendlela ye-direct stiffness: ukukhululwa kweziphetho, izisekelo nezipringi, imithwalo emabhimini; ukunyakaza, izimpendulo, amandla aseziphethweni zamalunga. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela njenge-CraftScript\u003C/span\u003E ye-DetailCraft ne-BimCraft ibhala imodeli yonke ngayo. Isisekelo sokuhlaziya, hhayi ukuhlola kwekhodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodal_tet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafrikhwensi wemvelo nezimo zemodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eheat_steady\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheat_transient\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheat_system\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudlulisa ukushisa okuzinzile nokuguquguqukayo ngamazinga okushisa aqinile, ukufakwa kokushisa, ukukhiqizwa, i-flux nokuhamba kokushisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etop88\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etop99\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etopopt3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhodi e-2-D angu-88 nangu-99 emigqa asakazwe, nendlela efanayo ye-3-D kumakhyubhu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-electromagnetics\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epoisson2d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-electrostatics ye-2-D (amandla kagesi, insimu, i-capacitance, ukushaja) ne-magnetostatics (i-vector potential, ukuminyana kwe-flux, omagnethi ahlala njalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugeleza koketshezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elbm2d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elbm3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugeleza kwe-lattice Boltzmann: i-2-D ibhalwe ngokuphelele ku-script, i-3-D ku-kernel yokugeleza ye-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhloko yomsebenzi ngamunye inikeza izimpikiswano zawo ngqo. Amayunithi ayawo ayamayunithi wezifundo ze-PartCraft, uma inhloko ingasho ngenye indlela: amamilimitha, ama-newton, ama-megapascal, amathani ngemamilimitha ekhyubhu ngokuminyana, watt nekelvin ngokushisa. Imisebenzi ye-electromagnetic ne-lattice Boltzmann isebenza ngamayunithi anemigomo efanayo; izinhloko zawo zithi kanjani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlola-umtapo\"\u003EUkuhlola umtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhloko yomsebenzi ngamunye iphela nge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhlola\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhesi elincane nempendulo eyaziwayo. Izivivinyo ze-PartCraft ziyisebenzisa zonke, futhi lapho i-PartCraft inophenyo lwayo lomsebenzi ofanayo, impendulo ye-script iqhathaniswa nalolo phenyo kwi-mesh efanayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukuphambuka kwethiphu ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha (phakathi kuka-0.2 % ngamakhyubhu, 0.05 % ngama-tetrahedron), nokuqhathaniswa nezixazululi ze-\u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E workspace kwi-mesh efanayo (ngokufanayo ezinombolweni eziningi);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eifrikhwensi yokuqala ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha (ingaphansi ngo-0.24 %, njengoba kulindeleke ebheni elifushane) nasesixazululini se-modal se-\u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukushisa: udonga oluhlaza olushisayo ngokuqondile, umzimba omncane opholayo njengoba ifomula ye-lumped-capacity isho, izinga lokushisa lesilabhu eliyancipha njengoba ithiyori isho;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo: i-\u003Ccode\u003Etop88\u003C/code\u003E iphinda ukuphindaphinda okungu-94 nokuhambisana kwephepha 203.1925 (nango-218.8032 nesihlungi sokuminyana); i-\u003Ccode\u003Etopopt3d\u003C/code\u003E iphela ngokuhambisana okufanayo nowe-\u003Cstrong\u003EGenerative\u003C/strong\u003E workspace ngezilungiselelo ezifanayo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ei-capacitance yekhapheshitha nensimu ye-solenoid ende kuqhathaniswa nezinani zencwadi yokufundela, insimu yegebe ye-electromagnet kuqhathaniswa nefomula yesekethe yomagnethi, nomagnethi ohlala njalo kuqhathaniswa nomagnethi ongqindilili emoyeni nomagnethi ovalwe yisigcini sensimbi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukugeleza komsele kuqhathaniswa neprofayili eyiparabola eqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-umsebenzi\"\u003EFunda umsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ithebhu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo\u003C/strong\u003E yephaneli ye-script.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umsebenzi. Inhloko yawo ibonisa: okubalwayo, indlela, amayunithi, izimo nemikhawulo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinkomba\u003C/strong\u003E (incwadi noma iphepha, namanombolo ezibalo) kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhlola\u003C/strong\u003E — ikhesi elincane nempendulo eyaziwayo elihlolwa izivivinyo zePartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula (ukufunda kuphela)\u003C/span\u003E ivula i-script yonke ethebhini enomngcele omile. Ungayiqalisa, ukhethe futhi uqalise izingxenye zayo, kodwa awungayishintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-eyodwa\"\u003EShintsha eyodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EYenza ikopi ukuze uhlele\u003C/strong\u003E phezu kwethebhu efundeka kuphela). Ikopi iyi-script engxenyeni yakho enegama elifanayo, ngakho igcinwa nengxenye, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eyonke ukubizwa kwalo msebenzi kusebenzisa ikopi yakho manje\u003C/strong\u003E — umhleli uyisho phezu kwe-script. Qamba kabusha ikopi ukuze ugcine zombili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yisebenzisa\"\u003EYisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiza umsebenzi womtapo kunoma iyiphi i-script ngegama lawo, njengomsebenzi wangaphakathi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ExPhys = top88(60, 20, 0.5, 3.0, 1.5, 1);\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphumela ibuya njengezinani endaweni yokusebenza; amagrafu nezinsimu okubonisa zivela embonweni nasemabonisweni angaphansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlaziya okuzinzile kwengxenye evulekile, isibonelo, kuthatha imigqa embalwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ev = voxel_mesh(part(), 2);                   % amakhyubhu ayi-2 mm\nX = meshNodes(v);\nbc = struct(&#039;fixed&#039;, nodes_at(v, 2, min(X(:, 2))));   % bamba phansi\ntop = nodes_at(v, 2, max(X(:, 2)));\nbc.loads = {struct(&#039;nodes&#039;, top, &#039;force&#039;, [0 -500 0])};   % 500 N phansi phezulu\nr = static_voxel(v, 210000, 0.3, bc);       % insimbi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Er\u003C/code\u003E ibamba ukunyakaza, ukucindezeleka nezimpendulo; ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises kudwetshwa engxenyeni eguquliwe. Ezingxenyeni ezigobile sebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003Etet_mesh\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E, angakwazi nokulayisha nokubamba ubuso bonke (\u003Ccode\u003Eface_nodes\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi yomtapo ibhalwe nge-CraftScript, futhi i-script ye-Lua ibiza ngayo nge-\u003Ccode\u003Ecs\u003C/code\u003E njengemisebenzi yangaphakathi: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc)\u003C/code\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EAma-script ku-Lua\u003C/a\u003E). Umsebenzi ngamunye uxazulula impahla eyodwa nomthwalo owodwa; izinhloko zidweba okunye okungahlanganisiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Umtapo wokuhlaziya uyisethi yama-script, ngamunye umsebenzi ongawufunda kusukela phezulu kuya phansi: indlela i-stiffness matrix eyakhiwa ngayo, lapho imibandela yomkhawulo ifakwa khona, isixazululi esisebenza, nendlela imiphumela eqagelwa ngayo. Akukho lutho oluvalelwe ngaphakathi kwebhokisi elimnyama; kuphela izingxenye ezisheshayo (izinhlamvu zezakhiwo, izixazululi ze-sparse, ukwakha imesh) ezakhelwe ngaphakathi. Qala ngesibonelo Iqembu le-Izibonelo linama-script amahlanu amafushane asebenzisa umtapo ngokuphelele. Chofoza eyodwa, cindezela Vula (ukufunda kuphela), bese F5: ngayinye ihlanza umbono, ibonise umphumela ku-canvas negrafu kuma-sub-display. Isibonelo Okubonisa Ukucindezeleka kwe-cantilever Ibha yensimbi engu-100 × 10 × 10 mm ngaphansi komthwalo wethiphu ongu-100 N: ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises ebhalini eguquliwe, nokuphambuka kwethiphu kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha ezingeni lezakhi ezine (kuhlelwe ngegrafu) Ukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo se-MBB beam Ukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo okuyisiko elingu-60 × 20: ukwakheka kwedizayini, ukwehla kwe-compliance, uhlelo lokugcina (ukuphindaphinda okungu-94, compliance 203.19) Insimu ye-capacitor Amapuleti amabili anobubanzi be-4 mm, ahlukene ngo-1 mm: amandla kagesi nensimu, i-capacitance enemiphetho iqhathaniswa nenani elifanele nefomula ka-Palmer Ukugeleza komsele Ukugeleza kwe-lattice Boltzmann kudlule into emsele: insimu yejubane nomlando wokuhlangana I-electromagnet Ingodo yensimbi enesimo se-C, enegebe lomoya nekhoyili: ukuminyana kwe-flux, insimu egebeni iqhathaniswa nefomula yesekethe yomagnethi, i-inductance nokudonsa egebeni. Ichazwe ku-Izinkambu zomagnethi ku-2-D Umagnethi ohlala njalo Ingodo efanayo kodwa nomagnethi ohlala njalo esikhundleni sekhoyili: indawo yokusebenza yomagnethi, insimu egebeni iqhathaniswa nesekethe yomagnethi, ukuthi i-flux ivuza kangakanani, nokudonsa. Ku-Izinkambu zomagnethi ku-2-D Amaqembu Iqembu Imisebenzi Yenzani Ukwakha imesh box_mesh, cylinder_mesh, voxel_mesh, tet_mesh, mesh_quality, nodes_at, face_nodes Amabhokisi nama-silinda njengama-hexahedron, amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedron; amakhyubhu noma ama-tetrahedron wanoma iyiphi imodeli (ingxenye, umzimba, i-STL elayishiwe); amavolumu wezakhi nekhwalithi; ukukhetha ama-node endizeni noma ebusweni Ukucindezeleka okuzinzile static_voxel, static_tet Ukucindezeleka okuzinzile okulinganayo kumakhyubhu noma kuma-tetrahedron ane-node eyi-10: ukunyakaza, ukucindezeleka, von Mises, izimpendulo Izinhlaka frame3d Izinhlaka ze-3D zamabhimu, izinsika nezinhlaka ngendlela ye-direct stiffness: ukukhululwa kweziphetho, izisekelo nezipringi, imithwalo emabhimini; ukunyakaza, izimpendulo, amandla aseziphethweni zamalunga. I-Thumela njenge-CraftScript ye-DetailCraft ne-BimCraft ibhala imodeli yonke ngayo. Isisekelo sokuhlaziya, hhayi ukuhlola kwekhodi Ukunyakaza modal_tet Amafrikhwensi wemvelo nezimo zemodi Ukushisa heat_steady, heat_transient, heat_system Ukudlulisa ukushisa okuzinzile nokuguquguqukayo ngamazinga okushisa aqinile, ukufakwa kokushisa, ukukhiqizwa, i-flux nokuhamba kokushisa Ukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo top88, top99, topopt3d Amakhodi e-2-D angu-88 nangu-99 emigqa asakazwe, nendlela efanayo ye-3-D kumakhyubhu I-electromagnetics poisson2d, magnetostatic2d I-electrostatics ye-2-D (amandla kagesi, insimu, i-capacitance, ukushaja) ne-magnetostatics (i-vector potential, ukuminyana kwe-flux, omagnethi ahlala njalo) Ukugeleza koketshezi lbm2d, lbm3d Ukugeleza kwe-lattice Boltzmann: i-2-D ibhalwe ngokuphelele ku-script, i-3-D ku-kernel yokugeleza ye-PartCraft Inhloko yomsebenzi ngamunye inikeza izimpikiswano zawo ngqo. Amayunithi ayawo ayamayunithi wezifundo ze-PartCraft, uma inhloko ingasho ngenye indlela: amamilimitha, ama-newton, ama-megapascal, amathani ngemamilimitha ekhyubhu ngokuminyana, watt nekelvin ngokushisa. Imisebenzi ye-electromagnetic ne-lattice Boltzmann isebenza ngamayunithi anemigomo efanayo; izinhloko zawo zithi kanjani. Ukuhlola umtapo Inhloko yomsebenzi ngamunye iphela nge-ukuhlola: ikhesi elincane nempendulo eyaziwayo. Izivivinyo ze-PartCraft ziyisebenzisa zonke, futhi lapho i-PartCraft inophenyo lwayo lomsebenzi ofanayo, impendulo ye-script iqhathaniswa nalolo phenyo kwi-mesh efanayo: ukuphambuka kwethiphu ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha (phakathi kuka-0.2 % ngamakhyubhu, 0.05 % ngama-tetrahedron), nokuqhathaniswa nezixazululi ze-Simulation workspace kwi-mesh efanayo (ngokufanayo ezinombolweni eziningi); ifrikhwensi yokuqala ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa nethiyori yebha (ingaphansi ngo-0.24 %, njengoba kulindeleke ebheni elifushane) nasesixazululini se-modal se-Simulation; ukushisa: udonga oluhlaza olushisayo ngokuqondile, umzimba omncane opholayo njengoba ifomula ye-lumped-capacity isho, izinga lokushisa lesilabhu eliyancipha njengoba ithiyori isho; ukwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo: i-top88 iphinda ukuphindaphinda okungu-94 nokuhambisana kwephepha 203.1925 (nango-218.8032 nesihlungi sokuminyana); i-topopt3d iphela ngokuhambisana okufanayo nowe-Generative workspace ngezilungiselelo ezifanayo; i-capacitance yekhapheshitha nensimu ye-solenoid ende kuqhathaniswa nezinani zencwadi yokufundela, insimu yegebe ye-electromagnet kuqhathaniswa nefomula yesekethe yomagnethi, nomagnethi ohlala njalo kuqhathaniswa nomagnethi ongqindilili emoyeni nomagnethi ovalwe yisigcini sensimbi; ukugeleza komsele kuqhathaniswa neprofayili eyiparabola eqondile. Funda umsebenzi Vula ithebhu ye-Umtapo yephaneli ye-script. Chofoza umsebenzi. Inhloko yawo ibonisa: okubalwayo, indlela, amayunithi, izimo nemikhawulo, izinkomba (incwadi noma iphepha, namanombolo ezibalo) kanye ne-ukuhlola — ikhesi elincane nempendulo eyaziwayo elihlolwa izivivinyo zePartCraft. Vula (ukufunda kuphela) ivula i-script yonke ethebhini enomngcele omile. Ungayiqalisa, ukhethe futhi uqalise izingxenye zayo, kodwa awungayishintshi. Shintsha eyodwa Cindezela Yenza ikopi (noma Yenza ikopi ukuze uhlele phezu kwethebhu efundeka kuphela). Ikopi iyi-script engxenyeni yakho enegama elifanayo, ngakho igcinwa nengxenye, futhi yonke ukubizwa kwalo msebenzi kusebenzisa ikopi yakho manje — umhleli uyisho phezu kwe-script. Qamba kabusha ikopi ukuze ugcine zombili. Yisebenzisa Biza umsebenzi womtapo kunoma iyiphi i-script ngegama lawo, njengomsebenzi wangaphakathi: xPhys = top88(60, 20, 0.5, 3.0, 1.5, 1); Imiphumela ibuya njengezinani endaweni yokusebenza; amagrafu nezinsimu okubonisa zivela embonweni nasemabonisweni angaphansi. Ukuhlaziya okuzinzile kwengxenye evulekile, isibonelo, kuthatha imigqa embalwa: v = voxel_mesh(part(), 2); % amakhyubhu ayi-2 mm X = meshNodes(v); bc = struct('fixed', nodes_at(v, 2, min(X(:, 2)))); % bamba phansi top = nodes_at(v, 2, max(X(:, 2))); bc.loads = {struct('nodes', top, 'force', [0 -500 0])}; % 500 N phansi phezulu r = static_voxel(v, 210000, 0.3, bc); % insimbi r ibamba ukunyakaza, ukucindezeleka nezimpendulo; ukucindezeleka kwe-von Mises kudwetshwa engxenyeni eguquliwe. Ezingxenyeni ezigobile sebenzisa tet_mesh no static_tet, angakwazi nokulayisha nokubamba ubuso bonke (face_nodes). Imisebenzi yomtapo ibhalwe nge-CraftScript, futhi i-script ye-Lua ibiza ngayo nge-cs njengemisebenzi yangaphakathi: cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc) (bheka Ama-script ku-Lua). Umsebenzi ngamunye uxazulula impahla eyodwa nomthwalo owodwa; izinhloko zidweba okunye okungahlanganisiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript-own-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bhala ukuhlaziya kwakho","summary":"Yakha ukuhlaziya njenge-script e-Script workspace: yenza imesh yengxenye, hlanganisa futhi uxazulule, bonisa insimu negrafu yokuhlangana, uqinisekise umphumela ngokubala ngesandla, bese ugcina izinyathelo njengama-script ahlukene ahlanganyela okuguquguqukayo.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["ukuhlaziya okwenziwe","ukuhlaziya okwenziwe ngokwakho","i-FEA script","finite element","hlanganisa","stiffness","imibandela yomkhawulo","xazulula","pcg","sparse","insimu","post-process","ukuhlangana","ukuqinisekisa","ukubala ngesandla","ukuhlola","inqubo"],"headings":[{"id":"1-imesh","text":"1. Imesh","level":2},{"id":"2-hlanganisa-futhi-uxazulule","text":"2. Hlanganisa futhi uxazulule","level":2},{"id":"3-bonisa-umphumela","text":"3. Bonisa umphumela","level":2},{"id":"4-hlola","text":"4. Hlola","level":2},{"id":"5-yigcine","text":"5. Yigcine","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlaziya ku-Script workspace yimbalwa ye-script emfushane edlulisela okuguquguqukayo omunye komunye. Qala kumsebenzi womtapo wokuhlaziya \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Eomtapo\u003C/a\u003E osondele kulokho odinga, yenza ikopi, bese uyashintsha; noma yakha okusuka ngezansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-imesh\"\u003E1. Imesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodel = part();                  % ingxenye oyenza imodeli, njengemodeli\nm = tetmesh(model, 4);           % ama-tetrahedron cishe ayi-4 mm ubude\nshow(m)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola imesh embonweni ngaphambi kokuqhubeka: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyilingana, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eihlo\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkubonisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E iyifihla ingxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-hlanganisa-futhi-uxazulule\"\u003E2. Hlanganisa futhi uxazulule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBhala ilophu yezakhi ku-script (ifundeka njengencwadi yokufundela), bese ushiya izingxenye ezinzima zemisebenzi yangaphakathi: amamatrikhsi ezakhi, ukuhlanganiswa kwe-sparse kusukela kuma-triplet, nesixazululi se-conjugate gradient esinomlungiseli. Umsebenzi womtapo onjenge-\u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E (uma umtapo usuwunawo) ungumzekelo ophelele wokukopisha kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-bonisa-umphumela\"\u003E3. Bonisa umphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ef = field(m, vm, &#039;node&#039;, &#039;von Mises&#039;, &#039;MPa&#039;);  % inani elilodwa ngenode ngayinye\nshow(f, &#039;deform&#039;, u, &#039;scale&#039;, 100)\nplot(residuals, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;Solver residual&#039;, &#039;id&#039;, &#039;conv&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbubanzi be-legend bungafakwa ngesandla noma buphindiselwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza imesh ukuze ufunde amanani kunode.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgrafu egcina i-\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;id&#039;\u003C/code\u003E efanayo ivuselelwa endaweni yayo, ngakho phrinta futhi uphlotte ngaphakathi kwelophu ukuze ubuke ukuhlangana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-hlola\"\u003E4. Hlola\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQhathanisa nento oyaziyo: ukuphambuka kwethiphu ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa ne-PL³/3EI, ipuleti elinesikhala kuqhathaniswa nesici sokugxilisa ukucindezeleka kwalo, izimpendulo kuqhathaniswa nemithwalo. Bhala ukuhlola njengesikripthi sakho ukuze siqhube futhi ngemva kwawo wonke ushintsho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etip = max(abs(u(:)));\nexpected = P * L^3 / (3 * E * I);\nfprintf(&#039;tip %g mm, beam theory %g mm (%.1f %%)\\n&#039;, tip, expected, 100 * (tip / expected - 1))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-yigcine\"\u003E5. Yigcine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsinyathelo ngasinye singaba ithebhu yaso ye-script: zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo, ngakho zihlume ngokulandelana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-script agcinwa engxenyeni. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza okuguquguqukayo nengxenye\u003C/strong\u003E ethebhini lokuguquguqukayo ukuze ugcine nemiphumela (kuze kube ngama-32 MB).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Script ilanda i-script ukuze uyabelane ngayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ilethe eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ukuhlaziya ku-Script workspace yimbalwa ye-script emfushane edlulisela okuguquguqukayo omunye komunye. Qala kumsebenzi womtapo wokuhlaziya omtapo osondele kulokho odinga, yenza ikopi, bese uyashintsha; noma yakha okusuka ngezansi. 1. Imesh model = part(); % ingxenye oyenza imodeli, njengemodeli m = tetmesh(model, 4); % ama-tetrahedron cishe ayi-4 mm ubude show(m) Hlola imesh embonweni ngaphambi kokuqhubeka: F iyilingana, i-ihlo ku-Okubonisiwe iyifihla ingxenye. 2. Hlanganisa futhi uxazulule Bhala ilophu yezakhi ku-script (ifundeka njengencwadi yokufundela), bese ushiya izingxenye ezinzima zemisebenzi yangaphakathi: amamatrikhsi ezakhi, ukuhlanganiswa kwe-sparse kusukela kuma-triplet, nesixazululi se-conjugate gradient esinomlungiseli. Umsebenzi womtapo onjenge-static_tet (uma umtapo usuwunawo) ungumzekelo ophelele wokukopisha kuwo. 3. Bonisa umphumela f = field(m, vm, 'node', 'von Mises', 'MPa'); % inani elilodwa ngenode ngayinye show(f, 'deform', u, 'scale', 100) plot(residuals, 'title', 'Solver residual', 'id', 'conv') Ububanzi be-legend bungafakwa ngesandla noma buphindiselwe ku-Ozenzakalelayo. Chofoza imesh ukuze ufunde amanani kunode. Igrafu egcina i-'id' efanayo ivuselelwa endaweni yayo, ngakho phrinta futhi uphlotte ngaphakathi kwelophu ukuze ubuke ukuhlangana. 4. Hlola Qhathanisa nento oyaziyo: ukuphambuka kwethiphu ye-cantilever kuqhathaniswa ne-PL³/3EI, ipuleti elinesikhala kuqhathaniswa nesici sokugxilisa ukucindezeleka kwalo, izimpendulo kuqhathaniswa nemithwalo. Bhala ukuhlola njengesikripthi sakho ukuze siqhube futhi ngemva kwawo wonke ushintsho: tip = max(abs(u(:))); expected = P * L^3 / (3 * E * I); fprintf('tip %g mm, beam theory %g mm (%.1f %%)\\n', tip, expected, 100 * (tip / expected - 1)) 5. Yigcine Isinyathelo ngasinye singaba ithebhu yaso ye-script: zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo, ngakho zihlume ngokulandelana. Ama-script agcinwa engxenyeni. Khetha Londoloza okuguquguqukayo nengxenye ethebhini lokuguquguqukayo ukuze ugcine nemiphumela (kuze kube ngama-32 MB). Londoloza eqenjini le-Script ilanda i-script ukuze uyabelane ngayo; Vula ilethe eyodwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"magnetic-fields-2d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izinkambu zamagnethi ngo-2-D (isifundo)","summary":"Bala insimu yamagnethi yesigxobo kagesi noma ignethi esiqinile ngomtapo wokuhlaziya: qalisa izibonelo, funda i-flux density, insimu esikhaleni, i-inductance nokudonsa, shintsha idizayini, bese wakha imodeli yakho yamakhoyili, amagnethi nensimbi.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["magnetic","magnetostatics","magnetic field","flux density","tesla","electromagnet","solenoid","coil","ampere turns","iron core","air gap","permeability","inductance","magnetic force","reluctance","magnetic circuit","vector potential","electromagnetics","finite element","fem","motor","actuator","transformer","magnetostatic2d","permanent magnet","neodymium","ndfeb","ferrite","remanence","working point","recoil","leakage","holding magnet"],"headings":[{"id":"okumodelwayo","text":"Okumodelwayo","level":2},{"id":"qalisa-isibonelo","text":"Qalisa isibonelo","level":2},{"id":"funda-imiphumela","text":"Funda imiphumela","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-idizayini","text":"Shintsha idizayini","level":2},{"id":"qhubeka-wakhe-imodeli-yakho-yesimo","text":"Qhubeka wakhe imodeli yakho yesimo","level":2},{"id":"amagnethi-aqinile","text":"Amagnethi aqinile","level":2},{"id":"okungakenzi-okwamanje","text":"Okungakenzi okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmtapo wokuhlaziya we-PartCraft ungabala insimu yamagnethi yamakhoyili nensimbi ngo-2-D: ukugawula kwento ende futhi efanayo ubude bayo, njengesigxobo kagesi, igeneyi yesigxobo, ibhasi noma ukugawula kwemoto. Lesi sifundo siqalisa isibonelo sesigxobo kagesi somtapo, sifunde okusho, sikushintshe, sikutshele ukuthi ungakhiqiza kanjani imodeli yakho yesimo, bese ungeza ignethi esiqinile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsebenzisa indawo yeScript kanye no\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Emtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/a\u003E. Awudingi ukwazi ulimi lwe-CraftScript ukuze ulandele; isibonelo sitshela ukuthi umugqa ngamunye wenzani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okumodelwayo\"\u003EOkumodelwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmgodi we-C wensimbi, 100 × 80 mm ngaphandle futhi 20 mm ubukhulu, nesikhala somoya esingu-2 mm emlenzeni wayo wokudla. Ikhoyili yamaturns angu-100 ephethe i-10 A (1000 ampere-turns) ihlanganiswa ozungeze umlenzi wayo wesobunxele. Konke kude endaweni ephuma esikrinini, ngakho izimpendulo zi-\u003Cstrong\u003Engemitha yokujula ngayinye\u003C/strong\u003E: phindaphinda ngokujula kwangempela ukuze uthole ignethi yangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E yomtapo ixazulula i-vector potential yamagnethi ku-grid yesikwele se-1 mm kubhokisi lomoya ozungeze ignethi, bese ibala i-flux density \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E (ngamatesla) kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalisa-isibonelo\"\u003EQalisa isibonelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EScript\u003C/strong\u003E kubhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokunxele kwe-toolbar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ithebhu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary\u003C/strong\u003E yepaneli ye-script, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EExamples\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EElectromagnet: field, gap, inductance\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula (ukufunda kuphela)\u003C/span\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgomzuzwana noma amabili i-canvas ibonisa i-flux density, nekhonsoli iphrinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EB in the gap 0.5427 T; magnetic circuit 0.5516 T (-1.6 %: fringing and leakage)\ninductance 0.1539 H per metre of depth; the circuit gives 0.1103 H/m, missing the flux that leaks past the gap\nstored energy 7.694 J/m; |B| peaks at 1.97 T in the window&#039;s inner corners (real steel would saturate there)\npull across the gap about 2343 N per metre of depth (117.2 N for 50 mm deep)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulothi engaphansi kwe-canvas ingumugqa we-B_y, i-flux density evundleni, phakathi komugqa wesigxobo, isuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla: cishe −0.55 T emlenzeni wesobunxele (i-flux ihamba iyehla), cishe akukho lutho ewindini, kanti +0.55 T emlenzeni wesokudla nasekuqhubeni kwesikhala (i-flux ibuya ikhuphuka). I-flux efanayo idlula ensimbini nasesikhaleni, ngakho imilenze emibili nesikhala zibonisa inani elifanayo cishe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-imiphumela\"\u003EFunda imiphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsimu esikhaleni\u003C/strong\u003E ingu-0.543 T. Ukubala ngesandla kuthatha igigo njengesifunda samagnethi esisodwa, B = μ0 N I / (g + l / μr), lapho g kuyisikhala, l umugqa ohamba ngensimbi kanye ne-μr yensimbi ehlobene; ikhipha 0.552 T. Insimu ingaphansi kancane kokubalwe ngesandla ngoba i-flux iphuma endaweni yesikhala (fringing) nengxenye ye-flux ithatha indlela emfishane ewindini (leakage). Ngesikhala esincane noma i-grid eshelelisekile, bayasondelana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-inductance\u003C/strong\u003E yekhoyili ye-100-turn ingu-0.154 H ngemitha yokujula, isuka kumandla agcinwe enkambweni. Ifomula yesifunda inika ngaphansi (0.110 H/m) ngoba ibala kuphela i-flux edlula esikhaleni, hhayi ledlula ngaphandle kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa\u003C/strong\u003E okuvala isikhala ngu-B² w / (2 μ0) lapho nobubanzi bobuso besikhala bungu w: cishe 2300 N ngemitha, noma 117 N ngegnethi ejulile ngo-50 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/strong\u003E kwe-1.97 T kuhlala emabhendeni angaphakathi ewindi, lapho i-flux iguquka ngokuqinile. Imodeli ithatha insimbi njengelinear; insimbi yangempela yomsebenzi ihlala ngo-1.5 kuya ku-2 T, ngakho bheka izinani ezingaphezulu kwalokho njengesixwayiso, hhayi impendulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzivivinyo zomtapo zisebenzisa lesi sibonelo zihlole insimu yesikhala ngefomula yesifunda samagnethi nsuku zonke lapho i-PartCraft ishintshwa. Indlela, izinkomba zayo nezinye izihlolo (isolenoyidi ende, isolenoyidi enensimbi) zisemkhawulweni we-\u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E: chofoza kuyo emtapweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-idizayini\"\u003EShintsha idizayini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphezulu kwe-script efundeka kuphela. Ikopi igcinwa nengxenye yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha inani eliseduze kwesiqalo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. Zama:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eg = 0.001;\u003C/code\u003E — isikhala esingu-half: insimu yesikhala icishe iphindeke kabili, kanjalo nokudonsa (kuhambisana ne-B²).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emur = 200;\u003C/code\u003E — inhlanganisela ebuthakathaka: amaturns amaningi asetshenziswa ensimbini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN = 200;\u003C/code\u003E — amaturns amabili: insimu amabili, i-inductance amane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eh = 0.0005;\u003C/code\u003E — i-grid enhle kakhulu: izimpendulo ezisondele, cishe isikhathi esiphindwe amane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqalisa ngalunye kushintsha i-canvas. Izinguquguqukayo ezenziwe yi-script (njengo-\u003Ccode\u003EBgap\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EF\u003C/code\u003E) zihlala ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EVariables\u003C/strong\u003E zokubala kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qhubeka-wakhe-imodeli-yakho-yesimo\"\u003EQhubeka wakhe imodeli yakho yesimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibonelo sakha konke ngohlu lwezintathu, inani elilodwa ngesikwele se-grid ngasinye, ongalenza noma yisiphi isimo esidwetshwe ngemigqa eqondile ehambisana ne-grid:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELapho kukhona insimbi:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Eiron\u003C/code\u003E iyiqiniso kuzikwele ezingaphakathi kwegigo. Isibonelo sakha kumakhonjana: \u003Ccode\u003Eframe &amp; ~window &amp; ~gap\u003C/code\u003E kusho &quot;ku-frame, hhayi ewindini, hhayi esikhaleni&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-permeability:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E1 + (mur - 1) * iron\u003C/code\u003E ingu-1 emoyeni nango-\u003Ccode\u003Emur\u003C/code\u003E ensimbini. Izinto eziningi zithola amanani azo ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqukethwe kwamanje:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003EJ\u003C/code\u003E kuyi-current density ngama-ampere ngomitha yesikwele, okuhle ukuphuma esikrinini, okubi ukungena kuso. Ikhoyili inezinhlangothi ezimbili ezinezimpawu eziphambene; isibonelo sibala \u003Ccode\u003EJ0\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uhlangothi olulodwa lwethwele N I.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBese \u003Ccode\u003Er = magnetostatic2d(m, permeability, J)\u003C/code\u003E ixazulula. \u003Ccode\u003Er.B\u003C/code\u003E kuyi-flux density kuso ngalinye isikwele (imigqa emibili, x no-y), \u003Ccode\u003Er.Bmag\u003C/code\u003E ubukhulu bayo, \u003Ccode\u003Er.energy\u003C/code\u003E amandla agcinwe ngemitha. \u003Ccode\u003Eplot(x, y)\u003C/code\u003E idweba umugqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmtapo usebenza ngemitha, nokubuka ngamamilimitha, ngakho insimu eboniswa njengoba iyiyo ibonakala ingaphansi kakhulu ngamakhulu ayinkulungwane. Isibonelo sibonisa lokho ku-kopi ye-grid ngamamilimitha (\u003Ccode\u003Emm = quadGrid(…)\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ccode\u003Eshow(field(mm, …))\u003C/code\u003E): kopisha lezi zimugqa ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgokuzenzakalelayo umphetho webhokisi ugcina insimu ingaphumi: ayikho i-flux ephuma kuyo. Yenza ibhokisi okungenani libe kabili noma kathathu usayizi wegnethi ukuze lokhu kungacindezeli insimu. Ngegnethi ehambisanayo ungamodela ingxenye yayo: ikhanda le-\u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E lisho umbandela womphetho ongasetshenziswa emgqeni wokuhambisana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagnethi-aqinile\"\u003EAmagnethi aqinile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibonelo sesibili, \u003Cstrong\u003EExamples\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EPermanent magnet in an iron core: working point, leakage, pull\u003C/strong\u003E, siyisigxobo esifanayo kodwa ikhoyili isusiwe, kanti isilayisi se-10 mm somlenzi wesobunxele sishintshelwe ignethi, eyenziwe ngamagnethi ephezulu. Yiqalise nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Iphrinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ethe magnet works at B = 1.036 T, H = -124 kA/m (on its recoil line B = Br + μ0 μr H)\nB in the gap 0.6778 T; the magnetic circuit without leakage 0.9692 T (-30.1 %)\nleakage factor 1.53: of the flux leaving the magnet, 65 % crosses the gap between the pole faces\npull across the gap about 3656 N per metre of depth (182.8 N for 50 mm deep)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza.\u003C/strong\u003E Ignethi ichazwa ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003Eremanence\u003C/strong\u003E Br (insimu eyigcina lapho ifakwe ensimbini: cishe 1.2 T ye-NdFeB esintered, 0.4 T ye-ferrite) nango-recoil permeability yayo (cishe 1.05 no-1.1). Ukuvula isikhala kuyiphonsa phansi emgqeni wayo wokubuya: lapha ibe ku-1.04 T, ne-H ibheke ngaphambili ye-B ngaphakathi kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Leakage.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukubalwa ngesandla ngaphandle kokuvuza kunika 0.97 T esikhaleni; imodeli inika 0.68 T. Ignethi iqhuba i-flux yayo ngomthwalo onamandla phezu kobude obufushane, ngakho okuningi kuya ngqo ngaphezu kwewindi kunokudlula esikhaleni. I-leakage factor isho ukuthi kangakanani: 1.53 lapha. Setha \u003Ccode\u003Eg = 0;\u003C/code\u003E kwe-keeper evaliwe: ignethi isebenza ngaphakathi kuhhafu ngekhulu kwesibalo sangesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagnethi emodelini yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Nika \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E amagnethi njenge \u003Ccode\u003Estruct(&#039;Br&#039;, Br)\u003C/code\u003E, lapho \u003Ccode\u003EBr\u003C/code\u003E inomugqa owodwa ngesikwele se-grid nge-remanence ngokuthi x no-y ngamatesla (ziro ngaphandle kwamagnethi), bese unika izikwele zamagnethi i-recoil permeability yazo kuhlu lwe-permeability:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E``\u003Ccode\u003E Brem = [zeros(numel(mag), 1), 1.2 * mag];     % 1.2 T phezulu emasikweni lapho mag kuyiqiniso r = magnetostatic2d(m, 1 + (mur - 1) * iron + 0.05 * mag, 0, struct(), struct(&#039;Br&#039;, Brem)); \u003C/code\u003E``\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgegnethi emagnetiswe ngengeli, beka \u003Ccode\u003EBr·cos(angle)\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EBr·sin(angle)\u003C/code\u003E emakholomu amabili; ngendandatho emagnetiswe ephumela ngaphandle, bala isiqondiso sesikwele ngasinye ngokuya kwendawo yaso. I-\u003Ccode\u003Er.H\u003C/code\u003E inika amandla ensimu H kuso ngalinye isikwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli igcina ignethi emgqeni wayo oqondile wokubuya noma ingakanani ukucindezelwa kwayo. Ignethi yangempela eqhutshwe ngaphezu kwendawo yayo yokugoba (ngesikhala esikhulu, ikhoyili enamandla noma ukushisa) ilahlekelwa yingxenye yamandla ayo ngokuphelele; hlola indawo yokusebenza ngevini yomkhiqizi yalo mkhawulo nokushisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzivivinyo zomtapo zihlola amagnethi ngemiphumela yesandla emibili: ignethi eyindilinga emoyeni ovulekile (ngaphakathi kwayo, B = Br / (1 + μr)) negnethi evalwe yiyoki yensimbi (isifunda samagnethi), zombili ngaphakathi kuka-1 %.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungakenzi-okwamanje\"\u003EOkungakenzi okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcwala.\u003C/strong\u003E Insimbi iyilinear: phinda ikhulu kabili ikhoyili, insimu iphindeke kabili, ngaphandle komkhawulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphuca amandla.\u003C/strong\u003E Amagnethi ahlala emgqeni wawo oqondile wokubuya (bheka ngenhla).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-eddy currents\u003C/strong\u003E nokulahlekelwa (ukulahlekelwa kwensimbi, ukulahlekelwa kwethusi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye ezinyakazayo nokuphenduka.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho rotor ejikelezayo ku-stator, akukho torque ngengeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimo ezijikelezayo.\u003C/strong\u003E I-grid yenziwe ngezikwele ezilinganayo, ngakho imiphetho egobile iphuma ibhodlwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3-D.\u003C/strong\u003E Konke kuyisigaxa sento ende.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwakhiwa kwemoto (i-rotor ejikelezayo, i-torque nokulahlekelwa ku-2-D) kuhlolwa ngenguqulo ezayo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Umtapo wokuhlaziya we-PartCraft ungabala insimu yamagnethi yamakhoyili nensimbi ngo-2-D: ukugawula kwento ende futhi efanayo ubude bayo, njengesigxobo kagesi, igeneyi yesigxobo, ibhasi noma ukugawula kwemoto. Lesi sifundo siqalisa isibonelo sesigxobo kagesi somtapo, sifunde okusho, sikushintshe, sikutshele ukuthi ungakhiqiza kanjani imodeli yakho yesimo, bese ungeza ignethi esiqinile. Isebenzisa indawo yeScript kanye nomtapo wokuhlaziya. Awudingi ukwazi ulimi lwe-CraftScript ukuze ulandele; isibonelo sitshela ukuthi umugqa ngamunye wenzani. Okumodelwayo Umgodi we-C wensimbi, 100 × 80 mm ngaphandle futhi 20 mm ubukhulu, nesikhala somoya esingu-2 mm emlenzeni wayo wokudla. Ikhoyili yamaturns angu-100 ephethe i-10 A (1000 ampere-turns) ihlanganiswa ozungeze umlenzi wayo wesobunxele. Konke kude endaweni ephuma esikrinini, ngakho izimpendulo zi-ngemitha yokujula ngayinye: phindaphinda ngokujula kwangempela ukuze uthole ignethi yangempela. I-magnetostatic2d yomtapo ixazulula i-vector potential yamagnethi ku-grid yesikwele se-1 mm kubhokisi lomoya ozungeze ignethi, bese ibala i-flux density B (ngamatesla) kuyo. Qalisa isibonelo Khetha Script kubhokisi le-Workspace ngakwesokunxele kwe-toolbar. Vula ithebhu ye-Library yepaneli ye-script, bese Examples › Electromagnet: field, gap, inductance. Chofoza Vula (ukufunda kuphela), bese ucindezela F5. Ngomzuzwana noma amabili i-canvas ibonisa i-flux density, nekhonsoli iphrinta: B in the gap 0.5427 T; magnetic circuit 0.5516 T (-1.6 %: fringing and leakage) inductance 0.1539 H per metre of depth; the circuit gives 0.1103 H/m, missing the flux that leaks past the gap stored energy 7.694 J/m; |B| peaks at 1.97 T in the window's inner corners (real steel would saturate there) pull across the gap about 2343 N per metre of depth (117.2 N for 50 mm deep) Ipulothi engaphansi kwe-canvas ingumugqa we-B_y, i-flux density evundleni, phakathi komugqa wesigxobo, isuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla: cishe −0.55 T emlenzeni wesobunxele (i-flux ihamba iyehla), cishe akukho lutho ewindini, kanti +0.55 T emlenzeni wesokudla nasekuqhubeni kwesikhala (i-flux ibuya ikhuphuka). I-flux efanayo idlula ensimbini nasesikhaleni, ngakho imilenze emibili nesikhala zibonisa inani elifanayo cishe. Funda imiphumela Insimu esikhaleni ingu-0.543 T. Ukubala ngesandla kuthatha igigo njengesifunda samagnethi esisodwa, B = μ0 N I / (g + l / μr), lapho g kuyisikhala, l umugqa ohamba ngensimbi kanye ne-μr yensimbi ehlobene; ikhipha 0.552 T. Insimu ingaphansi kancane kokubalwe ngesandla ngoba i-flux iphuma endaweni yesikhala (fringing) nengxenye ye-flux ithatha indlela emfishane ewindini (leakage). Ngesikhala esincane noma i-grid eshelelisekile, bayasondelana. I-inductance yekhoyili ye-100-turn ingu-0.154 H ngemitha yokujula, isuka kumandla agcinwe enkambweni. Ifomula yesifunda inika ngaphansi (0.110 H/m) ngoba ibala kuphela i-flux edlula esikhaleni, hhayi ledlula ngaphandle kwayo. Ukudonsa okuvala isikhala ngu-B² w / (2 μ0) lapho nobubanzi bobuso besikhala bungu w: cishe 2300 N ngemitha, noma 117 N ngegnethi ejulile ngo-50 mm. Ukuphakama kwe-1.97 T kuhlala emabhendeni angaphakathi ewindi, lapho i-flux iguquka ngokuqinile. Imodeli ithatha insimbi njengelinear; insimbi yangempela yomsebenzi ihlala ngo-1.5 kuya ku-2 T, ngakho bheka izinani ezingaphezulu kwalokho njengesixwayiso, hhayi impendulo. Izivivinyo zomtapo zisebenzisa lesi sibonelo zihlole insimu yesikhala ngefomula yesifunda samagnethi nsuku zonke lapho i-PartCraft ishintshwa. Indlela, izinkomba zayo nezinye izihlolo (isolenoyidi ende, isolenoyidi enensimbi) zisemkhawulweni we-magnetostatic2d: chofoza kuyo emtapweni. Shintsha idizayini Chofoza Yenza ikopi ngaphezulu kwe-script efundeka kuphela. Ikopi igcinwa nengxenye yakho. Shintsha inani eliseduze kwesiqalo bese ucindezela F5 futhi. Zama: g = 0.001; — isikhala esingu-half: insimu yesikhala icishe iphindeke kabili, kanjalo nokudonsa (kuhambisana ne-B²). mur = 200; — inhlanganisela ebuthakathaka: amaturns amaningi asetshenziswa ensimbini. N = 200; — amaturns amabili: insimu amabili, i-inductance amane. h = 0.0005; — i-grid enhle kakhulu: izimpendulo ezisondele, cishe isikhathi esiphindwe amane. Ukuqalisa ngalunye kushintsha i-canvas. Izinguquguqukayo ezenziwe yi-script (njengo-Bgap, L, F) zihlala ohlwini lwe-Variables zokubala kwakho. Qhubeka wakhe imodeli yakho yesimo Isibonelo sakha konke ngohlu lwezintathu, inani elilodwa ngesikwele se-grid ngasinye, ongalenza noma yisiphi isimo esidwetshwe ngemigqa eqondile ehambisana ne-grid: Lapho kukhona insimbi: iron iyiqiniso kuzikwele ezingaphakathi kwegigo. Isibonelo sakha kumakhonjana: frame & ~window & ~gap kusho \"ku-frame, hhayi ewindini, hhayi esikhaleni\". I-permeability: 1 + (mur - 1) * iron ingu-1 emoyeni nango-mur ensimbini. Izinto eziningi zithola amanani azo ngendlela efanayo. Ukuqukethwe kwamanje: J kuyi-current density ngama-ampere ngomitha yesikwele, okuhle ukuphuma esikrinini, okubi ukungena kuso. Ikhoyili inezinhlangothi ezimbili ezinezimpawu eziphambene; isibonelo sibala J0 ukuze uhlangothi olulodwa lwethwele N I. Bese r = magnetostatic2d(m, permeability, J) ixazulula. r.B kuyi-flux density kuso ngalinye isikwele (imigqa emibili, x no-y), r.Bmag ubukhulu bayo, r.energy amandla agcinwe ngemitha. plot(x, y) idweba umugqa. Umtapo usebenza ngemitha, nokubuka ngamamilimitha, ngakho insimu eboniswa njengoba iyiyo ibonakala ingaphansi kakhulu ngamakhulu ayinkulungwane. Isibonelo sibonisa lokho ku-kopi ye-grid ngamamilimitha (mm = quadGrid(…), bese show(field(mm, …))): kopisha lezi zimugqa ezimbili. Ngokuzenzakalelayo umphetho webhokisi ugcina insimu ingaphumi: ayikho i-flux ephuma kuyo. Yenza ibhokisi okungenani libe kabili noma kathathu usayizi wegnethi ukuze lokhu kungacindezeli insimu. Ngegnethi ehambisanayo ungamodela ingxenye yayo: ikhanda le-magnetostatic2d lisho umbandela womphetho ongasetshenziswa emgqeni wokuhambisana. Amagnethi aqinile Isibonelo sesibili, Examples › Permanent magnet in an iron core: working point, leakage, pull, siyisigxobo esifanayo kodwa ikhoyili isusiwe, kanti isilayisi se-10 mm somlenzi wesobunxele sishintshelwe ignethi, eyenziwe ngamagnethi ephezulu. Yiqalise nge-F5. Iphrinta: the magnet works at B = 1.036 T, H = -124 kA/m (on its recoil line B = Br + μ0 μr H) B in the gap 0.6778 T; the magnetic circuit without leakage 0.9692 T (-30.1 %) leakage factor 1.53: of the flux leaving the magnet, 65 % crosses the gap between the pole faces pull across the gap about 3656 N per metre of depth (182.8 N for 50 mm deep) Indawo yokusebenza. Ignethi ichazwa ngo-remanence Br (insimu eyigcina lapho ifakwe ensimbini: cishe 1.2 T ye-NdFeB esintered, 0.4 T ye-ferrite) nango-recoil permeability yayo (cishe 1.05 no-1.1). Ukuvula isikhala kuyiphonsa phansi emgqeni wayo wokubuya: lapha ibe ku-1.04 T, ne-H ibheke ngaphambili ye-B ngaphakathi kuyo. I-Leakage. Ukubalwa ngesandla ngaphandle kokuvuza kunika 0.97 T esikhaleni; imodeli inika 0.68 T. Ignethi iqhuba i-flux yayo ngomthwalo onamandla phezu kobude obufushane, ngakho okuningi kuya ngqo ngaphezu kwewindi kunokudlula esikhaleni. I-leakage factor isho ukuthi kangakanani: 1.53 lapha. Setha g = 0; kwe-keeper evaliwe: ignethi isebenza ngaphakathi kuhhafu ngekhulu kwesibalo sangesandla. Amagnethi emodelini yakho. Nika magnetostatic2d amagnethi njenge struct('Br', Br), lapho Br inomugqa owodwa ngesikwele se-grid nge-remanence ngokuthi x no-y ngamatesla (ziro ngaphandle kwamagnethi), bese unika izikwele zamagnethi i-recoil permeability yazo kuhlu lwe-permeability: `` Brem = [zeros(numel(mag), 1), 1.2 * mag]; % 1.2 T phezulu emasikweni lapho mag kuyiqiniso r = magnetostatic2d(m, 1 + (mur - 1) * iron + 0.05 * mag, 0, struct(), struct('Br', Brem)); `` Ngegnethi emagnetiswe ngengeli, beka Br·cos(angle) no-Br·sin(angle) emakholomu amabili; ngendandatho emagnetiswe ephumela ngaphandle, bala isiqondiso sesikwele ngasinye ngokuya kwendawo yaso. I-r.H inika amandla ensimu H kuso ngalinye isikwele. Imodeli igcina ignethi emgqeni wayo oqondile wokubuya noma ingakanani ukucindezelwa kwayo. Ignethi yangempela eqhutshwe ngaphezu kwendawo yayo yokugoba (ngesikhala esikhulu, ikhoyili enamandla noma ukushisa) ilahlekelwa yingxenye yamandla ayo ngokuphelele; hlola indawo yokusebenza ngevini yomkhiqizi yalo mkhawulo nokushisa. Izivivinyo zomtapo zihlola amagnethi ngemiphumela yesandla emibili: ignethi eyindilinga emoyeni ovulekile (ngaphakathi kwayo, B = Br / (1 + μr)) negnethi evalwe yiyoki yensimbi (isifunda samagnethi), zombili ngaphakathi kuka-1 %. Okungakenzi okwamanje Ukugcwala. Insimbi iyilinear: phinda ikhulu kabili ikhoyili, insimu iphindeke kabili, ngaphandle komkhawulo. Ukuphuca amandla. Amagnethi ahlala emgqeni wawo oqondile wokubuya (bheka ngenhla). Ama-eddy currents nokulahlekelwa (ukulahlekelwa kwensimbi, ukulahlekelwa kwethusi). Izingxenye ezinyakazayo nokuphenduka. Akukho rotor ejikelezayo ku-stator, akukho torque ngengeli. Izimo ezijikelezayo. I-grid yenziwe ngezikwele ezilinganayo, ngakho imiphetho egobile iphuma ibhodlwe. 3-D. Konke kuyisigaxa sento ende. Ukwakhiwa kwemoto (i-rotor ejikelezayo, i-torque nokulahlekelwa ku-2-D) kuhlolwa ngenguqulo ezayo. Bheka Akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rough-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuhlanza nge-3D nokusala okusele","summary":"Hlanza isitoko esizungeze imodeli yonke ngoleveli ngoleveli ngethuluzi elisicaba, elinebull-nose noma elibhola, ushiye isitoko sokuqeda, bese uvumela ithuluzi elincane lisike kuphela lapho okokuqala lushiya khona impahla. Yini amapasi aqinisekisa, nokuthi yini angayiqinisekisi.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["ukuhlanza nge-3d","ukuhlanza","rough","ukusala okusele","insalela yesitoko","isitoko esizoshiya","stepdown","amazinga","z level","waterline","ramp","plunge","gouge","ithuluzi elincane"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuhlanza-nge-3d","text":"Ukuhlanza nge-3D","level":2},{"id":"ukusala-okusele","text":"Ukusala okusele","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-izindlela-zinhle-kangakanani","text":"Ukuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi emibili ku-Manufacture, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E kwi-toolbar yayo, ihlanza isitoko kusuka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekumodeli yonke\u003C/strong\u003E ngo-3D, ithuluzi libekwe lime (noma kuyisiqondiso sethuluzi somsebenzi ngokwawo, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\"\u003Eukuthambeka kwethuluzi\u003C/a\u003E). Azidingi ukukhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlanza-nge-3d\"\u003EUkuhlanza nge-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D rough\u003C/span\u003E isebenza isuka phezulu kwesitoko ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cstrong\u003Estepdown\u003C/strong\u003E ngesikhathi. Ezingeni ngalinye ihlanza konke ithuluzi elingakufinyelela lingathintanga imodeli: imigqa eqondile ehlukaniswe ngesinyathelo se-\u003Cstrong\u003Estepover\u003C/strong\u003E (ingxenyana yobubanzi bethuluzi), bese kanye ezungeze umphetho walokho elingakufinyelela, ukuze izindonga zilandelwe futhi zingasali njengomugqa wezinyathelo ngepulani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko esizoshiya\u003C/strong\u003E: ithuluzi lihlala kangakanani kude nemodeli lapho lonke, ukuze kube nokuqeda (okuzenzakalelayo 0.5 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga elilodwa ngaleyo ndawo esicaba\u003C/strong\u003E: izinga elengeziwe ngokuphakama kobuso bemodeli ngayinye esicaba (kanye nesitoko esizoshiya), ukuze isisekelo singaphiwa siphezulu nge-stepdown eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUngahlanzi isitoko esincane kune\u003C/strong\u003E: impahla encane kulena, phezulu noma ecaleni, ayifanelekile ukudlula (0.05 mm ukuhlanza, 0.5 mm ukusala okusele, ukuze umugqa oncane ongasele odongeni ungathumeli ithuluzi elincane odongeni ngalunye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEzansi\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho okusikwa ngaphansi kwalobu bukhulu. Okuyize kusho ukuthi phansi kwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqala ngesitoko \u003Cstrong\u003Enjengoba imisebenzi ngaphambi kwayo ikushiye\u003C/strong\u003E: ngemva kwedlulo lobuso alisiki umoya lapho i-face mill isidlule khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwehla: lapho ithuluzi lizohlangana nesitoko endleleni ephansi lizama isibhakabhaka ngendlela yalo yokudlula ku-\u003Cstrong\u003Eramp angle\u003C/strong\u003E, phambili nemuva kuze kube ngamabubanzi amabili ethuluzi ngaphezulu. Idlulo elifushane kakhulu kulokho libhodwa qondile phansi ngokondla kwe-plunge; umsebenzi uyawabala futhi uyakwaxwayisa, ngoba ithuluzi elingasiki ngesikhungo salo akufanele lenze lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusala-okusele\"\u003EUkusala okusele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERest\u003C/span\u003E iyisu elifanayo nalelo lesikhathi \u003Cstrong\u003Esethuluzi elincane ngemva kwelikhulu\u003C/strong\u003E. Lifunda isimulator sesitoko futhi lisika kuphela lapho impahla isasele khona: emakhoneni angaphakathi ithuluzi elikhulu lalingakwazi ukuthatha, izilotha lalingakwazi ukugcwalisa, nezinyathelo elazishiya emagqumeni. Kwezinye zonke alenzi lutho, ngakho indlela yalo iyingxenyana encane yalokho ithuluzi elifanayo elizokuthatha ngesitoko esisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELisebenze ngemva komsebenzi wokuhlanza futhi ukhethe ithuluzi elincane. Ludinga isimulator sesitoko semisebenzi ngaphambi kwalo, esihlale siyisebenzisa indawo yokusebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-izindlela-zinhle-kangakanani\"\u003EUkuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ukugawuka.\u003C/strong\u003E Izikhundla zethuluzi zinqunywa kugridi, nethuluzi lenziwe likhulu kancane kunalokho lalikunjalo (ngama-grid cell angu-1.4 ngakwesokudla nangakwesobunxele, nangesitoko esizoshiya), ukuze noma ikuphi lapho limi khona likhululekile emodelini. Izivivinyo zihlola wonke amaphuzu okusika ngethuluzi elinembile emeshini enembile, nesimulator sesitoko ngemva kwesinyathelo ngasinye: akukho ukugawuka, akukho ukuhamba ngokushesha ngesitoko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIntengo yakho\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga zigcina okungaphezu kancane kwesitoko esizoshiya, kuze kufike ekusalayo okubonakalayo ku-&quot;Extra stock on walls&quot; ku-operation (cishe 0.5 mm ethuluzini lika-Ø6, ocishe ubuncane ngelincane). Ukuqeda kuyakuthatha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zindlela akuzona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa ingumugqa oqondile, hhayi okuphambene noyisimo sengxenye noma amajika alingana. Yenza ukuphuma nokuhamba emoyeni okuningi kunendlela ye-offset noma ye-adaptive, futhi isinyathelo sokuqala ngaphansi kwesinyathelo ngasinye sisika ububanzi bethuluzi obugcwele. Kumapocket anesisekelo esicaba, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003EI-Adaptive\u003C/a\u003E yiyona ehlanzayo kangcono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsigoba sethuluzi nemgoqo awahlolwa. Isexwayiso siyavela uma ukusika kujule kunobude be-flute.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugoba okungaphansi akubonwa: imodeli ilingana nalokho ithuluzi elihlangana nakho lehla ngeleti layo. Ukuhlanza uhlangothi, nikeza umsebenzi wesibili \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\"\u003Eukuqondisa kwethuluzi okuthambekile\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusala okusele kwazi isitoko njengoba nje kwazi isimulator esigridini (amaseli angu-0.1 kuya ku-2 mm, ngosayizi wengxenye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngxenyeni enkulu uhlelo lude (ngaphezu kwama-100,000 wokuhamba ngeflange elingu-200 mm nethuluzi lika-Ø6) futhi lithatha cishe umzuzu ukuthi lisebenze, futhi noma yiluphi ushintsho esikhaleni sokusebenza luphinde lusebenze wonke uhlelo. Sebenzisa ithuluzi elikhulu elingena ukuze uhlanze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Imisebenzi emibili ku-Manufacture, ngaphansi kwe-More kwi-toolbar yayo, ihlanza isitoko kusuka kumodeli yonke ngo-3D, ithuluzi libekwe lime (noma kuyisiqondiso sethuluzi somsebenzi ngokwawo, ukuthambeka kwethuluzi). Azidingi ukukhetha. Ukuhlanza nge-3D 3D rough isebenza isuka phezulu kwesitoko ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-stepdown ngesikhathi. Ezingeni ngalinye ihlanza konke ithuluzi elingakufinyelela lingathintanga imodeli: imigqa eqondile ehlukaniswe ngesinyathelo se-stepover (ingxenyana yobubanzi bethuluzi), bese kanye ezungeze umphetho walokho elingakufinyelela, ukuze izindonga zilandelwe futhi zingasali njengomugqa wezinyathelo ngepulani. Isitoko esizoshiya: ithuluzi lihlala kangakanani kude nemodeli lapho lonke, ukuze kube nokuqeda (okuzenzakalelayo 0.5 mm). Izinga elilodwa ngaleyo ndawo esicaba: izinga elengeziwe ngokuphakama kobuso bemodeli ngayinye esicaba (kanye nesitoko esizoshiya), ukuze isisekelo singaphiwa siphezulu nge-stepdown eyodwa. Ungahlanzi isitoko esincane kune: impahla encane kulena, phezulu noma ecaleni, ayifanelekile ukudlula (0.05 mm ukuhlanza, 0.5 mm ukusala okusele, ukuze umugqa oncane ongasele odongeni ungathumeli ithuluzi elincane odongeni ngalunye). Ezansi: akukho okusikwa ngaphansi kwalobu bukhulu. Okuyize kusho ukuthi phansi kwemodeli. Iqala ngesitoko njengoba imisebenzi ngaphambi kwayo ikushiye: ngemva kwedlulo lobuso alisiki umoya lapho i-face mill isidlule khona. Ukwehla: lapho ithuluzi lizohlangana nesitoko endleleni ephansi lizama isibhakabhaka ngendlela yalo yokudlula ku-ramp angle, phambili nemuva kuze kube ngamabubanzi amabili ethuluzi ngaphezulu. Idlulo elifushane kakhulu kulokho libhodwa qondile phansi ngokondla kwe-plunge; umsebenzi uyawabala futhi uyakwaxwayisa, ngoba ithuluzi elingasiki ngesikhungo salo akufanele lenze lokho. Ukusala okusele Rest iyisu elifanayo nalelo lesikhathi sethuluzi elincane ngemva kwelikhulu. Lifunda isimulator sesitoko futhi lisika kuphela lapho impahla isasele khona: emakhoneni angaphakathi ithuluzi elikhulu lalingakwazi ukuthatha, izilotha lalingakwazi ukugcwalisa, nezinyathelo elazishiya emagqumeni. Kwezinye zonke alenzi lutho, ngakho indlela yalo iyingxenyana encane yalokho ithuluzi elifanayo elizokuthatha ngesitoko esisha. Lisebenze ngemva komsebenzi wokuhlanza futhi ukhethe ithuluzi elincane. Ludinga isimulator sesitoko semisebenzi ngaphambi kwalo, esihlale siyisebenzisa indawo yokusebenza. Ukuthi izindlela zinhle kangakanani Akukho ukugawuka. Izikhundla zethuluzi zinqunywa kugridi, nethuluzi lenziwe likhulu kancane kunalokho lalikunjalo (ngama-grid cell angu-1.4 ngakwesokudla nangakwesobunxele, nangesitoko esizoshiya), ukuze noma ikuphi lapho limi khona likhululekile emodelini. Izivivinyo zihlola wonke amaphuzu okusika ngethuluzi elinembile emeshini enembile, nesimulator sesitoko ngemva kwesinyathelo ngasinye: akukho ukugawuka, akukho ukuhamba ngokushesha ngesitoko. Intengo yakho: izindonga zigcina okungaphezu kancane kwesitoko esizoshiya, kuze kufike ekusalayo okubonakalayo ku-\"Extra stock on walls\" ku-operation (cishe 0.5 mm ethuluzini lika-Ø6, ocishe ubuncane ngelincane). Ukuqeda kuyakuthatha. Lezi zindlela akuzona: Imigqa ingumugqa oqondile, hhayi okuphambene noyisimo sengxenye noma amajika alingana. Yenza ukuphuma nokuhamba emoyeni okuningi kunendlela ye-offset noma ye-adaptive, futhi isinyathelo sokuqala ngaphansi kwesinyathelo ngasinye sisika ububanzi bethuluzi obugcwele. Kumapocket anesisekelo esicaba, I-Adaptive yiyona ehlanzayo kangcono. Isigoba sethuluzi nemgoqo awahlolwa. Isexwayiso siyavela uma ukusika kujule kunobude be-flute. Ukugoba okungaphansi akubonwa: imodeli ilingana nalokho ithuluzi elihlangana nakho lehla ngeleti layo. Ukuhlanza uhlangothi, nikeza umsebenzi wesibili ukuqondisa kwethuluzi okuthambekile. Ukusala okusele kwazi isitoko njengoba nje kwazi isimulator esigridini (amaseli angu-0.1 kuya ku-2 mm, ngosayizi wengxenye). Engxenyeni enkulu uhlelo lude (ngaphezu kwama-100,000 wokuhamba ngeflange elingu-200 mm nethuluzi lika-Ø6) futhi lithatha cishe umzuzu ukuthi lisebenze, futhi noma yiluphi ushintsho esikhaleni sokusebenza luphinde lusebenze wonke uhlelo. Sebenzisa ithuluzi elikhulu elingena ukuze uhlanze. Hlola okuphumayo ngesimulator somshini wakho ngaphambi kokusika.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"multi-axis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukusebenza ngama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5","summary":"Tshela i-PartCraft ukuthi yimaphi ama-eksisi azungezayo umshini unawo, thambekisa ithuluzi kunoma yimuphi umsebenzi ojwayelekile, qeda umphezulu ngebhola elithambekela lapho lisika, noma uthenge ingxenye ngaphansi kwethuluzi ku-4th axis. Okubhalwa ku-G-code, nokungafakazelwe.","section":"tasks","order":148,"keywords":["eksisi 5","eksisi 5","eksisi 4","i-eksisi yesine","multi axis","multiaxis","3+2","indexed","positional","tilt","ithuluzi elithambekile","ezungezayo","trunnion","ithebula","ikhanda","i-a eksisi","i-b eksisi","i-c eksisi","tcp","rtcp","indawo yethiphu yethuluzi","g43.4","inverse time","g93","kinematics","pivot","swarf","lead angle"],"headings":[{"id":"ama-eksisi-azungezayo-womshini","text":"Ama-eksisi azungezayo womshini","level":2},{"id":"ithuluzi-elithambekile-kumsebenzi-ojwayelekile","text":"Ithuluzi elithambekile kumsebenzi ojwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"ukuqeda-nge-5-eksisi","text":"Ukuqeda nge-5-eksisi","level":2},{"id":"ukuqeda-okuzungezayo-i-eksisi-yesine","text":"Ukuqeda okuzungezayo (i-eksisi yesine)","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-Manufacture ingabamba ithuluzi ngeengeli, futhi ingahambisa ama-eksisi azungezayo ngenkathi isika. Izinto ezintathu zikwenza lokho, ezilula kakhulu kuya kwezinkulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini.\u003C/strong\u003E Izindlela zihlolwa ngejiyometri ngezivivinyo, futhi i-G-code iyafundwa emuva, kodwa ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi alandela amakhodi abhalwe omlawuli, hhayi noma yimuphi umshini osethwe phambi kwethu. Hlola uhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho nasemoyeni ngaphambi kokufika ensimbi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-eksisi-azungezayo-womshini\"\u003EAma-eksisi azungezayo womshini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEthebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003ESetup\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotary axes\u003C/span\u003E ichaza ukuthi umshini unani:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmshini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELutho (ama-eksisi ama-3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-mill evamile. Noma yimuphi umsebenzi odinga ithuluzi elithambekile uyaxwayisa, futhi i-post iyawenqaba ukuwubhala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA (ijikeleza ngo-X)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi eyodwa ezungezayo ecaleni le-X: ithebula lesine noma i-indexer. Ithuluzi lingathambeka kuphela endizeni ye-Y–Z.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB (ijikeleza ngo-Y)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi eyodwa ezungezayo ecaleni le-Y. Ithuluzi lingathambeka kuphela endizeni ye-X–Z.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA no-C\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi ethambekayo ngo-X ephathwa, noma ephatha, ukuzungezwa ngo-Z: ithebula le-trunnion, noma ikhanda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB no-C\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo nokuthambeka ngo-Y.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphethwe yi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe table (the part turns)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe head (the tool turns)\u003C/span\u003E. Ithebula liyajikeleza ngendlela ephambene ukuze lilethe ubuso obufanayo ngaphansi kwethuluzi, ngakho uphawu lwayo yonke i-engeli lulandela lokhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmlawuli ugcina indawo yomphetho wethuluzi endleleni (TCP)\u003C/strong\u003E: uma kuvuliwe, i-X Y Z ohlelweni ingumphetho wethuluzi ezixhumanisweni zengxenye yayo, futhi umlawuli wenza konke okunye (ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi afana ne-Fanuc nekaLinuxCNC abhala \u003Ccode\u003EG43.4\u003C/code\u003E ngobude bethuluzi). Uma kuvaliwe, emshinini wethebula, i-PartCraft ibhala i-X Y Z njengoba ithebula elijikelezayo lithwala ingxenye, ngokuzungeza \u003Cstrong\u003Eindawo ejikelezayo\u003C/strong\u003E oyinikezayo (ezixhumanisweni zomsebenzi; 0, 0, 0 lapho imvelaphi yomsebenzi isemaphakathini). Umshini wekhanda udinga i-TCP evuliwe: ngaphandle kwayo uhlelo lwalo lwalubuza ubude be-pivot yomshini, okungaziwa yi-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhawulo wokuthambeka\u003C/strong\u003E: i-eksisi ethambekayo ihamba kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImishini ihlukile ngokuthi iyibala kanjani njengehle. Uma i-eksisi ijikeleza ngendlela engafanele emshinini wakho, shintsha uphawu ekhophini ye-post (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EAma-post processor ongawahlela\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithuluzi-elithambekile-kumsebenzi-ojwayelekile\"\u003EIthuluzi elithambekile kumsebenzi ojwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke imisebenzi yokugaya (ubuso, pocket, adaptive, contour, drill, chamfer, parallel, scallop, 3D rough, rest) inezinhlobo ezimbili: \u003Cstrong\u003ETool tilt\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ETilt towards\u003C/strong\u003E: isiqondiso sethuluzi kulowo msebenzi kuphela, kulinganiswa kusuka ku-eksisi yethuluzi yesetha. Lokhu kuyi-3+2 machining: ama-eksisi azungezayo ahamba endaweni athi lapho ama-eksisi amathathu asika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ama-engeli amabili, noma cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETool square to a face\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso obusicaba: ithuluzi liyakubheka ngqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ubuso nemiphetho yomsebenzi njengokujwayelekile. Okubalwa njengesicaba noma imbobo kwahlulelwa ngendlela ethambekile yethuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitoko salowo msebenzi yibhokisi elibamba isitoko esijikelezayo, ngakho ukuphakama nezikhala kuphephile kulolo hlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-G-code, ngaphambi komsebenzi ithuluzi liyakhuphuka, ama-eksisi azungezayo ayajikeleza, futhi ithuluzi lehla phezu kwendawo yalo yokuqala. Ethebuleni elingenayo i-TCP, amagama ajikeleze avele angama-arc futhi imijikelezo yokubhoboza iyasala imijikelezo (uhlaka olubhaliwe lujikeleza kuZ kuphela). Ngokuvulwa kwe-TCP endizeni ethambekile, ama-arc aba imigqa emifushane nemijikelezo ibe yizinyathelo ezimelelwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulingiswa kwesitoko kusebenza isiqondiso esithambekile \u003Cstrong\u003Esodwa\u003C/strong\u003E: kubonisa lokho umsebenzi ulusika kusitoko sonke ukusuka ohlangothini lwawo, futhi uthola ukugawuka khona, kodwa okusikwa kwezinye izikhombisi akudluliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuqeda-nge-5-eksisi\"\u003EUkuqeda nge-5-eksisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture ibala lo msebenzi nalowo olandelayo phezulu kuthebhu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOperations\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5-axis\u003C/span\u003E yi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003Eparallel finishing pass\u003C/a\u003E enebhola lesiphetho elithambekela lapho lihamba. Ibhola lisika ngesibhakabhaka, futhi isibhakabhaka sifana noma ithuluzi lithambekela kuphi ngokuzungeza isikhungo sakho, ngakho ibhola lilandela ngqo indlela ephasiwe yokudlula kwama-eksisi amathathu, kuphela isiqondiso sethuluzi siyashintsha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgasembhekeni womphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E: 1 = ngqo kumphezulu, 0 = ngokuqondile, noma noma yiluphi olusemaphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThambekela phambili\u003C/strong\u003E: amadigri ngesiqondiso sokusika, ukuze isikhungo esinyakazayo sebhola kungasikho lapho kusika khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthambeka okukhulu kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: ithuluzi alithambekeli ngaphezu kwalokhu kusuka ku-eksisi yesetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho isibambi sizothinta imodeli, ukuthambeka kuyanqunywa kuze kube sekuhlanzeni, nomsebenzi uthi ezindaweni ezingaki. Ukudlula ngakunye kungena futhi kuphume ngokuphakama okuqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuqeda-okuzungezayo-i-eksisi-yesine\"\u003EUkuqeda okuzungezayo (i-eksisi yesine)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotary\u003C/span\u003E ingeyengxenye ebanjwe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Ework X\u003C/strong\u003E ku-eksisi ejikelezayo. Ingxenye iyajikeleza futhi ibhola lesiphetho, elibheka i-eksisi njalo, lilandela umphezulu wayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudlula\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the axis\u003C/span\u003E (imigqa ecaleni le-X, isinyathelo esisodwa sokuphenduka ngakunye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERound the part\u003C/span\u003E (amakhwelo, isinyathelo esisodwa se-X ngakunye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-eksisi ku-Y / Z\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho i-eksisi ikhona. Okungenalutho kusho maphakathi nesitoko. Emshinini wethebula ngaphandle kwe-TCP kumele kube yindawo ejikelezayo kuSetup; umsebenzi uyaxwayisa uma ingenjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka / Kuya ku-X\u003C/strong\u003E nethi \u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka / Kuya ku-engeli\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye yobude nokuphenduka okuzosika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphakama kwebhola ngenhlanganisela yayo ngayinye yi-drop enembile yesphere emeshini yengxenye, kusuka ngaleso sicelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda nge-5-eksisi nokuqeda okuzungezayo kuthatha \u003Cstrong\u003Eibhola lesiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela. Akukho ukusika kwe-swarf (uhlangothi lwethuluzi edongeni elilula), akukho imigqa yokugeleza ecaleni kwezinkomba zomphezulu, akukho ukuhlanza okunama-eksisi amaningi, futhi akukho ukukhethwa okuzenzakalelayo kokuthambeka ukugwema ukushayisana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindlela ze-5-eksisi nezokuzungezayo \u003Cstrong\u003Eazidluli ekulingisweni kwesitoko\u003C/strong\u003E, okuyimephu yokuphakama engakwazi ukubamba ukusika okuthambekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-shank ihlolwa ekuqedeni nge-5-eksisi ngokumelene nemodeli ibonwa ngaphezulu; i-holder, i-spindle nomshini ngokwawo akuhlolwa noma kanjani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda okuzungezayo kusika kuphela lokho ethuluzi elikubonayo libheka i-eksisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda nge-5-eksisi kuthatha umzuzu noma ngaphezulu ukuthi kusebenze ezingxenyeni ezinkulu: i-shank ihlolwa ezindaweni zonke zamapasi onke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ama-eksisi ajikeleza ehamba nama-eksisi amugqa futhi i-TCP icishiwe, ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi abhala ukondla njengesikhathi esiphambene (\u003Ccode\u003EG93\u003C/code\u003E), bese ebuyela ku-\u003Ccode\u003EG94\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhodi yesikhala sokusebenza esithambekile (\u003Ccode\u003EG68.2\u003C/code\u003E nezinye) ayibhalwa, futhi kumshini othile akukho mikhawulo, ukuhlukanisa noma izindawo zokushayisana ezaziwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-Manufacture ingabamba ithuluzi ngeengeli, futhi ingahambisa ama-eksisi azungezayo ngenkathi isika. Izinto ezintathu zikwenza lokho, ezilula kakhulu kuya kwezinkulu. Akukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini. Izindlela zihlolwa ngejiyometri ngezivivinyo, futhi i-G-code iyafundwa emuva, kodwa ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi alandela amakhodi abhalwe omlawuli, hhayi noma yimuphi umshini osethwe phambi kwethu. Hlola uhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho nasemoyeni ngaphambi kokufika ensimbi. Ama-eksisi azungezayo womshini Ethebhini le-Setup, Rotary axes ichaza ukuthi umshini unani: Ukukhetha Umshini Lutho (ama-eksisi ama-3) I-mill evamile. Noma yimuphi umsebenzi odinga ithuluzi elithambekile uyaxwayisa, futhi i-post iyawenqaba ukuwubhala. A (ijikeleza ngo-X) Eksisi eyodwa ezungezayo ecaleni le-X: ithebula lesine noma i-indexer. Ithuluzi lingathambeka kuphela endizeni ye-Y–Z. B (ijikeleza ngo-Y) Eksisi eyodwa ezungezayo ecaleni le-Y. Ithuluzi lingathambeka kuphela endizeni ye-X–Z. A no-C Eksisi ethambekayo ngo-X ephathwa, noma ephatha, ukuzungezwa ngo-Z: ithebula le-trunnion, noma ikhanda. B no-C Okufanayo nokuthambeka ngo-Y. Bese: Iphethwe yi: The table (the part turns) noma The head (the tool turns). Ithebula liyajikeleza ngendlela ephambene ukuze lilethe ubuso obufanayo ngaphansi kwethuluzi, ngakho uphawu lwayo yonke i-engeli lulandela lokhu. Umlawuli ugcina indawo yomphetho wethuluzi endleleni (TCP): uma kuvuliwe, i-X Y Z ohlelweni ingumphetho wethuluzi ezixhumanisweni zengxenye yayo, futhi umlawuli wenza konke okunye (ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi afana ne-Fanuc nekaLinuxCNC abhala G43.4 ngobude bethuluzi). Uma kuvaliwe, emshinini wethebula, i-PartCraft ibhala i-X Y Z njengoba ithebula elijikelezayo lithwala ingxenye, ngokuzungeza indawo ejikelezayo oyinikezayo (ezixhumanisweni zomsebenzi; 0, 0, 0 lapho imvelaphi yomsebenzi isemaphakathini). Umshini wekhanda udinga i-TCP evuliwe: ngaphandle kwayo uhlelo lwalo lwalubuza ubude be-pivot yomshini, okungaziwa yi-PartCraft. Umkhawulo wokuthambeka: i-eksisi ethambekayo ihamba kangakanani. Imishini ihlukile ngokuthi iyibala kanjani njengehle. Uma i-eksisi ijikeleza ngendlela engafanele emshinini wakho, shintsha uphawu ekhophini ye-post (Ama-post processor ongawahlela). Ithuluzi elithambekile kumsebenzi ojwayelekile Yonke imisebenzi yokugaya (ubuso, pocket, adaptive, contour, drill, chamfer, parallel, scallop, 3D rough, rest) inezinhlobo ezimbili: Tool tilt ne-Tilt towards: isiqondiso sethuluzi kulowo msebenzi kuphela, kulinganiswa kusuka ku-eksisi yethuluzi yesetha. Lokhu kuyi-3+2 machining: ama-eksisi azungezayo ahamba endaweni athi lapho ama-eksisi amathathu asika. Thayipha ama-engeli amabili, noma cindezela Tool square to a face bese uchofoza ubuso obusicaba: ithuluzi liyakubheka ngqo. Khetha ubuso nemiphetho yomsebenzi njengokujwayelekile. Okubalwa njengesicaba noma imbobo kwahlulelwa ngendlela ethambekile yethuluzi. Isitoko salowo msebenzi yibhokisi elibamba isitoko esijikelezayo, ngakho ukuphakama nezikhala kuphephile kulolo hlangothi. Ku-G-code, ngaphambi komsebenzi ithuluzi liyakhuphuka, ama-eksisi azungezayo ayajikeleza, futhi ithuluzi lehla phezu kwendawo yalo yokuqala. Ethebuleni elingenayo i-TCP, amagama ajikeleze avele angama-arc futhi imijikelezo yokubhoboza iyasala imijikelezo (uhlaka olubhaliwe lujikeleza kuZ kuphela). Ngokuvulwa kwe-TCP endizeni ethambekile, ama-arc aba imigqa emifushane nemijikelezo ibe yizinyathelo ezimelelwe. Ukulingiswa kwesitoko kusebenza isiqondiso esithambekile sodwa: kubonisa lokho umsebenzi ulusika kusitoko sonke ukusuka ohlangothini lwawo, futhi uthola ukugawuka khona, kodwa okusikwa kwezinye izikhombisi akudluliswa. Ukuqeda nge-5-eksisi More ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture ibala lo msebenzi nalowo olandelayo phezulu kuthebhu le-Operations. 5-axis yi-parallel finishing pass enebhola lesiphetho elithambekela lapho lihamba. Ibhola lisika ngesibhakabhaka, futhi isibhakabhaka sifana noma ithuluzi lithambekela kuphi ngokuzungeza isikhungo sakho, ngakho ibhola lilandela ngqo indlela ephasiwe yokudlula kwama-eksisi amathathu, kuphela isiqondiso sethuluzi siyashintsha: Ngasembhekeni womphezulu: 1 = ngqo kumphezulu, 0 = ngokuqondile, noma noma yiluphi olusemaphakathi. Thambekela phambili: amadigri ngesiqondiso sokusika, ukuze isikhungo esinyakazayo sebhola kungasikho lapho kusika khona. Ukuthambeka okukhulu kakhulu: ithuluzi alithambekeli ngaphezu kwalokhu kusuka ku-eksisi yesetha. Lapho isibambi sizothinta imodeli, ukuthambeka kuyanqunywa kuze kube sekuhlanzeni, nomsebenzi uthi ezindaweni ezingaki. Ukudlula ngakunye kungena futhi kuphume ngokuphakama okuqondile. Ukuqeda okuzungezayo (i-eksisi yesine) Rotary ingeyengxenye ebanjwe ngaphansi kwe-work X ku-eksisi ejikelezayo. Ingxenye iyajikeleza futhi ibhola lesiphetho, elibheka i-eksisi njalo, lilandela umphezulu wayo: Ukudlula: Along the axis (imigqa ecaleni le-X, isinyathelo esisodwa sokuphenduka ngakunye) noma Round the part (amakhwelo, isinyathelo esisodwa se-X ngakunye). I-eksisi ku-Y / Z: lapho i-eksisi ikhona. Okungenalutho kusho maphakathi nesitoko. Emshinini wethebula ngaphandle kwe-TCP kumele kube yindawo ejikelezayo kuSetup; umsebenzi uyaxwayisa uma ingenjalo. Kusuka / Kuya ku-X nethi Kusuka / Kuya ku-engeli: ingxenye yobude nokuphenduka okuzosika. Ukuphakama kwebhola ngenhlanganisela yayo ngayinye yi-drop enembile yesphere emeshini yengxenye, kusuka ngaleso sicelo. Imikhawulo Ukuqeda nge-5-eksisi nokuqeda okuzungezayo kuthatha ibhola lesiphetho kuphela. Akukho ukusika kwe-swarf (uhlangothi lwethuluzi edongeni elilula), akukho imigqa yokugeleza ecaleni kwezinkomba zomphezulu, akukho ukuhlanza okunama-eksisi amaningi, futhi akukho ukukhethwa okuzenzakalelayo kokuthambeka ukugwema ukushayisana. Izindlela ze-5-eksisi nezokuzungezayo azidluli ekulingisweni kwesitoko, okuyimephu yokuphakama engakwazi ukubamba ukusika okuthambekile. I-shank ihlolwa ekuqedeni nge-5-eksisi ngokumelene nemodeli ibonwa ngaphezulu; i-holder, i-spindle nomshini ngokwawo akuhlolwa noma kanjani. Ukuqeda okuzungezayo kusika kuphela lokho ethuluzi elikubonayo libheka i-eksisi. Ukuqeda nge-5-eksisi kuthatha umzuzu noma ngaphezulu ukuthi kusebenze ezingxenyeni ezinkulu: i-shank ihlolwa ezindaweni zonke zamapasi onke. Lapho ama-eksisi ajikeleza ehamba nama-eksisi amugqa futhi i-TCP icishiwe, ama-post akhelwe ngaphakathi abhala ukondla njengesikhathi esiphambene (G93), bese ebuyela ku-G94. Ikhodi yesikhala sokusebenza esithambekile (G68.2 nezinye) ayibhalwa, futhi kumshini othile akukho mikhawulo, ukuhlukanisa noma izindawo zokushayisana ezaziwayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"turning","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuthenda emshinini wokuthenda","summary":"Qeda, hlanza, qeda, gcoba, sika ingxenye, thungela futhi bhoboza ingxenye ethendiwe, kusuka kumkhawulo ingxenye yenza ngesikhathi ijikeleza. Amathuluzi omshini wokuthenda, ukondla ngokuzungeza, ama-post omshini wokuthenda, nokuthi yini engafakazelwe.","section":"tasks","order":149,"keywords":["ukuthenda","umshini wokuthenda","thenda","ukuqeda ubuso","ukuhlanza","ukuqeda","umsele","ukugcoba","sika ingxenye","ukusika","ucingo","ukuthungela","g32","g33","g96","isivinini sokusika esingashintshi","css","ibanga lomphetho","insert","ibha","ichuck","ububanzi","ukondla ngokuzungeza","g71","g76"],"headings":[{"id":"setha","text":"Setha","level":2},{"id":"imisebenzi","text":"Imisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ithuluzi-elivikelwe-ngayo-engxenyeni","text":"Indlela ithuluzi elivikelwe ngayo engxenyeni","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-Manufacture inemisebenzi eyisikhombisa yomshini wokuthenda. Isebenza kunoma iyiphi ingxenye: okusikwayo yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eumkhawulo ingxenye yenza ngesikhathi ijikeleza\u003C/strong\u003E maphakathi nesitoko, ngakho ingxenye engeyona ejikelezayo ithenjwa iye esimweni esijikelezayo esiyibambayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini wokuthenda.\u003C/strong\u003E Izindlela zihlolwa ngejiyometri ngezivivinyo; ama-post amabili omshini wokuthenda alandela amakhodi abhalwe omlawuli. Hlola uhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho nasemoyeni kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha\"\u003ESetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEthebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003ESetup\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIeksisi yethuluzi\u003C/strong\u003E ngeyeksisi yesipindle, i-Z yomshini wokuthenda. Ubuso bengxenye bungo +Z; ichuck ibamba olunye uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECylinder\u003C/span\u003E, ibha. Ukushintsha kwayo kophezulu kube yikho okusikwa ukusika ubuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImvelaphi yomsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhungo sophezulu bomsebenzi noma sophezulu bemodeli sibeka Z0 ebusweni bangaphambili, indawo ejwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmlawuli\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFanuc-style lathe (.nc)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinuxCNC lathe (.ngc)\u003C/span\u003E. I-post yomshini wokugaya yenqaba uhlelo lokuthenda futhi iyakutshela lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsivinini esikhulu sesipindle\u003C/strong\u003E: umkhawulo isivinini sobuso esiphansi kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture ibala imisebenzi eyisikhombisa yokuthenda phezulu kuthebhu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOperations\u003C/strong\u003E. Umsebenzi wokuqala owengezayo uletha ithuluzi lawo: i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eturning insert\u003C/strong\u003E (ibanga lomphetho, i-engeli ye-insert, i-engeli yomphetho wokusika) noma i-\u003Cstrong\u003Egrooving blade\u003C/strong\u003E (ububanzi, ibanga lekhona, ukuthi ifika kangakanani). Yishintshe ethebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003ETools\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukondla kungokuzungeza, nesivinini kuyisivinini sobuso ngo-m/min esibanjwa yi-control njengoba ububanzi bushintsha; nikeza ithuluzi i-rpm yalo ukuze ulungise isivinini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imisebenzi\"\u003EImisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhlanza ubuso bebha obuphambili kuze kube yingxenye, ngesinyathelo esisodwa ngesikhathi, kusuka ngaphandle kuze kube ngaphesheya kwesikhungo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERough\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapasi ngomugqa we-Z ahlukaniswe \u003Cstrong\u003Engojule wokusika\u003C/strong\u003E ngalinye, aze afike emgodini nge-\u003Cstrong\u003Estock to leave\u003C/strong\u003E; bese kanye emgodini ukuze asuse izinyathelo. Isigodi phakathi kwezinxeko ngena ngokuphonsa okukodwa kojule wokusika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpasi elilodwa emgodini ngengxenyana yokondla kwethuluzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroove\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfaka i-blade ecaleni kwesinye ndawo lapho ingakwazi ukuthatha ngaphezu komkhawulo wesitoko esisele: imigodi i-turning insert ongayifinyelela. \u003Cstrong\u003EFrom / To Z\u003C/strong\u003E iyancisha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPart off\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsika ingxenye ngemuva kobuso bayo bangemuva, ibe yize ngaphezu kwesikhungo, nama-peck uma usethile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThread\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUcingo lwangaphandle: ububanzi obukhulu, i-pitch, ubude, inani lamapasi. Ukujula 0 kusho 0.6134 × pitch (ucingo lwe-60°). Ipasi ngalinye lithatha indawo efanayo yetshipisi; amapasi okuhlela aphinda elokugcina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhobo emgqeni wesikhungo kuze kube ngukujula, nama-peck.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ithuluzi-elivikelwe-ngayo-engxenyeni\"\u003EIndlela ithuluzi elivikelwe ngayo engxenyeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-insert ithathwa njengoba iyikho: isifunda sayo sephoyinti, nangemuva kwayo umphetho ohamba emuva, umugqa oqondile onensimbi engu-180° ngaphansi kwe-engeli yomphetho wokusika ne-engeli ye-insert. Lesi simo sehliswa kumkhawulo ngasemaphoyinteni ngamaphoyinti ngamaphoyinti ngaphezu kwe-Z, nendlela yiyo ephumula kuyo. Ngakho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsakazo wephoyinti sesivele ungene endleleni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ama-post kawabhali \u003Ccode\u003EG41\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EG42\u003C/code\u003E; izixhumanisi yiphoyinti elihlelwe lethuluzi (ikhona yesikwele esizungeze uphoyinti).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-insert \u003Cstrong\u003Eayikwazi ukulandela udonga oluthambekele kakhulu kunomphetho wayo ohamba emuva\u003C/strong\u003E. Umgodi ngemva kwesigodi awushiywa, nomsebenzi wokuqeda uyakutshela ukuthi ingakanani ingxenye ayiyo ukuthi ayifinyelele. Umsebenzi we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroove\u003C/span\u003E uyayithatha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitoko silandelwa ngaphansi kwe-Z ngemva kokusika ngakunye, ngakho ukuhlanza akusikiyo umoya, i-grooving ithola okusele, nomsebenzi ngamunye ubonisa ivolumu eyisusiwe nokuthi uke wasika yini engxenyeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthenda ngaphandle kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho ibha yokubhoboza, akukho imigodi yangaphakathi noma imithambo, akukho imigodi yobuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-spindle eyodwa, ingxenye ibanjwe ku-−Z. Akukho i-sub-spindle, akukho amathuluzi aphilayo, akukho ama-axis C noma Y, akukho ukunyakaza kwe-steady rest noma i-tailstock.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindlela ziyizinyathelo eziqondile: amajika ayizimfushane ngaphakathi kokubekezelela (akukho \u003Ccode\u003EG2\u003C/code\u003E/\u003Ccode\u003EG3\u003C/code\u003E), nokuhlanza nokuthungela kubhalwa ipasi ngalinye (akukho imijikelezo ye-\u003Ccode\u003EG71\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EG76\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthungela kuyimipasi eqondile nokuhudula okuqondile ekugcineni; nikeza umthambo ukhululeko omuhle. Umthambo awubonakali esitokeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubhoboza kusentla akushintshi imodeli yesitoko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-holder, i-turret kanye ne-chuck azihlolwa. Setha \u003Cstrong\u003EStop at Z\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ugcine ithuluzi kude nama-jaw.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkondla nesivinini kungamanani okuqala, njengakokugaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-Manufacture inemisebenzi eyisikhombisa yomshini wokuthenda. Isebenza kunoma iyiphi ingxenye: okusikwayo yi-umkhawulo ingxenye yenza ngesikhathi ijikeleza maphakathi nesitoko, ngakho ingxenye engeyona ejikelezayo ithenjwa iye esimweni esijikelezayo esiyibambayo. Akukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini wokuthenda. Izindlela zihlolwa ngejiyometri ngezivivinyo; ama-post amabili omshini wokuthenda alandela amakhodi abhalwe omlawuli. Hlola uhlelo ngesimulator somlawuli wakho nasemoyeni kuqala. Setha Ethebhini le-Setup: Ieksisi yethuluzi ngeyeksisi yesipindle, i-Z yomshini wokuthenda. Ubuso bengxenye bungo +Z; ichuck ibamba olunye uhlangothi. Isitoko: khetha Cylinder, ibha. Ukushintsha kwayo kophezulu kube yikho okusikwa ukusika ubuso. Imvelaphi yomsebenzi: isikhungo sophezulu bomsebenzi noma sophezulu bemodeli sibeka Z0 ebusweni bangaphambili, indawo ejwayelekile. Umlawuli: Fanuc-style lathe (.nc) noma LinuxCNC lathe (.ngc). I-post yomshini wokugaya yenqaba uhlelo lokuthenda futhi iyakutshela lokho. Isivinini esikhulu sesipindle: umkhawulo isivinini sobuso esiphansi kwawo. More ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture ibala imisebenzi eyisikhombisa yokuthenda phezulu kuthebhu le-Operations. Umsebenzi wokuqala owengezayo uletha ithuluzi lawo: i-turning insert (ibanga lomphetho, i-engeli ye-insert, i-engeli yomphetho wokusika) noma i-grooving blade (ububanzi, ibanga lekhona, ukuthi ifika kangakanani). Yishintshe ethebhini le-Tools. Ukondla kungokuzungeza, nesivinini kuyisivinini sobuso ngo-m/min esibanjwa yi-control njengoba ububanzi bushintsha; nikeza ithuluzi i-rpm yalo ukuze ulungise isivinini. Imisebenzi Umsebenzi Yenzani Face Ihlanza ubuso bebha obuphambili kuze kube yingxenye, ngesinyathelo esisodwa ngesikhathi, kusuka ngaphandle kuze kube ngaphesheya kwesikhungo. Rough Amapasi ngomugqa we-Z ahlukaniswe ngojule wokusika ngalinye, aze afike emgodini nge-stock to leave; bese kanye emgodini ukuze asuse izinyathelo. Isigodi phakathi kwezinxeko ngena ngokuphonsa okukodwa kojule wokusika. Finish Ipasi elilodwa emgodini ngengxenyana yokondla kwethuluzi. Groove Ifaka i-blade ecaleni kwesinye ndawo lapho ingakwazi ukuthatha ngaphezu komkhawulo wesitoko esisele: imigodi i-turning insert ongayifinyelela. From / To Z iyancisha. Part off Isika ingxenye ngemuva kobuso bayo bangemuva, ibe yize ngaphezu kwesikhungo, nama-peck uma usethile. Thread Ucingo lwangaphandle: ububanzi obukhulu, i-pitch, ubude, inani lamapasi. Ukujula 0 kusho 0.6134 × pitch (ucingo lwe-60°). Ipasi ngalinye lithatha indawo efanayo yetshipisi; amapasi okuhlela aphinda elokugcina. Drill Ibhobo emgqeni wesikhungo kuze kube ngukujula, nama-peck. Indlela ithuluzi elivikelwe ngayo engxenyeni I-insert ithathwa njengoba iyikho: isifunda sayo sephoyinti, nangemuva kwayo umphetho ohamba emuva, umugqa oqondile onensimbi engu-180° ngaphansi kwe-engeli yomphetho wokusika ne-engeli ye-insert. Lesi simo sehliswa kumkhawulo ngasemaphoyinteni ngamaphoyinti ngamaphoyinti ngaphezu kwe-Z, nendlela yiyo ephumula kuyo. Ngakho: Umsakazo wephoyinti sesivele ungene endleleni. Ama-post kawabhali G41 noma G42; izixhumanisi yiphoyinti elihlelwe lethuluzi (ikhona yesikwele esizungeze uphoyinti). I-insert ayikwazi ukulandela udonga oluthambekele kakhulu kunomphetho wayo ohamba emuva. Umgodi ngemva kwesigodi awushiywa, nomsebenzi wokuqeda uyakutshela ukuthi ingakanani ingxenye ayiyo ukuthi ayifinyelele. Umsebenzi we-Groove uyayithatha. Isitoko silandelwa ngaphansi kwe-Z ngemva kokusika ngakunye, ngakho ukuhlanza akusikiyo umoya, i-grooving ithola okusele, nomsebenzi ngamunye ubonisa ivolumu eyisusiwe nokuthi uke wasika yini engxenyeni. Imikhawulo Ukuthenda ngaphandle kuphela: akukho ibha yokubhoboza, akukho imigodi yangaphakathi noma imithambo, akukho imigodi yobuso. I-spindle eyodwa, ingxenye ibanjwe ku-−Z. Akukho i-sub-spindle, akukho amathuluzi aphilayo, akukho ama-axis C noma Y, akukho ukunyakaza kwe-steady rest noma i-tailstock. Izindlela ziyizinyathelo eziqondile: amajika ayizimfushane ngaphakathi kokubekezelela (akukho G2/G3), nokuhlanza nokuthungela kubhalwa ipasi ngalinye (akukho imijikelezo ye-G71 noma G76). Ukuthungela kuyimipasi eqondile nokuhudula okuqondile ekugcineni; nikeza umthambo ukhululeko omuhle. Umthambo awubonakali esitokeni. Ukubhoboza kusentla akushintshi imodeli yesitoko. I-holder, i-turret kanye ne-chuck azihlolwa. Setha Stop at Z ukuze ugcine ithuluzi kude nama-jaw. Ukondla nesivinini kungamanani okuqala, njengakokugaya.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"engineer-generators","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izingxenye ezivela kwifiziksi: izikhiqizi","summary":"Indawo yokusebenzela ye-Injiniyela nesici se-Umzimba owenziwe: khetha isikhiqizi, usethe okufakwayo (ukugeleza, ingcindezi, izinga lokushisa, impahla, iprinta), bese uthola ingxenye esayizwe ngezibalo zencwadi, nezinhlolo zayo zokukhiqiza nemafayela wezinhlaziyo. Okufakwayo okufanayo kunikeza ingxenye efanayo.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["injiniyela","isikhiqizi","umzimba owenziwe","ifiziksi","imithetho","isiphakeli sokushisa","manifold","inozulu","lattice","gyroid","ishidi ledatha","okufakwayo","okufanayo","izinhlolo","ukuphrinta nge-3D","umbhede womsizi"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-umzimba","text":"Yenza umzimba","level":2},{"id":"shintsha","text":"Shintsha","level":2},{"id":"ishidi-ledatha","text":"Ishidi ledatha","level":2},{"id":"izinhlolo","text":"Izinhlolo","level":2},{"id":"okuhilelwe","text":"Okuhilelwe","level":2},{"id":"izilawuli-zokuthumela-phandle","text":"Izilawuli zokuthumela phandle","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhiqizi\u003C/strong\u003E yisikripthi esilinganisa ingxenye ngezidingo zakho bese siyakha. Isikhiqizi somshintshi wokushisa sithatha ukushisa okudingeka ukuthi kudluliswe, izigeleza ezimbili nezinga lokushisa zazo, ingcindezi kanye nempahla; sibala ukuthi isigaxa kufanele sibe kanjani nokuthi udonga lwaso lukhulu kangakanani, siyakha, futhi sikutshela izinombolo asizisebenzisile nokuthi ngayinye yavela kuphi. Shintsha okufakwayo, ingxenye iyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphumela uyinhlaka ejwayelekile engxenyeni: ukhona ohlwini lwezici, uyaphrintwa, uyathunyelwa. Isikhiqizi ngokwaso sigcinwa engxenyeni, ngakho ifayela livulwa kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha ngaphandle kokuthi isikhiqizi sifakiwe, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuvula ingxenye akuwubizi ukuthi kusebenze isikripthi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-umzimba\"\u003EYenza umzimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha indawo yokusebenzela ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInjiniyela\u003C/span\u003E kushintshi wendawo yokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isikhiqizi ohlwini (esihamba ne-PartCraft, bese noma yiziphi ozivulile kufayela) bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikripthi siyasebenza. Lapho siqeda umzimba usebonakala embonweni, nephaneli ibonisa okufakwayo kwawo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eishidi ledatha\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enezinhlolo\u003C/strong\u003E zawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaphinda uwengeze kusuka ku-Idizayini: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmzimba owenziwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha noma yikuphi okufakwayo bese umzimba wenziwa futhi emizuzwini nje emva kokuthi uyeke ukubhala. Iphaneli ithi yiliphi kwamathathu aliqiniso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsuqediwe\u003C/strong\u003E: umzimba uhambisana nesikripthi nokufakwayo kwaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkufakwayo kushintshile\u003C/strong\u003E: umzimba engxenyeni ushintsho lwangaphambili; uyakhiwa futhi, noma cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukaqalwa\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqalisa kwehlulekile\u003C/strong\u003E: kubonisa iphutha lesikripthi nomugqa waso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyeka ukuqalisa okuthatha isikhathi eside. Undo ibuyela emuva ngesinyathelo ngasinye: ukuqalisa kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, nokufakwayo kuyisinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ishidi-ledatha\"\u003EIshidi ledatha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke inani isikhiqizi silisebenzile lidwetshwe nayo \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyunithi\u003C/strong\u003E yalo kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enokuthi livela kuphi\u003C/strong\u003E (incwadi yezibalo, umgomo, ishidi ledatha). Akukho okufihliwe. Ishidi liyingxenye yefayela, ngakho liyafana kwikhompyutha elandelayo. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/data-out\" data-topic=\"partcraft/data-out\"\u003EData out\u003C/a\u003E ichaza ukuthi lilondolozwa kanjani njenge-JSON noma PDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlolo\"\u003EIzinhlolo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikhiqizi singahlola ingxenye yaso ngokumelene nenqubo yokuphrinta: izindonga nezikhala ezincane kunomkhawulo wenqubo, izingcezu ezikhululekile, izikhala ezigcina impuphu noma i-resin, imigodi emincane kakhulu ukuthi ingadlulwa, nezindawo eziphakanyekayo ezidinga ukusekelwa. Okutholiwe kusephaneli nasohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E (inkinobho ene-⚠), futhi kugcinwa ngengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzibalo zenqubo ziyizinombolo ezizungezile ezinikezwa izincwadi zokuklama ezijwayelekile ngenqubo jikelele (FDM, SLA, SLS, umbhede womsizi wensimbi). \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuyona inkomba yomshini wakho\u003C/strong\u003E: zishintshe ngezibalo zesitolo sakho ngaphambi kokuthembela ekuhloleni. Ukuhlola kusebenza ngegridi ye-voxel, ngakho kunembile cishe ku-voxel elilodwa: udonga lubikwa kuphela uma lulincane kunomkhawulo ngaphezu kwe-voxel elilodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhilelwe\"\u003EOkuhilelwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsikhiqizi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhiqizayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGyroid block\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhlokhi egcwele i-gyroid, i-Schwarz P noma ishidi le-diamond: i-lattice elula kunazo zonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGyroid heat exchanger\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigaxa somshintshi wokushisa wamanzi amabili, silinganiswe ngesidingo sokushisa ngendlela ye-effectiveness-NTU, udonga lwaso ngengcindezi; ingahlola ukwehla kwengcindezi ngocwaningo lokugeleza kwe-cell eyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDistribution manifold\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhedha namagatsha, ipayipi ngalinye lilinganiswe ngokugeleza olusithwalayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGraded lattice beam\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-lattice enodonga oluthinta lapho ukuhlaziywa kwetopology kukhombisa ukuthi impahla iyadingeka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke lokhu kuyizilinganiso zokuqala ezisekelwe ezibalweni zencwadi. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineering-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineering-library\"\u003EIlabhulari yezobunjiniyela\u003C/a\u003E ichaza izibalo nemikhawulo yazo. Qalisa Simulation, Thermal noma Flow kumphumela ngaphambi kokuthembela kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilawuli-zokuthumela-phandle\"\u003EIzilawuli zokuthumela phandle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhiqizi ze-Injiniyela nezishidi zedatha zinesaziso sezilawuli zokuthumela phandle nezijeziso. Lifunde ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-export-notice\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-export-notice\"\u003EIzilawuli zokuthumela phandle ze-Injiniyela\u003C/a\u003E; nalo lisezansi kwawo wonke amashidi edatha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihlahla, izixhumanisi nezifakeli ku-core yomshintshi wokushisa: ngumgogodla kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmajika ezinga lokushisa lokuqina kwezimpahla: izimpahla zisezingeni lokushisa legumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulahleka kwe-tee nokwabelana kokugeleza phakathi kwamaphothi kumanifold.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungeza izikhiqizi kusuka kuhlu lwezengezo ngokuchofoza kanye; ukuvula ifayela kwengeza eyodwa kulesi siphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhiqizi zezinye izinhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isikhiqizi yisikripthi esilinganisa ingxenye ngezidingo zakho bese siyakha. Isikhiqizi somshintshi wokushisa sithatha ukushisa okudingeka ukuthi kudluliswe, izigeleza ezimbili nezinga lokushisa zazo, ingcindezi kanye nempahla; sibala ukuthi isigaxa kufanele sibe kanjani nokuthi udonga lwaso lukhulu kangakanani, siyakha, futhi sikutshela izinombolo asizisebenzisile nokuthi ngayinye yavela kuphi. Shintsha okufakwayo, ingxenye iyalandela. Umphumela uyinhlaka ejwayelekile engxenyeni: ukhona ohlwini lwezici, uyaphrintwa, uyathunyelwa. Isikhiqizi ngokwaso sigcinwa engxenyeni, ngakho ifayela livulwa kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha ngaphandle kokuthi isikhiqizi sifakiwe, futhi ukuvula ingxenye akuwubizi ukuthi kusebenze isikripthi. Yenza umzimba Khetha indawo yokusebenzela ye-Injiniyela kushintshi wendawo yokusebenza. Khetha isikhiqizi ohlwini (esihamba ne-PartCraft, bese noma yiziphi ozivulile kufayela) bese uchofoza Okusha. Isikripthi siyasebenza. Lapho siqeda umzimba usebonakala embonweni, nephaneli ibonisa okufakwayo kwawo, ishidi ledatha kanye nezinhlolo zawo. Ungaphinda uwengeze kusuka ku-Idizayini: Izici › Okwengeziwe › Umzimba owenziwe. Shintsha Shintsha noma yikuphi okufakwayo bese umzimba wenziwa futhi emizuzwini nje emva kokuthi uyeke ukubhala. Iphaneli ithi yiliphi kwamathathu aliqiniso: Usuqediwe: umzimba uhambisana nesikripthi nokufakwayo kwaso. Okufakwayo kushintshile: umzimba engxenyeni ushintsho lwangaphambili; uyakhiwa futhi, noma cindezela Qalisa. Akukaqalwa noma Ukuqalisa kwehlulekile: kubonisa iphutha lesikripthi nomugqa waso. Misa iyeka ukuqalisa okuthatha isikhathi eside. Undo ibuyela emuva ngesinyathelo ngasinye: ukuqalisa kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, nokufakwayo kuyisinyathelo esisodwa. Ishidi ledatha Yonke inani isikhiqizi silisebenzile lidwetshwe nayo iyunithi yalo kanye nokuthi livela kuphi (incwadi yezibalo, umgomo, ishidi ledatha). Akukho okufihliwe. Ishidi liyingxenye yefayela, ngakho liyafana kwikhompyutha elandelayo. Data out ichaza ukuthi lilondolozwa kanjani njenge-JSON noma PDF. Izinhlolo Isikhiqizi singahlola ingxenye yaso ngokumelene nenqubo yokuphrinta: izindonga nezikhala ezincane kunomkhawulo wenqubo, izingcezu ezikhululekile, izikhala ezigcina impuphu noma i-resin, imigodi emincane kakhulu ukuthi ingadlulwa, nezindawo eziphakanyekayo ezidinga ukusekelwa. Okutholiwe kusephaneli nasohlwini lwe-Izinkinga (inkinobho ene-⚠), futhi kugcinwa ngengxenye. Izibalo zenqubo ziyizinombolo ezizungezile ezinikezwa izincwadi zokuklama ezijwayelekile ngenqubo jikelele (FDM, SLA, SLS, umbhede womsizi wensimbi). Akuyona inkomba yomshini wakho: zishintshe ngezibalo zesitolo sakho ngaphambi kokuthembela ekuhloleni. Ukuhlola kusebenza ngegridi ye-voxel, ngakho kunembile cishe ku-voxel elilodwa: udonga lubikwa kuphela uma lulincane kunomkhawulo ngaphezu kwe-voxel elilodwa. Okuhilelwe Isikhiqizi Esikhiqizayo Gyroid block Ibhlokhi egcwele i-gyroid, i-Schwarz P noma ishidi le-diamond: i-lattice elula kunazo zonke Gyroid heat exchanger Isigaxa somshintshi wokushisa wamanzi amabili, silinganiswe ngesidingo sokushisa ngendlela ye-effectiveness-NTU, udonga lwaso ngengcindezi; ingahlola ukwehla kwengcindezi ngocwaningo lokugeleza kwe-cell eyodwa Distribution manifold Ihedha namagatsha, ipayipi ngalinye lilinganiswe ngokugeleza olusithwalayo Graded lattice beam I-lattice enodonga oluthinta lapho ukuhlaziywa kwetopology kukhombisa ukuthi impahla iyadingeka Konke lokhu kuyizilinganiso zokuqala ezisekelwe ezibalweni zencwadi. Ilabhulari yezobunjiniyela ichaza izibalo nemikhawulo yazo. Qalisa Simulation, Thermal noma Flow kumphumela ngaphambi kokuthembela kuwo. Izilawuli zokuthumela phandle Izikhiqizi ze-Injiniyela nezishidi zedatha zinesaziso sezilawuli zokuthumela phandle nezijeziso. Lifunde ku-Izilawuli zokuthumela phandle ze-Injiniyela; nalo lisezansi kwawo wonke amashidi edatha. Akukakwakhiwa Izihlahla, izixhumanisi nezifakeli ku-core yomshintshi wokushisa: ngumgogodla kuphela. Amajika ezinga lokushisa lokuqina kwezimpahla: izimpahla zisezingeni lokushisa legumbi. Ukulahleka kwe-tee nokwabelana kokugeleza phakathi kwamaphothi kumanifold. Ukungeza izikhiqizi kusuka kuhlu lwezengezo ngokuchofoza kanye; ukuvula ifayela kwengeza eyodwa kulesi siphequluli. Izikhiqizi zezinye izinhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"save-reopen","scope":"partcraft","title":"Londoloza, vula kabusha futhi uqhubeke nokusebenza","summary":"Londoloza izingxenye nezinhlanganisela ekhompyutheni yakho, uzinike amagama, uzivule kabusha ngenkinobho, ukhiye noma ngokudonsa, ugcine izinguqulo, futhi ugweme ukulahlekelwa umsebenzi ethebhini yesiphequluli.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["londoloza","vula","vula kabusha","layisha","landa","izinguqulo","ukusekela","qamba kabusha","igama lefayela","ukulahlekelwa komsebenzi","shiya indawo","partcraft.json","partcraft-asm.json","ingxenye entsha"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-ingxenye","text":"Londoloza ingxenye","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-inhlanganisela","text":"Londoloza inhlanganisela","level":2},{"id":"vula-kabusha","text":"Vula kabusha","level":2},{"id":"qala-kabusha","text":"Qala kabusha","level":2},{"id":"gcina-izinguqulo","text":"Gcina izinguqulo","level":2},{"id":"ungalahlekelwa-umsebenzi","text":"Ungalahlekelwa umsebenzi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ayigcini lutho phakathi kwezindwendwe. Ingxenye yakho ihlala ethebhini yesiphequluli kuze kube yilapho uyilondoloza njengefayela, futhi ibuyela uma uvula leyo fayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-ingxenye\"\u003ELondoloza ingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaka igama lengxenye: chofoza indawo engenalutho ekubukeni ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese uthayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E esigabeni sakwesokudla bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Isihloko somlando siyashintsha sifane nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiphequluli silanda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Ilondoloziwe Bracket.partcraft.json (umlando ogcwele; yivule lapha ukuze uqhubeke nokuhlela).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kuvulekile isikethi, ukulondoloza kuyasivala kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELeli fayela libamba zonke izikethi, ukuxhumana, izilinganiso kanye nezici, pho nezici ezivinjiwe, isikhundla se-rollback, izilungiselelo zeshidi lomdwebo nezinothi ze-GD&amp;T, nombhalo ogcwele wanoma yisiphi isiqinile se-STEP esingenisiwe. Uhlu lwakho lokuhlehlisa aluglongwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-inhlanganisela\"\u003ELondoloza inhlanganisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwinhlanganisela, ukuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ulanda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;assembly name&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E. Yonke ingxenye igcinwe ngaphakathi kwayo: awudingi amafayela engxenye ahlukile ukuze uyivule kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho uhlela ingxenye ngaphakathi kwenhlanganisela, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilondoloza leyo ngxenye yodwa njenge \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E kuqala, bese ulondoloza, ukuze ulondoloze inhlanganisela yonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-kabusha\"\u003EVula kabusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma yisiphi kwalezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese ukhetha ifayela;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edonsa ifayela kusuka \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi sakho samafayela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E liye ekubukeni kwe-3D (&quot;Shiya ingxenye ye-PartCraft ukuze uyivule&quot; iyavela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ihlukanisa izingxenye ezinhlanganisela ngokuthi kukhona yini ngaphakathi, ngakho zombili ziyavuleka ngendlela efanayo. Ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E noma le-\u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E livula njengesolidi esingeniswe: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo\u003C/a\u003E. Ibha yesimo iyaqinisekisa: &quot;Ivuliwe Bracket.partcraft.json: izici ezi-7.&quot; noma &quot;Ivuliwe Hinge.partcraft-asm.json: izingxenye ezi-3, izixhumanisi ezi-2.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ingxenye esesikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-PartCraft iyababuza kuqala: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard changes\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave first\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVala inhlanganisela (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E) ngaphambi kokuvula ifayela lengxenye. Uma uvula ingxenye kuyilapho inhlanganisela isesikrinini, ingxenye ilayisha ngemuva kwenhlanganisela futhi uyibona kuphela ngemva kokuvala inhlanganisela. Ukuvula ifayela lenhlanganisela futhi kuyashintsha inhlanganisela engalondoloziwe ngaphandle kokubuza, ngakho yilondoloze kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-kabusha\"\u003EQala kabusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E iqala &quot;Part1&quot; engenalutho. Iyabuza kuqala uma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, futhi ivala inhlanganisela evulekile (ibuze uma ingalondoloziwe).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-izinguqulo\"\u003EGcina izinguqulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngamunye kulanda kabusha, ngakho ungagcina izinguqulo ngokugcina amafayela kuphela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaka inguqulo noma usuku egameni ngaphambi kokulondoloza: &quot;Bracket rev B&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsiphequluli sakho singangeza &quot; (1)&quot;, &quot; (2)&quot; uma ifayela elinegama elifanayo sele likhona kufolda yokulanda. Okusha kakhulu yileyo enenombolo ephezulu kakhulu, noma hlola usuku kusuka \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi sakho samafayela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa amafayela aqediwe asuke kufolda yokulanda aye efolda yephrojekthi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho ayakhona\u003C/a\u003E ukuthola lapho okulandwa khona ngesistimu ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ungalahlekelwa-umsebenzi\"\u003EUngalahlekelwa umsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELondoloza ngaphambi kokuvala ithebhu, ukulayisha kabusha, noma ukuvumela ikhompyutha ilale isikhathi eside. Isiphequluli sibuza &quot;Shiya indawo?&quot; uma uzama ukuvala unezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, kodwa ukuphahla noma i-laptop evaliwe akunikezi isixwayiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi wangasese noma incognito ayasebenza, kodwa akukho okunye okuhlukile: ifayela libe yikopi eyodwa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza kwe-cloud nomlando wezinguqulo akukatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ayigcini lutho phakathi kwezindwendwe. Ingxenye yakho ihlala ethebhini yesiphequluli kuze kube yilapho uyilondoloza njengefayela, futhi ibuyela uma uvula leyo fayela. Londoloza ingxenye Naka igama lengxenye: chofoza indawo engenalutho ekubukeni ukuze kungakhethwa lutho, bese uthayipha Igama esigabeni sakwesokudla bese ucindezela Enter. Isihloko somlando siyashintsha sifane nalo. Cindezela Ctrl+S noma khetha Save. Isiphequluli silanda \u003Cname\u003E.partcraft.json. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ilondoloziwe Bracket.partcraft.json (umlando ogcwele; yivule lapha ukuze uqhubeke nokuhlela).\" Uma kuvulekile isikethi, ukulondoloza kuyasivala kuqala. Leli fayela libamba zonke izikethi, ukuxhumana, izilinganiso kanye nezici, pho nezici ezivinjiwe, isikhundla se-rollback, izilungiselelo zeshidi lomdwebo nezinothi ze-GD&T, nombhalo ogcwele wanoma yisiphi isiqinile se-STEP esingenisiwe. Uhlu lwakho lokuhlehlisa aluglongwa. Londoloza inhlanganisela Kwinhlanganisela, ukuthi Save noma Ctrl+S ulanda \u003Cassembly name\u003E.partcraft-asm.json. Yonke ingxenye igcinwe ngaphakathi kwayo: awudingi amafayela engxenye ahlukile ukuze uyivule kabusha. Lapho uhlela ingxenye ngaphakathi kwenhlanganisela, Ctrl+S ilondoloza leyo ngxenye yodwa njenge .partcraft.json. Khetha Back kuqala, bese ulondoloza, ukuze ulondoloze inhlanganisela yonke. Vula kabusha Noma yisiphi kwalezi: khetha Open noma cindezela Ctrl+O, bese ukhetha ifayela; donsa ifayela kusuka Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi sakho samafayela liye ekubukeni kwe-3D (\"Shiya ingxenye ye-PartCraft ukuze uyivule\" iyavela). I-PartCraft ihlukanisa izingxenye ezinhlanganisela ngokuthi kukhona yini ngaphakathi, ngakho zombili ziyavuleka ngendlela efanayo. Ifayela le-.step noma le-.stp livula njengesolidi esingeniswe: bheka Vula ifayela le-STEP bese wakha kulo. Ibha yesimo iyaqinisekisa: \"Ivuliwe Bracket.partcraft.json: izici ezi-7.\" noma \"Ivuliwe Hinge.partcraft-asm.json: izingxenye ezi-3, izixhumanisi ezi-2.\" Uma ingxenye esesikrinini inezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-PartCraft iyababuza kuqala: Cancel, Discard changes noma Save first. Vala inhlanganisela (Close) ngaphambi kokuvula ifayela lengxenye. Uma uvula ingxenye kuyilapho inhlanganisela isesikrinini, ingxenye ilayisha ngemuva kwenhlanganisela futhi uyibona kuphela ngemva kokuvala inhlanganisela. Ukuvula ifayela lenhlanganisela futhi kuyashintsha inhlanganisela engalondoloziwe ngaphandle kokubuza, ngakho yilondoloze kuqala. Qala kabusha New iqala \"Part1\" engenalutho. Iyabuza kuqala uma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, futhi ivala inhlanganisela evulekile (ibuze uma ingalondoloziwe). Gcina izinguqulo Ukulondoloza ngamunye kulanda kabusha, ngakho ungagcina izinguqulo ngokugcina amafayela kuphela: Faka inguqulo noma usuku egameni ngaphambi kokulondoloza: \"Bracket rev B\". Isiphequluli sakho singangeza \" (1)\", \" (2)\" uma ifayela elinegama elifanayo sele likhona kufolda yokulanda. Okusha kakhulu yileyo enenombolo ephezulu kakhulu, noma hlola usuku kusuka Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi sakho samafayela. Hambisa amafayela aqediwe asuke kufolda yokulanda aye efolda yephrojekthi yakho. Bheka Lapho amafayela akho ayakhona ukuthola lapho okulandwa khona ngesistimu ngayinye. Ungalahlekelwa umsebenzi Londoloza ngaphambi kokuvala ithebhu, ukulayisha kabusha, noma ukuvumela ikhompyutha ilale isikhathi eside. Isiphequluli sibuza \"Shiya indawo?\" uma uzama ukuvala unezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, kodwa ukuphahla noma i-laptop evaliwe akunikezi isixwayiso. Amawindi wangasese noma incognito ayasebenza, kodwa akukho okunye okuhlukile: ifayela libe yikopi eyodwa kuphela. Ukulondoloza kwe-cloud nomlando wezinguqulo akukatholakali okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"probing","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuhlola: thola ingxenye usethe ukushintshwa komsebenzi","summary":"Thinta ubuso obuphezulu, uhlangothi, imbobo noma i-boss ngeprobhu bese uvumela umlawuli ukuthi ahambise ukushintshwa komsebenzi kulapho ingxenye ikhona ngempela, noma alinganise kuphela. Yini umlawuli ngamunye angayenza, nokuthi yini engafakazelwe.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["iprobhu","ukuhlola","iprobhu lokuthinta","ukuthinta","ukushintshwa komsebenzi","g54","g31","g38.2","skip","datum","thola isikhungo","imbobo","boss","umphetho","setha ize","linganisa","ukuhlola","g10"],"headings":[{"id":"sebenzisa","text":"Sebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"umlawuli-ngamunye-ukubhala","text":"Umlawuli ngamunye ukubhala","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProbe\u003C/span\u003E ku-Manufacture ibhala umjikelezo wokuhlola kuhlelo: iprobhu ithinta ingxenye, futhi umlawuli uhambisa ukushintshwa komsebenzi (G54) ngomehluko phakathi kwalapho ubuso bathololwa khona nalapho imodeli ithi bukhona khona. Imisebenzi elandelayo ibe isika lapho ingxenye ikhona ngempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinyathelo ngaphambi kokuthinta ziyizinyathelo ezijwayelekile: iprobhu ayibhekwa kuze kube yinyathelo lokuhlola ngokwalo. Yenza kancane, emoyeni kuqala, nesandla sakho ku-feed hold.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEthebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003ETools\u003C/strong\u003E umsebenzi wokuqala wokuhlola wengeza \u003Cstrong\u003Eiprobhu lokuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi bebhola layo nokondla kokuhlola (100 mm/min uma ungasethi enye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProbe\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza lokho okufanele kuthintwe. Ukukhetha ngakunye kuyinzuzo eyodwa, ngokulandelana ochofoza ngakho:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmjikelezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso obusicaba obubheka i-eksisi yethuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthinta kunye kuhle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso obusicaba bohlangothi obuma ngokuqondile ku-X noma ku-Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthinta kunye kuya ebusweni, kancane ngaphansi kophezulu bawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX noma Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImbobo noma i-boss ecaleni le-eksisi yethuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthinta okune (+X, −X, +Y, −Y)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX no-Y yesikhungo sawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgomphumela\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the work offset\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure only\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQala lokhu kude\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003ESesha lokhu kude ngemva\u003C/strong\u003E yizinkomba zokuthi ukunyakaza kokuhlola kuqala kude kangakanani nobuso obulindelekile, nokuthi iprobhu ingahamba kude kangakanani ngaphezu kwalo ngaphambi kokuthi umlawuli ayeke. \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula\u003C/strong\u003E kungukuthi ibhola lehla kangakanani ngaphansi kophezulu bembobo, i-boss noma ubuso bohlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka umsebenzi weprobhu kuqala, ngaphambi kokuthi kukhona okusikwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umlawuli-ngamunye-ukubhala\"\u003EUmlawuli ngamunye ukubhala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlawuli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuthinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFanuc-style\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG31\u003C/code\u003E, indawo egcinwe ku-\u003Ccode\u003E#101\u003C/code\u003E kuya ku-\u003Ccode\u003E#104\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuguquguqukayo kokushintsha (\u003Ccode\u003E#5221\u003C/code\u003E kuya ku-\u003Ccode\u003E#5223\u003C/code\u003E) kuyanyakaziswa ngokuthola − okulindelekile. Measure only: umehluko ushiywa ku-\u003Ccode\u003E#110\u003C/code\u003E (no-\u003Ccode\u003E#111\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinuxCNC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG38.2\u003C/code\u003E, indawo egcinwe emapharamitheni amagama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG10 L2 P1\u003C/code\u003E ngokushintshwa okusha. Measure only: umlayezo we-\u003Ccode\u003E(DEBUG, …)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGRBL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG38.2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthinta kunye kusetha i-eksisi nge-\u003Ccode\u003EG10 L20 P1\u003C/code\u003E. I-GRBL ayinakho okuguquguqukayo, ngakho \u003Cstrong\u003Eayikwazi ukubala isikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E: ifayela lisho lokho ku-comment futhi ayisethi lutho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubalwa kwenziwa yi-post, ngakho ungakushintsha: izehlakalo yi-\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-move\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-set\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EAma-post processor ongawahlela\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintshwa komsebenzi kunye (G54). Ubuso obuma ngokuqondile kuma-eksisi kuphela: akukho i-engeli, akukho umjikelezo wamakhona, akukho ukujikeleza komsebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho setha lethuluzi, akukho ukuhlola ithuluzi elephukile, akukho ukulinganisa usayizi nokubekezelela, akukho umbiko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-spindle ayiqalisi ngenxa yeprobhu futhi i-coolant ihlala ivaliwe; akukho okuhlola ukuthi ithuluzi kwi-spindle liyiprobhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimulator sesitoko asisebenzisi indlela yokuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulinganiswa komzimba weprobhu (ukuphambuka kwebhola, ukugoba kwesihloko, iqondiso lokuthinta) kungokomlawuli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Probe ku-Manufacture ibhala umjikelezo wokuhlola kuhlelo: iprobhu ithinta ingxenye, futhi umlawuli uhambisa ukushintshwa komsebenzi (G54) ngomehluko phakathi kwalapho ubuso bathololwa khona nalapho imodeli ithi bukhona khona. Imisebenzi elandelayo ibe isika lapho ingxenye ikhona ngempela. Akukho lutho lapha olusebenziswe emshinini. Izinyathelo ngaphambi kokuthinta ziyizinyathelo ezijwayelekile: iprobhu ayibhekwa kuze kube yinyathelo lokuhlola ngokwalo. Yenza kancane, emoyeni kuqala, nesandla sakho ku-feed hold. Sebenzisa Ethebhini le-Tools umsebenzi wokuqala wokuhlola wengeza iprobhu lokuthinta: ububanzi bebhola layo nokondla kokuhlola (100 mm/min uma ungasethi enye). Cindezela More ku-toolbar ye-Manufacture, bese Probe, bese uchofoza lokho okufanele kuthintwe. Ukukhetha ngakunye kuyinzuzo eyodwa, ngokulandelana ochofoza ngakho: Ukukhetha Umjikelezo Okusethwayo Ubuso obusicaba obubheka i-eksisi yethuluzi Ukuthinta kunye kuhle Z Ubuso obusicaba bohlangothi obuma ngokuqondile ku-X noma ku-Y Ukuthinta kunye kuya ebusweni, kancane ngaphansi kophezulu bawo X noma Y Imbobo noma i-boss ecaleni le-eksisi yethuluzi Ukuthinta okune (+X, −X, +Y, −Y) X no-Y yesikhungo sawo Ngomphumela: Set the work offset noma Measure only. Qala lokhu kude no-Sesha lokhu kude ngemva yizinkomba zokuthi ukunyakaza kokuhlola kuqala kude kangakanani nobuso obulindelekile, nokuthi iprobhu ingahamba kude kangakanani ngaphezu kwalo ngaphambi kokuthi umlawuli ayeke. Ukujula kungukuthi ibhola lehla kangakanani ngaphansi kophezulu bembobo, i-boss noma ubuso bohlangothi. Beka umsebenzi weprobhu kuqala, ngaphambi kokuthi kukhona okusikwayo. Umlawuli ngamunye ukubhala Umlawuli Ukuthinta Umphumela Fanuc-style G31, indawo egcinwe ku-#101 kuya ku-#104 Okuguquguqukayo kokushintsha (#5221 kuya ku-#5223) kuyanyakaziswa ngokuthola − okulindelekile. Measure only: umehluko ushiywa ku-#110 (no-#111). LinuxCNC G38.2, indawo egcinwe emapharamitheni amagama G10 L2 P1 ngokushintshwa okusha. Measure only: umlayezo we-(DEBUG, …). GRBL G38.2 Ukuthinta kunye kusetha i-eksisi nge-G10 L20 P1. I-GRBL ayinakho okuguquguqukayo, ngakho ayikwazi ukubala isikhungo: ifayela lisho lokho ku-comment futhi ayisethi lutho. Ukubalwa kwenziwa yi-post, ngakho ungakushintsha: izehlakalo yi-probe-move ne-probe-set (Ama-post processor ongawahlela). Imikhawulo Ukushintshwa komsebenzi kunye (G54). Ubuso obuma ngokuqondile kuma-eksisi kuphela: akukho i-engeli, akukho umjikelezo wamakhona, akukho ukujikeleza komsebenzi. Akukho setha lethuluzi, akukho ukuhlola ithuluzi elephukile, akukho ukulinganisa usayizi nokubekezelela, akukho umbiko. I-spindle ayiqalisi ngenxa yeprobhu futhi i-coolant ihlala ivaliwe; akukho okuhlola ukuthi ithuluzi kwi-spindle liyiprobhu. Isimulator sesitoko asisebenzisi indlela yokuhlola. Ukulinganiswa komzimba weprobhu (ukuphambuka kwebhola, ukugoba kwesihloko, iqondiso lokuthinta) kungokomlawuli.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"write-a-generator","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bhala ijenretha","summary":"Ijenretha iyisikripthi se-CraftScript, Lua noma Python esinemigqa yokuphawula echaza okokufaka kwayo. Indlela okokufaka okuba ngayo ifomu, okufanele isikripthi sisishiye (umzimba, ishidi, izinkinga), isibonelo esincane esiphelele, nendlela yokuvula isikripthi sakho njengejenretha.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["ijenretha","bhala","isikripthi","ikhanda","igalelo","@input","@generator","umzimba","ishidi","izinkinga","to_body","mfg_check","ishidi ledatha","isibonelo","ilethisi","inkambu"],"headings":[{"id":"ikhanda","text":"Ikhanda","level":2},{"id":"okushiywa-yisikripthi","text":"Okushiywa yisikripthi","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-esincane-esiphelele","text":"Isibonelo esincane esiphelele","level":2},{"id":"izinkambu","text":"Izinkambu","level":2},{"id":"vula-isikripthi-sakho-njengejenretha","text":"Vula isikripthi sakho njengejenretha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIjenretha iyisikripthi esivamile (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003ECraftScript\u003C/a\u003E, Lua noma Python) esinemigqa embalwa yokuphawula phezulu. PartCraft ifunda imigqa yokuphawula yenze ifomu; isikripthi sakho sifunda okokufaka njengezinguquki ezisethiwe ngaphambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhanda\"\u003EIkhanda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaka lokhu emigqeni yokuphawula (\u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E ku-CraftScript, \u003Ccode\u003E--\u003C/code\u003E ku-Lua, \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E ku-Python):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E% @generator Umshini wokushintshana kokushisa\n% @input mdot: kg/s = 0.2 [0.01 .. 10] &quot;Ukugeleza kwesisindo&quot;\n% @input kind: = gyroid {gyroid, schwarzp, diamond} &quot;Ubuso&quot;\n% @input solid: = true\n% @input note: = &quot;text&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgalelo liba yi \u003Ccode\u003Ename: unit = default\u003C/code\u003E, bese kungenzeka libe uhla \u003Ccode\u003E[min .. max]\u003C/code\u003E (izinombolo zigcinwa phakathi kwalo), uhlu lwezinketho \u003Ccode\u003E{a, b, c}\u003C/code\u003E negama elibhalwe phakathi kwamagatsha. Iyunithi iyilebula nje yefomu: \u003Cstrong\u003Einani lifika kuleyo yunithi\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho isikripthi esifuna i-SI siyiguqule, futhi \u003Ccode\u003Eto_si(value, &#039;kg/s&#039;, &#039;kg/s&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E ihlola nokuthi iyunithi isho lokho ocabanga ukuthi isho. Igama liba izinhlamvu, izinombolo kanye no-underscore; \u003Ccode\u003Ebody\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheet\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E sele zisetshenziswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okushiywa-yisikripthi\"\u003EOkushiywa yisikripthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInguquki\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebody\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuyadingeka.\u003C/strong\u003E Imeshi yobuso, ngokuvamile evela ku-\u003Ccode\u003E[body, info] = to_body(field, h)\u003C/code\u003E. Ilungiswa iphinde ihlolwe lapho ukusebenza kuphela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkuphoqelekile. Isakhiwo: inkambu ngayinye ibe yinombolo noma umbhalo, noma isakhiwo esinezinkambu \u003Ccode\u003Evalue\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eref\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Enote\u003C/code\u003E. Siba yishidi ledatha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkuphoqelekile. Iseli \u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E elivela ku-\u003Ccode\u003Emfg_check(field, &#039;sls&#039;, struct(), h)\u003C/code\u003E, noma izingenisо zakho. Ziya ezihlolweni nohlwini lwezinkinga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonelo-esincane-esiphelele\"\u003EIsibonelo esincane esiphelele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E% Ikhyubhu elingenalutho elinodonga.\n% @generator Ikhyubhu elingenalutho\n% @input side: mm = 12 [4 .. 40] &quot;Uhlangothi&quot;\n% @input wall: mm = 1.5 [0.5 .. 5] &quot;Udonga&quot;\n% @input h: mm = 0.5 [0.25 .. 2] &quot;Usayizi we-voxel&quot;\nf = field_subtract(field_box([0 0 0], [side/2 side/2 side/2]), ...\n                   field_box([0 0 0], [side/2-wall side/2-wall side/2-wall]));\nfb = field_bake(f, h);\n[body, info] = to_body(fb, h);\nchk = mfg_check(fb, &#039;sls&#039;, struct(), h);\nproblems = chk.problems;\nsheet = struct();\nsheet.volume = struct(&#039;value&#039;, info.volume, &#039;unit&#039;, &#039;mm3&#039;, &#039;ref&#039;, &#039;of the mesh&#039;);\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kwenza ibhokisi evaliwe, futhi ukuhlola kubika ukuvalwa kwangaphakathi kwalo njengephutha lenqubo yempushana. Yenza usayizi we-voxel \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E ube ngaphansi kwesithathu sodonga oluncane kakhulu ofuna: ngaphansi kwamavoxel amathathu cishe udonga aluthembeki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambu\"\u003EIzinkambu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efield_sphere\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_box\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_capsule\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_torus\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_revolve\u003C/code\u003E (isisekelo sokujikeleza esivela kuphrofayili), \u003Ccode\u003Etpms\u003C/code\u003E (izindawo ze-gyroid, Schwarz P kanye ne-diamond, nosayizi wesisele kanye nodonga okungashintsha kuso lonke isiqephu), \u003Ccode\u003Elattice\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003Elattice_beams\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ealong\u003C/code\u003E (umgudu ojikelezile ohamba endleleni), izinhlanganisela ze-boolean \u003Ccode\u003Efield_union\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_intersect\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_subtract\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_blend\u003C/code\u003E obushelelezile, kanye \u003Ccode\u003Efield_offset\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_shell\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_move\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_rotate\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_scale\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Esample(f, points)\u003C/code\u003E inikeza ibanga elisayinelwe emaphoyinti (elinegethivu ngaphakathi), \u003Ccode\u003Efield_voxel\u003C/code\u003E inikeza ama-voxel wabaxazi. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fields\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fields\"\u003EIzinkambu\u003C/a\u003Eichaza ukuthi yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImikhawulo okufanele uyazi: udonga olucekeceke oluthe xaxa kunengxenye yesine yeseli luvala imigudu; isici esincane kunama-voxel amathathu cishe singaxinezeleka; \u003Ccode\u003Ealong\u003C/code\u003E ihlanganisa amakhoni ajikelezile, ngakho ububanzi obushintsha ngokushesha buhlala busanda (sebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003Efield_revolve\u003C/code\u003E ephrofayileni).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-isikripthi-sakho-njengejenretha\"\u003EVula isikripthi sakho njengejenretha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikhaleni sokusebenza se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmqambi\u003C/span\u003E chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela. Isikripthi esingenalo umugqa we-\u003Ccode\u003E@generator\u003C/code\u003E noma we-\u003Ccode\u003E@input\u003C/code\u003E siyanqatshwa: bekungeke kube nento yokusetha. Ijenretha igcinwa kulesi siphequluli (kuze kube ngu-20) futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E iyisusa. Umzimba oqalwe kuyo uthwala ikhophi yesikripthi, ngakho ingxenye ayincikile kuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lingabamba nezijenretha eziningi: ihlanganisiwe ye-JSON \u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-generators&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 1, &quot;generators&quot;: [{&quot;title&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;…&quot;}]}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ijenretha iyisikripthi esivamile (CraftScript, Lua noma Python) esinemigqa embalwa yokuphawula phezulu. PartCraft ifunda imigqa yokuphawula yenze ifomu; isikripthi sakho sifunda okokufaka njengezinguquki ezisethiwe ngaphambili. Ikhanda Faka lokhu emigqeni yokuphawula (% ku-CraftScript, -- ku-Lua, # ku-Python): % @generator Umshini wokushintshana kokushisa % @input mdot: kg/s = 0.2 [0.01 .. 10] \"Ukugeleza kwesisindo\" % @input kind: = gyroid {gyroid, schwarzp, diamond} \"Ubuso\" % @input solid: = true % @input note: = \"text\" Igalelo liba yi name: unit = default, bese kungenzeka libe uhla [min .. max] (izinombolo zigcinwa phakathi kwalo), uhlu lwezinketho {a, b, c} negama elibhalwe phakathi kwamagatsha. Iyunithi iyilebula nje yefomu: inani lifika kuleyo yunithi, ngakho isikripthi esifuna i-SI siyiguqule, futhi to_si(value, 'kg/s', 'kg/s') ihlola nokuthi iyunithi isho lokho ocabanga ukuthi isho. Igama liba izinhlamvu, izinombolo kanye no-underscore; body, sheet kanye ne-problems sele zisetshenziswe. Okushiywa yisikripthi Inguquki Yini body Kuyadingeka. Imeshi yobuso, ngokuvamile evela ku-[body, info] = to_body(field, h). Ilungiswa iphinde ihlolwe lapho ukusebenza kuphela. sheet Akuphoqelekile. Isakhiwo: inkambu ngayinye ibe yinombolo noma umbhalo, noma isakhiwo esinezinkambu value, unit, ref kanye ne-note. Siba yishidi ledatha. problems Akuphoqelekile. Iseli problems elivela ku-mfg_check(field, 'sls', struct(), h), noma izingenisо zakho. Ziya ezihlolweni nohlwini lwezinkinga. Isibonelo esincane esiphelele % Ikhyubhu elingenalutho elinodonga. % @generator Ikhyubhu elingenalutho % @input side: mm = 12 [4 .. 40] \"Uhlangothi\" % @input wall: mm = 1.5 [0.5 .. 5] \"Udonga\" % @input h: mm = 0.5 [0.25 .. 2] \"Usayizi we-voxel\" f = field_subtract(field_box([0 0 0], [side/2 side/2 side/2]), ... field_box([0 0 0], [side/2-wall side/2-wall side/2-wall])); fb = field_bake(f, h); [body, info] = to_body(fb, h); chk = mfg_check(fb, 'sls', struct(), h); problems = chk.problems; sheet = struct(); sheet.volume = struct('value', info.volume, 'unit', 'mm3', 'ref', 'of the mesh'); Lokhu kwenza ibhokisi evaliwe, futhi ukuhlola kubika ukuvalwa kwangaphakathi kwalo njengephutha lenqubo yempushana. Yenza usayizi we-voxel h ube ngaphansi kwesithathu sodonga oluncane kakhulu ofuna: ngaphansi kwamavoxel amathathu cishe udonga aluthembeki. Izinkambu field_sphere, field_box, field_capsule, field_cylinder, field_torus, field_revolve (isisekelo sokujikeleza esivela kuphrofayili), tpms (izindawo ze-gyroid, Schwarz P kanye ne-diamond, nosayizi wesisele kanye nodonga okungashintsha kuso lonke isiqephu), lattice kanye lattice_beams, along (umgudu ojikelezile ohamba endleleni), izinhlanganisela ze-boolean field_union, field_intersect, field_subtract, field_blend obushelelezile, kanye field_offset, field_shell, field_move, field_rotate, field_scale. sample(f, points) inikeza ibanga elisayinelwe emaphoyinti (elinegethivu ngaphakathi), field_voxel inikeza ama-voxel wabaxazi. Izinkambuichaza ukuthi yini. Imikhawulo okufanele uyazi: udonga olucekeceke oluthe xaxa kunengxenye yesine yeseli luvala imigudu; isici esincane kunama-voxel amathathu cishe singaxinezeleka; along ihlanganisa amakhoni ajikelezile, ngakho ububanzi obushintsha ngokushesha buhlala busanda (sebenzisa field_revolve ephrofayileni). Vula isikripthi sakho njengejenretha Esikhaleni sokusebenza se-Umqambi chofoza Vula bese ukhetha ifayela. Isikripthi esingenalo umugqa we-@generator noma we-@input siyanqatshwa: bekungeke kube nento yokusetha. Ijenretha igcinwa kulesi siphequluli (kuze kube ngu-20) futhi Susa iyisusa. Umzimba oqalwe kuyo uthwala ikhophi yesikripthi, ngakho ingxenye ayincikile kuso. Ifayela lingabamba nezijenretha eziningi: ihlanganisiwe ye-JSON {\"format\": \"cadcraft-generators\", \"version\": 1, \"generators\": [{\"title\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\"}]}.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"engineering-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ilabhulari yezobunjiniyela","summary":"Izibalo zencwadi njengezikripthi ezifundekayo, ngamayunithi e-SI, nomthombo wawo wonke umphumela: ukugeleza kwepayipi nomsele, ukudluliswa kokushisa nezishintshi zokushisa, izingxenye zengcindezi, ukunyakaza kwegesi, izakhiwo zamanzi nomoya, izimpahla, namayunithi ahlolwayo. Yini eyisebenzisayo nokuthi ime kuphi.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["ilabhulari","ubunjiniyela","amayunithi","Darcy-Weisbach","Colebrook","Reynolds","isici sokuphikisa","Dittus-Boelter","Gnielinski","NTU","ukusebenza","LMTD","ifini","Barlow","Lamé","inozulu","isentropic","Mach","ukugeleza okuvinjiwe","amanzi","umoya","izakhiwo","impahla","imithombo"],"headings":[{"id":"amayunithi-ahlolwayo","text":"Amayunithi ahlolwayo","level":2},{"id":"izakhiwo","text":"Izakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"ukugeleza-emapayipini-nasemisele","text":"Ukugeleza emapayipini nasemisele","level":2},{"id":"ukudluliswa-kokushisa","text":"Ukudluliswa kokushisa","level":2},{"id":"izingxenye-zengcindezi","text":"Izingxenye zengcindezi","level":2},{"id":"ukunyakaza-kwegesi","text":"Ukunyakaza kwegesi","level":2},{"id":"hlola-umphumela","text":"Hlola umphumela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIlabhulari yezobunjiniyela iyisethi yezikripthi kuMtapo weSikripthi (\u003Ccode\u003Ecraftlib/eng\u003C/code\u003E). Ngayinye iyinkomba yokusebenza ongayifunda kusuka phezulu kuya ezansi, nekhanda elinika \u003Cstrong\u003Eindlela\u003C/strong\u003E yayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eamayunithi\u003C/strong\u003E ayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eimikhawulo\u003C/strong\u003E yayo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinkomba\u003C/strong\u003E zayo kanye nokuhlolwa \u003Cstrong\u003Echeck\u003C/strong\u003E nenombolo esebenziwe. Zisebenzisa amayunithi e-SI kuyo yonke, futhi zibuyisa amanani aqukethe \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyunithi\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Esource\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze ishidi ledatha likwazi ukuphrinta ukuthi yonke inombolo yavela kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi-ahlolwayo\"\u003EAmayunithi ahlolwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto_si(10, &#039;bar&#039;, &#039;Pa&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E iguqula inani futhi yenqaba iyunithi elinika okuhlukile (ubude lapho kulindeleke ingcindezi). \u003Ccode\u003Efrom_si\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit_convert(1, &#039;bar&#039;, &#039;psi&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Eunit_kind(&#039;W/(m K)&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E (&quot;thermal conductivity&quot;) zisebenza ngendlela efanayo. \u003Ccode\u003Etemp_k(25, &#039;C&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Etemp_from_k\u003C/code\u003E ziguqula izinga lokushisa, elinokuguqulwa kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izakhiwo\"\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efluid(&#039;water&#039;, T)\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Efluid(&#039;air&#039;, T, p)\u003C/code\u003E: ukuminyana, ukunamathela, ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile, nenombolo ye-Prandtl. Amanzi 0 kuya ku-100 °C, umoya 250 kuya ku-600 K; ngaphandle kwalokho iyayeka esikhundleni sokweqisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ematerial(&#039;ss304&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E: i-Young&#039;s modulus, i-Poisson&#039;s ratio, ukuminyana, ukuvuma, ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile, nokunwebeka: amanani ezinga lokushisa legumbi avela kumashidi edatha afanayo ne-Simulation. Umklamo wangempela usebenzisa izibalo ezisemthethweni zomhlinzeki. Amajika ezinga lokushisa awakakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugeleza-emapayipini-nasemisele\"\u003EUkugeleza emapayipini nasemisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ereynolds\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehydraulic_diameter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efriction_factor\u003C/code\u003E (ukugeleza okulinganayo, bese i-equation ye-Colebrook yokugeleza okunamabhubhane; uhla lwe-2300 kuya ku-4000 alunayo ifomula ethembekile futhi luyakutshela lokho), \u003Ccode\u003Edarcy_weisbach\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eminor_loss\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epipe_flow\u003C/code\u003E (ipayipi elijikelezayo, konke ngesikhathi esisodwa) no \u003Ccode\u003Erect_channel\u003C/code\u003E (imisele enxande ngokwe-Shah ne-London fit).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukudluliswa-kokushisa\"\u003EUkudluliswa kokushisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_dittus_boelter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_gnielinski\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_tube\u003C/code\u003E (ikhetha ukugeleza okulinganayo noma okunamabhubhane futhi itshele ukuthi yiyiphi i-correlation), \u003Ccode\u003Ehtc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efin_efficiency\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elmtd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeffectiveness\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Entu_for\u003C/code\u003E (izinhlobo ze-effectiveness-NTU zokugeleza okuphambene, okufanayo, i-shell-and-tube, ukugeleza okuphambene kwamabili, nomfudlana oyodwa oshintshayo) no \u003Ccode\u003Ehx_size\u003C/code\u003E (usayizi we-UA idatha edinga; ikhombisa ukuthi kungenzeka kangakanani uma idatha ingafinyelelwa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izingxenye-zengcindezi\"\u003EIzingxenye zengcindezi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eallowable_stress\u003C/code\u003E (ukuvuma ngaphezu kwesibalo sokuphepha), \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_thin_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebarlow\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_thick_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E (Lamé, ngokwe-hoop noma i-shear criterion) no \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_sphere\u003C/code\u003E. Lezi ziyizinkomba zezibalo zencwadi, \u003Cstrong\u003Eakuwona ukubalwa kwekhodi yesitsha sokucindezela\u003C/strong\u003E: azikho izindleko zokugqwala, ukusebenza kwezixhumanisi noma izinto zekhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukunyakaza-kwegesi\"\u003EUkunyakaza kwegesi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eisentropic\u003C/code\u003E (izilinganiso ku-Mach number), \u003Ccode\u003Emach_from_area\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echoked_flow\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ethroat_area\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Eexit_mach\u003C/code\u003E, ngegesi elifanele ngaphandle kokungqubuzana, ukushisa noma ama-shock.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-umphumela\"\u003EHlola umphumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck_stress\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echeck_thermal\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Echeck_flow\u003C/code\u003E zisebenzisa izixazululi zePartCraft zengcindezi, zokuqhuba nokugeleza engxenyeni eyakhiwe kusuka ekripthini, zifunde ingcindezi nokuguquka okukhulu kakhulu, izinga lokushisa nokugeleza kokushisa, nokuvuleka kwenethiwekhi yemisele. Azishintshi lutho ezixazululini. Izinhlolo zengcindezi nezokushisa zisebenzisa ama-voxel, ngakho ubuso obugobile bungamasitebisi, nengcindezi ekhoneni elibukhali elingaphakathi noma ngaphansi komthwalo wephoyinti incike ngosayizi we-voxel.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ilabhulari yezobunjiniyela iyisethi yezikripthi kuMtapo weSikripthi (craftlib/eng). Ngayinye iyinkomba yokusebenza ongayifunda kusuka phezulu kuya ezansi, nekhanda elinika indlela yayo, amayunithi ayo, imikhawulo yayo, izinkomba zayo kanye nokuhlolwa check nenombolo esebenziwe. Zisebenzisa amayunithi e-SI kuyo yonke, futhi zibuyisa amanani aqukethe iyunithi ne-source, ukuze ishidi ledatha likwazi ukuphrinta ukuthi yonke inombolo yavela kuphi. Amayunithi ahlolwayo to_si(10, 'bar', 'Pa') iguqula inani futhi yenqaba iyunithi elinika okuhlukile (ubude lapho kulindeleke ingcindezi). from_si, unit_convert(1, 'bar', 'psi') no unit_kind('W/(m K)') (\"thermal conductivity\") zisebenza ngendlela efanayo. temp_k(25, 'C') no temp_from_k ziguqula izinga lokushisa, elinokuguqulwa kwalo. Izakhiwo fluid('water', T) no fluid('air', T, p): ukuminyana, ukunamathela, ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile, nenombolo ye-Prandtl. Amanzi 0 kuya ku-100 °C, umoya 250 kuya ku-600 K; ngaphandle kwalokho iyayeka esikhundleni sokweqisa. material('ss304'): i-Young's modulus, i-Poisson's ratio, ukuminyana, ukuvuma, ukuqhuba, ukushisa okuthile, nokunwebeka: amanani ezinga lokushisa legumbi avela kumashidi edatha afanayo ne-Simulation. Umklamo wangempela usebenzisa izibalo ezisemthethweni zomhlinzeki. Amajika ezinga lokushisa awakakhiwa. Ukugeleza emapayipini nasemisele reynolds, hydraulic_diameter, friction_factor (ukugeleza okulinganayo, bese i-equation ye-Colebrook yokugeleza okunamabhubhane; uhla lwe-2300 kuya ku-4000 alunayo ifomula ethembekile futhi luyakutshela lokho), darcy_weisbach, minor_loss, pipe_flow (ipayipi elijikelezayo, konke ngesikhathi esisodwa) no rect_channel (imisele enxande ngokwe-Shah ne-London fit). Ukudluliswa kokushisa nusselt_dittus_boelter, nusselt_gnielinski, nusselt_tube (ikhetha ukugeleza okulinganayo noma okunamabhubhane futhi itshele ukuthi yiyiphi i-correlation), htc, fin_efficiency, lmtd, effectiveness no ntu_for (izinhlobo ze-effectiveness-NTU zokugeleza okuphambene, okufanayo, i-shell-and-tube, ukugeleza okuphambene kwamabili, nomfudlana oyodwa oshintshayo) no hx_size (usayizi we-UA idatha edinga; ikhombisa ukuthi kungenzeka kangakanani uma idatha ingafinyelelwa). Izingxenye zengcindezi allowable_stress (ukuvuma ngaphezu kwesibalo sokuphepha), wall_thin_cylinder, barlow, wall_thick_cylinder (Lamé, ngokwe-hoop noma i-shear criterion) no wall_sphere. Lezi ziyizinkomba zezibalo zencwadi, akuwona ukubalwa kwekhodi yesitsha sokucindezela: azikho izindleko zokugqwala, ukusebenza kwezixhumanisi noma izinto zekhodi. Ukunyakaza kwegesi isentropic (izilinganiso ku-Mach number), mach_from_area, choked_flow, throat_area no exit_mach, ngegesi elifanele ngaphandle kokungqubuzana, ukushisa noma ama-shock. Hlola umphumela check_stress, check_thermal no check_flow zisebenzisa izixazululi zePartCraft zengcindezi, zokuqhuba nokugeleza engxenyeni eyakhiwe kusuka ekripthini, zifunde ingcindezi nokuguquka okukhulu kakhulu, izinga lokushisa nokugeleza kokushisa, nokuvuleka kwenethiwekhi yemisele. Azishintshi lutho ezixazululini. Izinhlolo zengcindezi nezokushisa zisebenzisa ama-voxel, ngakho ubuso obugobile bungamasitebisi, nengcindezi ekhoneni elibukhali elingaphakathi noma ngaphansi komthwalo wephoyinti incike ngosayizi we-voxel.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"data-out","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuphuma kwedatha: ishidi ledatha, izinsimu namameshi","summary":"Gcina ishidi ledatha lomzimba owenziwe njenge-JSON noma i-PDF, insimu yawo njengesithombe se-VTK (.vti) noma isethi lezinga le-OpenVDB (.vdb), nobuso bawo njengemesh ye-VTK (.vtu) ye-ParaView namanye amathuluzi okuhlaziya, nemesh njenge-3MF equkethe idatha yomenzi. Ingxenye efanayo ihlala ibhala amafayela afanayo.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["ukuthumela","ishidi ledatha","json","pdf","vti","vtu","vtk","paraview","3mf","insimu","ukuphambuka okusayiniwe","fea","cfd","metadata","openvdb"],"headings":[{"id":"akukakhiwa","text":"Akukakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu-workspace ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnjiniyela\u003C/span\u003E, noma ezakhiweni zomzimba oyenziwe, vula \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphuma kwedatha\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwenzela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi ledatha (JSON)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke okufakwayo, yonke inombolo nesayithi nomthombo wayo, ukuhlolwa, nesigxivizo se-mesh. Ihlelwe, azikho izikhathi: ingxenye efanayo inikeza ifayela elifanayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi ledatha (PDF)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo ephepheni, kumakhasi anamaningi njengoba kudingeka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsimu (.vti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye njengokuphambuka okusayiniwe (inegethivu ngaphakathi) nemaski yangaphakathi ngegridi lamaphoyinti: ifayela lesithombe se-VTK ye-ParaView namathuluzi akhelwe ku-VTK. Yakhiwa kusuka ebusweni bomzimba ngosayizi we-voxel wokufakwa komenzi, ngakho ithatha isikhathi, nomzimba ongaphezu kuka-400 000 wama-triangle mkhulu kakhulu ekhasini: gcina insimu kusuka ku-script (\u003Ccode\u003Efield_bake\u003C/code\u003E) esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsethi lezinga (.vdb)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsimu efanayo njengesethi lezinga le-OpenVDB: isihlahla esingasongiwe esigcina kuphela ibhendi elincane lama-voxel angqongqoze ubuso, yamathuluzi afunda i-OpenVDB (abenzi bezithombe, ukulingisa nezinhlelo ze-3D). Usayizi we-voxel namayunithi ngabomenzi (amamilimitha), ibhendi elincane liyingxenye esebenzayo, ngaphakathi kunegethivu. Yakhiwa ebusweni njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E, nomkhawulo ofanayo wama-400 000 triangle; ifayela elingaphezu kuka-1.5 GB liyenqatshelwa (sebenzisa usayizi omkhulu we-voxel). Ifayela liyifomethi ye-OpenVDB 224, alicindezelwe ngaphandle kokupakishwa kwamanani asebenzayo ye-OpenVDB ngokwayo, ngakho noma yisiphi isifundi se-OpenVDB siyavula.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso (.vtu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vtu\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-triangle, nendawo nokujwayela kwawo ngayinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF enedatha yomenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-mesh ngamamilimitha ye-slicer, nomenzi, okufakwayo kwawo nobubanzi bodonga lwawo (ngelathisi enezinga) njenge-metadata kufayela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okuvela ewashini noma kumshini kulezi zifayela, ngakho ungaqhathanisa amafayela amabili ngebhayithi ngebhayithi: ibhayithi eshintshiwe isho ingxenye eshintshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E noma i-\u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E yensimu ngosayizi we-voxel ohlukile kolomenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufunda amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E ngaphakathi (kwakhiwa ukubhala kuphela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ku-workspace ye-Unjiniyela, noma ezakhiweni zomzimba oyenziwe, vula Ukuphuma kwedatha: Inkinobho Ifayela Ukwenzela Ishidi ledatha (JSON) .json Yonke okufakwayo, yonke inombolo nesayithi nomthombo wayo, ukuhlolwa, nesigxivizo se-mesh. Ihlelwe, azikho izikhathi: ingxenye efanayo inikeza ifayela elifanayo. Ishidi ledatha (PDF) .pdf Okufanayo ephepheni, kumakhasi anamaningi njengoba kudingeka. Insimu (.vti) .vti Ingxenye njengokuphambuka okusayiniwe (inegethivu ngaphakathi) nemaski yangaphakathi ngegridi lamaphoyinti: ifayela lesithombe se-VTK ye-ParaView namathuluzi akhelwe ku-VTK. Yakhiwa kusuka ebusweni bomzimba ngosayizi we-voxel wokufakwa komenzi, ngakho ithatha isikhathi, nomzimba ongaphezu kuka-400 000 wama-triangle mkhulu kakhulu ekhasini: gcina insimu kusuka ku-script (field_bake) esikhundleni salokho. Isethi lezinga (.vdb) .vdb Insimu efanayo njengesethi lezinga le-OpenVDB: isihlahla esingasongiwe esigcina kuphela ibhendi elincane lama-voxel angqongqoze ubuso, yamathuluzi afunda i-OpenVDB (abenzi bezithombe, ukulingisa nezinhlelo ze-3D). Usayizi we-voxel namayunithi ngabomenzi (amamilimitha), ibhendi elincane liyingxenye esebenzayo, ngaphakathi kunegethivu. Yakhiwa ebusweni njenge-.vti, nomkhawulo ofanayo wama-400 000 triangle; ifayela elingaphezu kuka-1.5 GB liyenqatshelwa (sebenzisa usayizi omkhulu we-voxel). Ifayela liyifomethi ye-OpenVDB 224, alicindezelwe ngaphandle kokupakishwa kwamanani asebenzayo ye-OpenVDB ngokwayo, ngakho noma yisiphi isifundi se-OpenVDB siyavula. Ubuso (.vtu) .vtu Ama-triangle, nendawo nokujwayela kwawo ngayinye. 3MF enedatha yomenzi .3mf I-mesh ngamamilimitha ye-slicer, nomenzi, okufakwayo kwawo nobubanzi bodonga lwawo (ngelathisi enezinga) njenge-metadata kufayela. Akukho okuvela ewashini noma kumshini kulezi zifayela, ngakho ungaqhathanisa amafayela amabili ngebhayithi ngebhayithi: ibhayithi eshintshiwe isho ingxenye eshintshiwe. Akukakhiwa I-.vti noma i-.vdb yensimu ngosayizi we-voxel ohlukile kolomenzi. Ukufunda amafayela .vdb ngaphakathi (kwakhiwa ukubhala kuphela).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"run-from-usb","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sebenzisa ku-USB drive","summary":"Okubhalwa yizinsiza zobunjiniyela nokuthi kuphi, ukuze i-CadCraft Studio isebenze kusitiki se-USB noma kunoma yiliphi ifolda ngaphandle kwe-installer nangaphandle kwamalungelo omlawuli: izilungiselelo, abakhiqizi, ama-cache namafayela engxenye, nokuthi yini esala esitikini.","section":"tasks","order":154,"keywords":["usb","ephathekayo","akukho installer","administrator","admin","izilungiselelo","ifolda yedatha","abakhiqizi","lapho kubhalwa khona amafayela","offline","ubumfihlo","ukufinyelela komsingathi"],"headings":[{"id":"i-zip-ephathekayo-ye-windows-nele-linux","text":"I-zip ephathekayo ye-Windows nele-Linux","level":2},{"id":"ukufinyelela-komsingathi","text":"Ukufinyelela komsingathi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinsiza zobunjiniyela (abakhiqizi, umtapo wolwazi wobunjiniyela, izihlolo namafayela edatha) \u003Cstrong\u003Eazidingi amalungelo omlawuli\u003C/strong\u003E futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eazidingi i-installer\u003C/strong\u003E. Zibhala kuphela okudweliwe lapha, akukho okunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho igcinwa khona\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye zakho, nemizimba yazo eyakhiwe, amashithi edatha nezihlolo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lengxenye oyilondolozayo (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E), lapho uyilondoloza khona.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbakhiqizi obavule kumafayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-storage yohlelo lwayo: i-local storage yesiphequluli ekhasini lewebhu, nefolda \u003Ccode\u003Edata\u003C/code\u003E eseduze nohlelo kwi-Studio ephathekayo. Okungafika ku-20.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilungiselelo (usayizi wama-voxel owusethile, amathrendi esixazululi, isakhiwo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-storage efanayo yohlelo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashithi edatha, izindawo, imeshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela lapho uzigcina khona: ukulanda kuya lapho ukhetha khona.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zinsiza \u003Cstrong\u003Eazenzi zicelo zenethiwekhi zazo\u003C/strong\u003E: abakhiqizi abahambisiwe ngamafayela asesiqondisweni sohlelo, umtapo wolwazi nezihlolo zisebenza kukhompyutha yakho kwi-worker engafinyeleli inethiwekhi, nedatha yobunjiniyela (izakhiwo zamanzi nomoya, izimpahla) itholakala ngaphakathi kohlelo. Umkhiqizi ovulwe kufayela ufundwa kukhompyutha yakho futhi awuyi noma kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-zip-ephathekayo-ye-windows-nele-linux\"\u003EI-zip ephathekayo ye-Windows nele-Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Studio ephathekayo ye-Windows igcina izilungiselelo, ama-cache nezengezo zayo kufolda ethi \u003Ccode\u003Edata\u003C/code\u003E eseduze nohlelo. I-Linux AppImage iyigcina iseduze nayo uma kukhona ifayela elibizwa nge-\u003Ccode\u003Eportable\u003C/code\u003E eseduze kwayo; ngaphandle kwalelo fayela isebenzisa ifolda yakho yasekhaya. Azikho ifomu ephathekayo ye-Mac: isistimu igcina uhlelo olulandiwe lungabhali eduze kwalo. Amanothi ephathekayo angokwesistimu (usizo lwe-\u003Ccode\u003EStudio\u003C/code\u003E) adweba okubhalwa uhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukufinyelela-komsingathi\"\u003EUkufinyelela komsingathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho lapha okucela ukufinyelela komsingathi. Amaprinta, imishini ye-serial namadivayisi e-USB ayahlukile: ayacela lapho umsebenzi udinga wona, kanye ngedivayisi ngayinye, futhi akukho okuthinta abakhiqizi noma izihlolo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinsiza zobunjiniyela (abakhiqizi, umtapo wolwazi wobunjiniyela, izihlolo namafayela edatha) azidingi amalungelo omlawuli futhi azidingi i-installer. Zibhala kuphela okudweliwe lapha, akukho okunye. Yini Lapho igcinwa khona Izingxenye zakho, nemizimba yazo eyakhiwe, amashithi edatha nezihlolo Ifayela lengxenye oyilondolozayo (.partcraft.json), lapho uyilondoloza khona. Abakhiqizi obavule kumafayela Ku-storage yohlelo lwayo: i-local storage yesiphequluli ekhasini lewebhu, nefolda data eseduze nohlelo kwi-Studio ephathekayo. Okungafika ku-20. Izilungiselelo (usayizi wama-voxel owusethile, amathrendi esixazululi, isakhiwo) Ku-storage efanayo yohlelo. Amashithi edatha, izindawo, imeshi Kuphela lapho uzigcina khona: ukulanda kuya lapho ukhetha khona. Lezi zinsiza azenzi zicelo zenethiwekhi zazo: abakhiqizi abahambisiwe ngamafayela asesiqondisweni sohlelo, umtapo wolwazi nezihlolo zisebenza kukhompyutha yakho kwi-worker engafinyeleli inethiwekhi, nedatha yobunjiniyela (izakhiwo zamanzi nomoya, izimpahla) itholakala ngaphakathi kohlelo. Umkhiqizi ovulwe kufayela ufundwa kukhompyutha yakho futhi awuyi noma kuphi. I-zip ephathekayo ye-Windows nele-Linux I-Studio ephathekayo ye-Windows igcina izilungiselelo, ama-cache nezengezo zayo kufolda ethi data eseduze nohlelo. I-Linux AppImage iyigcina iseduze nayo uma kukhona ifayela elibizwa nge-portable eseduze kwayo; ngaphandle kwalelo fayela isebenzisa ifolda yakho yasekhaya. Azikho ifomu ephathekayo ye-Mac: isistimu igcina uhlelo olulandiwe lungabhali eduze kwalo. Amanothi ephathekayo angokwesistimu (usizo lwe-Studio) adweba okubhalwa uhlelo. Ukufinyelela komsingathi Akukho lapha okucela ukufinyelela komsingathi. Amaprinta, imishini ye-serial namadivayisi e-USB ayahlukile: ayacela lapho umsebenzi udinga wona, kanye ngedivayisi ngayinye, futhi akukho okuthinta abakhiqizi noma izihlolo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"engineer-export-notice","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izilawuli zokuthumela phandle ze-Injiniyela","summary":"Isaziso sezilawuli zokuthumela phandle esihamba ne-Injiniyela: sikhonjiswa lapha, ngaphansi kwawo wonke amashidi edatha nasecaleni kwezikhiqizi ezikuphethe.","section":"tasks","order":155,"keywords":["injiniyela","ukuthumela phandle","izilawuli zokuthumela phandle","izijeziso","isaziso","ishidi ledatha","inozulu","isikhiqizi"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilawuli zokuthumela phandle.\u003C/strong\u003E Injiniyela nezikhiqizi zayo ngamathuluzi wokuklama ajwayelekile akhiwe ngezibalo ezishicilelwe zobunjiniyela bokufundisa. Asisho ukuthi noma yisiphi isikhiqizi, uklama, ishidi ledatha noma ifayela elithunyelwe liyakhululeka ezilawulweni zokuthumela phandle noma ezijezisweni, noma ukuthi lingathunyelwa ngokusemthethweni, lidluliselwe noma lisetshenziswe kunoma yiliphi izwe noma yimuphi umuntu. Wena ubhekele ukuhlukanisa okudizayinile nokulandela imithetho yokuthumela phandle nezijeziso ezikusebenzela. Lesi yisaziso esisisisekelo: sihlela ukushintsha lezi zilawuli ukuze zihambisane nemithetho yokuthumela phandle yezwe lomsuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELamagama afanayo ashiwo ngaphansi kwawo wonke amashidi edatha (kwiphaneli, ku-PDF nakufayela le-JSON) nasecaleni kwanoma yisiphi isikhiqizi esiphethe isaziso, njengenozulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjiniyela ayisiyo uhlelo lwayo: iyingxenye ehlanganyelwe yazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft ezayifakayo, futhi isaziso sifana kuzo zonke. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-generators\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-generators\"\u003EIzingxenye ezivela kwifiziksi: izikhiqizi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izilawuli zokuthumela phandle. Injiniyela nezikhiqizi zayo ngamathuluzi wokuklama ajwayelekile akhiwe ngezibalo ezishicilelwe zobunjiniyela bokufundisa. Asisho ukuthi noma yisiphi isikhiqizi, uklama, ishidi ledatha noma ifayela elithunyelwe liyakhululeka ezilawulweni zokuthumela phandle noma ezijezisweni, noma ukuthi lingathunyelwa ngokusemthethweni, lidluliselwe noma lisetshenziswe kunoma yiliphi izwe noma yimuphi umuntu. Wena ubhekele ukuhlukanisa okudizayinile nokulandela imithetho yokuthumela phandle nezijeziso ezikusebenzela. Lesi yisaziso esisisisekelo: sihlela ukushintsha lezi zilawuli ukuze zihambisane nemithetho yokuthumela phandle yezwe lomsuka. Lamagama afanayo ashiwo ngaphansi kwawo wonke amashidi edatha (kwiphaneli, ku-PDF nakufayela le-JSON) nasecaleni kwanoma yisiphi isikhiqizi esiphethe isaziso, njengenozulu. Injiniyela ayisiyo uhlelo lwayo: iyingxenye ehlanganyelwe yazo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft ezayifakayo, futhi isaziso sifana kuzo zonke. Bheka Izingxenye ezivela kwifiziksi: izikhiqizi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qala incwadi ku-Illustrate","summary":"Indawo yokusebenza ye-Illustrate yenza izincwadi kusuka kwidizayini yakho: imibono, imidwebo yomugqa ehlukaniswe namabhaluni nohlu lwezingxenye, imiyalelo ngesinyathelo ngesinyathelo, izinkinobho zokunyakaza nefayela le-3D lomthengi elingavulwa ngaphandle kwe-CAD. Incwadi iyifayela lalo siqu.","section":"tasks","order":160,"keywords":["illustrate","incwadi","umdwebo wobuchwepheshe","ukwenza amadokhumenti","umbono ohlukaniswe","uhlu lwezingxenye","imiyalelo","partcraft-manual"],"headings":[{"id":"qala-enye","text":"Qala enye","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-nokuvula","text":"Londoloza nokuvula","level":2},{"id":"akakakhiwa-okwamanje","text":"Akakakhiwa okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIllustrate\u003C/strong\u003E yindawo yokusebenza yamadokhumenti adingwa ngaphandle kwedizayini: imibono ehlukaniswe namabhaluni nohlu lwezingxenye, imidwebo yomugqa yezincwadi, imiyalelo ngesinyathelo ngesinyathelo, izinkinobho zokunyakaza nefayela le-3D umthengi angalivula ngaphandle kwe-CAD. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E kwisishintshi se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E ekuqaleni kwethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIncwadi\u003C/strong\u003E iyifayela lalo siqu (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E). Igcina ikhophi yesimo sengxenye ngayinye, isihlahla somkhiqizo nezimfanelo zezingxenye, nexhumanisa kulapho zavela khona, ukuze usebenze ku-incwadi kanti idizayini iqhubeka. Uma idizayini ishintsha, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-update\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-update\"\u003EBuyekeza kusuka kwidizayini\u003C/a\u003E iletha izinguquko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala-enye\"\u003EQala enye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlahlandlela\u003C/span\u003E, bese:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka engxenyeni evulekile\u003C/span\u003E: ingxenye evulekile ku-Design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwinhlanganisela evulekile\u003C/span\u003E: iboniswa esikhundleni salo uma kuvulekile inhlanganisela; izingxenye zayo, izindawo zazo, izinombolo zengxenye, izinto nezinkinobho zokunyakaza kuyeza nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwifayela lenhlanganisela…\u003C/span\u003E: ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E elilondoloziwe; i-PartCraft ibumba kuqala izingxenye zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwenye ifayela…\u003C/span\u003E: i-glTF (.glb, .gltf), OBJ, STL noma 3MF. Isihlahla nemigqa yegama lefayela siyagcinwa, futhi amakhophi engxenye eyodwa (isimo esifanayo esibekwe kabili) aba yingxenye eyodwa enani. Amafayela e-STL nama-OBJ awatshengisi iyunithi yawo, ngakho uyabuzwa. Amafayela e-STL afundwa ngo-Z phezulu; i-glTF ne-3MF zitshela eyazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho incwadi ivuliwe, i-Illustrate ibonisa ikhophi yayo yezingxenye; ingxenye noma inhlanganisela evulekile ku-Design iyafihlwa kuze kubuyele ku-Design.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-nokuvula\"\u003ELondoloza nokuvula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlahlandlela\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ilondoloza incwadi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E iyivula. Konke okushintshwa ku-Illustrate kuyisinyathelo esisodwa emlandweni wencwadi yayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E asebenza ku-incwadi uma i-Illustrate ivuliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akakakhiwa-okwamanje\"\u003EAkakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafayela e-STEP awavuleki ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwenye ifayela…\u003C/span\u003E okwamanje. Vula i-STEP ku-Design esikhundleni salokho (ifika njengomzimba oqinile: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP nakha kulo\u003C/a\u003E) bese uqala incwadi ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka engxenyeni evulekile\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyilondoloze njenge-glTF, 3MF, OBJ noma STL.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-ModelCraft ne-BimCraft azikwazi okwamanje ukudlulisa imodeli ngqo ku-Illustrate: yilondoloze njenge-glTF (.glb) bese usebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kwenye ifayela…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkulandelayo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-views\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-views\"\u003EImibono nezimo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Illustrate yindawo yokusebenza yamadokhumenti adingwa ngaphandle kwedizayini: imibono ehlukaniswe namabhaluni nohlu lwezingxenye, imidwebo yomugqa yezincwadi, imiyalelo ngesinyathelo ngesinyathelo, izinkinobho zokunyakaza nefayela le-3D umthengi angalivula ngaphandle kwe-CAD. Khetha Illustrate kwisishintshi se-Indawo yokusebenza ekuqaleni kwethuluzi. Incwadi iyifayela lalo siqu (\u003Cname\u003E.partcraft-manual.json). Igcina ikhophi yesimo sengxenye ngayinye, isihlahla somkhiqizo nezimfanelo zezingxenye, nexhumanisa kulapho zavela khona, ukuze usebenze ku-incwadi kanti idizayini iqhubeka. Uma idizayini ishintsha, Buyekeza kusuka kwidizayini iletha izinguquko. Qala enye Chofoza Okusha eqenjini Umhlahlandlela, bese: Kusuka engxenyeni evulekile: ingxenye evulekile ku-Design. Kusuka kwinhlanganisela evulekile: iboniswa esikhundleni salo uma kuvulekile inhlanganisela; izingxenye zayo, izindawo zazo, izinombolo zengxenye, izinto nezinkinobho zokunyakaza kuyeza nazo. Kusuka kwifayela lenhlanganisela…: ifayela le-.partcraft-asm.json elilondoloziwe; i-PartCraft ibumba kuqala izingxenye zalo. Kusuka kwenye ifayela…: i-glTF (.glb, .gltf), OBJ, STL noma 3MF. Isihlahla nemigqa yegama lefayela siyagcinwa, futhi amakhophi engxenye eyodwa (isimo esifanayo esibekwe kabili) aba yingxenye eyodwa enani. Amafayela e-STL nama-OBJ awatshengisi iyunithi yawo, ngakho uyabuzwa. Amafayela e-STL afundwa ngo-Z phezulu; i-glTF ne-3MF zitshela eyazo. Lapho incwadi ivuliwe, i-Illustrate ibonisa ikhophi yayo yezingxenye; ingxenye noma inhlanganisela evulekile ku-Design iyafihlwa kuze kubuyele ku-Design. Londoloza nokuvula Londoloza eqenjini Umhlahlandlela (noma Ctrl+S) ilondoloza incwadi; Vula iyivula. Konke okushintshwa ku-Illustrate kuyisinyathelo esisodwa emlandweni wencwadi yayo: Hlehlisa no Phinda wenze asebenza ku-incwadi uma i-Illustrate ivuliwe. Akakakhiwa okwamanje Amafayela e-STEP awavuleki ku-Kusuka kwenye ifayela… okwamanje. Vula i-STEP ku-Design esikhundleni salokho (ifika njengomzimba oqinile: bona Vula ifayela le-STEP nakha kulo) bese uqala incwadi ngokuthi Kusuka engxenyeni evulekile, noma uyilondoloze njenge-glTF, 3MF, OBJ noma STL. I-ModelCraft ne-BimCraft azikwazi okwamanje ukudlulisa imodeli ngqo ku-Illustrate: yilondoloze njenge-glTF (.glb) bese usebenzisa Kusuka kwenye ifayela…. Okulandelayo: Imibono nezimo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-views","scope":"partcraft","title":"Imibono, izimo, izigaba nesikhulisi","summary":"Incwadi igcina uhlu olulandelanayo lwemibono. Ngayinye igcina ikhamera, isimo esihlukaniswe, nengxenye ngayinye ukuthi iyabonakala yini, iyisithunzi yini, ukuqina kwayo nombala wayo, kanye nesitayela, isigaba noma ukusikwa kwebhokisi, nesikhulisi.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["illustrate","umbono","ikhamera","fihla","isithunzi","hlukanisa","ukuqina","umbala","isigaba","ukusika","isikhulisi","x-ray","isitayela somugqa"],"headings":[{"id":"indawo-ebonakalayo-nemibono-yayo","text":"Indawo ebonakalayo nemibono yayo","level":2},{"id":"ukubukeka","text":"Ukubukeka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo-ebonakalayo-nemibono-yayo\"\u003EIndawo ebonakalayo nemibono yayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokho obukuhlola yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eindawo ebonakalayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Phendula imodeli njengoba kwenziwa ku-Design, bese ushintsha ukuthi izingxenye zibukeka kanjani:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ingxenye ukuyikhetha; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza yengeza noma yehlisa eyodwa. Imigqa yomuthi we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingxenye\u003C/span\u003E nayo iyakhetha (umugqa wegrupu ukhetha konke okuphakathi kwawo). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ingxenye efanayo\u003C/span\u003E yengeza wonke amakhophi engxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithunzi (G)\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ibonakala ingaqinile futhi imfiyane) kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa (I)\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: kukhona lezi kuphela) zisebenza ekukhethweni; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisa konke. Ipaneli ibeka ukuqina nombala wengxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka okuhlukanisiwe\u003C/span\u003E ephanelini ikhetha enye yemibono ehlukaniswe yomklamo nokuthi idlaliwe kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukubuka\u003C/span\u003E igcina lokho okubonakalayo njengombono omusha nesithombe esincane. Chofoza umbono ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele kuwo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza ukubuka\u003C/span\u003E igcina indawo ebonakalayo emboneni owuyeleyo. Imibono ingaqanjwa kabusha (chofoza kabili), ihanjiswe phezulu nphansi, ikopishwe futhi isuswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubukeka\"\u003EUkubukeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubukeka\u003C/span\u003E sibeka, ngendawo ebonakalayo nangombono ngamunye ogciniwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/span\u003E: eshadiwe, eshadiwe nemiphetho, imibala eqinile, umugqa kuphela, noma x-ray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpuleni elinqunyiwe\u003C/span\u003E: isusa uhlangothi olulodwa kudlula X, Y noma Z; ubuso osikiwe bugcwaliswa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina olunye uhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E iyayiguqula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusikwa kwebhokisi\u003C/span\u003E: isika ikhoni emodelini ukuze kubonakale ngaphakathi. Ku-3D view ubuso bayo osikiwe bushiyelwe bungavaliwe; kumdwebo womugqa (Thumela) bushadiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhulisi\u003C/span\u003E: ilensi eyindilinga ebonisa ingxenye enkulisiwe, noma ngaphakathi nazo zonke izimiphetho. Hudula ilensi ukuze uyihambise; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQondisa ilensi\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza iphoyinti ekufanele libheke kulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbono ophilayo uhlale ubonisa ikhamera iqondile (orthographic). Umbono ungagcinwa njenge-perspective; izithombe zawo nomugqa womdwebo ziyawusebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indawo ebonakalayo nemibono yayo Lokho obukuhlola yi-indawo ebonakalayo. Phendula imodeli njengoba kwenziwa ku-Design, bese ushintsha ukuthi izingxenye zibukeka kanjani: Chofoza ingxenye ukuyikhetha; Shift+chofoza yengeza noma yehlisa eyodwa. Imigqa yomuthi we-Izingxenye nayo iyakhetha (umugqa wegrupu ukhetha konke okuphakathi kwawo). Khetha ingxenye efanayo yengeza wonke amakhophi engxenye. Fihla (H), Isithunzi (G) (G: ibonakala ingaqinile futhi imfiyane) kanye Hlukanisa (I) (I: kukhona lezi kuphela) zisebenza ekukhethweni; Bonisa konke ibuyisa konke. Ipaneli ibeka ukuqina nombala wengxenye. Ukubuka okuhlukanisiwe ephanelini ikhetha enye yemibono ehlukaniswe yomklamo nokuthi idlaliwe kangakanani. Engeza ukubuka igcina lokho okubonakalayo njengombono omusha nesithombe esincane. Chofoza umbono ohlwini lwe-Imibono ukuze ubuyele kuwo; Buyekeza ukubuka igcina indawo ebonakalayo emboneni owuyeleyo. Imibono ingaqanjwa kabusha (chofoza kabili), ihanjiswe phezulu nphansi, ikopishwe futhi isuswe. Ukubukeka Isigaba Ukubukeka sibeka, ngendawo ebonakalayo nangombono ngamunye ogciniwe: Isitayela: eshadiwe, eshadiwe nemiphetho, imibala eqinile, umugqa kuphela, noma x-ray. Ipuleni elinqunyiwe: isusa uhlangothi olulodwa kudlula X, Y noma Z; ubuso osikiwe bugcwaliswa. Gcina olunye uhlangothi iyayiguqula. Ukusikwa kwebhokisi: isika ikhoni emodelini ukuze kubonakale ngaphakathi. Ku-3D view ubuso bayo osikiwe bushiyelwe bungavaliwe; kumdwebo womugqa (Thumela) bushadiwe. Isikhulisi: ilensi eyindilinga ebonisa ingxenye enkulisiwe, noma ngaphakathi nazo zonke izimiphetho. Hudula ilensi ukuze uyihambise; Qondisa ilensi bese uchofoza iphoyinti ekufanele libheke kulo. Umbono ophilayo uhlale ubonisa ikhamera iqondile (orthographic). Umbono ungagcinwa njenge-perspective; izithombe zawo nomugqa womdwebo ziyawusebenzisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-annotations","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izichasiso ezihlala zixhunyiwe","summary":"Amalebula, izinkomba, imicibisholo, izilinganiso, izimo nezithombe. Izichasiso engxenyeni ziboshwe iphoyinti kuyo futhi zihamba nengxenye lapho ihlukaniswa; umbhalo wazo ungagcwalisa inombolo yengxenye, igama, impahla nobuningi.","section":"tasks","order":162,"keywords":["illustrate","ukuchaza","ilebula","inkomba","umugqa wokuxhuma","umcibisholo","umcibisholo wokuphenduka","linganisa","ubukhulu","radius","engeli","isimo","isithombe","izinkambu"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKhetha ithuluzi esigabeni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli, bese uchofoza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlebula\u003C/strong\u003E nenkomba: chofoza iphoyinti engxenyeni. Umbhalo uhlala eceleni kwalo nomugqa wokuxhuma eliya kuleliphoyinti; hudula umbhalo ukuze uwubeke. Umbhalo wawo uhlelwa ephaneli futhi ungasebenzisa izinkambu: \u003Ccode\u003E{number}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{material}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{description}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{qty}\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003E{item}\u003C/code\u003E (inombolo yebhamuni) ziyagcwaliswa kusuka engxenyeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImicibisholo\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza ubuso; umcibisholo uqala lapho bese ukhomba ngaphandle kobuso. Umugqa, wegobile noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eumcibisholo wokuphenduka\u003C/strong\u003E ozungeze i-normal yobuso (&quot;turn here&quot;). Ubude bawo, isitayela nendlela yawo kuphaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E: ibanga (amaphoyinti amabili), engeli (amaphoyinti amathathu, ikhona yesibili) noma irediyasi (amaphoyinti amathathu emphethweni ogobile). Inani lithathwa lapho izingxenye zihlanganiswe khona, ngakho ukuhlukanisa akushintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimo nezithombe\u003C/strong\u003E: unxantathu, i-ellipse, umugqa noma umcibisholo ohlanganiswe nesithombe (ukuchofoza kabili), noma isithombe se-PNG noma JPEG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzichasiso engxenyeni zihamba nayo uma ihlukaniswa noma ihanjiswa embonweni, futhi aziboniswa uma ifihliwe. Ngombono ngamunye ubona izichasiso ohlwini lwawo: inkinobho yeso ephaneli iboniswa noma ifihle eyodwa kulo mbono; ibhini liyisusa emhlahlandlelweni.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Khetha ithuluzi esigabeni se-Annotate ephaneli, bese uchofoza: Ilebula nenkomba: chofoza iphoyinti engxenyeni. Umbhalo uhlala eceleni kwalo nomugqa wokuxhuma eliya kuleliphoyinti; hudula umbhalo ukuze uwubeke. Umbhalo wawo uhlelwa ephaneli futhi ungasebenzisa izinkambu: {number}, {name}, {material}, {description}, {qty} kanye {item} (inombolo yebhamuni) ziyagcwaliswa kusuka engxenyeni. Imicibisholo: chofoza ubuso; umcibisholo uqala lapho bese ukhomba ngaphandle kobuso. Umugqa, wegobile noma umcibisholo wokuphenduka ozungeze i-normal yobuso (\"turn here\"). Ubude bawo, isitayela nendlela yawo kuphaneli. Izilinganiso: ibanga (amaphoyinti amabili), engeli (amaphoyinti amathathu, ikhona yesibili) noma irediyasi (amaphoyinti amathathu emphethweni ogobile). Inani lithathwa lapho izingxenye zihlanganiswe khona, ngakho ukuhlukanisa akushintshi. Izimo nezithombe: unxantathu, i-ellipse, umugqa noma umcibisholo ohlanganiswe nesithombe (ukuchofoza kabili), noma isithombe se-PNG noma JPEG. Izichasiso engxenyeni zihamba nayo uma ihlukaniswa noma ihanjiswa embonweni, futhi aziboniswa uma ifihliwe. Ngombono ngamunye ubona izichasiso ohlwini lwawo: inkinobho yeso ephaneli iboniswa noma ifihle eyodwa kulo mbono; ibhini liyisusa emhlahlandlelweni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-parts-list","scope":"partcraft","title":"Uhlu lwezingxenye namabhaluni","summary":"Izinombolo zamabhaluni zinikezwa kanye kuphela futhi aziphindwa. Faka ibhaluni yonke ingxenye ebonwa umbono ngokuchofoza kanye, bonisa uhlu lwezingxenye emboneni oluhlungwe ngezingxenye zawo, khetha amakholomu awo, bese uwulondoloza njenge-CSV.","section":"tasks","order":163,"keywords":["illustrate","bom","uhlu lwezinto ezidingekayo","uhlu lwezingxenye","ibhaluni","inombolo yento","inani","csv","ithebula"],"headings":[{"id":"amabhaluni","text":"Amabhaluni","level":2},{"id":"emboneni-nanjenge-csv","text":"Emboneni nanjenge-CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezingxenye\u003C/span\u003E sidweba izingxenye: umugqa oyodwa ngengxenye ngayinye ngenani layo (amakhophi engxenye eyodwa, nezingxenye ezinenombolo yengxenye nesimo esifanayo, ziyumugqa oyodwa). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha izingxenye ezibonisiwe kulo mbono (ezingafihliwe, ezingasithunzi) noma zonke izingxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amabhaluni\"\u003EAmabhaluni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza amabhaluni ezingxenye ezibonisiwe\u003C/span\u003E inikeza umugqa ngamunye inombolo (eyokuqala etholakalayo elandelayo) futhi ibeke ibhaluni eyodwa ekhophini eliseduze nawe, endilingeni ezungeze imodeli. Hudula ibhaluni ukuze uyihambise. Inombolo ihlala nengxenye yayo: izingxenye ezengezwa kamuva zithola izinombolo ezintsha, futhi inombolo ayikaze inikezwe enye ingxenye, nakuba ingxenye yayo isusiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"emboneni-nanjenge-csv\"\u003EEmboneni nanjenge-CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThikha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa uhlu lwezingxenye kulokhu kubuka\u003C/span\u003E ukubeka ithebula esithombeni (hudula ukuze ulibeke ekhoneni). Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmakholomu\u003C/span\u003E alo (izimfanelo zengxenye ngokwayo nazo ziyatholakala) kanye nokuthi lidweba izingxenye zalo mbono noma zonke izingxenye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ibhala uhlu lwe-spreadsheet; umbhalo oqala njengefomula ubhalwa ukuze i-spreadsheet ingawusebenzisi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isigaba Uhlu lwezingxenye sidweba izingxenye: umugqa oyodwa ngengxenye ngayinye ngenani layo (amakhophi engxenye eyodwa, nezingxenye ezinenombolo yengxenye nesimo esifanayo, ziyumugqa oyodwa). Uhlu ikhetha izingxenye ezibonisiwe kulo mbono (ezingafihliwe, ezingasithunzi) noma zonke izingxenye. Amabhaluni Yenza amabhaluni ezingxenye ezibonisiwe inikeza umugqa ngamunye inombolo (eyokuqala etholakalayo elandelayo) futhi ibeke ibhaluni eyodwa ekhophini eliseduze nawe, endilingeni ezungeze imodeli. Hudula ibhaluni ukuze uyihambise. Inombolo ihlala nengxenye yayo: izingxenye ezengezwa kamuva zithola izinombolo ezintsha, futhi inombolo ayikaze inikezwe enye ingxenye, nakuba ingxenye yayo isusiwe. Emboneni nanjenge-CSV Thikha Bonisa uhlu lwezingxenye kulokhu kubuka ukubeka ithebula esithombeni (hudula ukuze ulibeke ekhoneni). Khetha Amakholomu alo (izimfanelo zengxenye ngokwayo nazo ziyatholakala) kanye nokuthi lidweba izingxenye zalo mbono noma zonke izingxenye. Londoloza njenge-CSV ibhala uhlu lwe-spreadsheet; umbhalo oqala njengefomula ubhalwa ukuze i-spreadsheet ingawusebenzisi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-line-art","scope":"partcraft","title":"Imidwebo yobuchwepheshe: imigqa, izithombe namashidi","summary":"Thumela noma yimuphi umbono njengomugqa we-vector (SVG noma PDF) onemigqa emithathu yobukhulu, imigqa efihliwe eyenziwe ngamadeshi noma ishiywe ngaphandle, ubuso osikiwe obushadiwe kanye nokugcwaliswa okukhethekayo, noma njenge-PNG; beka imibono eminingi kushidi elilodwa.","section":"tasks","order":164,"keywords":["illustrate","umugqa","umdwebo wobuchwepheshe","svg","pdf","png","imigqa efihliwe","umbumbululo","imigqa yokufiphaza","ishidi","thumela"],"headings":[{"id":"akakakhiwa-okwamanje","text":"Akakakhiwa okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E ivula ingxoxo yokuthumela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuthunyelwayo\u003C/span\u003E: isimo sesikhathi manje, umbono oyodwa, noma yonke imibono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengo\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ESVG\u003C/strong\u003E (imigqa ye-vector; kombili kubhalwa kusuka kumdwebo ofanayo), \u003Cstrong\u003EPNG yomugqa\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eisithombe se-PNG sombono we-3D\u003C/strong\u003E (kuze kufike ku-4096 pixels ububanzi), kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-interactive\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-interactive\"\u003Enefayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmakhasi\u003C/span\u003E: umbono oyodwa ekhasini ngalinye, noma yonke imibono ishidini elilodwa negama layo ngaphansi kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphepha\u003C/span\u003E: A4, A3, Letter noma Tabloid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa efihliwe\u003C/span\u003E: ishiwo ngamadeshi noma ishiywe ngaphandle. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugcwaliswa\u003C/span\u003E: njengoba ukubuka kubonakala, akukho, imibala eqinile noma eshadiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba futhi imiphetho ethambile\u003C/span\u003E yengeza imigqa yemininingwane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa womdwebo unobukhulu obuthathu: imibumbulo (imiphetho yokubumba nemiphetho evulekile, nemigqa yokusika), imiphetho ebukhali, kanye nemigqa yemininingwane. Ubuso osikiwe besigaba noma ukusikwa kwebhokisi buyashadwa. Imibono yokuhlukanisa ithola imigqa yochungechunge ukusuka lapho kubekwe khona ingxenye ngayinye; amabhaluni, izincazelo, uhlu lwezingxenye nesikhulisi nakho kuyadwetshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa womdwebo wenziwa ngokusekelwe kumumo wezingxenye ngendlela ye-mesh (leyo efanayo esetshenziswa yishidi lomdwebo le-PartCraft ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel), ngakho ubuso obugobile budwetshwa ngezinhlaka njengoba imodeli iziphethe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akakakhiwa-okwamanje\"\u003EAkakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzithombe ezifana nekhwalithi ye-path tracer (i-renderer ye-ModelCraft) azitholakali lapha; izithombe ze-PNG zibukeka njengombono we-3D ngokwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Thumela eqenjini Phuma ivula ingxoxo yokuthumela: Okuthunyelwayo: isimo sesikhathi manje, umbono oyodwa, noma yonke imibono. Njengo: PDF noma SVG (imigqa ye-vector; kombili kubhalwa kusuka kumdwebo ofanayo), PNG yomugqa, noma isithombe se-PNG sombono we-3D (kuze kufike ku-4096 pixels ububanzi), kanye nefayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo. Amakhasi: umbono oyodwa ekhasini ngalinye, noma yonke imibono ishidini elilodwa negama layo ngaphansi kwawo. Iphepha: A4, A3, Letter noma Tabloid. Imigqa efihliwe: ishiwo ngamadeshi noma ishiywe ngaphandle. Ukugcwaliswa: njengoba ukubuka kubonakala, akukho, imibala eqinile noma eshadiwe. Dweba futhi imiphetho ethambile yengeza imigqa yemininingwane. Umugqa womdwebo unobukhulu obuthathu: imibumbulo (imiphetho yokubumba nemiphetho evulekile, nemigqa yokusika), imiphetho ebukhali, kanye nemigqa yemininingwane. Ubuso osikiwe besigaba noma ukusikwa kwebhokisi buyashadwa. Imibono yokuhlukanisa ithola imigqa yochungechunge ukusuka lapho kubekwe khona ingxenye ngayinye; amabhaluni, izincazelo, uhlu lwezingxenye nesikhulisi nakho kuyadwetshwa. Umugqa womdwebo wenziwa ngokusekelwe kumumo wezingxenye ngendlela ye-mesh (leyo efanayo esetshenziswa yishidi lomdwebo le-PartCraft ngaphandle kwe-exact kernel), ngakho ubuso obugobile budwetshwa ngezinhlaka njengoba imodeli iziphethe. Akakakhiwa okwamanje Izithombe ezifana nekhwalithi ye-path tracer (i-renderer ye-ModelCraft) azitholakali lapha; izithombe ze-PNG zibukeka njengombono we-3D ngokwawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-instructions","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amadokhumenti emiyalelo","summary":"Guqula imibono ibe imiyalelo ngesinyathelo ngesinyathelo: ikhasi lekhava, ikhasi ngalinye lesinyathelo nesithombe salo, izingxenye ezibonisiwe, amanothi, izexwayiso namathuluzi, kanye nohlu lwezingxenye; alondolozwa njenge-PDF noma njengekhasi elilodwa le-HTML elishicilela kahle. Izakhiwo ziyamafayela.","section":"tasks","order":165,"keywords":["illustrate","imiyalelo","imiyalelo yokuhlanganisa","incwadi yesevisi","izinyathelo","isexwayiso","amathuluzi","isakhiwo","logo","pdf","html"],"headings":[{"id":"izakhiwo","text":"Izakhiwo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula isigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiyalelo\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala imiyalelo kusuka emibonweni\u003C/span\u003E: ibuka ngayinye iba yisinyathelo, ngokulandelana kwemibono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsinyathelweni ngasinye khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsihloko\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe\u003C/span\u003E (njengoba ukubuka kubonakala, umugqa, imibala eqinile noma eshadiwe), nokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlu izingxenye ezikhombiswa yilesi sinyathelo\u003C/span\u003E noma cha, bese uthayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzexwayiso\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E (eyodwa emugqeni ngayinye). Izinyathelo ziyanyuka nehla; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isinyathelo\u003C/span\u003E yengeza eyodwa kunoma yimuphi umbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhasi lekhava\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhasi lohlu lwezingxenye ekugcineni\u003C/span\u003E kuvulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ibhala amakhasi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-HTML\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ikhasi elilodwa elifundeka esikrinini futhi lishicilele isinyathelo esisodwa ekhasini ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izakhiwo\"\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E sibeka iphepha, esilaleni noma esimileni, ilogo (PNG noma JPEG), umbala wenhloko kanye nomugqa wephansi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E siyalibhala njenge-fayela le \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-template.json\u003C/code\u003E ukuze lisetshenziswe kwezinye izincwadi ngokusebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa isakhiwo…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula isigaba Imiyalelo bese uchofoza Qala imiyalelo kusuka emibonweni: ibuka ngayinye iba yisinyathelo, ngokulandelana kwemibono. Esinyathelweni ngasinye khetha Ukubuka, Isihloko, Isithombe (njengoba ukubuka kubonakala, umugqa, imibala eqinile noma eshadiwe), nokuthi Hlu izingxenye ezikhombiswa yilesi sinyathelo noma cha, bese uthayipha Amanothi, Izexwayiso kanye Amathuluzi (eyodwa emugqeni ngayinye). Izinyathelo ziyanyuka nehla; Engeza isinyathelo yengeza eyodwa kunoma yimuphi umbono. Ikhasi lekhava kanye Ikhasi lohlu lwezingxenye ekugcineni kuvulekile ngokuzenzakalelayo. Londoloza njenge-PDF ibhala amakhasi; Londoloza njenge-HTML ibhala ikhasi elilodwa elifundeka esikrinini futhi lishicilele isinyathelo esisodwa ekhasini ngalinye. Izakhiwo Isakhiwo sibeka iphepha, esilaleni noma esimileni, ilogo (PNG noma JPEG), umbala wenhloko kanye nomugqa wephansi. Londoloza isakhiwo siyalibhala njenge-fayela le .partcraft-template.json ukuze lisetshenziswe kwezinye izincwadi ngokusebenzisa Sebenzisa isakhiwo….","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-interactive","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ifayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo","summary":"Thumela incwadi njengefayela elilodwa le-HTML elivuleka ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kunoma yisiphequluli, ngaphandle kokufaka, i-akhawunti noma ukulandelwa: imodeli, imibono, uhlu lwezingxenye oluxhunyiwe ezinhlangothini zombili, i-animation nesikhulisi.","section":"tasks","order":166,"keywords":["illustrate","ezisebenzisanayo","ifayela le-3d","html","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","isiphequluli","umthengi","indawo yokukhiqiza"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengo\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo (HTML, livula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi)\u003C/span\u003E, ilondoloza ifayela elilodwa le \u003Ccode\u003E.html\u003C/code\u003E. Lithumele ngemeyili, ulibeke kuinkumbulo ye-USB noma efolda eyabelwana: livula kunoma yisiphequluli esisekela i-WebGL 2, ekhompyutheni, ethabulethi noma efonini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKulo fayela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ukuze uphendule imodeli; hudula ngeqhaza lokudla noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+hudula ukuze uhambise; isikrolo noma ukucindezela ukuze usondeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umbono ohlwini: ikhamera iyaya lapho, nezingxenye zithatha izindawo, izimo, ukusikwa nesikhulisi salowo mbono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa wohlu lwezingxenye ukuze ukhanyise izingxenye zawo; chofoza ingxenye ukuze ukhanyise umugqa wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma incwadi inokunyakaza, ibha engaphansi kwemodeli iyakudlala, iyiyeke futhi ihambe kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela liphethe yonke into eyidingayo (imodeli, isibukisi kanye ne-three.js, ngelayisensi yayo ye-MIT) futhi livimbela zonke izicelo: alikwazi ukufinyelela i-inthanethi, alinayo i-akhawunti futhi alilandeli muntu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ye-3D esebenzisanayo ngaphakathi kwe-PDF ayinikezwa: izisiphequluli nezifundi eziningi ze-PDF azikwazi ukuyibonisa, futhi ifundi ekwazi ukuyibonisa iyayivala ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ifayela le-HTML yimpendulo esebenzisanayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Thumela, bese Njengo Ifayela le-3D elisebenzisanayo (HTML, livula ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi), ilondoloza ifayela elilodwa le .html. Lithumele ngemeyili, ulibeke kuinkumbulo ye-USB noma efolda eyabelwana: livula kunoma yisiphequluli esisekela i-WebGL 2, ekhompyutheni, ethabulethi noma efonini. Kulo fayela: Hudula ukuze uphendule imodeli; hudula ngeqhaza lokudla noma Shift+hudula ukuze uhambise; isikrolo noma ukucindezela ukuze usondeze. Chofoza umbono ohlwini: ikhamera iyaya lapho, nezingxenye zithatha izindawo, izimo, ukusikwa nesikhulisi salowo mbono. Chofoza umugqa wohlu lwezingxenye ukuze ukhanyise izingxenye zawo; chofoza ingxenye ukuze ukhanyise umugqa wayo. Uma incwadi inokunyakaza, ibha engaphansi kwemodeli iyakudlala, iyiyeke futhi ihambe kuyo. Ifayela liphethe yonke into eyidingayo (imodeli, isibukisi kanye ne-three.js, ngelayisensi yayo ye-MIT) futhi livimbela zonke izicelo: alikwazi ukufinyelela i-inthanethi, alinayo i-akhawunti futhi alilandeli muntu. Imodeli ye-3D esebenzisanayo ngaphakathi kwe-PDF ayinikezwa: izisiphequluli nezifundi eziningi ze-PDF azikwazi ukuyibonisa, futhi ifundi ekwazi ukuyibonisa iyayivala ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ifayela le-HTML yimpendulo esebenzisanayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-animation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Phisa umhlahlandlela ngokunyakaza","summary":"Gcina izingxenye (indawo, ukuboniswa noma ukufihlwa, ukubonakala nombala) nekhamera ngesikhathi esithile, rekhoda izinyathelo zokubuka okuhlukaniswe, udlale izibuko ngokulandelana, bese udlala lapha noma ulondoloze ividiyo.","section":"tasks","order":167,"keywords":["illustrate","ukunyakaza","ikhiye","isikhathi","ukunyakaza kokuhlukanisa","ikhamera","ividiyo","webm","mp4","dlala"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimation\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey everything\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the selected parts\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the camera\u003C/span\u003E zigcina ukuthi izinto zimi kanjani manje esikhathini samanje: indawo yengxenye ngayinye, ukuthi iyaboniswa yini, ukubonakala kwayo nombala wayo, nekhamera. Shintsha isimo, hudula i-slider ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETime\u003C/span\u003E, bese ugcina futhi: ukunyakaza kudlula kusuka kwesikhiye esisodwa kuya kwesilandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecord the exploded view\u003C/span\u003E yengeza isikhiye esisodwa ngesinyathelo ngasinye sokubuka okuhlukaniswe kwesimo, isekhondi ngesinyathelo, ngemuva kwalokho okusekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews as camera stops\u003C/span\u003E idlala izibuko ngokulandelana: ikhamera ihamba iye kuzo ngayinye, ilinde kuyo, futhi izingxenye zithatha izimo zombono ngamunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPause\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoop\u003C/span\u003E zidlala embonweni; izikhiye zengxenye ngayinye nezekhamera ziyadweba (chofoza isikhiye ukuze uye esikhathini saso). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E ibhala i-WebM noma i-MP4 (lapho isiphequluli singayikhodisa khona) noma izithombe njengezithombe ze-PNG ku-ZIP.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkunyakaza kugcinwa ngefomethi efanayo nesebenzisa i-Animate workspace ye-ModelCraft. Umhleli wayo wamajika nemiklamo yayo kuseyeModelCraft okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula isigaba se-Animation: Key everything, Key the selected parts kanye Key the camera zigcina ukuthi izinto zimi kanjani manje esikhathini samanje: indawo yengxenye ngayinye, ukuthi iyaboniswa yini, ukubonakala kwayo nombala wayo, nekhamera. Shintsha isimo, hudula i-slider ye-Time, bese ugcina futhi: ukunyakaza kudlula kusuka kwesikhiye esisodwa kuya kwesilandelayo. Record the exploded view yengeza isikhiye esisodwa ngesinyathelo ngasinye sokubuka okuhlukaniswe kwesimo, isekhondi ngesinyathelo, ngemuva kwalokho okusekhona. Views as camera stops idlala izibuko ngokulandelana: ikhamera ihamba iye kuzo ngayinye, ilinde kuyo, futhi izingxenye zithatha izimo zombono ngamunye. Play, Pause, Stop kanye Loop zidlala embonweni; izikhiye zengxenye ngayinye nezekhamera ziyadweba (chofoza isikhiye ukuze uye esikhathini saso). Save video ibhala i-WebM noma i-MP4 (lapho isiphequluli singayikhodisa khona) noma izithombe njengezithombe ze-PNG ku-ZIP. Ukunyakaza kugcinwa ngefomethi efanayo nesebenzisa i-Animate workspace ye-ModelCraft. Umhleli wayo wamajika nemiklamo yayo kuseyeModelCraft okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"illustrate-update","scope":"partcraft","title":"Buyekeza incwadi kusuka kwidizayini","summary":"Uma idizayini ishintsha, Buyekeza ilethe izimo nezindawo ezintsha futhi igcine imibono, izincazelo, izinombolo zamabhaluni nezinkinobho zokunyakaza. Ubona okuhambile, okusha nokususiwe ngaphambi kokuthi kukhona okushintsha; kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":168,"keywords":["illustrate","buyekeza","ukushintsha kwedizayini","ukubuyekezwa","ukuvumelanisa","inhlanganisela eshintshiwe","umbiko"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza kusuka kwidizayini…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwegama lencwadi, bese ukhetha ingxenye noma inhlanganisela evulekile, noma ifayela (uhlobo olufanayo nalo ncwadi eyenziwa ngalo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbiko uveza okuzoshintsha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuhambile\u003C/strong\u003E: izingxenye, nokuthi zihamba kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintsha kwesimo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkusha\u003C/strong\u003E: izingxenye, ezibonakala kuyo yonke imibono, zingekho ibhaluni lenombolo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkususiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: izingxenye ezisuswayo, namanothi nezinkinobho zokunyakaza ezazibhekisele kuzo: nazo ziyasuswa, futhi zibalwa lapha ukuze lutho lungalahlwa ngokungazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuqanjwe kabusha\u003C/strong\u003E: izingxenye ezishintshe igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyisebenzise. Izingxenye zihlanganiswa ngesazisi sazo sedizayini, ngakho imibono, izincazelo, izinombolo zamabhaluni nezinkinobho zihlala nazo. Buyekeza ingumnyathelo owodwa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela incwadi njengoba yayinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Chofoza Buyekeza kusuka kwidizayini… ngaphansi kwegama lencwadi, bese ukhetha ingxenye noma inhlanganisela evulekile, noma ifayela (uhlobo olufanayo nalo ncwadi eyenziwa ngalo). Umbiko uveza okuzoshintsha: Okuhambile: izingxenye, nokuthi zihamba kangakanani. Ukushintsha kwesimo. Okusha: izingxenye, ezibonakala kuyo yonke imibono, zingekho ibhaluni lenombolo okwamanje. Okususiwe: izingxenye ezisuswayo, namanothi nezinkinobho zokunyakaza ezazibhekisele kuzo: nazo ziyasuswa, futhi zibalwa lapha ukuze lutho lungalahlwa ngokungazi. Okuqanjwe kabusha: izingxenye ezishintshe igama. Chofoza Buyekeza ukuze uyisebenzise. Izingxenye zihlanganiswa ngesazisi sazo sedizayini, ngakho imibono, izincazelo, izinombolo zamabhaluni nezinkinobho zihlala nazo. Buyekeza ingumnyathelo owodwa: Hlehlisa ibuyisela incwadi njengoba yayinjalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"partcraft","title":"Yenza ingxenye ehlanganyelwe ne-Live TeamWork","summary":"Yini eshintsha ku-PartCraft lapho useseseshini ye-Live TeamWork kusuka ku-CadCraft Studio: izakhiwo zonke ogqinisweni olulodwa, wonke amawindi akha isolidi efanayo, ukuhlehlisa kwakho, nokujoyina usebhulawuzeni kunethiwekhi efanayo.","section":"tasks","order":199,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","ndawonye","sebenzisana","iseshini","yabelana live","joyina","ihlahla lezakhiwo","umlando","ukwakha kabusha","isikhombi","ukhetho","bona omunye nomunye","amagama","umbala","ukukhetha","ukuhlehlisa","umphathi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"wonke-umuntu-umodela-ngesikhathi-esisodwa","text":"Wonke umuntu umodela ngesikhathi esisodwa","level":2},{"id":"babonane","text":"Babonane","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-okwakho","text":"Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa okwakho","level":2},{"id":"joyina-kusiphequluli","text":"Joyina kusiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"lapho-iseshini-iphela","text":"Lapho iseshini iphela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYini eyenzeka engxenyeni lapho abantu abaningana bemodela ngesikhathi esisodwa. I-CadCraft Studio iqala futhi ijoyine iseshini ye-Live TeamWork (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi lingokwengxenye ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wonke-umuntu-umodela-ngesikhathi-esisodwa\"\u003EWonke umuntu umodela ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu usebenza ohlahleni olufanayo lwezakhiwo: izikethi, ukuhudulwa, izimbobo, amaphethini, ukugoqa, imingcele. Okuhlelwa kwakho kuvela ngokushesha; okwabanye kuvela ngemva kwesikhashana bakwenza. Kuhamba kuphela isihlahla: ngasinye isikhwama sakha isolidi ngaso, futhi i-kernel ye-PartCraft yakha isolidi efanayo kusihlahla esifanayo kuwo wonke amawindi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbantu ababili beshintsha isakhiwo esisodwa:\u003C/strong\u003E izilungiselelo ezihlukile (enye ukujula, enye uhlobo lokuphela) zombili ziyagcinwa; isilungiselelo esifanayo siya kokokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikethi\u003C/strong\u003E sihamba siphelele: uma abantu ababili behlela isikethi esisodwa ngesikhathi esisodwa, owokugcina uyanqoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo esakhelwe kwesisusiwe ngomuntu\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuhudula kwesikethi esisusiwe, imbobo ebusweni obususiwe) siyathathwa, futhi ibha yesimo ithi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlela kabusha isihlahla\u003C/strong\u003E kuyahlolwa: uma abantu ababili bedonsa izakhiwo ngesikhathi esisodwa, ukunyakaza kwesibili kuyathathwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"babonane\"\u003EBabonane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu oseseshini unombala wakhe. Ubona isikhombi sComuntu ngamunye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze, ebusweni abakhomba kuyo. Uma bekhethe isakhiwo ohlahleni, igama lesakhiwo likhombisa ngemuva kwegama labo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhombi, amagama nokukhethwa kukhona seshini kuphela: aziqondi efayeleni futhi azingeni ohlehlisweni lomuntu. Ziyashelela kulapho umuntu ngamunye ekhona, ngakho zihlala zibushelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-okwakho\"\u003EUkuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa okwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlehlisa ukuhlela kwakho kokugcina futhi ishiye ezukaboni bonke. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo kusukela ngaleso sikhathi, akukho ehlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo ithi ngubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joyina-kusiphequluli\"\u003EJoyina kusiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmngane ongenaye i-Studio angaskena isithombe ngaphansi kwekhodi yomphathi ngefoni, ithebulethi noma ikhompyutha kunethiwekhi efanayo. I-PartCraft ivula kusiphequluli, igcwaliswe yingxenye yomphathi uma umphathi evumela, bese iyakha. Isixhumanisi sokumemela singenza umuntu ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan kuhlelo, abanye bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela uma iseshini yomphathi ivuliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-iseshini-iphela\"\u003ELapho iseshini iphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphathi yedwa ulondoloza ingxenye. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yilondoloze uma ufuna ukuyigcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlanganisela aziyabelwani seshini okwamanje: vula ingxenye ngokwayo ukuze usebenze kuyo ndawonye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Yini eyenzeka engxenyeni lapho abantu abaningana bemodela ngesikhathi esisodwa. I-CadCraft Studio iqala futhi ijoyine iseshini ye-Live TeamWork (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi lingokwengxenye ngokwayo. Wonke umuntu umodela ngesikhathi esisodwa Wonke umuntu usebenza ohlahleni olufanayo lwezakhiwo: izikethi, ukuhudulwa, izimbobo, amaphethini, ukugoqa, imingcele. Okuhlelwa kwakho kuvela ngokushesha; okwabanye kuvela ngemva kwesikhashana bakwenza. Kuhamba kuphela isihlahla: ngasinye isikhwama sakha isolidi ngaso, futhi i-kernel ye-PartCraft yakha isolidi efanayo kusihlahla esifanayo kuwo wonke amawindi. Abantu ababili beshintsha isakhiwo esisodwa: izilungiselelo ezihlukile (enye ukujula, enye uhlobo lokuphela) zombili ziyagcinwa; isilungiselelo esifanayo siya kokokugcina. Isikethi sihamba siphelele: uma abantu ababili behlela isikethi esisodwa ngesikhathi esisodwa, owokugcina uyanqoba. Isakhiwo esakhelwe kwesisusiwe ngomuntu (ukuhudula kwesikethi esisusiwe, imbobo ebusweni obususiwe) siyathathwa, futhi ibha yesimo ithi kungani. Ukuhlela kabusha isihlahla kuyahlolwa: uma abantu ababili bedonsa izakhiwo ngesikhathi esisodwa, ukunyakaza kwesibili kuyathathwa. Babonane Wonke umuntu oseseshini unombala wakhe. Ubona isikhombi sComuntu ngamunye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze, ebusweni abakhomba kuyo. Uma bekhethe isakhiwo ohlahleni, igama lesakhiwo likhombisa ngemuva kwegama labo. Izikhombi, amagama nokukhethwa kukhona seshini kuphela: aziqondi efayeleni futhi azingeni ohlehlisweni lomuntu. Ziyashelela kulapho umuntu ngamunye ekhona, ngakho zihlala zibushelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane. Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa okwakho Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa ukuhlela kwakho kokugcina futhi ishiye ezukaboni bonke. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo kusukela ngaleso sikhathi, akukho ehlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo ithi ngubani. Joyina kusiphequluli Umngane ongenaye i-Studio angaskena isithombe ngaphansi kwekhodi yomphathi ngefoni, ithebulethi noma ikhompyutha kunethiwekhi efanayo. I-PartCraft ivula kusiphequluli, igcwaliswe yingxenye yomphathi uma umphathi evumela, bese iyakha. Isixhumanisi sokumemela singenza umuntu ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan kuhlelo, abanye bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela uma iseshini yomphathi ivuliwe. Lapho iseshini iphela Umphathi yedwa ulondoloza ingxenye. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yilondoloze uma ufuna ukuyigcina. Izinhlanganisela aziyabelwani seshini okwamanje: vula ingxenye ngokwayo ukuze usebenze kuyo ndawonye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuza kusuka kwenye imodeli eyi-parametric","summary":"Indlela izinkambiso zabamodeli bezingxenye ze-parametric zedeskithophu ezihambisana ne-PartCraft, nomehluko oyibhidla abasebenzisi abanolwazi ngehora lokuqala.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["ukushintsha","ukudlulisa","ejwayelekile","umphathi wezakhi","isihlahla sokwakha","isilinganiso esihlakaniphile","i-boss extrude","i-cut extrude","umsizi womgodi","ukuxhuma","ukutholwa kokuphazamiseka","ibha yokubuyela emuva","umphathi wezakhiwo","mouse","umehluko"],"headings":[{"id":"izinkambiso-zihlelwe","text":"Izinkambiso, zihlelwe","level":2},{"id":"umehluko-oyibhidla-abantu","text":"Umehluko oyibhidla abantu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma wenza izingxenye ku-SolidWorks, iningi lemibono ye-PartCraft liyakujwayela: izikethi ezisezindizeni engaphambili, engaphezulu nengakwesokudla, ukuxhumana kanye nezilinganiso ezihlakaniphile, umlando wezakhi onebha yokubuyela emuva, nezinhlanganisela ezibekwe ngokuxhuma. Indlela yokufinyelela kuzo ihluke ezindaweni ezithile, futhi lokhu kwakha kokuqala kwenza kancane. Leli khasi lihlanganisa izinkambiso zakho nezinto ezikumangaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambiso-zihlelwe\"\u003EIzinkambiso, zihlelwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOjwayele ukukusebenzisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-PartCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsihlahla sokwakha ngakwesobunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmlando ngakwesobunxele: izindiza, bese izakhi, izikethi zingeniwe ngaphansi kwesakhi esizisebenzisayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindiza ezintathu engaphambili, engaphezulu nengakwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindiza ezintathu ezifanayo, ngomsuka. Front ingu-XY, Top ingu-XZ, Right ingu-YZ; Y ibheka phezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi endizeni noma ebusweni, bese ikhona yokuqinisekisa ukuphuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) endizeni ekhethiwe noma ebusweni obuthe; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuze kuvale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso esihlakaniphile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Chofoza izinto ezimbili noma ezimbili, bese ubeka lapho inombolo iyakhona. Lapho ubeka khona kukhetha ukuthi iyithe xaxa, ime, noma ihambisane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza ukuxhumana ephaneli yezakhiwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha izinto, bese izinkinobho zokuxhumana ephaneli yesokudla (Ukuhlangana, Okuthe xaxa, Okuhambisanayo, Okuthinta, Okulinganayo njalo njalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuxhumana okuzenzakalelayo ngenkathi udweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinamathelisi zengeza ukuxhumana kwephoyinti, ephoyinteni elisemgqeni, okuthe xaxa nokumile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibala yesikethi obuluhlaza / omnyama / obomvu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono ofanayo: obuluhlaza kuze kube ngukuchazwa okungaphelele, omnyama uchazwe ngokuphelele, obomvu uchazwe ngokweqile. Ichiphu likhombisa amadigri enkululeko asele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo samasiyingi azungezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa umugqa wesisekelo wokuqala uma ungakhethi enye i-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfillet yesikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) esikethini: chofoza ikhona, bese uthayipha umsakazo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha kwejiyomethri yokwakha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss ngokukhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E: Blind, Mid-plane, Up to face / next / vertex, Offset from face, indlela yesibili, i-taper, ikhonkco elilodwa (Khetha izifunda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusika ngokukhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E: iqala njenge-Through all; shintsha ibe yi-Blind ukuze ube yimbobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss / ukusika ngokujikeleza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusikwa okujikelezayo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndiza / i-axis / iphoyinti lesethenjwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndiza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-axis\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EIzindiza zesethenjwa, ama-axis namaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss noma ukusika okuhanjiswe noma okulotshiwe, uhlaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E ezindizeni ezithe xaxa (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft nohlaka\u003C/a\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (zidinga i-exact kernel)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsizi womgodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E kuwo wonke amaphoyinti esikethi angaxhunyiwe: okulula, i-counterbore, i-countersink (90° / 82°) noma i-tapped ISO metric M2–M24, edlule noma i-blind\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumo oqondile / ojikelezayo, isibuko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlayini\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokujikeleza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibuko\u003C/span\u003E (izakhi noma umzimba wonke)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet ne-chamfer emaphethelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza isiphetho, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza okuningi, bese uchofoza inkinobho. Irediyasi eyodwa; ama-chamfer alinganayo, anamabanga amabili noma ibanga nengeli. Kule nguqulo kuphela amaphethelo aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa, nama-round ahlangana endaweni eyodwa abe mitred. Round noma bevel amaphethelo ajikelezayo esikethini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E esikethini, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugoba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ubuso obuthe ukuze uvule, bese uchofoza inkinobho. Ubukhulu bodonga bunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E: lifundwa njengama-triangle, umzimba oqinile wokwakha phezu kwawo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela isakhi, bese OK\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isakhi; shintsha izinombolo ngakwesokudla; sakhiwa kabusha ngesikhathi uthayipha. Akukho OK, akukho Khansela: sebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela isikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili isikethi emlandweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkha kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuzenzakalela ngemva kwayo yonke inguquko. Akukho nkinobho yokwakha kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVimbela / khipha ekuvinjelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVimbela\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ekuvinjelweni\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ibha yokubuyela emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela lapha\u003C/span\u003E esakhini; chofoza &quot;Rollback bar · roll forward&quot; ukuze ubuyele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa isakhi esihlahleni ukuze ulungise indawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; kuyenqatshwa nesizathu lapho ingaphula ukuncika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela izilinganiso ngokuchofoza kabili emodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha isakhi: izilinganiso zesikethi sayo zidwebelwe ephaneli yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzixhumanisi: ezihlangene, ezigxile, ibanga, i-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): khetha ubuso obuthe engxenyeni ngayinye; uxhumanisi ubeka ubuso nobuso. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E se-axis sisebenza njenge-concentric; \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlehliswa\u003C/strong\u003E njengebanga; \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona\u003C/strong\u003E njenge-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye emisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye yokuqala imisiwe; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ingxenye emisiwe\u003C/span\u003E iyashintsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaka ingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ikopi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E (enye ikhophi) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka\u003C/span\u003E (kusuka efayelini lengxenye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela ingxenye enhlanganiselweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkutholwa kokuphazamiseka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkugqekeza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhambisa ingxenye ukuze ubone ukunyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa isilayidi sekona noma sokuhlehliswa koxhumanisi ojikelezayo noma ohambayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E iyazula. Ingxenye engenaxhumanisi: \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ngesandla\u003C/strong\u003E (imicibisholo oyidonsayo, noma amanani abhalwayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa / hlola\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): amabanga, amakona, imisakazo, izindawo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhiwo zobuningi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono oqhekeziwe, uhlu lwezinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwinhlanganisela ingenalutho okukhethiwe: \u003Cstrong\u003EImibono echazwayo\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwezinto\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzakhiwo zobuningi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E: ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi, yesiqinile esinamaphethelo amancane (kuncane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo). Ayikho inqwaba: azikho izinto okwamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza, Londoloza njenge-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E idawuniloda \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E inezinhlobo ze-STL, 3MF, i-STEP enembile (AP242 noma AP214), i-STEP enamaphethelo, DXF kanye nomdwebo we-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza umdwebo wengxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E: ishidi le-A3 elizenzakalelayo nemibono emithathu, isometric, isigaba esisodwa, isiqephu esisodwa, ama-datum, amafreyimu ezilawuli ze-feature kanye nezimpawu zokuqeda. Osayizi bejwayelekile kuphela ababalwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudonsa ukuze kuzungezwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudonsa kwesokunxele kuzungeza embonweni. Ukudonsa kwephakathi noma kwesokudla kuhambisa umbono. Isikrolo sisondeza endaweni yesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuma kwemibono, Bheka ngqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBheka ngqo\u003C/span\u003E ngobuso, indiza noma isikethi okhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulingana kwesikrini (F)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E (esikethini, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingumsebenzi we-Fillet)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho. Ukudonsa ngesokudla kuhambisa umbono; esikethini, ukuchofoza ngesokudla kuphetha ikhonkco lemigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma izandla zakho ziyazi i-SolidWorks, khetha isitayela semenyu i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsihlahla sezakhi\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E: iribhoni yamathebhu e-Features, Sketch, Surfaces, Evaluate, Drawing, Assembly ne-View, inkinobho ephakathi iyazungeza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ephakathi ziyahambisa, nenkinobho yesokunxele ikhetha kuphela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"partcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umehluko-oyibhidla-abantu\"\u003EUmehluko oyibhidla abantu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikethi siphelele yiphrofayili.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Extrude ne-Revolve zisebenzisa yonke ilophu evaliwe esikethini. Awukwazi ukukhetha isifunda esisodwa noma ikhonkco elilodwa lesikethi ukuze uthole isakhi. Sebenzisa isikethi esisodwa ngesakhi ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikethi esithathwa yisakhi.\u003C/strong\u003E Isakhi sisebenzisa isikethi osivale ngokugcina noma esikhethwe emlandweni. Uma ungakhethi lutho sithatha isikethi esisha kakhulu esingasetshenziswa yisakhi. Uma uthola esingafanele, khetha isikethi esifanele bese ukhetha isakhi futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko zisebenza njengoba uthayipha.\u003C/strong\u003E Alikho idayalogi yesakhi enokuthi OK noCancel. Yonke inombolo yakha kabusha ngokushesha, futhi i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yindlela yokubuyela. Uhlu lokuHlehlisa luhlanganisa izinguquko zesikethi, izakhi nezilungiselelo ngokufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkweqile kokuchazwa akuvunyelwa ukuhlala kungaqondakali.\u003C/strong\u003E Alikho izilinganiso ezishayelwayo (ezisezinkomba). Isilinganiso esilungiswe yizinye izixhumanisi sibikwa njengesiweqile (&quot;sase sinomkhawulo. Sisuse.&quot;). Isilinganiso esiphikisanayo sishiya i-geometry ingashintshi futhi sibe bomvu. Susa esisodwa, noma hlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-sweep nama-loft akakakhiwa; ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell nama-draft anemikhawulo.\u003C/strong\u003E Le nguqulo ye-PartCraft yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel; ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Mesh kernel&quot; njalo. Ama-fillet ne-chamfer asebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa, futhi lapho ama-round ehlangana endaweni eyodwa, abe mitred, angaxubani. Ama-shell ayavuleka, nama-draft athambeka, ubuso obuthe kuphela. Izakhi ezidinga i-exact kernel zisasebenza, kodwa zithi &quot;akakakhiwa&quot; lapho zikhethwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabili ka-Fillet.\u003C/strong\u003E Esikethini, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) igoqa ikhona yesikethi. Engxenyeni, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini lezakhi igoqa amaphethelo aqinile (amaphethelo aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa kule nguqulo). Alikho i-sweep noma i-loft kule nguqulo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimbobo zidinga amaphoyinti akhululekile.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E ibhola ngamaphoyinti adalwe ngethuluzi le-Point. Izikhungo zendilinga nokuphela komugqa akubalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Through all ingeyokusika kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E I-boss idinga ukujula. Alikho imiphetho ye-&quot;up to vertex / surface / next&quot; okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsiqinile sinamaphethelo amancane.\u003C/strong\u003E Imesh kernel yakha ubuso obugobile ngezinhlangothi ezithe xaxa, ngakho umbono, izivolumu kanye nokuthumela kwe-STL ne-3MF kwakhiwe ngazo: \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yengxenye uyawenza ahlukane kangcono. Ukuthumela kwe-STEP okunembile akukhona: kubhala ubuso obugobile ngomumo wabo wangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamillimitha kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Alikho isilungiselelo se-inch okwamanje. Phindaphinda usayizi we-inch nge-25.4 uma uwubhala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EY iphezulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Indiza ye-Front ibheke wena futhi i-Top ibheke phansi ngengxenye, njengoba ulindele, kodwa i-axis yomhlaba ephezulu yi-Y. Ukuthumela kwe-STL, 3MF kanye ne-STEP enembile kuguqulwa kuye ku-Z ephezulu; i-STEP enamaphethelo igcina i-Y iphezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi ziwubuso, hhayi amapheya e-geometry.\u003C/strong\u003E Uxhumanisi uqala njalo kubuso obuthe ababili obubekwe ubuso nobuso. Ngephini esimgodini, khetha ubuso obuthe obuzungeze umgodi nesigxobo sephini, bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhungo\u003C/strong\u003E ku-axis yomgodi nakuhlo lwe-axis ye-revolve yephini. Izingxenye ezingafinyelelwa yizixhumanisi zihlala lapho zafakwa khona; azikwazi ukudonswa. Izixhumanisi emjikelezweni azixazululwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza kuyidawuniloda.\u003C/strong\u003E Alikho ifayela oligcina lishintshwa njalo. Ukulondoloza ngakunye kuyifayela elisha kwifolda yakho yokudawuniloda. Qamba ingxenye kuqala, bese ugcina amafayela akho kwifolda yephrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlikho imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla, alikho ithebhu yomphathi wemiyalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Konke kusethuluzi nasephaneli yesokudla, futhi ithuluzi liyashintsha ngokuthi usenzani: amathuluzi esikethi avela esikethini kuphela, namathuluzi enhlanganisela enhlanganiselweni kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkhiye abangumlando owodwa esikethini.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zikhetha amathuluzi ngaphandle kokhiye abaguquli. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EOkhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma wenza izingxenye ku-SolidWorks, iningi lemibono ye-PartCraft liyakujwayela: izikethi ezisezindizeni engaphambili, engaphezulu nengakwesokudla, ukuxhumana kanye nezilinganiso ezihlakaniphile, umlando wezakhi onebha yokubuyela emuva, nezinhlanganisela ezibekwe ngokuxhuma. Indlela yokufinyelela kuzo ihluke ezindaweni ezithile, futhi lokhu kwakha kokuqala kwenza kancane. Leli khasi lihlanganisa izinkambiso zakho nezinto ezikumangaza. Izinkambiso, zihlelwe Ojwayele ukukusebenzisa Ku-PartCraft Isihlahla sokwakha ngakwesobunxele Umlando ngakwesobunxele: izindiza, bese izakhi, izikethi zingeniwe ngaphansi kwesakhi esizisebenzisayo Izindiza ezintathu engaphambili, engaphezulu nengakwesokudla Izindiza ezintathu ezifanayo, ngomsuka. Front ingu-XY, Top ingu-XZ, Right ingu-YZ; Y ibheka phezulu Isikethi endizeni noma ebusweni, bese ikhona yokuqinisekisa ukuphuma Isikethi (S) endizeni ekhethiwe noma ebusweni obuthe; Phuma noma Esc kuze kuvale Isilinganiso esihlakaniphile Isilinganiso (D). Chofoza izinto ezimbili noma ezimbili, bese ubeka lapho inombolo iyakhona. Lapho ubeka khona kukhetha ukuthi iyithe xaxa, ime, noma ihambisane Engeza ukuxhumana ephaneli yezakhiwo Khetha izinto, bese izinkinobho zokuxhumana ephaneli yesokudla (Ukuhlangana, Okuthe xaxa, Okuhambisanayo, Okuthinta, Okulinganayo njalo njalo) Ukuxhumana okuzenzakalelayo ngenkathi udweba Izinamathelisi zengeza ukuxhumana kwephoyinti, ephoyinteni elisemgqeni, okuthe xaxa nokumile Imibala yesikethi obuluhlaza / omnyama / obomvu Umbono ofanayo: obuluhlaza kuze kube ngukuchazwa okungaphelele, omnyama uchazwe ngokuphelele, obomvu uchazwe ngokweqile. Ichiphu likhombisa amadigri enkululeko asele Isikhungo samasiyingi azungezayo Umugqa wesisekelo (N); Jikeleza isebenzisa umugqa wesisekelo wokuqala uma ungakhethi enye i-axis Ifillet yesikethi Fillet (F) esikethini: chofoza ikhona, bese uthayipha umsakazo Ukushintsha kwejiyomethri yokwakha Ukwakha (Q) Boss ngokukhipha Ukukhipha: Blind, Mid-plane, Up to face / next / vertex, Offset from face, indlela yesibili, i-taper, ikhonkco elilodwa (Khetha izifunda) Ukusika ngokukhipha Sika: iqala njenge-Through all; shintsha ibe yi-Blind ukuze ube yimbobo Boss / ukusika ngokujikeleza Jikeleza / Okwengeziwe › Ukusikwa okujikelezayo Indiza / i-axis / iphoyinti lesethenjwa Okwengeziwe › Indiza, I-axis, Iphoyinti (bona Izindiza zesethenjwa, ama-axis namaphoyinti) Boss noma ukusika okuhanjiswe noma okulotshiwe, uhlaka Okwengeziwe › Uhlaka ezindizeni ezithe xaxa (bona Sweep, loft nohlaka). Sweep no-Loft akakakhiwa kule nguqulo (zidinga i-exact kernel) Umsizi womgodi Imbobo kuwo wonke amaphoyinti esikethi angaxhunyiwe: okulula, i-counterbore, i-countersink (90° / 82°) noma i-tapped ISO metric M2–M24, edlule noma i-blind Umumo oqondile / ojikelezayo, isibuko Olayini, Ngokujikeleza, Isibuko (izakhi noma umzimba wonke) Fillet ne-chamfer emaphethelweni Fillet / Chamfer: chofoza isiphetho, Shift+chofoza okuningi, bese uchofoza inkinobho. Irediyasi eyodwa; ama-chamfer alinganayo, anamabanga amabili noma ibanga nengeli. Kule nguqulo kuphela amaphethelo aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa, nama-round ahlangana endaweni eyodwa abe mitred. Round noma bevel amaphethelo ajikelezayo esikethini (Fillet esikethini, F) Ukugoba Shell: chofoza ubuso obuthe ukuze uvule, bese uchofoza inkinobho. Ubukhulu bodonga bunye Vula ifayela le-STEP Vula: lifundwa njengama-triangle, umzimba oqinile wokwakha phezu kwawo (Vula ifayela le-STEP) Hlela isakhi, bese OK Chofoza isakhi; shintsha izinombolo ngakwesokudla; sakhiwa kabusha ngesikhathi uthayipha. Akukho OK, akukho Khansela: sebenzisa Ctrl+Z Hlela isikethi Chofoza kabili isikethi emlandweni Akha kabusha Kuzenzakalela ngemva kwayo yonke inguquko. Akukho nkinobho yokwakha kabusha Vimbela / khipha ekuvinjelweni Vimbela / Khipha ekuvinjelweni ngakwesokudla Donsa ibha yokubuyela emuva Buyela lapha esakhini; chofoza \"Rollback bar · roll forward\" ukuze ubuyele Donsa isakhi esihlahleni ukuze ulungise indawo Hambisa phezulu / Hambisa phansi noma Alt+↑ / Alt+↓; kuyenqatshwa nesizathu lapho ingaphula ukuncika Hlela izilinganiso ngokuchofoza kabili emodeli Khetha isakhi: izilinganiso zesikethi sayo zidwebelwe ephaneli yesokudla Izixhumanisi: ezihlangene, ezigxile, ibanga, i-engeli Hlanganisa (J): khetha ubuso obuthe engxenyeni ngayinye; uxhumanisi ubeka ubuso nobuso. Isikhungo se-axis sisebenza njenge-concentric; Ukuhlehliswa njengebanga; Ikona njenge-engeli Ingxenye emisiwe Ingxenye yokuqala imisiwe; Yenza ingxenye emisiwe iyashintsha Faka ingxenye Engeza ikopi noma Phinda (enye ikhophi) noma Faka (kusuka efayelini lengxenye) Hlela ingxenye enhlanganiselweni Hlela ingxenye, bese Emuva Ukutholwa kokuphazamiseka Ukugqekeza Ukuhambisa ingxenye ukuze ubone ukunyakaza Donsa isilayidi sekona noma sokuhlehliswa koxhumanisi ojikelezayo noma ohambayo; Hlola ukunyakaza ukuthola ukungqubuzana iyazula. Ingxenye engenaxhumanisi: Hambisa ngesandla (imicibisholo oyidonsayo, noma amanani abhalwayo) Linganisa / hlola Imibono, bese Linganisa (M): amabanga, amakona, imisakazo, izindawo; Izakhiwo zobuningi Umbono oqhekeziwe, uhlu lwezinto Kwinhlanganisela ingenalutho okukhethiwe: Imibono echazwayo kanye Uhlu lwezinto ephaneli yesokudla Izakhiwo zobuningi Ibhokisi le-Ingxenye: ivolumu, indawo yobuso, usayizi, yesiqinile esinamaphethelo amancane (kuncane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo). Ayikho inqwaba: azikho izinto okwamanje Londoloza, Londoloza njenge-STEP Londoloza idawuniloda .partcraft.json; Thumela inezinhlobo ze-STL, 3MF, i-STEP enembile (AP242 noma AP214), i-STEP enamaphethelo, DXF kanye nomdwebo we-PDF Yenza umdwebo wengxenye Umdwebo: ishidi le-A3 elizenzakalelayo nemibono emithathu, isometric, isigaba esisodwa, isiqephu esisodwa, ama-datum, amafreyimu ezilawuli ze-feature kanye nezimpawu zokuqeda. Osayizi bejwayelekile kuphela ababalwa Ukudonsa ukuze kuzungezwe Ukudonsa kwesokunxele kuzungeza embonweni. Ukudonsa kwephakathi noma kwesokudla kuhambisa umbono. Isikrolo sisondeza endaweni yesikhombi Ukuma kwemibono, Bheka ngqo Imenyu ye-Imibono; Bheka ngqo ngobuso, indiza noma isikethi okhethiwe Ukulingana kwesikrini (F) F, noma Lingana (esikethini, F ingumsebenzi we-Fillet) Imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla Akukho. Ukudonsa ngesokudla kuhambisa umbono; esikethini, ukuchofoza ngesokudla kuphetha ikhonkco lemigqa Uma izandla zakho ziyazi i-SolidWorks, khetha isitayela semenyu i-Isihlahla sezakhi ku-Izilungiselelo › PartCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse: iribhoni yamathebhu e-Features, Sketch, Surfaces, Evaluate, Drawing, Assembly ne-View, inkinobho ephakathi iyazungeza, Shift nenkinobho ephakathi ziyahambisa, nenkinobho yesokunxele ikhetha kuphela. Bona Imenyu, okhiye nemouse. Umehluko oyibhidla abantu Isikethi siphelele yiphrofayili. I-Extrude ne-Revolve zisebenzisa yonke ilophu evaliwe esikethini. Awukwazi ukukhetha isifunda esisodwa noma ikhonkco elilodwa lesikethi ukuze uthole isakhi. Sebenzisa isikethi esisodwa ngesakhi ngasinye. Isikethi esithathwa yisakhi. Isakhi sisebenzisa isikethi osivale ngokugcina noma esikhethwe emlandweni. Uma ungakhethi lutho sithatha isikethi esisha kakhulu esingasetshenziswa yisakhi. Uma uthola esingafanele, khetha isikethi esifanele bese ukhetha isakhi futhi. Izinguquko zisebenza njengoba uthayipha. Alikho idayalogi yesakhi enokuthi OK noCancel. Yonke inombolo yakha kabusha ngokushesha, futhi i-Ctrl+Z yindlela yokubuyela. Uhlu lokuHlehlisa luhlanganisa izinguquko zesikethi, izakhi nezilungiselelo ngokufanayo. Ukweqile kokuchazwa akuvunyelwa ukuhlala kungaqondakali. Alikho izilinganiso ezishayelwayo (ezisezinkomba). Isilinganiso esilungiswe yizinye izixhumanisi sibikwa njengesiweqile (\"sase sinomkhawulo. Sisuse.\"). Isilinganiso esiphikisanayo sishiya i-geometry ingashintshi futhi sibe bomvu. Susa esisodwa, noma hlehlisa. Ama-sweep nama-loft akakakhiwa; ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell nama-draft anemikhawulo. Le nguqulo ye-PartCraft yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel; ibha yesimo ithi \"Mesh kernel\" njalo. Ama-fillet ne-chamfer asebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa, futhi lapho ama-round ehlangana endaweni eyodwa, abe mitred, angaxubani. Ama-shell ayavuleka, nama-draft athambeka, ubuso obuthe kuphela. Izakhi ezidinga i-exact kernel zisasebenza, kodwa zithi \"akakakhiwa\" lapho zikhethwa. Bona I-mesh kernel kanye Okungakakhiwa. Amabili ka-Fillet. Esikethini, Fillet (F) igoqa ikhona yesikethi. Engxenyeni, i-Fillet eqenjini lezakhi igoqa amaphethelo aqinile (amaphethelo aqondile phakathi kwezindawo ezithe xaxa kule nguqulo). Alikho i-sweep noma i-loft kule nguqulo: bona Okungakakhiwa. Izimbobo zidinga amaphoyinti akhululekile. Imbobo ibhola ngamaphoyinti adalwe ngethuluzi le-Point. Izikhungo zendilinga nokuphela komugqa akubalwa. I-Through all ingeyokusika kuphela. I-boss idinga ukujula. Alikho imiphetho ye-\"up to vertex / surface / next\" okwamanje. Isiqinile sinamaphethelo amancane. Imesh kernel yakha ubuso obugobile ngezinhlangothi ezithe xaxa, ngakho umbono, izivolumu kanye nokuthumela kwe-STL ne-3MF kwakhiwe ngazo: Amajika ephaneli yengxenye uyawenza ahlukane kangcono. Ukuthumela kwe-STEP okunembile akukhona: kubhala ubuso obugobile ngomumo wabo wangempela. Amamillimitha kuphela. Alikho isilungiselelo se-inch okwamanje. Phindaphinda usayizi we-inch nge-25.4 uma uwubhala. Y iphezulu. Indiza ye-Front ibheke wena futhi i-Top ibheke phansi ngengxenye, njengoba ulindele, kodwa i-axis yomhlaba ephezulu yi-Y. Ukuthumela kwe-STL, 3MF kanye ne-STEP enembile kuguqulwa kuye ku-Z ephezulu; i-STEP enamaphethelo igcina i-Y iphezulu. Izixhumanisi ziwubuso, hhayi amapheya e-geometry. Uxhumanisi uqala njalo kubuso obuthe ababili obubekwe ubuso nobuso. Ngephini esimgodini, khetha ubuso obuthe obuzungeze umgodi nesigxobo sephini, bese usetha Isikhungo ku-axis yomgodi nakuhlo lwe-axis ye-revolve yephini. Izingxenye ezingafinyelelwa yizixhumanisi zihlala lapho zafakwa khona; azikwazi ukudonswa. Izixhumanisi emjikelezweni azixazululwa. Ukulondoloza kuyidawuniloda. Alikho ifayela oligcina lishintshwa njalo. Ukulondoloza ngakunye kuyifayela elisha kwifolda yakho yokudawuniloda. Qamba ingxenye kuqala, bese ugcina amafayela akho kwifolda yephrojekthi. Alikho imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla, alikho ithebhu yomphathi wemiyalo. Konke kusethuluzi nasephaneli yesokudla, futhi ithuluzi liyashintsha ngokuthi usenzani: amathuluzi esikethi avela esikethini kuphela, namathuluzi enhlanganisela enhlanganiselweni kuphela. Okhiye abangumlando owodwa esikethini. L, R, C, A, P, N, F, D, Q kanye S zikhetha amathuluzi ngaphandle kokhiye abaguquli. Bona Okhiye nemouse.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"partcraft","title":"Imenyu, okhiye nemouse","summary":"Khetha isitayela semenyu esihambisana nendlela osuvele usebenza ngayo, nika noma yiliphi umyalo ukhiye wakho, hambisa imiyalo phakathi kwamathebhu e-ribbon, bese usetha okwenziwa yivili nenkinobho ngayinye ku-3D view.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["menu style","menus","ribbon","toolbar","feature tree","keyboard shortcuts","hotkeys","keys","customize","remap","rebind","mouse","wheel","invert","zoom direction","middle button","orbit","pan","export","import","switching","familiar"],"headings":[{"id":"izitayela-ezimbili","text":"Izitayela ezimbili","level":2},{"id":"yenza-kube-ngokwakho","text":"Yenza kube ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"imouse","text":"Imouse","level":2},{"id":"thatha-nawe","text":"Thatha nawe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo ye-PartCraft ifinyelelwa ngendlela efanayo noma yiyiphi. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela semenyu\u003C/strong\u003E sinquma kuphela lapho zihlala khona esikrinini, lapho zibizwa khona nokuthi yiziphi okhiye ezizisebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyakukhumbula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitayela-ezimbili\"\u003EIzitayela ezimbili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkutholayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-toolbar yePartCraft: i-workspace switcher, File, Sketch, Features, Drawing, Assembly, Edit ne-View. Okhiye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sketch, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lingana, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E linganisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuka kwesigaba. Qalisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsihlahla sezakhi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-ribbon elungiswe njengoba izinhlelo ze-mechanical CAD ezisekelwe ezici zilungisa zazo: imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E (nazo zonke izinto ezithunyelwayo), izinkinobho ezisheshayo, namathebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzifundo\u003C/span\u003E (izindawo zokusebenza nezithuluzi zazo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E (amathuluzi amanual esikhaleni se-Illustrate; amathuluzi aso ashintsha kuqala abe yi-Illustrate) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E iqala ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/span\u003E, ngoba ingxenye iqala ngesketch. Okhiye abengeziwe: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E extrude, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hole, kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese inhlamvu yombono: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E front, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E back, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E top, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bottom, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E right, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E left, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isometric, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E normal to. Ku-3D view inkinobho ephakathi iyazungeza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ephakathi ishelelisa, inkinobho yesokudla ishelelisa kanti inkinobho yokunxele ikhetha kuphela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZonke izitayela zigcina \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lenye indawo yokusebenza liyashintsha liye kuyo kuqala; ithuluzi le-Design elikhethwe kwenye indawo yokusebenza libuyela ku-Design kuqala. Amathuluzi e-sketch alinda i-sketch, amathuluzi okudweba alinda ishidi lokudweba, amathuluzi kahlanganiso alinda uhlanganiso: ibha yesimo ikutshela okufanele uqale ngakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphakathi kwe-sketch, esihlokweni sokudweba, kuhlanganiso nakwezinye izindawo zokusebenza, izinhlamvu zigcina incazelo yazo lapho (i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umugqa, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E irektangele, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuhlangana …) kuzo zonke izitayela. I-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezimpini zigcina okwazo njalo. Okhiye bolungiselelo lwePartCraft isitayela sakho esabela komunye umyalo abalungeli ukusebenza, kanti ibha yesimo ikhombisa lapho umyalo wabo uye khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-kube-ngokwakho\"\u003EYenza kube ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkhiye nemenyu\u003C/span\u003E, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukhiye\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela ukhiye, noma okhiye ababili ngokulandelana. Chofoza ukhiye ukuze ukususe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgombala we-ribbon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELapho ihlala khona\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa umyalo kwelinye ithebhu nepaneli, kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkhiye kuphela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImouse\u003C/span\u003E, setha ivili, izinkinobho ezishelelisa i-sketch, nokuthi yini inkinobho ngayinye ku-3D view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYinike igama bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe kuqala kwenza ikopi yakho (&quot;My Feature tree&quot;); esakhelwe kuqala asishintshi nanini. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili, noma olandela ukhiye wamagama amabili angakayithayiphwa, ubonakala ngokubomvu futhi kumele ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imouse\"\u003EImouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvili lemouse\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E (isiqalo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphandle\u003C/span\u003E, nokuthi kusheshe kangakanani. I-pinch yetrackpad isondeza njalo ngendlela eminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShelelisa i-sketch nge\u003C/strong\u003E: inkinobho ephakathi, inkinobho yesokudla, noma zombili. Ukuchofoza ngakwesokudla ku-sketch kusaqeda isinyathelo sethuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa ku-3D view\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEyomibuko ngamunye\u003C/span\u003E igcina isethingi ye-PartCraft (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E: kwesokunxele kuzungeza, noma inkinobho ephakathi izungeza). Noma setha inkinobho ngayinye ukuthi izungeze, ishelelise, isondeze noma ingenzi lutho; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho yokuzungeza iyashelelisa. Ukuchofoza okungadonsi kukhethe kusaqhubeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thatha-nawe\"\u003EThatha nawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E igcina isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa…\u003C/span\u003E iyengeza, ivela kolunye ikhompyutha noma kumsebenzisi ohlangene naye. Ifayela elingenisiwe lingakhomba kuphela imiyalo yePartCraft: okunye okukuwo kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe ebhalweni yesimo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa lesi sitayela\u003C/span\u003E isusa esinye sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi siphequluli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa leli sitayela kuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza ukuthi zonke izinhlelo zivule ngesitayela esihambisanayo (i-toolbar yazo, noma i-ribbon), nezinguquko ozenzile kwenye ngayinye. Ukukhetha esinye isitayela kuhlelo olulodwa kushintsha lolo hlelo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EOkhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"partcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkusuka kwenye imodeler eyiparametric\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imiyalo ye-PartCraft ifinyelelwa ngendlela efanayo noma yiyiphi. Isitayela semenyu sinquma kuphela lapho zihlala khona esikrinini, lapho zibizwa khona nokuthi yiziphi okhiye ezizisebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,) › PartCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyakukhumbula. Izitayela ezimbili Isitayela Okutholayo PartCraft I-toolbar yePartCraft: i-workspace switcher, File, Sketch, Features, Drawing, Assembly, Edit ne-View. Okhiye S sketch, F lingana, M linganisa, X ukubuka kwesigaba. Qalisa. Isihlahla sezakhi I-ribbon elungiswe njengoba izinhlelo ze-mechanical CAD ezisekelwe ezici zilungisa zazo: imenyu ye-Ifayela (nazo zonke izinto ezithunyelwayo), izinkinobho ezisheshayo, namathebhu Izici, Isikethi, Ubuso, Hlola, Umdwebo, Inhlanganisela, Izifundo (izindawo zokusebenza nezithuluzi zazo), Illustrate (amathuluzi amanual esikhaleni se-Illustrate; amathuluzi aso ashintsha kuqala abe yi-Illustrate) kanye ne-Ukubuka. Izici iqala ngo-Isikethi, ngoba ingxenye iqala ngesketch. Okhiye abengeziwe: E extrude, H hole, kanye V bese inhlamvu yombono: V F front, V B back, V T top, V O bottom, V R right, V L left, V I isometric, V N normal to. Ku-3D view inkinobho ephakathi iyazungeza, Shift nenkinobho ephakathi ishelelisa, inkinobho yesokudla ishelelisa kanti inkinobho yokunxele ikhetha kuphela. Zonke izitayela zigcina Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D ne-Ctrl+A. Ithuluzi lenye indawo yokusebenza liyashintsha liye kuyo kuqala; ithuluzi le-Design elikhethwe kwenye indawo yokusebenza libuyela ku-Design kuqala. Amathuluzi e-sketch alinda i-sketch, amathuluzi okudweba alinda ishidi lokudweba, amathuluzi kahlanganiso alinda uhlanganiso: ibha yesimo ikutshela okufanele uqale ngakho. Ngaphakathi kwe-sketch, esihlokweni sokudweba, kuhlanganiso nakwezinye izindawo zokusebenza, izinhlamvu zigcina incazelo yazo lapho (i-L umugqa, i-R irektangele, i-J ukuhlangana …) kuzo zonke izitayela. I-Delete, i-Esc, i-Enter, i-Tab, i-Space nezimpini zigcina okwazo njalo. Okhiye bolungiselelo lwePartCraft isitayela sakho esabela komunye umyalo abalungeli ukusebenza, kanti ibha yesimo ikhombisa lapho umyalo wabo uye khona. Yenza kube ngokwakho Khetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza Lungisa…. Ku-Okhiye nemenyu, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza), Engeza ukhiye bese ucindezela ukhiye, noma okhiye ababili ngokulandelana. Chofoza ukhiye ukuze ukususe. Ngombala we-ribbon, Lapho ihlala khona ihambisa umyalo kwelinye ithebhu nepaneli, kumenyu ye-Ifayela, noma ku-Okhiye kuphela. Ku-Imouse, setha ivili, izinkinobho ezishelelisa i-sketch, nokuthi yini inkinobho ngayinye ku-3D view. Yinike igama bese uchofoza Londoloza. Ukulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe kuqala kwenza ikopi yakho (\"My Feature tree\"); esakhelwe kuqala asishintshi nanini. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili, noma olandela ukhiye wamagama amabili angakayithayiphwa, ubonakala ngokubomvu futhi kumele ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze. Imouse Ivili lemouse: Ukuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphakathi (isiqalo) noma Ukuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphandle, nokuthi kusheshe kangakanani. I-pinch yetrackpad isondeza njalo ngendlela eminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo. Shelelisa i-sketch nge: inkinobho ephakathi, inkinobho yesokudla, noma zombili. Ukuchofoza ngakwesokudla ku-sketch kusaqeda isinyathelo sethuluzi. Donsa ku-3D view: Eyomibuko ngamunye igcina isethingi ye-PartCraft (Izilungiselelo › PartCraft: kwesokunxele kuzungeza, noma inkinobho ephakathi izungeza). Noma setha inkinobho ngayinye ukuthi izungeze, ishelelise, isondeze noma ingenzi lutho; Shift nenkinobho yokuzungeza iyashelelisa. Ukuchofoza okungadonsi kukhethe kusaqhubeka. Thatha nawe Thumela igcina isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane .ccinput.json; Ngenisa… iyengeza, ivela kolunye ikhompyutha noma kumsebenzisi ohlangene naye. Ifayela elingenisiwe lingakhomba kuphela imiyalo yePartCraft: okunye okukuwo kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe ebhalweni yesimo. Susa lesi sitayela isusa esinye sakho. Lezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi siphequluli. Sebenzisa leli sitayela kuzo zonke izinhlelo ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza ukuthi zonke izinhlelo zivule ngesitayela esihambisanayo (i-toolbar yazo, noma i-ribbon), nezinguquko ozenzile kwenye ngayinye. Ukukhetha esinye isitayela kuhlelo olulodwa kushintsha lolo hlelo kuphela. Okuhlobene: Okhiye nemouse · Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft · Ukusuka kwenye imodeler eyiparametric","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"partcraft","title":"Okhiye nemouse","summary":"Yonke imfishane yekhibhodi nesenzo se-mouse kuPartCraft, ihlelwe ngendawo esebenza kuyo: noma kuphi, ukukopisha nokunamathisela, kungxenye, ku-3D view, ku-sketch, emlandweni nakuhlanganiso.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","izimfishane","izinkinobho ezishisayo","okhiye","imouse","ukuzungeza","phendula","shelelisa","sondeza","wheel","chofoza ngakwesokudla","hlehlisa","phinda wenze","londoloza","vula","escape","susa","alt arrow","kopisha","namathisela","sika","phinda","khetha konke","inkinobho ephakathi"],"headings":[{"id":"noma-kuphi","text":"Noma kuphi","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-namathisela-nephinde","text":"Kopisha, namathisela nephinde","level":2},{"id":"ku-ngxenye-akukho-sketch-evulekile","text":"Ku-ngxenye (akukho sketch evulekile)","level":2},{"id":"ku-ukubuka-kwe-3d","text":"Ku-ukubuka kwe-3D","level":2},{"id":"ngenkathi-ukhetha-imiphetho-noma-ubuso-be-fillet-i-chamfer-noma-i-shell","text":"Ngenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma ubuso be-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell","level":2},{"id":"esihlokweni-sokudweba","text":"Esihlokweni sokudweba","level":2},{"id":"ku-sketch","text":"Ku-sketch","level":2},{"id":"kubhokisi-lenombolo","text":"Kubhokisi lenombolo","level":3},{"id":"ohlwini-lomlando","text":"Ohlwini lomlando","level":2},{"id":"kuhlanganiso","text":"Kuhlanganiso","level":2},{"id":"esikhaleni-sokusebenza-se-script","text":"Esikhaleni sokusebenza se-Script","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-isiphequluli-esingazithatha","text":"Izinkinobho isiphequluli esingazithatha","level":2},{"id":"lapho-i-hambisa-ikhona","text":"Lapho i-Hambisa ikhona","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOkhiye abasebenzi lapho uthayipha kubhokisi epaneli, ngaphandle kwe-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ezisebenza njalo. Okhiye bezinhlamvu basebenza ngaphandle komodifayi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzincazelo ezijwayelekile mayelana nokhiye kusiphequluli, nakumakhibhodi angenawo okhiye bomsebenzi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noma-kuphi\"\u003ENoma kuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza ingxenye (kuhlanganiso: inhlanganisela). Ivala i-sketch evulekile kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ifayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela (ibuza kuqala uma kukhona okungalondolozwanga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula noma uvale lo msizo (futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E kwi-app bar). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nayo iyawuvala. Kumalaptop amaningi namakhibhodi e-Mac, bamba Fn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodi yesikrini: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, isikrini esigcwele nezinhlamvu zifihliwe. Control nakwi-Mac, hhayi ⌘\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhuma kusikrini esigcwele (uma usesikrinini esigcwele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, kubandakanya ithebhu ye-PartCraft (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubhokisi lenombolo epaneli, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwukuhlehlisa kombhalo wesiphequluli. Kubhokisi lenombolo ngaphezu kwesilinganiso se-sketch, ihlehlisa kwi-PartCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-namathisela-nephinde\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela nephinde\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZisebenza kokusebenzayo: ijiyometri ekhethiwe ku-sketch evulekile, isici esikhethiwe emlandweni, noma ingxenye ekhethiwe kuhlanganiso. Imininingwane ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela nephinde\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika: kopisha, bese usula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela. Ku-sketch ikhophi ilandela iphoyinti: chofoza lapho okuyoya khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela endaweni efanayo: amakhonjana afanayo (kuhlanganiso, indawo efanayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda: kopisha futhi unamathisele ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ingabi nalutho ku-clipboard\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke (ku-sketch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha lutho (futhi ukhansele ukunamathisela okulandela iphoyinti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubhokisi lenombolo, lezi zinkinobho zikopisha futhi zinamathisele umbhalo njengoba kujwayelekile. Umbhalo okhethiwe kupaneli ukopishwa yisiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ngxenye-akukho-sketch-evulekile\"\u003EKu-ngxenye (akukho sketch evulekile)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketch ekhethiwe kundiza noma ebusweni obuncane obukhethiwe; uma kungakhethwanga lutho, khetha indawo ngokuchofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana ingxenye ku-view\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa, kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza nakuhlanganiso; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isula okukhethiwe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi iyavala (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"partcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa amakhaza, ama-engeli nobuningi\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka kwesigaba ukuvula noma ukuvala, kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza nakuhlanganiso; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyavala (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/section-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/section-view\"\u003EBheka ngaphakathi ngokubuka kwesigaba\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa isici esikhethiwe (ibuza uma ezinye zisisebenzisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"0\"\u003E0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E … \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"9\"\u003E9\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E9\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\".\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENesici esikhethiwe: thayipha inombolo yaso enkulu (ukujula kwe-Extrude, ububanzi be-Hole, inani lephethini, iradiyasi ye-fillet …), bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina eyakudala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa isici esikhethiwe, uma kukhethiwe esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYeka ukukhetha indiza ye-sketch, noma sula ukukhetha (kuhlanganisa imiphetho noma ubuso obukhethwe nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ukubuka-kwe-3d\"\u003EKu-ukubuka kwe-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza kuqala kukho ukuze kube nokugxila kwekhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula ukubuka ngamadigri angu-15\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezinye izimpini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yokunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula (zungeza) ukubuka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ⌘ ibanjwe ngenkathi udonsa ngenkinobho yokunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQhubeka ngevili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza endaweni yesikhombi (ukuya ngaphandle kuya ngaphakathi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuswayipha ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula ukubuka; nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, shelelisa. Pinch isondeza. Kusethwe yi-\u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E kuzilungiselelo ze-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENge-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphendula ukubuka: Inkinobho ephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E kuzilungiselelo ze-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/a\u003E, inkinobho ephakathi iphendula ukubuka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla kushelelisa, bese inkinobho yokunxele ikhetha kuphela. | Chofoza | Khetha ubuso (buyagqamiswa bonke), umphetho noma indiza | | \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza umphetho noma ubuso | Qoqa imiphetho noma ubuso obuningi | | Chofoza isikhala esingenalutho | Sula ukukhetha |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenkathi-ukhetha-imiphetho-noma-ubuso-be-fillet-i-chamfer-noma-i-shell\"\u003ENgenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma ubuso be-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye noma imouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza umphetho noma ubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza, noma uyikhiphe uma isuvele ikhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda ukukhetha (okufana no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkhiye bompondo, ngenkathi i-view igxilile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula; nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, shelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esihlokweni-sokudweba\"\u003EEsihlokweni sokudweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana ishidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza (ishidi ligxilile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezinye izimpini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (ishidi ligxilile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha kancane uphawu lwe-GD&amp;T olukhethiwe ngo-1 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa uphawu olukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYeka ukubeka uphawu; uma kungenjalo khetha; uma kungenjalo buyela emodelini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kubuka, ngenkathi kukhethwe Datum, Frame, Finish noma Detail\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbeke lapho (ihlanganise nomugqa osondele kakhulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza uphawu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELikhethe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa uphawu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELihambise (umugqa ohamba nalo ugcina ipoyinti yawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQhubeka ngevili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza endaweni yesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-sketch\"\u003EKu-sketch\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIrektangele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmnsalo (isikhungo, ukuqala, ukuphela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wesikhungo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet ikhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpline (amaphoyinti okufanele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrim\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uphambanisa: zombili izinhlangothi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintshela amakhava akhethiwe ukuba yisakhiwo nokubuyela emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda ichain yomugqa noma i-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha konke okusketch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha, sika, namathisela ijiyometri (ukunamathisela kulandela iphoyinti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela ngamakhonjana afanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda okukhethiwe futhi ukubeke ngokuchofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuyela emuva: khansela inkomba yenombolo noma ukunamathisela, qeda ichain yomugqa, buyela ku-Khetha, sula ukukhetha, bese uvala i-sketch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka amaphoyinti ngethuluzi lokudweba; khetha nge-Khetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza noma ususe ekukhetheni (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ku-Windows nakwi-Linux, ⌘+chofoza ku-Mac, yenza okufanayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa esikhaleni esingenalutho (Khetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwindi: likhetha konke okungaphakathi ngokuphelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa iphoyinti, umugqa noma umphetho wendilinga (Khetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa; izixhumanisi ziyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa inombolo yesilinganiso (Khetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa ilebula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili isilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha inani lawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ngenkathi udweba imigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda ichain\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQhubeka ngevili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza endaweni yesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kubhokisi-lenombolo\"\u003EKubhokisi lenombolo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa inani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVala ungashintshi lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza kwenye indawo nakho kusebenzisa inani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ohlwini-lomlando\"\u003EOhlwini lomlando\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFika ohlwini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHamba phakathi kwemigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa isici esikhethiwe phezulu noma phansi, lapho umlando uvumela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha inombolo enkulu yesici emgqeni waso; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyisetha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina eyakudala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha ipulani noma isici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili isketch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYivula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili inombolo yesici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYishintsha emgqeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuhlanganiso\"\u003EKuhlanganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQala ukuhlangana: bese uchofoza ubuso obulinganayo kwengxenye ngayinye ezimbili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhansela ukuhlangana oqalile, noma sula ukukhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa ingxenye noma ukuhlangana okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa ingxenye noma ukuhlangana okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa nephinde wenze kuluhlu lwenhlanganisela yayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda ingxenye ekhethiwe (ingxenye efanayo, eceleni kwezinye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha ingxenye, bese uyinamathisela eceleni kwezinye noma endaweni efanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImouse ku-view: njengoku-3D view ngenhla. Chofoza ingxenye ukuze uyikhethe. Chofoza kabili ingxenye ohlwini ukuze uyihlele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikhaleni-sokusebenza-se-script\"\u003EEsikhaleni sokusebenza se-Script\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalisa i-script (kumhleli, epaneli noma ku-view)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalisa imigqa ekhethiwe, noma umugqa okuwo ikhesa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaka / phuma imigqa ekhethiwe. Ukuze uphume kumhleli ngekhibhodi, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command /\"\u003E⌘/\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+/\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaka noma susa ukuphawula imigqa ekhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command F\"\u003E⌘F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command H\"\u003E⌘H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThola / thola futhi ushintshe kwi-script; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E okulandelayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Return\"\u003E⇧ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F3\"\u003E⇧ F3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E okwandulelayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyavala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command [\"\u003E⇧⌘[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command ]\"\u003E⇧⌘]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoqa / vula ibhlokhi ikhesa kuyo (umsebenzi, if, for, while … end)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Space\"\u003E⌘ Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa izincomo zegama oliwuthayipha (ivula ngemva kwezinhlamvu ezimbili); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zikhetha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zithatha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyavala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E komugqa ngaphansi kwe-console\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalisa lowo mstatement; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zibuyisa ezedlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELingana i-view nento ebonwa yi-scripts\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EBhala futhi uqalise ama-script\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-isiphequluli-esingazithatha\"\u003EIzinkinobho isiphequluli esingazithatha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Safari ingavula umlando: sebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuphinda wenze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukhiye wamabhukhimakhi wesiphequluli: i-PartCraft iyithatha lapho uhlelo lugxilile, iyishiye uma uthayipha kubhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F11\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisikrini esigcwele nokusondeza kwekhasi lesiphequluli, hhayi ezePartCraft. Sebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole isikrini esigcwele, nevili ukuze uthole imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye bomsebenzi kumalaptop amaningi namaMac badinga okhiye Fn: cindezela Fn+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuthola usizo, noma sebenzisa inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthinta nezinhlamvu ze-trackpad: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003EAma-trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-i-hambisa-ikhona\"\u003ELapho i-Hambisa ikhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa umzimba\u003C/span\u003E itholakala kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E weqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, kubhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E lapho uthayipha khona ΔX, ΔY no-ΔZ, nanjengo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDonsa ukuze uhambise\u003C/span\u003E izimpini ngengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okhiye abasebenzi lapho uthayipha kubhokisi epaneli, ngaphandle kwe-Ctrl+S ne-Ctrl+O, ezisebenza njalo. Okhiye bezinhlamvu basebenza ngaphandle komodifayi. Izincazelo ezijwayelekile mayelana nokhiye kusiphequluli, nakumakhibhodi angenawo okhiye bomsebenzi: Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Noma kuphi Okhiye Isenzo Ctrl+S Londoloza ingxenye (kuhlanganiso: inhlanganisela). Ivala i-sketch evulekile kuqala Ctrl+O Vula ifayela lengxenye noma lenhlanganisela (ibuza kuqala uma kukhona okungalondolozwanga) Ctrl+Z Hlehlisa Ctrl+Y noma Ctrl+Shift+Z Phinda wenze F1 Vula noma uvale lo msizo (futhi Usizo kwi-app bar). Esc nayo iyawuvala. Kumalaptop amaningi namakhibhodi e-Mac, bamba Fn Ctrl+Shift+F Imodi yesikrini: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, isikrini esigcwele nezinhlamvu zifihliwe. Control nakwi-Mac, hhayi ⌘ Esc Phuma kusikrini esigcwele (uma usesikrinini esigcwele) Ctrl+, Izilungiselelo, kubandakanya ithebhu ye-PartCraft (bheka Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft) Kubhokisi lenombolo epaneli, Ctrl+Z iwukuhlehlisa kombhalo wesiphequluli. Kubhokisi lenombolo ngaphezu kwesilinganiso se-sketch, ihlehlisa kwi-PartCraft. Kopisha, namathisela nephinde Zisebenza kokusebenzayo: ijiyometri ekhethiwe ku-sketch evulekile, isici esikhethiwe emlandweni, noma ingxenye ekhethiwe kuhlanganiso. Imininingwane ku-Kopisha, namathisela nephinde. Okhiye Isenzo Ctrl+C Kopisha okukhethiwe Ctrl+X Sika: kopisha, bese usula Ctrl+V Namathisela. Ku-sketch ikhophi ilandela iphoyinti: chofoza lapho okuyoya khona Ctrl+Shift+V Namathisela endaweni efanayo: amakhonjana afanayo (kuhlanganiso, indawo efanayo) Ctrl+D Phinda: kopisha futhi unamathisele ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ingabi nalutho ku-clipboard Ctrl+A Khetha konke (ku-sketch) Esc Khetha lutho (futhi ukhansele ukunamathisela okulandela iphoyinti) Kubhokisi lenombolo, lezi zinkinobho zikopisha futhi zinamathisele umbhalo njengoba kujwayelekile. Umbhalo okhethiwe kupaneli ukopishwa yisiphequluli. Ku-ngxenye (akukho sketch evulekile) Okhiye Isenzo S Sketch ekhethiwe kundiza noma ebusweni obuncane obukhethiwe; uma kungakhethwanga lutho, khetha indawo ngokuchofoza F Lingana ingxenye ku-view M Linganisa, kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza nakuhlanganiso; Esc isula okukhethiwe, Esc futhi iyavala (bheka Linganisa amakhaza, ama-engeli nobuningi) X Ukubuka kwesigaba ukuvula noma ukuvala, kuzo zonke izindawo zokusebenza nakuhlanganiso; Esc iyavala (bheka Bheka ngaphakathi ngokubuka kwesigaba) Delete Susa isici esikhethiwe (ibuza uma ezinye zisisebenzisa) 0 … 9, . Nesici esikhethiwe: thayipha inombolo yaso enkulu (ukujula kwe-Extrude, ububanzi be-Hole, inani lephethini, iradiyasi ye-fillet …), bese Enter. Esc igcina eyakudala Backspace Susa isici esikhethiwe, uma kukhethiwe esisodwa Esc Yeka ukukhetha indiza ye-sketch, noma sula ukukhetha (kuhlanganisa imiphetho noma ubuso obukhethwe nge-Shift) Ku-ukubuka kwe-3D Chofoza kuqala kukho ukuze kube nokugxila kwekhibhodi. Okhiye Isenzo ← → ↑ ↓ Phendula ukubuka ngamadigri angu-15 Shift+← nezinye izimpini Shelelisa + noma = Sondeza ngaphakathi − Sondeza ngaphandle Imouse Isenzo Donsa ngenkinobho yokunxele Phendula (zungeza) ukubuka Donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi Shelelisa Shift, Ctrl noma ⌘ ibanjwe ngenkathi udonsa ngenkinobho yokunxele Shelelisa Qhubeka ngevili Sondeza endaweni yesikhombi (ukuya ngaphandle kuya ngaphakathi) Ukuswayipha ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad Phendula ukubuka; nge-Shift, shelelisa. Pinch isondeza. Kusethwe yi-Scrolling kuzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft Nge-Ukuphendula ukubuka: Inkinobho ephakathi kuzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft, inkinobho ephakathi iphendula ukubuka, Shift nenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla kushelelisa, bese inkinobho yokunxele ikhetha kuphela. | Chofoza | Khetha ubuso (buyagqamiswa bonke), umphetho noma indiza | | Shift+chofoza umphetho noma ubuso | Qoqa imiphetho noma ubuso obuningi | | Chofoza isikhala esingenalutho | Sula ukukhetha | Ngenkathi ukhetha imiphetho noma ubuso be-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell Okhiye noma imouse Isenzo Chofoza umphetho noma ubuso Yengeza, noma uyikhiphe uma isuvele ikhona Esc noma Enter Qeda ukukhetha (okufana no-Kuqediwe) F Lingana Okhiye bompondo, ngenkathi i-view igxilile Phendula; nge-Shift, shelelisa Esihlokweni sokudweba Okhiye Isenzo F Lingana ishidi + / − Sondeza (ishidi ligxilile) Shift+← nezinye izimpini Shelelisa (ishidi ligxilile) ← → ↑ ↓ Shintsha kancane uphawu lwe-GD&T olukhethiwe ngo-1 mm Delete noma Backspace Susa uphawu olukhethiwe Esc Yeka ukubeka uphawu; uma kungenjalo khetha; uma kungenjalo buyela emodelini Imouse Isenzo Chofoza kubuka, ngenkathi kukhethwe Datum, Frame, Finish noma Detail Ibeke lapho (ihlanganise nomugqa osondele kakhulu) Chofoza uphawu Likhethe Donsa uphawu Lihambise (umugqa ohamba nalo ugcina ipoyinti yawo) Qhubeka ngevili Sondeza endaweni yesikhombi Donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi Shelelisa Ku-sketch Okhiye Isenzo L Umugqa R Irektangele C Indilinga A Umnsalo (isikhungo, ukuqala, ukuphela) P Iphoyinti N Umugqa wesikhungo F Fillet ikhona D Isilinganiso B Spline (amaphoyinti okufanele) T Trim E Elula O Offset (B ngenkathi uphambanisa: zombili izinhlangothi) M Mirror S Khetha Q Shintshela amakhava akhethiwe ukuba yisakhiwo nokubuyela emuva Enter Qeda ichain yomugqa noma i-spline Delete noma Backspace Susa okukhethiwe Ctrl+A Khetha konke okusketch Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V Kopisha, sika, namathisela ijiyometri (ukunamathisela kulandela iphoyinti) Ctrl+Shift+V Namathisela ngamakhonjana afanayo Ctrl+D Phinda okukhethiwe futhi ukubeke ngokuchofoza Esc Buyela emuva: khansela inkomba yenombolo noma ukunamathisela, qeda ichain yomugqa, buyela ku-Khetha, sula ukukhetha, bese uvala i-sketch Imouse Isenzo Chofoza Beka amaphoyinti ngethuluzi lokudweba; khetha nge-Khetha Shift+chofoza Engeza noma ususe ekukhetheni (Ctrl+chofoza ku-Windows nakwi-Linux, ⌘+chofoza ku-Mac, yenza okufanayo) Donsa esikhaleni esingenalutho (Khetha) Iwindi: likhetha konke okungaphakathi ngokuphelele Donsa iphoyinti, umugqa noma umphetho wendilinga (Khetha) Hambisa; izixhumanisi ziyahlala Donsa inombolo yesilinganiso (Khetha) Hambisa ilebula Chofoza kabili isilinganiso Shintsha inani lawo Chofoza kabili noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ngenkathi udweba imigqa Qeda ichain Donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi Shelelisa Qhubeka ngevili Sondeza endaweni yesikhombi Kubhokisi lenombolo Okhiye Isenzo Enter Sebenzisa inani Esc Vala ungashintshi lutho Ukuchofoza kwenye indawo nakho kusebenzisa inani. Ohlwini lomlando Okhiye Isenzo Tab Fika ohlwini ↑ / ↓ Hamba phakathi kwemigqa Enter noma Space Khetha umugqa Alt+↑ / Alt+↓ Hambisa isici esikhethiwe phezulu noma phansi, lapho umlando uvumela F2 Shintsha inombolo enkulu yesici emgqeni waso; Enter iyisetha, Esc igcina eyakudala Imouse Isenzo Chofoza Khetha ipulani noma isici Chofoza kabili isketch Yivula Chofoza kabili inombolo yesici Yishintsha emgqeni Kuhlanganiso Okhiye Isenzo J Qala ukuhlangana: bese uchofoza ubuso obulinganayo kwengxenye ngayinye ezimbili F Lingana Esc Khansela ukuhlangana oqalile, noma sula ukukhetha Delete Susa ingxenye noma ukuhlangana okukhethiwe Backspace Susa ingxenye noma ukuhlangana okukhethiwe Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y Hlehlisa nephinde wenze kuluhlu lwenhlanganisela yayo Ctrl+D Phinda ingxenye ekhethiwe (ingxenye efanayo, eceleni kwezinye) Ctrl+C, bese Ctrl+V noma Ctrl+Shift+V Kopisha ingxenye, bese uyinamathisela eceleni kwezinye noma endaweni efanayo Imouse ku-view: njengoku-3D view ngenhla. Chofoza ingxenye ukuze uyikhethe. Chofoza kabili ingxenye ohlwini ukuze uyihlele. Esikhaleni sokusebenza se-Script Okhiye Isenzo F5 Qalisa i-script (kumhleli, epaneli noma ku-view) Ctrl+Enter Qalisa imigqa ekhethiwe, noma umugqa okuwo ikhesa Tab / Shift+Tab Faka / phuma imigqa ekhethiwe. Ukuze uphume kumhleli ngekhibhodi, cindezela Esc, bese Tab Ctrl+/ Faka noma susa ukuphawula imigqa ekhethiwe Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H Thola / thola futhi ushintshe kwi-script; Enter noma F3 okulandelayo, Shift+Enter noma Shift+F3 okwandulelayo, Esc iyavala Ctrl+Shift+[ / Ctrl+Shift+] Goqa / vula ibhlokhi ikhesa kuyo (umsebenzi, if, for, while … end) Ctrl+Space Bonisa izincomo zegama oliwuthayipha (ivula ngemva kwezinhlamvu ezimbili); ↑ / ↓ zikhetha, Enter noma Tab zithatha, Esc iyavala Enter komugqa ngaphansi kwe-console Qalisa lowo mstatement; ↑ ne-↓ zibuyisa ezedlule F Lingana i-view nento ebonwa yi-scripts Bheka Bhala futhi uqalise ama-script. Izinkinobho isiphequluli esingazithatha Ctrl+Y ku-Safari ingavula umlando: sebenzisa Ctrl+Shift+Z ukuphinda wenze. Ctrl+D ukhiye wamabhukhimakhi wesiphequluli: i-PartCraft iyithatha lapho uhlelo lugxilile, iyishiye uma uthayipha kubhokisi. F11 ne-Ctrl++ / Ctrl+− zisikrini esigcwele nokusondeza kwekhasi lesiphequluli, hhayi ezePartCraft. Sebenzisa Ctrl+Shift+F ukuze uthole isikrini esigcwele, nevili ukuze uthole imodeli. Okhiye bomsebenzi kumalaptop amaningi namaMac badinga okhiye Fn: cindezela Fn+F1 ukuthola usizo, noma sebenzisa inkinobho ethi Usizo. Ukuthinta nezinhlamvu ze-trackpad: Ama-trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane. Lapho i-Hambisa ikhona I-Hambisa umzimba itholakala kumenyu ye-Okwengeziwe weqembu le-Izici, kubhokisi le-Hambisa lapho uthayipha khona ΔX, ΔY no-ΔZ, nanjengo Donsa ukuze uhambise izimpini ngengxenye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft","summary":"Khetha inkinobho yembewu egingqa ukubuka, yenza ukuskrola kwe-trackpad kugingqe futhi kushelelise ingxenye, vula noma uvale izixhumanisi ezizenzakalelayo ngesikhathi udweba isikethi, futhi usethe ukuthi ama-solver wesimulation asebenzisa amathrendi amangaki.","section":"reference","order":15,"keywords":["izilungiselelo","okuncamelayo","izinketho","imbewu","inkinobho ephakathi","inkinobho yevili","orbit","gingqa","rotate","trackpad","touchpad","skrola","swayipha","khama","izixhumanisi","constraints","auto constrain","izixhumanisi ezizenzakalelayo","bambelela","coincident","amathrendi","amathrendi esixazululi","amathrendi amaningi","ukuxazulula okusheshayo","okuhambisanayo"],"headings":[{"id":"ukugingqa-kokubuka","text":"Ukugingqa kokubuka","level":2},{"id":"ukuskrola-ivili-noma-i-trackpad","text":"Ukuskrola: ivili noma i-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukudweba-engeza-izixhumanisi-ngesikhathi-udweba","text":"Ukudweba: engeza izixhumanisi ngesikhathi udweba","level":2},{"id":"ukudweba-isilinganiso-ngesikhathi-udweba","text":"Ukudweba: isilinganiso ngesikhathi udweba","level":2},{"id":"isibonisi-sekhona","text":"Isibonisi sekhona","level":2},{"id":"amathrendi-esixazululi","text":"Amathrendi esixazululi","level":2},{"id":"kuseva-yewebhu-yakho","text":"Kuseva yewebhu yakho","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E ngegiya elisendaweni yesicelo noma ngo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ithebhu yokuqala, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E, ibamba izilungiselelo zalolu hlelo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E ibamba ezabelwa zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amapaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft zikhona kuhlelo kuphela: uzishintsha lapha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyazikhumbula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset PartCraft settings\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela konke esimweni sokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugingqa-kokubuka\"\u003EUkugingqa kokubuka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho yesobunxele\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala): donsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele ukugingqa ingxenye; donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho ephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E: cindezela ivili bese udonsa ukugingqa ingxenye; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma ⌘) ngenkinobho ephakathi, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, ukuze ushelelise. Inkinobho yesobunxele ikhetha ubuso, imiphetho namapuleni kuphela, ngakho ukuchofoza okunyakaza kancane akusoze kugingqe ingxenye. Izinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD zisebenza ngale ndlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIvili lisondeza endaweni isikhombi sikuyo noma kunjalo. Esikethini, inkinobho yesokudla neyephakathi zishelelisa njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuskrola-ivili-noma-i-trackpad\"\u003EUkuskrola: ivili noma i-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThola ngokwakho\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala): I-PartCraft iyaqapha ukuskrola. Ukuskrola okuvundlile noma okuncane, njengoba i-trackpad ikuthumela, kugingqa ingxenye; izinotshi zevili eliphelele zisondeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvili\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuskrola kuhlala kusondeza endaweni isikhombi sikuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E: swayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukugingqa ingxenye, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uswayiphe ukuze ushelelise, khama ukuze usondeze. Esikethini ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili kushelelisa isikethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhama kusondeza kuzo zonke izinketho. Uma &quot;Thola ngokwakho&quot; ingakunqumi kahle ngevili noma nge-trackpad yakho, khetha ohlobo olunalo. Okwengeziwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003EI-trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukudweba-engeza-izixhumanisi-ngesikhathi-udweba\"\u003EUkudweba: engeza izixhumanisi ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza izixhumanisi ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/strong\u003E (ivuliwe ekuqaleni): ukuchofoza okubambelela ephoyintini kwenza iphoyinti elisha lihlangane nayo, ukuchofoza ejikeni kubeka iphoyinti kuleyo jika, nomugqa odwetshwe ocishe ulingane noma umile uba ngohlangothi noma oqondile. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EIzixhumanisi nezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYicime uma ufuna ukubeka ijometri eduze nezinye ngaphandle kokuyixhumanisa nazo. Isikhombi sisabambelela eziphoyintini nasemajikeni, kodwa akukho okuxhunyiwe: imigqa edwetshwe ngokulandelana ayabelani ngemiphetho yayo, ngakho ukudonsa kungazihlukanisa. Engeza izixhumanisi ofuna wena ngokwakho esigabeni sakwesokudla. Iphrofayili evaliwe isakhishwa uma imiphetho yayo ihlangana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsilungiselelo siguqula kuphela okwengezwa yisidwebi esisha. Izixhumanisi ezisesikethini zisala, nethuluzi le-Fillet lisadala ijika layo elithintayo neradiyasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukudweba-isilinganiso-ngesikhathi-udweba\"\u003EUkudweba: isilinganiso ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/strong\u003E (ivuliwe ekuqaleni): ngesikhathi umugqa, irektangela, indilinga noma umnsalo udwetshwa, ukuthayipha inombolo kugcwalisa ibhokisi losayizi eduze nesikhombi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iya kwebhokisi elilandelayo) bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idweba ukwakheka ngalolo sayizi, nesilinganiso esishayelayo sosayizi ngamunye obuthayipha. Ivaliwe: ukuthayipha inombolo ngesikhathi udweba akwenzi lutho, futhi izakheko zidwetshwa ngokuchofoza kuphela. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics#type-the-size-as-you-draw\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-hash=\"type-the-size-as-you-draw\"\u003EThayipha usayizi ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonisi-sekhona\"\u003EIsibonisi sekhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkubonakala ekhoneni lokubuka kwe-3D: \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala; ngakwesokudla phezulu — chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kuleyo ndawo, donsa ukuze uzungeze, donsa indilinga yekhampasi ukuze ugingqe imodeli), \u003Cstrong\u003EIsithonjana sesiqondiso\u003C/strong\u003E (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngakwesokunxele phansi olugingqa ngokubuka: X ibomvu, Y eluhlaza, Z eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ELutho\u003C/strong\u003E. Akukho okubonakala lapho udweba isikethi noma eshidini lomdwebo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"partcraft/view-cube\"\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathrendi-esixazululi\"\u003EAmathrendi esixazululi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathrendi angangamalingana isixazululi sesimulation. \u003Cstrong\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala) kusebenzisa okungaphansi kwe-processor ezisebenzayo zekhompyutha ngu-1 (okungafika ku-16), ukuze ikhasi lisasabela ngesikhathi isifundo sixazulula; noma khetha inombolo. Izifundo ezinkulu ze-voxel, ukuwohloka (buckling), ukucindezeleka ngokuhamba kwesikhathi nokugeleza kwe-flow zixazulula ngokushesha kumathrendi amaningi (cishe 2× ku-4 amathrendi kuma-80,000 amakhyubhu ezilinganisweni zethu, ngaphezu kakhulu ekhompyutheni engasebenzi); amamodeli angaphansi kuka-20,000 okungaziwa ahlala ethrendini eyodwa, ngoba ukuqala amathrendi kubiza ngaphezu kwalokho akonga. Isixazululo esinamathrendi sinikeza impendulo efanayo nethrendi eyodwa (ngokuzungeza: amasamba ahlanganiswa ngolunye ulandelelo). Imiphumela yesifundo ngasinye ibala \u003Cstrong\u003EN amathrendi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eithrendi eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E nesizathu ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsixazululi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathrendi adinga ukuthi ikhasi libe \u003Cstrong\u003Elihlukaniswe ngokuphambene\u003C/strong\u003E (isiphequluli sivumela abasebenzi babelane ngenkumbulo kuphela ngalokho). Ikhasi le-lab lenza kanjalo; lapho lingenjalo, isilungiselelo sithi lokho (&quot;Leli khasi alihlukaniswe ngokuphambene, ngakho abaxazululi basebenza ngethrendi eyodwa noma yini okhethiwe lapha.&quot;) bese yonke ukuxazulula isebenzisa ithrendi eyodwa. Okunye konke kusebenza ngokufanayo, nezimpendulo ziyafana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzifundo zokugeleza kwe-laminar nazo zisebenzisa amathrendi (cishe 2.5× ku-4 amathrendi kumaseli oketshezi angama-54,000, impendulo efanayo kudijithi lokugcina). Isixazululi se-quadratic-tetrahedron nokudlulisa kokushisa kusebenza ethrendini eyodwa: ukusebenzisa amathrendi kwabo kulinganiswe kukhompyutha yethu yokuhlola kuba kancane (abaxazululi babo bavinjelwa isivinini senkumbulo nesinyathelo esingahlukaniswa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kuseva-yewebhu-yakho\"\u003EKuseva yewebhu yakho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usebenzisa i-PartCraft kusuka kuseva yakho, isebenza njengoba ihlinzekwa. Ngamathrendi esixazululi, yenza iseva ithumele izinhloko ezimbili nekhasi le-PartCraft:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin\nCross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Apache, kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.htaccess\u003C/code\u003E lefolda (kudinga mod_headers):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EHeader set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy &quot;same-origin&quot;\nHeader set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy &quot;require-corp&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-nginx, ku-\u003Ccode\u003Elocation\u003C/code\u003E ehlinzeka i-PartCraft:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eadd_header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy &quot;same-origin&quot; always;\nadd_header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy &quot;require-corp&quot; always;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayisha kabusha ikhasi: Settings › Solver threads bese kunikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomatic\u003C/strong\u003E nenani lekhompyutha yakho. Inhloko yesibili yenza isiphequluli senqabe noma yini ikhasi elayilayisha kwenye indawo engavumeli lokho, okulungile kwi-PartCraft ngokwayo (ilayisha konke kusuka kufolda yayo).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula Settings ngegiya elisendaweni yesicelo noma ngo Ctrl+,. Ithebhu yokuqala, PartCraft, ibamba izilungiselelo zalolu hlelo; General ibamba ezabelwa zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amapaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft zikhona kuhlelo kuphela: uzishintsha lapha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyazikhumbula. Reset PartCraft settings ibuyisela konke esimweni sokuqala. Ukugingqa kokubuka Inkinobho yesobunxele (okokuqala): donsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele ukugingqa ingxenye; donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla noma ephakathi ukuze ushelelise. Inkinobho ephakathi: cindezela ivili bese udonsa ukugingqa ingxenye; bamba Shift (noma Ctrl, noma ⌘) ngenkinobho ephakathi, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, ukuze ushelelise. Inkinobho yesobunxele ikhetha ubuso, imiphetho namapuleni kuphela, ngakho ukuchofoza okunyakaza kancane akusoze kugingqe ingxenye. Izinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD zisebenza ngale ndlela. Ivili lisondeza endaweni isikhombi sikuyo noma kunjalo. Esikethini, inkinobho yesokudla neyephakathi zishelelisa njengakuqala. Ukuskrola: ivili noma i-trackpad Thola ngokwakho (okokuqala): I-PartCraft iyaqapha ukuskrola. Ukuskrola okuvundlile noma okuncane, njengoba i-trackpad ikuthumela, kugingqa ingxenye; izinotshi zevili eliphelele zisondeza. Ivili: ukuskrola kuhlala kusondeza endaweni isikhombi sikuyo. Trackpad: swayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukugingqa ingxenye, bamba Shift uswayiphe ukuze ushelelise, khama ukuze usondeze. Esikethini ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili kushelelisa isikethi. Ukukhama kusondeza kuzo zonke izinketho. Uma \"Thola ngokwakho\" ingakunqumi kahle ngevili noma nge-trackpad yakho, khetha ohlobo olunalo. Okwengeziwe ku-I-trackpad, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane. Ukudweba: engeza izixhumanisi ngesikhathi udweba Engeza izixhumanisi ngesikhathi udweba (ivuliwe ekuqaleni): ukuchofoza okubambelela ephoyintini kwenza iphoyinti elisha lihlangane nayo, ukuchofoza ejikeni kubeka iphoyinti kuleyo jika, nomugqa odwetshwe ocishe ulingane noma umile uba ngohlangothi noma oqondile. Bheka Izixhumanisi nezilinganiso. Yicime uma ufuna ukubeka ijometri eduze nezinye ngaphandle kokuyixhumanisa nazo. Isikhombi sisabambelela eziphoyintini nasemajikeni, kodwa akukho okuxhunyiwe: imigqa edwetshwe ngokulandelana ayabelani ngemiphetho yayo, ngakho ukudonsa kungazihlukanisa. Engeza izixhumanisi ofuna wena ngokwakho esigabeni sakwesokudla. Iphrofayili evaliwe isakhishwa uma imiphetho yayo ihlangana. Isilungiselelo siguqula kuphela okwengezwa yisidwebi esisha. Izixhumanisi ezisesikethini zisala, nethuluzi le-Fillet lisadala ijika layo elithintayo neradiyasi. Ukudweba: isilinganiso ngesikhathi udweba Isilinganiso ngesikhathi udweba (ivuliwe ekuqaleni): ngesikhathi umugqa, irektangela, indilinga noma umnsalo udwetshwa, ukuthayipha inombolo kugcwalisa ibhokisi losayizi eduze nesikhombi (Tab iya kwebhokisi elilandelayo) bese Enter idweba ukwakheka ngalolo sayizi, nesilinganiso esishayelayo sosayizi ngamunye obuthayipha. Ivaliwe: ukuthayipha inombolo ngesikhathi udweba akwenzi lutho, futhi izakheko zidwetshwa ngokuchofoza kuphela. Bheka Thayipha usayizi ngesikhathi udweba. Isibonisi sekhona Okubonakala ekhoneni lokubuka kwe-3D: Ikhyubhu lokubuka (okokuqala; ngakwesokudla phezulu — chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kuleyo ndawo, donsa ukuze uzungeze, donsa indilinga yekhampasi ukuze ugingqe imodeli), Isithonjana sesiqondiso (uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z ngakwesokunxele phansi olugingqa ngokubuka: X ibomvu, Y eluhlaza, Z eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka) noma Lutho. Akukho okubonakala lapho udweba isikethi noma eshidini lomdwebo. Bheka Ikhyubhu lokubuka. Amathrendi esixazululi Amathrendi angangamalingana isixazululi sesimulation. Okuzenzakalelayo (okokuqala) kusebenzisa okungaphansi kwe-processor ezisebenzayo zekhompyutha ngu-1 (okungafika ku-16), ukuze ikhasi lisasabela ngesikhathi isifundo sixazulula; noma khetha inombolo. Izifundo ezinkulu ze-voxel, ukuwohloka (buckling), ukucindezeleka ngokuhamba kwesikhathi nokugeleza kwe-flow zixazulula ngokushesha kumathrendi amaningi (cishe 2× ku-4 amathrendi kuma-80,000 amakhyubhu ezilinganisweni zethu, ngaphezu kakhulu ekhompyutheni engasebenzi); amamodeli angaphansi kuka-20,000 okungaziwa ahlala ethrendini eyodwa, ngoba ukuqala amathrendi kubiza ngaphezu kwalokho akonga. Isixazululo esinamathrendi sinikeza impendulo efanayo nethrendi eyodwa (ngokuzungeza: amasamba ahlanganiswa ngolunye ulandelelo). Imiphumela yesifundo ngasinye ibala N amathrendi noma ithrendi eyodwa nesizathu ngaphansi kwe-Isixazululi. Amathrendi adinga ukuthi ikhasi libe lihlukaniswe ngokuphambene (isiphequluli sivumela abasebenzi babelane ngenkumbulo kuphela ngalokho). Ikhasi le-lab lenza kanjalo; lapho lingenjalo, isilungiselelo sithi lokho (\"Leli khasi alihlukaniswe ngokuphambene, ngakho abaxazululi basebenza ngethrendi eyodwa noma yini okhethiwe lapha.\") bese yonke ukuxazulula isebenzisa ithrendi eyodwa. Okunye konke kusebenza ngokufanayo, nezimpendulo ziyafana. Izifundo zokugeleza kwe-laminar nazo zisebenzisa amathrendi (cishe 2.5× ku-4 amathrendi kumaseli oketshezi angama-54,000, impendulo efanayo kudijithi lokugcina). Isixazululi se-quadratic-tetrahedron nokudlulisa kokushisa kusebenza ethrendini eyodwa: ukusebenzisa amathrendi kwabo kulinganiswe kukhompyutha yethu yokuhlola kuba kancane (abaxazululi babo bavinjelwa isivinini senkumbulo nesinyathelo esingahlukaniswa). Kuseva yewebhu yakho Uma usebenzisa i-PartCraft kusuka kuseva yakho, isebenza njengoba ihlinzekwa. Ngamathrendi esixazululi, yenza iseva ithumele izinhloko ezimbili nekhasi le-PartCraft: Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp Ku-Apache, kufayela le-.htaccess lefolda (kudinga mod_headers): Header set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy \"same-origin\" Header set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy \"require-corp\" Ku-nginx, ku-location ehlinzeka i-PartCraft: add_header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy \"same-origin\" always; add_header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy \"require-corp\" always; Layisha kabusha ikhasi: Settings › Solver threads bese kunikeza Automatic nenani lekhompyutha yakho. Inhloko yesibili yenza isiphequluli senqabe noma yini ikhasi elayilayisha kwenye indawo engavumeli lokho, okulungile kwi-PartCraft ngokwayo (ilayisha konke kusuka kufolda yayo).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sketch-relations","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izixhumanisi nezilinganiso zesikethi","summary":"Zonke izixhumanisi nezilinganiso esinesikethi se-PartCraft, okufanele ukhethe ngakunye, uphawu lwakho, nokuziphatha lapho kuxazululwa.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["izixhumanisi","izilinganiso","ukuxhumana","ehlangene","ethe xaxa","ethi ngqo","ihambisanayo","perpendicular","tangent","lingana","ngokumaphakathi","iphakathi","bopha","ibanga","ibanga elithe xaxa","ibanga elithi ngqo","umsakazo","ububanzi","i-engeli","uphawu","izimpawu"],"headings":[{"id":"izixhumanisi","text":"Izixhumanisi","level":2},{"id":"izilinganiso","text":"Izilinganiso","level":2},{"id":"ukuziphatha-kokuxazulula","text":"Ukuziphatha kokuxazulula","level":2},{"id":"akukatholakali-okwamanje","text":"Akukatholakali okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zibopha indlela ijometri ehlezi ngayo ngokuhlobene nejometri yenye. Izilinganiso zibopha usayizi. Ukuze wengeze ixhumanisi, khetha izinto ngethuluzi le-Khetha (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uchofoza inkinobho yalo epanelini elingakwesokudla; ukuze wengeze isilinganiso, sebenzisa ithuluzi lesilinganiso (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) noma izinkinobho zezilinganiso epanelini elingakwesokudla. Ukusebenza nazo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EChaza ngokuphelele isikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwegama elithi &quot;igculo&quot; kusho indilinga noma umnsalo. Umsuka ubalwa njengephoyinti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumanisi\"\u003EIzixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUphawu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E• Ehlangene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E• (ibonakala kuphela uma ikhethiwe noma kukhona inkinga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti ayahlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E• Ehlangene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E•\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti nomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lisemugqeni (noma ekwelulweni kwawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E• Ehlangene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E•\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti negculo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lisendilinganeni noma emnsalweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Ethe xaxa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa, noma amaphoyinti amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa ulingene, noma amaphoyinti amabili ahlezi ngokuphakama okufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV Ethi ngqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa, noma amaphoyinti amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa umi ngqo, noma amaphoyinti ahlezi eyodwa phezu kwomunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E∥ Ihambisanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E∥\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa iqhubeka ngendlela efanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⊥ I-perpendicular\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⊥\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa ihlangana nge-engeli elilungile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET I-tangent\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa negculo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa uthinta igculo ngaphandle kokulidlula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET I-tangent\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagculo amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyathintana, angaphandle noma angaphakathi, njengoba edwetshwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET I-tangent\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-spline nomugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo ayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-spline iphuma kulowo mphetho ngendlela yegculo lesibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E= Lingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E=\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude obufanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E= Lingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E=\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagculo amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo ofanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎ Ngokumaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagculo amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhungo esifanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎ Ngokumaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti negculo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lihlala esikhungweni segculo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EM Iphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EM\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti nomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti lihlala ephakathini komugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E↔ Ngokufana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E↔\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili nomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti angezithombe zesibuko zomunye ngokusho komugqa (Isibuko sidala lezi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚓ Bopha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti, umugqa, igculo noma i-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyibamba ngqo lapho ikhona manje (i-spline: amaphoyinti ayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa lapha ihlanganisa nemigqa yesisekelo. Ukudweba kwengeza ezinye izixhumanisi ngawe: ukunamathela ephoyinteni kwenza liyahlangana, ukunamathela egculweni kubeka iphoyinti kulo, imigqa esedlule ukuba ithe xaxa noma ethi ngqo ithola H noma V, nesikwele sinezikhona zaso ezine exhunyiwe, ezimbili H nezimbili V.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBopha\u003C/strong\u003E kuyindlela esheshayo yokumisa into ukuthi ingahambi, kodwa-ke ingxenye ngeke ilandele ukushintsha kwesilinganiso esiseceleni. Kungcono izilinganiso ezisuka emsuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilinganiso\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlinganisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIbonakala njengo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude bawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga eliqondile phakathi kwawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti nomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga kusuka ephoyinteni liye emugqeni, ngokuqondile kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili ehambisanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgebe phakathi kwawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga elithe xaxa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili, noma umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga elithe xaxa kuphela (kwesobunxele nakwesokudla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga elithe xaxa 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga elithi ngqo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili, noma umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga elithi ngqo kuphela (phezulu nphansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga elithi ngqo 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga noma umnsalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo wawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo R10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga noma umnsalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi bawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi ⌀20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-engeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili engahambisani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-engeli phakathi kwawo, kusuka ku-0 kuya ku-180 amadigri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-engeli 30°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgethuluzi lesilinganiso, i-PartCraft ikhetha uhlobo ngokuchofoza kwakho nangendawo ofaka ngayo inombolo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUchofoza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthola\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa oyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude bawo; uma uthambekile, ithi xaxa uma inombolo iphezulu noma ingaphansi kwawo, ithi ngqo uma ingecele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndilinga oyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmnsalo oyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsakazo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti amabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga; ithi xaxa noma ithi ngqo njengomugqa othambekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti nomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga kusuka ephoyinteni liye emugqeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-engeli, noma ibanga uma ihambisanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti nendilinga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho: &quot;Lezo zinto azikwazi ukulinganiswa ndawonye.&quot; Linganisa esikhungweni sendilinga esikhundleni salokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhambisa\u003C/strong\u003E (kubonakala njengebanga) kwenziwa ithuluzi lokuhambisa: ligcina umugqa okopishwe ulingana ebangeni elithile, noma igculo okopishwe noma indilinga egxilile nomsakazo omkhulu noma omncane ngalelo banga. Ezinye izingxenye zalokho kuhambisa okufanayo zithwala ixhumanisi \u003Cstrong\u003EO\u003C/strong\u003E futhi zilandela isilinganiso esisodwa sokuhambisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003EAma-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinani zesilinganiso zingamamilimitha (noma amadigri), azikaze zibe ngaphansi kwezeru. Umsakazo nobububanzi kumele kube ngaphezu kwezeru. Inani lezeru liyavunyelwa ebangeni: amaphoyinti ahlukaniswe ngo-0 ahlangene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuziphatha-kokuxazulula\"\u003EUkuziphatha kokuxazulula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkunyakaza okuncane kakhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Inani lishintsha, isixazululi sihambisa ijometri kancane ngangokunokwenzeka. Umugqa obude bawo bushintsha ukhula ngokulinganayo emaphethelweni omabili uma kungekho lutho olubamba noma yiliphi uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ukuguqula.\u003C/strong\u003E Amabanga kusuka ephoyinteni kuya emugqeni, amabanga athe xaxa nathi ngqo, ama-engeli nokuthintana akhumbula uhlangothi ayenziwe ngalo. Ukushintsha inani akusoze kuguqule ijometri iye ohlangothini olunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkungqubuzana kushiya izinto njengazo.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma izixhumanisi zishaywa omunye, isikethi sihlala njengasemandulo futhi ezingqubuzanayo ziba bomvana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi ezeqile\u003C/strong\u003E (ezishiwo ezinye) zikhonjwa ebhaleni lesimo (&quot;Sekushiwo ngaphambili. Susa lokho.&quot;) futhi isici sisakhiwa, nesexwayiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlangano zokuthinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Lapho umnsalo we-fillet uhlangana nemigqa yawo eshaye iphoyinti lokuphela elifanayo, ukuthinta kuxazululwa ngendlela ehlala icacile lapho, ngakho izigoba zesikethi zingafundwa njengezichazwe ngokweqile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukatholakali-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukatholakali okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi ze-collinear, coradial kanye ne-pierce; iphoyinti ku-spline; izilinganiso ezilawulwa (zereferensi); izilinganiso ze-ordinate nobude bomsakazo; izibalo phakathi kwezilinganiso. Sebenzisa Ihambisanayo kanye nebanga elingu-0 emigqeni ye-collinear.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izixhumanisi zibopha indlela ijometri ehlezi ngayo ngokuhlobene nejometri yenye. Izilinganiso zibopha usayizi. Ukuze wengeze ixhumanisi, khetha izinto ngethuluzi le-Khetha (S) bese uchofoza inkinobho yalo epanelini elingakwesokudla; ukuze wengeze isilinganiso, sebenzisa ithuluzi lesilinganiso (D) noma izinkinobho zezilinganiso epanelini elingakwesokudla. Ukusebenza nazo: Chaza ngokuphelele isikethi. Ngaphansi kwegama elithi \"igculo\" kusho indilinga noma umnsalo. Umsuka ubalwa njengephoyinti. Izixhumanisi Inkinobho Uphawu Khetha Umphumela • Ehlangene • (ibonakala kuphela uma ikhethiwe noma kukhona inkinga) Amaphoyinti amabili Amaphoyinti ayahlangana • Ehlangene • Iphoyinti nomugqa Iphoyinti lisemugqeni (noma ekwelulweni kwawo) • Ehlangene • Iphoyinti negculo Iphoyinti lisendilinganeni noma emnsalweni H Ethe xaxa H Umugqa, noma amaphoyinti amabili Umugqa ulingene, noma amaphoyinti amabili ahlezi ngokuphakama okufanayo V Ethi ngqo V Umugqa, noma amaphoyinti amabili Umugqa umi ngqo, noma amaphoyinti ahlezi eyodwa phezu kwomunye ∥ Ihambisanayo ∥ Imigqa emibili Imigqa iqhubeka ngendlela efanayo ⊥ I-perpendicular ⊥ Imigqa emibili Imigqa ihlangana nge-engeli elilungile T I-tangent T Umugqa negculo Umugqa uthinta igculo ngaphandle kokulidlula T I-tangent T Amagculo amabili Ayathintana, angaphandle noma angaphakathi, njengoba edwetshwe T I-tangent T I-spline nomugqa, umnsalo noma i-spline ehlangana nomunye wamaphethelo ayo I-spline iphuma kulowo mphetho ngendlela yegculo lesibili = Lingana = Imigqa emibili Ubude obufanayo = Lingana = Amagculo amabili Umsakazo ofanayo ◎ Ngokumaphakathi ◎ Amagculo amabili Isikhungo esifanayo ◎ Ngokumaphakathi ◎ Iphoyinti negculo Iphoyinti lihlala esikhungweni segculo M Iphakathi M Iphoyinti nomugqa Iphoyinti lihlala ephakathini komugqa ↔ Ngokufana ↔ Amaphoyinti amabili nomugqa Amaphoyinti angezithombe zesibuko zomunye ngokusho komugqa (Isibuko sidala lezi) ⚓ Bopha ⚓ Iphoyinti, umugqa, igculo noma i-spline Iyibamba ngqo lapho ikhona manje (i-spline: amaphoyinti ayo) Imigqa lapha ihlanganisa nemigqa yesisekelo. Ukudweba kwengeza ezinye izixhumanisi ngawe: ukunamathela ephoyinteni kwenza liyahlangana, ukunamathela egculweni kubeka iphoyinti kulo, imigqa esedlule ukuba ithe xaxa noma ethi ngqo ithola H noma V, nesikwele sinezikhona zaso ezine exhunyiwe, ezimbili H nezimbili V. Bopha kuyindlela esheshayo yokumisa into ukuthi ingahambi, kodwa-ke ingxenye ngeke ilandele ukushintsha kwesilinganiso esiseceleni. Kungcono izilinganiso ezisuka emsuka. Izilinganiso Inkinobho Khetha Ilinganisa Ibonakala njengo Ibanga Umugqa Ubude bawo Ibanga 40 Ibanga Amaphoyinti amabili Ibanga eliqondile phakathi kwawo Ibanga 40 Ibanga Iphoyinti nomugqa Ibanga kusuka ephoyinteni liye emugqeni, ngokuqondile kuwo Ibanga 40 Ibanga Imigqa emibili ehambisanayo Igebe phakathi kwawo Ibanga 40 Ibanga elithe xaxa Amaphoyinti amabili, noma umugqa Ibanga elithe xaxa kuphela (kwesobunxele nakwesokudla) Ibanga elithe xaxa 40 Ibanga elithi ngqo Amaphoyinti amabili, noma umugqa Ibanga elithi ngqo kuphela (phezulu nphansi) Ibanga elithi ngqo 40 Umsakazo Indilinga noma umnsalo Umsakazo wawo Umsakazo R10 Ububanzi Indilinga noma umnsalo Ububanzi bawo Ububanzi ⌀20 I-engeli Imigqa emibili engahambisani I-engeli phakathi kwawo, kusuka ku-0 kuya ku-180 amadigri I-engeli 30° Ngethuluzi lesilinganiso, i-PartCraft ikhetha uhlobo ngokuchofoza kwakho nangendawo ofaka ngayo inombolo: Uchofoza Uthola Umugqa oyodwa Ubude bawo; uma uthambekile, ithi xaxa uma inombolo iphezulu noma ingaphansi kwawo, ithi ngqo uma ingecele Indilinga oyodwa Ububanzi Umnsalo oyodwa Umsakazo Amaphoyinti amabili Ibanga; ithi xaxa noma ithi ngqo njengomugqa othambekile Iphoyinti nomugqa Ibanga kusuka ephoyinteni liye emugqeni Imigqa emibili I-engeli, noma ibanga uma ihambisanayo Iphoyinti nendilinga Akukho: \"Lezo zinto azikwazi ukulinganiswa ndawonye.\" Linganisa esikhungweni sendilinga esikhundleni salokho Ukuhambisa (kubonakala njengebanga) kwenziwa ithuluzi lokuhambisa: ligcina umugqa okopishwe ulingana ebangeni elithile, noma igculo okopishwe noma indilinga egxilile nomsakazo omkhulu noma omncane ngalelo banga. Ezinye izingxenye zalokho kuhambisa okufanayo zithwala ixhumanisi O futhi zilandela isilinganiso esisodwa sokuhambisa. Bona Ama-spline, Sika, Ukuhambisa namanye amathuluzi esikethi. Izinani zesilinganiso zingamamilimitha (noma amadigri), azikaze zibe ngaphansi kwezeru. Umsakazo nobububanzi kumele kube ngaphezu kwezeru. Inani lezeru liyavunyelwa ebangeni: amaphoyinti ahlukaniswe ngo-0 ahlangene. Ukuziphatha kokuxazulula Ukunyakaza okuncane kakhulu. Inani lishintsha, isixazululi sihambisa ijometri kancane ngangokunokwenzeka. Umugqa obude bawo bushintsha ukhula ngokulinganayo emaphethelweni omabili uma kungekho lutho olubamba noma yiliphi uhlangothi. Akukho ukuguqula. Amabanga kusuka ephoyinteni kuya emugqeni, amabanga athe xaxa nathi ngqo, ama-engeli nokuthintana akhumbula uhlangothi ayenziwe ngalo. Ukushintsha inani akusoze kuguqule ijometri iye ohlangothini olunye. Ukungqubuzana kushiya izinto njengazo. Uma izixhumanisi zishaywa omunye, isikethi sihlala njengasemandulo futhi ezingqubuzanayo ziba bomvana. Izixhumanisi ezeqile (ezishiwo ezinye) zikhonjwa ebhaleni lesimo (\"Sekushiwo ngaphambili. Susa lokho.\") futhi isici sisakhiwa, nesexwayiso. Izinhlangano zokuthinta. Lapho umnsalo we-fillet uhlangana nemigqa yawo eshaye iphoyinti lokuphela elifanayo, ukuthinta kuxazululwa ngendlela ehlala icacile lapho, ngakho izigoba zesikethi zingafundwa njengezichazwe ngokweqile. Akukatholakali okwamanje Izixhumanisi ze-collinear, coradial kanye ne-pierce; iphoyinti ku-spline; izilinganiso ezilawulwa (zereferensi); izilinganiso ze-ordinate nobude bomsakazo; izibalo phakathi kwezilinganiso. Sebenzisa Ihambisanayo kanye nebanga elingu-0 emigqeni ye-collinear.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"features","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izici nezinketho zazo","summary":"Isici ngasinye ebhodini lamathuluzi nezilungiselelo zaso, okuzenzakalelayo nemikhawulo, kusukela ekukhipheni kuya ku-fillet, ku-shell nasezolidini ze-STEP ezingeniswe, izenzo ezabelwa yizici zonke, nezilungiselelo zengxenye.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["izici","okungakakhiwa","khipha","sika","vuvuka","sika okuvuvukile","umgodi","iphethini yomugqa","iphethini yesiyingi","isibonakaliso","fillet","chamfer","shell","ngenisa","izinketho","okuzenzakalelayo","izilungiselelo","ukuqina","amajika","ukuvimbela","ukubuyela emuva"],"headings":[{"id":"isikethi","text":"Isikethi","level":2},{"id":"khipha-nesika","text":"Khipha nesika","level":2},{"id":"jikeleza-nokusika-okujikelezayo","text":"Jikeleza nokusika okujikelezayo","level":2},{"id":"umgodi","text":"Umgodi","level":2},{"id":"iphethini-elilayini","text":"Iphethini elilayini","level":2},{"id":"iphethini-elijikelezayo","text":"Iphethini elijikelezayo","level":2},{"id":"isibonakaliso","text":"Isibonakaliso","level":2},{"id":"fillet-ne-chamfer","text":"Fillet ne-Chamfer","level":2},{"id":"shell","text":"Shell","level":2},{"id":"isolidi-esingeniswe","text":"Isolidi esingeniswe","level":2},{"id":"konke-isici-sinakho","text":"Konke isici sinakho","level":2},{"id":"izimo-komlando","text":"Izimo komlando","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo-zengxenye","text":"Izilungiselelo zengxenye","level":2},{"id":"ukuqondisa-kwamajika","text":"Ukuqondisa kwamajika","level":3},{"id":"akukakhiwa-okwamanje","text":"Akukakhiwa okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzici zibhalwa komlando ngokuhlelwa kwazo kwenziwa futhi zakhiwa kabusha kusuka phezulu kuya phansi. Ngasinye sibizwa ngohlobo lwaso nenombolo: Sketch1, Extrude1, Revolve1, Hole1, LPattern1, CirPattern1, Mirror1, Fillet1, Chamfer1, Shell1, Imported1.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yakha zonke izici nge-mesh kernel. I-Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe, ne-Shell ivula izinhlangothi ezithe. Izolidi ezingeniswe zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo: azikakhiwa, futhi isigaba sazo esingezansi sichaza ukuthi ingxenye eyenziwe enguqulweni yakudala iyigcina. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E ne-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikethi\"\u003EIsikethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFront, Top noma Right, noma ubuso obuthe. Iyabonakala, ayishintshwa: ukuze uhambise isikethi, yenza esisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIcacisiwe ngokugcwele, Icacisiwe ngaphansi (nezinqumo zokunyakaza), Icacisiwe ngaphezu, noma Akukho lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjometri, Ukuxhumana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMangaki amajika, amaphoyinti nokuxhumana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezishayelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZonke izilinganiso zesikethi, ezishintshekayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela isikethi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha njenge-DXF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha-nesika\"\u003EKhipha nesika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E zenza isici esifanayo, siqale ngezilungiselelo ezihlukile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhipha kuqala ku-\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkusika kuqala ku-\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsenzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi (engeza impahla), Sika (susa impahla), Hlanganisa (gcina ukuhlangana), Isidumbu esisha (akukakhiwa kule nguqulo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuvaliwe (ukujula), Phakathi kwendiza (zombili izindlela), Konke kudlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke kudlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-1,000,000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe / Kuvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphrofayili: wonke amalunu avaliwe emigqeni eqinile, emasongweni namasekhono esikethini. Amalunu angaphakathi kwamanye amalunu ayimigodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKonke kudlule kusebenza kuphela kwezokusika. Ifinyelela ngqo ngaphakathi kwengxenye ohlangothini olukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusika kungena empahleni, kude nohlangothi lwendiza yesikethi oluphuma ngaphandle; Phendula indlela iyaguqula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jikeleza-nokusika-okujikelezayo\"\u003EJikeleza nokusika okujikelezayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsenzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi, Sika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiqukathi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E), Sika (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusikwa okujikelezayo\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlangana (°)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-360\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wokuqala wephakathi, noma yimuphi umugqa noma umugqa wephakathi wesikethi, noma isici seeksisi esilele endizeni yesikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa wokuqala wephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphrofayili kumele ihlale ohlangothini olulodwa leeksisi. Ingayithinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEksisi yokujikeleza ingasetshenziswa yizakhiwo ezijikelezayo nezixhumanisi zenhlanganisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umgodi\"\u003EUmgodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOlula, Counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOlula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke kudlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvuliwe / Kuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma Konke kudlule kuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi be-counterbore ⌀\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKubanzi kunomgodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula kwe-counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKujulile kancane kunomgodi ovaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe / Kuvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmgodi owodwa kuwo wonke amaphoyinti angalungiswanga esikethi (amaphoyinti adalwe ngethuluzi lephoyinti). Iphaneli ibonisa ukuthi mangaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigodi ibhodla ngokuqondile endizeni yesikethi, ingene empahleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEksisi yomgodi ngamunye ingasetshenziswa izixhumanisi zenhlanganisela (&quot;Hole1, hole 2&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iphethini-elilayini\"\u003EIphethini elilayini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici ezizokopishelwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma yiziphi izici zesolidi ezingaphezulu kwalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esikhethiwe, kungenjalo isici sesolidi sokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi ye-X, eksisi ye-Y, eksisi ye-Z; umugqa wesikethi sangaphambilini; eksisi yokujikeleza; umphetho okhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi ye-X (noma umphetho okhethwe lapho wengeza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma yisiphi isibalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusukela ku-1 kuya ku-1000, kubandakanya okwangempela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe / Kuvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iphethini-elijikelezayo\"\u003EIphethini elijikelezayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici ezizokopishelwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengakwelilayini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengakwelilayini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengakwe-Indlela phezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEksisi yokujikeleza yakamuva, kungenjalo eksisi ye-Y (noma umphetho okhethiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlangana (°)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-360. I-360 ibeka izikhopi ngokulinganayo zonke; okungaphansi kuzisakaza ngaphezu kwelo hlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusukela ku-1 kuya ku-1000, kubandakanya okwangempela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe / Kuvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonakaliso\"\u003EIsibonakaliso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibonakaliso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsidumbu sonke (njengoba sakhiwe kwaze kwaba manje), noma izici ezikhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esikhethiwe, kungenjalo isidumbu sonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleni lesibonakaliso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFront, Top noma Right; ubuso obuthe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleni le-Right, noma ubuso obuthe okukhethwe lapho wengeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fillet-ne-chamfer\"\u003EFillet ne-Chamfer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule nguqulo i-mesh kernel iyazakha emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe (amakhona angaphandle noma angaphakathi), nomsantsa oyodwa. Umphetho ojikelezayo uthi &quot;Fillet: kule nguqulo kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe (i-mesh kernel iyawakha). Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho egobile esikethini.&quot;; lapho imiphetho ejikelezayo ihlangana ekhoneni iyasikwa (mitred), nesici sixwayisa &quot;Fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho ejikelezayo ihlangana iyasikwa, ayixutshwa.&quot; Izinhlobo ze-Chamfer (ibanga elilinganayo, amabanga amabili, ibanga nengonyama, no-\u003Cstrong\u003EFlip sides\u003C/strong\u003E) zonke ziyasebenza. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EJikeleza, gobisa nokwenza kube yisikhwama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsantsa (mm) (Fillet)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga (mm) (Chamfer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0, linye kuzo zombili izinhlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ekhethiwe, ngayinye ibhalwe ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo (&quot;Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side&quot;), ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ekhethwe lapho wengeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha imiphetho ngaphambi kokukhetha inkinobho (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ukuze uthole eminingi), noma khetha inkinobho kungakhethiwe lutho bese uchofoza imiphetho kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E (noma chofoza kabili isici) iyashintsha imiphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho igcinwa ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo, ngakho isinda kushintsha kosayizi ngaphambili komlando.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shell\"\u003EShell\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-mesh kernel iyayakha. Izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela zingavulwa (&quot;Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).&quot;); izindonga zobukhulu obuhlukene azikakhiwa okwamanje. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EJikeleza, gobisa nokwenza kube yisikhwama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdonga (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphezu kwe-0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindonga zikhula ngaphandle (izinhlangothi zihlala ngaphakathi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe: izindonga ziya ngaphakathi. Kuvuliwe: izindonga ziya ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi ezivulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi ezisusiwe, okungenani eyodwa, ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi ezikhethwe lapho wengeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E iyashintsha izinhlangothi ezivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isolidi-esingeniswe\"\u003EIsolidi esingeniswe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenziwa ngokuvula ifayela le-STEP, STL, OBJ noma 3MF: umzimba wesolidi wamatriyangula ongenalo umlando wawo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF\u003C/a\u003E). Ibonisa ifayela elivela kulo nokulungisa okwenziwe ngokungeniswa; \u003Cstrong\u003EIyunithi kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisela ukuze\u003C/strong\u003E ziyahleleka. Isolidi se-STEP esingeniswe yinguqulo yakudala enekernel eqondile sihlala komlando simakwe njengokungakakhiwa; vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze ulingenise njengamatriyangula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzenzakalelayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhezulu kufayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ up (izinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD), Y up\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ up\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphethini nezibonakaliso zingakopisha isolidi esingeniswe, kodwa hhayi i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"konke-isici-sinakho\"\u003EKonke isici sinakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzansi kwephaneli yesici ngasinye:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVimbela\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ekuvinjelweni\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyivala noma ivule. Izici ezidinga kuwo azakhiwa kuze kube yilapho ivaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela lapha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYakha kuphela izici ezingaphezulu kwalo. Izici ezintsha zingena ebhalweni lokubuyela emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela kabusha, lapho okungasetshenziswa yisici kungaphela ngaphansi kwaso. Kuba mpunga nesizathu uma kungenjalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsisusa, futhi (emva kokubuza) zonke izici ezisisebenzisayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha igama (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-60)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzici ezinesikethi zidlule nazo \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zesikethi\u003C/strong\u003E, ezishintshekayo ngqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimo-komlando\"\u003EIzimo komlando\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkubonakala njengakho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwakhiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokujwayelekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke kuhle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsexwayiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwakhiwe, kukhona okufanele kuhlolwe: &quot;Over defined: 1 relation is not needed.&quot; noma &quot;Nothing is left of the part after this.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ iphutha, bomvu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyikwazanga ukwakhiwa; umyalezo uchaza ngani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ akukakhiwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdinga isici esehlulekile, esivinjiwe noma esibuyele emuva, noma idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo (&quot;Sweep: not built yet. …&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvinjiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eivaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbuyele emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eikhanya ngaphansi kwebha yokubuyela emuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa uze ubuyele phambili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo-zengxenye\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zengxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho. Iphaneli yangakwesokudla ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E: igama lengxenye, elisetshenziswa emagameni amafayela nakubhulokhi yesihloko somdwebo (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-120).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E: bheka ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuqondisa-kwamajika\"\u003EUkuqondisa kwamajika\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-mesh kernel yakha isolidi ngokwayo ngobuso obuthe, ngakho umbono, i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP enobuso, ivolumu nemibono yomdwebo konke kulandela \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E: mangaki ama-facet ngesiyingi ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAma-facet ngokujikeleza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIvolumu yesimo esijikelezayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuqinile (32 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E32\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe ngaphansi ka-0.64 % kwenani eliqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkujwayelekile (64 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E64\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe ngaphansi ka-0.16 % (okuzenzakalelayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuhle (128 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E128\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe ngaphansi ka-0.04 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E256\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe ngaphansi ka-0.01 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmajika aqinile enza ukukhipha nemibono ibushelelezi, nokwakha kabusha kuhamba kancane. Lesi silungiselelo sigcinwa efayelini lengxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakhiwa-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-fillet anobubanzi obuguquguqukayo, ama-fillet nama-chamfer emaphethelweni ajikelezayo, ama-shell avula izinhlangothi ezigobile, i-draft ezinhlangothini ezigobile, i-sweep, i-loft, i-rib, izolidi ze-STEP ezinezinhlangothi ezigobile eziqondile, izidumbu ezintsha, ama-taper, &quot;kuze kube&quot; ubuso noma i-vertex, nezikhombo ezinhlangothini nasemaphethelweni esolidi, zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo. Futhi akukakhiwa: imigodi enesikulufo nemigodi ye-countersunk. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izici zibhalwa komlando ngokuhlelwa kwazo kwenziwa futhi zakhiwa kabusha kusuka phezulu kuya phansi. Ngasinye sibizwa ngohlobo lwaso nenombolo: Sketch1, Extrude1, Revolve1, Hole1, LPattern1, CirPattern1, Mirror1, Fillet1, Chamfer1, Shell1, Imported1. I-PartCraft yakha zonke izici nge-mesh kernel. I-Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe, ne-Shell ivula izinhlangothi ezithe. Izolidi ezingeniswe zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo: azikakhiwa, futhi isigaba sazo esingezansi sichaza ukuthi ingxenye eyenziwe enguqulweni yakudala iyigcina. Bheka I-mesh kernel ne-Akukakhiwa okwamanje. Isikethi Isilungiselelo Amanothi Ipuleni Front, Top noma Right, noma ubuso obuthe. Iyabonakala, ayishintshwa: ukuze uhambise isikethi, yenza esisha Isimo Icacisiwe ngokugcwele, Icacisiwe ngaphansi (nezinqumo zokunyakaza), Icacisiwe ngaphezu, noma Akukho lutho Ijometri, Ukuxhumana Mangaki amajika, amaphoyinti nokuxhumana Izilinganiso ezishayelayo Zonke izilinganiso zesikethi, ezishintshekayo Izinkinobho: Hlela isikethi, Khipha njenge-DXF. Khipha nesika Ukukhipha kanye Sika zenza isici esifanayo, siqale ngezilungiselelo ezihlukile. Isilungiselelo Izinketho Ukukhipha kuqala ku- Ukusika kuqala ku- Isenzo Isiqukathi (engeza impahla), Sika (susa impahla), Hlanganisa (gcina ukuhlangana), Isidumbu esisha (akukakhiwa kule nguqulo) Isiqukathi Sika Ukuphela Okuvaliwe (ukujula), Phakathi kwendiza (zombili izindlela), Konke kudlule Okuvaliwe Konke kudlule Ukujula (mm) Ngaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-1,000,000 10 10 Phendula indlela Kuvalwe / Kuvuliwe Kuvalwe Kuvalwe Iphrofayili: wonke amalunu avaliwe emigqeni eqinile, emasongweni namasekhono esikethini. Amalunu angaphakathi kwamanye amalunu ayimigodi. Konke kudlule kusebenza kuphela kwezokusika. Ifinyelela ngqo ngaphakathi kwengxenye ohlangothini olukhethiwe. Ukusika kungena empahleni, kude nohlangothi lwendiza yesikethi oluphuma ngaphandle; Phendula indlela iyaguqula. Jikeleza nokusika okujikelezayo Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Isenzo Isiqukathi, Sika Isiqukathi (Jikeleza), Sika (Okwengeziwe › Ukusikwa okujikelezayo) Ukuhlangana (°) Ngaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-360 360 Eksisi Umugqa wokuqala wephakathi, noma yimuphi umugqa noma umugqa wephakathi wesikethi, noma isici seeksisi esilele endizeni yesikethi Umugqa wokuqala wephakathi Iphrofayili kumele ihlale ohlangothini olulodwa leeksisi. Ingayithinta. Eksisi yokujikeleza ingasetshenziswa yizakhiwo ezijikelezayo nezixhumanisi zenhlanganisela. Umgodi Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Uhlobo Olula, Counterbore Olula Ububanzi (mm) Ngaphezu kwe-0 6 Konke kudlule Kuvuliwe / Kuvaliwe Kuvuliwe Ukujula (mm) Uma Konke kudlule kuvaliwe 10 Ububanzi be-counterbore ⌀ Kubanzi kunomgodi 11 Ukujula kwe-counterbore Kujulile kancane kunomgodi ovaliwe 6 Phendula indlela Kuvalwe / Kuvuliwe Kuvalwe Umgodi owodwa kuwo wonke amaphoyinti angalungiswanga esikethi (amaphoyinti adalwe ngethuluzi lephoyinti). Iphaneli ibonisa ukuthi mangaki. Imigodi ibhodla ngokuqondile endizeni yesikethi, ingene empahleni. Eksisi yomgodi ngamunye ingasetshenziswa izixhumanisi zenhlanganisela (\"Hole1, hole 2\"). Iphethini elilayini Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Izici ezizokopishelwa Noma yiziphi izici zesolidi ezingaphezulu kwalo Isici esikhethiwe, kungenjalo isici sesolidi sokugcina Indlela Eksisi ye-X, eksisi ye-Y, eksisi ye-Z; umugqa wesikethi sangaphambilini; eksisi yokujikeleza; umphetho okhethiwe Eksisi ye-X (noma umphetho okhethwe lapho wengeza) Ibanga (mm) Noma yisiphi isibalo 20 Inani Kusukela ku-1 kuya ku-1000, kubandakanya okwangempela 3 Phendula indlela Kuvalwe / Kuvuliwe Kuvalwe Iphethini elijikelezayo Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Izici ezizokopishelwa Njengakwelilayini Njengakwelilayini Eksisi Njengakwe-Indlela phezulu Eksisi yokujikeleza yakamuva, kungenjalo eksisi ye-Y (noma umphetho okhethiwe) Ukuhlangana (°) Ngaphezu kwe-0, kuze kube ku-360. I-360 ibeka izikhopi ngokulinganayo zonke; okungaphansi kuzisakaza ngaphezu kwelo hlangana 360 Inani Kusukela ku-1 kuya ku-1000, kubandakanya okwangempela 6 Phendula indlela Kuvalwe / Kuvuliwe Kuvalwe Isibonakaliso Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Isibonakaliso Isidumbu sonke (njengoba sakhiwe kwaze kwaba manje), noma izici ezikhethiwe Isici esikhethiwe, kungenjalo isidumbu sonke Ipuleni lesibonakaliso Front, Top noma Right; ubuso obuthe Ipuleni le-Right, noma ubuso obuthe okukhethwe lapho wengeza Fillet ne-Chamfer Kule nguqulo i-mesh kernel iyazakha emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe (amakhona angaphandle noma angaphakathi), nomsantsa oyodwa. Umphetho ojikelezayo uthi \"Fillet: kule nguqulo kuphela emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili ezithe (i-mesh kernel iyawakha). Jikeleza noma gobisa imiphetho egobile esikethini.\"; lapho imiphetho ejikelezayo ihlangana ekhoneni iyasikwa (mitred), nesici sixwayisa \"Fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho ejikelezayo ihlangana iyasikwa, ayixutshwa.\" Izinhlobo ze-Chamfer (ibanga elilinganayo, amabanga amabili, ibanga nengonyama, no-Flip sides) zonke ziyasebenza. Bheka Jikeleza, gobisa nokwenza kube yisikhwama. Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Umsantsa (mm) (Fillet) Ngaphezu kwe-0 2 Ibanga (mm) (Chamfer) Ngaphezu kwe-0, linye kuzo zombili izinhlangothi 1 Imiphetho Imiphetho ekhethiwe, ngayinye ibhalwe ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo (\"Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side\"), ne-Susa Imiphetho ekhethwe lapho wengeza Khetha imiphetho ngaphambi kokukhetha inkinobho (Shift+chofoza ukuze uthole eminingi), noma khetha inkinobho kungakhethiwe lutho bese uchofoza imiphetho kamuva. Khetha imiphetho (noma chofoza kabili isici) iyashintsha imiphetho. Imiphetho igcinwa ngezinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangene nazo, ngakho isinda kushintsha kosayizi ngaphambili komlando. Shell I-mesh kernel iyayakha. Izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela zingavulwa (\"Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi ezithe kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakha).\"); izindonga zobukhulu obuhlukene azikakhiwa okwamanje. Bheka Jikeleza, gobisa nokwenza kube yisikhwama. Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Udonga (mm) Ngaphezu kwe-0 2 Izindonga zikhula ngaphandle (izinhlangothi zihlala ngaphakathi) Kuvalwe: izindonga ziya ngaphakathi. Kuvuliwe: izindonga ziya ngaphandle Kuvalwe Izinhlangothi ezivulekile Izinhlangothi ezisusiwe, okungenani eyodwa, ne-Susa Izinhlangothi ezikhethwe lapho wengeza Khetha izinhlangothi iyashintsha izinhlangothi ezivulekile. Isolidi esingeniswe Yenziwa ngokuvula ifayela le-STEP, STL, OBJ noma 3MF: umzimba wesolidi wamatriyangula ongenalo umlando wawo (Vula ifayela le-STEP, Vula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF). Ibonisa ifayela elivela kulo nokulungisa okwenziwe ngokungeniswa; Iyunithi kufayela, Phezulu kufayela no Sebenzisela ukuze ziyahleleka. Isolidi se-STEP esingeniswe yinguqulo yakudala enekernel eqondile sihlala komlando simakwe njengokungakakhiwa; vula kabusha ifayela le-STEP ukuze ulingenise njengamatriyangula. Isilungiselelo Izinketho Okuzenzakalelayo Phezulu kufayela Z up (izinhlelo eziningi ze-CAD), Y up Z up Amaphethini nezibonakaliso zingakopisha isolidi esingeniswe, kodwa hhayi i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell. Konke isici sinakho Ezansi kwephaneli yesici ngasinye: Inkinobho Yenza Vimbela / Khipha ekuvinjelweni Iyivala noma ivule. Izici ezidinga kuwo azakhiwa kuze kube yilapho ivaliwe Buyela lapha Yakha kuphela izici ezingaphezulu kwalo. Izici ezintsha zingena ebhalweni lokubuyela emuva Hambisa phezulu / Hambisa phansi Hlela kabusha, lapho okungasetshenziswa yisici kungaphela ngaphansi kwaso. Kuba mpunga nesizathu uma kungenjalo Susa Isisusa, futhi (emva kokubuza) zonke izici ezisisebenzisayo Igama Shintsha igama (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-60) Izici ezinesikethi zidlule nazo Izilinganiso zesikethi, ezishintshekayo ngqo. Izimo komlando Isimo Okubonakala njengakho Incazelo Kwakhiwe Ngokujwayelekile Konke kuhle Isexwayiso ⚠ Kwakhiwe, kukhona okufanele kuhlolwe: \"Over defined: 1 relation is not needed.\" noma \"Nothing is left of the part after this.\" Iphutha ⚠ iphutha, bomvu Ayikwazanga ukwakhiwa; umyalezo uchaza ngani Akukakhiwa ⚠ akukakhiwa Idinga isici esehlulekile, esivinjiwe noma esibuyele emuva, noma idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo (\"Sweep: not built yet. …\") Ivinjiwe ivaliwe Ivalwe Ibuyele emuva ikhanya ngaphansi kwebha yokubuyela emuva Akukakhiwa uze ubuyele phambili Izilungiselelo zengxenye Chofoza isikhala esingenalutho ukuze kungakhethwa lutho. Iphaneli yangakwesokudla ibonisa Ingxenye: Igama: igama lengxenye, elisetshenziswa emagameni amafayela nakubhulokhi yesihloko somdwebo (kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-120). Amajika: bheka ngezansi. Ukuqondisa kwamajika I-mesh kernel yakha isolidi ngokwayo ngobuso obuthe, ngakho umbono, i-STL, i-3MF, i-STEP enobuso, ivolumu nemibono yomdwebo konke kulandela Amajika: mangaki ama-facet ngesiyingi ngasinye. Isilungiselelo Ama-facet ngokujikeleza Ivolumu yesimo esijikelezayo Kuqinile (32 ngokujikeleza) 32 Cishe ngaphansi ka-0.64 % kwenani eliqondile Okujwayelekile (64 ngokujikeleza) 64 Cishe ngaphansi ka-0.16 % (okuzenzakalelayo) Kuhle (128 ngokujikeleza) 128 Cishe ngaphansi ka-0.04 % Kuhle kakhulu (256 ngokujikeleza) 256 Cishe ngaphansi ka-0.01 % Amajika aqinile enza ukukhipha nemibono ibushelelezi, nokwakha kabusha kuhamba kancane. Lesi silungiselelo sigcinwa efayelini lengxenye. Akukakhiwa okwamanje Ama-fillet anobubanzi obuguquguqukayo, ama-fillet nama-chamfer emaphethelweni ajikelezayo, ama-shell avula izinhlangothi ezigobile, i-draft ezinhlangothini ezigobile, i-sweep, i-loft, i-rib, izolidi ze-STEP ezinezinhlangothi ezigobile eziqondile, izidumbu ezintsha, ama-taper, \"kuze kube\" ubuso noma i-vertex, nezikhombo ezinhlangothini nasemaphethelweni esolidi, zidinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo. Futhi akukakhiwa: imigodi enesikulufo nemigodi ye-countersunk. Bheka Akukakhiwa okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"file-formats","scope":"partcraft","title":"Amafomethi amafayela","summary":"Wonke amafayela i-PartCraft ayawafunda ayawabhala, nezandiso, iyunithi, amaeksisi nokuthi ngayinye iyagcina noma ilahle yini.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["amafomethi","izinhlobo zamafayela","izandiso","usd","usdz","3dm","ifc","bim","partcraft.json","partcraft-asm.json","stl","3mf","obj","mesh","step","stp","ap242","dxf","r12","pdf","gltf","iges","iyunithi","z up"],"headings":[{"id":"amafayela-e-partcraft","text":"Amafayela e-PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"ama-facet-nokuqondile","text":"Ama-facet nokuqondile","level":2},{"id":"akusekelwe-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akusekelwe kule nguqulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomethi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsandiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVula\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELondoloza noma khipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEksisi phezulu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIgcina\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ye-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmlando ogcwele: amasikethi, ukuxhumana, izilinganiso, izici, ukuvinjwa, ukubuyela emuva, isilungiselelo samajika, izilungiselelo zomdwebo ne-GD&amp;T, umbhalo we-STEP owangeniswa kwenguqulo yakudala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInhlanganisela ye-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E kwinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke ingxenye (efakiwe), amakhophi nezindawo zawo, izixhumanisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL (binary noma umbhalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, njengomzimba wesolidi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (kubuzwa uma kuvulwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-triyangula wesolidi kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, njengomzimba wesolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (ichazwe kufayela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi njengento eyodwa ye-mesh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, njengomzimba wesolidi (ubuso kuphela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekubuzwa uma kuvulwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ noma Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP (AP203, AP214, AP242)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, njengomzimba wesolidi ofundwa njengamatriyangula (ubuso obugobile budwetshwa njengama-facet; ubuso obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi efayela kugcinwa ukuze kukhishwe ngokuqondile): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (kusukela eyunithini yefayela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ, noma Y uma ukhethile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzolidi nemizimba yobuso, izinhlanganisela zazo zonke izingxenye zikuzo; akukho mibala, amagama, isihlahla senhlanganisela noma i-PMI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, njengomzimba wesolidi owodwa kusuka kumeshi nobuso (imeshi elondoloziwe yokubonisa, noma ihlukaniswe): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-.3dm\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusukela eyunithini yefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ, noma Y uma ukhethile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImeshi, ama-polysurface, ukukhishwa nokubekwa kwamabhulokhi njengomzimba owodwa; akukho majika, mibala, izingqimba noma amagama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP242, eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi eyodwa eqondile: ubuso obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi ezindaweni zawo zangempela, imijikelezo namajika aqondile njengemiphetho; izinhlangothi ezigobile zesolidi, izintambo ezenziwe, izidumbu ezivela kumafayela e-mesh nobuso bejika le-STEP zihlala zingama-facet. I-STEP esetshenziswa ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD ne-CAM\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP214, eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi efanayo eqondile kuhlaka lakudala le-AP214, kwezinhlelo ezifunda lokho kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP242, ngobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi evaliwe yobuso obuthe: izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo njengobuso obuthe. Yohlelo olwenqaba ifayela eliqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP214, ngobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (ama-facet, mesh kernel)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi efanayo kuhlaka lakudala le-AP214, kwezinhlelo ezifunda lokho kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphakheji ye-USD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi nempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima; inhlanganisela ngayinye yengxenye kanye kanye namakhophi onke abekiwe: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"partcraft/usd\"\u003EKhipha njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC 4\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC 4 (ngazo zonke izici)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwakheka njengamatriyangula, impahla, yonke iparamitha, ibhulokhi yesihloko, izinkulumo; izingxenye zenhlanganisela njengezinhlobo namakhophi abekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF R12, isikethi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E nesikethi esikhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ex, y zesikethi uqobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa, amasongo namasekhono aqondile, amaphoyinti; izingqimba PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION, POINTS\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF R12, ubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe\u003C/span\u003E nobuso obuthe okukhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ex, y zobuso uqobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImikhawulo yobuso: imigodi ejikelezayo njengamasongo aqondile, okunye njengeziphethelo ezivaliwe ze-polyline (imiphetho ejikelezayo njengama-facet)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo we-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm ephepheni le-A3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibono yangaphambili, yangaphezulu, yangakwesokudla, ye-isometric, yesigaba neyemininingwane edwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet, imigqa efihliwe, usayizi jikelele, izimpawu ze-GD&amp;T, ibhulokhi yesihloko\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-e-partcraft\"\u003EAmafayela e-PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili zingumbhalo ocacile (JSON). Isolidi ayigcinwa ngaso sonke isikhathi: i-PartCraft iyakha kabusha kumlando, ngakho amafayela ahlala emancane futhi ahambisana nomlando ngaso sonke isikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela ngalinye linenombolo yenguqulo. Lolu hlobo lubhala ifayela ngalinye lengxenye ngenguqulo esezansi kakhulu egcina okusetshenziswayo (2 kuya ku-5; isidumbu esenziwe kusuka kumeshi sidinga 5) bese livula zonke izinguqulo zakudala. Ifayela elivela kwi-PartCraft yakamuva liyenqatshwa ngomyalezo okhomba zombili izinguqulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWonke amanani ahlolwa lapho ifayela livulwa. Amagama alahlekelwa yizinhlamvu zokulawula; izinombolo ezingaphandle kobuningi, izinkomba zezici ezingekho nezinhlobo zezici ezingaziwa ziyenqatshwa ngesizathu esilula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUngahleli lawa mafayela ngesandla uma ungazi ifomethi. Ifayela elingadlulisi ukuhlolwa aliyikuvuleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye enesolidi enkulu ye-STEP eyangeniswa kwenguqulo yakudala ingadlula i-50 MB, okukhulu kakhulu i-PartCraft ingalivula njengefayela lengxenye (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting#file-problems\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"file-problems\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-facet-nokuqondile\"\u003EAma-facet nokuqondile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-STL ne-3MF zihlala zenziwe ngama-facet, ngesilungiselelo se-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E, kanjalo ne-DXF yobuso ngaphandle kwemigodi ejikelezayo, eyizindilinga eqondile. I-DXF yesikethi inamasongo namasekhono eqondile, ngoba ivela ngqo esikethini. Lolu hlobo lwakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, ngakho nemibono yomdwebo (nezigaba zifakiwe) inama-facet. Ukukhishwa kwe-STEP okuqondile kuyisici: i-kernel yazi ubuso ngabunye obuqondile esikethini (noma kufayela le-STEP okwavulwa kuso isidumbu), ngakho izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo zibhalwa njengamasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi eqondile noma kunjalo \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajika\u003C/strong\u003E esethwe kuwo (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EKhipha ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akusekelwe-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkusekelwe kule nguqulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomethi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EglTF, IGES, Parasolid, ACIS (ngenayo noma ngaphandle); ukukhishwa kwe-OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhalwa kuphela yi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003Ephakheji yezinguqulo\u003C/a\u003E, njengeshidi lomdwebo lokucushwa ngakunye. Ayifundwa, futhi akukho okunye ukukhishwa. Khipha i-DXF; zonke izinhlelo ze-CAD zivula i-R12 DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STEP yenhlanganisela nomdwebo wenhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje. Khipha ingxenye ngayinye njenge-STEP eqondile; i-STL, i-3MF nohlu lwempahla kukhishwa kwinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela wengxenye nenhlanganisela wezinye izinhlelo (ngaphandle kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E, evulwa njengomzimba owodwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ifomethi Isandiso Vula Londoloza noma khipha Iyunithi Eksisi phezulu Igcina Ingxenye ye-PartCraft .partcraft.json Yebo Londoloza mm Y Umlando ogcwele: amasikethi, ukuxhumana, izilinganiso, izici, ukuvinjwa, ukubuyela emuva, isilungiselelo samajika, izilungiselelo zomdwebo ne-GD&T, umbhalo we-STEP owangeniswa kwenguqulo yakudala Inhlanganisela ye-PartCraft .partcraft-asm.json Yebo Londoloza kwinhlanganisela mm Y Yonke ingxenye (efakiwe), amakhophi nezindawo zawo, izixhumanisi STL (binary noma umbhalo) .stl Yebo, njengomzimba wesolidi: Vula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF STL, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D mm (kubuzwa uma kuvulwa) Z Ama-triyangula wesolidi kuphela 3MF .3mf Yebo, njengomzimba wesolidi 3MF, ukuze kuphrintwe nge-3D mm (ichazwe kufayela) Z Isolidi njengento eyodwa ye-mesh OBJ .obj Yebo, njengomzimba wesolidi (ubuso kuphela) Cha kubuzwa uma kuvulwa Z noma Y STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) .step, .stp Yebo, njengomzimba wesolidi ofundwa njengamatriyangula (ubuso obugobile budwetshwa njengama-facet; ubuso obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi efayela kugcinwa ukuze kukhishwe ngokuqondile): Vula ifayela le-STEP mm (kusukela eyunithini yefayela) Z, noma Y uma ukhethile Izolidi nemizimba yobuso, izinhlanganisela zazo zonke izingxenye zikuzo; akukho mibala, amagama, isihlahla senhlanganisela noma i-PMI .3dm .3dm Yebo, njengomzimba wesolidi owodwa kusuka kumeshi nobuso (imeshi elondoloziwe yokubonisa, noma ihlukaniswe): Vula imodeli ye-.3dm Kusukela eyunithini yefayela Z, noma Y uma ukhethile Imeshi, ama-polysurface, ukukhishwa nokubekwa kwamabhulokhi njengomzimba owodwa; akukho majika, mibala, izingqimba noma amagama STEP AP242, eqondile .step STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile) mm Z Isolidi eyodwa eqondile: ubuso obuthe, amasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi ezindaweni zawo zangempela, imijikelezo namajika aqondile njengemiphetho; izinhlangothi ezigobile zesolidi, izintambo ezenziwe, izidumbu ezivela kumafayela e-mesh nobuso bejika le-STEP zihlala zingama-facet. I-STEP esetshenziswa ezinye izinhlelo ze-CAD ne-CAM STEP AP214, eqondile .step STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile) mm Z Isolidi efanayo eqondile kuhlaka lakudala le-AP214, kwezinhlelo ezifunda lokho kuphela STEP AP242, ngobuso .step STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi) mm Y Isolidi evaliwe yobuso obuthe: izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo njengobuso obuthe. Yohlelo olwenqaba ifayela eliqondile STEP AP214, ngobuso .step STEP AP214 (ama-facet, mesh kernel) mm Y Isolidi efanayo kuhlaka lakudala le-AP214, kwezinhlelo ezifunda lokho kuphela Iphakheji ye-USD .usdz Cha Iphakheji ye-USD (.usdz) m Z Isolidi nempahla yayo, ivolumu nobunzima; inhlanganisela ngayinye yengxenye kanye kanye namakhophi onke abekiwe: Khipha njenge-USD IFC 4 .ifc Cha IFC 4 (ngazo zonke izici) mm Z Ukwakheka njengamatriyangula, impahla, yonke iparamitha, ibhulokhi yesihloko, izinkulumo; izingxenye zenhlanganisela njengezinhlobo namakhophi abekiwe DXF R12, isikethi .dxf Cha DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe nesikethi esikhethiwe mm x, y zesikethi uqobo Imigqa, amasongo namasekhono aqondile, amaphoyinti; izingqimba PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION, POINTS DXF R12, ubuso .dxf Cha DXF yesikethi noma yobuso obuthe nobuso obuthe okukhethiwe mm x, y zobuso uqobo Imikhawulo yobuso: imigodi ejikelezayo njengamasongo aqondile, okunye njengeziphethelo ezivaliwe ze-polyline (imiphetho ejikelezayo njengama-facet) Umdwebo we-PDF .pdf Cha Umdwebo (PDF): imibono, isigaba, imininingwane, GD&T mm ephepheni le-A3 Imibono yangaphambili, yangaphezulu, yangakwesokudla, ye-isometric, yesigaba neyemininingwane edwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet, imigqa efihliwe, usayizi jikelele, izimpawu ze-GD&T, ibhulokhi yesihloko Amafayela e-PartCraft Zombili zingumbhalo ocacile (JSON). Isolidi ayigcinwa ngaso sonke isikhathi: i-PartCraft iyakha kabusha kumlando, ngakho amafayela ahlala emancane futhi ahambisana nomlando ngaso sonke isikhathi. Ifayela ngalinye linenombolo yenguqulo. Lolu hlobo lubhala ifayela ngalinye lengxenye ngenguqulo esezansi kakhulu egcina okusetshenziswayo (2 kuya ku-5; isidumbu esenziwe kusuka kumeshi sidinga 5) bese livula zonke izinguqulo zakudala. Ifayela elivela kwi-PartCraft yakamuva liyenqatshwa ngomyalezo okhomba zombili izinguqulo. Wonke amanani ahlolwa lapho ifayela livulwa. Amagama alahlekelwa yizinhlamvu zokulawula; izinombolo ezingaphandle kobuningi, izinkomba zezici ezingekho nezinhlobo zezici ezingaziwa ziyenqatshwa ngesizathu esilula. Ungahleli lawa mafayela ngesandla uma ungazi ifomethi. Ifayela elingadlulisi ukuhlolwa aliyikuvuleka. Ingxenye enesolidi enkulu ye-STEP eyangeniswa kwenguqulo yakudala ingadlula i-50 MB, okukhulu kakhulu i-PartCraft ingalivula njengefayela lengxenye (bheka Ukuxazulula izinkinga). Ama-facet nokuqondile I-STL ne-3MF zihlala zenziwe ngama-facet, ngesilungiselelo se-Amajika, kanjalo ne-DXF yobuso ngaphandle kwemigodi ejikelezayo, eyizindilinga eqondile. I-DXF yesikethi inamasongo namasekhono eqondile, ngoba ivela ngqo esikethini. Lolu hlobo lwakha yonke ingxenye nge-mesh kernel, ngakho nemibono yomdwebo (nezigaba zifakiwe) inama-facet. Ukukhishwa kwe-STEP okuqondile kuyisici: i-kernel yazi ubuso ngabunye obuqondile esikethini (noma kufayela le-STEP okwavulwa kuso isidumbu), ngakho izinhlangothi ezijikelezayo zibhalwa njengamasilinda, amakhoni, amasfere namathoyi eqondile noma kunjalo Amajika esethwe kuwo (bheka Khipha ukuze kuphrintwe, STEP ne-DXF). Akusekelwe kule nguqulo Ifomethi Isimo glTF, IGES, Parasolid, ACIS (ngenayo noma ngaphandle); ukukhishwa kwe-OBJ Akukakhiwa DWG Ibhalwa kuphela yi-phakheji yezinguqulo, njengeshidi lomdwebo lokucushwa ngakunye. Ayifundwa, futhi akukho okunye ukukhishwa. Khipha i-DXF; zonke izinhlelo ze-CAD zivula i-R12 DXF I-STEP yenhlanganisela nomdwebo wenhlanganisela Akukakhiwa okwamanje. Khipha ingxenye ngayinye njenge-STEP eqondile; i-STL, i-3MF nohlu lwempahla kukhishwa kwinhlanganisela Amafayela wengxenye nenhlanganisela wezinye izinhlelo (ngaphandle kwe-.3dm, evulwa njengomzimba owodwa) Akukakhiwa Bheka Akukakhiwa okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"trackpad-and-touch","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ipedi yethrekhi, ukuthinta nezikrini ezincane","summary":"Ungajikeleza, ushelelise nosondeze nge-trackpad ye-Mac noma ye-laptop, okusebenza ezikrinini ezithintwayo nokuthi yini edinga ikhibhodi, nokuthi isikrini sihlelwa kanjani kwifoni noma kuwindi elincane.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","magic mouse","mac","ukuthinta","ithebulethi","ipad","ifoni","pinch","iminwe emibili","right click","secondary click","izinkomba","isikrini esincane","mobile"],"headings":[{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"izikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Izikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"izikrini-ezincane-namafoni","text":"Izikrini ezincane namafoni","level":2},{"id":"amasiphequluli","text":"Amasiphequluli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft yenziwe ngemouse enevili nenkinobho ephakathi, kodwa i-trackpad isebenza kahle uma usazi izinkomba, nesikrini sokuthinta siyasebenza ukubuka izingxenye nokudweba okulula kweskethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikeleza ingxenye (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza uhudule ngomunwe owodwa (noma hudula ngeminwe emithathu, uma uvule ukuhudula ngeminwe emithathu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma ⌘) bese uchofoza uhudule, noma chofoza uhudule ngeminwe emibili icindezelwe (ukuhudula kwe-secondary-click)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikeleza ingxenye, uswayiphe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwayipha ngeminwe emibili; nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuswayipha kushelelisa. Kudinga \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E esethwe ku &quot;Work it out&quot; (okokuqala) noma &quot;Trackpad&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza (3D nokudweba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch. Ukusondeza kuya ngasesikhombisini. Ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E esethwe ku &quot;Mouse wheel&quot;, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili nakho kuyasondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ngesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwayipha ngeminwe emibili (&quot;Work it out&quot; noma &quot;Trackpad&quot;), noma chofoza uhudule ngeminwe emibili icindezelwe. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+hudula akushelelisi eskethini (kudweba iwindi lokukhetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza ekukhetheni eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma ⌘+chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula secondary click ku-Izilungiselelo zesistimu, Trackpad, Point &amp; Click uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikeleza ingxenye (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela i-touchpad (noma thinta ubambe) bese uhudula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula, noma hudula ngesifunda senkinobho yesokudla ecindezelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikeleza ingxenye, uswayiphe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwayipha ngeminwe emibili; nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuswayipha kushelelisa. Kudinga \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E esethwe ku &quot;Work it out&quot; (okokuqala) noma &quot;Trackpad&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza (3D nokudweba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch lapho i-touchpad isekela khona. Ukusondeza kuya ngasesikhombisini. Ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E esethwe ku &quot;Mouse wheel&quot;, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kuyasondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ngesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta ngeminwe emibili, noma ikhona ekhoneni eliphansi kwesokudla letouchpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwayipha ngeminwe emibili (&quot;Work it out&quot; noma &quot;Trackpad&quot;), noma hudula ngesifunda senkinobho yesokudla ecindezelwe. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+hudula akushelelisi eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza ekukhetheni eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E itholakala ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E: &quot;Work it out&quot; (okokuqala) ithatha ukuskrola okungaphansi noma okusanhlamvu njengetrackpad, &quot;Trackpad&quot; ihlala yenza njalo, &quot;Mouse wheel&quot; ayikaze yenze njalo. Pinch iyasondeza kuzo zombili izimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza ibha ye-3D, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezinkinobho zomcibisholo ushelelisa, uma usuchofozile embonweni: kuyasiza ku-trackpad. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisondeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EIzikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ifunda ukuthinta, ngakho amathebulethi, amalaptop athintwayo nama-foni ayasebenza, nemikhawulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkhiye bokuthinta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usuthinte isikrini, kuvela ibha encane ngakwesokudla esingezansi kombono nokhiye abasweli umunwe. Iyanyamalala uma usebenzisa imouse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E: ukhiye we-Esc. Uyakhansela okuqalile noma ubuyele emuva, njengalokho okwenza ukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E (eskethini, nge-Select): uma ivuliwe, ngayinye ukuthinta kwengeza into ekukhetheni noma kuyisuse, njenge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza. Yithinte futhi ukuze ubuyele ekukhetheni into eyodwa ngesikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E (uma udweba uchungechunge lomugqa, i-spline noma i-polygon): iyiqedele, njengokuchofoza ngesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubamba umunwe ungashintshi cishe ingxenyana yesibili kwenza okufanayo ngokuthinta okukodwa: ngethuluzi lokudweba iqedela okudwetshwayo, nge-Select ingeza into engaphansi komunwe ekukhetheni noma iyisuse. Amaphoyinti nemigqa kulula ukuwathinta ngomunwe: i-PartCraft ibheka cishe kabili ukuthinta ngokuzungeza kunokuchofoza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmbonweni we-3D\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmunwe owodwa: jikeleza ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIminwe emibili: pinch ukusondeza, hambisa ndawonye ukushelelisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThinta: khetha ubuso, umphetho noma indiza. Akukho ukukhanyisa kwe-hover ngaphambi kokuthinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEskethini\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThinta ngethuluzi lokudweba ukubeka iphoyinti ngalinye: thinta ukuqala, bese uthinta ukuphela. Ukuhlanganisa kwenzeka lapho ukhipha umunwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIminwe emibili pinch futhi ishelelise. Ukubeka umunwe wesibili kuyayeka ukudonsa okuqale ngomunwe wokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqeda uchungechunge lomugqa, thinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E, bamba umunwe ungashintshi, noma thinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E futhi (noma elinye ithuluzi) ku-toolbar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENge-Select, thinta ukukhetha; hudula iphoyinti noma umugqa ukuwahambisa; hudula endaweni engenalutho ukuze uthole iwindi. Ukuthinta kwesibili kushintsha ukukhetha, ngaphandle uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe (noma ubambe umunwe ungashintshi kwenye into yesibili).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha isilinganiso, sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwaso ephaneli yesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIshidi lombumbo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThinta ukubeka nokukhetha izimpawu, bese uhudula impawu ukuyinyakazisa. Pinch ukusondeza, hambisa iminwe emibili ukushelelisa, noma hudula umunwe owodwa phezu kwephepha elingenalutho. Umunwe wesibili uyayima impawu oyihudulayo, futhi ibuyele emuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkudinga ikhibhodi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubhala izinombolo: ikhibhodi yesikrini iyavela emabhokisini wezinombolo nasezindaweni zezilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinkinobho zamathuluzi: sebenzisa i-toolbar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikrini-ezincane-namafoni\"\u003EIzikrini ezincane namafoni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-1280 pixels noma ngaphezulu, i-toolbar ilingana emugqeni owodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi kuka-760 no-1100 pixels, amaphaneli ohlangothini aba mancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kuka-760 pixels (ifoni, noma iwindi elincane), isikrini siyagxilwa: i-toolbar (swayipha ngokuhlangene ukuthola izinkinobho eziningi), umbono we-3D, ibha yesimo, bese amaphaneli wezakhiwo nomlando. Skrola ikhasi ukuze ufinyelele amaphaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImenyu (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono\u003C/span\u003E) ivula kuwo wonke ububanzi besikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-iPhone akukho imodi yesikrini esigcwele ku-browser; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho yemodi yesikrini zishintsha kuphela phakathi kwejwayelekile nokufihla amabha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfoni iyanele ukuvula ingxenye, ukuyijikeleza nokuhlola izinto zayo. Ukumodela okwangempela kudinga isikrini esikhulu nemouse noma trackpad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amasiphequluli\"\u003EAmasiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmasiphequluli amanje e-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari asebenzisa i-PartCraft ku-Windows, macOS nakwa-Linux, nasemathebulethini nasemafonini, uma i-WebGL ne-WebAssembly zitholakala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EAmasiphequluli nezikhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft yenziwe ngemouse enevili nenkinobho ephakathi, kodwa i-trackpad isebenza kahle uma usazi izinkomba, nesikrini sokuthinta siyasebenza ukubuka izingxenye nokudweba okulula kweskethi. Trackpad Ukuthi Yenza lokhu Jikeleza ingxenye (3D) Chofoza uhudule ngomunwe owodwa (noma hudula ngeminwe emithathu, uma uvule ukuhudula ngeminwe emithathu) Shelelisa (3D) Bamba Shift (noma ⌘) bese uchofoza uhudule, noma chofoza uhudule ngeminwe emibili icindezelwe (ukuhudula kwe-secondary-click) Jikeleza ingxenye, uswayiphe Swayipha ngeminwe emibili; nge-Shift, ukuswayipha kushelelisa. Kudinga Scrolling esethwe ku \"Work it out\" (okokuqala) noma \"Trackpad\" Sondeza (3D nokudweba) Pinch. Ukusondeza kuya ngasesikhombisini. Ngo-Scrolling esethwe ku \"Mouse wheel\", ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili nakho kuyasondeza Chofoza ngesokudla Chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma Ctrl+chofoza Shelelisa eskethini Swayipha ngeminwe emibili (\"Work it out\" noma \"Trackpad\"), noma chofoza uhudule ngeminwe emibili icindezelwe. Shift+hudula akushelelisi eskethini (kudweba iwindi lokukhetha) Engeza ekukhetheni eskethini Shift+chofoza noma ⌘+chofoza Vula secondary click ku-Izilungiselelo zesistimu, Trackpad, Point & Click uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukuthi Yenza lokhu Jikeleza ingxenye (3D) Cindezela i-touchpad (noma thinta ubambe) bese uhudula Shelelisa (3D) Bamba Shift noma Ctrl bese uhudula, noma hudula ngesifunda senkinobho yesokudla ecindezelwe Jikeleza ingxenye, uswayiphe Swayipha ngeminwe emibili; nge-Shift, ukuswayipha kushelelisa. Kudinga Scrolling esethwe ku \"Work it out\" (okokuqala) noma \"Trackpad\" Sondeza (3D nokudweba) Pinch lapho i-touchpad isekela khona. Ukusondeza kuya ngasesikhombisini. Ngo-Scrolling esethwe ku \"Mouse wheel\", ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kuyasondeza Chofoza ngesokudla Thinta ngeminwe emibili, noma ikhona ekhoneni eliphansi kwesokudla letouchpad Shelelisa eskethini Swayipha ngeminwe emibili (\"Work it out\" noma \"Trackpad\"), noma hudula ngesifunda senkinobho yesokudla ecindezelwe. Shift+hudula akushelelisi eskethini Engeza ekukhetheni eskethini Shift+chofoza noma Ctrl+chofoza Scrolling itholakala ku-Izilungiselelo ze-PartCraft: \"Work it out\" (okokuqala) ithatha ukuskrola okungaphansi noma okusanhlamvu njengetrackpad, \"Trackpad\" ihlala yenza njalo, \"Mouse wheel\" ayikaze yenze njalo. Pinch iyasondeza kuzo zombili izimo. Izinkinobho zomcibisholo zijikeleza ibha ye-3D, futhi Shift nezinkinobho zomcibisholo ushelelisa, uma usuchofozile embonweni: kuyasiza ku-trackpad. + ne-− zisondeza. Izikrini zokuthinta I-PartCraft ifunda ukuthinta, ngakho amathebulethi, amalaptop athintwayo nama-foni ayasebenza, nemikhawulo. Okhiye bokuthinta Uma usuthinte isikrini, kuvela ibha encane ngakwesokudla esingezansi kombono nokhiye abasweli umunwe. Iyanyamalala uma usebenzisa imouse. Esc: ukhiye we-Esc. Uyakhansela okuqalile noma ubuyele emuva, njengalokho okwenza ukhiye. Engeza (eskethini, nge-Select): uma ivuliwe, ngayinye ukuthinta kwengeza into ekukhetheni noma kuyisuse, njenge-Shift+chofoza. Yithinte futhi ukuze ubuyele ekukhetheni into eyodwa ngesikhathi. Kuqediwe (uma udweba uchungechunge lomugqa, i-spline noma i-polygon): iyiqedele, njengokuchofoza ngesokudla. Ukubamba umunwe ungashintshi cishe ingxenyana yesibili kwenza okufanayo ngokuthinta okukodwa: ngethuluzi lokudweba iqedela okudwetshwayo, nge-Select ingeza into engaphansi komunwe ekukhetheni noma iyisuse. Amaphoyinti nemigqa kulula ukuwathinta ngomunwe: i-PartCraft ibheka cishe kabili ukuthinta ngokuzungeza kunokuchofoza. Embonweni we-3D Umunwe owodwa: jikeleza ingxenye. Iminwe emibili: pinch ukusondeza, hambisa ndawonye ukushelelisa. Thinta: khetha ubuso, umphetho noma indiza. Akukho ukukhanyisa kwe-hover ngaphambi kokuthinta. Eskethini Thinta ngethuluzi lokudweba ukubeka iphoyinti ngalinye: thinta ukuqala, bese uthinta ukuphela. Ukuhlanganisa kwenzeka lapho ukhipha umunwe. Iminwe emibili pinch futhi ishelelise. Ukubeka umunwe wesibili kuyayeka ukudonsa okuqale ngomunwe wokuqala. Ukuqeda uchungechunge lomugqa, thinta Kuqediwe, bamba umunwe ungashintshi, noma thinta Umugqa futhi (noma elinye ithuluzi) ku-toolbar. Nge-Select, thinta ukukhetha; hudula iphoyinti noma umugqa ukuwahambisa; hudula endaweni engenalutho ukuze uthole iwindi. Ukuthinta kwesibili kushintsha ukukhetha, ngaphandle uma Engeza ivuliwe (noma ubambe umunwe ungashintshi kwenye into yesibili). Ukushintsha isilinganiso, sebenzisa Edit eduze kwaso ephaneli yesokudla. Ishidi lombumbo Thinta ukubeka nokukhetha izimpawu, bese uhudula impawu ukuyinyakazisa. Pinch ukusondeza, hambisa iminwe emibili ukushelelisa, noma hudula umunwe owodwa phezu kwephepha elingenalutho. Umunwe wesibili uyayima impawu oyihudulayo, futhi ibuyele emuva. Okudinga ikhibhodi Ukubhala izinombolo: ikhibhodi yesikrini iyavela emabhokisini wezinombolo nasezindaweni zezilinganiso. Izinkinobho zamathuluzi: sebenzisa i-toolbar. Izikrini ezincane namafoni Ku-1280 pixels noma ngaphezulu, i-toolbar ilingana emugqeni owodwa. Phakathi kuka-760 no-1100 pixels, amaphaneli ohlangothini aba mancane. Ngaphansi kuka-760 pixels (ifoni, noma iwindi elincane), isikrini siyagxilwa: i-toolbar (swayipha ngokuhlangene ukuthola izinkinobho eziningi), umbono we-3D, ibha yesimo, bese amaphaneli wezakhiwo nomlando. Skrola ikhasi ukuze ufinyelele amaphaneli. Imenyu (Thumela, Imibono) ivula kuwo wonke ububanzi besikrini. Ku-iPhone akukho imodi yesikrini esigcwele ku-browser; Ctrl+Shift+F nenkinobho yemodi yesikrini zishintsha kuphela phakathi kwejwayelekile nokufihla amabha. Ifoni iyanele ukuvula ingxenye, ukuyijikeleza nokuhlola izinto zayo. Ukumodela okwangempela kudinga isikrini esikhulu nemouse noma trackpad. Amasiphequluli Amasiphequluli amanje e-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari asebenzisa i-PartCraft ku-Windows, macOS nakwa-Linux, nasemathebulethini nasemafonini, uma i-WebGL ne-WebAssembly zitholakala. Bona Amasiphequluli nezikhompyutha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"scripts-and-cli","scope":"partcraft","title":"Izikripthi nomugqa wokuyala","summary":"Ifomethi yesikripthi se-PartCraft (.pcscript) ebhala ingxenye yonke njengombhalo ofundekayo, nethuluzi lomugqa wokuyala le-partcraft elakha, liguqule, lihlehlise futhi lihlole izingxenye ngaphandle kwesikrini.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["isikripthi","pcscript","umbhalo","umugqa wokuyala","cli","terminal","iqoqo","zenzakalela","hlola","lint","akha","thumela","ulawulo lwenguquko","diff","isikripthi esiparamethrikhi"],"headings":[{"id":"ohlelweni","text":"Ohlelweni","level":2},{"id":"ifomethi-yesikripthi","text":"Ifomethi yesikripthi","level":2},{"id":"ithuluzi-lomugqa-wokuyala","text":"Ithuluzi lomugqa wokuyala","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlolwa","text":"Ukuhlolwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkumodela okucophelelayo kuncike kakhulu ekuzilawuleni kunasezinkinobhweni. Ingxenye ebhalwe njengombhalo ingafundwa, ibuyekezwe, iqhathaniswe umugqa ngomugqa futhi yakhiwe kabusha yisikripthi. I-PartCraft isebenza ngezindlela zombili: noma iyiphi ingxenye ingabhalwa njengesikripthi, futhi isikripthi sakha ingxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ohlelweni\"\u003EOhlelweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParameters\u003C/span\u003E, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikripthi\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as script\u003C/span\u003E ilanda ingxenye evulekile njenge \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen script\u003C/span\u003E yakha ingxenye kusuka kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E. Iphutha libikwa ngenombolo yomugqa walo, futhi akukho okufakwayo esikhundleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifomethi-yesikripthi\"\u003EIfomethi yesikripthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epcscript 1\npart &quot;Bracket&quot;\n  resolution 64\n\nparam width = 120\n  note Plate width\nparam thick = 8\nparam bolt = 8.5\nparam margin = bolt * 1.5\n\nsketch Plate\n  on top\n  point a 0, 0\n  point b 120, 0\n  point c 120, 60\n  point d 0, 60\n  line bottom a b\n  line right b c\n  line top c d\n  line left d a\n  coincident a O\n  horizontal bottom\n  horizontal top\n  vertical left\n  vertical right\n  distance bottom = width\n  distance left 60\n\nextrude Base\n  sketch Plate\n  depth = thick\n\nsketch HoleCentres\n  on face Base end\n  point h1 12, 12\n  hdistance O h1 = margin\n  vdistance O h1 = margin\n\nhole Bolts\n  sketch HoleCentres\n  d = bolt\n  through\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImithetho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa osendaweni yokunxele uqala isitatimende: \u003Ccode\u003Epcscript\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eparam\u003C/code\u003E, uhlobo lwesici (\u003Ccode\u003Esketch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eextrude\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erevolve\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elpattern\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecpattern\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emirror\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efillet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echamfer\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eshell\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eimport\u003C/code\u003E nezinhlobo ezintsha) elilandelwa igama lalo, noma \u003Ccode\u003Erollback &lt;feature&gt;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa egxilile yizilungiselelo zesitatimende esingaphezulu. Ilungiselelo elimi lodwa (\u003Ccode\u003Ethrough\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ereverse\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esuppressed\u003C/code\u003E) lisho yebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlungiselelo lenombolo liyinombolo, noma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E nesisho, okwenza isibalo: \u003Ccode\u003Edepth = thick\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsikethini: \u003Ccode\u003Eon\u003C/code\u003E ibiza indiza (\u003Ccode\u003Efront\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etop\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eright\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface Base end\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface Revolve1 side l3\u003C/code\u003E); ijometri ingu \u003Ccode\u003Epoint &lt;name&gt; x, y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eline &lt;name&gt; &lt;point&gt; &lt;point&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecircle &lt;name&gt; &lt;centre&gt; &lt;radius&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc &lt;name&gt; &lt;centre&gt; &lt;start&gt; &lt;end&gt;\u003C/code\u003E (ngokuphambene nowashi) noma \u003Ccode\u003Espline &lt;name&gt; fit|control &lt;points&gt;\u003C/code\u003E; izixhumanisi zingohlobo lwazo namagama abahlanganisayo (\u003Ccode\u003EO\u003C/code\u003E ingumsuka); isilinganiso siphela ngenani laso noma nge-\u003Ccode\u003E= expression\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzilungiselelo ezingakhethwa zejometri noma zokuxhumana zibekwa ekugcineni emabhulaketini aphakathi, zihlukaniswe ngu-\u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E[construction]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E[side -1; label 5, 3]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E iqala ukuphawula (ekuqaleni komugqa noma emva kwesikhala). Amagama anezikhala abekwa phakathi kwezinikezo ezimbili (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhombisi zezici ziqala ku-f1 ngokulandelana okubhalwe ngakho. Izinkomba zemiphetho nobuso zisebenzisa zona, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003Eedge f2.side:l3 f2.end [at 50, 0, 10]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzilungiselelo ifomethi engenawo amagama azo zibhalwa \u003Ccode\u003Ejson\u003C/code\u003E nenani; zifundwa kabusha njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma silondolozwe kusuka kuhlelo, isikripthi sifaka zonke izilungiselelo, ngakho sivula njengengxenye efanayo. Isolidi se-STEP esingenisiwe sibhalwa ngaphakathi kwesikripthi kusuka kuhlelo, nanjengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E elihlukile elibizwa nge-\u003Ccode\u003Estep-file\u003C/code\u003E emugqeni wokuyala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithuluzi-lomugqa-wokuyala\"\u003EIthuluzi lomugqa wokuyala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lisebenza kukhompyutha enoNode.js 24, kusuka kukhophi yomthombo we-CadCraft: \u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs &lt;command&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. Lithuluzi lomthuthukisi futhi lisebenzisa amamojuli afanayo nohlelo. Izingxenye ziyizifayela ze-\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E noma izikripthi ze-\u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmyalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Einfo &lt;part&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici, amapharamitha, ibha ye-rollback, ivolumu nosayizi wesolidi esakhiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparams &lt;part&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke iparamitha nesibalo ngenani layo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eset &lt;part&gt; width=150 Base.depth==thick\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokuqhubeka: shintsha amapharamitha, xhuma izinombolo (\u003Ccode\u003E==\u003C/code\u003E noma isisho), usethe izinombolo ezilula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrive &lt;part&gt; Base.depth=12\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokubuyela emuva: xazulula ipharamitha elawula inombolo eshayelwayo (\u003Ccode\u003E--prefer width\u003C/code\u003E ikhetha enye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild &lt;part&gt; --out x.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhala \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E noma i-macro (\u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild &lt;part&gt; --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye wethebula lomklamo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Evariants &lt;part&gt; --out-dir d\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E--zip f.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke ukucushwa njenge-STEP, IFC, DWG nesibukeli, ithebula lezinguqulo nento yomtapo wolwazi (\u003Ccode\u003E--only &quot;A,B&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--formats step,ifc,dwg,preview\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--no-item\u003C/code\u003E); bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EYenza iphakethe lezinguqulo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escript &lt;in.pcscript&gt; -o part.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikripthi sibe yingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto-script &lt;part&gt; -o part.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ibe isikripthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erollback &lt;part&gt; [&lt;feature&gt;]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eforward &lt;part&gt; [--end]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha ibha ye-rollback kufayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck &lt;part&gt; [--strict]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlolwa kokuzilawula (ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild\u003C/code\u003E futhi amukela \u003Ccode\u003E--set name=value\u003C/code\u003E (ngalokhu kwakhiwa kuphela) no \u003Ccode\u003E--upto &lt;feature&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. Yonke imiyalo amukela \u003Ccode\u003E--json\u003C/code\u003E. Amakhodi okuphuma: 0 kuhle, 1 kutholakale inkinga, 2 umyalo ubhalwe kabi. Isikripthi asibhalwa kabusha endaweni yaso: nikeza \u003Ccode\u003E-o\u003C/code\u003E ukuze ulondoloze ikhophi eshintshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlolwa\"\u003EUkuhlolwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck\u003C/code\u003E ibika lokho okwenza ingxenye ibe nzima ukuyishintsha kamuva:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkutholiwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKubalwa njenge\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi esichazwe ngokweqile (izixhumanisi eziphikisanayo noma eziphindiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esingakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpharamitha noma isibalo esinephutha, noma amapharamitha asebenzisana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikethi esingachazwanga ngokwanele, namandla ayo okunyakaza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisexwayiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinombolo ezibhalwe ngqo ezicini nasezilinganisweni ezingalawulwa yipharamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisexwayiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpharamitha engasetshenziswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisexwayiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esivinjiwe; ibha ye-rollback ingekho ekugcineni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisexwayiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E--strict\u003C/code\u003E yenza wonke amasexwayiso abe amaphutha, ngakho isikripthi sokwakha singenqaba ingxenye engalawulwa ngokugcwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkukhiphayo kwe-macro ye-\u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E kuhloselwe umklami wengxenye umaningi wezitolo asebenzisayo: uma kusebenza ngaphakathi kwaleyo nhlelo, yakha ingxenye khona. Ayikaqhutshwa kuleyo nhlelo lapha (ayitholakali ezinsizeni zethu), ngakho yiphathe njengengahlolwanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ukumodela okucophelelayo kuncike kakhulu ekuzilawuleni kunasezinkinobhweni. Ingxenye ebhalwe njengombhalo ingafundwa, ibuyekezwe, iqhathaniswe umugqa ngomugqa futhi yakhiwe kabusha yisikripthi. I-PartCraft isebenza ngezindlela zombili: noma iyiphi ingxenye ingabhalwa njengesikripthi, futhi isikripthi sakha ingxenye. Ohlelweni Kwithebhu ethi Parameters, ngaphansi kwe-Isikripthi: Save as script ilanda ingxenye evulekile njenge \u003Cname\u003E.pcscript. Open script yakha ingxenye kusuka kufayela le-.pcscript. Iphutha libikwa ngenombolo yomugqa walo, futhi akukho okufakwayo esikhundleni. Ifomethi yesikripthi pcscript 1 part \"Bracket\" resolution 64 param width = 120 note Plate width param thick = 8 param bolt = 8.5 param margin = bolt * 1.5 sketch Plate on top point a 0, 0 point b 120, 0 point c 120, 60 point d 0, 60 line bottom a b line right b c line top c d line left d a coincident a O horizontal bottom horizontal top vertical left vertical right distance bottom = width distance left 60 extrude Base sketch Plate depth = thick sketch HoleCentres on face Base end point h1 12, 12 hdistance O h1 = margin vdistance O h1 = margin hole Bolts sketch HoleCentres d = bolt through Imithetho: Umugqa osendaweni yokunxele uqala isitatimende: pcscript, part, param, uhlobo lwesici (sketch, extrude, revolve, hole, lpattern, cpattern, mirror, fillet, chamfer, shell, import nezinhlobo ezintsha) elilandelwa igama lalo, noma rollback \u003Cfeature\u003E. Imigqa egxilile yizilungiselelo zesitatimende esingaphezulu. Ilungiselelo elimi lodwa (through, reverse, suppressed) lisho yebo. Ilungiselelo lenombolo liyinombolo, noma = nesisho, okwenza isibalo: depth = thick. Esikethini: on ibiza indiza (front, top, right, face Base end, face Revolve1 side l3); ijometri ingu point \u003Cname\u003E x, y, line \u003Cname\u003E \u003Cpoint\u003E \u003Cpoint\u003E, circle \u003Cname\u003E \u003Ccentre\u003E \u003Cradius\u003E, arc \u003Cname\u003E \u003Ccentre\u003E \u003Cstart\u003E \u003Cend\u003E (ngokuphambene nowashi) noma spline \u003Cname\u003E fit|control \u003Cpoints\u003E; izixhumanisi zingohlobo lwazo namagama abahlanganisayo (O ingumsuka); isilinganiso siphela ngenani laso noma nge-= expression. Izilungiselelo ezingakhethwa zejometri noma zokuxhumana zibekwa ekugcineni emabhulaketini aphakathi, zihlukaniswe ngu-;: [construction], [side -1; label 5, 3]. # iqala ukuphawula (ekuqaleni komugqa noma emva kwesikhala). Amagama anezikhala abekwa phakathi kwezinikezo ezimbili (\"). Izikhombisi zezici ziqala ku-f1 ngokulandelana okubhalwe ngakho. Izinkomba zemiphetho nobuso zisebenzisa zona, isibonelo edge f2.side:l3 f2.end [at 50, 0, 10]. Izilungiselelo ifomethi engenawo amagama azo zibhalwa json nenani; zifundwa kabusha njengoba zinjalo. Uma silondolozwe kusuka kuhlelo, isikripthi sifaka zonke izilungiselelo, ngakho sivula njengengxenye efanayo. Isolidi se-STEP esingenisiwe sibhalwa ngaphakathi kwesikripthi kusuka kuhlelo, nanjengefayela le-.step elihlukile elibizwa nge-step-file emugqeni wokuyala. Ithuluzi lomugqa wokuyala Ithuluzi lisebenza kukhompyutha enoNode.js 24, kusuka kukhophi yomthombo we-CadCraft: node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs \u003Ccommand\u003E. Lithuluzi lomthuthukisi futhi lisebenzisa amamojuli afanayo nohlelo. Izingxenye ziyizifayela ze-.partcraft.json noma izikripthi ze-.pcscript. Umyalo Okwenzayo info \u003Cpart\u003E Izici, amapharamitha, ibha ye-rollback, ivolumu nosayizi wesolidi esakhiwe params \u003Cpart\u003E Yonke iparamitha nesibalo ngenani layo set \u003Cpart\u003E width=150 Base.depth==thick Ngokuqhubeka: shintsha amapharamitha, xhuma izinombolo (== noma isisho), usethe izinombolo ezilula drive \u003Cpart\u003E Base.depth=12 Ngokubuyela emuva: xazulula ipharamitha elawula inombolo eshayelwayo (--prefer width ikhetha enye) build \u003Cpart\u003E --out x.step Ibhala .step, .stl, .3mf, .json, .pcscript noma i-macro (.swb) build \u003Cpart\u003E --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes Ifayela elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye wethebula lomklamo variants \u003Cpart\u003E --out-dir d noma --zip f.zip Yonke ukucushwa njenge-STEP, IFC, DWG nesibukeli, ithebula lezinguqulo nento yomtapo wolwazi (--only \"A,B\", --formats step,ifc,dwg,preview, --no-item); bheka Yenza iphakethe lezinguqulo script \u003Cin.pcscript\u003E -o part.json Isikripthi sibe yingxenye to-script \u003Cpart\u003E -o part.pcscript Ingxenye ibe isikripthi rollback \u003Cpart\u003E [\u003Cfeature\u003E], forward \u003Cpart\u003E [--end] Shintsha ibha ye-rollback kufayela check \u003Cpart\u003E [--strict] Ukuhlolwa kokuzilawula (ngezansi) build futhi amukela --set name=value (ngalokhu kwakhiwa kuphela) no --upto \u003Cfeature\u003E. Yonke imiyalo amukela --json. Amakhodi okuphuma: 0 kuhle, 1 kutholakale inkinga, 2 umyalo ubhalwe kabi. Isikripthi asibhalwa kabusha endaweni yaso: nikeza -o ukuze ulondoloze ikhophi eshintshiwe. Ukuhlolwa check ibika lokho okwenza ingxenye ibe nzima ukuyishintsha kamuva: Okutholiwe Kubalwa njenge Isikethi esichazwe ngokweqile (izixhumanisi eziphikisanayo noma eziphindiwe) iphutha Isici esingakhi iphutha Ipharamitha noma isibalo esinephutha, noma amapharamitha asebenzisana iphutha Isikethi esingachazwanga ngokwanele, namandla ayo okunyakaza isexwayiso Izinombolo ezibhalwe ngqo ezicini nasezilinganisweni ezingalawulwa yipharamitha isexwayiso Ipharamitha engasetshenziswa isexwayiso Isici esivinjiwe; ibha ye-rollback ingekho ekugcineni isexwayiso --strict yenza wonke amasexwayiso abe amaphutha, ngakho isikripthi sokwakha singenqaba ingxenye engalawulwa ngokugcwele. Okukhiphayo kwe-macro ye-.swb kuhloselwe umklami wengxenye umaningi wezitolo asebenzisayo: uma kusebenza ngaphakathi kwaleyo nhlelo, yakha ingxenye khona. Ayikaqhutshwa kuleyo nhlelo lapha (ayitholakali ezinsizeni zethu), ngakho yiphathe njengengahlolwanga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript-language","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ulimi lwe-CraftScript","summary":"I-CraftScript ngekhasi elilodwa: ama-matrix, izinhlu nokuhlonza, opharetha, ukulawula ukuhamba, imisebenzi, izakhiwo namaseli, izimvumelo, ukuphindisela, amaphutha nesabelo sezinyathelo, nokuthi ihluke kanjani ku-MATLAB.","section":"reference","order":61,"keywords":["CraftScript","ulimi","isintaksi","matrix","array","vector","tensor","index","end","colon","range","operator","element-wise","transpose","if","for","while","switch","try","catch","function","anonymous function","struct","cell","comment","echo","semicolon","MATLAB","Octave","port"],"headings":[{"id":"amanani","text":"Amanani","level":2},{"id":"ama-array-nokuhlonza","text":"Ama-array nokuhlonza","level":2},{"id":"opharetha","text":"Opharetha","level":2},{"id":"ukulawula-ukuhamba-nemisebenzi","text":"Ukulawula ukuhamba nemisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"ukuphindisela-izimvumelo-okuphumayo","text":"Ukuphindisela, izimvumelo, okuphumayo","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-nemikhawulo","text":"Amaphutha nemikhawulo","level":2},{"id":"akufani-ne-matlab","text":"Akufani ne-MATLAB","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-CraftScript ulimi lwe-matrix olubhalwe ukuze lufundeke njenge-MATLAB, ngakho iningi lezinkambu zezibalo zakudala (isibonelo, ikhodi yokwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo engu-88 imigqa) isebenza ngezinguquko ezincane kuphela. Isebenza ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EScript workspace\u003C/a\u003E nasemugqeni womyalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanani\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo, i-array\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ev = [1 2 3]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EA = [1 2; 3 4]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke inombolo iba yi-array (eyi-1×1). Ama-array agcinwa ngekholomu ngekholomu, kuze kube ngama-dimension ayi-8\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokwesimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA &gt; 2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etrue\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-array aqiniso/amanga; angasetshenziswa njengezinkomba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;beam&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;beam&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-matrix ebhodlile (sparse)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esparse(i, j, v, n, n)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinqubweni zokuqina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImesh, insimu, imodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EhexGrid(…)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epart()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eload(&#039;part.stl&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkudwetshwa yi-\u003Ccode\u003Eshow\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo (struct)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Es.E = 210e3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkambu ezinamagama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIseli (cell)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ec = {1, &#039;two&#039;, [3 4]}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwanoma yiziphi izinani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibambi somsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ef = @(x) x.^2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-array-nokuhlonza\"\u003EAma-array nokuhlonza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImikhakha: \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0:0.1:1\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Elinspace(a, b, n)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ezeros(n, m)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eones\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeye\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erand\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlonza kuqala ku-1: \u003Ccode\u003EA(2, 3)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ev(end)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EA(:, 1)\u003C/code\u003E (ikholomu yonke), \u003Ccode\u003EA(:)\u003C/code\u003E (konke njengekholomu eyodwa), \u003Ccode\u003Ev(v &gt; 0)\u003C/code\u003E (ukuhlonza ngokwesimo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkunikeza inani ngaphezu kwesiphetho kukhulisa i-array, njenge-MATLAB: \u003Ccode\u003Ev(10) = 1\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"opharetha\"\u003EOpharetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / \\ ^\u003C/code\u003E ngokusebenzayo kwe-matrix (\u003Ccode\u003EA \\ b\u003C/code\u003E ixazulula); \u003Ccode\u003E.* ./ .^\u003C/code\u003E zisebenza sakhi-sakhi. \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E iguqula (transpose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqhathanisa \u003Ccode\u003E== ~= &lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;=\u003C/code\u003E; izingqondo \u003Ccode\u003E&amp; | ~\u003C/code\u003E (sakhi-sakhi) kanye no \u003Ccode\u003E&amp;&amp; ||\u003C/code\u003E (ziyeka msinya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulawula-ukuhamba-nemisebenzi\"\u003EUkulawula ukuhamba nemisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efor k = 1:10\n  if mod(k, 2) == 0\n    continue\n  elseif k &gt; 7\n    break\n  end\nend\nwhile err &gt; 1e-6, … end\nswitch kind\n  case &#039;steel&#039;\n    E = 210e3;\n  otherwise\n    E = 70e3;\nend\ntry\n  x = A \\ b;\ncatch e\n  disp(e.message)\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi ifakwa ku-script ngemva kwemiyalo yayo, noma esikhenkethweni sayo se-script esiqanjwe ngegama lomsebenzi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efunction [k, m] = beam(E, I, L)\n  k = 3 * E * I / L^3;\n  m = 0;\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama liyafunwa ngalolu hlelo: okuguquguqukayo, i-script kulesi singxenye enalelo gama, umsebenzi womtapo, umsebenzi wangaphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuphindisela-izimvumelo-okuphumayo\"\u003EUkuphindisela, izimvumelo, okuphumayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitatimende esingenalo \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E sibonisa inani laso; \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E iyasithulisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E iqala isimvumelo; \u003Ccode\u003E%{\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003E%}\u003C/code\u003E emigqeni yazo zimvumela imigqa phakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edisp(x)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efprintf(&#039;%g\\n&#039;, x)\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Edisplay(x)\u003C/code\u003E zibhala kukhonsoli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-nemikhawulo\"\u003EAmaphutha nemikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphutha asho ngamagama alula ukuthi yini engahambanga kahle futhi anikeze umugqa (nochungechunge lwezingcingo zomsebenzi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqalisa ngakunye kunesabelo sezinyathelo (Izinketho zokuqalisa esikhenkethweni); ilophu engapheli imisa ngomyalezo, noma cindezela Misa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-array ngamunye abamba izinani ezifika ku-134 million.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akufani-ne-matlab\"\u003EAkufani ne-MATLAB\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiyalo yokufaka igrafu ifaka izinketho zayo ekubizweni: \u003Ccode\u003Eplot(x, y, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;Error&#039;, &#039;xlabel&#039;, &#039;Step&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E. I-\u003Ccode\u003Efigure\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehold\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eaxis\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etitle(…)\u003C/code\u003E nezinye ezifana nazo yamukelwa futhi ayenzi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Ccode\u003Einput\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Ekeyboard\u003C/code\u003E akusekelwa: i-script ayikwazi ukuma ukuze ibuze umbuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAzikho izinsethi zamathuluzi; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Eumtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/a\u003E nemisebenzi yangaphakathi yiyona ekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-CraftScript ulimi lwe-matrix olubhalwe ukuze lufundeke njenge-MATLAB, ngakho iningi lezinkambu zezibalo zakudala (isibonelo, ikhodi yokwenziwa kahle kwesakhiwo engu-88 imigqa) isebenza ngezinguquko ezincane kuphela. Isebenza ku-Script workspace nasemugqeni womyalo. Amanani Uhlobo Isibonelo Amanothi Inombolo, i-array a = 3, v = [1 2 3], A = [1 2; 3 4] Yonke inombolo iba yi-array (eyi-1×1). Ama-array agcinwa ngekholomu ngekholomu, kuze kube ngama-dimension ayi-8 Ngokwesimo A \u003E 2, true Ama-array aqiniso/amanga; angasetshenziswa njengezinkomba Umbhalo 'beam', \"beam\" I-matrix ebhodlile (sparse) sparse(i, j, v, n, n) Ezinqubweni zokuqina Imesh, insimu, imodeli hexGrid(…), part(), load('part.stl') Okudwetshwa yi-show Isakhiwo (struct) s.E = 210e3 Izinkambu ezinamagama Iseli (cell) c = {1, 'two', [3 4]} Uhlu lwanoma yiziphi izinani Isibambi somsebenzi f = @(x) x.^2 Ama-array nokuhlonza Imikhakha: 1:5, 0:0.1:1. linspace(a, b, n), zeros(n, m), ones, eye, rand. Ukuhlonza kuqala ku-1: A(2, 3), v(end), A(:, 1) (ikholomu yonke), A(:) (konke njengekholomu eyodwa), v(v \u003E 0) (ukuhlonza ngokwesimo). Ukunikeza inani ngaphezu kwesiphetho kukhulisa i-array, njenge-MATLAB: v(10) = 1. Opharetha + - * / \\ ^ ngokusebenzayo kwe-matrix (A \\ b ixazulula); .* ./ .^ zisebenza sakhi-sakhi. ' iguqula (transpose). Ukuqhathanisa == ~= \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E=; izingqondo & | ~ (sakhi-sakhi) kanye no && || (ziyeka msinya). Ukulawula ukuhamba nemisebenzi for k = 1:10 if mod(k, 2) == 0 continue elseif k \u003E 7 break end end while err \u003E 1e-6, … end switch kind case 'steel' E = 210e3; otherwise E = 70e3; end try x = A \\ b; catch e disp(e.message) end Imisebenzi ifakwa ku-script ngemva kwemiyalo yayo, noma esikhenkethweni sayo se-script esiqanjwe ngegama lomsebenzi: function [k, m] = beam(E, I, L) k = 3 * E * I / L^3; m = 0; end Igama liyafunwa ngalolu hlelo: okuguquguqukayo, i-script kulesi singxenye enalelo gama, umsebenzi womtapo, umsebenzi wangaphakathi. Ukuphindisela, izimvumelo, okuphumayo Isitatimende esingenalo ; sibonisa inani laso; ; iyasithulisa. % iqala isimvumelo; %{ no %} emigqeni yazo zimvumela imigqa phakathi kwazo. disp(x), fprintf('%g\\n', x) no display(x) zibhala kukhonsoli. Amaphutha nemikhawulo Amaphutha asho ngamagama alula ukuthi yini engahambanga kahle futhi anikeze umugqa (nochungechunge lwezingcingo zomsebenzi). Ukuqalisa ngakunye kunesabelo sezinyathelo (Izinketho zokuqalisa esikhenkethweni); ilophu engapheli imisa ngomyalezo, noma cindezela Misa. Ama-array ngamunye abamba izinani ezifika ku-134 million. Akufani ne-MATLAB Imiyalo yokufaka igrafu ifaka izinketho zayo ekubizweni: plot(x, y, 'title', 'Error', 'xlabel', 'Step'). I-figure, hold, axis, title(…) nezinye ezifana nazo yamukelwa futhi ayenzi lutho. I-input no keyboard akusekelwa: i-script ayikwazi ukuma ukuze ibuze umbuzo. Azikho izinsethi zamathuluzi; umtapo wokuhlaziya nemisebenzi yangaphakathi yiyona ekhona.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript-lua","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ama-script ku-Lua","summary":"Bhala ama-script e-Script workspace ngeLua 5.4: itafula le-cs lemisebenzi yangaphakathi, ama-array njengezinani anokuhlonza nokusebenza ngezibalo, i-workspace ws ehlanganyelwe, ukuphrinta nokubonisa imiphumela, nokuthi yini evaliwe.","section":"reference","order":62,"keywords":["Lua","Lua 5.4","script","ulimi","itafula cs","ws","workspace","userdata","itensa","array","matrix","phrinta","bonisa","sandbox"],"headings":[{"id":"okubalulekile","text":"Okubalulekile","level":2},{"id":"biza-umtapo-wokuhlaziya","text":"Biza umtapo wokuhlaziya","level":2},{"id":"kuvaliwe","text":"Kuvaliwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-Lua ulimi lwesibili kwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EScript workspace\u003C/a\u003E. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELua\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini lolimi phezu komhleli (ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.lua\u003C/code\u003E livula nge-Lua ngokwalo). I-Lua ne-CraftScript zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo okufanayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi efanayo, ngakho i-script ye-Lua ingasebenzisa okwenziwe yi-script ye-CraftScript, nakuphambene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubalulekile\"\u003EOkubalulekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-- yonke imisebenzi yangaphakathi isetafuleni le-cs\nlocal K = cs.zeros(3, 3)\nK:set(1, 1, 4)                 -- ku-1, njenge-CraftScript\nprint(K(1, 1), #K)             -- isakhi; inani lezakhi\n\n-- i-workspace: okuguquguqukayo okufanayo bonke ama-scriptababona\nws.total = K(1, 1) * 2\nprint(ws.total)\n\n-- imiphumela eminingi komsebenzi owodwa\nlocal V, D = cs.call(&#039;eig&#039;, 2, cs.tensor({{2, 1}, {1, 2}}))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.&lt;name&gt;(…)\u003C/code\u003E ibiza noma yimuphi umsebenzi wangaphakathi ibuyise umphumela wokuqala; \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(name, n, …)\u003C/code\u003E ibuyisa imiphumela \u003Ccode\u003En\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor({1, 2, 3})\u003C/code\u003E yenza umugqa, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor({{1, 2}, {3, 4}})\u003C/code\u003E yenza i-matrix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-array, ama-sparse matrix, imesh nezinsimu yizinani ezinezindlela: \u003Ccode\u003Et(i, j)\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Et:get(i, j)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:set(i, j, v)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:shape()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E#t\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:T()\u003C/code\u003E (ukuguqula), \u003Ccode\u003Et:totable()\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / ^\u003C/code\u003E zisho okufanayo njengakwi-CraftScript (\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E ngumphumela we-matrix); \u003Ccode\u003Et:times(u)\u003C/code\u003E iphindaphinda sakhi-sakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elingu-array ye-1×1 lifika njengenombolo evamile ye-Lua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ews.name\u003C/code\u003E ifunda futhi ibhale i-workspace ehlanganyelwe. Okuguquguqukayo okuwumhlaba i-script yakho eyishiya nakho kufika lapho iphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprint(…)\u003C/code\u003E ibhala kukhonsoli; \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.show(f)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.plot(y)\u003C/code\u003E nezinye izimisebenzi zokubonisa zisebenza njengakwi-CraftScript.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"biza-umtapo-wokuhlaziya\"\u003EBiza umtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi yomtapo wokuhlaziya (ithebhu ye-Library) nemisebenzi ye-CraftScript ama-script wengxenye yakho achaza nawo afinyelelwa nge-\u003Ccode\u003Ecs\u003C/code\u003E nawo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elocal t = cs.box_mesh(100, 10, 10, 5, &#039;tet10&#039;)\nlocal bc = cs.struct({ fixedFaces = 5, loads = { cs.struct({ face = 6, force = cs.tensor({ 0, -100, 0 }) }) } })\nlocal r = cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc)\nprint(r.maxDisp)\nlocal nodes, tris = cs.call(&#039;face_nodes&#039;, 2, t, 6)   -- imiphumela emibili\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZitholakala ngaphambi kokuqala kwe-script, ngakho bhala igama ku-script: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(&#039;static_tet&#039;, …)\u003C/code\u003E. Igama elakhiwa ngenkathi i-script iqhuba lifinyelela imisebenzi yangaphakathi kuphela. I-struct eyakhiwe nge-\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.struct({ … })\u003C/code\u003E iyi-struct ye-CraftScript, nohlu lwe-Lua lwazo (\u003Ccode\u003E{ cs.struct(…), … }\u003C/code\u003E) luyiseli, okulindelwe yizilungiselelo zomtapo. Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle ngaphakathi komsebenzi womtapo, umyalezo uqamba umsebenzi nomugqa wawo, futhi ukhomba umugqa wakho owubizile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuvaliwe\"\u003EKuvaliwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-script awakwazi ukufinyelela amafayela, inethiwekhi noma ikhasi: \u003Ccode\u003Eio\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eos\u003C/code\u003E (ngaphandle kwewashi), \u003Ccode\u003Erequire\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edofile\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eloadfile\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Edebug\u003C/code\u003E ziyasuswa. Sebenzisa Vula ye-Script workspace nokuguquguqukayo ukuze ulethe idatha. Isabelo sezinyathelo nokuMisa kusebenza njengakwi-CraftScript.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-Lua ulimi lwesibili kwi-Script workspace. Khetha Lua ebhokisini lolimi phezu komhleli (ifayela .lua livula nge-Lua ngokwalo). I-Lua ne-CraftScript zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo okufanayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi efanayo, ngakho i-script ye-Lua ingasebenzisa okwenziwe yi-script ye-CraftScript, nakuphambene. Okubalulekile -- yonke imisebenzi yangaphakathi isetafuleni le-cs local K = cs.zeros(3, 3) K:set(1, 1, 4) -- ku-1, njenge-CraftScript print(K(1, 1), #K) -- isakhi; inani lezakhi -- i-workspace: okuguquguqukayo okufanayo bonke ama-scriptababona ws.total = K(1, 1) * 2 print(ws.total) -- imiphumela eminingi komsebenzi owodwa local V, D = cs.call('eig', 2, cs.tensor({{2, 1}, {1, 2}})) cs.\u003Cname\u003E(…) ibiza noma yimuphi umsebenzi wangaphakathi ibuyise umphumela wokuqala; cs.call(name, n, …) ibuyisa imiphumela n. cs.tensor({1, 2, 3}) yenza umugqa, cs.tensor({{1, 2}, {3, 4}}) yenza i-matrix. Ama-array, ama-sparse matrix, imesh nezinsimu yizinani ezinezindlela: t(i, j) noma t:get(i, j), t:set(i, j, v), t:shape(), #t, t:T() (ukuguqula), t:totable(). + - * / ^ zisho okufanayo njengakwi-CraftScript (* ngumphumela we-matrix); t:times(u) iphindaphinda sakhi-sakhi. Inani elingu-array ye-1×1 lifika njengenombolo evamile ye-Lua. ws.name ifunda futhi ibhale i-workspace ehlanganyelwe. Okuguquguqukayo okuwumhlaba i-script yakho eyishiya nakho kufika lapho iphela. print(…) ibhala kukhonsoli; cs.show(f), cs.plot(y) nezinye izimisebenzi zokubonisa zisebenza njengakwi-CraftScript. Biza umtapo wokuhlaziya Imisebenzi yomtapo wokuhlaziya (ithebhu ye-Library) nemisebenzi ye-CraftScript ama-script wengxenye yakho achaza nawo afinyelelwa nge-cs nawo: local t = cs.box_mesh(100, 10, 10, 5, 'tet10') local bc = cs.struct({ fixedFaces = 5, loads = { cs.struct({ face = 6, force = cs.tensor({ 0, -100, 0 }) }) } }) local r = cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc) print(r.maxDisp) local nodes, tris = cs.call('face_nodes', 2, t, 6) -- imiphumela emibili Zitholakala ngaphambi kokuqala kwe-script, ngakho bhala igama ku-script: cs.static_tet( noma cs.call('static_tet', …). Igama elakhiwa ngenkathi i-script iqhuba lifinyelela imisebenzi yangaphakathi kuphela. I-struct eyakhiwe nge-cs.struct({ … }) iyi-struct ye-CraftScript, nohlu lwe-Lua lwazo ({ cs.struct(…), … }) luyiseli, okulindelwe yizilungiselelo zomtapo. Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle ngaphakathi komsebenzi womtapo, umyalezo uqamba umsebenzi nomugqa wawo, futhi ukhomba umugqa wakho owubizile. Kuvaliwe Ama-script awakwazi ukufinyelela amafayela, inethiwekhi noma ikhasi: io, os (ngaphandle kwewashi), require, dofile, loadfile kanye ne-debug ziyasuswa. Sebenzisa Vula ye-Script workspace nokuguquguqukayo ukuze ulethe idatha. Isabelo sezinyathelo nokuMisa kusebenza njengakwi-CraftScript.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"craftscript-python","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ama-script ku-Python","summary":"Bhala ama-script e-Script workspace ngePython 3: into ethi cs yemisebenzi yangaphakathi, ama-array njengezinani ezifana ne-numpy anokuhlonza okuqala ku-0, i-workspace ehlanganyelwe, ukuphrinta, okungakakho, nokuthi i-Python ivalelwe kanjani njenge-CraftScript ne-Lua.","section":"reference","order":63,"keywords":["Python","Python 3","CPython","WebAssembly","ivalelwe","ephephile","script","ulimi","cs","ws","workspace","numpy","array","matrix","ukuhlonza","phrinta","bonisa","ukuthembeka"],"headings":[{"id":"i-python-ivalelwe","text":"I-Python ivalelwe","level":2},{"id":"okubalulekile","text":"Okubalulekile","level":2},{"id":"biza-umtapo-wokuhlaziya","text":"Biza umtapo wokuhlaziya","level":2},{"id":"akukakho-okwamanje","text":"Akukakho okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-Python ulimi lwesithathu kwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EScript workspace\u003C/a\u003E. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EPython\u003C/strong\u003E ebhokisini lolimi phezu komhleli (ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.py\u003C/code\u003E livula nge-Python ngokwalo). I-Python, i-Lua ne-CraftScript zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo okufanayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi efanayo, ngakho i-script ye-Python ingasebenzisa okwenziwe yi-script ye-CraftScript, nakuphambene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqalisa kokuqala kwe-Python kuvakashelo kulayisha i-Python ngokwayo (CPython 3.14, cishe 7 MB) kule sayithi, okuthatha imizuzwana embalwa. I-Python ayikaba yingxenye ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E okwamanje: qhuba i-script eyodwa ye-Python uku-inthanethi kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-python-ivalelwe\"\u003EI-Python ivalelwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-script e-Python avalelwe njengama-script e-CraftScript ne-Lua: afinyelela engxenyeni, okuguquguqukayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi, hhayi okunye. Ukuqalisa ngakunye kuyi-Python entsha esandbox yayo enesakhiwo esincane samafayela ekhumbulweni (imitapo yayo yemithetho nefolda ye-\u003Ccode\u003E/tmp\u003C/code\u003E enyamalala ngemva kokuqhuba). Ayikwazi ukufinyelela inethiwekhi, amafayela akho noma ikhasi lonke, kusibonisi nasemugqeni womyalo ngokufanayo. I-script evela komunye umuntu isenza kusebenze isikhathi noma inkumbulo eningi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyiphelisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubalulekile\"\u003EOkubalulekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA = cs.magic(3)              # yonke imisebenzi yangaphakathi ngu-cs.&lt;name&gt;\nB = A @ A.T                  # @ ngumphumela we-matrix, .T ukuguqula\nC = A * 2 + 1                # + - * / ** zisebenza sakhi-sakhi, njenge-numpy\nprint(A[0, 1], A[-1, -1])    # ngo-0; okungamanani angaphansi kubalwa kusukela emuva\nrow = A[1]                   # isikhombi esisodwa ku-matrix: umugqa\nbig = A[A &gt; 4]               # imaski yokuqiniseka ikhetha izakhi\nA[0, 0] = -5                 # ukunikeza inani ku-array\nV, D = cs.call(&#039;eig&#039;, 2, A)  # imiphumela eminingi: cs.call(igama, inani, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-array ye-1 × 1 ifika njengenombolo evamile; ezinye ama-array, ama-sparse matrix, imesh, izinsimu nemodeli ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003EValues\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Value inezakhiwo \u003Ccode\u003Eshape\u003C/code\u003E (i-tuple), \u003Ccode\u003ET\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etype\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enumel()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecopy()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etolist()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elen()\u003C/code\u003E (imigqa yayo), no \u003Ccode\u003Efloat()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eint()\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Ebool()\u003C/code\u003E ngesakhi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqhathanisa (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E==\u003C/code\u003E, …) kusebenza sakhi-sakhi, njenge-numpy: kunikeza i-Value yokuqiniseka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezinombolo olunikezwa umsebenzi wangaphakathi luba ama-array: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.sum([1, 2, 3])\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor([[1, 2], [3, 4]])\u003C/code\u003E yenza i-matrix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-dict iba yi-struct nohlu lwezinto ezixubile luba iseli, futhi kuphinde kube njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okuwumhlaba i-script yakho ikwenzayo (inombolo, i-Value, i-dict, uhlu…) kufika ethebhini le-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuguquguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E lapho ukuqhuba kuphela, noma emva kwephutha. Amagama aqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E, imisebenzi, amakilasi nezimoduli ahlala ku-Python. \u003Ccode\u003Ews.name\u003C/code\u003E ifunda noma isethe okuguquguqukayo ngqo, ne-\u003Ccode\u003Ews_names()\u003C/code\u003E iyawahlu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprint(…)\u003C/code\u003E ibhala kukhonsoli. \u003Ccode\u003Edisplay(…)\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.display\u003C/code\u003E) ibonisa imesh, insimu noma igrafu, njengakwi-CraftScript.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"biza-umtapo-wokuhlaziya\"\u003EBiza umtapo wokuhlaziya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImisebenzi yomtapo ibizwa njengemisebenzi yangaphakathi: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.box_mesh(20, 10, 10, 5, &#039;hex&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(&#039;modal_tet&#039;, 2, …)\u003C/code\u003E. Bhala igama ku-script njengoba linjalo: i-PartCraft ithola imisebenzi yomtapo i-script esebenzisa ngaphambi kokuqhuba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakho-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukakho okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ei-numpy, i-scipy namanye amaphakheji: kukhona kuphela umtapo ojwayelekile we-Python (\u003Ccode\u003Emath\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ejson\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eitertools\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edecimal\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estatistics\u003C/code\u003E…), ngaphandle kwezingxenye zawo zamawindow, zesiteshi nedatabase (\u003Ccode\u003Etkinter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecurses\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esqlite3\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-socket nanoma yini enye engafinyelela ngaphandle: i-Python akunayo inethiwekhi lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-\u003Ccode\u003Etime.sleep\u003C/code\u003E iphendula ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugoqa emhleleni, nokubiza umsebenzi we-Python kusuka ku-script ye-CraftScript.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqhuba kuhlola isabelo somyalelo nokuMisa njalo emigqeni engu-1000; ukubalwa okude ngaphakathi komsebenzi owodwa wangaphakathi kuqedwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-Python ulimi lwesithathu kwi-Script workspace. Khetha Python ebhokisini lolimi phezu komhleli (ifayela .py livula nge-Python ngokwalo). I-Python, i-Lua ne-CraftScript zabelana ngokuguquguqukayo okufanayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi efanayo, ngakho i-script ye-Python ingasebenzisa okwenziwe yi-script ye-CraftScript, nakuphambene. Ukuqalisa kokuqala kwe-Python kuvakashelo kulayisha i-Python ngokwayo (CPython 3.14, cishe 7 MB) kule sayithi, okuthatha imizuzwana embalwa. I-Python ayikaba yingxenye ye-Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi okwamanje: qhuba i-script eyodwa ye-Python uku-inthanethi kuqala. I-Python ivalelwe Ama-script e-Python avalelwe njengama-script e-CraftScript ne-Lua: afinyelela engxenyeni, okuguquguqukayo nemisebenzi yangaphakathi, hhayi okunye. Ukuqalisa ngakunye kuyi-Python entsha esandbox yayo enesakhiwo esincane samafayela ekhumbulweni (imitapo yayo yemithetho nefolda ye-/tmp enyamalala ngemva kokuqhuba). Ayikwazi ukufinyelela inethiwekhi, amafayela akho noma ikhasi lonke, kusibonisi nasemugqeni womyalo ngokufanayo. I-script evela komunye umuntu isenza kusebenze isikhathi noma inkumbulo eningi: Misa iyiphelisa. Okubalulekile A = cs.magic(3) # yonke imisebenzi yangaphakathi ngu-cs.\u003Cname\u003E B = A @ A.T # @ ngumphumela we-matrix, .T ukuguqula C = A * 2 + 1 # + - * / ** zisebenza sakhi-sakhi, njenge-numpy print(A[0, 1], A[-1, -1]) # ngo-0; okungamanani angaphansi kubalwa kusukela emuva row = A[1] # isikhombi esisodwa ku-matrix: umugqa big = A[A \u003E 4] # imaski yokuqiniseka ikhetha izakhi A[0, 0] = -5 # ukunikeza inani ku-array V, D = cs.call('eig', 2, A) # imiphumela eminingi: cs.call(igama, inani, …) I-array ye-1 × 1 ifika njengenombolo evamile; ezinye ama-array, ama-sparse matrix, imesh, izinsimu nemodeli ngu-Values. I-Value inezakhiwo shape (i-tuple), T, type, numel(), copy(), tolist(), len() (imigqa yayo), no float(), int() no bool() ngesakhi esisodwa. Ukuqhathanisa (\u003C, ==, …) kusebenza sakhi-sakhi, njenge-numpy: kunikeza i-Value yokuqiniseka. Uhlu lwezinombolo olunikezwa umsebenzi wangaphakathi luba ama-array: cs.sum([1, 2, 3]). cs.tensor([[1, 2], [3, 4]]) yenza i-matrix. I-dict iba yi-struct nohlu lwezinto ezixubile luba iseli, futhi kuphinde kube njalo. Konke okuwumhlaba i-script yakho ikwenzayo (inombolo, i-Value, i-dict, uhlu…) kufika ethebhini le-Okuguquguqukayo lapho ukuqhuba kuphela, noma emva kwephutha. Amagama aqala nge-_, imisebenzi, amakilasi nezimoduli ahlala ku-Python. ws.name ifunda noma isethe okuguquguqukayo ngqo, ne-ws_names() iyawahlu. print(…) ibhala kukhonsoli. display(…) (noma cs.display) ibonisa imesh, insimu noma igrafu, njengakwi-CraftScript. Biza umtapo wokuhlaziya Imisebenzi yomtapo ibizwa njengemisebenzi yangaphakathi: cs.box_mesh(20, 10, 10, 5, 'hex'), cs.call('modal_tet', 2, …). Bhala igama ku-script njengoba linjalo: i-PartCraft ithola imisebenzi yomtapo i-script esebenzisa ngaphambi kokuqhuba. Akukakho okwamanje i-numpy, i-scipy namanye amaphakheji: kukhona kuphela umtapo ojwayelekile we-Python (math, json, itertools, decimal, statistics…), ngaphandle kwezingxenye zawo zamawindow, zesiteshi nedatabase (tkinter, curses, sqlite3). Ama-socket nanoma yini enye engafinyelela ngaphandle: i-Python akunayo inethiwekhi lapha. I-time.sleep iphendula ngokushesha. Ukugoqa emhleleni, nokubiza umsebenzi we-Python kusuka ku-script ye-CraftScript. Ukuqhuba kuhlola isabelo somyalelo nokuMisa njalo emigqeni engu-1000; ukubalwa okude ngaphakathi komsebenzi owodwa wangaphakathi kuqedwa kuqala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"fields","scope":"partcraft","title":"Insimu: izimo njengamabanga","summary":"Yini insimu (umumo ogcinwe njengebanga kusuka endaweni yawo), indlela yokuwakha kusuka ezakhiweni ezisisekelo, ama-boolean, ama-lattice nobuso obuncane kuskripthi, ukuthi ashintshwa kanjani abe yisidumbu, nokuthi kungani iskripthi esifanayo sihlala sinika amabhithi afanayo.","section":"reference","order":95,"keywords":["insimu","ibanga elisayiniwe","sdf","voxel","gyroid","tpms","lattice","boolean","offset","shell","blend","dual contouring","okunqunyiwe","ukuvalwa ngokuphelele","manifold","brick"],"headings":[{"id":"kusukela-ensimini-kuya-esidumbini","text":"Kusukela enSimini kuya esidumbini","level":2},{"id":"njalo-kuba-amabhithi-afanayo","text":"Njalo kuba amabhithi afanayo","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cstrong\u003Einsimu\u003C/strong\u003E ichaza isimo ngobude besuka kunoma yiliphi iphoyinti liye endaweni yaso: linegethivu ngaphakathi, lingu-zero endaweni, linhle ngaphandle. Isiyingi sobubanzi be-5 &quot;ibanga kusuka emaphakathini ngaphandle kwe-5&quot;. Ukuhlanganisa izimo kuyizibalo zamabanga: inhlangano iwukuncane kwamabili, ukuhlangana kuwukukhulu, ukukhipha esinye kwesinye kuwukukhulu kokuqala kuwukukhipha kwesesibili. Ukukhulisa isimo ngo-1 mm kukhipha u-1 ebangeni; udonga oluyisikhwama liwubanga, eligoqwe phansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYingakho izinsimu zinhle kuma-lattice, imisele nezindonga ezinobukhulu obuhlukahlukene: ubuso be-gyroid bungu &quot;isamba se-sine singu-zero&quot;, nodonga olukhula kusuka ku-1 kuya ku-3 mm kuso sonke isigaba yinani elishintsha kuso sonke isigaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusukela-ensimini-kuya-esidumbini\"\u003EKusukela enSimini kuya esidumbini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto_body(field, h)\u003C/code\u003E ithatha isampula yensimu ngegridi yamaphoyinti ayi-\u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E millimitha ngakunye, igcina kuphela amaphoyinti aseduze nobuso (igridi elincane le-8 × 8 × 8 bricks), futhi yakha ubuso nge-\u003Cstrong\u003Edual contouring\u003C/strong\u003E: i-vertex eyodwa ngeseli ngayinye yobuso, ebekwe lapho izindiza zobuso zihlangana, ngakho umphetho obukhali uhlala ubukhali ngaphakathi kwe-voxel eyodwa. Ubuso buvaliwe futhi wonke amaphethelo ahlanganyelwa yizinxantathu ezimbili kuphela; ibhalo liyasho lokho. Isici esincane kakhulu kuno-voxel ezintathu singancipha, bese ibhalo lisho ukuthi isidumbu asisona isolidi evaliwe kunokuba siyifihle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi we-voxel ungunembeza: ivolumu yesiyingi esinama-voxel angu-25 ngobubanzi iphakathi kwamakhulu ambalwa ephesenti, udonga luqinisekile njengama-voxel alo. Igridi elikhulu kakhulu lisheshisa kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"njalo-kuba-amabhithi-afanayo\"\u003ENjalo kuba amabhithi afanayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInsimu alinayo iwashi noma inombolo engaphazanyiswa. I-sine ne-cosine ye-gyroid, nakho konke okuphawulekayo, okulogarithimu nokuphakama okusemtapweni, kubalwa ngokuhlanganiswa okulula kwezibalo ukuze i-Node, i-Chrome, i-Firefox ne-Safari zinikeze amabhithi afanayo; igridi lihanjwa ngokulandelana okulungisiwe, ngakho iskripthi esifanayo nemvelo efanayo sinikeza ama-mesh namashidi wedatha afana ngebhithi, kunoma yikuphi ikhompyutha naseziphathini zezintambo zomsebenzi ezinganani. Lokhu kuyahlolwa, kubandakanya isiphequluli kanye ne-Node.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/write-a-generator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/write-a-generator\"\u003EBhala isikhiqizi\u003C/a\u003E sakha ingxenye ngezinsimu; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineering-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineering-library\"\u003EUmtapo wobunjiniyela\u003C/a\u003E uyilinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-insimu ichaza isimo ngobude besuka kunoma yiliphi iphoyinti liye endaweni yaso: linegethivu ngaphakathi, lingu-zero endaweni, linhle ngaphandle. Isiyingi sobubanzi be-5 \"ibanga kusuka emaphakathini ngaphandle kwe-5\". Ukuhlanganisa izimo kuyizibalo zamabanga: inhlangano iwukuncane kwamabili, ukuhlangana kuwukukhulu, ukukhipha esinye kwesinye kuwukukhulu kokuqala kuwukukhipha kwesesibili. Ukukhulisa isimo ngo-1 mm kukhipha u-1 ebangeni; udonga oluyisikhwama liwubanga, eligoqwe phansi. Yingakho izinsimu zinhle kuma-lattice, imisele nezindonga ezinobukhulu obuhlukahlukene: ubuso be-gyroid bungu \"isamba se-sine singu-zero\", nodonga olukhula kusuka ku-1 kuya ku-3 mm kuso sonke isigaba yinani elishintsha kuso sonke isigaba. Kusukela enSimini kuya esidumbini to_body(field, h) ithatha isampula yensimu ngegridi yamaphoyinti ayi-h millimitha ngakunye, igcina kuphela amaphoyinti aseduze nobuso (igridi elincane le-8 × 8 × 8 bricks), futhi yakha ubuso nge-dual contouring: i-vertex eyodwa ngeseli ngayinye yobuso, ebekwe lapho izindiza zobuso zihlangana, ngakho umphetho obukhali uhlala ubukhali ngaphakathi kwe-voxel eyodwa. Ubuso buvaliwe futhi wonke amaphethelo ahlanganyelwa yizinxantathu ezimbili kuphela; ibhalo liyasho lokho. Isici esincane kakhulu kuno-voxel ezintathu singancipha, bese ibhalo lisho ukuthi isidumbu asisona isolidi evaliwe kunokuba siyifihle. Usayizi we-voxel ungunembeza: ivolumu yesiyingi esinama-voxel angu-25 ngobubanzi iphakathi kwamakhulu ambalwa ephesenti, udonga luqinisekile njengama-voxel alo. Igridi elikhulu kakhulu lisheshisa kakhulu. Njalo kuba amabhithi afanayo Insimu alinayo iwashi noma inombolo engaphazanyiswa. I-sine ne-cosine ye-gyroid, nakho konke okuphawulekayo, okulogarithimu nokuphakama okusemtapweni, kubalwa ngokuhlanganiswa okulula kwezibalo ukuze i-Node, i-Chrome, i-Firefox ne-Safari zinikeze amabhithi afanayo; igridi lihanjwa ngokulandelana okulungisiwe, ngakho iskripthi esifanayo nemvelo efanayo sinikeza ama-mesh namashidi wedatha afana ngebhithi, kunoma yikuphi ikhompyutha naseziphathini zezintambo zomsebenzi ezinganani. Lokhu kuyahlolwa, kubandakanya isiphequluli kanye ne-Node. Okulandelayo Bhala isikhiqizi sakha ingxenye ngezinsimu; Umtapo wobunjiniyela uyilinganisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","summary":"Izinkinga ongahlangabezana nazo ku-PartCraft, kusukela ohlelweni olungaqali kuya ezici ezehlulekayo, iziskethi ezingeke zixazululeke, amafayela angeke avuleke kanye nezixhumanisi ezingasebenzi kahle, nomlayezo obonwayo nokulungisa kwawo.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["inkinga","iphutha","usizo","akusebenzi","ehlulekayo","ukuwa","kumnyama","webgl","webassembly","kernel","akukakhiwa","ukuchazwa ngokweqile","iskethi evulekile","akukwazi ukuvula","akukho okwenzekayo","isiqondiso esingalungile","kancane"],"headings":[{"id":"uhlelo-alugqalwa","text":"Uhlelo alugqalwa","level":2},{"id":"lesi-siphequluli-asikwazi-ukubonisa-i-3d-webgl-icimile-noma-ayikho-ngakho-i-partcraft-ayikwazi-ukusebenza-lapha","text":"\"Lesi siphequluli asikwazi ukubonisa i-3D (WebGL icimile noma ayikho), ngakho i-PartCraft ayikwazi ukusebenza lapha.\"","level":3},{"id":"i-solid-kernel-ayilayithanga","text":"\"I-solid kernel ayilayithanga: …\"","level":3},{"id":"iqhosha-langaphandle-lithi-akukwazanga-ukulondoloza-noma-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi-akutholakali","text":"Iqhosha langaphandle lithi \"Akukwazanga ukulondoloza\" noma \"Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali\"","level":3},{"id":"i-partcraft-ingaphandle-kwe-inthanethi-kodwa-idlule-isikhathi","text":"I-PartCraft ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi kodwa idlule isikhathi","level":3},{"id":"sweep-akikakhiwa-okwamanje-idinga-i-kernel-eqondile","text":"\"Sweep: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, …\"","level":3},{"id":"ilayitha-i-solid-kernel-akuphelelisi","text":"\"Ilayitha i-solid kernel…\" akuphelelisi","level":3},{"id":"akwenzeki-lutho-lapho-ucindezela-ukhiye","text":"Akwenzeki lutho lapho ucindezela ukhiye","level":2},{"id":"iqhosha-lethuluzi-lifiphele","text":"Iqhosha lethuluzi lifiphele","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zeskethi","text":"Izinkinga zeskethi","level":2},{"id":"iskethi-ayivumeli-ukungeza-ukuxhumana","text":"Iskethi ayivumeli ukungeza ukuxhumana","level":3},{"id":"ichazwe-ngokweqile-azikwazi-ukufezeka-zonke-hlehlisa-noma-susa-elinye-lazo","text":"\"Ichazwe ngokweqile: … azikwazi ukufezeka zonke. Hlehlisa, noma susa elinye lazo.\"","level":3},{"id":"ichazwe-ngokweqile-sele-kuphethwe-yisuse","text":"\"Ichazwe ngokweqile: … sele kuphethwe. Yisuse.\"","level":3},{"id":"lezi-zinto-azikwazi-ukulinganiswa-ndawonye","text":"\"Lezi zinto azikwazi ukulinganiswa ndawonye.\"","level":3},{"id":"i-fillet-idinga-ikhona-lapho-kuhlangana-imigqa-emibili-ngqo-lowo-radius-mkhulu-kakhulu-kule-migqa","text":"\"I-fillet idinga ikhona lapho kuhlangana imigqa emibili ngqo.\" / \"Lowo radius mkhulu kakhulu kule migqa.\"","level":3},{"id":"ijiyomethri-ibuyela-emuva-lapho-ngiyihudula","text":"Ijiyomethri ibuyela emuva lapho ngiyihudula","level":3},{"id":"le-skethi-ayikwazi-ukuvula-idinga-i-extrude2-ehlulekayo","text":"\"Le skethi ayikwazi ukuvula: Idinga i-Extrude2, ehlulekayo.\"","level":3},{"id":"izinkinga-zezici","text":"Izinkinga zezici","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zokukhetha","text":"Izinkinga zokukhetha","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zamafayela","text":"Izinkinga zamafayela","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zombumbo","text":"Izinkinga zombumbo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ze-assembly","text":"Izinkinga ze-assembly","level":2},{"id":"kuyahamba-kancane","text":"Kuyahamba kancane","level":2},{"id":"usazama","text":"Usazama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma into ingasebenzi, qala ngokufunda i-\u003Cstrong\u003Eibha yesimo\u003C/strong\u003E esezansi: i-PartCraft ithi lapho kungani inqabile noma ilindele ukuthini okulandelayo. Isici esehlulekayo siphinde sibonise umlayezo waso phezulu ephaneli yaso yokudla nalapho uhlela umugqa waso kumlando.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlelo-alugqalwa\"\u003EUhlelo alugqalwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lesi-siphequluli-asikwazi-ukubonisa-i-3d-webgl-icimile-noma-ayikho-ngakho-i-partcraft-ayikwazi-ukusebenza-lapha\"\u003E&quot;Lesi siphequluli asikwazi ukubonisa i-3D (WebGL icimile noma ayikho), ngakho i-PartCraft ayikwazi ukusebenza lapha.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E isiphequluli sivalile noma sivimbele ukubonisa kwegrafikhi ye-3D (WebGL), noma umshayeli wegrafikhi awuyisekeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungisa:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://settings/system\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003Eedge://settings/system\u003C/code\u003E ku-Edge) bese uvula &quot;Use graphics acceleration when available&quot;, bese uqala kabusha isiphequluli. Uma sesivulekile, hlola \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://gpu\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthole isimo se-WebGL, bese ubuyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:support\u003C/code\u003E ubheke i-Graphics, WebGL. Uma ivinjiwe, buyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi. Ku-\u003Ccode\u003Eabout:config\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewebgl.disabled\u003C/code\u003E kumele ibe \u003Ccode\u003Efalse\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-WebGL ivulekile njalo ku-Safari yamanje. Buyekeza i-macOS (i-Safari iyabuyekezwa nayo). Uma kusahluleka, zama i-Chrome noma i-Firefox ku-Mac efanayo ukuze uqinisekise ukuthi ihadiwe yegrafikhi ayiyona imbangela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-desktop akude nezinye izimishini ezibonakalayo azinayo i-WebGL. Zama kukhompyutha ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"i-solid-kernel-ayilayithanga\"\u003E&quot;I-solid kernel ayilayithanga: …&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E i-kernel yejiyomethri (uhlelo lwe-WebAssembly) ayikwazanga ukulethwa noma ukuqala. Ngokuvamile uxhumo luphuke ngesikhathi uhlelo lulayitha, i-WebAssembly ivalwe yinqubomgomo yenkampani noma isethingi yokuvikela yesiphequluli, noma isiphequluli sidala kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungisa:\u003C/strong\u003E layitha kabusha ikhasi uxhunywe. Uma kuqhubeka kusahluleka, zama esinye isiphequluli samanje. Ku-Firefox, \u003Ccode\u003Ejavascript.options.wasm\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Ccode\u003Eabout:config\u003C/code\u003E kumele ibe \u003Ccode\u003Etrue\u003C/code\u003E. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, uhlelo nekernel yalo kulayitha kuphela uma i-app bar ibe ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphambi kokuthi ulahlekelwe uxhumo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E uxhunywe; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"iqhosha-langaphandle-lithi-akukwazanga-ukulondoloza-noma-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi-akutholakali\"\u003EIqhosha langaphandle lithi &quot;Akukwazanga ukulondoloza&quot; noma &quot;Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/strong\u003E: amanye amafayela awazange alandwe. Chofoza ukuze uzame futhi uxhunywe; uxhumo olucothayo noma olukhokhelwayo lungadinga ukuzama okwesibili. \u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali\u003C/strong\u003E: leli windi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi yangaphandle (amawindi asimfihlo nezinye izikhompyutha ezilawulwayo ziyayivimbela). Sebenzisa iwindi elijwayelekile, noma gcina ithebhu livulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"i-partcraft-ingaphandle-kwe-inthanethi-kodwa-idlule-isikhathi\"\u003EI-PartCraft ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi kodwa idlule isikhathi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EIlungele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/strong\u003E uma uxhunywe bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sweep-akikakhiwa-okwamanje-idinga-i-kernel-eqondile\"\u003E&quot;Sweep: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, …&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmlayezo ogcwele uthi &quot;&lt;Name&gt;: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft. Usizo › Okungakakhiwa okwamanje kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho.&quot; Uyawubona uma ukhetha i-Sweep, i-Loft, i-Rib, i-flange yeshidi lensimbi, isici sobuso, i-Combine, i-Move body, i-Scale body noma i-Path pattern, nakwezinye izinto okwenza kuphela i-kernel eqondile. Akukho okuvula kubi ngesiphequluli sakho noma ngengxenye yakho: le nguqulo ye-PartCraft yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho, nento ethi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ilayitha-i-solid-kernel-akuphelelisi\"\u003E&quot;Ilayitha i-solid kernel…&quot; akuphelelisi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinda kancane uma uxhumo lunzima: i-kernel ne-3D library ziyalayitha okokuqala. Bese layitha kabusha. Uma ikhasi ngokwalo likhomba iphutha, bona ngenhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akwenzeki-lutho-lapho-ucindezela-ukhiye\"\u003EAkwenzeki lutho lapho ucindezela ukhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye abasebenzi lapho ikhesa lisebhokisini ephaneli. Chofoza ku-3D view noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E emva kokubhala (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uphume).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye bezinkomba nokhiye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E/\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bajikeleza futhi basondeze umbono kuphela uma usuchofozile kumbono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKukhona ingxoxo evuliwe: yiphendule kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-sketch, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyithuluzi le-Fillet, hhayi Fit. Sebenzisa iqhosha le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iqhosha-lethuluzi-lifiphele\"\u003EIqhosha lethuluzi lifiphele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaqhosha esici afiphele uma iskethi ivulekile. Vala iskethi kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi eskethi asebenza kuphela ngaphakathi keskethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E ziyafiphela uma kungekho lutho oluzohlehliswa noma oluzophindwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E idinga ingxenye enesolid. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E idinga izingxenye ezimbili ku-assembly. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E idinga ingxenye ekhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E ziyafiphela ku-assembly: thumela ingxenye ngayinye. Enye inhlelo yenqaba ifayela eqondile: zama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile)\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi)\u003C/span\u003E, bese utshela thina nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBika inkinga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E nezinye izici ezidinga i-kernel eqondile azifiphele: zisasebenza, izincazelo zazo ezivelayo ziphela ngokuthi &quot;akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile)&quot;, futhi ukuchofoza kuyakusho lokho kwi-ibha yesimo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E idinga ingxenye enesolid, futhi ifiphele lapho iskethi ivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ziyafiphela ku-assembly: ama-assembly awakakwazi ukuthunyelwa. Vala, noma hlela ingxenye, ukuze uthumele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zeskethi\"\u003EIzinkinga zeskethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"iskethi-ayivumeli-ukungeza-ukuxhumana\"\u003EIskethi ayivumeli ukungeza ukuxhumana\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Ayikho ukuxhumana okulingana nalokhu okukhethiwe. Khetha izinto ezimbili noma eyodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza kuyangeza).&quot; Ukuxhumana kudinga ukukhetha okuhlukile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-relations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-relations\"\u003EUkuxhumana kweskethi nezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okudingwa yikho ngakunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ichazwe-ngokweqile-azikwazi-ukufezeka-zonke-hlehlisa-noma-susa-elinye-lazo\"\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile: … azikwazi ukufezeka zonke. Hlehlisa, noma susa elinye lazo.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuxhumana noma isilinganiso esisha siphikisana nalokhu okuvele. Iskethi ayinyakazanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungisa:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma susa enye yezinto ezibomvu ohlwini lwephaneli yesokudla (khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwayo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ichazwe-ngokweqile-sele-kuphethwe-yisuse\"\u003E&quot;Ichazwe ngokweqile: … sele kuphethwe. Yisuse.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImbangela:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuxhumana akwengezi lutho: ezinye sezikuphoqa kakade (isibonelo Parallel ezinhlangothini ezimbili zesikwele, noma isilinganiso esisesikhundleni esingaguquki). Akukho zilinganiso ezilandelwayo kule nguqulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulungisa:\u003C/strong\u003E yisuse. Ingxenye iyakhiwa noma kunjalo, ngesexwayiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lezi-zinto-azikwazi-ukulinganiswa-ndawonye\"\u003E&quot;Lezi zinto azikwazi ukulinganiswa ndawonye.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUchofoze, isibonelo, iphoyinti nesiyingi. Linganisa kuphoyinti lesikhungo sesiyingi esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"i-fillet-idinga-ikhona-lapho-kuhlangana-imigqa-emibili-ngqo-lowo-radius-mkhulu-kakhulu-kule-migqa\"\u003E&quot;I-fillet idinga ikhona lapho kuhlangana imigqa emibili ngqo.&quot; / &quot;Lowo radius mkhulu kakhulu kule migqa.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza ngqo ephoyinteni lekhona lemigqa emibili eqinile. Sebenzisa radius encane kunaleyo umugqa omfushane ovumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ijiyomethri-ibuyela-emuva-lapho-ngiyihudula\"\u003EIjiyomethri ibuyela emuva lapho ngiyihudula\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhudula kuzophula ukuxhumana noma isilinganiso, ngakho i-PartCraft iyibuyisela. Kuphela ijiyomethri eluhlaza (engachazwanga ngokuphelele) ingahamba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"le-skethi-ayikwazi-ukuvula-idinga-i-extrude2-ehlulekayo\"\u003E&quot;Le skethi ayikwazi ukuvula: Idinga i-Extrude2, ehlulekayo.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIskethi ihlezi ebusweni besici esingakakhiwa. Lungisa leso sici kuqala, noma vula kabusha, noma qhubeka phambili (roll forward).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zezici\"\u003EIzinkinga zezici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Yenza iskethi kuqala: khetha indiza, Iskethi, dweba iphrofayli evaliwe, Phuma.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyikho iskethi engasetshenziswanga enemigqa yamajika, futhi akukho ekhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba iskethi, noma khetha iskethi oyisebenzisayo emlandweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Iskethi ayinayo iphrofayli evaliwe yokuphushwa.&quot; (noma &quot;yokuzungezisa&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyikho ilupu elivaliwe lemigqa eqinile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVala izikhala; buyisela imigqa yokwakha ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Iphrofayli ivulekile: ukuphela ku-(x, y) akuhlanganisiwe nalutho.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona isikhala kuleso siphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula iskethi, hudula ukuphela kumakhelwane wakho ukuze kuhlangane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Iphrofayli ihlukana ku-(x, y): ngaphezu kwezinhlangothi ezimbili zihlangana khona.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emithathu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana kuphoyinti elilodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa umugqa owengeziwe, noma uwushintshe ube wokwakha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ilupu elivaliwe lidinga okungenani izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ijika.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili iphindana phambili nasemuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba kabusha ilupu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Kudlula konke kwezinqamuko. Sebenzisa ukujula ku-boss.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-boss esethwe ku-Through all\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetha End ku-Blind noma Mid-plane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Akukho okuzosikwa kuleyo nhlangothi yeskethi. Zama olunye uhlangothi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusika kubheka ngaphandle kwempahla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThikha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsiqondiso esiphambene\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Akukho okuzosikwa okwamanje.&quot; / &quot;Akukho okuzokhandwa okwamanje.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyikho isolidi ngaphambi kwalesi sici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza i-boss kuqala, noma hehlisa isici phansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Dweba umugqa wephakathi (umugqa wokwakha) eskethini ukuze uzungeze kuwo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuzungezisa ngaphandle kwe-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza umugqa wephakathi, noma khetha umugqa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Axis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Iphrofayli idlula i-axis. Yigcine ohlangothini olulodwa lomugqa wephakathi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrofayli ibhekene nazo zombili izinhlangothi ze-axis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba kabusha ingxenye yephrofayli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Beka amaphoyinti eskethi lapho kuzoba khona izimbobo (ithuluzi le-Point), bese wenza umgodi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho maphoyinti akhululekile eskethini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza amaphoyinti nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Isimbobo kufanele sibe sibanzi kunomgodi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbubanzi (⌀) besimbobo abukhulu kune-Diameter\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza isimbobo sibe sibanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Isimbobo kufanele sibe sengcone kunomgodi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsimbobo sijulile kunomgodi ovaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza sibe sengcone, noma umgodi ube mujulile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Khetha izici ozokopisha.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpattern noma i-mirror ayikho okuthikhiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThikha isici ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukopishe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Extrude2 akunayo isolidi yokukopisha.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici ekopishwayo sehlulekile noma sivaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELungisa noma vula kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Idinga i-Sketch3, ehlulekayo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esincike kuso akikakhiwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELungisa isici esisho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ubuso ihlezi kuwo sekunyamalele (i-Extrude1 ayikakhiwa).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso beskethi ayisekho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELungisa leso sici, noma susa iskethi uphinde uyenze\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Akusalutho ingxenye ngemva kwalokhu.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusika kususe wonke amanzi (impahla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlola usayizi nesiqondiso sokusika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-solid kernel ayikwazanga ukwakha lokhu (…).&quot; noma &quot;I-solid kernel ayikwazanga ukuhlanganisa lokhu nomzimba.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-kernel yenqaba ijiyomethri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa, noma shintsha usayizi kancane; izinhlangothi ezithinta ngokunembile zingabangela lokhu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Sweep: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft.&quot; (futhi i-Loft, i-Rib nezinye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esenziwe kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini esingakhiwa yi-kernel eqondile kuphela. Sihlala emlandweni futhi sigcinwa sibuyiselwe singashintshiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVimbela noma susa; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-round eyi-5 mm ayilingani lapha (…).&quot; / &quot;I-chamfer eyi-2 mm …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi mkhulu kakhulu ebusweni eliseduze nomphetho, noma ikhona ayikwazi ukuxutshwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi omncane, noma imiphetho embalwa ngesici ngasinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet: kule nguqulo imiphetho eqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha). Gotsha noma ubhevele imiphetho egoqekile eskethini.&quot; (futhi i-Chamfer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmphetho okhethiwe ugoqekile, njengomphetho wesimbobo, noma ukhona ebusweni obugoqekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E bese usisusa; gotsha noma ubhevele leyo ndawo eskethini esikhundleni salokho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-fillet enobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike radius eyodwa.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius eguqukayo\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYikhiphe ukuthikha bese unikeza radius eyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho egoqiwe ihlangana, ihlanganiswa nge-mitre, hhayi ixutshwe.&quot; (⚠, isexwayiso)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho ekhethiwe ihlangana ekhoneni; ama-round ahlangana lapho ngokhuvi obukhali\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho okudingeka ukulungiswe: ingxenye iyakhiwa. Fillet imiphetho embalwa uma ikhuvi libalulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Umphetho iyagoqa kuwo sekunyamalele: umphetho phakathi kuka-Extrude1 no-Cut2.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUshintsho lwangaphambilini lususe umphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E, susa umphetho obomvu, khetha omusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Khetha imiphetho embonweni, bese uyengeza.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici se-fillet noma i-chamfer alinayo imiphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Khetha izinhlangothi ozozisusa (ezivulekile), bese wenza i-shell.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-shell ayinazo izinhlangothi ezivulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-shell ayikwazanga ukwenziwa ngalobu bukhulu (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdonga lukhulu kunengxenye encane yemodeli noma kunoba we-fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdonga olumncane, noma ama-fillet amakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso obuvulekile bugoqekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E bese usisusa; vula izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso obuthanjisiwe buyisilinda, i-cone noma ubuso be-freeform\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa, uthambise izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ubuso ivulayo sekunyamalele (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUshintsho lwangaphambilini lususe ubuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha izinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-Fillet1 iguqula imiphetho noma izindonga zomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpattern noma i-mirror ikopisha i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYikhiphe ukuthikha; yenza ipattern yokusika kuqala, bese fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ihlezi ebusweni okungatholwa kuphela yi-kernel eqondile: akikakhiwa okwamanje kule nguqulo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIskethi ebusweni i-mesh kernel engakwazi ukuthola, njengalena yakhiwa kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza iskethi endizeni esisekelo noma ebusweni obuyisicaba be-extrude, bese uyibeka ngezilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Isebenzisa ubuso noma umphetho wesolid, okungatholwa kuphela yi-kernel eqondile: akikakhiwa okwamanje kule nguqulo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndiza, i-axis noma iphoyinti lereferensi ebusweni noma emphethweni wesolid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYakha kusuka ezindizeni ezisisekelo, amaphoyinti eskethi noma ama-coordinates\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ukukhipha kuze kube ubuso, ubuso obulandelayo noma i-vertex: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile).&quot; / &quot;I-Taper: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsimo sokuphela noma i-taper kuphela i-kernel eqondile iyakwakha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa ukujula kwe-Blind noma i-Mid-plane oyilinganisayo; shiya i-Taper ku-0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zokukhetha\"\u003EIzinkinga zokukhetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Lobo buso bugoqekile. Khetha ubuso obuyisicaba noma indiza ukuze udwebe kuyo.&quot; Iskethi idinga ubuso obuyisicaba. Dweba endizeni esisekelo bese ubeka iskethi ngezilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso buthi &quot;Fixed where picked&quot;: alukho umphetho weskethi owenza kuwo, isibonelo ubuso bekhophi yokukopisha ye-pattern, ngakho iskethi ebusweni leyo ihlala ilapho lapho ingxenye ishintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho inzima ukuyifinyelela: sondeza. Umphetho uyanqoba ubuso obuseduze uma isikhombisi siphezu kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zamafayela\"\u003EIzinkinga zamafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;I-PartCraft ivula amafayela ayo .partcraft.json, okuthunyelwe kusukela ku-CadCraft macro ye-SolidWorks (.cadcraft-sw.json) namafayela e-STEP. &quot;bracket.igs&quot; akukho kulezi.&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela lawo mafayela ayaqashelwa (namamesh e-STL, OBJ ne-3MF namafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;&quot;part.stp&quot; akuyona ifayela le-STEP (aliqali nge-ISO-10303-21).&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela alisona umbhalo we-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela le-STEP likhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kuka-60 MB) ukuze lingenisiwe lapha.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza ibe lula emthonjeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela likhulu kakhulu ukuba yingxenye ye-PartCraft.&quot; kwingxenye oyigcinile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi elikhulu le-STEP elangenisiwa kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini lenze ifayela lengxenye libe ngaphezu kuka-50 MB. Sebenzisa ikhophi yangaphambilini engayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela likhulu kakhulu ukuba yingxenye ye-PartCraft.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela ngaphezu kuka-50 MB; alisona ifayela le-PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lolu akusona ifayela le-PartCraft (alikho ku-JSON).&quot; / &quot;Lolu akusona ifayela le-PartCraft.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonakele noma eliyelohlelo lomunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Leli fayela ligcinwe yi-PartCraft entsha (inguqulo yefayela …); lapha ifunda inguqulo …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula kwi-PartCraft entsha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Extrude2: ukujula akulungile.&quot; (noma enye inani)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela libhalwe ngesandla noma lonakele. Sebenzisa ikhophi yangaphambilini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkungenisa ku-assembly kuthi &quot;Part1.partcraft.json akunayo isolidi yokungenisa.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lengxenye alinayo isolidi. Vula, yakha isolidi, gcina, bese ungenisa futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela engiligcinile alikho lapho ngilindele.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukulondoloza kuyidawunilodi: bheka efolda yokulanda yesiphequluli, noma vula uhlu lokulanda kwi-toolbar yesiphequluli. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho ahamba khona\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgivule ingxenye kodwa i-assembly isasesikrinini.\u003C/strong\u003E Ingxenye ilayithe ngemva kwe-assembly. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvale i-assembly ubone ingxenye. Vala ama-assembly ngaphambi kokuvula amafayela engxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zombumbo\"\u003EIzinkinga zombumbo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Yakha isolidi kuqala, bese wenza umbumbo wayo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYakha ingxenye kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ishidi alinandawo ye-detail. Yenza i-detail ibe ncane, noma ukhiphe umbono.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDetail radius\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EDetail scale\u003C/strong\u003E encane, noma susa isigaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-detail ithathwa emibonweni ephambili, ephezulu, ngakwesokudla noma esigabeni.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kwelinye lala mabono\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Chofoza kwelinye lemibono.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza kube phezu kwephepha elingenalutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-Position idinga okungenani ireferensi eyodwa ye-datum.&quot; nemilayezo yefreyimu eyinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetha ama-datum iphaneli eyicela, noma khetha enye impawu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Imibono yombumbo ayikwazanga ukwenziwa: …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa ushintsho lokugcina. Uma kuqhubeka, gcina, layitha kabusha ikhasi bese uvula kabusha ingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ze-assembly\"\u003EIzinkinga ze-assembly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Yakha isolidi kuqala, bese uyifaka ku-assembly.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ayinayo isolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ngenisa ingxenye yesibili kuqala (Engeza ikopi, Faka, noma Hlela › Phinda).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIxhumanisi idinga izingxenye ezimbili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Khetha ubuso kwenye ingxenye.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbuso bezixhumanisi zombili kumele bube ezinxenyeni ezihlukene\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Lobo buso bugoqekile. Khetha ubuso obuyisicaba …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzixhumanisi ziqala ebusweni obuyisicaba. Bese usebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EGxila ku\u003C/strong\u003E ngehhole noma i-axis yokuzungezisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-Bracket2 ayihlanganiswanga nengxenye esekelwe emhlabeni, ngakho ihlala lapho yabekwa khona.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza ixhumanisi kuyo kuya engxenyeni ebekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-Revolute3 ivala ilupu elingeke livale: ilahlekile ngo-2.000 mm. Hlola ubuso, ama-offset namakhawulo ezixhumanisi zelupu.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye azikwazi ukuhlangana zonke: hlola ubude, ubuso obusetshenziswa yixhumanisi ngayinye, ama-offset (izingxenye ezibekwe ubuso nobuso kumele zivumelane ngokujula) namakhawulo; noma susa ixhumanisi eyodwa yelupu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ubuso lo xhumanisi ulisebenzisayo sekunyamalele ku-Bracket.&quot; / &quot;I-axis lo xhumanisi ulisebenzisayo sekunyamalele ku-Bracket.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ihleliwe. Susa ixhumanisi bese uyenza futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-axis ihamba ngaphezu kobuso, ngakho ayikwazi ukusetha isikhungo sexhumanisi.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha i-axis edlula ebusweni, noma &quot;Ubuso bomsuka wobuso&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;I-assembly igcina okungenani ingxenye eyodwa. Yivale esikhundleni salokho.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye zihlanganisiwe kodwa endaweni engafanele.\u003C/strong\u003E Setha \u003Cstrong\u003EGxila ku\u003C/strong\u003E kwomabili amahlangothi exhumanisi ukuze ube ngamahhole noma ama-axis okuzungezisa afanele ukuhlelwa, bese ulungisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIkona (°)\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EOffset (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuyahamba-kancane\"\u003EKuyahamba kancane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Ngokujwayelekile noma Coarse uma wenza imodeli; shintsha ku-Fine ngaphambi kokuthumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinani ezikhulu zepattern (amakhophi amakhulu) zithatha isikhathi ukwakha kabusha ngalo lonke ushintsho. Vimbela ipattern lapho usebenza ezinye izici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlolwa kokuxhumana (Clash) nokuhlola ukunyakaza kuqhathanisa zonke izingxenye ezimbili; ama-assembly amakhulu athatha isikhathi eside.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala amathebhu amakhulu amanye. I-PartCraft isebenza ngeprosesa nomdwebo wekhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usazama\"\u003EUsazama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGcina ifayela lakho kuqala (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), bese uvuselela ikhasi bese uvula futhi. Uma isici sisahluleka, sikhethe, funda umlayezo waso, bese uzama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ubuyele esimeni esihle sokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma into ingasebenzi, qala ngokufunda i-ibha yesimo esezansi: i-PartCraft ithi lapho kungani inqabile noma ilindele ukuthini okulandelayo. Isici esehlulekayo siphinde sibonise umlayezo waso phezulu ephaneli yaso yokudla nalapho uhlela umugqa waso kumlando. Uhlelo alugqalwa \"Lesi siphequluli asikwazi ukubonisa i-3D (WebGL icimile noma ayikho), ngakho i-PartCraft ayikwazi ukusebenza lapha.\" Imbangela: isiphequluli sivalile noma sivimbele ukubonisa kwegrafikhi ye-3D (WebGL), noma umshayeli wegrafikhi awuyisekeli. Ukulungisa: Vula chrome://settings/system (noma edge://settings/system ku-Edge) bese uvula \"Use graphics acceleration when available\", bese uqala kabusha isiphequluli. Uma sesivulekile, hlola chrome://gpu ukuze uthole isimo se-WebGL, bese ubuyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi. Vula about:support ubheke i-Graphics, WebGL. Uma ivinjiwe, buyekeza umshayeli wegrafikhi. Ku-about:config, webgl.disabled kumele ibe false. I-WebGL ivulekile njalo ku-Safari yamanje. Buyekeza i-macOS (i-Safari iyabuyekezwa nayo). Uma kusahluleka, zama i-Chrome noma i-Firefox ku-Mac efanayo ukuze uqinisekise ukuthi ihadiwe yegrafikhi ayiyona imbangela. Ama-desktop akude nezinye izimishini ezibonakalayo azinayo i-WebGL. Zama kukhompyutha ngokwayo. \"I-solid kernel ayilayithanga: …\" Imbangela: i-kernel yejiyomethri (uhlelo lwe-WebAssembly) ayikwazanga ukulethwa noma ukuqala. Ngokuvamile uxhumo luphuke ngesikhathi uhlelo lulayitha, i-WebAssembly ivalwe yinqubomgomo yenkampani noma isethingi yokuvikela yesiphequluli, noma isiphequluli sidala kakhulu. Ukulungisa: layitha kabusha ikhasi uxhunywe. Uma kuqhubeka kusahluleka, zama esinye isiphequluli samanje. Ku-Firefox, javascript.options.wasm ku-about:config kumele ibe true. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, uhlelo nekernel yalo kulayitha kuphela uma i-app bar ibe ithi Ilungele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ngaphambi kokuthi ulahlekelwe uxhumo (Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi uxhunywe; bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi). Iqhosha langaphandle lithi \"Akukwazanga ukulondoloza\" noma \"Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali\" Akukwazanga ukulondoloza: amanye amafayela awazange alandwe. Chofoza ukuze uzame futhi uxhunywe; uxhumo olucothayo noma olukhokhelwayo lungadinga ukuzama okwesibili. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi akutholakali: leli windi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi yangaphandle (amawindi asimfihlo nezinye izikhompyutha ezilawulwayo ziyayivimbela). Sebenzisa iwindi elijwayelekile, noma gcina ithebhu livulekile. I-PartCraft ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi kodwa idlule isikhathi Chofoza Ilungele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi uma uxhunywe bese ukhetha Londoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu). \"Sweep: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, …\" Umlayezo ogcwele uthi \"\u003CName\u003E: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft. Usizo › Okungakakhiwa okwamanje kuchaza okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho.\" Uyawubona uma ukhetha i-Sweep, i-Loft, i-Rib, i-flange yeshidi lensimbi, isici sobuso, i-Combine, i-Move body, i-Scale body noma i-Path pattern, nakwezinye izinto okwenza kuphela i-kernel eqondile. Akukho okuvula kubi ngesiphequluli sakho noma ngengxenye yakho: le nguqulo ye-PartCraft yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel. Bona Okungakakhiwa okwamanje ukuze uthole okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho, nento ethi I-mesh kernel. \"Ilayitha i-solid kernel…\" akuphelelisi Linda kancane uma uxhumo lunzima: i-kernel ne-3D library ziyalayitha okokuqala. Bese layitha kabusha. Uma ikhasi ngokwalo likhomba iphutha, bona ngenhla. Akwenzeki lutho lapho ucindezela ukhiye Okhiye abasebenzi lapho ikhesa lisebhokisini ephaneli. Chofoza ku-3D view noma cindezela Esc emva kokubhala (noma Tab uphume). Okhiye bezinkomba nokhiye +/− bajikeleza futhi basondeze umbono kuphela uma usuchofozile kumbono. Kukhona ingxoxo evuliwe: yiphendule kuqala. Ku-sketch, F iyithuluzi le-Fillet, hhayi Fit. Sebenzisa iqhosha le-Lingana. Iqhosha lethuluzi lifiphele Amaqhosha esici afiphele uma iskethi ivulekile. Vala iskethi kuqala. Amathuluzi eskethi asebenza kuphela ngaphakathi keskethi. Hlehlisa ne-Phinda wenze ziyafiphela uma kungekho lutho oluzohlehliswa noma oluzophindwa. Inhlanganisela idinga ingxenye enesolid. Hlanganisa idinga izingxenye ezimbili ku-assembly. Hlela ingxenye idinga ingxenye ekhethiwe. STEP AP242 (isolidi eqondile) ne-STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile) ziyafiphela ku-assembly: thumela ingxenye ngayinye. Enye inhlelo yenqaba ifayela eqondile: zama STEP AP214 (isolidi eqondile), bese STEP (ngobuso, kernel yemeshi), bese utshela thina nge-Usizo › Bika inkinga. Sweep, Loft nezinye izici ezidinga i-kernel eqondile azifiphele: zisasebenza, izincazelo zazo ezivelayo ziphela ngokuthi \"akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile)\", futhi ukuchofoza kuyakusho lokho kwi-ibha yesimo. Bona Okungakakhiwa okwamanje. Umdwebo idinga ingxenye enesolid, futhi ifiphele lapho iskethi ivulekile. Izinto ze-Thumela ziyafiphela ku-assembly: ama-assembly awakakwazi ukuthunyelwa. Vala, noma hlela ingxenye, ukuze uthumele. Izinkinga zeskethi Iskethi ayivumeli ukungeza ukuxhumana \"Ayikho ukuxhumana okulingana nalokhu okukhethiwe. Khetha izinto ezimbili noma eyodwa (Shift+chofoza kuyangeza).\" Ukuxhumana kudinga ukukhetha okuhlukile. Bona Ukuxhumana kweskethi nezilinganiso ukuze uthole okudingwa yikho ngakunye. \"Ichazwe ngokweqile: … azikwazi ukufezeka zonke. Hlehlisa, noma susa elinye lazo.\" Imbangela: ukuxhumana noma isilinganiso esisha siphikisana nalokhu okuvele. Iskethi ayinyakazanga. Ukulungisa: Ctrl+Z, noma susa enye yezinto ezibomvu ohlwini lwephaneli yesokudla (khetha Susa eduze kwayo). \"Ichazwe ngokweqile: … sele kuphethwe. Yisuse.\" Imbangela: ukuxhumana akwengezi lutho: ezinye sezikuphoqa kakade (isibonelo Parallel ezinhlangothini ezimbili zesikwele, noma isilinganiso esisesikhundleni esingaguquki). Akukho zilinganiso ezilandelwayo kule nguqulo. Ukulungisa: yisuse. Ingxenye iyakhiwa noma kunjalo, ngesexwayiso. \"Lezi zinto azikwazi ukulinganiswa ndawonye.\" Uchofoze, isibonelo, iphoyinti nesiyingi. Linganisa kuphoyinti lesikhungo sesiyingi esikhundleni salokho. \"I-fillet idinga ikhona lapho kuhlangana imigqa emibili ngqo.\" / \"Lowo radius mkhulu kakhulu kule migqa.\" Chofoza ngqo ephoyinteni lekhona lemigqa emibili eqinile. Sebenzisa radius encane kunaleyo umugqa omfushane ovumela. Ijiyomethri ibuyela emuva lapho ngiyihudula Ukuhudula kuzophula ukuxhumana noma isilinganiso, ngakho i-PartCraft iyibuyisela. Kuphela ijiyomethri eluhlaza (engachazwanga ngokuphelele) ingahamba. \"Le skethi ayikwazi ukuvula: Idinga i-Extrude2, ehlulekayo.\" Iskethi ihlezi ebusweni besici esingakakhiwa. Lungisa leso sici kuqala, noma vula kabusha, noma qhubeka phambili (roll forward). Izinkinga zezici Umlayezo Imbangela Ukulungisa \"Yenza iskethi kuqala: khetha indiza, Iskethi, dweba iphrofayli evaliwe, Phuma.\" Ayikho iskethi engasetshenziswanga enemigqa yamajika, futhi akukho ekhethiwe Dweba iskethi, noma khetha iskethi oyisebenzisayo emlandweni \"Iskethi ayinayo iphrofayli evaliwe yokuphushwa.\" (noma \"yokuzungezisa\") Ayikho ilupu elivaliwe lemigqa eqinile Vala izikhala; buyisela imigqa yokwakha ngo-Q \"Iphrofayli ivulekile: ukuphela ku-(x, y) akuhlanganisiwe nalutho.\" Kukhona isikhala kuleso siphoyinti Vula iskethi, hudula ukuphela kumakhelwane wakho ukuze kuhlangane \"Iphrofayli ihlukana ku-(x, y): ngaphezu kwezinhlangothi ezimbili zihlangana khona.\" Imigqa emithathu noma ngaphezulu ihlangana kuphoyinti elilodwa Susa umugqa owengeziwe, noma uwushintshe ube wokwakha \"Ilupu elivaliwe lidinga okungenani izinhlangothi ezintathu noma ijika.\" Imigqa emibili iphindana phambili nasemuva Dweba kabusha ilupu \"Kudlula konke kwezinqamuko. Sebenzisa ukujula ku-boss.\" I-boss esethwe ku-Through all Setha End ku-Blind noma Mid-plane \"Akukho okuzosikwa kuleyo nhlangothi yeskethi. Zama olunye uhlangothi.\" Ukusika kubheka ngaphandle kwempahla Thikha Isiqondiso esiphambene \"Akukho okuzosikwa okwamanje.\" / \"Akukho okuzokhandwa okwamanje.\" Ayikho isolidi ngaphambi kwalesi sici Yenza i-boss kuqala, noma hehlisa isici phansi \"Dweba umugqa wephakathi (umugqa wokwakha) eskethini ukuze uzungeze kuwo.\" Ukuzungezisa ngaphandle kwe-axis Engeza umugqa wephakathi, noma khetha umugqa ku-I-Axis \"Iphrofayli idlula i-axis. Yigcine ohlangothini olulodwa lomugqa wephakathi.\" Iphrofayli ibhekene nazo zombili izinhlangothi ze-axis Dweba kabusha ingxenye yephrofayli \"Beka amaphoyinti eskethi lapho kuzoba khona izimbobo (ithuluzi le-Point), bese wenza umgodi.\" Akukho maphoyinti akhululekile eskethini Engeza amaphoyinti nge-P \"Isimbobo kufanele sibe sibanzi kunomgodi.\" Ububanzi (⌀) besimbobo abukhulu kune-Diameter Yenza isimbobo sibe sibanzi \"Isimbobo kufanele sibe sengcone kunomgodi.\" Isimbobo sijulile kunomgodi ovaliwe Yenza sibe sengcone, noma umgodi ube mujulile \"Khetha izici ozokopisha.\" Ipattern noma i-mirror ayikho okuthikhiwe Thikha isici ngaphansi kwe-Izici ukuze ukopishe \"Extrude2 akunayo isolidi yokukopisha.\" Isici ekopishwayo sehlulekile noma sivaliwe Lungisa noma vula kabusha \"Idinga i-Sketch3, ehlulekayo.\" Isici esincike kuso akikakhiwa Lungisa isici esisho \"Ubuso ihlezi kuwo sekunyamalele (i-Extrude1 ayikakhiwa).\" Ubuso beskethi ayisekho Lungisa leso sici, noma susa iskethi uphinde uyenze \"Akusalutho ingxenye ngemva kwalokhu.\" Ukusika kususe wonke amanzi (impahla) Hlola usayizi nesiqondiso sokusika \"I-solid kernel ayikwazanga ukwakha lokhu (…).\" noma \"I-solid kernel ayikwazanga ukuhlanganisa lokhu nomzimba.\" I-kernel yenqaba ijiyomethri Hlehlisa, noma shintsha usayizi kancane; izinhlangothi ezithinta ngokunembile zingabangela lokhu \"Sweep: akikakhiwa okwamanje. Idinga i-kernel eqondile, engekho kule nguqulo ye-PartCraft.\" (futhi i-Loft, i-Rib nezinye) Isici esenziwe kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini esingakhiwa yi-kernel eqondile kuphela. Sihlala emlandweni futhi sigcinwa sibuyiselwe singashintshiwe Vimbela noma susa; bona Okungakakhiwa okwamanje ukuze uthole okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho \"I-round eyi-5 mm ayilingani lapha (…).\" / \"I-chamfer eyi-2 mm …\" Usayizi mkhulu kakhulu ebusweni eliseduze nomphetho, noma ikhona ayikwazi ukuxutshwa Usayizi omncane, noma imiphetho embalwa ngesici ngasinye \"Fillet: kule nguqulo imiphetho eqondile phakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha). Gotsha noma ubhevele imiphetho egoqekile eskethini.\" (futhi i-Chamfer) Umphetho okhethiwe ugoqekile, njengomphetho wesimbobo, noma ukhona ebusweni obugoqekile Khetha imiphetho bese usisusa; gotsha noma ubhevele leyo ndawo eskethini esikhundleni salokho \"I-fillet enobubanzi obushintsha ngomphetho: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile). Yinike radius eyodwa.\" Radius eguqukayo ithikiwe Yikhiphe ukuthikha bese unikeza radius eyodwa \"Fillet nge-mesh kernel: lapho imiphetho egoqiwe ihlangana, ihlanganiswa nge-mitre, hhayi ixutshwe.\" (⚠, isexwayiso) Imiphetho ekhethiwe ihlangana ekhoneni; ama-round ahlangana lapho ngokhuvi obukhali Akukho okudingeka ukulungiswe: ingxenye iyakhiwa. Fillet imiphetho embalwa uma ikhuvi libalulekile \"Umphetho iyagoqa kuwo sekunyamalele: umphetho phakathi kuka-Extrude1 no-Cut2.\" Ushintsho lwangaphambilini lususe umphetho Khetha imiphetho, susa umphetho obomvu, khetha omusha \"Khetha imiphetho embonweni, bese uyengeza.\" Isici se-fillet noma i-chamfer alinayo imiphetho Khetha imiphetho \"Khetha izinhlangothi ozozisusa (ezivulekile), bese wenza i-shell.\" I-shell ayinazo izinhlangothi ezivulekile Khetha izinhlangothi \"I-shell ayikwazanga ukwenziwa ngalobu bukhulu (…).\" Udonga lukhulu kunengxenye encane yemodeli noma kunoba we-fillet Udonga olumncane, noma ama-fillet amakhulu \"Shell: kule nguqulo ivula izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).\" Ubuso obuvulekile bugoqekile Khetha izinhlangothi bese usisusa; vula izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela \"Uhlaka: kule nguqulo izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela (i-mesh kernel iyakwakha).\" Ubuso obuthanjisiwe buyisilinda, i-cone noma ubuso be-freeform Susa, uthambise izinhlangothi eziyisicaba kuphela \"Ubuso ivulayo sekunyamalele (…).\" Ushintsho lwangaphambilini lususe ubuso Khetha izinhlangothi futhi \"I-Fillet1 iguqula imiphetho noma izindonga zomzimba; ayikwazi ukukopishwa. …\" Ipattern noma i-mirror ikopisha i-fillet, i-chamfer noma i-shell Yikhiphe ukuthikha; yenza ipattern yokusika kuqala, bese fillet \"Ihlezi ebusweni okungatholwa kuphela yi-kernel eqondile: akikakhiwa okwamanje kule nguqulo.\" Iskethi ebusweni i-mesh kernel engakwazi ukuthola, njengalena yakhiwa kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini Yenza iskethi endizeni esisekelo noma ebusweni obuyisicaba be-extrude, bese uyibeka ngezilinganiso \"Isebenzisa ubuso noma umphetho wesolid, okungatholwa kuphela yi-kernel eqondile: akikakhiwa okwamanje kule nguqulo.\" Indiza, i-axis noma iphoyinti lereferensi ebusweni noma emphethweni wesolid Yakha kusuka ezindizeni ezisisekelo, amaphoyinti eskethi noma ama-coordinates \"Ukukhipha kuze kube ubuso, ubuso obulandelayo noma i-vertex: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile).\" / \"I-Taper: akikakhiwa okwamanje (idinga i-kernel eqondile).\" Isimo sokuphela noma i-taper kuphela i-kernel eqondile iyakwakha Sebenzisa ukujula kwe-Blind noma i-Mid-plane oyilinganisayo; shiya i-Taper ku-0 Izinkinga zokukhetha \"Lobo buso bugoqekile. Khetha ubuso obuyisicaba noma indiza ukuze udwebe kuyo.\" Iskethi idinga ubuso obuyisicaba. Dweba endizeni esisekelo bese ubeka iskethi ngezilinganiso. Ubuso buthi \"Fixed where picked\": alukho umphetho weskethi owenza kuwo, isibonelo ubuso bekhophi yokukopisha ye-pattern, ngakho iskethi ebusweni leyo ihlala ilapho lapho ingxenye ishintsha. Imiphetho inzima ukuyifinyelela: sondeza. Umphetho uyanqoba ubuso obuseduze uma isikhombisi siphezu kwawo. Izinkinga zamafayela Umlayezo Ukulungisa 'I-PartCraft ivula amafayela ayo .partcraft.json, okuthunyelwe kusukela ku-CadCraft macro ye-SolidWorks (.cadcraft-sw.json) namafayela e-STEP. \"bracket.igs\" akukho kulezi.' Kuphela lawo mafayela ayaqashelwa (namamesh e-STL, OBJ ne-3MF namafayela .3dm) '\"part.stp\" akuyona ifayela le-STEP (aliqali nge-ISO-10303-21).' Ifayela alisona umbhalo we-STEP \"Leli fayela le-STEP likhulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kuka-60 MB) ukuze lingenisiwe lapha.\" Yenza ibe lula emthonjeni \"Leli fayela likhulu kakhulu ukuba yingxenye ye-PartCraft.\" kwingxenye oyigcinile Isolidi elikhulu le-STEP elangenisiwa kwisakhiwo sangaphambilini lenze ifayela lengxenye libe ngaphezu kuka-50 MB. Sebenzisa ikhophi yangaphambilini engayo \"Leli fayela likhulu kakhulu ukuba yingxenye ye-PartCraft.\" Ifayela ngaphezu kuka-50 MB; alisona ifayela le-PartCraft \"Lolu akusona ifayela le-PartCraft (alikho ku-JSON).\" / \"Lolu akusona ifayela le-PartCraft.\" Ifayela lonakele noma eliyelohlelo lomunye \"Leli fayela ligcinwe yi-PartCraft entsha (inguqulo yefayela …); lapha ifunda inguqulo …\" Vula kwi-PartCraft entsha \"Extrude2: ukujula akulungile.\" (noma enye inani) Ifayela libhalwe ngesandla noma lonakele. Sebenzisa ikhophi yangaphambilini Ukungenisa ku-assembly kuthi \"Part1.partcraft.json akunayo isolidi yokungenisa.\" Ifayela lengxenye alinayo isolidi. Vula, yakha isolidi, gcina, bese ungenisa futhi Ifayela engiligcinile alikho lapho ngilindele. Ukulondoloza kuyidawunilodi: bheka efolda yokulanda yesiphequluli, noma vula uhlu lokulanda kwi-toolbar yesiphequluli. Bona Lapho amafayela akho ahamba khona. Ngivule ingxenye kodwa i-assembly isasesikrinini. Ingxenye ilayithe ngemva kwe-assembly. Khetha Vala ukuze uvale i-assembly ubone ingxenye. Vala ama-assembly ngaphambi kokuvula amafayela engxenye. Izinkinga zombumbo Umlayezo Ukulungisa \"Yakha isolidi kuqala, bese wenza umbumbo wayo.\" Yakha ingxenye kuqala \"Ishidi alinandawo ye-detail. Yenza i-detail ibe ncane, noma ukhiphe umbono.\" Detail radius noma Detail scale encane, noma susa isigaba \"I-detail ithathwa emibonweni ephambili, ephezulu, ngakwesokudla noma esigabeni.\" Chofoza kwelinye lala mabono \"Chofoza kwelinye lemibono.\" Ukuchofoza kube phezu kwephepha elingenalutho \"I-Position idinga okungenani ireferensi eyodwa ye-datum.\" nemilayezo yefreyimu eyinye Setha ama-datum iphaneli eyicela, noma khetha enye impawu \"Imibono yombumbo ayikwazanga ukwenziwa: …\" Hlehlisa ushintsho lokugcina. Uma kuqhubeka, gcina, layitha kabusha ikhasi bese uvula kabusha ingxenye Izinkinga ze-assembly Umlayezo Ukulungisa \"Yakha isolidi kuqala, bese uyifaka ku-assembly.\" Ingxenye ayinayo isolidi \"Ngenisa ingxenye yesibili kuqala (Engeza ikopi, Faka, noma Hlela › Phinda).\" Ixhumanisi idinga izingxenye ezimbili \"Khetha ubuso kwenye ingxenye.\" Ubuso bezixhumanisi zombili kumele bube ezinxenyeni ezihlukene \"Lobo buso bugoqekile. Khetha ubuso obuyisicaba …\" Izixhumanisi ziqala ebusweni obuyisicaba. Bese usebenzisa Gxila ku ngehhole noma i-axis yokuzungezisa \"I-Bracket2 ayihlanganiswanga nengxenye esekelwe emhlabeni, ngakho ihlala lapho yabekwa khona.\" Engeza ixhumanisi kuyo kuya engxenyeni ebekiwe \"I-Revolute3 ivala ilupu elingeke livale: ilahlekile ngo-2.000 mm. Hlola ubuso, ama-offset namakhawulo ezixhumanisi zelupu.\" Izingxenye azikwazi ukuhlangana zonke: hlola ubude, ubuso obusetshenziswa yixhumanisi ngayinye, ama-offset (izingxenye ezibekwe ubuso nobuso kumele zivumelane ngokujula) namakhawulo; noma susa ixhumanisi eyodwa yelupu \"Ubuso lo xhumanisi ulisebenzisayo sekunyamalele ku-Bracket.\" / \"I-axis lo xhumanisi ulisebenzisayo sekunyamalele ku-Bracket.\" Ingxenye ihleliwe. Susa ixhumanisi bese uyenza futhi \"I-axis ihamba ngaphezu kobuso, ngakho ayikwazi ukusetha isikhungo sexhumanisi.\" Khetha i-axis edlula ebusweni, noma \"Ubuso bomsuka wobuso\" \"I-assembly igcina okungenani ingxenye eyodwa. Yivale esikhundleni salokho.\" Sebenzisa Vala Izingxenye zihlanganisiwe kodwa endaweni engafanele. Setha Gxila ku kwomabili amahlangothi exhumanisi ukuze ube ngamahhole noma ama-axis okuzungezisa afanele ukuhlelwa, bese ulungisa Ikona (°) ne-Offset (mm). Kuyahamba kancane Setha Curves ku-Ngokujwayelekile noma Coarse uma wenza imodeli; shintsha ku-Fine ngaphambi kokuthumela. Izinani ezikhulu zepattern (amakhophi amakhulu) zithatha isikhathi ukwakha kabusha ngalo lonke ushintsho. Vimbela ipattern lapho usebenza ezinye izici. Ukuhlolwa kokuxhumana (Clash) nokuhlola ukunyakaza kuqhathanisa zonke izingxenye ezimbili; ama-assembly amakhulu athatha isikhathi eside. Vala amathebhu amakhulu amanye. I-PartCraft isebenza ngeprosesa nomdwebo wekhompyutha yakho. Usazama Gcina ifayela lakho kuqala (Ctrl+S), bese uvuselela ikhasi bese uvula futhi. Uma isici sisahluleka, sikhethe, funda umlayezo waso, bese uzama Ctrl+Z ubuyele esimeni esihle sokugcina.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"partcraft","title":"Okungakakhiwa okwamanje","summary":"Konke okungenziwa yile nguqulo ye-PartCraft okwamanje, kusukela ezindleleni ezigoqayo kuya ekubonisweni ngama-intshi, izilinganiso zokudweba nezinhlelo ezingaphansi, nokuthi yini okufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho namuhla.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["okungekho","akukakhiwa","imikhawulo","imikhawulo","uhlelo lwesikhathi esizayo","exact kernel","fillet","chamfer","shell","sweep","loft","ukungenisa kwe-step","ukulingisa","manufacture","ukugoqa kwesiphetho","i-face fillet","izibalo","amaintshi","izilinganiso zokudweba","izinhlelo ezingaphansi","cloud","ithebhulethi","ifoni","ukuhamba kumsindo"],"headings":[{"id":"kudinga-i-exact-kernel","text":"Kudinga i-exact kernel","level":2},{"id":"izici","text":"Izici","level":2},{"id":"amasketshi","text":"Amasketshi","level":2},{"id":"amapharamitha-namayunithi","text":"Amapharamitha namayunithi","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2},{"id":"izidwewe","text":"Izidwewe","level":2},{"id":"ama-assembly","text":"Ama-assembly","level":2},{"id":"ukukhiqiza","text":"Ukukhiqiza","level":2},{"id":"ukulingisa-nokuklama-okuzenzakalelayo","text":"Ukulingisa nokuklama okuzenzakalelayo","level":2},{"id":"ama-script","text":"Ama-script","level":2},{"id":"i-app","text":"I-app","level":2},{"id":"umakhi-izinkiyi-nezinkambu","text":"Umakhi (izinkiyi nezinkambu)","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-PartCraft ingunguqulo yokuqala. Leli khasi lidwebe okungenziwa yi-PartCraft yalolu hlobo, ukuze ungazifuni, nokuthi yini okufanele wenze namuhla. Akukho okunalo usuku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kudinga-i-exact-kernel\"\u003EKudinga i-exact kernel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELe nguqulo yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EI-mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E). Konke okulandelayo kudinga i-exact geometry kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo okwamanje. Izingxenye ezigcinwe nalezi zici ziyavulwa: izici zihlala emlandweni, zimakwe njengezingakakhiwa, futhi ziyagcinwa lapho ulondoloza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E emaphethelweni ajikeleziwe; ama-fillet anobubanzi oshintshayo ngomphetho; ama-round ahlanganiswa ngokuthambile lapho ehlangana khona (i-mesh kernel iwasika ngama-mitre)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kobuso obusicaba; gobisa amanye amakhona ngaphambi kokuqunta esketshini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E esketshini, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E ivula ubuso obugobile; izindonga zobukhulu obuhlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ubuso obusicaba; engeza izinto ngama-extrude lapho udonga kumele lube lukhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E ebusweni obugobile; ukuqunta kuya kubuso, kubuso obulandelayo noma kuvertex; ama-extrude athambile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQunta noma phendula, ngezinyathelo uma kudingeka; qunta ukujula okulinganiswe ngokwakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase flange\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge flange\u003C/span\u003E nezingqwembe ezisicaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQunta ipuleti noma iphrofayili yezimfucuza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo: ukuqeda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForm\u003C/span\u003E ngaphakathi engxenyeni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPatch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGordon surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtend surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim surface\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye eziningi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECombine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove body\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale body\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath pattern\u003C/span\u003E, izici ezenza isigaba esisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsolidi eyodwa; amaphethini nezici zokukopisha okuphindwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasketshi, amapuleni, ama-eksisi namaphoyinti ebusweni okuphela i-exact kernel ingawathola (ubuso olwenziwe yi-fillet, udonga lwembobo, ubuso besolidi elingeniswe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba ezipuleni eziyisisekelo, ezipuleni zesethulo nasebusweni obusicaba bama-extrude nokuphendula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphetho sedizayini esizuzwe njengengxenye noma sengezwa kuyo (siba yisolidi eyingenisiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELanda umphumela njenge-STL noma STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela ubuso obugobile besolidi le-STEP elivuliwe njengobuso oluqondile; i-exact STEP yobuso be-spline, obuphonswa nobuphendulwe kusuka kufayela le-STEP, izinhlangothi ze-spline, izinsimbi ezakhiwe; i-STEP yezinye izinhlelo zokwakha izingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E ifunda i-STEP njengezikhonjana futhi igcina ubuso obusicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, izingqimba nama-torus efayeleni ukuze ihlinzeke ngokuthunyelwa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EVula ifayela le-STEP\u003C/a\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala bonke ubuso be-analytic ngokunembile futhi igcina lezo njengama-facet (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EExport\u003C/a\u003E); i-macro yezinye izinhlelo zokwakha izingxenye isabhala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmawaka eqondile ku-drawing views\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzivivinyo nezivivinyo zesigaba zidwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmavolumu, izindawo namabanga ngokunembile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E inikeza izinombolo zesolidi ye-faceted, zincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo; isethingi ye-\u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E eshaya kakhulu iyazisondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanye amakhodi kwamathebula angezansi aphakamisa enye yalezi zici njengendlela yokuzungeza into ethile ngenye. Lezo zincomo zisebenza uma i-exact kernel ibuyile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izici\"\u003EIzici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-fillet obuso, ama-fillet agcwele ama-round, ama-fillet anobubanzi obusethwe emaphoyinteni ngomphetho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E enobubanzi obungashintshi noma obushintshayo ngokuqondile; izici eziningi ze-fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashell anezindonga zobukhulu obuhlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E eyodwa; engeza izinto ngama-extrude lapho udonga kumele lube lukhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E ebusweni obungaqondile (i-spline)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E isebenza ebusweni obusicaba, obungamasilinda nobungamakhoni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphendula okuphendukayo, ukuphendula kodonga olulincane nobuso; ukuqedela kwe-tangency ku-loft; i-loft enereyili eyodwa yesiqondisi; izindlela ze-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E enokuqondiswa okusetshenzisiwe noma isikali sokuphela; i-loft enereyili ezimbili noma ngaphezulu yesiqondisi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft ne-draft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimfucuza ezivela emadlumbeni noma ku-spline; izimfucuza ezikhula ziyisikwele kusketshi (kusukela embonweni owuphezulu); i-draft ezimfucuzeni; izimfucuza eziningi kusketshi owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERib\u003C/span\u003E kusuka kuchungechunge olulodwa lwemigqa endizeni yesimfucuza siqobo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rib\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rib\"\u003EIzimfucuza nama-gusset\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Kuze kufike&quot; ebusweni obugobile, &quot;kuze kufike kolandelayo&quot; kuma-face agobile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuze kufike ebusweni obusicaba noma endizeni yesethulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimbobo ezibhobozwe ngaphansi, imithambo yamaintshi nephayipi, imithambo ethambile, ukuphela kwemithambo namaqalo emithambo anamakhoni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-counterbore ngokujula okuncane; imithambo ye-ISO metric nethrapezoidal, ukuthi ibukeka kanjani noma ibhalwe: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EImithambo esikhundleni sokuzungeza nemibhobo, edwetshiwe noma eyakhiwe\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-extrude ajulile ngokwezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba izingxenye zombili zephrofayili\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukopisha amaphethini okudlulile ngesinyathelo ngasinye, amaphethini okugcwalisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa izici ezihlukene; amaphethini adlula ngevini: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath pattern\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukopisha amaphethini, amamirror, ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell namasolidi angeniswe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha isketshi noma isici abakhiwe kuso, noma yenza iphethini kuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-tangency ye-(G1) emaphoyinteni angajwayelekile e-form; ukuhlanganisa ama-patch e-form ezingxenyeni ezinkulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhakamisa i-Level ye-form: ama-patch angalinganiswa aba amancane; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/form-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/form-surfaces\"\u003EIzimo ezingenasici nge-Form\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-form eyakhiwe ngezingcezu eziningi ezivaliwe kusici esisodwa; izinkaxa phakathi kwama-form\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngcezu eyodwa evaliwe ngesici se-Form ngasinye; ihlanganise nge-Join\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha izinsizakalo zobuso embonweni (ngaphandle kwamaphoyinti okusika nokuhlanga); ama-fillet obuso; ukungasika; ama-patch e-G2; ama-Gordon ahlangene nobuso obugobile obuseduze (ahlanganiswa namaphuleti nobuso obusicaba kwakhiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZikhethe ngegama ephaneli yesici; yenza ubukhulu kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet kwisolidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwezinsizakalo ku-history; ukungabandakanyi izinsizakalo ezifihliwe ekuthunyelweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQamba kabusha futhi ufihle izinsizakalo ephaneli yezinsizakalo; susa noma ucindezele isici esakhe insizakalo ukuze uyishiye ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa okungafani okugcina amasilinda namakhoni e-analytic; ukulinganisa okungafani kobuso obucindezelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale body\u003C/span\u003E yenza ubuso obugobile bube yi-B-splines eduze (ngaphakathi kuka-0.0000004 mm); ukulinganisa okufanayo kuhlala kunembile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlanganisa izinsizakalo zobuso; izimfuno zeMinkowski\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E kuqala, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECombine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlaziywa kokubekezelela: izitaki ezigoqa amakhona (izilinganiso ze-vector ezimbili nezintathu), ukuzwela okubalwe kusuka ejiyometri, i-Monte Carlo nokusabalala kwamanye, ukubekezelela kobukhulu ezilinganisweni zesketshi, ukubekezelela okuyisiphuthuma kusuka ebunzimbeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack-up\u003C/span\u003E kwi-assembly: enye indlela, okubi kakhulu kanye ne-RSS, ukubekezelela okuthayipheke, okuvela kwi-general tolerance ye-title block noma kuhlaka lwe-GD&amp;T: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tolerance-stackup\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tolerance-stackup\"\u003EIzitaki zokubekezelela\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela: ukuhlukanisa ukusika nokungena; ukusika kwezindawo ezabelwanayo kanye kanye; izingxenye okufanele zigcinwe ndawonye; izinsalela zamaroll, nesitoko esabelwane phakathi kwamaphrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENest flat parts on sheets…\u003C/span\u003E ngesikhala, imiphetho, ukugoba nendlela yesiqhoqho: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\"\u003EHlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini\u003C/a\u003E; amapuleti asele ayagcinwa futhi asetshenziswa kuqala: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-offcuts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-offcuts\"\u003EGcina bese usebenzisa okusele\u003C/a\u003E; hlela ukusika kusofthiwe wakho wesikhando\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsimbi ebhethiwe: ukuhlanganisa imiphetho, ukugoba, ama-flange ahlanganisiwe nama-contour; ama-flange emiphetheni egobile noma ebusweni be-base flange egobile; izigoba ezidweba; ukuvalwa kwamakhona; izinsimbi zokwakha; ukuguqula isolidi ibe insimbi ebhethiwe; ibhedi ye-base flange egobile enokusika kuyo; amathebula okugoba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase flange\u003C/span\u003E (ipuleti noma iphrofayili egobile), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge flange\u003C/span\u003E emiphetheni eqondile yamapuleti nezindawo zokuphumula, nobuso obusicaba nge-K-factor: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sheet-metal\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sheet-metal\"\u003EInsimbi ebhethiwe\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlaziywa kwe-draft kuma-assembly; ukuthola umugqa wokuhlukanisa; ukuhlaziywa kobukhulu bodonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft analysis\u003C/span\u003E engxenyeni ku-Design: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/draft-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/draft-analysis\"\u003EHlola i-draft yokwakha nokufakwa\u003C/a\u003E; vula yonke ingxenye ye-assembly ukuze uyihlole\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amasketshi\"\u003EAmasketshi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-ellipse, ama-arc athintwayo, ama-conic, ama-spline anedigri ethile noma amandla (NURBS)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-spline (cubic), ama-arc namasilinda nobudlelwano bokuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti ku-spline (ubudlelwano), ubudlelwano be-curvature (G2)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka iphoyinti le-spline lapho kumele lidlule khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhophi e-offset ama-spline alandela ushintsho olulandelayo; ama-offset ezinkomba zama-spline abukhali\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda i-offset ngemva kwoshintsho; zungeza ikhona kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhophi amaphethini ahlala exhunywe emthonjeni; amaphethini ngevini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda iphethini ngemva koshintsho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuprojekta amaphethelo ajikelezayo akhululekile noma athambekile, ijiyometri eprojekthiwe elandela ingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProjekta amaphethelo ajikelezayo aqondile nalinganayo, bese ulinganisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezishayelwe (ezireferensi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda usayizi kusuka ephaneli noma kuqoqo le-part\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlanganiswa okuqondile (collinear)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParallel nekhala elingu-0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunamathela kolunye uhlelo (i-clipboard yesistimu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela ngaphandle i-DXF, STEP, STL noma 3MF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthayipha amaarc, izixhumanisi ezihlobene noma ze-polar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha imigqa namasirkili; dweba ama-arc nge-Arc tool\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha ijiyometri ngaphandle kwepointa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKudinga ukuchofoza noma ukuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapharamitha-namayunithi\"\u003EAmapharamitha namayunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkumiswa okushintsha izinto; ithebula lodizayini ye-CSV elivala izici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkumiswa kusetha amapharamitha futhi kuvula nokuvala izici: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EUkumiswa nethebula lodizayini\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft variants\u003C/code\u003E yakha ukumiswa okulondoloziwe ngegama, nezici ezivaliwe: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EYenza iphakethe lezinguquko kokumiswa kwakho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa kwezinombolo zezici zamanje ze-panel yazo (i-plane, sweep, draft nokufana nakho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibhale ku-script noma nge-\u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft set\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EAma-script nomugqa womyalo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ebonakala ngamaintshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi ubonisa ngamamilimitha; thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E ebhokisini lenombolo noma ku-expression bese kuba ngu-50.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela izici zesolidi ye-STEP eyengeniwe (ifika ingenayo umlando)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza noma sika izinto ngezici zakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkufunda imibala, amagama, isakhiwo se-assembly ne-PMI kusuka ku-STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela i-glTF, OBJ, IGES, Parasolid; i-DWG yengxenye ye-3D (kuphela i-variant pack ibhala i-DWG: ishidi lokudweba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL noma i-3MF kumesh; i-STEP kumasolidi; i-DXF kwe-2D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula i-IGES, i-DXF noma amafayela ezinye izinhlelo (amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E avulwa njengesisodwa somzimba: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-.3dm njengesolidi\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECela i-STEP, noma i-mesh evaliwe ye-STL, OBJ noma 3MF: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EVula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo se-assembly (ihlelo lamagama engxenye) kusitoko se-STEP esithunyelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-assembly STEP iyi-compound eyodwa yezinsizakalo ezibekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulondoloza kufolda oyikhethayo ngaphandle kokudawuniloda kwesiphequluli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula &quot;ask where to save&quot; kumasethingi okudawuniloda kwesiphequluli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izidwewe\"\u003EIzidwewe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezingaphezu kwezinkulu ezintathu zokuphelela (usayizi wemigodi, izindawo, ukubekezelela kobukhulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhawula i-PDF, noma ithumele i-DXF bese uyilinganisa ngohlelo lwe-2D CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkungaphezu kwesigaba esisodwa noma ingxenye eyodwa; amabhuku ahlanganisiwe, ama-angle abonakalayo nezinhlelo ezingeziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigaba esisodwa nengxenye eyodwa ngesidwe ngasinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo ngokukhululekile, izinkomba nemitapo ekhasini (ngaphandle kwamabhoku wesihloko nokuguqulwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInothi lokuqeda, noma umbhalo owengeziwe kwi-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuprojekta kwe-first-angle, izibonelo ezinyakazayo, amashidi ahlezi ebude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-third angle, ukwakheka okuzenzakalelayo, amashidi ahlezi A4–A0 nama-ANSI A–E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka isigaba ngokuphilayo: izindiza eziningi noma ibhokisi lesigaba ngesikhathi esisodwa, umugqa wangaphandle ozungeze isigaba, ukugcina isigaba efayeleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndiza eyodwa ngesikhathi kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection view\u003C/span\u003E; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/section-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/section-view\"\u003EBheka ngaphakathi ngokubuka isigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibono ye-assembly enezinye izibonelo, izilinganiso noma ama-balloon onganyakazisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibonelo se-isometric (noma sihlakazwe) esinama-balloon okuzenzakalelayo nohlu lwezingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukopisha nokunamathisela kwe-GD&amp;T nezimpawu zokuqeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka ngalunye nge-Datum, Frame noma Finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibhalo: amafayela e-STEP ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom another file…\u003C/span\u003E yesifanekiso, imodeli ethunyelwe ngqo kusuka ku-ModelCraft noma BimCraft, izithombe ngekhwalithi ye-path tracer, i-3D ehlanganyelwe ngaphakathi kwe-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula i-STEP ku-Design bese uqala umbhalo ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the open part\u003C/span\u003E; londoloza imodeli njenge-glTF (.glb); izithombe ze-PNG zombono we-3D; ifayela le-3D elihlanganyelwe: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EQala umbhalo ku-Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-assembly\"\u003EAma-assembly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmajoyinti egiya, rack, cam nesikulufo; ijoyinti lebhola elikhawulelwe kukhoni; amajoyinti ezindaweni ezigobile noma phakathi kwamaphoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-joint aqinile, ajikelezayo, ayisilayidi, asicaba, ama-cylindrical, aseyizinzwa, ebhola nesikhala se-pin kubuso obusicaba, ngamanani ngamanani anemikhawulo yawo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EYakha i-assembly\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinyathelo zokuhlakaza ezihambisa izingxenye nokuhudula izingxenye ama-joint ayibeka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinyathelo ezigoqayo zokuhlakaza; susa i-joint ukuze uhambise ingxenye ngesandla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-sub-assembly\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinga elilodwa lezingxenye kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagiya, ama-cam, ukuxhumana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhiqiza\"\u003EUkukhiqiza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlanza okuguquguqukayo nokuhlanza ngokuphakama kwe-3D; ukuqeda ngomugqa wokuphakama, ngepensela, ngoradial nangesipiral; amapasi ahambisanayo abhalwa njengama-arc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlanza nge-3D ngemigqa eqondile: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003EUkuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele\u003C/a\u003E; Ukuqedwa kwe-Parallel ne-Scallop: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EUkuqedwa nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E; ubuso be-2.5-eksisi, i-pocket, i-adaptive ye-2D, contour, drill nochamfer: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003EYenza izindlela zethuluzi ne-G-code\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusika i-swarf, izindlela zomugqa wokugeleza nokuhlanza kwama-eksisi amaningi, amakhodi esikhala sokusebenza esithambekile (G68.2), ukuhlolwa kokushayisana kwe-holder nomshini; ukulingiswa kokusika kwe-5-eksisi nokuzungezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthuluzi elithambekile kunoma yimuphi umsebenzi, ukuqedwa nge-5-eksisi ngebhola lesiphetho nokuqedwa okuzungezayo ngo-4th-axis: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\"\u003EUkusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubhoboza nemithambo yangaphakathi ekhalaleni, imiyalo ye-G71/G76, ama-arc ezindleleni zokuthenda, amathuluzi aphilayo, i-sub-spindle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthenda ngaphandle: ubuso, rough, finish, groove, part off, thread, drill ku-centre: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/turning\" data-topic=\"partcraft/turning\"\u003EUkuthenda emshinini wokuthenda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlola i-angle noma ikhona, isethi yethuluzi, ukukala usayizi ngokubekezelela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlola ubuso, uhlangothi, imbobo noma ingxenye ukuze usethe ukushintshwa komsebenzi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/probing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/probing\"\u003EIprobhu\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlolwa kokushayisana kwe-holder ne-shank\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaphela izexwayiso zobude be-flute bese uhlola kusimulator somlawuli wakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphila kwethuluzi nomjikelezo wezinhlelo ezincane ku-post; ukulayisha amafayela e-post angewakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBhala noma shintsha i-post ngefomethi yePartCraft: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EAma-post processor ongawahlela\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-G-code yamayunithi e-inch (G20)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamilimitha (G21) kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulingisa-nokuklama-okuzenzakalelayo\"\u003EUkulingisa nokuklama okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifundo ezingalingani: ukuvuma, ukuguquka okukhulu, ukuxhumana phakathi kwezingxenye, ukukhathala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmandla amile nemvelo ezinzile: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola ukucindezela nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E; gcina isilinganiso sokuphepha siphezulu kakhulu kuno-1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlehla kwe-buckling okungalingani (ukungafani, post-buckling, snap-through)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinombolo ezilinganayo zokuhlehla ngomkhawulo omkhulu: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EUkushisa, ukucindezela okushisayo nokuhlehla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya phakathi kwezindawo (view factors), ukumelana nokuxhumana, izinto ezithintwa yizinga lokushisa, ukunyakaza ekucindezelekeni okushisayo (amagagasi okushaqeka okushisayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya kubuso bozungezayo, ukucindezela okushisayo okuzinzile noma okuphansi phakathi nesikhathi, izakhiwo ezingashintshi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EUkushisa, ukucindezela okushisayo nokuhlehla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlukanisa okuzenzakalelayo kokushisa okudlulayo nezifundo ngomthwalo oshisayo; ukwenza i-mesh ibe yincane lapho iphutha lincane; inhloso yesisebenzi esilinganayo (ukucindezela okuphezulu esikhundleni esisodwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlukanisa ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E ezifundweni ezizinzile, ezihlehla, ezinamafreqansi emvelo nezinzile ezishisayo, ephutheni lonke lengxenye: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHlola ukucindezela nokuguquka\u003C/a\u003E; noma nciphisa usayizi wesakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimpoqo nezinhlaka ezinenkomba, imithwalo ekude, izikhathi, izinzipho, ukuphindisa okuqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmandla nengcindezi ezinhlangothini, ukudonsa; ubuso obuqinile nobungenayo ukungaphikisani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulingisa kwezinhlanganisela; izinto ezihlukana ngokuqondisa (izingqimba ezishicilelwe, ama-composite)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye eyodwa, impahla eyodwa yonke ilingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlobo zokukhiqizwa nemithetho yokukhiqiza (okwenza kube nzima, izindlela zokugaya) ekwakhiweni okuzenzakalelayo; izinto ezimbalwa esimweni esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsimo esiqinile kakhulu sevolumu; hlola umphumela ku-Simulation: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/generative-design\" data-topic=\"partcraft/generative-design\"\u003EKhulisa isimo ngemithwalo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmphumela njengesolidi esihlelekayo (esibushelelezi, esinemingcele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-STL, i-STEP enobuso oqondile noma ingxenye enomphumela njengesolidi esingeniswe esinobuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlelo zezinto ezingokwezinzwa zokwakha (i-electric machine): irotor ejikelezayo ku-stator, i-torque ngokuya ngekona, insimbi egcwele, izinsimbi ezilahlekelwa ngamandla ngaphezu kwesiqu sazo, imibuthano yamanzi nokulahlekelwa kwensimbi nethusi; izinkambu ze-magnetic ku-3D noma ku-mesh egoqayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-magnetostatics ye-2-D enomugqa ku-grid ye-analysis library: izinto zokuhlanganiswa, insimbi, izinsimbi zokuhlala ezindaweni zazo, imikhawulo, i-inductance nokuhudulwa: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EIzinkambu ze-magnetic ku-2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-script\"\u003EAma-script\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsizo lokuhamba phezu kwebhokisi, amaphoyinti okumisa nokuhamba ku-script editor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthola, ukugoqa nokuqedela kuyakhona (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EBhala futhi uqalise ama-script\u003C/a\u003E); kwezinye, umhleli wakho: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Script zithutha ama-script ngaphakathi nangaphandle; imisebenzi yangaphakathi ihlolwe ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003EUlimi lwe-CraftScript\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti okumisa nokuhamba ku-script\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edisp\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Efprintf\u003C/code\u003E ngendlela; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqalisa imigqa ethile ekhethiwe ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkambu namapulani ama-script abonisa adwetshwe kwi-Design workspace; ama-script aguqula amapharamitha engxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbonakala kwi-Script workspace; ama-script afunda amapharamitha ngo-\u003Ccode\u003Eparam\u003C/code\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EBhala futhi uqalise ama-script\u003C/a\u003E), abashintshe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParameters\u003C/span\u003E tab\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithombe nemithebula ecaleni kwamapulani; ukuhlela ipulani (ukusondeza, imikhawulo yomugqa) ngaphambi kokulondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEcaleni kukhombisa amapulani; londoloza ipulani njenge-PNG, SVG noma CSV bese uyiqeda kwenye indawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-numpy nezinye izinkomba zephayitoni; i-Python ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; ukufaka i-Python kumhleli; i-Pascal Script\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlabrari ejwayelekile ye-Python, CraftScript neLua: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EAma-script ku-Python\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudlulisa imisebenzi ye-Lua kumisebenzi yangaphakathi; ukubiza umsebenzi welabhulari kusuka ku-Lua ngegama elakhelwe ngesikhathi i-script isebenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBhala igama lomsebenzi welabhulari ku-script (\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(…)\u003C/code\u003E), noma uwubize ku-script ye-CraftScript\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-app\"\u003EI-app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugcina efwini, ukwabelana nomlando wenguqulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela kukhompyutha yakho futhi ugcine izinguqulo ngamagama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-PartCraft njenge-app efakiwe ku-iPad nasku-iPhone\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa i-PartCraft kusiphequluli sedivayisi; ku-Android nakwi-desktop iphinde isebenze ku-CadCraft Studio (getcadcraft.com/download)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImenyu yokudweba (right-click)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yamathuluzi nephaneli yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusebenza ngokuphelele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ekuqaleni okusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela uma i-app ilondolozwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiza into oyiphuthelwe kakhulu ngekhasi lokusekela lesayithi: liyakwakha ukuthi kuzolandela yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umakhi-izinkiyi-nezinkambu\"\u003EUmakhi (izinkiyi nezinkambu)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhloko, amaport nokufakwa kumsebenzi oshisayo wangaphambili; amagrafu ezinga lokushisa lezinto zamandla; ukulahlekelwa kwethi emanifoldini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbakhi bakha okuyisisekelo nama-tube; engeza ukufakwa ku-Design; sebenzisa izinombolo zezinto zokushisa kwegumbi ngohlelo lokuphepha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkungeza abakhi ku-add-on directory ngokucindezela kanye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E ku-Engineer workspace ingeza umakhi kusuka ku-fayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lenkambu eliphezulu kunosayizi wevokhseli womakhi; ukufunda amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza inkambu ephezulu kusuka ku-script; i-\u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E iyabhalwa, ayifundwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibalo zekhodi yesitsha sokucindezela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibalo zethekisthi ezilula zomdonga nezinjongo ezijulile zomdonga, nengxenye yokuphepha oyikhethayo; hhayi umkhawulo wekhodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbakhi ezinye izinhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-PartCraft kuphela kule nguqulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"I-PartCraft ingunguqulo yokuqala. Leli khasi lidwebe okungenziwa yi-PartCraft yalolu hlobo, ukuze ungazifuni, nokuthi yini okufanele wenze namuhla. Akukho okunalo usuku. Kudinga i-exact kernel Le nguqulo yakha zonke izingxenye nge-mesh kernel (bona I-mesh kernel). Konke okulandelayo kudinga i-exact geometry kernel, engekho kulolu hlobo okwamanje. Izingxenye ezigcinwe nalezi zici ziyavulwa: izici zihlala emlandweni, zimakwe njengezingakakhiwa, futhi ziyagcinwa lapho ulondoloza. Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Fillet ne-Chamfer emaphethelweni ajikeleziwe; ama-fillet anobubanzi oshintshayo ngomphetho; ama-round ahlanganiswa ngokuthambile lapho ehlangana khona (i-mesh kernel iwasika ngama-mitre) I-Fillet ne-Chamfer zisebenza emaphethelweni aqondile phakathi kobuso obusicaba; gobisa amanye amakhona ngaphambi kokuqunta esketshini (Fillet esketshini, F) Shell ivula ubuso obugobile; izindonga zobukhulu obuhlukile Vula ubuso obusicaba; engeza izinto ngama-extrude lapho udonga kumele lube lukhulu Sweep, Loft, Draft ebusweni obugobile; ukuqunta kuya kubuso, kubuso obulandelayo noma kuvertex; ama-extrude athambile Qunta noma phendula, ngezinyathelo uma kudingeka; qunta ukujula okulinganiswe ngokwakho Rib, Base flange, Edge flange nezingqwembe ezisicaba Qunta ipuleti noma iphrofayili yezimfucuza Izindawo: ukuqeda Form ngaphakathi engxenyeni, Patch, Loft surface, Gordon surface, Stitch, Thicken, Offset surface, Extend surface, Trim surface Akutholakali Izingxenye eziningi: Combine, Move body, Scale body, Path pattern, izici ezenza isigaba esisha Isolidi eyodwa; amaphethini nezici zokukopisha okuphindwe Amasketshi, amapuleni, ama-eksisi namaphoyinti ebusweni okuphela i-exact kernel ingawathola (ubuso olwenziwe yi-fillet, udonga lwembobo, ubuso besolidi elingeniswe) Dweba ezipuleni eziyisisekelo, ezipuleni zesethulo nasebusweni obusicaba bama-extrude nokuphendula Isiphetho sedizayini esizuzwe njengengxenye noma sengezwa kuyo (siba yisolidi eyingenisiwe) Landa umphumela njenge-STL noma STEP Ukuhlela ubuso obugobile besolidi le-STEP elivuliwe njengobuso oluqondile; i-exact STEP yobuso be-spline, obuphonswa nobuphendulwe kusuka kufayela le-STEP, izinhlangothi ze-spline, izinsimbi ezakhiwe; i-STEP yezinye izinhlelo zokwakha izingxenye Open ifunda i-STEP njengezikhonjana futhi igcina ubuso obusicaba, amasilinda, amakhoni, izingqimba nama-torus efayeleni ukuze ihlinzeke ngokuthunyelwa (Vula ifayela le-STEP); Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) ibhala bonke ubuso be-analytic ngokunembile futhi igcina lezo njengama-facet (Export); i-macro yezinye izinhlelo zokwakha izingxenye isabhala Amawaka eqondile ku-drawing views Izivivinyo nezivivinyo zesigaba zidwetshwe kusuka kuma-facet Amavolumu, izindawo namabanga ngokunembile Measure inikeza izinombolo zesolidi ye-faceted, zincane kancane ezingxenyeni ezijikelezayo; isethingi ye-Curves eshaya kakhulu iyazisondeza Amanye amakhodi kwamathebula angezansi aphakamisa enye yalezi zici njengendlela yokuzungeza into ethile ngenye. Lezo zincomo zisebenza uma i-exact kernel ibuyile. Izici Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ama-fillet obuso, ama-fillet agcwele ama-round, ama-fillet anobubanzi obusethwe emaphoyinteni ngomphetho I-Fillet enobubanzi obungashintshi noma obushintshayo ngokuqondile; izici eziningi ze-fillet Amashell anezindonga zobukhulu obuhlukile I-Shell eyodwa; engeza izinto ngama-extrude lapho udonga kumele lube lukhulu I-Draft ebusweni obungaqondile (i-spline) I-Draft isebenza ebusweni obusicaba, obungamasilinda nobungamakhoni Ukuphendula okuphendukayo, ukuphendula kodonga olulincane nobuso; ukuqedela kwe-tangency ku-loft; i-loft enereyili eyodwa yesiqondisi; izindlela ze-spline Sweep enokuqondiswa okusetshenzisiwe noma isikali sokuphela; i-loft enereyili ezimbili noma ngaphezulu yesiqondisi: bona Sweep, loft ne-draft Izimfucuza ezivela emadlumbeni noma ku-spline; izimfucuza ezikhula ziyisikwele kusketshi (kusukela embonweni owuphezulu); i-draft ezimfucuzeni; izimfucuza eziningi kusketshi owodwa Rib kusuka kuchungechunge olulodwa lwemigqa endizeni yesimfucuza siqobo: bona Izimfucuza nama-gusset \"Kuze kufike\" ebusweni obugobile, \"kuze kufike kolandelayo\" kuma-face agobile Kuze kufike ebusweni obusicaba noma endizeni yesethulo Izimbobo ezibhobozwe ngaphansi, imithambo yamaintshi nephayipi, imithambo ethambile, ukuphela kwemithambo namaqalo emithambo anamakhoni I-counterbore ngokujula okuncane; imithambo ye-ISO metric nethrapezoidal, ukuthi ibukeka kanjani noma ibhalwe: bona Imithambo esikhundleni sokuzungeza nemibhobo, edwetshiwe noma eyakhiwe Ama-extrude ajulile ngokwezici Dweba izingxenye zombili zephrofayili Ukukopisha amaphethini okudlulile ngesinyathelo ngasinye, amaphethini okugcwalisa Sebenzisa izici ezihlukene; amaphethini adlula ngevini: Path pattern Ukukopisha amaphethini, amamirror, ama-fillet, ama-chamfer, ama-shell namasolidi angeniswe Kopisha isketshi noma isici abakhiwe kuso, noma yenza iphethini kuso I-tangency ye-(G1) emaphoyinteni angajwayelekile e-form; ukuhlanganisa ama-patch e-form ezingxenyeni ezinkulu Phakamisa i-Level ye-form: ama-patch angalinganiswa aba amancane; bona Izimo ezingenasici nge-Form I-form eyakhiwe ngezingcezu eziningi ezivaliwe kusici esisodwa; izinkaxa phakathi kwama-form Ingcezu eyodwa evaliwe ngesici se-Form ngasinye; ihlanganise nge-Join Ukukhetha izinsizakalo zobuso embonweni (ngaphandle kwamaphoyinti okusika nokuhlanga); ama-fillet obuso; ukungasika; ama-patch e-G2; ama-Gordon ahlangene nobuso obugobile obuseduze (ahlanganiswa namaphuleti nobuso obusicaba kwakhiwe) Zikhethe ngegama ephaneli yesici; yenza ubukhulu kuqala, bese wenza i-fillet kwisolidi Uhlu lwezinsizakalo ku-history; ukungabandakanyi izinsizakalo ezifihliwe ekuthunyelweni Qamba kabusha futhi ufihle izinsizakalo ephaneli yezinsizakalo; susa noma ucindezele isici esakhe insizakalo ukuze uyishiye ngaphandle Ukulinganisa okungafani okugcina amasilinda namakhoni e-analytic; ukulinganisa okungafani kobuso obucindezelwe Scale body yenza ubuso obugobile bube yi-B-splines eduze (ngaphakathi kuka-0.0000004 mm); ukulinganisa okufanayo kuhlala kunembile Ukuhlanganisa izinsizakalo zobuso; izimfuno zeMinkowski Stitch noma Thicken kuqala, bese Combine Ukuhlaziywa kokubekezelela: izitaki ezigoqa amakhona (izilinganiso ze-vector ezimbili nezintathu), ukuzwela okubalwe kusuka ejiyometri, i-Monte Carlo nokusabalala kwamanye, ukubekezelela kobukhulu ezilinganisweni zesketshi, ukubekezelela okuyisiphuthuma kusuka ebunzimbeni Stack-up kwi-assembly: enye indlela, okubi kakhulu kanye ne-RSS, ukubekezelela okuthayipheke, okuvela kwi-general tolerance ye-title block noma kuhlaka lwe-GD&T: bona Izitaki zokubekezelela Ukuhlela: ukuhlukanisa ukusika nokungena; ukusika kwezindawo ezabelwanayo kanye kanye; izingxenye okufanele zigcinwe ndawonye; izinsalela zamaroll, nesitoko esabelwane phakathi kwamaphrojekthi Nest flat parts on sheets… ngesikhala, imiphetho, ukugoba nendlela yesiqhoqho: bona Hlela izingxenye ezibhethiwe ezishidini; amapuleti asele ayagcinwa futhi asetshenziswa kuqala: bona Gcina bese usebenzisa okusele; hlela ukusika kusofthiwe wakho wesikhando Insimbi ebhethiwe: ukuhlanganisa imiphetho, ukugoba, ama-flange ahlanganisiwe nama-contour; ama-flange emiphetheni egobile noma ebusweni be-base flange egobile; izigoba ezidweba; ukuvalwa kwamakhona; izinsimbi zokwakha; ukuguqula isolidi ibe insimbi ebhethiwe; ibhedi ye-base flange egobile enokusika kuyo; amathebula okugoba Base flange (ipuleti noma iphrofayili egobile), Edge flange emiphetheni eqondile yamapuleti nezindawo zokuphumula, nobuso obusicaba nge-K-factor: bona Insimbi ebhethiwe Ukuhlaziywa kwe-draft kuma-assembly; ukuthola umugqa wokuhlukanisa; ukuhlaziywa kobukhulu bodonga Draft analysis engxenyeni ku-Design: bona Hlola i-draft yokwakha nokufakwa; vula yonke ingxenye ye-assembly ukuze uyihlole Amasketshi Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ama-ellipse, ama-arc athintwayo, ama-conic, ama-spline anedigri ethile noma amandla (NURBS) Ama-spline (cubic), ama-arc namasilinda nobudlelwano bokuthinta Iphoyinti ku-spline (ubudlelwano), ubudlelwano be-curvature (G2) Beka iphoyinti le-spline lapho kumele lidlule khona Amakhophi e-offset ama-spline alandela ushintsho olulandelayo; ama-offset ezinkomba zama-spline abukhali Phinda i-offset ngemva kwoshintsho; zungeza ikhona kuqala Amakhophi amaphethini ahlala exhunywe emthonjeni; amaphethini ngevini Phinda iphethini ngemva koshintsho Ukuprojekta amaphethelo ajikelezayo akhululekile noma athambekile, ijiyometri eprojekthiwe elandela ingxenye Projekta amaphethelo ajikelezayo aqondile nalinganayo, bese ulinganisa Izilinganiso ezishayelwe (ezireferensi) Funda usayizi kusuka ephaneli noma kuqoqo le-part Ukuhlanganiswa okuqondile (collinear) Parallel nekhala elingu-0 Ukunamathela kolunye uhlelo (i-clipboard yesistimu) Thumela ngaphandle i-DXF, STEP, STL noma 3MF Ukuthayipha amaarc, izixhumanisi ezihlobene noma ze-polar Thayipha imigqa namasirkili; dweba ama-arc nge-Arc tool Ukukhetha ijiyometri ngaphandle kwepointa Kudinga ukuchofoza noma ukuthinta Amapharamitha namayunithi Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukumiswa okushintsha izinto; ithebula lodizayini ye-CSV elivala izici Ukumiswa kusetha amapharamitha futhi kuvula nokuvala izici: bona Ukumiswa nethebula lodizayini; partcraft variants yakha ukumiswa okulondoloziwe ngegama, nezici ezivaliwe: bona Yenza iphakethe lezinguquko kokumiswa kwakho Ukulinganisa kwezinombolo zezici zamanje ze-panel yazo (i-plane, sweep, draft nokufana nakho) Zibhale ku-script noma nge-partcraft set (Ama-script nomugqa womyalo) Ingxenye ebonakala ngamaintshi Usayizi ubonisa ngamamilimitha; thayipha 2in ebhokisini lenombolo noma ku-expression bese kuba ngu-50.8 Amafayela Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukuhlela izici zesolidi ye-STEP eyengeniwe (ifika ingenayo umlando) Engeza noma sika izinto ngezici zakho Ukufunda imibala, amagama, isakhiwo se-assembly ne-PMI kusuka ku-STEP Akutholakali Ukuthumela i-glTF, OBJ, IGES, Parasolid; i-DWG yengxenye ye-3D (kuphela i-variant pack ibhala i-DWG: ishidi lokudweba) I-STL noma i-3MF kumesh; i-STEP kumasolidi; i-DXF kwe-2D Ukuvula i-IGES, i-DXF noma amafayela ezinye izinhlelo (amafayela .3dm avulwa njengesisodwa somzimba: Vula imodeli ye-.3dm njengesolidi) Cela i-STEP, noma i-mesh evaliwe ye-STL, OBJ noma 3MF: Vula i-STL, OBJ noma i-3MF Isakhiwo se-assembly (ihlelo lamagama engxenye) kusitoko se-STEP esithunyelwe I-assembly STEP iyi-compound eyodwa yezinsizakalo ezibekiwe Ukulondoloza kufolda oyikhethayo ngaphandle kokudawuniloda kwesiphequluli Vula \"ask where to save\" kumasethingi okudawuniloda kwesiphequluli Izidwewe Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Izilinganiso ezingaphezu kwezinkulu ezintathu zokuphelela (usayizi wemigodi, izindawo, ukubekezelela kobukhulu) Phawula i-PDF, noma ithumele i-DXF bese uyilinganisa ngohlelo lwe-2D CAD Okungaphezu kwesigaba esisodwa noma ingxenye eyodwa; amabhuku ahlanganisiwe, ama-angle abonakalayo nezinhlelo ezingeziwe Isigaba esisodwa nengxenye eyodwa ngesidwe ngasinye Umbhalo ngokukhululekile, izinkomba nemitapo ekhasini (ngaphandle kwamabhoku wesihloko nokuguqulwa) Inothi lokuqeda, noma umbhalo owengeziwe kwi-PDF Ukuprojekta kwe-first-angle, izibonelo ezinyakazayo, amashidi ahlezi ebude I-third angle, ukwakheka okuzenzakalelayo, amashidi ahlezi A4–A0 nama-ANSI A–E Ukubuka isigaba ngokuphilayo: izindiza eziningi noma ibhokisi lesigaba ngesikhathi esisodwa, umugqa wangaphandle ozungeze isigaba, ukugcina isigaba efayeleni Indiza eyodwa ngesikhathi kusuka ku-Views › Section view; bona Bheka ngaphakathi ngokubuka isigaba Imibono ye-assembly enezinye izibonelo, izilinganiso noma ama-balloon onganyakazisa Isibonelo se-isometric (noma sihlakazwe) esinama-balloon okuzenzakalelayo nohlu lwezingxenye Ukukopisha nokunamathisela kwe-GD&T nezimpawu zokuqeda Beka ngalunye nge-Datum, Frame noma Finish Imibhalo: amafayela e-STEP ku-From another file… yesifanekiso, imodeli ethunyelwe ngqo kusuka ku-ModelCraft noma BimCraft, izithombe ngekhwalithi ye-path tracer, i-3D ehlanganyelwe ngaphakathi kwe-PDF Vula i-STEP ku-Design bese uqala umbhalo ngo-From the open part; londoloza imodeli njenge-glTF (.glb); izithombe ze-PNG zombono we-3D; ifayela le-3D elihlanganyelwe: bona Qala umbhalo ku-Illustrate Ama-assembly Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Amajoyinti egiya, rack, cam nesikulufo; ijoyinti lebhola elikhawulelwe kukhoni; amajoyinti ezindaweni ezigobile noma phakathi kwamaphoyinti Ama-joint aqinile, ajikelezayo, ayisilayidi, asicaba, ama-cylindrical, aseyizinzwa, ebhola nesikhala se-pin kubuso obusicaba, ngamanani ngamanani anemikhawulo yawo: bona Yakha i-assembly Izinyathelo zokuhlakaza ezihambisa izingxenye nokuhudula izingxenye ama-joint ayibeka Izinyathelo ezigoqayo zokuhlakaza; susa i-joint ukuze uhambise ingxenye ngesandla Ama-sub-assembly Izinga elilodwa lezingxenye kuphela Amagiya, ama-cam, ukuxhumana Akutholakali Ukukhiqiza Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukuhlanza okuguquguqukayo nokuhlanza ngokuphakama kwe-3D; ukuqeda ngomugqa wokuphakama, ngepensela, ngoradial nangesipiral; amapasi ahambisanayo abhalwa njengama-arc Ukuhlanza nge-3D ngemigqa eqondile: bona Ukuhlanzwa nge-3D nokusala okusele; Ukuqedwa kwe-Parallel ne-Scallop: bona Ukuqedwa nge-3D; ubuso be-2.5-eksisi, i-pocket, i-adaptive ye-2D, contour, drill nochamfer: bona Yenza izindlela zethuluzi ne-G-code Ukusika i-swarf, izindlela zomugqa wokugeleza nokuhlanza kwama-eksisi amaningi, amakhodi esikhala sokusebenza esithambekile (G68.2), ukuhlolwa kokushayisana kwe-holder nomshini; ukulingiswa kokusika kwe-5-eksisi nokuzungezayo Ithuluzi elithambekile kunoma yimuphi umsebenzi, ukuqedwa nge-5-eksisi ngebhola lesiphetho nokuqedwa okuzungezayo ngo-4th-axis: bona Ukusebenza nama-eksisi ama-4 nama-5 Ukubhoboza nemithambo yangaphakathi ekhalaleni, imiyalo ye-G71/G76, ama-arc ezindleleni zokuthenda, amathuluzi aphilayo, i-sub-spindle Ukuthenda ngaphandle: ubuso, rough, finish, groove, part off, thread, drill ku-centre: bona Ukuthenda emshinini wokuthenda Ukuhlola i-angle noma ikhona, isethi yethuluzi, ukukala usayizi ngokubekezelela Ukuhlola ubuso, uhlangothi, imbobo noma ingxenye ukuze usethe ukushintshwa komsebenzi: bona Iprobhu Ukuhlolwa kokushayisana kwe-holder ne-shank Qaphela izexwayiso zobude be-flute bese uhlola kusimulator somlawuli wakho Ukuphila kwethuluzi nomjikelezo wezinhlelo ezincane ku-post; ukulayisha amafayela e-post angewakho Bhala noma shintsha i-post ngefomethi yePartCraft: bona Ama-post processor ongawahlela I-G-code yamayunithi e-inch (G20) Amamilimitha (G21) kuphela Ukulingisa nokuklama okuzenzakalelayo Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Izifundo ezingalingani: ukuvuma, ukuguquka okukhulu, ukuxhumana phakathi kwezingxenye, ukukhathala Amandla amile nemvelo ezinzile: bona Hlola ukucindezela nokuguquka; gcina isilinganiso sokuphepha siphezulu kakhulu kuno-1 Ukuhlehla kwe-buckling okungalingani (ukungafani, post-buckling, snap-through) Izinombolo ezilinganayo zokuhlehla ngomkhawulo omkhulu: bona Ukushisa, ukucindezela okushisayo nokuhlehla Ukukhanya phakathi kwezindawo (view factors), ukumelana nokuxhumana, izinto ezithintwa yizinga lokushisa, ukunyakaza ekucindezelekeni okushisayo (amagagasi okushaqeka okushisayo) Ukukhanya kubuso bozungezayo, ukucindezela okushisayo okuzinzile noma okuphansi phakathi nesikhathi, izakhiwo ezingashintshi: bona Ukushisa, ukucindezela okushisayo nokuhlehla Ukuhlukanisa okuzenzakalelayo kokushisa okudlulayo nezifundo ngomthwalo oshisayo; ukwenza i-mesh ibe yincane lapho iphutha lincane; inhloso yesisebenzi esilinganayo (ukucindezela okuphezulu esikhundleni esisodwa) Hlukanisa ngokuzenzakalela ezifundweni ezizinzile, ezihlehla, ezinamafreqansi emvelo nezinzile ezishisayo, ephutheni lonke lengxenye: bona Hlola ukucindezela nokuguquka; noma nciphisa usayizi wesakhi Izimpoqo nezinhlaka ezinenkomba, imithwalo ekude, izikhathi, izinzipho, ukuphindisa okuqondile Amandla nengcindezi ezinhlangothini, ukudonsa; ubuso obuqinile nobungenayo ukungaphikisani Ukulingisa kwezinhlanganisela; izinto ezihlukana ngokuqondisa (izingqimba ezishicilelwe, ama-composite) Ingxenye eyodwa, impahla eyodwa yonke ilingana Izinhlobo zokukhiqizwa nemithetho yokukhiqiza (okwenza kube nzima, izindlela zokugaya) ekwakhiweni okuzenzakalelayo; izinto ezimbalwa esimweni esisodwa Isimo esiqinile kakhulu sevolumu; hlola umphumela ku-Simulation: bona Khulisa isimo ngemithwalo Umphumela njengesolidi esihlelekayo (esibushelelezi, esinemingcele) I-STL, i-STEP enobuso oqondile noma ingxenye enomphumela njengesolidi esingeniswe esinobuso Izinhlelo zezinto ezingokwezinzwa zokwakha (i-electric machine): irotor ejikelezayo ku-stator, i-torque ngokuya ngekona, insimbi egcwele, izinsimbi ezilahlekelwa ngamandla ngaphezu kwesiqu sazo, imibuthano yamanzi nokulahlekelwa kwensimbi nethusi; izinkambu ze-magnetic ku-3D noma ku-mesh egoqayo I-magnetostatics ye-2-D enomugqa ku-grid ye-analysis library: izinto zokuhlanganiswa, insimbi, izinsimbi zokuhlala ezindaweni zazo, imikhawulo, i-inductance nokuhudulwa: bona Izinkambu ze-magnetic ku-2-D Ama-script Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Usizo lokuhamba phezu kwebhokisi, amaphoyinti okumisa nokuhamba ku-script editor Ukuthola, ukugoqa nokuqedela kuyakhona (bona Bhala futhi uqalise ama-script); kwezinye, umhleli wakho: Save no Open eqenjini le-Script zithutha ama-script ngaphakathi nangaphandle; imisebenzi yangaphakathi ihlolwe ku-Ulimi lwe-CraftScript Amaphoyinti okumisa nokuhamba ku-script disp no fprintf ngendlela; Ctrl+Enter iqalisa imigqa ethile ekhethiwe ngesikhathi esisodwa Izinkambu namapulani ama-script abonisa adwetshwe kwi-Design workspace; ama-script aguqula amapharamitha engxenye Abonakala kwi-Script workspace; ama-script afunda amapharamitha ngo-param (bona Bhala futhi uqalise ama-script), abashintshe ku-Parameters tab Izithombe nemithebula ecaleni kwamapulani; ukuhlela ipulani (ukusondeza, imikhawulo yomugqa) ngaphambi kokulondoloza Ecaleni kukhombisa amapulani; londoloza ipulani njenge-PNG, SVG noma CSV bese uyiqeda kwenye indawo I-numpy nezinye izinkomba zephayitoni; i-Python ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; ukufaka i-Python kumhleli; i-Pascal Script Ilabrari ejwayelekile ye-Python, CraftScript neLua: bona Ama-script ku-Python Ukudlulisa imisebenzi ye-Lua kumisebenzi yangaphakathi; ukubiza umsebenzi welabhulari kusuka ku-Lua ngegama elakhelwe ngesikhathi i-script isebenza Bhala igama lomsebenzi welabhulari ku-script (cs.static_tet(…)), noma uwubize ku-script ye-CraftScript I-app Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukugcina efwini, ukwabelana nomlando wenguqulo Akutholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela kukhompyutha yakho futhi ugcine izinguqulo ngamagama I-PartCraft njenge-app efakiwe ku-iPad nasku-iPhone Sebenzisa i-PartCraft kusiphequluli sedivayisi; ku-Android nakwi-desktop iphinde isebenze ku-CadCraft Studio (getcadcraft.com/download) Imenyu yokudweba (right-click) Ibha yamathuluzi nephaneli yesokudla Ukusebenza ngokuphelele ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ekuqaleni okusha Kuphela uma i-app ilondolozwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi: bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Biza into oyiphuthelwe kakhulu ngekhasi lokusekela lesayithi: liyakwakha ukuthi kuzolandela yini. Umakhi (izinkiyi nezinkambu) Akukakhiwa okwamanje Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Izinhloko, amaport nokufakwa kumsebenzi oshisayo wangaphambili; amagrafu ezinga lokushisa lezinto zamandla; ukulahlekelwa kwethi emanifoldini Abakhi bakha okuyisisekelo nama-tube; engeza ukufakwa ku-Design; sebenzisa izinombolo zezinto zokushisa kwegumbi ngohlelo lokuphepha Ukungeza abakhi ku-add-on directory ngokucindezela kanye Open ku-Engineer workspace ingeza umakhi kusuka ku-fayela Ifayela lenkambu eliphezulu kunosayizi wevokhseli womakhi; ukufunda amafayela .vdb Londoloza inkambu ephezulu kusuka ku-script; i-.vdb iyabhalwa, ayifundwa Izibalo zekhodi yesitsha sokucindezela Izibalo zethekisthi ezilula zomdonga nezinjongo ezijulile zomdonga, nengxenye yokuphepha oyikhethayo; hhayi umkhawulo wekhodi Abakhi ezinye izinhlelo I-PartCraft kuphela kule nguqulo","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenzisa lolu sizo","summary":"Vula usizo, lusesha, bese ubona izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["usizo","f1","sesha","amathuto","incwadi"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-usizo","text":"Vula usizo","level":2},{"id":"thola-isihloko","text":"Thola isihloko","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho","text":"Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi","text":"Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-usizo\"\u003EVula usizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nokhiye \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EOkhiye ku-Mac\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-isihloko\"\u003EThola isihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela lapho wawukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EIzinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo &quot;Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi\"\u003ELolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo. Vula usizo Cindezela F1, noma khetha Usizo ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo. Cindezela Esc noma khetha Vala ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo. Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela F1 kanye nokhiye fn (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho Usizo. Bona Okhiye ku-Mac. Thola isihloko Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele. Izihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga. Izixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. Back ibuyisela lapho wawukhona. Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho Ezinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo \"Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi\". Khetha Shintsha kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini. Khetha Bonisa konke ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo. Izinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: Ctrl+S ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux. Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi Iwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, Vula kuwebhusayithi ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Izisebenzi nekhompyutha","summary":"Izisebenzi izinhlelo ezisebenza kuzo, okwehlukile phakathi kwazo, nokuthi ikhompyutha yakho idinga ini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","isiphequluli","mac","windows","linux","ipad","ithebulethi","webgl","izidingo","inkumbulo"],"headings":[{"id":"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa","text":"Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi","text":"Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-ne-linux","text":"Mac, Windows ne-Linux","level":2},{"id":"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu","text":"Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho","text":"Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa\"\u003EIsiphequluli esingasetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiphequluli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi\"\u003EOkwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha &quot;File download location&quot; ibe &quot;Ask for each download&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-ne-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows ne-Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EAmathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu\"\u003EIsiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu \u003Cem\u003Eeqala\u003C/em\u003E, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EOkudingwa ikhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIchip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona Lapho amafayela akho aya khona). Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa Sebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi: Isiphequluli Injini Amanothi Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Eyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela. Firefox Gecko Iyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese. Safari WebKit Iyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa. Zombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho. Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi Ukuvula ifolda. Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu. Ukulondoloza. Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini. Ku-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha \"Always ask you where to save files\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha \"File download location\" ibe \"Ask for each download\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Mac, Windows ne-Linux Izinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta Ezinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo. Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu Sizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi. Inguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) I-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho. Lena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu eqala, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici. Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho Lezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe: I-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe). Ichip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho. Isikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela. Amafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad","summary":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo, okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac, ukuchofoza ngesokudla nokuhambisa ngaphandle kwe-mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","inqamulelo","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","okhiye bomsebenzi","trackpad","chofoza ngesokudla","inkinobho ephakathi","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac","text":"Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac","level":2},{"id":"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo","text":"Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad","text":"Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo","text":"Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkubhalwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Mac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Windows ne-Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInkinobho ye-Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. &quot;Bese&quot; kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac\"\u003EOkhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebamba \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evula \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uvula &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo\"\u003EIzinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Mac kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad\"\u003EIzinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula &quot;Secondary click&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo\"\u003EUkubhala ebhokisini lombhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala &quot;L&quot; kubhala u-L. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo Usizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo. Ukubhalwa Ku-Mac Ku-Windows ne-Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) kanye S Ctrl kanye S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F Ctrl, Shift kanye F Alt+← Option (⌥) kanye ← Alt kanye ← Backspace Inkinobho ye-Delete Backspace Delete fn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili) Delete Enter Return Enter Uphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. \"Bese\" kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo. Izinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho Ctrl+Z isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (Ctrl+Shift+F), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona. Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12: bamba fn (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma vula System Settings, bese Keyboard, bese Keyboard Shortcuts, bese Function Keys, bese uvula \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Ezinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho. Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo Ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T kanye Ctrl+W njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho. Ctrl+Q ku-Mac kanye Alt+F4 ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza. Isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (Control-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini / F11) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-Ctrl+Shift+F, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo. Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad Izinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu: Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula \"Secondary click\" ku-System Settings, bese Trackpad, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba Ctrl ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela. Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo Lapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala \"L\" kubhala u-L. Cindezela Esc noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Thola ithuluzi noma isilungiselelo","summary":"Cindezela Ctrl+K bese uthayipha izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ukuze usebenzise noma yiliphi ithuluzi, ushintshe noma yisiphi isilungiselelo noma uvule isihloko sosizo.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["thola","sesha","ipaleti yomyalo","vula ngokushesha","sebenzisa umyalo","ctrl k","cmd k","ithuluzi","isilungiselelo","inqamulelo"],"headings":[{"id":"thola-bese-usebenzisa","text":"Thola bese usebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-bese-usebenzisa\"\u003EThola bese usebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi. Thola bese usebenzisa Cindezela Ctrl+K, noma khetha Thola ebhareni ephezulu. Bhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu. Cindezela Enter ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. Esc ivala ibhokisi. Ithuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula Izilungiselelo kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo. Okufanele wazi Okusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye. Amathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama. Amathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela amaphaneli bese usebenzisa isikrini sesibili","summary":"Faka amaphaneli ohlangothini lwesobunxele, lwesokudla noma ngaphansi, uwabeke phezu kwawanye, uwahlanganise njengamathebhu, uwabambe noma uwafihle, uwantante phezu komdwebo, wenze isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu, khetha imigqa yethuluzi osebenzisa, noma uwahambise ewindini lawo esikrinini esinye.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["amaphaneli","faka","ntanta","hambisa iphaneli","donsa","isakhiwo","amathebhu","eqenjini lethebhu","beka phezulu","bopha","fihla ngokuzenzakalela","fihla iphaneli","vala iphaneli","okuhlangene","ubukhulu besakhiwo","okuhlangene kakhulu","imigqa yebha yamathuluzi","phindisela","umugqa owodwa","imigqa emi-2","imigqa yethuluzi","isikrini sesibili","izikrini ezimbili","isikrini esingaphezulu","iwindi","i-pop-up","setha kabusha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini","text":"Hambisa iphaneli ewindini","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu","text":"Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu","level":2},{"id":"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele","text":"Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele","level":2},{"id":"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu","text":"Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa","text":"Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa ikhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili","text":"Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili","level":2},{"id":"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli","text":"Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo","text":"Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ingxoxo","text":"Hambisa ingxoxo","level":2},{"id":"buyisela-amaphaneli","text":"Buyisela amaphaneli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini\"\u003EHambisa iphaneli ewindini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu\"\u003EHlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ashintsha amathebhu, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aya kowokuqala nowokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma eqenjini lethebhu\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu yalo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele\"\u003EBopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe \u003Cstrong\u003Elifihla ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha isikhonkwane\u003C/span\u003E, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yokuvala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu\"\u003EYenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezimbili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulula\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa\"\u003EKhetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezintathu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhindisela emugqeni olandelayo\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa owodwa\u003C/span\u003E ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa ikhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENtanta phezu komdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBopha emphethweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E elinye iphaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala imenyu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ungakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibeke esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli\"\u003EAmawindi amaningi amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2\u003C/span\u003E (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula okulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo\"\u003ENgendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwingxenye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ingxoxo\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta ku-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ngewindi layo\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisela-amaphaneli\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lapha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala. Iphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-⋯, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-⋯ kuphela. Hambisa iphaneli ewindini Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu. Lapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta. Amaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele. Iphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo. Donsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-⋯. Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu Amaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, ← no-→ ashintsha amathebhu, futhi Home no-End aya kowokuqala nowokugcina. Ukuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha Phuma eqenjini lethebhu kumenyu yalo ye-⋯, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa. Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele Isikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe lifihla ngokuzenzakalela: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela Esc) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha Khipha isikhonkwane, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele. Inkinobho yokuvala, noma Fihla lo phaneli emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela Enter. Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo unezinketho ezimbili. Okulula yisimo esizenzakalelayo. Okuhlangene unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. Setha kabusha isakhiwo ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile. Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi unezinketho ezintathu. Phindisela emugqeni olandelayo yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. Imigqa emi-2 igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, Umugqa owodwa ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma Tab ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-Imigqa emi-2, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › CadCraft. Sebenzisa ikhibhodi Inkinobho ye-⋯ yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: Faka ngakwesobunxele, Faka ngakwesokudla, Faka ngaphansi, Ntanta phezu komdwebo, Bopha emphethweni, Fihla lo phaneli, Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne elinye iphaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha nakwe-Yibuyisele. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela Enter, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela Enter futhi. Esc ivala imenyu. Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili Khetha ⋯ kwiphaneli, bese Hambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha. Ungakhetha futhi Hambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha ku-Izilungiselelo. Iwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa. Qhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu. Izinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha Yibeke esikrinini sami sesibili kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo. Donsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli Iphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye. Kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi Hambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2 (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi \"panels 2\". Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona. Iwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa. Ngemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha Vula okulandelayo kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye. Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo Iribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-⋯ kwingxenye bese ukhetha Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha; Yibuyisele (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa. Hambisa ingxoxo Yonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi. Ukusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela Alt+Shift+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza Ctrl ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa. Efonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa. Ku-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-Phrinta ku-PDF ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, Vula ngewindi layo. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo. Buyisela amaphaneli Khetha Buyisela amaphaneli kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona. Ukuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha Vula ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma Gcina lapha. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Setha kabusha isakhiwo ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo. Uma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi. Isakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"float-a-group-over-the-drawing","text":"Float a group over the drawing","level":2},{"id":"pin","text":"Pin","level":2},{"id":"close-a-group","text":"Close a group","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group&#039;s grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"float-a-group-over-the-drawing\"\u003EFloat a group over the drawing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick \u003Cstrong\u003EFloat on the drawing\u003C/strong\u003E in a group&#039;s grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin\"\u003EPin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPin\u003C/strong\u003E in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnpin\u003C/strong\u003E gives it all back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"close-a-group\"\u003EClose a group\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach ribbon group has a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the right of its name, and every group&#039;s grip menu has \u003Cstrong\u003EClose\u003C/strong\u003E. The group leaves its bar; the bar&#039;s own grip menu lists it as \u003Cstrong\u003EShow … again\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group's grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab. Float a group over the drawing Pick Float on the drawing in a group's grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it. Pin Pin in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. Unpin gives it all back. Close a group Each ribbon group has a × at the right of its name, and every group's grip menu has Close. The group leaves its bar; the bar's own grip menu lists it as Show … again. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-styles","scope":"basics","title":"Pick an interface style","summary":"Choose how the toolbar, panels and tabs are arranged, see what a style leaves out in your app, keep one style for every app or one for a single app, and export or import a style file.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["interface style","style","layout","workspace","ribbon","toolbox","drafting","multi-view","sketch","vector","duncan","classic","per app","import","export","ccworkspace","arrange","my tools","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"pick-a-style","text":"Pick a style","level":2},{"id":"see-what-a-style-leaves-out","text":"See what a style leaves out","level":2},{"id":"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app","text":"One style for every app, or one for this app","level":2},{"id":"arrange-your-own","text":"Arrange your own","level":2},{"id":"export-and-import-a-style","text":"Export and import a style","level":2},{"id":"if-a-style-does-not-work","text":"If a style does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-a-style\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and choose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface style\u003C/span\u003E choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/span\u003E. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app&#039;s classic style, is the arrangement the app started with.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe styles are \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVector\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuncan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutoRev\u003C/span\u003E and the four \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad1 Ribbon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad2 Workbench\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad3 Review\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad4 Studio\u003C/span\u003E styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-what-a-style-leaves-out\"\u003ESee what a style leaves out\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: &quot;In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).&quot; It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app\"\u003EOne style for every app, or one for this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse a different interface style for\u003C/span\u003E this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E again and the style in use becomes this app&#039;s own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-your-own\"\u003EArrange your own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own interface style…\u003C/span\u003E opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app&#039;s toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy layout\u003C/span\u003E (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a style that has the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E slots, right-click a tool and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E, or drag it to an empty slot. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmpty this slot\u003C/span\u003E clears one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"export-and-import-a-style\"\u003EExport and import a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this interface style\u003C/span\u003E saves the style as a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccworkspace.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport an interface style…\u003C/span\u003E reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app&#039;s own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; pick it there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-style-does-not-work\"\u003EIf a style does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFinish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo go back at any time, choose the classic style again in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does. Pick a style Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,) and choose the Global tab. Under Interface style choose Pick a style. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged. Choose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app's classic style, is the arrangement the app started with. The styles are Drafting, Multi-view, Sketch, Vector, Duncan, Ribbon and project browser, Toolbox and info box, AutoRev and the four PRO-cad1 Ribbon, PRO-cad2 Workbench, PRO-cad3 Review and PRO-cad4 Studio styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under From add-ons and files. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered. This page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those. See what a style leaves out An app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker Settings says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: \"In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).\" It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. Multi-view splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view. One style for every app, or one for this app The style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick Use a different interface style for this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps. In the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads This app or Every app, and This app is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose Every app to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose This app again and the style in use becomes this app's own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws. Arrange your own Arrange your own interface style… opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app's toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as My layout (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (Arrange the panels). In a style that has the My tools slots, right-click a tool and choose Add to My tools, or drag it to an empty slot. Empty this slot clears one. Export and import a style Export this interface style saves the style as a .ccworkspace.json file. Import an interface style… reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app's own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under From add-ons and files; pick it there. If a style does not work If a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so. Finish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running. To go back at any time, choose the classic style again in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube seribhoni yamathebhu phezu komdwebo, ne-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngakwesobunxele kanye nethebhu ngayinye yokubuka evuliwe, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sasendulo noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","iribhoni","amathebhu eribhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","isiphequluli","amaphalethi","iphaneli le-properties","amathebhu okubuka","ibha yesimo","ukufinyelela ngokushesha","goqa iribhoni","iwindi leribhoni","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo","efakiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo","text":"Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yesihloko:\u003C/strong\u003E igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha\u003C/span\u003E (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni:\u003C/strong\u003E amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yezinketho:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaneli lesobunxele:\u003C/strong\u003E i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuka nebha yesimo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo &quot;Vula ifayela kuqala&quot;, noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina iribhoni ivulekile\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yesihloko: igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, Okwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, Usizo kanye Izilungiselelo. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo. Iribhoni: amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. Ifayela ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala. Ibha yezinketho: ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe. Iphaneli lesobunxele: i-Properties phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile. Ibha yokubuka nebha yesimo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo \"Vula ifayela kuqala\", noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi Uma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, ← no-→ bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-Home no-End bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo Chofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-Hambisa iribhoni ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-Goqa iribhoni ne-Gcina iribhoni ivulekile. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula. Hambisa iribhoni › Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele iribhoni, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube yikholomu yamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele ezindaweni zakho, ibhokisi lolwazi phezu kwesikrini elilandela ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma okukhethiwe kuwe, inavigeyitha ngakwesokudla, ithebhu ngayinye yokubuka, izinketho ezisheshayo nephaleti lokuhlela, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sakudala noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ikholomu yamathuluzi","ibhokisi lolwazi","ibha yolwazi","inavigeyitha","ishadi lephrojekthi","ibha esheshayo","izinketho ezisheshayo","iphaleti lokuhlela","iphaleti lepeti","amathuluzi ami","amathuluzi angikhethile","amathebhu okubuka","iwindi lebhokisi lamathuluzi","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo","text":"Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lolwazi:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi &quot;Akukhethiwe lutho&quot;. Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ami:\u003C/strong\u003E iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInavigeyitha:\u003C/strong\u003E iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha esheshayo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaleti lokuhlela:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo\"\u003ENika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yamathuluzi: ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo. Ibhokisi lolwazi: ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese Ctrl+Z kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi \"Akukhethiwe lutho\". Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe. Ibhokisi lamathuluzi: ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya. Amathuluzi ami: iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha Engeza kumathuluzi ami; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli. Inavigeyitha: iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-Properties nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo. Ibha esheshayo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi. Iphaleti lokuhlela: chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-Properties. Esc, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo Inkinobho ye-Hambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho bese ulondoloza amasethi akho","summary":"Khetha iphaneli elibonisa isiphequluli sephrojekthi, i-Properties noma okuqukethwe yiphaneli ngalinye, lapho ibhokisi lamathuluzi lihlala khona nokuthi amabha aqukethe ini, ulondoloze njengesakhiwo sakho, futhi ugcine wonke amasethi ngegama ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwawo.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","hlela","yenza ngokwakho","isakhiwo sami","isakhiwo sakho","amaphaneli","abahleli","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","properties","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ibha esheshayo","ibhokisi lolwazi","indawo yokusebenza","isethi","iphrofayili","londoloza isethi","shintsha isethi","thumela isethi","ngenisa isethi","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho","text":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza","text":"Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho\"\u003EHlela isakhiwo sakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ukulungiswa kwakho…\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama, bese ukhetha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu komdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgasohlangothini lomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka:\u003C/strong\u003E usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza:\u003C/strong\u003E bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yami\u003C/span\u003E. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintshela kuyo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYabelana:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa isethi…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E kanye no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ngaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Hlela isakhiwo sakho Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,), khetha Jikelele, bese Isakhiwo. Khetha Hlela ukulungiswa kwakho…. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje. Nikeza igama, bese ukhetha: Phezu komdwebo: ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo. Ngasohlangothini lomdwebo: ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-Amathuluzi ami; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma Properties, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo. Indawo yomdwebo: amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo. Ukubukeka: usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu. Khetha Sebenzisa lolu lungiselelo. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa. Kunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-Kusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini; Thumela lolu lungiselelo silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi Hlela amaphaneli. Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza Indawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-Amathuluzi ami. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo. Londoloza: bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha Londoloza isethi yami. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi. Shintsha: khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha Shintshela kuyo. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha. Yabelana: Thumela ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-.ccenv.json; Ngenisa isethi… yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye. Susa: khetha isethi bese ukhetha Susa. Ungagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili. Ukuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi, isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi kanye no-isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox","window","palette stack","large tools","small tools","more tools"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own","text":"A block in a window of its own","level":2},{"id":"palettes-in-two-stacks","text":"Palettes in two stacks","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the first … tools\u003C/span\u003E keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E▾\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all its tools\u003C/span\u003E undoes it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the ribbon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge tools\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall tools\u003C/span\u003E draw every tool of the group one size; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESizes as the app draws them\u003C/span\u003E goes back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own\"\u003EA block in a window of its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn Arrange mode the map of places also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn a window\u003C/span\u003E for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in windows\u003C/span\u003E in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place \u003Ccode\u003Ewindow\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"palettes-in-two-stacks\"\u003EPalettes in two stacks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe panel&#039;s palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack&#039;s tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. The panel&#039;s own content always stays in its panel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Show the first … tools keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group's ▾. Show all its tools undoes it. In the ribbon, Large tools and Small tools draw every tool of the group one size; Sizes as the app draws them goes back. A block in a window of its own In Arrange mode the map of places also has In a window for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click Open in windows in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place window. Palettes in two stacks The panel's palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack's tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of Undo. The panel's own content always stays in its panel. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","summary":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, okusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokudinga okuxhumeka.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ayikho i-inthanethi","indiza","ukuvakasha endaweni","ikhashe","service worker","faka","landa","ukuxhumeka"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okudinga-ukuxhumeka","text":"Okudinga ukuxhumeka","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda &quot;Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi&quot;. Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EOkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudinga-ukuxhumeka\"\u003EOkudinga ukuxhumeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala. Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Vula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi. Khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni ephezulu. Linda \"Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\". Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala. Yenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo. Usuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi. Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola. Ukulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho. Lolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha. Okudinga ukuxhumeka Ukuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe. Izixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-Vula kuwebhusayithi nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi. Ukulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje. Okufanele wazi Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa. Amawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza. I-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo. I-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see Present a drawing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"theme-light-dark","scope":"basics","title":"Light and dark: the sun and the moon","summary":"Switch every app and the site between the light and the dark theme with the sun and the moon in the top bar, or pick one in Settings, or let your system decide.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["theme","light","dark","sun","moon","dark mode","light mode","night","paper","model","colours","contrast","match the system","appearance"],"headings":[{"id":"switch-it-in-the-top-bar","text":"Switch it in the top bar","level":2},{"id":"choose-it-in-settings","text":"Choose it in Settings","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-it-in-the-top-bar\"\u003ESwitch it in the top bar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the right of the top bar there are two small buttons:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Esun\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight theme\u003C/span\u003E: a light page with dark lines;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Emoon\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDark theme\u003C/span\u003E: a dark page with light lines.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E (light) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E (dark). They do the same thing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it-in-settings\"\u003EChoose it in Settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETheme\u003C/span\u003E offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer&#039;s light or dark setting and change when it changes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003Ework environment\u003C/a\u003E and it does not change your drawing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe drawing&#039;s own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELogos and icons follow the theme by themselves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Every CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow. Switch it in the top bar At the right of the top bar there are two small buttons: the sun is the Light theme: a light page with dark lines; the moon is the Dark theme: a dark page with light lines. The one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar's More menu. Where the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words Paper (light) and Model (dark). They do the same thing. Choose it in Settings Settings › Global › Theme offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer's light or dark setting and change when it changes. Good to know The theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a work environment and it does not change your drawing. The drawing's own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the Model tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface. Logos and icons follow the theme by themselves.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"craft-menu","scope":"basics","title":"The CadCraft menu: settings, help, presenting and your account in one place","summary":"In the Drafting layout, the app mark and name at the top left open one menu with Settings, Full screen, Help, About, Save for offline, Present, the theme switch and your account. Pin what you use often to the top row.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["craft menu","cadcraft menu","app menu","settings","full screen","help","about","offline","present","presentation","account","sign in","sign out","theme","light","dark","sun","moon","pin","add-ons","alt+o","find"],"headings":[{"id":"what-the-menu-holds","text":"What the menu holds","level":2},{"id":"pin-what-you-use-often","text":"Pin what you use often","level":2},{"id":"add-ons-and-find","text":"Add-ons and Find","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-the-menu-holds\"\u003EWhat the menu holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, when the app can be kept on this computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisit GetCadCraft.com\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAccount\u003C/span\u003E with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign out\u003C/span\u003E under it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in\u003C/span\u003E when you are not signed in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-what-you-use-often\"\u003EPin what you use often\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-ons-and-find\"\u003EAdd-ons and Find\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe menu is part of the Drafting layout (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EThe Drafting layout\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press Alt+O. What the menu holds Settings (Ctrl+,), Full screen, Help (F1) and About. Save for offline, when the app can be kept on this computer. Present: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See Present a drawing. Visit GetCadCraft.com. A row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme. Account with Sign out under it, or Sign in when you are not signed in. Pin what you use often Each option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you. Add-ons and Find Add-ons in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics. Good to know The menu is part of the Drafting layout (Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See The Drafting layout. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"present","scope":"basics","title":"Present a drawing: hide the interface","summary":"Present hides the bars, ribbon and palettes so a client sees only the drawing. Nothing closes; Esc or Exit presentation brings everything back.","section":"start","order":45,"keywords":["present","presentation","presentation mode","show client","hide interface","clean view","hide toolbars","hide panels","meeting","exit presentation","escape"],"headings":[{"id":"start-presenting","text":"Start presenting","level":2},{"id":"stop-presenting","text":"Stop presenting","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhen you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"start-presenting\"\u003EStart presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/craft-menu\" data-topic=\"basics/craft-menu\"\u003EThe CadCraft menu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stop-presenting\"\u003EStop presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit presentation\u003C/span\u003E at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPresent is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"When you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing. Start presenting Open the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press Alt+O) and pick Present. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see The CadCraft menu). The title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view. Stop presenting Press Esc, or click Exit presentation at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed. Good to know Present is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Lapho amafayela akho aya khona","summary":"Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho, indlela ukulondoloza ngayo, nokuthi isiphequluli sikhumbula ini.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["ubumfihlo","ukulayisha phezulu","ifu","londoloza","landa","isitoreji","endaweni","ukuphepha","imfihlo"],"headings":[{"id":"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo","text":"Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli","text":"Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ngefu","text":"Ukulondoloza ngefu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EAmafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela alilayishwa phezulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela ukulondoloza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha \u003Cstrong\u003E(ngokulanda)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EIzisebenzi nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo &quot;(edited)&quot; noma &quot;(marked up)&quot;, ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli\"\u003EOkukhunjulwa yisiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ngefu\"\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho Uma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Ifayela alilayishwa phezulu. Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo Ikhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha (ngokulanda): Ukulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona Izisebenzi nekhompyutha). Izinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo \"(edited)\" noma \"(marked up)\", ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga. Uma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"). Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli Ezinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo. Ukulondoloza ngefu Ukulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"recipes-you-can-run","text":"Recipes you can run","level":2},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes-you-can-run\"\u003ERecipes you can run\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/examples\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/examples\u003C/a\u003E has recipes as files you can run yourself: \u003Ccode\u003Emcp-tidy-a-drawing\u003C/code\u003E makes an assistant&#039;s calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-check-standards\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-convert-and-plot\u003C/code\u003E do the same jobs with the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Recipes you can run github.com/getcadcraft/examples has recipes as files you can run yourself: mcp-tidy-a-drawing makes an assistant's calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and cli-check-standards and cli-convert-and-plot do the same jobs with the cadcraft command line. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft&#039;s sketch tools take a stroke&#039;s pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch stair\u003C/span\u003E takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don&#039;t use pressure yet. No app uses the pen&#039;s tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Where the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft's sketch tools take a stroke's pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft's Sketch stair takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don't use pressure yet. No app uses the pen's tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"zu","chain":["zu","en"]};
